(4, 'CB Gallant', 'シービーギャラン', '配角', '', '__Affiliations__: Roger Pirates __Occupations__: Pirate CB Gallant was a member of the Roger Pirates until the crew''s dissolution. His current whereabouts and status are unknown. (Source: One Piece Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_184741.png'),
