(18, 'Kouhei Konishi', '小西恒平', '配角', 'Chihiro Suzuki', 'He is the editor of JUMP. Gintoki meets him in episode 100. His dream is to work in fashion magazines. His name is a reference to [Kouhei Oonishi](https://anilist.co/staff/168654/), who worked as an editor on Gintama until 2007.', '/uploads/images/c_43084.jpg'),
(18, 'Sanzou Fudou', '不動三蔵', '配角', 'Kousei Tomita', 'Sanzo Fudo works as a realtor, considered the "Messiah" of Kabukichou because he would help anyone to get a place to stay no matter who or what their situation was. In episode 136 he helps Madao find an apartment.', '/uploads/images/c_43216.jpg'),
(18, 'Ojii-san', 'おじいさん', '配角', 'Mugihito', 'He is the old man who lived in seclusion after his wife died and communicated only with the dog named [Kintaro ](https://anilist.co/character/43219/Kintaro). ~!He dies at the end of episode 130. !~', '/uploads/images/c_43218.jpg'),
(18, 'Kintarou', '金太郎', '配角', 'Kenyuu Horiuchi', 'A dog on his deathbed whose owner, a reclusive old man, is also on his deathbed. ~!In fact, it is an Amanto who captures The Worlds, having filled the inhabitants of these planets.!~ ~!He dies at the end of episode 130.!~', '/uploads/images/c_43219.jpg'),
