(18, 'Kanshichirou Hashida', '橋田勘七郎', '配角', 'Eriko Kigawa', 'A baby that was left in front of the yorozuya and was mistaken as Gintoki''s son since it looks like him. It was revealed that he is the grandson of the leader of a certain organization. He was being taken back to the organization because he will be the successor of the group.', '/uploads/images/c_44579.jpg'),
