(18, 'Houichi', 'ホウイチ', '配角', 'Yousuke Akimoto', 'Houichi is the Kabukichou Boss Cat and rules over the other stray cats. He has a very strict personality and is rough with any newbie. Each new cat must fight him in order for him to see if they are worthy of living in Kabukichou. ~!He used to be a human, but became a cat after the the cat he was taking care of sacrificed itself.!~', '/uploads/images/c_45215.jpg'),
