(18, 'Ochi-san', '落さん', '配角', 'Masaki Aizawa', 'Ochi-san is a down-trodden ex-white-collar worker. He is now the coordinator for the District''s Test-Your-Courage Haunted House. (Source: Gintama Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_45415.jpg'),
