(47, 'Junya Nakajou', '中城順哉', '配角', 'Takayuki Kondou', 'Assistant Director in Fuyumi Irisu''s independent film. He was one of the three detectives involved in solving the mystery of Hongou''s unfinished script.', '/uploads/images/c_64409.png'),
