(55, 'Ellie', 'エリー', '配角', 'Miyuki Kobori', 'She is a young girl from the Calaneth District. She and her brother witness the departure and comeback of the Scout Regiment on the 57th Exterior Scouting Mission.', '/uploads/images/c_137201.png'),
(55, 'Zoku 3', '賊３', '配角', 'Shintarou Oohata', 'He is one of a trio of men who killed [Mikasa''s father](https://anilist.co/character/84339) and [mother](https://anilist.co/character/84341) before kidnapping their daughter [Mikasa Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/40881) in the year 844.', '/uploads/images/c_137283.png'),
(55, 'Zoku 2', '賊２', '配角', 'Hiroki Maeda', 'He is one of a trio of men who killed [Mikasa''s father](https://anilist.co/character/84339) and [mother](https://anilist.co/character/84341) before kidnapping their daughter [Mikasa Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/40881) in the year 844.', '/uploads/images/c_137284.png'),
(55, 'Zoku 1', '賊１', '配角', 'Gou Shinomiya', 'He is one of a trio of men who killed [Mikasa''s father](https://anilist.co/character/84339) and [mother](https://anilist.co/character/84341) before kidnapping their daughter [Mikasa Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/40881) in the year 844.', '/uploads/images/c_137286.png'),
(55, 'Mitsumete no Kyojin', '見つめての巨人', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_140903.png'),
(55, 'Louise', 'ルイーゼ', '配角', '', 'A young girl who was in Trost with her mother attempting to flee when the Titans invaded. After being saved by [Mikasa Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/40881/Mikasa-Ackerman) and the other 104th Cadets, she was inspired by their heroic actions and later joins the military herself as a Survey Corps recruit, hoping to get closer to Mikasa, her idol. Louise believes that strength is the most important attribute one can have in the world, to the point that she almost seems to have a "might equals right" mentality. Much of this mindset stems from her experiences during the Battle of Trost District, where she claims to have learned from watching Mikasa Ackerman fight in the face of adversity to achieve victory. She believes that the ends justify the means, and has no qualms about breaking rules if she believes that disobeying others will get her what she wants.', '/uploads/images/c_209870.png'),
(55, 'Lobov', 'ロボフ', '配角', 'Daichi Endou', 'A Scout Regiment recruit and former commander of the garrison who participated in the Raid on Liberio.', '/uploads/images/c_209872.png'),
(56, 'Kouko Kaga', '加賀香子', '主角', 'Yui Horie', 'She had a perfect future planned with [Mitsuo Yanagisawa](https://anilist.co/character/43671/Yanagisawa-Mitsuo) as her husband, and nothing will get in her way! She has a side of her that is not violent as Mitsuo has described.', '/uploads/images/c_43669.jpg'),
(56, 'Banri Tada', '多田万里', '主角', 'Makoto Furukawa', 'Having had an nearly fatal accident shortly after high school graduation, he has lost all memories from before then. He spent a year recovering, and has now entered Law School.', '/uploads/images/c_43670.jpg'),
(56, 'Mitsuo Yanagisawa', '柳澤光央', '主角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''10") He tried to escape from Kouko by secretly taking the entrance exams for a private law school in Tokyo. Just when he thought he was free of her at long last, she appeared out of nowhere, having found him out and secretly followed him to the same school.', '/uploads/images/c_43671.jpg'),
(56, 'Nana Hayashida', '林田奈々', '主角', 'Ai Kayano', 'A second year student and Banri and Kouko''s senior in the Festival Research Society. Her nickname Linda (りんだ) is an alternate reading of the kanji for Hayashida (林田). ~!Banri''s love interest and best-friend during High School, she now follows him and keeps an eye out for him, though he cannot remember her at all. For reasons unknown as yet, she has not told him about their shared past.!~', '/uploads/images/c_43672.jpg'),
(56, 'Chinami Oka', '岡千波', '主角', 'Ibuki Kido', 'A rather petite girl specializing in film studies, she plays the role of young girls as a voice actor.', '/uploads/images/c_56931.jpg'),
(56, 'Takaya Satou', '佐藤隆哉', '配角', 'Takahiro Hikami', '__Height:__ 162cm (5''3") First year law student. Totally fascinated by two-dimensional girls, he is awkward around three-dimensional (aka real) girls. He has gone so far as to invent his own ideal girl, a two-dimensional creation of his imagination known to him as VJ (Brigitte Jeomillia).', '/uploads/images/c_73497.jpg'),
(56, 'Nana', 'Nana', '配角', 'Satomi Satou', 'Nana is a third-year female student. She dresses and acts similarly to the character of the same name in the manga "Nana".', '/uploads/images/c_87748.jpg'),
(56, 'Kosshii', 'コッシー', '配角', 'Takayuki Kondou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_87749.jpg'),
(56, 'Sao', 'さお', '配角', 'Saori Gotou', 'A member of Tea Club.', '/uploads/images/c_87750.jpg'),
(56, 'Shii', 'しー', '配角', 'Shizuka Itou', 'A member of the Tea Club.', '/uploads/images/c_87751.jpg'),
(56, 'Banri no Haha', '万里の母', '配角', 'Takako Honda', 'Tada Banri''s mother.', '/uploads/images/c_87752.jpg'),
(57, 'Mirai Kuriyama', '栗山未来', '主角', 'Risa Taneda', '__Height:__ 152 cm Mirai Kuriyama is the deuteragonist of the Kyoukai no Kanata series. She is a first-year student and a member of the school''s Literary Club. She comes from a bloodline of Spirit World Warriors who possess blood-manipulation abilities. However, because these abilities are considered heretical among the Spirit World Warrior clans, she is shunned. After meeting [Kanbara Akihito](https://anilist.co/character/81757) she started opening up to people and relating to them again.', '/uploads/images/c_81751.png'),
(57, 'Mitsuki Nase', '名瀬美月', '主角', 'Minori Chihara', '__Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") Nase Mitsuki is the sadistic second daughter of the famous underworlder Nase household. She is with [Akihito](https://anilist.co/character/81757/Kanbara-Akihito) in order to observe him, but she is in fact very worried about him. She is good enough friends with Akihito to be able to speak frankly with him, and is the president of the school''s literature club as a second-year student. (Source: Anime News Network)', '/uploads/images/c_81753.png'),
(57, 'Akihito Kanbara', '神原秋人', '主角', 'KENN', '__Race:__ Half-Youmu __Height:__ 171 cm (5''7'''') Akihito is one of the main characters of the Kyoukai no Kanata series. He is an alone living second year student and a member of his school''s Literary Club. He is a half-youmu and has the ability to instantly heal from his wounds. He is mostly unfamiliar with spirit world warriors and Youmu, something rare for someone like him.', '/uploads/images/c_81757.png'),
(57, 'Hiroomi Nase', '名瀬博臣', '主角', 'Tatsuhisa Suzuki', '**Race:** Spirit World Warrior __Height:__ 178 cm (5''10") Nase Hiroomi is the eldest son of the famous underworlder Nase family and [Mitsuki''s](https://anilist.co/character/81753/Nase-Mitsuki) elder brother. It appears that Hirooumi and [Akihito](https://anilist.co/character/81757/Kanbara-Akihito) had something happen between them in the past, but now they are on such good terms that they can joke around with each other. He has a little sister complex. Due to his barrier powers as an underworlder, he is extremely sensitive to cold, and is almost always seen wearing a muffler or scarf. Hiroomi is a third-year student in high school.', '/uploads/images/c_81763.png'),
(57, 'Miroku Fujima', '藤真弥勒', '配角', 'Masaya Matsukaze', '**Race:** Spirit World Warrior __Height:__ 180 cm (5''11") He is an antagonist and secondary character in the Kyoukai no Kanata series. He is an Interrogation Officer in the Spirit World Warriors Society.', '/uploads/images/c_87624.png'),
(57, 'Sakura Inami', '伊波桜', '配角', 'Moe Toyota', '__Height:__ 159 cm (5''3") She is the second daughter of a family to whom [Mirai](https://anilist.co/character/81751) is indebted. She came to Nagatsuki City in pursuit of Mirai, who killed her older sister, [Yui](https://anilist.co/character/87630). (Source: Kyoukai no Kanata Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_87625.png'),
(57, 'Izumi Nase', '名瀬泉', '配角', 'Ayako Kawasumi', '__Height:__ 170 cm The eldest daughter of the Nase clan. She usually has a calm demeanor despite having a malicious undertone. She has the viewpoint that youmu are no different from crops or farm animals and exist solely to provide her clan with a livelihood. (Source: Wikipedia)', '/uploads/images/c_87626.png'),
(57, 'Ai Shindou', '新堂愛', '配角', 'Yuri Yamaoka', '__Height:__ 146 cm [Ayaka](https://anilist.co/character/87628/Shindou-Ayaka)''s sister who manages the appraising shop when Ayaka is unavailable. She is a cat-like youmu, with the ability to shape-shift into human form. When transformed, she appears as a two tailed cat.', '/uploads/images/c_87627.png'),
(57, 'Ayaka Shindou', '新堂彩華', '配角', 'Naomi Shindou', '__Height:__ 165 cm She is a fox Youmu, but works as a Spirit World Warrior.', '/uploads/images/c_87628.png'),
(57, 'Shizuku Ninomiya', '二ノ宮雫', '配角', 'Akeno Watanabe', '__Height:__ 168 cm She’s a beautiful, lighthearted person, who has quite a few lamentable qualities for which men often reject her.', '/uploads/images/c_87629.png'),
(57, 'Yui Inami', '伊波唯', '配角', 'Sayuri Yahagi', '[Mirai](https://anilist.co/character/81751/Kuriyama-Mirai) and Yuuto''s mentor figure.', '/uploads/images/c_87630.jpg'),
(57, 'Yayoi Kanbara', '神原弥生', '配角', 'Hiromi Konno', '__Height:__ 160 cm Kanbara Yayoi is [Akihito](https://anilist.co/character/81757)''s mother.', '/uploads/images/c_87631.png'),
(57, 'Yakiimo', 'ヤキイモ', '配角', '', 'Yakiimo is a youmu that [Mitsuki](https://anilist.co/character/81753/Nase-Mitsuki) is keeping as a pet. The name means sweet potato and it''s based on its appearance.', '/uploads/images/c_180179.png'),
(58, 'Ryuuko Matoi', '纏流子', '主角', 'Ami Koshimizu', 'She transfers into Honnouji Academy as a second-year student, an Academy ruled by power and authority. She wields a huge single-bladed scissor, and demands to know the owner of the other half. As she remembers, the wielder of the lost half of the scissor blade is the same person who killed her father. ~!Her body has been fused with life fibers, making her a "life fiber monster"!~ ~!She is the daughter of Kiryuuin Ragyou, making Kiryuuin Satsuki her older sister!~', '/uploads/images/c_83797.png'),
(58, 'Satsuki Kiryuuin', '鬼龍院皐月', '主角', 'Ryouka Yuzuki', 'Satsuki Kiryuin is another main heroine of the anime, "Kill La Kill." She is an 18-year-old woman, and is the Student Council President of Honnouji Academy. She rules the school with an iron first, and assesses the students'' abilities, holding the position/authority to draw out power surpassing that of humans. ~!She seems to have information regarding the death of Ryuko''s father, putting the two at odds immediately after her arrival.!~ ~!She later states that she was the one to send Harime Nui to kill her father, however that was a lie, as the entire murder was orchestrated by Kiryuuin Ragyou and Harime Nui.!~ ~!After betraying her mother, she shares the same goal as Ryuuko Matoi.!~ ~!She is the sister of Ryuuko Matoi.!~', '/uploads/images/c_83799.png'),
(58, 'Senketsu', '鮮血', '主角', 'Toshihiko Seki', 'A living sailor uniform [Ryuuko](https://anilist.co/character/83797/Matoi-Ryuuko) finds beneath her house. Senketsu is a Kamui (神衣 lit. "God Clothes"), an outfit that provides its wearer with godlike abilities in exchange for their blood. He has the power to transform into an indestructible suit of armor, albeit with a skimpy appearance, much to Ryūko''s embarrassment. His name, given to him by Ryūko, literally means ''fresh blood''. ~!After defeating Kiryuuin Ragyou, while falling through the earth''s stratosphere, Senketsu burns up protecting Ryuuko.!~', '/uploads/images/c_87510.jpg'),
(58, 'Mako Mankanshoku', '満艦飾マコ', '主角', 'Aya Suzaki', 'Mako is a second year student at Honnouji Academy. She is an uber air-head, so her unbelievable actions never cease to shock and awe the people around her. She strongly believes that she and [Ryuko](https://anilist.co/character/83797) are best of friends even though they have just met.', '/uploads/images/c_87511.png'),
(58, 'Ira Gamagoori', '蟇郡 苛', '配角', 'Tetsu Inada', 'Gamagoori Ira is one of Four Kings. He is the Head of the Public Morals Committee. He sworn absolute loyalty to the Student Council President.', '/uploads/images/c_87604.jpg'),
(58, 'Houka Inumuta', '犬牟田 宝火', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', 'Houka Inumuta is one of Four Kings, as he is the Student Council Secretary and Intelligence and Strategic Analyst. He always tries to use the least effort to achieve the greatest results. ~!After the events of episode 17, He and the other 4 kings join Nudist Beach!~', '/uploads/images/c_87605.jpg'),
(58, 'Nonon Jakuzure', '蛇崩乃音', '配角', 'Mayumi Shintani', 'Nonon Jakuzure is one of the main characters in Kill la Kill and one of the Student Council''s Elite Four. She regulates the school''s non-athletic groups, such as the gardening and biology clubs. Nonon also runs the school''s Rakugo Club, 100 Poems by 100 Poets Club and most likely the marching band. Nonon''s Three-Star Goku Uniform resembles that of a drum majorette. Her baton is not just for show, as Nonon is a conductor as well. ~!After the events of episode 17, she and the other 4 kings join Nudist Beach!~', '/uploads/images/c_87606.png'),
(58, 'Matarou Mankanshoku', '満艦飾 又郎', '配角', 'Ayumi Fujimura', 'Mako''s little brother. He acts as the leader of the local troublemakers who mostly loiters around the Honnouji Town cul-de-sac.', '/uploads/images/c_87607.jpg'),
(58, 'Barazou Mankanshoku', '満艦飾 薔薇蔵', '配角', 'Kenyuu Horiuchi', 'Mako''s father. He is the town’s unlicensed doctor. He''s killed more patients than actually saved them.', '/uploads/images/c_87608.jpg'),
(58, 'Sukuyo Mankanshoku', '満艦飾好代', '配角', 'Yukari Fukui', 'Mako''s carefree mother.', '/uploads/images/c_87609.jpg'),
(58, 'Aikurou Mikisugi', '美木杉 愛九郎', '配角', 'Shinichirou Miki', 'A mysterious male teacher who develops an interest in Ryuko soon after she arrives at Honnouji Academy. ~!He is secretly an operative of the terrorist organization Nudist Beach, working to prevent Satsuki Kiryuin''s influence from spreading any further. He also knew Ryuko''s father before he was murdered. Has a tendency to strip, as fitting with his organization''s name.!~', '/uploads/images/c_87610.jpg'),
(58, 'Maiko Oogure', '大暮麻衣子', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', 'Oogure Maiko is the Head of Trap development.', '/uploads/images/c_87611.jpg'),
(58, 'Uzu Sanageyama', '猿投山渦', '配角', 'Nobuyuki Hiyama', 'Sanageyama Uzu is one of Four Kings. He is the Head of the Sports Club. ~!After losing a battle to Ryuuko Matoi, he resolves himself to ask Iori Shirou to sew his eyes shut.!~ ~!After the events of episode 17, he and the other 4 kings join Nudist Beach.!~', '/uploads/images/c_87612.png'),
(58, 'Takaharu Fukuroda', '袋田隆治', '配角', 'Mitsuo Iwata', 'The Boxing Club Captain.', '/uploads/images/c_87613.jpg'),
(58, 'Omiko Hakodate', '臣子 函館', '配角', 'Chiaki Takahashi', 'Omiko Hakodate is a Third Year Class T student and Captain of the Tennis Club.', '/uploads/images/c_87614.jpg'),
(58, 'Takiji Kuroido', '黒井戸滝司', '配角', 'Kousei Hirota', 'The head steward to the Kiryuin Family. He has been entrusted to care for the Kiryuin mansion in Satsuki’s mother’s absence.', '/uploads/images/c_87615.jpg'),
(58, 'Shirou Iori', '伊織糸郎', '配角', 'Yuuji Ueda', 'The president of the Honnouji Academy Sewing Club. The Sewing Club is responsible for manufacturing the Goku Uniforms.', '/uploads/images/c_87616.jpg'),
(58, 'Sanzou Soroi', '揃三蔵', '配角', 'Akio Nojima', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_87618.jpg'),
(58, 'Nui Harime', '針目縫', '配角', 'Yukari Tamura', '**Hair Color**: Blonde **Eye Color**: Dark Blue **Occupation**: Grand Couturier **Affiliation**: Revocs Corporation ~! **Race**: Life Fiber/Human hybrid **Relatives**: [Ragyo Kiryuin](https://anilist.co/character/126061/Ragyo-Kiryuin) (creator) !~ Nui Harime is the Grand Couturier of the Revocs Corporation. She is known for her cute appearance, sadistic yet childish nature, and incredible fighting power. Nui appears to be a young teenage girl of medium height. She has long blonde hair styled in drill-like pigtails, with smaller locks framing her face. Her eyes are sapphire blue, with highlights that resemble a smiling face. She wears a richly adorned pink lolita-styled dress with matching boots and fingerless gloves. She accentuates her ensemble with a parasol, a large pink hair bow, and a purple eyepatch. Her design has a prominent heart motif, such as on her collar, the center of her bow, her earrings, and even the highlights on her pigtails. Nui has a childlike, jovial, and happy-go-lucky demeanor; always smiling, and acting very friendly and even polite with everyone, demonstrating excessive intimacy towards even [Satsuki Kiryuin](https://anilist.co/character/83799/Satsuki-Kiryuin). According to [Ragyo Kiryuin](https://anilist.co/character/126061/Ragyo-Kiryuin), Nui is free-spirited and will do whatever she wants according to her whims. Her bubbly behavior and nonchalance towards anyone that stands in her way often puts her at odds with the main cast, and can easily becom', '/uploads/images/c_88475.jpg'),
(58, 'Tsumugu Kinagase', '黄長瀬紬', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', 'A member of the organization called Nudist Beach whose main purpose is to rid the world of Life Fibers.', '/uploads/images/c_121617.jpg'),
(58, 'Ragyou Kiryuuin', '鬼龍院羅暁', '配角', 'Romi Park', 'The head of the Kiryuuin family. ~!After being betrayed by Satsuki in the events of episode 17, she becomes the main antagonist!~', '/uploads/images/c_126061.png'),
(58, 'Rei Hououmaru', '鳳凰丸礼', '配角', 'Ayumi Fujimura', 'Rei is originally from Africa but her hometown was caught in a civil war. Ragyou saved her and gave her the name she has now, “Rei Hououmaru”. She now works as secretary for Kiryuuin Ragyou at Revocs Corporation.', '/uploads/images/c_138197.jpg'),
(58, 'Ryousuke Todoroki', '轟輌輔', '配角', 'Kiyohito Yoshikai', 'Ryōsuke Todoroki is the president of the Automotive Airsoft Club, a club made from the merger of the Automotive and Airsoft Clubs.', '/uploads/images/c_190944.png'),
(58, 'Aizenbou Fuguhara', '河豚原愛善坊', '配角', 'Saki Nitta', 'Aizenbou Fuguhara is the president of the Ping Pong club.', '/uploads/images/c_190945.png'),
(58, 'Jack Naitou', '内藤ジャック', '配角', 'Suguru Inoue', 'Jack Naitou is the Knife Throwing Club president.', '/uploads/images/c_190946.png'),
(58, 'Isshin Matoi', '纏一身', '配角', 'Kinryuu Arimoto', '[Ryuuko](https://anilist.co/character/83797/)''s deceased father who created [Senketsu](https://anilist.co/character/87510/S). He was also the creator of the scissor blade. ~!Previously known as Kiryuuin Souichirou, he had faked his death in order to escape from the clutches of Kiryuuin Ragyou, and founded the organization "Nudist Beach"!~', '/uploads/images/c_251701.png'),
(58, 'Kaneo Takarada', '宝多金男', '配角', 'Makoto Awane', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_258650.png'),
(59, 'Chitoge Kirisaki', '桐崎千棘', '主角', 'Nao Touyama', '__Height:__ 160 cm The main female protagonist of the series. She is the daughter of [Adelt Wogner Kirisaki](https://anilist.co/character/82935) and [Hana Kirisaki](https://anilist.co/character/84919) who served as the fake girlfriend of [Raku Ichijou](https://anilist.co/character/48393) for the next three years of her school life to prevent a war from starting between their families. Chitoge is somewhat a forgetful, stern and bold girl. However, once someone gets to know her better, she becomes very talkative and nice. Similar to Raku, Chitoge is the type to go out of her way to help someone. For example, when Raku lost his pendant once again from the chain being broken, Chitoge had secretly gotten the Beehive gang to help fix it for him and gave it back later that night. Chitoge is somewhat oblivious when it comes to love and others'' love interests, for example, how she didn''t know what [Seishirou Tsugumi](https://anilist.co/character/58885)’s "symptoms" were, which were actually love. She is also very athletic as she can easily jump over the school''s walls and swim the length of the school pool in a couple of seconds. Ever since she was a child she had a hard time making friends as they disliked her. As a result, she had a cold demeanor toward people at the start of the series due to her relationship with her family. This led her to create notebooks filled with information on classmates in an attempt to make friends. When Chitoge had lost her ribbon, she becomes very emoti', '/uploads/images/c_48391.jpg'),
(59, 'Raku Ichijou', '一条楽', '主角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', '**Height:** 168 cm Son of a Yakuza family. He''s intelligent but not an adept fighter. He likes sweet things, wants to marry a Yamato Nadeshiko and says he''s the kind of person who has to do it absolutely correctly when he puts his mind into something otherwise he can''t be satisfied.', '/uploads/images/c_48393.jpg'),
(59, 'Kosaki Onodera', '小野寺小咲 ', '主角', 'Kana Hanazawa', '**Height:** 157 cm She is one of the main characters in the manga series Nisekoi. She is shown to have a crush on [Raku Ichijou](https://anilist.co/character/48393/Raku-Ichijou), the male protagonist of Nisekoi, and is also the only girl that Raku openly has feelings for. Kosaki is discreet, innocent, and slightly timid. She is very kind, she takes care of Raku when he is wounded or ill. Generally, she opts to think carefully before acting, as seen when she stalls her confession to Raku in consideration that he may have feelings for [Chitoge](https://anilist.co/character/48391/Chitoge-Kirisaki). In confrontation with Raku, Kosaki displays inconfidence, initially needing encouragement from [Ruri](https://anilist.co/character/58281/Ruri-Miyamoto) attempt confessing her love. Kosaki works well with her classmates, possessing close friends and being the most popular girl for the boys before Chitoge transferred and after Kosaki and Raku allegedly began dating. Both Kosaki and Raku are completely unaware that the feelings they hold for each other are mutual. Like in many average fictional love stories, these two try not to show their feelings to each other. She loves Raku because he is kind and caring. Just like the other girls who like him, she can be jealous as well but not to the point of having bloodlust. She often worries/wonders whether Raku and Chitoge''s "fake relationship" is actually developing into something more than just that. Chitoge and Kosaki have a really trusting r', '/uploads/images/c_52723.jpg'),
(59, 'Ruri Miyamoto', '宮本るり', '配角', 'Yumi Uchiyama', '__Height:__ 145 cm She is [Kosaki](https://anilist.co/character/52723/Kosaki-Onodera)''s friend. She supports Kosaki''s love for [Raku](https://anilist.co/character/48393/Raku-Ichijou), often giving her a push from behind to take the next step forward. Also beats up Shu for his perverted comments. ~!She fell in love with Shu later on in the series and eventually confessed to him. She also said that she will wait for Shu to get over his feelings for Kyoko. In the final chapter it is shown that she is now working as a translator and living with Shu.!~', '/uploads/images/c_58281.jpg'),
(59, 'Seishirou Tsugumi', '鶫 誠士郎', '配角', 'Mikako Komatsu', '**Height:** 165 cm Tsugumi is a hitwoman who was raised and trained by [Claude](https://anilist.co/character/82933/Claude-Ringheart) of the Beehive Gangsters. Tsugumi is originally introduced as a guy who transfers to [Chitoge](https://anilist.co/character/48391/Chitoge-Kirisaki)''s class, and has orders to protect her from [Raku](https://anilist.co/character/48393/Raku-Ichijou), whom she thinks forced Chitoge into the relationship. She and Chitoge are childhood friends; she tries to keep a ten year old promise of becoming strong to protect Chitoge. However, after Raku treats her nicely, she begins to develop some feelings for him, even though she is too stubborn and embarrassed to admit it. In America, her assassin code name is "Black Tiger", who had a rivalry with "[White Fang](https://anilist.co/character/84917/McCoy-Paula)". She does well academically, having ranked next to Chitoge on a yearly exam.', '/uploads/images/c_58885.jpg'),
(59, 'Shuu Maiko', '舞子集', '配角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '**Height:** 174 cm Although Shuu appears to be playful, he is actually very sensitive. He was the first one who realized that [Chitoge](https://anilist.co/character/48391/Chitoge-Kirisaki) and [Raku](https://anilist.co/character/48393/Raku-Ichijou) were not actually dating. Also, he was the only one who seemed to realize that [Tsugumi](https://anilist.co/character/58885/Seishirou-Tsugumi) was a girl, though he hid the thought and decided to play along just for his own amusement. Also, it should be noted that Shuu is the kind of person that would do almost anything for a laugh. Best friend of Raku Ichijou.', '/uploads/images/c_63489.jpg'),
(59, 'Marika Tachibana', '橘万里花', '配角', 'Kana Asumi', '**Height:** 152 cm Marika transfers to [Raku](https://anilist.co/character/48393/Raku-Ichijou)''s class and is introduced as his fiancée; she bears a key that she thinks will unlock Raku''s pendant, and is the most vocal about expressing her love to Raku. She is the daughter of the police chief, and has been in love with Raku for the past ten years. She does not get along with [Chitoge](https://anilist.co/character/48391/Chitoge-Kirisaki); she states she hates girls with long hair despite the fact that she also has long hair. She has a frail constitution; ten years prior, she was frequently visited by a young Raku, who brought her gifts and sparked a friendship with her. She used to speak in a rather vulgar manner but has attempted to correct her language after Raku had told her that he likes a girly girl with long hair. However, when flustered, she reverts to her old speaking habits.', '/uploads/images/c_66597.jpg'),
(59, 'Claude Ringheart', 'クロード', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', '**Height:** 190 cm Claude is one of the leaders of the Bee Hive Gangsters, and one of the few characters who suspects the relationship between [Raku](https://anilist.co/character/48393/Raku-Ichijou) and [Chitoge](https://anilist.co/character/48391/Chitoge-Kirisaki) is fake. He stalks Chitoge regularly to make sure Raku does not take advantage of her. Chitoge stated that when she was young, she was unable to make friends because of Claude''s over-protectiveness and background checks. He raises [Tsugumi](https://anilist.co/character/58885/Seishirou-Tsugumi) as a hitman, and appears to be clueless as to her gender, having given her a boy''s name, Seshirou.', '/uploads/images/c_82933.jpg'),
(59, 'Adelt Wogner Kirisaki', 'アーデルト 桐崎 ウォグナー', '配角', 'Masashi Ebara', '**Height:** 192 cm [Chitoge](https://anilist.co/character/48391/Chitoge-Kirisaki)''s father and husband of [Hana](https://anilist.co/character/84919/Hana-Kirisaki). Adel is an old friend of the father of [Raku](https://anilist.co/character/48393/Raku-Ichijou) despite disagreements between of the Yakuza and Mafia.', '/uploads/images/c_82935.jpg'),
(59, 'Ryuunosuke Sasaki', '佐々木 竜之介', '配角', 'Nobuyuki Hiyama', '**Height:** 188 cm He is the head member of the Shuei-Gumi Clan much like Claude is of the Bee Hive Gang.', '/uploads/images/c_82937.jpg'),
(59, 'Kyouko Nichihara', 'キョーコちゃん', '配角', 'Hitomi Nabatame', '**Height:** 169 cm English teacher of first year, class C. She has appeared since the first story. A rough character.', '/uploads/images/c_84909.jpg'),
(59, 'Gen Tachibana', '橘巌', '配角', 'Fumihiko Tachiki', '**Height:** 195 cm He is the father of [Marika Tachibana](https://anilist.co/character/66597/Marika-Tachibana) and holds the highest rank in the Police Department.', '/uploads/images/c_86127.jpg'),
(59, 'Nanako Onodera', '小野寺菜々子', '配角', 'Sayaka Oohara', '**Height:** 173 cm Mother of [Haru](https://anilist.co/character/84911/Haru-Onodera) and [Kosaki](https://anilist.co/character/52723/Kosaki-Onodera). She is also the owner of the Onodera Sweets Shop.', '/uploads/images/c_86129.png'),
(59, 'Shinobu Honda', '本田忍', '配角', 'You Taichi', 'Honda is Marika''s personal attendant and police escort. She monitors Marika and at times advises her to not overexert herself due to her frail condition. ~!In chapter 195, it is revealed that her name before gaining her title as a shinobu is Youko.!~', '/uploads/images/c_167794.png'),
(59, 'Issei Ichijou', '一条一征', '配角', 'Kenichi Ogata', '__Height__: 163 cm He is the former boss of the Shuei-Gumi Clan, and the father of [Raku](https://anilist.co/character/48393/Raku-Ichijou).', '/uploads/images/c_250828.png'),
(59, 'Yoshino', '吉野', '配角', 'Haruo Yamagishi', 'One of the frequent costumers of Onodera''s Sweet Shop.', '/uploads/images/c_328478.png'),
(60, 'Shirou Emiya', '衛宮士郎', '主角', 'Noriaki Sugiyama', '__Height:__ 167 cm Shirou is the main character of Fate/stay night. He is a serious yet helpful, hardworking, and honest teenager. His hobbies include fixing a variety of broken things, from VCRs to stoves, as well as cooking and cleaning. He is initially confused about the Holy Grail War and attempts to irrationally shield others from danger, including his own Servant, [Saber](https://anilist.co/character/497)', '/uploads/images/c_496.jpg'),
(60, 'Artoria Pendragon', 'アルトリア・ペンドラゴン', '主角', 'Ayako Kawasumi', '__Height:__ 154 cm (5''1) Artoria Pendragon, better known as Arthur Pendragon and King Arthur, is regarded as a male in history but is actually female. She is the "Once and Future King" and a legendary hero of Britain known as the King of Knights. She used to wield the sword from the stone, Caliburn, but it was eventually destroyed and the Lady of the Lake gifted her with Excalibur and Avalon. __In Fate/Prototype:__ ~!He is presented as male instead, conserving his original name of Arthur Pendragon. Also called Prototype Saber, he is the Saber-class Servant under the control of [Ayaka Sajyou](https://anilist.co/character/54223).!~ __In Fate/stay night:__ ~!Saber is summoned in the Fifth Holy Grail War as the Servant of [Shirou Emiya](https://anilist.co/character/496). Shirou had been having dreams of Excalibur in the days leading up to the start of the Holy Grail War after receiving his Command Spells and, while stumbling in his shed during his escape from [Lancer](https://anilist.co/character/499), Avalon, hidden inside him, reacts to the traces of a magic circle and summons Artoria as his Servant.!~ __In Fate/stay night: Heaven''s Feel:__ ~! Corrupted by [Angra Mainyu](https://anilist.co/character/120855), Artoria is vastly different from her normal self. She is also called Saber Alter/Black Saber. The results of her alteration is not only within Artoria''s interior but also extends to her outward appearance. The color of her skin becomes pale, and the pupil of her eyes that w', '/uploads/images/c_497.png'),
(60, 'Rin Tohsaka', '遠坂凛', '主角', 'Kana Ueda', '__Height:__ 124 cm (Fate/Zero), 159 cm (Fate/stay night) Rin is a model student and idol of [Shirou](https://anilist.co/character/496)''s school. She barely talks to other students in her school and exhibits a desire to be left alone, as exemplified by her tendency to stay on the school''s rooftop, away from the rest of the students. She is also secretly a Magus and a Master in the Fifth Holy Grail War. In the beginning of the anime, she summons [Archer](https://anilist.co/character/2087) for her Servant, although she originally wanted to summon Saber. Rin is reared as the successor to her family''s magecraft, instructed by her father, [Tokiomi Tohsaka](https://anilist.co/character/16017), to prioritize sorcery over her own interests. After her father is killed, Rin continues to perfect her sorcery, with some guidance from her guardian, [Kirei Kotomine](https://anilist.co/character/506). She strives to earn the admiration of her peers to avoid drawing attention to her private life, even though she is secretly stingy, tomboyish, and a perfectionist. She is perceptive, resourceful and avidly competitive. ~!Rin is [Sakura](https://anilist.co/character/500/Matou-Sakura)''s older sister, but the two were forced to live apart by their father, Tokiomi. Rin once had a good relationship with Sakura before their separation, evident by a ribbon Sakura always kept. Rin later convinced herself that Sakura was living a happier life with the Matou family than she was living as the Tohsaka famil', '/uploads/images/c_498.png'),
(60, 'Cú  Chulainn', 'クー・フーリン', '配角', 'Nobutoshi Kanna', 'Born as Sètanta from a mortal woman, Deichtine, and the Sun God Lugh he''s a Hero from the Ulster Cycle of Irish Mythology. He took the name Cú Chulainn after he killed the guard dog of the blacksmith Culann, said to be stronger than 10 men, when he was only a child. To make up to the old blacksmith he offered himself as a guard dog and since then was called Cú Chulainn, "Culann''s savage dog". Trained in the Arts of the Spear and magic Runes by Scáthach, he wields the cursed Gàe Bolg, the spear that inflicts wounds that never heal. __In Fate/Stay Night:__ ~! Originally the servant of [Bazett Fraga McRemitz](https://anilist.co/character/24332/Fraga-McRemitz-Bazett), he becomes the Servant of [Kirei Kotomine](https://anilist.co/character/506/Kotomine-Kirei) after Kirei fatally wounds Bazett and remains under his command for the duration of the War. !~ __In Fate/Grand Order -First Order:__ ~! He is a Caster-class servant. Unlike the other Servants, he''s not blackened and aids [Mash](https://anilist.co/character/120735/Kyrielight-Mash) and [Ritsuka](https://anilist.co/character/120734/Fujimaru-Ritsuka) in their task !~ __In Fate/hollow Ataraxia:__ ~! [Caren Hortensia](https://anilist.co/character/46957/Hortensia-Caren) acts as his Master.!~', '/uploads/images/c_499.jpg'),
(60, 'Sakura Matou', '間桐桜', '配角', 'Noriko Shitaya', '__Height:__ 120 cm (Fate/Zero), 156 cm (Fate/stay night) A student in her first year of high school, Sakura is the sister of [Shinji Mato](https://anilist.co/character/501). After [Shirou](https://anilist.co/character/496)''s father [Kiritsugu](https://anilist.co/character/10010) died, Sakura often visited Shirou''s home to help him with his daily chores. She is outwardly shy and timid, but possesses great inner strength. Sakura has a long standing and obvious crush on Shirou Emiya.', '/uploads/images/c_500.png'),
(60, 'Shinji Matou', '間桐慎二', '配角', 'Hiroshi Kamiya', '[Sakura Matou](https://anilist.co/character/500/Matou-Sakura)''s older brother, and a long-time friend of [Shirou](https://anilist.co/character/496/Emiya-Shirou). Shinji is very popular as vice-captain of the archery dojo despite being chauvinistic and a narcissist. Like [Rin Tohsaka](https://anilist.co/character/498/Tohsaka-Rin), he is of a distinguished lineage of sorcerers, though the Matou blood has thinned and no longer produces heirs naturally capable of sorcery. Shinji feels uncomfortable with his sister''s daily visits to Shirou''s home. He has an open crush on Rin, but she does not return his favors.', '/uploads/images/c_501.jpg'),
(60, 'Medusa', 'メドゥーサ', '配角', 'Yuu Asakawa', '~!Medusa is a Greek mythological figure described as a winged human female with living venomous snakes in place of hair. Those who gazed upon her face would turn to stone. With her older sisters [Stheno](https://anilist.co/character/191058/Stheno) and [Euryale](https://anilist.co/character/191065/Euryale), they made up the three Gorgon Sisters who inhabited the Shapeless Isle. She came into existence thanks to the thoughts and prayers of humans, who desired a perfect goddess, but she was cursed for her beauty and turned into a monster hated by all. She is thus not a Heroic Spirit but a monster closer to a Divine Spirit. Due to her nature, she can manifest through different aspects depending on which disposition is predominant (more or less monstrous)!~ __In Fate/stay night:__ ~!She is the Rider-class Servant of [Shinji Matou](https://anilist.co/character/501/Matou-Shinji) in the Fifth Holy Grail War of Fate/stay night.!~ __In Fate/stay night: Heaven''s Feel:__ ~!She only truly acts as [Sakura](https://anilist.co/character/500/Matou-Sakura)''s Servant when their connection is revealed in Heaven''s Feel.!~ __In Fate/Grand Order - First Order:__ ~!She is a Lancer-class Servant. Medusa is Blackened, a process by which a being is tainted by an outside force, causing their personality to be reversed toward the orientation of evil.!~ __In Fate/Grand Order: Absolute Demonic Front Babylonia:__ ~!In this singularity Medusa manifests as two separate beings: One is Ana, a Lancer-class Serva', '/uploads/images/c_502.jpg'),
(60, 'Illyasviel von Einzbern', 'イリヤスフィール・フォン・アインツベルン', '配角', 'Mai Kadowaki', '**Height:** 133 cm **Birthday in [Fate/kaleid](https://anilist.co/manga/33526/): **Jul 20 A young Teutonic aristocrat, she traveled to Japan to participate in the Holy Grail War as a Master. Illyasviel has an angelic appearance and an unsurpassed degree of magical power. She lives in a castle on the outskirts of Fuyuki City, accompanied only by her Servant and two maids. Illyasviel asks those she feels comfortable around to simply call her "Illya".', '/uploads/images/c_503.png'),
(60, 'Heracles', 'ヘラクレス', '配角', 'Tadahisa Saizen', '__In Fate/Stay Night:__ ~!The Servant of [Illya](https://anilist.co/character/503/von-Einzbern-Illyasviel), he is a swarthy giant with adamantine skin and gross brawn. He wields a colossal stone Axe-Sword, and is capable of causing massive destruction with the mere backlash of his swings. As a Berserker, he was stripped of his sanity and reason, acting feral and animalistic in combat. Berserkers are praised as members of the "Strongest" class, though they are difficult to control. Illya, however, appears to have little trouble managing Berserker.!~', '/uploads/images/c_504.jpg'),
(60, 'Taiga Fujimura', '藤村大河', '配角', 'Miki Itou', '__Height:__ 165 cm She is an English teacher at [Shirou''s](https://anilist.co/character/496/Emiya-Shirou) school, homeroom instructor of Shirou''s class and the supervising teacher for the archery dojo. After [Kiritsugu](https://anilist.co/character/10010/Emiya-Kiritsugu) died, Taiga became Shirou''s guardian and has been living with him for several years. Taiga and Shirou are very close, and she regards him as a younger brother. She''s initially distrustful of [Saber](https://anilist.co/character/497/Pendragon-Artoria), believing that "some strange woman was trying to take Shirou from her" as she put it. She becomes exasperated whenever a new girl appears at Shirou''s house, thinking he stashes girls at his house. Taiga always shows up for breakfast and dinner at Shirou''s house to have some of [Sakura''s](https://anilist.co/character/500/Matou-Sakura) cooking, and always saves some scraps from breakfast for her lunch. ~!During Rider''s Blood Fort attack on Shirou''s school, Taiga was the only person who could still move around somewhat. Begging [Shinji Matou](https://anilist.co/character/501/Matou-Shinji) for help, he quickly kicks her in the head, knocking her unconscious. She recovers quickly though, even pigging-out on hospital food while recovering.!~', '/uploads/images/c_505.jpg'),
(60, 'Kirei Kotomine', '言峰綺礼', '配角', 'Jouji Nakata', '__Height:__ 185 cm (Fate/Zero), 193 cm (Fate/stay night) ~!Through an agreement between the Mages'' Association and the Church, the Holy Grail Wars are moderated by a priest. Kirei''s father was the mediator for the 4th Holy Grail War, and when he died, Kirei felt obligated to replace him. His selection as mediator is unusual, for Kirei is a member of both the Church and Mages'' Association, organizations on hostile terms with one another. Since the death of [Rin](https://anilist.co/character/498/Tohsaka-Rin)''s father, he has also acted as an indirect caretaker for Rin.!~', '/uploads/images/c_506.png'),
(60, 'Archer', 'アーチャー', '主角', 'Junichi Suwabe', '__Height:__ 187 cm (6''1) __In Fate/stay night UBW:__ ~!He is the Servant of one of the series'' main heroines, [Rin Tousaka](https://anilist.co/character/498/Tohsaka-Rin). Due to an incomplete summon, he apparently has no memory of his previous life or identity. Archer is sarcastic and cynical but under his hardened exterior lies a complex and dark personality that unfolds throughout the story. Though skilled with ranged weapons, he can hold his own in melee combat. Archer considers [Shirou Emiya](https://anilist.co/character/496/Emiya-Shirou)''s idealism to be weak and delusional, recognizing the mentality of "wanting to save everyone" as naive and impossible. Archer is actually a future version of Emiya Shirou, who became a hero through Emiya''s wish to save innocent lives. After his death he became a Counter Guardian, a Spirit deployed to maintain balance and prevent humanity''s extinction, but without the ability to act on his own he was forced to kill and face the fact that his ideals were not realizable time and time again. To escape this cycle the only hope for EMIYA was to be summoned as a Heroic Spirit and kill his past self before he became a Counter Guardian, which would cause a time paradox and release him from the cycle.!~ __In Fate/Grand Order - First Order:__ ~!EMIYA was Blackened, a process by which a being is tainted by an outside force, causing their personality to be reversed toward the orientation of evil!~', '/uploads/images/c_2087.jpg'),
(60, 'Gilgamesh', 'ギルガメッシュ', '配角', 'Tomokazu Seki', '__Height:__ 182 cm Gilgamesh is the King of Uruk, said to have reigned during the Sumer Dynasty in Mesopotamia 5000 years ago. He''s the namesake Hero described in the Epic of Gilgamesh, making him the most ancient Hero on which all the others legends were modeled. This grants him the title of King of Heroes and, within his Gates of Babylon, the prototypes of all the Noble Phantasms of the Heroes yet to come. Born from the human Lugalbanda, the King of Uruk, and the goddess Rimat-Ninsun, he was a being so perfect and transcendent to the point that he was two-thirds deity and one-third human. He was the chosen one that would guide humanity on the earth that was slowly abandoning the Age of Gods, but instead he grew up to be a selfish and arrogant despot. His only friend and being he considered his equal was [Enkidu](https://anilist.co/character/60059). __In Fate/Zero:__ ~! Initially summoned as the Archer-class Servant of [Tokiomi Toosaka](https://anilist.co/character/16017/Tokiomi-Toosaka) in the 4th Holy Grail War, using the fossil of the first skin ever shed by a snake as a catalyst, he soon becomes bored with his Master and takes interest in Kirei Kotomine. Together they plot to kill Tokiomi and forge a new pact, with Gilgamesh pushing Kotomine to accept his true desires. He also takes interest in Iskandar as a worthy opponent to kill, and in Artoria, a tragic figure to take as his bride. In the end, invested by the pollution of the Holy Grail, he is gifted a mortal body an', '/uploads/images/c_2514.png'),
(60, 'Kojirou Sasaki', '佐々木小次郎', '配角', 'Shinichirou Miki', 'He was summoned by [Caster](https://anilist.co/character/3440/Medea) as a guardian and watchmen for the front gate of the Ryudo Temple. As an improper servant, Assassin is entirely dependent on Caster for mana and cannot move freely beyond the grounds of Ryudoji. Furthermore, he lacks most of the usual parameters and abilities granted to his class. Because of his limited status, Assassin cares little for the Holy Grail, and outside of his duties to Caster, he only seeks to enjoy a decent sword fight.', '/uploads/images/c_2585.png'),
(60, 'Soichirou Kuzuki', '葛木宗一郎', '配角', 'Masaki Terasoma', 'A well-built man with angular glasses, Kuzuki is the strict homeroom instructor of [Rin''s](https://anilist.co/character/498/Tohsaka-Rin) class. He primarily lectures on World History, though he also holds classes in Ethics. Kuzuki is well respected among staff and students, but he is widely regarded as austere and impersonal. ~!A serial killer, he is [Caster''s](https://anilist.co/character/3440/Medea) ally but acts more as her servant. He is in love with Caster although he hides it completely. He hid the fact that they had been defeated by the protagonists from Caster when she lay dying to spare her feelings; saying that victory was theirs he held her until she died, and perished himself immediately afterward.!~', '/uploads/images/c_3439.jpg'),
(60, 'Medea', 'メデイア', '配角', 'Atsuko Tanaka', '__Height:__ 163 cm __Servant type:__ Caster ~!An honored guest of the Ryudou family​ permitted to live at their temple until the preparations for her marriage have been finalized. A gorgeous and talented yet mysterious woman of high stature, her presence has attracted the attention of many trainee monks.!~', '/uploads/images/c_3440.png'),
(60, 'Kiritsugu Emiya', '衛宮切嗣', '配角', 'Rikiya Koyama', '__Height:__ 175 cm __Sidearm:__ Thompson contender in conjunction with his Mystic Code Origin Bullets [Shirou](https://anilist.co/character/496)''s foster father and his savior from the aftermath of the massive Fuyuki fire. During his lifetime, Kiritsugu was disillusioned with becoming a Hero of Justice, a defender of humanity who could save everyone. Although he feels he failed to do so, his efforts were a source of inspiration for Shirou. Prior to his fateful meeting with Shirou, Kiritsugu was notorious as the "Magus Killer," a freelancer who would hunt down heretical magi. Although he was a magus with Magic Circuits and abilities he was considered unorthodox in that he would utilize modern technology and weaponry along with his magecraft to track down and kill magi. Although mentioned and seen in flashbacks in Fate/stay night, Kiritsugu is one of the main protagonists in its prequel Fate/Zero. ~!It is hinted at in certain parts of Fate/stay night and confirmed in its prequel Fate/Zero that Kiritsugu is in fact [Illyasviel von Einzbern](https://anilist.co/character/503/von-Einzbern-Illyasviel)''s biological father, making Shirou and her step-siblings.!~', '/uploads/images/c_10010.png'),
(60, 'Issei Ryuudou', '柳洞一成', '配角', 'Mitsuaki Madono', 'Issei is the Student Body President of Shirō''s school, and another close friend of [Shirō](https://anilist.co/character/496/Emiya-Shirou). Issei often asks Shirō to fix broken equipment for the Student Body to try and reduce save money on the school''s bill. Issei and Shirō often have lunch together in the Student Body''s office where they talk about what ever comes to mind. His father is the head priest of Ryūdōji Temple, and his brother was a classmate of [Taiga](https://anilist.co/character/505/Fujimura-Taiga) and [Neko-san](https://anilist.co/character/187774/Hotaruzuka-Otoko). He dislikes [Rin](https://anilist.co/character/498/Tohsaka-Rin) and seems to have some sort of fear of females, although he seems to be unusually at ease around [Saber](https://anilist.co/character/497/Pendragon-Artoria). ~!Issei unknowingly tells Shirō that [Caster](https://anilist.co/character/3440/Medea) is at the Temple.!~', '/uploads/images/c_15937.png'),
(60, 'Ayako Mitsuzuri', '美綴綾子', '配角', 'Fumie Mizusawa', '__Height:__ 162 cm A stellar athlete, and captain of the archery dojo. Ayako and [Rin](https://anilist.co/character/498/Tohsaka-Rin) are actively competing to see who will be the first to snag a boyfriend. Ayako often asks [Shirou](https://anilist.co/character/496/Emiya-Shirou) to come to the archery dojo and watch them practice. ~!She is victimized by [Rider](https://anilist.co/character/502/Medusa) or [Caster](https://anilist.co/character/3440/Medea) early in the story and is later found unconscious in an alleyway. After she is attacked, Ayako is not seen again.!~ In the anime, ~!Ayako is seen with [Shinji](https://anilist.co/character/501/Matou-Shinji) after her disappearance, although Shinji denies it when asked by Shirou.!~', '/uploads/images/c_21024.png'),
(60, 'Leysritt', 'リーゼリット', '配角', 'Miho Miyagawa', 'Leysritt is a homunculus created by the Einzbern family to serve as a maid much like Sella. Despite her appearance, she is only about two years old. Regardless of her thin ego, she developed a sense of reason due to her alignment with Illya. As a result, Leysritt often says what she thinks without any consideration and this gets her often into a verbal conflict with Sella. She and Illya are actually very close friends and should Illya die, Leysritt would die as well. In contrast to Sella, she possesses a casual personality but has difficulty expressing her emotions and comes across as robotic at times. However, she appears to enjoy teasing Sella and also takes a liking to Shirou because his presence makes Illya happy.', '/uploads/images/c_24333.jpg'),
(60, 'Sella', 'セラ', '配角', 'Haruhi Nanao', 'Sella is a homunculus created by the Einzbern family to serve as a maid and to teach Illya sorcery. Despite her appearance, she is only about two years old. Sella is highly protective of Illya, whom she loves and cares for deeply, and thus is very suspicious of Shirou Emiya. Despite her apparent coldness to everyone but Illya, Sella is actually rather fickle and insecure, particularly about her body, and Leysritt and Illya often tease Sella for her harsh personality.', '/uploads/images/c_44025.jpg'),
(60, 'Kaede Makidera', '蒔寺楓', '配角', 'Michiru Yuimoto', 'Classification: Human Height: 163 cm Weight: 49 kg BWH: 72-56-78 Likes: wind chimes, competition Dislikes: Failure Affiliation: Homurahara Academy, Year 2 class A, track team Kaede is a friend of Rin Toosaka and known at Homura academy as the leader of track team. Even though she wishes to be called "Black Panther of Homura", her real nickname is simply "Maki." (Source: Type-Moon Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_142729.jpg'),
(60, 'Yukika Saegusa', '三枝由紀香', '配角', 'Eri Nakao', 'Classification: Human Weight: 39 kg Height: 155 cm BWH: 75-57-78 Likes: cooking, taking care of her brothers Dislikes: sports Affiliation: Homurahara Academy, Year 2 class A, track team Yukika is a gentle, cheerful girl and the mascot of the famous Homura Academy track girl trio, along with Kaede and Kane. She also is one of the few non-magi who can see Assassin sitting in front of Ryuudou Temple. (Source: Type-Moon Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_142730.jpg'),
(60, 'Kane  Himuro', '氷室鐘', '配角', 'Rie Nakagawa', 'She is a student at Homurahara School. She is a friend of Yukika Saegusa and Kaede Makidera, they are known as Class 2-A''s famed track girl trio and she generally plays the straight man of the group. She is the track team''s high-jumping ace. She is considerate and intelligent. She is the brains of the trio. She is quiet, reserved, and doesn''t speak that much as well. She is Minori''s best friend and has a passion for gossip, especially if it involves those around her. (Source: Type-Moon Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_142731.jpg'),
(60, 'Otoko Hotaruzuka', '蛍塚音子', '配角', '', 'Otoko Hotaruzuka is the daughter of the owner of Copenhagen in Fuyuki. Otoko went to highschool with [Taiga Fujimura](https://anilist.co/character/505/Fujimura-Taiga), keeping a close friendship since then. During the Fourth Holy Grail War, [Rider](https://anilist.co/character/16021/Iskandar) stole a barrel of wine from their bar meant for the Fujimura family, prompting Taiga to track down the culprit out of friendship. Five years before the Fifth Holy Grail War, [Shirou Emiya](https://anilist.co/character/496/Emiya-Shirou) came to start working for them. He took any job given to him, even including working while both she and her father were out sick.', '/uploads/images/c_187774.jpg'),
(61, 'Sora', '空', '主角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', '__Race:__ Human Abandoned by his parents, Sora is a brilliant NEET (Not in Education, Employment, or Training) hikikomori (shut-in) gamer along with his stepsister, [Shiro](https://anilist.co/character/82525/Shiro). He does not take life very seriously and is pretty much a good-for-nothing gamer. One day, he and his sister are called into an alternate world and they have to become Saviors of Humanity! Despite being a NEET and a shut-in, Sora is extremely outgoing and confident, and is not afraid to play games with people face to face, even when they''re cheating. He is also extremely manipulative - which he refers to as using negotiating skills. This fits in with his play style as while Shiro is excellent at logic and computing, Sora can read people and predict what their next move is, using this knowledge to beat them. However, if he is separated from Shiro by so much as a closed door he becomes a spineless, cowardly wreck, and only returns to his former self if he is able to see her. He views his sister as his equal and partner, but is also protective of her, shown by actions such as putting his body between her and the ground when he thought they were going to hit hard when first arriving on Disboard. Sora is extroverted and has no problems dealing with people. While not as intelligent as Shiro, he is shown to have a brilliant IQ. Rather than computing numbers like Shiro, Sora can rapidly compute what his opponents are going to do based on observing their behavior and motiv', '/uploads/images/c_82523.png'),
(61, 'Stephanie Dola', 'ステファニー・ドーラ', '主角', 'Youko Hikasa', '__Race:__ Imanity Stephanie is expressive and emotional, to the point where she cannot hide her emotions during a poker game. She loved her grandfather dearly and is angered when people call her grandfather a fool. She fell in love with [Sora](https://anilist.co/character/82523/Sora) due to the pledges forcing her to, and she often has violent outbursts to try to break free of it. She loves her kingdom and the world and believes in the potential of Imanity.', '/uploads/images/c_82527.png'),
(61, 'Jibril', 'ジブリール', '主角', 'Yukari Tamura', '__Race:__ Flügel Jibril is the youngest and strongest of the Flügel race. Her love toward knowledge starts even before the declaration of the Ten Oaths. She is against the book sharing law, and left her homeland to win the main library of the human world from the previous king in a game. ~!Unlike [Steph](https://anilist.co/character/82527), Jibril is happy to become the siblings underling, and is shown growing feelings toward [Sora](https://anilist.co/character/82523).!~', '/uploads/images/c_87887.png'),
(61, 'Chlammy Zell', 'クラミー・ツェル', '配角', 'Yuka Iguchi', '__Height:__ 158cm A human who allied with several different races in order to win the king''s contest, due to her belief that humans will never be strong and must depend on others in order to survive.', '/uploads/images/c_88001.png'),
(61, 'Fiel Nilvalen', 'フィール・ニルヴァレン', '配角', 'Mamiko Noto', '__Race__: Elf Fiel Nilvalen who usually has her name shortened to Fii, is an Elf girl who is [Chlammy Zell](https://anilist.co/character/88001/Chlammy-Zell)''s game partner, as well as the one who helps her cheat using her elven magic. She is very protective of Chlammy and would go to great lengths to keep her safe. She is a hexa-caster (able to cast and maintain up to six spells at once), a very rare capability that only an extraordinary few possess. She is part of the Nilvalen family which may be a factor of her strong magic as a result of being a descendant of [Shinku Nilvalen](https://anilist.co/character/123694/Shinku--Nilvalen).', '/uploads/images/c_88002.jpg'),
(61, 'Izuna Hatsuse', '初瀬いづな', '配角', 'Miyuki Sawashiro', '__Race:__ Werebeast Izuna Hatsuse is a Werebeast girl and the former ambassador of the Werebeast race to Immanity. After [Sora](https://anilist.co/character/82523/Sora) and [Shiro](https://anilist.co/character/82525/Shiro) forced the werebeasts to join the Commonwealth of Elkia, Izuna was directed by [Miko](https://anilist.co/character/137440/Miko) to follow and learn from them. [Steph](https://anilist.co/character/82527/Dola-Stephanie) has noted that she actually shares similarities to Sora and Shiro, such as lacking common sense, being arrogant towards others, and being extremely smart and competent at gaming. She mostly exhibits an innocent personality pertaining to her age yet is very competent at playing games to the point of representing the Werebeasts in national games against other races. She possesses all the incredible physical abilities found in all Werebeasts as well as the rare Blood Break found in a select few Werebeast individuals.', '/uploads/images/c_88003.png'),
(61, 'Tet', 'テト', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', '__Race__: None (Formerly: Old Deus) Tet is the One True God of Disboard. Tet does not belong to any of the 16 races, although the closest affiliation to him would be Immanity. To challenge Tet for the title of the One True God, one must collect all pieces of different chess from 16 races. This means that, under the tenth rule of the Ten Covenants, one must defeat or unite all 16 races before being able to play against him. ~!He was born from [Riku](https://anilist.co/character/123691/Riku-Dola)''s wish and the overwhelming presence of incredible magic energy. Claiming the Suniaster and becoming the One True God, Tet immediately used his absolute power to repair the damage done to the planet and set forth the Ten Covenants, thus ending the Great War.!~', '/uploads/images/c_88004.png'),
(61, 'Mahakoht Dola', 'マハコート・ドーラ', '配角', 'Jun Fukushima', 'The previous ruler of Imanity, as well as Steph''s grandfather. His reign led to many losses for Imanity, thus many people call him a, "Foolish King." He is terrible at games, being unable to win a majority. However, he is able to give Imanity a chance by finding out opponent''s secrets. When he was near the end of his life, he entrusted Steph with, "The Key to Imanity''s Hope;" which is to be given to someone who is capable of saving Imanity.', '/uploads/images/c_88267.png'),
(61, 'Azriel', 'アズリール', '配角', 'Yui Horie', 'The first Flügel created by Artosh and Representative of the Council of Eighteen Wings. As such, her title allows her to have first say in emergencies. She calls Jibril her "little sister". During the war, she conveyed Artosh''s will among other Flügel. After the war, she passed the law in which Flügel shared books among each other. Azriel has a somewhat split personality, being peppy and bubbly to a cold, relentless state. Prior to Jibril''s creation, Azriel was merciless and considered other Flügel expendable; afterwards, however, she turned into a sister figure when Jibril came to be. Even so, she continues to have a condescending attitude towards lower exceed races. She is extremely powerful as the first Flügel to be created, being able to pull off many feats. This is further enhanced by her mental connection with Avant Heim, while also being its representative. Even with her strength, Jibril considers Azriel to be rather stupid compared to other Flügel. Despite this, Azriel is clever when it comes to mind games and deception. What she lacks is an understanding of learning, trying, and failing; preventing her from learning from her mistakes.', '/uploads/images/c_126084.jpg'),
(61, 'Queen', 'クイーン', '配角', 'Risa Taneda', 'Queen is the in-game name of a character, who was not mentioned in the original light novel, who is said to be the strongest member of 『Night Opera』, a guild of 1,200 players. She appears in the first episode of the anime. She finds 『 』 to be cool and smart since they were able to dodge her attacks despite her using dishonest means (cheating) to cast consecutive spells.', '/uploads/images/c_134187.png'),
(61, 'Miko', '巫女', '配角', 'Naomi Shindou', '__Race:__ Werebeast Miko is the representative of the Werebeasts and rules over the Eastern Union. She lost her real name during the formation of the country when placing it as a wager. She looked down on Immanity at first, but after forming a truce with Sora and joining the Commonwealth of Elkia, she starts to have faith in the siblings who represent Immanity. She contains the rare Werebeast ability, Blood Break. Also, being a Blood Break capable individual, she ages very slowly. Sora had hypothesized Miko''s age to be at least 58 years old, but her true age remains unknown. Despite her true age, Miko holds the appearance of a woman in her 20''s. ~!Miko had to spend at least 50 years to unite the various Werebeast tribes into what is currently the Eastern Union, in which she lost her original name in a bet and gained her title as she contacted a certain Old Deus.!~', '/uploads/images/c_137440.jpg'),
(61, 'Ino Hatsuse', '初瀬いの', '配角', 'Mugihito', 'A werebeast and Izuna''s grandpa. He is protective of Izuna and dislikes it when she is close to Sora and Shiro. According to Miko, Hatsuse has thirty wives, much to Sora''s chagrin. Hatsuse acts in a formal manner, being friendly around guests and officials. However, if he''s around rude or condescending people, he will usually reciproctate their attitudes back. Hatsuse also is very perverted, telling many dirty jokes while not on a job. He was also banished from his tribe due to having experiences with every woman in his tribe. As he has 30 wives, he wishes for polygamy to be legal in the Eastern Union; which is one reason why he works under Miko.', '/uploads/images/c_139371.png'),
(61, 'Koukan', '高官', '配角', 'Taketora', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_175514.png'),
(61, 'Senshi', '戦士', '配角', 'Shinobu Matsumoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_175515.png'),
(61, 'Touzoku', '盗賊', '配角', 'Itaru Yamamoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_175516.png'),
(61, 'Sakaba no Onna', '酒場の女', '配角', 'Yuka Keichou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_329566.png'),
(61, 'Nourin Daijin', '農林大臣', '配角', 'Haruki Ishiya', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_329567.png'),
(61, 'Keizai Daijin', '経済大臣', '配角', 'Taisuke Nishimura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_329568.png'),
(62, 'Yato', '夜ト', '主角', 'Hiroshi Kamiya', '__Race:__ God __Height:__ 174 cm (5’8”) __Occupation:__ God of War, Delivery God, God of Calamity (previously) Yato is one of the three main protagonists of Noragami. An obscure god who considers himself a God of Fortune / Happiness and War, he has been labeled a God of Calamity and Depression in the past. Yato''s dream is to become a famous god, whom everyone worships. Yato can be mischievous, crude, and unpredictable in his behavior. He often has a low tolerance for something he wants, usually causing those around him to become upset. Furthermore, he is rather childish and gullible at times. Yato will often indulge in fantasies of being a very successful God with more followers than any other deity; shrines full of luxury and shrine maiden at his fingertips. As his existence would end if he were to be forgotten, he has developed Athazagoraphobia. ~!It is revealed that Yato''s real name is Yaboku (夜卜) Yaboku contains the kanji ya (夜 night) and boku (卜 divination). [Sakura](https://anilist.co/character/189754/Sakura) mistakenly read 卜 as the katakana ト to because of the similarities, thus giving the well-known alias name Yato.!~', '/uploads/images/c_84677.png'),
(62, 'Hiyori Iki', '壱岐ひより', '主角', 'Maaya Uchida', '__Race:__ Hanyou (Half Phantom, Half Human) __Height:__ 162,5 cm (~5''4") Hiyori Iki is a Half-Phantom who can leave her human body, being like this since she "saved" [Yato](https://anilist.co/character/84677/Yato) from an incoming bus. Despite being raised to be completely lady-like in a rich household, Hiyori is a huge martial arts fan and has a fixation on a martial artist called Touno, whom she adores and copies her attacks from. She often becomes inspired and acts on his words. Hiyori is a very pure, kind-hearted, and brave girl who will go out of her way to help someone in danger, even strangers, regardless of the severe consequences, including suffering from blight. She has a strong moral compass and is not above calling people out if she feels their actions are wrong. Hiyori is also extremely perceptive of those around her, but despite that she can be a bit air-headed too. She also has a strong liking to Yato''s smell and even called it her favorite smell on one occasion, but she becomes rather embarrassed by how much she likes it and dodges the subject whenever it is brought up.', '/uploads/images/c_84679.png'),
(62, 'Yukine', '雪音', '主角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Race:__ Shinki __Height:__ 147 cm (4''10") While wandering about as a spirit, Yukine was picked up by [Yato](https://anilist.co/character/84677) and made into a Shinki. When called "Sekki" he transforms into a katana. ~!He died at a young age, making him miss his normal life as a middle schooler. He acts like his age, and was once stealing money from people with the excuse that it''s okay since he''s dead. After being "saved" by [Hiyori](https://anilist.co/character/84679/Iki-Hiyori), he becomes more obedient and respects Yato and Hiyori. When he was alive he had trouble with his father as seen by Yato when he first obtains Yukine.!~ In a katana form, he finds Yato''s sweaty hands so disgusting that he calls him "Drippy."', '/uploads/images/c_84681.png'),
(62, 'Bishamon', '毘沙門', '配角', 'Miyuki Sawashiro', '__Race:__ God __Occupation:__ Goddess of Fortune and Goddess of War Bishamon is one of the Seven Gods of Fortune and also officially a Goddess of War and Warriors. She is intent on keeping order among the gods. Due to her past with [Yato](https://anilist.co/character/84677/Yato), she is bent on vengeance and decided to destroy anything he held dear to himself. Despite being a goddess, Bishamon is shown to be quite generous towards her Shinki. She willingly accepts any wandering and troubled spirit, useful or not, and adds them to her family. Due to her failure in the past involving Shinki, Bishamon decides to be more distant from them, depicting herself as a fierce goddess and making sure that they are not worried about her, which only resulted to them being more insecure and lonely. In the anime, Bishamon''s hair is depicted as blonde, as opposed of the silver hair in the manga.', '/uploads/images/c_88239.jpg'),
(62, 'Kazuma', '兆麻', '配角', 'Jun Fukuyama', '__Race:__ Shinki Kazuma is a calm, serious, and sensible person. He is one of [Bishamon''s](https://anilist.co/character/88239/Bishamon) Shinki and cares about her deeply. When he is called by his shinki name, "Chouki", Kazuma transforms into a cherry blossom-shaped earring with the ability to navigate and track others. ~!He is a Blessed Regalia.!~', '/uploads/images/c_88240.png'),
(62, 'Kofuku Ebisu', 'エビス 小福', '配角', 'Aki Toyosaki', 'Originally introduced as [Yato''s](https://anilist.co/character/84677/Yato) girlfriend that he frequently shakes down for money, Kofuku is later revealed to be the infamous Binbougami - a Japanese Goddess of Poverty. She goes by the cover name "Kofuku Ebisu" in order to make it seem as though she is a god of fortune. She has a Shinki named [Daikoku](https://anilist.co/character/88691/Daikoku).', '/uploads/images/c_88241.png'),
(62, 'Tenjin', '天神', '配角', 'Tooru Ookawa', 'He is the infamous god of academics. He has several shinki, all of them women (including Yato''s former shinki); and has his own shrine, much to Yato''s envy. He would sometimes assume human form to intervene if, for example, Yato goes out of control playing around.', '/uploads/images/c_88689.png'),
(62, 'Rabo', '蠃蚌', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', 'Rabo is an enigmatic character and appears only in the anime. He is often seen conversing with Nora and has been known to be able to control Phantoms.', '/uploads/images/c_88690.jpg'),
(62, 'Daikoku', '大黒', '配角', 'Daisuke Ono', 'Daikoku is [Kofuku''s](https://anilist.co/character/88241) somewhat overprotective shinki. He regards himself as Kofuku''s husband.', '/uploads/images/c_88691.png'),
(62, 'Nora', '野良', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', '__Race:__ Shinki __Occupation:__ Stray __Nora__ is a former shinki of [Yato](https://anilist.co/character/84677/Yato). "Nora," meaning "stray," is how the gods call any shinki who has many masters and many names, most notable owners of Nora are ~! [Ebisu](https://anilist.co/character/89120/Ebisu) and [Takemikazuchi](https://anilist.co/character/159592/Takemikazuchi) !~ Nora, at first comes off as very gentle and kind. She seems to care deeply for Yato, and continually prompts him to use her, because she was once a human and all she wanted was to have a family that cared about her. ~!Later, it is revealed how manipulating and cruel she is. She tries to kill Yukine, as well as taunt him, due to the fact that he was impure, but also because she wants Yato to use her instead of him. She also tries to kill Hiyori due to how close she has gotten to Yato and believing she has softened him. She is depicted to show interest in anything with beauty, as shown when she commented on Yukine''s eyes. She, just as Yato, is influenced and controlled by the actions and demands of "Father". Although she is initially seen as a villain, she is another puppet in the grand scheme of Yato''s father. !~', '/uploads/images/c_88692.png'),
(62, 'Ebisu', '恵比寿', '配角', 'Ryoutarou Okiayu', '__Race:__ God __Age:__ Ancient __Occupation:__ God of Fishing and Commerce __Ebisu__ is one of the Seven Gods of Fortune. He is the humorless God of Fishing and Commerce. Initially, Ebisu appears very stoic, always bearing a near-emotionless facial expression and speaking in a reserved, polite, yet aloof tone. He is also highly pragmatic and resourceful, constantly progressing towards his goals and willing to go to great lengths to achieve what he is after. Despite his aloof appearance and personality, he can actually be a silly person, making him appear rather comically serious at times. He is a kind god at heart. ~!Ebisu is later revealed to be attempting to gain control over phantoms; a severe taboo if not sin in the eyes of the heavensl.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89120.png'),
(62, 'Kuraha', '囷巴', '配角', 'Kazuhiko Inoue', 'Kuraha is a current Regalia to Bishamon. His regalia form is a male lion with a scar on his right eye.', '/uploads/images/c_89301.png'),
(62, 'Tsuguha', '紹巴', '配角', 'Ari Ozawa', 'Tsuguha is one of Bishamon''s Ten Shinki. She transforms into Bishamon''s bikini battle attire. Her vessel name is Shouki. ~!She becomes an ayakashi and is killed by Kazuma after finding out her birth name.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89304.png'),
(62, 'Aimi Tabata', '田端愛美', '配角', 'Yuuko Takayama', '__Nationality:__ Japanese __Occupation:__ High School Student Aimi Tabata is one of Hiyori''s friends from school. Not much has been shown about her personality. However, it is known that she is kind and supportive of Hiyori. She seems to be reasonable, calm, and mature. She often worries for Hiyori when she falls asleep (due to her soul slipping out of her body).', '/uploads/images/c_121612.jpg'),
(62, 'Mayu', '真喩', '配角', 'Asami Imai', '__Race:__ Shinki Mayu has a very honest personality and a strong sense of justice. During the time she worked for Yato, she couldn’t stand his attitudes because not only he always lazed around, but he also often talked about killing and didn’t seem to care about humans that needed his help. Because of this she complained a lot and always insulted and badmouthed Yato after she quit. Despite her attitudes towards Yato, she also respects Yato and cares for him. She often gets worried whenever Yato got into trouble even when she is serving Tenjin. At one point she volunteered herself to help Yato, who was impure due to Yukine’s actions.', '/uploads/images/c_121705.png'),
(62, 'Hashimoto', '橋本', '配角', 'Natsuki Hanae', 'Appeared briefly in episode 8. He was bullying Manabu Ogiwara. ~!After Manabu confronts him, he peed his pants out of fear.!~', '/uploads/images/c_139308.jpg'),
(62, 'Tsuyu', '梅雨', '配角', 'Saori Hayami', 'Tsuyu is the spirit of a plum tree who lived with Tenjin for 1,000 years. She is not a shinki, but rather stayed with Tenjin out of a lasting love.', '/uploads/images/c_176886.png'),
(62, 'Sasaki', '佐々木', '配角', 'Momoe Kishimoto', 'Caretaker for Hiyori''s house.', '/uploads/images/c_242235.png'),
(62, 'Hiyori no Mama', 'ひよりのママ', '配角', 'Miki Itou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_267078.png'),
(62, 'Hiyori no Papa', 'ひよりのパパ', '配角', 'Hiroshi Yanaka', 'Hiyori''s dad. Has his own hospital', '/uploads/images/c_312687.jpg'),
(63, 'Miyuki Shiba', '司波深雪', '主角', 'Saori Hayami', '__Height:__ 160 cm __Classification:__ A-rank Magician Miyuki is a first year student in Course 1 of First High School. She is the younger sister of [Tatsuya Shiba](https://anilist.co/character/55743/Shiba-Tatsuya). She is a bloom, which is considered the upper class. She was appointed as the freshmen representative, and is well known throughout the school. Described as very beautiful, she draws attention everywhere she goes. Yet, she is still modest and kind. She has a warm and loving nature, and defends her brother readily. She feels bad about being labelled as a "genius"; she feels that her brother is the real genius. Miyuki feels sad that their father only cares about her, and ignores Tatsuya completely.', '/uploads/images/c_55741.png'),
(63, 'Tatsuya Shiba', '司波達也', '主角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Height:__ 182 cm Shiba Tatsuya is a First Year Student in Course 2 of the First High School. He is the eldest son of Four Leaves Technology (FLT) company''s president. His only sibling is [Shiba Miyuki](https://anilist.co/character/55741/Shiba-Miyuki). Since he was born in April and Miyuki born in March, they are studying in the same year according to Japanese school system. He is known as a Weed, which is the considered the lower class. He has a rather cold personality and he doesn''t show his feelings, but he seems to love his sister and cares for her. He calms her down, when she''s about to lose control over her magic and doesn''t seem to mind that she is one of the most talented students at the school, while he''s only a reserve. He is not easily intimidated by his opponents.', '/uploads/images/c_55743.png'),
(63, 'Erika Chiba', '千葉エリカ', '配角', 'Yumi Uchiyama', 'A First year 2nd course student in E class with Tatsuya, Mikihiko, Leo and Mizuki A beauty in her own right she is someone who garners attention from those around her. She has an outgoing personality that allows her to befriend people easily but is someone who is not easily committed and goes off on a whim, (She doesnt get along with Leo though). A member of one of the ''Hundreds Families'' the Chiba family, a family famous for training people in swordsmanship. She herself is proficient in the sword, enough for her to be recognised and allowed to carry the Chiba family name.', '/uploads/images/c_72311.png'),
(63, 'Azusa Nakajou', '中条あずさ', '配角', 'Saki Ogasawara', 'A Second Year Student. The student council secretary of the First High School.', '/uploads/images/c_72563.png'),
(63, 'Haruka Ono', '小野遥', '配角', 'Sakura Tange', 'Haruka is the general counselor at First High for 1st year A and E classes.', '/uploads/images/c_72569.png'),
(63, 'Harunobu Kazama', '風間玄信', '配角', 'Tooru Ookawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_73187.png'),
(63, 'Katsuto Juumonji', '十文字克人', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', 'Katsuto is the Club Activities Group Leader of the First High School. He is the eldest child and heir of the Juumonji family, one of the ''Ten Number Clans''.', '/uploads/images/c_73471.png'),
(63, 'Yakumo Kokonoe', '九重八雲', '配角', 'Ryoutarou Okiayu', 'Yakumo is an ancient magic "Ninjutsu" user. He is Tatsuya''s martial arts master.', '/uploads/images/c_78043.png'),
(63, 'Kanon Chiyoda', '千代田花音', '配角', 'Saori Oonishi', 'Kanon is a 2nd year course 1 student at First High.', '/uploads/images/c_78045.png'),
(63, 'Sayuri Shiba', '司波小百合', '配角', 'Megumi Toyoguchi', 'Sayuri is the stepmother of [Tatsuya](https://anilist.co/character/55743/Tatsuya-Shiba) and [Miyuki](https://anilist.co/character/55741/Miyuki-Shiba).', '/uploads/images/c_79163.png'),
(63, 'Hanzou Hattori', '服部範蔵', '配角', 'Ryouhei Kimura', 'Hanzou is a Second Year Student. The student council vice president of the First High School.', '/uploads/images/c_88182.png'),
(63, 'Suzune Ichihara', '市原鈴音', '配角', 'Mai Nakahara', 'Suzune is a third year student. She is the student council accountant of the First High School.', '/uploads/images/c_88183.png'),
(63, 'Masaki Ichijou', '一条将輝', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'Masaki is a first year attending Third High.', '/uploads/images/c_88184.png'),
(63, 'Shinkurou Kichijouji', '吉祥寺真紅郎', '配角', 'Ayumu Murase', 'Shinkurou is a first year attending Third High.', '/uploads/images/c_88186.png'),
(63, 'Takeaki Kirihara', '桐原武明', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', 'Takeaki is a second year student in course 1 of the First High School. He is in the Kenjustu Club.', '/uploads/images/c_88187.png'),
(63, 'Shizuku Kitayama', '北山雫', '配角', 'Yuiko Tatsumi', 'A first year 1st course student in A class with [Miyuki](https://anilist.co/character/55741/Shiba-Miyuki), Jun and [Honoka](https://anilist.co/character/88191/Mitsui-Honoka).', '/uploads/images/c_88188.png'),
(63, 'Sayaka Mibu', '壬生紗耶香', '配角', 'Haruka Tomatsu', 'Sayaka is a second year student in course 2 of the First High School. She is in the Kendo Club.', '/uploads/images/c_88190.png'),
(63, 'Honoka Mitsui', '光井ほのか', '配角', 'Sora Amamiya', 'A first year 1st course student in A class with [Miyuki](https://anilist.co/character/55741/Shiba-Miyuki), Jun, and [Shizuku](https://anilist.co/character/88188/Kitayama-Shizuku). Becomes the next student council secretary after [Azusa](https://anilist.co/character/72563/Nakajou-Azusa).', '/uploads/images/c_88191.png'),
(63, 'Shun Morisaki', '森崎駿', '配角', 'Takashi Oohara', 'Morisaki Shun is a Course 1 student in First High School who exhibited elitism and used derogatory words against Tatsuya and the other Course 2 students on the first day of school.', '/uploads/images/c_88192.png'),
(63, 'Mayumi Saegusa', '七草真由美', '配角', 'Kana Hanazawa', '__Height__: 155 cm Mayumi is the Student Council President of First High School. She is a member of the Saegusa family, one of the ''Ten Master Clans''. She is the very first person from First High School to converse with Shiba Tatsuya on his enrollment day.', '/uploads/images/c_88194.png'),
(63, 'Leonhart Saijou', '西城レオンハルト', '配角', 'Takuma Terashima', 'A First year 2nd course student in E class with [Tatsuya](https://anilist.co/character/55743/Shiba-Tatsuya), Mizuki and [Erika](https://anilist.co/character/72311/Chiba-Erika).', '/uploads/images/c_88195.png'),
(63, 'Midori Sawaki', '沢木碧', '配角', 'Gou Shinomiya', 'Midori is a member of the Moral Committee', '/uploads/images/c_88196.png'),
(63, 'Mizuki Shibata', '柴田美月', '配角', 'Satomi Satou', 'A first year 2nd course student in E class with Tatsuya, Leo and Erika.', '/uploads/images/c_88197.png'),
(63, 'Koutarou Tatsumi', '辰巳鋼太郎', '配角', 'Kenji Hamada', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_88198.png'),
(63, 'Kinoe Tsukasa', '司甲', '配角', 'Masayuki Katou', 'Kinoe is a third year student in course 2 of the First High School. He is the ace of the kendo club.', '/uploads/images/c_88199.png'),
(63, 'Mari Watanabe', '渡辺摩利', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', 'Mari is the Moral Committee Chairman of the First High School.', '/uploads/images/c_88200.png'),
(63, 'Mikihiko Yoshida', '吉田幹比古', '配角', 'Atsushi Tamaru', 'A first year 2nd course student in E class with Tatsuya, Mizuki and Erika. He is childhood friends with Erika.', '/uploads/images/c_88201.png'),
(63, 'Eimi Akechi', '明智英美', '配角', 'Asuka Nishi', 'Freshman in First High School, in the same year as the Shiba siblings. She is one of the representatives of their school for the Newcomers'' Division of the Nine Schools Competition in the events Ice Pillar Break and Speed Shooting. Her full name is Amelia Eimi Akechi Goldie and often referred to as Eimi. (Source: Mahouka Koukou no Rettousei Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_188681.jpg'),
(63, 'Tatsurou Shiba', '司波龍郎', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', 'Shiba Tatsurou is the father of [Miyuki](https://anilist.co/character/55741/Miyuki-Shiba) and [Tatsuya](https://anilist.co/character/55743/Tatsuya-Shiba). He is the Vice President of Four Leaves Technology, the largest shareholder of the company, and is also in charge of all FLT Research & Development divisions. Tatsurou is extremely cold and uncaring towards his son, Tatsuya.', '/uploads/images/c_188682.jpg'),
(63, 'Kei Isori', '五十里啓', '配角', 'Souma Saitou', 'Kei is a year 2 student of First High School during the main characters'' freshman year. He was also one of the 8 engineers selected to be part of the technical support team, also known as the auxiliary team or technician team, for the Nine Schools Competition.', '/uploads/images/c_188683.jpg'),
(63, 'Hagane Tomitsuka', '十三束鋼', '配角', 'Daiki Yamashita', 'Hagane is a student of First High School, a Year 2 Course 1 student who is in the Magic Engineering Course, and was one of the lead representatives among of his cohorts during the Nine Schools Competition. He is a member of the Tomitsuka Family, which is one of the Hundred Families', '/uploads/images/c_188684.jpg'),
(63, 'Kyouko Fujibayashi', '藤林響子', '配角', 'Shizuka Itou', 'Fujibayashi Kyouko is a First Lieutenant from the 101 Independent Magic-Equipped Battalion, the daughter of the Fujibayashi Family, and the granddaughter of Kudou Retsu. She is known throughout the world of combat Magicians as the "Electron Sorceress."', '/uploads/images/c_189575.png'),
(63, 'Maya Yotsuba', '四葉真夜', '配角', 'Chiwa Saitou', 'Yotsuba Maya is the twin-sister of Shiba Miya, and the aunt of Shiba Tatsuya and Shiba Miyuki. She is the current Head of the Yotsuba Family. She is one of the strongest Magicians of the modern era in the world, known as the "Queen of Night" and "Demon King of the Far East".', '/uploads/images/c_213001.png'),
(63, 'Gongjin Zhou', '周公瑾', '配角', 'Kouji Yusa', 'Ancient magic user from the Great Asian Union. Looks very young despite being much older in reality. ~!He has no loyalty to the Great Asian Union and is actively sabotaging them for his own needs. His true loyalty lies with Gu Jie.!~', '/uploads/images/c_324172.png'),
(64, 'Shouyou Hinata', '日向翔陽', '主角', 'Ayumu Murase', '__Teams:__ Yukigaoka Junior High (Former); Karasuno High (Current) __Number:__ 1 (Junior High 3rd Year); 10 (High School 1st year); 5 (High School 3rd year) __Position:__ Captain (Junior High); Outside Hitter (Junior High); Middle Blocker (High School) Hinata has an unusually high ability to jump. Since he was young, Hinata trained his legs to compensate for his lack of height. He joins the Karusuno High School Volleyball team and amazes the team with his natural affinity as a spiker. Although he is a complete beginner and never had any experience playing in a volleyball team, he grows rapidly through each match. ~!After graduating from high school, Hinata traveled to Brazil to gain experience by playing beach volleyball. This is when he got the name, Ninja Shoyo. Upon returning to Japan, he became a member of the MSBY Black Jackals, a Division 1 team in the V-League. He became a member of the Japan Men’s National Volleyball Team during the 2021 Olympics. Currently, that is the year 2022, he is a member of Asas São Paulo, a professional team in the Brazil Super League.!~', '/uploads/images/c_64769.png'),
(64, 'Tobio Kageyama', '影山飛雄', '主角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Team:__ Karasuno High, Kitagawa Daiichi Junior High (former) __Height:__ 180.6 cm __Year:__ 1st Year, class 3 __Number:__ 9 __Position:__ Setter A famous setter in his middle school who joins the Karusuno High Volleyball team. He was known as the "King of the Court" in his middle school because of his arrogant demeanor and the way he would order around his teammates. Although he still carries an overbearing attitude, he begins to change when he starts to play with [Hinata Shouyou](https://anilist.co/character/64769) who views him as a rival.', '/uploads/images/c_64771.png'),
(64, 'Koushi Sugawara', '菅原孝支', '配角', 'Miyu Irino', '__Height:__ 174 cm Being the vice captain, Sugawara has a soothing personality for his teammates and acts as a pillar of support for them. Even though he isn''t Karasuno''s official setter anymore, he doesn''t dream of giving up on playing in general. As such, he encourages himself and all of his teammates not to give up, no matter how rough the situation might be. Sugawara''s dedication to volleyball is clear when he decides to continue club activities even when most third years choose to retire to focus on their futures. In a meeting, his teacher asked Sugawara why he''s so determined to continue playing even though he''s not a starting member, and Sugawara replied that he doesn''t want to have regrets in the future. He is also quite perceptive as he noticed how [Tanaka](https://anilist.co/character/67325/Tanaka-Ryuunosuke) asked for the key to the gym (back during the first years'' 3-on-3 match) even though he always comes in late, so Sugawara knew that something was up. He is also intelligent as he can come up with helpful tactics during the game. An example of this is when he came up with the idea of saying "bring it" and "send it to me" for [Kageyama](https://anilist.co/character/64771/Kageyama-Tobio) and [Hinata](https://anilist.co/character/64769/Hinata-Shouyou)''s combo.', '/uploads/images/c_67321.png'),
(64, 'Daichi Sawamura', '澤村大地', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 176.8 cm __Year:__ 3rd year, class 4 __Number:__ 1 __Position:__ Wing Spiker The captain of the Karasuno High volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_67323.png'),
(64, 'Ryuunosuke Tanaka', '田中龍之介', '配角', 'Yuu Hayashi', '__Height:__ 177.2 cm __Team:__ Karasuno High __Number:__ 5 __Position:__ Wing Spiker', '/uploads/images/c_67325.jpg'),
(64, 'Yuu Nishinoya', '西谷夕', '配角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '__Team:__ Karasuno High, Chidoriyama Junior High (former) __Height:__ 159.3 cm (5''2") __Year:__ 2nd year, Class 3 __Number:__ 4 __Position:__ Libero Yuu is a very energetic and temperamental person. His boisterous nature and crazy shenanigans can attract unwanted attention quite easily, which often bodes ill for him. Although he hardly ever worries about the consequences of his actions (and may even revert to violence in order to vent out his anger on certain occasions), he is surprisingly considerate of his friends'' feelings and insecurities. Yuu can be extremely impatient, excitable and impulsive. As [Ryuunosuke Tanaka](https://anilist.co/character/67325) puts it, "he simply gets too fired up for his own good." He doesn''t bother to filter his words, and is therefore prone to blurting out whatever he''s thinking in a loud and tactless manner. In-game, however, his attitude changes drastically: he becomes incredibly focused and serious, remaining calm and doing everything in his power to provide the support his team needs until the very end. For this reason, everyone in the volleyball club respects him greatly.', '/uploads/images/c_67327.jpg'),
(64, 'Kei Tsukishima', '月島蛍', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', '**Height:** 188 cm **Team:** Karasuno High **Year:** 1st year, class 4 **Number:** 11 **Position:** Middle Blocker A member of the Karasuno High volleyball club. Tsukishima is very blunt and will sometimes rile his teammates up due to his antagonistic nature (most notably being [Hinata](https://anilist.co/character/64769/Hinata-Shouyou), [Kageyama](https://anilist.co/character/64771/Kageyama-Tobio), [Nishinoya](https://anilist.co/character/67327/Nishinoya-Yuu), and [Tanaka](https://anilist.co/character/67325/Tanaka-Ryuunosuke)) and sometimes other teams because of his casual smug attitude, taking pride in and relishing when his opponents see him as a nuisance as seen with [Tendou](https://anilist.co/character/126073/Tendou-Satori) and [Shirabu](https://anilist.co/character/137537/Shirabu-Kenjirou). Tsukishima is standoffish and has an arrogant and condescending personality, but he has low self-esteem and thinks of himself as inferior. Although he is only outwardly close with [Yamaguchi](https://anilist.co/character/71609/Yamaguchi-Tadashi), he can be seen occasionally caring about his other club members.', '/uploads/images/c_67329.png'),
(64, 'Chikara Ennoshita', '縁下力', '配角', 'Toshiki Masuda', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 175.4 cm __Year:__ 2nd year, class 4 __Position:__ Wing Spiker Ennoshita seems quiet and reserved but can behave boldly towards the other 2nd years. He''s smart and hasn''t received a failing mark before. Similarly to Sugawara, he is always smiling. He''s supposedly the only one within the 2nd years to be able to control Tanaka and Nishinoya. He''s also able to understand different people, as stated a few times by Tanaka and when he knew what to do to give Yamaguchi some courage before his jump float serve.', '/uploads/images/c_67331.png'),
(64, 'Asahi Azumane', '東峰旭', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 184.7 cm __Year:__ 3rd year, class 3 __Number:__ 3 __Position:__ Wing Spiker In contrast to his appearance, he is rather quiet and gentle and has his difficulties realizing that he is Karasuno''s ace as he initially doesn''t feel that way. He shows to be weak-willed at the beginning when he leaves the team before the first years come, feeling that he let down his entire team when they lost against Date Tech High even though they counted on him. After coming back to Karasuno, he realizes that his will to play volleyball is much stronger than he thought and with the help of his teammates, he acknowledges his position as Karasuno''s ace (even though he is still mocked sometimes by Daichi for not having any "ace-like presence") and gains self-confidence.', '/uploads/images/c_67333.png'),
(64, 'Kiyoko Shimizu', '清水潔子', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 166.2 cm __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 2 The manager of the Karasuno High volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_67689.png'),
(64, 'Kouji Sekimukai', '関向幸治', '配角', 'Seigo Yokota', 'Hinata''s good friend back when they still were attending Yukigaoka Junior High. He''s playing soccer.', '/uploads/images/c_70857.png'),
(64, 'Yukitaka Izumi', '泉行高', '配角', 'Kyousuke Ikeda', 'Hinata''s good friend from Yukigaoka Junior High. He''s playing basketball, but often helped out Hinata with practicing volleyball.', '/uploads/images/c_70859.png'),
(64, 'Keishin Ukai', '烏養繋心', '配角', 'Kazunari Tanaka', '**Height:** 178.2 cm **Team:** Karasuno High Karasuno High School volleyball club''s alumnus, currently coaching volleyball club and helping out his mother at the shop.', '/uploads/images/c_70861.jpg'),
(64, 'Kenma Kozume', '孤爪研磨', '配角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 169.2 cm The setter of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. Kenma is [Kuroo](https://anilist.co/character/71269)''s childhood friend and keeps playing volleyball because of him. He has a very calm personality and is usually doing things at his own pace. Often seen playing video games and being introverted. Nekoma''s backbone, brain and heart.', '/uploads/images/c_71267.jpg'),
(64, 'Tetsurou Kuroo', '黒尾鉄朗', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 187.7 cm __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 5 __Number:__ 1 __Position:__ Middle Blocker The captain of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. Kuroo has a somehow manipulative and cunning personality, but cares about his friends and teammates very deeply. As Nekoma''s captain he has a sense of responsibility and confidence. Even though Kuroo''s a middle blocker, he often uses offensive plays too.', '/uploads/images/c_71269.jpg'),
(64, 'Tadashi Yamaguchi', '山口忠', '配角', 'Souma Saitou', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 179.5cm - 180.0cm __Year:__ 1st year, class 4 __Number:__ 12 __Position:__ Middle Blocker Yamaguchi always hangs out with Tsukishima and is very protective of him. He has trained himself hard to use a jump float serve. He is also a substitute ace server of the Karasuno Volleyball team.', '/uploads/images/c_71609.png'),
(64, 'Tooru Oikawa', '及川徹', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', '__Height:__ 184 cm The setter and captain of the Aoba Josai High School volleyball club. He was [Kageyama](https://anilist.co/character/64771/Tobio-Kageyama)''s senpai when they were attending Kitagawa Daiichi. According to Kageyama, he is a very talented setter and volleyball player with a ​complex personality. His favourite food is milk bread.', '/uploads/images/c_71611.png'),
(64, 'Taketora Yamamoto', '山本猛虎', '配角', 'Seigo Yokota', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 176.7 cm __Year:__ 2nd Year, class 1 __Number:__ 4 __Position:__ Wing Spiker Yamamoto is proud and short tempered wing spiker of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. He usually doesn''t think what he says and is somewhat similar to Tanaka.', '/uploads/images/c_73673.jpg'),
(64, 'Sou Inuoka', '犬岡走', '配角', 'Kyousuke Ikeda', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 185.3 cm __Year:__ 1st Year, class 1 __Number:__ 7 __Position:__ Middle Blocker Middle blocker of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. He has friendly personality and becomes friends with Hinata after their game.', '/uploads/images/c_73675.jpg'),
(64, 'Yuuki Shibayama', '芝山優生', '配角', 'Takumi Watanabe', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 162.5 cm __Weight:__ 53.3 kg __Year:__ 1st Year, class 4 __Number:__ 12 __Position:__ Libero One of the libero of the Nekoma High School volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_73677.jpg'),
(64, 'Ittetsu Takeda', '武田一鉄', '配角', 'Hiroshi Kamiya', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 166.5 cm Volleyball club faculty advisor of the Karasuno High School. Takeda is inexperienced in volleyball, but still became an advisor for Karasuno. He often doesn''t understand rules and that''s why he takes notes about every new thing he learns. Takeda has an enthusiastic and brave personality.', '/uploads/images/c_73679.png'),
(64, 'Yuutarou Kindaichi', '金田一勇太郎', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', '__Team:__ Aoba Josai High, Kitagawa Daiichi (former) __Height:__ 189.2 cm __Year:__ 1st year __Position:__ Middle Blocker Middle blocker of the Aoba Josai High School volleyball club. He was Kageyama''s teammate back in junior high school. Kindaichi was one of the players who hated Kageyama''s selfish plays and refused to understand him.', '/uploads/images/c_73681.jpg'),
(64, 'Nobuyuki Kai', '海信行', '配角', 'Takanori Hoshino', '__Team__: Nekoma High School __Height__: 176.5 cm __Weight__: 68.9 kg __Year__: 3rd Year, class 4 __Number__: 2 __Position__: Wing Spiker', '/uploads/images/c_74029.jpg'),
(64, 'Morisuke Yaku', '夜久衛輔', '配角', 'Shinnosuke Tachibana', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 165.2 cm __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 5 __Number:__ 3 __Position:__ Libero Currently playing libero of the Nekoma High School volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_74033.png'),
(64, 'Shouhei Fukunaga', '福永招平', '配角', 'Shouta Chounan', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 178.3 cm __Year:__ 2nd Year, class 2 __Number:__ 6 __Position:__ Wing Spiker', '/uploads/images/c_74039.jpg'),
(64, 'Manabu Naoi', '直井学', '配角', 'Kanehira Yamamoto', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School The coach of the Nekoma High School volleyball club and Ukai''s old acquaintance.', '/uploads/images/c_74591.jpg'),
(64, 'Yasufumi Nekomata', '猫又育史', '配角', 'Nobuaki Fukuda', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School The coach of the Nekoma High School volleyball club and Ukai''s rival. He doesn''t like to lose.', '/uploads/images/c_74593.jpg'),
(64, 'Hajime Iwaizumi', '岩泉一', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', '__Height:__ 179.3 cm __Team:__ Aobajousai High School __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 5 __Number:__ 4 __Position:__ Wing Spiker __Ability Parameters (out of 5):__ Power = 5; jump = 4; stamina = 4; intellect = 3; technique = 3; speed = 4 Is a third-year student from Aoba Johsai High; he is the volleyball team''s ace, vice-captain and a wing spiker. He is also [Tōru Oikawa](https://anilist.co/character/71611/Oikawa-Tooru)''s childhood friend and "pillar". Iwaizumi often gets irritated by Oikawa''s behavior and tells him that guys who have girls going kyaa kyaa over them irritates him the most.', '/uploads/images/c_75636.png'),
(64, 'Hayato Ikejiri', '池尻隼人', '配角', 'Hiromu Miyazaki', '__Team:__ Tokonami High School __Height:__ 177.2 cm __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 1 __Number:__ 4 __Position:__ Wing Spiker Ikejiri went to the same junior high school as Daichi where they played volleyball together.', '/uploads/images/c_76814.jpg'),
(64, 'Wakatoshi Ushijima', '牛島若利', '配角', 'Ryouta Takeuchi', '__Height:__ 189.5 cm (6'' 2.6") __Team:__ Shiratorizawa Academy __Number:__ 1 __Position:__ Wing Spiker Wakatoshi Ushijima is a third year at Shiratorizawa Academy and the captain and ace of the school''s boys'' volleyball team. Currently, he is the number one ace in Miyagi Prefecture and one of the country''s top three aces, along with Sakusa and Kiryu. Left handed. His favourite food is hayashi rice.', '/uploads/images/c_76816.png'),
(64, 'Yui Michimiya', '道宮結', '配角', 'Asami Seto', '__Height:__ 159 cm (5'' 2") __Team:__ Karasuno Girls'' Volleyball Club __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 1 __Number:__ 1 The captain of the Karasuno High girls volleyball club. Michimiya is shown to be a very active person, always smiling and cracking jokes. She is a very determined person, who cares a lot for her team, giving them motivational speeches, and always tries to stay composed in front of them; she only cries when she''s away from her teammates. However, she herself had stated that she isn''t strict enough. Around [Daichi](https://anilist.co/character/67323/Sawamura-Daichi) though she can become flustered and clumsy, repeating words to try and find the right thing to say.', '/uploads/images/c_77165.jpg'),
(64, 'Kaname Moniwa', '茂庭要', '配角', 'Takashi Onozuka', '**Height:** 176 cm **Team:** Datekougyou High School **Number:** 2 **Position:** Setter The captain of the Datekougyou High School volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_77413.png'),
(64, 'Kenji Futakuchi', '二口堅治', '配角', 'Masatomo Nakazawa', '__Team:__ Datekougyou High School __Height:__ 184.2 cm According to Moniwa, Futakuchi is a problematic kouhai with a very easy going personality. He''s often seen arguing with Kamasaki who is the ​complete opposite of Futakuchi.', '/uploads/images/c_77415.jpg'),
(64, 'Takanobu Aone', '青根高伸', '配角', 'Hiroki Matsukawa', '__Team:__ Datekougyou High School __Height:__ 191.8 cm __Year:__ 2nd Year, class A __Number:__ 7 __Position:__ Middle Blocker Main pillar of Datekou. Even though Aone never smiles and seems serious and scary, he actually has a very kind heart. Futakuchi said that Aone has a habit of "locking on" to you if he knows his opponent is an ace.', '/uploads/images/c_77417.jpg'),
(64, 'Nobuteru Irihata', '入畑伸照 ', '配角', 'Mitsuaki Hoshino', 'The coach of the Aoba Josai High School volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_77419.jpg'),
(64, 'Yuusuke Takinoue', '滝ノ上祐輔', '配角', 'Shuuhei Sakaguchi', 'Height: 185.6 cm Position: Middle Blocker Karasuno High School volleyball club''s alumnus. He and Shimada are part of the Karasuno Neighborhood Association team. And they often come to watch current Karasuno''s games as well as to root for them. Yuusuke''s working at Takinoue Electric Goods.', '/uploads/images/c_80511.png'),
(64, 'Makoto Shimada', '嶋田誠', '配角', 'Tomoaki Maeno', '__Height:__ 177.7cm Karasuno High School volleyball club''s alumnus. He and Takinoue are part of the Karasuno Neighborhood Association team. And they often come to watch current Karasuno''s games as well as to root for them. Makoto''s working at Shimada Mart.', '/uploads/images/c_80513.jpg'),
(64, 'Hisashi Kinoshita', '木下久志', '配角', 'Nobuyori Sagara', '__Height:__ 174cm Narita, Ennoshita and Kinoshita are 2nd years who couldn''t keep up with the training when old Ukai returned and that''s why they left volleyball club. However after some time they came back because they realized that they still want to play volleyball, though coach Ukai was no longer there. Ennoshita called them ''''disgraceful'''' 2nd years.', '/uploads/images/c_80515.jpg'),
(64, 'Kazuhito Narita', '成田一仁', '配角', 'Koutarou Nishiyama', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 180.2 cm __Year:__ 2nd Year, class 4 Narita, Ennoshita and Kinoshita are 2nd years who couldn''t keep up with the training when old Ukai returned and that''s why they left volleyball club. However after some time they came back because they realized that they still want to play volleyball, though coach Ukai was no longer there. Ennoshita called them ''''disgraceful'''' 2nd years.', '/uploads/images/c_80517.jpg'),
(64, 'Akira Kunimi', '国見英', '配角', 'Atsushi Tamaru', '__Team:__ Aobajōsai (former Kitagawa Daīchi) (first year at Aoba Johsai) __Height:__ 182.8 cm __Number:__ 13 __Position:__ Wing Spiker He is a quiet and indifferent person, though it''s mostly out of laziness. He occasionally skips practice as well and doesn''t seem to put his full effort into matches; however, his true strength lies in his late game plays. Kunimi dislikes loud, energetic people and was dismayed when Koganegawa yelled at him to "go all out", which is one of his least liked phrases. He also refers to Hinata, Koganegawa, and Hyakuzawa as the "idiot squad" because of their energy. Kageyama has also mentioned that Kunimi is smart, though it''s unknown if that refers to his game sense or general studies.', '/uploads/images/c_89508.jpg'),
(64, 'Issei Matsukawa', '松川一静', '配角', 'Yuusen Isamu', 'Issei is a 3rd year student from Aobajohsai High; he is one of the middle blockers.', '/uploads/images/c_137468.png'),
