(64, 'Ikkei Ukai', '烏養一繋', '配角', 'Hiroshi Naka', 'Ikkei is the former coach of Karasuno High''s Boys'' Volleyball Club. He once led the team to nationals and was well-known. After being hospitalized, he resigned from coaching the team.', '/uploads/images/c_137541.png'),
(64, 'Taiga Sakurai', '桜井大河', '配角', 'Arthur Lounsbery', 'Taiga is a third year at Tokonami High. He plays as a libero.', '/uploads/images/c_137604.png'),
