(69, 'Shirou Kuramori', '倉森志郎', '配角', 'Issei Futamata', 'Shirou Kuramori is a Private Detective who is hired by [Reiko Tamura](https://anilist.co/character/16586/) to spy on [Shinichi Izumi](https://anilist.co/character/12323/). ~!After becoming a liability, he is targeted and his family killed by parasites.!~ (Source: Kiseijuu Fandom)', '/uploads/images/c_192962.png'),
(69, 'Miki', '三木', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_192963.png'),
(70, 'Nine', 'ナイン', '主角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', 'Known as Nine, is one of two members of the Sphinx terrorist group. He grew up in an experimental institution for gifted children with [Twelve](https://anilist.co/character/88096/Twelve), though the both of them managed to escape. Later on, both Nine and Twelve carry out several terroristic acts in Japan. He is reserved, calm and collected, and very, very intelligent. Nine is efficient in many fields, up to exceptional computing and hacking. He''s an impeccable strategist, with a knack for chess and classical literature. Good with disguises.', '/uploads/images/c_88094.jpg'),
(70, 'Lisa Mishima', '三島リサ', '主角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', 'Lisa Mishima is a quiet and shy girl who attended the same high school that [Nine](https://anilist.co/character/88094/Nine) and [Twelve](https://anilist.co/character/88096/Twelve) had transferred to. Because of her clumsiness and shyness, she was an easy target for the bullies in her class. As she came to know the two boys, Nine and Twelve, she felt a connection. Like they all had something in common and she had grown attached to them, especially Twelve. Nine didn''t see her as very useful when she lived with them. Always in the way and always burning food, you can see why. But Twelve did not feel that way, for he had gotten too involved with her and was very affectionate toward her. Her father and mother are divorced, and her mother is over-protective and appears to be mentally unstable. She holds the fear that Lisa would also one day leave her just like Lisa''s father did once.', '/uploads/images/c_88095.jpg'),
(70, 'Twelve', 'ツエルブ', '主角', 'Souma Saitou', 'Twelve is one of two members of a terrorist group known as Sphinx, working with [Nine](https://anilist.co/character/88094/Nine) as his primary partner. He and Nine grew up together in an institution for children known as the Settlement, and engaged in terrorist activities, with unknown motives. On the outside, he''s a typical jokester: light-humored and energetic, enjoying messing around in other people''s business. However, he is fully capable and willing to adopt ruthless and violent methods if the situation calls for it. This contradictory set of personality traits are the result of the psychological damage sustained during his stay at the aforementioned children''s institution. Nonetheless, he is a loyal and dependable friend, has a genius mind and a keen sense of social justice. He also has a compassionate side, as evidenced by his interactions with [Lisa Mishima](https://anilist.co/character/88095/Mishima-Lisa). ~!Twelve changes dramatically upon interacting with Lisa Mishima. When she runs away, he goes after her against Nine''s wishes. He is made by [Five](https://anilist.co/character/88301/Five) to choose between saving Lisa and betraying Nine, and ultimately chooses to save Lisa. However, he later helps Nine out of a sticky situation at great risk to himself. In the final episode, shortly after he, Nine and Lisa are reunited, he is shot and killed by the American government.!~', '/uploads/images/c_88096.jpg'),
(70, 'Five', 'ハイヴ', '配角', 'Megumi Han', 'A government operative and a nuclear scientist affiliated with NEST, an organization within the United States FBI. She travels to Japan to assist in investigations regarding the terrorist attack.', '/uploads/images/c_88301.png'),
(70, 'Kenjirou Shibasaki', '柴崎健次郎', '主角', 'Shunsuke Sakuya', 'A detective in the metropolitan police department. He used to work in the investigations division but now works in the records division. He''s a contemporary of the head of the terror incident investigation. He is aloof and lazy, with a reluctance to work, but when push comes to shove and people''s lives are in danger he quickly turns into a smart, quick-minded man being able to solve most problems that arise. He is extremely experienced in his field and has a strong sense of justice.', '/uploads/images/c_88302.jpg'),
(70, 'Mukasa', '六笠', '配角', 'Mitsuaki Kanuka', 'Mukasa is Shibazaki''s co-worker from the Records Division. He assists Shibazaki in solving the riddles of the Sphinx at the most unlikely of times. He has a carefree personality and is often depicted eating something.', '/uploads/images/c_157966.jpg'),
(70, 'Souta Aoki', '青木宗太', '配角', 'Takaya Hashi', 'A former manager within the Ministry of Health and Welfare Guidance Division, he holds information about The Athena Plan.', '/uploads/images/c_157968.jpg'),
(70, 'Kurahashi', '倉橋', '配角', 'Hideaki Tezuka', 'Works at the police station. He utilizes Shibazaki''s detective skills to analyze and resolve the incidents related to Sphinx.', '/uploads/images/c_157970.jpg'),
(70, 'Clarence', 'クラレンス', '配角', 'Daisuke Takahashi', 'He''s an FBI special agent. He is sent to Japan from the United States government to assist in investigations regarding the Sphinx incidents.', '/uploads/images/c_157971.jpg'),
(70, 'Hamada', '浜田', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Takato', 'A bomb specialist working for the Japanese police.', '/uploads/images/c_157972.jpg'),
(70, 'Kinoshita', '木下', '配角', 'Yuusuke Kuwahata', 'He works at the Technology Crime Division. He belongs to the life safety unit, which performs the crackdown of cyber crime.', '/uploads/images/c_157973.jpg'),
(70, 'Hamura', '羽村', '配角', 'Keisuke Aigasa', 'A police officer of the Criminal Division Section 1. He likes solving criminal cases, but he thinks Shibazaki got this job to easily and doesn''t get along with him.', '/uploads/images/c_157974.jpg'),
(70, 'Okano', '岡野', '配角', 'Kunpei Sakamoto', 'A police officer of the Criminal Division Section 1. He is responsible for incidents involving kidnapping or hostages.', '/uploads/images/c_157975.jpg'),
(70, 'Haruka', '晴香', '配角', 'Reina Ueda', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_174735.png'),
(70, 'Mobuko', 'モブ子', '配角', 'Uki Satake', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_174736.png'),
(70, 'Shunzou Mamiya', '間宮俊造', '配角', 'Shuichiro Moriyama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_174737.png'),
(70, 'Shimada', '島田', '配角', 'Yutaka Aoyama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_174738.png'),
(70, 'Kawai', '河合', '配角', 'Yoshimitsu Shimoyama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_174739.png'),
(70, 'Ichirou Fujikara', '藤川いちろう', '配角', 'Kanji Obana', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_174740.jpg'),
(70, 'Shibazaki''s Wife', '柴崎妻', '配角', 'Naoko Kaneta', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_174741.png'),
(71, 'Ryouta Watari', '渡里遼', '主角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', 'Ryouta is Kousei and Tsubaki''s childhood friend who is also the captain of the school''s soccer team. He is extremely popular with girls, often adopting a frivolous attitude. However, he does once in a while come up with good insight.', '/uploads/images/c_69405.jpg'),
(71, 'Kousei Arima', '有馬公生', '主角', 'Natsuki Hanae', 'Kousei is formerly a child prodigy in playing piano, often dubbed as the "Human Metronome". He was able to play the piano with extreme precision and discipline and thus had won many competitions across Japan.', '/uploads/images/c_69407.jpg'),
(71, 'Tsubaki Sawabe', '澤部椿', '主角', 'Ayane Sakura', 'Tsubaki is Kousei''s childhood friend and next-door neighbor, who treats him like a little brother. She is athletic and part of the softball club in school. Often dismayed at Kousei''s inability to move on after his mother''s death, she attempts to get him to play the piano again in order to make a clear decision about his future.', '/uploads/images/c_69409.jpg'),
(71, 'Kaori Miyazono', '宮園かをり', '主角', 'Risa Taneda', '**Height:** 157 cm Kaori is [Tsubaki''s](https://anilist.co/character/69409) classmate, a free-spirited violinist who had drawn many criticisms from the judge panel due to her unwillingness to follow the score, but is highly favored by her audience. Kaori met [Kousei](https://anilist.co/character/69407) when she requested Tsubaki to set her up with [Watari](https://anilist.co/character/69405).', '/uploads/images/c_69411.jpg'),
(71, 'Saitou', '斉藤', '配角', 'Kazuyuki Okitsu', 'Saitou is Tsubaki''s baseball-playing senior and her target of admiration.', '/uploads/images/c_81723.jpg'),
(71, 'Nao Kashiwagi', '柏木奈緒', '配角', 'Shizuka Ishigami', 'Kashiwagi is a good friend of Tsubaki''s who often gives her advice.', '/uploads/images/c_81725.jpg'),
(71, 'Takeshi Aiza', '相座武士', '配角', 'Yuuki Kaji', 'Takeshi is a pianist of the same year as Kousei, who aimed to surpass him since watching him play at a young age. For that, Takeshi would even abandon a competition in Europe in order to compete with Kousei. (Source: Wikipedia)', '/uploads/images/c_85839.jpg'),
(71, 'Emi Igawa', '井川絵見', '配角', 'Saori Hayami', 'Emi is a pianist of the same year as Kousei, who decided to become a pianist after listening to Kousei play at the age of 5. Emi is very emotional and her piano performance often depends on her mood on that day.', '/uploads/images/c_85841.jpg'),
(71, 'Saki Arima', '有馬早希', '配角', 'Mamiko Noto', 'Saki is Kousei''s strict mother who demands Kousei play the piano to perfection, often beating him up for small mistakes. While she did not plan to make Kousei a pianist at first, her realization of Kousei''s talents and her own illness made her decide to give Kousei a strict foundation in piano in order to be able to find his own style, and a living, afterwards.', '/uploads/images/c_88785.jpg'),
(71, 'Hiroko Seto', '瀬戸紘子', '配角', 'Mie Sonozaki', 'Hiroko is a nationally famous pianist and Saki''s friend during college days. She was the one who discovered Kousei''s talents in piano and suggested Saki to make him a pianist.', '/uploads/images/c_88786.jpg'),
(71, 'Koharu Seto', '瀬戸小春', '配角', 'Inori Minase', 'Daughter of Hiroko Seto, Koharu is generally a happy and cheerful child who adores her mother. Koharu has been shown to be quite shy and hesitant around others when she first meets them, but eventually warms up to them and begins to consider them as her family, as seen when she drew a picture of Nagi Aiza playing the piano with Kousei Arima.', '/uploads/images/c_138444.jpg'),
(71, 'Nagi Aiza', '相座凪', '配角', 'Ai Kayano', 'Nagi is Takeshi''s little sister who pretended to ask for tutelage from Hiroko in order to scout her brother''s rival, Kousei.', '/uploads/images/c_157244.jpg'),
(71, 'Otokonoko', '男の子', '配角', 'Mariko Higashiuchi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_333899.jpg'),
(72, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', '比企谷八幡', '主角', 'Takuya Eguchi', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") Hachiman is an isolated, friendless boy who is pragmatic to a fault. His most prominent feature is his set of "dead fish-eyes." He firmly believes that "youth" is simply an illusion created by hypocrites, for hypocrites, born from the ashes of past failures. In this state of apparent corruption, he is coerced into joining the Service Club by his futures advisor in the hopes that exposing him to the world will change his personality, and ultimately make him a "better person." He is called "Hikki" affectionately by [Yui](https://anilist.co/character/67069).', '/uploads/images/c_67065.png'),
(72, 'Yukino Yukinoshita', '雪ノ下雪乃', '主角', 'Saori Hayami', 'Yukino is the leader of the Service Club, of which she is the sole member until [Hachiman](https://anilist.co/character/67065) joins her. She is smart, beautiful, and is nicknamed the "Ice-cold Beauty" for her icy demeanor. She has a twisted sense of "noblesse oblige", and believes that it is the duty of the exceptional (in other words, herself) to help the "lost lambs" of the world. Her personality often leads her to be disgusted at the naivete of others, particularly [Yui](https://anilist.co/character/67069)''s, and she does not hesitate to show it. Despite this, Yui still affectionally calls her "Yukinon." She is a student of Class 2J (The academic standards of Class J are 2 to 3 points higher than the regular classes on the bell curve.) ~!It was later revealed that her father is a member of the National Diet (a legislator in Japan''s parliament). Yukino was in the car that hit [Hachiman](https://anilist.co/character/67065).!~ ~!She later confesses to [Hachiman](https://anilist.co/character/67065) and becomes his girlfriend.!~', '/uploads/images/c_67067.png'),
(72, 'Yui Yuigahama', '由比ヶ浜結衣', '主角', 'Nao Touyama', 'Yui is a cheerful, outgoing girl who becomes the Service Club''s first "customer", asking them to help her bake cookies for "a certain someone". Her problems lie not with her personality, but with her inability to deal with issues by herself. She believes that talent is inborn, and often aspired to be like others until [Yukino](https://anilist.co/character/67067) changed her way of thinking. Following her experience with the Service Club, Yui begins to attend Service Club sessions after school as well, despite Yukino''s objections early on. ~!She is the owner of the dog that led to [Hachiman](https://anilist.co/character/67065)''s accident.!~ ~!She has feelings for [Hachiman](https://anilist.co/character/67065) which she admits to the members of the Service Club in the final episode of the series.!~', '/uploads/images/c_67069.png'),
(72, 'Saika Totsuka', '戸塚彩加', '配角', 'Mikako Komatsu', 'Saika is a member of the tennis club who has a feminine appearance, but prefers others to not mistake his gender. He is called "The Prince" by his female classmates. On their first meeting, Saika asks help from [Hachiman](https://anilist.co/character/67065) to join the tennis club, which was brushed off by [Yukino](https://anilist.co/character/67067). Saika then asked the service club to help him improve his tennis skills. He eventually became one of the few people in class 2F who would talk to Hachiman, and often hangs out with Hachiman.', '/uploads/images/c_67071.jpg'),
(72, 'Yoshiteru Zaimokuza', '材木座義輝', '配角', 'Nobuyuki Hiyama', 'Zaimokuza is a student from class 2C who suffers from adolescent delusions. He displays a high interest in historical shoguns, magic, and writing (despite the fact he is a terrible writer), and video game creation. He often talks like a movie narrator or with grandiose overtones. He sometimes refers to himself and those around him in the 3rd person and involves them in his fantasy/roleplaying scenarios. He sees Hachiman as a friend after being paired up with him during physical education lessons. While he is annoying, he has a group of otaku friends he''s on good terms with. He aims to be a light novel writer.', '/uploads/images/c_67073.png'),
(72, 'Komachi Hikigaya', '比企谷小町', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', '[Hachiman](https://anilist.co/character/67065)''s younger sister who is very different than her brother. She''s cheerful and lively and is part of her school''s student council.', '/uploads/images/c_67075.png'),
(72, 'Shizuka Hiratsuka', '平塚静', '配角', 'Ryouka Yuzuki', 'Shizuka is [Hachiman](https://anilist.co/character/67065)''s teacher, a language teacher who serves as his futures advisor/counselor. She is aware of Hachiman''s supposed "problems", and takes steps to ensure he is freed from them, her first move being to force him into joining the Service Club. However, she appears to have some quirks of her own: she is a young smoker, she is very sensitive about her age, and she is often prone to quoting or copying scenes from popular shounen manga. She also never remembers to knock before entering the Service Club''s classroom, much to [Yukino](https://anilist.co/character/67067)''s chagrin.', '/uploads/images/c_67077.png'),
(72, 'Saki Kawasaki', '川崎沙希', '配角', 'Ami Koshimizu', '[Hachiman Hikigaya](https://anilist.co/character/67065/Hikigaya-Hachiman)''s classmate who seems like a delinquent, but wants to make friends. She cares deeply for her brother as she hid her name and age to work in night-shift part-time jobs in order to pay school fees and reduce her family''s load. After her brother asked help from the service club, the service club eventually followed her to her workplace and found out her motives behind working night-shifts, she stopped working after the service club suggested her to aim for a scholarship instead.', '/uploads/images/c_74587.jpg'),
(72, 'Haruno Yukinoshita', '雪ノ下陽乃', '配角', 'Mai Nakahara', '[Yukino](https://anilist.co/character/67067)''s elder sister who is even more outstanding than Yukino. However, unlike Yukino, she shows a good attitude towards other people, even if she has to lie about her true feelings most of the time. As the eldest sister she has to maintain a cheerful facade when representing the family for either their father''s political events or mother''s business meetings.', '/uploads/images/c_79589.png'),
(72, 'Hayato Hayama', '葉山隼人', '配角', 'Takashi Kondou', 'He is a very popular guy in [Hikki](https://anilist.co/character/67065) and [Yui](https://anilist.co/character/67069)''s class, who is good in almost everything. (Source: Otaku-streamers)', '/uploads/images/c_79591.png'),
(72, 'Yumiko Miura', '三浦優美子', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', 'She is [Hikki](https://anilist.co/character/67065) and [Yui](https://anilist.co/character/67069)''s classmate who is very popular in Class 2-F, as well as the main female figure in [Hayato Hayama](https://anilist.co/character/79591/Hayato-Hayama)''s clique. Yumiko''s personality is pompous. Due to her popularity, she is held in highest hierarchy. Hence, she has no trouble making friends and also has little to no understanding towards people who have social troubles. Yumiko doesn''t show interest, or mind anyone other than higher hierarchy of the class, which is noted by Hachiman Hikigaya by her attitude towards him. She holds herself in a very high esteem, and is not afraid to use her authority. Yumiko has be shown to be very good at tennis as it was stated that she won the Junior High Championship. She also demonstrated her skills in the tennis match showdown and she also participated in the athletic festival sports event of cavalry battle for the white team.', '/uploads/images/c_79593.png'),
(72, 'Hina Ebina', '海老名姫菜', '配角', 'Nozomi Sasaki', 'Hina is a classmate of [Yui](https://anilist.co/character/67069) and [Hachiman](https://anilist.co/character/67065), who is a quiet girl and hangs around [Yumiko](https://anilist.co/character/79593/). She is a fujoshi, which is why other boys from her class are always avoiding her.', '/uploads/images/c_79595.png'),
(72, 'Kakeru Tobe', '戸部翔', '配角', 'Chado Horii', 'Kakeru is one of [Hayato](https://anilist.co/character/79591)''s friends. He is in the football club. He has feelings for [Hina](https://anilist.co/character/79595) and is the only guy in class who often supports Hina''s scripts.', '/uploads/images/c_82543.png'),
(72, 'Yamato', '大和', '配角', 'Yoshihisa Kawahara', 'Yamato is one of Hayato''s friends. He is in the rugby club.', '/uploads/images/c_82545.png'),
(72, 'Oooka', '大岡', '配角', 'Minoru Shiraishi', 'Oooka is one of Hayato''s friends. He is in the baseball club.', '/uploads/images/c_82547.png'),
(72, 'Rumi Tsurumi', '鶴見留美', '配角', 'Sumire Morohoshi', 'Rumi is a lonely primary school student who is openly despised by her peers. Hayato at first tried to resolve the situation through talking to her in front of her classmates, which instead attracted more hateful attention to her. After much discussion, Hachiman and company decided that the only way out is to destroy the trust between her peers, through having Hayato and Kakeru acting as bullies threatening Rumi''s group-mates during treasure hunt and exposing their selfish nature to each other, thus preventing further organized acts of teasing on Rumi. However, in exchange, she would hardly have any friends after this. (Source:Wikipedia)', '/uploads/images/c_84613.png'),
(72, 'Meguri Shiromeguri', '城廻めぐり', '配角', 'Azumi Asakura', 'Meguri is a third year student and the president of Sobu High School''s student council. Although she is not a reliable leader herself, her personality has brought her immense support from the councilors and thus she is able to unite the student council. (Source: Wikipedia)', '/uploads/images/c_86015.jpg'),
(72, 'Iroha Isshiki', '一色いろは', '主角', 'Ayane Sakura', 'Iroha is a 1st-year student of class 1-C in Sobu High school, introduced in Volume 7.5. Hachiman sees her as a “not cute [Komachi](https://anilist.co/character/67075/Komachi-Hikigaya)” or a “better version of [Sagami](https://anilist.co/character/85283/Minami-Sagami).” She acts in front of anyone to maintain her “cute appearance” with the image of an innocent girl in order to keep her image well with others, but she is a sly and crafty girl underneath. She shows her true color to [Hachiman](https://anilist.co/character/67065/Hachiman-Hikigaya) and [Tobe](https://anilist.co/character/82543/Kakeru-Tobe), which irritates the former while the latter is unaware of it.', '/uploads/images/c_88727.png'),
(72, 'Tamanawa', '玉縄', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', 'Tamanawa is the head of the planning committee for the Christmas festival. He really likes synergy and has shown a talent in freestyle rap.', '/uploads/images/c_129150.jpg'),
(72, 'Kaori Orimoto', '折本かおり', '配角', 'Haruka Tomatsu', '[Hachiman](https://anilist.co/character/67065) and Kaori both went to the same junior school. Hachiman also used to like her and asked her out before.', '/uploads/images/c_149026.jpg'),
(72, 'Chika Nakamachi', '仲町千佳', '配角', 'Saki Fujita', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_149027.jpg'),
(72, 'Keika Kawasaki', '川崎京華', '配角', 'Azumi Asakura', 'The younger sister of Saki Kawasaki.', '/uploads/images/c_181120.jpg'),
(72, 'Fujin Yuigahama', '由比ヶ浜母', '配角', 'Sayaka Oohara', '[Yui](https://anilist.co/character/67069)''s mother. She seems to be lenient, kind, friendly person being mostly like Yui herself.', '/uploads/images/c_187653.jpg'),
(73, 'Koro-sensei', '殺せんせー ', '主角', 'Jun Fukuyama', '__Height:__ ~300cm (~9''10") He is a teacher for class 3-E of Kunugigaoka Junior High School and the main antihero of Ansatsu Kyoushitsu. He claims responsibility for blowing up the moon into a permanent crescent shape and plans to destroy the Earth in a year after teaching the students of class 3-E the art of assassination. His name comes from korosenai (殺せない), meaning "cannot be killed", and sensei (先生), meaning teacher. In this way, he is literally called the unkillable teacher. ~!Later in the story he is revealed to have been original reaper named Ryushi Korogane.!~', '/uploads/images/c_65643.png'),
(73, 'Nagisa Shiota', '潮田渚', '主角', 'Mai Fuchigami', '__Height:__ 159 cm (5''2.5") __Class:__ Class 3-E He is one of the students in Class 3-E. Nagisa is seen as one of the weakest students in the class due to his small stature and mediocre physical abilities that are comparable to a girl. However, he is actually the most talented to become an assassin out of all the students, something acknowledged by [Korosensei](https://anilist.co/character/65643) and [Karasuma](https://anilist.co/character/73881). He is able to draw closer while hiding his bloodlust to make a surprise attack and able to make his opponents falter through his bloodlust alone. Nagisa usually writes down Korosensei''s weaknesses that at first seen minor (since it doesn''t look like major weaknesses), but eventually revealed to be useful since once they''re able to almost kill Korosensei because of one of his weaknesses that is the same as the one that Nagisa has written down in his note. Outwardly friendly and polite to his friends and everyone, he hides a somewhat darker side of him as an assassin that won''t be able to be found out during daily classes and will only be shown during training and assassination time. According to Karasuma, whenever Nagisa unleashes his killing intent, he isn''t training and truly goes for a kill. ~!In the end, he kills [Koro-Sensei](https://anilist.co/character/65643/Korosensei).!~ ~!In the epilogue, 7 years later, Nagisa becomes a teacher of Paradise High School''s Class 3-5, Deciding to follow in Koro-sensei''s steps.!~', '/uploads/images/c_65645.png'),
(73, 'Karma Akabane', '赤羽業', '配角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '**Height:** 175 cm A student in [Koro-sensei](https://anilist.co/character/65643)''s class 3-E of Kunugigaoka Junior High School who had been suspended from school due to his violent behavior. He excels at using weaponry and foul play and is the only student thus far to have successfully injured Korosensei. Despite this, he is actually rather smart and manages a perfect score on one of Korosensei''s tests. He and [Nagisa](https://anilist.co/character/65645) were in the same class during their 1st and 2nd years at Kunugigaoka.', '/uploads/images/c_71933.jpg'),
(73, 'Tadaomi Karasuma', '烏間惟臣', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', 'He is a government worker associated with the Ministry of Defense. He first appeared announcing Korosensei''s deal with the government and their mission to assassinate him before the end of the year. He later became the assistant teacher and P.E. instructor of class 3-E, using his lessons to train the students in assassination techniques. He is well known among militaries for his outstanding reputation and is a powerful individual, which he has proven when he easily overpowered Irina''s master, who is a retired professional hitman, and even Korosensei himself is afraid upon seeing his capability for the first time. He is strict, but kind man, though he keeps a distance between himself and the students due to his status as an agent and his own professionalism. He is one of a few who is very perceptive enough to see Nagisa''s talent as an assassin. He seems to know Korosensei''s past, though he has no intention to indulge into it further.', '/uploads/images/c_73881.png'),
(73, 'Irina Jelavic', 'イリーナ・イェラビッチ', '配角', 'Shizuka Itou', '__Occupation:__ Professional Hitman, Part-time Foreign Language Teacher She is a professional hitwoman who is hired to kill [Korosensei](https://anilist.co/character/65643/Koro-sensei) by becoming a part-time foreign language teacher in class 3-E. She uses her charms to seduce Korosensei, making him at first obeys to whatever she asks. However, her first assassination attempt was foiled when Korosensei able to suppressed her 3-men''s attacks, ending in her humiliation and swore revenge. She teaches the students how to seduce people from other countries, so that with this method, they can learn foreign languages, and usually would punish male students who failed answering her questions during her lesson by kissing them. Irina is a deceitful, wily and beguiling individual; she frequently uses her charm to influence and manipulate her targets. She can easily befriend people, if she so chooses, and entice them to let down their defenses and become vulnerable to her. Seduction is primarily the technique she employs, and it is her area of expertise. Irina is a professional assassin who excels at handling infiltration and approaching targets. She possesses strong conversational skills in ten languages, and a proven track record of eleven jobs in countries all over the world.', '/uploads/images/c_73883.jpg'),
(73, 'Ritsu', '律', '配角', 'Saki Fujita', 'An artificial intelligence developed in Norway and sent to Class 3-E as a transfer student to dispose of [Korosensei](https://anilist.co/character/65643/Korosensei), able to learn his movement patterns and perfect her shooting skills in order to eventually kill him. After receiving a few modifications from Korosensei, she develops a conscience and becomes friends with the rest of class 3-E, who give her her shortened nickname. Thanks to her processing power, she frequently helps with Intel gathering and communications and usually interacts with others via a smartphone application developed by her classmates. She is portrayed by Kanna Hashimoto in the live action movie.', '/uploads/images/c_74832.png'),
(73, 'Kaede Kayano', '茅野カエデ', '配角', 'Aya Suzaki', 'She is one of [Nagisa](https://anilist.co/character/65645/Shiota-Nagisa)''s classmates and close friends, being the one who is mostly seen with him. She hasn''t shown any capabilities during her training to become an assassin, and so far has only been shown to discuss [Koro-sensei](https://anilist.co/character/65643/Korosensei)''s weaknesses along with Nagisa. She experiences a slight inferiority complex when it comes to sex appeal, resulting her to get angry whenever there''s a woman with big breasts and readily protest. ~!it''s revealed later in the story that she''s [Aguri Yukimura''s](https://anilist.co/character/207936/Aguri-Yukimura) younger sister, Akari Yukimura and her real birthday is on November 9.!~', '/uploads/images/c_85291.jpg'),
(73, 'Itona Horibe', '堀部イトナ', '配角', 'Megumi Ogata', 'Transfer student who aims to kill [Koro-sensei](https://anilist.co/character/65643). He is the second assassin transfer student to arrive at Class 3-E, following the previous assassin, [Ritsu](https://anilist.co/character/74832). He initially served as the secondary antagonist, before ultimately joining Class E for good. After being abandoned by [Shiro](https://anilist.co/character/176246) and befriending [Terasaka](https://anilist.co/character/85809) and his gang, Itona has since become more mellow and humble, and is now able to admit people are stronger than him, while still retaining his brutal honesty. He has also shown to be a very observant and creative individual.', '/uploads/images/c_85293.jpg'),
(73, 'Manami Okuda', '奥田愛美', '配角', 'Sayuri Yahagi', 'She is a student in class 3-E of Kunugigaoka Junior High School, taught by Korosensei. Okuda is shy and rather introverted. She admits that she isn''t really good with surprise attacks and expressing things in language. She excels in chemistry and capable of making poisons for assassinations.', '/uploads/images/c_85297.jpg'),
(73, 'Tomohito Sugino', '杉野友人', '配角', 'Yoshitaka Yamaya', 'He is one of the students and Nagisa''s close friends. He used to be a basketball player in their school''s basketball club until he was assigned into class 3-E, making him kicked out from the club. He dreams to become a professional baseball player like his idol, Arita, and emulates his techniques to improve his own performance in baseball and is shown to very dedicated to it. He also sometimes used his baseball techniques in his attempts to kill Korosensei. He has a crush on Yukiko.', '/uploads/images/c_85299.jpg'),
(73, 'Megu Kataoka', '片岡メグ', '配角', 'Chie Matsuura', 'She is a student of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. She is assigned to Class 3-E, where she trains to become a professional assassin, with her teacher as the target. She is one of the two class representatives of Class 3-E, with the other being [Yūma Isogai](https://anilist.co/character/85801/Isogai-Yuma). (Source: Ansatsu Kyoushitsu Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_85799.png'),
(73, 'Yuma Isogai', '磯貝悠馬', '配角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', 'He is a student and class rep in class 3-E of Kunugigaoka Junior High School, taught by Korosensei.', '/uploads/images/c_85801.jpg'),
(73, 'Yukiko Kanzaki', '神崎由紀子', '配角', 'Satomi Satou', 'She is a student of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. She is assigned to Class 3-E, where she trains to become a professional assassin, with her teacher as the target. Yukiko is diligent, ladylike, and cordial; although she does not particularly stand out, she is popular with her classmates. A very considerate individual, she had, on one occasion, volunteered to buy drinks for everyone in her class. Yukiko is deliberative and an excellent organizer. She was responsible for structuring the schedule for Class 3-E''s trip to Kyoto, and her work had impressed Korosensei. Furthermore, she is adept in considering all factors before making a decision, which is why she had chosen the virtually unoccupied Gion District as the ideal setting for the assassination to take place.', '/uploads/images/c_85803.jpg'),
(73, 'Takuya Muramatsu', '村松卓也', '配角', 'Kouki Harasawa', 'Takuya Muramatsu is a student of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. He is assigned to Class 3-E, where he trains to become a professional assassin, with his teacher as the target. His partners are Ryōma Terasaka and Taiji Yoshida. Muramatsu is an inconsiderate individual, unmindful to the consequences of his actions. He is willing to resort to any means in order to escape contemptible circumstances. He collaborates with Ryōma Terasaka and Taiji Yoshida, and together they pressure others to act according to their bidding.', '/uploads/images/c_85805.jpg'),
(73, 'Sousuke Sugaya', '菅谷宗介', '配角', 'Eiji Miyashita', 'He is a student of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. He is assigned to Class 3-E, where he trains to become a professional assassin, with his teacher as the target. Sousuke is exceptionally skilled at drawing and sculpting. His proficiency ranges from posters to disguise masks; he can make them with relative ease. He is also strongly individualistic, and launches attacks against Korosensei in a capricious, unpredictable manner; for instance, he offers to draw a Henna tattoo on Korosensei, but secretly had the Anti-Sensei bullets grounded into a fine powder and then mixed with the Henna paint. (Source: Assassination Classroom wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_85807.jpg'),
(73, 'Ryouma Terasaka', '寺坂竜馬', '配角', 'Subaru Kimura', 'He is a student of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. He is assigned to Class 3-E, where he trains to become a professional assassin, with his teacher as the target. His partners are Takuya Muramatsu and Taiji Yoshida. Terasaka is a rash, selfish and impatient individual. Desperate to escape from the miserable circumstances of being part of the dropout class, he is willing to resort to any means, even if the methods may be immoral. He holds no regards for the injuries of his comrades who provide assistance. However, Terasaka possesses relative leadership skills, as he is usually accompanied by his peers, Takuya Muramatsu and Taiji Yoshida. He persuades others to do his bidding by being direct and intrusively forward, as indicated when he pressures Nagisa Shiota to carry out an assassination of Korosensei by reminding him of the harsh conditions they live in.', '/uploads/images/c_85809.png'),
(73, 'Taisei Yoshida', '吉田大成', '配角', 'Yoshiyuki Shimozuma', 'He is a student of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. He is assigned to Class 3-E, where he trains to become a professional assassin, with his teacher as the target. His partners are Ryōma Terasaka and Takuya Muramatsu. Yoshida is an inconsiderate individual, unmindful to the consequences of his actions. He is willing to resort to any means in order to escape contemptible circumstances. He collaborates with Ryōma Terasaka and Takuya Muramatsu, and together they pressure others to act according to their bidding.', '/uploads/images/c_85811.png'),
(73, 'Taiga Okajima', '岡島大河', '配角', 'Ryou Naitou', 'He is a student in Korosensei''s class 3-E of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. Okajima is the class pervert and is rather open about it. As with Rio Nakamura, Okajima is known to like peeping. He likes to read erotica magazines and even claimed to be a brother of Korosensei and Itona Horibe for doing so. At the start of July, he enjoys looking at the girls'' more exposed skin.', '/uploads/images/c_85813.png'),
(73, 'Yuzuki Fuwa', '不破優月', '配角', 'Kana Ueda', 'She is a student in class 3-E of Kunugigaoka Junior High School, taught by Korosensei. Fuwa has an imaginative personality, as evidenced with her like of reading the Weekly Shōnen Jump magazine.', '/uploads/images/c_85815.png'),
(73, 'Gakuhou Asano', '浅野学侯', '配角', 'Shou Hayami', 'He is the board chairman and administrative head of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. He has made the academy into the foremost in Japan in the ten years since its founding. Gakuhō is a reasonable, prudent, and shrewd individual; he is primarily known for his cool-headed rationalism. He is a proponent of logic and efficiency, and handles matters accordingly. An able and competent administrator, he is resolved in removing factors that may upset the intended balance.', '/uploads/images/c_85819.png'),
(73, 'Touka Yada', '矢田桃花', '配角', 'Ayaka Suwa', 'She is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E. She is the big sister of Class 3-E and one of the most enthusiastic students about learning the art of infiltration from [Irina](https://anilist.co/character/73883/Jelavic-Irina). She''s been described as being adult-like and cool to the point that [Kayano](https://anilist.co/character/85291/Kayano-Kaede) admits that she''s attracted to her despite her large bust. Yada does not like violence, which is why she commits herself to negotiation in order avoid fighting.', '/uploads/images/c_88795.png'),
(73, 'Sumire Hara', '原寿美鈴', '配角', 'Miho Hino', 'She is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E. Hara is one of the most passive members of the class where she frequently acts as support in assassination attempts with her ability to assess the situation and herself. She is usually regarded as a motherly figure, due to her ability to cook and care for the class.', '/uploads/images/c_88796.png'),
(73, 'Hiroto Maehara', '前原陽斗', '配角', 'Shintarou Asanuma', 'He is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E. Maehara is a nice guy and in every sense of the word, a playboy. He has a "live the moment" attitude about life in general. He is one of the few that is popular in the whole school despite being in the E Class. Despite that attitude, he is a caring person and isn''t the type to pick on someone weaker than him. He also falls into the type of being honest, and often reacts strongly to things.', '/uploads/images/c_88797.png'),
(73, 'Rio Nakamura', '中村莉桜', '配角', 'Manami Numakura', 'She is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. She was a former elementary school genius but felt lonely and longed to be normal. When she got to middle school, she began shirking off her studies which landed her in Class 3-E. She loves teasing the other students in her class (sometimes together with Karma Akabane)', '/uploads/images/c_88798.png'),
(73, 'Kirara Hazama', '狭間綺羅々', '配角', 'Fuuko Saitou', 'She is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E. Hazama is a quiet girl who loves reading, preferring to sit in the shade with a book rather than swim during summer gym classes and wants to become a librarian. She even recommended to Itona the novel, The Count of Monte Cristo, though accidentally spoiled the ending. She prefers dark stories and horror novels, and because of this also has an interest in the occult which she displayed when she attempted to use a curse on Korosensei.', '/uploads/images/c_88799.png'),
(73, 'Koutarou Takebayashi', '竹林考太郎', '配角', 'Daichuu Mizushima', 'He is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E. Takebayashi is mostly a quiet person. However, he seems somewhat eccentric in his behavior and stands out as the oddball in the class. He also seems to be clumsy at physical activity, having ping pong balls hit his glasses while playing with others and nearly losing balance in one of Tadaomi Karasuma''s lessons. He is also obsessed with anime, at one point stating "A girl isn''t a true girl until she loses the third D" implying he likes anime girls more than real women. He also enjoys going to maid cafes.', '/uploads/images/c_88800.png'),
(73, 'Kouki Mimura', '三村航輝', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', 'He is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E.', '/uploads/images/c_88801.png'),
(73, 'Masayoshi Kimura', '木村正義', '配角', 'Shunsuke Kawabe', 'He is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E. Kimura is one of the relatively proactive students when it comes to assassination and aims to claim the 10 billion yen reward.', '/uploads/images/c_88802.png'),
(73, 'Hinano Kurahashi', '倉橋陽菜乃', '配角', 'Hisako Kanemoto', 'She is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E. Hinano''s personality is an energetic and positive girl and is always seen with a smile on her face regardless of whether she''s trying to assassinate Korosensei, or whatever else. Hinano is also a passionate animal and nature lover.', '/uploads/images/c_88803.png'),
(73, 'Hinata Okano', '岡野ひなた', '配角', 'Minami Tanaka', 'She is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E. In her initial appearances, Okano was often shown to be serious with a relatively neutral expression. As the series goes on, she''s later shown to also be playful in addition to being serious. She is also described as someone who acts before she thinks.', '/uploads/images/c_88804.png'),
(73, 'Ryuunosuke Chiba', '千葉龍之介', '配角', 'Junji Majima', '__Height::__ 172 cm (5’8”) __School:__ Kunugigaoka Junior High School __Class:__ 3-E __Seat Number:__ 15 He is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. Chiba is a serious and stoic boy. He''s very calm and doesn''t talk a lot. He is the best marksman among all of Class 3-E. He excels in spatial calculation and, as such, is unmatched in long distance shooting. His abilities have even earned him the praises of [Lovro](https://anilist.co/character/265570/Brovski-Lovro), a hitman dealer and a retired assassin.', '/uploads/images/c_88805.png'),
(73, 'Rinka Hayami', '速水凛香', '配角', 'Shiho Kawaragi', 'She is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E. Rinka is a very stoic, businesslike and professional girl who has been compared to a working adult along with Chiba. As a result of her serious demeanor, she can be quite straightforward and direct.', '/uploads/images/c_88806.png'),
(73, 'Gakushuu Asano', '浅野学秀', '配角', 'Mamoru Miyano', 'A student in class 3-A in Kunugigaoka Junior High School. He is the student council president and the son of the Board Chairman, Gakuhou Asano. He is a genius student who, like many main building students, look down upon class 3-E.', '/uploads/images/c_89352.jpg'),
(73, 'Kunudon', 'くぬどん', '配角', 'Kurumi Mamiya', 'Kunudon is the mascot of Kununigoaka. He hates E class and is a propaganda tool used by the director.', '/uploads/images/c_172719.jpg'),
(73, 'Ren Sakakibara', '榊原蓮', '配角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', 'is a student in Class 3-A in Kunugigaoka Junior High School and one of the Big Five. He is also the Student Council secretary.', '/uploads/images/c_175947.jpg'),
(73, 'Grip', 'グリップ', '配角', 'Katsuki Murase', 'One of three assassins in Okinawa along with Smog and Gastro. Grip is a foreigner with wavy platinum blond hair and light blue eyes. He boasts great physical strength, which he utilizes in his assassinations.', '/uploads/images/c_176241.jpg'),
(73, 'Smog', 'スモッグ', '配角', 'Atsushi Imaruoka', 'One of three assassins in Okinawa along with Gastro and Grip. He specializes in creating/making poisons.', '/uploads/images/c_176242.jpg'),
(73, 'Gastro', 'ガストロ', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', 'One of three assassins in Okinawa, along with Smog and Grip. He loves the taste of a gun so much that he uses it as a utensil.', '/uploads/images/c_176243.jpg'),
(73, 'Akira Takaoka', '鷹岡明', '配角', 'Kenta Miyake', 'A trained soldier who served with Tadaomi Karasuma. When he was in the military, he was able to produce elite loyal troops in a short span of time by connecting with them as a tightly-knit family and standing as a violent father at the same time.', '/uploads/images/c_176244.jpg'),
(73, 'Yuuji Norita', '法田勇治', '配角', 'Ayumu Murase', 'A rich teenage boy. Although he is initially lazy and rides on his father''s coattails, with encouragement from Nagisa he decides to change himself for the better.', '/uploads/images/c_176245.jpg'),
(73, 'Shiro', 'シロ', '配角', 'Ryouta Takeuchi', 'A mysterious man in white clothes who hides secrets about Koro-sensei''s past. ~!His real name is Kotarou Yanagisawa!~', '/uploads/images/c_176246.jpg'),
(73, 'Natsuhiko Koyama', '小山夏彦', '配角', '', 'Natsuhiko Koyama is a student in Class 3-A in Kunugigaoka Junior High School and the president of the Biology Club who is one of the Big Five.', '/uploads/images/c_207935.jpg'),
(73, 'Aguri Yukimura', '雪村あぐり', '配角', '', 'Aguri Yukimura is the former teacher of Class 3-E.', '/uploads/images/c_207936.jpg'),
(73, 'Teppei Araki', '荒木鉄平', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_245009.jpg'),
(73, 'Tomoya Seo', '瀬尾智也', '配角', '', 'Tomoya Seo is a student in Class 3-A in Kunugigaoka Junior High School and one of the Five Virtuosos. He is also the Student Assembly Chairman.', '/uploads/images/c_245010.png'),
(73, 'Red Eye', 'レッドアイ', '配角', '', 'Sniper hired to kill Koro-sensei during the Kyoto trip.', '/uploads/images/c_245011.jpg'),
(73, 'Kazutaka Shindo', '進藤一考', '配角', '', 'Kazutaka Shindou is a student in Class 3-A in Kunugigaoka Junior High School and plays in the baseball team.', '/uploads/images/c_245012.jpg'),
(73, 'Lovro Brovski', 'ロヴロ・ブロフスキ', '配角', 'Takashi Matsuyama', 'Lovro is a hitman dealer who was once a talented assassin. He is the Japanese government''s only link with the world of hitmen.', '/uploads/images/c_265570.png'),
(73, 'Chousuke Takada', '高田長助', '配角', 'Masahito Yabe', 'Chosuke Takada is a student in Class 3-D of Kunugigaoka Junior High School who is often seen with Nobuta Tanaka.', '/uploads/images/c_266253.png'),
(73, 'Nobuta Tanaka', '田中信太', '配角', 'Hiroki Gotou', 'Nobuta Tanaka is a student in Class 3-D of Kunugigaoka Junior High School who is often seen with Chosuke Takada.', '/uploads/images/c_266254.png'),
(74, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Rintarou Nishi', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(74, 'Meliodas', 'メリオダス', '主角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Race:__ ~!Demon!~ __Height:__ 152cm (5''0") Meliodas the leader of the Seven Deadly Sins and the Sin of Wrath with the symbol of the Dragon. He is the main protagonist of the Nanatsu no Taizai and the owner of the Boar Hat bar.', '/uploads/images/c_72921.png'),
(74, 'Elizabeth Liones', 'エリザベス・リオネス', '主角', 'Sora Amamiya', 'Elizabeth Liones is the third adoptive princess of the Kingdom of Liones Originally an alleged survivor of Danafor''s destruction, Elizabeth was adopted and raised by the king [Bartra Liones](https://anilist.co/character/131565/Bartra-Liones). After the Holy Knights rebel, she sets on journey to find Seven Deadly Sins, becoming a waitress for [Meliodas](https://anilist.co/character/72921/Meliodas-)'' tavern Boar Hat. ~!She is 107th and current incarnation of the Goddess Elizabeth, and the lover of Meliodas, captain of the Seven Deadly Sins. She is the deuteragonist of the series.!~', '/uploads/images/c_72923.png'),
(74, 'Gilthunder', 'ギルサンダー', '配角', 'Mamoru Miyano', '__Height:__ 185 cm (6''1") One of the holy knights of the Britannia kingdom. He is a Diamond-ranked Holy Knight.', '/uploads/images/c_74285.png'),
(74, 'Diane', 'ディアンヌ', '主角', 'Aoi Yuuki', 'Diane is a member of the Seven Deadly Sins and is The Sin of Envy with the symbol of the Serpent. She is also a member of the Giant''s Clan. She is a fair maiden with pink eyes and medium length brown hair which is tied up into Mega Twintails. Despite being a beautiful looking maiden, she is in fact a giant from the giant clan, and is several times larger than ordinary humans. She wears a one piece orange suit, boots that extend almost up to the knees, and a metal armband which is embedded with shiny metal pebbles. Her current outfits and attire is believed to be the most fashionable ones. She wears an orange colored short sleeved bodysuit and boots. As the Serpent''s Sin of Envy, her main traits are jealousy and envy. She shows strong affection for Meliodas, so when she met him together with Elizabeth, she grew very jealous and threw him away whilst calling him a cheater. In contrary with Elizabeth who wants to be strong and powerful, she wants to be small.', '/uploads/images/c_74653.jpg'),
(74, 'Ban', 'バン', '主角', 'Tatsuhisa Suzuki', '__Height:__ 210 cm Ban is a member of the Seven Deadly Sins and is The Sin of Greed with the symbol of the Fox. He was imprisoned in the Baste Dungeon.', '/uploads/images/c_77605.png'),
(74, 'King', 'キング', '主角', 'Jun Fukuyama', '__Height:__ 165 cm King is a member of the Seven Deadly Sins and is the Sin of Sloth with the symbol of the Grizzly. He is also Oslo''s master. King''s real identity is Fairy King Harlequin, the king of the fairy race.', '/uploads/images/c_83801.png'),
(74, 'Guila', 'ギーラ', '配角', 'Mariya Ise', 'Geera is a Holy Knight who left herself in a near-death state to have access to the Capital of the Dead and kill the Deadly Sins who had gone there. She is a young female with a slim build. She has long black hair and her eyes are depicted as if they are closed.', '/uploads/images/c_86665.jpg'),
(74, 'Dreyfus', 'ドレファス', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', 'Dreyfus is one of the current Great Holy Knights, thus also making him one of the two people who have command over the entirety of Britannia after the coup d''état. His attire consists of a standard set of a Holy Knight''s armor that has a spike on each shoulder. He has long black hair that reaches up to his shoulder, with a short beard.', '/uploads/images/c_86677.png'),
(74, 'Hendricksen', 'ヘンドリクセン', '配角', 'Yuuya Uchida', 'Hendricksen is one of the current Great Holy Knights, thus also making him one of the two people who have command over the entirety of Britannia after the coup d''état. He wears a set of and covers it with a robe on top. He has short light-colored hair and also a goatee. Hendricksen is a serious man, who, like Dreyfus, appears to be willing to capture the king and enslave the citizens to prepare for the Holy War. However, he also seems to be plotting something.', '/uploads/images/c_86679.png'),
(74, 'Elaine', 'エレイン', '配角', 'Kotori Koiwai', 'Elaine is King''s sister, and the Guardian Saint of the Fountain of Youth. She has long and thin eyelashes, and cut hair that reaches her neck. She wears a single white one-piece dress which is tied together with a butterfly knot at the back. Elaine is shown to be a kind, caring and forgiving girl.', '/uploads/images/c_86681.png'),
(74, 'Hawk', 'ホーク', '主角', 'Misaki Kuno', 'Hawk is a talking pig and Meliodas''s companion. He is introduced as the cleaner of the Boar Hat bar who helps clean the disgusting food scraps. He is a relatively large pink pig who wears an earring with the word star boar on his left ear. His body is well rounded and his legs are fairly short. He has a unique patch of black spots shaped like a four-leafed clover. His body and appearance are fairly similar to a typical Gloucestershire Old Spots Pig.', '/uploads/images/c_86683.png'),
(74, 'Howzer', 'ハウザー', '配角', 'Ryouhei Kimura', 'Hauser is a Holy Knight, a colleague and partner of Gilthunder, and a subordinate of the Great Holy Knight, Dreyfus. He wears a set of Holy Knight armor and has short light-colored curled up hair. Hauser demonstrates a lot of self confidence and is very optimistic, which is the complete opposite of Gilthunder''s personality; he is also shown to be somewhat naive and stupid.', '/uploads/images/c_86685.png'),
(74, 'Veronica Liones', 'ベロニカ・リオネス', '配角', 'Hisako Kanemoto', 'Veronica is the second princess of Britannia. The younger sibling of the first princess, [Margaret](https://anilist.co/character/126382/Liones-Margaret), and elder to her adopted sister; the third princess, [Elizabeth](https://anilist.co/character/72923/Liones-Elizabeth). She has a tomboyish appearance, short light colored hair and a slim build. She wears a stylish fur coat, a knight-styled attire, a belt and a pair of long boots. She is described to be a tomboy, who, as a child, liked to and often used to play with swords with the boys, and would be scolded by her father for doing so. Sharing the Holy Knights'' attitude about enslaving the citizens, she also cares about her younger sister, Elizabeth.', '/uploads/images/c_86691.png'),
(74, 'Jericho', 'ジェリコ', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', 'Jericho is an apprentice Holy Knight who served under the Weird Fangs. She was stationed at the Baste Dungeon, where the Deadly Sin, Ban was imprisoned. She is young woman of slim build, with light hair that is swept over the left side of her face and tied into a ponytail at the back. She wears a black coat over her armor, adorned with a cross on the left side and larger cross covering the back. Underneath her armor are similarly fashioned black clothes. Metal gauntlets cover her arms, while metal greaves and sabatons cover her legs and feet. Jericho is a proud and serious individual. She is stern in her command over the guards of Baste Dungeon and overconfident in her abilities, appearing arrogant at times, which led to her humiliation by Ban.', '/uploads/images/c_86699.jpg'),
(74, 'Griamor', 'グリアモール', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', 'Griamor is a Holy Knight who comes from a lineage of Holy Knights that have served the kingdom of Lyonesse for many generations. He is Veronica''s bodyguard, and shows absolute loyalty towards her. Griamor is a very tall and muscular individual who is at least twice the height of ordinary civilians, and has grey shoulder length hair. His attire consists of a single-spiked helmet, full leg armor and no upper body clothing, except a mysterious metal plate strapped around his chest with two straps. He also wears a glove on one hand and a sleeve-armor on the other arm. He, like many other Holy Knights, is heartless and cruel. Although he is ruthless, he shows absolute loyalty to Veronica and cannot allow himself to displease her, having started to serve her at a quite young age, even role-playing as a horse for her to ride on as a child.', '/uploads/images/c_86703.jpg'),
(74, 'Gowther', 'ゴウセル', '主角', 'Yuuhei Takagi', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") (Human size), 23 - 24 cm (0''9") (doll) He is shown to be completely clueless and unaware of others'' feelings, not understanding the meaning of friendship. He often states things factually, not understanding how what he says can upset people. He decides to assist [Elizabeth](https://anilist.co/character/72923/Liones-Elizabeth) on her journey, not because of a desire for justice, but because he felt obligated as a member of the Seven Deadly Sins. Since Gowther doesn''t understand emotions, he goes to great length to understand them. For example, observing [Meliodas](https://anilist.co/character/72921/Meliodas) and [Ban](https://anilist.co/character/77605/Ban)''s friendship.', '/uploads/images/c_88823.png'),
(74, 'Merlin', 'マーリン', '配角', 'Maaya Sakamoto', 'She is a member of the Seven Deadly Sins. She has the mark of the boars sin of gluttony. She was regarded as the greatest mage in Britannia and is the master of [Vivian](https://anilist.co/character/131564) as well as a teacher of [King Arthur of Camelot](https://anilist.co/character/122210). She came to the aid of the sins in their battle against [Hendirkson](https://anilist.co/character/86679) but had to leave to tend to the King. She has not officially rejoined the sins but said she would as soon as she was finished with her other business.', '/uploads/images/c_89180.png'),
(74, 'Arthur Pendragon', 'アーサー・ペンドラゴン', '配角', 'Sachi Kokuryuu', 'Named the king of Camelot after pulling a sword from the stone that hundreds of holy knights could not. Arthur is a polite, young man who is still adjusting to his role as king. He takes his responsibilities very seriously, but usually undertakes them with a smile and has a very warm, and happy-go-lucky demeanor. He marched toward the kingdom of Liones with an army of illusions created by Merlin in hopes of meeting with the king; however, he was confronted by Hendricksen who tried to kill him before Meliodas came to his aide. (Source: MyAnimeList)', '/uploads/images/c_122210.png'),
(74, 'Margaret Liones', 'マーガレット・リオネス', '配角', 'Nana Mizuki', 'The first princess of the Kingdom of Liones. The elder sibling of the second princess, Veronica and of her adopted sister; the third princess, Elizabeth.', '/uploads/images/c_126382.png'),
(74, 'Zaratras', 'ザラトラス', '配角', 'Rikiya Koyama', 'Zaratras was a Great Holy Knight and was once the strongest in the order of Liones'' Holy Knights before his death ten years prior to the beginning of series. He is also the father of the Holy Knight, Gilthunder, and was the Seven Deadly Sins'' superior.', '/uploads/images/c_131560.png'),
(74, 'Liz', 'リズ', '配角', 'Sora Amamiya', 'Liz, or Elizabeth, was a knight from an enemy kingdom of Danafor, which attempted night ambush at Danafor, but got captured and sentenced to death. She was saved by Meliodas, the leader of the Holy Knights of Danafor and ended up living in Danafor and eventually also became Meliodas'' lover. She is believed to have been killed during Danafor''s complete annihilation.', '/uploads/images/c_131561.jpg'),
(74, 'Vivian', 'ビビアン', '配角', 'Minako Kotobuki', 'Vivian is an enigmatic Holy Knight once directly serving under Great Holy Knight [Hendrickson](https://anilist.co/character/86679/Hendricksen) and used to be an apprentice of [Merlin](https://anilist.co/character/89180/Merlin), the Boar''s Sin Gluttony. Vivian is regarded as the kingdom of Liones'' greatest mage.', '/uploads/images/c_131564.jpg'),
(74, 'Bartra Liones', 'バルトラ・リオネス', '配角', 'Rintarou Nishi', 'The eleventh king of Liones and father of Elizabeth. He was held captive after the Seven Deadly Sins were framed for killing the great holy knight Zaratras.', '/uploads/images/c_131565.jpg'),
(74, 'Gustav', 'グスタフ', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', 'Gustaf is a Ruby ranked Holy Knight and Jericho''s older brother.', '/uploads/images/c_131567.jpg'),
(74, 'Zeal', 'ジール', '配角', 'Yui Nakajima', 'Guila''s younger brother', '/uploads/images/c_131574.jpg'),
(74, 'Slader', 'スレイダー', '配角', 'Shinichirou Miki', 'Slader was kidnapped and raised as a child by savages who held no regard for his worth as a human. After being freed by the king of Liones he pledged loyalty and resolved to hunt down any who wronged the kingdom. He is a member of Dawn Roar who holds a rivalry against Gowther of the Seven Deadly Sins.', '/uploads/images/c_131889.jpg'),
(74, 'Golgius', 'ゴルギウス', '配角', 'Choo', 'A holy knight of the weird fangs. Golgius uses underhanded and deceitful tactics in order to get his way. Contracts a doctor to poison Melodidas while holding his daughter hostage and making off with Elizabeth and his sword, also tries to assassinate Melodidas while holding his hands up in surrender. He has the power of transparency, which he claims to be teleportation', '/uploads/images/c_131891.jpg'),
(74, 'Cain Barzard', 'ケイン・バルザド', '配角', 'Takashi Inagaki', 'Cain is a short elderly man with combed hair, and a long mustache and beard. He also wears a clock, and his eyes seem to be always closed. Under his cloak, Cain wears trousers, and a long shirt that bears the crest of Danafor. He seem like a drunk, and strange, weak old man but deep down he might be a powerful fighter and wanted to have revenge on Meliodas for destroying their kingdom long time ago, he seem to be shock when he found out he wasn''t Meliodas'' son and that he didn''t age.', '/uploads/images/c_131898.jpg'),
(74, 'Mead', 'ミード', '配角', 'Yumiko Kobayashi', 'Mead is an orphan, adopted by the villagers of Bernia after his parents, who were travelers, became victim to an epidemic when they stopped by Bernia.', '/uploads/images/c_131904.jpg'),
(74, 'Ellen', 'エレン', '配角', 'Nozomi Furuki', 'She is the sister of Luigi. She knows the way into the Capital of the Dead.', '/uploads/images/c_131905.jpg'),
(74, 'Weinheidt', 'ワインハイト', '配角', 'Hideki Nakanishi', 'Weinheidt was a member from the group of Holy Knights, Dawn Roar and was the marksman of the team. Weinheidt was a well-built man with a short beard and mustache and wears a set of medieval archer clothing with a small cloak draped around his shoulders. Like the other Dawn Roar members, Weinheidt was willing to kill anybody for the mission. He was faithful to whatever mission his team is assigned to and doesn''t care about the motives behind the mission as long as the job gets done, although he can be curious sometimes. Despite the Holy Knights'' coup, Weinheidt retains his loyalty to the king along with his teammates when Baltra ordered Dawn Roar to stop Slader from hurting himself, to which Weinheidt complied.', '/uploads/images/c_131906.jpg'),
(74, 'Friesia', 'フリージア', '配角', 'Megumi Han', 'Friesia is a Holy Knight with the ability to manipulate insects. Belonging to the infamous Weird Fangs stationed at Baste Dungeon, she aided in the capture of the Deadly Sin, Ban.', '/uploads/images/c_131907.jpg'),
(74, 'Dale', 'デール', '配角', 'Mitsuru Miyamoto', 'A Holy Knight and father of Guila and Zeal. Although Dale is labeled as a traitor after his disappearance, the incident is shrouded in mystery', '/uploads/images/c_131908.png'),
(74, 'Jude', 'ジュド', '配角', 'Nobuyuki Hiyama', 'A Holy Knight, and one of the four Weird Fangs of Baste Dungeon who captured and imprisoned Ban. Jude is known to have tortured Ban mercilessly during the Sin''s imprisonment.', '/uploads/images/c_131909.jpg'),
(74, 'Taizoo', 'タイズー', '配角', 'Kenichirou Matsuda', 'is a mountain bandit-turned merchant, and a three-time champion of Vaizel''s annual fight festival', '/uploads/images/c_131910.jpg'),
(74, 'Ruin', 'ルイン', '配角', 'Atsushi Ono', 'A holy knight of the weird fangs whom wishes to bring ruin to the seven deadly sins. Claims his body is his true armor, and more durable than steel. Hypnotizes both Melodidas and Diane into fighting each other with his bell. Easily defeated by Melodidas after Elizabeth tore the hypnotizing bell off his staff.', '/uploads/images/c_131911.jpg'),
(74, 'Twigo', 'ツイーゴ', '配角', 'Kenta Miyake', 'Twigo is an apprentice Holy Knight who is stationed near Caines Village. ~!After his defeat by Meliodas, he, wanting to gain greater powers, drank the demon''s blood, but died since he was incompatible.!~', '/uploads/images/c_131912.jpg'),
(74, 'Dana', 'ダナ', '配角', 'Tomoyuki Shimura', 'is an elderly doctor who resides in Dalmary Town, and has a daughter named Sennett. Dr. Dana is a level-headed person and is extremely dedicated to his work as he did not stop "treating" Meliodas even when Friesia was destroying the town.He cares deeply about his daughter as he was willing to even poison Meliodas to have her released from imprisonment', '/uploads/images/c_131913.jpg'),
(74, 'Marmas', 'マルマス', '配角', 'Kenichirou Matsuda', 'Marmas is a Holy Knight. He led Guila and Jericho in the assault on Byzel', '/uploads/images/c_131914.jpg'),
(74, 'Alioni', 'アリオーニ', '配角', 'Hirofumi Nojima', 'Alioni is a member of the group of knights, Beard of the Mountain Cat, which was garrisoned at the base of the mountain in Kaynes Village, and claimed to serve under a Holy Knight. He was first seen beside his fellow knights trying to capture to capture the enigmatic and infamous Rust Knight who had appeared at the mysterious bar, the Boar Hat.', '/uploads/images/c_131915.jpg'),
(74, 'Simon', 'サイモン', '配角', 'Ryousuke Kanemoto', 'is a Holy Knight and a member of Dawn Roar', '/uploads/images/c_131916.jpg'),
(74, 'Sennett', 'セネット', '配角', 'Yurie Kobori', 'is the daughter of an elderly doctor, Dana who works at Dalmary Town. Sennett is a polite and caring person. She loves her father very much, and was worried about him when she left; she was extremely happy when he is revealed to be alive.She also cares about her dagger as it is a memento of her mother', '/uploads/images/c_131917.jpg'),
(74, 'Luigi', 'ルイジ', '配角', 'Emiri Katou', 'He is the brother of Ellen.', '/uploads/images/c_131918.jpg'),
(74, 'Hawk Mama', 'ホークママ', '配角', 'Kayou Nakajima', 'She is Hawk''s mother and the extremely large, green pig who transports the Boar Hat bar. She is introduced to live underground and transports the bar Boar Hat with her head. So far, her name remains unknown but she has gained many aliases.', '/uploads/images/c_133377.png'),
(74, 'Helbram', 'ヘルブラム', '配角', 'Hiroshi Kamiya', 'Helbram is a Holy Knight, Geera''s master, and the subordinate of the Great Holy Knight, Hendricksen. He wears a set of copper-colored full body armor, adorning it with a purple coat on top. He usually covers his face with a unique helm with a skyblue crest on it. Helbram has a serious personality, but also a playful side, which is seen when he jokes that Meliodas'' decoration of Geera''s face was not very bad. Helbram was also shown to like doing research, even taking notes during battle. ~!During the fighting festival in the Byzel Arc, he disguised himself as a referee with the alias of Love Helm.!~', '/uploads/images/c_140918.jpg'),
(75, 'Joutarou Kuujou', '空条承太郎', '主角', 'Daisuke Ono', '__Height:__ 195 cm (6''5") __Occupation:__ Student, Marine Explorer, Oceanographer __Nationality:__ Japanese Joutarou is Holly Kujo''s son and [Joseph Joestar](https://anilist.co/character/6356)''s grandson. In Part 3, he has a recognizable attire of a blue trenchcoat-length school uniform jacket with yellow chains on the collar. He also wears a trademark hat which, while torn in the back, often seems to blend with his hair. When Joutarou first appears, he turned himself in to the police because he believes his Stand is an evil spirit possessing him. After he is released from jail, and learns what his Stand is, Joutarou gets used to Star Platinum -- a fierce, muscular, vaguely Aztec-looking spirit with "the precision of a machine" and the ability to destroy virtually anything with a sledgehammer barrage of fists. He has a very tough exterior, and is even rather rough and delinquent, but he also is very dedicated, intense, and loyal. He is very intelligent, but usually lets his (or Star Platinum''s) fists do the talking with the enemy, even though he often has to rely on his wits to deal with stand users'' attacks. He is also known for a quick and short temper. His catchphrase is "Yare yare daze." It generally relates of being bored or exasperation. In Part 3, he is the main target of [Dio](https://anilist.co/character/4004), who realizes that Joutarou is his greatest threat. One of the strongest stands in the JoJo universe; Star Platinum possesses super human senses, strength, sta', '/uploads/images/c_4003.png'),
(75, 'Dio Brando', 'ディオ・ブランドー', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', '__Height:__ 195 cm (6''5") __Race:__ Human (formerly), Vampire (onwards) __Nationality:__ British Dio is an immortal vampire and the arch rival of the Joestar clan. __Series 1: Phantom Blood__ ~!Dio is the son of [Dario Brando](https://anilist.co/character/74099/Brando-Dario), an alcoholic and abusive father. Back when Dio was just a boy, he was brought into the household of [George Joestar](https://anilist.co/character/21956/Joestar-I-George) after the mysterious death of his father, so as to repay the debt he owed Dio''s father for saving his life. But soon Dio''s personality caused trouble for George''s young son, [Jonathan Joestar](https://anilist.co/character/8087/Joestar-Jonathan). Even more of a sociopath than his father, Dio was resolute to shatter Jonathan''s spirit and take his place as the favored son, even going so far as to arrange for Jonathan''s dog [Danny](https://anilist.co/character/222601/Danny) to be burned to death. Initially, Dio is able earn the trust of the patriarch of the Joestar family through deceit (and at Jonathan''s expense). However, his plans of taking over the Joestar household were discovered by Jonathan when he discovered that not only had Dio poisoned his biological father to death, he was doing the same to his adoptive father, all to take the Joestar estate for his own. Determined not to be stopped, and understanding the potential to enjoy power over all things instead of just the Joestar estate, Dio wears and activates the Stone Mask, becoming ', '/uploads/images/c_4004.png'),
(75, 'Jean-Pierre Polnareff', 'ジャン＝ピエール・ポルナレフ', '主角', 'Fuminori Komatsu', '__Height:__ 185 cm (6''1") Jean-Pierre Polnareff is a Frenchman who joins the Joestar group on their journey to Egypt after being freed from Dio''s control by the group. He aims to avenge the murder of his sister. His brash nature and overconfidence combined with his general tomfoolery is often the source of trouble throughout the journey, and other members of the group often remark on his tendency to endanger himself and others. ~!Polnareff reappears in 2001 (Part 5), now 36 years old and wheelchair-bound, to assist [Giorno](https://anilist.co/character/10529/Giovanna-Giorno) and the rest of Passione in their fight against the boss.!~ He also serves as the inspiration for many characters in other franchises such as [Guile](https://anilist.co/character/9312/Guile) (Street Fighter), [Paul](https://anilist.co/character/285435/Phoenix-Paul) (Tekken), [Benimaru Nikaido](https://anilist.co/character/61203/Nikaido-Benimaru) (King of Fighters).', '/uploads/images/c_4368.png'),
(75, 'Joseph Joestar', 'ジョセフ・ジョースター', '主角', 'Unshou Ishizuka', '__Height__: 195 cm (6''5") Joseph Joestar begins as a young Englishman in New York, with his grandmother [Erina](https://anilist.co/character/21937). However, an attack by [Straits](https://anilist.co/character/21961) and the disappearance of [Robert Edward O Speedwagon](https://anilist.co/character/21938) soon involve him in the greater chain of events.', '/uploads/images/c_6356.png'),
(75, 'Jonathan Joestar', 'ジョナサン・ジョースター', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 195 cm __Nationality:__ British __Occupation:__ Archaeologist Born the unique son of the wealthy businessman [George Joestar I](https://anilist.co/character/21956), Jonathan is an honest, kind, and positive man whose life is fraught with tragedy after meeting his adopted older brother - and series antagonist - [Dio Brando](https://anilist.co/character/4004). In his battle against Dio, Jonathan becomes a Ripple user under the tutelage of the master [Will Anthonio Zeppeli](https://anilist.co/character/18062). **Part 5:**~!Jonathan is the biological father of [Giorno Giovanna](https://anilist.co/character/10529), the protagonist of Vento Aureo, as well as a handful of other illegitimate offspring.!~', '/uploads/images/c_8087.png'),
(75, 'Noriaki Kakyouin', '花京院典明', '主角', 'Daisuke Hirakawa', '__Height:__ 178 cm (5''10") __Stand:__ Hierophant Green Kakyoin is a high school student and user of the stand Hierophant Green. Unlike most stand users, Kakyoin was born with his stand, though it caused him to feel like an outsider for most of his life due to not knowing any other stand users. Until meeting the rest of the main characters, Hierophant was Kakyoin’s only real friend. Hierophant is not physically strong, but is elastic and can able to unravel into tentacles which can capture opponents. It can also enter an enemy’s body to possess them, though Kakyoin rarely uses this ability. Hierophant’s signature power is emerald splash, which hurls emeralds that slice opponents. Kakyoin remains calm and collected even in dangerous situations, and is good at seeing through opponents’ strategies. During a trip to Egypt with his family, he encountered [Dio](https://anilist.co/character/4004/Brando-Dio), who controlled him using a flesh bud. It was later removed by [Jotaro](https://anilist.co/character/4003/Kuujou-Joutarou) and Kakyoin joined the Joestar group.', '/uploads/images/c_8945.jpg'),
(75, 'Mohammed Avdol', 'モハメド・アヴドゥル', '主角', 'Kenta Miyake', '__Height:__ 188 cm (6''2") __Stand:__ Magician''s Red Avdol is a fortune teller and friend of [Joseph Joestar](https://anilist.co/character/6356/Joestar-Joseph). They met three years before the events of the story. He was born with a stand, Magician’s Red, which controls fire. This stand’s abilities include Crossfire Hurricane, which shoots fire in the shape of an Ankh, and Crossfire Hurricane Special, which splits into multiple Ankh-shaped flames. He can also create flame tracker that detects a person’s energy. Avdol presents himself as a serious person but can sometimes let his emotions get the best of him. He often acts as the voice of reason among the Joestar group and exhibits strong loyalty by frequently placing himself in danger to protect his friends. He is knowledgeable about geography and stands, enjoys India’s chaotic atmosphere, and respects [Polnareff](https://anilist.co/character/4368/Polnareff-JeanPierre)''s chivalrous attitude that he displayed when they first met. Avdol gives [Jotaro](https://anilist.co/character/4003/Kuujou-Joutarou)''s stand its name. ~!Avdol encountered [DIO](https://anilist.co/character/4004/Brando-Dio) in Egypt before the main events of the story, but was able to escape unscathed.!~ ~!At one point he is shot by [Hol Horse](https://anilist.co/character/16557/Horse-Hol) and presumed dead, but he was actually in hiding and rejoins the Joestar group later. He is killed protecting Polnareff and [Iggy](https://anilist.co/character/21089/Iggy) from', '/uploads/images/c_8946.jpg'),
(75, 'Hol Horse', 'ホル・ホｰス', '配角', 'Hidenobu Kiuchi', '**Height**: 188cm *(anime)* Hol Horse is a minor antagonist in JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure: Stardust Crusaders (first seen in Chapter 141 and Episode 10), as well as one of the main characters of Crazy Diamond''s Demonic Heartbreak. He is a tall, blonde-haired cowboy-themed mercenary, serving under Dio and his army of other Stand Users. He considers himself "The #2", preferring to work as support with a partner due to his cowardice and caution. He also respects women, no matter how pretty, or how ugly, as seen with his ex, Nena. His Stand is Emperor, named after the Tarot Card of the same name. It manifests itself as a retro-futuristic pistol, which functions as a normal firearm, although the bullets are able to change their trajectory to Hol Horse''s command. ~!He is seemingly fatally injured by his own Stand''s bullets in Chapter 221 (and episode 37 of the anime), but manages to survive and go into hiding, fearing Dio''s punishment for failing his mission of killing the Joestar group.!~', '/uploads/images/c_16557.png'),
(75, 'Iggy', 'イギー', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 33.3 cm __Nationality:__ American Iggy is a boston terrier who wields a stand known as The Fool, which is able to manipulate sand. Since The Fool is made of sand, damaging it will not hurt Iggy. He creates various objects out of sand including the wings of a glider and a statue of DIO. Iggy is depicted as rude and disobedient, as shown by his tendency to chew on people’s hair while farting on them. He loves coffee-flavored gum. Iggy was previously owned by a rich man, but he ran away and became a stray in New York. Avdol caught him and brought him to Egypt to help the Joestar group defeat DIO. He frequently chews Polnareff’s hair and once put chewed gum inside Jotaro’s hat. ~!At first, Iggy seems indifferent towards the Joestar’s quest to defeat DIO. Then he accidentally finds DIO’s mansion and is attacked and injured by Pet Shop, causing his hatred for DIO to grow. He is killed after saving Polnareff from Vanilla Ice.!~ He was initially drawn as realistic dog, but as the story progressed, his face gradually became more similar to a human’s. He is named after Iggy Pop.', '/uploads/images/c_21089.jpg'),
(75, 'Suzie Q', 'スージーＱ', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 168 cm The female assistant to Lisa Lisa. Suzie Q is a slightly ditzy girl who worries for her friends. Evidently this carefree personality has not diminished even in the events of Stardust Crusaders, when she is shown enthusiastically recording her sightings in Japan on a camcorder when on a trip to see her daughter. ~!She is introduced as the female assistant to Lisa Lisa. When she first appears, she is taken over by the remains of Esidisi and attacks her friends. Thanks to a combination attack by Caesar and Joseph, she is saved with only minor injury. She marries Joseph in 1939.!~', '/uploads/images/c_21962.png'),
(75, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Tooru Ookawa', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(75, 'J. Geil', 'J・ガイル', '配角', 'Takuya Kirimoto', 'J. Geil is the man responsible for the murder of Polnareff''s sister, earning him Polnareff''s desire for revenge. J. Geil expend most of his time hiding from plain view, preferring to have a partner in which to rely on. This made him a perfect candidate for Hol Horse who like him believe working in pairs. He would hide in the shadows while Hol Horse broke the glass needed for his stand to work and sometimes they would do combination attack, such as Hal Horse breaking glass and J. Geil attacking while Hol Horse shot a bullet from his Stand, the Emperor, locking the enemy in a mortal circle. Like his mother he had a deformity that give him two right hands. (Source: JJBA Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_42159.jpg'),
(75, 'Enya Geil', 'エンヤ・ガイル', '配角', 'Reiko Suzuki', 'Enya Geil is one of Dio''s most loyal supporters, and the one who originally gave him the Stand Arrow, which she obtained from Diavolo. She is the mother of J. Geil. Her stand is Justice, which is able to control people through their wounds, whether alive or dead. For legal reasons, her name is changed in the American version of both the game and the manga, to N-Yah Gail and Enyaba Geil respectively. In the OVA: ~!She is able to change her appearance from that of a young woman to an old lady at will. No explanation as to why is ever given.!~', '/uploads/images/c_77359.jpg'),
(75, 'Rubber Soul', 'ラバーソール', '配角', 'Shinji Kawada', 'Rubber Soul is a medium-height curly haired man, with his Stand granting him the ability to grow larger and to change appearance at will. He was hired by Dio with the promise of earning 100 millions as a reward for killing Jotaro. Rubber Soul does, however, have a rather disturbing personality: he is extremely rude and impolite, showing no respect nor mercy for people and animals, as they are beings that he only sees as food for his Yellow Temperance. He does not seem to be particularly intelligent, though he has a really bad temper: he wanted to ambush Jotaro with Kakyoin''s appearance, but his unusual behavior blew his cover. Rubber Soul is also very violent: he attempts to kill a pickpocket by breaking his back, and remorselessly eats a dog under the eyes of its master with his Stand. In order to grow bigger, he did not hesitate to eat bugs either. From: http://jjba.wikia.com/wiki/Rubber_Soul', '/uploads/images/c_78409.png'),
(75, 'Boingo', 'ボインゴ', '配角', '', 'Boingo is a young Stand User whose Stand is Tohth. As part of the Egypt 9 Glory Gods, he attempts to assassinate the Joestar Group in Egypt alongside his older brother Oingo and later Hol Horse. Boingo is a young child of ordinary build, but his characteristics include an unusually large mouth and a large afro held together by a topless cap, leaving a few stray hair locks. His attire consists of a bright shirt and trousers over which he wears shorts and a jacket, plus a coat and simple shoes. Tohth is an Artificial Non-Humanoid Stand that takes the form of a manga. The book, titled, Oingo Boingo Brothers Adventure, will show predictions of the future. When an image appears, the prediction(s) then become fate and are destined to come to fruition. However, nobody, not even Boingo, can control the Image projected onto Tohth.', '/uploads/images/c_79703.jpg'),
(75, 'Nena', 'ネーナ', '配角', 'Satsuki Yukino', 'Nena is a minor antagonist appearing in Stardust Crusaders. She first appears in India alongside Hol Horse and tries to assassinate Joseph Joestar while passing as an ordinary woman. She is a Stand User who uses Empress. Nena first looks like a beautiful young Indian woman in typical Indian attire. However, this is only a disguise and Nena is truly a short, ugly and overweight woman wearing a bikini. Nena also possesses a bud on her tongue. Nena used her Stand Empress to kill a beautiful young woman and wore her skin to hide her true form. (Source: Jojo Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_129823.png'),
(75, 'Holly Kuujou', '空条ホリィ       ', '配角', 'Reiko Takagi', 'Holly Kuujou née Joestar is the daughter of [Joseph Joestar](https://anilist.co/character/6356/) and mother of [Joutarou Kuujou](https://anilist.co/character/4003/).', '/uploads/images/c_129824.png'),
(75, 'Forever', 'フォーエバー', '配角', 'Kappei Yamaguchi', 'Forever is a malicious orangutan in DIO''s service who confronts the group in the South China Sea aboard a freighter. Said ship happens to be possessed by Forever''s Stand: Strength.', '/uploads/images/c_130569.png'),
(75, 'Sherry Polnareff', 'シェリー・ポルナレフ', '配角', 'Yuka Komatsu', 'Sherry Polnareff is Jean Pierre Polnareff''s little sister who was raped and murdered by J. Geil, prompting Polnareff to seek revenge against her killer.', '/uploads/images/c_130570.png'),
(75, 'Anne', 'アン', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', 'Anne is a minor character appearing in Stardust Crusaders. Joining the Joestar Group before departing for Singapore, she somehow follows them from there to Pakistan and appears regularly alongside the main characters.', '/uploads/images/c_130571.png'),
(75, 'Gray Fly', 'グレー・フライ', '配角', 'Katsumi Chou', 'Gray Fly is an assassin sent by DIO who attacks the group aboard a plane traveling from Tokyo to Cairo, eventually crashing it into the ocean near Hong Kong. He is a Stand User and wields Tower of Gray.', '/uploads/images/c_130572.png'),
(75, 'Steely Dan', '鋼入りのスティーリーダン', '配角', 'Daisuke Kishio', 'Steely Dan is a Stand User using the microscopic Lovers. Steely Dan is sent to assassinate Enya the Hag and then confronts the Joestar Group in Pakistan.', '/uploads/images/c_130573.png'),
(75, 'Devo', 'デーボ', '配角', 'Shouto Kashii', 'Devo the Cursed is an infamous Native American shaman and assassin in DIO''s service. Devo ambushes Jean Pierre Polnareff in his hotel room in Singapore. He is a Stand User and uses Ebony Devil.', '/uploads/images/c_130574.png'),
(75, 'Cameo', 'カメオ', '配角', 'Kinryuu Arimoto', 'Cameo (カメオ Kameo) is a minor antagonist featured in Stardust Crusaders. He isolates Polnareff from the Joestar Group on a secluded island in the Red Sea while they are there to retrieve Avdol. Cameo is one of DIO''s henchmen, and the Stand User behind the genie Stand, Judgement.', '/uploads/images/c_130575.png'),
(75, 'Mannish Boy', 'マニッシュ・ボーイ', '配角', 'Ikue Ootani', 'Mannish Boy is an evil genius baby and Stand user in DIO''s service. He tries to murder the Joestar Group inside the nightmare-world of his Death Thirteen.', '/uploads/images/c_130576.png'),
(75, 'Arabia Fats', 'アラビア・ファッツ', '配角', 'Manabu Sakamaki', 'Arabia Fats is another of DIO''s goons, who ambushes the Joestar Group in the middle of the Arabian desert with his Stand: Sun.', '/uploads/images/c_130577.png'),
(75, 'Roses', 'ローゼス', '配角', 'Motomu Kiyokawa', 'Roses is the butler of Joseph Joestar and Suzi Q, also acting as the latter''s personal chauffeur and bodyguard.', '/uploads/images/c_130578.png'),
(75, 'ZZ', 'ズィー・ズィー', '配角', 'Masami Iwasaki', 'ZZ is another of DIO''s assassins who confronts the Joestar Group. He is a Stand User who drives his Wheel of Fortune.', '/uploads/images/c_130579.png'),
(75, 'Nise Captain Tennille', '偽キャプテン・テニール', '配角', 'Tesshou Genda', 'The impostor Captain Tennille is a minor antagonist appearing in Stardust Crusaders. He is an assassin sent by DIO who fights the Joestar Group in the middle of the ocean on their way to Egypt. He is a Stand User and wields Dark Blue Moon.', '/uploads/images/c_130580.png'),
(75, 'Midler', 'ミドラー', '配角', 'Aya Hisakawa', 'Midler is the last of DIO''s assassins the heroes encounter before entering Egypt. She is a Stand User, and her High Priestess attacks the group as they travel by submarine in the Red Sea.', '/uploads/images/c_130581.png'),
(75, 'Imushitsu no Sensei', '医務室の先生', '配角', 'Ayumi Tsunematsu', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_388258.png'),
(75, 'Kankoukyaku A', '観光客A', '配角', 'Ayaka Suwa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_389591.jpg'),
(75, 'Kankoukyaku B', '観光客B', '配角', 'Ai Kakuma', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_389592.jpg'),
(75, 'Keikan A', '警官A', '配角', 'Koutarou Nakamura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_389593.jpg'),
(75, 'Keikan B', '警官B', '配角', 'Eiji Miyashita', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_389594.jpg'),
(75, 'Senin A', '船員A', '配角', 'Shinobu Matsumoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_389595.jpg'),
(75, 'Senin B', '船員B', '配角', 'Takahiro Fujiwara', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_389596.jpg'),
(75, 'Senin C', '船員C', '配角', 'Yuuma Uchida', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_389597.jpg'),
(75, 'Tenshu', '店主', '配角', 'Takahiro Fujiwara', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_389598.jpg'),
(75, 'Suri', 'スリ', '配角', 'Kenji Yanagisawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_389599.jpg'),
(76, 'Yuuichirou Hyakuya', '百夜優一郎', '主角', 'Miyu Irino', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") Yuuichirou is a member of the Japanese Imperial Demon Army and Shinoa Hiragi''s squad in the Moon Demon Company. He, along with Mikaela Hyakuya, possesses the "Seraph" gene, which is relevant to the forbidden taboo and the focal point of the story, "Seraph of the End". Yuuichirou seems to be an excellent swordsman, as he was trained by Guren himself. He is also a "seraph of the end" with 1/10th of him being not human; he may have been experimented on by the Hyakuya, but this is unclear since the adults in charge of him were killed minutes after he arrived at the orphanage.', '/uploads/images/c_83015.jpg'),
(76, 'Shinoa Hiiragi', '柊シノア', '主角', 'Saori Hayami', '__Height:__ 150 cm (4''11") Shinoa Hiiragi is Guren''s sergeant and one of the squad leaders of the Moon Demon Company. She is appointed to supervise [Yuuichirou](https://anilist.co/character/83015/Hyakuya-Yuuichirou) during his suspension from the Japanese Imperial Demon Army for his reckless behavior. She is sarcastic and enjoys teasing others, especially Yuuichirou. Her Demon Weapon is Shikama Douji (Four-Scythe Child), a manifestation-type demon weapon which takes the form of a large scythe, but can be condensed into a pen-like object. She can call out the demon, which she fondly addresses as "Shi," inhabiting it out of the weapon to attack an enemy. Her primary ability is to detect anything that comes within the attack radius of her scythe. Despite being a member of the distinguished Hiiragi family, Shinoa is uninterested in their internal power struggle. Moreover, due to her sister''s legacy, she is generally shunned by the upper echelon of the army. However, she is loyal to Guren and to the members of her squad. A childhood lacking in familial warmth left Shinoa with little understanding of the importance of friendship and camaraderie. She is moved by Yuuichirou''s unwavering loyalty to the members of his squad, who he considers his family, and wants to foster the same feelings for them herself.', '/uploads/images/c_83017.jpg'),
(76, 'Mikaela Hyakuya', '百夜ミカエラ', '主角', 'Kenshou Ono', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") The deuteragonist of the Owari no Seraph series. He is an incomplete vampire and a servant of Third Progenitor [Krul Tepes](https://anilist.co/character/88899/Tepes-Krul). He was human until Krul Tepes forced him to drink her blood. He, along with [Yuuichirou Hyakuya](https://anilist.co/character/83015/Hyakuya-Yuuichirou), possesses the "Seraph" gene, which is relevant to the forbidden taboo and the focal point of the story, "Seraph of the End." He wields a red colored sword. When he orders it to drink his blood, it sprouts thorny vines that pierce his hand. His strength grows in proportion to the amount of his blood the sword drinks.', '/uploads/images/c_87287.jpg'),
(76, 'Ashuramaru', '阿朱羅丸', '配角', 'Hibiku Yamamura', 'The demon into the black series demon blade used by [Yuuchirou](https://anilist.co/character/83015/Hyakuya-Yuuichirou). It often warns Yuuchirou about how humans are dangerous and can''t be trusted.', '/uploads/images/c_88888.jpg'),
(76, 'Krul Tepes', 'クルル・ツェペシ', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', '__Height:__ 145 cm (4''9") Krul Tepes is a third progenitor among the vampires and the former vampire queen of Japan. Just like all other vampires, she views the humans as nothing more than livestock. She sees them as foul and endlessly greedy creatures who will do anything for their own personal gain. When [Ferid Bathory](https://anilist.co/character/88990/Bathory-Ferid) slaughters the Hyakuya Sect orphans she carefully hid in Sanguinem and protected as livestock, she becomes enraged because he fatally wounded one of the seraph and allowed another to escape. She never mentions a word about the orphans and displays no interest in them. She saves [Mika](https://anilist.co/character/87287/Hyakuya-Mikaela)''s life against his will by turning him into a vampire, but this appears to have been done for her own personal interests. He refuses to drink human blood, so she gives her blood to him in exchange for making him dependent on her. Even so, she is the only vampire who shows him kindness, and there are several moments when she hugs him or treats him gently. After developing a close bond with Mika, she shows concern for his family member, [Yuuichirou Hyakuya](https://anilist.co/character/83015/Hyakuya-Yuuichirou). She claims to like both Mika and Yu. However, it is uncertain if this is due to her close relation with Mika and concern for Mika''s sake or if this is because she wants to use the seraph for her own purposes. She also appears to trust Mika, and only she and Mika appear to', '/uploads/images/c_88899.jpg'),
(76, 'Shihou Kimizuki', '君月士方', '主角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''9") __Race__: Human Kimizuki is a serious and diligent person. He is competitive against Yuuichirou Hyakuya. He earned the highest test scores in their class, and he is angry when Yuuichirou appears out of nowhere and may earn Cursed Gear before him. He is hot-headed and tends to get in fights with both Mitsuba and Yuuichirou. He is tidy and skilled at cooking. When his friends are unconscious or injured, he is the first to take care of them, whether it be nursing them or giving them his jacket to keep them warm. Although the other members of his squad quickly refer to each other on a first-name basis, he is the only member the others address with his surname. Kimizuki has very high intelligence and was at the top of his class in all subjects, and regularly earned perfect scores. He earned 100s on each of his Latin, English, and Japanese spellcraft exams. He is on par with Yuichiro on skills of swordsmanship.', '/uploads/images/c_88912.jpg'),
(76, 'Yoichi Saotome', '早乙女与一', '主角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '__Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") __Race__: Human __Affiliation__: Japanese Imperial Demon Army __Section__: Moon Demon Squad __Demon Weapon Series__: Black Demon Series __Demon__: Gekkouin He is a member of the Japanese Imperial Demon Army and Shinoa Hīragi''s squad in the Moon Demon Company. Yoichi has an equilibrium of kindness and altruism, giving him an optimistic and sweet personality. This gives him a strong mental balance against his demon, who takes the form of his sister. He lacked passion to kill vampires and fight and avenge his sister originally, but as he got to know his new "family", he began to see the reason that he was there. Yoichi does dislike conflict amongst friends, but conflict on the battle field doesn''t bother him anymore. As time passed, Yoichi is shown to be much more confident with his skills, sniping down three Horsemen at ease by himself. Yoichi is usually the peace maker around Shinoa''s Squad. Yuichiro and Kimizuki are usually fighting, and Yoichi often ends up in the middle of it. He has developed a love for his "family" that impacted his personality greatly. He used to get very nervous and stutter a lot, but the closer he got to the Squad, the more confident he got. He doesn''t question his self-worth as much as before, and instead focuses more on protecting his new "family".', '/uploads/images/c_88988.jpg'),
(76, 'Ferid Bathory', 'フェリド・バートリー', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', 'He is a seventh progenitor among the vampires. He is the one who killed Yuuichirou''s family, thus fueling his desire for revenge against all vampires. On the outside, Ferid acts kind and polite. However, he keeps many secrets which he has ready to deploy, and tells equally as many lies, similarly to use as and when they are best served. Extremely sadistic, Ferid will go to lengths to prepare, and then carry about murderous acts on a whim. A sense of pleasure appears to be gained in patiently manipulating others in order to torment them. Preferring the blood of beautiful boys and girls, he has kept many mansions filled with them over the centuries. Once he loses interest in one to the point of forgetting the child''s name, Ferid kills him or her. Chatty, Ferid strikes up conversations with other vampires, and will speak calmly even in tense scenarios where he has the air of very much being in control of a situation.', '/uploads/images/c_88990.jpg'),
(76, 'Mito Juujou', '十条美十', '配角', 'Yuu Shimamura', 'She is a Colonel of the Japanese Imperial Demon Army and a member of [Guren](https://anilist.co/character/88993/Ichinose-Guren)''s squad in the Moon Demon Company. She is also the daughter of the prestigious Jujo family.', '/uploads/images/c_88991.jpg'),
(76, 'Shinya Hiiragi', '柊深夜', '配角', 'Tatsuhisa Suzuki', '__Height:__ 183 cm (6''0") __Race:__ Human __Affiliation:__ Japanese Imperial Demon Army __Section:__ Moon Demon Squad __Demon Weapon Series:__ Black Demon Series __Demon:__ Byakomaru A Major General of the Japanese Imperial Demon Army. Although he has a high capacity for spellcraft since childhood, Shinya is not comfortable with being with the Hiiragi Family. Shinya is shown to be a gentle and cool man. He does not get angry easily, even when being insulted by [Seishirou](https://anilist.co/character/89785/Hiiragi-Seishirou). He is seen smiling pleasantly all the time, even in tough spots. He has a lighthearted and breezy personality. Shinya is shown to be very loyal to his friends, such as [Guren](https://anilist.co/character/88993/Ichinose-Guren). He is also very observant and perceptive, and easily grasps Guren''s emotions.', '/uploads/images/c_88992.jpg'),
(76, 'Guren Ichinose', '一瀬グレン', '主角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Height:__ 183 cm (6''0") __Race:__ Human __Section:__ Moon Demon Squad __Demon Weapon Series:__ Black Demon __Demon:__ Mahiru-no Yo He is a Lieutenant Colonel of the Japanese Imperial Demon Army and the commanding officer of the Vampire Extermination Unit, Moon Demon Company. Guren would become a wise leader who values teamwork, co-operation and friends, and determined those were necessary to ensure the survival of the human race from demons and vampires. Sometimes pretending to be lazy, in truth, he really works hard. He keeps many secrets to himself, and has no difficulty lying about them. When enduring hardships in battle, he will focus on winning and take the most direct path to that.', '/uploads/images/c_88993.jpg'),
(76, 'Seishirou Hiiragi', '柊征志郎', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', 'Seishiro Hiiragi is a Major General of the Japanese Imperial Demon Army.', '/uploads/images/c_89785.jpg'),
(76, 'Tenri Hiiragi', '柊 天利', '配角', 'Keiji Fujiwara', 'Tenri Hiiragi is the general of the Japanese Imperial Demon Army. (Source: MAL)', '/uploads/images/c_89786.jpg'),
(76, 'Crowley Eusford', 'クローリー・ユースフォード', '配角', 'Kenichi Suzumura', 'Crowley is a Thirteenth Progenitor among vampires and a member of Seventh Progenitor Ferid Bathory''s faction. However, he hides his strength under Ferid''s orders and is actually equal in strength to a Seventh Progenitor. Crowley is calm and brave which makes him a patient vampire who enjoys fighting any opponent. Even when he is in a tight spot, he remains calm with a pleasant smile. Despite sticking to Ferid, he appears to be emotionally detached from him, such as throwing the latter out of the bus as "revenge". Crowley also appears to be quite unimpressed with Ferid half of the time, calling his antics "stupid" and even sympathizing for the children getting dragged into the mess that Ferid created. He also doesn''t appear to trust Ferid and is not afraid to be blunt to him for it.', '/uploads/images/c_90238.png'),
(76, 'Kureto Hiiragi', '柊暮人', '配角', 'Tomoaki Maeno', '__Race:__ Human __Height:__ 187 cm (6''1") __Section:__ Shibuya Main Army __Demon Weapon Series:__ Black Demon __Demon:__ Raimeiki He is the Lieutenant General of the Japanese Imperial Demon Army. His goal is to exterminate all the vampires in Japan and find the person who is manipulating the Hīragi family. He and Mahiru were in competition to be the next head of the Hīragi family. He was the student council president of First Shibuya High. He maintained his position as top of his class since first entering the school. He mentions to [Guren](https://anilist.co/character/88993/Ichinose-Guren) that his decisions hold more weight at the school than the principal''s. ~!He later becomes​ the head of the Hīragi Family as well as the Japanese Imperial Demon Army, by killing his own father.!~', '/uploads/images/c_135241.png'),
(76, 'Norito  Goshi', '五士典人', '配角', 'Daisuke Ono', '__Race:__ Human __Height:__ 185 cm (6''1") __Affiliation:__ Order of the Imperial Demons, Japanese Imperial Demon Army __Section:__ Moon Demon Company, Guren Squad __Rank:__ Colonel Colonel in the Japanese Imperial Demon Army.', '/uploads/images/c_135248.jpg'),
(76, 'Sayuri  Hanayori', '花依小百合', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', '__Race:__ Human __Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") (Catastrophe), 165 cm (5''5") (Vampire Reign) __Affiliation:__ Order of the Imperial Moon, Japanese Imperial Demon Army, [Guren Ichinose](https://anilist.co/character/88993/Ichinose-Guren)''s Aides __Section:__ Moon Demon Company, Guren Squad __Rank:__ Second Lieutenant She is a second lieutenant of the Japanese Imperial Demon Army and a member of Guren''s squad in the Moon Demon Company. While serving as a member of the Moon Demon Company, she is also an Army instructor for the training classes. Sayuri belongs to a retainer house that serves the Ichinoses. Sayuri is shown to be quite perceptive at times, observing how [Yuu](https://anilist.co/character/83015/Hyakuya-Yuuichirou) and his friends are much stronger than she is, when she was 16. ~!She had a crush on Guren and was his emotional support.!~', '/uploads/images/c_135249.jpg'),
(76, 'Mitsuba Sanguu', '三宮三葉', '主角', 'Yuka Iguchi', '__Birthday:__ July 7, 2004 __Height:__ 155 cm (5''1") __Race:__ Human __Affiliation:__ Japanese Imperial Demon Army __Section:__ Moon Demon Squad __Demon Weapon Series:__ Dakini __Demon:__ Tenjiryū A member of the Japanese Imperial Demon Army and a member of [Yuu](https://anilist.co/character/83015/Hyakuya-Yuuichirou)''s team of the Moon Demon Squad. She also the younger sister of Aoi Sanguu. Mitsuba is shown to be a serious and by-the-book soldier, who dislikes those who break the formation and commit to individual action. In reality, she is a talkative, selfish girl. Despite this, she gets jealous easily. Mitsuba appears to be the most talkative girl in her group.', '/uploads/images/c_135250.jpg'),
(76, 'Shigure Yukimi', '雪見時雨', '配角', 'Yui Ishikawa', '__Race:__ Human __Height:__ 150 cm (4''11") (Catastrophe) 151 cm (4''11½") (Vampire Reign) __Affiliation:__ Order of the Imperial Moon, Japanese Imperial Demon Army, [Guren Ichinose](https://anilist.co/character/88993/Ichinose-Guren)''s Aides __Section:__ Moon Demon Company, Guren Squad __Rank:__ Second Lieutenant She is a second lieutenant of the Japanese Imperial Demon Army and a member of Guren''s squad in the Moon Demon Company. Like [Sayuri Hanayori](https://anilist.co/character/135249/Hanayori-Sayuri), Shigure is also a servant for the Ichinose Family. ~!Similar to Sayuri, she''s very protective of Guren, and does not hesitate to carry out his orders. Like Sayuri, she also has a crush on Guren, but does not show it often.!~', '/uploads/images/c_135251.jpg'),
(76, 'Horn  Skuld', 'ホーン・スクルド', '配角', 'Youko Hikasa', 'Horn Skuld is a vampire noble who serves Thirteenth Progenitor Crowley Eusford. She is fond of both him and her partner, Seventeenth Progenitor Chess Belle, and she can usually be found in their company.', '/uploads/images/c_135255.jpg'),
(76, 'Akane  Hyakuya', '百夜 茜', '配角', 'You Taichi', 'One of the orphans from Hyakuya Orphanage along with Yuuichirou and Mika. Being the eldest in their group, she did the motherly duties for them, such as preparing food. ~!She had a crush on Mikaela Hyakuya.!~ ~!Ferid Bathory hunts down Mika and Yu. When they agree to surrender, he pulls out Akane''s head from the trunk of his fancy western car and tells Yu to say that to her face. Once Yu''s demon side takes control, he tosses her head to Yoichi Saotome. After subduing Yu, he tells Mika that he has come to show them how to return Akane to life. He says the name of this experiment is the Seraph of the End.!~', '/uploads/images/c_135256.png'),
(76, 'Chess  Belle', 'チェス・ベル', '配角', 'Nozomi Furuki', 'Race: Human (Formerly), Vampire (Currently)Born: April 1st Height: 151 cm (4''11½") Affiliation: Vampires Section: Ferid Bathory''s Faction, Japan Occupation: Crowley Eusford''s Aide Rank: 17th Progenitor Status: Alive Chess Belle is a seventeenth progenitor vampire who serves Thirteenth Progenitor Crowley Eusford. Even though she is a noble, her personality is freewheeling gets jealous easily and behavior is very careless. Chess is a very short girl with an hourglass figure and very large breasts. She has chin-length iris-colored hair and bangs that frame her face. Like all vampires, she has red eyes, fangs, and pointed ears. She also has visible lower lashes. She wears a headband that matches Horn''s. She also wears a matching black collar and a white cape that reaches past her buttocks. Like Horn, she wears an attire with a low cut that reveals her cleavage. She wears a black and white dress with detached black sleeves. A blue bow decorates the front of her bodice, and the black of the dress emphasizes her breasts and hips as it trails down to the front of her skirts. She has a large bow at her tailbone in the back of her dress. Two white skirts layer over each other and reach down to her knees. She wears black stockings that reach right above her She is immature, careless, playful, and childish, which foils the more serious and mature behavior of her partner, Horn. She is very fond of both Crowley and Horn, and she can usually be found in their company. She gets jealous easil', '/uploads/images/c_135257.jpg'),
(76, 'René Simm', 'レーネ・シム', '配角', 'Yuuichirou Umehara', 'René Simm is a vampire who often works with Lacus Welt and Mikaela Hyakuya as a city guard. He is tasked with gathering surviving humans to provide a food source for vampires. Thinking objectively in situations, René keeps a clear head in precarious situations. He does not approve of Mika''s behavior in battle and thought he destroyed a Four Horseman of John by himself to gain glory.', '/uploads/images/c_209534.jpg'),
(76, 'Lacus Welt', 'ラクス・ウェルト', '配角', 'Takuma Nagatsuka', 'Lacus Welt is a vampire in Japan who often works with René Simm and Mikaela Hyakuya.', '/uploads/images/c_209535.png'),
(77, 'Momonga', 'モモンガ', '主角', 'Satoshi Hino', 'He is the guild master of Ainz Ooal Gown and regarded as the highest of the Almighty 41 Supreme Beings by the NPCs of the Great Tomb of Nazarick. He is also the creator of [Pandora''s Actor](https://anilist.co/character/89154/Pandoras-Actor). A cautious and stingy person, Momonga always tries to plan and control details, avoiding any haphazard actions. Because he doesn''t underestimate his opponents, he will usually overkill them. Since being transferred to a new world and becoming an actual Undead being, Momonga could feel himself becoming very cold and calculating, his emotions repressed. Loyal to his friends and creations, since becoming Lord ruler of Nazarick in the new world he acts with a certain degree of nobility for his devoted followers. Momonga only does things that will benefit Nazarick or himself, whether its information or prestige. Although he does have a sense of justice and doesn''t hate humans as much as his followers, he holds no attachment to them, and he feels nothing toward their deaths. ~!His real name is Satoru Suzuki.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89103.png'),
(77, 'Shalltear Bloodfallen', 'シャルティア・ブラッドフォールン', '配角', 'Sumire Uesaka', 'The Guardian of the First, Second, and Third floors of Nazarick, she has the form of a beautiful vampire girl. She''s also in love with [Momonga](https://anilist.co/character/89103). She and [Albedo](https://anilist.co/character/89122) constantly clash for his attention. While the two don''t mind sharing Momonga, they still fight for superiority and who would ultimately appeal to Momonga. Shalltear is one of the most powerful guardians, allegedly capable of going toe-to-toe with Albedo. ~!Due to an incident where she is subjected to mind control by a member of the Black Scripture, she ends up unintentionally rebelling against Nazarick.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89121.png'),
(77, 'Albedo', 'アルベド', '配角', 'Yumi Hara', 'The overseer of the Floor Guardians and one of the most powerful NPC in Nazarick. She takes the form of a beautiful woman with fallen angel wings and horns. Because [Ainz](https://anilist.co/character/89103) modified her settings on a whim, she ends up madly in love with him. Albedo''s romantic obsessions are so strong that if Ainz were to even glance at her body, she would immediately become excited. Albedo''s obsession with Ainz has led him to greatly regret his actions. While she tries to act calm, as befitting of her role, any perceived insult against Ainz or Nazarick, real or imagined, sends her into a rage. Like most inhabitants of Nazarick, she despises humans which she refers to as "lower life-forms." ~!Though the reason is not yet known, Albedo holds a strong hatred towards all of the 41 Supreme Beings except for Ainz. It is hinted that she is scheming to annihilate all the other guild members if they are found.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89122.png'),
(77, 'Solution Epsilon', 'ソリュシャン・イプシロン', '配角', 'Ayane Sakura', 'One of the Pleiades. She''s a slime and one of the most dangerous Pleiades to humans, since she enjoys devouring humans alive. An assassin and poisoner who can decide to protect or dissolve things she absorbs, she can also control the speed of her digestion. She gets along with [Shalltear](https://anilist.co/character/89121) because of their similar tastes', '/uploads/images/c_89123.png'),
(77, 'Demiurge', 'デミウルゴス', '配角', 'Masayuki Katou', 'The Guardian of the Seventh floor of Nazarick, with the form of a demon wearing glasses. Demiurge is very intelligent, but is also considered the most evil NPC on Nazarick. He greatly enjoys the suffering of others, made clear by his vicious experiments on prisoners. He''s in charge of tactics and defenses of Nazarick. Among the Guardians, he gets along the best with [Mare](https://anilist.co/character/89126/Bello-Fiore-Mare), since he understands the more cunning side of the Dark Elf.', '/uploads/images/c_89125.png'),
(77, 'Mare Bello Fiore', 'マーレ・ベロ・フィオーレ', '配角', 'Yumi Uchiyama', 'One of the Guardians of the Sixth floor of Nazarick alongside his twin sister [Aura](https://anilist.co/character/89129). He''s rather shy and calm in comparison to his sister, although he can fight and be ruthless when necessary. Like his sister, Mare is a Dark Elf. Mare specializes in Druid magic, capable of twisting the earth to his whims.', '/uploads/images/c_89126.png'),
(77, 'Aura Bella Fiora', 'アウラ・ベラ・フィオーラ', '配角', 'Emiri Katou', 'One of the Guardians of the Sixth floor of Nazarick, alongside her twin brother [Mare](https://anilist.co/character/89126). She''s very energetic and extroverted, in contrast with her brother. Aura is a 70-year-old Dark Elf. Despite constantly fighting, she and Shalltear are quite close. Aura specializes in beast-taming and fights with a long, bladed whip.', '/uploads/images/c_89129.png'),
(77, 'Cocytus', 'コキュートス', '配角', 'Kenta Miyake', 'Cocytus is the guardian of the Fifth floor of Nazarick. An insectoid heteromorph, he was created by Warrior Takemikazuchi to be an honourable warrior and is tasked with keeping a cache of powerful weapons for Nazarick. He has a neutral alignment, which stands out against the many evil entities in Nazarick. An extremely skilled fighter, Cocytus is an expert at selecting the right combination of weapons for the fight, and dealing huge amounts of damage quickly. With the help of his extra arms, he is capable of wielding four of his twenty-one weapons at once, allowing him to deal the highest damage per second of any floor guardian.', '/uploads/images/c_89138.png'),
(77, 'Narberal Gamma', 'ナーベラル・ガンマ', '配角', 'Manami Numakura', 'One of the Pleiades, combat maids of the Tenth floor under [Sebas Tian](https://anilist.co/character/89155). She''s a Doppelgänger and, because she''s one of the most human-looking of the maids, she is [Momonga](https://anilist.co/character/89103)''s companion in his exploration of the new world disguised as adventurers. Narberal takes great pride in this duty, often "wearing" it like a badge of honor. However, like most in Nazarick, she holds great disdain towards humans. This proves troublesome, as she becomes incredibly violent when human males make advances on her. While operating as a member of the adventuring guild, "Darkness", Narberal operates under the alias of "Nabe", which becomes "Nabe, the Beautiful Lady" when Darkness becomes famous. Narberal''s beauty has been compared to that of the "Golden Princess of Re-Estize" by many of the country''s inhabitants.', '/uploads/images/c_89152.png'),
(77, 'Pandora''s Actor', 'パンドラズ・アクタ', '配角', 'Mamoru Miyano', '__Height:__ 177cm __Race:__ Doppelgänger __Affiliation:__ Great Tomb of Nazarick __Occupation:__ Area Guardian of the Treasury __Creator:__ Ainz Ooal Gown (Momonga) __Hobby:__ Managing Magic Items The Area Guardian in charge of the Treasury and finances of Nazarick, who was created by Ains himself. He''s a Doppelgänger whose face is a simple egghead with three holes dressed in a Neo-Nazi-esque uniform. In Momonga''s original design, he''s the combination of everything that he thought was cool, with exaggerated gestures and body language. His existence embarrasses Ains, but at the same time knows he''s the NPC he can trust the most and the only one who can perform all his master''s tasks without misunderstanding his intentions. He''s on the same level as the Floor Guardians, and can copy the appearance and skills of anyone he has seen.', '/uploads/images/c_89154.jpg'),
(77, 'Sebas Tian', 'セバス・チャン', '配角', 'Shigeru Chiba', 'The butler of the Tenth floor of Nazarick, who specializes in unarmed combat, with power comparable with the other Floor Guardians. He has the appearance of an elderly gentleman with a neat beard, but is actually of a species known as Dragonoids. He has a strong sense of justice, like his creator. Thus, he dislikes when the other Guardians kill humans needlessly. Because of their opposite personalities, he and [Demiurge](https://anilist.co/character/89125/Demiurge) don''t get along.', '/uploads/images/c_89155.png'),
(77, 'Entoma Vasilissa Zeta', 'エントマ・ヴァシリッサ・ゼータ', '配角', 'Kei Shindou', 'One of the members of the battle maids originally created by Genjiro. ~!She has the appearance of a normal girl but her true form is that of an arachanid hybrid. She has bug mask to cover her real face. She uses a leech that recreates human voices after it kills them to disguise her original voice. She has insect focused abilities and uses talismans.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126281.jpg'),
(77, 'Shizu Delta', 'シズ・デルタ', '配角', 'Asami Seto', 'One of the members of the battle maids originally created by someone except for Tabula Smaragdina. CZ2I28 Delta is an automaton battle maid and member of the "Pleiades Six Stars," the battle maid squad of the Great Tomb of Nazarick. CZ2128 appears emotionless and has a silent nature. Her Karma is relatively high, which makes her, along with Yuri Alpha, one of the two "safe" Pleiades to humans. Though she usually ignores conversations from humans, sometimes there is a possibility to communicate with her. She hates cannibalism and likes cute things, such as Eclair.', '/uploads/images/c_126841.jpg'),
(77, 'Gazef Stronoff', 'ガゼフ・ストロノーフ', '配角', 'Hiroshi Shirokuma', '__Race:__ Human __Affiliation:__ Re-Estize Kingdom __Occupation:__ Warrior Captain Gazeff Stronoff is the Warrior Captain of the Re-Estize Kingdom and King Ramposa III''s personal bodyguard, and professes his utmost loyalty to him. Incredibly talented with the sword and well-versed in martial arts, he is famously considered the strongest warrior in the entire kingdom, and commands the respect and admiration of everyone who knows his name. Due to internal power struggles among the nobles in the kingdom, Gazeff is not knighted, so the King granted him the title of "Warrior Captain", which allows him to command his own unit comprised of "Warrior Troops". Born a commoner in a frontier village, he later became a mercenary. During his travels, he encountered a former adamantite-ranked adventurer who taught him his extraordinary swordsmanship. He participated in the grand tournament and defeated Brain Unglaus, becoming the champion and earning the King''s trust.', '/uploads/images/c_126869.png'),
(77, 'Lupusregina Beta', 'ルプスレギナ・ベータ', '配角', 'Mikako Komatsu', 'A member of the "Pleiades Six Stars", the battle maid squad of the Great Tomb of Nazarick. She serves as the role of battle cleric and focuses on healing magic. In terms of combat ability, she possesses the highest physical defense and resistances among the Pleiades, and has balanced stats overall. Being a werewolf, she is weak to silver weapons, but is blessed with resistance against other metals. Her appearance is that of a brown-skinned beauty with amber-colored eyes, and red hair which she ties in two long braids. She wears a maid uniform with short sleeves and long black gloves, white stockings, and a skirt that has a long slit on its left side. She is usually seen carrying her signature weapon slung across her back, a menacing black and silver scepter which looks like and oversized religious symbol, the Crosier. Lupusregina boasts a very sociable and outgoing personality, and seems very friendly, even towards humans, a race considered unworthy of respect by other beings of Nazarick. For example, she adds "-chan" to the other maid''s names, and often likes teasing [Enri](https://anilist.co/character/128405) with lewd jokes. The Homunculus Maids (the ordinary maids of Nazarick) are convinced she''s the friendliest of the Pleiades and even believe that being approached by her can be a sign of good fortune. However, her fellow battle-maid [Yuri Alpha](https://anilist.co/character/128288) has commented that Lupusregina''s friendliness is merely a facade, and that in reality she', '/uploads/images/c_126870.jpg'),
(77, 'Touch Me', 'たっち・みー', '配角', 'Ryoutarou Okiayu', 'Touch Me is one of the original founding members of the Ainz Ooal Gown guild and one of the strongest warriors in YGGDRASIL. He is regarded as one of the Forty-One Supreme Beings by the NPCs of the Great Tomb of Nazarick. He is the creator of Sebas Tian. At some point in YGGDRASIL, Touch Me participated in an official martial tournament and defeated all of his adversaries. By winning the tournament, he was awarded a special prize that comes in two. Firstly, he was given a special job class known as the "World Champion" of Álfheimr, and in addition he was awarded with the pure white armor set called "Compliance with Law." Touch Me''s outfit consists of shining white armor and a helm. His chest piece contains a huge sapphire embedded in the middle, which radiates with pure and divine light. He is also adorned with a reddish cape attached around his right shoulder. Additionally, he is armed with both sword and shield. Touch Me''s actual facial appearance in real life is said to look exactly like Sebas Tian. As Touch Me played YGGDRASIL, he decided to assist the heteromorphic players during a time when they were being hunted down for fun through PKing. Thus, that was how he met Momonga, by saving him from a PK party; the two started becoming friends since then. There was also a time when Bukubukuchagama could not find a party to adventure with due to her appearance, so he was the one who approached her before anyone else. Afterwards, they formed a party together with other non-huma', '/uploads/images/c_127437.jpg'),
(77, 'Brain Unglaus', 'ブレイン・アングラウス', '配角', 'Kouji Yusa', 'Brain is a warrior turned mercenary after he lost to Gazef Stronoff in a grand tournament to determine the strongest fighter in Re-Estize Kingdom. He has brown eyes with blue hair and the appearance of a wild beast. He is equipped with a chainmail and wears a necklace and ring which are infused with protection magic. His whole body is lean and his muscles are tough as steel and tempered through experience. Originally a farmer, he was gifted with what could only be described as a God-given talent in the mastery of the sword. He has always believed himself to be the strongest fighter inside the Kingdom, having never lost a fight before he entered the grand tournament to decide the King''s guard captain. He easily fought his way to the final where he faced off against Gazef Stronoff. A grand and close battle ensued between the two, but eventually,​ he would taste his first defeat at the hand of Gazef. His fame was shattered and his confidence as an unbeatable warrior took a hit. He then decided to do everything he could to become stronger, so he would truly become unbeatable. At the same time, in order to make a living he started working as a mercenary for the Death Spreading Brigade. ~!When first introduced he is very arrogant, thinking that he is the most powerful, even though he earlier lost to Gazef. While a mercenary, he suffered a devastating defeat at the hand of Shalltear Bloodfallen when she attacked the hideout of the Death Spreading Brigade. After that, his personality', '/uploads/images/c_128263.png'),
(77, 'Yuri Alpha', 'アルファユリ', '配角', 'Hiromi Igarashi', 'The Vice-Captain, but de facto leader of the Pleiades. She is a Dullahan who uses a choker to keep her head attached to the rest of her body, causing her to appear to be human. She specializes in unarmed combat and uses Gauntlets in battle. She is programmed to behave like a teacher, because her creator was one, and the other Pleiades look up to her like a big sister. Like Sebas, she holds a primarily neutral stance towards outsiders, but unlike him, her sense of justice is not so strong that she''d help people like him. (Source: Wikipedia)', '/uploads/images/c_128288.jpg'),
(77, 'Clementine', 'クレマンティーヌ', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', '__Race:__ Human __Affiliation:__ - Slane Theocracy (Former) - Black Scripture (Former) - Zurrernorn __Family:__ Quaiesse Hazeia Quintia (Brother) __Occupation:__ Warrior Clementine was a sadistic psychopath, obsessed with inflicting pain and torture on others. As a former member of the Black Scripture, Clementine was extremely confident in her abilities. She would go so far as to declare herself unbeatable until her unfortunate encounter with Ainz, who proved to be much more powerful than her. Before Clementine went rogue, she once held the position of 9th Seat in the Black Scripture. Besides betraying the Scripture, she also stole the magical Crown of Wisdom from one of the Six Miko Princesses of the Theocracy. Because of that, she has chosen to flee from her homeland and join Zurrernorn for protection.', '/uploads/images/c_128401.jpg'),
(77, 'Nemu Emmot', 'ネム・エモット', '配角', 'Marika Kouno', 'Race: Human Affiliation: Sorcerer Kingdom Re-Estize Kingdom (Formerly) Family: Enri Emmot (Older Sister) Nfirea Bareare (Brother-In-Law) Occupation: Villager Residence: Carne Village Nemu has a childish and naive personality, but it seems that she may actually know more than her older sister. She used to be more bold and rebel, but after the attack to her village and the death of her parents she try to be more useful and obedient to help Enri. However, it seems that her boldness comes back when she gets emotional, like the time that she visited Nazarick', '/uploads/images/c_128402.jpg'),
(77, 'Lizzie Bareare', 'リィジー・バレアレ', '配角', 'Ikuko Tani', 'Race: Human Affiliation: Sorcerer Kingdom Re-Estize Kingdom (Formerly) Family: Nfirea Bareare (Grandson) Occupation: Herbalist Potion Maker Residence E-Rantel (Formerly) Carne Village (Currently) is a pharmacist who used to operate in E-Rantel and the grandmother of Nfirea Bareare. When Nfirea was kidnapped by Zurrernorn, she made a deal with Ainz to rescue him in return for her services. Afterwards, she moved to Carne Village. Though a seemingly old woman, Lizzie Bareare is still quite sharp for her age. Highly knowledgeable about the make-up, properties and lore of potions. She also has a demanding and fastidious personality. Her intense gaze gives other people the shivers. Renown throughout the city of E-Rantel, Lizzie Bareare holds the title as the city''s best pharmacist.', '/uploads/images/c_128403.jpg'),
(77, 'Nfirea Bareare', 'ンフィーレア・バレアレ', '配角', 'Ayumu Murase', '__Race:__ Human __Affiliation:__ Sorcerer Kingdom, Re-Estize Kingdom (Formerly) __Family:__ Lizzie Bareare (Grandmother), Enri Emmot (Wife), Nemu Emmot (Sister-In-Law) __Occupation:__ Herbalist, Potion Maker __Residence:__ E-Rantel (Formerly), Carne Village (Currently) __Birthday:__ Middle Wind Month 18th Day __Hobby:__ Alchemical Experiments. Nfirea is described as a nice, calm and timid person. He works hard at making potions with his grandmother every day. He also has a minor inferiority complex, due to comparing himself to Ainz. At a young age, Nfirea Bareare was raised by his grandmother Lizzie Bareare after his parents died; he only has murky impressions of them. His grandmother made him her apprentice and taught him everything she knew about herbs, alchemy, and potion-making. He met Enri Emmot while delivering potions to Carne Village and developed feelings for her.', '/uploads/images/c_128404.jpg'),
(77, 'Enri Emmot', 'エンリ・エモット', '配角', 'Mao Ichimichi', 'Race: Human Race Affiliation Sorcerer Kingdom Re-Estize Kingdom (Formerly) is the Chieftain of Carne Village and the older sister of Nemu Emmot. Raised by a loving family, Enri has grown up to be a kind person, but has shown to have a strong character. As seen when she is willing to sacrifice herself for the sake of her little sister''s life. She shows great leadership, being the new village head and defending the town from monsters with the other villagers. Growing up in Carne Village and living there all her life, Enri has always lived the life of a simple farmer''s daughter. Due to her healthy lifestyle, Enri has grown to be physically fit to the point where she is considered as one of the strongest five in the village.', '/uploads/images/c_128405.jpg'),
(77, 'Hamusuke', 'ハムスケ', '配角', 'Akeno Watanabe', 'Hamsuke resembles a giant Djungarian hamster with a long snake tail. Six sigils dot her silvery fur. Before being inducted in the Great Tomb of Nazarick, Hamusuke was very boastful and prideful of her ability and power as the "Virtuous King of the Forest." However, since meeting [Momonga](https://anilist.co/character/89103) and witnessing the power of the denizens of Nazarick, she has seen how vastly inferior she is. She accepts this and swears loyalty to Momonga, willing to do anything to please his master and earn his keep.', '/uploads/images/c_128569.jpg'),
(77, 'Nigun Grid Luin', 'ニグン・グリッド・ルーイン', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', 'Nigun Grid Luin (ニグン・グリッド・ルーイン) was the captain of the Sunlight Scripture of the Slane Theocracy. He was ordered by the Cardinals to assassinate the Re-Estize Kingdom''s strongest warrior, Gazef Stronoff.', '/uploads/images/c_141731.jpg'),
(77, 'Brita', 'ブリタ', '配角', 'Satsuki Yukino', 'Brita (ブリタ) is the leader of the Vigilance Committee of Carne Village and a former iron ranked adventurer whose hard-earned healing potion was broken by Momon but was compensated with a new but unknown one which fortunately saved her life.', '/uploads/images/c_175036.png'),
(77, 'Dyne Woodwonder', 'ダイン・ウッドワンダー', '配角', 'Ryouta Takeuchi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_175037.png'),
(77, 'Moknach', 'モックナック', '配角', 'Tooru Sakurai', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_175038.png'),
(77, 'Belius', 'ベリュース', '配角', 'Hironori Saitou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_175039.png'),
(77, 'Bellote', 'ベロテ', '配角', 'Koutarou Nishiyama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_175040.png'),
(77, 'Zach', 'ザック', '配角', 'Kentarou Tone', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_175041.png'),
(77, 'Pluton Ainzach', 'プルトン・アインザック', '配角', 'Kanehira Yamamoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_175042.png'),
(77, 'Igvarge', 'イグヴァルジ', '配角', 'Shinya Hamazoe', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_175043.png'),
(77, 'Londres Di Clamp', 'ロンデス・ディ・クランプ', '配角', 'Yoshihito Sasaki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_175044.png'),
(77, 'Herohero', 'ヘロヘロ', '配角', 'Junji Majima', 'Herohero (ヘロヘロ) is a guild member of Ainz Ooal Gown and regarded as one of the Forty-One Supreme Beings by the NPCs of the Great Tomb of Nazarick. He is the creator of Solution Epsilon and one of the creators of the Homunculus Maids groups that work in Nazarick.', '/uploads/images/c_189116.png'),
(78, 'Ken Kaneki', '金木研', '主角', 'Natsuki Hanae', '__Height:__ 169 cm (5''6") Ken Kaneki was originally a human and a normal college student until he encountered a female ghoul named [Rize](https://anilist.co/character/88413/Rize-Kamishiro) who was posing as a human at the time. Rize, using Kaneki''s crush on her as leverage, managed to lure him into an alley and tried to eat him but ended up dying when construction beams fell on top of her. Kaneki, already in a half-dead state from Rize''s attempts at killing him, ends up in a hospital and has some of Rize''s organs transplanted into his body. This results in him absorbing some of Rize''s powers and characteristics, such as a ghoul eye, powers of regeneration, and the inability to stomach human food. Terrified and lost, Kaneki''s life takes a dramatic turn from then on as he tries to find a place for himself in the world, realizing he now belongs to neither the human nor ghoul world and refusing to eat humans to sustain himself. Meeting some of the ​other ghouls, as well as humans, makes him realize that things aren''t just black and white and that there are more to ghouls and humans than originally thought.', '/uploads/images/c_87275.png'),
(78, 'Touka Kirishima', '霧嶋董香', '主角', 'Sora Amamiya', '__Height:__ 156 cm (5''1") Touka is a ghoul successfully posing as a human and working as a waitress at a cafe which serves as a gathering place for other ghouls, as well as a food resource. She saves [Kaneki](https://anilist.co/character/87275/Kaneki-Ken)''s life at one point and acts as a reluctant guide to him and his adaptation to the ghoul society. She doesn''t like Kaneki much and has no qualms about expressing her dislike for him. She is very serious, tough and hard-working, trying to keep their district as safe for ghouls and humans as possible. Her powers and strength are also quite great and she makes for a formidable opponent.', '/uploads/images/c_87277.png'),
(78, 'Hinami Fueguchi', '笛口雛実', '配角', 'Sumire Morohoshi', '__Height:__ 148 cm - 152 cm (4''10" - 4''11") Hinami is a child ghoul whose parents were killed by ghoul investigators. Before, she and her mother seek help from the owner of the Antique Cafe to acquire food. Hinami is initially quite shy, but when she opens up, she is cheerful and earnest. [Ken](https://anilist.co/character/87275/Kaneki-Ken) helps her learn kanji, as she cannot attend school, and is very eager to learn. Currently, she is living together with [Touka Kirishima](https://anilist.co/character/87277/Kirishima-Touka).', '/uploads/images/c_88293.png'),
(78, 'Koutarou Amon', '亜門鋼太朗', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', '__Height:__ 191 cm (6''3") A first class police investigator who investigates Ghouls, also known as a Dove. He comes to the 20th ward with his mentor, [Mado Kureo](https://anilist.co/character/88423), to investigate Ghoul incidents in the area. He has a strong sense of justice, fervently believing it is the right and moral thing to do to exterminate the Ghouls. He hunts the Ghouls in order to prevent more human children from becoming orphaned like himself, and he often works after hours to achieve his goals. He wields a "Quinque" (a weapon made from the "Kagune" of a Ghoul) that has the appearance of a pole-arm with a large cylindrical bludgeon at the end.', '/uploads/images/c_88407.png'),
(78, 'Yukinori Shinohara', '篠原幸紀', '配角', 'Yutaka Nakano', 'A Special Class Ghoul Investigator. In the past, he acted as Koutarou Amon''s instructor at the Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_88408.png'),
(78, 'Nishiki Nishio', '西尾錦', '配角', 'Shintarou Asanuma', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''9") Nishiki Nishio is a ghoul whose original feeding ground was taken from Rize. He is a sophomore in the Pharmaceutical Department of Kamii University and Kimi Nishino''s boyfriend.', '/uploads/images/c_88409.png'),
(78, 'Kimi Nishino', '西野貴未', '配角', 'Yurie Kobori', 'Kimi Nishino is a assistant for Akihiro Kanou who aids in his ghoulification experiments, the previous human lover of Nishiki Nishio and a medical student at Kamii University.~!Although she is aware of his ghoul nature, she remained loyal to him and kept his secret. After the Owl Suppression Operation, he left her in order to keep her safe.!~', '/uploads/images/c_88410.jpg'),
(78, 'Ayato Kirishima', '霧嶋絢都', '配角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 159 cm (5''2") Ayato Kirishima is [Touka Kirishima](https://anilist.co/character/87277/Touka-Kirishima)''s younger brother. He grew up with his sister in the 20th ward but at some point of time, he disappeared. Currently, he is an executive of Aogiri Tree. An arrogant youth with a similar harsh attitude that resembles his sister. Other than physical looks, he shares many similarities with Touka such as his cold, hotblooded attitude and a habit for kicking people. However, he''s more harsh compared to her and surprisingly nicer than his Aogiri superiors.', '/uploads/images/c_88411.png'),
(78, 'Juuzou Suzuya', '鈴屋什造', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") A Rank 3 Ghoul Investigator. In the past, he went by the name Rei Suzuya. He is the partner of [Yukinori Shinohara](https://anilist.co/character/88408). He is a young man with androgynous appearance. He has many stitches used as both first-aid and fashion. His hair is tied with a stitching string in a roman numeral 13 pattern, with large pupils that leaves an eerie and frightening impression.', '/uploads/images/c_88412.png'),
(78, 'Uta', 'ウタ', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', '__Height:__ 177 cm A ghoul that has his own art studio where he makes masks for other ghouls. He has a lot of piercings and tattoos on his body, making him look pretty intimidating, even as a normal-looking human. He''s the one who also made a mask for Kaneki.', '/uploads/images/c_88414.jpg'),
(78, 'Itori', 'イトリ', '配角', 'Ayahi Takagaki', 'Itori is an old friend of Yomo and Uta. She can be found in Helter Skelter bar, where she makes her share in the information web of the underworld. Itori is over friendly and talkative. She likes having fun and even doing pranks. Her bad point might be her using people like toys to get the information she wants.', '/uploads/images/c_88415.jpg'),
(78, 'Enji Koma', '古間円児', '配角', 'Anri Katsu', 'Enji Koma is a ghoul and a waiter at Anteiku. He is an expert coffee brewer. In his youth, he was known as the Devil Ape and led the Apes ghoul gang.', '/uploads/images/c_88416.jpg'),
(78, 'Tatara', 'タタラ', '配角', 'Kouji Yusa', 'A direct subordinate of the One-Eyed King and one of Aogiri Tree''s leaders. He was a former member of the Chinese ghoul organization Chi She Lian. As one of the Aogiri Tree leaders and a trusted subordinate working under the One-Eyed King, Tatara comes off as a rather loyal individual. He is portrayed as composed and stoic mostly. He often monitors the activities of the Aogiri executives, but kills in cold-blood when embarking on a mission. He is also proud of his immense stamina when fighting and the accuracy of his calculations as well. Tatara seems to have a taste for precision; as shown when he turns down Kaneki considering he''s an artificial one-eyed ghoul. He appears to hold a grudge against Houji, to the extent that even the Quinque associated with him, is enough to make him enraged and lose his near unflappable composure. As the second-in-command of Aogiri, it can be inferred that he is quite powerful.', '/uploads/images/c_88418.png'),
(78, 'Nico', 'ニコ', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', '__Species:__ Ghoul __Height:__ 175 cm __Affiliations:__ Clown Mask Ghoul Gang A gay ghoul (okama) in love. He was once acting together with Yamori and participating in Aogiri Tree.', '/uploads/images/c_88419.jpg'),
(78, 'Hideyoshi Nagachika', '永近英良', '配角', 'Toshiyuki Toyonaga', '__Race:__ Human Hideyoshi is a normal human and the best friend of [Ken Kaneki](https://anilist.co/character/87275/Kaneki-Ken). Hide is incredibly observant and can figure things out about people in a almost sherlock-like manner. He also becomes interested in things and works hard on them until he finds something else to interest him.', '/uploads/images/c_88421.png'),
(78, 'Shuu Tsukiyama', '月山習', '配角', 'Mamoru Miyano', '__Height:__ 180 cm Shuu Tsukiyama was the infamous Gourmet ghoul of the 20th ward. He was a fourth-year student studying Social Welfare at the Department of Human Sciences at Seinan Gakuin University. He comes from the extremely wealthy and influential Tsukiyama family which his father, Mirumo Tsukiyama was the head of. Tsukiyama himself became the head of his family after the Tsukiyama Family Extermination Operation. He was also a member of the Ghoul Restaurant, known as MM until he betrayed them. He joined Kaneki''s group with the hidden intention of eating Ken Kaneki, obsessed with his scent and taste but eventually came to genuinely care for Kaneki. Two years later, his severe depression and anorexia after Kaneki''s apparent demise left him emaciated and required constant care from his family servants. After finding out Kaneki was alive and meeting him, he recovers, being able to walk and eat on his own as well as take measures to help Kaneki regain his memories.', '/uploads/images/c_88424.png'),
(78, 'Yakumo Oomori', '大守八雲', '配角', '', 'A white-haired brute with sharp lizard eyes. Yamori is ghoul who is as scary as he looks. Normally in a entirely white suit and black dress shirt, he resembles a typical gangster.', '/uploads/images/c_88428.jpg'),
(78, 'Akira Mado', '真戸暁', '配角', 'Asami Seto', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 164 cm __Affiliations:__ CCG __Quinque:__ Amatsu (Koukaku/Bikaku) __Likes:__ making quinques, solving puzzles and cats Akira Mado is a Rank 2 Ghoul Investigator and Kureo''s daughter. She is currently partnered with Koutarou Amon. She is an intelligent woman and seems to be always serious about work and her daily routine in general. Like her father, she has deep insight and intuition that helps her in investigation and determining what is going on around her while on the field. She shares her father''s "quinque-mania," but it is not as extreme as his was. Akira remains professional in most situations, no matter who she is faced with, and she isn''t one to admit her own feelings on a subject unless provoked to a certain degree. Seen through her interactions with others, it is most likely that she would prefer to make a quinque rather than to interact with someone else.', '/uploads/images/c_88838.png'),
(78, 'Kishou Arima', '有馬貴将', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', '__Height:__ 180 cm __Quinque:__ IXA (Koukaku), Narukami (Ukaku), Yukimura 1/3 (Koukaku) Kishou Arima is a famed Special Class Ghoul Investigator known as the CCG''s Reaper. He is undefeated as a Ghoul Investigator and at some point was formerly partnered with Take Hirako. His investigative skills and prowess in combat has led many investigators such as [Koutarou Amon](https://anilist.co/character/88407/Koutarou-Amon) to admire him. __Tokyo Ghoul:Re__ ~!He later passes down his Yukimura 1/3 (Koukaku) quinque to [Sasaki Haise](https://anilist.co/character/87275/Ken-Kaneki), a rank 1 investigator and mentor of Quinx squad. Along with [Akira Mado](https://anilist.co/character/88838/Akira-Mado), he is the overseer of the Quinx squad and keeps a check on Sasaki Haise along with the Quinx members.!~', '/uploads/images/c_88946.jpg'),
(78, 'Eto', 'エト', '配角', 'Maaya Sakamoto', '__Height:__ 151 cm __RC Type:__ Ukaku __Rating:__ ~!S as Eto SSS as One Eyed Owl!~ Eto is an executive of Aogiri Tree from the 24th ward. Eto is often seen interacting with fellow Aogiri member [Tatara](https://anilist.co/character/88418/Tatara). ~!She is the daughter of [Yoshimura](https://anilist.co/character/136024/Yoshimura), and the half-Ghoul known as the One-Eyed Owl. Her human identity is Sen Takatsuki (高槻 泉), a best-selling horror novelist mentioned throughout the series. Her relation with the One-Eyed King is unclear. However the CCG and [Nico](https://anilist.co/character/88419/Nico) speculate that they are the same person.!~', '/uploads/images/c_90231.jpg'),
(78, 'Naki', 'ナキ', '配角', 'Hiro Shimono', 'Naki is a ghoul who was imprisoned in Cochlea until Aogiri Tree''s invasion on the prison. He was liberated by Aogiri Tree due to being a direct underling and supposedly the right hand man of Yamori. He was almost always accompanied by the Twins Gagi and Guge. He eventually climbs the ranks within Aogiri, and has become an Executive in his own right. The number of Ghouls following him has grown considerably, forming a gang known as the White Suits for their distinctive dressing style. Naki is left handed.', '/uploads/images/c_90232.jpg'),
(78, 'Kurona Yasuhisa', '安久黒奈', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', 'Kurona Yasuhisa is an artificial one-eyed ghoul who impeded Ken Kaneki''s pursuit of Madam A alongside her twin sister Nashiro. ~!After being abandoned by Akihiro Kanou, she vanished until her appearance during the Rushima Landing Operation. She merged with her sister and became known to the CCG as Floppy.!~', '/uploads/images/c_90236.jpg'),
(78, 'Nashiro Yasuhisa', '安久 奈白', '配角', 'Haruka Tomatsu', 'Nashiro Yasuhisa is an artificial one-eyed ghoul who impeded Ken Kaneki''s pursuit of Madam A alongside her twin sister Kurona. ~!She was fatally wounded in battle, and abandoned to die by Akihiro Kanou. Her sister claimed that she survived on as a parasitic mass on her stomach, but Kanou claimed this to have been nothing but a delusion to cope with Nashiro''s death.!~', '/uploads/images/c_90237.jpg'),
(78, 'Noro', 'ノロ', '配角', 'Kenji Hamada', 'He is one of the direct subordinates of the King of an Eye and one of the leaders of the Aogiri Tree, next to Tatara. In the past he was called Noroi and was responsible for raising Eto, when Kuzen surrendered in District 24. He is a giant who intimidates with an overwhelming silence, seems to communicate only through actions, not words.', '/uploads/images/c_125567.jpg'),
(78, 'Seidou Takizawa', '滝澤政道', '配角', 'Shinnosuke Tachibana', '__Height:__ 171 cm Takizawa is a Rank 2 Ghoul Investigator. A classmate of [Akira Mado](https://anilist.co/character/88838/Akira-Mado) at the Academy, he is partnered with Kousuke Houji and assigned to the 20th ward to investigate the Gourmet. He greatly respects [Kishou Arima](https://anilist.co/character/88946/Kishou-Arima) and [Koutarou Amon](https://anilist.co/character/88407/Koutarou-Amon) and admires their achievements. ~!Though he was declared among the casualties of the raid in the 20th Ward, it is revealed that he had actually survived as artificial one-eyed ghoul. He is now a member of Aogiri Tree. As an artificial one-eyed ghoul, he is known as Owl. After betraying Aogiri and killing [Tatara](https://anilist.co/character/88418/Tatara), Takizawa reunited with Akira Mado, and became a member of Ken Kaneki''s organization, Goat. !~', '/uploads/images/c_125884.jpg'),
(78, 'Take Hirako', '平子丈', '配角', 'Takayuki Kondou', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 172 cm __Affiliations:__ CCG __Quinque:__ Nagomi 1/3 (Rinkaku) Take Hirako is a First Class Ghoul Investigator. In the past, he formed a duo with Kishou Arima. Hirako is of average height and his facial features have been described as "plain" or "bland." He usually has a blank expression on his face. Like all members of CCG, he usually wears formal attire. Like his mentor Kishou Arima, Hirako has a very calm personality and has inherited the same cold and calculating approach to fighting ghouls.He is skilled to the point of being able to suppress a S-class Ukaku type ghoul.', '/uploads/images/c_136023.jpg'),
(78, 'Yoshimura', '芳村', '配角', 'Takayuki Sugou', 'Yoshimura is a ghoul and the manager of the Anteiku cafe. He tries to help every ghoul, especially those who can''t hunt themselves. He takes in Ken Kaneki and tries to help him survive being a ghoul. ~!He is Eto''s father.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136024.png'),
(78, 'Taishi Fura', '富良太志', '配角', 'Ryouhei Kimura', 'Taishi Fura is a First-Class Ghoul Investigator. He is the protagonist of the side story Tokyo Ghoul: Jack, alongside Kishou Arima.', '/uploads/images/c_145217.jpg'),
(78, 'Ui Koori', '宇井郡', '配角', 'Keisuke Oda', 'Koori is a Special Class Investigator and an Investigation Commander in Division I. He is the leader of S1 Squad, and a former protege of Kishou Arima and the partner of Hairu Ihei. He is in charge of the 4th ward.', '/uploads/images/c_169534.jpg'),
(78, 'Renji Yomo', '四方蓮示', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Height:__ 182 cm (5''11") Renji Yomo is a worker at Anteiku and the right hand of [Yoshimura](https://anilist.co/character/136024/Yoshimura). He is an old friend of [Uta](https://anilist.co/character/88414/Uta) and [Itori](https://anilist.co/character/88415/Itori). Because of his scavenging habits and long-beaked, avian mask, he has the nickname of "Raven."', '/uploads/images/c_172074.jpg'),
(78, 'Akihiro Kanou', '嘉納明博', '配角', 'Kenji Nomura', 'Akihiro Kanou, often referred to as Professor Kanou, is a physician at Kanou General Hospital.', '/uploads/images/c_189325.png'),
(78, 'Kuramoto Itou', '伊東倉元', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', '__Height:__ 172 cm Kuramoto Itou is a First Class Ghoul Investigator and the deputy squad leader of the Hirako Squad.', '/uploads/images/c_206156.png'),
(78, 'Maris-Stella', 'マリスステラ', '配角', '', 'The grumpy cat of Akira Mado. She appears to be affectionate towards Akira, but hostile to anyone else.', '/uploads/images/c_207563.jpg'),
(78, 'Chuu Hachikawa', '鉢川忠', '配角', 'Kenta Miyake', 'An Associate Special Class Investigator from the CCG.', '/uploads/images/c_235080.png'),
(78, 'Kazuichi Banjou', '万丈数壱', '配角', 'Kentarou Itou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_241488.jpg'),
(78, 'Big Madam', 'ビッグマダム', '配角', 'Kimiko Saitou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_241489.png'),
(78, 'Kouitsu Chigyou', '地行甲乙', '配角', 'Shinji Kawada', 'Kouitsu Chigyou is the head ghoul researcher at CCG Laboratory Division. He used to be a researcher in the GFG in Germany.', '/uploads/images/c_241525.png'),
(78, 'Kaya Irimi', '入見カヤ', '配角', 'Fuyuka Ooura', 'Kaya Irimi is a waitress working at Anteiku.', '/uploads/images/c_241529.png'),
(78, 'Ayumu Hogi', '穂木あゆむ', '配角', 'Rui Tanabe', 'Ayumu is a First Class Investigator from the CCG and Vice-Chief of Chuu Hachikawa''s squad. Ayumu was part of the Squad 3 in the Anteiku raid.', '/uploads/images/c_241530.png'),
(78, 'Misato Gori', '五里美郷', '配角', 'Reina Ueda', 'Misato Gori is a Rank 2 Ghoul Investigator. She is currently affiliated with the 13th ward.', '/uploads/images/c_241531.png'),
(78, 'Kiyoko Aura', '安浦清子', '配角', 'Chinatsu Akasaki', 'Kiyoko is a Special Class Investigator, and noteworthy for being the first woman to achieve that rank. She is assigned to the 1st Ward as the Chief of Division I . She was a classmate of Kasuka Mado, and is greatly admired by the female employees of CCG for her many achievements.', '/uploads/images/c_241532.png'),
(78, 'Matasaka Kamishiro', '神代叉栄', '配角', 'Kiyoyuki Yanada', 'Matasaka Kamishiro is a SS-rank ghoul and the former leader of the ghouls in the 6th ward. Most people refer to him by his nickname Orca or Shachi. He is a strong ghoul, well-versed in the martial arts. When he was the leader of the ghouls in the 6th ward, he trained and strengthened his followers. However, he was captured and sent to the Ghoul Detention Center. After he was freed during Aogiri Tree''s attack, he decided to join the organization.', '/uploads/images/c_241535.png'),
(78, 'Iwao Kuroiwa', '黒磐巌', '配角', 'Ryuuzaburou Ootomo', 'Iwao Kuroiwa is a Special Class Ghoul Investigator. Currently, he serves as the vice commander of the 11th Ward Special Countermeasures Unit. Yukinori Shinohara calls him by the nickname Iwaccho.', '/uploads/images/c_241539.png'),
(78, 'Roma Hoito', '帆糸ロマ', '配角', 'Suzuko Mimori', 'Roma Hoito is a ghoul and used to be a waitress at Anteiku.', '/uploads/images/c_241540.png'),
(78, 'Katsuya Mabuchi', '馬淵活也', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', 'Katsuya Mabuchi is a ghoul investigator. He is the subordinate of Itsuki Marude and is normally seen standing beside Marude.', '/uploads/images/c_241545.png'),
(78, 'Mougan Tanakamaru', '田中丸望元', '配角', 'Tsuyoshi Koyama', 'Mougan is a Special Class Investigator and the Division I Branch Director of CCG''s 2nd Ward Branch Office. He acted as the captain of Squad 2 in the Anteiku raid.', '/uploads/images/c_241551.png'),
(78, 'Yoshitoki Washuu', '和修吉時', '配角', 'Shunsuke Sakuya', 'Yoshitoki Washuu is the current Bureau Director of CCG''s Main Office and Tsuneyoshi Washuu''s son.', '/uploads/images/c_241552.png'),
(78, 'Tsuneyoshi Washuu', '和修常吉', '配角', 'Katsunosuke Hori', 'Tsuneyoshi Washuu is the current chairman of CCG and Yoshitoki Washuu''s father.', '/uploads/images/c_241555.png'),
(79, 'Isla', 'アイラ', '主角', 'Sora Amamiya', 'Isla is a Giftia who has a childish appearance, is extremely clumsy, and doesn''t show much emotion. She''s also a veteran Giftia who is said to be the #1 in retrievals in the terminal service, and she is seen having a diary that records down what she has done with her retrieval targets. She is currently working on the same team as [Tsukasa Mizugaki](https://anilist.co/character/88754/Tsukasa-Mizugaki) and has previously worked with [Kazuki Kuwanomi](https://anilist.co/character/88757/Kazuki-Kuwanomi) years ago.', '/uploads/images/c_88753.jpg'),
(79, 'Tsukasa Mizugaki', '水柿ツカサ', '主角', 'Yasuaki Takumi', 'After failing his college entrance exams due to medical problems, he eventually gets a job through his father on Terminal Service No. 1, although he initially does not know what they do. He is assigned as [Isla](https://anilist.co/character/88753)''s spotter and soon becomes attached to her.', '/uploads/images/c_88754.jpg'),
(79, 'Michiru Kinushima', '絹島ミチル', '配角', 'Chinatsu Akasaki', 'Michiru Kinushima is a Spotter at Terminal Service #1, and is partnered with Zack. She is Tsukasa Mizugaki''s senior and mentor at Terminal Service. (Source: Plastic Memories Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_88755.jpg'),
(79, 'Zack', 'ザック', '配角', 'Sayuri Yahagi', 'Zack is a Giftia and a Marksman that is partnered with Michiru Kinushima, and works for the SAI Terminal Service Program. His personality is shown to be a quick-witted character, but also shows many degrees of compassion. Zack is also often portrayed playing quietly on his handheld video games, leading to his appearance of an antisocial character. He is also often portrayed teasing Michiru Kinushima''s dialogues.', '/uploads/images/c_88756.jpg'),
(79, 'Kazuki Kuwanomi', '桑乃実カヅキ', '配角', 'Megumi Toyoguchi', 'Kazuki Kuwanomi is the director of field work, a Spotter at Terminal Service #1 and the second in power only to the manager of the department, Takao Yamanobe. She was previously Constance''s partner, but recently became Isla''s partner again. (Source: Plastic Memories Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_88757.jpg'),
(79, 'Constance', 'コンスタンス', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', 'Constance is a male giftia. He is now Kazuki''s partner, ever since Isla and Kazuki disbanded. He is as tall as Tsukasa and though he is a giftia, he looks like he is in his late teens/early 20s. Constance and Tsukasa get along very well, but do not talk much. (Source: Plastic Memories Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_88758.jpg'),
(79, 'Yasutaka Hanada', '縹ヤスタカ', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', 'Yasutaka Hanada is a veteran employee and spotter at SAI Terminal Service #1. He has been working for over ten years at Terminal Service. He is partnered with Sherry. (Source: Plastic Memories Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_88759.jpg'),
(79, 'Sherry', 'シェリー', '配角', 'Aimi', 'Sherry is a Giftia who works at Terminal Service #1 and is Yasutaka Hanada''s marksman. (Source: Plastic Memories Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_88760.jpg'),
(79, 'Eru Miru', '海松エル', '配角', 'Sumire Uesaka', 'Eru Miru is an engineer in the Giftia maintenance team at Terminal Service #1, who has been on the job for two years. (Source: Plastic Memories Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_88761.jpg'),
(79, 'Takao Yamanobe', '山野辺 タカオ', '配角', 'Nobuo Tobita', 'Takao Yamanobe is the Section chief for the terminal service 1. Although he is in charge of the small office located behind the SAI tower, he leaves all duties and works to Kazuki Kuwanomi. (Source: Plastic Memories Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_88762.jpg'),
(79, 'Andy', 'アンディ', '配角', 'Mikako Komatsu', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_214299.jpg'),
(79, 'Nina', 'ニーナ', '配角', 'Misaki Kuno', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_214300.jpg'),
(79, 'Chizu Shirohana', '白花チヅ', '配角', 'Reiko Suzuki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_214301.png'),
(79, 'Marsha', 'マーシャ', '配角', 'Mamiko Noto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_214302.png'),
(79, 'Souta Wakanae', '若苗ソウタ', '配角', 'Misato Fukuen', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_214303.png'),
(79, 'Mikijirou Tetsuguro', '鉄黒ミキジロウ', '配角', 'Mitsuaki Hoshino', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_214304.png'),
(79, 'Mari Iwai', '岩井マリ', '配角', 'Kiyoko Miyazawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_214305.png'),
(79, 'Hajime Iwai', '岩井ハジメ', '配角', 'Kan Tanaka', 'is the husband of Mrs. Mari Iwai and is one of the owners of Edward.', '/uploads/images/c_214306.png'),
(79, 'Edward', 'エドワード', '配角', 'Akinori Egoshi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_214307.png'),
(79, 'Ren Kawarake', '土器レン', '配角', 'Shinnosuke Ogami ', 'He is the one and only administrative assistant in the Terminal Service Department. He is in charge of assigning members their collection schedules. He is a very nice and sincere guy and everyone depends on him. He has a strong build since he was previously a member of the rugby club.', '/uploads/images/c_214308.png'),
(80, 'Hestia', 'ヘスティア', '主角', 'Inori Minase', '__Race:__ God __Height:__ 140 cm (4''7") __Affiliation:__ Hestia Familia Hestia is an energetic, kind goddess who sees potential in [Bell](https://anilist.co/character/88860/Cranel-Bell). She is a hard worker, and works jobs to support the two while Bell goes off to the dungeon. Hestia tends to be shown as very petty and gets jealous easily when girls, namely [Aiz](https://anilist.co/character/87655/Wallenstein-Ais), show interest in Bell, because she is deeply in love with him, or they are the reason for his strength growth. Despite seeming mature and dependable toward Bell, Hestia is in truth, a lazy goddess, as she couldn''t get a job or put effort into work. After descending to the Lower World, Hestia was taken care of by her friend [Hephaestus](https://anilist.co/character/142544/Hephaestus). Soon after, she was asked to live on her own after she kept freeloading off of Hephaestus'' familia and was given a room at an abandoned church. Hestia tried to create her own familia, but wasn''t able to recruit anyone. After failing to recruit for the 50th time, she noticed Bell and decided to secretly follow him. Hestia found out that Bell had been trying to enter a familia, but was rejected multiple times and seemed to be in the same boat. Hestia then took the chance to recruit him, which Bell happily agreed upon; becoming the first member of her familia. She took Bell to a bookstore, the location she already decided beforehand, and granted her Falna to her first dependent.', '/uploads/images/c_87654.jpg'),
(80, 'Ais Wallenstein', 'アイズ・ヴァレンシュタイン', '配角', 'Saori Oonishi', '__Height:__ 162 cm (5''4") Ais Wallenstein, also known as the Sword Princess, is a First-Class Adventurer and a key member of the Loki Familia. Among the small fraction of First-Class Adventurers, she is considered one of the strongest.', '/uploads/images/c_87655.png'),
(80, 'Bell Cranel', 'ベル・クラネル', '主角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', '__Race:__ Human __Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") Bell Cranel is the captain of the Hestia Familia. Bell was raised by his grandfather in a rural farming village deep within the mountains near the labyrinth city Orario. He had heard and read many stories about heroes from his grandfather, forming his dream of aspiring to be a mighty one himself. After his grandfather''s death, he took it upon himself to leave the village, traveling to the land of Orario to fulfill his dreams. Upon his arrival in the city, Bell attempted to enter numerous Familia, but was rejected by each one. [Hestia](https://anilist.co/character/87654/Hestia), a Goddess, unable to find members willing to join her Familia, asked him if he''d like to become the first member of her Familia. Bell gladly accepted, and so started his new life, finally with a Goddess'' blessing. Bell is a kind, straightforward, brave, yet shy boy who desires to be a hero like the ones he grew up reading about. He cares deeply for the people around him, especially his Goddess, Hestia, and his Familia. He considers them like family due to the death of his grandfather. Bell''s goals didn''t start out pure, as he wanted to be an adventurer in hopes of picking up girls, even thinking of starting a harem. However, after his experience with [Ais](https://anilist.co/character/87655/Wallenstein-Ais) and [Bete](https://anilist.co/character/122632/Loga-Bete), Bell seems to have forgone that dream and fell in love with Ais Wallenstein. He became determined', '/uploads/images/c_88860.jpg'),
(80, 'Ryuu  Lion', 'リュー・リオン', '配角', 'Saori Hayami', '__Race:__ Elf __Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") Ryuu Lion is a waitress at the Hostess of Fertility. Ryuu was a member of a family that cared for the sacred tree in their home forest of Ryumilua. As time passed, she began to think that beautiful Elves were the ugliest of all people, due to seeing her fellow Elves'' behavior toward those of other races. No matter how much she tried to forget it, once she began thinking about it, the thought firmly planted itself in her mind. Eventually, the thought became enough to make her decide to leave the forest. Ryuu is calm and stoic but also cares deeply for her friends. When a person related to her or her friends are in danger or in need of help, she is always ready to step in and help no matter the cost. Like many Elves, Ryuu is selective with who may touch her. However, she has been advised by [Alise](https://anilist.co/character/288478) to not let go of a man that was able to grab her hands, and began to follow [Bell](https://anilist.co/character/88860) with her eyes. Unlike most Elves, she doesn''t bear the same hatred towards the Crozzo family or their magic swords for their role in the destruction of the forests the Elves lived in, stating that the event took place many years ago and that her village wasn''t directly affected. ~!After arriving in Orario, Ryuu became an adventurer known as Gale, belonging to the Astraea Familia. She was caught in a trap set by Evilus and all of her fellow Familia members were murdered. Overcome with vengean', '/uploads/images/c_88890.jpg'),
(80, 'Eina Tulle', 'エイナ・チュール', '配角', 'Haruka Tomatsu', '__Race__: Half Elf __Height:__ 164 cm (5''5") __Affiliation:__ Guild Eina Tulle is a receptionist at the Guild and Bell Cranel''s advisor. Eina joined the Guild five years earlier at the age of 14 after she graduated from the school. Originally excited to work at the Guild, she quickly learned that it wasn''t as fun as she thought it would be, eventually changing her personality into what it is now. She met Bell four years later and became his dungeon adviser. Eina shows a serious, calm demeanor, appearing as a very wise and sisterly figure towards Bell, even so far as getting worried whenever he went out to dangerous levels in the dungeon. She gets embarrassed when the subject of romance or love is mentioned, especially coming from Bell. Eina is passionate about her job as she doesn''t want any adventurers under her care to die in the dungeon. She has a particular stance when it comes to advising adventurers; in addition to the usual Dungeon-prowling advice and regular meetings, she would also summon her adventurers to private lessons, where she crams as much Dungeon knowledge into their heads as possible. It was to the point where she gained a scary reputation among many adventurers, as she would often demand her pupils to perfectly draw out maps and monsters strategies from memory, with the threat of extra work if there were any mistakes. No one had lasted all the way to the end of her course, most ran away halfway through, and the only one known so far to be able to endure he', '/uploads/images/c_88896.jpg'),
(80, 'Liliruca Arde', 'リリルカ・アーデ', '主角', 'Maaya Uchida', '__Race:__ Pallum __Height:__ 110 cm (3''7") Liliruca Arde is a member of the Hestia Familia. Originally a member of the Soma Familia, she converted to the Hestia Familia after securing her freedom after the War Game. Lili was born to Hobbit parents belonging to the Soma Familia, making her a member of the Familia from birth. However, her parents didn''t look after her and ordered her to earn money for them instead. A while later, her parents were killed in the dungeon, leaving her to fend for herself. The Soma Familia didn''t take care of her and bullied her, making her lonely and isolated. To earn money, she tried to be an adventurer, but didn''t have the talent, eventually switching to being a supporter. As a supporter, she was constantly looked down on by those she partied with, fueling the hatred of adventurers inside of her. After a while, Lili decided to run away from the Soma Familia and become a normal citizen. However, the Soma Familia found her and inflicted misery on the old couple who took care of her, destroying their store and stealing money. She began to hate Soma himself, wondering why he created a Familia if he wasn''t going to take care of it. From that time on, Lili began using her hatred of adventurers as an excuse to trick and steal from them. She also treated Bell the same way, however, his actions repeatedly caused her to question her own attitude. After she is saved by Bell, she becomes much closer to him and develops romantic feelings for him. Lili often u', '/uploads/images/c_88897.png'),
(80, 'Tiona Hiryute', 'ティオナ・ヒリュテ', '配角', 'Rie Murakawa', '__Race:__ Amazoness __Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") __Affiliation:__ Loki Familia __Level:__ 6 __Skills:__ Berserk • Intense Heat __Weapon: __Urga • Blade Rolan Tiona Hiryute is a first class adventurer and an executive member of the Loki Familia. She is the younger twin of the Hiryute Sisters. [Tione](https://anilist.co/character/127209/Hiryute-Tione) and Tiona were born in Telskyura and were forced to join the Kali Familia from the moment they were born. Both sisters didn''t know who their parents were, but knew that they were sisters. She reached Level 2 on the same day Tione did after killing an Amazoness she knew in a fight to the death. Soon after, both sisters became students to Argana and Bache. Around a year after reaching Level 2, Tiona found her first hero story. The day before her seventh birthday, Tiona asked Kali to let her and Tione leave the country, which Kali granted a couple days later, much to the sisters'' surprise. The sisters traveled across the land, temporarily joining different Familia for a year, during which both sisters reached Level 3. They arrived at Orario years later when they were 12 years old. After agreeing to join the Familia of the adventurer that defeated them, they proceeded to defeat everyone that challenged them, only to lose to [Finn](https://anilist.co/character/142538/Deimne-Finn) and [Gareth](https://anilist.co/character/142542/Landrock-Gareth) when they were challenged by the Loki Familia. Following a dungeon expedition they went on shor', '/uploads/images/c_121633.jpg'),
(80, 'Mord Latro', 'モルド・ラトロー', '配角', 'Kouichi Souma', '__Race:__ Human __Height:__ 178 cm (5''10") __Affiliation:__ Ogma Familia __Level:__ 2 __Weapon:__ Double-Edged Sword Mord Latro is a Level 2 adventurer who was initially an enemy to Bell Cranel. Mord Latro is a loud and tough adventurer. He is also shown to be ill-tempered, holding a grudge against Bell for his rapid growth and fame. He is also shown to have a lustful nature, claiming that Bell should share Ryuu, Syr, and Lili while at the Hostess of Fertility because "they were friends". Despite Mord''s dislike for Bell at first due to his growth and fame, he comes to respect Bell after his battle with him on the 18th floor, as well as witnessing Bell finish off the Floor Boss Black Goliath. Through various encounters, such as the El Dorado Resort incident, he also becomes much friendlier to him, even coming to his defense when an adventurer insulted him for helping monsters. He even bet 100,000 valis on the Hestia Familia during the War Game, showing his confidence in their abilities.', '/uploads/images/c_122200.jpg'),
(80, 'Guile India', 'ガイル・インディア', '配角', 'Daiki Hamano', '__Race:__ Human __Level:__ 2 __Weapon:__ Spike Mace __Equipment:__ Shield Crest Guile is one of Mord''s loyal companions along with Scott Olds. He mainly follows the orders given to him such as watching over their hostage Hestia, but expressed the desire to go join the others at Mord''s duel when they heard loud noises coming from that direction.', '/uploads/images/c_122201.jpg'),
(80, 'Lunoire Faust', 'ルノア・ファウスト', '配角', 'Yuna Yoshino', '__Race:__ Human __Height:__ 161 cm (5''3") Lunoire Faust is a waitress at the Hostess of Fertility and a former bounty hunter known as Faust as a member of the Demeter Familia. Lunoire was born to parents that lived in a territory of the empire. However, her parents soon died because of a war, and she was forced to live her life as one of the street children. After living for some time in harsh conditions, she heard about the falna and joined a Familia, but later began traveling on her own a while later once her Goddess was forced back to heaven. After a while, she arrived at Orario nine years before the story and failed her first mission of killing the Gulliver Brothers, barely escaping with her life, and began refusing jobs to kill first class adventurers. Eventually, after failing to kill a wanted Ryuu, she joined the Hostess of Fertility. Lunoire has a straightforward and caring personality, as shown when she tried to distance herself from her own Familia in order to protect them. She once considered finding a husband that didn''t need to be cool as long as he would care for her and let her laze around in a small house.', '/uploads/images/c_122203.jpg'),
(80, 'Mia Grand', 'ミア・グランド', '配角', 'Yuka Keichou', '__Race:__ Dwarf __Height:__ 180 cm (5''11") __Affiliation:__ Hostess of Fertility • Freya Familia __Level:__ 6 Mia Grand is the owner of the Hostess of Fertility, and is later revealed to be the former captain of the Freya Familia. Several years ago, Mia joined the Freya Familia because she owed Freya a favor, eventually becoming the captain of the Familia. When Ottar joined the Familia, Freya asked her to take care of him. Sometime before Ais came to Orario, Mia partially left the Freya Familia to open the Hostess of Fertility, employing Anya there. As the proprietress of the Hostess of Fertility, she is strict both to her employees and customers alike. She doesn''t tolerate any violence within the pub or slacking off by her employees and will punish any individuals accordingly, such as when she threatened Mord. Despite her rough personality, she is also shown to be kind, taking in girls with histories and protecting them. In addition, she likes money, telling Bell a couple of times to spend a lot of money.', '/uploads/images/c_122206.png'),
(80, 'Bete Loga', 'ベート・ローガ', '配角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '__Race:__ Werewolf __Height:__ 183 cm (6''0") __Affiliation:__ Loki Familia __Level:__ 6 __Skills:__ Úlfheðinn • Fenris Wolf • Solmani __Magic:__ Hati __Weapon:__ Flosvirt • Dual Rolan Bete Loga is a first class adventurer and an executive member of the Loki Familia. He was the former captain of the Vidar Familia until they left the city. Bete was born to the leader of a clan of Werewolves and had a sister named Luna along with a childhood friend named Rene, who he later got in a relationship with. However, his whole clan was killed by a monster when he was 12, and he traveled to Orario where he eventually became the captain of the Vidar Familia. When he was 16, he temporarily left the city as a Level 3 to kill the monster that killed his clan, succeeding in doing so after a day of fighting. Unfortunately, he discovered upon his return that his Familia had failed their recent dungeon expedition, resulting in the deaths of the vice-captain, who he used to be in a relationship with, along with several others while others that survived gained wounds fatal for an adventurer. The Vidar Familia subsequently left the city, though he stayed behind, and later joined the Loki Familia after an incident with Finn and Gareth at a pub. Bete has a rough personality and a slight superiority complex. He completely hates the weak, especially those that don''t do anything about their weakness, and is not afraid to express his opinions about it. He can be an idiot who can''t read the atmosphere. Fu', '/uploads/images/c_122632.png'),
(80, 'Lefiya Viridis', 'レフィーヤ・ウィリディス', '配角', 'Juri Kimura', '__Race:__ Elf __Height:__ 156 cm (5''1") __Affiliation:__ Loki Familia __Level:__ 4 __Skills:__ Fairy Canon • Double Canon __Magic:__ Arcs Ray • Fusillade Fallarica • Elf Ring __Weapon:__ Forest''s Teardrop Lefiya Viridis is a second class adventurer and a member of the Loki Familia. She is a mage training to succeed Riveria Ljos Alf. She has a magic that allows her to use any Elf Magic, hence the alias Thousand Elf. Sometime in the past, Lefiya was an honor student at the School, leveling up after three years at eleven years of age. After graduating, she joined the Loki Familia at Level 2 and leveled up a year later. Lefiya is clumsy, but hard working. She occasionally zones out as her imagination runs rampant. She has a deep admiration for Ais and through her admiration, aims to become stronger so that she can stand next to Ais as an equal. She is often jealous of Bell due to his interactions with Ais. Lefiya maintains her elven pride, but is more open than normal Elves due to her own kind nature and growing up surrounded by people from other races. Lefiya struggled with her own worth as a member of the Loki Familia, having low confidence, self doubt, and other problems that began to get better once she befriended Filvis and learned concurrent chanting. Having a fear of being left completely alone due to her ineptitude, she highly valued her relationships, especially with Ais and Filvis. She can also mix between being kind and mean quickly, as she frequently switched between ', '/uploads/images/c_125821.jpg'),
(80, 'Tione Hiryute', 'ティオネ・ヒリュテ', '配角', 'Minami Takahashi', '__Race:__ Amazoness __Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") __Affiliation:__ Loki Familia __Level:__ 6 __Skills:__ Berserk • Backdraft __Magic:__ List Iorum __Weapon:__ Zolas • Filuka • Halberd Rolan Tione Hiryute is a first class adventurer and an executive member of the Loki Familia. She is the older twin of the Hiryute Sisters. Tione and Tiona were born in Telskyura and were forced to join the Kali Familia from the moment they were born. Both sisters didn''t know who their parents were, but knew that they were sisters. She reached Level 2 on her fifth birthday after she unknowingly killed Seldas, a person that she had viewed as a mother and an older sister, in a daily fight to the death, resulting in her resentment of Telskyura. Soon after, both sisters became students to Argana and Bache. The day before Tione''s seventh birthday, Tiona asked Kali to let them leave the country, which she granted a couple of days later, much to their surprise. The sisters traveled across the land, temporarily joining different Familia for a year, during which both sisters reached Level 3. They arrived at Orario years later when they were 12 years old. After agreeing to join the Familia of the adventurer that defeated them, they proceeded to defeat everyone that challenged them, only to lose to Finn and Gareth when they were challenged by the Loki Familia. Upon her defeat, Tione fell in love with Finn, and desperately tried to make herself into a woman he would like. Following a dungeon expedition they went', '/uploads/images/c_127209.jpg'),
(80, 'Loki', 'ロキ ', '配角', 'Yurika Kubo', '__Race:__ God __Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") __Affiliation:__ Loki Familia Loki is the head of the Loki Familia. Loki acts in a very tomboyish manner. She very much enjoys living up to her nickname, trickster, and shows a lustful side toward females, namely Ais Wallenstein. She also has a breast complex and tends to get into fights with Hestia over breast size.', '/uploads/images/c_134595.jpg'),
(80, 'Riveria Ljos Alf', 'リヴェリア・リヨス・アールヴ', '配角', 'Risa Taneda', '__Race:__ High Elf __Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Affiliation:__ Loki Familia __Level:__ 6 __Skills:__ Fairy Anthem • Alf Regina __Magic:__ Rea Laevateinn • Wynn Fimbulvetr • Veil Breath • Via Shilheim • Vas Windheim • Liv Ilusio • Fil Eldis • Luna Aldis • Van Alheim • Flare Burn __Weapon:__ Magna Alfs Riveria Ljos Alf is the daughter of Larfal Ljos Alf and the vice-captain of the Loki Familia. Riveria was born in the Alf''s Royal Forest as a member of the High Elf family. She lived there for 71 years until she grew tired of her father''s negative attitude toward her interest in the outside world and decided to leave. She left the forest with her childhood friend and former personal chamberlain Aina with the help of Finn and Loki. She is also a friend of Njord, as he took care of them before the early Loki Familia entered Orario. Riveria has a serious personality. She is one of the only people that didn''t laugh at Bell and condemned the others for laughing at him. She is also a strict mentor to the lower leveled members of her Familia, training Lefiya in her studies as a mage and Ais when she was a child. She is calm and collected during the heat of battle, dealing with unexpected events in a leader-like fashion, as shown in the event of the Loki Familia being attacked by large numbers of Virga on the 50th floor. Despite this, Riveria is kind to others, especially to her fellow Loki Familia members, earning her the nickname of mama from Loki. Riveria hates to be called an "old wom', '/uploads/images/c_135541.jpg'),
(80, 'Welf Crozzo', 'ヴェルフ・クロッゾ', '主角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', '__Race:__ Human __Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") Welf Crozzo is a member of the Hestia Familia and Bell''s personal blacksmith, later becoming one for the entire Hestia Familia after converting from the Hephaestus Familia. Welf was originally born in Rakia, a nation type Familia ruled by Ares. As a member of the Crozzo Family, he lived as a noble due to the successes his predecessors had in creating magic swords. However, his life changed the day his Skill Crozzo Blood appeared, which enabled him to create magic swords again. Despite his family''s joy at the prospect of being able to create more magic swords, Welf despised his skill, causing him to escape Rakia with the help of his former Goddess Phobos. Welf Crozzo is a straightforward and honest person. He is generally casual to everyone that he associates with. He doesn''t like to be associated with his family name, preferring to not be a part of the conversation when his name is brought up and even refuses people that come to him seeking magic swords.', '/uploads/images/c_138250.png'),
(80, 'Hermes', 'ヘルメス', '配角', 'Souma Saitou', '__Race:__ God __Height:__ 177 cm (5''10") __Affiliation:__ Hermes Familia Hermes is the head of the Hermes Familia. At first glance, Hermes has a casual and playful personality. However, his true nature is someone who is sharp, shrewd, and cunning, becoming serious if needs be. He is eloquent in speech as he is skilled in holding his own when it comes to sounding other people. Later on, he gains an interest in [Bell](https://anilist.co/character/88860/Cranel-Bell) and does whatever he can to make him into a hero, such as convincing [Ryuu](https://anilist.co/character/88890/Lion-Ryuu) to help him or getting rid of [Ishtar](https://anilist.co/character/146789/Ishtar). If needs be, he will clash with allies, as shown when he was willing to sacrifice a number of Xenos in order to restore Bell''s reputation despite working with [Ouranos](https://anilist.co/character/134228/Uranus) to protect them.', '/uploads/images/c_142531.jpg'),
(80, 'Freya', 'フレイヤ', '配角', 'Youko Hikasa', '__Race:__ God __Height:__ 170 cm (5''7"), ~!162 cm (5''4") (as Syr)!~ __Affiliation:__ Freya Familia, ~!Hostess of Fertility (as Syr), Maria''s Orphanage (as Syr)!~ Freya Is the head of the Freya Familia. Long ago, Hera, at the request of [Zeus](https://anilist.co/character/142554/Zeus), asked Freya for help in their goal to save the world. Freya made her a challenge, telling her that she would help her if she won. Having lost the challenge, Freya was forced to stay in Orario as part of the deal, in addition to losing several members of her Familia as a result. Some time later, Freya met a girl named Syr. After telling her that she would rescue her, Freya asked the girl what she wanted. Hearing that she wanted to be like her, Freya decided to offer her a deal, which she accepted. Freya is flirtatious, loves to tease, and has an unending appetite for talented adventurers. She seeks the best and most talented adventurers and will obtain them no matter the cost. She holds an obsession over [Bell Cranel](https://anilist.co/character/88860/Cranel-Bell) and actively does anything in her power to see him grow as an adventurer. Freya doesn''t like to be bound by anyone, though she doesn''t wish to become an arrogant ruler either. She is very impatient. She constantly interferes with Bell''s activities knowing it might kill him but wanting to see him grow as fast as possible. At the same time, she is just as willing to help Bell to see him grow, such as when she gave up a grimoire just to s', '/uploads/images/c_142533.png'),
(80, 'Ottarl', 'オッタル', '配角', 'Ryoukan  Koyanagi', '__Race:__ Boaz __Height:__ 210 cm (6''11") __Affiliation:__ Freya Familia __Level:__ 7 __Skills:__ Vana Arganture • Stortus Ottar __Magic:__ Hildis Vini __Weapon:__ Supreme Black Sword • Greataxe • Great Hammer Ottar is the captain of the Freya Familia and is currently the only Level 7 in Orario. When Ottar was a child, he was abandoned without even having known his own name. Freya found him dying in an alley somewhere and told him he was beautiful and took him into her Familia. She also gave him his name at this time. Due to her material support and emotional warmth, Freya would become everything to Ottar. Two years after joining her Familia, Ottar would become Level 2. Around this time, Mia joined the Freya Familia at the request of Freya in order to train Ottar. Ottar clashed a few times with the Zeus and Hera Familias before they were defeated by the One Eyed Black Dragon and were forced out of Orario. Each time ended in him being defeated. At some point in the past, Ottar half-killed a Balor, the Monster Rex of the 49th floor. Later, after learning about Ais defeating Udaeus by herself, he also defeated Udaeus by himself while managing to obtain the Udaeus'' sword. He reached Level 6 fifteen years before his battle with Udaeus and Level 7 after defeating Zald seven years before the same battle. Ottar is extremely loyal to Freya and will follow her orders. He is shown to not feel any jealousy toward Freya''s interest in Bell and does not allow anyone to insult Freya, becomin', '/uploads/images/c_142536.png'),
(80, 'Finn Deimne', 'フィン・ディムナ', '配角', 'Mutsumi Tamura', '__Race:__ Pallum __Height:__ 119 cm (3''11") __Affiliation:__ Loki Familia __Level:__ 6 __Skills:__ Pallum • Spirit Noble Brave • Dia Fianna • Command Howl • Ail mac Midna __Magic:__ Hell Finegas • Tir na Nog __Weapon:__ Fortia Spear • Spear Rolan Finn Deimne is the captain of the Loki Familia. Finn was born in a village located in a mountainous area and had bad memories of his life ever since he was born. He hated his parents and other Pallum as he wondered why they didn''t try to use their intellect rather than submit to people who were stronger than them. Unlike them, he began to gather knowledge, secretly reading books at the village chief''s house, and when he was caught, he was described to be like a sage. When he was ten years old, monsters attacked his village in the middle of the night, causing him to try to help the village, though he would have died if his parents hadn''t protected him with their lives. Despite this, the other Pallum abandoned them, making him see despair through them. Nevertheless, he also saw courage through his parent''s actions. After the other villagers arrived to get rid of the monsters, he ran off to cry, coming back the next morning to bury his parents himself. By that time, he had a firm resolve to become the Pallum''s light and renamed himself Finn, his thumb beginning to tingle in the process. Finn has a sharp mind, being able to memorize complex things, judge correctly, and take action without hesitation. He cares for his Familia members'' saf', '/uploads/images/c_142538.png'),
(80, 'Ganesha', 'ガネーシャ', '配角', 'Hiroshi Tsuchida', '__Race:__ God __Height:__ 190 cm (6''3") __Affiliation:__ Ganesha Familia Ganesha Is the head of the Ganesha Familia. Ganesha appears to be very flamboyant, speaking in a loud voice and making poses. He even spent practically all of the Familia''s money in making the Ganesha Familia home into huge shape of himself, also naming it after himself. When protecting the citizens, reputation and position means nothing to him; he will even get Gods and Goddesses involved, if he so desires. Ganesha also has a habit of repeatedly mentioning his name, such as "I am Ganesha". However, when the situation demands it, Ganesha has shown himself capable of adopting a more serious attitude and expressing concern for the well-being of others.', '/uploads/images/c_142541.png'),
(80, 'Gareth Landrock', 'ガレス・ランドロック', '配角', 'Kenji Nomura', '__Race:__ Dwarf __Height:__ 151 cm (5''0") __Affiliation:__ Loki Familia __Level:__ 6 __Skills:__ Dvergr Enhance • Ardigalea __Magic:__ Earth Raid __Weapon:__ Grand Axe • Axe Rolan Gareth Landrock is a first class adventurer and a top executive of the Loki Familia. Gareth is a good natured and kind person, acting as a father figure to members like Bete. Before Gareth joined the Loki Familia, he worked as a miner, working in various mines located in his homeland. He was known for going on business trips to dangerous volcanoes, finding several deposits of silver, and helping with work on an underground tunnel.', '/uploads/images/c_142542.png'),
(80, 'Takemikazuchi', 'タケミカヅチ', '配角', 'Junji Majima', '__Race:__ God __Height:__ 176 cm (5''9") , 183 cm (6''0") with geta __Affiliation:__ Takemikazuchi Familia Takemikazuchi is a God and the head of the Takemikazuchi Familia. Takemikazuchi is friendly with [Hestia](https://anilist.co/character/87654/Hestia) and has taught her many things such as the dogeza. He is kind to his Familia members. He is also a natural gigolo, and is clueless to how his actions affect others around him, which makes him come out as insensitive.', '/uploads/images/c_142543.png'),
(80, 'Hephaestus', 'ヘファイストス', '配角', 'Yuka Terasaki', '__Race:__ God __Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") __Affiliation:__ Hephaestus Familia Hephaestus is the head of the Hephaestus Familia. Hephaestus shows a strict and hardworking nature compared to her friend, Hestia, who was known as the lazy goddess. She is also known to care very much about her children. As a Goddess of Smithing, Hephaestus is a master at it. She was able to smith the Hestia Knife, a living weapon with Hestia''s falna, even without her arcanum.', '/uploads/images/c_142544.png'),
(80, 'Miach', 'ミアハ', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', '__Race:__ God __Height:__ 188 cm (6''2") __Affiliation:__ Miach Familia Miach is the head of the Miach Familia. Miach is a kind, compassionate, and friendly God, and has good relations with Bell and the members of the Hestia Familia, often handing out free potions to him. He has a habit of handing out free potions, causing financial problems for his Familia, and is referred to as a "natural gigolo" along with Takemikazuchi due to his friendliness toward women. He is also caring of his own Familia member Naaza Erisuis, taking out a huge loan from the Dian Cecht Familia to have a silver arm created for her.', '/uploads/images/c_142549.jpg'),
(80, 'Chigusa Hitachi', 'ヒタチ・千草', '配角', '', '__Race:__ Human __Height:__ 154 cm (5''1") __Affiliation:__ Takemikazuchi Familia __Level:__ 2 Chigusa Hitachi is a member of the Takemikazuchi Familia. Despite having a timid and shy personality, she is loyal to her Familia, especially Ouka who she has feelings for.', '/uploads/images/c_142553.jpg'),
(80, 'Zeus', 'ゼウス', '配角', 'Atsushi Ono', '__Race:__ God __Affiliation:__ Bell Cranel __Previous Affiliation:__ Zeus Familia Zeus is the adoptive grandfather of Bell Cranel and the former head of the Zeus Familia. Zeus was the head of one of the strongest Familia, which was weakened after their loss to the One-Eyed Black Dragon 15 years earlier, and he was subsequently forced out of Orario. He later became a farmer in a small village in the mountains north of the city, where he raised Bell, once protecting him from a Goblin attack. Zeus raised Bell until he decided to pretend he was dead for unknown reasons. He was later mentioned to have been shocked upon hearing that Bell had leveled up and asked Hermes to look after him. Zeus is a pervert as seen by his words to Bell about picking up girls and he once peeked on the Goddesses at the Divine Bathhouse. He acted as a kind father-like figure to Bell, taking care of him and telling him hero stories along with giving him handwritten storybooks on his birthdays of stories he had heard himself. Because of this, Zeus was the reason why Bell decided to become an adventurer.', '/uploads/images/c_142554.png'),
(80, 'Mikoto Yamato', 'ヤマト・命', '配角', 'Chinatsu Akasaki', '__Race:__ Human __Height:__ 157 cm (5''2") __Affiliation:__ Hestia Familia • Takemikazuchi Familia (temporary leave) __Level:__ 2 __Skills:__ Yatanokurogarasu • Yatanoshirogarasu __Magic:__ Futsunomitama __Weapon:__ Kotetsu • Chizan • Shunsan • Shakuya Yamato Mikoto is a member of the Hestia Familia and the Takemikazuchi Familia, having converted to aid the former during the War Game. Mikoto originally hails from the Far East. Her parents died several years after her birth. Tsukuyomi and [Takemikazuchi](https://anilist.co/character/142543/Takemikazuchi) took the young girl into their orphanage, where she lived for years, eventually joining the Takemikazuchi Familia. Mikoto and the other members of the Takemikazuchi Familia used to sneak [Sanjouno Haruhime](https://anilist.co/character/142551/Sanjouno-Haruhime) out of her mansion at night to play with her. They were eventually caught, damaging relations between Haruhime''s father and the shrine. They pursued their nightly fun regardless. Two years before the story, Mikoto and the other Takemikazuchi Familia members moved to Orario to earn money to help support the shrine. Mikoto has a serious and honorable personality, unwilling to use cowardly tactics even in an emergency, as shown through her disapproval of Pass Parading the monsters that were chasing them onto the Hestia Familia. She also has a softer side as she cares for the well-being of her friends and is fiercely loyal to them.', '/uploads/images/c_142923.jpg'),
(80, 'Anya Fromel', 'アーニャ・フローメル', '配角', 'Asuka Nishi', '__Race:__ Cat People __Height:__ 150 cm (4''11") __Affiliation:__ Hostess of Fertility __Level:__ 4 Anya Fromel is a waitress at the Hostess of Fertility. When she was one year old, Anya lost her parents and her home. Because of this, her brother Allen was forced to wander the ruins of a kingdom while protecting her. So it was for two years until they met Freya, who offered them to go with her, which they accepted. Sometime before Ais came to Orario, Mia partially left the Freya Familia to open the Hostess of Fertility, employing Anya there. Anya is shown to be a foolish person whose unthoughtful actions stand out. She is terrible at singing, enough to be referred to as a "disaster". Despite being somewhat of an airhead, she is loyal to her friends, such as when she was openly hostile to Hermes for mentioning Ryuu''s past, and when she helped the Elf by being Chloe''s opponent while she fought Lunoire. She used to act like a senior to Ryuu at work, though she failed miserably due to her unthoughtful actions, such as when she accidentally brought Lunoire coffee when she ordered tea. Even so, she refuses to give up, as shown when she repeatedly tried to touch Ryuu even though the Elf kept on swatting her away, at which point Ryuu thought she saw flames of resolve around her. However, she is reluctant to talk about her past, becoming startled when Ryuu asked her and immediately changed the subject. Anya is the younger sister of Allen Fromel. However, they have both cut ties with ea', '/uploads/images/c_143047.jpg'),
(80, 'Asfi Al Andromeda', 'アスフィ・アル・アンドロメダ', '配角', 'Ai Kayano', '__Race:__ Human __Height:__ 164 cm (5''5") __Affiliation:__ Hermes Familia __Level:__ 4 __Magic:__ Kalov Argol __Weapon:__ Canoval Dagger Asfi Al Andromeda is a member and the captain of the Hermes Familia. She is also one of the most famous item makers in Orario, known as Perseus. Asfi was the princess of an island nation that was stolen by a God. At some point, she was taken away by Hermes and became an adventurer and a member of his Familia. Asfi is serious and will follow Hermes'' orders. She is a hard worker that is often pushed around by Hermes. Welf states that she may come from royalty somewhere due to her behavior, and in truth, she is the princess of a maritime nation. (Source: Danmachi Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_143051.jpg'),
(80, 'Chloe Rollo', 'クロエ・ロロ', '配角', 'Aya Suzaki', '__Race:__ Cat People __Height:__ 158 cm (5''2") __Affiliation:__ Hostess of Fertility • Njord Familia __Level:__ 4 __Magic:__ Pheles Cruz __Weapon:__ Violetta Chloe Rollo is a waitress at the Hostess of Fertility pub and a former assassin known as Rollo as a member of the Njord Familia. Chloe was born to parents who were members of a Familia that acted as a criminal organization. From the moment she was born, she was taught different methods of assassination, and was praised when she properly utilized them. However, she began to dislike her Familia after her mother died while protecting her. Her Goddess agreed to let her leave, though she was ordered to carry out a number of tasks before leaving, including assassinating a Level 3 knight of the empire using only a knife. Despite the extreme difficulty of her tasks, she was successful, leveling up in the process. After leaving her Familia, she traveled around for a while, until she came to Orario around nine years before the story. While there, she failed her first mission, which was to assassinate Shakti Varma, barely escaping with her life, and began refusing jobs to kill first class adventurers. Eventually, after failing to kill a wanted Ryuu, she joined the Hostess of Fertility. Chloe is known to have a crafty side and often gambles, which her fellow employees give a cold shoulder to. She is loyal to her fellow Hostess of Fertility coworkers, such as when she was openly hostile to Hermes for mentioning Ryuu''s past. Despite b', '/uploads/images/c_143052.jpg'),
(80, 'Kashima  Ouka', 'カシマ・桜花', '配角', 'Kazuyuki Okitsu', '__Race:__ Human __Height:__ 190 cm (6''3") __Affiliation:__ Takemikazuchi Familia __Level:__ 2 __Weapon:__ Kougou Kashima Ouka is a member and captain of the Takemikazuchi Familia. Ouka is a strong and respected member of his familia. Being the leader, he often decides the course of action for his Familia members during dungeon trips. He is capable of instructing his companions and making harsh decisions in desperate situations. Despite his decisions, he shows deep care for his Familia due to them knowing each other from when they were children. Ouka is also headstrong and unafraid to express his thoughts to others, believing that he made the right decision in doing a Pass Parade. However, he later made up for it when he decided that he didn''t want to be a man who was all talk. (Source: Danmachi Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_143055.jpg'),
(80, 'Misha  Flott', 'ミィシャ・フロット', '配角', 'Chinami Hashimoto', '__Race:__ Human __Height:__ 150 cm (4''9") __Affiliation:__ Guild Misha Flott is a Guild worker and friend of Eina Tulle. Misha is a curious and slightly irresponsible girl. She likes teasing her friend, Eina, about her relationship with Bell; or any of her male relationships for that matter. Though she likes complaining, she still does her job; although whether it was done correctly or not is up for debate. (Source: Danmachi Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_143126.jpg'),
(80, 'Demeter', 'デメテル', '配角', 'Harumi Sakurai', '__Race:__ God __Height:__ 162 cm (5''4") __Affiliation:__ Demeter Familia Demeter is the head of the Demeter Familia. Demeter is a good natured Goddess that acts mature when talking to others whether they may be Gods or their children. She apparently can get carried away as she asked Lunoire not to praise her too much about her cooking. She is on good terms with other Gods like Hestia and enjoys teasing others as shown when she hugged Bell in front of her. She can be aware of the hidden motives of others, such as when she noticed Dionysus'' expression during the God''s banquet. Demeter also cares for her children, as she used to worry about Lunoire when she was a bounty hunter, and suggested for her work with the other members in the fields once she finished her work. (Source: Danmachi Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_159926.png'),
(80, 'Canoe Belway', 'カヌゥ・ベルウェイ', '配角', 'Taketora', '__Race:__ Raccoon __Height:__ 155 cm (5''1") __Affiliation:__ Soma Familia __Level:__ 1 __Weapon:__ Magic Sword An adventurer from the Soma Familia. Canoe was crafty and greedy. He often beat Lili and stole the money and items that she had collected. He also betrayed Ged Raish after they ambushed Lili in the Dungeon, causing his death when he tried to escape, only to be killed by the approaching Killer Ants. His greed ultimately led to his demise as he let loose the Minotaur Ottar had tamed. (Source: Danmachi Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_183244.jpg'),
(80, 'Ged Raish', 'ゲド・ライッシュ', '配角', 'Jun Fukushima', '__Race:__ Human __Age:__ Around 20 __Height:__ 177 cm (5''10") __Affiliation:__ Unknown Familia __Level:__ 1 Deceased A former member of the Soma Familia. Ged showed little concern or patience for anyone who slowed him down from completing a quest or killing monsters. This was evident through his attitude toward Lili, calling her useless and even threatening to use her as a decoy. (Source: Danmachi Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_183245.png'),
(80, 'Scott Olds', 'スコット・オールズ', '配角', 'Taku Yashiro', '__Race:__ Human __Level:__ 2 Scott Olds is one of Mord Latro''s companions. (Source: Danmachi Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_183246.png'),
(80, 'Bom Cornwall', 'ボム・コーンウォール', '配角', 'Kenta Sasa', '__Race:__ Spirit Bom Cornwall is the owner of the Gnome''s General Store. Bom used to buy Lili''s stolen goods even though he knew that she changed her appearance using Cinder Ella and didn''t report her. He later showed his kindness again when he agreed to hide Lili from the Soma Familia.', '/uploads/images/c_183247.jpg'),
(81, 'Souma Yukihira', '幸平創真', '主角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', '__Height:__ 171 cm He is the son of [Jouichirou Yukihira](https://anilist.co/character/77495) and, until it closed, worked at his father''s restaurant, Restaurant Yukihira. Souma fight his odds in the elite school to becoming the best chef in the world even with strong background discrimination of his academy. He is currently a student at Tootsuki Culinary Academy and a resident of Polar Star Dormitory. Souma is a rather energetic child who has the constant drive to move forward with his cooking, mostly due to his rivalry with his father. Due to his drive to move forward Souma is willing to try odd things with food including "Grilled Squid Tentacles Dressed in Peanut Butter," though these dishes usually don''t go over too well. It is because the will of Soma to try to move forward, his dish often considered as creative and innovative by some peers and lecturers; lead his rivalry with all the students in the Tootsuki Culinary Academy even rough. Through all this Souma maintains a laid back attitude towards just about everything but cooking. Souma can cook many different foods in many different styles, though he prefers what he calls "Yukihira Style," which is the cooking style which he learned from his father. Souma shows an immense capability for cooking and a special adaption with learning from his mistakes and improvising through learning from said mistakes. It is due to his creativity and also resourcefulness, Souma is able to create the same dish with different ways of cook', '/uploads/images/c_75216.jpg'),
(81, 'Erina Nakiri', '薙切えりな', '主角', 'Risa Taneda', '__Height:__ 162 cm One of the two main heroines in the manga, Erina is initially the primary antagonist of [Souma Yukihira](https://anilist.co/character/75216), until this develops into more of a friendship. Erina is the only daughter of [Azami Nakiri](https://anilist.co/character/156421) and an unnamed mother who is [Senzaemon](https://anilist.co/character/76028)''s biological daughter. Erina often detests whoever is considered "common" due to her regal pedigree and status within the Toutsuki organization. Her "God Tongue" can accurately describe the taste and composition of any food, and she gives harsh critiques to chefs and students alike. However, there have been rare occasions where she gives credit to chefs with skill. She had been promoted as the Elite Ten''s 10th seat as a middle-schooler.', '/uploads/images/c_75284.png'),
(81, 'Megumi Tadokoro', '田所恵', '主角', 'Minami Takahashi', '__Height:__ 154 cm __Cuisine Style:__ Hospitality Megumi is from a cold harbor town in the Tōhoku region and enrolled into Tōtosuki''s junior high program hoping to be able to help her family''s bed-and-breakfast the Shokei''en Inn. Because of her stage fright and shyness she performs poorly and causes her to rank at the bottom of her class. Megumi is clumsy and timid, thoughtful, kind and honest girl with polite manners. She is always looking out for others and is willing to assist them in any way she can. According to Gin Dōjima, Megumi''s greatest gift is her warm hospitality as she cooks. She highly idolizes her mother. Although Megumi is a capable chef, she does not fare well under pressure because she has stage fright. Because she is intimidated very easily, she makes simple mistakes when she cooks, causing many of her classmates to see her as a weak student. She is quick to panic when something goes awry and tends to over think situations when under pressure or stress, such as repeatedly packing and unpacking a suitcase to make sure she packed something, even though she did not need to pack a suitcase in the first place. ~!Megumi eventually even becomes the 10th seat of the Elite Ten Council of the Tōtsuki Culinary Academy after the Promotion Exams Arc.!~', '/uploads/images/c_76026.png'),
(81, 'Senzaemon Nakiri', '薙切仙左衛門', '配角', 'Banjou Ginga', 'Senzaemon is headmaster of Tōtsuki Academy and [Erina](https://anilist.co/character/75284)''s grandfather. Known as the "Gastric Godfather", he has the tendency of stripping his upper body when he eats a good dish. Despite his appearance and reputation, he is reasonable and gives accurate commentary and assessment for the food he tastes without being overly critical to the losers. ~!Many years previously, Senzaemon and Gin noticed Jōichirō Saiba''s critical condition at the start of a tournament, and took upon themselves some of the blame for pressuring Jōichirō into becoming mentally trapped in the creation of his dishes. Feeling Jōichirō''s talent was beyond the tasks of the academy, Senzaemon freed his former student to travel abroad and learn independently, a proposal Jōichirō happily accepted, as well as Gin whom Senzaemon offered him as the head of resort planner as a mean to atone their sins to ensure no one will share a similar fate as what happened to Joichiro before. For a period thereafter, Senzaemon hired Jōichirō as his private chef.!~ ~!Six years ago, Senzaemon exiled his son-in-law, Azami, for abusing Erina with brainwashing, and turns out even worst and dangerous to rule the academy than Joichiro''s previous ill-fate. Senzaemon became Erina''s legal guardian and had Azami''s name struck from the Tōtsuki records. However, in the year Erina enrolls in the academy, Azami returns and a majority of the Elite Ten vote to support Azami as headmaster, replacing Senzaemon. I', '/uploads/images/c_76028.png'),
(81, 'Fumio Daimidou', '大御堂ふみ緒', '配角', 'Mari Yokoo', 'She is the warden and guardian of Polar Star Dormitory.', '/uploads/images/c_77489.jpg'),
(81, 'Roland Chapelle', 'ローランド・シャペル', '配角', 'Yuu Mizushima', 'Roland Chapelle (Rōran Shaperu) is one of the stern lecturer in the Totsuki Culinary Academy, who was infamous for his extreme discipline. Earned the nickname as the Chef Who Never Smiles, Chapelle takes student''s performance and presentation in a serious matter which every presentations counts as if it is their conduct in their future careers, not just in French cuisine but also others involves cookery. Whoever failed to reach his eligible standard shall faced his worst judgment upon them, making this veteran lecturer a judge, jury and even executioner in this prestige academy. He always has been this strict until Yukihira Soma, the Yukihira transfer student''s resourceful and innovative cooking that made him smile for the first time with the impression Soma''s version of Boeuf Bourguignon; making Soma is the first (and the only) rookie chef intrigued by this iron heart veteran. As the professional lecturer with French Cuisine is part of his forte and pride, Chapelle is very serious upon his native dish and he is not tolerate any fools (student or anyone alike) making fun of it. It is also believed that rigid discipline meant 100% success, Chapelle has a concept that any student whom didn''t pass with the flying colors are considered people who failed to prove their worth. With his grumpy and no-nonsense attitude combined, Chapelle''s strict discipline is so extreme that every students feared him as his judgement meant absolute end should the requirement didn''t meet his expectat', '/uploads/images/c_77491.png'),
(81, 'Jouichirou Yukihira', '幸平城一郎', '配角', 'Rikiya Koyama', 'The father of Sōma Yukihira, and owner of the diner Yukihira in the Sumire Shopping District. His passion for cooking knows no bounds and his skill is world-class. As the sole parental-figure and family member in Sōma''s life, he is a mentor, teacher, and rival to his son. Like Sōma, Jōichirō is laid-back but professional and has a serious side that emerges when he is cooking. The two share the same habit of creating horrible experimental dishes. Jōichirō is supportive of his son but does occasionally like to see Sōma stressed and frustrated by challenging him to many cook-offs – always ending in Jōichirō''s victory – to show him how much he has to grow. He left home to work abroad and sent his son to Tōtsuki Academy, telling Sōma that he needs to succeed in Tōtsuki if he ever wants to surpass him.', '/uploads/images/c_77495.png'),
(81, 'Kiyoshi Goudabayashi', 'ごうだばやしきよし', '配角', 'Kenji Nomura', 'Kiyoshi Gōdabayashi is a 91st Generation student of Tōtsuki Culinary Academy. He was the 76th president of the Chan RS before it was disbanded and destroyed as a result of a loss in a Shokugeki against Erina Nakiri.', '/uploads/images/c_78473.jpg'),
(81, 'Satoshi Isshiki', '一色慧', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', 'He is a student at Totsuki Culinary Academy, a resident of Polar Star Dormitory and the current 7th seat of the Elite Ten Council. Aside from that, Satoshi''s position as one of the Elite 10 also promote a strong determination for his kouhai(junior),Yukihira Soma to drive his dream to become one of the 10 seat and could be a potential challenge for Soma due to his natural cooking abilities.', '/uploads/images/c_78475.png'),
(81, 'Ikumi Mito', '水戸郁魅', '配角', 'Shizuka Ishigami', 'She is one of the student of Tootsuki Culinary Academy whom is also a former rival to Yukihira Soma. As the sole successor of the meat culinary expert of the Mito family for abundance knowledge about the meat culinary (especially beef and donburi), Ikumi is responsible to hold the pride of her family''s name and like any other students in Tootsuki Culinary Academy, Ikumi is extremely prejudice upon the society classes and use high class ingredient to make a high standard dish. It is said that Ikumi''s rigid family rules and regulations had made her cooking skill more elegant and grace like playing piano. Using all graces of cooking by using the high grade materials as well as expensive, Ikumi can almost made the dish as elegant as it look to impressed her clients.', '/uploads/images/c_78935.png'),
(81, 'Ryouko Sakaki', '榊涼子', '配角', 'Ai Kayano', 'Ryouko is gentle and kind, responding to the eccentrics of the other Polar Star residents in a level-headed manner and comforting the other students when they are troubled. Ryōko''s specialty is fermented foods due to her parents owning a well-known fermented-goods shop, and she maintains a workshop near the dorms to produce her own ingredients. She also keeps a bottle of "fermented rice drink" that she would sometimes bring out during parties and celebrations, which [Souma](https://anilist.co/character/75216/Yukihira-Souma) suspects is illegally brewed sake. ~!During the Autumn Elections, she presented a "curry soy-natto rice" using charcoal-fermented natto and homemade rice-sauce fermented with koji. The dish garnered praise from the judges, who suddenly felt as if they were in a festival due to the quintessentially Japanese and festive taste of the dish. She ultimately took 7th place in her block.!~', '/uploads/images/c_85727.png'),
(81, 'Yuuki Yoshino', '吉野悠姫', '配角', 'Maaya Uchida', 'She is a student at Tōtsuki Culinary Academy and a resident of Polar Star Dormitory. She and the other resident students from his hostel befriended with their fellow roommate Yukihira Soma and also aware to Soma''s talent as one of the finest and unique of all. She is also a roommate and friend to her fellow student, Tadokoro Megumi and Sakaki Ryoko. Yuki is more focus on animal meat as her main cuisine. Unlike Ikumi, the meat master in any meat culinary, Yuki often used the animal hunted game from domestic poultry to any other animals (like rabbits and deer) as her main theme. Yuki''s cutting skill could be yet', '/uploads/images/c_85773.jpg'),
(81, 'Shun Ibusaki', '伊武崎峻', '配角', 'Taishi Murata', 'Shun is presumably known his senior, Isshiki Satoshi better than anyone else as he was stayed much longer than the rest of the Polar Star Gang. Unlike his passionate room mates, Shun is very realistic on the terms and very serious upon making his style in perfection. Shun is also a quiet student who prefer speak only whenever is considered as crucial by many. It is also once claimed that he is a calculative chef whose choose to act wisely over hesitation.', '/uploads/images/c_85775.png'),
(81, 'Takumi Aldini', 'タクミ・アルディーニ ', '配角', 'Natsuki Hanae', '__Height:__ 168 cm Takumi is the oldest nephew of the owner of the Trattoria Aldini, a trattoria (family-style restaurant) located in Florence, Italy. He is half-Japanese but, unlike his brother [Isami](https://anilist.co/character/85785/Aldini-Isami), appears more European – with blond hair and blue eyes – and is noted as being extremely handsome, having fan clubs in Toutsuki Academy and his hometown. He enrolled in Tōtsuki at the behest of his uncle, taking with him his mezzaluna (two-handed knife) and a bottle of homemade olive oil as a good luck charm. His specialty is Italian cuisine, although many professional chefs noted that he has a broad vision; like [Souma](https://anilist.co/character/75216/Yukihira-Souma), he will incorporate ingredients and methods from other culinary styles to create inventive dishes, and can modify his recipes while cooking. He is very kind and supportive of his less-skilled brother, to the point of risking his pride to defend Isami''s honor. Takumi has a fierce (and somewhat one-sided) rivalry with Sōma. Takumi sees Sōma as someone similar to himself – both having grown-up working at small family restaurants – and a worthy rival, and jumps at any chance to compete with him. He frequently tries to challenge Sōma to informal cooking challenges (usually leading to an embarrassing situation for himself), hoping to one day defeat Sōma in a formal Shokugeki. Despite their rivalry, both he and Sōma greatly respect each other, and likely view each oth', '/uploads/images/c_85777.jpg'),
(81, 'Hinako Inui', '乾日向子', '配角', 'Mamiko Noto', 'One of the graduated students from Tootsuki Culinary Academy who turned professional, she is one of the respected legends of both her former school and alumni, among the few students who successfully graduated academy. Like most of the 10 alumni, Inui took the quality of the food very serious for it''s freshness as well as. Fame for her nickname as the Mist Queen during her admission in the academy, Inui is able to know the quality of the food just by her nibble before she could bite into her mouth. With this, she can easily tell of the food is good or bad by just putting the food on her lips before finally eating them. Behind her mature, stern and professional personality however, Inui may be childish and rather whenever she confused of either decision which she could made. Considered as a joke member of all alumni, Inui actually make several jokes to cheer her peers. Inui''s cooking style would preferred to the Japanese traditional style/ known as Washi. (Source: Shokugeki no Souma Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_85779.png'),
(81, 'Koujirou Shinomiya', '四宮小次郎', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', 'Owner of a French cuisine restaurant called Shino''s, Kojirou was a student of the 79th generation and held the first seat of the Elite Ten. He is commonly seen sporting glasses and red hair. Known as the "Legumes Magician", Kojirou was convinced he was going to be successful in France with his French–Japanese fusion restaurant, Shino''s. However, his French staff refused to follow his recipes, even sabotaging his dishes. Facing financial ruin, he hardened himself emotionally and fired anyone who questioned his skills in the kitchen. Although this allowed him to reach the top, his proud and stubborn refusal to make exceptions resulted in his skills stagnating over the years. ~!Kojirou returns to Toutsuki as a guest teacher, and "fires" Megumi for altering his recipe despite there being an insufficient quantity of suitable ingredients. He threatens to do the same to Souma for coming to her defense, leading Souma to challenge him to an unofficial Shokugeki. During this match, Shinomiya makes a technically perfect dish that is the unanimous winner. However, Gin gives a bonus vote for Megumi''s dish, prompting Shinomiya to try it and admit that her flexible cooking style suits the tastes of the customer. Shinomiya is reminded of his mother''s kindness, and taking this to heart lets Megumi pass.!~ ~!Kojirou reappears in the story when Souma is assigned as a stagiaire (intern) at his new restaurant, Shino''s Tokyo. His personality has noticeably softened since their last encounter, and ', '/uploads/images/c_85781.jpg'),
(81, 'Gin Doujima', '堂島銀', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', 'Graduated from Tootsuki Culinary Academy, he is one of the respected legends of both his former school and Tootsuki Academy Alumni that is among the few who successfully graduated his academy with flying colors, thus became one of the proficient members of Tootsuki Resort as his graduation. As a living legend, Doujima is skillful in both culinary and board administration due to his talents in both culinary and managements that he handle the kitchen solo without the assistance of any chef around him. It is due to his professional discipline and tenacity, he is both respected and feared by many students and lecturers alike in his former academy. As the legend by the students of the Tootsuki Culinary Academy, Doujima is believed to possesses all styles of cooking to create much unique cuisine in different way. Usually handle the kitchen solo, Doujima has no problem to make 100 different meals thanks to his vast knowledge of ingredients as well of the varieties of cuisine. (Source: Shokugeki no Souma Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_85783.png'),
(81, 'Isami Aldini', 'イサミ・アルディーニ', '配角', 'Yuuki Ono', 'Isami is Takumi''s brother, and the younger nephew of the owner of Trattoria Aldini. Unlike his brother, he has more of a Japanese appearance, with black hair and sharp eyes. Isami is originally shown to be overweight, with his eyes and mouth drawn in a simple fashion, although he briefly became much thinner during the Autumn Election preliminaries. Like Isami, he enrolled in Tōtsuki to hone his skills at the behest of their uncle. Although an equally talented chef, Isami is shown to be less sophisticated than his brother. He was scolded for trying to (and failing to) revise a dish that Takumi had made during their time in the trattoria, and constantly sought to be praised for his cooking like Takumi. Though Isami is supportive of his brother, he does aim to eventually surpass him as a cook. Nonetheless, the brothers are very close. ~!At the Autumn Election, he presented a tomato-curry calzone that was praised by the judges. He aimed to surpass his brother''s score with the dish, but ultimately finished 5th in his block. He tried to support Takumi in his quarter-finals match against Subaru Mimasaka, and was devastated when Takumi lost to his own dish. He and Takumi opened a booth during the Moon Banquet Festival, naming it a branch of Trattoria Aldini, and gained first place in sales in their area. He is targeted as a rebel by the Azami Administration''s Promotional Exams, defeated by Eishi on the third exam and expelled.!~ Isami and Takumi are featured in the Shokugeki no Soma ', '/uploads/images/c_85785.png'),
(81, 'Fuyumi Mizuhara', '水原冬美', '配角', 'Ayako Kawasumi', 'Italian restaurant "Ristorante F" chef. Withdrawn basically cynical personality.', '/uploads/images/c_85787.png'),
(81, 'Hitoshi Seikimori', '関守平', '配角', 'Junji Majima', 'Hitoshi Sekimori is a 78th Generation Tōtsuki Academy Alumnus. He is the owner and head chef of the sushi restaurant, Ginza Hinowa.', '/uploads/images/c_85789.png'),
(81, 'Goutoda Donato', 'ドナート梧桐田', '配角', 'Takayuki Kondou', 'Donato Gotōda is an 80th Generation Tōtsuki Academy Alumnus. He is the owner and head chef of the Auberge, Tesoro.', '/uploads/images/c_85793.jpg'),
(81, 'Shingo Andou', '安東伸吾', '配角', 'Eiji Takemoto', 'Shingo Andō is one of the minor characters in the manga series and also one of 5 guest judges for the B Block Preliminary Round. Reputed for his silent yet serious personality, this food critic is infamous for the cruel yet truthful comments that will spell doom to any unlucky restaurant.', '/uploads/images/c_88720.jpg'),
(81, 'Zenji Marui', '丸井善二', '配角', 'Yuusuke Kobayashi', 'He is a student at Totsuki Culinary Academyand a resident of Polar Star Dormitory. he and the other resident students from this hostel befriended with their fellow roommate/kouhai, Yukihira Soma whom also seen the amazing skill of the freshman. It is due to he rarely cooks, Zenji is considered as the weakest chef among the Polar Star Gang despite his brains has seemly possessed with infinite knowledge about cooking and black-&-white documents.', '/uploads/images/c_88721.png'),
(81, 'Alice Nakiri', '薙切アリス', '配角', 'Chinatsu Akasaki', 'Alice Nakiri is a 92nd Tōtsuki Generation student and [Erina Nakiri](https://anilist.co/character/75284/Nakiri-Erina)''s cousin, whose cooking style is specialized in Molecular Gastronomy. Unlike her cousin though, Alice is much more friendly and cheery. She even will talk to her rivals casually, sometimes merely to poke fun at them, something she inherited from her mother. She is also a modern girl, eager to talk about love and gossip, even with the incredibly socially dense Erina. She is also very cunning, able to manipulate Erina using reverse psychology to keep her at a local public pool despite the latter''s initial disgust at the location. She is quite bossy with [Ryō](https://anilist.co/character/88972/Kurokiba-Ryou), usually ordering him to do nearly everything for her. She tends to overreact when she is unhappy, throwing fits or snapping back at people. However, most of these are temporary and she will quickly return to normal in a few minutes.', '/uploads/images/c_88956.png'),
(81, 'Ryou Kurokiba', '黒木場リョウ', '配角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', 'Ryou Kurokiba is a 92nd Toutsuki Generation Student and Alice Nakiri''s aide. Generally lazy and gloomy, Ryou''s personality drastically shifts once he puts on his bandana, becoming aggressive, short-tempered, and brash. He grew up in a port town in Denmark, where he became the head chef of a pub due to his commanding personality and great skill. Due to his heritage, he is an expert in seafood and he can judge the quality of any and all seafood with only a glance. Mainly seen to be beside Alice Nakiri and has known her since childhood.', '/uploads/images/c_88972.png'),
(81, 'Eizan Etsuya', '枝津也叡山', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', 'He is a 91st Toutsuki Generation student of Toutsuki Culinary Academy and the current 9th Seat of the Elite Ten Council. He is known as the Alquimista aka "The Alchemist".', '/uploads/images/c_89210.jpg'),
(81, 'Akira Hayama', '葉山アキラ', '配角', 'Mutsumi Tamura', 'An assistant of Professor [Jun Shiomi](https://anilist.co/character/144632/Shiomi-Jun), Akira comes from overseas; they met when he was an orphaned child and warned her about adultered spices in a market (presumably in India). Jun recognized the dormant talent in him and brought him back to Japan, where he was adopted by her teacher, Hayama. Akira quickly learned Japanese and studied spices and aroma under Shiomi. Jun became a mother figure for him, and his motivation to succeed at cooking stems from wanting to give something back to Jun. Akira specializes in curry dishes, with a wide knowledge of spices and aroma. He is a tall and handsome man with tanned skin and silver hair. Like [Sōma](https://anilist.co/character/75216/Yukihira-Souma), he aims to be at the top of the Elite Ten. His nose is very sharp when it comes to spices, capable of identifying ingredients and grade of cooking by the first smell, considered a worthy match of Erina''s God''s Tongue and being identified as an "Aroma Master". Although Jun and Akira are both experts in spices, she uses theoretical knowledge while he depends on his sense of smell. In contrast to Jun''s naive, ditzy, easily angered and dependent persona, Akira is mature, reliable, street smart, cool and down-to-earth.', '/uploads/images/c_122706.jpg'),
(81, 'Hisako Arato', '新戸緋沙子', '配角', 'Saori Oonishi', 'Erina''s secretary and close friend, Hisako specializes in medicinal-based dishes. She thinks of Erina as the best, that only she could be Erina''s number two and nobody could ever get past her to Erina''s level.', '/uploads/images/c_122708.jpg'),
(81, 'Nao Sadatsuka', '貞塚ナオ', '配角', 'Saori Gotou', 'Nao Sadatsuka is a 92nd Tootsuki Generation student of Tootsuki Culinary Academy. Nao holds a deep harboring affection towards Erina Nakiri. Nao would do anything to get close to Erina including sending her 30 letters daily or watching her from afar using binoculars.', '/uploads/images/c_140802.jpg'),
(81, 'Jun Shiomi', '汐見潤', '配角', 'Mikako Komatsu', 'Shiomi is a 74th Generation Toutsuki Academy Alumnus and a former resident of the Polar Star Dormitory. She is one of the lecturers in Tootsuki Culinary Academy as well as the professor of the Shiomi Seminar. Shiomi Jun is leagal guardian of Hayama Akira. Jun is the youngest lecturer in the academy, but is actually older than she physically appears. Despite the fact that she in her 30s, she is shorter than both Souma and Megumi and has a noticeably youthful face, causing both Souma and Megumi to mistake her as a middle school student of the academy.', '/uploads/images/c_144632.jpg'),
(81, 'Yaeko Minegasaki', '峰ヶ崎八重子', '配角', 'Izumi Chiba', 'Yaeko is an urban life planner and the first, albeit minor, antagonist of Shokugeki no Soma. She is a ruthless business woman who only cares about her job and she is willing to resort to dirty tactics to ensure that she has her way. Because of her job and callous behavior, she disregards many family-owned businesses, such as Restaurant Yukihira.', '/uploads/images/c_158237.jpg'),
(81, 'Miyoko Houjou', '北条美代子', '配角', 'Asami Seto', 'A 92nd Totsuki Generation student. She is also the heiress to her family restaurant.', '/uploads/images/c_162355.png'),
(81, 'Shouji  Satou ', '佐藤昭二', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', 'Shōji Satō is a 92nd Tōtsuki Generation student and a resident of Polar Star Dormitory.', '/uploads/images/c_181780.png'),
(81, 'Daigo  Aoki ', '青木大吾', '配角', 'Junichi Yanagita', 'Daigo Aoki is a 92nd Tōtsuki Generation student and a resident of Polar Star Dormitory.', '/uploads/images/c_181782.png'),
(81, 'Aki Koganei', '小金井亞紀', '配角', 'Yukiyo Fujii', 'Aki Koganei is a high school student and a close friend of Mayumi Kurase.', '/uploads/images/c_198857.jpg'),
(81, 'Kinu Nakamozu', '中百舌鳥きぬ', '配角', 'Aya Hisakawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_198858.jpg'),
(81, 'Tokuzou', '徳蔵', '配角', 'Kan Tanaka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_198859.jpg'),
(81, 'Kanichi Konishi', '小西寛一', '配角', 'Shinji Kawada', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_203140.png'),
(81, 'Urara Kawashima', '川島麗', '配角', 'Rina Hidaka', 'Urara is a 92nd Toutsuki Generation student and a popular idol at Toutsuki Culinary Academy. She is often an emcee for many of the academy''s grand events.', '/uploads/images/c_219135.jpg'),
(81, 'Osaji Kita', '喜田修治', '配角', 'Taketora', 'He was one of the 5 guest judges of Block "B" for the 43rd Annual Tōtsuki Autumn Election. A renowned entrepreneur and a founder of his own Gastronomy Club, Osaji''s reputation in both his wealth and influence has made him a celebrity in the cooking industry.', '/uploads/images/c_219632.jpg'),
(81, 'Natsume Sendawara', '千俵なつめ', '配角', 'Youko Hikasa', 'Natsume Sendawara is one of the heads of the Haubi Food Corporation along with her twin sister, Orie Sendawara, and one of the five judges of Block A in the 43rd Annual Tōtsuki Autumn Election Preliminaries', '/uploads/images/c_219633.jpg'),
(81, 'Orie Sendawara', '千俵 おりえ', '配角', 'Youko Hikasa', 'Orie Sendawara is one of the heads of the Haubi Food Cooperation along with her twin sister, Natsume Sendawara, and was one of the five judges of the B Block in the 43rd Annual Tōtsuki Autumn Election.', '/uploads/images/c_219634.jpg'),
(81, 'Yua Sasaki', '佐々木由愛', '配角', 'Rina Hidaka', 'A 92nd Tōtsuki Generation student. Like her fellow schoolmate, Urara Kawashima, she is also an MC for hosting important events occurring around and within Tōtsuki Culinary Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_219665.jpg'),
(81, 'Mayumi Kurase', '倉瀬真由美', '配角', 'Ai Kakuma', 'Mayumi Kurase is Sōma Yukihira''s close friend and one of his former classmates from kindergarten to middle school.', '/uploads/images/c_219696.png'),
(81, 'Yuuya Tomita', '富田友哉', '配角', 'Shinji Kawada', 'Yūya Tomita is the chairman of the Sumiredōri Shopping District and the 2nd generation owner of Tomitaya.', '/uploads/images/c_219697.png'),
(81, 'Shigeno Kuraki', '蔵木 滋乃', '配角', 'Naomi Shindou', 'Shigeno Kuraki is one of the three judges who appeared in Sōma Yukihira''s Shokugeki against Ikumi Mito and she is also the president of the traditional Japanese restaurant called Kuraki.', '/uploads/images/c_219951.png'),
(81, 'Tadokoro no Haha', '田所の母', '配角', 'Tomo Muranaka', 'The mother of [Tadokoro Megumi](https://anilist.co/character/76026/Megumi-Tadokoro).', '/uploads/images/c_220280.jpg'),
(81, 'Shigenoshin Kouda', '香田茂之進', '配角', 'Hideyuki Umezu', 'Shigenoshin Kouda is a gourmet critique and one of the five judges of Block A in the 43rd Annual Tōtsuki Autumn Election.', '/uploads/images/c_220281.jpg'),
(81, 'Madoka Enomoto', '榎本円', '配角', 'Saori Oonishi', 'Madoka Enomoto is a 92nd Tōtsuki Generation student and a member of the Miyazato Seminar. She adores [Marui](https://anilist.co/character/88721/Zenji-Marui).', '/uploads/images/c_220282.png'),
(81, 'Tokihiko Sakuma', '佐久間時彦', '配角', 'Tooru Ookawa', 'Tokihiko Sakuma is the Maître d''hôtel of the Tōtsuki Resort and one of the judges during the Egg Breakfast Buffet Challenge at the Tōtsuki Friendship and Rapport Training Camp.', '/uploads/images/c_220283.png'),
(81, 'Yoshiaki Nikaidou', '二楷堂佳明', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', 'Yoshiaki Nikaidō is one of the students who attempted to enter Tōtsuki Culinary Academy alongside Sōma Yukihira. His family owns an unnamed French restaurant.', '/uploads/images/c_220284.png'),
(81, 'Hiromi Sena', '瀬名博巳', '配角', 'Masaya Matsukaze', 'Hiromi Sena is the Vice Chef De Cuisine, Sous Chef to Gin Dōjima at Tōtsuki Resort, and a minor character of the series.', '/uploads/images/c_220285.png'),
(81, 'Takao Miyazato', '宮里隆夫', '配角', 'Ryuuichi Kijima', 'Takao Miyazato is one of the lecturers in Tōtsuki Culinary Academy as well as the professor of the Miyazato Seminar. He is among the few who recognizes Zenji Marui''s true talent behind his frail endurance.', '/uploads/images/c_220286.png'),
(81, 'Makito Minatozaka', '港坂巻人', '配角', 'Hiroshi Yanaka', 'Makito Minatozaka is an exclusive producer of a popular television program called Is That A Kitchen?. He is also one of the five judges in Block A in the 43rd Annual Tōtsuki Autumn Election', '/uploads/images/c_220287.png'),
(81, 'Takumi Ishiwatari', '石渡拓己', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', 'Takumi Ishiwatari is a 92nd Tōtsuki Generation student.', '/uploads/images/c_220288.png'),
(81, 'Yoshiki Bitou', '尾藤良樹', '配角', 'Hiromichi Tezuka', 'Yoshiki Bitou is a Japanese black beef critic and one of the three judges involved in Sōma Yukihira''s Shokugeki against Ikumi Mito.', '/uploads/images/c_220289.png'),
(81, 'Katsunori Okamoto', '岡本克典', '配角', 'Ikuji Nose', 'Katsunori Okamoto is the television producer of First-Class Gluttons, and one of the three judges involved in Sōma Yukihira''s Shokugeki against Ikumi Mito.', '/uploads/images/c_220290.png'),
(81, 'Kyuusaku', '久作', '配角', 'Yutaka Aoyama', 'Kyūsaku is the owner of Natural Cheese''s Kyūsaku, a partner of the Tōtsuki Culinary Academy Manufacturer Division, and a food supplier to Tōtsuki Resort.', '/uploads/images/c_221491.png'),
(81, 'Akari Miyano', '宮野 朱里', '配角', 'Marika Kouno', 'Akari Miyano was a guest at the Tōtsuki Resort and participated as a judge for the breakfast buffet task for the 92nd Tōtsuki Generation''s Tōtsuki Friendship and Rapport Training Camp.', '/uploads/images/c_221492.png'),
(81, 'Kousuke', '耕助', '配角', 'Kouichi Souma', 'Kōsuke is the owner of Green Bean''s Kōsuke, a partner of the Tōtsuki Culinary Academy Manufacturer Division, and a food supplier to Tōtsuki Resort.', '/uploads/images/c_221493.png'),
(81, 'McFly', 'マク・フライ', '配角', 'Itaru Yamamoto', 'McFly is a doctor and one of Jōichirō Yukihira''s customers abroad.', '/uploads/images/c_221494.png'),
(82, 'Light Yagami', '夜神月', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5''10") Light is a third year high school student (12th Grade) at Daikoku Private Academy who also attends supplemental classes at Gamou Prep Academy in the beginning of the story. Light has a father, [Soichiro Yagami](https://anilist.co/character/1927/Yagami-Souichirou), who is the head of the Police Force. Light also has a mother, [Sachiko Yagami](https://anilist.co/character/14735/Yagami-Sachiko), and a younger sister, [Sayu Yagami](https://anilist.co/character/8135/Yagami-Sayu). In Spring 2004, he becomes a first-year student (freshman) at To-Oh University and gets one of the top scores of its entrance exam. Nicknamed "Kira", he uses the Death Note to create his ideal world of justice under him; its new God. Though he looks frail, Light is an extremely athletic person, with an aptitude to find an opponent''s weak point. He is a genius, which adds to his notion that only he is fit to judge humanity and steer it on a proper moral course.', '/uploads/images/c_80.png'),
(82, 'Decim', 'デキム', '主角', 'Tomoaki Maeno', 'Decim is the bartender of Quindecim and also the arbiter of floor 15. His faction deals with people who have died at the same time. He can create threads and use them to restrict rude customers from moving, or use them to hang things. They are strong enough to stop a person in their tracks and swing them hard against the wall.', '/uploads/images/c_81853.jpg'),
(82, 'Kurokami no Onna', '黒髪の女', '主角', 'Asami Seto', '__Height:__ 170 cm She is an amnesiac woman taken in by [Nona](https://anilist.co/character/88681/Nona) to Quindecim and hired as [Decim](https://anilist.co/character/81853/Decim)''s assistant. When she first awoke, she appeared to be an innocent but skeptical woman. However, once she became accustomed to living in Quindecim, she acted as a strong-willed woman who always spoke her mind whenever she felt it was necessary. She is not afraid to disagree with Decim if she believes he is wrong.', '/uploads/images/c_82037.jpg'),
(82, 'Roujin', '老人', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_82039.jpg'),
(82, 'Nona', 'ノーナ', '主角', 'Rumi Ookubo', 'Nona is the manager of the Arbiter system, as well as the bartender of Nona Ginta located on the ninetieth floor. She is the boss of Decim, Ginti, Clavis, along with the rest of the other arbiters.', '/uploads/images/c_88681.jpg'),
(82, 'Ginti', 'ギンティ', '主角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', 'Ginti is bartender of a bar named Viginti, which is located on the 20th floor. (Source: Death Parade Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_88683.jpg'),
(82, 'Clavis', 'クラヴィス', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', 'He is an elevator operator in the arbiter system, as well as a personal valet to Nona. His task is to transport arbiters and guests between floors. Also, he smiles a lot.', '/uploads/images/c_88780.jpg'),
(82, 'Castra', 'カストラ', '配角', 'Ryouka Yuzuki', 'She is an organization clerk who measures coefficients of the dead and classifies them in various fields in order to determine their bar destination.', '/uploads/images/c_88789.jpg'),
(82, 'Oculus', 'オクルス', '配角', 'Tesshou Genda', 'Occulus is the founder of the post-death arbitration system. He spends most of his time playing billiards, especially with Nona, whose presence he appreciates for discussion. Oculus is strictly opposed to the idea that referees can have human feelings because he says "humans cannot judge humans." The lotus flower under his chin can be enlarged, allowing him to see through the memories of the people he "absorbs" with.', '/uploads/images/c_88790.jpg'),
(82, 'Quin', 'クイーン', '配角', 'Ryouko Shiraishi', 'Quin works in the information processing section, and is now in charge of sending the “memories of the dead” to arbiters. She used to work as an arbiter and was the owner of Quindecim prior to Decim''s appointment there.', '/uploads/images/c_122637.jpg'),
(82, 'Harada', '原田', '配角', 'Mamoru Miyano', 'One of the main dancers in Cross Heart Attack. He is a great dancer and a womanizer. ~!In the living world, Harada dated a fan of his named Kana. He broke up with Kana and left her devastated. When Kana explained how terrible she felt when he broke up with her, Harada laughed and apologized. This led to Kana committing suicide. It is later revealed that he was killed by Kana''s sister with a bomb as revenge for Kana''s death. It is implied that Harada and Kana''s sister slept together before he was killed by her.!~', '/uploads/images/c_122638.jpg'),
(82, 'Mayu Arita', '有田マユ', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', 'Mayu is a student who is a huge fan of the idol group C.H.A, of which Harada is a member. She is a happy go lucky girl who is also a bit of a klutz. Her death was what would be called a freak accident, where while entering the bath she slipped on a bar of soap lying on the floor, hit her head and died instantly.', '/uploads/images/c_122639.jpg'),
(82, 'Jirou', '次郎', '配角', 'Megumi Matsumoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_134077.jpg'),
(82, 'Chiyuki no Haha', '知幸の母', '配角', 'Miki Itou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_158220.jpg'),
(82, 'Fujii', '藤井', '配角', 'Hiroki Yasumoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_158229.jpg'),
(82, 'Kana', 'カナ', '配角', 'Izumi Chiba', 'She previously dated Harada, the member of the boy group C.H.A. After they ended their relationship, she became hysterical about how Harada was too cheerful about it. She later committed suicide because of their breakup.', '/uploads/images/c_158230.png'),
(82, 'Tria', 'トリア', '配角', 'Izumi Chiba', 'Arbiter who is employed on an unknown floor.', '/uploads/images/c_158231.png'),
(82, 'Takashi', 'たかし', '配角', 'Kazuya Nakai', '~!It is later realized that the reason for their death was because of Takashi''s jealousy. Early in the game, he finds out that Machiko is pregnant, only to figure out later that it isn''t his and that she was having an affair. He then proceeds to try attacking Machiko with one of the darts, but is stopped by Decim. He then passes out and gets sent back into the elevators; there, he is sent to be reincarnated.!~', '/uploads/images/c_158452.png'),
(82, 'Tateishi no Chichioya', '洋介の父親', '配角', 'Masayoshi Sugawara', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_158477.png'),
(82, 'Yousuke Tateishi', '立石洋介', '配角', 'Masakazu Morita', 'Hikikomori who works part time as a security guard, he spends most of his free time locked up in his room where he does nothing but read manga, watch anime and play games. His parents'' divorced when he was still child left him devastated and depressed that he has been a loner ever since. Though his father has remarried, he is very hostile towards his stepmother despite her attempts to become close to him. He met Misaki in Quindecim, where both of them are forced to play an arcade game that will decide their fates. He later remembers that he committed suicide after jumping off several stories from his apartment complex. The last thing he saw before dying was his stepmother, who was crying and begging him to hold on as they drove to the hospital in the back of an ambulance.', '/uploads/images/c_158518.jpg'),
(82, 'Tateishi no Mamahaha', '洋介の継母', '配角', 'Yasuyo Tomita', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_158520.png'),
(82, 'Mai Takada', '高田舞', '配角', 'Mao Ichimichi', 'Part time attendant at a local bowling alley where Miura and his friends frequent. ~!She found herself at Quindecim where she was later joined by Miura. They were forced to play a game of bowling that would decide their fate. During the game, the two of them realized that they had died in a bus accident. She starts to remember the time when she was with with Miura and Chisato during their childhood days. At first she had her memories are confused, believing that she was Chisato; however, it was revealed that she had plastic surgery to look like Chisato. Little is know as what their fate has become, but is was strongly implied that the two were to be reincarnated.!~', '/uploads/images/c_158572.png'),
(82, 'Lisa', 'リサ', '配角', 'Misa Katou', 'Kana''s sister. She dated Harada in order to decieve him and avenge her sister''s suicide. Lisa murders Harada by planting a bomb in his room while he slept.', '/uploads/images/c_158623.png'),
(82, 'Machiko', '真智子', '配角', 'Ayako Kawasumi', 'Machiko along with her husband Takashi take part in the death game of darts. ~!It is later found out that she was having an affair and carrying the baby of her boyfriend, which leads to Takashi trying to attack her with a dart. After Takashi passes out, Machiko re-enters one of the elevators which takes her to the void. However, in Onna''s opinion, the baby she carries actually belongs to Takashi and she acted guilty because she truly loves the latter, where later on Decim realizing that he made a mistake but it was too late for any rectification.!~', '/uploads/images/c_158682.png'),
(82, 'Shigeru Miura', '三浦しげる', '配角', 'Lynn', 'College student and the childhood friend of Chisato Miyazaki and Mai Takada.', '/uploads/images/c_158783.png'),
(82, 'Chisato Miyazaki', '宮崎ちさと', '配角', 'Marie Hatanaka', 'Miura and Mai''s childhood friend who moved out when they were little.', '/uploads/images/c_158794.jpg'),
(82, 'Novem', 'ノエム', '配角', 'Shouta Yamamoto', 'Arbiter who is employed on an unknown floor.', '/uploads/images/c_158795.jpg'),
(82, 'Shimada', '島田', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', 'Brother of Sae Shimada.', '/uploads/images/c_158803.png'),
(82, 'Sae Shimada', '島田紗英', '配角', 'Akane Fujita', 'Sister of Shimada. ~!After losing both her parents at a young age, her brother Shimada supported her. She was attacked and raped by an unnamed assailant and unknowingly saw Tatsumi watching, thinking he was a partner. After the attack this leaves her hateful and broken going as far as telling her brother that she wants her attackers dead.!~', '/uploads/images/c_158964.png'),
(82, 'Misaki Tachibana', '橘みさき', '配角', 'Yuriko Yamaguchi', 'Actress and a single mom, who has underwent a lot of failed relationships. She and Yousuke both arrive at Quindecim where they were force to play an arcade game to decide their fate. At first she thought that she is in some kind of reality show only to discover in the midst of the game that she was strangle to death by her manager whom she antagonised and slapped.', '/uploads/images/c_158990.jpg'),
(82, 'Yumi Tatsumi', '辰巳由美', '配角', 'Yuuko Kobayashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_161539.png'),
(82, 'Sachiko Uemura', '上村幸子', '配角', 'Ikuko Tani', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_161541.png'),
(82, 'Tatsumi', '辰巳', '配角', 'Keiji Fujiwara', 'Detective', '/uploads/images/c_162882.jpg'),
(82, 'Memine', 'メミン', '配角', 'Izumi Chiba', 'Memine is a cat who lives on Viginti together with Ginti, and helps him with his duties as an arbiter.', '/uploads/images/c_181332.png'),
(83, 'Shouko Nishimiya', '西宮硝子', '主角', 'Saori Hayami', 'A young, deaf transfer student with an amazingly positive outlook on life. Despite being a victim of continuous bullying, she always keeps a smile on her face.', '/uploads/images/c_80243.jpg'),
(83, 'Shouya Ishida', '石田将也', '主角', 'Mayu Matsuoka', '__Height:__ 183 cm The main character and narrator. Ishida bullied [Nishimiya Shouko](https://anilist.co/character/80243) in elementary school and when she transferred away, he was ostracized and bullied by his former friends. He started to ignore those around him (imagining them with a large X across their face) and was driven to the point of suicide. He changed his mind after he apologized to Nishimiya and began to spend time with her. He learned sign language specifically so he could apologize to her and is shown to be very talented in it. He feels like he hasn''t been punished enough for bullying Nishimiya and often wishes he could kill his younger self. He seems resigned to the fact that he will never be able to have friends again.', '/uploads/images/c_80491.jpg'),
(83, 'Yuzuru Nishimiya', '西宮結絃', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', '[Shouko](https://anilist.co/character/80243/Nishimiya-Shouko)''s younger sister who is currently a middle school student. She cut her hair short so their [mother](https://anilist.co/character/124037/Nishimiya-Yaeko) would not cut Shouko''s and has kept it that way ever since; due to this, she is often mistaken for a boy, with [Ishida](https://anilist.co/character/80491/Ishida-Shouya) even thinking that she is Shouko''s boyfriend at first.', '/uploads/images/c_89335.jpg'),
(83, 'Naoka Ueno', '植野直花', '配角', 'Yuuki Kaneko', 'A girl from [Ishida](https://anilist.co/character/80491/Ishida-Shouya) and [Nishimiya](https://anilist.co/character/80243/Nishimiya-Shouko)''s elementary school and the girl that Ishida was closest to at school. Ishida remembers her bossing him about and also being his main helper in bullying Nishimiya. After having separated from him since middle school graduation, Ueno runs into Ishida years later, herself now working in a cat café.', '/uploads/images/c_124026.jpg'),
(83, 'Miyako Ishida', '石田美也子', '配角', 'Satsuki Yukino', 'A kind and loving single mother of Shouya and his older sister who owns a hair salon. She cares for her granddaughter Maria as well as Ishida and often lets Yuzuru stay around the house. She became disappointed upon learning that Ishida bullied Nishimiya and had to pay 1.7 million yen for all the hearing aids Ishida broke. ~!When Ishida pays her back with the intention of killing himself afterwards, she reveals that she had been aware of his plans and threatens to burn the money if he tries to kill himself again—leaving her with nothing. Unfortunately, she accidentally burns the money anyway. After Ishida ends up in a coma, she becomes awkward around Nishimiya, despite trying to remain polite.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124030.jpg'),
(83, 'Maria Ishida', '石田マリア', '配角', 'Erena Kamata', '[Ishida](https://anilist.co/character/80491/Ishida-Shouya)''s young niece who lives with Ishida and his family. Maria is half-Japanese from her mother''s side and half-Brazilian from her father''s side. ~!She gains a constant wonder about the difference between things that are dead and alive after Ishida''s fall and fearing he might be dead, Yuzuru takes it upon herself to teach her the difference—being an expert on the matter.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124031.jpg'),
(83, 'Miki Kawai', '川井みき', '配角', 'Megumi Han', 'Nicknamed "Kawaiichi," Kawai was the school representative at Ishida''s elementary school. She is popular and normally takes charge of situations and is shown to be kind to everyone; however, all her actions seem to have her academic reputation in mind. Kawai is also a narcissist who believes that everyone should love her, as well as wants to be the victim in every problem she faces. ~!Though she never actually insulted Nishimiya, Kawai did nothing to intervene and even laughed alongside her friends, making her also responsible for Nishimiya''s transfer. Kawai''s accusation of Ishida being a bully is a catalyst to his isolation among his classmates. Kawai becomes Ishida''s classmate again in high school and takes part in Nagatsuka''s film shooting, bringing Mashiba, whom she has a crush on, in tow. It is revealed that Kawai has always been scared of Ishida and accuses him of not wanting to face the truth, again a catalyst to his falling out with his film crew. Later, when she tells the class that they will make paper cranes as a wish of recovery for Ishida, who is hospitalized after saving Nishimiya, her classmates are disgusted and secretly bully her. Having to experience the feeling of getting bullied for the first time, Kawai resolves to become more empathetic with others. At the end of the series, Kawai presents Ishida with the paper cranes made by their classmates and follows Mashiba to study to become a teacher.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124033.jpg'),
(83, 'Satoshi Mashiba', '真柴智', '配角', 'Toshiyuki Toyonaga', 'A boy who becomes interested in and joins Ishida''s group of friends upon learning they are making a movie. He is eager to be the leading actor and is considered handsome and talented enough to do so. Mashiba was lonely as a child and the other children took him for granted and bullied him, now he is completely intolerant of bullies in any form, and while generally calm and level-headed, he reacts violently to any random act of bullying he sees. ~!He is oblivious to Kawai''s crush on him until Ishida points it out. It is later revealed that Mashiba befriends Ishida because of his social awkwardness and never being able to fit in at school despite trying to; by hanging out with Ishida—believing him to be even stranger than he is—he would appear normal. However, this only makes him feel that he should be the least important in the group. Thus, when Ishida asks Mashiba to hit him after the former reveals his bullying records, he calmly does so. Mashiba is the first to reconcile with Ishida upon his release from the hospital and later studies to become a teacher after graduation.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124034.jpg'),
(83, 'Tomohiro Nagatsuka', '永束友宏', '配角', 'Kenshou Ono', 'A short, fat, and lonely boy who is a habitual liar. When someone tries to steal Nagatsuka''s bike, Ishida offers his to be taken instead. Nagatsuka sees this act of kindness as an unbreakable act of friendship and swiftly becomes Ishida''s self-proclaimed best friend and starts to idolize Ishida. He is shown to be quite obsessive and protective of Ishida and often dislikes him befriending other people. However, Nagatsuka is also supportive of Ishida and often offers advice. He has plans to become a millionaire, so is willing to hand out money to friends and is keen to become a film director—entering himself and Ishida into a film competition. It is shown both Ueno and Kawai find Nagatsuka repulsive, while Ishida is uncomfortable that Nagatsuka is so willing to take his side when he knows so little about him. Though his film proves to be a failure, this only made Nagatsuka resolved to take up film studies as his college subject.', '/uploads/images/c_124035.jpg'),
(83, 'Ito Nishimiya', '西宮いと', '配角', 'Ikuko Tani', 'Shouko and Yuzuru''s maternal grandmother. A caring, wise woman, she cared for Nishimiya and Yuzuru when their father left and their mother was at work. She bought Yuzuru her first camera and tries to convince Yuzuru that her mother means well for both her and her sister. ~!Ito dies of old age and leaves a letter that Yuzuru asks Ishida to read at the funeral. The letter tries one last time to convince Yuzuru to forgive her mother, but she grows angry and does not hear the end of it.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124036.jpg'),
(83, 'Yaeko Nishimiya', '西宮八重子', '配角', 'Akiko Hiramatsu', 'A cold woman, who after catching a virus from her husband during pregnancy, left Shouko deaf. Yaeko''s husband''s family quickly filed for a divorce. When her husband left, she was pregnant with Yuzuru and her mother helped her raise both her daughters. ~!Eventually, she left her mother to care for the children permanently while she works—causing problems in her relationship with Yuzuru—not helped by the fact Yuzuru frequently skips school to take photos of dead animals. She made Shouko stay at the elementary school where she was bullied for so long in the hopes it would toughen her up and prepare her for how people would treat her. She planned to cut Shouko''s hair like a boy to make her look tougher, but Yuzuru cut her own hair instead in protest. She hates Shouya and feels he can never atone for the happy school years he stole from her daughter. Upon seeing him again years after he left school, she slaps him; however, after her mother''s death, she begins to warm up to Ishida and thanks him for being Yuzuru''s friend.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124037.jpg'),
(83, 'Miyoko Sahara', '佐原みよこ', '配角', 'Yui Ishikawa', 'A kind girl from Ishida and Nishimiya''s elementary school. She was the only person willing to make an effort to learn sign language and befriend Nishimiya. ~!Sadly, this singled her out for bullying too, and started to take all her classes in the nurse''s office. Ishida finds Sahara several years later so she can reconnect with Nishimiya, and she becomes her friend again. She was always and is still bullied by Ueno for her unorthodox sense of fashion, however, the two remain close even after they separated and Sahara boldly claims they are now best friends. Sahara has grown very tall during the time-skip and due to her high heel boots appears even taller. After Ishida, Sahara spends the most time with the Nishimiya family; however, their relationship is briefly strained when Ishida decides to cut off all ties with his friends by insulting them, claiming that Sahara is always the first to run away from a problem. Sahara later texts Ishida asking how he could prove that he has grown up; this motivates him to risk his life-saving Nishimiya during her attempted suicide. Fed up with Ueno always blaming Nishimiya for everything, she chooses to take Nishimiya''s side and defends her from being attacked by Ueno during Ishida''s hospitalization. After graduating from high school, Sahara goes to Tokyo to become a runway model, bringing an unwilling Ueno with her.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124038.jpg'),
(83, 'Kazuki Shimada', '島田一旗', '配角', 'Ryou Nishitani', 'Ishida''s best friend in elementary school. He helped him bully Nishimiya. ~!When Nishimiya moved away, Shimada placed all the blame on Ishida and soon became the ringleader of the people bullying Ishida: frequently stealing his shoes, beating him up, and writing threats and cruel things on his desk in chalk every morning. Ueno wants Ishida and Shimada to be friends again and gets Ishida to the amusement park where Shimada is now working, but Ishida storms away, deciding he does not care about Shimada and does not want to be his friend again. It is revealed that when Ishida falls while saving Nishimiya, Shimada sees him and saves him from the river; however, Ishida never learns this because he is unconscious at that time and Shimada asks Nishimiya, who witnesses the event, not to tell him about it.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124039.jpg'),
(83, 'Takeuchi', '竹内', '配角', 'Fuminori Komatsu', 'Takeuchi-sensei was the homeroom teacher of Shouya, Shouko, Naoka, Shimada, Hirose, Miki, and Miyoko during their 6th-grade year. ~!While he was disappointed in Ishida for bullying Nishimiya, he still laughed at the jokes made about her, and once Nishimiya left, he prompted the class to turn Ishida into a scapegoat for all their bullying. He refused to believe Ishida when he claimed he was being bullied too. Years later, Ishida runs into Takeuchi again when looking for locations for the film. Takeuchi says that Ishida has grown into a fine young man and all the bad things in his past have changed Ishida for the better. Mashiba dislikes how Takeuchi talks about Nishimiya and throws his drink into Takeuchi''s face, costing them the chance to film at the school, though with Ishida''s later hospitalization and Mashiba''s apology to him, Takeuchi allows them to shoot anyway.!~', '/uploads/images/c_135851.jpg'),
(83, 'Pedro', 'ペドロ', '配角', 'Ryuunosuke Watanuki', 'Maria''s Brazilian father.', '/uploads/images/c_135852.jpg'),
(83, 'Kita', '喜多', '配角', '', 'Ishida''s music teacher in elementary school. As Sahara was among the students, Kita was the only one among the teachers who was willing to get along with Nishimiya despite her deafness. She attempted to make the class learn sign language for Nishimiya''s sake, but her proposal was rejected because she herself did not know about it. Later, Kita also included Nishimiya to take part in the school choir, but despite trying hard to teach her, Nishimiya ended up ruining the song and made the school lose the choir competition.', '/uploads/images/c_135853.png'),
(83, 'Keisuke Hirose', '広瀬啓祐', '配角', 'Takuya Masumoto', 'Keisuke was Shouya Ishida''s friend in elementary school. Although he did bully Shouko Nishimiya, he wasn''t a huge participant and usually seemed uncomfortable picking on her. However, he was more than happy bullying Shouya later on. ~!Keisuke stayed close with Kazuki after graduation and along with him brings Shouya from the river after he falls down after saving Shouko.!~', '/uploads/images/c_135854.png'),
(83, 'Ishida no Ane', '将也の姉', '配角', 'Ayano Hamaguchi', 'Ishida''s older sister. She is significantly older than him as she already graduated from college when he was still in elementary school. Curiously, she is the only character with lines whose face is never seen. According to Shouya, his sister had dated numerous men, one of whom has a younger brother who was bullied by Shouya. Later, she dated a Brazilian man named Pedro; this time, her relationship stuck, and she had a daughter, Maria, with him.', '/uploads/images/c_135856.jpg'),
(84, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(84, 'Mikasa Ackerman', 'ミカサ・アッカーマン', '主角', 'Yui Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") - 176 cm (5''9½") __Position:__ 104th Training Corps, Survey Corps __Relatives:__ [Birth Mother](https://anilist.co/character/84341/Mikasa-no-Haha) (Deceased), [Birth Father](https://anilist.co/character/84339/Mikasa-no-Chichi) (Deceased), [Grisha Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/62477/Grisha-Yeager) (Foster Father), [Carla Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/62475/Carla-Yeager) (Foster Mother, Deceased), [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) (Foster Brother) Mikasa is Eren Yaeger''s foster sister and mutual childhood friend of [Armin Arlert](https://anilist.co/character/46494), living with the two of them in Shiganshina District within the southern region of Wall Maria. When she was young, her parents were killed by human traffickers, and she was kidnapped. Eren discovered this and helped her escape her captors. Later, Eren gave her his scarf, which she constantly wears and shares an emotional attachment to. She was adopted by the Yaeger family soon after. Because of these past events, Mikasa shares an unbreakable bond with Eren and lives to protect him, constantly worrying for Eren''s well-being. After the Titans broke through Wall Maria and killed her and Eren''s mother, she chose to follow Eren into the military to try and keep him safe from danger. Even as a child, Mikasa possessed impressive fighting skill and strength, and that skill was only honed further during her training. Mikasa is considered a genius among all th', '/uploads/images/c_40881.png'),
(84, 'Eren Yeager', 'エレン・イェーガー', '主角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") - 183 cm (6''0") __Affiliation:__ 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps. Eren was born to [Carla](https://anilist.co/character/62475/Yeager-Carla) and [Grisha Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/62477/Yeager-Grisha) in Shiganshina District within the southern region of Wall Maria. He grew up in the town with his parents and foster sister [Mikasa](https://anilist.co/character/40881/Ackerman-Mikasa), who moved in with the Yeagers as a child. Eren spent most of his time with Mikasa and their mutual best friend [Armin Arlert](https://anilist.co/character/46494/Arlert-Armin), whom the pair often defended from neighborhood bullies. Eren is a passionate, determined, hardheaded, and impulsive young man. When they were children, Armin showed him a book depicting the wonders of the outside world. Eren grew to share Armin''s curiosity of the world beyond the Walls and resolved to see it for himself. This dream inspired his admiration of the Survey Corps and his desire to join their ranks as soon as he became eligible for enrollment. When the Titans suddenly broke through Wall Maria into Shiganshina, Eren was forced to watch on as his mother became trapped under the rubble of their house and eaten by a titan. Forever changed from this event, Eren vows to kill every last titan.', '/uploads/images/c_40882.jpg'),
(84, 'Levi', 'リヴァイ', '配角', 'Hiroshi Kamiya', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") Squad Captain of the Special Operations Squad (known as Squad Levi) within the Survey Corps. He is known as humanity''s strongest soldier. Levi is abrasive, blunt, and has a strong respect for structure and discipline. He is a clean-freak, demanding spotless cleanliness of himself, his equipment, and his environment. Rumors say he was involved in underground crime in his life before coming a soldier. Despite his emotionless and unfriendly demeanor, Levi cares deeply for his squad and greatly values human life.', '/uploads/images/c_45627.png'),
(84, 'Sasha Blouse', 'サシャ・ブラウス', '配角', 'Yuu Kobayashi', '__Initial Height:__ 168cm __Affiliations__: 104th Cadet Corps, Survey Corps; Soldier __Relatives__: [Artur Blouse](https://anilist.co/character/131281/Artur-Blouse) (Father), [Lisa Blouse](https://anilist.co/character/134952/Lisa-Blouse) (Mother) Originally from Dauper, a remote and scarcely populated village of hunters located in a mountain forest in the southern area of Wall Rose, Sasha joined the military as a cadet of the 104th Training Corps, where she ranked 9th upon graduation. After graduating, she''d choose to enlist in the Scouting Regiment. Sasha is a friendly and fun-loving girl. She speaks with a local accent from her home village, but initially hid it out of embarrassment by using overly formal and polite speech. She is a constant food hoarder and is known to have an incredible appetite; eating provided her with considerable gratification and relief, especially during times of great stress, and food was often the only thing on her mind when at ease. Raised as an animal hunter, Sasha specializes in archery, horseback riding, and tracking, although her eccentricity and unconventional methods tend to make her a poor fit for group operations. ~!She later saves a child named [Kaya](https://anilist.co/character/132738/Kaya) from a titan attack, who her family ends up adopting.!~', '/uploads/images/c_45887.jpg'),
(84, 'Reiner Braun', 'ライナー・ブラウン', '主角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', '__Height__: 185 cm (6''1") Member of the Survey Corps and former cadet of the 104th Training Corps. Reiner is a passionate and strong-willed young man with a strong sense of duty. He ranked 2nd in his training class upon graduation, finishing behind only [Mikasa](https://anilist.co/character/40881). His comrades have great trust in him, and he is stated to be the "big brother" of the 104th cadets.', '/uploads/images/c_46484.png'),
(84, 'Connie Springer', 'コニー・スプリンガー', '配角', 'Hiro Shimono', '__Height__: 158 cm (5''2") __Relatives:__ [Mother](https://anilist.co/character/137287/Conny-no-Haha), Martin Springer (Brother), Sunny Springer (Sister) Connie Springer is a graduate of the 104th Training Corps, having ranked 8th in class. He is known to be one of the quickest soldiers while using ODM gear and is skilled at making very sharp turns. He hails from the rural Ragako Village within Wall Rose, his greatest ambition being to make his family and village proud of him. Upon graduation, he chose to join the Survey Corps. Upbeat and naive, Connie is rather unfocused outside of combat, and enjoys goofing around and messing with his friends, but can also be a bit dense at times, as he can have some difficulty comprehending new developments as they appear. Connie always tries to remain optimistic, consistently caring for the well-being of his friends, family and village, and being willing to help in any way he can. However, this soft spot and the struggles he goes through as a member of the Survey Corps takes a toll on him, as he often responds to grief and loss with anger, irritation and hatred, causing him to at times make rash, impulsive decisions. He will do anything to protect his family, whether it be his biological family or his closest friends.', '/uploads/images/c_46486.png'),
(84, 'Bertolt Hoover', 'ベルトルト・フーバー', '配角', 'Tomohisa Hashizume', '__Height__: 192 cm (6''3") __Affiliation__: Survey Corps Member of the Survey Corps and former cadet of the 104th Training Corps. Bertoldt ranked 3rd in his training class upon graduation, finishing behind only [Mikasa](https://anilist.co/character/40881) and his hometown friend [Reiner](https://anilist.co/character/46484). He is a quiet young man who identifies himself as someone with a weak will that follows popular opinion. Despite ranking 3rd in his class, his training commandant noted him to be a person with great potential, but an utter lack of initiative. Bertoldt originally he enlisted in the military with aspirations of joining the Military Police and living in the safety of the inner wall, but after the Battle of Trost he instead decided to join the Survey Corps.', '/uploads/images/c_46488.jpg'),
(84, 'Annie Leonhart', 'アニ・レオンハート', '配角', 'Yuu Shimamura', '__Height__: 153 cm (5") A member of the 104th Southern Division in the Cadet Corps. After graduating from the 104th, ranked 4th place in the top 10, she ends up joining the Military Police. She is roommates with [Hitch Dreyse](https://anilist.co/character/86017). A stoic girl, Annie is considered to be an isolated, solitary type, being rarely seen smiling or socializing and often having an emotionless expression. She is apathetic and somnolent, with little desire to put in any effort into meaningless disciplines or activities. Nonetheless, what drives Annie more than anything is her desire for a normal life.', '/uploads/images/c_46490.jpg'),
(84, 'Hannes', 'ハンネス', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', 'A soldier who saves Eren and Mikasa during the prologue. He owes a debt to the Yeager family.', '/uploads/images/c_46492.jpg'),
(84, 'Armin Arlert', 'アルミン・アルレルト', '主角', 'Marina Inoue', '__Height:__ 163 cm (5''4") __Position:__ 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps __Relatives:__ [Grandfather](https://anilist.co/character/84313/Armin-no-Ojiisan) Armin is a young boy who was born and raised in the Shiganshina District within the walls, being childhood friends with both [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) and [Mikasa Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/40881). After Wall Maria was breached, he chose to join Mikasa and Eren in joining the military, both to try to make a good and meaningful impact on the world, and to fulfill his dream of seeing the outside world. Even when he was young, the naturally curious Armin has always had a deep fascination with the world beyond the Walls. As a child, he found and studied an illegal book about the outside world that was owned by his grandfather. He often shared the book and information contained in it with Eren Yeager, his best friend, and his dreams of seeing the world outside the walls. Armin was branded a heretic by other children for his unusual interest in the outside world and was thus frequently picked on. Too timid to defend himself, Armin would often rely on his friends Eren and Mikasa Ackerman to protect him from local bullies. This, coupled with his frail physique, was a deep shame for Armin, leading him to have poor self-esteem and to believe that he is a burden to others. Because of this, Armin has always been very eager to prove his worth, especially towards his close friends. Armin ', '/uploads/images/c_46494.png'),
(84, 'Erwin Smith', 'エルヴィン・スミス', '配角', 'Daisuke Ono', '**Height:** 188 cm **Position:** 13th Commander, Survey Corps Discerning, intelligent, and widely respected, Erwin is the unshakable and calculated 13th commander of the Survey Corps. While he cares deeply for his men, he does not hesitate to sacrifice them for the good and prosperity of mankind, and his men have proven more than willing to stake their lives at his order. Erwin developed the Long-Distance Enemy Scouting Formation.', '/uploads/images/c_46496.png'),
(84, 'Jean Kirstein', 'ジャン・キルシュタイン', '配角', 'Kishou Taniyama', '__Height__: 175 cm (5''8") __Relatives__: [Mother](https://anilist.co/character/131444/Jean-no-Haha) Jean Kirschtein is a graduate of the 104th Cadet Corps, among whom he ranked 6th for his skills with ODM gear and ability to look at things through a more tactical lense. Jean hails from Wall Rose''s Trost District, and joined the military with hopes of living a peaceful life within the walls as part of the Military Police. However, he would later find himself joining the Survey Corps after being convinced both by his close friend [Marco Bott''s](https://anilist.co/character/62479/Marco-Bott) words, and after witnessing the death of several of his comrades. Jean has a blunt personality. He holds no restraint when it comes to speaking his mind, even when he knows it would not be wise to do so or when it could spark conflict. Jean is also pragmatic: he has a strong aversion to exposing himself to dangerous situations. During his time as a cadet, Jean was extremely hot-headed, easily becoming frustrated and quick to resort to violence when pushed. Jean was also very cynical about defeating the Titans, believing that humanity has no chance against them and openly mocking more idealistic individuals like [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager), and saw resisting the Titans as a hopeless cause. However, despite these things, and although he presents himself as self-centered, Jean places high value on the lives of his comrades, and is willing to risk his life to pr', '/uploads/images/c_46498.png'),
(84, 'Carla Yeager', 'カルラ・イェーガー', '配角', 'Yoshino Takamori', 'Eren''s mother. ~!She''s eaten alive in the second chapter.!~ Note: Carla Yeager is the official English translation by Kodansha.', '/uploads/images/c_62475.png'),
(84, 'Marco Bott', 'マルコ・ボット', '配角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', '__Height__: 178 cm (5''9") __Affiliations__: 104th Training Corps Originally from Jinae District. Marco ranked 7th in the 104th Training Corps and is widely respected by other cadets of the 104th. Marco is a very kind, calm, and idealistic person, valuing the good of the group above his own interests, as well as understanding and coping with his own shortcomings and limitations. He is seen as a natural leader, and desires to join the Military Police to serve near the King. *Note: Marco Bott is the official English translation by Kodansha.*', '/uploads/images/c_62479.jpg'),
(84, 'Krista Lenz', 'クリスタ・レンズ', '配角', 'Shiori Mikami', '__Height__: 145 cm (4''8") __Affiliations__: 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps Ranked tenth in the trainee class, Krista is a very shy and kind, caring person, often being described as a "goddess" or "angel" by her peers. She is good friends with [Ymir](https://anilist.co/character/71479/Ymir).', '/uploads/images/c_62481.png'),
(84, 'Dot Pixis', 'ドット・ピクシス', '配角', 'Masahiko Tanaka', 'The highest-ranked Administrator of the Southern Region. Head of the Garrison''s Southern Territories, Pixis is a cunning leader with astute insights. However, he is also an alcoholic who is constantly watched over by his aid, [Anka](https://anilist.co/character/84331/Anka-Rheinberger), who constantly scolds him for sleeping and drinking during critical moments.', '/uploads/images/c_62485.png'),
(84, 'Mike Zacharias', 'マイク・ザカリアス', '配角', 'Kenta Miyake', 'Squad Captain of his own squad, Squad Mike, a major division within the Survey Corps. He has been described by others as "humanity''s second strongest soldier", being only behind [Levi](https://anilist.co/character/45627/Levi). Mike is an extremely strong and durable soldier and an acknowledged leader with a brave heart and a tactical mind. He also has a remarkably good sense of smell, which allows him to detect Titans from great distances. During times of ease, Mike is shown to be a quiet and reserved man, rarely speaking unless it concerned a more serious matter. He also has a bizarre habit of "sniffing" people when he meets them.', '/uploads/images/c_71119.jpg'),
(84, 'Hange Zoe', 'ハンジ・ゾエ', '配角', 'Romi Park', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Affiliation:__ Survey Corps; Section Commander, Squad Leader. Leader of the Survey Corps'' Fourth Squad, Hange is also in charge of conducting research on Titans, and pursues this knowledge so passionately that they have become obsessed with Titans as a result. After originally holding a deep hatred for the creatures, Hange decided to take on a new outside-the-box approach to their research by letting go of their resentment towards Titans and approaching the test subjects with compassion. Hange is an energetic, freethinking and quirky scientist, with a unique way of conducting both themselves and their work. Hange is a genius outside of just Titan research too, using their brain to create weapons, tactical plans, and inventions for the benefit of humanity. As a leader, Hange is thoughtful of their comrades, and can easily figure out complex problems in order to create plans for their teammates to carry out.', '/uploads/images/c_71121.png'),
(84, 'Nick', 'ニック', '配角', 'Tomohisa Asou', 'Pastor Nick is a member of a religion that worships the Walls as holy. He claims that he lost his family as a result of addiction to Vine. As a religious leader, Pastor Nick used his influence to oppose any modification of the walls, be it permanently sealing the gates or even mounting cannons on the top. Though he claimed it was blasphemy for humans to "maim" the wall, ~!the real reason was to reduce the risk of workers discovering the Titans within during renovations.!~ (Source: Shingeki no Kyojin Wikia) Note: Minister Nick is the official English translation by Kodansha.', '/uploads/images/c_71453.jpg'),
(84, 'Marlo Freudenberg', 'マルロ・フロイデンベルク', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', '__Affiliations:__ Military Police, 104th Cadet Corps. Recruit of the Military Police stationed in Stohess District. While most who join the Military Police Regiment do so because they want a safe position far from the danger of the Titans, Marlo did so because he claims to want "to uphold justice and do what''s right.", much to the amusement of his fellow officer, [Hitch Dreyse](https://anilist.co/character/86017/Hitch-Dreyse), whom he often clashes with due to them being near complete opposites. His goal is to rise to the top of the organization so he can stop the pilfering of taxes and misappropriation of land. Though steadfast in his idealism, he could make moral compromises to achieve his goal, confessing a willingness to act like "scum" in order to move up in rank. Due to his passion towards his ideals, he had often been compared to [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) by people who know both of them.', '/uploads/images/c_71457.png'),
(84, 'Ymir', 'ユミル', '主角', 'Saki Fujita', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5''7") __Affiliations:__ 104th Trainees Squad, Scouting Legion Member of the Scouting Legion. She seems selfish, cynical, bossy, sly, uncooperative, exploitative, and confrontational, but she can apparently be kind, especially to [Krista](https://anilist.co/character/62481/Krista-Lenz).', '/uploads/images/c_71479.png'),
(84, 'Nanaba', 'ナナバ', '配角', 'Asami Shimoda', '__Height:__ 172 cm __Affiliation:__ Scouting Legion Survey Corps', '/uploads/images/c_71481.png'),
(84, 'Gelgar', 'ゲルガー', '配角', 'Yasuyuki Kase', 'Member of Scouting Legion. Has an undying love for alcohol. (Source: Attack on Titan Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_72511.jpg'),
(84, 'Henning', 'ヘニング', '配角', 'Keiichi Nakagawa', 'Member of Scouting Legion that fought the Castle Utgard''s battle.', '/uploads/images/c_75512.jpg'),
(84, 'Rene', 'リーネ', '配角', 'Risa Shimizu', 'Member of Scouting Legion that fought the Castle Utgard''s battle.', '/uploads/images/c_75514.jpg'),
(84, 'Hugo', 'フーゴ', '配角', 'Akio Suyama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_84307.jpg'),
(84, 'Daz', 'ダズ', '配角', 'Shuuhei Takubo', 'Daz is a member of the 104th Trainees Squad. ~!In Ch. 40, Ymir and Historia Reiss recount a story about Dazz from training. Wanting praise and recognition, Dazz undertook harsh physical training in the snowy mountains. However, he wasn''t strong enough to endure it, and nearly died. Ymir told Krista to leave him behind or her own life would be endangered; when Krista refused, Ymir used her Titan shifter powers to bring Dazz back to the camp safely. In Ch. 12, when Dot Pixis announces the plan to reconquer Trost District, Dazz has a breakdown and starts screaming that he doesn''t want to die. Though Marco Bott tries to quiet him, a commanding officer overhears and threatens to execute him. Dazz replies that execution would be better then being eaten by a Titan. However, Dot Pixis then announces that all deserters will be pardoned -- but have to live with the guilt that they abandoned their families to the Titans. Dazz is unable to leave his family to that fate, and returns to participate in the operation to plug the breach. After the mission, he briefly appears in Chapter 21 standing next to Sasha Blouse when Irvin Smith gives a speech urging the 104th Training Squad members to join the Scouting Legion. As he is not present in the group of trainees who join, he presumably opted for the Stationary Guard instead.!~ (Source: Shingeki no Kyojin Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_84321.png'),
(84, 'Kitz Weilman', 'キッツ・ヴェールマン', '配角', 'Tomoyuki Shimura', 'The Captain of the Garrison''s 1st Division Elite Forces', '/uploads/images/c_84325.jpg'),
(84, 'Anka Rheinberger', 'アンカ・ラインベルガー', '配角', 'Ikumi Hayama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_84331.png'),
(84, 'Rico Brzenska', 'リコ・ブレツェンスカ', '配角', 'Michiko Kaiden', 'The Squad Leader of the 1st Division Elite Force of the Stationary Guard. ~!She is the sole survivor of the elite squads assigned to protect Eren during the liberation of Trost District. She does not trust Eren and still views him as a traitor.!~', '/uploads/images/c_84707.jpg'),
(84, 'Hitch Dreyse', 'ヒッチ・ドリス', '配角', 'Akeno Watanabe', '**Height:** 168 cm __Affiliations:__ 104th Cadet Corps. Recruit of the Military Police stationed in Stohess District. She was roommates with [Annie Leonhart](https://anilist.co/character/46490/Annie-Leonhart). Hitch acts immature in certain ways, she has a sarcastic, easygoing personality and seems to mischievously enjoy teasing and needling her fellow officers, especially [Marlo Freudenberg](https://anilist.co/character/71457/Marlo-Freudenberg). She claims she chose to join the Military Police out of laziness, as it is well known that the senior staff are incredibly corrupt and she wanted to benefit from the system herself; however, she did not take into account that, as a new recruit, her superiors would dump all their work on her. Though she may act a bit air-headed at times, Hitch is not selfish and cares about those around her, especially her fellow comrades.', '/uploads/images/c_86017.jpg'),
(84, 'Zeke', 'ジーク', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', '__Height__: 183 cm Zeke is the current inheritor of the Beast Titan, and is considered by [Reiner Braun](https://anilist.co/character/46484/Reiner-Braun) to be the strongest Warrior, contrasting [Levi''s](https://anilist.co/character/45627/Levi) title of "humanity''s strongest soldier".', '/uploads/images/c_125661.png'),
(84, 'Nifa', 'ニファ', '配角', 'Sayaka Senbongi', '__Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") Nifa is a soldier in the Survey Corps'' Fourth Squad under the command of [Hange Zoe](https://anilist.co/character/71121/Hange-Zoe). Nifa appears to be a loyal and trustworthy member of Fourth Squad, as she is often tasked to record the details of important meetings and entrusted to deliver vital information to others within the Scouting Regiment. She acts serious most of the time, however, she has been seen drinking alcoholic beverages before giving out more intense reports and info.', '/uploads/images/c_126849.jpg'),
(84, 'Moblit Berner', 'モブリット・バーナー', '配角', 'Rintarou Nishi', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9") __Affiliation:__ Survey Corps; Executive Officer, Fourth Squad. A veteran member of the Survey Corps and [Hange Zoe](https://anilist.co/character/71121/Hange-Zoe)''s second-in-command within the Survey Corps'' Fourth Squad. He also serves as Hanji''s assistant and messenger. He comes across as an intelligent and responsible person, which may be the reason he was tasked to keep his overzealous and eccentric superior out of trouble. Much of the time, this leaves him in a state of near-panic, having to constantly remind Hange to be more careful or yanking them to safety. That he remains at Hange''s side constantly suggests he is a loyal person, and that he cares deeply for his superior''s safety, regardless of the stress involved with being under their command. He is also able to show signs of a serious nature when it comes to missions, going out of his way to investigate problems and put himself in danger before others.', '/uploads/images/c_127573.jpg'),
(84, 'Abel', 'ゴーグル', '配角', 'Kiyohito Yoshikai', 'Goggles is a soldier in the Scout Regiment fourth squad under the command of Hange Zoë, who is noted for his trademark glasses, or "goggles". He participated in the 57th Exterior Scouting Mission and often accompanies higher ups, such as Hange and Levi, on serious missions. (Source: Shingeki no Kyojin Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_127681.jpg'),
(84, 'Marcel Galliard', 'マルセル・ガリアード', '配角', 'Masamichi Kitada', '~!Marcel was a comrade and childhood friend of Reiner Braun, Bertolt Hoover, and Annie Leonhart. He was part of the group sent by Marley to attack the Eldians of Paradis in year 845, but his mission was cut short by the sudden appearance of Ymir in her mindless Titan form.!~ (Source: Shingeki no Kyojin Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_127683.png'),
(84, 'Phil', 'フィル', '配角', 'Yukari Shimotsuki', 'A member of the Garrison.', '/uploads/images/c_130625.png'),
(84, 'Rashad', 'ラシャド', '配角', 'Yuuki Hayashi', 'Rashad is a team captain in the Survey Corps'' Fourth Squad under the command of [Hange Zoe](https://anilist.co/character/71121). While Rashad is shown to be a brave and conditioned soldier, he also has shown himself to be a rather considerate man, watching over fellow wounded soldiers along with [Nifa](https://anilist.co/character/126849/Nifa). He is also shown to prioritize his fellow soldiers'' well-being over immediate threats to himself, retrieving water to soothe burned soldiers while engaged with the [Colossal Titan].', '/uploads/images/c_131280.png'),
(84, 'Artur Blouse', 'アルトゥル・ブラウス', '配角', 'Hiroshi Naka', '__Relatives:__ [Lisa Blause](https://anilist.co/character/134952/Lisa-Blouse) (Wife), [Sasha Blause](https://anilist.co/character/45887/Sasha-Blouse) (Daughter). Artur Blouse is the father of Sasha Blouse and a hunter in the Dauper village. It was his words that motivated Sasha to leave home and join the military. Artur appears to be a mature father figure who is deeply devoted to his clan. Though he appreciates his way of life, he realizes that many people''s homes were taken by Titans and that they must share the forest for the greater good. He appears to be very wise, willing to accept change and move beyond their traditions if it meant a better way of life for everyone, and is very clearly a selfless person who puts others before himself. Like his daughter, he has a native Dauper accent. ~!ㅤ After his daughter Sasha saved [Kaya](https://anilist.co/character/132738/Kaya), he and his wife decided to adopt her and open their home up to other orphaned children whose family was slain by the titans, going so far as to refer to them as his "family."!~', '/uploads/images/c_131281.png'),
(84, 'Tomas', 'トーマ', '配角', 'Ryouta Takeuchi', 'He is a member of the Scout Regiment in Squad Miche. ~!He brought the news of Wall Rose''s breach to Commander Erwin.!~', '/uploads/images/c_131282.png'),
(84, 'Lauda', 'ラウダ', '配角', 'Kimihiko Nakamura', 'He is a team leader in the Scout Regiment Fourth Squad under the command of Hange Zoë.', '/uploads/images/c_131283.png'),
(84, 'Kaya no Haha', 'カヤの母', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', '~!During the Wall Rose invasion, she is left stranded in her town with her traumatized daughter as a Titan slowly eats her. Sasha Blouse arrives in the town to alert its citizens and finds the two women in the house they were left in. Sasha unsuccessfully attempts to cut the Titan''s nape with an axe, and then notices the child in the room. Sasha apologizes to the mother as she decides to abandon her, and successfully takes her child to safety. The woman later dies from her wounds!~', '/uploads/images/c_132794.jpg'),
(84, 'Conny no Haha', 'コニーの母', '配角', 'Michiko Kaiden', 'She is the mother of Conny Springer and a resident of Ragako village. ~!She was transformed into a Titan by the Beast Titan during Wall Rose''s supposed breach.!~', '/uploads/images/c_137287.png'),
(85, 'Makoto Nakashima', '中島真', '配角', 'Akane Fujita', 'In *Kiben Gakuha, Yotsuya-senpai no Kaidan.* - Protagonist of the series where she accompanies her senpai in unraveling the fate of her missing friend. In *Haikyu!!* - Middle child of the Nakashima family. She often attends [Takeru](https://anilist.co/character/76818/Takeru-Nakashima)''s games and cheers enthusiastically along with the rest of her family.', '/uploads/images/c_50755.jpg'),
(85, 'Shouyou Hinata', '日向翔陽', '主角', 'Ayumu Murase', '__Teams:__ Yukigaoka Junior High (Former); Karasuno High (Current) __Number:__ 1 (Junior High 3rd Year); 10 (High School 1st year); 5 (High School 3rd year) __Position:__ Captain (Junior High); Outside Hitter (Junior High); Middle Blocker (High School) Hinata has an unusually high ability to jump. Since he was young, Hinata trained his legs to compensate for his lack of height. He joins the Karusuno High School Volleyball team and amazes the team with his natural affinity as a spiker. Although he is a complete beginner and never had any experience playing in a volleyball team, he grows rapidly through each match. ~!After graduating from high school, Hinata traveled to Brazil to gain experience by playing beach volleyball. This is when he got the name, Ninja Shoyo. Upon returning to Japan, he became a member of the MSBY Black Jackals, a Division 1 team in the V-League. He became a member of the Japan Men’s National Volleyball Team during the 2021 Olympics. Currently, that is the year 2022, he is a member of Asas São Paulo, a professional team in the Brazil Super League.!~', '/uploads/images/c_64769.png'),
(85, 'Tobio Kageyama', '影山飛雄', '主角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Team:__ Karasuno High, Kitagawa Daiichi Junior High (former) __Height:__ 180.6 cm __Year:__ 1st Year, class 3 __Number:__ 9 __Position:__ Setter A famous setter in his middle school who joins the Karusuno High Volleyball team. He was known as the "King of the Court" in his middle school because of his arrogant demeanor and the way he would order around his teammates. Although he still carries an overbearing attitude, he begins to change when he starts to play with [Hinata Shouyou](https://anilist.co/character/64769) who views him as a rival.', '/uploads/images/c_64771.png'),
(85, 'Koushi Sugawara', '菅原孝支', '配角', 'Miyu Irino', '__Height:__ 174 cm Being the vice captain, Sugawara has a soothing personality for his teammates and acts as a pillar of support for them. Even though he isn''t Karasuno''s official setter anymore, he doesn''t dream of giving up on playing in general. As such, he encourages himself and all of his teammates not to give up, no matter how rough the situation might be. Sugawara''s dedication to volleyball is clear when he decides to continue club activities even when most third years choose to retire to focus on their futures. In a meeting, his teacher asked Sugawara why he''s so determined to continue playing even though he''s not a starting member, and Sugawara replied that he doesn''t want to have regrets in the future. He is also quite perceptive as he noticed how [Tanaka](https://anilist.co/character/67325/Tanaka-Ryuunosuke) asked for the key to the gym (back during the first years'' 3-on-3 match) even though he always comes in late, so Sugawara knew that something was up. He is also intelligent as he can come up with helpful tactics during the game. An example of this is when he came up with the idea of saying "bring it" and "send it to me" for [Kageyama](https://anilist.co/character/64771/Kageyama-Tobio) and [Hinata](https://anilist.co/character/64769/Hinata-Shouyou)''s combo.', '/uploads/images/c_67321.png'),
(85, 'Daichi Sawamura', '澤村大地', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 176.8 cm __Year:__ 3rd year, class 4 __Number:__ 1 __Position:__ Wing Spiker The captain of the Karasuno High volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_67323.png'),
(85, 'Ryuunosuke Tanaka', '田中龍之介', '配角', 'Yuu Hayashi', '__Height:__ 177.2 cm __Team:__ Karasuno High __Number:__ 5 __Position:__ Wing Spiker', '/uploads/images/c_67325.jpg'),
(85, 'Yuu Nishinoya', '西谷夕', '配角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '__Team:__ Karasuno High, Chidoriyama Junior High (former) __Height:__ 159.3 cm (5''2") __Year:__ 2nd year, Class 3 __Number:__ 4 __Position:__ Libero Yuu is a very energetic and temperamental person. His boisterous nature and crazy shenanigans can attract unwanted attention quite easily, which often bodes ill for him. Although he hardly ever worries about the consequences of his actions (and may even revert to violence in order to vent out his anger on certain occasions), he is surprisingly considerate of his friends'' feelings and insecurities. Yuu can be extremely impatient, excitable and impulsive. As [Ryuunosuke Tanaka](https://anilist.co/character/67325) puts it, "he simply gets too fired up for his own good." He doesn''t bother to filter his words, and is therefore prone to blurting out whatever he''s thinking in a loud and tactless manner. In-game, however, his attitude changes drastically: he becomes incredibly focused and serious, remaining calm and doing everything in his power to provide the support his team needs until the very end. For this reason, everyone in the volleyball club respects him greatly.', '/uploads/images/c_67327.jpg'),
(85, 'Kei Tsukishima', '月島蛍', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', '**Height:** 188 cm **Team:** Karasuno High **Year:** 1st year, class 4 **Number:** 11 **Position:** Middle Blocker A member of the Karasuno High volleyball club. Tsukishima is very blunt and will sometimes rile his teammates up due to his antagonistic nature (most notably being [Hinata](https://anilist.co/character/64769/Hinata-Shouyou), [Kageyama](https://anilist.co/character/64771/Kageyama-Tobio), [Nishinoya](https://anilist.co/character/67327/Nishinoya-Yuu), and [Tanaka](https://anilist.co/character/67325/Tanaka-Ryuunosuke)) and sometimes other teams because of his casual smug attitude, taking pride in and relishing when his opponents see him as a nuisance as seen with [Tendou](https://anilist.co/character/126073/Tendou-Satori) and [Shirabu](https://anilist.co/character/137537/Shirabu-Kenjirou). Tsukishima is standoffish and has an arrogant and condescending personality, but he has low self-esteem and thinks of himself as inferior. Although he is only outwardly close with [Yamaguchi](https://anilist.co/character/71609/Yamaguchi-Tadashi), he can be seen occasionally caring about his other club members.', '/uploads/images/c_67329.png'),
(85, 'Chikara Ennoshita', '縁下力', '配角', 'Toshiki Masuda', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 175.4 cm __Year:__ 2nd year, class 4 __Position:__ Wing Spiker Ennoshita seems quiet and reserved but can behave boldly towards the other 2nd years. He''s smart and hasn''t received a failing mark before. Similarly to Sugawara, he is always smiling. He''s supposedly the only one within the 2nd years to be able to control Tanaka and Nishinoya. He''s also able to understand different people, as stated a few times by Tanaka and when he knew what to do to give Yamaguchi some courage before his jump float serve.', '/uploads/images/c_67331.png'),
(85, 'Asahi Azumane', '東峰旭', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 184.7 cm __Year:__ 3rd year, class 3 __Number:__ 3 __Position:__ Wing Spiker In contrast to his appearance, he is rather quiet and gentle and has his difficulties realizing that he is Karasuno''s ace as he initially doesn''t feel that way. He shows to be weak-willed at the beginning when he leaves the team before the first years come, feeling that he let down his entire team when they lost against Date Tech High even though they counted on him. After coming back to Karasuno, he realizes that his will to play volleyball is much stronger than he thought and with the help of his teammates, he acknowledges his position as Karasuno''s ace (even though he is still mocked sometimes by Daichi for not having any "ace-like presence") and gains self-confidence.', '/uploads/images/c_67333.png'),
(85, 'Kiyoko Shimizu', '清水潔子', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 166.2 cm __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 2 The manager of the Karasuno High volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_67689.png'),
(85, 'Keishin Ukai', '烏養繋心', '配角', 'Kazunari Tanaka', '**Height:** 178.2 cm **Team:** Karasuno High Karasuno High School volleyball club''s alumnus, currently coaching volleyball club and helping out his mother at the shop.', '/uploads/images/c_70861.jpg'),
(85, 'Kenma Kozume', '孤爪研磨', '配角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 169.2 cm The setter of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. Kenma is [Kuroo](https://anilist.co/character/71269)''s childhood friend and keeps playing volleyball because of him. He has a very calm personality and is usually doing things at his own pace. Often seen playing video games and being introverted. Nekoma''s backbone, brain and heart.', '/uploads/images/c_71267.jpg'),
(85, 'Tetsurou Kuroo', '黒尾鉄朗', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 187.7 cm __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 5 __Number:__ 1 __Position:__ Middle Blocker The captain of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. Kuroo has a somehow manipulative and cunning personality, but cares about his friends and teammates very deeply. As Nekoma''s captain he has a sense of responsibility and confidence. Even though Kuroo''s a middle blocker, he often uses offensive plays too.', '/uploads/images/c_71269.jpg'),
(85, 'Tadashi Yamaguchi', '山口忠', '配角', 'Souma Saitou', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 179.5cm - 180.0cm __Year:__ 1st year, class 4 __Number:__ 12 __Position:__ Middle Blocker Yamaguchi always hangs out with Tsukishima and is very protective of him. He has trained himself hard to use a jump float serve. He is also a substitute ace server of the Karasuno Volleyball team.', '/uploads/images/c_71609.png'),
(85, 'Tooru Oikawa', '及川徹', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', '__Height:__ 184 cm The setter and captain of the Aoba Josai High School volleyball club. He was [Kageyama](https://anilist.co/character/64771/Tobio-Kageyama)''s senpai when they were attending Kitagawa Daiichi. According to Kageyama, he is a very talented setter and volleyball player with a ​complex personality. His favourite food is milk bread.', '/uploads/images/c_71611.png'),
(85, 'Taketora Yamamoto', '山本猛虎', '配角', 'Seigo Yokota', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 176.7 cm __Year:__ 2nd Year, class 1 __Number:__ 4 __Position:__ Wing Spiker Yamamoto is proud and short tempered wing spiker of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. He usually doesn''t think what he says and is somewhat similar to Tanaka.', '/uploads/images/c_73673.jpg'),
(85, 'Sou Inuoka', '犬岡走', '配角', 'Kyousuke Ikeda', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 185.3 cm __Year:__ 1st Year, class 1 __Number:__ 7 __Position:__ Middle Blocker Middle blocker of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. He has friendly personality and becomes friends with Hinata after their game.', '/uploads/images/c_73675.jpg'),
(85, 'Yuuki Shibayama', '芝山優生', '配角', 'Takumi Watanabe', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 162.5 cm __Weight:__ 53.3 kg __Year:__ 1st Year, class 4 __Number:__ 12 __Position:__ Libero One of the libero of the Nekoma High School volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_73677.jpg'),
(85, 'Ittetsu Takeda', '武田一鉄', '配角', 'Hiroshi Kamiya', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 166.5 cm Volleyball club faculty advisor of the Karasuno High School. Takeda is inexperienced in volleyball, but still became an advisor for Karasuno. He often doesn''t understand rules and that''s why he takes notes about every new thing he learns. Takeda has an enthusiastic and brave personality.', '/uploads/images/c_73679.png'),
(85, 'Yuutarou Kindaichi', '金田一勇太郎', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', '__Team:__ Aoba Josai High, Kitagawa Daiichi (former) __Height:__ 189.2 cm __Year:__ 1st year __Position:__ Middle Blocker Middle blocker of the Aoba Josai High School volleyball club. He was Kageyama''s teammate back in junior high school. Kindaichi was one of the players who hated Kageyama''s selfish plays and refused to understand him.', '/uploads/images/c_73681.jpg'),
(85, 'Nobuyuki Kai', '海信行', '配角', 'Takanori Hoshino', '__Team__: Nekoma High School __Height__: 176.5 cm __Weight__: 68.9 kg __Year__: 3rd Year, class 4 __Number__: 2 __Position__: Wing Spiker', '/uploads/images/c_74029.jpg'),
(85, 'Morisuke Yaku', '夜久衛輔', '配角', 'Shinnosuke Tachibana', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 165.2 cm __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 5 __Number:__ 3 __Position:__ Libero Currently playing libero of the Nekoma High School volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_74033.png'),
(85, 'Shouhei Fukunaga', '福永招平', '配角', 'Shouta Chounan', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 178.3 cm __Year:__ 2nd Year, class 2 __Number:__ 6 __Position:__ Wing Spiker', '/uploads/images/c_74039.jpg'),
(85, 'Manabu Naoi', '直井学', '配角', 'Kanehira Yamamoto', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School The coach of the Nekoma High School volleyball club and Ukai''s old acquaintance.', '/uploads/images/c_74591.jpg'),
(85, 'Yasufumi Nekomata', '猫又育史', '配角', 'Nobuaki Fukuda', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School The coach of the Nekoma High School volleyball club and Ukai''s rival. He doesn''t like to lose.', '/uploads/images/c_74593.jpg'),
(85, 'Hajime Iwaizumi', '岩泉一', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', '__Height:__ 179.3 cm __Team:__ Aobajousai High School __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 5 __Number:__ 4 __Position:__ Wing Spiker __Ability Parameters (out of 5):__ Power = 5; jump = 4; stamina = 4; intellect = 3; technique = 3; speed = 4 Is a third-year student from Aoba Johsai High; he is the volleyball team''s ace, vice-captain and a wing spiker. He is also [Tōru Oikawa](https://anilist.co/character/71611/Oikawa-Tooru)''s childhood friend and "pillar". Iwaizumi often gets irritated by Oikawa''s behavior and tells him that guys who have girls going kyaa kyaa over them irritates him the most.', '/uploads/images/c_75636.png'),
(85, 'Wakatoshi Ushijima', '牛島若利', '配角', 'Ryouta Takeuchi', '__Height:__ 189.5 cm (6'' 2.6") __Team:__ Shiratorizawa Academy __Number:__ 1 __Position:__ Wing Spiker Wakatoshi Ushijima is a third year at Shiratorizawa Academy and the captain and ace of the school''s boys'' volleyball team. Currently, he is the number one ace in Miyagi Prefecture and one of the country''s top three aces, along with Sakusa and Kiryu. Left handed. His favourite food is hayashi rice.', '/uploads/images/c_76816.png'),
(85, 'Takeru Nakashima', '中島猛', '配角', 'Atsushi Abe', 'Wakutaniminami High School''s key player, he''s in his 3rd year. He''s the captain of the volleyball team.', '/uploads/images/c_76818.jpg'),
(85, 'Yui Michimiya', '道宮結', '配角', 'Asami Seto', '__Height:__ 159 cm (5'' 2") __Team:__ Karasuno Girls'' Volleyball Club __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 1 __Number:__ 1 The captain of the Karasuno High girls volleyball club. Michimiya is shown to be a very active person, always smiling and cracking jokes. She is a very determined person, who cares a lot for her team, giving them motivational speeches, and always tries to stay composed in front of them; she only cries when she''s away from her teammates. However, she herself had stated that she isn''t strict enough. Around [Daichi](https://anilist.co/character/67323/Sawamura-Daichi) though she can become flustered and clumsy, repeating words to try and find the right thing to say.', '/uploads/images/c_77165.jpg'),
(85, 'Kaname Moniwa', '茂庭要', '配角', 'Takashi Onozuka', '**Height:** 176 cm **Team:** Datekougyou High School **Number:** 2 **Position:** Setter The captain of the Datekougyou High School volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_77413.png'),
(85, 'Kenji Futakuchi', '二口堅治', '配角', 'Masatomo Nakazawa', '__Team:__ Datekougyou High School __Height:__ 184.2 cm According to Moniwa, Futakuchi is a problematic kouhai with a very easy going personality. He''s often seen arguing with Kamasaki who is the ​complete opposite of Futakuchi.', '/uploads/images/c_77415.jpg'),
(85, 'Takanobu Aone', '青根高伸', '配角', 'Hiroki Matsukawa', '__Team:__ Datekougyou High School __Height:__ 191.8 cm __Year:__ 2nd Year, class A __Number:__ 7 __Position:__ Middle Blocker Main pillar of Datekou. Even though Aone never smiles and seems serious and scary, he actually has a very kind heart. Futakuchi said that Aone has a habit of "locking on" to you if he knows his opponent is an ace.', '/uploads/images/c_77417.jpg'),
(85, 'Nobuteru Irihata', '入畑伸照 ', '配角', 'Mitsuaki Hoshino', 'The coach of the Aoba Josai High School volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_77419.jpg'),
(85, 'Yuusuke Takinoue', '滝ノ上祐輔', '配角', 'Shuuhei Sakaguchi', 'Height: 185.6 cm Position: Middle Blocker Karasuno High School volleyball club''s alumnus. He and Shimada are part of the Karasuno Neighborhood Association team. And they often come to watch current Karasuno''s games as well as to root for them. Yuusuke''s working at Takinoue Electric Goods.', '/uploads/images/c_80511.png'),
(85, 'Makoto Shimada', '嶋田誠', '配角', 'Tomoaki Maeno', '__Height:__ 177.7cm Karasuno High School volleyball club''s alumnus. He and Takinoue are part of the Karasuno Neighborhood Association team. And they often come to watch current Karasuno''s games as well as to root for them. Makoto''s working at Shimada Mart.', '/uploads/images/c_80513.jpg'),
(85, 'Hisashi Kinoshita', '木下久志', '配角', 'Nobuyori Sagara', '__Height:__ 174cm Narita, Ennoshita and Kinoshita are 2nd years who couldn''t keep up with the training when old Ukai returned and that''s why they left volleyball club. However after some time they came back because they realized that they still want to play volleyball, though coach Ukai was no longer there. Ennoshita called them ''''disgraceful'''' 2nd years.', '/uploads/images/c_80515.jpg'),
(85, 'Kazuhito Narita', '成田一仁', '配角', 'Koutarou Nishiyama', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 180.2 cm __Year:__ 2nd Year, class 4 Narita, Ennoshita and Kinoshita are 2nd years who couldn''t keep up with the training when old Ukai returned and that''s why they left volleyball club. However after some time they came back because they realized that they still want to play volleyball, though coach Ukai was no longer there. Ennoshita called them ''''disgraceful'''' 2nd years.', '/uploads/images/c_80517.jpg'),
(85, 'Koutarou Bokuto', '木兎光太郎', '配角', 'Ryouhei Kimura', '__Height:__ 185.3 cm Bokuto is a third year student at Fukurodani Academy and is its volleyball team''s captain and wing spiker. His spikes pack a powerful punch that others can struggle to receive. Despite this, Bokuto has a tendency to not doing well in the middle of games when getting shut out. Luckily, [Akaashi](https://anilist.co/character/88938) has a whole list of things Bokuto does and tries his best to bring Bokuto back up to his usual self. Besides Akaashi, Bokuto is friends with a few other rival team''s players, such as [Kuroo](https://anilist.co/character/71269) and sorta friends with [Tsukishima](https://anilist.co/character/67329).', '/uploads/images/c_88937.png'),
(85, 'Keiji Akaashi', '赤葦京治', '配角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', '__Height:__ 182.3 cm A second year at Fukurodani Academy, and its volleyball team''s vice-captain and setter. Akaashi is often calm and collected, though he does have times where he begins to get worried about things. More often than not, he has to handle Bokuto and all of his antics during the game. When such happens, Akaashi usually thinks of some way to bring Bokuto into peak condition again, though there are times where he struggles with doing so.', '/uploads/images/c_88938.png'),
(85, 'Hitoka Yachi', '谷地仁花', '配角', 'Sumire Morohoshi', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Position:__ Manager __Occupation:__ High School Student (1st Year, Class 5) A 1st year who was recruited by [Shimizu](https://anilist.co/character/67689/Shimizu-Kiyoko) as a manager trainee. She appears to be very nervous, but easily befriends [Hinata](https://anilist.co/character/64769/Hinata-Shouyou). She''s paranoid (which causes her to be intimidated easily), very curious, and is organized with her notes, including the ones that she takes from class; this is largely due to her mother being a graphic designer.', '/uploads/images/c_89124.jpg'),
(85, 'Yuuji Terushima', '照島遊児', '配角', 'Takuya Eguchi', '**Team:** Johzenji **Height:** 177 cm **Number:** 1 **Position:** Wing Spiker **Role:** Captain The recently instated captain of the Johzenji volleyball team. Values spirit and fun over all else, contrary to the teams original motto "valor and simplicity." His ways of practice are often very hectic, and include mostly 2 vs 2.', '/uploads/images/c_89311.png'),
(85, 'Akira Kunimi', '国見英', '配角', 'Atsushi Tamaru', '__Team:__ Aobajōsai (former Kitagawa Daīchi) (first year at Aoba Johsai) __Height:__ 182.8 cm __Number:__ 13 __Position:__ Wing Spiker He is a quiet and indifferent person, though it''s mostly out of laziness. He occasionally skips practice as well and doesn''t seem to put his full effort into matches; however, his true strength lies in his late game plays. Kunimi dislikes loud, energetic people and was dismayed when Koganegawa yelled at him to "go all out", which is one of his least liked phrases. He also refers to Hinata, Koganegawa, and Hyakuzawa as the "idiot squad" because of their energy. Kageyama has also mentioned that Kunimi is smart, though it''s unknown if that refers to his game sense or general studies.', '/uploads/images/c_89508.jpg'),
(85, 'Lev Haiba', '灰羽リエーフ', '配角', 'Mark Ishii', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 194 cm __Weight:__ 79,7 kg __Year:__ 1st Year __Position:__ Middle Blocker Lev is a half Russian, half Japanese. However he says he doesn''t speak Russian because he was born and raised in Japan. His name in Russian means lion. Lev wasn''t around when Karasuno and Nekoma had their first match together. He started playing volleyball in high school, that''s why he was still a novice and spent whole time on bench at that time so he didn''t come. Lev is blessed with natural physical ability, intuition and height. He declares that he''s an ace even though he''s a middle blocker. Kenma states that Lev is a good and honest guy. Lev is quite childish and cheerful, shown when he was making fun of Hinata''s height. Lev''s appearance, as well as his piercing eyes, causes people to believe he is much more intimidating and serious than he actually is. Though he can be blunt, he never seems to mean any harm and adopts a playful attitude towards most things. He is also shown to be enthusiastic about spiking as he gets excited about it very easily, and can be competitive with people he is interested in.', '/uploads/images/c_89517.png'),
(85, 'Saeko Tanaka', '田中冴子', '配角', 'Yuka Komatsu', 'Saeko Tanaka is a former student of Karasuno High and the older sister of Ryuunosuke Tanaka. She was also a classmate of the Small Giant during her high school years. The second years of the volleyball team views her as a cool older sister, especially Nishinoya, but Tanaka thinks of her as a nuisance whenever she bothers his study sessions. Like her brother, she''s loud and outspoken. Her driving has been described by her brother as dangerous as he had once stated to Hinata and Kageyama that he can''t guarantee their safety in her car.', '/uploads/images/c_90142.jpg'),
(85, 'Akiteru Tsukishima', '月島明光', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', 'Kei Tsukishima''s older brother.', '/uploads/images/c_121624.jpg'),
(85, 'Kanji  Koganegawa', '黄金川貫至', '配角', 'Masayuki Shouji', '__Height:__ 191.5 cm __Team:__ Datekougyou High School __Year:__ 1st year __Number:__ 7 __Position:__ Setter Koganegawa is a first year setter at Date Tech High. He is very energetic and enthusiastic but often lacks the ability to think carefully about his actions. Despite being rather simple-minded, he''s also shown to be determined to improve his abilities and support his team as their setter and with his height but tends to focus on improving the wrong areas.', '/uploads/images/c_134003.png'),
(85, 'Kentarou Kyoutani ', '京谷賢太郎', '配角', 'Shunsuke Takeuchi', '__Height:__ 178.8 cm __Team:__ Aoba Johsai High __Year:__ 2nd Year, Class 1 __Position:__ Right-Wing Spikers He is said to have the best ability among the second years at Aobajōsai High, but his brash attitude is cause for poor relationships with other members of the volleyball team. He doesn''t seem to show any respect for the third years (besides Iwaizumi), irritating them and shocking the first years upon Kentaro''s return to the team. He is extremely strong, and he can only hit the ball with his full strength or he "doesn''t feel satisfied."', '/uploads/images/c_135829.png'),
(85, 'Kazuma Bobata', '母畑和馬', '配角', 'Shouya Chiba', 'Team: Johzenji High Height: 185.9 cm Weight: 71.8 kg Year: 2nd Year Number: 2 Position: Middle Blocker Bobata is a second year student in Johzenji High. He is one of the volleyball team''s middle blockers. He appears to be very carefree and outgoing. Like his teammates, he has a reckless playing style and is confident about winning, but after losing to Karasuno, he seems to have calmed down a lot.', '/uploads/images/c_135830.png'),
(85, 'Hana  Misaki', '三咲華', '配角', 'Ayumi Fujimura', '__Height:__ 163.2 cm (5''4") __Team:__ Jouzenji High __Position:__ Manager She is a third year student at Jouzenji High and was the manager of the volleyball team.', '/uploads/images/c_135831.png'),
