(87, 'Arata Kaizaki', '海崎新太', '主角', 'Kenshou Ono', 'A 27-year old man who seems to fail at every job interview he partakes in. He accepts an offer to be part of the ReLIFE experiment in order to receive a recommendation to a company. ~!In Chapter 221, he learns that [Chizuru](https://anilist.co/character/89426/Hishiro-Chizuru) was a subject of ReLIFE and was shocked to discover she is older than him. After she briefly becomes sad at his possible disappointment, he assures her that he is happy with the revelation and hugs her which surprises but delights her. He then confesses his feelings for her that he is truly in love with her and wishes to be with her forever, and asks her to go out on a date with him. She is very touched by this declaration and states if he is okay with her she''ll go out with him on a date, as they smile at each other and share their first kiss.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89425.png'),
(87, 'Chizuru Hishiro', '日代千鶴', '主角', 'Ai Kayano', 'A prodigy who has the best grades among the girls in her class. She''s extremely bad at communication. She has a habit of immediately looking up anything she doesn''t understand on the internet. ~!Hishiro was in fact Test Subject No. 001 of the Kantou Branch of ReLIFE Laboratory. Her inter-personal issues had made her not able to keep any job for long, and the list of short-term employments on her resume eventually made her unemployable. Her first year of ReLIFE experiment was a failure, but she was given a second chance, and she made the effort to make friends the second year. With the help of [Kaizaki](https://anilist.co/character/89425/Kaizaki-Arata) and her friends, she was able to overcome her past issues and restore her feelings that were damaged in the past. After her ReLIFE experiment ended, she joined the ReLIFE Laboratory in the Research and Development Division.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89426.jpg'),
(87, 'Ryou Yoake', '夜明了', '主角', 'Ryouhei Kimura', 'A member of the ReLife research team, and the person in charge of Arata''s experiment. He''s always cheerful, but has a cunning personality. He takes the form of a high schooler and supports Arata as a classmate.', '/uploads/images/c_89427.jpg'),
(87, 'An Onoya', '小野屋杏', '主角', 'Reina Ueda', '__Height:__ 153 cm (5''0") A third year in [Arata Kaizaki](https://anilist.co/character/89425/Kaizaki-Arata)''s class. She may be positive about everything she thinks about, but then she may not be thinking about anything. ~!However, she is in fact an employee of the ReLIFE Support Division and [Ryo Yoake](https://anilist.co/character/89427/Yoake-Ryou)''s junior supervisor in the ReLIFE experiment. She was actually going to be the support of Kaizaki, though this was changed. Her real age is 26-27!~', '/uploads/images/c_89428.png'),
(87, 'Rena Kariu', '狩生玲奈', '主角', 'Haruka Tomatsu', 'A stoic tsundere who has good grades, sports prowess, and a competitive personality. However, she''s never satisfied and is always aiming higher.', '/uploads/images/c_89632.jpg'),
(87, 'Kazuomi Ooga', '大神和臣', '主角', 'Yuuma Uchida', '__Height:__ 171 cm (5''7") Kazuomi Ooga looks like a flashy student, but he has the best grades among the boys in his class. He has a pure side and is not interested in romance. He is not athletic. ~!Kazuomi greatly respects his older brother, who had previously shouldered the responsibilities of providing for the family. Even after Takaomi became a NEET, Kazuomi simply felt it is now his old turn to be responsible and let his brother time to rest. The piercing Kazuomi got from his brother was one of his greatest treasures, as a remembrance for when Takaomi was cheerfully working hard.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89633.jpg'),
(87, 'Honoka Tamarai', '玉来ほのか', '配角', 'Himika Akaneya', 'Honoka Tamarai is the captain of the volleyball team. She has a spacey personality and is easy-going, but is extremely skilled at sports and has monster strength. She''s the childhood friend of [Inukai](https://anilist.co/character/89839/Inukai-Akira) and [Asaji](https://anilist.co/character/89840/Asaji-Nobunaga), and they call her "Tama (-chan)."', '/uploads/images/c_89838.png'),
(87, 'Akira Inukai', '犬飼暁', '配角', 'Noriaki Sugiyama', 'A young man with an unfriendly, blunt, but also honest personality. He''s the kind of person to act before speaking. [Tamarai](https://anilist.co/character/89838/Tamarai-Honoka) and [Asaji](https://anilist.co/character/89840/Asaji-Nobunaga) call him "Aki (-chan)."', '/uploads/images/c_89839.png'),
(87, 'Nobunaga Asaji', '朝地信長', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', 'A kind and friendly young man. He is very skilled in athletics. [Tamarai](https://anilist.co/character/89838) and [Inukai](https://anilist.co/character/89839) call him "Nobu (-chan)."', '/uploads/images/c_89840.jpg'),
(87, 'Kokoro Amatsu', '天津心', '配角', 'Miyuki Sawashiro', 'The teacher of Year 3 Class 3. She specializes in physical education. She is also in charge of the girls'' volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_143179.jpg'),
(87, 'Rumi Naomi', 'ナオミ留美', '配角', 'Minami Takahashi', 'An employee who joined Arata''s company after he was fired.', '/uploads/images/c_157963.jpg'),
(87, 'Kento Amagase', '天ヶ瀬賢人', '配角', 'Tokuyoshi Kawashima', 'An employee of the ReLIFE institute in the field of research, within the laboratory of the company. He takes care of providing the pills to transform subjects from adults to adolescents and vice versa.', '/uploads/images/c_157964.jpg'),
(87, 'Zen Kamioka', '上岡善', '配角', 'Kenji Akabane', 'A new employee of the former company of Arata Kaizaki. ~!After meeting Arata at the cemetery, he tells him that his actions inspired some people at the company.!~', '/uploads/images/c_157965.jpg'),
(87, 'Saiki Michiru', '満ちるせいき', '配角', 'Shizuka Itou', 'Michiru was Arata Kaizaki''s superior from his former company. ~!She commits suicide after getting severely rebuked by her coworkers.!~', '/uploads/images/c_192604.jpg'),
(87, 'Koushi Usa', '宇佐浩史', '配角', 'Wataru Hatano', 'He is a teacher at Aoba High School. He''s in charge of 3rd year, class 4. He''s also the supervisor of the boys volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_215257.jpg'),
(88, 'Genus Hakase', 'ジーナス博士', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', 'Gifted with immense intelligence, even at a young age he had made various scientific contributions. His fantastic mental capacities have allowed him to accomplish many genetic wonders. After considerable experimentation he has figured out how to create beasts such as Beast King and Carnage Kabuto.', '/uploads/images/c_8060.jpg'),
(88, 'Juu Ou', '獣王', '配角', 'Jirou Saitou', 'Artificial mutant created by Dr. Genus of the House of Evolution. Beast King is the leader of Dr. Genus'' strike force and second-strongest specimen in the House of Evolution, exceeded only by Carnage Kabuto.', '/uploads/images/c_8061.jpg'),
(88, 'Butagami', '豚神', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', '__Race:__ Human __Occupation:__ Superhero __Abilities:__ Superhuman Physical Prowess, Inhuman Digestive System, Elasticity __Level:__ S-Class: Rank 10 __Personality:__ Pig God is a glutton and is constantly eating food. He is also very direct, or simply lazy. However he is a very caring individual and also appears to be very humble, as he usually doesn''t mind helping others or openly embracing other heroes'' advices. He also does not mind paying for people in secret. __Abilities:__ As an S-Class hero, Pig God is very powerful, he has the ability to digest swallowed monsters almost instantly, he also seems to have complete control over his digestive system. Pig God has a thick layer of fat capable of absorbing all types of impact and he is also immune to poison.', '/uploads/images/c_8841.jpg'),
(88, 'Zeniru', 'ゼニール', '配角', 'Hiroki Gotou', 'He is a multi-millionaire established in F-City.', '/uploads/images/c_11830.jpg'),
(88, 'Kanirante', 'カニランテ', '配角', 'Yukitoshi Tokumoto', 'Mysterious Being which was created when a man ate too much crab and underwent metamorphosis.', '/uploads/images/c_12985.jpg'),
(88, 'Kuseno Hakase', 'クセーノ博士', '配角', 'Kenichi Ogata', 'The doctor responsible for Genos'' repairs and upgrades. He was pursing the cyborg that destroyed Genos'' town. Genos begged for him to make him into a cyborg after promising the destroy the cyborg that destroyed his home.', '/uploads/images/c_13124.jpg'),
(88, 'Vaccine Man', 'ワクチンマン', '配角', 'Ryuusei Nakao', '__Height:__ 2-18 m (6''7"-59''1") __Level:__ Dragon Creature born due to the massive pollution released across the Earth by human beings. According to him, he was created as an incarnation of nature''s wrath, meant to wipe out humanity and thus effectively vaccinate the earth against future infections. He is the first enemy faced by Saitama shown in One Punch-Man.', '/uploads/images/c_13125.jpg'),
(88, 'Saitama', 'サイタマ', '主角', 'Makoto Furukawa', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") Saitama is the main protagonist of One Punch Man, and the most powerful hero alive. Having apparently trained himself to superhuman condition, Saitama faces an existential crisis as he is now too powerful to gain any thrill from his heroic deeds. He is registered with the Heroes Association as a B-Class Superhero and is tasked to defend Z-City against Mysterious Beings. For a superhero, Saitama is rather laid-back. Because even the mightiest foes pose no challenge to him, he doesn''t take his hero work very seriously. In spite of this, he is constantly searching for an opponent that can challenge him, since his superhero work is beginning to bore him because it''s too easy. The combination of his attitude, unstoppable strength, and distinctively simple and ''unimpressive'' appearance often cause his battles to become anticlimactic. Saitama will usually allow his opponents to rant about their motives and power up into their strongest forms before suddenly and nonchalantly obliterating them with one punch.', '/uploads/images/c_73935.jpg'),
(88, 'Genos', 'ジェノス', '主角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 178 cm (5''10") __Debut:__ Chapter 6 / Episode 1 __Race:__ Cyborg __Location:__ Z-City __Abilities:__ Enhancements Physical feats, Full Cyborg Weaponry, Highly Skilled and Strategist Combatant __Weapons:__ Cyborg Body __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ S-Class; Rank 16 (beginning), Rank 14 (current) __Affiliation:__ The Heroes Association A cyborg and a self-proclaimed disciple of [Saitama](https://anilist.co/character/73935). He is always aiming to become stronger and fights for justice. Genos is an extremely serious character. He has a strong motivation to become stronger and is always looking at Saitama as an example of the ultimate hero. Constantly trying to be like him even if it results in reckless fights.', '/uploads/images/c_73979.jpg'),
(88, 'Onsoku no Sonic', '音速のソニック', '配角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 174 cm __Race:__ Human __Location:__ Z-City __Abilities:__ Superhuman Speed and Agility __Weapons:__ Ninja equipment __Occupation:__ Bodyguard (former, now a villain) __Affiliation:__ Mr. Monier (former) Sonic is a villain in the series, first appearing as a bodyguard hired by Mr. Monier. He views [Saitama](https://anilist.co/character/73935/Saitama) as his eternal rival. Sonic is a villain who, despite his normally calm appearance, loves fighting strong opponents as shown by when he gets a "child-like smile" on his face when he first meets Saitama and has two of his attacks blocked, earlier calling this his "bad habit." He seems to be very quick to act as he attacks Saitama on their first meeting without letting him explain the situation.', '/uploads/images/c_74167.png'),
(88, 'Sneck', 'スネック', '配角', 'Shinichirou Miki', '__Race:__ Human __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ A-Class; Rank: 38 __Affiliation:__ Heroes Association Sneck is an A-Class Superhero, rank 38. He was tasked with welcoming the new heroes for the National Superhero Registry Test that Saitama and Genos were a part of.', '/uploads/images/c_75460.png'),
(88, 'Bang ', 'バング', '配角', 'Kazuhiro Yamaji', '__Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") __Race:__ Human __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ S-Class __Rank:__ 3 __Affiliation:__ Heroes Association Bang is an S-Class, rank 3, superhero for the Heroes Association, settled in Z-City. Bang owns a dojo passed down from generations, and uses the fighting style the Rock-Smashing Water Stream Fist. __Abilities:__ Bang being in the top 3 of the S-Class ranking, he is acknowledged by the public and heroes to be a strong fighter. Not much is known about Bang''s abilities other than that he uses a martial art called "Rock-Smashing Water Stream Fist".', '/uploads/images/c_81141.png'),
(88, 'Tatsumaki', 'タツマキ', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', '__Race:__ Human __Abilities:__ Psychokinesis __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ S-Class; Rank: 2 __Affiliation:__ Heroes Association __Family:__ [Fubuki](https://anilist.co/character/81931/) (sister) Tatsumaki is a petite woman, commonly mistaken for being much younger than she really is. She has an adolescent face with emerald green eyes and green hair that naturally curls up on the ends. She wears a long dress that separates into 4 sections slightly above the hips and low-heeled black shoes. __Personality:__ She has a rather brash, moody, hotheaded, and impatient personality. She is disrespectful towards most people, especially to those she deems incompetent. Despite her arrogant personality, she feels obligated to defeat monsters and considers her job as a hero to be a duty, accepting any of the Hero Association''s requests to defeat monsters, due to the fact that she tends to get bored when she is not fighting monsters. She also seeks them to fight in her own time. She has a bit of a soft side towards her little sister Fubuki, but she is also very overprotective. __Abilities:__ As the most powerful esper in One-Punch Man and one of the most powerful heroes, Tatsumaki possesses extreme skill in wielding her psychic abilities, whether it be for offense, defense, or miscellaneous uses. Tatsumaki''s knowledge about psychic powers is also as vast as her skill in wielding them, which is enough to lift an entire city. She''s also called as the Association''s ultimate weapon.', '/uploads/images/c_81929.png'),
(88, 'Fubuki', 'フブキ', '配角', 'Saori Hayami', '__Race:__ Human __Occupation:__ Superhero __Height:__ 167 cm (5''5¾") __Level:__ B-Class Rank 1 __Affiliation:__ Hero Association __Family:__ Tatsumaki (sister) __Abilities:__ Psychokinesis Fubuki, also known by her hero alias Blizzard of Hell, is the B-Class Rank 1 professional hero of the Hero Association. She is an esper, the younger sister of Tatsumaki, and the leader of the Blizzard Group, a B-Class hero faction. She and her sister are known as the Psychic Sisters. Fubuki is currently trying to recruit [Saitama](https://anilist.co/character/73935/Saitama) into her group. She''s also a self-declared member of the Saitama Group.', '/uploads/images/c_81931.png'),
(88, 'Bofoi', 'ボフォイ', '配角', 'Tesshou Genda', '__Race:__ Human __Alias:__ Metal Knight __Location:__ Z-City __Abilities:__ Weapons; Large remotely controlled robot, with lots of firepower __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ S-Class; Rank: 6 __Affiliation:__ The Heroes Association S-Class Rank 6 of the Hero Association. Besides fighting, Bofoi also provides many services for the Hero Association, such as weaponry sponsorships and facility construction.', '/uploads/images/c_81933.jpg'),
(88, 'Satoru', 'サトル', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Race:__ Human __Location:__ Z-City __Weapons:__ Gauntlets __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ C-Class; Rank: 1 __Affiliation:__ Heroes Association License-less Rider is a C-Class Hero from Z-City. He has the #1 rank of the C-Class.', '/uploads/images/c_81935.png'),
(88, 'Tanktop Tiger', 'タンクトップタイガー ', '配角', 'Hiromu Miyazaki', '**Race:** Human **Occupation:** Superhero **Level:** C-Class; Rank: 6 **Affiliation:** The Heroes Association Tanktop Tiger (タンクトップタイガー Tankutopu Taiga) is a C-Class superhero, rank 6, and the younger brother of Tanktop Black Hole. __Appearance:__ Tanktop Tiger is a large, muscular man who has tiger stripes running through his hair and eyebrows. He wears a tiger stripped tanktop. Tanktop Tiger is especially loud and obnoxious. He is confident in his own power and looks down upon superhero newbies, making him quite arrogant and hostile.', '/uploads/images/c_81939.jpg'),
(88, 'Tanktop Black Hole', 'タンクトップブラックホール', '配角', 'Atsushi Imaruoka', '__Race:__ Human __Alias:__ Tanktop Black Hole __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ B-Class __Affiliation:__ The Heroes Association __Partner:__ Tanktop Tiger Tanktop Black Hole is a B-Class hero and the older brother of Tanktop Tiger. Tanktop Black Hole is a large, well-built man with short black hair. He wears a very simple costume of pants and a black tanktop. He has a rather confident and stubborn personality. He refuses to believe a C-Class hero could ever be capable of destroying the meteor. He is also a rather charismatic person, shown by his ability to bend a crowd to his will.', '/uploads/images/c_81941.jpg'),
(88, 'Ougon Ball', '黄金ボール', '配角', 'Souta Arai', '__Race:__ Human __Weapons:__ Slingshot __Abilities:__ Shape Memory Gold __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ A-Class; Rank: 29 __Affiliation:__ Heroes Association Golden Ball is an A-Class Superhero, rank 29. He was partnered with Spring Mustache to investigate the Kombu Infinity rumor in Z-City. He is a rather confident man, who believes he does not need to prepare for a fight.', '/uploads/images/c_81943.jpg'),
(88, 'Agoni', 'アゴーニ', '配角', '', 'Race: Human Location: A-City Occupation: Founder of The Heroes Association Affiliation: The Heroes Association Agoni is a multi-millionaire and the founder of The Heroes Association. He had the idea for said group when his grandson was attacked by a Mysterious Being 3 years prior to the time One Punch-Man is set.', '/uploads/images/c_81945.jpg'),
(88, 'Mosquito Musume', 'モスキート娘', '配角', 'Miyuki Sawashiro', 'Mosquito Girl (モスキート娘 Mosukito Musume) is a prototype artificial mutant created by Dr. Genus of the House of Evolution. As a hybrid between human and mosquito, she has control over large swarms of the insects, using them to collect blood as sustenance or repair any bodily damage.', '/uploads/images/c_85797.png'),
(88, 'Ground Dragon', 'グランド ドラゴン', '配角', 'Shinya Hamazoe', '__Affiliation:__ House of Evolution', '/uploads/images/c_85981.jpg'),
(88, 'Armored Gorilla', 'アーマードゴリラ', '配角', 'Shouta Yamamoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_85983.jpg'),
(88, 'Asura Kabuto', '阿修羅カブト', '配角', 'Unshou Ishizuka', 'Carnage Kabuto (阿修羅カブト, Ashura Kabuto) was an artificial mutant created by Dr. Genus of the House of Evolution and is by far their strongest creation.', '/uploads/images/c_85991.jpg'),
(88, 'Hammer-Head', 'ハンマーヘッド', '配角', 'Wataru Takagi', '__Height:__ 215 cm (7''0") Leader of the Paradise Group. Is a wanted class B criminal with a past criminal record of numerous violent offenses.', '/uploads/images/c_86019.jpg'),
(88, 'Banken Man', '番犬マン', '配角', 'Yuuji Ueda', 'Watchdog Man (番犬マン Banken-man) is a S-Class Rank 12 professional hero who is in charge of Q-City. Watchdog Man has been shown to be very blunt and nonchalant. He acts like a dog at all times, speaking sparingly, sitting on his haunches while alert or loitering, and curling up in a dog bed while asleep. He takes a stance on all fours while fighting, rather than standing upright to confront enemies.', '/uploads/images/c_86027.png'),
(88, 'Puri-Puri Prisoner', 'ぷりぷりプリズナー', '配角', 'Masaya Onosaka', '__Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ S-Class; Rank 17 Puri-Puri Prisoner is a flamboyant, openly homosexual superhero. He takes an interest in other, up-and-coming heroes and criminals; an interest which led to his titular jail sentence, as he kept attacking them. Criminals that he apprehends are then added to his harem.', '/uploads/images/c_86029.png'),
(88, 'Ikemen Kamen Amai Mask', 'イケメン仮面アマイマスク', '配角', 'Mamoru Miyano', '__Race:__ Human ~!Mysterious Being (Ugmon)!~ __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ A-Class; Rank 1. Sweet Mask is a tall and lean-built young man with messy, shoulder-length light blue hair and yellow eyes. He is considered to be very handsome by the public. Aside from being a hero he is also a famous model, actor and singer, being the most popular one in the world. Sweet Mask has stated that he believes that heroes are to protect the citizens, and if they can''t do that, they must become strong enough to be able to do so. He also genuinely cares for the well-being of the citizens around him and actually wishes happiness upon every living thing in the universe. However, befitting the darker side of Sweet Mask''s name is his hidden merciless nature. He is shown to have a burning hatred for anything that he sees as evil. Anything that he declares as evil must be swiftly and thoroughly exterminated. Sweet Mask is shown to adhere to any method that makes heroes popular. He notes that only promotions to S-Class or A-Class are fit for his attention, as they are the heroes who draw the most attention from the public, and hence, any heroes in those ranks who earn themselves negative reputations would drag his reputation down as well. Because of this, Sweet Mask stays in the A-Class Rank 1 position to prevent unworthy heroes from promoting to S-Class. Sweet Mask is very narcissistic about "beauty overwhelming the power", as he said about his philosophy that "heroes have to be beautiful a', '/uploads/images/c_86031.png'),
(88, 'Stinger', 'スティンガー', '配角', 'Tomokazu Seki', '__Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ A-Class; Rank 11', '/uploads/images/c_86033.png'),
(88, 'Max', 'マックス', '配角', 'Souichirou Hoshi', 'Max (マックス, Makkusu), also known by his hero alias Lightning Max (イナズマックス, Inazumakkusu), is the A-Class Rank 19 professional hero for the Hero Association. Max is shown to think ahead and spy on his target to know how to defeat them but it is shown that he has some doubt in his abilities.', '/uploads/images/c_86035.jpg'),
(88, 'Banehige', 'バネヒゲ', '配角', 'Makoto Yasumura', '__Level:__ A-Class; Rank: 33 Spring Mustachio is an intelligent, serious man who doesn''t back down, as shown by his persistence in fighting Kombu Infinity, even after being beaten up rather badly. He also shares a bond with fellow A-Class hero Golden Ball, as they regularly pair up to hunt monsters and share drinks in their spare time.', '/uploads/images/c_86039.png'),
(88, 'All Back-Man', 'オールバックマン', '配角', 'Hiromichi Tezuka', '__Rank:__ Class-C', '/uploads/images/c_86049.jpg'),
(88, 'Kombu Infinity', '昆布インフィニティ', '配角', 'Ami Naitou', 'Mysterious Being that dwell in Z-City. It heard a rumor that a strong being was present in the outskirts of the town that drew strong Heroes opponents to it.', '/uploads/images/c_86055.png'),
(88, 'Shinkaiou', '深海王', '配角', 'Rikiya Koyama', 'The Deep Sea King (深海王, Shinkaiō) ruled over the Seafolk as their king, and claimed the deep sea as his own. The Deep Sea King is a rather sadistic individual, who enjoys causing pain to others and starting fights. He is determined to take the surface world for himself to rule. He regards people as little more than food and has no qualms about treating them as such. He is also very arrogant and prideful, considering himself to be better than everyone and stating that he stands at the very top of the pyramid of all living organisms on the planet.', '/uploads/images/c_86057.png'),
(88, 'King', 'キング', '配角', 'Hiroki Yasumoto', '__Race:__ Human __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ S-Class; Rank 7 __Affiliation:__ The Heroes Association Despite not being the highest ranked hero of the Heroes Association, he is considered to be the most powerful man on Earth, and it is due to this strength that he receives praise and respect from fellow heroes. His strength is so feared that criminals and mysterious beings will surrender before having to fight him. Appearance: King has slightly long, blonde, brushed back hair along with three long scars on the left side of his face. He wears a turtleneck sweater, has sunken cheeks, a defined jawline and a squarish chin. Notably, a loud drumming sound may be heard in his proximity. The King Engine is a rumbling sound that others claim occurs when King readies for battle or when he is generally serious having an intimidating effect on his opponents. ~! In actuality, it is simply the sound of King''s heartbeat which, when he is frightened, is so loud that it can be heard outside his body, but because of King''s intimidating reputation people mistake it for bloodlust. King is able to appear to remain calm in threatening situations as well as put out an extremely threatening aura. Despite the intimidating personality King projects, he is actually a coward and an otaku. He has been shown to get very excited about buying a dating game. Saitama saved his life many times, but always end up getting all the credits that was supposed to be for the latter. With this misunderstanding,', '/uploads/images/c_88907.png'),
(88, 'Bad', 'バッド', '配角', 'Wataru Hatano', 'Bad (バッド, Baddo), also known by his hero alias Metal Bat (金属バット, Kinzoku Batto), is the S-Class Rank 15 professional hero for the Hero Association. Metal Bat is a young man with black hair styled in a pompadour, and dark eyes that emphasize his hot temper. Metal Bat has a great deal of confidence in himself, stating that he did not care whether a threat is a Demon or Dragon level. Like [Saitama](https://anilist.co/character/73935/Saitama), he doesn''t care about his rank, and accidentally kills his enemies faster than he intended.', '/uploads/images/c_89156.png'),
(88, 'Boros-sama', 'ボロス様', '配角', 'Toshiyuki Morikawa', '__Race:__ Alien __Height:__ 240 cm (7''10½") __Occupation__: Space Pirate __Disaster Level:__ Dragon (or higher) Boros was the leader of the Dark Matter Thieves, a group of alien invaders responsible for the destruction of A-City. Like Saitama, Boros faced a self-imposed existential crisis, having become so powerful that no battle thrilled him. ~!Boros was the first on-screen opponent of Saitama that survived after getting punched, much to the hero''s surprise. In fact, he is the very first of Saitama''s opponents that took more than one punch to kill; Saitama even considered him to be the strongest opponent he had faced so far.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89263.png'),
(88, 'Garou', 'ガロウ', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''9") Garou is a former disciple of [Bang](https://anilist.co/character/81141), but was kicked out from his dojo for going on a rampage. He''s one of the strongest characters in the series and plays a major role as the main villain in the Hero Hunt arc. Garou is introduced as an evil character with a hatred for heroes and a confident, vindictive personality. He hates being insulted and will attack or kill any who offend him. He thinks highly of himself and uses that assertion to threaten high ranking personal such as heroes and [Shicchi](https://anilist.co/character/137876/Sitch). He does not consider other human villains to be allies, wiping out a large group of them along with the heroes present. He will also attack low ranked hero and hero staff members if he encounters them. A large aspect of his personality seems to be some sort of disdain for his former master, Bang, enough to avoid using the Water Stream Rock Smashing Fist he was taught unless seriously cornered. He has no remorse even for people who aid him, as he smashed [Licenseless Rider](https://anilist.co/character/81935)''s face soon after the latter defended him. Although Garou is an evil character, he possesses some kind of morality: he lets heroes live so that they can grow stronger and fight him again. In some ways, Garou can be considered the opposite to [Saitama](https://anilist.co/character/73935). Where Saitama wanted to be a hero who fought villains from his childhood, Garou wanted to ', '/uploads/images/c_89277.png'),
(88, 'Suiryu', 'スイリュー', '配角', '', 'Suiryu is a Martial Artist and user of the Void Fist. He is said to be a top contender in the Super Fight tournament. Suiryu is an easygoing and carefree man usually seen smiling and is a notorious playboy, who would rather spend time with women than training. He is also very eager to fight strong opponents and believes the reason for fighting is to live an easy life without worry. During fights, Suiryu holds back in an effort to make any fight more interesting, only using his legs during his fights and later defeating his opponents with one kick. While fighting he tries to make small talk and after he defeats his opponents, he sarcastically apologizes to them for being too strong. Suiryu is a martial arts prodigy. Despite having spent most of his time goofing off or not taking his lessons seriously, he still ultimately became one of the most revered martial artists in the world, considered a legend for winning four Super Fight tournaments in a row.', '/uploads/images/c_132939.png'),
(88, 'Zombieman', 'ゾンビマン', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', '__Race:__ Human-Mutant __Abilities:__ Regeneration __S-Class:__ Rank 8 __Affiliation:__ Hero Association __Personality:__ Zombieman is stated to be nihilistic, possibly due to the fact that he has "died" several times, therefore he is always calm. In addition, he prefers to work as a lone wolf and dislikes gathering, although he still respects common courtesy. However, he appears to have a sadistic side, since he enjoys killings that create rivers of blood, he is also shown to be a rather smart individual, with detective-like thinking. In comparison to the other S-Class heroes, Zombieman is more thoughtful and respectful. __Abilities__: Zombieman possesses one of the best regeneration capabilities in the series. He is able to regenerate any part of his body no matter how severe the injury is, and he was able to heal his broken arms in an instant. He needs only a few minutes to recover from an extremely mutilated state and regrow his left arm, however this regeneration does not give Zombieman full immortality, as he will die if he is reduced to mincemeat. Zombieman has an incredible threshold for extensive physical activity, displaying one of the most impressive feats of stamina in the series and being able to fight for hours on end while his expedient recovery rate handles the more serious of injuries he suffers.', '/uploads/images/c_133835.png'),
(88, 'Isamu', 'イサム', '配角', 'Minami Takayama', '__Height:__ 135cm (4''5") __Race:__ Human __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ S-Class; Rank: 5 __Affiliation:__ Heroes Association Child Emperor is a young boy with large eyes. He wears a plain T-shirt with two buttons both of which are buttoned, along with a black school bag on his back. As a genius, the Child Emperor values education, which can be seen when he mentions about going to cram school even after hearing about the Earth being in danger. He easily becomes infuriated when being labeled as childish by others. He is very analytical, observing the situation and formulating plans in a calm and collected manner.', '/uploads/images/c_137661.png'),
(88, 'Sitch', 'シッチ', '配角', 'Nobuo Tobita', 'Sitch (シッチ, Shicchi) is the Minister Officer of Justice for the Hero Association.', '/uploads/images/c_137876.jpg'),
(88, 'Matsuge', 'マツゲ', '配角', 'Yoshiaki Hasegawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_137879.png'),
(88, 'Charanko', 'チャランコ', '配角', 'Toshiki Masuda', 'Charanko is a Martial Artist and Bang''s last and only disciple before he was expelled during Garou''s hero hunt.', '/uploads/images/c_138979.jpg'),
(88, 'Kudou Kishi', '駆動騎士', '配角', '', 'Drive Knight (駆動騎士, Kudō Kishi) is the S-Class Rank 9 professional hero for the Hero Association.Drive Knight has long black hair and wears a white mask. His mask has a single horizontal slit for the eyes, and a single red shining eye in the center of the slit. The mask has three small vertical slits where his mouth should be. His armor is rather simplistic, being similar to a medieval black knights'' armor.', '/uploads/images/c_138980.png'),
(88, 'Senkou no Flash', '閃光のフラッシュ', '配角', 'Kousuke Toriumi', '__Race__: Human __Age__: 25 __Abilities__: Superhuman Speed and Agility, Master Swordsman, Ninjutsu Master __Occupation__: Superhero __S-Class__: Rank 13 __Personality__: Flashy Flash is a calm and serious man but he also appears to be quite arrogant. Despite his collected composure, Flashy Flash has a tendency to be hasty and reckless. __Abilities__: As an S-Class hero, Flashy Flash is very powerful. In terms of speed, Flashy Flash is arguably the fastest S-Class hero in the association, except for Blast and Saitama. Flashy was shown to be strong enough to combat and kill two Dragon-level threats simultaneously. He can deliver powerful kicks that can stun Dragon-level monsters. He can also easily cut massive pieces of stone and create giant explosions throughout his fighting.', '/uploads/images/c_138981.png'),
(88, 'Kamikaze', 'カミカゼ', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', '__Race:__ Human __Abilities:__ Superhuman Physical Prowess, Master Swordsmanship __Occupation:__ Superhero, Swordsmanship Teacher __Affiliation:__ Hero Association, Council of Swordmasters __Level:__ S-Class Rank 4 __Personality:__ Atomic Samurai has a rather prideful and jocular personality as seen when he refused to shake Saitama''s hand, telling him that he only acknowledges the strong, and telling Saitama that he would greet him properly only if he makes it to the higher ranks of S-Class. Atomic Samurai also enjoys his swordplay and makes a game out of it, often taunting monsters and showing off as he cuts them to pieces, Kamikaze also is straightforward to a humorous degree in many ways, and is incredibly confident and cocky. __Abilities:__ Atomic Samurai is one of the top S-Class heroes. He is regarded as one of the most powerful of them, and the strongest backup hero in the Hero Association, he is also considered Earth''s strongest swordsman. Atomic Samurai possesses extreme levels of speed, being able to cut his opponents to pieces in the blink of an eye using his sword.', '/uploads/images/c_154767.png'),
(88, 'Melzargard', 'メルザルガルド', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', '__Race__: Alien Melzalgald was one of the Alien Invaders who attacked A-City. Its body is able to change shape and It has multiple heads, each of which is able to separate and form its own body.', '/uploads/images/c_156124.jpg'),
(88, 'Tanktop Master', 'タンクトップマスター', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', '**Race:** Human **Occupation:** Superhero **Level:** S-Class; Rank: 14 **Affiliation:** The Heroes Association Much like the other heroes with the Tanktop motif, Tanktop Tiger and Tanktop Black Hole, Tanktop Master is a muscular man with a tanktop and short hair. However, unlike the other Tanktop heroes, no known color is associated with Tanktop Master''s name. In the first anniversary color spread of the manga, he is shown with blonde hair and a blue tank top. Tanktop Master has a chivalrous nature, which can be seen when he noted that even if Tornado is ranked 2nd, he should not let a "little girl" handle dangerous enemies on her own, despite the fact that Tornado is actually an adult. He is also unafraid to admit defeat, for example, when he was outclassed by Tornado during the encounter of Dark Matter Thieves'' aircraft.', '/uploads/images/c_156125.png'),
(88, 'Chougoukin Kurobikari', '超合金クロビカリ', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', '**Race:** Human **Occupation:** Superhero Superalloy Blackluster is a large, bald man with round eyes and a defined jawline. He is very muscular, with a thick neck, large and well-defined pectoral and abdominal muscles and large, muscular arms.', '/uploads/images/c_156126.png'),
(88, 'Lin Lin', 'リンリン', '配角', 'Risa Tsumugi', 'Lin Lin is a Martial Artist and user of the Palm Bell Fist.', '/uploads/images/c_158071.jpg'),
(88, 'Iaian', 'イアイアン', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', 'Iaian is the A-Class Rank 2 professional hero of the Hero Association and the top disciple of Atomic Samurai. Iaian is described to be persistent in battle, refusing to back down regardless of whether his enemy is stronger or more skilled. Despite his persistence, he is in fact very analytical in battle, determining the strength of his opponent, all of their abilities and he also does not underestimate his opponent.', '/uploads/images/c_165855.png'),
(88, 'Geryuganshoop', 'ゲリュガンシュプ', '配角', 'Hiroki Gotou', 'Geryuganshoop was an alien, a general of the Dark Matter Thieves, and the right-hand man of Boros.', '/uploads/images/c_208320.jpg'),
(88, 'Fukegao', 'フケガオ', '配角', 'Takuma Suzuki', '__Occupation:__ Scientist Fukegao was a genius scientist who developed the Biceps Brachii King steroid, which turned his brother Marugori into a mutated giant.', '/uploads/images/c_208321.jpg'),
(88, 'Ago no Wareta Gaki', 'アゴの割れたガキ', '配角', 'Ami Naitou', '~!Ago no Wareta Gaki is the grandson of Agoni, the multimillionaire founder of the Hero Association.!~ He was saved by Saitama from Crablante three years prior to the start of the series.', '/uploads/images/c_208322.jpg'),
(88, 'Denchi Man', '電池マン', '配角', 'Hiromichi Tezuka', 'Denchi Man is a C-Class Rank 85 professional hero for the Hero Association.', '/uploads/images/c_208323.jpg'),
(88, 'Marugori', 'マルゴリ', '配角', 'Shinya Hamazoe', 'Marugori also called Beefcake, was a human who drank the Biceps Brachii King steroid developed by Fukegao, which turned him into a mutated giant.', '/uploads/images/c_208324.jpg'),
(88, 'Groribas', 'グロリバース', '配角', 'Shinya Hamazoe', 'Groribas is an Alien, who works for Boros'' team, the "Dark Matter Thieves". He is a Dragon-Level threat and has a large imposing body. Its head and hands consist of eyeless mouths with rows of long sharp teeth. His head has a spiky collar around his neck and is quite muscular. He can use acid and hand to hand combat to its fullest usage leading him to be called the best warrior by Geryuganshoop.', '/uploads/images/c_247693.jpg'),
(88, 'Lily', 'リリー', '配角', 'Ari Ozawa', 'The Class B Rank 74 hero who is the personal assistant of Fubuki of the Blizzard Bunch. She uses a staff as her fighting weapon.', '/uploads/images/c_261832.png'),
(88, 'Hige Shokuin', 'ヒゲ職員', '配角', 'Shouta Yamamoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_286886.png'),
(88, 'Megane Shokuin', 'メガネ職員', '配角', 'Youji Ueda', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_290637.png'),
(88, 'Exma', 'エクスマ', '配角', 'Risa Tsumugi', 'Executive for the Hero Association. She is the deputy chief of the Hero Disciplinary Supervision Division', '/uploads/images/c_307001.png'),
(88, 'Sekingar', 'セキンガル', '配角', 'Yoshihito Sasaki', 'Executive in the Hero Association. He commands the mission to rescue Waganma.', '/uploads/images/c_307003.png'),
(88, 'Blue Fire', 'ブルーファイア', '配角', 'Yoshiaki Hasegawa', 'Blue Fire is an A-Class Rank 6 professional hero for the Hero Association.', '/uploads/images/c_326805.png'),
(88, 'Armored Kakarichou', 'アーマード係長', '配角', '', 'He is one of the C class hero.', '/uploads/images/c_326806.png'),
(88, 'Bun-Bun Man', 'ブンブンマン', '配角', '', 'Class C superhero.', '/uploads/images/c_326807.png'),
(88, 'Kaeru Otoko', 'カエル男', '配角', 'Hiroki Gotou', 'Race: Artificial Mutant Abilities: Weapns; Wakizashi Level: Tiger Affiliation: House of Evolution Debut: Chapter 7/Episode 2 Frog-Man was an artificial mutant created by Dr. Genus of the House of Evolution. Appearance: Frog-Man is a humanoid frog. He has large eyes, a white stomach and throat, black spots on his back and arms, and a scar that runs across his face. He wears a wide belt with a tanto stuck through it, black pants, sandals, a pendant necklace and has a kanji tattoo on his left shoulder. Overall, his appearance is that of a yakuza underling. Personality: Nothing is known about Frog-Man''s personality due to his quick defeat by Saitama and eventual death at the hands of Beast King.', '/uploads/images/c_326808.png'),
(88, 'Namekujarasu', 'ナメクジャラス', '配角', 'Shinya Hamazoe', '__Race:__ Artificial Mutant __Abilities:__ Telepathy __Level:__ Tiger __Affiliation:__ House of Evolution __Debut:__ Chapter 7/Episode 2 Slugerous was an artificial mutant created by Dr. Genus of the House of Evolution. Appearance: Slugerous is a humanoid slug. He has a black spotted, very slug-like torso and head with the addition of arms and legs and a nose and mouth. Personality: Nothing is known of Slugerous'' personality due death at the hands of Beast King.', '/uploads/images/c_326809.png'),
(88, 'Kamakyuri', 'カマキュリー', '配角', 'Yoshiaki Hasegawa', '__Race:__ Artificial Mutant __Abilities:__ Weapons; Insect Fangs __Level:__ Tiger __Affiliation:__ House of Evolution __Debut:__ Chapter 7/Episode 2 Kamakyuri was an artificial mutant created by Dr. Genus. He is an advanced form of praying mantis, and purported to be among the stronger specimens of the House of Evolution. Appearance: Kamakyuri is a tall humanoid creature with many insect-like qualities. He is encased in a segmented, thorny exoskeleton, with clawed feet and serrated, scythe-like forelegs, similar to those of a praying mantis. Mandibles protrude on each side of his mouth, and the top of his skull is transparent and reflective, revealing his brain. Personality: Nothing is known of Kamakyuri''s personality due to his defeat by Saitama.', '/uploads/images/c_326810.png'),
(88, 'Chitei Hito', '地底人', '配角', 'Shouta Yamamoto', '__Race:__ Mysterious Being __Location:__ Under the earth''s crust __Abilities:__ Immense Strength __Affiliation:__ Mother Earth __Debut:__ Chapter 4/Episode 1 The Subterranean People are the self-proclaimed "True People of the Earth". They are ruled by the Subterranean King and live under the earth''s crust, but grew too numerous in numbers and planned to take over the surface.', '/uploads/images/c_326811.png'),
(88, 'Chitei Ou', '地底王', '配角', 'Youji Ueda', '__Race:__ Mysterious Being __Location:__ Under the earth''s crust __Abilities:__ Superhuman Strength __Weapons:__ Lava Swords __Affiliation:__ Mother Earth __Debut:__ Chapter 4/Episode 1 The Subterranean King is the king of the Subterranean People. He led his people from below the surface to conquer the area on it.', '/uploads/images/c_326812.png'),
(88, 'Smile Man', 'スマイルマン', '配角', 'Reigo Yamaguchi', 'Smile Man is a A-Class Rank 27 professional hero for the Hero Association.', '/uploads/images/c_326813.png'),
(88, 'Hero Kyoukai Shokuin', 'ヒーロー協会職員', '配角', 'Kanami Satou', 'A currently unnamed Z Branch Operator for the Hero Association.', '/uploads/images/c_326814.png'),
(88, 'Super Custom YO649Z Mk. II', 'バリカスタムよ649ZマークⅡ', '配角', 'Hiroki Gotou', 'Mysterious being.', '/uploads/images/c_326815.png'),
(88, 'Shibabawa', 'シババワ', '配角', 'Kimiko Saitou', '__Race:__ Human __Occupation:__ Fortune Teller Shibabawa was a renowned fortune teller that resided in G-City. Shibabawa is an old woman with white hair, long fingernails, very thin eyebrows and many wrinkles. She has sunken cheeks and very few teeth. She wears a pearl necklace and earrings. Not much is known of her personality, but she seems to fear a ''great disaster'' she foretold.', '/uploads/images/c_326816.png'),
(89, 'Yato', '夜ト', '主角', 'Hiroshi Kamiya', '__Race:__ God __Height:__ 174 cm (5’8”) __Occupation:__ God of War, Delivery God, God of Calamity (previously) Yato is one of the three main protagonists of Noragami. An obscure god who considers himself a God of Fortune / Happiness and War, he has been labeled a God of Calamity and Depression in the past. Yato''s dream is to become a famous god, whom everyone worships. Yato can be mischievous, crude, and unpredictable in his behavior. He often has a low tolerance for something he wants, usually causing those around him to become upset. Furthermore, he is rather childish and gullible at times. Yato will often indulge in fantasies of being a very successful God with more followers than any other deity; shrines full of luxury and shrine maiden at his fingertips. As his existence would end if he were to be forgotten, he has developed Athazagoraphobia. ~!It is revealed that Yato''s real name is Yaboku (夜卜) Yaboku contains the kanji ya (夜 night) and boku (卜 divination). [Sakura](https://anilist.co/character/189754/Sakura) mistakenly read 卜 as the katakana ト to because of the similarities, thus giving the well-known alias name Yato.!~', '/uploads/images/c_84677.png'),
(89, 'Hiyori Iki', '壱岐ひより', '主角', 'Maaya Uchida', '__Race:__ Hanyou (Half Phantom, Half Human) __Height:__ 162,5 cm (~5''4") Hiyori Iki is a Half-Phantom who can leave her human body, being like this since she "saved" [Yato](https://anilist.co/character/84677/Yato) from an incoming bus. Despite being raised to be completely lady-like in a rich household, Hiyori is a huge martial arts fan and has a fixation on a martial artist called Touno, whom she adores and copies her attacks from. She often becomes inspired and acts on his words. Hiyori is a very pure, kind-hearted, and brave girl who will go out of her way to help someone in danger, even strangers, regardless of the severe consequences, including suffering from blight. She has a strong moral compass and is not above calling people out if she feels their actions are wrong. Hiyori is also extremely perceptive of those around her, but despite that she can be a bit air-headed too. She also has a strong liking to Yato''s smell and even called it her favorite smell on one occasion, but she becomes rather embarrassed by how much she likes it and dodges the subject whenever it is brought up.', '/uploads/images/c_84679.png'),
(89, 'Yukine', '雪音', '主角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Race:__ Shinki __Height:__ 147 cm (4''10") While wandering about as a spirit, Yukine was picked up by [Yato](https://anilist.co/character/84677) and made into a Shinki. When called "Sekki" he transforms into a katana. ~!He died at a young age, making him miss his normal life as a middle schooler. He acts like his age, and was once stealing money from people with the excuse that it''s okay since he''s dead. After being "saved" by [Hiyori](https://anilist.co/character/84679/Iki-Hiyori), he becomes more obedient and respects Yato and Hiyori. When he was alive he had trouble with his father as seen by Yato when he first obtains Yukine.!~ In a katana form, he finds Yato''s sweaty hands so disgusting that he calls him "Drippy."', '/uploads/images/c_84681.png'),
(89, 'Bishamon', '毘沙門', '主角', 'Miyuki Sawashiro', '__Race:__ God __Occupation:__ Goddess of Fortune and Goddess of War Bishamon is one of the Seven Gods of Fortune and also officially a Goddess of War and Warriors. She is intent on keeping order among the gods. Due to her past with [Yato](https://anilist.co/character/84677/Yato), she is bent on vengeance and decided to destroy anything he held dear to himself. Despite being a goddess, Bishamon is shown to be quite generous towards her Shinki. She willingly accepts any wandering and troubled spirit, useful or not, and adds them to her family. Due to her failure in the past involving Shinki, Bishamon decides to be more distant from them, depicting herself as a fierce goddess and making sure that they are not worried about her, which only resulted to them being more insecure and lonely. In the anime, Bishamon''s hair is depicted as blonde, as opposed of the silver hair in the manga.', '/uploads/images/c_88239.jpg'),
(89, 'Kazuma', '兆麻', '主角', 'Jun Fukuyama', '__Race:__ Shinki Kazuma is a calm, serious, and sensible person. He is one of [Bishamon''s](https://anilist.co/character/88239/Bishamon) Shinki and cares about her deeply. When he is called by his shinki name, "Chouki", Kazuma transforms into a cherry blossom-shaped earring with the ability to navigate and track others. ~!He is a Blessed Regalia.!~', '/uploads/images/c_88240.png'),
(89, 'Kofuku Ebisu', 'エビス 小福', '配角', 'Aki Toyosaki', 'Originally introduced as [Yato''s](https://anilist.co/character/84677/Yato) girlfriend that he frequently shakes down for money, Kofuku is later revealed to be the infamous Binbougami - a Japanese Goddess of Poverty. She goes by the cover name "Kofuku Ebisu" in order to make it seem as though she is a god of fortune. She has a Shinki named [Daikoku](https://anilist.co/character/88691/Daikoku).', '/uploads/images/c_88241.png'),
(89, 'Tenjin', '天神', '配角', 'Tooru Ookawa', 'He is the infamous god of academics. He has several shinki, all of them women (including Yato''s former shinki); and has his own shrine, much to Yato''s envy. He would sometimes assume human form to intervene if, for example, Yato goes out of control playing around.', '/uploads/images/c_88689.png'),
(89, 'Daikoku', '大黒', '配角', 'Daisuke Ono', 'Daikoku is [Kofuku''s](https://anilist.co/character/88241) somewhat overprotective shinki. He regards himself as Kofuku''s husband.', '/uploads/images/c_88691.png'),
(89, 'Nora', '野良', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', '__Race:__ Shinki __Occupation:__ Stray __Nora__ is a former shinki of [Yato](https://anilist.co/character/84677/Yato). "Nora," meaning "stray," is how the gods call any shinki who has many masters and many names, most notable owners of Nora are ~! [Ebisu](https://anilist.co/character/89120/Ebisu) and [Takemikazuchi](https://anilist.co/character/159592/Takemikazuchi) !~ Nora, at first comes off as very gentle and kind. She seems to care deeply for Yato, and continually prompts him to use her, because she was once a human and all she wanted was to have a family that cared about her. ~!Later, it is revealed how manipulating and cruel she is. She tries to kill Yukine, as well as taunt him, due to the fact that he was impure, but also because she wants Yato to use her instead of him. She also tries to kill Hiyori due to how close she has gotten to Yato and believing she has softened him. She is depicted to show interest in anything with beauty, as shown when she commented on Yukine''s eyes. She, just as Yato, is influenced and controlled by the actions and demands of "Father". Although she is initially seen as a villain, she is another puppet in the grand scheme of Yato''s father. !~', '/uploads/images/c_88692.png'),
(89, 'Ebisu', '恵比寿', '配角', 'Ryoutarou Okiayu', '__Race:__ God __Age:__ Ancient __Occupation:__ God of Fishing and Commerce __Ebisu__ is one of the Seven Gods of Fortune. He is the humorless God of Fishing and Commerce. Initially, Ebisu appears very stoic, always bearing a near-emotionless facial expression and speaking in a reserved, polite, yet aloof tone. He is also highly pragmatic and resourceful, constantly progressing towards his goals and willing to go to great lengths to achieve what he is after. Despite his aloof appearance and personality, he can actually be a silly person, making him appear rather comically serious at times. He is a kind god at heart. ~!Ebisu is later revealed to be attempting to gain control over phantoms; a severe taboo if not sin in the eyes of the heavensl.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89120.png'),
(89, 'Aiha', '藍巴', '配角', 'Hisako Toujou', 'Aiha (藍巴) is one of Bishamonten''s Shinki. As a Shinki, she takes the form of a medieval suit of armour with a long skirt.', '/uploads/images/c_89296.jpg'),
(89, 'Kouto Fujisaki', '藤崎浩人', '配角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Age:__ Looks 16, 1100+ (real) Fujisaki Kouto (藤崎浩人, Fujisaki Kōto) is a third year student at Hiyori Iki''s school. ~!He is possessed by Yato and Nora’s "Father", a conjurer of phantoms who deceived the gods.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89297.png'),
(89, 'Izanami', 'イザナミ', '配角', 'Hibiku Yamamura', 'Izanami (イザナミ) is one of the most powerful gods, serving as the Queen of the Underworld. She is also the "mother" of the first gods, including Ebisu.', '/uploads/images/c_89298.png'),
(89, 'Kinuha', '紝巴', '配角', 'Kanami Satou', 'Kinuha (紝巴), is a current Regalia to Bishamonten. She turns into a whip in her shinki form. Her vessel name is Jinki (紝器).', '/uploads/images/c_89299.png'),
(89, 'Kugaha', '陸巴', '配角', 'Takanori Hoshino', 'Kugaha is shown to be helpful and caring at first. ~!He was one of Bishamon''s former Shinki who conspired against her. He worked under the guise of a doctor while attempting to poison first her Regalia and ultimately, her. Upon being discovered, he was exiled and stripped of his name.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89300.jpg'),
(89, 'Kuraha', '囷巴', '配角', 'Kazuhiko Inoue', 'Kuraha is a current Regalia to Bishamon. His regalia form is a male lion with a scar on his right eye.', '/uploads/images/c_89301.png'),
(89, 'Ookuninushi', '大国主', '配角', 'Shunsuke Sakuya', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_89302.jpg'),
(89, 'Suzuha', '鈴巴', '配角', 'Koutarou Nishiyama', 'Suzuha is a young looking Shinki with a very kind personality. ~!He was one of Bishamon''s Shinki and Yukine''s first friend. It was revealed at the beginning of the season that his name hadn''t been called by Bishamon in years before he died.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89303.jpg'),
(89, 'Tsuguha', '紹巴', '配角', 'Ari Ozawa', 'Tsuguha is one of Bishamon''s Ten Shinki. She transforms into Bishamon''s bikini battle attire. Her vessel name is Shouki. ~!She becomes an ayakashi and is killed by Kazuma after finding out her birth name.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89304.png'),
(89, 'Aimi Tabata', '田端愛美', '配角', 'Yuuko Takayama', '__Nationality:__ Japanese __Occupation:__ High School Student Aimi Tabata is one of Hiyori''s friends from school. Not much has been shown about her personality. However, it is known that she is kind and supportive of Hiyori. She seems to be reasonable, calm, and mature. She often worries for Hiyori when she falls asleep (due to her soul slipping out of her body).', '/uploads/images/c_121612.jpg'),
(89, 'Mayu', '真喩', '配角', 'Asami Imai', '__Race:__ Shinki Mayu has a very honest personality and a strong sense of justice. During the time she worked for Yato, she couldn’t stand his attitudes because not only he always lazed around, but he also often talked about killing and didn’t seem to care about humans that needed his help. Because of this she complained a lot and always insulted and badmouthed Yato after she quit. Despite her attitudes towards Yato, she also respects Yato and cares for him. She often gets worried whenever Yato got into trouble even when she is serving Tenjin. At one point she volunteered herself to help Yato, who was impure due to Yukine’s actions.', '/uploads/images/c_121705.png'),
(89, 'Takemikazuchi', 'タケミカヅチ', '配角', 'Shinya Hamazoe', '__Race:__ God __Occupation:__ God of Thunder __Takemikazuchi__ is a God of Thunder, but he''s also sometimes identified as a God of Swords. A significant god, he is of high standing in the heavens and is known for his skill in combat. His most well-known shinki is Kiun. Loud and carefree, Takemikazuchi has a very dominant personality. His behavior stands in stark contrast to Kiun''s stern and reserved disposition. He can also be quite lazy, expressing reluctance to fulfill the mission he was entrusted with by the heavens at one point. Fitting his reputation as a god versed in combat, he seems to be bored with how peaceful Takamagahara is at present, claiming that he would''ve liked it if it was under some kind of threat for a change. ~!Takemikazuchi has a strong desire to obtain a blessed regalia, especially after seeing how powerful Kazuma''s attack on Kiun was despite him being just an earring. !~', '/uploads/images/c_159592.png'),
(89, 'Akiha', '秋巴', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_230841.png'),
(89, 'Kazuha', '数巴', '配角', 'Satomi Akesaka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_230842.png'),
(89, 'Karuha', '刈巴', '配角', 'Satomi Akesaka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_230843.png'),
(89, 'Ayu', '歩喩', '配角', 'Mao Ichimichi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_230845.png'),
(89, 'Nayu', '南喩', '配角', 'Himika Akaneya', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_230846.png'),
(89, 'Yugiha', '靫巴', '配角', 'Mariko Higashiuchi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_230847.png'),
(89, 'Moyu', '望喩', '配角', 'Shiori Izawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_230848.png'),
(89, 'Miyu', '実喩', '配角', 'Yuki Takao', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_230849.png'),
(89, 'Akira Yamashita', '山下晶', '配角', 'Minami Takahashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_230850.png'),
(89, 'Fukurokuju', '福禄寿', '配角', 'Kazumasa Nakamura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_230852.png'),
(89, 'Touma', '当麻', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_230853.png'),
(89, 'Mineha', '嶺巴', '配角', 'Yuki Takao', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_230854.png'),
(89, 'Benzaiten', '弁財天', '配角', 'Chihiro Ishiguro', 'She is one of the Seven Gods of Fortune. She is officially the goddess of knowledge, beauty, and art (especially music).', '/uploads/images/c_239595.png'),
(89, 'Hotei', '布袋', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', 'He is one of the Seven Gods of Fortune. He is officially the god of abundance and good health.', '/uploads/images/c_239596.png'),
(89, 'Jurojin', '寿老人', '配角', 'Shunichi Maki', 'He is one of the Seven Gods of Fortune. He is officially the god of long life.', '/uploads/images/c_239600.png'),
(89, 'Sasaki', '佐々木', '配角', 'Momoe Kishimoto', 'Caretaker for Hiyori''s house.', '/uploads/images/c_242235.png'),
(89, 'Fumiha', '文巴', '配角', 'Yuu Serizawa', 'is Bishamonten''s shinki.', '/uploads/images/c_247981.jpg'),
(89, 'Hiyori no Mama', 'ひよりのママ', '配角', 'Miki Itou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_267078.png'),
(89, 'Hiyori no Papa', 'ひよりのパパ', '配角', 'Hiroshi Yanaka', 'Hiyori''s dad. Has his own hospital', '/uploads/images/c_312687.jpg'),
(90, 'Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo', 'ボボボーボ・ボーボボ', '配角', '', 'This is the cool and incomprehensible hero, swarthy and musclebound, sporting sunglasses and a large golden afro. His hair is 24-karat gold but is usually said to be yellow or blonde; some viewers even argue about its true color. He is called Bo-bobo for short. He refuses to let people call him Bo. He fights with his nose hair using the Hanage Shinken (sometimes "Super Fist of the Nose Hair", other times "Snot Fou-You"), as well as simply confusing his enemies. His only weakness, which he discovered while visiting the world of Blabsalot, is the fact that he doesn''t have as many deadly attacks. He believes that the Fist of the Nose Hair is sacred and that he shouldn''t overuse it. He has three brothers and one sister. Bo-BoBo directs small "micromovies" in his own movie theatre "Bo-BoBo Gekijou" (Bo-BoBo Theater, but also called other names in the dub). He apparently has some control over an army of stuffed teddy bears which are seen in many episodes. There is an apparently large colony of tiny humans and humanoid boogers living in his nose. They sometimes aid him in battle.', '/uploads/images/c_3227.jpg'),
(90, 'Tetsuya Kuroko', '黒子テツヤ', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 168 cm (5''6") __School:__ Seirin High __Number:__ #11 __Speciality:__ Simple sleight of hand tricks The phantom sixth member of the "Generation of Miracles." He has a very weak presence and often seemingly appears out of nowhere as a result. At the first glance all of his abilities seem to be below average, but despite being bad at dribbling and shooting he can be a dangerous opponent. He specializes in circulating passes without being seen. Because of his largely complementary skill set, Kuroko considers himself a "shadow" whose goal is to help his "light" achieve greatness.', '/uploads/images/c_18769.png'),
(90, 'Nika Tamiya', '田宮仁香', '配角', '', 'Nika is a person with the ability of a switch girl. She can change personalities just like that. There are only 2 people in her school that know this about her. Her best friend from childhood and a handsome guy who also has an On and Off mode like her.', '/uploads/images/c_22467.jpg'),
(90, 'Koro-sensei', '殺せんせー ', '主角', 'Jun Fukuyama', '__Height:__ ~300cm (~9''10") He is a teacher for class 3-E of Kunugigaoka Junior High School and the main antihero of Ansatsu Kyoushitsu. He claims responsibility for blowing up the moon into a permanent crescent shape and plans to destroy the Earth in a year after teaching the students of class 3-E the art of assassination. His name comes from korosenai (殺せない), meaning "cannot be killed", and sensei (先生), meaning teacher. In this way, he is literally called the unkillable teacher. ~!Later in the story he is revealed to have been original reaper named Ryushi Korogane.!~', '/uploads/images/c_65643.png'),
(90, 'Nagisa Shiota', '潮田渚', '主角', 'Mai Fuchigami', '__Height:__ 159 cm (5''2.5") __Class:__ Class 3-E He is one of the students in Class 3-E. Nagisa is seen as one of the weakest students in the class due to his small stature and mediocre physical abilities that are comparable to a girl. However, he is actually the most talented to become an assassin out of all the students, something acknowledged by [Korosensei](https://anilist.co/character/65643) and [Karasuma](https://anilist.co/character/73881). He is able to draw closer while hiding his bloodlust to make a surprise attack and able to make his opponents falter through his bloodlust alone. Nagisa usually writes down Korosensei''s weaknesses that at first seen minor (since it doesn''t look like major weaknesses), but eventually revealed to be useful since once they''re able to almost kill Korosensei because of one of his weaknesses that is the same as the one that Nagisa has written down in his note. Outwardly friendly and polite to his friends and everyone, he hides a somewhat darker side of him as an assassin that won''t be able to be found out during daily classes and will only be shown during training and assassination time. According to Karasuma, whenever Nagisa unleashes his killing intent, he isn''t training and truly goes for a kill. ~!In the end, he kills [Koro-Sensei](https://anilist.co/character/65643/Korosensei).!~ ~!In the epilogue, 7 years later, Nagisa becomes a teacher of Paradise High School''s Class 3-5, Deciding to follow in Koro-sensei''s steps.!~', '/uploads/images/c_65645.png'),
(90, 'Karma Akabane', '赤羽業', '配角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '**Height:** 175 cm A student in [Koro-sensei](https://anilist.co/character/65643)''s class 3-E of Kunugigaoka Junior High School who had been suspended from school due to his violent behavior. He excels at using weaponry and foul play and is the only student thus far to have successfully injured Korosensei. Despite this, he is actually rather smart and manages a perfect score on one of Korosensei''s tests. He and [Nagisa](https://anilist.co/character/65645) were in the same class during their 1st and 2nd years at Kunugigaoka.', '/uploads/images/c_71933.jpg'),
(90, 'Tadaomi Karasuma', '烏間惟臣', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', 'He is a government worker associated with the Ministry of Defense. He first appeared announcing Korosensei''s deal with the government and their mission to assassinate him before the end of the year. He later became the assistant teacher and P.E. instructor of class 3-E, using his lessons to train the students in assassination techniques. He is well known among militaries for his outstanding reputation and is a powerful individual, which he has proven when he easily overpowered Irina''s master, who is a retired professional hitman, and even Korosensei himself is afraid upon seeing his capability for the first time. He is strict, but kind man, though he keeps a distance between himself and the students due to his status as an agent and his own professionalism. He is one of a few who is very perceptive enough to see Nagisa''s talent as an assassin. He seems to know Korosensei''s past, though he has no intention to indulge into it further.', '/uploads/images/c_73881.png'),
(90, 'Irina Jelavic', 'イリーナ・イェラビッチ', '配角', 'Shizuka Itou', '__Occupation:__ Professional Hitman, Part-time Foreign Language Teacher She is a professional hitwoman who is hired to kill [Korosensei](https://anilist.co/character/65643/Koro-sensei) by becoming a part-time foreign language teacher in class 3-E. She uses her charms to seduce Korosensei, making him at first obeys to whatever she asks. However, her first assassination attempt was foiled when Korosensei able to suppressed her 3-men''s attacks, ending in her humiliation and swore revenge. She teaches the students how to seduce people from other countries, so that with this method, they can learn foreign languages, and usually would punish male students who failed answering her questions during her lesson by kissing them. Irina is a deceitful, wily and beguiling individual; she frequently uses her charm to influence and manipulate her targets. She can easily befriend people, if she so chooses, and entice them to let down their defenses and become vulnerable to her. Seduction is primarily the technique she employs, and it is her area of expertise. Irina is a professional assassin who excels at handling infiltration and approaching targets. She possesses strong conversational skills in ten languages, and a proven track record of eleven jobs in countries all over the world.', '/uploads/images/c_73883.jpg'),
(90, 'Ritsu', '律', '配角', 'Saki Fujita', 'An artificial intelligence developed in Norway and sent to Class 3-E as a transfer student to dispose of [Korosensei](https://anilist.co/character/65643/Korosensei), able to learn his movement patterns and perfect her shooting skills in order to eventually kill him. After receiving a few modifications from Korosensei, she develops a conscience and becomes friends with the rest of class 3-E, who give her her shortened nickname. Thanks to her processing power, she frequently helps with Intel gathering and communications and usually interacts with others via a smartphone application developed by her classmates. She is portrayed by Kanna Hashimoto in the live action movie.', '/uploads/images/c_74832.png'),
(90, 'Kaede Kayano', '茅野カエデ', '配角', 'Aya Suzaki', 'She is one of [Nagisa](https://anilist.co/character/65645/Shiota-Nagisa)''s classmates and close friends, being the one who is mostly seen with him. She hasn''t shown any capabilities during her training to become an assassin, and so far has only been shown to discuss [Koro-sensei](https://anilist.co/character/65643/Korosensei)''s weaknesses along with Nagisa. She experiences a slight inferiority complex when it comes to sex appeal, resulting her to get angry whenever there''s a woman with big breasts and readily protest. ~!it''s revealed later in the story that she''s [Aguri Yukimura''s](https://anilist.co/character/207936/Aguri-Yukimura) younger sister, Akari Yukimura and her real birthday is on November 9.!~', '/uploads/images/c_85291.jpg'),
(90, 'Itona Horibe', '堀部イトナ', '配角', 'Megumi Ogata', 'Transfer student who aims to kill [Koro-sensei](https://anilist.co/character/65643). He is the second assassin transfer student to arrive at Class 3-E, following the previous assassin, [Ritsu](https://anilist.co/character/74832). He initially served as the secondary antagonist, before ultimately joining Class E for good. After being abandoned by [Shiro](https://anilist.co/character/176246) and befriending [Terasaka](https://anilist.co/character/85809) and his gang, Itona has since become more mellow and humble, and is now able to admit people are stronger than him, while still retaining his brutal honesty. He has also shown to be a very observant and creative individual.', '/uploads/images/c_85293.jpg'),
(90, 'Manami Okuda', '奥田愛美', '配角', 'Sayuri Yahagi', 'She is a student in class 3-E of Kunugigaoka Junior High School, taught by Korosensei. Okuda is shy and rather introverted. She admits that she isn''t really good with surprise attacks and expressing things in language. She excels in chemistry and capable of making poisons for assassinations.', '/uploads/images/c_85297.jpg'),
(90, 'Tomohito Sugino', '杉野友人', '配角', 'Yoshitaka Yamaya', 'He is one of the students and Nagisa''s close friends. He used to be a basketball player in their school''s basketball club until he was assigned into class 3-E, making him kicked out from the club. He dreams to become a professional baseball player like his idol, Arita, and emulates his techniques to improve his own performance in baseball and is shown to very dedicated to it. He also sometimes used his baseball techniques in his attempts to kill Korosensei. He has a crush on Yukiko.', '/uploads/images/c_85299.jpg'),
(90, 'Megu Kataoka', '片岡メグ', '配角', 'Chie Matsuura', 'She is a student of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. She is assigned to Class 3-E, where she trains to become a professional assassin, with her teacher as the target. She is one of the two class representatives of Class 3-E, with the other being [Yūma Isogai](https://anilist.co/character/85801/Isogai-Yuma). (Source: Ansatsu Kyoushitsu Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_85799.png'),
(90, 'Yuma Isogai', '磯貝悠馬', '配角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', 'He is a student and class rep in class 3-E of Kunugigaoka Junior High School, taught by Korosensei.', '/uploads/images/c_85801.jpg'),
(90, 'Yukiko Kanzaki', '神崎由紀子', '配角', 'Satomi Satou', 'She is a student of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. She is assigned to Class 3-E, where she trains to become a professional assassin, with her teacher as the target. Yukiko is diligent, ladylike, and cordial; although she does not particularly stand out, she is popular with her classmates. A very considerate individual, she had, on one occasion, volunteered to buy drinks for everyone in her class. Yukiko is deliberative and an excellent organizer. She was responsible for structuring the schedule for Class 3-E''s trip to Kyoto, and her work had impressed Korosensei. Furthermore, she is adept in considering all factors before making a decision, which is why she had chosen the virtually unoccupied Gion District as the ideal setting for the assassination to take place.', '/uploads/images/c_85803.jpg'),
(90, 'Takuya Muramatsu', '村松卓也', '配角', 'Kouki Harasawa', 'Takuya Muramatsu is a student of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. He is assigned to Class 3-E, where he trains to become a professional assassin, with his teacher as the target. His partners are Ryōma Terasaka and Taiji Yoshida. Muramatsu is an inconsiderate individual, unmindful to the consequences of his actions. He is willing to resort to any means in order to escape contemptible circumstances. He collaborates with Ryōma Terasaka and Taiji Yoshida, and together they pressure others to act according to their bidding.', '/uploads/images/c_85805.jpg'),
(90, 'Sousuke Sugaya', '菅谷宗介', '配角', 'Eiji Miyashita', 'He is a student of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. He is assigned to Class 3-E, where he trains to become a professional assassin, with his teacher as the target. Sousuke is exceptionally skilled at drawing and sculpting. His proficiency ranges from posters to disguise masks; he can make them with relative ease. He is also strongly individualistic, and launches attacks against Korosensei in a capricious, unpredictable manner; for instance, he offers to draw a Henna tattoo on Korosensei, but secretly had the Anti-Sensei bullets grounded into a fine powder and then mixed with the Henna paint. (Source: Assassination Classroom wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_85807.jpg'),
(90, 'Ryouma Terasaka', '寺坂竜馬', '配角', 'Subaru Kimura', 'He is a student of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. He is assigned to Class 3-E, where he trains to become a professional assassin, with his teacher as the target. His partners are Takuya Muramatsu and Taiji Yoshida. Terasaka is a rash, selfish and impatient individual. Desperate to escape from the miserable circumstances of being part of the dropout class, he is willing to resort to any means, even if the methods may be immoral. He holds no regards for the injuries of his comrades who provide assistance. However, Terasaka possesses relative leadership skills, as he is usually accompanied by his peers, Takuya Muramatsu and Taiji Yoshida. He persuades others to do his bidding by being direct and intrusively forward, as indicated when he pressures Nagisa Shiota to carry out an assassination of Korosensei by reminding him of the harsh conditions they live in.', '/uploads/images/c_85809.png'),
(90, 'Taisei Yoshida', '吉田大成', '配角', 'Yoshiyuki Shimozuma', 'He is a student of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. He is assigned to Class 3-E, where he trains to become a professional assassin, with his teacher as the target. His partners are Ryōma Terasaka and Takuya Muramatsu. Yoshida is an inconsiderate individual, unmindful to the consequences of his actions. He is willing to resort to any means in order to escape contemptible circumstances. He collaborates with Ryōma Terasaka and Takuya Muramatsu, and together they pressure others to act according to their bidding.', '/uploads/images/c_85811.png'),
(90, 'Taiga Okajima', '岡島大河', '配角', 'Ryou Naitou', 'He is a student in Korosensei''s class 3-E of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. Okajima is the class pervert and is rather open about it. As with Rio Nakamura, Okajima is known to like peeping. He likes to read erotica magazines and even claimed to be a brother of Korosensei and Itona Horibe for doing so. At the start of July, he enjoys looking at the girls'' more exposed skin.', '/uploads/images/c_85813.png'),
(90, 'Yuzuki Fuwa', '不破優月', '配角', 'Kana Ueda', 'She is a student in class 3-E of Kunugigaoka Junior High School, taught by Korosensei. Fuwa has an imaginative personality, as evidenced with her like of reading the Weekly Shōnen Jump magazine.', '/uploads/images/c_85815.png'),
(90, 'Gakuhou Asano', '浅野学侯', '配角', 'Shou Hayami', 'He is the board chairman and administrative head of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. He has made the academy into the foremost in Japan in the ten years since its founding. Gakuhō is a reasonable, prudent, and shrewd individual; he is primarily known for his cool-headed rationalism. He is a proponent of logic and efficiency, and handles matters accordingly. An able and competent administrator, he is resolved in removing factors that may upset the intended balance.', '/uploads/images/c_85819.png'),
(90, 'Touka Yada', '矢田桃花', '配角', 'Ayaka Suwa', 'She is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E. She is the big sister of Class 3-E and one of the most enthusiastic students about learning the art of infiltration from [Irina](https://anilist.co/character/73883/Jelavic-Irina). She''s been described as being adult-like and cool to the point that [Kayano](https://anilist.co/character/85291/Kayano-Kaede) admits that she''s attracted to her despite her large bust. Yada does not like violence, which is why she commits herself to negotiation in order avoid fighting.', '/uploads/images/c_88795.png'),
(90, 'Sumire Hara', '原寿美鈴', '配角', 'Miho Hino', 'She is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E. Hara is one of the most passive members of the class where she frequently acts as support in assassination attempts with her ability to assess the situation and herself. She is usually regarded as a motherly figure, due to her ability to cook and care for the class.', '/uploads/images/c_88796.png'),
(90, 'Hiroto Maehara', '前原陽斗', '配角', 'Shintarou Asanuma', 'He is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E. Maehara is a nice guy and in every sense of the word, a playboy. He has a "live the moment" attitude about life in general. He is one of the few that is popular in the whole school despite being in the E Class. Despite that attitude, he is a caring person and isn''t the type to pick on someone weaker than him. He also falls into the type of being honest, and often reacts strongly to things.', '/uploads/images/c_88797.png'),
(90, 'Rio Nakamura', '中村莉桜', '配角', 'Manami Numakura', 'She is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. She was a former elementary school genius but felt lonely and longed to be normal. When she got to middle school, she began shirking off her studies which landed her in Class 3-E. She loves teasing the other students in her class (sometimes together with Karma Akabane)', '/uploads/images/c_88798.png'),
(90, 'Kirara Hazama', '狭間綺羅々', '配角', 'Fuuko Saitou', 'She is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E. Hazama is a quiet girl who loves reading, preferring to sit in the shade with a book rather than swim during summer gym classes and wants to become a librarian. She even recommended to Itona the novel, The Count of Monte Cristo, though accidentally spoiled the ending. She prefers dark stories and horror novels, and because of this also has an interest in the occult which she displayed when she attempted to use a curse on Korosensei.', '/uploads/images/c_88799.png'),
(90, 'Koutarou Takebayashi', '竹林考太郎', '配角', 'Daichuu Mizushima', 'He is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E. Takebayashi is mostly a quiet person. However, he seems somewhat eccentric in his behavior and stands out as the oddball in the class. He also seems to be clumsy at physical activity, having ping pong balls hit his glasses while playing with others and nearly losing balance in one of Tadaomi Karasuma''s lessons. He is also obsessed with anime, at one point stating "A girl isn''t a true girl until she loses the third D" implying he likes anime girls more than real women. He also enjoys going to maid cafes.', '/uploads/images/c_88800.png'),
(90, 'Kouki Mimura', '三村航輝', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', 'He is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E.', '/uploads/images/c_88801.png'),
(90, 'Masayoshi Kimura', '木村正義', '配角', 'Shunsuke Kawabe', 'He is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E. Kimura is one of the relatively proactive students when it comes to assassination and aims to claim the 10 billion yen reward.', '/uploads/images/c_88802.png'),
(90, 'Hinano Kurahashi', '倉橋陽菜乃', '配角', 'Hisako Kanemoto', 'She is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E. Hinano''s personality is an energetic and positive girl and is always seen with a smile on her face regardless of whether she''s trying to assassinate Korosensei, or whatever else. Hinano is also a passionate animal and nature lover.', '/uploads/images/c_88803.png'),
(90, 'Hinata Okano', '岡野ひなた', '配角', 'Minami Tanaka', 'She is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E. In her initial appearances, Okano was often shown to be serious with a relatively neutral expression. As the series goes on, she''s later shown to also be playful in addition to being serious. She is also described as someone who acts before she thinks.', '/uploads/images/c_88804.png'),
(90, 'Ryuunosuke Chiba', '千葉龍之介', '配角', 'Junji Majima', '__Height::__ 172 cm (5’8”) __School:__ Kunugigaoka Junior High School __Class:__ 3-E __Seat Number:__ 15 He is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E of Kunugigaoka Junior High School. Chiba is a serious and stoic boy. He''s very calm and doesn''t talk a lot. He is the best marksman among all of Class 3-E. He excels in spatial calculation and, as such, is unmatched in long distance shooting. His abilities have even earned him the praises of [Lovro](https://anilist.co/character/265570/Brovski-Lovro), a hitman dealer and a retired assassin.', '/uploads/images/c_88805.png'),
(90, 'Rinka Hayami', '速水凛香', '配角', 'Shiho Kawaragi', 'She is a student in Korosensei''s Class 3-E. Rinka is a very stoic, businesslike and professional girl who has been compared to a working adult along with Chiba. As a result of her serious demeanor, she can be quite straightforward and direct.', '/uploads/images/c_88806.png'),
(90, 'Gakushuu Asano', '浅野学秀', '配角', 'Mamoru Miyano', 'A student in class 3-A in Kunugigaoka Junior High School. He is the student council president and the son of the Board Chairman, Gakuhou Asano. He is a genius student who, like many main building students, look down upon class 3-E.', '/uploads/images/c_89352.jpg'),
(90, 'Kusuo Saiki', '斉木楠雄', '配角', '', '**Height:** 167 cm Kusuo Saiki has an extremely uncaring, neutral personality. As a gifted psychic that can do anything he wants, he has long stopped caring about the world; however, he has shown to be extremely cautious, as he often runs from [Nendou](https://anilist.co/character/90108), the only person he fears and is prone to immediately teleporting to faraway places upon spotting an insect. Saiki has a sweet tooth, so he loves sweets, especially Coffee Jelly. Fourteen days after his birth, Kusuo uttered his first word without moving his mouth and 1 month after birth he took his first step in midair. At the age of 1 was the first time Kusuo has voluntarily used his abilities, when his mother said they were out of mirin, Kusuo teleported away and returned with several bottles of mirin. Kusuo Saiki is a gifted psychic. Having obtained his powers since birth, the first signs of Saiki''s powers came from when he was able to hear the voices of his parents and he subsequently telepathically spoke back to them. Two months later, he demonstrated the ability to walk in the air. Saiki has stated that in three days, he can wipe out humanity. The full extent of all of his abilities is unknown.', '/uploads/images/c_90107.png'),
(90, 'Kunudon', 'くぬどん', '配角', '', 'Kunudon is the mascot of Kununigoaka. He hates E class and is a propaganda tool used by the director.', '/uploads/images/c_172719.jpg'),
(90, 'Ren Sakakibara', '榊原蓮', '配角', '', 'is a student in Class 3-A in Kunugigaoka Junior High School and one of the Big Five. He is also the Student Council secretary.', '/uploads/images/c_175947.jpg'),
(90, 'Smog', 'スモッグ', '配角', '', 'One of three assassins in Okinawa along with Gastro and Grip. He specializes in creating/making poisons.', '/uploads/images/c_176242.jpg'),
(90, 'Gastro', 'ガストロ', '配角', '', 'One of three assassins in Okinawa, along with Smog and Grip. He loves the taste of a gun so much that he uses it as a utensil.', '/uploads/images/c_176243.jpg'),
(90, 'Yuuji Norita', '法田勇治', '配角', '', 'A rich teenage boy. Although he is initially lazy and rides on his father''s coattails, with encouragement from Nagisa he decides to change himself for the better.', '/uploads/images/c_176245.jpg'),
(90, 'Shiro', 'シロ', '配角', 'Ryouta Takeuchi', 'A mysterious man in white clothes who hides secrets about Koro-sensei''s past. ~!His real name is Kotarou Yanagisawa!~', '/uploads/images/c_176246.jpg'),
(90, 'Reaper', '死神', '配角', 'Nobunaga Shimazaki', 'Before becoming the Reaper, he was born in an extremely wealthy family. One night, his father was killed by the original Reaper. As he witnessed his father''s assassination from a window, he fell head over heels over the act, calling it "a beautiful skill"; in turn, this motivated him to become an assassin under the current Reaper''s tutelage.', '/uploads/images/c_176275.png'),
(90, 'Sakura Kiyashiki', '鬼屋敷さくら', '配角', 'Hibiku Yamamura', 'Sakura is a young girl that Nagisa meets when Class 3-E helps out at Wakaba Park''s nursery.', '/uploads/images/c_207930.jpg'),
(90, 'Nagai', '永井', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_207931.jpg'),
(90, 'Matsukata', '松方', '配角', '', 'Matsukata is the principal of Wakaba Park cram school.', '/uploads/images/c_207932.jpg'),
(90, 'Rikuto Ikeda', '池田陸', '配角', '', 'Rikuto Ikeda was one of the three first students in Gakuhō Asano''s cram school 10 years prior to the Assassination Classroom series along with Nakai and Mori.', '/uploads/images/c_207933.png'),
(90, 'Mori', '森', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_207934.jpg'),
(90, 'Natsuhiko Koyama', '小山夏彦', '配角', '', 'Natsuhiko Koyama is a student in Class 3-A in Kunugigaoka Junior High School and the president of the Biology Club who is one of the Big Five.', '/uploads/images/c_207935.jpg'),
(90, 'Aguri Yukimura', '雪村あぐり', '配角', 'Ayako Kawasumi', 'Aguri Yukimura is the former teacher of Class 3-E.', '/uploads/images/c_207936.jpg'),
(90, 'Teppei Araki', '荒木鉄平', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_245009.jpg'),
(90, 'Tomoya Seo', '瀬尾智也', '配角', '', 'Tomoya Seo is a student in Class 3-A in Kunugigaoka Junior High School and one of the Five Virtuosos. He is also the Student Assembly Chairman.', '/uploads/images/c_245010.png'),
(90, 'Red Eye', 'レッドアイ', '配角', '', 'Sniper hired to kill Koro-sensei during the Kyoto trip.', '/uploads/images/c_245011.jpg'),
(90, 'Kazutaka Shindo', '進藤一考', '配角', '', 'Kazutaka Shindou is a student in Class 3-A in Kunugigaoka Junior High School and plays in the baseball team.', '/uploads/images/c_245012.jpg'),
(90, 'Lovro Brovski', 'ロヴロ・ブロフスキ', '配角', 'Takashi Matsuyama', 'Lovro is a hitman dealer who was once a talented assassin. He is the Japanese government''s only link with the world of hitmen.', '/uploads/images/c_265570.png'),
(90, 'Chousuke Takada', '高田長助', '配角', 'Masahito Yabe', 'Chosuke Takada is a student in Class 3-D of Kunugigaoka Junior High School who is often seen with Nobuta Tanaka.', '/uploads/images/c_266253.png'),
(90, 'Nobuta Tanaka', '田中信太', '配角', 'Hiroki Gotou', 'Nobuta Tanaka is a student in Class 3-D of Kunugigaoka Junior High School who is often seen with Chosuke Takada.', '/uploads/images/c_266254.png'),
(90, 'Hiromi Shiota', '潮田広海', '配角', 'Kotono Mitsuishi', '[Nagisa](https://anilist.co/character/65645/Nagisa-Shiota)''s mother.', '/uploads/images/c_289465.jpg'),
(91, 'Megumin', 'めぐみん', '主角', 'Rie Takahashi', 'Megumin is an archmage and the self-proclaimed top genius of the Crimson Demons, an order of magicians who are born with high intelligence and magical powers. Despite being an archwizard, she can only use the high level skill ''Explosion'', the strongest of all offensive magic, and only once a day as it consumes tremendous magical power. Due to this she is more often a liability than an asset. Megumin speaks and dresses as a Chuunibyou and her only desire is to unleash explosion magic in the face of her enemies.', '/uploads/images/c_89361.png'),
(91, 'Aqua', 'アクア', '主角', 'Sora Amamiya', 'Aqua is a goddess of water. She guides humans who die young to the afterlife. Due to her cocky attitude towards [Kazuma](https://anilist.co/character/89364), she ends up being dragged to another world with him to defeat the Demon King. Aqua chose the advanced job of archpriest, as being a goddess she''s naturally a strong wielder of healing magic. However, she spends most of her skillpoints on party trick skills.', '/uploads/images/c_89362.png'),
(91, 'Darkness', 'ダクネス', '主角', 'Ai Kayano', 'A crusader and a masochist. Despite being an advanced knight, she is extremely clumsy and none of her attacks ever hit their mark. However, she has great endurance and stamina and acts as the frontline of the party. She often throws herself in front of enemies to "shield" her party, but in reality it''s just her masochism.', '/uploads/images/c_89363.png'),
(91, 'Kazuma Satou', '佐藤和真', '主角', 'Jun Fukushima', '__Height:__ 162 cm (5''4") A hikikomori (shut-in), otaku and NEET, Kazuma arrives in the afterlife after a traffic accident and decides to go to another world to defeat the Demon King, taking [Aqua](https://anilist.co/character/89362) with him. He has the weakest job of ''Adventurer'', but has decent intelligence and extraordinarily high luck. This is demonstrated whenever he uses his ''steal'' skill.', '/uploads/images/c_89364.png'),
(91, 'Yunyun', 'ゆんゆん', '配角', '', 'Yunyun is a member of the Crimson Magic Clan, and she and [Megumin](https://anilist.co/character/89361) are friends as well as rivals.', '/uploads/images/c_120652.png'),
(91, 'Wiz', 'ウィズ', '配角', 'Yui Horie', 'Wiz is the owner of a famous Magic Item Shop in Axel that has many unsalable items with quirky defects. She used to be a renowned Arch Wizard, but has since retired. At night, she has a secret identity as a kind-hearted lich who helps lingering spirits pass on. She is also the only harmless Demon King''s General and prefers to live as a human.', '/uploads/images/c_120655.jpg'),
(91, 'Luna', 'ルナ', '配角', 'Sayuri Hara', 'Part of the Guild Staff, she is the go-to woman for adventurers visiting the guild. Luna is a very kind, caring and cheerful young woman who has a rather ''''Onee-chan'''' (big sister) aura about her. She has common sense which is a rarity in the Fantasy World. Luna is also a calm person, taking everything in stride.', '/uploads/images/c_120657.png'),
(91, 'Eris', 'エリス', '配角', 'Ayaka Suwa', 'Eris is the Goddess of Fortune and [Aqua''s](https://anilist.co/character/89362) junior. Eris is a very kind and gentle girl who treats others with kindness and respect. She is also very caring and she always interest her adherents. She has a very cheerful attitude but at times can act a bit childish. She is insecure about her breast size and uses breast pads to compensate. Aqua often embarrasses her with this knowledge, as Eris wants as few people as possible to notice her lack in bust. She is also kind-hearted and gentle, and therefore, her scent is very fragrant, according to her peers and Aegis. ~!Eris disguises herself as Chris, a friend to [Darkness](https://anilist.co/character/89363) listed under the occupation of thief. Chris is an innocent, cheerful and energetic girl that is almost always seen with a big smile and boasting a bright personality. She also seems to have high confidence in herself. Though at times she acts quite childish and mischievous, Chris has a big, kind heart.!~', '/uploads/images/c_120658.jpg'),
(91, 'Sena', 'セナ', '配角', 'Hitomi Nabatame', 'Royal Prosecutor for the Kingdom of Belzerg.', '/uploads/images/c_122424.png'),
(91, 'Arakuremono', '荒くれ者', '配角', 'Tetsu Inada', 'An anime-exclusive character. The first person [Kazuma](https://anilist.co/character/89364) speaks with in Axel''s guildhall. (Source: Wikipedia)', '/uploads/images/c_126854.jpg'),
(91, 'Beldia', 'ベルディア', '配角', 'Hiroki Yasumoto', 'A dullahan and one of the Devil King''s generals. He becomes hostile towards [Kazuma](https://anilist.co/character/89364)''s party after [Megumin](https://anilist.co/character/89361) keeps using his castle for explosion practice. ~!He is weak against water and is defeated by [Aqua](https://anilist.co/character/89362)''s purifying magic.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136042.jpg'),
(91, 'Keith', 'キース', '配角', 'Wataru Hatano', 'A frivolous archer who is part of Taylor''s party.', '/uploads/images/c_136043.png'),
(91, 'Kyouya Mitsurugi', '御剣響夜', '配角', 'Takuya Eguchi', 'A Japanese citizen who was also reincarnated to the fantasy world by Aqua. He is one of Belzerg''s strongest adventurers and wields the cursed sword Gram. The sword was his gift from Aqua.', '/uploads/images/c_136044.jpg'),
(91, 'Dust', 'ダスト', '配角', 'Junji Majima', 'A warrior and a member of the party consisting of [Rin](https://anilist.co/character/240105/Rin), [Keith](https://anilist.co/character/136043/Keith), and [Taylor](https://anilist.co/character/242932/Taylor). He is a major supporting character in the main KonoSuba series, as well as the protagonist of the Limelight spinoff series alongside [Rin](https://anilist.co/character/240105/Rin). Dust is rumored to be one of the strongest adventurers in Axel, to the point where he could become a highly accomplished individual if not for his lazy personality. However, he appears to actively hide his true abilities, handicapping himself by using a longsword rather than a spear, his preferred weapon of choice. ~!In the Limelight spinoff series, Dust is revealed to be a formerly renowned knight born of lower-ranking nobility. Having been banished and stripped of his status after helping the princess [Leonor](https://anilist.co/character/340950/Leonor) avoid her wedding, he became a delinquent adventurer, joining [Taylor](https://anilist.co/character/242932/Taylor)''s party and quickly becoming close with [Rin](https://anilist.co/character/240105/Rin) due to her striking resemblance of [Leonor](https://anilist.co/character/340950/Leonor). Promising the princess to do so, he only makes use of his full abilities when those he cares about are at stake.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136046.png'),
(91, 'Tenshi', '天使', '配角', 'Ai Kakuma', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_137174.jpg'),
(91, 'Hakase', '博士', '配角', 'Choo', '"Head Researcher" is an unnamed person who lived and died centuries before the main story begins. He is sometimes also referred to as "Idiot Inventor," "Stupid Chief Engineer," "The Scientist," or some other names along those lines. He was born in modern Japan and sent to the distant-past Fantasy World as a Reincarnator to fight the Demon King of that time. While we never get to meet him when he was alive, we do see glimpses of his life from his research diaries.', '/uploads/images/c_203544.png'),
(91, 'Rin', 'リーン', '配角', 'Yumiri Hanamori', 'An intermediate wizard and a member of [Taylor](https://anilist.co/character/242932/Taylor)''s party, alongside [Keith](https://anilist.co/character/136043/Keith) and [Dust](https://anilist.co/character/136046/Dust). Rin is a highly capable magic user, although she is humble and describes herself as a rookie wizard. She is also a very direct and honest person, and although she''s usually calm, she knows how to hit someone back when she is teased. Her level-headedness compared to the boys in her party often leads to her getting Dust out of trouble and scolding him for his actions. Despite her strict demeanor however she is a pleasant person, and at times shows genuine kindness and concern for Dust as well.', '/uploads/images/c_240105.png'),
(91, 'Taylor', 'テイラー', '配角', 'Reiou Tsuchida', 'Taylor is a crusader and the leader of the party consisting of Dust, Keith, and Lean.', '/uploads/images/c_242932.png'),
(91, 'Lolisa', 'ロリーサ', '配角', 'Nanami Yamashita', 'The youngest employee of the Succubus Cafe. She is introduced when she was captured by [Aqua](https://anilist.co/character/89362/Aqua), after having been on her way to service [Kazuma](https://anilist.co/character/89364/Satou-Kazuma). Like her coworkers, she has the magical power to put people to sleep and make them dream as requested.', '/uploads/images/c_294249.png'),
(91, 'Fio', 'フィオ', '配角', 'Yoshino Aoyama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_307853.png'),
(91, 'Cremea', 'クレメア', '配角', 'Yumeha Kouda', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_307854.png'),
(91, 'Cedre', 'セドル', '配角', 'Yuu Wakabayashi', '~!He was one of the few people killed by Beldia and resurrected by Aqua.!~', '/uploads/images/c_326526.png'),
(91, 'Garilhe', 'ガリル', '配角', 'Kouzou Douzaka', 'An adventurer. ~!He was one of the few people killed by Beldia and resurrected by Aqua.!~', '/uploads/images/c_326527.png'),
(91, 'Heinz', 'ヘインズ', '配角', 'Haruka Jinya', 'He often teases Darkness for not being able to hit the enemy. ~!He was one of the few people killed by Beldia and was resurrected by Aqua.!~', '/uploads/images/c_326529.png'),
(91, 'Uketsuke Succubus', '受付サキュバス', '配角', 'Kotono Mitsuishi', 'She is one of the Succubi working in the "special" shop.', '/uploads/images/c_326530.png'),
(91, 'Priest', 'プリースト', '配角', 'Mitsuo Senda', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_326531.png'),
(91, 'Cabbage', 'キャベツ', '配角', 'Tomoko Kaneda', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_329386.png'),
(91, 'Fudousan Gyousha', '不動産業者', '配角', 'Shouto Kashii', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_329387.png'),
(91, 'Magician', 'マジシャン', '配角', 'Miki Hase', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_329388.png'),
(91, 'Uketsuke', '受付', '配角', 'Mitsuki Nakae', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_329389.png'),
(92, 'Sonohokasei', 'その他声', '配角', 'Ayaka Asai', 'This character page is set to represent and list credits for voice roles without a specific character name/role attributed. Character roles named specifically should be added separately.', '/uploads/images/c_36310.jpg'),
(92, 'Satoru Fujinuma', '藤沼悟', '主角', 'Shinnosuke Mitsushima', 'A struggling manga author with a supernatural power that enables, or rather, forces him to prevent deaths and catastrophes that happen near him by sending him back in time when an accident occurs, repeating the scene until the accident is prevented. ~!He falls into a coma for 15 years after he was nearly murdered by Yashiro!~', '/uploads/images/c_89275.png'),
(92, 'Kayo Hinazuki', '雛月加代', '主角', 'Aoi Yuuki', 'A 10-year-old girl and the first victim of the serial killer/kidnapper. She went missing on the 2nd of March 1988. Her body was found a few days later once the snow had thawed.', '/uploads/images/c_89276.jpg'),
(92, 'Sachiko Fujinuma', '藤沼佐知子', '配角', 'Minami Takayama', 'Sachiko is Satoru''s mother and former news announcer. She possesses a sharp eye and is quick to observe any irregularities. She knows about the cold cases of serial kidnapping in her town but decided to keep quiet and ignore it due to her child''s growth and safety.', '/uploads/images/c_89326.jpg'),
(92, 'Airi Katagiri', '片桐愛梨', '配角', 'Chinatsu Akasaki', 'Airi Katagiri is a high school student and Satoru''s co-worker at Oasi Pizza. She becomes involved in Satoru''s life when he manages to prevent life-threatening incidents from occurring.', '/uploads/images/c_89355.jpg'),
(92, 'Kazu', 'カズ', '配角', 'Yukitoshi Kikuchi', 'Kazu is one of Satoru''s primary school classmates.', '/uploads/images/c_89356.png'),
(92, 'Kenya Kobayashi', '小林賢也', '配角', 'You Taichi', 'Kenya is one of Satoru''s primary school classmates. He has a strong sense of justice and has a sharp eye for abnormalities. ~!He becomes a lawyer in the future.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89357.png'),
(92, 'Osamu', '修', '配角', 'Ayaka Nanase', 'Osamu is one of Satoru''s primary school classmates.', '/uploads/images/c_89358.jpg'),
(92, 'Jun Shiratori', '白鳥潤', '配角', 'Daichuu Mizushima', 'Jun Shiratori was a food delivery worker in Satoru''s hometown and often approached lone students around his house. He was nicknamed "Yuuki" because he was always encouraging the children to be courageous. He was originally framed as the killer of the three kidnapped students in the town and sentenced to death.', '/uploads/images/c_89359.png'),
(92, 'Hiromi Sugita', '杉田広美', '配角', 'Atsushi Tamaru', 'Hiromi is one of Satoru''s primary school classmates. ~!He was one of the original victims in the serial kidnapping case.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89360.png'),
(92, 'Gaku Yashiro', '八代学', '配角', 'Mitsuru Miyamoto', 'Gaku is Satoru''s homeroom teacher during primary school. ~!In the original timeline, Yashiro successfully murdered two children at Mikoto Elementary School—Kayo Hinazuki and Hiromi Sugita—as well as another student from Izumi Primary named Aya Nakanishi. After being a school teacher, he inherited his father-in-law''s constituency and became a council member in his place. During his time as a council member, he is seen by Sachiko Fujinuma during his attempt to abduct another child. After Sachiko remembers his identity, she is immediately murdered and her son, Satoru, is framed for the murder.!~ ~! In the third Revival, while Satoru is unaware of Yashiro''s true identity as the murderer, he completely renders Yashiro''s plans useless. Yashiro attempts to murder Satoru by drowning him in a car in which he is locked in tight by a seatbelt. Satoru somehow survives, and Yashiro is left entertained about Satoru''s persistence. Satoru goes into a coma for 15 years, and Yashiro watches over him until he wakes up again. Upon Satoru''s awakening, Yashiro again tries to frame Satoru for murder, only to be caught by a plan formulated by Satoru.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89365.jpg'),
(92, 'Misato', '美里', '配角', 'Hina Kino', 'Misato is one of [Satoru](https://anilist.co/character/89275/Satoru-Fujinuma)’s primary school classmates. She holds a grudge against [Kayo](https://anilist.co/character/89276/Kayo-Hinazuki).', '/uploads/images/c_89366.jpg'),
(92, 'Akemi  Hinazuki', '雛月明美', '配角', 'Akemi Okamura', 'Mother of [Kayo Hinazuki](https://anilist.co/character/89276/Kayo-Hinazuki).', '/uploads/images/c_129807.jpg'),
(92, 'Takahashi', '高橋', '配角', 'Eiji Takeuchi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_382880.png'),
(92, 'Shiratori no Chichi', '白鳥父', '配角', 'Hideaki Tezuka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_382883.png'),
(92, 'Hinazuki Sobo', '雛月祖母', '配角', 'Hiroko Takahashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_382884.png'),
(92, 'Kumi', '久美', '配角', 'Reika Uyama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_382885.png'),
(92, 'Sawada', '澤田', '配角', 'Tooru Ookawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_382886.png'),
(92, 'Hamada', '浜田', '配角', 'Asami Yoshida', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_382887.png'),
(92, 'Aya Nakanishi', '中西彩', '配角', 'Sayaka Kaneko', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_382888.png'),
(93, 'Yukichi Fukuzawa', '福沢諭吉', '配角', 'Rikiya Koyama', '__Height:__ 186 cm (6''1") The president of the Armed Detective Agency, who manages the hooligans. Although he doesn''t often come out, at a critical moment, he triumphantly takes command. Because Yukichi is a man of dignity and status, it seems even the frivolous Ranpo will actually work if he orders it. (Source: Bungou Stray Dogs wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_89196.png'),
(93, 'Atsushi Nakajima', '中島敦', '主角', 'Yuuto Uemura', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Ability:__ Beast Beneath the Moonlight He came to Yokohama after being driven out of a poor orphanage that was attacked by a man-eating tiger. On the verge of starvation, he meets [Dazai](https://anilist.co/character/89198/Dazai-Osamu) and gets a job helping at the detective agency. Because he''s never had friends or family and was labeled as "useless," he lacks self-confidence.', '/uploads/images/c_89197.png'),
(93, 'Osamu Dazai', '太宰治', '主角', 'Mamoru Miyano', '**Height:** 181 cm (5''11") **Ability:** No Longer Human A member of the Armed Detective Agency. He''s a suicide enthusiast who searches for a place to die. However, he doesn''t like pain, and would prefer a lovers'' suicide with a beautiful woman. He''s aimless, elusive, nonchalant, and jokes around normally, but, when he is serious, it is clear that he is an insightful and intelligent individual. He loves to annoy his fellow Agency member, [Kunikida](https://anilist.co/character/89200). ~!He was a former Executive of the city''s worst underworld organization, the Port Mafia.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89198.png'),
(93, 'Ryuunosuke Akutagawa', '芥川龍之介', '主角', 'Kenshou Ono', '__Height:__ 172cm (5''8") __Likes:__ Curios and antiques, tea, figs __Dislikes:__ Bonsai trees, dogs, baths "The weak will die. Die, and make way for others." A member of the notorious "Port Mafia" that operates by the harbor. Akutagawa has a black and white "survival of the fittest" view of the world, claiming that weak people should die and give way to the stronger ones. His ability is called "Rashōmon" (羅生門). He is not afraid of pain and defeat, if only to hear a word from a "certain person". His ruthless, vicious nature makes him one of the Port Mafia''s most dangerous members, feared by both ally and foe. Much of the obedience he receives from subordinates of Black Lizard , and the Mafia in general, largely stems from fear of his short temper and general intolerance of incompetence. In chapter 87, ~!it is revealed that Akutagawa doesn''t have much time left to live, as he is suffering from a vital lung disease.!~ In chapter 88 of the manga, ~!Akutagawa turns undead, being bitten by Bram Stoker after a fatal blow which results in his death.!~ (Source: Bungou Stray Doys Wiki, Anime News Network)', '/uploads/images/c_89199.png'),
(93, 'Doppo Kunikida', '国木田独歩', '主角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', '__Height:__ 189 cm (6''2") __Ability:__ The Matchless Poet A member of the Armed Detective Agency. He carries a notepad with the word "Ideal" written on the cover, and what is written inside are guides for life. He has a straight-laced personality and hates nothing more than schedules going awry. As a partner to the free-spirited [Dazai](https://anilist.co/character/89198/Dazai-Osamu), his troubles never end.', '/uploads/images/c_89200.png'),
(93, 'Ranpo Edogawa', '江戸川乱歩', '配角', 'Hiroshi Kamiya', '__Height:__ 168 cm (5''6") The great detective of the Armed Detective Agency. He possesses sharp observation skills that are acknowledged by his coworkers, and he settles difficult cases at the request of the police. Because of his self-confidence, his speech is brazen and child-like. His motto is "If you''ll have me, everything will be ok!" He likes logical thinking and fantastic tales.', '/uploads/images/c_89201.png'),
(93, 'Junichirou Tanizaki', '谷崎潤一郎', '配角', 'Toshiyuki Toyonaga', '__Height:__ 174 cm (5''8.5") __Ability:__ Light Snow He is a member of the Armed Detective Agency and the older brother of [Naomi](https://anilist.co/character/89209/Tanizaki-Naomi).', '/uploads/images/c_89205.png'),
(93, 'Kenji Miyazawa', '宮沢賢治', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Kagura', '__Height:__ 158 cm (5''2") __Ability:__ Undefeated by the Rain A member of the Armed Detective Agency. Before he was scouted, he lived in a rural area without electricity. He knows no suspicion, and will be understanding and considerate no matter who he is talking to. He has a lot of friends who call him "Ken-chan." He likes music, tempura soba, and Mitsuya cider. (Source: Bungou Stray Dogs Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_89207.png'),
(93, 'Akiko Yosano', '与謝野晶子', '配角', 'Yuu Shimamura', '__Height:__ 166 cm (5''5") __Ability:__ Thou Shalt Not Die A modern woman with a bob cut who''s a member of the Armed Detective Agency. Although she''s an excellent doctor who is indispensable to the Agency, all members of the the Agency are scared to be placed into her care. It''s recommended that you don''t use outdated misogynistic expressions in front of her.', '/uploads/images/c_89208.png'),
(93, 'Naomi Tanizaki', '谷崎ナオミ', '配角', 'Chiaki Omigawa', 'Naomi Tanizaki is a member of the Armed Detective Agency and the younger sister of Junichirou.', '/uploads/images/c_89209.png'),
(93, 'Chuuya Nakahara', '中原中也', '配角', 'Kishou Taniyama', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") Chuuya is a Port Mafia member who detests [Osamu Dazai](https://anilist.co/character/89198) for betraying the mafia and joining the Armed Detective Agency. He''s also constantly teased by Dazai what makes him hate Dazai even more. Chuuya is short but he''s quick and uses powerful martial arts. His ability, "For The Tainted Sorrow," revolves around gravity manipulation, allowing him to manipulate and alter the gravity of anything he touches, keeping it that way until a certain period of time.', '/uploads/images/c_89853.png'),
(93, 'Motojirou Kajii', '梶井基次郎', '配角', 'Wataru Hatano', '__Height:__ 180 cm (5''11") A member of Port Mafia. He''s a bomber wanted for the explosion at the Maruzen Building. He''s an enthusiastic scientist who boasts that "death" is the "ultimate experiment."', '/uploads/images/c_89854.png'),
(93, 'Ichiyou Higuchi', '樋口一葉', '配角', 'Asami Seto', 'A beautiful and intelligent woman who wears pants. She belongs to a commando unit that answers to the leader of Port Mafia, and has authority over the military group "Black Lizard." She adores Akutagawa and calls him "senpai."', '/uploads/images/c_89855.png'),
(93, 'Kyouka Izumi', '泉鏡花', '配角', 'Sumire Morohoshi', '__Height:__ 148cm (4''10") A docile young lady who dresses in a kimono, but also a member of Port Mafia. As she holds a killing ability, she was found by the organization and raised as an assassin. ~!She later joins the Armed Detective Agency.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89856.jpg'),
(93, 'Francis Fitzgerald', 'フランシス・スコット・キー・フィッツジェラルド', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', '__Height:__ 191 cm (6''3") __Ability:__ The Great Fitzgerald Francis poses as the leader for an american secret society, ''''The Guild''''. Said organization is composed by rich and notorious individuals, who all have some type of powerful influence in the USA. His ability, ''''The Great Fitzgerald'''', allows him to power up his own atributes and traits, according to the money he spent from his countless fortune. A fierce man, who loves his family, and would do pretty much anything to achieve his goals.', '/uploads/images/c_121164.png'),
(93, 'Ougai Mori', '森鷗外', '配角', 'Mitsuru Miyamoto', '__Height:__ 175 cm __Ability:__ Vita Sexualis Ougai Mori is the boss of the Port Mafia. Ougai is analytical and tactical. He often puts on overdramatic acts but rarely breaks his composure internally. He has been shown to be somewhat ruthless and unfaltering when it comes to violence. He hasn''t, however, shown any particular enjoyment from killing. His ruthlessness comes from his pragmaticism. Although he can be intimidating at times and emit a scary formal aura, he is often polite to the point of seeming approachable. He is polite to allies and enemies alike.', '/uploads/images/c_121168.png'),
(93, 'Lucy Montgomery', 'ルーシー・モード・モンゴメリ', '配角', 'Kana Hanazawa', '__Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") A member of Ability User Society "Fellowship of The Guild." Her ability is known as "Anne of Abyssal Red". ~!She helped [Atsushi](https://anilist.co/character/89197/Nakajima-Atsushi) escape the Guild because they bonded over their past trauma and loneliness.!~', '/uploads/images/c_132222.jpg'),
(93, 'Michizou Tachihara', '立原道造', '配角', 'Yuu Hayashi', '__Height:__ 176 cm __Ability:__ Midwinter Memento A commander of the Black Lizards, the Port Mafia''s squad of hitmen. Though he puts up a tough and violent front, he cares deeply for his friends. Very skilled gunner, especially when dual wielding.', '/uploads/images/c_136705.png'),
(93, 'Gin Akutagawa', '芥川銀', '配角', 'Shiina Natsukawa', 'Ryuunosuke''s younger sister and a member of the "Black Lizards" Assault Unit. It seems she is in good terms with Dazai.', '/uploads/images/c_137512.jpg'),
(93, 'Elise', 'エリス', '配角', 'Sora Amamiya', 'Member of Port Mafia, a young girl usually seen with Ougai Mori. ~!She is the ability of Mori Ougai!~', '/uploads/images/c_138063.jpg'),
(93, 'Ryuurou Hirotsu', '広津柳浪', '配角', 'Atsushi Ono', '__Height:__ 178cm __Ability:__ Falling Camellia Member of Port Mafia, "Black Lizards" Assault Unit Captain. His ability, Falling Camellia, cause things that he touches to fly backward with immense force.', '/uploads/images/c_138066.jpg'),
(93, 'Yamagiwa', '山際', '配角', 'Yumi Uchiyama', 'She was an officer who was murdered, whose body was found floating in the river. The case of her murder was investigated by Ranpo Edogawa of the Armed Detective Company, along with Atsushi and Dazai.', '/uploads/images/c_138144.jpg'),
(93, 'Nobuko Sasaki', '佐々城信子', '配角', 'Sanae Kobayashi', 'a lecturer at a university in Tokyo.', '/uploads/images/c_138147.png'),
(93, 'Rokuzou Taguchi', '田口六蔵', '配角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', 'An information broker who provided info for the Armed Detective Company.', '/uploads/images/c_138151.png'),
(93, 'Minoura', '箕浦', '配角', 'Hiroshi Shirokuma', 'Member of the Japanese Police Force. Successor of Yasui-san whom Ranpo had worked with previously on cases.', '/uploads/images/c_138152.jpg'),
(93, 'Junsa Sugimoto', '杉本巡査', '配角', 'Ayumu Murase', 'He is is a rookie police officer who served under Yamagiwa and Minoura, also being the former''s killer.', '/uploads/images/c_138153.jpg'),
(93, 'Aoiki King', '蒼き王', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_203971.jpg'),
(93, 'James L', 'ジェームズ・L', '配角', 'Eiichirou Tokumoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_203972.jpg'),
(94, 'Emilia', 'エミリア', '主角', 'Rie Takahashi', '**Height:** 164 cm (5''5") She is a silver-haired half-elf girl who is one of the candidates to become the next ruler in the royal election. [Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru) first meets her when her insignia is stolen by [Felt](https://anilist.co/character/88574/Felt) as she needs to possess it to be eligible to participate in the election. She introduces herself as Satella when she and Subaru met during the first timeline before introducing herself by her real name when she got her insignia back. Emilia is good natured and likes to take care of others, though she herself refuses to admit it, instead thinking of it as her own selfishness. She is indifferent to her own appearance, leaving [Puck](https://anilist.co/character/90187/Puck) to take care of her clothes and hair. Because her appearance is similar to the [Witch of Envy](https://anilist.co/character/127242/Satella), she has received unfair discrimination from others. She sometimes acts like a child and is unacquainted with the world as she used to live in the woods with other Elves, though despite this she still works hard to become a ruler.', '/uploads/images/c_88572.jpg'),
(94, 'Subaru Natsuki', 'ナツキ・スバル', '主角', 'Yuusuke Kobayashi', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") On the way home from the convenience store, he suddenly finds himself transported into another world. He has the ability that he calls "Return by Death" to go back in time when he dies. Despite being a hikikomori and gamer in his real world, Subaru does a bit of workout and seems to know basic hand-to-hand combat, making him not completely weak. While Subaru tends to not read the situation, he is loyal to those he holds dear, willing to help them, even if that means taking the thorny path. He has his resolve confirmed through the many situations and circumstances he faces in the fantasy world, originally having been one to always take the "easy" route. As a hikikomori, he is hopeful of the possibilities that being sucked into a new realm brings, but later realizes the realities of the predicament he is in. Ultimately, he resolves himself to be faithful and protective of the ones that he cares most about.', '/uploads/images/c_88573.png'),
(94, 'Felt', 'フェルト', '配角', 'Chinatsu Akasaki', '**Height:** 150 cm (4''11") A thief that lives in the slums. Felt stole [Emilia''s](https://anilist.co/character/88572/Emilia) insignia, hoping for quick, easy cash. Though Felt can usually handle her own, she does consider [Rom](https://anilist.co/character/124117/Rom) to be like family. ~!After being chosen by the insignia, she is forced to participate in the Royal Selection and is currently a candidate to become the 42nd King of Lugunica.!~', '/uploads/images/c_88574.jpg'),
(94, 'Rem', 'レム', '主角', 'Inori Minase', '__Height:__ 154 cm (5''1") Rem is one of the twin maids working for [Roswaal L Mathers](https://anilist.co/character/90182/Mathers-L-Roswaal). She has medium length sky blue hair that covers her right eye, large light blue eyes, and young features. She also has hair clips towards left side of her hair, flower-shaped ribbon on the same side of her hair, and a maid hairband. She looks nearly identical to her sister [Ram](https://anilist.co/character/88576) apart from her hair, eyes, and ribbon coloring. She usually wears a maid uniform, and since her chest is slightly larger than her sister''s, she secretly changes the measurements to hide it. Rem tends to speak in a superficially polite manner and sometimes acts without thinking. She holds both respect to the point of worship and guilt toward her sister for an incident in the past. Because of her respect and guilt toward her sister, she used to think of herself as inferior.', '/uploads/images/c_88575.png'),
(94, 'Ram', 'ラム', '主角', 'Rie Murakawa', '__Height:__ 154 cm (5’1”) Ram is one of the twin maids working for [Roswaal L Mathers](https://anilist.co/character/90182). She has medium length light pink hair that covers her left eye, large darkish pink eyes, and young features. She also has hair clips towards right side of her hair, flower-shaped ribbon on the same side of her hair, and a maid hairband. She looks nearly identical to her sister [Rem](https://anilist.co/character/88575/Rem) apart from her hair, eyes, and ribbon coloring. Ram is seemingly self-centered and does things at her own pace, however in actuality she maintains a distance from people to ascertain them. She believes that Roswaal is the greatest and no one else is as precious except for her sister Rem. She is slightly more outgoing in comparison to the generally taciturn Rem, who generally allows Ram to take the lead in their sisterly bond.', '/uploads/images/c_88576.png'),
(94, 'Reinhard van Astrea', 'ラインハルト・ヴァン・アストレア', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Height__: 184 cm (6''0") Reinhard van Astrea is the current Sword Saint and a member of the Royal Guard, currently acting as [Felt](https://anilist.co/character/88574/Felt)''s knight. As the Sword Saint and the Knight of the Royal Guard, Reinhard embodies chivalry and elegance, treating everyone with exceptional respect. He is fair, brave, and always acts in the name of justice, whether on duty or simply strolling through the Royal Capital. As a knight, Reinhard only uses his sword when necessary, since, in addition to being a rule, his iron-clad rule is to not inflict pain to others if not absolutely necessary, be it a normal thug or a member of the Witch Cult.', '/uploads/images/c_88577.png'),
(94, 'Petelgeuse Romanee-Conti', 'ペテルギウス・ロマネコンティ', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'Sin Archbishop of the Witch Cult, representing sloth. ~!He was later killed by [Natsuki Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru) with the help of [Julius Juukulius](https://anilist.co/character/90183/Euclius-Julius).!~ ~!A hundred years earlier, Petelgeuse was a moderate, upright and rational man. He was close friends with [Fortuna](https://anilist.co/character/183732/Fortuna) and [Emilia](https://anilist.co/character/88572/Emilia), enough to be described as being like a family. However, when [Regulus](https://anilist.co/character/174098/Corneas-Regulus) and [Pandora](https://anilist.co/character/137522/Pandora) attacked their village, he accidentally killed Fortuna through Pandora''s power, causing him to go mad.!~', '/uploads/images/c_90170.jpg'),
(94, 'Anastasia Hoshin', 'アナスタシア・ホーシン', '配角', 'Kana Ueda', 'Anastasia Hoshin is the head of the Hoshin Trading Company and a candidate to become the 42nd King of Lugnica. Her knight is Julius Juukulius. Despite her surname being "Hoshin", she''s not directly related to Hoshin of the Wilderness. She chose the name because she was inspired by his legacy.', '/uploads/images/c_90177.png'),
(94, 'Aldebaran', 'アルデバラン', '配角', 'Keiji Fujiwara', '**Height:** 173 cm (5''8") Aldebaran, commonly known as Al, is [Priscilla Barielle](https://anilist.co/character/90186/Priscilla-Barielle)''s knight, though he claims to just be a subordinate. He has a frivolous personality and acts aloof, but shows insecurity regarding his disfigured face and wears a helmet to conceal it. Due to that, he is a man of both eccentric appearance and behavior. ~!Like Subaru, he is revealed to be from Japan and was summoned roughly 18 years before Subaru. Shortly after he was summoned, he lost his left arm in an unfortunate incident in the Empire of Vollachia. !~', '/uploads/images/c_90178.png'),
(94, 'Wilhelm van Astrea', 'ヴィルヘルム・ヴァン・アストレア', '配角', 'Kenyuu Horiuchi', '__Height:__ 178 cm (5''10") Wilhelm van Astrea né Trias, is a member of the Crusch Camp and was [Theresia van Astrea](https://anilist.co/character/124116/van-Astrea-Theresia)''s husband. Wilhelm is a refined man with a highly gentle and humble demeanor. However unearth that even temperament belied a fierce warrior who often is the first to help when something happens. However this wasn''t always the case as in youth, Wilhelm was very opposite of who he was in his later years. Brash, afoot, short tempered, lonely and often cold with others. He was a troubled individual who devoted himself wholly to the sword and cared for little else. Even so, he knew how to analyze a situation, always finding a way out. Nonetheless, Theresia greatly influenced his personality, becoming increasingly sociable and protective, achieving more results during the Demi-human War. It was through her most of all that he would become the person he is today.', '/uploads/images/c_90179.jpg'),
(94, 'Elsa Granhiert', 'エルザ・グランヒルテ', '配角', 'Mamiko Noto', 'An assassin-for-hire from the Northernmost nation, the Holy Kingdom of Gusteko, known as "The Bowel Hunter". Elsa wishes to make a trade for an insignia, as her client''s wishes. ~!Elsa Granhiert was an assassin working together with [Meili](https://anilist.co/character/175577) for an individual they refer to as "Mother" until her death.!~', '/uploads/images/c_90180.png'),
(94, 'Beatrice', 'ベアトリス', '配角', 'Satomi Arai', '__Height:__ 140 cm (4''7") __Age:__ ~!400+ (Actual)!~ The caretaker of the library in [Roswaal](https://anilist.co/character/90182)''s mansion. She has a distinct way of speaking, adding "I suppose" (かしら, kashira) and "in fact" (のよ, no yo) at the end of some of her sentences. ~!Around 400 years ago, Beatrice was created by [Echidna](https://anilist.co/character/129330). She helped her with her experiments, such as the Sanctuary Barrier, though she wasn''t told everything as she didn''t know that [Ryuuzu Meyer](https://anilist.co/character/174072) would be sealed in a crystal. Sometime later, Echidna ordered her to stand guard over the library while she waited for "that person," an order which she diligently followed.!~ ~!After numerous and painful attempts to convince her to leave the library [Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573) succeeded, and Beatrice became his contract spirit.!~', '/uploads/images/c_90181.png'),
(94, 'Roswaal Mathers', 'ロズワール・Ｌ・メイザース', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', '~!__Mental age:__ 400+!~ The lord of the Roswaal Mansion and a descendant of the original Roswaal. He comes across as an eccentric due to his flamboyant appearance and odd speaking style, the latter which he shares with his grandmother. However, he harbors a more calculating and reserved side with a sharp political mind and gaze that reads others quite well. ~!It is later revealed that he is in fact the original Roswaal, Roswaal A. Mathers, who has been possessing his descendants'' bodies to meet his teacher Echidna again at any cost, even if that means sacrificing himself or those close to him.!~', '/uploads/images/c_90182.png'),
(94, 'Julius Euclius', 'ユリウス・ユークリウス', '配角', 'Takuya Eguchi', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5''10") Julius Euclius is [Anastasia Hoshin''s](https://anilist.co/character/90177/Hoshin-Anastasi) knight and a member of the Royal Guard. Julius lived with his family at the Euclius House. After his father, Klein Euclius died, he started to live with his uncle Alviero and he started to take care of Julius and became his adoptive father. As a member of Lugnica''s nobility, Julius acts in a proper fashion, always having an air of nobility and conviction. He is also considerate and doesn''t forget to show care toward others. He also shows a strict side, giving out accurate assessments of others whether they''re good or bad, which is a result of his upbringing as an elite, and in actuality, he believes that he and others can do better than they currently are. Julius doesn''t like those who forget their place, leading him to have bad relations with [Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru) for a while. While both have apologized to each other after the battle with the Hakugei, Subaru told him he still hated him. Julius said he didn''t intend to be friends. They both became very intimate very quickly during the planning and attacking the Witch Cult. In the end, Julius directly considered Subaru as his friend.', '/uploads/images/c_90183.png'),
(94, 'Felix Argyle', 'フェリックス・アーガイル', '配角', 'Yui Horie', 'Felix Argyle commonly known as Ferris, is [Crusch Karsten](https://anilist.co/character/90185)''s knight. He is a beast human (demi-human).', '/uploads/images/c_90184.png'),
(94, 'Crusch Karsten', 'クルシュ・カルステン', '配角', 'Yuka Iguchi', 'Crusch Karsten is the Matriarch of House Karsten and a candidate to become the 42nd King of Lugnica. While normally calm and serious, Crusch is honest, sincere, right, being a type of person who is destined to stand above others, though she has talent and has worked hard to reach where she is now. She is already the head of her family, finishing her work better than her father. She prefers to act herself and has the pride of a warrior. Crusch is also gentle, often believing the false knowledge jokingly told to her by [Ferris](https://anilist.co/character/90184), and sometimes displays an airheaded side. Like her mother Helena Karsten, she is shown to be ruthless and reckless.', '/uploads/images/c_90185.jpg'),
(94, 'Priscilla Barielle', 'プリシラ・バーリエル', '配角', 'Yukari Tamura', 'The matriarch of House Barielle and a candidate to become the 42nd King of Lugunica. Her knight is [Al](https://anilist.co/character/90178/Aldebaran).', '/uploads/images/c_90186.png'),
(94, 'Puck', 'パック', '配角', 'Yumi Uchiyama', '__Height:__ 7 cm Puck is an Artificial Spirit that [Emilia](https://anilist.co/character/88572/Emilia) was formerly contracted with. He is the current Great Spirit of Fire. ~!He is currently known as the Beast of The End.!~ ~!Around 400 years ago, Puck was created by Echidna, though he had apparently left her by the time she moved into the Sanctuary. Seven years before the start of the election, Puck unfroze Emilia and began to act as her friend and mentor, and later on started to live at Roswaal''s mansion where he was reunited with Beatrice.!~ Puck can be described as cute or adorable, thus his skin being pink around his cheeks. His fur is mostly grey with silver in certain spots (i.e. tip of the tail). His eyebrows are pretty small and rhombus-shaped. He also has a gold earring on his left ear. Sometimes, he carries a purple bag. Puck is generally a nice spirit. He is very happy and stays at Emilia''s side to protect her, affectionately calling her "Lia". He occasionally goofs around and gets along especially well with [Beatrice](https://anilist.co/character/90181/Beatrice). ~!However, Puck''s demeanor greatly changes in loops where Emilia dies, showing a complete disregard for anyone except her, and was even willing to destroy the world because of the condition in their contract.!~', '/uploads/images/c_90187.jpg'),
(94, 'Otto Suwen', 'オットー・スーウェン', '配角', 'Kouhei Amasaki', 'Otto Suwen is a merchant appearing in Re:Zero. His remarkable misfortune always takes him to dangerous situations, from which he escapes thanks to his wit. Otto has gray hair that is mentioned to be as long as a gal game protagonist. He is said to be somewhat handsome if he has a serious expression. However, he is usually either retorting, shouting, or panicking, ruining his looks. He has a medium build, but has trained himself since he used to work as a merchant.', '/uploads/images/c_124110.jpg'),
(94, 'Rachins Hoffman', 'ラチンス・ホフマン', '配角', 'Genki Muro', 'One of the three thugs that attacked Subaru at the very start of Arc 1. ~! He later joined the Felt Camp when [Felt](https://anilist.co/character/88574/Felt) employed him after Royal Selection began. After being employed by Felt, he started to get trained by Reinhard and has developed considerable power. !~ ~! He was born as a noble from the Royal Capital of Lugunica, to [Rickert Hoffman](https://anilist.co/character/226757/Rickert-Hoffman) and an unnamed woman. However, after unknown events, he left his family and began living in the slums. He scorns his father and chose to cut ties with his family. !~', '/uploads/images/c_124115.png'),
(94, 'Theresia van Astrea', 'テレシア・ヴァン・アストレア', '配角', 'Minami Takahashi', 'Theresia was the former Sword Saint/Master Swordsman, [Wilhelm](https://anilist.co/character/90179/Wilhelm-van-Astrea)''s wife and [Reinhard](https://anilist.co/character/88577/Reinhard-van-Astrea)''s grandmother.', '/uploads/images/c_124116.png'),
(94, 'Rom', 'ロム', '配角', 'Mugihito', 'Rom, commonly known as Grandpa or Old Man Rom, is a member of the Felt Camp and the former owner of the Stolen Goods Warehouse.', '/uploads/images/c_124117.jpg'),
(94, 'Kadomon Risch', 'カドモン・リッシュ', '配角', 'Kenta Miyake', 'Kadomon is a fruit seller in the royal capital.', '/uploads/images/c_124118.jpg'),
(94, 'Plum Risch', 'プラム・リッシュ', '配角', 'Aimi Tanaka', 'Plum is the daughter of [Kadomon Risch](https://anilist.co/character/124118)', '/uploads/images/c_124119.jpg'),
(94, 'Satella', 'サテラ', '配角', 'Rie Takahashi', 'Satella is one of the Witches of Sin, being the Witch of Envy. ~! Contrary to popular belief, Satella and the Witch of Envy are separate personalities. Both of them love Subaru, though the Witch of Envy is aggressive about it.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127242.png'),
(94, 'Petra Leyte', 'ペトラ・レイテ', '配角', 'Marika Kouno', 'Petra is a bright and kind girl from Irlam Village. She likes [Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru) very much after he saved her from the Wolgarm incident. ~!She became a maid at the Roswaal Mansion after Subaru came back from the witchcult incident. !~', '/uploads/images/c_141858.jpg'),
(94, 'Frederica Baumann', 'フレデリカ・バウマン', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', 'Frederica Baumann is a maid working for [Roswaal L. Mathers](https://anilist.co/character/90182/Mathers-Roswaal) and a member of the Emilia Camp. She quit her job as a maid a few months before [Subaru''s](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru) appearance, but returned after [Ram](https://anilist.co/character/88576/Ram) couldn''t manage the mansion ~!after [Rem](https://anilist.co/character/88575/Rem) had her name and memories eaten. !~ ~!She is the half-sister of [Garfiel Tinsel](https://anilist.co/character/133847/Tinsel-Garfiel).!~', '/uploads/images/c_143378.png'),
(94, 'Mimi Pearlbaton', 'ミミ・パールバトン', '配角', 'Yukiyo Fujii', '__Height:__ 135 cm (4''5") Mimi is one of Anastasia Hoshin''s followers and is one of three vice-captains of the mercenary group Fang of Steel.', '/uploads/images/c_157961.png'),
(94, 'Meili Portroute', 'メィリィ・ポートルート', '配角', 'Eri Suzuki', 'One of the children that lives in the village within [Roswaal](https://anilist.co/character/90182)''s region. She''s timid, though is friendly, such as when she introduces a small dog to [Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573). ~!Meili Portroute is a Demon Beast User.!~', '/uploads/images/c_175577.jpg'),
(94, 'Patrasche', 'パトラッシュ', '配角', '', '[Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru)''s Earth Dragon that he officially received from [Crusch Karsten](https://anilist.co/character/90185/Karsten-Crusch) for his efforts in the Hakugei battle. Despite being of a species known for being feisty, Patrasche is extremely loyal to Subaru, as she is willing to put her life on the line for him.', '/uploads/images/c_181313.jpg'),
(94, 'Ricardo Welkin', 'リカード・ウェルキン', '配角', 'Kenji Nomura', 'Ricardo Welkin is one of Anastasia Hoshin''s followers and the captain of the mercenary group: Fang of Iron.', '/uploads/images/c_181314.png'),
(94, 'Lucas', 'リュカ', '配角', 'Yuna Yoshino', 'Citizen of Irlam Village.', '/uploads/images/c_185043.jpg'),
(94, 'Ketty Muttart', 'ケティ・ムッタート', '配角', 'Hiroshi Yanaka', 'Was a merchant and a member of the Witch Cult.', '/uploads/images/c_185044.jpg'),
(94, 'Raksha Risch', 'ラクシャ・リッシュ', '配角', 'Hibiku Yamamura', 'Wife of Kadomon Risch.', '/uploads/images/c_185045.jpg'),
(94, 'Russell Fellow', 'ラッセル・フェロー', '配角', 'Tooru Ookawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_185046.jpg'),
(94, 'Tivey Pearlbaton', 'ティビー・パールバトン', '配角', 'Hiroki Shimowada', 'One of Anastasia Hoshin''s followers and is one of the three vice captains of the mercenary group Fang of Iron.', '/uploads/images/c_187763.png'),
(94, 'Hetaro Pearlbaton', 'ヘータロー・パールバトン', '配角', 'Megumi Han', 'Hetaro Pearlbaton is one of Anastasia Hoshin''s followers and is one of the three vice captains of the mercenary group Fang of Iron.', '/uploads/images/c_203919.png'),
(94, 'Schult', 'シュルト', '配角', '', 'Schult is a member of the Priscilla Camp. Though not much is known about him, he''s extremely loyal to his mistress and is one of her closest attendants.', '/uploads/images/c_205259.png'),
(94, 'Marcos Gildark', 'マーコス・ギルダーク', '配角', 'Itaru Yamamoto', 'Marcos Gildark is the captain of the Royal Guard and Knight Commander.', '/uploads/images/c_205260.png'),
(94, 'Kan', 'カン', '配角', 'Daiki Yamashita', '__Height:__ 130 cm (4''3") Camberley, commonly known as Kan, is one of the three thugs that attacked Subaru. ~! He later joined the [Felt](https://anilist.co/character/88574/Felt) Camp when Felt employed him after Royal Selection began. After being employed by Felt, he began getting trained by Reinhard and has developed considerable power. !~', '/uploads/images/c_205261.png'),
(94, 'Gaston', 'ガストン', '配角', 'Tetsu Inada', 'Gaston, commonly known as Ton, is one of the three thugs that attacked Subaru. ~! He later joined the [Felt](https://anilist.co/character/88574/Felt) Camp when Felt employed him after Royal Selection began. After being employed by Felt, he started to get trained by Reinhard and has developed considerable power. !~', '/uploads/images/c_205262.png'),
(94, 'Temae', 'テマエ', '配角', 'Akiko Kimura', 'Temae was Ram and Rem''s mother.', '/uploads/images/c_205582.png'),
(94, 'Setanta', 'セタンタ', '配角', 'Hideaki Tezuka', 'Setanta was the chief of the Oni Village Ram and Rem lived at when they were young.', '/uploads/images/c_205583.jpg'),
(94, 'Quark', 'クオーク', '配角', 'Susumu Chiba', 'Quark was Ram and Rem''s father.', '/uploads/images/c_205584.png'),
(94, 'Chamov', 'チャモフ', '配角', '', 'Chamov is a puppy demihuman, with white hair, blue eyes, and an amiable puppy face. He typically likes to wear a hat.', '/uploads/images/c_205881.jpg'),
(94, 'Bordeaux Zellgef', 'ボルドー・ツェルゲフ', '配角', 'Jirou Saitou', 'Bordeaux Zellgef is a member of the Sage Council. During the Demi-Human war, he acted as the captain of the Zellgef Squadron. Four decades ago during the Demi-Human War, Bordeaux was a tall, muscular and somewhat frightening man, usually donned in heavy iron armour and wielding a massive battle axe. He had short and spiky light blue hair, and equally blue and thick eyebrows. His eyes radiated a strong fighting spirit.', '/uploads/images/c_218202.png'),
(94, 'Rickert Hoffman', 'リッカートホフマン', '配角', 'Yutaka Aoyama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_226757.jpg'),
(94, 'Hitosashiyubi', '人差し指', '配角', 'Youko Hikasa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_226758.jpg'),
(94, 'Miklotov McMahon', 'マイクロトフ・マクマホン', '配角', 'Motomu Kiyokawa', 'The representative of the Council of Wise Men who are currently ruling over the Dragon Kingdom of Lugunica. Many have considered Miklotov to be the true brains of the Kingdom who, in the event that the royal family were to disappear, would be a suitable replacement ruler.', '/uploads/images/c_354519.png'),
(95, 'Joutarou Kuujou', '空条承太郎', '主角', 'Daisuke Ono', '__Height:__ 195 cm (6''5") __Occupation:__ Student, Marine Explorer, Oceanographer __Nationality:__ Japanese Joutarou is Holly Kujo''s son and [Joseph Joestar](https://anilist.co/character/6356)''s grandson. In Part 3, he has a recognizable attire of a blue trenchcoat-length school uniform jacket with yellow chains on the collar. He also wears a trademark hat which, while torn in the back, often seems to blend with his hair. When Joutarou first appears, he turned himself in to the police because he believes his Stand is an evil spirit possessing him. After he is released from jail, and learns what his Stand is, Joutarou gets used to Star Platinum -- a fierce, muscular, vaguely Aztec-looking spirit with "the precision of a machine" and the ability to destroy virtually anything with a sledgehammer barrage of fists. He has a very tough exterior, and is even rather rough and delinquent, but he also is very dedicated, intense, and loyal. He is very intelligent, but usually lets his (or Star Platinum''s) fists do the talking with the enemy, even though he often has to rely on his wits to deal with stand users'' attacks. He is also known for a quick and short temper. His catchphrase is "Yare yare daze." It generally relates of being bored or exasperation. In Part 3, he is the main target of [Dio](https://anilist.co/character/4004), who realizes that Joutarou is his greatest threat. One of the strongest stands in the JoJo universe; Star Platinum possesses super human senses, strength, sta', '/uploads/images/c_4003.png'),
(95, 'Dio Brando', 'ディオ・ブランドー', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 195 cm (6''5") __Race:__ Human (formerly), Vampire (onwards) __Nationality:__ British Dio is an immortal vampire and the arch rival of the Joestar clan. __Series 1: Phantom Blood__ ~!Dio is the son of [Dario Brando](https://anilist.co/character/74099/Brando-Dario), an alcoholic and abusive father. Back when Dio was just a boy, he was brought into the household of [George Joestar](https://anilist.co/character/21956/Joestar-I-George) after the mysterious death of his father, so as to repay the debt he owed Dio''s father for saving his life. But soon Dio''s personality caused trouble for George''s young son, [Jonathan Joestar](https://anilist.co/character/8087/Joestar-Jonathan). Even more of a sociopath than his father, Dio was resolute to shatter Jonathan''s spirit and take his place as the favored son, even going so far as to arrange for Jonathan''s dog [Danny](https://anilist.co/character/222601/Danny) to be burned to death. Initially, Dio is able earn the trust of the patriarch of the Joestar family through deceit (and at Jonathan''s expense). However, his plans of taking over the Joestar household were discovered by Jonathan when he discovered that not only had Dio poisoned his biological father to death, he was doing the same to his adoptive father, all to take the Joestar estate for his own. Determined not to be stopped, and understanding the potential to enjoy power over all things instead of just the Joestar estate, Dio wears and activates the Stone Mask, becoming ', '/uploads/images/c_4004.png'),
(95, 'Jean-Pierre Polnareff', 'ジャン＝ピエール・ポルナレフ', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 185 cm (6''1") Jean-Pierre Polnareff is a Frenchman who joins the Joestar group on their journey to Egypt after being freed from Dio''s control by the group. He aims to avenge the murder of his sister. His brash nature and overconfidence combined with his general tomfoolery is often the source of trouble throughout the journey, and other members of the group often remark on his tendency to endanger himself and others. ~!Polnareff reappears in 2001 (Part 5), now 36 years old and wheelchair-bound, to assist [Giorno](https://anilist.co/character/10529/Giovanna-Giorno) and the rest of Passione in their fight against the boss.!~ He also serves as the inspiration for many characters in other franchises such as [Guile](https://anilist.co/character/9312/Guile) (Street Fighter), [Paul](https://anilist.co/character/285435/Phoenix-Paul) (Tekken), [Benimaru Nikaido](https://anilist.co/character/61203/Nikaido-Benimaru) (King of Fighters).', '/uploads/images/c_4368.png'),
(95, 'Joseph Joestar', 'ジョセフ・ジョースター', '配角', 'Unshou Ishizuka', '__Height__: 195 cm (6''5") Joseph Joestar begins as a young Englishman in New York, with his grandmother [Erina](https://anilist.co/character/21937). However, an attack by [Straits](https://anilist.co/character/21961) and the disappearance of [Robert Edward O Speedwagon](https://anilist.co/character/21938) soon involve him in the greater chain of events.', '/uploads/images/c_6356.png'),
(95, 'Noriaki Kakyouin', '花京院典明', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 178 cm (5''10") __Stand:__ Hierophant Green Kakyoin is a high school student and user of the stand Hierophant Green. Unlike most stand users, Kakyoin was born with his stand, though it caused him to feel like an outsider for most of his life due to not knowing any other stand users. Until meeting the rest of the main characters, Hierophant was Kakyoin’s only real friend. Hierophant is not physically strong, but is elastic and can able to unravel into tentacles which can capture opponents. It can also enter an enemy’s body to possess them, though Kakyoin rarely uses this ability. Hierophant’s signature power is emerald splash, which hurls emeralds that slice opponents. Kakyoin remains calm and collected even in dangerous situations, and is good at seeing through opponents’ strategies. During a trip to Egypt with his family, he encountered [Dio](https://anilist.co/character/4004/Brando-Dio), who controlled him using a flesh bud. It was later removed by [Jotaro](https://anilist.co/character/4003/Kuujou-Joutarou) and Kakyoin joined the Joestar group.', '/uploads/images/c_8945.jpg'),
(95, 'Mohammed Avdol', 'モハメド・アヴドゥル', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 188 cm (6''2") __Stand:__ Magician''s Red Avdol is a fortune teller and friend of [Joseph Joestar](https://anilist.co/character/6356/Joestar-Joseph). They met three years before the events of the story. He was born with a stand, Magician’s Red, which controls fire. This stand’s abilities include Crossfire Hurricane, which shoots fire in the shape of an Ankh, and Crossfire Hurricane Special, which splits into multiple Ankh-shaped flames. He can also create flame tracker that detects a person’s energy. Avdol presents himself as a serious person but can sometimes let his emotions get the best of him. He often acts as the voice of reason among the Joestar group and exhibits strong loyalty by frequently placing himself in danger to protect his friends. He is knowledgeable about geography and stands, enjoys India’s chaotic atmosphere, and respects [Polnareff](https://anilist.co/character/4368/Polnareff-JeanPierre)''s chivalrous attitude that he displayed when they first met. Avdol gives [Jotaro](https://anilist.co/character/4003/Kuujou-Joutarou)''s stand its name. ~!Avdol encountered [DIO](https://anilist.co/character/4004/Brando-Dio) in Egypt before the main events of the story, but was able to escape unscathed.!~ ~!At one point he is shot by [Hol Horse](https://anilist.co/character/16557/Horse-Hol) and presumed dead, but he was actually in hiding and rejoins the Joestar group later. He is killed protecting Polnareff and [Iggy](https://anilist.co/character/21089/Iggy) from', '/uploads/images/c_8946.jpg'),
(95, 'Yoshikage Kira', '吉良吉影', '主角', 'Toshiyuki Morikawa', '**Height:** 175 cm (5''9") Kira is a man who longs for a simple life, and doesn''t wish to be bothered. Although he reveals many talents, this yearning shows in his dislike of coming in first, as the cast eventually realizes. He becomes quite bothered when someone disrupts his "simplicity", and goes to extreme lengths to get it back. He keeps a collection of his own fingernail clippings, and believes when they grow quickly he has trouble. Kira also has a bizarre fetish for the female hand, stemming from an erotic fascination with the hands of the Mona Lisa. Unfortunately, his desire has never extended to the rest of the female person. This results in his murdering women in order to acquire their (severed) hands as "girlfriends"—when one "girlfriend" begins to decay, he goes off in search of a replacement. Originally, Kira murdered his victims by stabbing them so viciously they were left with horrific back wounds (their hideous nature is implied by the fact that the reader is never actually shown [Reimi](https://anilist.co/character/90167/Sugimoto-Reimi)''s wound). However, his Stand, Killer Queen, eventually awoke from his desire to leave no evidence behind of his killings—hence its ability to make its victims completely disintegrate. He now lets Killer Queen annihilate his victims (except for his "girlfriend"-hands), letting everyone else think that the victims have simply gone missing. Even if the number of missing attracts attention (as it eventually does), no one would have ', '/uploads/images/c_12055.png'),
(95, 'Rohan Kishibe', '岸辺露伴', '主角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', 'Rohan is a mangaka that first appears as an antagonist to [Koichi](https://anilist.co/character/24496/Hirose-Kouichi) and Toshizaku when they go to his house for an autograph. After they try to sneak a peek of the new issue of his manga he uses his stand Heaven''s Door to make neither of them able to attack him. Then he reads their memories and in doing so finds out about [Josuke](https://anilist.co/character/13085/Higashikata-Jousuke), [Okuyasu](https://anilist.co/character/28991/Nijimura-Okuyasu) and everyone else in the story so far, but only according to how Koichi sees them. Then he decides to use them as materials for his manga. After using Koichi as his personal "Inspiration" Okuyasu and Josuke find out about where Koichi has been going by following him. They defeat him and leave him in the hospital for a while. In the Jojolands Universe he appears as rich japanese who owns a Villa on Hawai''i Island and as a second antagonist who fight with [Jodio](https://anilist.co/character/298895/Joestar-Jodio), [Dragona](https://anilist.co/character/298896/Joestar-Dragona), [Paco](https://anilist.co/character/298904/Laburantes-Paco) and [Usagi](https://anilist.co/character/306164/Alohaoe-Usagi). Furthermore, he saves in his safe the diamond which Jodio and his group want to steal and two Lava Rocks.', '/uploads/images/c_12659.png'),
(95, 'Jousuke Higashikata', '東方仗助', '主角', 'Yuuki Ono', '__Height:__ 185 cm __Nationality:__ Japanese Josuke is the illegitimate son of [Jotaro](https://anilist.co/character/4003/Kuujou-Joutarou)''s grandfather, [Joseph Joestar](https://anilist.co/character/6356/Joestar-Joseph). He is a caring, popular, and slightly naive teenager. Inspired by his police officer grandfather''s (on his mother''s side) sense of justice, he isn''t afraid to fight for those in need. He is confronted by Jotaro with the need to eradicate evil Stand users from his hometown, Morioh. He refuses at first, believing that it is not any of his business. However, he quickly changes his mind when his policeman grandfather is killed by a criminal Stand user. With a vow paralleling that of [Peter Parker](https://anilist.co/character/154717/Parker-Peter), Josuke decides to deliver justice to evil Stand users in his grandfather''s place. Josuke''s Stand power, Crazy Diamond, is a melee Stand with short range (3m). Crazy Diamond has the ability of "restoration".', '/uploads/images/c_13085.jpg'),
(95, 'Iggy', 'イギー', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 33.3 cm __Nationality:__ American Iggy is a boston terrier who wields a stand known as The Fool, which is able to manipulate sand. Since The Fool is made of sand, damaging it will not hurt Iggy. He creates various objects out of sand including the wings of a glider and a statue of DIO. Iggy is depicted as rude and disobedient, as shown by his tendency to chew on people’s hair while farting on them. He loves coffee-flavored gum. Iggy was previously owned by a rich man, but he ran away and became a stray in New York. Avdol caught him and brought him to Egypt to help the Joestar group defeat DIO. He frequently chews Polnareff’s hair and once put chewed gum inside Jotaro’s hat. ~!At first, Iggy seems indifferent towards the Joestar’s quest to defeat DIO. Then he accidentally finds DIO’s mansion and is attacked and injured by Pet Shop, causing his hatred for DIO to grow. He is killed after saving Polnareff from Vanilla Ice.!~ He was initially drawn as realistic dog, but as the story progressed, his face gradually became more similar to a human’s. He is named after Iggy Pop.', '/uploads/images/c_21089.jpg'),
(95, 'Kouichi Hirose', '広瀬康一', '主角', 'Yuuki Kaji', 'An ally and classmate who meets [Jousuke](https://anilist.co/character/13085/Higashikata-Jousuke) when [Joutarou](https://anilist.co/character/4003/Kuujou-Joutarou) is searching for him, resulting in the two becoming quick friends. His stand is Echoes, which has three distinct forms, or Acts (Koichi can only call upon one at any given time).', '/uploads/images/c_24496.jpg'),
(95, 'Mikitaka Hasekura', '支倉 未起隆', '配角', 'Yasuyuki Kase', 'Mikitaka first appears in chapter 378 (I Am An Alien! 1). He claims he''s a 216 year old alien from the Mclon system looking for a planet for his people to live in. His job is piloting a space shuttle and his hobby is raising small pets. He possesses the ability to assume any physical form he desires. Although he can take a form vastly smaller than his normal mass, and can separate himself into several components in the process, it is not known if he can take on a much larger form. On the negative side, if exposed to a siren or similar sound, he suffers a painful rash until the sound stops. It was never revealed in the manga whether Mikitaka is a delusional stand user activated by the Arrow or truly an extraterrestrial life-form (he gives his full name as Nu Mikitakazo Nshi). According to JOJO!A-GO-GO artbook, his stand''s name is Earth, Wind And Fire.', '/uploads/images/c_24819.png'),
(95, 'Okuyasu Nijimura', '虹村億泰', '主角', 'Wataru Takagi', 'Okuyasu isn''t exactly the brightest character in the Jojo story, and tended to rely on his elder brother Keicho to make hard decisions. After his brother died, he sought revenge against the User of Red Hot Chili Pepper, Akira Otoishi. During this time and the following events surrounding Yoshikage Kira, he became fast friends with Josuke and Koichi. Okuyasu tends to be jealous of Koichi''s relationship with Yukako, and enjoys Tonio''s cooking. He also befriends Shigechi, after doing battle with his Harvest with Josuke. ~!This friendship is why he became further enraged when Shigechi was killed by Yoshikage Kira. !~ ~!Okuyasu''s father is a bizarre creature, mutated by Dio''s spores when Okuyasu was only 7. He rather dislikes Rohan because of what Rohan tried to do to him when they first met.!~', '/uploads/images/c_28991.png'),
(95, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Tooru Ookawa', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(95, 'Shigekiyo Yanguu', '矢安宮重清', '配角', 'Kappei Yamaguchi', 'A side character in Diamond is Unbreakable. Shigechi is a short and stocky teenage boy. Apparently bald, his crown is textured by short spikes, and he has thick, drooping earlobes. He has small, high eyebrows, and youthful features. His teeth are misaligned, and he is missing his left maxillary central incisor. Introduced as a kid using his Stand, Harvest, to collect money throughout the town, Shigechi befriends Josuke Higashikata and Okuyasu Nijimura. ~!He is soon killed by Yoshikage Kira, prompting Josuke Higashikata and his friend''s search for the murderer.!~', '/uploads/images/c_42156.png'),
(95, 'Akira Otoishi', '音石明', '配角', 'Shoutarou Morikubo', 'Akira was one of the many people Keicho Nijimura shot with the Bow and Arrow while trying to find a stand user capable of killing his mutated father. Akira was one the many lucky ones to develop a stand after which point he became interested in them and how to create them. To further his goal on studying them he needed the Bow and Arrow which he forcefully took from Keicho leading to Keicho''s death. From there on he tormented several people, among them Josuke while trying to improve in the use of his guitar skills. (Source: JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_42157.png'),
(95, 'Yukako Yamagishi', '山岸由花子', '配角', 'Mamiko Noto', '__Height:__ 167 cm Yukako is a student in love with Koichi Hirose. At first she was very aggressive in her affections towards him, jealously attacking what she believed were potential rivals in love and even going so far as to kidnap him and threaten his life should he not return her feelings and not appreciate her efforts to "change him into a better person" – she had picked up false rumors that he was insufferable, false rumors that were spread by Josuke and Okuyasu in order to help Koichi in turning her away from him; unfortunately for them, their measures had the opposite effect. Later in the story, Yukako, still lovestruck, seemed to have learned from her mistake in trying to force Koichi. Unhappy about her unrequited love she made use of the services offered by Aya Tsuji''s beauty enhancing Cinderella stand, which rendered her into a bewitchingly attractive woman in the eyes of Koichi - for a price and a certain time limit, during which she was to use a special lipstick in order to uphold the "magic" i.e. the stand''s power. ~!The stand allowed her to grow closer to Koichi, who, after some trials and tribulations, warmed up to her and willingly became her boyfriend. !~', '/uploads/images/c_42158.png'),
(95, 'Keichou Nijimura', '虹村形兆', '配角', 'Tomoyuki Shimura', 'A minor antagonist featured in the fourth part of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure, Diamond is Unbreakable, specifically in the "The Nijimura Brothers" story arc. Keicho is Okuyasu''s older brother. He is the first in Morioh to possess the Bow and Arrow and liberally creates Stand users in hopes one of them can kill his monstrous father. Keicho himself is a Stand User and his Stand is the miniature army, Bad Company. ~!After his fight with Josuke Higashikata, he dies from being electrically fried by Akira Otoishi''s stand, Red Hot Chili Pepper!~', '/uploads/images/c_76724.png'),
(95, 'Reimi  Sugimoto', '杉本鈴美', '配角', 'Sayuri Hara', 'Reimi Sugimoto is Yoshikage Kira''s first victim, and as a ghost, chose to stay on Earth in hope of finding someone to help her bring Kira to justice.', '/uploads/images/c_90167.png'),
(95, 'Tomoko Higashikata', '東方朋子', '配角', 'Megumi Toyoguchi', 'She is the single mother of [Josuke Higashikata](https://anilist.co/character/13085/Jousuke-Higashikata). A single mother and teacher, Tomoko is known to show a strong temperament, disliking it when guys try to hit on her (as she still loves Joseph) and she gets annoyed quite easily. She also seems to be mildly perceptive, noticing that the seal on her milk that Angelo had given her was broken. Despite her sharp temperament, she is mostly a kind person, particularly to her family and friends.', '/uploads/images/c_130127.png'),
(95, 'Terunosuke Miyamoto', '宮本輝之輔', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', 'Terunosuke is a man of average height and slim build. He has skin of a medium tone, light eyes, and light hair that is styled in a criss-cross pattern, framing his face and curling upwards at its ends. He wears a long, light coat closed to the end of his chest. Underneath is a dark top wrapped in three ornate belts and fitted dark pants. The inside of his coat has the word "ENIGMA" printed at its bottom.', '/uploads/images/c_130128.png'),
(95, 'Yoshihiro Kira', '吉良吉廣', '配角', 'Shigeru Chiba', 'Yoshihiro Kira is a ghost, having the appearance of a lightly-built, balding old man. Yoshihiro has a small mustache and a goatee of dark hair. While he was human, Yoshihiro is shown to have fancied modest, respectable attire; consisting of a striped green button-down shirt with a purple tie, yellow cardigan and a loose fitting lime-green suit. As a ghost, however, Yoshihiro now only wears his striped green shirt with matching pants. (Source: JoJo''s Bizarre Encyclopedia)', '/uploads/images/c_130129.png'),
(95, 'Aya Tsuji', '辻彩', '配角', 'Sayaka Oohara', 'Aya is a woman of average to above-average height and slim build. Of fine features, she wears her light hair in an arrangement between a slight beehive and a ponytail; her bangs divided in two, in a clean arch reaching cheek level. Her dark eyebrows rest high on her forehead. She wears a pink dress with a thick corset belt at her waist, two smaller belts buckled around it. She is depicted with a more notable cleavage in the anime. (Source: JoJo''s Bizarre Encyclopedia)', '/uploads/images/c_130130.png'),
(95, 'Anjuurou Katagiri', '片桐安十郎', '配角', 'Kenji Hamada', 'Angelo is a tall muscular man with short spiked hair, prominent facial features and a lack of eyebrows. Outside his prison attire in flashbacks, he''s only ever seen wearing a milkman outfit consisting of a long sleeve shirt and overalls. (Source: JoJo''s Bizarre Encyclopedia)', '/uploads/images/c_130131.png'),
(95, 'Yuuya Fungami', '噴上裕也', '配角', 'Kishou Taniyama', 'Yuuya Fungami is a minor character in Diamond is Unbreakable. He is featured as an antagonist in Highway Star, and as an ally in Enigma Boy. Yuuya is a motorcycle gang member who was made into a Stand User by Yoshihiro Kira and prompted into attacking the Joestar Group. Selfishly attacking Rohan and Jousuke in a high-speed road chase with his Highway Star, Yuuya later assists Josuke in the fight against Terunosuke.', '/uploads/images/c_130132.png'),
(95, 'Hayato Kawajiri', '川尻早人', '配角', 'Rina Satou', 'Hayato is the son of Kosaku Kawajiri and [Shinobu Kawajiri](https://anilist.co/character/130141/Kawajiri-Shinobu). He does not like to interact with his family and spends most of his time inside his bedroom.', '/uploads/images/c_130133.png'),
(95, 'Masazou Kinoto', '乙雅三', '配角', 'Makoto Ishii', 'Masazo Kinoto is a scrawny man, having an undercut with two wild locks of hair, and cauliflower ears. He is seen wearing casual business attire: a collared shirt, khaki pants and a large trench coat. Masazo is a quiet and timid architect, but a little greedy. (Source: JoJo''s Bizarre Encyclopedia)', '/uploads/images/c_130134.png'),
(95, 'Tamami Kobayashi', '小林玉美', '配角', 'Satoshi Tsuruoka', 'Tamami initially appears as a tall and intimidating man. With pronounced epicanthic folds, he wears hair of dark to medium tone combed in the manner of a pompadour into a sort of thick helmet; and he has a small cross-shaped scar beyond the bottom-left corner of his mouth. (Source: JoJo''s Bizarre Encyclopedia)', '/uploads/images/c_130136.png'),
(95, 'Toshikazu Hazamada', '間田敏和', '配角', 'Hiroki Shimowada', 'A teenage male, Hazamada is initially tall, but later in the story, like Tamami, he shrinks to Koichi''s height. In the anime, he is simply depicted as already being short in stature. He has long, straight dark hair and wears a school uniform with the character "間" along the collar and several belts spread vertically down the chest- mirroring a strait jacket. He has dark color upper eyelids. (Source: JoJo''s Bizarre Encyclopedia)', '/uploads/images/c_130137.png'),
(95, 'Toyohiro Kanedaichi', '鋼田一豊大', '配角', 'Kouichi Toochika', 'Before showing that he wore a mask, he didn''t look very unusual, aside from some facial markings. After he revealed this, his eyes'' colors invert, his hair is more tucked into his hat and his ears become exaggeratedly large. The mask''s opening also suddenly becomes visible around his neck.', '/uploads/images/c_130138.png'),
(95, 'Tonio Trussardi', 'トニオ・トラサルディー', '配角', 'Tokuyoshi Kawashima', 'Tonio is a man of average to above-average height and medium build. He keeps short, light, neat hair; and he often wears a genial expression. Tonio is only shown in his chef''s uniform, comprising a light or white double-breasted jacket, a loose tie, an apron, and a tall, cylindrical hat. He wears the small, metallic emblem of a "T" at the upper corners of the chest his jacket and apron, and at the frontal fold of his hat. (Source: JoJo''s Bizarre Encyclopedia)', '/uploads/images/c_130139.png'),
(95, 'Ken Oyanagi', '大柳賢', '配角', 'Chika Sakamoto', 'Ken is a young boy of short stature, slim build and medium straight hair. His attire consists of a headband, open ankle-high sandals and shortalls with both straps on one shoulder; the garment is adorned on all sides by several large safety pins. He has ginger hair and brown eyes in the colored manga,and white hair and gold eyes in the anime. (Source: JoJo''s Bizarre Encyclopedia)', '/uploads/images/c_130140.png'),
(95, 'Shinobu Kawajiri', '川尻しのぶ', '配角', 'Yuu Shimamura', 'Shinobu has reddish-pink hair (brown hair in manga) that is parted to the right and tied back in low ponytail. Sometimes, like in her first appearance, she will tie back several locks of hair that are part of her bangs.', '/uploads/images/c_130141.png'),
(95, 'Ryouhei Higashikata', '東方良平', '配角', 'Katsuhisa Houki', 'The grandfather of [Jousuke](https://anilist.co/character/13085/), and the father of [Tomoko Higashikata](https://anilist.co/character/130127/).', '/uploads/images/c_130142.png'),
(95, 'Nijimura', '虹村父', '配角', 'Naomi Kusumi', 'Nijimura Sr. is a short, rotund creature with rough, blistered green skin, mismatched eyes, no ears, a squished nose, and puffy lips resembling a beak. He has a mohawk-like hairstyle with small bald patches in between. He wears a sleeveless shirt along with shorts. Before his deformation, as seen in a photograph, he was a man of masculine features and short, dark hair, wearing a genial expression. (Source: JoJo''s Bizarre Encyclopedia)', '/uploads/images/c_130258.png'),
(95, 'Mushikui', '虫喰い', '配角', '', 'Bug-Eaten is a brown rat approximately 20 cm long. It possesses a strange protuberance on the forehead as well as an abnormally large nose. Its right ear has been chewed out in a fight, earning it its nickname. (Source JoJo Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_181335.png'),
(95, 'Arnold', 'アーノルド', '配角', '', 'Like Reimi, Arnold is a ghost who remains by their side in the alley while they wait for their time to come.', '/uploads/images/c_218854.jpg'),
(95, 'Police', 'ポリス', '配角', '', 'Police is Koichi Hirose''s sleepy dog. In almost all of his appearances he is seen sleeping. Koichi once even wondered if he was still alive. As the Hirose family already has Police, Koichi isn''t allowed to have another pet and has to take him for walks. He is seen sleeping at the beginning of Tamami Kobayashi''s and Yukako Yamagishi''s fights and is taken for a walk during Yuya''s fight. His name is taken from the British band The Police', '/uploads/images/c_218858.png'),
(95, 'Kouichi Haha', '幸一母', '配角', 'Ayumi Nagao', 'She is the wife of Mr. Hirose and also the mother of Ayana Hirose and Koichi Hirose.', '/uploads/images/c_218860.png'),
(95, 'Ayana Hirose', '広瀬 綾那', '配角', 'Hana Takeda', 'She is a third year student in an all-girls high school. Ayana is the older sister of Koichi Hirose, and the daughter of Mr. Hirose and Mrs. Hirose.', '/uploads/images/c_218861.png'),
(95, 'Reiko', 'レイコ', '配角', 'Minami Shinoda', 'One of the three fangirls of Yuya Fungami. She has a "HIGHWAY STAR" tattoo on one of her arms.', '/uploads/images/c_222255.jpg'),
(95, 'Yoshie', 'ヨシエ', '配角', 'Juri Kimura', 'One of the three fangirls of Yuya Fungami. She has a "HIGHWAY STAR" tattoo on one of her arms.', '/uploads/images/c_222256.jpg'),
(95, 'Akemi', 'アケミ', '配角', 'Aoi Koga', 'One of the three fangirls of Yuya Fungami. She has a "HIGHWAY STAR" tattoo on one of her arms.', '/uploads/images/c_222257.jpg'),
(95, 'Shizuka Joestar', '静・ジョースター', '配角', 'Taeko Kawata', 'Shizuka is a baby found on the side of a road in Morioh by Joseph Joestar, who subsequently adopts her. Incidentally, she is a Stand User who can turn invisible thanks to her Achtung Baby. Her face is made visible only when covered by makeup, upon which Joseph and Josuke agree that she is cute. She wears a range of soft, light baby clothing, including a small, bobbled knit cap, and large, dark glasses (designed to hide her invisible eyes).', '/uploads/images/c_222258.png'),
(95, 'Minako Ookura', '大倉美那子', '配角', 'Ayaka Asai', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_231058.png'),
(95, 'Satoru Nakae', '中江悟', '配角', 'Tasuku Hatanaka', '[Minako Ookura](https://anilist.co/character/231058/)''s boyfriend.', '/uploads/images/c_231059.png'),
(95, 'Sakai', '堺', '配角', 'Yuusen Isamu', '[Toshikazu Hazamada](https://anilist.co/character/130137/)''s friend.', '/uploads/images/c_231060.png'),
(95, 'Murakami', '村上', '配角', '', 'Old woman asking Rohan and Kouichi for directions.', '/uploads/images/c_234749.png'),
(95, 'Mushikuidenai', '虫食いでない', '配角', '', 'It and another rat were struck by Akira Otoishi with an Arrow, giving the two Stands Ratt.', '/uploads/images/c_247926.png'),
(95, 'Mukade-ya Tenshu', 'ムカデ屋店主', '配角', 'Shinobu Matsumoto', 'The man is the elderly owner of Mukade Shoe Store, a small store located in Morioh that also does simple tailoring. Yoshikage Kira goes to his shop to repair his jacket.', '/uploads/images/c_247931.png'),
(95, 'Kurasu Daihyou', 'クラス代表', '配角', 'Sanae Kobayashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_247932.png'),
(95, 'Jousuke no Onjin', '仗助の恩人', '配角', '', 'He is a mysterious teenage high school student who helps a young Jousuke Higashikata and his mother Tomoko get to the hospital by pushing their car when it is stuck in a blizzard. Jousuke catches a glimpse of the boy and aspires to become a hero like him. He imitates the boy''s hairstyle and doesn''t forgive anyone who would insult it, as he would feel like they were insulting his hero.', '/uploads/images/c_247936.png'),
(95, 'Joshi Seito', '女子生徒', '配角', 'Ayano Hamaguchi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_331866.jpg'),
(96, 'Katsuki Bakugou', '爆豪勝己', '主角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5''7") __Quirk:__ Explosion Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Katsuki is a crude, arrogant, short-tempered, and aggressive person, especially at the beginning of the series. Due to the constant praise of his abilities and powerful Quirk, Katsuki has developed a superiority complex, and because of that, he desires to be the first and best at everything. He loves to win above all else and cannot stand it when he doesn''t, leading him to lose his already short temper if he achieves anything but a complete victory. Katsuki is not only very athletic and talented at fighting, but also very intelligent and extremely perceptive, capable of strategic planning and improvisation. Additionally, his grades are among the highest of his class. Katsuki also possesses surprising talent in other areas, such as cooking and music, even though he doesn''t show a particular interest in them. Overall, Katsuki is considered a natural-born genius with the potential to be one of the best Pro Heroes. Katsuki''s Quirk "Explosion" allows him to secrete nitroglycerin-like sweat from the palms of his hands and ignite it on command, allowing him to create strong explosions. The more Katsuki sweats, the stronger his explosions become. Not only can Katsuki use the explosions for attacking, he can also use them to propel himself and navigate through the air at high speeds, allowing him to fly at his opponents without giving them time to react, as well as evade incoming attacks, even whi', '/uploads/images/c_88892.png'),
(96, 'Izuku Midoriya', '緑谷出久', '主角', 'Daiki Yamashita', '__Height:__ 166 cm (5''5¼") __Quirk:__ One For All Student in Class 1-A at U.A High School. Although he was born without a Quirk, Izuku''s innate heroism and strong sense of justice manages to catch the attention of the legendary hero [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224). Izuku has since become All Might''s closest pupil. Izuku is a very timid, reserved, and polite boy. Although initially portrayed as insecure, tearful, and vulnerable, Izuku gradually matures into a more confident and braver person. His infectious leadership skills, combined with his passion and strategic abilities, have turned Izuku into a central figure of Class 1-A. He is caring and emotional, never hesitating to help or rescue someone in danger, even if he knows that he might not be strong or otherwise qualified enough to do it. Izuku is extremely (and sometimes scarily) enthusiastic about topics related to heroes. His dream drives him to write down notes about everything he learns about heroes'' Quirks and fighting capabilities. Thanks to this practice, Izuku has developed a great analytical mind and can form complex battle plans in a few seconds, factoring in the best ways he can utilize the Quirks of allies and enemies alike for his own advantage. Izuku''s Quirk "One For All" was transferred to him from All Might. His Quirk allows him to stockpile an enormous amount of raw power, allowing him to significantly enhance all of his physical abilities to various boundless levels. This results in unbel', '/uploads/images/c_89028.png'),
(96, 'Shouto Todoroki', '轟焦凍', '配角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9") __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Half-Cold Half-Hot Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School, where he got in through official recommendations. He is the youngest son of the top hero [Endeavor](https://anilist.co/character/126158). Shouto initially has a cold, aloof personality, which stemmed from his complicated family life. Focused and unemotional, Shouto preferred to keep things to himself instead of hanging out with others. After the events of the U.A. Sports Festival, however, he notably became more sociable and kinder than ever before. He even gained a sense of humor and would occasionally smile, although still retaining some fragments of his previous distant attitude and nonchalant demeanor. While usually quiet and reserved, Shouto initially possessed a moderate level of arrogance, which, combined with his solitary tendencies, sometimes made him take the initiative without considering the opinions of others. Shouto''s Quirk Half-Cold Half-Hot gives him the ability to generate ice from the right side of his body, and flames from his left side. Due to years of rejecting his father, Shouto has developed a habit of favoring ice, even when fire would be a better option. This grudge also caused him to have difficulty controlling his flames. If he overuses one element without utilizing the other, then his own body temperature will suffer.', '/uploads/images/c_89220.png'),
(96, 'Ochako Uraraka', '麗日お茶子', '主角', 'Ayane Sakura', '__Height:__ 156 cm (5''1") __Quirk:__ Zero Gravity Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School Ochako is an outgoing, lively person who thinks about everything positively, though she is objective enough to see flaws and virtues. She gets excited over little things very easily. Ochaco has been described by other students as "the most laidback girl" among her class, being very bubbly and kind of an airhead at times. She is often incredibly blunt without being aware of it. She is on good terms with everyone and is particularly close friends with several class members, including [Izuku](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku), [Tenya Ida](https://anilist.co/character/89222/Iida-Tenya), and [Tsuyu](https://anilist.co/character/89223/Asui-Tsuyu). Ochaco''s Quirk gives her the power to manipulate gravity upon touching solid things with the pads on her fingertips. The targets lose their gravitational pull, effectively making them weightless. She is able to activate or cancel her Quirk''s effects by closing her fingers together, and is shown to be careful with her hands in order to avoid accidental quirk activation.', '/uploads/images/c_89221.png'),
(96, 'Tenya Iida', '飯田天哉', '配角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5''10") __Quirk:__ Engine Class representative of Class 1-A at U.A. High School Tenya may look severe, but he''s actually just a very serious person, who takes everything, even the most insignificant thing, seriously. A testament to his generally hyperactive and intense behavior, Tenya often exhibits plenty of peculiar tics, such as moving his arms around in strange chopping patterns or sometimes twitching his body uncontrollably. Tenya is very humble, willing to admit to his mistakes, apologize for rude behavior, and improve in areas he lacks. Being part of the highly-esteemed Ida Family of Heroes, Tenya is proud of his lineage and works hard to meet his expectations. He greatly admires his older brother, Tensei (also known as the Turbo Hero: Ingenium), and aspires to become a similar hero. Tenya''s Quirk Engine gives him car-like engines in each of his calves, giving him incredible running speed and extreme kicking power. Tenya needs to fuel his engines by drinking orange juice. Tenya''s engines have multiple gears; it is currently unknown how many, but it has been implied that there are more than three.', '/uploads/images/c_89222.png'),
(96, 'Tsuyu Asui', '蛙吹梅雨', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', '__Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Frog Tsuyu is a very straight-forward girl that always says what''s on her mind and what she thinks about others. She prefers to be called by her first name.', '/uploads/images/c_89223.png'),
(96, 'Toshinori Yagi', '八木俊典', '主角', 'Kenta Miyake', '__Height:__ 220 cm (7''2") __Quirk:__ One for All All Might is the No. 1 Hero and the "Symbol of Peace." In his hero form, All Might is a very tall and over-muscular man whose design resembles the american hero comics. His hair spikes on top of his head and his whole body has more shadows than a normal human being. However, in his true form, he is an overly-skinny man who spits a lot of blood out of his mouth and his clothes appear loose.', '/uploads/images/c_89224.jpg'),
(96, 'Shouta Aizawa', '相澤消太', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', '__Height: __183 cm (6'') __Occupation:__ Pro Hero, Teacher __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Erasure Aizawa''s hero name, Eraserhead, was coined by [Present Mic](https://anilist.co/character/127425) when they were younger. Using the binding cloth, Aizawa has a unique fighting style that allows him to immobilize his enemies. He is known to expel students that don''t meet his standards, however it should be noted that he did not expel anyone from Class 1-A. Aizawa is extremely vocal, able to voice his opinions very easily. Although seeming emotionless and reserved, he has a soft spot for his students and genuinely cares for them.', '/uploads/images/c_89225.png'),
(96, 'Tomura Shigaraki', '死柄木弔', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9) __Quirk:__ Decay Leader of the League of Villains and protégé of [All For One](https://anilist.co/character/125956/All-For-One). He was raised by his master, All For One, with the goal of killing [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224/Yagi-Toshinori), and ultimately destroying the society he represents. Tomura is a very twisted, malevolent, and maliciously warped young man, who is considered to be the polar opposite of [Izuku Midoriya](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku). He doesn''t care for his or almost anyone else''s life, having no qualms about performing evil deeds like murdering innocent people. Tomura was initially perceived to be a "man-child": arrogant, selfish, dependent, and demanding, becoming angry if things didn''t go his way and likening reality to some sort of video game. Unlike his mentor, Tomura lacked subtlety, preferring to eliminate problems through force. Much like a child, Tomura seemed unable to cope with his own feelings, instead lashing out and abusing both others or himself, tearing at his own neck when he becomes frustrated. Initially, Tomura seemingly caused destruction just for the sake of it and felt directionless about the League''s path forward after [Stain](https://anilist.co/character/126067/Akaguro-Chizome)''s arrest. It would take a fateful meeting with Izuku in a mall for him to develop an epiphany and become aware of his true convictions: to crumble hero society through All Might''s death. Tomur', '/uploads/images/c_89226.jpg'),
(96, 'Nomu (U.S.J.)', '脳無', '配角', 'Tsuguo Mogami', '__Height:__ 195 cm (6''4¾") __Affiliation:__ League of Villains __Fighting Style:__ Melee Combat __Quirks:__ Shock Absorption; Super Regeneration The U.S.J. Nomu is an Upper-Tier Nomu that appeared with the League of Villains and acted as one of the main antagonists of the U.S.J. Arc.', '/uploads/images/c_89240.jpg'),
(96, 'Momo Yaoyorozu', '八百万百', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") __Quirk:__ Creation Vice class representative of Class 1-A at U.A. High School. She was admitted to the school through official recommendations. Momo is a very prudent, dedicated person who acts as a natural leader. She is generally level-headed and calm in dangerous situations, but she isn''t above falling into a panic. Momo can be blunt with her comments about people''s mistakes and miscalculations, tending to be very direct and wishing to help her peers improve enough to become great heroes. Momo''s Quirk gives her the ability to create any non-living material/object from her exposed skin by transforming the molecular structure of her fat cells. In order to create something, she needs to understand the molecular structure of which the material/object is made.', '/uploads/images/c_89241.png'),
(96, 'Eijirou Kirishima', '切島鋭児郎', '配角', 'Toshiki Masuda', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Quirk:__ Hardening Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Eijiro is a boisterous and outgoing guy with a fondness for manliness, often using the terms "manly" and "unmanly" to describe things and people he does or doesn''t like, respectively. Eijiro is very honest and kind-hearted, having a straightforward way of thinking and following a specific code of chivalry that motivates him to live without regret. He is determined and selfless, bravely putting the safety of others before himself. He is also a big fan of Crimson Riot, a retro hero from whom he takes inspiration, including personal values and his hero name. Although Eijiro may not be as hot-blooded and competitive as [Katsuki Bakugou](https://anilist.co/character/88892), he does not shy away from comparing himself to him, with [Izuku](https://anilist.co/character/89028) stating that the two have managed to develop a relationship between equals. As a result, Eijiro is notably one of the few people that Katsuki holds in higher esteem. Eijiro''s Quirk gives him the power to harden and sharpen any or all parts of his body, causing his flesh to become jagged and rock-like. There is a limit to how much damage his hardened body can withstand, which causes the Hardening itself to slowly dissipate, and Eijiro to lose stamina from struggling to keep his Quirk active.', '/uploads/images/c_89243.jpg'),
(96, 'Minoru Mineta', '峰田実', '配角', 'Ryou Hirohashi', '__Height:__ 108 cm (3'' 6½") __Quirk:__ Pop Off __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Fighting Style:__ Medium Ranged Support Minoru Mineta, also known as the Fresh-Picked Hero: Grape Juice, is a student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School, training to become a Pro Hero.', '/uploads/images/c_89244.png'),
(96, 'Mina Ashido', '芦戸三奈', '配角', 'Eri Kitamura', '__Height:__ 159 cm (5''3") __Quirk:__ Acid Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Mina is a cheerful and easygoing girl who usually displays a smile. Highly social and excitable, she loves to hang out with her friends and is shown to become very upset when denied an opportunity to be at a gathering. She possesses a strong fashion sense and likes to go shopping. Due to her athleticism and energy, Mina enjoys and is very skilled at dancing. Mina is extremely courageous and is viewed as an ideal personality for hero work. Mina''s Quirk Acid allows her to produce a corrosive liquid from her body. She can control the solubility and viscosity of this corrosive liquid. There is a limit to how long she can produce the corrosive liquid until her skin gradually loses its natural resistance to it. Overusing her Quirk or pushing it too far can also be fatal, as it dehydrates her body very fast. Mina can use her acid offensively, but has shown utility with it as well, such as melting handholds for herself to climb with. She is also known to secrete a non-corrosive version of the acid from her feet in order to slide around.', '/uploads/images/c_89247.png'),
(96, 'Denki Kaminari', '上鳴電気', '配角', 'Tasuku Hatanaka', '__Height:__ 168 cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Electrification Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Denki is a friendly, social, and energetic boy who enjoys hanging out with others. He is rather casual when interacting with other people, including the generally unfriendly [Katsuki Bakugou](https://anilist.co/character/88892/Bakugou-Katsuki). Denki''s Quirk Electrification allows him to store and discharge electricity. While he can also discharge this energy over a distance, Denki has little to no control over it, meaning it will go everywhere indiscriminately. Denki is also able to absorb and neutralize electricity and other lightning-based Quirks. Whenever Denki exceeds his wattage limit, he loses his ability to discharge energy, with his entire personality changing into that of a giggling idiot for a certain period until he reverts to normal. In this state, he is always giving thumbs-ups as a way to let others know that he is okay.', '/uploads/images/c_89249.png'),
(96, 'Hanta Sero', '瀬呂範太', '配角', 'Kiyotaka Furushima', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5'' 9¾") __Quirk:__ Tape Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Hanta is amicable and has proven to be one of the more sociable members of Class 1-A. He can sometimes be loud and showy, often trying to impress his peers with his Quirk. He is often the only person to call his classmates out when they act crazy. He is pretty humorous and usually makes jokes with his classmates. However, when push comes to shove, Hanta is a brave hero-in-training who wishes to prosper on his own while helping others do the same. Hanta''s Quirk is that he has tape dispenser-like organs in his elbows, from which he can shoot long cellophane tape-like strips; he can also retract them. They appear to be somewhat sturdier than regular tape. Overuse of his Quirk will cause his skin to dry out. He can use his tape to wrap people, swing long distances, and create traps, among other applications.', '/uploads/images/c_89895.png'),
(96, 'Mashirao Ojiro', '尾白猿夫', '配角', 'Kousuke Miyoshi', '__Height:__ 169 cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Tail Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Mashirao has a very calm and noble attitude and a profound sense of dignity, which prevents him from accepting results he doesn''t feel he earned with his own abilities. He is also described as a hard worker. Along with a strong sense of dignity, Mashirao can be described as sheepish and bashful, not very often enjoying the spotlight and being easily embarrassed. A recurring joke is that others view Mashirao as "plain," which profoundly upsets him. Mashirao''s Quirk is that he has a long, powerful, sturdy tail. His tail effectively functions as a third arm that he can use to grab things. Furthermore, it''s attack power is strong enough to break objects made of metal, he can wrap it around enemies, and it can support Mashirao''s body weight. Mashirao is incredibly adept at using his tail, combining it with his knowledge of martial arts to engage enemies in close-range combat, performing fast and acrobatic moves. His tail can also increase his speed and mobility by whipping it down against the ground to use it like a springboard. (Source: My Hero Academia Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_89896.png'),
(96, 'Kyouka Jirou', '耳郎響香', '配角', 'Kei Shindou', '__Height:__ 154 cm (5''1") __Quirk:__ Earphone Jack __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Fighting Style:__ Medium Ranged + Support Combat Kyoka is a petite, fair-skinned girl with a slender build. She has triangular, lazy-looking onyx eyes with notably long lower eyelashes, and rather small eyebrows. Kyoka has a pragmatic, unenthusiastic and teasing personality that is mostly shown to those she finds irritating. Kyoka is not always like this though, as she does enjoy socializing with others, in which case she is usually nice and friendly. Kyoka''s Quirk (Earphone Jack) allows her to plug the jacks that hang from her earlobes into all sorts of things and channel the sound of her heartbeat into them; causing havoc inside the plugged objects. It''s also used to catch sounds and vibrations from her surroundings.', '/uploads/images/c_89897.png'),
(96, 'Fumikage Tokoyami', '常闇踏陰', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', '__Height:__ 158 cm __Quirk:__ Dark Shadow Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Fumikage is reserved, serious, and focused, albeit noble and valiant. Though not talkative, Fumikage will directly ignore questions or requests that seem in some way pointless. During combat, Fumikage is known to be fierce and dependable, with his strength and capabilities rarely being questioned. Fumikage is fond of darkness and other related concepts, considering himself a "creature of the dark" and employing archaic-sounding speeches that paint him slightly creepy or dramatic. Fumikage''s Quirk "Dark Shadow" allows him to manifest a sentient shadow monster from his body that he can materialize and contract freely. Dark Shadow''s energy is limited and can be drained by bright light. Dark Shadow retracts into Fumikage''s body when it runs out of energy. The shadow entity''s personality, strength, defense, and control depend on the lack of light. In bright light, Dark Shadow is weaker and smaller but still has considerable strength and defense and is easier to control, but in total darkness, Dark Shadow''s size and parameters are drastically enhanced. It is powerful enough to rip out and cut down multiple full-grown trees easily. However, Dark Shadow is more difficult to control in the dark, causing it to rampage based on its own free will.', '/uploads/images/c_89898.png'),
(96, 'Mezou Shouji', '障子目蔵', '配角', 'Masakazu Nishida', '__Height:__ 187 cm (6''2") __Quirk:__ Dupli-Arms Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Shouji is friendly and gentle, and he will work nicely with anyone. He is not the type to hold grudges, showing no ill will towards those that harm him unwillingly. Shouji is entirely selfless and willing to risk his life for anyone. He can be empathetic and understanding, but still shows a sense of maturity and responsibility that prevents him from acting under emotional impulses. He is very protective of his classmates, especially if they are hurt or injured. He is also quite thick-skinned, as he said he is used to being feared due to his appearance. Shouji''s Quirk grants him a set of tentacles alongside his arms. He can transform the tips of these tentacles to replicate other parts of his body (ex: mouth, ears, eyes). The duplicated body parts are more efficient than the originals; as a result, Mezo is able to hear better, see-through more angles at a time, and they grant him much higher degrees of strength. He uses these arms to talk most of the time through duplicate mouths, rather than his actual mouth.', '/uploads/images/c_89899.png'),
(96, 'Tooru Hagakure', '葉隠透', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', '__Height:__ 152 cm (5''0") __Quirk:__ Invisibility Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Tooru is a bubbly, cheery, and easygoing girl who does most things with an upbeat attitude. She is very socially eager and likes shopping, and her room suggests that she likes plushies and other cute things. Tooru''s Quirk is that her body is completely invisible. In addition to the stealth capabilities granted to her by her invisible body, Tooru can refract light that passes through her, allowing her to intensify the light into a blinding flash. She has further refined this application of her Quirk, achieving the ability to manipulate and redirect light-based attacks, such as [Yuuga Aoyama](https://anilist.co/character/127042/Aoyama-Yuuga)''s Navel Laser.', '/uploads/images/c_89900.png'),
(96, 'Kouji Kouda', '口田甲司', '配角', 'Takuma Nagatsuka', '__Height:__ 186 cm (6''1") __Quirk:__ Anivoice Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Contrary to his strong and powerful appearance, Kouji is very timid and quiet. He rarely speaks and prefers using sign language to communicate with his classmates. He hates violence due to his kind-hearted nature. Kouji appears to greatly enjoy the company of animals, as his Quirk allows him to interact with animals in ways others cannot. He owns a small rabbit as a pet. Kouji''s Quirk "Anivoice (生き物ボイス, Ikimono Voice)" gives him the ability to command any creature in the animal kingdom by speaking to them. Whatever command he gives, the animal will carry it out. However, he cannot exert control if they cannot hear his command. The target must also be a real animal and not merely animal-like. Kouji can also exchange information with the animals to find the locations of various people and potential enemies faster. Kouji has been shown to use the Quirk effectively with flocks of birds to create a smokescreen of animals and to attack an opponent, along with his use of insects to distract and attack his opponents. He has now also overcome his fear of bugs, so he often uses bugs to swarm opponents with numbers.', '/uploads/images/c_89901.png'),
(96, 'Rikidou Satou', '砂藤力道', '配角', 'Tooru Nara', '__Height:__ 185 cm (6''1") __Quirk:__ Sugar Rush Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Rikidou is interested in sweets and baking, a valuable skill due to his Quirk. He is surprisingly talented at making sweets. Rikidou''s Quirk Sugar Rush allows him to increase his strength five-fold for three minutes. To activate his Quirk, he needs to consume 10 grams of sugar. When converting sugar into strength, his cognitive functions gradually drop, making him sleepy afterward. For every additional 10 grams of sugar he ingests, he extends the time of increased strength by another three minutes.', '/uploads/images/c_89902.png'),
(96, 'Yuu Takeyama', '岳山優', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', '__Height:__ 162 cm (5''4") (Normal form); 2062cm (67''8") (Transformed) __Quirk:__ Gigantification __Occupation:__ Pro Hero Pro Hero. Her Quirk allows her to grow to a gigantic size. She cannot variate between her base-height and the gigantified height achieved via her Quirk, making her only able to be either her normal height of 162cm (5 feet 4 inches) or her enlarged height of 2,062cm (67 feet 8 inches) tall.', '/uploads/images/c_121529.png'),
(96, 'All For One', 'オール・フォー・ワン', '配角', 'Akio Ootsuka', '__Quirk:__ All For One __Occupation:__ Villain __Fighting Style:__ Close Range and Long Range All For One is the true leader and benefactor of the League of Villains. Once Japan''s most powerful villain and All Might''s arch-nemesis, his true motives are unclear and his true identity unknown. His current goal is to raise Shigaraki to become his eventual successor.', '/uploads/images/c_125956.jpg'),
(96, 'Yuuga Aoyama', '青山優雅', '配角', 'Kousuke Kuwano', '**Height:** 168 cm (5''6") **Quirk:** Navel Lazer Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Yuuga appears to be vain and prideful, thinking of himself as superior to the rest of his classmates, especially regarding his Quirk. He exhibits flamboyant mannerisms, is fond of posing, and likes to grab the attention of those around him despite frequently getting ignored by his peers. He also plays up his French heritage, occasionally implementing French words into his sentences. Yuuga''s Quirk allows him to shoot a powerful sparkling laser cannon from his navel. It is so powerful, it can blast through two meters of solid concrete. If he fires the laser for more than 1 second at a time, he will suffer intestinal distress.', '/uploads/images/c_127042.png'),
(96, 'Hizashi Yamada', '山田ひざし', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', '__Height:__ 185cm (6''1") __Quirk:__ Voice Pro Hero. He also works as an English teacher at U.A. High School and as a radio talk show host. Yamada maintains the eccentric persona of a radio host. He often poses when he talks and maintains a certain level of excitement or volume, regardless of the situation. Though he tends to be a jovial individual, Hizashi is capable of great rage when it comes to his friends and colleagues. Yamada''s Quirk "Voice" allows him to increase the volume of his voice, giving him an ability that is similar to a sonic scream. The sound from his Quirk is strong enough to cause people''s ears to bleed from far away. The only known weakness of this Quirk is that the loud sounds do not travel well underground, making this Quirk ineffective against anything that is underground or separated from him by layers of earth.', '/uploads/images/c_127425.png'),
(96, 'Nemuri Kayama', '香山睡', '配角', 'Akeno Watanabe', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") __Quirk:__ Somnambulist Pro Hero. She also works as a Modern Hero Art History teacher at U.A. High School. Nemuri is a very playful and flirtatious person with an unpredictably serious and temperamental side to her. She gets angry whenever someone interrupts her or insults her. She is especially sensitive about her age. Despite her flirtatious personality, Nemuri was intelligent, perceptive, and articulate. While she comes off as a hero who enjoys her fame derived from her beauty and sex appeal, Nemuri has demonstrated true heroism and bravery, willing to fight on the front lines and put her life at risk for others. Nemuri''s Quirk "Somnambulist" allows her to put nearby people to sleep by exuding a sleep-inducing aroma from her body. Her Quirk works better on males than females.', '/uploads/images/c_127427.png'),
(96, 'Shinji Nishiya', '西屋森児', '配角', 'Masamichi Kitada', '__Height:__ 168 cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Arbor Pro Hero. Underneath his helmet, he has puffy red leaf-like hair, though his face has remained unseen since he has only been shown while wearing his mask. Shinji is a very serious and focused person when it comes to being a hero in his hero duties; however, he easily feels down when someone takes his glory or credit. Shinji''s Quirk "Arbor" (樹木, Jumoku) allows him to enlarge and control his wooden body parts into strong tree branches. These branches are excellent for binding.', '/uploads/images/c_129758.png'),
(96, 'Naomasa Tsukauchi', '塚内直正', '配角', 'Tokuyoshi Kawashima', 'Naomasa Tsukauchi is a police detective in the Police Force. Naomasa is a tall man with short black hair and black eyes. As a member of the police force, he is normally seen in his uniform. He wears a signature tan overcoat and a matching hat. He also sports a black suit underneath with matching slacks and dress shoes. Detective Tsukauchi is an earnest, hardworking individual who has earned the right to be a close friend of All Might. Enough so, that he was even entrusted with the truth about One For All and the latter''s true form. He appears to have a close relationship with All Might, as he even leaked sensitive information to the hero just because he felt it was the right thing to do.', '/uploads/images/c_129762.png'),
(96, 'Inko Midoriya', '绿谷引子', '配角', 'Aya Kawakami', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3'''') Izuku Midoriya''s mother. Her quirk allows her to pull small objects towards her.', '/uploads/images/c_136897.png'),
(96, 'Kurogiri', '黒霧', '配角', 'Takahiro Fujiwara', '__Affiliation:__ League of Villains __Quirk:__ Warp Gate Kurogiri has a level-headed personality, which often serves to ground Tomura Shigaraki''s immaturity. He is intensely loyal to both All For One and Tomura. He is very polite and well-spoken, even to enemies. ~! Kurogiri is actually an intelligent Nomu made from the corpse of Eraserhead and President Mics high school friend Oboro Shirakumo made to serve Tomura Shigaraki. Although he remains unaware of his previous identity after Eraserheads efforts to talk to him it’s shown that a small part of Oboro is still in Kurogiri!~', '/uploads/images/c_137506.jpg'),
(96, 'Nezu', '根津', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Takato', '__Height:__ 85 cm __Quirk:__ High Spec Nezu, also known as Mr. Principal is a Pro Hero and the principal of U.A. High School. He is an extremely rare case of an animal who manifested a Quirk. He can be very long-winded at times when explaining or educating.', '/uploads/images/c_143539.png'),
(96, 'Thirteen', 'スペースヒーロ・13号 ', '配角', 'Inuko Inuyama', 'Thirteen is a wise, well-mannered person. As a rescue hero, Thirteen has displayed how passionate they are about saving people through their teachings. They even developed their own training facility - the Unforeseen Simulation Joint - to train future heroes in search and rescue tactics. They are very passionate about Quirks, specifically on the topic of using Quirks for creation and assistance rather than for destruction and battle. Thirteen has also been shown to be very brave. Despite not being a combat type, they do not hesitate to use their Quirk to fight against villains in the name of protecting others', '/uploads/images/c_143542.png'),
(96, 'Daruma Ujiko', '氏子達磨', '配角', 'Minoru Inaba', 'Daruma Ujiko is the pseudonym of a villain affiliated with the League of Villains, later the Paranormal Liberation Front. He is a faithful servant of All For One and later Tomura Shigaraki as well.', '/uploads/images/c_148747.jpg'),
(96, 'Ryou Inui', '犬井猟', '配角', '', 'Ryo Inui is a Pro Hero and serves as the Lifestyle Guidance Counselor at U.A. High School.', '/uploads/images/c_149178.png'),
(96, 'Desutegoro', 'デステゴロ', '配角', 'Shinnosuke Ogami ', 'Death Arms is a Pro Hero. He took part in the fight against the Sludge Villain, and later witnessed the U.A. Sports Festival from outside the arena, along with Mt. Lady and Kamui Woods.', '/uploads/images/c_149187.png'),
(96, 'Ken Ishiyama', '石山堅', '配角', 'Kenta Ookuma', 'Cementoss is a Pro Hero as well as a teacher at U.A. High School. During the U.A. Sports Festival, he acted as the proctor for the 1-on-1 fights in case things got out of hand. He also faced off against Eijiro Kirishima and Rikido Sato in their Final Exam.', '/uploads/images/c_149188.jpg'),
(96, 'Ectoplasm', 'エクトプラズム', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 180 cm (5'' 11") __Affiliation:__ Yuuei __Quirk:__ Clones Ectoplasm has the ability to produce ectoplasm from his mouth and transform it into clones of himself. He can create up to thirty clones at once, and push his limit to thirty-six if he''s feeling good. He can also produce a giant clone of himself, although this sacrifices his ability to produce normal-sized ones for the time being. His clones can be defeated with a strong blow, but otherwise, only Ectoplasm can dispel them.', '/uploads/images/c_150853.jpg'),
(96, 'Chiyo  Shuuzenji', '修善寺治与', '配角', 'Etsuko Kozakura', '__Quirk:__ Heal __Occupation:__ Pro Hero, Nurse Chiyo has a very kind and compassionate personality, where she treats everyone kindly, though she does have a strict and reproaching attitude towards those that have done something foolish. She''s mostly like this with All Might for not teaching Izuku how to use his Quirk properly or with Izuku for using his Quirk recklessly.', '/uploads/images/c_157655.jpg'),
(96, 'Lunch Rush', 'ランチラッシュ', '配角', 'Keisuke Ueda', 'Lunch Rush is a Pro Hero and the Chef at the cafeteria of U.A. High School. He is known for his good cooking.', '/uploads/images/c_191595.png'),
(96, 'Snipe', 'スナイプ', '配角', 'Tooru Nara', '__Quirk:__ Homing Snipe is a Pro Hero and a member of the teaching staff at U.A. High School. Snipe has the appearance of a stereotypical western cowboy Snipe''s Quirk allows him to lock on to any target he can see within six hundred meters and make any projectile he releases chase after said target', '/uploads/images/c_191596.jpg'),
(96, 'Higari Maijima', '埋島干狩', '配角', 'You Kitazawa', 'Higari Maijima, also known as the Excavation Hero: Power Loader, is a Pro Hero and faculty member at U.A. High School.', '/uploads/images/c_191597.png'),
(96, 'Sekijiro Kan', '管赤慈郎', '配角', 'Shuuhei Matsuda', 'Sekijiro Kan, also known by his hero name, Blood Hero: Vlad King, is a Pro Hero and the homeroom teacher of U.A. High School''s Class 1-B.', '/uploads/images/c_191598.jpg'),
(96, 'Sludge Villain', 'ヘドロ・ヴィラン', '配角', 'Shinya Fukumatsu', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_241581.jpg'),
(96, 'Sansa Tamakawa', '玉川三茶', '配角', '', 'Sansa is a member in the Police Force.', '/uploads/images/c_241582.jpg'),
(96, 'Backdraft', 'バックドラフト', '配角', 'Shuuhei Matsuda', 'Backdraft is a pro hero. His quirk, Hydrokinesis, allows him to create and manipulate water through spigots that he has in place of hands. He is affiliated with Musutafu Fire Department', '/uploads/images/c_283096.png'),
(96, 'Josei Kisha', '女性記者', '配角', 'Yuu Shimamura', 'Television news reporter.', '/uploads/images/c_345848.png'),
(97, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Akio Ootsuka', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(97, 'Puri-Puri Prisoner', 'ぷりぷりプリズナー', '配角', '', '__Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ S-Class; Rank 17 Puri-Puri Prisoner is a flamboyant, openly homosexual superhero. He takes an interest in other, up-and-coming heroes and criminals; an interest which led to his titular jail sentence, as he kept attacking them. Criminals that he apprehends are then added to his harem.', '/uploads/images/c_86029.png'),
(97, 'Arataka Reigen', '霊幻新隆', '主角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5''10.5") [Mob''s](https://anilist.co/character/89616) mentor and boss in the Mob Psycho 100 series. He owns a business exorcising ghosts and is a self-proclaimed psychic. He is Mob''s moral compass. He was the first person to ever consider Mob as normal and his teachings have never failed Mob.', '/uploads/images/c_89334.png'),
(97, 'Shigeo Kageyama', '影山茂夫', '主角', 'Setsuo Itou', '**Height:** 157 cm He is the assistant and disciple of [Arataka Reigen](https://anilist.co/character/89334/Reigen-Arataka). He is also the newest member of the Body Improvement Club. Shigeo is a quiet and polite individual who tries to live a normal life despite having strong telepathic power, he wants to be seen as a good human among the people in his social life. This often makes him naive and gullible when those with malicious intent want to use him for a laugh or to cause trouble but Shigeo has very strong beliefs to never use his powers to hurt another person because of an altercation he faced once as a child.', '/uploads/images/c_89616.png'),
(97, 'Ekubo', 'エクボ', '主角', 'Akio Ootsuka', 'Ekubo is a self-proclaimed upper-class evil spirit who has aligned himself with [Mob](https://anilist.co/character/89616) after being defeated by him. Ekubo wants to be a god. Specifically, he wants to be worshipped by all humanity. ~!Despite having that kind of ego, he didn''t hesitate to put himself at Mob''s mercy in the hopes of using the boy to his advantage. At first, he wanted to steal Mob''s body and use it to become a god, but he eventually decided to try to make Mob a god instead.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89617.png'),
(97, 'Ritsu Kageyama', '影山律', '主角', 'Miyu Irino', '__Height:__ 159.4 cm Ritsu is very clever and apparently serious, he also serves on the student council and excels in academics and everything else he tries. None of that matters to him as much as psychic power, however, his brother is more important to him than anyone or anything else. ~!Before he awoke his own psychic powers, he longed for the esper abilities his brother has always had and was frustrated by his own inability to do things like bend spoons. He may have a habit of carrying spoons around with him, for bending purposes. He is a perfectionist with a not-so-hidden dark side. Unlike [Mob](https://anilist.co/character/89616/Kageyama-Shigeo), he finds it okay to use psychic violence against people when necessary.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89618.png'),
(97, 'Tenga Onigawara', '鬼瓦天牙', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', 'Tenga Onigawara is the leader of Salt Middle School and an unofficial member of the Body Improvement Club.', '/uploads/images/c_89619.png'),
(97, 'Tome Kurata', '暗田トメ', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', '__School:__ Salt Middle School __School club:__ Telepathy Club (President) Tome seems to be a slacker but is passionate about the possibility of using telepathy to contact extraterrestrials. However, when the Telepathy Club''s research into the matter bears no results, she quickly gives up. When she learns that [Mob](https://anilist.co/character/89616/Kageyama-Shigeo) is an Esper, her passion is revitalized.', '/uploads/images/c_89620.png'),
(97, 'Teruki Hanazawa', '花沢輝気', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', '__Height:__ 161.4 cm Hanazawa Teruki is an esper who was first introduced as an antagonist, but later became [Mob](https://anilist.co/character/89616/Kageyama-Shigeo)''s friend after being defeated by him. He was the shadow leader (urabanchou) of Black Vinegar Middle School, using his psychic powers to rule over the delinquents at his own school, as well as to defeat those from other schools. Teruki is a talented, quick-thinking, and hardworking esper. In terms of raw power, he is nowhere near Mob''s level, but he compensates for this by putting in effort and training diligently. He is able to analyze other espers'' techniques and their weaknesses in a short amount of time, and often incorporates said techniques in his own fights. He is constantly training to improve himself, and is remarked by various espers as possessing a keen and powerful set of skills.', '/uploads/images/c_89621.png'),
(97, 'Ichi Mezato', '米里イチ', '配角', 'Ayumi Fujimura', 'Ichi Mezato is a school girl who goes to Salt Middle School and is part of the News Club. She is in class 2-1.', '/uploads/images/c_89622.jpg'),
(97, 'Tsubomi Takane', '高嶺ツボミ', '配角', 'Uki Satake', 'She is a middle schooler at Salt Middle School. Mob harbors a large crush on her. ~!Most of what we know about Tsubomi''s personality in the manga is from what Mob and other characters say about her. However, in the anime adaptation, there are extra scenes of Tsubomi that add to her character and personality and make her a more compassionate individual.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89623.jpg'),
(97, 'Shou Suzuki', '鈴木将', '配角', 'Sachi Kokuryuu', '~!Sho Suzuki is the son of the leader of Claw. He led a direct resistance against his father''s world domination plan.!~', '/uploads/images/c_130683.jpg'),
(97, 'Musashi Gouda', 'ムサシ', '配角', 'Toshihiko Seki', 'Musashi Goda is a student of Salt Middle School and the Body Improvement Club''s President. Musashi has a strong sense of justice but strongly disagrees with senseless violence', '/uploads/images/c_132972.jpg'),
(97, 'Tsuyoshi Edano', '枝野剛', '配角', 'Yuu Hayashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_133189.jpg'),
(97, 'Gou Asahi', '朝日豪', '配角', 'Yuusuke Kuwahata', 'Gou is an esper and one of the children who was invited to the Awakening Lab.', '/uploads/images/c_133190.jpg'),
(97, 'Rei Kurosaki', '黒崎麗', '配角', 'Sanae Fuku', 'Rei is an esper and one of the children who was invited to the Awakening Lab', '/uploads/images/c_133191.jpg'),
