(97, 'Toichirou Suzuki', '鈴木統一郎', '配角', 'Kazuhiko Inoue', 'Toichiro is an extremely powerful esper and the founder and leader of Claw.', '/uploads/images/c_133204.jpg'),
(97, 'Kaito Shiratori', '白鳥海斗', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Kagura', 'Kaito is an esper, the twin brother of [Daichi Shiratori](https://anilist.co/character/133206/Shiratori-Daichi), and one of the children who was invited to the Awakening Lab.', '/uploads/images/c_133205.jpg'),
(97, 'Daichi Shiratori', '白鳥大地', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Kagura', 'Daichi is an esper, the twin brother of [Kaito Shiratori](https://anilist.co/character/133205/Shiratori-Kaito), and one of the children who was invited to the Awakening Lab.', '/uploads/images/c_133206.jpg'),
(97, 'Souchou', '総長', '配角', 'Keiji Fujiwara', 'Shouchou was a spirit who appeared early on in the anime adaptation. He was the leader of a biker gang. They all died while riding through Honeido Tunnel when the rider at the front slipped on a banana peel and caused an explosive pile-up', '/uploads/images/c_133207.png'),
(97, 'Terada', '寺蛇', '配角', 'Fumihiko Tachiki', 'Terada is an esper and a former member of Claw. He was part of the upper echelon called "Scar".', '/uploads/images/c_133208.png'),
