(97, 'Gozu', '五頭', '配角', '', 'Gozu is the gang leader of the Mayo Middle School. He attempts to fight Koyama, but is defeated.', '/uploads/images/c_216566.jpg'),
(97, 'Bandai', '磐梯', '配角', 'Seiichirou Yamashita', 'Bandai is the gang leader of the Soy Sauce Middle School.', '/uploads/images/c_216567.jpg'),
(97, 'Joutenin', '女店員', '配角', 'Rina Satou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_216573.jpg'),
(97, 'Otoko Tenin', '男店員', '配角', 'Wataru Takagi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_216574.jpg'),
(98, 'Souma Yukihira', '幸平創真', '主角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', '__Height:__ 171 cm He is the son of [Jouichirou Yukihira](https://anilist.co/character/77495) and, until it closed, worked at his father''s restaurant, Restaurant Yukihira. Souma fight his odds in the elite school to becoming the best chef in the world even with strong background discrimination of his academy. He is currently a student at Tootsuki Culinary Academy and a resident of Polar Star Dormitory. Souma is a rather energetic child who has the constant drive to move forward with his cooking, mostly due to his rivalry with his father. Due to his drive to move forward Souma is willing to try odd things with food including "Grilled Squid Tentacles Dressed in Peanut Butter," though these dishes usually don''t go over too well. It is because the will of Soma to try to move forward, his dish often considered as creative and innovative by some peers and lecturers; lead his rivalry with all the students in the Tootsuki Culinary Academy even rough. Through all this Souma maintains a laid back attitude towards just about everything but cooking. Souma can cook many different foods in many different styles, though he prefers what he calls "Yukihira Style," which is the cooking style which he learned from his father. Souma shows an immense capability for cooking and a special adaption with learning from his mistakes and improvising through learning from said mistakes. It is due to his creativity and also resourcefulness, Souma is able to create the same dish with different ways of cook', '/uploads/images/c_75216.jpg'),
(98, 'Erina Nakiri', '薙切えりな', '主角', 'Risa Taneda', '__Height:__ 162 cm One of the two main heroines in the manga, Erina is initially the primary antagonist of [Souma Yukihira](https://anilist.co/character/75216), until this develops into more of a friendship. Erina is the only daughter of [Azami Nakiri](https://anilist.co/character/156421) and an unnamed mother who is [Senzaemon](https://anilist.co/character/76028)''s biological daughter. Erina often detests whoever is considered "common" due to her regal pedigree and status within the Toutsuki organization. Her "God Tongue" can accurately describe the taste and composition of any food, and she gives harsh critiques to chefs and students alike. However, there have been rare occasions where she gives credit to chefs with skill. She had been promoted as the Elite Ten''s 10th seat as a middle-schooler.', '/uploads/images/c_75284.png'),
(98, 'Megumi Tadokoro', '田所恵', '主角', 'Minami Takahashi', '__Height:__ 154 cm __Cuisine Style:__ Hospitality Megumi is from a cold harbor town in the Tōhoku region and enrolled into Tōtosuki''s junior high program hoping to be able to help her family''s bed-and-breakfast the Shokei''en Inn. Because of her stage fright and shyness she performs poorly and causes her to rank at the bottom of her class. Megumi is clumsy and timid, thoughtful, kind and honest girl with polite manners. She is always looking out for others and is willing to assist them in any way she can. According to Gin Dōjima, Megumi''s greatest gift is her warm hospitality as she cooks. She highly idolizes her mother. Although Megumi is a capable chef, she does not fare well under pressure because she has stage fright. Because she is intimidated very easily, she makes simple mistakes when she cooks, causing many of her classmates to see her as a weak student. She is quick to panic when something goes awry and tends to over think situations when under pressure or stress, such as repeatedly packing and unpacking a suitcase to make sure she packed something, even though she did not need to pack a suitcase in the first place. ~!Megumi eventually even becomes the 10th seat of the Elite Ten Council of the Tōtsuki Culinary Academy after the Promotion Exams Arc.!~', '/uploads/images/c_76026.png'),
(98, 'Senzaemon Nakiri', '薙切仙左衛門', '配角', 'Banjou Ginga', 'Senzaemon is headmaster of Tōtsuki Academy and [Erina](https://anilist.co/character/75284)''s grandfather. Known as the "Gastric Godfather", he has the tendency of stripping his upper body when he eats a good dish. Despite his appearance and reputation, he is reasonable and gives accurate commentary and assessment for the food he tastes without being overly critical to the losers. ~!Many years previously, Senzaemon and Gin noticed Jōichirō Saiba''s critical condition at the start of a tournament, and took upon themselves some of the blame for pressuring Jōichirō into becoming mentally trapped in the creation of his dishes. Feeling Jōichirō''s talent was beyond the tasks of the academy, Senzaemon freed his former student to travel abroad and learn independently, a proposal Jōichirō happily accepted, as well as Gin whom Senzaemon offered him as the head of resort planner as a mean to atone their sins to ensure no one will share a similar fate as what happened to Joichiro before. For a period thereafter, Senzaemon hired Jōichirō as his private chef.!~ ~!Six years ago, Senzaemon exiled his son-in-law, Azami, for abusing Erina with brainwashing, and turns out even worst and dangerous to rule the academy than Joichiro''s previous ill-fate. Senzaemon became Erina''s legal guardian and had Azami''s name struck from the Tōtsuki records. However, in the year Erina enrolls in the academy, Azami returns and a majority of the Elite Ten vote to support Azami as headmaster, replacing Senzaemon. I', '/uploads/images/c_76028.png'),
(98, 'Fumio Daimidou', '大御堂ふみ緒', '配角', 'Mari Yokoo', 'She is the warden and guardian of Polar Star Dormitory.', '/uploads/images/c_77489.jpg'),
(98, 'Roland Chapelle', 'ローランド・シャペル', '配角', 'Yuu Mizushima', 'Roland Chapelle (Rōran Shaperu) is one of the stern lecturer in the Totsuki Culinary Academy, who was infamous for his extreme discipline. Earned the nickname as the Chef Who Never Smiles, Chapelle takes student''s performance and presentation in a serious matter which every presentations counts as if it is their conduct in their future careers, not just in French cuisine but also others involves cookery. Whoever failed to reach his eligible standard shall faced his worst judgment upon them, making this veteran lecturer a judge, jury and even executioner in this prestige academy. He always has been this strict until Yukihira Soma, the Yukihira transfer student''s resourceful and innovative cooking that made him smile for the first time with the impression Soma''s version of Boeuf Bourguignon; making Soma is the first (and the only) rookie chef intrigued by this iron heart veteran. As the professional lecturer with French Cuisine is part of his forte and pride, Chapelle is very serious upon his native dish and he is not tolerate any fools (student or anyone alike) making fun of it. It is also believed that rigid discipline meant 100% success, Chapelle has a concept that any student whom didn''t pass with the flying colors are considered people who failed to prove their worth. With his grumpy and no-nonsense attitude combined, Chapelle''s strict discipline is so extreme that every students feared him as his judgement meant absolute end should the requirement didn''t meet his expectat', '/uploads/images/c_77491.png'),
(98, 'Jouichirou Yukihira', '幸平城一郎', '配角', 'Rikiya Koyama', 'The father of Sōma Yukihira, and owner of the diner Yukihira in the Sumire Shopping District. His passion for cooking knows no bounds and his skill is world-class. As the sole parental-figure and family member in Sōma''s life, he is a mentor, teacher, and rival to his son. Like Sōma, Jōichirō is laid-back but professional and has a serious side that emerges when he is cooking. The two share the same habit of creating horrible experimental dishes. Jōichirō is supportive of his son but does occasionally like to see Sōma stressed and frustrated by challenging him to many cook-offs – always ending in Jōichirō''s victory – to show him how much he has to grow. He left home to work abroad and sent his son to Tōtsuki Academy, telling Sōma that he needs to succeed in Tōtsuki if he ever wants to surpass him.', '/uploads/images/c_77495.png'),
(98, 'Satoshi Isshiki', '一色慧', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', 'He is a student at Totsuki Culinary Academy, a resident of Polar Star Dormitory and the current 7th seat of the Elite Ten Council. Aside from that, Satoshi''s position as one of the Elite 10 also promote a strong determination for his kouhai(junior),Yukihira Soma to drive his dream to become one of the 10 seat and could be a potential challenge for Soma due to his natural cooking abilities.', '/uploads/images/c_78475.png'),
(98, 'Ikumi Mito', '水戸郁魅', '配角', 'Shizuka Ishigami', 'She is one of the student of Tootsuki Culinary Academy whom is also a former rival to Yukihira Soma. As the sole successor of the meat culinary expert of the Mito family for abundance knowledge about the meat culinary (especially beef and donburi), Ikumi is responsible to hold the pride of her family''s name and like any other students in Tootsuki Culinary Academy, Ikumi is extremely prejudice upon the society classes and use high class ingredient to make a high standard dish. It is said that Ikumi''s rigid family rules and regulations had made her cooking skill more elegant and grace like playing piano. Using all graces of cooking by using the high grade materials as well as expensive, Ikumi can almost made the dish as elegant as it look to impressed her clients.', '/uploads/images/c_78935.png'),
(98, 'Ryouko Sakaki', '榊涼子', '配角', 'Ai Kayano', 'Ryouko is gentle and kind, responding to the eccentrics of the other Polar Star residents in a level-headed manner and comforting the other students when they are troubled. Ryōko''s specialty is fermented foods due to her parents owning a well-known fermented-goods shop, and she maintains a workshop near the dorms to produce her own ingredients. She also keeps a bottle of "fermented rice drink" that she would sometimes bring out during parties and celebrations, which [Souma](https://anilist.co/character/75216/Yukihira-Souma) suspects is illegally brewed sake. ~!During the Autumn Elections, she presented a "curry soy-natto rice" using charcoal-fermented natto and homemade rice-sauce fermented with koji. The dish garnered praise from the judges, who suddenly felt as if they were in a festival due to the quintessentially Japanese and festive taste of the dish. She ultimately took 7th place in her block.!~', '/uploads/images/c_85727.png'),
(98, 'Yuuki Yoshino', '吉野悠姫', '配角', 'Maaya Uchida', 'She is a student at Tōtsuki Culinary Academy and a resident of Polar Star Dormitory. She and the other resident students from his hostel befriended with their fellow roommate Yukihira Soma and also aware to Soma''s talent as one of the finest and unique of all. She is also a roommate and friend to her fellow student, Tadokoro Megumi and Sakaki Ryoko. Yuki is more focus on animal meat as her main cuisine. Unlike Ikumi, the meat master in any meat culinary, Yuki often used the animal hunted game from domestic poultry to any other animals (like rabbits and deer) as her main theme. Yuki''s cutting skill could be yet', '/uploads/images/c_85773.jpg'),
(98, 'Shun Ibusaki', '伊武崎峻', '配角', 'Taishi Murata', 'Shun is presumably known his senior, Isshiki Satoshi better than anyone else as he was stayed much longer than the rest of the Polar Star Gang. Unlike his passionate room mates, Shun is very realistic on the terms and very serious upon making his style in perfection. Shun is also a quiet student who prefer speak only whenever is considered as crucial by many. It is also once claimed that he is a calculative chef whose choose to act wisely over hesitation.', '/uploads/images/c_85775.png'),
(98, 'Takumi Aldini', 'タクミ・アルディーニ ', '配角', 'Natsuki Hanae', '__Height:__ 168 cm Takumi is the oldest nephew of the owner of the Trattoria Aldini, a trattoria (family-style restaurant) located in Florence, Italy. He is half-Japanese but, unlike his brother [Isami](https://anilist.co/character/85785/Aldini-Isami), appears more European – with blond hair and blue eyes – and is noted as being extremely handsome, having fan clubs in Toutsuki Academy and his hometown. He enrolled in Tōtsuki at the behest of his uncle, taking with him his mezzaluna (two-handed knife) and a bottle of homemade olive oil as a good luck charm. His specialty is Italian cuisine, although many professional chefs noted that he has a broad vision; like [Souma](https://anilist.co/character/75216/Yukihira-Souma), he will incorporate ingredients and methods from other culinary styles to create inventive dishes, and can modify his recipes while cooking. He is very kind and supportive of his less-skilled brother, to the point of risking his pride to defend Isami''s honor. Takumi has a fierce (and somewhat one-sided) rivalry with Sōma. Takumi sees Sōma as someone similar to himself – both having grown-up working at small family restaurants – and a worthy rival, and jumps at any chance to compete with him. He frequently tries to challenge Sōma to informal cooking challenges (usually leading to an embarrassing situation for himself), hoping to one day defeat Sōma in a formal Shokugeki. Despite their rivalry, both he and Sōma greatly respect each other, and likely view each oth', '/uploads/images/c_85777.jpg'),
(98, 'Hinako Inui', '乾日向子', '配角', 'Mamiko Noto', 'One of the graduated students from Tootsuki Culinary Academy who turned professional, she is one of the respected legends of both her former school and alumni, among the few students who successfully graduated academy. Like most of the 10 alumni, Inui took the quality of the food very serious for it''s freshness as well as. Fame for her nickname as the Mist Queen during her admission in the academy, Inui is able to know the quality of the food just by her nibble before she could bite into her mouth. With this, she can easily tell of the food is good or bad by just putting the food on her lips before finally eating them. Behind her mature, stern and professional personality however, Inui may be childish and rather whenever she confused of either decision which she could made. Considered as a joke member of all alumni, Inui actually make several jokes to cheer her peers. Inui''s cooking style would preferred to the Japanese traditional style/ known as Washi. (Source: Shokugeki no Souma Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_85779.png'),
(98, 'Koujirou Shinomiya', '四宮小次郎', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', 'Owner of a French cuisine restaurant called Shino''s, Kojirou was a student of the 79th generation and held the first seat of the Elite Ten. He is commonly seen sporting glasses and red hair. Known as the "Legumes Magician", Kojirou was convinced he was going to be successful in France with his French–Japanese fusion restaurant, Shino''s. However, his French staff refused to follow his recipes, even sabotaging his dishes. Facing financial ruin, he hardened himself emotionally and fired anyone who questioned his skills in the kitchen. Although this allowed him to reach the top, his proud and stubborn refusal to make exceptions resulted in his skills stagnating over the years. ~!Kojirou returns to Toutsuki as a guest teacher, and "fires" Megumi for altering his recipe despite there being an insufficient quantity of suitable ingredients. He threatens to do the same to Souma for coming to her defense, leading Souma to challenge him to an unofficial Shokugeki. During this match, Shinomiya makes a technically perfect dish that is the unanimous winner. However, Gin gives a bonus vote for Megumi''s dish, prompting Shinomiya to try it and admit that her flexible cooking style suits the tastes of the customer. Shinomiya is reminded of his mother''s kindness, and taking this to heart lets Megumi pass.!~ ~!Kojirou reappears in the story when Souma is assigned as a stagiaire (intern) at his new restaurant, Shino''s Tokyo. His personality has noticeably softened since their last encounter, and ', '/uploads/images/c_85781.jpg'),
(98, 'Gin Doujima', '堂島銀', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', 'Graduated from Tootsuki Culinary Academy, he is one of the respected legends of both his former school and Tootsuki Academy Alumni that is among the few who successfully graduated his academy with flying colors, thus became one of the proficient members of Tootsuki Resort as his graduation. As a living legend, Doujima is skillful in both culinary and board administration due to his talents in both culinary and managements that he handle the kitchen solo without the assistance of any chef around him. It is due to his professional discipline and tenacity, he is both respected and feared by many students and lecturers alike in his former academy. As the legend by the students of the Tootsuki Culinary Academy, Doujima is believed to possesses all styles of cooking to create much unique cuisine in different way. Usually handle the kitchen solo, Doujima has no problem to make 100 different meals thanks to his vast knowledge of ingredients as well of the varieties of cuisine. (Source: Shokugeki no Souma Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_85783.png'),
(98, 'Isami Aldini', 'イサミ・アルディーニ', '配角', 'Yuuki Ono', 'Isami is Takumi''s brother, and the younger nephew of the owner of Trattoria Aldini. Unlike his brother, he has more of a Japanese appearance, with black hair and sharp eyes. Isami is originally shown to be overweight, with his eyes and mouth drawn in a simple fashion, although he briefly became much thinner during the Autumn Election preliminaries. Like Isami, he enrolled in Tōtsuki to hone his skills at the behest of their uncle. Although an equally talented chef, Isami is shown to be less sophisticated than his brother. He was scolded for trying to (and failing to) revise a dish that Takumi had made during their time in the trattoria, and constantly sought to be praised for his cooking like Takumi. Though Isami is supportive of his brother, he does aim to eventually surpass him as a cook. Nonetheless, the brothers are very close. ~!At the Autumn Election, he presented a tomato-curry calzone that was praised by the judges. He aimed to surpass his brother''s score with the dish, but ultimately finished 5th in his block. He tried to support Takumi in his quarter-finals match against Subaru Mimasaka, and was devastated when Takumi lost to his own dish. He and Takumi opened a booth during the Moon Banquet Festival, naming it a branch of Trattoria Aldini, and gained first place in sales in their area. He is targeted as a rebel by the Azami Administration''s Promotional Exams, defeated by Eishi on the third exam and expelled.!~ Isami and Takumi are featured in the Shokugeki no Soma ', '/uploads/images/c_85785.png'),
(98, 'Fuyumi Mizuhara', '水原冬美', '配角', 'Ayako Kawasumi', 'Italian restaurant "Ristorante F" chef. Withdrawn basically cynical personality.', '/uploads/images/c_85787.png'),
(98, 'Hitoshi Seikimori', '関守平', '配角', 'Junji Majima', 'Hitoshi Sekimori is a 78th Generation Tōtsuki Academy Alumnus. He is the owner and head chef of the sushi restaurant, Ginza Hinowa.', '/uploads/images/c_85789.png'),
(98, 'Goutoda Donato', 'ドナート梧桐田', '配角', 'Takayuki Kondou', 'Donato Gotōda is an 80th Generation Tōtsuki Academy Alumnus. He is the owner and head chef of the Auberge, Tesoro.', '/uploads/images/c_85793.jpg'),
(98, 'Zenji Marui', '丸井善二', '配角', 'Yuusuke Kobayashi', 'He is a student at Totsuki Culinary Academyand a resident of Polar Star Dormitory. he and the other resident students from this hostel befriended with their fellow roommate/kouhai, Yukihira Soma whom also seen the amazing skill of the freshman. It is due to he rarely cooks, Zenji is considered as the weakest chef among the Polar Star Gang despite his brains has seemly possessed with infinite knowledge about cooking and black-&-white documents.', '/uploads/images/c_88721.png'),
(98, 'Alice Nakiri', '薙切アリス', '配角', 'Chinatsu Akasaki', 'Alice Nakiri is a 92nd Tōtsuki Generation student and [Erina Nakiri](https://anilist.co/character/75284/Nakiri-Erina)''s cousin, whose cooking style is specialized in Molecular Gastronomy. Unlike her cousin though, Alice is much more friendly and cheery. She even will talk to her rivals casually, sometimes merely to poke fun at them, something she inherited from her mother. She is also a modern girl, eager to talk about love and gossip, even with the incredibly socially dense Erina. She is also very cunning, able to manipulate Erina using reverse psychology to keep her at a local public pool despite the latter''s initial disgust at the location. She is quite bossy with [Ryō](https://anilist.co/character/88972/Kurokiba-Ryou), usually ordering him to do nearly everything for her. She tends to overreact when she is unhappy, throwing fits or snapping back at people. However, most of these are temporary and she will quickly return to normal in a few minutes.', '/uploads/images/c_88956.png'),
(98, 'Ryou Kurokiba', '黒木場リョウ', '配角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', 'Ryou Kurokiba is a 92nd Toutsuki Generation Student and Alice Nakiri''s aide. Generally lazy and gloomy, Ryou''s personality drastically shifts once he puts on his bandana, becoming aggressive, short-tempered, and brash. He grew up in a port town in Denmark, where he became the head chef of a pub due to his commanding personality and great skill. Due to his heritage, he is an expert in seafood and he can judge the quality of any and all seafood with only a glance. Mainly seen to be beside Alice Nakiri and has known her since childhood.', '/uploads/images/c_88972.png'),
(98, 'Eizan Etsuya', '枝津也叡山', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', 'He is a 91st Toutsuki Generation student of Toutsuki Culinary Academy and the current 9th Seat of the Elite Ten Council. He is known as the Alquimista aka "The Alchemist".', '/uploads/images/c_89210.jpg'),
(98, 'Akira Hayama', '葉山アキラ', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', 'An assistant of Professor [Jun Shiomi](https://anilist.co/character/144632/Shiomi-Jun), Akira comes from overseas; they met when he was an orphaned child and warned her about adultered spices in a market (presumably in India). Jun recognized the dormant talent in him and brought him back to Japan, where he was adopted by her teacher, Hayama. Akira quickly learned Japanese and studied spices and aroma under Shiomi. Jun became a mother figure for him, and his motivation to succeed at cooking stems from wanting to give something back to Jun. Akira specializes in curry dishes, with a wide knowledge of spices and aroma. He is a tall and handsome man with tanned skin and silver hair. Like [Sōma](https://anilist.co/character/75216/Yukihira-Souma), he aims to be at the top of the Elite Ten. His nose is very sharp when it comes to spices, capable of identifying ingredients and grade of cooking by the first smell, considered a worthy match of Erina''s God''s Tongue and being identified as an "Aroma Master". Although Jun and Akira are both experts in spices, she uses theoretical knowledge while he depends on his sense of smell. In contrast to Jun''s naive, ditzy, easily angered and dependent persona, Akira is mature, reliable, street smart, cool and down-to-earth.', '/uploads/images/c_122706.jpg'),
(98, 'Subaru Mimasaka', '美作昴', '配角', 'Hiroki Yasumoto', 'A heavily built student who is introduced during the Autumn Election. Despite his look, he''s smarter than he appears and has a strong sense for details. He has no specialty, but painstakingly researches and copies the chefs he faces, predicting the exact dish they will make and marginally improving upon it. He loves intense cooking-duels and totally defeating his opponent, so he always bets his opponent''s precious tool at Shokugekis. He is a gracious host and not averse to having a casual chat with future opponents. However, before and during a match he will mock, belittle and set out to destroy his opponent. ~!Subaru first appears during the Autumn Election preliminaries, taking the fourth spot from Zenji Marui and Shun Ibusaki. He insults Takumi and his brother, provoking Takumi to bet his mezzaluna, and having previously stalked Takumi and investigated his preparations, Subaru copies Takumi''s dish with a slight improvement. Although the judges dislike his actions and methods, Subaru''s dish is judged superior. This leads Sōma to challenge Subaru to give back all 100 cooking tools he''d won, against the total defeat of Sōma quitting being a cook. Sōma circumvents Subaru''s research method by waiting until the competition starts before thinking of ways to improve his dish, something Subaru didn''t believe was possible. After his defeat, Subaru tries to leave Tōtsuki and quit as a cook but Sōma convinces him to continue his studies. Subaru later appears when Sōma asks for assista', '/uploads/images/c_122707.jpg'),
(98, 'Hisako Arato', '新戸緋沙子', '配角', 'Saori Oonishi', 'Erina''s secretary and close friend, Hisako specializes in medicinal-based dishes. She thinks of Erina as the best, that only she could be Erina''s number two and nobody could ever get past her to Erina''s level.', '/uploads/images/c_122708.jpg'),
(98, 'Nao Sadatsuka', '貞塚ナオ', '配角', 'Saori Gotou', 'Nao Sadatsuka is a 92nd Tootsuki Generation student of Tootsuki Culinary Academy. Nao holds a deep harboring affection towards Erina Nakiri. Nao would do anything to get close to Erina including sending her 30 letters daily or watching her from afar using binoculars.', '/uploads/images/c_140802.jpg'),
(98, 'Jun Shiomi', '汐見潤', '配角', 'Mikako Takahashi', 'Shiomi is a 74th Generation Toutsuki Academy Alumnus and a former resident of the Polar Star Dormitory. She is one of the lecturers in Tootsuki Culinary Academy as well as the professor of the Shiomi Seminar. Shiomi Jun is leagal guardian of Hayama Akira. Jun is the youngest lecturer in the academy, but is actually older than she physically appears. Despite the fact that she in her 30s, she is shorter than both Souma and Megumi and has a noticeably youthful face, causing both Souma and Megumi to mistake her as a middle school student of the academy.', '/uploads/images/c_144632.jpg'),
(98, 'Miyoko Houjou', '北条美代子', '配角', 'Asami Seto', 'A 92nd Totsuki Generation student. She is also the heiress to her family restaurant.', '/uploads/images/c_162355.png'),
(98, 'Mitsuru Soutsuda', '早津田みつる', '配角', 'Daiki Yamashita', 'Mitsuru Soutsuda is a 93rd Generation Totsuki Academy student at Totsuki Culinary Academy and a member of the Newspaper Club, also known as Totsuki Sports.', '/uploads/images/c_172550.png'),
(98, 'Shouji  Satou ', '佐藤昭二', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', 'Shōji Satō is a 92nd Tōtsuki Generation student and a resident of Polar Star Dormitory.', '/uploads/images/c_181780.png'),
(98, 'Daigo  Aoki ', '青木大吾', '配角', 'Junichi Yanagita', 'Daigo Aoki is a 92nd Tōtsuki Generation student and a resident of Polar Star Dormitory.', '/uploads/images/c_181782.png'),
(98, 'Taki Tsunozaki', '角崎瀧', '配角', 'Mikako Komatsu', 'Taki Tsunozaki is an 88th Generation Tōtsuki Academy Alumnus and a previous 2nd seat of the Elite Ten Council who is the owner and head chef of the Spanish restaurant called Taki Amarillo.', '/uploads/images/c_191017.jpg'),
(98, 'Sonoka  Kikuchi', '木久知園果', '配角', 'Asuka Nishi', 'Sonoka Kikuchi is an 89th Generation Tōtsuki Academy Alumnus and a previous 2nd seat of the Elite Ten Council. She is the owner and head chef of the Western-style restaurant, Shunkatei.', '/uploads/images/c_191018.jpg'),
(98, 'Leonora Nakiri', '薙切レオノーラ', '配角', 'Sayaka Oohara', 'The mother of Nakiri Alice and one of the three judges that participates in the finals of the Fall selection tournament.', '/uploads/images/c_203987.png'),
(98, 'Urara Kawashima', '川島麗', '配角', 'Rina Hidaka', 'Urara is a 92nd Toutsuki Generation student and a popular idol at Toutsuki Culinary Academy. She is often an emcee for many of the academy''s grand events.', '/uploads/images/c_219135.jpg'),
(98, 'Yua Sasaki', '佐々木由愛', '配角', 'Rina Hidaka', 'A 92nd Tōtsuki Generation student. Like her fellow schoolmate, Urara Kawashima, she is also an MC for hosting important events occurring around and within Tōtsuki Culinary Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_219665.jpg'),
(98, 'Kakinoshin Oizumi', '大泉 柿之進', '配角', 'Mitsuru Ogata', 'Kakinoshin Ōizumi is the President of the Japanese Food Industry Council and a frequent culinary judge for Tōtsuki Culinary Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_219672.jpg'),
(98, 'Yuuya Tomita', '富田友哉', '配角', 'Shinji Kawada', 'Yūya Tomita is the chairman of the Sumiredōri Shopping District and the 2nd generation owner of Tomitaya.', '/uploads/images/c_219697.png'),
(98, 'Lucie Hugo', 'リュシ・ユゴー', '配角', 'Satomi Arai', 'Lucie Hugo is the Chief Boucher of Shino''s and temporarily holds the same position at Shino''s Tokyo.', '/uploads/images/c_220291.png'),
(98, 'Kazune Nishizono', '西園和音', '配角', 'Mariko Higashiuchi', 'Kazune Nishizono is an employee of Totsuki Culinary Academy Affairs Division and an observer for the students participating in the Stagiaire event.', '/uploads/images/c_220292.png'),
(98, 'Kiyo', 'キヨ', '配角', 'Mayumi Shintani', 'Kiyo is a resident in the Sumiredori Shopping District and also one of Restaurant Yukihira''s regulars.', '/uploads/images/c_220293.png'),
(98, 'Shimizu', '清水', '配角', 'Ryou Sugisaki', 'Shimizu is a regular patron of Western Cuisine Mitamura.', '/uploads/images/c_220294.png'),
(98, 'Tetsuji Kabutoyama', '甲山鉄次', '配角', 'Masashi Nogawa', 'Tetsuji Kabutoyama is a 91st Generation student of Totsuki Culinary Academy and the president of the Skewer RS.', '/uploads/images/c_220295.png'),
(98, 'Abel Blondin', 'アベル・ブロンダン', '配角', 'Seiichirou Yamashita', 'Abel Blondin is the Head Chef of the French restaurant, Shino''s Tokyo. He also served as Sous Chef to Kojirou Shinomiya in his main restaurant, Shino''s, back in Paris, France.', '/uploads/images/c_220296.png'),
(98, 'Gao Wei', '高唯', '配角', 'Akeno Watanabe', 'Gao Wei is the Service Manager of Shino''s and temporarily holds the same position at Shino''s Tokyo.', '/uploads/images/c_220297.png'),
(98, 'Seishuu Saotome', '早乙女星周', '配角', 'Masayuki Katou', 'Seishuu Saotome is the Director of Japan Gourmet Society and a frequent culinary judge for Totsuki Culinary Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_220298.png'),
(98, 'Hisanao Kageura', '景浦久尚', '配角', 'Yasuaki Takumi', 'Hisanao Kageura is the president of the Shokugeki Administration Bureau.', '/uploads/images/c_220299.png'),
(99, 'Takao Akizuki', '秋月孝雄', '配角', '', 'A 15-year-old in his first year of high school. He hopes to become a shoemaker and practices on the side while he works his part-time job. His family circumstances have given him maturity beyond his years. He skips the first half of school on rainy days to think up new shoe designs in the garden. (Source: official site)', '/uploads/images/c_79463.jpg'),
(99, 'Yukari Yukino', '雪野百香里', '配角', 'Kana Hanazawa', 'The mysterious woman [Takao](https://anilist.co/character/79463/Akizuki-Takao) met one rainy day in the garden. She spends her days with chocolate in one hand and a beer in the other. Their rainy morning meetings begin after she responds to Takao''s greeting in classic verse.', '/uploads/images/c_79465.jpg'),
(99, 'Mitsuha Miyamizu', '宮水三葉', '主角', 'Mone Kamishiraishi', '**Height:** 163 cm ~!**Age after timeskip:** 25-26!~ She lives in a small town called Itomori. She is a part of her family''s shrine and participates in old traditions as a shrine maiden with her younger sister [Yotsuha](https://anilist.co/character/121518/Yotsuha-Miyamizu).', '/uploads/images/c_121514.png'),
(99, 'Taki Tachibana', '立花瀧', '主角', 'Ryuunosuke Kamiki', '~!**Age after timeskip:** 22-23!~ He lives in Tokyo, juggling between his part-time job at an Italian restaurant, his relation with his friends, and his dreams to eventually become an architect.', '/uploads/images/c_121516.png'),
(99, 'Tsukasa Fujii', '藤井司', '配角', 'Nobunaga Shimazaki', 'A side character in Kimi no Na wa. He is one of Taki Tachibana''s closests friends and is often concerned about him whenever Mitsuha Miyamizu embodies him. Despite teasing Taki, he tries to support him as much as he can. ~!At the end of the movie, he is married to Miki Okudera.!~', '/uploads/images/c_121517.jpg'),
(99, 'Yotsuha Miyamizu', '宮水四葉', '配角', 'Kanon Tani', '[Mitsuha](https://anilist.co/character/121514/Miyamizu-Mitsuha)''s younger sister, who lives with her and their [grandmother](https://anilist.co/character/121520/Miyamizu-Hitoha). She thinks her sister is somewhat crazy but loves her despite the situation. She participates in creating both kumihimo and kuchikamizake.', '/uploads/images/c_121518.jpg'),
(99, 'Hitoha Miyamizu', '宮水一葉', '配角', 'Etsuko Ichihara', 'The head of the Miyamizu family and the maternal grandmother of [Mitsuha](https://anilist.co/character/121514/Miyamizu-Mitsuha) and [Yotsuha](https://anilist.co/character/121518/Miyamizu-Yotsuha). Hitoha is a calm and composed woman with a strong love for her family, especially her granddaughters. However, she isn''t particularly fond of her [son-in-law](https://anilist.co/character/150755/Miyamizu-Toshiki) since he rejected the Miyamizu shrine and its traditions to pursue a career in politics, calling him "that stupid son".', '/uploads/images/c_121520.jpg'),
(99, 'Sayaka Natori', '名取早耶香', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_121521.jpg'),
(99, 'Miki Okudera', '奥寺ミキ', '配角', 'Masami Nagasawa', 'A university student, one of Taki''s friends and his co-worker at the Italian restaurant "Il Giardino delle Parole". She is a beautiful and fashionable college girl who is popular with the male waiters. She develops closer feelings for Taki when Mitsuha inhabits his body. She is a smoker, which Tsukasa discovers when they spend a night together while accompanying Taki on his search for Mitsuha. .~!At the end of Your Name, Okudera is shown to be wearing a wedding ring although it is never stated who she marries in the film. In an interview, however, Makoto Shinkai revealed that she was engaged with Tsukasa Fujii, as he was also shown with a wedding ring prior to Taki and Okudera''s exchange at the end of the film!~', '/uploads/images/c_121522.jpg'),
(99, 'Shinta Takagi', '高木真太', '配角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_121523.jpg'),
(99, 'Katsuhiko Teshigawara', '勅使河原克彦', '配角', 'Ryou Narita', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_121524.jpg'),
(99, 'Toshiki Miyamizu', '宮水俊樹', '配角', 'Masaki Terasoma', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_150755.jpg'),
(99, 'Futaba Miyamizu', '宮水二葉', '配角', 'Sayaka Oohara', 'Futaba Miyamizu is the late wife of Toshiki and the mother of Mitsuha and Yotsuha. Futaba was a devote member of the Miyamizu family, where she participated in various rituals for her family''s shrine until her death in 2007.', '/uploads/images/c_158632.jpg'),
(99, 'Taki no Chichi', '瀧の父', '配角', 'Kazuhiko Inoue', 'Taki''s father.', '/uploads/images/c_158634.jpg'),
(99, 'Teshigawara no Chichi', '勅使河原の父', '配角', 'Chafuurin', 'Katsuhiko''s father', '/uploads/images/c_158635.jpg'),
(99, 'Teshigawara no Haha', '勅使河原の母', '配角', 'Yuka Katou', 'Katsuhiko''s mother', '/uploads/images/c_158636.jpg'),
(100, 'Tanya Degurechaff', 'ターニャ・デグレチャフ', '主角', 'Aoi Yuuki', 'While Tanya Degurechaff may look like a cute, adorable and innocent little girl, but deep inside, she is a cold-hearted and ruthless contractualist. This side of her is especially evident when she is in battle against her enemies; she shows no remorse as she weaves through a chaotic battleground inflicting maximum damage through whatever means necessary to accomplish her missions. Tanya strongly disapproves of failure and disobedience from her subordinates. She is loyal to her own job and always wants to finish it as soon as possible. Tanya will never let anyone discriminate against her appearance because of how fast she goes through the ranks in the military. ~!Tanya was originally a male salaryman who was murdered by a coworker after he fired them. Tanya was reborn as a young girl living in an alternate universe version of Europe during World War I. At just nine years of age, to avoid conscription into less work, Tanya volunteers for the Empire''s Mages Division and is promoted to Second Lieutenant shortly after.!~', '/uploads/images/c_121052.png'),
(100, 'Hans von Zettour', 'ハンス・フォン・ゼートゥーア', '配角', 'Houchuu Ootsuka', 'Imperial Army General, Chief of Staff. A rationalist boasting enormous knowledge. Cooperates with [Rudersdorf](https://anilist.co/character/121059), Chief of Operations, to plan and implement strategies.', '/uploads/images/c_121056.jpg'),
(100, 'Viktoriya Serebryakov', 'ヴィクトーリヤ・イヴァーノヴナ・セレブリャコーフ', '配角', 'Saori Hayami', 'Viktoriya Ivanovna Serebryakov is a mage and a conscript in the Empire''s army, and in the past were a member of Platoon 3 under [Tanya](https://anilist.co/character/121052)''s leadership. After that, she joined the new Wing Battalion named "V601" to serve as Tanya''s adjutant.', '/uploads/images/c_121057.jpg'),
(100, 'Erich von Lergen', 'エーリッヒ・フォン・レルゲン', '配角', 'Shinichirou Miki', 'A high-ranking officer in the Empire''s Military Command, belonging to Strategic Headquarter. He is part of the General Staff''s strategic advisory member that deals with the Empire''s war tactics. A thoughtful and keen man, he quickly deduces the true nature of [Tanya Degurechaff](https://anilist.co/character/121052/Degurechaff-Tanya), calling her a demon. Even so, he trusts her ruthless efficiency to carry out tasks perfectly.', '/uploads/images/c_121058.jpg'),
(100, 'Kurt von Rudersdorf', 'クルト・フォン・ルーデルドルフ', '配角', 'Tesshou Genda', 'Imperial Army General, Chief of Operations. A wonderful and involved soldier, able to plan out large scale strategies as well as finely tune precise operations towards success. Friend of [Zettour](https://anilist.co/character/121056), Chief of Staff.', '/uploads/images/c_121059.jpg'),
(100, 'Séverin  Bientôt', 'セヴラン・ビアント', '配角', 'Ryoukan  Koyanagi', 'Séverin Bientôt is Captain of the 2nd Mage Squadron of the Francois Republic. His Mage Squadron is famous as the elite Special Forces.', '/uploads/images/c_135038.jpg'),
(100, 'Augustin  Hosman', 'オーギュスタン・ホスマン', '配角', 'Taketora', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_135039.jpg'),
(100, 'Isaac Dustin Drake', 'サー・アイザック・ダスティン・ドレイク', '配角', 'Binbin Takaoka', 'Sir Isaac Dustin Drake is a Captain of a Marine Mage Wing', '/uploads/images/c_135040.jpg'),
(100, 'Warren Grantz', 'ヴォーレン・グランツ', '配角', 'Yuusuke Kobayashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_135041.jpg'),
(100, 'Pierre-Michel  De Lugo', 'ピエール・ミシェル＝ド・ルーゴ', '配角', 'Takaya Hashi', 'Pierre-Michel de Lugo is the Vice Minister of Defense and Armies of the Francois Republic.', '/uploads/images/c_135042.jpg'),
(100, 'Olvajoule  Kazole', 'オルバジュール . カゾール', '配角', 'Atsushi Ono', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_135043.jpg'),
(100, 'Sonzai X', '存在 X', '配角', 'Hideaki Tezuka', 'Being X is the main antagonist of the Youjo Senki series. It is, in its own words, "God", but [Tanya](https://anilist.co/character/121052) in her first meeting with it labeled it as the devil. Being X is a mysterious being. It claims to be a God, the God of the Bible, the one that gave the 10 commandments to Moses. However, there are a number of Gods and Archangels overseeing the world(s), which goes against what is postulated in the First Commandment. Its goal appears to be the increase of the number of faithful people in the world.', '/uploads/images/c_135044.png'),
(100, 'Cunningham', 'カニンガム', '配角', 'Toshiki Iwasawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_135045.jpg'),
(100, 'Wilibald Koenig', 'ヴィリバルト・ケーニッヒ', '配角', 'Jun  Kasama', 'Wilibald Koenig is the 3rd Company commander of V601 under the command of [Tanya Degurechaff](https://anilist.co/character/121052).', '/uploads/images/c_135046.jpg'),
(100, 'Adelheid Von Schugel', 'アーデルハイト・フォン・シューゲル', '配角', 'Nobuo Tobita', 'He is a talented mad engineer, inventing many useful weapons during the war.', '/uploads/images/c_135047.jpg'),
(100, 'Anson Sioux', 'アンソン・スー', '配角', 'Kenyuu Horiuchi', 'He is the commanding officer of the Legadonia Entente Alliance''s 5th Air Mage Battalion.', '/uploads/images/c_135048.png'),
(100, 'Harald Von Vist', 'ハラルド・フォン・ヴィスト', '配角', 'Ryuuichi Kijima', 'Imperial Mage hailing from the volunteer wing who graduated from the same year as Visha and Kurst. He was a member of the third platoon in the 205th Mage Company under [Tanya Degurechaff](https://anilist.co/character/121052).', '/uploads/images/c_135049.jpg'),
(100, 'Mortiz-Paul  Von Hans', 'モーリッツ＝ポール・フォン・ハンス', '配角', 'Jirou Saitou', 'He is the Commander of the Western Theater', '/uploads/images/c_135050.jpg'),
(100, 'Heinrich  Schreise', 'ハンリヒ・ツー・シュライゼ', '配角', 'Naomi Kusumi', 'He is the Strategic Commander of the Northern Theater.', '/uploads/images/c_135051.jpg'),
(100, 'Mary Sioux', 'メアリー・スー', '配角', 'Haruka Tomatsu', 'She is the sole daughter of [Anson Sioux](https://anilist.co/character/135048). ~!Mary Sioux is one of the main antagonists of the series, the ultimate rival and the tool used by [Being X](https://anilist.co/character/135044) in order to stabilize a neutral war against [Tanya Degurechaff](https://anilist.co/character/121052). After her father''s death, she became rather more vengeful and serious. Her hatred grows when she hears the name "Devil of the Rhine," she will begin to rage but resulting exposing herself in a controlless side. She is the only person who can match Tanya von Degurechaff in many battles. !~', '/uploads/images/c_135052.jpg'),
(100, 'Ihlen  Schwarzkopf', 'イーレン・シュワルコフ', '配角', 'Shinobu Matsumoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_135053.jpg'),
(100, 'Kurst Von Walhorf', 'クルスト・フォン・ヴァルホルフ', '配角', 'Shusaku Shirakawa', 'Kurst von Walhorf is a volunteer mage who just graduated from Cadet Corps and was sent to the Rhine as part of the reinforcements from Central.', '/uploads/images/c_135054.jpg'),
(100, 'Aisha  Schubert', 'アイシャ . シューベルト', '配角', 'Natsumi Fujiwara', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_135055.jpg'),
(100, 'Rhiner Neumann', 'ライナー・ノイマン', '配角', 'Daichi Hayashi', 'Rhiner Neumann is serving as the 4th Company Commander of V601 under the command of [Tanya Degurechaff](https://anilist.co/character/121052).', '/uploads/images/c_135057.jpg'),
(100, 'Matheus Johann Weiss', 'マテウス・ヨハン・ヴァイス', '配角', 'Daiki Hamano', 'He is the vice captain of the 203rd Aerial Mage Wing, and the captain of the 2nd Aerial Mage Squadron belongs to it.', '/uploads/images/c_135058.jpg'),
(100, 'Maximilian Johann Von Ugar', 'マクシミリアン・ヨハン・フォン・ウーガ', '配角', 'Susumu Akagi', 'Maximilian Johann von Ugar is a classmate and rival of [Tanya Degurechaff](https://anilist.co/character/121052) in their class during War College Arc. He hails from a plain family, and had a newborn daughter in 1924. After graduating from War College, their friendship goes on, and Tanya gains personal connections with him, which helps her many times afterwards.', '/uploads/images/c_135059.jpg'),
(100, 'Klein Balheim', 'クライン . バルハイム', '配角', 'Yuuya Hirose', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_135060.jpg'),
(100, 'Ragald', 'ラガルド', '配角', 'Tarusuke Shingaki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_135062.jpg'),
(101, 'Shouyou Hinata', '日向翔陽', '主角', 'Ayumu Murase', '__Teams:__ Yukigaoka Junior High (Former); Karasuno High (Current) __Number:__ 1 (Junior High 3rd Year); 10 (High School 1st year); 5 (High School 3rd year) __Position:__ Captain (Junior High); Outside Hitter (Junior High); Middle Blocker (High School) Hinata has an unusually high ability to jump. Since he was young, Hinata trained his legs to compensate for his lack of height. He joins the Karusuno High School Volleyball team and amazes the team with his natural affinity as a spiker. Although he is a complete beginner and never had any experience playing in a volleyball team, he grows rapidly through each match. ~!After graduating from high school, Hinata traveled to Brazil to gain experience by playing beach volleyball. This is when he got the name, Ninja Shoyo. Upon returning to Japan, he became a member of the MSBY Black Jackals, a Division 1 team in the V-League. He became a member of the Japan Men’s National Volleyball Team during the 2021 Olympics. Currently, that is the year 2022, he is a member of Asas São Paulo, a professional team in the Brazil Super League.!~', '/uploads/images/c_64769.png'),
(101, 'Tobio Kageyama', '影山飛雄', '主角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Team:__ Karasuno High, Kitagawa Daiichi Junior High (former) __Height:__ 180.6 cm __Year:__ 1st Year, class 3 __Number:__ 9 __Position:__ Setter A famous setter in his middle school who joins the Karusuno High Volleyball team. He was known as the "King of the Court" in his middle school because of his arrogant demeanor and the way he would order around his teammates. Although he still carries an overbearing attitude, he begins to change when he starts to play with [Hinata Shouyou](https://anilist.co/character/64769) who views him as a rival.', '/uploads/images/c_64771.png'),
(101, 'Koushi Sugawara', '菅原孝支', '配角', 'Miyu Irino', '__Height:__ 174 cm Being the vice captain, Sugawara has a soothing personality for his teammates and acts as a pillar of support for them. Even though he isn''t Karasuno''s official setter anymore, he doesn''t dream of giving up on playing in general. As such, he encourages himself and all of his teammates not to give up, no matter how rough the situation might be. Sugawara''s dedication to volleyball is clear when he decides to continue club activities even when most third years choose to retire to focus on their futures. In a meeting, his teacher asked Sugawara why he''s so determined to continue playing even though he''s not a starting member, and Sugawara replied that he doesn''t want to have regrets in the future. He is also quite perceptive as he noticed how [Tanaka](https://anilist.co/character/67325/Tanaka-Ryuunosuke) asked for the key to the gym (back during the first years'' 3-on-3 match) even though he always comes in late, so Sugawara knew that something was up. He is also intelligent as he can come up with helpful tactics during the game. An example of this is when he came up with the idea of saying "bring it" and "send it to me" for [Kageyama](https://anilist.co/character/64771/Kageyama-Tobio) and [Hinata](https://anilist.co/character/64769/Hinata-Shouyou)''s combo.', '/uploads/images/c_67321.png'),
(101, 'Daichi Sawamura', '澤村大地', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 176.8 cm __Year:__ 3rd year, class 4 __Number:__ 1 __Position:__ Wing Spiker The captain of the Karasuno High volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_67323.png'),
(101, 'Ryuunosuke Tanaka', '田中龍之介', '配角', 'Yuu Hayashi', '__Height:__ 177.2 cm __Team:__ Karasuno High __Number:__ 5 __Position:__ Wing Spiker', '/uploads/images/c_67325.jpg'),
(101, 'Yuu Nishinoya', '西谷夕', '配角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '__Team:__ Karasuno High, Chidoriyama Junior High (former) __Height:__ 159.3 cm (5''2") __Year:__ 2nd year, Class 3 __Number:__ 4 __Position:__ Libero Yuu is a very energetic and temperamental person. His boisterous nature and crazy shenanigans can attract unwanted attention quite easily, which often bodes ill for him. Although he hardly ever worries about the consequences of his actions (and may even revert to violence in order to vent out his anger on certain occasions), he is surprisingly considerate of his friends'' feelings and insecurities. Yuu can be extremely impatient, excitable and impulsive. As [Ryuunosuke Tanaka](https://anilist.co/character/67325) puts it, "he simply gets too fired up for his own good." He doesn''t bother to filter his words, and is therefore prone to blurting out whatever he''s thinking in a loud and tactless manner. In-game, however, his attitude changes drastically: he becomes incredibly focused and serious, remaining calm and doing everything in his power to provide the support his team needs until the very end. For this reason, everyone in the volleyball club respects him greatly.', '/uploads/images/c_67327.jpg'),
(101, 'Kei Tsukishima', '月島蛍', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', '**Height:** 188 cm **Team:** Karasuno High **Year:** 1st year, class 4 **Number:** 11 **Position:** Middle Blocker A member of the Karasuno High volleyball club. Tsukishima is very blunt and will sometimes rile his teammates up due to his antagonistic nature (most notably being [Hinata](https://anilist.co/character/64769/Hinata-Shouyou), [Kageyama](https://anilist.co/character/64771/Kageyama-Tobio), [Nishinoya](https://anilist.co/character/67327/Nishinoya-Yuu), and [Tanaka](https://anilist.co/character/67325/Tanaka-Ryuunosuke)) and sometimes other teams because of his casual smug attitude, taking pride in and relishing when his opponents see him as a nuisance as seen with [Tendou](https://anilist.co/character/126073/Tendou-Satori) and [Shirabu](https://anilist.co/character/137537/Shirabu-Kenjirou). Tsukishima is standoffish and has an arrogant and condescending personality, but he has low self-esteem and thinks of himself as inferior. Although he is only outwardly close with [Yamaguchi](https://anilist.co/character/71609/Yamaguchi-Tadashi), he can be seen occasionally caring about his other club members.', '/uploads/images/c_67329.png'),
(101, 'Chikara Ennoshita', '縁下力', '配角', 'Toshiki Masuda', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 175.4 cm __Year:__ 2nd year, class 4 __Position:__ Wing Spiker Ennoshita seems quiet and reserved but can behave boldly towards the other 2nd years. He''s smart and hasn''t received a failing mark before. Similarly to Sugawara, he is always smiling. He''s supposedly the only one within the 2nd years to be able to control Tanaka and Nishinoya. He''s also able to understand different people, as stated a few times by Tanaka and when he knew what to do to give Yamaguchi some courage before his jump float serve.', '/uploads/images/c_67331.png'),
(101, 'Asahi Azumane', '東峰旭', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 184.7 cm __Year:__ 3rd year, class 3 __Number:__ 3 __Position:__ Wing Spiker In contrast to his appearance, he is rather quiet and gentle and has his difficulties realizing that he is Karasuno''s ace as he initially doesn''t feel that way. He shows to be weak-willed at the beginning when he leaves the team before the first years come, feeling that he let down his entire team when they lost against Date Tech High even though they counted on him. After coming back to Karasuno, he realizes that his will to play volleyball is much stronger than he thought and with the help of his teammates, he acknowledges his position as Karasuno''s ace (even though he is still mocked sometimes by Daichi for not having any "ace-like presence") and gains self-confidence.', '/uploads/images/c_67333.png'),
(101, 'Kiyoko Shimizu', '清水潔子', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 166.2 cm __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 2 The manager of the Karasuno High volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_67689.png'),
(101, 'Kouji Sekimukai', '関向幸治', '配角', 'Seigo Yokota', 'Hinata''s good friend back when they still were attending Yukigaoka Junior High. He''s playing soccer.', '/uploads/images/c_70857.png'),
(101, 'Yukitaka Izumi', '泉行高', '配角', 'Kyousuke Ikeda', 'Hinata''s good friend from Yukigaoka Junior High. He''s playing basketball, but often helped out Hinata with practicing volleyball.', '/uploads/images/c_70859.png'),
(101, 'Keishin Ukai', '烏養繋心', '配角', 'Kazunari Tanaka', '**Height:** 178.2 cm **Team:** Karasuno High Karasuno High School volleyball club''s alumnus, currently coaching volleyball club and helping out his mother at the shop.', '/uploads/images/c_70861.jpg'),
(101, 'Kenma Kozume', '孤爪研磨', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 169.2 cm The setter of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. Kenma is [Kuroo](https://anilist.co/character/71269)''s childhood friend and keeps playing volleyball because of him. He has a very calm personality and is usually doing things at his own pace. Often seen playing video games and being introverted. Nekoma''s backbone, brain and heart.', '/uploads/images/c_71267.jpg'),
(101, 'Tetsurou Kuroo', '黒尾鉄朗', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 187.7 cm __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 5 __Number:__ 1 __Position:__ Middle Blocker The captain of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. Kuroo has a somehow manipulative and cunning personality, but cares about his friends and teammates very deeply. As Nekoma''s captain he has a sense of responsibility and confidence. Even though Kuroo''s a middle blocker, he often uses offensive plays too.', '/uploads/images/c_71269.jpg'),
(101, 'Tadashi Yamaguchi', '山口忠', '配角', 'Souma Saitou', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 179.5cm - 180.0cm __Year:__ 1st year, class 4 __Number:__ 12 __Position:__ Middle Blocker Yamaguchi always hangs out with Tsukishima and is very protective of him. He has trained himself hard to use a jump float serve. He is also a substitute ace server of the Karasuno Volleyball team.', '/uploads/images/c_71609.png'),
(101, 'Tooru Oikawa', '及川徹', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', '__Height:__ 184 cm The setter and captain of the Aoba Josai High School volleyball club. He was [Kageyama](https://anilist.co/character/64771/Tobio-Kageyama)''s senpai when they were attending Kitagawa Daiichi. According to Kageyama, he is a very talented setter and volleyball player with a ​complex personality. His favourite food is milk bread.', '/uploads/images/c_71611.png'),
(101, 'Taketora Yamamoto', '山本猛虎', '配角', '', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 176.7 cm __Year:__ 2nd Year, class 1 __Number:__ 4 __Position:__ Wing Spiker Yamamoto is proud and short tempered wing spiker of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. He usually doesn''t think what he says and is somewhat similar to Tanaka.', '/uploads/images/c_73673.jpg'),
(101, 'Sou Inuoka', '犬岡走', '配角', '', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 185.3 cm __Year:__ 1st Year, class 1 __Number:__ 7 __Position:__ Middle Blocker Middle blocker of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. He has friendly personality and becomes friends with Hinata after their game.', '/uploads/images/c_73675.jpg'),
(101, 'Yuuki Shibayama', '芝山優生', '配角', '', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 162.5 cm __Weight:__ 53.3 kg __Year:__ 1st Year, class 4 __Number:__ 12 __Position:__ Libero One of the libero of the Nekoma High School volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_73677.jpg'),
(101, 'Ittetsu Takeda', '武田一鉄', '配角', 'Hiroshi Kamiya', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 166.5 cm Volleyball club faculty advisor of the Karasuno High School. Takeda is inexperienced in volleyball, but still became an advisor for Karasuno. He often doesn''t understand rules and that''s why he takes notes about every new thing he learns. Takeda has an enthusiastic and brave personality.', '/uploads/images/c_73679.png'),
(101, 'Yuutarou Kindaichi', '金田一勇太郎', '配角', '', '__Team:__ Aoba Josai High, Kitagawa Daiichi (former) __Height:__ 189.2 cm __Year:__ 1st year __Position:__ Middle Blocker Middle blocker of the Aoba Josai High School volleyball club. He was Kageyama''s teammate back in junior high school. Kindaichi was one of the players who hated Kageyama''s selfish plays and refused to understand him.', '/uploads/images/c_73681.jpg'),
(101, 'Nobuyuki Kai', '海信行', '配角', '', '__Team__: Nekoma High School __Height__: 176.5 cm __Weight__: 68.9 kg __Year__: 3rd Year, class 4 __Number__: 2 __Position__: Wing Spiker', '/uploads/images/c_74029.jpg'),
(101, 'Morisuke Yaku', '夜久衛輔', '配角', '', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 165.2 cm __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 5 __Number:__ 3 __Position:__ Libero Currently playing libero of the Nekoma High School volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_74033.png'),
(101, 'Shouhei Fukunaga', '福永招平', '配角', '', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 178.3 cm __Year:__ 2nd Year, class 2 __Number:__ 6 __Position:__ Wing Spiker', '/uploads/images/c_74039.jpg'),
(101, 'Hajime Iwaizumi', '岩泉一', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', '__Height:__ 179.3 cm __Team:__ Aobajousai High School __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 5 __Number:__ 4 __Position:__ Wing Spiker __Ability Parameters (out of 5):__ Power = 5; jump = 4; stamina = 4; intellect = 3; technique = 3; speed = 4 Is a third-year student from Aoba Johsai High; he is the volleyball team''s ace, vice-captain and a wing spiker. He is also [Tōru Oikawa](https://anilist.co/character/71611/Oikawa-Tooru)''s childhood friend and "pillar". Iwaizumi often gets irritated by Oikawa''s behavior and tells him that guys who have girls going kyaa kyaa over them irritates him the most.', '/uploads/images/c_75636.png'),
(101, 'Wakatoshi Ushijima', '牛島若利', '配角', 'Ryouta Takeuchi', '__Height:__ 189.5 cm (6'' 2.6") __Team:__ Shiratorizawa Academy __Number:__ 1 __Position:__ Wing Spiker Wakatoshi Ushijima is a third year at Shiratorizawa Academy and the captain and ace of the school''s boys'' volleyball team. Currently, he is the number one ace in Miyagi Prefecture and one of the country''s top three aces, along with Sakusa and Kiryu. Left handed. His favourite food is hayashi rice.', '/uploads/images/c_76816.png'),
(101, 'Yui Michimiya', '道宮結', '配角', 'Asami Seto', '__Height:__ 159 cm (5'' 2") __Team:__ Karasuno Girls'' Volleyball Club __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 1 __Number:__ 1 The captain of the Karasuno High girls volleyball club. Michimiya is shown to be a very active person, always smiling and cracking jokes. She is a very determined person, who cares a lot for her team, giving them motivational speeches, and always tries to stay composed in front of them; she only cries when she''s away from her teammates. However, she herself had stated that she isn''t strict enough. Around [Daichi](https://anilist.co/character/67323/Sawamura-Daichi) though she can become flustered and clumsy, repeating words to try and find the right thing to say.', '/uploads/images/c_77165.jpg'),
(101, 'Yuusuke Takinoue', '滝ノ上祐輔', '配角', 'Shuuhei Sakaguchi', 'Height: 185.6 cm Position: Middle Blocker Karasuno High School volleyball club''s alumnus. He and Shimada are part of the Karasuno Neighborhood Association team. And they often come to watch current Karasuno''s games as well as to root for them. Yuusuke''s working at Takinoue Electric Goods.', '/uploads/images/c_80511.png'),
(101, 'Makoto Shimada', '嶋田誠', '配角', 'Tomoaki Maeno', '__Height:__ 177.7cm Karasuno High School volleyball club''s alumnus. He and Takinoue are part of the Karasuno Neighborhood Association team. And they often come to watch current Karasuno''s games as well as to root for them. Makoto''s working at Shimada Mart.', '/uploads/images/c_80513.jpg'),
(101, 'Hisashi Kinoshita', '木下久志', '配角', 'Nobuyori Sagara', '__Height:__ 174cm Narita, Ennoshita and Kinoshita are 2nd years who couldn''t keep up with the training when old Ukai returned and that''s why they left volleyball club. However after some time they came back because they realized that they still want to play volleyball, though coach Ukai was no longer there. Ennoshita called them ''''disgraceful'''' 2nd years.', '/uploads/images/c_80515.jpg'),
(101, 'Kazuhito Narita', '成田一仁', '配角', 'Koutarou Nishiyama', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 180.2 cm __Year:__ 2nd Year, class 4 Narita, Ennoshita and Kinoshita are 2nd years who couldn''t keep up with the training when old Ukai returned and that''s why they left volleyball club. However after some time they came back because they realized that they still want to play volleyball, though coach Ukai was no longer there. Ennoshita called them ''''disgraceful'''' 2nd years.', '/uploads/images/c_80517.jpg'),
(101, 'Koutarou Bokuto', '木兎光太郎', '配角', 'Ryouhei Kimura', '__Height:__ 185.3 cm Bokuto is a third year student at Fukurodani Academy and is its volleyball team''s captain and wing spiker. His spikes pack a powerful punch that others can struggle to receive. Despite this, Bokuto has a tendency to not doing well in the middle of games when getting shut out. Luckily, [Akaashi](https://anilist.co/character/88938) has a whole list of things Bokuto does and tries his best to bring Bokuto back up to his usual self. Besides Akaashi, Bokuto is friends with a few other rival team''s players, such as [Kuroo](https://anilist.co/character/71269) and sorta friends with [Tsukishima](https://anilist.co/character/67329).', '/uploads/images/c_88937.png'),
(101, 'Keiji Akaashi', '赤葦京治', '配角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', '__Height:__ 182.3 cm A second year at Fukurodani Academy, and its volleyball team''s vice-captain and setter. Akaashi is often calm and collected, though he does have times where he begins to get worried about things. More often than not, he has to handle Bokuto and all of his antics during the game. When such happens, Akaashi usually thinks of some way to bring Bokuto into peak condition again, though there are times where he struggles with doing so.', '/uploads/images/c_88938.png'),
(101, 'Hitoka Yachi', '谷地仁花', '配角', 'Sumire Morohoshi', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Position:__ Manager __Occupation:__ High School Student (1st Year, Class 5) A 1st year who was recruited by [Shimizu](https://anilist.co/character/67689/Shimizu-Kiyoko) as a manager trainee. She appears to be very nervous, but easily befriends [Hinata](https://anilist.co/character/64769/Hinata-Shouyou). She''s paranoid (which causes her to be intimidated easily), very curious, and is organized with her notes, including the ones that she takes from class; this is largely due to her mother being a graphic designer.', '/uploads/images/c_89124.jpg'),
(101, 'Akira Kunimi', '国見英', '配角', '', '__Team:__ Aobajōsai (former Kitagawa Daīchi) (first year at Aoba Johsai) __Height:__ 182.8 cm __Number:__ 13 __Position:__ Wing Spiker He is a quiet and indifferent person, though it''s mostly out of laziness. He occasionally skips practice as well and doesn''t seem to put his full effort into matches; however, his true strength lies in his late game plays. Kunimi dislikes loud, energetic people and was dismayed when Koganegawa yelled at him to "go all out", which is one of his least liked phrases. He also refers to Hinata, Koganegawa, and Hyakuzawa as the "idiot squad" because of their energy. Kageyama has also mentioned that Kunimi is smart, though it''s unknown if that refers to his game sense or general studies.', '/uploads/images/c_89508.jpg'),
(101, 'Lev Haiba', '灰羽リエーフ', '配角', 'Mark Ishii', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 194 cm __Weight:__ 79,7 kg __Year:__ 1st Year __Position:__ Middle Blocker Lev is a half Russian, half Japanese. However he says he doesn''t speak Russian because he was born and raised in Japan. His name in Russian means lion. Lev wasn''t around when Karasuno and Nekoma had their first match together. He started playing volleyball in high school, that''s why he was still a novice and spent whole time on bench at that time so he didn''t come. Lev is blessed with natural physical ability, intuition and height. He declares that he''s an ace even though he''s a middle blocker. Kenma states that Lev is a good and honest guy. Lev is quite childish and cheerful, shown when he was making fun of Hinata''s height. Lev''s appearance, as well as his piercing eyes, causes people to believe he is much more intimidating and serious than he actually is. Though he can be blunt, he never seems to mean any harm and adopts a playful attitude towards most things. He is also shown to be enthusiastic about spiking as he gets excited about it very easily, and can be competitive with people he is interested in.', '/uploads/images/c_89517.png'),
(101, 'Saeko Tanaka', '田中冴子', '配角', 'Yuka Komatsu', 'Saeko Tanaka is a former student of Karasuno High and the older sister of Ryuunosuke Tanaka. She was also a classmate of the Small Giant during her high school years. The second years of the volleyball team views her as a cool older sister, especially Nishinoya, but Tanaka thinks of her as a nuisance whenever she bothers his study sessions. Like her brother, she''s loud and outspoken. Her driving has been described by her brother as dangerous as he had once stated to Hinata and Kageyama that he can''t guarantee their safety in her car.', '/uploads/images/c_90142.jpg'),
(101, 'Akiteru Tsukishima', '月島明光', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', 'Kei Tsukishima''s older brother.', '/uploads/images/c_121624.jpg'),
(101, 'Satori Tendou', '天童覚', '配角', 'Subaru Kimura', '__Height:__ 187.7 cm (6'' 1.9") __Home town:__ Miyagi Prefecture __Home country:__ Japan __Likes:__ Shounen Jump, Chocolate, Ice Cream, Cute Actresses __Jumping Reach:__ 327 cm Satori Tendō is a third year middle blocker in Shiratorizawa Academy. He is often referred to as Guess Monster by other teams. He is cheerful and loud, though a bit sardonic. Tendō enjoys teasing both his teammates and opponents, usually annoying the latter. However, when he gets into the game, he becomes a different, more intimidating person, relishing the look of defeat on people''s faces when they are denied. He has a high success rate with this blocking style due to his analytical skills and predictions, thus he is confident in his abilities . He also greatly values the fun aspect of volleyball. ~!As an elementary student, he was called a monster for his looks also probably due to the meaning of his name (Satori refers to a Yokai) and was told he couldn''t join the volleyball team by other students because of that. Using his guess block, he was able to block the spike of one of his bullies. This event made him feel happy and he continued to use his unique blocking technique to feel that way again despite much opposition until high school. Since his guess block got a lot of points, the Shiratorizawa coach let him join the team without resistance.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126073.png'),
(101, 'Kentarou Kyoutani ', '京谷賢太郎', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 178.8 cm __Team:__ Aoba Johsai High __Year:__ 2nd Year, Class 1 __Position:__ Right-Wing Spikers He is said to have the best ability among the second years at Aobajōsai High, but his brash attitude is cause for poor relationships with other members of the volleyball team. He doesn''t seem to show any respect for the third years (besides Iwaizumi), irritating them and shocking the first years upon Kentaro''s return to the team. He is extremely strong, and he can only hit the ball with his full strength or he "doesn''t feel satisfied."', '/uploads/images/c_135829.png'),
(101, 'Issei Matsukawa', '松川一静', '配角', '', 'Issei is a 3rd year student from Aobajohsai High; he is one of the middle blockers.', '/uploads/images/c_137468.png'),
(101, 'Shinji Watari', '渡親治', '配角', '', 'Shinji is a second year libero in Aobajohsai High.', '/uploads/images/c_137469.jpg'),
(101, 'Takahiro Hanamaki', '花巻貴大', '配角', '', 'Takahiro is a 3rd year wing spiker at Aobajohsai High.', '/uploads/images/c_137470.png'),
(101, 'Tatsuki Washio', '鷲尾辰生', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 187.8 cm (6''1.9") __Uniform Number:__ 2 Tatsuki is a third-year middle blocker at Fukuroudani Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_137474.jpg'),
(101, 'Yamato Sarukui', '猿杙大和', '配角', '', '__Height__: 181.5cm Yamato is a third year wing spiker in Fukuroudani Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_137475.jpg'),
(101, 'Haruki Komi', '小見春樹', '配角', '', 'Third-year high school student at Fukuroudani Academy. He is the starting libero on the boys'' volleyball team.', '/uploads/images/c_137477.jpg'),
(101, 'Wataru Onaga', '尾長渉', '配角', '', 'Wataru is a first year middle blocker at Fukuroudani Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_137479.png'),
(101, 'Akinori Konoha', '木葉秋紀', '配角', '', 'Akinori is a third year wing spiker from Fukuroudani Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_137480.jpg'),
(101, 'Tsutomu Goshiki', '五色工', '配角', 'Shinba Tsuchiya', '__Height:__ 181 cm (5''11") __Hometown:__ Miyagi Prefecture Tsutomu Goshiki is a first year wing spiker in Shiratorizawa Academy. Goshiki appears to have been a capable volleyball player even before entering Shiratorizawa Academy. In one of his recollections, he is seen being praised by an elderly lady while showing off a volleyball related trophy. He is also frequently acknowledged for his height and reliability as an ace.', '/uploads/images/c_137534.png'),
(101, 'Eita Semi', '瀬見英太', '配角', 'Takuma Terashima', '__Height:__ 179.5 cm (5'' 10.7") __Hometown:__ Miyagi Prefecture Eita Semi is a third year setter in Shiratorizawa Academy. Like most members of the Shiratorizawa Boys'' Volleyball Team, Semi got into the school through a sports scholarship. He was a famous setter during his time at middle school and the main setter for Shiratorizawa before being replaced by Shirabu.', '/uploads/images/c_137535.png'),
(101, 'Reon Ouhira', '大平獅音', '配角', 'Teruyuki Tanzawa', '__Height:__ 182.7 cm (5'' 11.9") __Hometown:__ Miyagi Prefecture __Introduction:__ Reon is a third year wing spiker at Shiratorizawa Academy. It''s implied that he was accepted due to a sports scholarship for volleyball. __Personality:__ Ouhira has a soothing personality and tends to be responsible for calming his teammates down when they''re hyped up. He doesn''t get riled up easily and is similar to Ushijima when it comes to his temperament; along with Ushijima, he wasn''t upset about the hundred serves they had to do upon losing. He is confident in his own abilities, going up against three blockers and performing well despite being aware of the audience''s disappointment that it wasn''t Ushijima attacking. (Source [Haikyuu!! Fandom Wikia](https://haikyuu.fandom.com/wiki/Reon_%C5%8Chira))', '/uploads/images/c_137536.png'),
(101, 'Kenjirou Shirabu', '白布賢二郎', '配角', 'Toshiyuki Toyonaga', '__Height:__ 174.8 cm (5'' 8.8") __Hometown:__ Miyagi Prefecture __Introduction:__ Kenjirou Shirabu is a second year setter at Shiratorizawa Academy. He is the only player on Shiratorizawa''s Boys'' Volleyball Team who didn''t get into the school with a sports scholarship. He took the exam to get into Shiratorizawa in hopes of being able to play with tall and strong players after watching Ushijima play in junior high. __Personality:__ He is respectful towards his upperclassmen but tends to bicker with Goshiki, a first year. Though he appears serious and composed, Shirabu is extremely hot-headed and gets annoyed at nearly every move his opponents pull. However, he is capable of recomposing himself quickly. He is also very studious and hardworking, spending all of his free time studying in order to pass the difficult entrance exam for Shiratorizawa. During junior high, he had good grades.', '/uploads/images/c_137537.png'),
(101, 'Taichi Kawanishi', '川西太一', '配角', 'Daiki Oomori', '__Height:__ 188.3 cm (6'' 2.1") __Hometown:__ Miyagi Prefecture __Introduction:__ Taichi Kawanishi is a second year middle blocker at Shiratorizawa Academy. __Personality:__ He doesn''t talk to his teammates very often, and appears mostly emotionless, only looking annoyed on occasion. He has been seen crying once. He doesn''t seem to put much effort into his playing and sometimes accidentally lets a ball in; however, since he''s a starting member in Shiratorizawa, his abilities shouldn''t be too low. Tendō has noted that Kawanishi has an eclectic and more analytical blocking style, which the third year''s a little annoyed by; Kawanishi would use guess blocking on occasions and switch back to read blocking when needed. He also won''t fight any uncertain battles. (Source: Haikyuu!! Fandom Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_137538.png'),
(101, 'Tanji Washijou', '鷲匠鍛治', '配角', 'Ryuusei Nakao', 'Tanji is the head coach of Shiratorizawa Academy Boys'' Volleyball team.', '/uploads/images/c_137539.png'),
(101, 'Hayato Yamagata', '山形隼人', '配角', 'Kenji Fukuda', '__Date of Birth:__ February 14, 1995 __Height:__ 174.3 cm (5'' 8.6") __Weight:__ 66.5 kg (146.6 lbs) __Likes:__ Uni donburi (Sea urchin on rice) __Hometown:__ Miyagi Prefecture __Introduction:__ Hayato Yamagata is a third year libero in Shiratorizawa Academy. __Personality:__ He is serious and focused on the game. When Nishinoya pulled off an incredible move, Yamagata grinned widely. It''s been shown he is similar to Nishinoya when it comes to ''getting into'' the game, yet he seems more aggressive than most liberos. Yamagata is also seen being very supportive of his kouhai, Goshiki, and was shown telling Ushijima when he was being unintentionally rude towards him. He appears to be very protective of the younger years and often acts as a mentor. (Source [Haikyuu!! Fandom Wikia](https://haikyuu.fandom.com/wiki/Hayato_Yamagata))', '/uploads/images/c_137540.png'),
(101, 'Ikkei Ukai', '烏養一繋', '配角', 'Hiroshi Naka', 'Ikkei is the former coach of Karasuno High''s Boys'' Volleyball Club. He once led the team to nationals and was well-known. After being hospitalized, he resigned from coaching the team.', '/uploads/images/c_137541.png'),
(101, 'Hiroki Kurokawa', '黒川弘樹', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', 'Hiroki was a member of Karasuno High''s Boys'' Volleyball Club. He played as a wing spiker and was the captain during his third year.', '/uploads/images/c_137543.png'),
(101, 'Hidemi Tashiro', '田代秀水', '配角', 'Kouki Miyata', 'Hidemi is a former member of Karasuno High''s Boys'' Volleyball Club. He was the former team captain during his third year.', '/uploads/images/c_137544.png'),
(101, 'Hidenori Uchizawa', '内沢英紀', '配角', '', 'A wing spiker on the Karasuno Neighborhood Association Team.', '/uploads/images/c_139523.png'),
(101, 'Yukinari Mori', '森行成', '配角', '', 'A college student and a middle blocker in the Karasuno Neighborhood Association Team.', '/uploads/images/c_139525.png'),
(101, 'Akira Saitou', '斉藤明', '配角', 'Kenji Sugimura', 'Assistant boys'' volleyball coach for Shiratorizawa Academy', '/uploads/images/c_290129.jpg'),
(101, 'Chizuru Sasaki', '佐々木千鶴', '配角', 'Kanami Satou', '__Uniform Number:__ 11 Third-year student at Karasuno High and wing spiker for the girls'' volleyball team. She is close friends with [Michimiya](https://anilist.co/character/77165/Yui-Michimiya) and Aihara.', '/uploads/images/c_290165.jpg'),
(101, 'Kyoutou', '教頭', '配角', 'Yasumichi Kushida', 'Vice Principal of Karasuno High School. He is balding and attempts to keep his head covered with a toupee. He is said to have a bad relationship with the volleyball club that has gotten worse since Hinata and Kageyama joined the club. However, once the team starts to win again, he begins supporting the club more.', '/uploads/images/c_290203.jpg'),
(101, 'Mao Aihara', '相原真緒', '配角', 'Rie Suegara', '__Uniform Number:__ 2 Third-year student at Karasuno High School. She played on the girls'' volleyball team as the team''s ace and vice-captain. She is good friends with and very supportive of [Michimiya](https://anilist.co/character/77165/Yui-Michimiya).', '/uploads/images/c_290205.jpg'),
(101, 'Minaho Ono', '小野ミナホ', '配角', 'Haruka Yamazaki', 'Teacher at Karasuno High School. She is often seen teaching [Hinata](https://anilist.co/character/64769/Shouyou-Hinata)''s classes, overseeing tests, and working in the staff room. She supervises Hinata and [Kageyama](https://anilist.co/character/64771/Tobio-Kageyama) while they took their make-up exams and encourages them to do well afterward. When the Karasuno boys'' team won an important match, she joined the students in opening the windows and cheering to welcome them back. She attends the Karasuno vs. Shiratorizawa match and tells the [Vice Principal](https://anilist.co/character/290203/Kyoutou) that their hastily-assembled cheering section had not been practiced enough.', '/uploads/images/c_290215.jpg'),
(101, 'Takashi Utsui', '空井崇', '配角', 'Satoshi Taki', '[Wakatoshi Ushijima](https://anilist.co/character/76816/Wakatoshi-Ushijima)''s father. He introduced Wakatoshi to volleyball, telling him stories about his team''s reliable ace in high school. When the Ushijima family objected to Wakatoshi''s left-handedness, Utsui begged the head of household to allow Wakatoshi to keep his unique trait and that it would be a strength in his future. ~!Utsui has been residing in Irvine, California and is the training coach for the Irvine Polar Bears. He also authored several books about volleyball physical training through the years!~', '/uploads/images/c_290466.jpg'),
(101, 'Shizuyasu Yokoyama', '横山静康', '配角', 'Hiroshi Iwasaki', 'Appears to be a long-time avid fan of Karasuno High School''s boys'' volleyball team. It is said that he will cheer for the plays he thinks are good, and boo the bad ones. The current Karasuno third-years remember him coming to watch their games during their first year and calling the team fallen crows.', '/uploads/images/c_290467.jpg'),
(101, 'Yuu Ogasawara', '小笠原優', '配角', '', 'One of the volleyball students attending Ikkei Ukai''s training sessions. He and the other kids mistsake Hinata for a middle school student but were surprised at the height of his jump when he was told to block a spike.', '/uploads/images/c_337315.png'),
(102, 'Megumin', 'めぐみん', '主角', 'Rie Takahashi', 'Megumin is an archmage and the self-proclaimed top genius of the Crimson Demons, an order of magicians who are born with high intelligence and magical powers. Despite being an archwizard, she can only use the high level skill ''Explosion'', the strongest of all offensive magic, and only once a day as it consumes tremendous magical power. Due to this she is more often a liability than an asset. Megumin speaks and dresses as a Chuunibyou and her only desire is to unleash explosion magic in the face of her enemies.', '/uploads/images/c_89361.png'),
(102, 'Aqua', 'アクア', '主角', 'Sora Amamiya', 'Aqua is a goddess of water. She guides humans who die young to the afterlife. Due to her cocky attitude towards [Kazuma](https://anilist.co/character/89364), she ends up being dragged to another world with him to defeat the Demon King. Aqua chose the advanced job of archpriest, as being a goddess she''s naturally a strong wielder of healing magic. However, she spends most of her skillpoints on party trick skills.', '/uploads/images/c_89362.png'),
(102, 'Darkness', 'ダクネス', '主角', 'Ai Kayano', 'A crusader and a masochist. Despite being an advanced knight, she is extremely clumsy and none of her attacks ever hit their mark. However, she has great endurance and stamina and acts as the frontline of the party. She often throws herself in front of enemies to "shield" her party, but in reality it''s just her masochism.', '/uploads/images/c_89363.png'),
(102, 'Kazuma Satou', '佐藤和真', '主角', 'Jun Fukushima', '__Height:__ 162 cm (5''4") A hikikomori (shut-in), otaku and NEET, Kazuma arrives in the afterlife after a traffic accident and decides to go to another world to defeat the Demon King, taking [Aqua](https://anilist.co/character/89362) with him. He has the weakest job of ''Adventurer'', but has decent intelligence and extraordinarily high luck. This is demonstrated whenever he uses his ''steal'' skill.', '/uploads/images/c_89364.png'),
(102, 'Yunyun', 'ゆんゆん', '配角', 'Aki Toyosaki', 'Yunyun is a member of the Crimson Magic Clan, and she and [Megumin](https://anilist.co/character/89361) are friends as well as rivals.', '/uploads/images/c_120652.png'),
(102, 'Komekko', 'こめっこ', '配角', 'Maria Naganawa', 'Komekko is [Megumin](https://anilist.co/character/89361)''s adorable younger sister. She is a young Crimson Demon and the only Crimson Magic kid around her age.', '/uploads/images/c_120653.png'),
(102, 'Chomusuke', 'ちょむすけ', '配角', 'Hitomi Nabatame', 'Chomusuke acts as [Megumin](https://anilist.co/character/89361)''s familiar. She is a black cat with a red cross-shaped marking on her forehead and bat like wings. She cannot speak human language, but she seems to be fairly intelligent and can understand human speech to some extent. ~!She is actually the other half of Lady Wolbach, who was sealed in the Crimson Demon Village.!~', '/uploads/images/c_120654.jpg'),
(102, 'Wiz', 'ウィズ', '配角', 'Yui Horie', 'Wiz is the owner of a famous Magic Item Shop in Axel that has many unsalable items with quirky defects. She used to be a renowned Arch Wizard, but has since retired. At night, she has a secret identity as a kind-hearted lich who helps lingering spirits pass on. She is also the only harmless Demon King''s General and prefers to live as a human.', '/uploads/images/c_120655.jpg'),
(102, 'Luna', 'ルナ', '配角', 'Sayuri Hara', 'Part of the Guild Staff, she is the go-to woman for adventurers visiting the guild. Luna is a very kind, caring and cheerful young woman who has a rather ''''Onee-chan'''' (big sister) aura about her. She has common sense which is a rarity in the Fantasy World. Luna is also a calm person, taking everything in stride.', '/uploads/images/c_120657.png'),
(102, 'Eris', 'エリス', '配角', 'Ayaka Suwa', 'Eris is the Goddess of Fortune and [Aqua''s](https://anilist.co/character/89362) junior. Eris is a very kind and gentle girl who treats others with kindness and respect. She is also very caring and she always interest her adherents. She has a very cheerful attitude but at times can act a bit childish. She is insecure about her breast size and uses breast pads to compensate. Aqua often embarrasses her with this knowledge, as Eris wants as few people as possible to notice her lack in bust. She is also kind-hearted and gentle, and therefore, her scent is very fragrant, according to her peers and Aegis. ~!Eris disguises herself as Chris, a friend to [Darkness](https://anilist.co/character/89363) listed under the occupation of thief. Chris is an innocent, cheerful and energetic girl that is almost always seen with a big smile and boasting a bright personality. She also seems to have high confidence in herself. Though at times she acts quite childish and mischievous, Chris has a big, kind heart.!~', '/uploads/images/c_120658.jpg'),
(102, 'Sena', 'セナ', '配角', 'Hitomi Nabatame', 'Royal Prosecutor for the Kingdom of Belzerg.', '/uploads/images/c_122424.png'),
(102, 'Arakuremono', '荒くれ者', '配角', 'Tetsu Inada', 'An anime-exclusive character. The first person [Kazuma](https://anilist.co/character/89364) speaks with in Axel''s guildhall. (Source: Wikipedia)', '/uploads/images/c_126854.jpg'),
(102, 'Vanir', 'バニル', '配角', 'Masakazu Nishida', 'Demon King''s army ex-general.', '/uploads/images/c_130106.png'),
(102, 'Beldia', 'ベルディア', '配角', '', 'A dullahan and one of the Devil King''s generals. He becomes hostile towards [Kazuma](https://anilist.co/character/89364)''s party after [Megumin](https://anilist.co/character/89361) keeps using his castle for explosion practice. ~!He is weak against water and is defeated by [Aqua](https://anilist.co/character/89362)''s purifying magic.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136042.jpg'),
(102, 'Keith', 'キース', '配角', 'Wataru Hatano', 'A frivolous archer who is part of Taylor''s party.', '/uploads/images/c_136043.png'),
(102, 'Kyouya Mitsurugi', '御剣響夜', '配角', 'Takuya Eguchi', 'A Japanese citizen who was also reincarnated to the fantasy world by Aqua. He is one of Belzerg''s strongest adventurers and wields the cursed sword Gram. The sword was his gift from Aqua.', '/uploads/images/c_136044.jpg'),
(102, 'Dust', 'ダスト', '配角', 'Junji Majima', 'A warrior and a member of the party consisting of [Rin](https://anilist.co/character/240105/Rin), [Keith](https://anilist.co/character/136043/Keith), and [Taylor](https://anilist.co/character/242932/Taylor). He is a major supporting character in the main KonoSuba series, as well as the protagonist of the Limelight spinoff series alongside [Rin](https://anilist.co/character/240105/Rin). Dust is rumored to be one of the strongest adventurers in Axel, to the point where he could become a highly accomplished individual if not for his lazy personality. However, he appears to actively hide his true abilities, handicapping himself by using a longsword rather than a spear, his preferred weapon of choice. ~!In the Limelight spinoff series, Dust is revealed to be a formerly renowned knight born of lower-ranking nobility. Having been banished and stripped of his status after helping the princess [Leonor](https://anilist.co/character/340950/Leonor) avoid her wedding, he became a delinquent adventurer, joining [Taylor](https://anilist.co/character/242932/Taylor)''s party and quickly becoming close with [Rin](https://anilist.co/character/240105/Rin) due to her striking resemblance of [Leonor](https://anilist.co/character/340950/Leonor). Promising the princess to do so, he only makes use of his full abilities when those he cares about are at stake.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136046.png'),
(102, 'Alderp Alexei Barnes', 'アルダープ・アレクセイ・バーネス', '配角', 'Takashi Nagasako', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_177154.jpg'),
(102, 'Wolbach', 'ウォルバク', '配角', 'Yuuko Kaida', 'Wolbach is a goddess that presides over violence and sloth. She serves as one of the eight generals of the Demon King and has many worshippers within the Demon King''s army. ~!She was a major antagonist, being one of the most predominately featured of the eight generals of the Demon King''s army, and was the arch-nemesis of the adventurer Megumin. Wolbach was split into two beings and sealed within a complex sealing stone; one of these beings represented the sloth aspect of Wolbach while the other one represented the aspect of violence and took the form of a huge black beast. Approximately 8 years prior to the main series, a young Megumin was playing with the complex sealing stone and accidentally released Wolbach and her other half, which went on a rampage. Wolbach used Explosion to defeat the beast and save Megumin, then she sapped her violence aspect of most of its energy before resealing it, deciding to come back for it when it was more calm. Wolbach then taught Megumin the spell "Explosion" as thanks and left the Crimson Demon Village behind. Despite being an "evil god" and a general of the Demon King, Wolbach was shown to be of relatively high moral standing. Although she was a Goddess, Wolbach didn''t talk down to Megumin (who at the time was a young girl) and elicited concern about the young girl''s future as she thought Megumin dedicating her life to Explosion would be a waste. The aspect of violence was later unknowingly unsealed by Megumin''s younger sister Komekko seve', '/uploads/images/c_177157.jpg'),
(102, 'Hans', 'ハンス', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_177158.png'),
(102, 'Keele', 'キール', '配角', 'Nobuo Tobita', 'Was a former Arch Wizard who later became a Lich to save his love.', '/uploads/images/c_177159.jpg'),
(102, 'Ignis  Dustiness Ford', 'イグニス ダスティネス フォード', '配角', 'Kazuhiko Inoue', 'Is the father of Darkness and the current head of the Dustiness House.', '/uploads/images/c_177160.png'),
(102, 'Walter Alexei Barnes', 'バルター・アレクセイ・バーネス', '配角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_177164.jpg'),
(102, 'Rin', 'リーン', '配角', 'Yumiri Hanamori', 'An intermediate wizard and a member of [Taylor](https://anilist.co/character/242932/Taylor)''s party, alongside [Keith](https://anilist.co/character/136043/Keith) and [Dust](https://anilist.co/character/136046/Dust). Rin is a highly capable magic user, although she is humble and describes herself as a rookie wizard. She is also a very direct and honest person, and although she''s usually calm, she knows how to hit someone back when she is teased. Her level-headedness compared to the boys in her party often leads to her getting Dust out of trouble and scolding him for his actions. Despite her strict demeanor however she is a pleasant person, and at times shows genuine kindness and concern for Dust as well.', '/uploads/images/c_240105.png'),
(102, 'Fio', 'フィオ', '配角', 'Yoshino Aoyama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_307853.png'),
(102, 'Cremea', 'クレメア', '配角', 'Yumeha Kouda', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_307854.png'),
(102, 'Cedre', 'セドル', '配角', 'Yuu Wakabayashi', '~!He was one of the few people killed by Beldia and resurrected by Aqua.!~', '/uploads/images/c_326526.png'),
(102, 'Garilhe', 'ガリル', '配角', 'Kouzou Douzaka', 'An adventurer. ~!He was one of the few people killed by Beldia and resurrected by Aqua.!~', '/uploads/images/c_326527.png'),
(102, 'Heinz', 'ヘインズ', '配角', 'Haruka Jinya', 'He often teases Darkness for not being able to hit the enemy. ~!He was one of the few people killed by Beldia and was resurrected by Aqua.!~', '/uploads/images/c_326529.png'),
(102, 'Kokuou', '国王', '配角', 'Shouto Kashii', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_327408.png'),
(102, 'Kajiya', '鍛冶屋', '配角', 'Hidenari Ugaki', 'Blacksmith who creates Kazuma''s armour and katana.', '/uploads/images/c_327409.png'),
(102, 'Saibankan', '裁判官', '配角', 'Shouto Kashii', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_327410.png'),
(103, 'Kobayashi', '小林', '主角', 'Mutsumi Tamura', 'Kobayashi is a computer programmer and office worker. She finds herself living with a dragon named [Tohru](https://anilist.co/character/120970/Tohru). Even though Kobayashi maintains a cool demeanor, she has been regarded as kind-hearted and reliable among her friends and colleagues. Level-headed and pragmatic, she stands as the source of reason when dealing with her dragon friends. However, when intoxicated, she tends to become rowdy and aggressive, especially in her interests in maids, and is not above subjecting Tohru to her drunken whims. Before meeting Tohru, Kobayashi would don a stoic expression on her face. Now, she is more approachable and open to others, often seen smiling contentedly. Kobayashi often chastised Tohru for her lack of propriety on human standards. However, as time passes by, she grows accustomed to Tohru''s quirks and would sometimes show small signs of affection and gratitude for the dragon, such as holding Tohru''s hand or going out of her way to fulfill some of Tohru''s wishes to ease her troubles.', '/uploads/images/c_120969.jpg'),
(103, 'Tohru', 'トール', '主角', 'Yuuki Kuwahara', '__Faction__: Chaos __Relatives__: [Damocles](https://anilist.co/character/172721/Damocles) (father) Tohru is a female dragon with the ability to transform into a human girl. After [Kobayashi](https://anilist.co/character/120969/Kobayashi) rescues her, she falls in love with her and decides to work for her as a maid. As a Chaos Dragon, Tohru was raised to hate humans and was supposed to be a fierce and dangerous force of evil with nothing other than destruction in mind. However, this all changed when she met Kobayashi. She is now cheerful and kind to every human she meets, except for those who are real, or as it is in most cases, imaginary, threats to her love interest Kobayashi (such as [Makoto Takiya](https://anilist.co/character/120976/Makoto-Takiya)). She is also quickly influenced by what she sees on television or the internet and shares a fiery relationship with her rival, [Elma](https://anilist.co/character/120977/Elma). As Kobayashi''s maid, Tohru is a hard worker and cares deeply for the household, tending to all aspects of daily life, although this will often lead to trouble, such as when Tohru tries to feed her tail to Kobayashi, or when she molests Kobayashi''s dirty laundry. Still, Kobayashi always shows her appreciation for Tohru''s efforts and does her best to guide Tohru in the ways of modern life and human culture on Earth. Tohru is very protective of [Kanna](https://anilist.co/character/120974/Kanna-Kamui) and is essentially her mother figure and big sister comb', '/uploads/images/c_120970.jpg'),
(103, 'Fafnir', 'ファフニール', '配角', 'Daisuke Ono', 'An old friend of [Tohru](https://anilist.co/character/120970/Tohru), he is a male dragon with a strong distrust for humans which leads to him questioning much of Tohru''s actions and ideals in his earlier appearances. He shares some resemblance to the traits of his namesake, such as his cold demeanour and disdainful mentality. He appears as a refined young man with long black hair and red eyes in his human form. ~!After Tohru''s attempts to find a place to stay for him (under the name Takeshi Ooyama), Fafnir eventually comes to live with [Takiya](https://anilist.co/character/120976/Takiya-Makoto), becoming obsessed with video games and popular culture.!~', '/uploads/images/c_120971.jpg'),
(103, 'Riko Saikawa', '才川リコ', '配角', 'Emiri Katou', '**Relatives**: [Georgie Saikawa](https://anilist.co/character/120978/Georgie-Saikawa) (older sister) Riko Saikawa is [Kanna](https://anilist.co/character/120974/Kanna-Kamui)''s friend and classmate in elementary school. A running gag involves her becoming overwhelmingly flushed with bliss every time she and Kanna make physical contact, along with her shiny forehead. At first glance, Riko seems bossy and mean, but over time, she seems nicer as shown with Kanna, and very polite around people like [Kobayashi](https://anilist.co/character/120969/Kobayashi), although she originally mistook Kobayashi for Kanna''s mother. She has a crush on Kanna and enjoys being around her. When being touched by Kanna or when she receives praise from her, she tends to grin goofily and get red in the face, becoming overwhelmed with excitement. Though she initially tries to pick a fight with Kanna for her sudden popularity on the first day of her transfer to the school, she quickly becomes good friends with her. They often spend time with each other, walking home together from school and picking the other as their partner during school activities.', '/uploads/images/c_120972.jpg'),
(103, 'Shouta Magatsuchi', '真ヶ土翔太', '配角', 'Kaori Ishihara', '__Relatives:__ [Mr. Magatsuchi](https://anilist.co/character/248474) (father), Saori Magatsuchi (mother) Shouta Magatsuchi is a young boy born into a family of mages in the modern world. He has shown to possess enough knowledge on the arcane arts to attempt summoning a demon. [Lucoa](https://anilist.co/character/120975) came out of a summoning portal Shouta created and starts living with him. Shouta is an elementary school boy in 5th grade with both purple hair and eyes. His bangs reach well below his eyebrows. His appearance looks partly androgynous. Shouta is quiet and shy most of the time when seen with Lucoa. When Lucoa attempts to seduce Shouta, he would run away with embarrassment and accuse Lucoa of being a demon. As his father is [Kobayashi](https://anilist.co/character/120969)''s manager, she''s asked to look after Shouta at times.', '/uploads/images/c_120973.jpg'),
(103, 'Kanna Kamui', 'カンナカムイ', '主角', 'Maria Naganawa', '[Tohru](https://anilist.co/character/120970)''s friend from the dragon realm who got exiled from her world and wound up living with [Kobayashi](https://anilist.co/character/120969) as well. She is very young by dragon standards, equivalent to a primary school student, which she attends as a third-year student bearing Kobayashi''s surname later in the series. She initially assumes that Kobayashi seduced Tohru into staying and wanted her to return to their original world. ~!She grows attached to Kobayashi as the series progresses, viewing her as a mother figure.!~ Kanna''s basis and tribal attire are inspired by the culture of the indigenous natives of Hokkaido and claims to be from Ushishir. She bears feather-like horns and a thin tail ending in a bulb, and is capable of charging with electricity.', '/uploads/images/c_120974.jpg'),
(103, 'Quetzalcoatl', 'ケツァルコアトル', '配角', 'Minami Takahashi', '**Faction**: Spectation Quetzalcoatl often referred to as Lucoa, is a former dragon goddess and an old friend of [Tohru](https://anilist.co/character/120970/Tohru). She was exiled from her seat after consuming cursed liquor that led her into a scandalous affair. As a member of the spectating faction, she does not interfere with any events involving the dragons or gods. She''s by far the most powerful dragon in the series. Quetzalcoatl appears to be laid-back and carefree who is rarely seen without a smile. She is wise, kind, and nurturing who often has advice for her younger kin. As a former goddess, she is better tuned to human customs, as seen when she explains to Tohru why Kobayashi was not receptive to Tohru''s initial cleaning regimen. Despite this, however, Lucoa seems to lack some sense of dignity severely. She is not above using her body as a means of getting what she wants, as shown when she attempts to use her alluring figure as an offering to [Shouta](https://anilist.co/character/120973/Shouta-Magatsuchi), hoping to allow her to stay in his home. Quetzalcoatl lives with Shouta but does not work for her stay. The two have a complicated relationship as Shouta sees Quetzalcoatl as a succubus or demon rather than a dragon. Quetzalcoatl will often try to get Shouta''s attention, but due to her massive breasts, she often ends up flustering and embarrassing him instead.', '/uploads/images/c_120975.jpg'),
(103, 'Makoto Takiya', '滝谷真', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '[Kobayashi](https://anilist.co/character/120969)''s co-worker who is initially believed by [Tohru](https://anilist.co/character/120970) to be a rival for Kobayashi''s affections, but is really just an otaku who likes to talk about maids with her. Kobayashi helps him set up during Comiket every year. ~![Fafnir](https://anilist.co/character/120971) eventually decides to live with him to stay in the human world.!~', '/uploads/images/c_120976.jpg'),
(103, 'Elma', 'エルマ', '配角', 'Yuuki Takada', '**Faction**: Harmony Elma is a female dragon from the Harmony faction, the opposing faction of Chaos, which [Tohru](https://anilist.co/character/120970/Tohru) belongs to. She adopts the name Elma Joui as her human alias after she finds that she is unable to return to her world. Elma is the only dragon of the main cast who lives on her own in the human world. Elma usually takes the form of a human woman with short black hair, large breasts, blue eyes, and a long spiral unicorn-like horn (which she can freely hide). In the anime and [Elma’s Office Lady Diary](https://anilist.co/manga/100756/Miss-Kobayashis-Dragon-Maid-Elmas-Office-Lady-Diary/), her hair also has purple tips. At work, she wears round glasses. She also wears a business suit which consists of a white shirt, light blue tie, a loose blue sweater, a grey blazer, and a dark grey knee-length skirt with light grey socks and black heels. Her casual attire in the anime consists of olive-green skin-tight trousers, a light blue jacket, a dark blue vest, and a yellow scarf. Her first outfit, which she also wears in her world while in human form, consists of a light tan scarf with a dark blue (sometimes black) leotard. She wears a purple kimono with pink piping and a dark blue sash over the leotard, with the top pulled down. She has bandages around her legs and sandals. She can be seen with a cobalt blue and turquoise tail (which she can freely hide). Sometimes, she carries around a long, brown trident. In Elma''s dragon form,', '/uploads/images/c_120977.jpg'),
(103, 'Georgie Saikawa', '才川ジョージー', '配角', 'Yuuko Gotou', '**Relatives**: [Riko Saikawa](https://anilist.co/character/120972/Riko-Saikawa) (younger sister), unnamed parents Georgie Saikawa is the older sister of Riko Saikawa. Her real name is Nae Saikawa (才川苗). She likes to pretend to be a housemaid. Georgie wears an orange polka-dot maid outfit with a white apron. She also has a white cap and has her red hair in twin-pigtails. Her stockings are black striped. Georgie is a sweet and gentle lady. She always supports Riko and her family. She seems to know a lot about maids and has a huge passion for them. She mentions that she''s wanted to be one since she was a kid when she read a book about maids, but no one accepted her job offers, so decided to be one for her family. Georgie and [Kobayashi](https://anilist.co/character/120969/Kobayashi) automatically have a close bond as they both share an interest in maids. [Tohru](https://anilist.co/character/120970/Tohru) isn''t fond of her and shows jealousy as she sees her as a rival through impersonating as a maid to win over Kobayashi. (Source: Miss Kobayashi''s Dragon Maid Wiki, edited)', '/uploads/images/c_120978.jpg'),
(103, 'Damocles', 'ダモクレス', '配角', 'Takayuki Sugou', 'Damocles is the father of Tohru and is known as the Emperor of Demise and is considered one of the strongest dragons shown. Damocles is callous and stern, hating humans and viewing them as inferior and evil - a belief he tried to impart on Tohru. However, unlike other Chaos Dragons, he respects the non-interference laws preventing dragons from killing humans of Earth, although when angered, he attacks Kobayashi and threatens to leave her at the brink of death. Despite this, he cares for his daughter and is concerned for her safety and happiness.', '/uploads/images/c_172721.jpg'),
(103, 'Sone', '曽根', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', 'Sone is one of Kobayashi''s neighbors.', '/uploads/images/c_209895.jpg'),
(103, 'Yana', '谷菜', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', 'Yana is one of Kobayashi''s neighbors.', '/uploads/images/c_209896.png'),
(103, 'Touzoku no Shoujo', '盗賊の少女', '配角', 'Haruka Chisuga', 'She is a girl that Tohru met back in her world.', '/uploads/images/c_209897.png'),
(103, 'Kachou', '課長', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_209898.png'),
(103, 'Josei Kyoushi', '女性教師', '配角', 'Yuuko Gotou', 'Kanna and Riko''s teacher.', '/uploads/images/c_222745.png'),
(103, 'Tatsuta', '辰田', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_234738.png'),
(103, 'Yamashita', '山下', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_234739.png'),
(103, 'Sasakibe', '笹木部', '配角', 'Kaori Ishihara', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_234740.png'),
(103, 'Toda', '戸田', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_234741.png'),
(104, 'Violet Evergarden', 'ヴァイオレット・エヴァーガーデン', '主角', 'Yui Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 161 cm Violet is described as a very beautiful young woman, being almost doll-like in appearance, with light-blue eyes, a fair complexion, and a slender frame. She is noted for her womanly semblance. She has waist-length golden hair with locks that frame her face. She either has her hair untied, in a low ponytail, or, after becoming a Doll, pulled up into two braided buns with two red ribbons. Due to losing her arms in the war, Violet received maneuverable prosthetic arms made of adamant silver. After the end of the war and on normal occasions, Violet is often seen wearing a white blouse, a green skirt and a pair of heeled brown boots. ~!Growing up as an orphaned child soldier in the army who was treated as a mere tool, Violet was not educated like a regular human being and did not understand human feelings well. She was raised and grew up as a person who had feelings, but couldn''t perceive or express them. For this reason, she could be mistaken as emotionless, or apathetic. Even before she was found and taken into the army, she couldn''t speak or understand speech, only understanding orders to kill. She did not possess any sense of right or wrong from the start; she didn''t understand what could be considered righteous or erroneous. She merely chased after the adults who gave her orders. She followed the idea of "kill or be killed," thus she could kill countless people without feeling guilt or remorse. She did anything that was asked of her and always followed orde', '/uploads/images/c_90169.png'),
(104, 'Cattleya Baudelaire', 'カトレア・ボードレール', '配角', 'Aya Endou', 'Cattleya Baudelaire is a character in the Violet Evergarden series. Being a figurehead Auto Memories Doll who works for the CH Postal Company, Cattleya never stops being requested and often takes on clients with love troubles. She works alongside [Violet](https://anilist.co/character/90169/Evergarden-Violet) and has been close with [Hodgins](https://anilist.co/character/124799/Hodgins-Claudia) since before the company was established, joining as one of its initial employees.', '/uploads/images/c_124787.jpg'),
(104, 'Benedict Blue', 'ベネディクト・ブルー', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', 'Benedict Blue (ベネディクト・ブルー, Benedikuto Burū?) is a character in the Violet Evergarden series. He is a postman working at the CH Postal Company. He has known Hodgins since before the company''s establishment and has had a brusque attitude towards him since he started working there.', '/uploads/images/c_124788.jpg'),
(104, 'Dietfried Bougainvillea', 'ディートフリート・ブーゲンビリア', '配角', 'Hidenobu Kiuchi', 'Dietfried Bougainvillea is a naval captain in the navy and [Gilbert](https://anilist.co/character/124790/)''s older brother. He was the one who found [Violet](https://anilist.co/character/90169/) and made her into Gilbert''s "weapon" on his promotion to a major in the army. (Source: Violet Evergarden wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_124789.png'),
(104, 'Gilbert Bougainvillea', 'ギルベルト・ブーゲンビリア', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', 'Gilbert Bougainvillea is a character in the Violet Evergarden series. He is a major in the Leidenschaftlich army who values Violet more than anything, seeing her as a human being rather than a tool. ~!Violet was "given" to Gilbert as a gift to commemorate his promotion, having being promoted to a major in light of his wartime achievements and expectations from his bloodline. Dietfried, not wanting to take care of Violet, pushed this task to his younger brother. Gilbert then decided to enlist her on a militant unit that he had been appointed to take overall command of in his promotion to major. He later received permission to conduct private experiments at the training grounds as to whether Violet could be officially classified as a "weapon."!~', '/uploads/images/c_124790.png'),
(104, 'Bridget', 'ブリジット', '配角', 'Yurika Aizawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_124791.jpg'),
(104, 'Erica Brown', 'エリカ・ブラウン', '配角', 'Minori Chihara', 'Erica Brown is a character in the Violet Evergarden series. She is an Auto Memories Doll who has been working at the CH Postal Company for a while. She is not good at communicating and isn''t confident in her work. ~!Erica is an anime-original character.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124792.jpg'),
(104, 'Iris Cannary', 'アイリス・カナリー', '配角', 'Haruka Tomatsu', 'Iris Cannary is a character in the Violet Evergarden series. A rookie Auto Memories Doll with an unyielding spirit who works at CH Postal Company, Iris admires young working women and is enthusiastic about quickly making a name for herself in the industry. ~!As a child, she became friends with a boy named Emonn Snow and the two were very close. Iris was in love with him, and she had also supposedly convinced herself that her feelings were reciprocated. Because of that, she confessed to him before they graduated school, but he rejected her confession. The emotional pain caused by Emonn''s rejection was what caused her to leave her hometown to become an Auto Memories Doll.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124793.png'),
(104, 'Iberis Conoway', 'イベリス・コノウェ', '配角', 'Mari Doi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_124794.png'),
(104, 'Tiffany Evergarden', 'ティファニー・エヴァーガーデン', '配角', 'Toshiko Sawada', 'An old woman who wants to take in Violet after being contacted by Gilbert. She has lost her son during the war.', '/uploads/images/c_124795.jpg'),
(104, 'Dansei Kyaku', '男性客', '配角', 'Takuya Inagaki', 'Appears in episode 2 of the anime.', '/uploads/images/c_124798.png'),
(104, 'Claudia Hodgins', 'クラウディア・ホッジンズ', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', 'A former army commander. He founded the CH postal company and serves as president. (Source: Wikipedia)', '/uploads/images/c_124799.jpg'),
(104, 'Lilian', 'リリアン', '配角', 'Rie Hikisaka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_124801.jpg'),
(104, 'Iris no Mei', 'アイリスの姪', '配角', 'Rie Hikisaka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_124803.jpg'),
(104, 'Spencer Marlborough', 'スペンサー・モールバラ', '配角', 'Subaru Kimura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_124805.png'),
(104, 'Bluebell Unoa', 'ブルーベル・ユノア', '配角', 'Shouko Yuzuki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_124806.png'),
(104, 'Roland', 'ローランド', '配角', 'Riki Kagami', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_124807.jpg'),
(104, 'Oliver', 'オリバー', '配角', 'Naoya Nosaka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_124808.jpg'),
(104, 'Nerine', 'ネリネ', '配角', 'Aya Saitou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_124809.jpg'),
(104, 'Luculia Marlborough', 'ルクリア・モールバラ', '配角', 'Azusa Tadokoro', 'Luculia is a graduate of the Auto Memories Doll Training School and a novice Auto Memories Doll. Luculia and Violet became friends as fellow classmates at the training school, and she is the one who helped Violet graduate and earn her licence. She is shown to be a kind and considerate person who is willing to go out of her way to assist others, such as her offering Violet some of her food the first day they met as well as attempting to help her write a letter to Gilbert. Despite a tragic backstory, she is shown to carry a positive attitude and cheerful demeanor when around other people, but tends to be more quiet and solemn when alone. She is expressive and sociable, but she struggles to communicate her own feelings, particularly regarding her brother.', '/uploads/images/c_124810.jpg'),
(104, 'Leon Stephanotis', 'レオン・ステファノティス', '配角', 'Yuuto Uemura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_129999.png'),
(104, 'Charlotte Abelfreyja Drossel', 'シャルロッテ・エーベルフレイヤ・ドロッセル', '配角', 'Megumi Nakajima', 'She is the princess of Drossel, and the narrator for the 5th episode of Violet Evergarden.', '/uploads/images/c_142149.png'),
(104, 'Toby Selwyn', 'トビー・セルウィン', '配角', 'Chikahiro Kobayashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_161638.png'),
(104, 'Aidan Field', 'エイダン・フィールド', '配角', 'Shintarou Asanuma', 'Aidan is a soldier who appeared in episode 11 and was the one who requested the Auto Memories Doll in Ctrigall.', '/uploads/images/c_195572.jpg'),
(104, 'Ann Magnolia', 'アン・マグノリア', '配角', 'Sumire Morohoshi', 'Ann Magnolia is a character in the Violet Evergarden series and the protagonist of the second chapter of the first volume of the light novel. She is a young girl who lives with her terminally ill [mother](https://anilist.co/character/223026/Clara-Magnolia).', '/uploads/images/c_213148.jpg'),
(104, 'Rhodanthe', 'ローダンセ', '配角', 'Yukari Nozawa', 'She is the instructor at the Auto Memories Doll Training School.', '/uploads/images/c_223021.png'),
(104, 'Damian Baldur Flugel', 'ダミアン・バルドゥール・フリューゲル', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', 'He is the prince of the Kingdom of Flugel who is set to marry princess Charlotte of the Kingdom of Drossel.', '/uploads/images/c_223022.png'),
(104, 'Oscar Webster', 'オスカー・ウェブスター', '配角', 'Satoshi Taki', 'A playwright who used to seclude himself due to the deaths of his wife and daughter. However, after deciding to write his very first children''s play to dedicate it to his daughter''s memory, he entrusts Violet with the task of putting his ideas on paper.', '/uploads/images/c_223023.png'),
(104, 'Olivia Webster', 'オリビア・ウェブスター', '配角', 'Sayaka Senbongi', 'She is the beloved daughter of Oscar and the insipration behind Olive, the main character in her father''s first children''s play.', '/uploads/images/c_223024.png'),
(104, 'Clara Magnolia', 'クラーラ・マグノリア', '配角', 'Ayako Kawasumi', 'She is the mother of [Ann](https://anilist.co/character/213148/Ann-Magnolia), who had a terminal illness and predicted that her fate was close.', '/uploads/images/c_223026.png'),
(104, 'Illias Vandal', 'イライアス・ヴァンダル', '配角', 'Shunsuke Sakuya', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_223027.png'),
(104, 'Eckhart Munter', 'エックハルト・ミュンター', '配角', 'Riki Kagami', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_223028.png'),
(104, 'Merkulov', 'メルクーロフ', '配角', 'Kousei Hirota', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_223029.png'),
(104, 'Alberta', 'アルベルタ', '配角', 'Mami Koyama', 'A court lady in the service of the royal family of the kingdom of Drossel, she has been taking care of Charlotte since she was born, and she is more important to Charlotte than her own parents.', '/uploads/images/c_330769.jpg'),
(105, 'Katsuki Bakugou', '爆豪勝己', '主角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5''7") __Quirk:__ Explosion Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Katsuki is a crude, arrogant, short-tempered, and aggressive person, especially at the beginning of the series. Due to the constant praise of his abilities and powerful Quirk, Katsuki has developed a superiority complex, and because of that, he desires to be the first and best at everything. He loves to win above all else and cannot stand it when he doesn''t, leading him to lose his already short temper if he achieves anything but a complete victory. Katsuki is not only very athletic and talented at fighting, but also very intelligent and extremely perceptive, capable of strategic planning and improvisation. Additionally, his grades are among the highest of his class. Katsuki also possesses surprising talent in other areas, such as cooking and music, even though he doesn''t show a particular interest in them. Overall, Katsuki is considered a natural-born genius with the potential to be one of the best Pro Heroes. Katsuki''s Quirk "Explosion" allows him to secrete nitroglycerin-like sweat from the palms of his hands and ignite it on command, allowing him to create strong explosions. The more Katsuki sweats, the stronger his explosions become. Not only can Katsuki use the explosions for attacking, he can also use them to propel himself and navigate through the air at high speeds, allowing him to fly at his opponents without giving them time to react, as well as evade incoming attacks, even whi', '/uploads/images/c_88892.png'),
(105, 'Izuku Midoriya', '緑谷出久', '主角', 'Daiki Yamashita', '__Height:__ 166 cm (5''5¼") __Quirk:__ One For All Student in Class 1-A at U.A High School. Although he was born without a Quirk, Izuku''s innate heroism and strong sense of justice manages to catch the attention of the legendary hero [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224). Izuku has since become All Might''s closest pupil. Izuku is a very timid, reserved, and polite boy. Although initially portrayed as insecure, tearful, and vulnerable, Izuku gradually matures into a more confident and braver person. His infectious leadership skills, combined with his passion and strategic abilities, have turned Izuku into a central figure of Class 1-A. He is caring and emotional, never hesitating to help or rescue someone in danger, even if he knows that he might not be strong or otherwise qualified enough to do it. Izuku is extremely (and sometimes scarily) enthusiastic about topics related to heroes. His dream drives him to write down notes about everything he learns about heroes'' Quirks and fighting capabilities. Thanks to this practice, Izuku has developed a great analytical mind and can form complex battle plans in a few seconds, factoring in the best ways he can utilize the Quirks of allies and enemies alike for his own advantage. Izuku''s Quirk "One For All" was transferred to him from All Might. His Quirk allows him to stockpile an enormous amount of raw power, allowing him to significantly enhance all of his physical abilities to various boundless levels. This results in unbel', '/uploads/images/c_89028.png'),
(105, 'Shouto Todoroki', '轟焦凍', '主角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9") __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Half-Cold Half-Hot Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School, where he got in through official recommendations. He is the youngest son of the top hero [Endeavor](https://anilist.co/character/126158). Shouto initially has a cold, aloof personality, which stemmed from his complicated family life. Focused and unemotional, Shouto preferred to keep things to himself instead of hanging out with others. After the events of the U.A. Sports Festival, however, he notably became more sociable and kinder than ever before. He even gained a sense of humor and would occasionally smile, although still retaining some fragments of his previous distant attitude and nonchalant demeanor. While usually quiet and reserved, Shouto initially possessed a moderate level of arrogance, which, combined with his solitary tendencies, sometimes made him take the initiative without considering the opinions of others. Shouto''s Quirk Half-Cold Half-Hot gives him the ability to generate ice from the right side of his body, and flames from his left side. Due to years of rejecting his father, Shouto has developed a habit of favoring ice, even when fire would be a better option. This grudge also caused him to have difficulty controlling his flames. If he overuses one element without utilizing the other, then his own body temperature will suffer.', '/uploads/images/c_89220.png'),
(105, 'Ochako Uraraka', '麗日お茶子', '主角', 'Ayane Sakura', '__Height:__ 156 cm (5''1") __Quirk:__ Zero Gravity Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School Ochako is an outgoing, lively person who thinks about everything positively, though she is objective enough to see flaws and virtues. She gets excited over little things very easily. Ochaco has been described by other students as "the most laidback girl" among her class, being very bubbly and kind of an airhead at times. She is often incredibly blunt without being aware of it. She is on good terms with everyone and is particularly close friends with several class members, including [Izuku](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku), [Tenya Ida](https://anilist.co/character/89222/Iida-Tenya), and [Tsuyu](https://anilist.co/character/89223/Asui-Tsuyu). Ochaco''s Quirk gives her the power to manipulate gravity upon touching solid things with the pads on her fingertips. The targets lose their gravitational pull, effectively making them weightless. She is able to activate or cancel her Quirk''s effects by closing her fingers together, and is shown to be careful with her hands in order to avoid accidental quirk activation.', '/uploads/images/c_89221.png'),
(105, 'Tenya Iida', '飯田天哉', '主角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5''10") __Quirk:__ Engine Class representative of Class 1-A at U.A. High School Tenya may look severe, but he''s actually just a very serious person, who takes everything, even the most insignificant thing, seriously. A testament to his generally hyperactive and intense behavior, Tenya often exhibits plenty of peculiar tics, such as moving his arms around in strange chopping patterns or sometimes twitching his body uncontrollably. Tenya is very humble, willing to admit to his mistakes, apologize for rude behavior, and improve in areas he lacks. Being part of the highly-esteemed Ida Family of Heroes, Tenya is proud of his lineage and works hard to meet his expectations. He greatly admires his older brother, Tensei (also known as the Turbo Hero: Ingenium), and aspires to become a similar hero. Tenya''s Quirk Engine gives him car-like engines in each of his calves, giving him incredible running speed and extreme kicking power. Tenya needs to fuel his engines by drinking orange juice. Tenya''s engines have multiple gears; it is currently unknown how many, but it has been implied that there are more than three.', '/uploads/images/c_89222.png'),
(105, 'Tsuyu Asui', '蛙吹梅雨', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', '__Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Frog Tsuyu is a very straight-forward girl that always says what''s on her mind and what she thinks about others. She prefers to be called by her first name.', '/uploads/images/c_89223.png'),
(105, 'Toshinori Yagi', '八木俊典', '主角', 'Kenta Miyake', '__Height:__ 220 cm (7''2") __Quirk:__ One for All All Might is the No. 1 Hero and the "Symbol of Peace." In his hero form, All Might is a very tall and over-muscular man whose design resembles the american hero comics. His hair spikes on top of his head and his whole body has more shadows than a normal human being. However, in his true form, he is an overly-skinny man who spits a lot of blood out of his mouth and his clothes appear loose.', '/uploads/images/c_89224.jpg'),
(105, 'Shouta Aizawa', '相澤消太', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', '__Height: __183 cm (6'') __Occupation:__ Pro Hero, Teacher __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Erasure Aizawa''s hero name, Eraserhead, was coined by [Present Mic](https://anilist.co/character/127425) when they were younger. Using the binding cloth, Aizawa has a unique fighting style that allows him to immobilize his enemies. He is known to expel students that don''t meet his standards, however it should be noted that he did not expel anyone from Class 1-A. Aizawa is extremely vocal, able to voice his opinions very easily. Although seeming emotionless and reserved, he has a soft spot for his students and genuinely cares for them.', '/uploads/images/c_89225.png'),
(105, 'Tomura Shigaraki', '死柄木弔', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9) __Quirk:__ Decay Leader of the League of Villains and protégé of [All For One](https://anilist.co/character/125956/All-For-One). He was raised by his master, All For One, with the goal of killing [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224/Yagi-Toshinori), and ultimately destroying the society he represents. Tomura is a very twisted, malevolent, and maliciously warped young man, who is considered to be the polar opposite of [Izuku Midoriya](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku). He doesn''t care for his or almost anyone else''s life, having no qualms about performing evil deeds like murdering innocent people. Tomura was initially perceived to be a "man-child": arrogant, selfish, dependent, and demanding, becoming angry if things didn''t go his way and likening reality to some sort of video game. Unlike his mentor, Tomura lacked subtlety, preferring to eliminate problems through force. Much like a child, Tomura seemed unable to cope with his own feelings, instead lashing out and abusing both others or himself, tearing at his own neck when he becomes frustrated. Initially, Tomura seemingly caused destruction just for the sake of it and felt directionless about the League''s path forward after [Stain](https://anilist.co/character/126067/Akaguro-Chizome)''s arrest. It would take a fateful meeting with Izuku in a mall for him to develop an epiphany and become aware of his true convictions: to crumble hero society through All Might''s death. Tomur', '/uploads/images/c_89226.jpg'),
(105, 'Momo Yaoyorozu', '八百万百', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") __Quirk:__ Creation Vice class representative of Class 1-A at U.A. High School. She was admitted to the school through official recommendations. Momo is a very prudent, dedicated person who acts as a natural leader. She is generally level-headed and calm in dangerous situations, but she isn''t above falling into a panic. Momo can be blunt with her comments about people''s mistakes and miscalculations, tending to be very direct and wishing to help her peers improve enough to become great heroes. Momo''s Quirk gives her the ability to create any non-living material/object from her exposed skin by transforming the molecular structure of her fat cells. In order to create something, she needs to understand the molecular structure of which the material/object is made.', '/uploads/images/c_89241.png'),
(105, 'Hitoshi Shinsou', '心操人使', '配角', 'Wataru Hatano', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''9½") __Quirk:__ Brainwashing Student at U.A. High School, attending Class 1-C of the Department of General Education. Hitoshi is a stoic and straightforward person with an innate ability to spark conversation with anyone despite holding a reserved and quiet attitude most of the time. He is shown to be rather clever, knowing just the right words to manipulate others into replying to his comments, allowing him to activate his Quirk. He does not mind doing something underhanded to claim victory in a fight. Due to having his Brainwashing Quirk perceived as evil throughout his life, Hitoshi has been somewhat feared by those aware of his power and has been discriminated against solely because of the Quirk he was born with. This persecution led him to become resentful of those who had Quirks more associated with hero work. Regardless of his drawbacks, however, Hitoshi desires to become a Pro Hero more than anything. Hitoshi''s Quirk Brainwashing allows him to put someone in a state where they are forced to obey whatever he commands. He can only activate this power when his target verbally responds to something he says. Brainwashing must be intentionally activated and will not take effect if Hitoshi doesn''t want it to. Using a megaphone or anything that makes his voice artificial will not allow his Quirk to activate, as the said devices would transform his voice into an electronic signal.', '/uploads/images/c_89242.png'),
(105, 'Eijirou Kirishima', '切島鋭児郎', '配角', 'Toshiki Masuda', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Quirk:__ Hardening Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Eijiro is a boisterous and outgoing guy with a fondness for manliness, often using the terms "manly" and "unmanly" to describe things and people he does or doesn''t like, respectively. Eijiro is very honest and kind-hearted, having a straightforward way of thinking and following a specific code of chivalry that motivates him to live without regret. He is determined and selfless, bravely putting the safety of others before himself. He is also a big fan of Crimson Riot, a retro hero from whom he takes inspiration, including personal values and his hero name. Although Eijiro may not be as hot-blooded and competitive as [Katsuki Bakugou](https://anilist.co/character/88892), he does not shy away from comparing himself to him, with [Izuku](https://anilist.co/character/89028) stating that the two have managed to develop a relationship between equals. As a result, Eijiro is notably one of the few people that Katsuki holds in higher esteem. Eijiro''s Quirk gives him the power to harden and sharpen any or all parts of his body, causing his flesh to become jagged and rock-like. There is a limit to how much damage his hardened body can withstand, which causes the Hardening itself to slowly dissipate, and Eijiro to lose stamina from struggling to keep his Quirk active.', '/uploads/images/c_89243.jpg'),
(105, 'Minoru Mineta', '峰田実', '配角', 'Ryou Hirohashi', '__Height:__ 108 cm (3'' 6½") __Quirk:__ Pop Off __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Fighting Style:__ Medium Ranged Support Minoru Mineta, also known as the Fresh-Picked Hero: Grape Juice, is a student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School, training to become a Pro Hero.', '/uploads/images/c_89244.png'),
(105, 'Mina Ashido', '芦戸三奈', '配角', 'Eri Kitamura', '__Height:__ 159 cm (5''3") __Quirk:__ Acid Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Mina is a cheerful and easygoing girl who usually displays a smile. Highly social and excitable, she loves to hang out with her friends and is shown to become very upset when denied an opportunity to be at a gathering. She possesses a strong fashion sense and likes to go shopping. Due to her athleticism and energy, Mina enjoys and is very skilled at dancing. Mina is extremely courageous and is viewed as an ideal personality for hero work. Mina''s Quirk Acid allows her to produce a corrosive liquid from her body. She can control the solubility and viscosity of this corrosive liquid. There is a limit to how long she can produce the corrosive liquid until her skin gradually loses its natural resistance to it. Overusing her Quirk or pushing it too far can also be fatal, as it dehydrates her body very fast. Mina can use her acid offensively, but has shown utility with it as well, such as melting handholds for herself to climb with. She is also known to secrete a non-corrosive version of the acid from her feet in order to slide around.', '/uploads/images/c_89247.png'),
(105, 'Mei Hatsume', '発目明', '配角', 'Shiori Sakurai', '__Height:__ 157 cm (5''2") __Quirk:__ Zoom Mei is a smart, off-setting, and assertive girl, often making those around her uncomfortable. She loves creating gadgets, which she refers to as her "super cute babies". Mei has a habit of "going straight to the point" and is very shameless and opportunistic when it comes to advertising her inventions. While talking to people, she has a habit of getting awkwardly close to them, which usually causes them to back away from her but she still moves up to them.', '/uploads/images/c_89248.png'),
(105, 'Denki Kaminari', '上鳴電気', '配角', 'Tasuku Hatanaka', '__Height:__ 168 cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Electrification Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Denki is a friendly, social, and energetic boy who enjoys hanging out with others. He is rather casual when interacting with other people, including the generally unfriendly [Katsuki Bakugou](https://anilist.co/character/88892/Bakugou-Katsuki). Denki''s Quirk Electrification allows him to store and discharge electricity. While he can also discharge this energy over a distance, Denki has little to no control over it, meaning it will go everywhere indiscriminately. Denki is also able to absorb and neutralize electricity and other lightning-based Quirks. Whenever Denki exceeds his wattage limit, he loses his ability to discharge energy, with his entire personality changing into that of a giggling idiot for a certain period until he reverts to normal. In this state, he is always giving thumbs-ups as a way to let others know that he is okay.', '/uploads/images/c_89249.png'),
(105, 'Hanta Sero', '瀬呂範太', '配角', 'Kiyotaka Furushima', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5'' 9¾") __Quirk:__ Tape Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Hanta is amicable and has proven to be one of the more sociable members of Class 1-A. He can sometimes be loud and showy, often trying to impress his peers with his Quirk. He is often the only person to call his classmates out when they act crazy. He is pretty humorous and usually makes jokes with his classmates. However, when push comes to shove, Hanta is a brave hero-in-training who wishes to prosper on his own while helping others do the same. Hanta''s Quirk is that he has tape dispenser-like organs in his elbows, from which he can shoot long cellophane tape-like strips; he can also retract them. They appear to be somewhat sturdier than regular tape. Overuse of his Quirk will cause his skin to dry out. He can use his tape to wrap people, swing long distances, and create traps, among other applications.', '/uploads/images/c_89895.png'),
(105, 'Mashirao Ojiro', '尾白猿夫', '配角', 'Kousuke Miyoshi', '__Height:__ 169 cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Tail Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Mashirao has a very calm and noble attitude and a profound sense of dignity, which prevents him from accepting results he doesn''t feel he earned with his own abilities. He is also described as a hard worker. Along with a strong sense of dignity, Mashirao can be described as sheepish and bashful, not very often enjoying the spotlight and being easily embarrassed. A recurring joke is that others view Mashirao as "plain," which profoundly upsets him. Mashirao''s Quirk is that he has a long, powerful, sturdy tail. His tail effectively functions as a third arm that he can use to grab things. Furthermore, it''s attack power is strong enough to break objects made of metal, he can wrap it around enemies, and it can support Mashirao''s body weight. Mashirao is incredibly adept at using his tail, combining it with his knowledge of martial arts to engage enemies in close-range combat, performing fast and acrobatic moves. His tail can also increase his speed and mobility by whipping it down against the ground to use it like a springboard. (Source: My Hero Academia Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_89896.png'),
(105, 'Kyouka Jirou', '耳郎響香', '配角', 'Kei Shindou', '__Height:__ 154 cm (5''1") __Quirk:__ Earphone Jack __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Fighting Style:__ Medium Ranged + Support Combat Kyoka is a petite, fair-skinned girl with a slender build. She has triangular, lazy-looking onyx eyes with notably long lower eyelashes, and rather small eyebrows. Kyoka has a pragmatic, unenthusiastic and teasing personality that is mostly shown to those she finds irritating. Kyoka is not always like this though, as she does enjoy socializing with others, in which case she is usually nice and friendly. Kyoka''s Quirk (Earphone Jack) allows her to plug the jacks that hang from her earlobes into all sorts of things and channel the sound of her heartbeat into them; causing havoc inside the plugged objects. It''s also used to catch sounds and vibrations from her surroundings.', '/uploads/images/c_89897.png'),
(105, 'Fumikage Tokoyami', '常闇踏陰', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', '__Height:__ 158 cm __Quirk:__ Dark Shadow Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Fumikage is reserved, serious, and focused, albeit noble and valiant. Though not talkative, Fumikage will directly ignore questions or requests that seem in some way pointless. During combat, Fumikage is known to be fierce and dependable, with his strength and capabilities rarely being questioned. Fumikage is fond of darkness and other related concepts, considering himself a "creature of the dark" and employing archaic-sounding speeches that paint him slightly creepy or dramatic. Fumikage''s Quirk "Dark Shadow" allows him to manifest a sentient shadow monster from his body that he can materialize and contract freely. Dark Shadow''s energy is limited and can be drained by bright light. Dark Shadow retracts into Fumikage''s body when it runs out of energy. The shadow entity''s personality, strength, defense, and control depend on the lack of light. In bright light, Dark Shadow is weaker and smaller but still has considerable strength and defense and is easier to control, but in total darkness, Dark Shadow''s size and parameters are drastically enhanced. It is powerful enough to rip out and cut down multiple full-grown trees easily. However, Dark Shadow is more difficult to control in the dark, causing it to rampage based on its own free will.', '/uploads/images/c_89898.png'),
(105, 'Mezou Shouji', '障子目蔵', '配角', 'Masakazu Nishida', '__Height:__ 187 cm (6''2") __Quirk:__ Dupli-Arms Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Shouji is friendly and gentle, and he will work nicely with anyone. He is not the type to hold grudges, showing no ill will towards those that harm him unwillingly. Shouji is entirely selfless and willing to risk his life for anyone. He can be empathetic and understanding, but still shows a sense of maturity and responsibility that prevents him from acting under emotional impulses. He is very protective of his classmates, especially if they are hurt or injured. He is also quite thick-skinned, as he said he is used to being feared due to his appearance. Shouji''s Quirk grants him a set of tentacles alongside his arms. He can transform the tips of these tentacles to replicate other parts of his body (ex: mouth, ears, eyes). The duplicated body parts are more efficient than the originals; as a result, Mezo is able to hear better, see-through more angles at a time, and they grant him much higher degrees of strength. He uses these arms to talk most of the time through duplicate mouths, rather than his actual mouth.', '/uploads/images/c_89899.png'),
(105, 'Tooru Hagakure', '葉隠透', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', '__Height:__ 152 cm (5''0") __Quirk:__ Invisibility Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Tooru is a bubbly, cheery, and easygoing girl who does most things with an upbeat attitude. She is very socially eager and likes shopping, and her room suggests that she likes plushies and other cute things. Tooru''s Quirk is that her body is completely invisible. In addition to the stealth capabilities granted to her by her invisible body, Tooru can refract light that passes through her, allowing her to intensify the light into a blinding flash. She has further refined this application of her Quirk, achieving the ability to manipulate and redirect light-based attacks, such as [Yuuga Aoyama](https://anilist.co/character/127042/Aoyama-Yuuga)''s Navel Laser.', '/uploads/images/c_89900.png'),
(105, 'Kouji Kouda', '口田甲司', '配角', 'Takuma Nagatsuka', '__Height:__ 186 cm (6''1") __Quirk:__ Anivoice Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Contrary to his strong and powerful appearance, Kouji is very timid and quiet. He rarely speaks and prefers using sign language to communicate with his classmates. He hates violence due to his kind-hearted nature. Kouji appears to greatly enjoy the company of animals, as his Quirk allows him to interact with animals in ways others cannot. He owns a small rabbit as a pet. Kouji''s Quirk "Anivoice (生き物ボイス, Ikimono Voice)" gives him the ability to command any creature in the animal kingdom by speaking to them. Whatever command he gives, the animal will carry it out. However, he cannot exert control if they cannot hear his command. The target must also be a real animal and not merely animal-like. Kouji can also exchange information with the animals to find the locations of various people and potential enemies faster. Kouji has been shown to use the Quirk effectively with flocks of birds to create a smokescreen of animals and to attack an opponent, along with his use of insects to distract and attack his opponents. He has now also overcome his fear of bugs, so he often uses bugs to swarm opponents with numbers.', '/uploads/images/c_89901.png'),
(105, 'Rikidou Satou', '砂藤力道', '配角', 'Tooru Nara', '__Height:__ 185 cm (6''1") __Quirk:__ Sugar Rush Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Rikidou is interested in sweets and baking, a valuable skill due to his Quirk. He is surprisingly talented at making sweets. Rikidou''s Quirk Sugar Rush allows him to increase his strength five-fold for three minutes. To activate his Quirk, he needs to consume 10 grams of sugar. When converting sugar into strength, his cognitive functions gradually drop, making him sleepy afterward. For every additional 10 grams of sugar he ingests, he extends the time of increased strength by another three minutes.', '/uploads/images/c_89902.png'),
(105, 'Yuu Takeyama', '岳山優', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', '__Height:__ 162 cm (5''4") (Normal form); 2062cm (67''8") (Transformed) __Quirk:__ Gigantification __Occupation:__ Pro Hero Pro Hero. Her Quirk allows her to grow to a gigantic size. She cannot variate between her base-height and the gigantified height achieved via her Quirk, making her only able to be either her normal height of 162cm (5 feet 4 inches) or her enlarged height of 2,062cm (67 feet 8 inches) tall.', '/uploads/images/c_121529.png'),
(105, 'Sirius', 'シリウス', '配角', 'Ami Koshimizu', 'Sirius is a pro hero and sidekick of Selkie.', '/uploads/images/c_122560.jpg'),
(105, 'Neito Monoma', '物間寧人', '配角', 'Kouhei Amasaki', '__Height:__ 170cm __Quirk:__ Copy Student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School. Neito has a rather complex personality since it differs depending on who he is addressing; he is particularly mocking, loud, and sarcastic with Class 1-A, but outside of these interactions, he is a calm, kind, and intelligent person. He envies Class 1-A with a passion over how they became the center of attention among U.A.''s first years because of the U.S.J. Incident. Truthfully, he only wants his class to stand out as they do, and he vents this feeling by throwing countless taunts towards his rivals, gloating over Class 1-B''s successes and disparaging 1-A for their failures. Neito''s Quirk is Copy, which allows him to duplicate and use another person''s Quirk after coming into physical contact with the user. He can hold four Quirks simultaneously and maintain copied powers for ten minutes. After the time limit runs out, he loses the copied Quirk until he once again touches the original user.', '/uploads/images/c_125450.png'),
(105, 'Himiko Toga', '渡我被身子', '配角', 'Misato Fukuen', '__Height:__ 157 cm __Quirk:__ Transform Himiko Toga is a villain affiliated with the League of Villains and part of its Vanguard Action Squad. She originally joined the group as a means to get closer to [Stain](https://anilist.co/character/126067). Himiko is a very cheerful girl, to the point of smiling even after having presumably killed someone, displaying apparent sadistic tendencies. She has a very twisted perception of love and friendship Himiko''s Quirk Transform grants her the ability to transform into a physical lookalike of another individual, as well as copy their voice. She can only transform into people whose blood she has ingested. The more blood she drinks, the longer she has access to that person''s form. For example, 1 cup of blood allows her to transform for a total of 18 hours. She can even switch between the appearances of multiple people if she drinks the blood of more than one person.', '/uploads/images/c_125619.png'),
(105, 'All For One', 'オール・フォー・ワン', '配角', 'Akio Ootsuka', '__Quirk:__ All For One __Occupation:__ Villain __Fighting Style:__ Close Range and Long Range All For One is the true leader and benefactor of the League of Villains. Once Japan''s most powerful villain and All Might''s arch-nemesis, his true motives are unclear and his true identity unknown. His current goal is to raise Shigaraki to become his eventual successor.', '/uploads/images/c_125956.jpg'),
(105, 'Itsuka Kendou', '拳藤一佳', '配角', 'Saki Ogasawara', '__Height:__ 166 cm (5''5") __Quirk:__ Big Fist Class representative of Class 1-B at U.A. High School, Itsuka is a spirited girl who is thoughtful of others. She does not hesitate to criticize even her classmates if she feels what they are doing is not correct. Due to Itsuka''s cheerful personality, she can bring all of Class 1-B together, thus making her the "big sister" of Class 1-B. Itsuka''s Quirk Big Fist grants her the ability to enlarge both of her hands to a gigantic size. With the increased size comes enhanced striking power and gripping capabilities.', '/uploads/images/c_126064.png'),
(105, 'Chizome Akaguro', '赤黒血染', '配角', 'Gou Inoue', '__Height:__ 182 cm (6''0) __Quirk:__ Bloodcurdle Villain and former vigilante that was notorious for having killed many Pro Heroes. He attacks and kills heroes who he believes do not fit his definition of a "true hero." Chizome is a cruel, unforgiving, and merciless man with a sense of duty to cleanse society of false heroes. He believes that those who become Heroes for fame or money are unworthy of being called the name and only [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224/Yagi-Toshinori) is a true hero. Due to his strong ideology, he took it upon himself to become the Hero Killer: Stain to stain his own hands with blood to purge fake heroes and change the current society. Despite his extremist views and beliefs, Stain did have genuine ideals about heroism, which he stood by firmly. He did not hesitate to save people he deemed worthy of being called Heroes, did not like killing without reason, and would even give advice to his enemies. Stain acknowledged that what he did was morally wrong but believed that for society to be put on the right path, someone must be what he was, suggesting that he saw himself as a martyr. Stain''s Quirk "Bloodcurdle" allows him to paralyze his target upon tasting a sample of their blood. The amount of time a victim remains paralyzed depends on their blood type; in ascending order from shortest to longest duration, they are: O, A, AB, and B. The maximum amount of time that anyone can be paralyzed is eight minutes. _In My Hero Academia: Vigilantes', '/uploads/images/c_126067.png'),
(105, 'Enji Todoroki', '轟炎司', '配角', 'Tetsu Inada', '__Height:__ 195 cm (6'' 4¾") __Occupation:__ Pro Hero __Quirk:__ Hellflame Endeavor is a tall man with a muscular physique. He has short and spiky, red hair with bright blue eyes. His beard and mustache appear to be made of fire, but when he turns off his flames on his face voluntarily, his stubble shows. ~!His desire to surpass the number one hero has driven him in family matters. Enji put [Shouto](https://anilist.co/character/89220/Todoroki-Shouto) through ruthless "training" which caused Shouto a severe degree of physical and emotional pain. Shouto, harboring a bitter hatred towards his father on account of this, refuses to use his fire powers in battles until [Izuku Midoriya](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku) reminded him of his mother''s encouragement. Later, Enji understood his mistakes and told his son he would try to be a better hero and father. He hopes for Shouto and the rest his family to forgive him in the future.!~ ~!He''s the former No.2 Hero, but later becomes the new No.1 Hero after [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224/Yagi-Toshinori) loses his Quirk!~', '/uploads/images/c_126158.png'),
(105, 'Dabi', '荼毘', '配角', 'Hiro Shimono', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9¼") __Quirk:__ Blueflame Dabi is a villain affiliated with the League of Villains and a member of the organization''s Vanguard Action Squad. Dabi is a stoic, aloof, confident, and focused individual who rarely shows emotion. While rather crude and violent, he''s also shown to be quite cautious. Overall, Dabi is a highly enigmatic individual who trusts no one, preferring to do things alone and in his way. He also gives off the impression of knowing more about certain people than he lets on. Dabi''s Quirk grants him the ability to generate and control highly destructive blue flames from his body. He has very well-developed control of his flames and can project them far from himself and in large amounts. However, Dabi''s body has a low tolerance for his flame, and he will get burned if he uses them for prolonged periods. ~!It is later revealed that Dabi is Touya Todoroki (轟燈矢), the eldest son of the Pro Hero [Endeavor](https://anilist.co/character/126158/Todoroki-Enji) and his wife [Rei](https://anilist.co/character/150628/Todoroki-Rei), and the older brother to [Shouto Todoroki](https://anilist.co/character/89220/Todoroki-Shouto). For a significant period of time, his whereabouts were unknown.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126378.png'),
(105, 'Yuuga Aoyama', '青山優雅', '配角', 'Kousuke Kuwano', '**Height:** 168 cm (5''6") **Quirk:** Navel Lazer Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Yuuga appears to be vain and prideful, thinking of himself as superior to the rest of his classmates, especially regarding his Quirk. He exhibits flamboyant mannerisms, is fond of posing, and likes to grab the attention of those around him despite frequently getting ignored by his peers. He also plays up his French heritage, occasionally implementing French words into his sentences. Yuuga''s Quirk allows him to shoot a powerful sparkling laser cannon from his navel. It is so powerful, it can blast through two meters of solid concrete. If he fires the laser for more than 1 second at a time, he will suffer intestinal distress.', '/uploads/images/c_127042.png'),
(105, 'Tetsutetsu Tetsutetsu', '鉄哲徹鐵', '配角', 'Kouji Okino', '__Height:__ 174cm (5''9") __Quirk:__ Steel Student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School. Tetsutetsu is defined by his very hotheaded and outspoken personality. He is confident, stubborn, and straightforward in his motivations and actions. He tends to be very vocal about his intentions and has a one-track mind, often looking for the simplest solution to problems to solve them most directly. Tetsutetsu''s direct personality shows through his tenacious and upfront fighting style during battles. Tetsutetsu''s Quirk allows him to turn his body into steel. This power grants Tetsutetsu both augmented defensive abilities to withstand attacks and the increased strength of his unarmed physical attacks.', '/uploads/images/c_127043.png'),
(105, 'Hizashi Yamada', '山田ひざし', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', '__Height:__ 185cm (6''1") __Quirk:__ Voice Pro Hero. He also works as an English teacher at U.A. High School and as a radio talk show host. Yamada maintains the eccentric persona of a radio host. He often poses when he talks and maintains a certain level of excitement or volume, regardless of the situation. Though he tends to be a jovial individual, Hizashi is capable of great rage when it comes to his friends and colleagues. Yamada''s Quirk "Voice" allows him to increase the volume of his voice, giving him an ability that is similar to a sonic scream. The sound from his Quirk is strong enough to cause people''s ears to bleed from far away. The only known weakness of this Quirk is that the loud sounds do not travel well underground, making this Quirk ineffective against anything that is underground or separated from him by layers of earth.', '/uploads/images/c_127425.png'),
(105, 'Ibara Shiozaki', '塩崎茨', '配角', 'Miho Masaka', '__Height:__ 167cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Vine Student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School. Ibara is a very modest and courteous person. Although graceful and soft-spoken, she is not afraid to make her pure intentions known. She seems highly religious due to her talking about heaven and divine beings in passing on multiple occasions, and her ultimate moves having somewhat religious names such as "Faith''s Shield" and "Crucifixion". Ibara''s Quirk "Vine (ツル, Tsuru) gives her hair-like vines that grow on her head. She can lengthen and manipulate the vines, allowing her to attack, defend and grapple. She also can detach them at will. The vines will grow back, provided her head receives proper sunlight and water. (Source: MyHero Academia Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_127426.png'),
(105, 'Nemuri Kayama', '香山睡', '配角', 'Akeno Watanabe', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") __Quirk:__ Somnambulist Pro Hero. She also works as a Modern Hero Art History teacher at U.A. High School. Nemuri is a very playful and flirtatious person with an unpredictably serious and temperamental side to her. She gets angry whenever someone interrupts her or insults her. She is especially sensitive about her age. Despite her flirtatious personality, Nemuri was intelligent, perceptive, and articulate. While she comes off as a hero who enjoys her fame derived from her beauty and sex appeal, Nemuri has demonstrated true heroism and bravery, willing to fight on the front lines and put her life at risk for others. Nemuri''s Quirk "Somnambulist" allows her to put nearby people to sleep by exuding a sleep-inducing aroma from her body. Her Quirk works better on males than females.', '/uploads/images/c_127427.png'),
(105, 'Sorahiko Torino', '酉野空彦', '配角', 'Kenichi Ogata', '__Height:__ 128 cm (4''2") __Affiliation:__ Yuuei (Retired) __Quirk:__ Jet A retired hero who is one of All Might''s colleagues and his former homeroom teacher. He was the one who taught All Might to control One For All during the his early days, and his training was so intense that All Might fears him to the point he subconsciously tried to forget about him until Grantorino sent his recommendation for Izuku to help him improve One For All, becoming his work place mentor. His Quirk is "Jet," allowing him to take in air through the sole of his foot to allow him to jump higher. (Source: Wikipedia)', '/uploads/images/c_127428.jpg'),
(105, 'Tensei Iida', '飯田天睛', '配角', 'Masamichi Kitada', '__Quirk:__ Engine Tensei Iida, also known as Turbo Hero "Ingenium", is the older brother of Tenya Iida and a former Pro Hero. Outside of his hero armor Tensei looks much like his younger brother Tenya, with square features and short black spiked hair. A differing feature is that he possesses arrow-shaped eyebrows and has a slightly longer face. Similar to his brother, he has engine exhausts protruding from his body, but out of the ends of his elbows instead of his calves. **Also in Illegals:** Tensei meets with Koichi during an early morning run. Tensei is impressed with Koichi''s Quirk and offers him a place in his agency, even expressing a desire for a sidekick with a fast mobility quirk. Later, when Tensei discovers Koichi has been working as a vigilante hero, he withdraws his offer to Koichi, but only because he believes him to be already in the right place.', '/uploads/images/c_129757.png'),
(105, 'Shinji Nishiya', '西屋森児', '配角', 'Masamichi Kitada', '__Height:__ 168 cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Arbor Pro Hero. Underneath his helmet, he has puffy red leaf-like hair, though his face has remained unseen since he has only been shown while wearing his mask. Shinji is a very serious and focused person when it comes to being a hero in his hero duties; however, he easily feels down when someone takes his glory or credit. Shinji''s Quirk "Arbor" (樹木, Jumoku) allows him to enlarge and control his wooden body parts into strong tree branches. These branches are excellent for binding.', '/uploads/images/c_129758.png'),
(105, 'Natsuo Todoroki', '轟夏雄', '配角', 'Yuuki Shin', '__Height:__ 181 cm Natsuo Todoroki is a college student. He is the son of [Enji](https://anilist.co/character/126158/Todoroki-Enji) and [Rei Todoroki](https://anilist.co/character/150628/Todoroki-Rei), the younger brother of Toya and [Fuyumi](https://anilist.co/character/150627/Todoroki-Fuyumi), and the older brother of [Shoto](https://anilist.co/character/89220/Todoroki-Shouto). Natsuo is a young man of average height, sporting white spiky hair with two small pieces of hair hanging down by his forehead. He greatly resembles his father at his age. Natsuo seems to be a care-free individual, as seen in his interactions with him and his family. However, he can be serious, and cares deeply for his family, except his father who he resents for his abusive treatment to his family. He does not feel forgiving to his father, blaming him for his mother Rei''s hospitalization and Shoto''s suffering.', '/uploads/images/c_129759.png'),
(105, 'Naomasa Tsukauchi', '塚内直正', '配角', 'Tokuyoshi Kawashima', 'Naomasa Tsukauchi is a police detective in the Police Force. Naomasa is a tall man with short black hair and black eyes. As a member of the police force, he is normally seen in his uniform. He wears a signature tan overcoat and a matching hat. He also sports a black suit underneath with matching slacks and dress shoes. Detective Tsukauchi is an earnest, hardworking individual who has earned the right to be a close friend of All Might. Enough so, that he was even entrusted with the truth about One For All and the latter''s true form. He appears to have a close relationship with All Might, as he even leaked sensitive information to the hero just because he felt it was the right thing to do.', '/uploads/images/c_129762.png'),
(105, 'Inko Midoriya', '绿谷引子', '配角', 'Aya Kawakami', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3'''') Izuku Midoriya''s mother. Her quirk allows her to pull small objects towards her.', '/uploads/images/c_136897.png'),
(105, 'Kurogiri', '黒霧', '配角', 'Takahiro Fujiwara', '__Affiliation:__ League of Villains __Quirk:__ Warp Gate Kurogiri has a level-headed personality, which often serves to ground Tomura Shigaraki''s immaturity. He is intensely loyal to both All For One and Tomura. He is very polite and well-spoken, even to enemies. ~! Kurogiri is actually an intelligent Nomu made from the corpse of Eraserhead and President Mics high school friend Oboro Shirakumo made to serve Tomura Shigaraki. Although he remains unaware of his previous identity after Eraserheads efforts to talk to him it’s shown that a small part of Oboro is still in Kurogiri!~', '/uploads/images/c_137506.jpg'),
(105, 'Giran', '義爛', '配角', 'Seirou Ogino', 'Giran is a B-rank villain and broker in affiliation with the League of Villains, working to scout new recruits for their organization', '/uploads/images/c_141749.jpg'),
(105, 'Emi Fukukado', '福門笑', '配角', 'Mariko Nagai', '__Height:__ 5''5 __Quirk:__ Outburst Pro Hero and a teacher of 2nd year, Class 2 at Ketsubutsu Academy High School.', '/uploads/images/c_142169.png'),
(105, 'Togaru Kamakiri', '鎌切尖', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 158 cm (6''2") __Quirk:__ Razor Sharp __Affiliation:__ Yuuei __Occupation:__ Student Togaru Kamakiri is a student in Class 1-B at U.A.', '/uploads/images/c_143274.png'),
(105, 'Shinya Kamihara', '紙原伸也', '配角', 'Kenta Kamakari', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Quirk:__ Foldabody: Shinya''s Quirk allows him to make his body and limbs extremely thin and long, effectively allowing him to transform himself into a razor sharp string. He is able to transform faster than the speed of sound. Shinya is a calm and focused individual, who is able to maintain a level head even when in a crisis situation, and encourages his teammates when they begin to panic. He is proven to be quite intelligent and is good at analyzing situations and strategy. He is the former Number 5 Pro-Hero, and is currently Number 4.', '/uploads/images/c_143275.png'),
(105, 'Tsunagu Hakamada', '袴田維', '配角', 'Hikaru Midorikawa', '__Height:__ 190cm (6''3") __Quirk:__ Fiber Master Pro Hero, ranked in the top 4. He is the recipient of the "Best Jeanist" award for eight consecutive years. Tsunagu is an elegant man with flamboyant tendencies. He believes very strongly that people with influence must maintain a positive appearance both physically and socially. Tsunagu often uses metaphors referencing jeans, denim, and various other sewing and fabric-based phrases, often inspiring his recruits with speeches, telling them to keep their life straight like their jeans. Tsunagu takes the role of being a hero very seriously. He is selfless, brave, and charismatic, and he aims to spread a sense of a peace to all people, no matter how dire the situation. Tsunagu''s Quirk "Fiber Master (ファイバーマスター)" allows him to freely manipulate the threads in any nearby piece of fabric. He has power over all types of cloth, but his Quirk works best with denim and is less effective on sweats. Fiber Master also works on other types of fiber not related to fabric, such as carbon fibers. He primarily uses this power to restrain his targets, either by using their own clothing against them, or simply unravels portions of his own clothing into strings.', '/uploads/images/c_143536.png'),
(105, 'Nezu', '根津', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Takato', '__Height:__ 85 cm __Quirk:__ High Spec Nezu, also known as Mr. Principal is a Pro Hero and the principal of U.A. High School. He is an extremely rare case of an animal who manifested a Quirk. He can be very long-winded at times when explaining or educating.', '/uploads/images/c_143539.png'),
(105, 'Gigantomachia', 'ギガントマキア', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Mamiya', 'Gigantomachia is a villain associated with the League of Villains.[1] He is one of All For One''s faithful servants and his former bodyguard, cultivated to be of use to Tomura Shigaraki if anything were to happen to him.', '/uploads/images/c_143540.png'),
(105, 'Thirteen', 'スペースヒーロ・13号 ', '配角', 'Inuko Inuyama', 'Thirteen is a wise, well-mannered person. As a rescue hero, Thirteen has displayed how passionate they are about saving people through their teachings. They even developed their own training facility - the Unforeseen Simulation Joint - to train future heroes in search and rescue tactics. They are very passionate about Quirks, specifically on the topic of using Quirks for creation and assistance rather than for destruction and battle. Thirteen has also been shown to be very brave. Despite not being a combat type, they do not hesitate to use their Quirk to fight against villains in the name of protecting others', '/uploads/images/c_143542.png'),
(105, 'Pony  Tsunotori', '角取ポニー', '配角', 'Kaede Hondo', '__Quirk:__ Horn Cannon Pony is a timid girl. As a foreigner, she does not have much knowledge of the language in Japan. She is shown to be rather naive and innocent in personality, learning nasty phrases from Neito Monoma without realizing what those words mean, as shown when Neito tells Pony unkind phrases to tell Class 1-A. Pony is a thoughtful and diligent person. She is the one who made her team not lose against Class 1-A because of her strategy and perseverance. She is highly observant and seems to be a careful person. Despite this, she made some unkind comments towards Mezo Shoji in their battle, calling him an "octopus" and saying she doesn''t like looking at him. Pony''s Quirk allows her to send her horns flying and remotely control them at will. She is able to control up to four horns that are sent flying. She has also been shown to be able to balance on them as they carry her around, much like Hawks'' wings. When Pony gets angry, she starts speaking in her native language: English.', '/uploads/images/c_145387.png'),
(105, 'Ryou Inui', '犬井猟', '配角', '', 'Ryo Inui is a Pro Hero and serves as the Lifestyle Guidance Counselor at U.A. High School.', '/uploads/images/c_149178.png'),
(105, 'Setsuna Tokage', '取蔭切奈', '配角', 'Hitomi Nabatame', 'Setsuna Tokage is a student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School, and is one of four students admitted through recommendations; one being her fellow 1-B classmate Juzo Honenuki, as well as rival Class 1-A students Shoto Todoroki and Momo Yaoyorozu.', '/uploads/images/c_149179.png'),
(105, 'Kinoko  Komori', '小森希乃子', '配角', 'Kei Shindou', 'Kinoko Komori is a student in Class 1-B, and is training to be a Pro Hero. Her quirk, Mushroom, allows her to spread spores that sprout mushrooms wherever they land, including inside of people''s bodies.', '/uploads/images/c_149180.png'),
(105, 'Yui Kodai', '小大唯', '配角', 'Yurianne Eve', 'Yui Kodai is a student in Class 1-B of U.A. High School. She is a quiet girl, but nevertheless cares about her fellow classmates.', '/uploads/images/c_149182.png'),
(105, 'Juzo Honenuki', '骨抜柔造', '配角', 'Masamichi Kitada', '__Height:__ 174 cm (5''8½") __Affiliation:__ U.A High __Quirk:__ Softening Juzo Honenuki is a student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School, and is one of four students admitted through recommendations; one being his fellow 1-B classmate [Setsuna Tokage](https://anilist.co/character/149179/Tokage-Setsuna), the others being rival 1-A students [Shoto Todoroki](https://anilist.co/character/89220/Todoroki-Shouto) and [Momo Yaoyorozu](https://anilist.co/character/89241/Yaoyorozu-Momo). Juzo''s Quirk allows him to soften any non-living thing he touches. For example, he can soften the ground to make it similar to quicksand, hindering movements and mobility. If Juzo makes contact again, he can undo the effect. He is also capable of swimming through softened material.', '/uploads/images/c_149183.png'),
(105, 'Desutegoro', 'デステゴロ', '配角', 'Shinnosuke Ogami ', 'Death Arms is a Pro Hero. He took part in the fight against the Sludge Villain, and later witnessed the U.A. Sports Festival from outside the arena, along with Mt. Lady and Kamui Woods.', '/uploads/images/c_149187.png'),
(105, 'Ken Ishiyama', '石山堅', '配角', 'Kenta Ookuma', 'Cementoss is a Pro Hero as well as a teacher at U.A. High School. During the U.A. Sports Festival, he acted as the proctor for the 1-on-1 fights in case things got out of hand. He also faced off against Eijiro Kirishima and Rikido Sato in their Final Exam.', '/uploads/images/c_149188.jpg'),
(105, 'Fuyumi Todoroki', '轟冬美', '配角', 'Kei Shindou', 'The only daughter of Eiji and Rei. Fuyumi is the younger sister of Touya and the older sister of Natsuo and Shouto. Fuyumi is a hard working girl, often making meals for the family and works as a teacher at an unnamed school. Unlike her family members, she doesn''t resent her father and just wishes they could all be a happy family, though she realizes such a thing is unlikely. Upon hearing Shouto gains friends, however, Fuyumi gets quite excited over it and is happy for him. In the past, Fuyumi took care of Shouto after their mother went to a hospital and never came back. To this day, her wish that she could have done something for Shouto still lingers within her.', '/uploads/images/c_150627.png'),
(105, 'Rei Todoroki', '轟冷', '配角', 'Michiko Neya', 'The damaged mother of the Todoroki family. Rei has an ice related quirk, which is believed to be powerful, as Eiji would not have had kids with her otherwise. In the past, Rei was very supportive towards Shouto and his dreams to become like All Might. She used to always say that his blood does not define him for him and for herself. Rei, who was once a kind and caring woman, is now in a mental ward. After all the abuse she faced from Eiji, she began to become mentally unstable. Over time, she had slowly began to snap, until she finally poured boiling water onto Shouto''s left side after seeing it. Immediately after burning Shouto, Rei began to apologize and attempt to comfort him when she realized what she had done. Due to her snapping, she was placed into a mental ward for her own safety. Even though Rei is in a mental ward, she has since returned to her former self. When Shouto visited, she was immensely happy and apologized for what she had done to him. Fuyumi and Natsuo also visit her as well, though she has yet to meet Eiji face to face again out of fear.', '/uploads/images/c_150628.png'),
(105, 'Ectoplasm', 'エクトプラズム', '配角', 'Masakazu Nishida', '__Height:__ 180 cm (5'' 11") __Affiliation:__ Yuuei __Quirk:__ Clones Ectoplasm has the ability to produce ectoplasm from his mouth and transform it into clones of himself. He can create up to thirty clones at once, and push his limit to thirty-six if he''s feeling good. He can also produce a giant clone of himself, although this sacrifices his ability to produce normal-sized ones for the time being. His clones can be defeated with a strong blow, but otherwise, only Ectoplasm can dispel them.', '/uploads/images/c_150853.jpg'),
(105, 'Chiyo  Shuuzenji', '修善寺治与', '配角', 'Etsuko Kozakura', '__Quirk:__ Heal __Occupation:__ Pro Hero, Nurse Chiyo has a very kind and compassionate personality, where she treats everyone kindly, though she does have a strict and reproaching attitude towards those that have done something foolish. She''s mostly like this with All Might for not teaching Izuku how to use his Quirk properly or with Izuku for using his Quirk recklessly.', '/uploads/images/c_157655.jpg'),
(105, 'Sen Kaibara', '回原旋', '配角', 'Tomoaki Maeno', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5''7½") __Quirk:__ Gyrate Kaibara Sen is a student from 1-B. His quirk "Gyrate" allows Kaibara to rotate any part of his body.', '/uploads/images/c_164355.png'),
(105, 'Gunhead', 'ガンヘッド ', '配角', 'Kouji Okino', 'Gunhead is a pro hero. We meet him when Ochaco Uraraka does an internship at the Battle Hero''s Office. Gunhead is a very professional individual whose kindness and friendliness makes him a great teacher. Despite his outward appearance he has cute tendencies such as posing cutely.', '/uploads/images/c_188796.png'),
(105, 'Snipe', 'スナイプ', '配角', 'Tooru Nara', '__Quirk:__ Homing Snipe is a Pro Hero and a member of the teaching staff at U.A. High School. Snipe has the appearance of a stereotypical western cowboy Snipe''s Quirk allows him to lock on to any target he can see within six hundred meters and make any projectile he releases chase after said target', '/uploads/images/c_191596.jpg'),
(105, 'Higari Maijima', '埋島干狩', '配角', 'You Kitazawa', 'Higari Maijima, also known as the Excavation Hero: Power Loader, is a Pro Hero and faculty member at U.A. High School.', '/uploads/images/c_191597.png'),
(105, 'Sekijiro Kan', '管赤慈郎', '配角', 'Shuuhei Matsuda', 'Sekijiro Kan, also known by his hero name, Blood Hero: Vlad King, is a Pro Hero and the homeroom teacher of U.A. High School''s Class 1-B.', '/uploads/images/c_191598.jpg'),
(105, 'Shihai Kuroiro', '黒色支配', '配角', 'Kouhei Amasaki', 'Shihai is a sly, deceitful schemer, who prefers to catch people off guard. He appears to enjoy dark concepts and has a penchant for dramatic speech', '/uploads/images/c_208141.jpg'),
(105, 'Juurouta Shishida', '宍田獣郎太', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', 'Juurouta seems to be an intellectual as he uses a fairly verbose way of speaking and often addresses others by respectful titles such as ''sir'' and ''miss''. This is because he was brought up in a very well mannered and doting family. While transformed, however Juurouta is rather boisterous and energetic, which is likely a side effect of his Quirk.', '/uploads/images/c_208142.jpg'),
(105, 'Nirengeki Shoda', '庄田連撃', '配角', '', 'Nirengeki has a very humble attitude, as he will not take credit for something he does not feel he earned by his own strength.', '/uploads/images/c_208143.jpg'),
(105, 'Kousei Tsuburaba', '円場硬成', '配角', 'Jun Fukuyama', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Affiliation:__ U.A High __Quirk:__ Solid Air Kousei is a very enthusiastic and competitive individual who holds himself to a high standard as he makes an effort to avoid descending to the level of his rivals.', '/uploads/images/c_208145.png'),
(105, 'Manga Fukidashi', '吹出漫我', '配角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', 'Manga appears to be an expressive and dramatic person. He is a regular man with a white speech bubble head that can change shape and display his thoughts in written form.', '/uploads/images/c_208146.jpg'),
(105, 'Yosetsu Awase', '泡瀬洋雪', '配角', '', 'Although he is not as social as some others, Yosetsu is foul-mouthed and tense, except for serious or life-or-death situations, in which he becomes very easily startled and much more talkative, although he retains his harsh way of speech.', '/uploads/images/c_208147.jpg'),
(105, 'Hiryu Rin', '鱗飛竜', '配角', 'Kousuke Kuwano', '**Height:** 170 cm (5''7") __Quirk:__ Scales He is a Class 1-B student in U.A. High School, training to become a Pro Hero. It''s notable that Hiryu possesses a serious demeanor when it comes to playing out his abilities into action. He is rather diligent in terms of academic abilities and Quirk functions as well. Hiryu has shown to be a very competent combatant, with a great handle on the applications of his Quirk. Thanks to the versatile nature of his Scales Quirk, Hiryu excels in both close and long-range combat, effectively switching between hand-to-hand combat, and shooting off his scales when it’s most convenient to him.', '/uploads/images/c_208148.png'),
(105, 'Reiko Yanagi', '柳レイ子', '配角', 'Ayane Sakura', 'Reiko is a quiet and emotionless teenager who often shows an odd body posture.', '/uploads/images/c_208149.jpg'),
(105, 'Kojiro Bondo', '凡戸固次郎', '配角', 'Hiroshi Kamiya', 'An easy going guy and described as a gentle giant.', '/uploads/images/c_208150.jpg'),
(105, 'Selkie', 'セルキー', '配角', 'Tomokazu Seki', 'Can do pretty much everything a spotted seal can do. He can even make sonar-like sound and use the echo to determine his opponent''s position. He is also very strong even if he believes that he can make a very cute seal face (which most people think is not).', '/uploads/images/c_210090.jpg'),
(105, 'Masaki Mizushima', '水島正規', '配角', 'Kenta Ookuma', '__Height:__ 176 cm __Occupation:__ Pro Hero Masaki Mizushima, also known as Normal Hero: Manuais, is the current No. 222 Pro Hero. He is based out of Hosu City.', '/uploads/images/c_210091.jpg'),
(105, 'Uwabami', 'ウワバミ', '配角', 'Mai Yamane', 'Uwabami is a Pro Hero.', '/uploads/images/c_210092.jpg'),
(105, 'Innsmouth', 'インスマス', '配角', 'Anri Katsu', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_210093.jpg'),
(105, 'Mitsuki Bakugou', '爆豪光己', '配角', 'Mari Kiyohara', 'Mitsuki Bakugou is Katsuki Bakugou''s mother and the wife of Masaru Bakugou.', '/uploads/images/c_231957.png'),
(105, 'Kenji Tsuragamae', '面構犬嗣', '配角', '', 'Kenji is the Chief of the Police Force.', '/uploads/images/c_239975.png'),
(105, 'Native', 'ネイティブ', '配角', 'KENN', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_239976.png'),
(105, 'Sansa Tamakawa', '玉川三茶', '配角', '', 'Sansa is a member in the Police Force.', '/uploads/images/c_241582.jpg'),
(105, 'Fuutou Nahashira', '永白風統', '配角', '', 'Student in U.A. High School''s Business Course. Strongly influenced by Best Jeanist.', '/uploads/images/c_340707.png'),
(105, 'Josei Kisha', '女性記者', '配角', 'Yuu Shimamura', 'Television news reporter.', '/uploads/images/c_345848.png'),
(106, 'Butagami', '豚神', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', '__Race:__ Human __Occupation:__ Superhero __Abilities:__ Superhuman Physical Prowess, Inhuman Digestive System, Elasticity __Level:__ S-Class: Rank 10 __Personality:__ Pig God is a glutton and is constantly eating food. He is also very direct, or simply lazy. However he is a very caring individual and also appears to be very humble, as he usually doesn''t mind helping others or openly embracing other heroes'' advices. He also does not mind paying for people in secret. __Abilities:__ As an S-Class hero, Pig God is very powerful, he has the ability to digest swallowed monsters almost instantly, he also seems to have complete control over his digestive system. Pig God has a thick layer of fat capable of absorbing all types of impact and he is also immune to poison.', '/uploads/images/c_8841.jpg'),
(106, 'Kuseno Hakase', 'クセーノ博士', '配角', 'Kenichi Ogata', 'The doctor responsible for Genos'' repairs and upgrades. He was pursing the cyborg that destroyed Genos'' town. Genos begged for him to make him into a cyborg after promising the destroy the cyborg that destroyed his home.', '/uploads/images/c_13124.jpg'),
(106, 'Saitama', 'サイタマ', '主角', 'Makoto Furukawa', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") Saitama is the main protagonist of One Punch Man, and the most powerful hero alive. Having apparently trained himself to superhuman condition, Saitama faces an existential crisis as he is now too powerful to gain any thrill from his heroic deeds. He is registered with the Heroes Association as a B-Class Superhero and is tasked to defend Z-City against Mysterious Beings. For a superhero, Saitama is rather laid-back. Because even the mightiest foes pose no challenge to him, he doesn''t take his hero work very seriously. In spite of this, he is constantly searching for an opponent that can challenge him, since his superhero work is beginning to bore him because it''s too easy. The combination of his attitude, unstoppable strength, and distinctively simple and ''unimpressive'' appearance often cause his battles to become anticlimactic. Saitama will usually allow his opponents to rant about their motives and power up into their strongest forms before suddenly and nonchalantly obliterating them with one punch.', '/uploads/images/c_73935.jpg'),
(106, 'Genos', 'ジェノス', '主角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 178 cm (5''10") __Debut:__ Chapter 6 / Episode 1 __Race:__ Cyborg __Location:__ Z-City __Abilities:__ Enhancements Physical feats, Full Cyborg Weaponry, Highly Skilled and Strategist Combatant __Weapons:__ Cyborg Body __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ S-Class; Rank 16 (beginning), Rank 14 (current) __Affiliation:__ The Heroes Association A cyborg and a self-proclaimed disciple of [Saitama](https://anilist.co/character/73935). He is always aiming to become stronger and fights for justice. Genos is an extremely serious character. He has a strong motivation to become stronger and is always looking at Saitama as an example of the ultimate hero. Constantly trying to be like him even if it results in reckless fights.', '/uploads/images/c_73979.jpg'),
(106, 'Onsoku no Sonic', '音速のソニック', '配角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 174 cm __Race:__ Human __Location:__ Z-City __Abilities:__ Superhuman Speed and Agility __Weapons:__ Ninja equipment __Occupation:__ Bodyguard (former, now a villain) __Affiliation:__ Mr. Monier (former) Sonic is a villain in the series, first appearing as a bodyguard hired by Mr. Monier. He views [Saitama](https://anilist.co/character/73935/Saitama) as his eternal rival. Sonic is a villain who, despite his normally calm appearance, loves fighting strong opponents as shown by when he gets a "child-like smile" on his face when he first meets Saitama and has two of his attacks blocked, earlier calling this his "bad habit." He seems to be very quick to act as he attacks Saitama on their first meeting without letting him explain the situation.', '/uploads/images/c_74167.png'),
(106, 'Sneck', 'スネック', '配角', 'Shinichirou Miki', '__Race:__ Human __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ A-Class; Rank: 38 __Affiliation:__ Heroes Association Sneck is an A-Class Superhero, rank 38. He was tasked with welcoming the new heroes for the National Superhero Registry Test that Saitama and Genos were a part of.', '/uploads/images/c_75460.png'),
(106, 'Bang ', 'バング', '配角', 'Kazuhiro Yamaji', '__Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") __Race:__ Human __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ S-Class __Rank:__ 3 __Affiliation:__ Heroes Association Bang is an S-Class, rank 3, superhero for the Heroes Association, settled in Z-City. Bang owns a dojo passed down from generations, and uses the fighting style the Rock-Smashing Water Stream Fist. __Abilities:__ Bang being in the top 3 of the S-Class ranking, he is acknowledged by the public and heroes to be a strong fighter. Not much is known about Bang''s abilities other than that he uses a martial art called "Rock-Smashing Water Stream Fist".', '/uploads/images/c_81141.png'),
(106, 'Tatsumaki', 'タツマキ', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', '__Race:__ Human __Abilities:__ Psychokinesis __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ S-Class; Rank: 2 __Affiliation:__ Heroes Association __Family:__ [Fubuki](https://anilist.co/character/81931/) (sister) Tatsumaki is a petite woman, commonly mistaken for being much younger than she really is. She has an adolescent face with emerald green eyes and green hair that naturally curls up on the ends. She wears a long dress that separates into 4 sections slightly above the hips and low-heeled black shoes. __Personality:__ She has a rather brash, moody, hotheaded, and impatient personality. She is disrespectful towards most people, especially to those she deems incompetent. Despite her arrogant personality, she feels obligated to defeat monsters and considers her job as a hero to be a duty, accepting any of the Hero Association''s requests to defeat monsters, due to the fact that she tends to get bored when she is not fighting monsters. She also seeks them to fight in her own time. She has a bit of a soft side towards her little sister Fubuki, but she is also very overprotective. __Abilities:__ As the most powerful esper in One-Punch Man and one of the most powerful heroes, Tatsumaki possesses extreme skill in wielding her psychic abilities, whether it be for offense, defense, or miscellaneous uses. Tatsumaki''s knowledge about psychic powers is also as vast as her skill in wielding them, which is enough to lift an entire city. She''s also called as the Association''s ultimate weapon.', '/uploads/images/c_81929.png'),
(106, 'Fubuki', 'フブキ', '配角', 'Saori Hayami', '__Race:__ Human __Occupation:__ Superhero __Height:__ 167 cm (5''5¾") __Level:__ B-Class Rank 1 __Affiliation:__ Hero Association __Family:__ Tatsumaki (sister) __Abilities:__ Psychokinesis Fubuki, also known by her hero alias Blizzard of Hell, is the B-Class Rank 1 professional hero of the Hero Association. She is an esper, the younger sister of Tatsumaki, and the leader of the Blizzard Group, a B-Class hero faction. She and her sister are known as the Psychic Sisters. Fubuki is currently trying to recruit [Saitama](https://anilist.co/character/73935/Saitama) into her group. She''s also a self-declared member of the Saitama Group.', '/uploads/images/c_81931.png'),
(106, 'Bofoi', 'ボフォイ', '配角', 'Tesshou Genda', '__Race:__ Human __Alias:__ Metal Knight __Location:__ Z-City __Abilities:__ Weapons; Large remotely controlled robot, with lots of firepower __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ S-Class; Rank: 6 __Affiliation:__ The Heroes Association S-Class Rank 6 of the Hero Association. Besides fighting, Bofoi also provides many services for the Hero Association, such as weaponry sponsorships and facility construction.', '/uploads/images/c_81933.jpg'),
(106, 'Satoru', 'サトル', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Race:__ Human __Location:__ Z-City __Weapons:__ Gauntlets __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ C-Class; Rank: 1 __Affiliation:__ Heroes Association License-less Rider is a C-Class Hero from Z-City. He has the #1 rank of the C-Class.', '/uploads/images/c_81935.png'),
(106, 'Tanktop Tiger', 'タンクトップタイガー ', '配角', 'Hiromu Miyazaki', '**Race:** Human **Occupation:** Superhero **Level:** C-Class; Rank: 6 **Affiliation:** The Heroes Association Tanktop Tiger (タンクトップタイガー Tankutopu Taiga) is a C-Class superhero, rank 6, and the younger brother of Tanktop Black Hole. __Appearance:__ Tanktop Tiger is a large, muscular man who has tiger stripes running through his hair and eyebrows. He wears a tiger stripped tanktop. Tanktop Tiger is especially loud and obnoxious. He is confident in his own power and looks down upon superhero newbies, making him quite arrogant and hostile.', '/uploads/images/c_81939.jpg'),
(106, 'Tanktop Black Hole', 'タンクトップブラックホール', '配角', 'Atsushi Imaruoka', '__Race:__ Human __Alias:__ Tanktop Black Hole __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ B-Class __Affiliation:__ The Heroes Association __Partner:__ Tanktop Tiger Tanktop Black Hole is a B-Class hero and the older brother of Tanktop Tiger. Tanktop Black Hole is a large, well-built man with short black hair. He wears a very simple costume of pants and a black tanktop. He has a rather confident and stubborn personality. He refuses to believe a C-Class hero could ever be capable of destroying the meteor. He is also a rather charismatic person, shown by his ability to bend a crowd to his will.', '/uploads/images/c_81941.jpg'),
(106, 'Ougon Ball', '黄金ボール', '配角', 'Souta Arai', '__Race:__ Human __Weapons:__ Slingshot __Abilities:__ Shape Memory Gold __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ A-Class; Rank: 29 __Affiliation:__ Heroes Association Golden Ball is an A-Class Superhero, rank 29. He was partnered with Spring Mustache to investigate the Kombu Infinity rumor in Z-City. He is a rather confident man, who believes he does not need to prepare for a fight.', '/uploads/images/c_81943.jpg'),
(106, 'Armored Gorilla', 'アーマードゴリラ', '配角', 'Shouta Yamamoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_85983.jpg'),
(106, 'Banken Man', '番犬マン', '配角', 'Yuuji Ueda', 'Watchdog Man (番犬マン Banken-man) is a S-Class Rank 12 professional hero who is in charge of Q-City. Watchdog Man has been shown to be very blunt and nonchalant. He acts like a dog at all times, speaking sparingly, sitting on his haunches while alert or loitering, and curling up in a dog bed while asleep. He takes a stance on all fours while fighting, rather than standing upright to confront enemies.', '/uploads/images/c_86027.png'),
(106, 'Puri-Puri Prisoner', 'ぷりぷりプリズナー', '配角', 'Masaya Onosaka', '__Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ S-Class; Rank 17 Puri-Puri Prisoner is a flamboyant, openly homosexual superhero. He takes an interest in other, up-and-coming heroes and criminals; an interest which led to his titular jail sentence, as he kept attacking them. Criminals that he apprehends are then added to his harem.', '/uploads/images/c_86029.png'),
(106, 'Ikemen Kamen Amai Mask', 'イケメン仮面アマイマスク', '配角', 'Mamoru Miyano', '__Race:__ Human ~!Mysterious Being (Ugmon)!~ __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ A-Class; Rank 1. Sweet Mask is a tall and lean-built young man with messy, shoulder-length light blue hair and yellow eyes. He is considered to be very handsome by the public. Aside from being a hero he is also a famous model, actor and singer, being the most popular one in the world. Sweet Mask has stated that he believes that heroes are to protect the citizens, and if they can''t do that, they must become strong enough to be able to do so. He also genuinely cares for the well-being of the citizens around him and actually wishes happiness upon every living thing in the universe. However, befitting the darker side of Sweet Mask''s name is his hidden merciless nature. He is shown to have a burning hatred for anything that he sees as evil. Anything that he declares as evil must be swiftly and thoroughly exterminated. Sweet Mask is shown to adhere to any method that makes heroes popular. He notes that only promotions to S-Class or A-Class are fit for his attention, as they are the heroes who draw the most attention from the public, and hence, any heroes in those ranks who earn themselves negative reputations would drag his reputation down as well. Because of this, Sweet Mask stays in the A-Class Rank 1 position to prevent unworthy heroes from promoting to S-Class. Sweet Mask is very narcissistic about "beauty overwhelming the power", as he said about his philosophy that "heroes have to be beautiful a', '/uploads/images/c_86031.png'),
(106, 'Max', 'マックス', '配角', 'Souichirou Hoshi', 'Max (マックス, Makkusu), also known by his hero alias Lightning Max (イナズマックス, Inazumakkusu), is the A-Class Rank 19 professional hero for the Hero Association. Max is shown to think ahead and spy on his target to know how to defeat them but it is shown that he has some doubt in his abilities.', '/uploads/images/c_86035.jpg'),
(106, 'Banehige', 'バネヒゲ', '配角', 'Makoto Yasumura', '__Level:__ A-Class; Rank: 33 Spring Mustachio is an intelligent, serious man who doesn''t back down, as shown by his persistence in fighting Kombu Infinity, even after being beaten up rather badly. He also shares a bond with fellow A-Class hero Golden Ball, as they regularly pair up to hunt monsters and share drinks in their spare time.', '/uploads/images/c_86039.png'),
(106, 'Genji', 'ゲンジ', '配角', 'Gen Satou', '__Height:__ 165cm Genji, also known by his hero alias Lightning Genji, is the A-Class Rank 17 professional hero of the Hero Association.', '/uploads/images/c_86043.jpg'),
(106, 'King', 'キング', '配角', 'Hiroki Yasumoto', '__Race:__ Human __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ S-Class; Rank 7 __Affiliation:__ The Heroes Association Despite not being the highest ranked hero of the Heroes Association, he is considered to be the most powerful man on Earth, and it is due to this strength that he receives praise and respect from fellow heroes. His strength is so feared that criminals and mysterious beings will surrender before having to fight him. Appearance: King has slightly long, blonde, brushed back hair along with three long scars on the left side of his face. He wears a turtleneck sweater, has sunken cheeks, a defined jawline and a squarish chin. Notably, a loud drumming sound may be heard in his proximity. The King Engine is a rumbling sound that others claim occurs when King readies for battle or when he is generally serious having an intimidating effect on his opponents. ~! In actuality, it is simply the sound of King''s heartbeat which, when he is frightened, is so loud that it can be heard outside his body, but because of King''s intimidating reputation people mistake it for bloodlust. King is able to appear to remain calm in threatening situations as well as put out an extremely threatening aura. Despite the intimidating personality King projects, he is actually a coward and an otaku. He has been shown to get very excited about buying a dating game. Saitama saved his life many times, but always end up getting all the credits that was supposed to be for the latter. With this misunderstanding,', '/uploads/images/c_88907.png'),
(106, 'Bad', 'バッド', '配角', 'Wataru Hatano', 'Bad (バッド, Baddo), also known by his hero alias Metal Bat (金属バット, Kinzoku Batto), is the S-Class Rank 15 professional hero for the Hero Association. Metal Bat is a young man with black hair styled in a pompadour, and dark eyes that emphasize his hot temper. Metal Bat has a great deal of confidence in himself, stating that he did not care whether a threat is a Demon or Dragon level. Like [Saitama](https://anilist.co/character/73935/Saitama), he doesn''t care about his rank, and accidentally kills his enemies faster than he intended.', '/uploads/images/c_89156.png'),
(106, 'Garou', 'ガロウ', '主角', 'Hikaru Midorikawa', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''9") Garou is a former disciple of [Bang](https://anilist.co/character/81141), but was kicked out from his dojo for going on a rampage. He''s one of the strongest characters in the series and plays a major role as the main villain in the Hero Hunt arc. Garou is introduced as an evil character with a hatred for heroes and a confident, vindictive personality. He hates being insulted and will attack or kill any who offend him. He thinks highly of himself and uses that assertion to threaten high ranking personal such as heroes and [Shicchi](https://anilist.co/character/137876/Sitch). He does not consider other human villains to be allies, wiping out a large group of them along with the heroes present. He will also attack low ranked hero and hero staff members if he encounters them. A large aspect of his personality seems to be some sort of disdain for his former master, Bang, enough to avoid using the Water Stream Rock Smashing Fist he was taught unless seriously cornered. He has no remorse even for people who aid him, as he smashed [Licenseless Rider](https://anilist.co/character/81935)''s face soon after the latter defended him. Although Garou is an evil character, he possesses some kind of morality: he lets heroes live so that they can grow stronger and fight him again. In some ways, Garou can be considered the opposite to [Saitama](https://anilist.co/character/73935). Where Saitama wanted to be a hero who fought villains from his childhood, Garou wanted to ', '/uploads/images/c_89277.png'),
(106, 'Kuroi Seishi', '黒い精子', '配角', 'Yuuichirou Umehara', 'Black Sperm is an arrogant yet insecure monster. He is very confident in his abilities, shown in his willingness to take on Monster King [Orochi](https://anilist.co/character/126979/Orochi), but he dislikes when other people "look down on him" for his appearance or personality, and if he senses that someone is doing so, he becomes furious. At the same time, he is willing to work with others in order to take on a stronger opponent, shown by his cooperation with the Monster Association.', '/uploads/images/c_126976.png'),
(106, 'Choze', 'チョゼ', '配角', 'Kentarou Tone', 'Choze was a Martial Artist and user of The Fist Of The Pure Blood Master Race. After eating Monster Cells offered by Gouketsu, Choze became a Mysterious Being and a member of the Monster Association.', '/uploads/images/c_126978.png'),
(106, 'Orochi', 'オロチ', '配角', 'Atsushi Ono', '"Monster King" Orochi, also called Lord Orochi, is the leader of the Monster Association.', '/uploads/images/c_126979.png'),
(106, 'Suiryu', 'スイリュー', '配角', 'Masaya Matsukaze', 'Suiryu is a Martial Artist and user of the Void Fist. He is said to be a top contender in the Super Fight tournament. Suiryu is an easygoing and carefree man usually seen smiling and is a notorious playboy, who would rather spend time with women than training. He is also very eager to fight strong opponents and believes the reason for fighting is to live an easy life without worry. During fights, Suiryu holds back in an effort to make any fight more interesting, only using his legs during his fights and later defeating his opponents with one kick. While fighting he tries to make small talk and after he defeats his opponents, he sarcastically apologizes to them for being too strong. Suiryu is a martial arts prodigy. Despite having spent most of his time goofing off or not taking his lessons seriously, he still ultimately became one of the most revered martial artists in the world, considered a legend for winning four Super Fight tournaments in a row.', '/uploads/images/c_132939.png'),
(106, 'Zombieman', 'ゾンビマン', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', '__Race:__ Human-Mutant __Abilities:__ Regeneration __S-Class:__ Rank 8 __Affiliation:__ Hero Association __Personality:__ Zombieman is stated to be nihilistic, possibly due to the fact that he has "died" several times, therefore he is always calm. In addition, he prefers to work as a lone wolf and dislikes gathering, although he still respects common courtesy. However, he appears to have a sadistic side, since he enjoys killings that create rivers of blood, he is also shown to be a rather smart individual, with detective-like thinking. In comparison to the other S-Class heroes, Zombieman is more thoughtful and respectful. __Abilities__: Zombieman possesses one of the best regeneration capabilities in the series. He is able to regenerate any part of his body no matter how severe the injury is, and he was able to heal his broken arms in an instant. He needs only a few minutes to recover from an extremely mutilated state and regrow his left arm, however this regeneration does not give Zombieman full immortality, as he will die if he is reduced to mincemeat. Zombieman has an incredible threshold for extensive physical activity, displaying one of the most impressive feats of stamina in the series and being able to fight for hours on end while his expedient recovery rate handles the more serious of injuries he suffers.', '/uploads/images/c_133835.png'),
(106, 'Isamu', 'イサム', '配角', 'Minami Takayama', '__Height:__ 135cm (4''5") __Race:__ Human __Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ S-Class; Rank: 5 __Affiliation:__ Heroes Association Child Emperor is a young boy with large eyes. He wears a plain T-shirt with two buttons both of which are buttoned, along with a black school bag on his back. As a genius, the Child Emperor values education, which can be seen when he mentions about going to cram school even after hearing about the Earth being in danger. He easily becomes infuriated when being labeled as childish by others. He is very analytical, observing the situation and formulating plans in a calm and collected manner.', '/uploads/images/c_137661.png'),
(106, 'Sitch', 'シッチ', '配角', 'Nobuo Tobita', 'Sitch (シッチ, Shicchi) is the Minister Officer of Justice for the Hero Association.', '/uploads/images/c_137876.jpg'),
(106, 'Matsuge', 'マツゲ', '配角', 'Yoshiaki Hasegawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_137879.png'),
(106, 'Charanko', 'チャランコ', '配角', 'Toshiki Masuda', 'Charanko is a Martial Artist and Bang''s last and only disciple before he was expelled during Garou''s hero hunt.', '/uploads/images/c_138979.jpg'),
(106, 'Kudou Kishi', '駆動騎士', '配角', 'Youji Ueda', 'Drive Knight (駆動騎士, Kudō Kishi) is the S-Class Rank 9 professional hero for the Hero Association.Drive Knight has long black hair and wears a white mask. His mask has a single horizontal slit for the eyes, and a single red shining eye in the center of the slit. The mask has three small vertical slits where his mouth should be. His armor is rather simplistic, being similar to a medieval black knights'' armor.', '/uploads/images/c_138980.png'),
(106, 'Senkou no Flash', '閃光のフラッシュ', '配角', 'Kousuke Toriumi', '__Race__: Human __Age__: 25 __Abilities__: Superhuman Speed and Agility, Master Swordsman, Ninjutsu Master __Occupation__: Superhero __S-Class__: Rank 13 __Personality__: Flashy Flash is a calm and serious man but he also appears to be quite arrogant. Despite his collected composure, Flashy Flash has a tendency to be hasty and reckless. __Abilities__: As an S-Class hero, Flashy Flash is very powerful. In terms of speed, Flashy Flash is arguably the fastest S-Class hero in the association, except for Blast and Saitama. Flashy was shown to be strong enough to combat and kill two Dragon-level threats simultaneously. He can deliver powerful kicks that can stun Dragon-level monsters. He can also easily cut massive pieces of stone and create giant explosions throughout his fighting.', '/uploads/images/c_138981.png'),
(106, 'Bomb', 'ボンブ', '配角', 'Shinya Fukumatsu', 'Bomb is Bang''s older brother as well as a dojo master. He and Bang are the two greatest masters of the Martial Arts world.[2] He''s one of the few people who are aware of Saitama''s true strength and is part of the Saitama Group.', '/uploads/images/c_138982.png'),
(106, 'Chain''n''toad', '鎖ガマ', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_154766.jpg'),
(106, 'Kamikaze', 'カミカゼ', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', '__Race:__ Human __Abilities:__ Superhuman Physical Prowess, Master Swordsmanship __Occupation:__ Superhero, Swordsmanship Teacher __Affiliation:__ Hero Association, Council of Swordmasters __Level:__ S-Class Rank 4 __Personality:__ Atomic Samurai has a rather prideful and jocular personality as seen when he refused to shake Saitama''s hand, telling him that he only acknowledges the strong, and telling Saitama that he would greet him properly only if he makes it to the higher ranks of S-Class. Atomic Samurai also enjoys his swordplay and makes a game out of it, often taunting monsters and showing off as he cuts them to pieces, Kamikaze also is straightforward to a humorous degree in many ways, and is incredibly confident and cocky. __Abilities:__ Atomic Samurai is one of the top S-Class heroes. He is regarded as one of the most powerful of them, and the strongest backup hero in the Hero Association, he is also considered Earth''s strongest swordsman. Atomic Samurai possesses extreme levels of speed, being able to cut his opponents to pieces in the blink of an eye using his sword.', '/uploads/images/c_154767.png'),
(106, 'Tanktop Master', 'タンクトップマスター', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', '**Race:** Human **Occupation:** Superhero **Level:** S-Class; Rank: 14 **Affiliation:** The Heroes Association Much like the other heroes with the Tanktop motif, Tanktop Tiger and Tanktop Black Hole, Tanktop Master is a muscular man with a tanktop and short hair. However, unlike the other Tanktop heroes, no known color is associated with Tanktop Master''s name. In the first anniversary color spread of the manga, he is shown with blonde hair and a blue tank top. Tanktop Master has a chivalrous nature, which can be seen when he noted that even if Tornado is ranked 2nd, he should not let a "little girl" handle dangerous enemies on her own, despite the fact that Tornado is actually an adult. He is also unafraid to admit defeat, for example, when he was outclassed by Tornado during the encounter of Dark Matter Thieves'' aircraft.', '/uploads/images/c_156125.png'),
(106, 'Chougoukin Kurobikari', '超合金クロビカリ', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', '**Race:** Human **Occupation:** Superhero Superalloy Blackluster is a large, bald man with round eyes and a defined jawline. He is very muscular, with a thick neck, large and well-defined pectoral and abdominal muscles and large, muscular arms.', '/uploads/images/c_156126.png'),
(106, 'Kaijin Hime Do-S', '怪人姫弩S', '配角', 'Natsumi Fujiwara', 'Kaijin Hime Do-S is a female dominatrix monster of the Monster Association who uses her whip to turn her opponents into love slaves. She is able to enslave the Blizzard Bunch, but Blizzard herself is able to resist.', '/uploads/images/c_156896.png'),
(106, 'Nigamushi', 'ニガムシ', '配角', 'Itaru Yamamoto', 'Sour Face is a Martial Artist and user of the Sour Face Style Martial Arts.', '/uploads/images/c_156897.jpg'),
(106, 'Pineapple', 'パイナップル', '配角', 'Hiromichi Tezuka', 'Pineapple is a B-Class professional hero for the Hero Association.', '/uploads/images/c_156898.png'),
(106, 'Mohican', 'モヒカン', '配角', 'Reigo Yamaguchi', 'Mohican is a C-Class professional hero for the Hero Association.', '/uploads/images/c_156899.jpg'),
(106, 'Lin Lin', 'リンリン', '配角', 'Risa Tsumugi', 'Lin Lin is a Martial Artist and user of the Palm Bell Fist.', '/uploads/images/c_158071.jpg'),
(106, 'Narinki', 'ナリンキ', '配角', 'Kouichi Souma', 'Narinki is a high-raking executive and one of the primary sponsors of the Hero Association. His fund contributes to 7% of the operation at the association.', '/uploads/images/c_171654.png'),
(106, 'Death Gatling', 'デスガトリング', '配角', 'Kento Shiraishi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_203397.png'),
(106, 'Mukade Chourou', 'ムカデ長老', '配角', 'Naoki Bandou', 'Elder centipede was a Dragon-level Mysterious Being and an executive member of the Monster Association.', '/uploads/images/c_209311.png'),
(106, 'Nyan', 'ニャーン', '配角', '', 'Nyan was once a house cat, who became a monster due to hatred of his owner. He disliked her affection and monsterized, becoming a Dragon-Level monster of the Monster Association as well as becoming a cadre of the MA. He has super strength, durability, speed and other usual powers. However his stand-out ability is his elasticity, which allows him to travel through cracks that are bigger than 3 millimeters.', '/uploads/images/c_241944.png'),
(106, 'Marshall Gorilla', 'マーシャルゴリラ', '配角', 'Soushirou Hori', 'Marshall Gorilla is a Tiger-Level monster who works for the Monster Association. He uses a knife to slash opponents and even though he was only a Tiger-Level threat, single handedly defeated Heavy Kong, who was an A class hero. However he got knocked out in one punch by Armored Gorilla.', '/uploads/images/c_241964.png'),
(106, 'Zenko', 'ゼンコ', '配角', 'Ayumi Mano', 'Zenko is the hot-headed younger sister of Metal Bat. She hates violence and does not stand for it at all. She''s also very protective and caring for her big brother.', '/uploads/images/c_241997.jpg'),
(106, 'Tanktop Vegetarian', 'タンクトップベジタリアン', '配角', 'Hiromichi Tezuka', 'Tanktop Vegetarian is the A-Class Rank 9 professional hero of the Hero Association. He is second in command in the Tank Topper Army.', '/uploads/images/c_242001.jpg'),
(106, 'Tanktop Hatter', 'タンクトップハッター', '配角', 'Kaito Takeda', 'Tanktop Hatter is a muscular man with a tank top, he also has medium length hair and sports a bowler hat. Tanktop Hatter started wearing a hat as his lucky charm because an oracle told him so.', '/uploads/images/c_242008.jpg'),
(106, 'Nichirin', 'ニチリン', '配角', '', 'Head of the Council of Swordsmasters. In the past he was also the sensei of Spring Mustachio. His weapon of choice is a cane katana.', '/uploads/images/c_263523.png'),
(106, 'Amahare', 'アマハレ', '配角', 'Kouichi Souma', 'A member of the Council of Swordsmasters. He carries twin jian swords in battle. He also has a pair of double blades mounted on his footwear. Father of [Yuta](https://anilist.co/character/310063/).', '/uploads/images/c_263524.jpg'),
(106, 'Zanbai', 'ザンバイ', '配角', 'Shinnosuke Ogami ', 'A member of the Council of Swordmasters. Father of [Shidou](https://anilist.co/character/310064).', '/uploads/images/c_263525.jpg'),
(106, 'Haragiri', 'ハラギリ', '配角', 'Kan Tanaka', 'A former member of the Council of Swordsmasters who used a Katana, He unfortunately ate a Monster Cell and was killed by Atomic Samurai shortly afterwards.', '/uploads/images/c_263526.png'),
(106, 'Hige Shokuin', 'ヒゲ職員', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_286886.png'),
