(106, 'Sairesuraa', 'サイレスラー', '配角', 'Ryou Sugisaki', 'Rhino Wrestler is a Mysterious Being belonging to the Monster Association.', '/uploads/images/c_327327.png'),
(106, 'Mukade Senpai', 'ムカデ先輩', '配角', 'Hiromichi Tezuka', 'Senior Centipede is a Mysterious Being.', '/uploads/images/c_327328.png'),
(106, 'Hedorokurage', 'ヘドロクラゲ', '配角', 'Tadanori Date', 'A mysterious being.', '/uploads/images/c_327329.png'),
(106, 'Maiko Plasma', '舞妓プラズマ', '配角', 'Risa Tsumugi', 'Maiko Plasma is one of the two Monster Association monsters assigned to attack D-City.', '/uploads/images/c_327330.png'),
(106, 'Mukade Kouhai', 'ムカデ後輩', '配角', 'Reigo Yamaguchi', 'Junior Centipede is a Mysterious Being that attacks Narinki and his son Waganma.', '/uploads/images/c_327331.png'),
(106, 'Yamazaru', '山猿', '配角', 'Shinya Hamazoe', 'Mountain Ape is the B-Class Rank 3 Hero of the Hero Association. He is part of the Blizzard Group, a group of B-Class heroes led by Fubuki, ranking behind only Fubuki herself and Eyelashes.', '/uploads/images/c_327333.png'),
(106, 'Tejina Man', 'テジナーマン', '配角', 'Yuuya Murakami', 'Magic Trick Man is an A-Class Rank 7 professional hero for the Hero Association.', '/uploads/images/c_327335.png'),
(106, 'Gouka no Flame', '業火のフレイム', '配角', 'Yasuaki Takumi', 'Hellfire Flame is a ninja partner of Gale Wind who both came from the 37th Graduation Class "Golden" of The Village . In the past, they joined the Monster Association to become stronger.', '/uploads/images/c_327336.png'),
(106, 'Jakumen', 'ジャクメン', '配角', 'Hayato Fujii', 'Jakumen is a Martial Artist and user of the Giga Pro Wrestling.', '/uploads/images/c_327337.png'),
(106, 'Juu Sensha Fundoshi', '重戦車フンドシ', '配角', 'Kouichi Souma', 'Heavy Tank Loincloth is the A-Class professional hero for the Hero Association.', '/uploads/images/c_327338.png'),
(106, 'Gouketsu', 'ゴウケツ', '配角', 'Kenji Nomura', 'Gouketsu was a Dragon-level Mysterious Being and an executive member of the Monster Association. He is the primary antagonist of the Super Fight Arc.', '/uploads/images/c_327339.png'),
(106, 'Gun Gun', 'ガンガン', '配角', 'Ryou Sugisaki', 'Gun Gun is a B-Class professional hero for the Hero Association with a Western-theme outfit and specializes in dual revolvers.', '/uploads/images/c_327340.png'),
(106, 'Gyoffrey', 'ギョフリー', '配角', 'Hayato Fujii', 'Gyoffrey is a Mysterious Being and a member of the Monster Association.', '/uploads/images/c_327341.png'),
(106, 'Gatlin', 'ガトリン', '配角', 'Reigo Yamaguchi', 'Gatlin is a Martial Artist and user of the Multi-Hit Style.', '/uploads/images/c_327342.png'),
(106, 'Megane', 'メガネ', '配角', 'Taito Ban', 'Glasses is the B-Class Rank 20 professional hero for the Hero Association. He is part of the Blizzard Group, a group of B-Class heroes led by Fubuki. ~!Glasses is one of the few professional heroes aware of Saitama''s true strength, after witnessing him easily destroy a monster that even Tatsumaki could not deal with. This encounter changed Glasses'' perspective on heroism and led him to leave the Blizzard Group in order to pursue strength of his own.!~', '/uploads/images/c_327343.png'),
(106, 'Hayete no Wind', '疾風のウィンド', '配角', 'Taishi Murata', 'Ninja from the Ninja Village. He is from the 37th graduating class like Hellfire Flame. He and Flame joined the Monster Association sometime in the past to rule the world.', '/uploads/images/c_327344.png'),
(106, 'Kaohagi', 'カオハギ', '配角', 'Yuuya Murakami', 'Face Ripper is a Demon-level mysterious being and a member of the Monster Association.', '/uploads/images/c_327345.png'),
(106, 'Butterfly DX', 'バタフライDX', '配角', 'Soushirou Hori', 'Butterfly DX is the A-Class Rank 16 professional hero of the Hero Association.', '/uploads/images/c_327347.png'),
(106, 'Benpatsu', 'ベンパッツ', '配角', 'Kouichi Souma', 'Benpatsu is a Martial Artist and user of the Harsh Path Style.', '/uploads/images/c_327348.png'),
(106, 'Ganriki', 'ガンリキ', '配角', 'Misako Tomioka', 'Eyesight was a Demon-level Mysterious Beings that attacked Y-City during the Monster Raid. Eyesight was a member of the Monster Association.', '/uploads/images/c_327349.png'),
(106, 'Bakuzan', 'バクザン', '配角', 'Takanori Hoshino', 'Bakuzan is a Martial Artist and user of the Dark Hell Assassination. He was said to be a top contender in the martial arts tournament.', '/uploads/images/c_327350.png'),
(107, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Kenichirou Matsuda', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(107, 'Noelle Silva', 'ノエル・シルヴァ', '主角', 'Kana Yuuki', '__Height:__ 161 cm (5''3") Noelle Silva is a member of the Black Bulls and was inducted into the squad around the same time as [Asta](https://anilist.co/character/123285). She is the second daughter of one of the Clover Kingdom''s royal families, House Silva, and the younger sister of the captain of the Silver Eagles, [Nozel Silva](https://anilist.co/character/124442). She likes sweets. ~!Her family disowned her due to her lack of control on her magic and having [their mother](https://anilist.co/character/124972) die while giving birth to her.!~', '/uploads/images/c_123283.png'),
(107, 'Yuno', 'ユノ', '主角', 'Nobunaga Shimazaki', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5''7") Yuno was left, along with Asta, in front of a church in a village called Hage when he was an infant. He grew up at the church and spends most of his day with Asta. Sometime later, a thug tries to take his necklace away from him and sell it for money. Fortunately, Asta steps in and tries to take it back. In the end, the thug decided to leave without the necklace after Asta keeps charging at him. Since then, Yuno stopped crying and decides to take Asta''s dream to be the Wizard King as his own as well.', '/uploads/images/c_123284.png'),
(107, 'Asta', 'アスタ', '主角', 'Gakuto Kajiwara', '__Height:__ 155 cm (5''1") An orphan who was left under the care of a church in the village of Hage. He dreams of becoming ​the Wizard King but is unable to use magic, so he trains to build up his physical strength. He is the wielder of a five-leaf clover anti-magic grimoire and is a 3rd Class Junior Magic Knight of the Clover Kingdom''s Black Bull and Royal Knights squads.', '/uploads/images/c_123285.png'),
(107, 'Finral Roulacase', 'フィンラル・ルーラケイス', '配角', 'Jun Fukuyama', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8'''') He is a nobleman of House Vaude and a member of Clover Kingdom''s Black Bull squad of the Magic Knights. He is from Tota, a village within the Clover Kingdom.', '/uploads/images/c_124433.png'),
(107, 'Charlotte Roselei', 'シャーロット・ローズレイ', '配角', 'Yuu Kobayashi', '__Height:__ 171 cm Charlotte is a noblewoman of House Roselei and the captain of Clover Kingdom''s Blue Rose squad of the Magic Knights. She appears as a quiet, cold, and indifferent woman who keeps her emotions controlled and well hidden. She is constantly shown to appear as a rather stern woman, despite inwardly having an inward monologue that constantly appears to say calm down, especially around [Yami Sukehiro](https://anilist.co/character/124440/Sukehiro-Yami). She often does not respond to situations that go out of hand, preferring to appear indifferent and let things play out. She does respond well to emergencies and pressing concerns, performing her duties and moving swiftly to take care of any problems that come up. However, she still is capable of losing her composure and becoming annoyed, which almost always involves Yami teasing of her. She is also a lightweight when it comes to alcohol, barely able to finish a pint before becoming drunk. Charlotte considers her duty to the kingdom to be her foremost responsibility, with little interest in the social aspects of life. Her beauty is quite noticeable when she chooses to show it, but she is more comfortable in plate mail than silk dresses and cares little for the opinions of most others. She also has a hard time being open with most people and expressing herself on occasion. That said, she often quips back at her fellow captains when they make rash decisions or do something she considers stupid, particularly Yami. Howe', '/uploads/images/c_124434.png'),
(107, 'Julius Novachrono', 'ユリウス・ノヴァクロノ', '配角', 'Toshiyuki Morikawa', '__Height:__ 180 cm The Wizard King of Clover Kingdom''s Order of the Magic Knights. Fascinated by magic in all its forms, he eagerly seeks out and observes unusual magical abilities whenever possible. Those close to him know him for his boundless enthusiasm, excitement, and curiosity toward magic. __Chapter 333 spoiler:__ ~!It is revealed that Julius was born in a body with two souls, with the other being [Lucius Zogratis](https://anilist.co/character/319876)!~', '/uploads/images/c_124435.jpg'),
(107, 'Vanessa Enoteca', 'バネッサ・エノテーカ', '配角', 'Nana Mizuki', '__Height:__ 170 cm Originally from the Forest of Witches, Vanessa is a member of the Black Bull Brigade.', '/uploads/images/c_124436.png'),
(107, 'Klaus Lunettes', 'クラウス・リュネット', '配角', 'Takuma Terashima', '__Height:__ 176 cm Klaus is a nobleman and a member of Clover Kingdom''s Golden Dawn squad of the Magic Knights.', '/uploads/images/c_124437.png'),
(107, 'Mimosa Vermillion', 'ミモザ・ヴァーミリオン', '配角', 'Asuka Nishi', '__Height:__ 158 cm Mimosa is a noblewoman of Clover Kingdom''s House Vermillion and a member of the Golden Dawn squad of the Magic Knights.', '/uploads/images/c_124438.jpg'),
(107, 'Magna Swing', 'マグナ・スウィング', '配角', 'Genki Muro', '__Height:__ 169 cm A member of the Black Bulls magic knight squad. Coming from Rayaka out in the countryside, he can easily bond with [Asta](https://anilist.co/character/123285/Asta) whom he is profoundly impressed by. His magic allows him to form fireballs which he can hurl at targets. He uses them as baseballs for the unofficial welcoming ceremonies he holds for new recruits. He can also form a magic bat for hitting his fireballs.', '/uploads/images/c_124439.jpg'),
(107, 'Yami Sukehiro', 'ヤミ・スケヒロ', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', '__Height:__ 183 cm Yami Sukehiro is a foreigner from the Land of the Sun and the first captain of the Clover Kingdom''s Black Bulls squad of the Magic Knights. ~!He is also a former member of the Grey Deer squad.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124440.png'),
(107, 'William Vangeance', 'ウィリアム・ヴァンジャンス', '配角', 'Daisuke Ono', '__Height:__ 172 cm William Vangeance is the captain of Clover Kingdom''s Golden Dawn squad of the Magic Knights. He is currently the closest person to becoming the next Wizard King.', '/uploads/images/c_124441.png'),
(107, 'Nozel Silva', 'ノゼル・シルヴァ', '配角', 'Kousuke Toriumi', '__Height:__ 177 cm Nozel is a nobleman and the oldest son of the Clover Kingdom''s ruling family, House Silva. He is also the captain of the Silver Eagle squad of the Magic Knights. ~!He is also the son of Acier Silva, the older brother of Nebra Silva, Solid Silva and Noelle Silva, and the cousin of Kirsch Vermilion and Mimosa Vermilion.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124442.png'),
(107, 'Lily Aquaria', 'リリー・アクアリア', '配角', 'Miyu Kubota', '__Height:__ 160 cm __Affinity:__ Water A nun and caretaker at the orphanage in Hage. ~!In chapter 334, Lucius Zogratis transforms her to a Paladin.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124443.png'),
(107, 'Grey', 'グレイ', '配角', 'Masayuki Akasaka', '__Species:__ Human __Affinity: __Transformation __Height:__ 159cm A 3rd Class Junior Magic Knight of Clover Kingdom''s Black Bull squad.', '/uploads/images/c_124444.jpg'),
(107, 'Gauche Adlai', 'ゴーシュ・アドレイ', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', '__Height:__ 181 cm He is a nobleman of House Adlai and a member of Clover Kingdom''s Black Bull squad. He is also the smartest and most clever member of the Black Bulls. Obsessed with his sister Marie.', '/uploads/images/c_124446.png'),
(107, 'Charmy Pappitson', 'チャーミー・パピットソン', '配角', 'Kiyono Yasuno', '__Height:__ 142 cm Member of the Black Bull squad. She is an extremely big eater and tougher than she looks. When someone threatens to steal her meals, she becomes cold and merciless. In contrast, she is actually very generous and loves to share her meals with her friends, going so far as to constantly give them food after they have already expressed their satisfaction. ~! Charmy is a half-dwarf. She also uses 2 attributes of magic: Cotton magic and Food magic !~', '/uploads/images/c_124447.png'),
(107, 'Gordon Agrippa', 'ゴードン・アグリッパ', '配角', 'Kenichirou Matsuda', '__Height:__ 187 cm (6''1.6") __Affinity:__ Poison Magic He is a member of Clover Kingdom''s Black Bull squad of the Magic Knights. Gordon was born into the Agrippa Family, a commoner family infamous for their Curse Magic. He grew up lonely and unable to make friends due to his magic and appearance. After receiving his grimoire, Gordon abandoned his family and joined the Black Bull squad of the Magic Knights. Over the years, he comes to view them as friends.', '/uploads/images/c_124448.png'),
(107, 'Luck Voltia', 'ラック・ボルティア', '配角', 'Ayumu Murase', '__Species:__ Human __Affinity:__ Lightning __Height:__ 167 cm A 5th Class Junior Magic Knight of Clover Kingdom''s Black Bull and Royal Knights squads.', '/uploads/images/c_124449.jpg'),
(107, 'Marx Francois', 'マルクス・フランソワ', '配角', 'Yoshitaka Yamaya', '__Height:__ 167 cm __Species:__ Human __Affinity:__ Memory He is one of the advisers of the Magic Emperor.', '/uploads/images/c_124454.png'),
(107, 'Gueldre Poizot', 'ゲルドル・ポイゾット', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', '__Height:__ 194 cm He is the former captain of Clover Kingdom''s Violet Orca squad of the Magic Knights.', '/uploads/images/c_124455.png'),
(107, 'Jack the Ripper', 'ジャック・ザリッパー', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', '__Height:__ 197 cm Jack is the captain of Clover Kingdom''s Green Mantis squad of the Magic Knights.', '/uploads/images/c_124456.png'),
(107, 'Rill Boismortier', 'リル・ボワモルティエ', '配角', 'Natsuki Hanae', '__Height:__ 165 cm Rill is the captain of Clover Kingdom''s Azure Deer squad of the Magic Knights and a member of the Royal Knights squad.', '/uploads/images/c_124457.png'),
(107, 'Dorothy Unsworth', 'ドロシー・アンズワース', '配角', 'Mariya Ise', 'Dorothy is the captain of Clover Kingdom''s Coral Peacock squad of the Magic Knights. She sleeps most of the time, but when she is awake she can bring enemies into a dream world where she controls everything.', '/uploads/images/c_124458.png'),
(107, 'Zora Ideale', 'ゾラ・イデアーレ', '配角', 'Hikaru Midorikawa', '~!Zora is the son of Zara Ideale, the first commoner Magic Knight, and is a rogue member of Clover Kingdom''s Black Bull squad. He assumes the identity of Xerx Lugner during the Royal Knights Selection Exam. Zora changes during the Selection Exam where he begins to take on a similar mindset to his father, with a strong trust in his comrades. The current Wizard King confronts Zora after the exam, speaking of how he was a friend of his fathers having met on the battlefield. The Wizard King prompts Zora to join the Magic Knight Squad he belongs in (presumably the Black Bulls), however Zora shrugs this off, ignoring the Wizard King. !~', '/uploads/images/c_124459.png'),
(107, 'Sekke Bronzazza', 'セッケ・ブロンザッザ', '配角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', '__Height:__ 175 cm Is a member of Clover Kingdom''s Green Mantis squad. A magic knight who fought and lost to Asta during their entrance exam. He befriended Asta in order to use him as a stepping stone to show off his powers which he believed to be superior, as Asta appeared to be an incompetent magician. As a magic knight, he complains about how tough he has it in his squad and that he''s always tasked with monotonous chores. He meets Asta''s group while gambling with an elderly woman on the black market. He tries to impress the women Asta is with, but ends up getting stabbed in the foot by a paralysis inducing knife while chasing a burglar. Believing his life to be over, he tries to pass on his unfulfilled life''s ambition to Asta before realizing his injury is far from fatal.', '/uploads/images/c_124460.png'),
(107, 'Heath Grice', 'ヒース・グライス', '配角', 'Ryoutarou Okiayu', '__Height:__ 187 cm Heath is a rogue mage and member of the White Night Eye.', '/uploads/images/c_124461.png'),
(107, 'Mars', 'マルス', '配角', 'Yuuichirou Umehara', '__Height:__ 170 cm Mars is a mage of the Diamond Kingdom and one of its Eight Shining Generals. He is the Kingdom''s product of human experimentation to enhance his Magic Power, with several magic stones embedded in his body.', '/uploads/images/c_124462.png'),
(107, 'Revchi Salik', 'レブチ', '配角', 'Yutaka Aoyama', '__Height:__ 176 cm Revchi was a member of the Clover Kingdom''s Violet Orca squad of the Magic Knights, where he was known as Revchi of the chain. After some years, he leaves the organization for unknown reasons and becomes a thief.', '/uploads/images/c_124463.jpg'),
(107, 'Rebecca Scarlet', 'レベッカ・スカーレット', '配角', 'Rikako Yamaguchi', '__Height:__ 165 cm __Sign:__ Aries', '/uploads/images/c_124471.png'),
(107, 'Licht', 'リヒト', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', '__Species:__ Elf __Affinity:__ Sword Magic __Height:__ 173 cm Licht is the leader of the Elf Tribe and one of its ten Apostles of Sephirah. He was married to Tetia, a human woman and the sister of Lemiel Silvamillion Clover, the first Magic Emperor.', '/uploads/images/c_124472.png'),
(107, 'Rhya', 'ライア', '配角', 'Hirofumi Arai', '__Affinity:__ Imitation __Height:__ 181 cm A rogue mage and a member of the Eye of the Midnight Sun''s Third Eye. ~!He is an elf reincarnated into the body of a human.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124473.jpg'),
(107, 'Vetto', 'ヴェット', '配角', 'Masaya Takatsuka', '~!Status: Deceased!~ ~!Species: Elf!~Affinity: BeastHeight: 196 cm Eyes: Purple Hair: Blond ~!An elf and a member of the Eye of the Midnight Sun''s Third Eye.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124475.png'),
(107, 'Marie Adlai', 'マリー・アドレイ', '配角', 'Hitomi Sasaki', '__Height:__ 135 cm She is the younger sister of Gauche Adlai and lives in Nairn under the care of Theresa Rapual.', '/uploads/images/c_124476.png'),
(107, 'Rades Spirito', 'ラデス・スピーリト', '配角', 'Masayuki Akasaka', '__Height:__ 174 cm Rades is a rogue mage who is a member of the White Night Eye. He was a member of Clover Kingdom''s Violet Orca squad of the Magic Knights.', '/uploads/images/c_124477.png'),
(107, 'Catherine', 'キャサリンス', '配角', 'Kimiko Jitsukawa', 'She is a rogue mage and a member of the White Night Eye.', '/uploads/images/c_124478.jpg'),
(107, 'Fana', 'ファナ', '配角', 'Mao Ichimichi', '__Height:__ 162cm __Species:__ Human ~!A rogue mage from the Diamond Kingdom living with other fugitives in the Clover Kingdom. She is also the former host of the elf Fana, one of the Eye of the Midnight Sun''s Third Eye.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124479.png'),
(107, 'Valtos', 'ヴァルトス', '配角', 'Daiki Hamano', '__Height:__ 178 cm Valtos is a rogue mage and a member of the White Night Eye.', '/uploads/images/c_124480.png'),
(107, 'Georg', 'ゲオルク', '配角', 'Wataru Tsuyuzaki', 'is a rogue mage and a member of the White Night Eye.', '/uploads/images/c_124481.jpg'),
(107, 'Lotus Whomalt', 'ロータス・フーモルト', '配角', 'Kenyuu Horiuchi', '__Height:__ 184 cm Lotus is a mage from the Diamond Kingdom. He is widely known by his nickname, the Hell Lotus.', '/uploads/images/c_124520.png'),
(107, 'Fuegoleon Vermillion', 'フエゴレオン・ヴァーミリオン', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', '__Height:__ 188 cm He is a nobleman and the first son of the Clover Kingdom''s House Vermillion, one of its royal families. He is also the former captain of the Crimson Lion squad of the Magic Knights.', '/uploads/images/c_124521.png'),
(107, 'Mereoleona Vermillion', 'メレオレオナ・ヴァーミリオン', '配角', 'Junko Minagawa', '__Height:__ 178 cm She is a noblewoman and the first daughter of the Clover Kingdom''s House Vermillion, one of its royal families. She is also the captain of the Crimson Lion squad and the Royal Knights squad.', '/uploads/images/c_124522.png'),
(107, 'Kirsch Vermillion', 'キルシュ・ヴァーミリオン', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', '**Height:** 182 cm Kirsch is a nobleman of Clover Kingdom''s House Vermillion, vice-captain of the Coral Peacock squad of the Magic Knights, and a 1st Class Senior Magic Knight.', '/uploads/images/c_124524.png'),
(107, 'Fanzell Kruger', 'ファンゼル・クルーガー', '配角', 'Satoshi Mikami', '__Height:__ 178 cm He is a former Commander of the Diamond Kingdom''s army. After fleeing the kingdom, he now lives together with his wife Dominante Code and his students Mariella and Fana.', '/uploads/images/c_124525.png'),
(107, 'Dominante Code', 'ドミナント・コード', '配角', 'Misako Tomioka', '**Height:** 167 cm A witch and former magic tool craftsman from Diamond Kingdom. She is the wife of Fanzell Kruger.', '/uploads/images/c_124526.png'),
(107, 'Mariella', 'マリエラ', '配角', 'Sayaka Senbongi', '__Height:__ 157 cm (5''2) A former assassin of the Diamond Kingdom tasked with bringing the deserters Fanzell Kruger and Dominante Code back to the kingdom, but after encountering Asta, she chooses a different life path.', '/uploads/images/c_124527.png'),
(107, 'Augustus Kira Clover XIII', 'アウグストゥス・キーラ・クローバー13世', '配角', 'Jun Miyamoto', '__Height:__ 160 cm He is the king of the Clover Kingdom.', '/uploads/images/c_124528.png'),
