(107, 'Theresa Rapual', 'テレジア・ラプアール', '配角', 'Rei Igarashi', 'Height: 162 cmSign: Aries A nun and a former member of the Crimson Lion squad of the Magic Knights. “Always... on every battlefield... it was the weak, the innocent children, who were the victims of war.” — To Asta in The Man Who Cuts Death', '/uploads/images/c_126024.png'),
(107, 'Kuro Nero', '黒ネロ', '配角', 'Hitomi Sasaki', '__Species:__ Anti-bird __Height:__ 8 cm An Anti-bird who decided to stay alongside [Asta](https://anilist.co/character/123285/Asta) after encountering him at the beginning of the Magic Knights Entrance Exam. ~!It''s later revealed that she is a human, her name is Secre Swallowtail. She was the servant of [Lumiere Silvamillion Clover](https://anilist.co/character/158550/Silvamillion-Clover-Lemiel), prince of the Clover Kingdom and the first Magic Emperor. She is transformed into an anti-bird named Nero after sealing Lumiere into a statue.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126948.png'),
(107, 'Leopold Vermillion', 'レオポルド・ヴァーミリオン', '配角', 'KENN', '__Height:__ 164 cm A nobleman and the second son of the Clover Kingdom''s House Vermillion, one of its royal families. He is a member of the Crimson Lion squad of the Magic Knights.', '/uploads/images/c_137881.png'),
(107, 'Lemiel Silvamillion Clover', 'ルミエル・シルヴァミリオン・クローバー', '配角', 'Shu Hikari', 'First Wizard King of the Clover Kingdom.', '/uploads/images/c_158550.png'),
(107, 'Zagred', 'ザグレド', '配角', 'Shoutarou Morikubo', 'This devil is the mastermind behind the creation of Licht''s five-leaf grimoire, the massacre of the Elf Tribe, and the reincarnation of the elves.', '/uploads/images/c_161333.png'),
(107, 'Dante Zogratis', 'ダンテ・ゾグラティス', '配角', 'Rikiya Koyama', 'Dante is a member of the Spade Kingdom''s Dark Triad and the host of the devil Lucifero. Dante seems to be a calm and easy going individual. Even in the face of a surprising turn of events, he does not lose his cool. He believes that evil is the true nature of humanity and the world is too dull because of it. Therefore, he considers being called evil a compliment, and encourages other people to embrace their malice, as it is a supreme emotion only humans have. He often looks down on who he considers weaker than him. His native magic is Flesh Magic, and his Demon''s, Lucifero, is Gravity Magic.', '/uploads/images/c_163782.png'),
(107, 'Zenon Zogratis', 'ゼノン・ゾグラティス', '配角', 'Tatsuhisa Suzuki', 'Zenon is a member of Spade Kingdom''s Dark Triad He is a tall man with black, messy hair. His most notable feature is a cross-shaped mark on the left side of his forehead and it extends down across his left eye. His magic Attribute is Bone Magic, and his Demon''s magic gives him Spatial Magic', '/uploads/images/c_167952.jpg'),
(107, 'Vanica Zogratis', 'ヴァニカ・ゾグラティス', '配角', 'Yui Ogura', 'Member of the Spade Kingdom''s Dark Triad, and the host for the devil Megicula. She''s a psychopath and she enjoys fightings against tough enemies. Her native magic is Blood Magic, whilst Megicula''s magic is Curse Warding Magic.', '/uploads/images/c_168300.png'),
(107, 'David Swallow', 'ダヴィド・スワロー', '配角', 'Makoto Sahara', 'Nobleman, member of the Golden Dawn. Uses Dice Magic.', '/uploads/images/c_174445.png'),
