(107, 'Liebe', 'リーベ', '配角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '~!Liebe is the devil who resides within Licht''s former grimoire, which is currently Asta''s grimoire. He is the source behind Asta''s Anti Magic.!~', '/uploads/images/c_192196.png'),
(107, 'Licita', 'リチタ', '配角', 'Kaori Ishihara', 'Licita was the foster mother of Liebe, the devil that currently recides within Asta''s grimoire. She died protecting him from Lucifero. ~!In chapter 270, it was confirmed that she is Asta''s mother.!~', '/uploads/images/c_192588.png'),
(107, 'Loyce Grinberryall', 'ロイス・グリンベリオール', '配角', 'Takashi Yoshida', 'Loyce Grinberryall was the King of the Spade Kingdom, alongside his wife Ciel Grinberryall, untill the Zogratis Siblings attacked the palace and overthrew the royal family. ~!It is later revealed by Ralph Niaflem, that he is the father of Yuno.!~', '/uploads/images/c_216708.jpg'),
