(107, 'Charla', 'チャルラ', '配角', 'Yuu Kobayashi', 'Charla belonged to the elf tribe 500 years prior to the present events. ~!After the reincarnation spell takes place, Charla possesses Charlotte Roselei and fights Yami Sukehiro to briefly incapacitate him at the Royal Capital before meeting each other again at the Shadow Palace, this time to team-up against the devil Zagred.!~', '/uploads/images/c_326897.png'),
