(107, 'Kabwe Carillon', 'カブエ・カリョン', '配角', 'Makoto Sahara', 'Kabwe Carillon is a guard for the Clover Kingdom''s Magic Parliament and a member of the Devil Banishers.', '/uploads/images/c_326900.png'),
(107, 'Drowa', 'ドロワ', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', 'Drowa is an elf and one of the ten Apostles of Sephirah.', '/uploads/images/c_326901.png'),
(108, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Maaya Sakamoto', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(108, 'Riko', 'リコ', '主角', 'Miyu Tomita', '**Occupation**: Delver **Relatives**: [Lyza](https://anilist.co/character/122465/Lyza) (mother), [Torka](https://anilist.co/character/161856/Torka) (father) Riko is the only child of the legendary White Whistle [Lyza](https://anilist.co/character/122465/Lyza), the Annihilator. When she was two, her mother began her last dive to the bottom of the abyss. She was left under the care of the Belchero Orphanage. Her dream is to become a White Whistle, a legendary type of Delver, and explore the depths of the abyss to learn its many secrets and find her mother. Riko is a good-natured, joyful, and energetic child. She has a quick and inquisitive mind, gathering and properly organizing all the information available on subjects that interest her. Growing up, she diligently studied to become a Delver like her mother was, enchanted by its mysteries and secrets. By the age of twelve, she had become an Apprentice Delver with the right to explore the shallowest level of the abyss on her own. Compared to [Reg](https://anilist.co/character/122444/Reg), she is fragile and lacking in physical prowess. However, her ability to keep a cool head under pressure to make rational decisions allows her to tackle the abyss.', '/uploads/images/c_122443.png'),
(108, 'Reg', 'レグ', '主角', 'Mariya Ise', 'Reg is a robotic being who appears to be a little boy. His actual age, origins, and even name are unknown because he cannot recall anything about his life before his encounter with [Riko](https://anilist.co/character/122443/Riko). He is named after a dog Riko used to have. Having a seemingly artificial body, Reg might be the only being completely immune to the Curse of the Abyss. Because of this, he is sometimes referred to as "The Treasure of the Deep." Reg’s body is extremely durable, even to the point that [Ozen the Immovable](https://anilist.co/character/122464/Ouzen) couldn’t break him even when slamming him into the floor with all her strength. Despite his high durability, Reg is agile and weighs little. His wounds heal at a faster rate than a human’s, and has a very high pain tolerance. His senses of smell and hearing are strong, one comparable to a dog. His arms can extend up to 40 meters each and can shoot them to the top of cliffs or grab things very far away. The cords attached are very durable. He is also equipped with an incinerator, which is a powerful incendiary cannon built into his hands and feet, emitting a beam of light, indicating the area to eliminate, penetrating through objects. Objects within the range of the light break apart and are absorbed into the spinning axes. The incinerator is connected to the Abyss in an unknown way, having the power to rewrite the rules of the Abyss. Reg passes out for 2 hours upon use, but it can be fired multiple times in ', '/uploads/images/c_122444.png'),
(108, 'Nanachi', 'ナナチ', '配角', 'Shiori Izawa', '**Species**: Narehate Nanachi is a Narehate — a person who’s survived the 6th layer’s Curse of the Abyss and has been left deformed as a result. Unlike other Narehates, Nanachi has retained a sound mind, possessing vast knowledge of the Abyss — its ecosystem, vegetation and even the use of the medicines. Their gender is ambiguous, often using the gender-neutral pronoun "oira." when referring to themself. Most of the time, Nanachi is cool and reserved, keeping their distance emotionally and physically. Their attitude often borders on being sarcastic and even cynical. However, behind this mask, Nanachi hides a kind and gentle soul, capable of deep compassion and selfless devotion. They are also quite bashful when complimented, seen in their reaction to being called "fluffy". They also express discomfort at being petted, especially by [Reg](https://anilist.co/character/122444/Reg).', '/uploads/images/c_122445.png'),
(108, 'Bondrewd', 'ボンドルド', '配角', 'Toshiyuki Morikawa', 'Bondrewd is a legendary white whistle delver who has made many great discoveries about the secrets of the Abyss. A researcher fascinated by the Abyss, he has often resorted to illegal and morally questionable means to get funds for and conduct his research, including selling artifacts illicitly, developing dangerous drugs, and even experimenting on living humans. Though how cruel, he still cared for the kids and people he brutally experimented on. His methods went against all the ethical principles of delvers, but he was allowed to continue due to his outstanding results. Ten years ago, he did the unthinkable by establishing a large base named the Idofront in the deepest area within the 5th Layer of the Abyss, as well as securing a route to the then-inviolable 6th layer. ~!During one of his experiments researching the Curse of the Abyss, Bondrewd offered children who wanted to unravel the secrets of the Abyss to come with him to the Ido Front. However, he never told them openly that they were going to be used as test subjects. Among the children were Nanachi and Mitty. As Bondrewd continued testing, more and more children were used up in his experiments until only Nanachi and Mitty were left. On his final test, he used both of them, resulting in Mitty being hit with the Curse of the Abyss, while Nanachi received the Blessing.!~', '/uploads/images/c_122463.jpg'),
(108, 'Ouzen', 'オーゼン', '配角', 'Sayaka Oohara', 'Ouzen the Immovable is an elite White Whistle who lives at the Observation Base on the second level of the Abyss where she commands a small team of cave raiders known as "The Layabouts." Ouzen was a mentor and a close friend of [Riko](https://anilist.co/character/122443/Riko)''s mother [Lyza](https://anilist.co/character/122465/Lyza). Ouzen is a peerless fighter—her unique relic "Thousand Pins" grants her superhuman strength, speed and longevity (even though Ouzen appears to be young, she''s attained the rank of a white whistle more than 50 years back). She''s over 2 meters tall and has a peculiar hairstyle which conceals the scalp deformations caused by the extended exposure to the Curse of the Abyss. Ouzen has absolute control over her facial expressions and her actual feelings (or lack thereof) cannot be guessed with any certainty. The reasons behind her actions are unknowable as well—Ouzen rarely bothers to explain herself and even when she does it''s impossible to know whether she''s telling the truth or just toying with the audience.', '/uploads/images/c_122464.jpg'),
(108, 'Lyza', 'ライザ', '配角', 'Maaya Sakamoto', 'Lyza the Annihilator is a legendary White Whistle who accomplished many great discoveries about the secrets of the Abyss. She is [Ozen''s](https://anilist.co/character/122464/Ouzen) apprentice and [Riko''s](https://anilist.co/character/122443/Riko) mother.', '/uploads/images/c_122465.png'),
(108, 'Nat', 'ナット', '配角', 'Mutsumi Tamura', '**Gender**: Male **Species**: Human **Occupation**: Delver **Class**: Red Whistle **Relatives**: Unnamed sister Nat is an orphan from the Belchero Orphanage in the town at the edge of the Abyss, Orth. Like all the children of the orphanage, he''s studied to become a Delver since a young age and attained the rank of Red Whistle Delver after his first descent. He wants to become a Moon Whistle Delver like [Jiruo](https://anilist.co/character/123188/Jiruo) and someday build an orphanage somewhere in Orth. Nat has short brown hair with bright blue eyes and wears, like his peers, a red whistle around his neck. He is often seen in his plain white sailor collar shirt, green pants, and track shoes. Nat cares about the people around him, especially [Riko](https://anilist.co/character/122443/Riko). He was against Riko descending into the Abyss with [Reg](https://anilist.co/character/122444/Reg); he spoke of the difficulties of dealing with the Abyss alone and that she wouldn''t be able to see anyone in Orth again. Although he was helping Riko and Reg descend into the Abyss, before the departure, he struggled to express he would miss Riko. Nat used to live in the Wharf, where he lived in the slums. He didn''t have any family besides his older sister. When his sister died, he was alone in the streets, but the orphanage took him in and he becoming a Delver.', '/uploads/images/c_122748.jpg'),
(108, 'Shiggy', 'シギー', '配角', 'Manami Numakura', '**Gender**: Male **Species**: Human **Occupation**: Delver **Class**: Red Whistle Shiggy is an orphan from the Belchero Orphanage in the town at the edge of the Abyss, Orth. Like all the children of the orphanage, he has studied to become a Delver since a young age and attained the rank of Red Whistle Delver after his first descent. Shiggy has short ashy black hair and bright-red eyes, wears rounded glasses, and bears a red whistle around his neck. He is often seen in his plain white sailor collar shirt and khaki green or black pants and track shoes. Shiggy has a great inquisitiveness, especially when it comes to the maps of the Abyss. He gives [Riko](https://anilist.co/character/122443/Riko) plenty of advice. When Riko tells her friends that she will delve into the Abyss to find [Lyza](https://anilist.co/character/122465/Lyza), Shiggy is skeptical and explains each layer via a depth chart. He decides to aid [Reg](https://anilist.co/character/122444/Reg) and Riko anyways and the three meet up the next morning in the South District. Shiggy advises them to enter the Abyss through the entry point at the wharf slums, which are not monitored as closely. (Source: Made in Abyss Wiki, edited)', '/uploads/images/c_122749.jpg'),
(108, 'Marulk', 'マルルク', '配角', 'Aki Toyosaki', 'Ozen''s assistant and a Blue Whistle Diver.', '/uploads/images/c_123145.png'),
(108, 'Hablog', 'ハボルグ', '配角', 'Tetsu Inada', 'Hablog (called Habo-san by Riko and the other children) is a well-known Black Whistle Delver and was the person who delivered Lyza''s White Whistle and final notes to the surface. Hablog is a very bright and kind person with a rather high level of curiosity, as is seen when he first meets Reg.', '/uploads/images/c_123185.jpg'),
(108, 'Kiwi', 'キウイ', '配角', 'Manami Hanawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_123186.jpg'),
(108, 'Jiruo', 'ジルオ', '配角', 'Taishi Murata', '**Gender**: Male **Species**: Human **Occupation**: Delver, Delving Instructor **Class**: Moon Whistle Jiruo is a Moon Whistle Delver who serves as a teacher for Apprentice Delvers from the Belchero Orphanage in the town of Orth. While he works as an instructor for the children, he is also largely responsible for their upbringing and well-being. Jiruo is serious and stern and tends to come off as cold at times but takes his job as a teacher and instructor seriously and prioritizes the childrens'' safety. At times he is very insightful and gives good advice, and does his best to support Riko after her mother''s whistle was brought back to the surface. Jiruo was the apprentice of the legendary White Whistle Delver Lyza. Though he was only a red whistle at the time, before she made her last dive, Lyza entrusted him with watching over Riko and protecting her identity as a child of a White Whistle Delver. (Source: Made in Abyss Wiki, edited)', '/uploads/images/c_123188.png'),
(108, 'Mitty', 'ミーティ', '配角', 'Eri Kitamura', '**Species**: Narehate Mitty is an amorphous Narehate who lived with Nanachi on the 4th layer of the Abyss. Mitty had been a regular human girl in the past and her appearance changed due to the result of the ascension from the 6th layer. ~!In Ilblu, it is revealed that Belaf paid compensation to have an exact replica of Mitty born into the village from the time a "masked man" brought her along to the village. This reproduction even has an exact copy of Mitty''s soul from that moment in time.!~', '/uploads/images/c_125877.jpg'),
(108, 'Simred', 'シムラド', '配角', 'Yuuki Shin', 'Black Whistle and a member of Ozen''s expedition team. He is currently stationed at the Seeker Camp in the 2nd layer.', '/uploads/images/c_153051.jpg'),
(108, 'Mio', 'ミオ', '配角', 'Rina Hidaka', 'Mio is a nurse that visits Orth on a merchant caravan. ~!She helps Kiwi get better from the Birthday-Death Disease.!~', '/uploads/images/c_158387.jpg'),
(108, 'Laffi', 'ラフィ', '配角', 'Hitomi Nabatame', 'Laffi is Hablog''s wife and owner of a shop in Orth. She is well-liked by Riko and the other orphans, who frequent her shop. Riko often using her telescope to observe Abyssal wildlife.', '/uploads/images/c_158388.jpg'),
(108, 'Tankutsuka', '探窟家', '配角', 'Yoshimitsu Shimoyama', 'A Black Whistle who had a chance encounter with Reg in the 4th layer. ~!Reg and Nanachi save his life by fighting a deadly Abyss monster that was about to kill him. After this, Reg tells him to send a message up to Jiruo!~', '/uploads/images/c_158389.jpg'),
(108, 'Zapo-jii', 'ザポ爺', '配角', 'Takayuki Nakatsukasa', 'Blue Whistle and a member of Ozen''s expedition team. He is currently stationed at the Seeker Camp in the 2nd layer.', '/uploads/images/c_158390.jpg'),
(108, 'Yelme', 'イェルム', '配角', 'Yoshihisa Kawahara', 'Moon Whistle and a member of Ozen''s expedition team. He is currently stationed at the Seeker Camp in the 2nd layer.', '/uploads/images/c_158391.jpg'),
(108, 'Beruchero', 'ベルチェロ', '配角', 'Youko Soumi', '**Gender**: Female **Race**: Human Belchero is the director of the Belchero Orphanage. She imposed strict rules within the Academy and the orphanage. Belchero has black hair with white strains in it, which ends in a topknot, and two long curls down each ear. She has a gaunt face and sharp eyes with a monocle on her right eye. She wears a black robe with black clothes beneath and black gloves. Belchero is very strict and enforces her rules strongly, but also only has the best interest of the orphans in mind. Belchero was once an active Delver but retired due to knee injuries. Belchero, together with Jiruo, teaches the orphans about the Abyss and other academic subjects. (Source: Made in Abyss Wiki, edited)', '/uploads/images/c_158393.jpg'),
(108, 'Torka', 'トーカ', '配角', '', 'Torka is Lyza''s husband and Riko''s father. He was one of the members of a survey team ordered from the government, with a special mission to retrieve the Greater Artifact Unheard Bell from the 4th layer of the Abyss. Lyza married Torka when she was a White Whistle Delver, while Torka was a Black Whistle Delver.', '/uploads/images/c_161856.png'),
(108, 'Srajo', 'スラージョ', '配角', '', 'Srajo "The Obscure", is a legendary White Whistle Delver of the Abyss. Since she is a White Whistle, she is presumed to have made amazing discoveries within the pit and retrieved Artifacts that have changed the world. Like most White Whistle Delvers, she settled on the 5th layer and lived there for some time, since it is the last point of the Abyss where it is possible to return alive. ~!At some point and for unknown reasons, Srajo decided to take her "Last Dive" and descended to the 6th layer of the Abyss without even mentioning it to anyone else. [Bondrewd](https://anilist.co/character/122463/Bondrewd) was the only one that was made aware of her decision.!~', '/uploads/images/c_237657.png'),
(108, 'Wakuna', 'ワクナ', '配角', '', 'Wakuna "The Chosen", also known as the "Lord of Guidance", is one of the legendary White Whistle Delvers in the Abyss, and is therefore presumed to have made outstanding discoveries down in the deep. He made his "Last Dive" to the 6th layer some time before Riko''s journey.', '/uploads/images/c_237658.jpg'),
(109, 'Yumeko Jabami', '蛇喰夢子', '主角', 'Saori Hayami', '__Height:__ 166 cm (5''5") A girl who transfers into Hyakkaou Private Academy. She might look like an attractive young lady, but she is actually a "Kakegurui," someone who finds pleasure in taking risks. Attractive, smooth as silk, and silver-tongued, Yumeko is a natural-born gambler. Gathering the attention of her peers and the entire student council, there''s no denying she enjoys the attention she receives. Despite all odds in a gambling match, she somehow manages to turn the tables in the most daring ways, often times using her perceptiveness to decipher her opponent''s tricks.', '/uploads/images/c_121889.jpg'),
(109, 'Mary Saotome', '早乙女芽亜里', '主角', 'Minami Tanaka', '__Height:__ 162 cm (5''4") Mary Saotome is a deuteragonist of _Kakegurui_, and also the main protagonist of the spin-off series _Kakegurui Twin_. She is a student at Hyakkaou Private Academy, and a classmate of [Yumeko Jabami](https://anilist.co/character/121889) and [Ryota Suzui](https://anilist.co/character/122688) who is the first character in the entire series that challenges Yumeko and loses against her. At first, Mary is shown to be incredibly sadistic and twisted, such as how she treats her classmate Ryota Suzui after he turned into a "housepet", due to his low social status within the academy, and is shown cruelly taunting her fellow opponents during their gambling matches. She''s also shown to be extremely egotistical both in and out of matches, often being confident in her victory. Mary also possesses a habit of mocking her opponents and laughing at them, especially when match seems to be her win. After losing to Yumeko Jabami and experiencing the life of being a housepet, Mary became desperate to regain her status within the academy, having no other goal in her mind. Soon after being humiliated, Mary eventually loses her pride, having a mental breakdown during a match against [Yuriko](https://anilist.co/character/122694/Nishinotouin-Yuriko) and falling into the state of grief and shame. After regaining her status, she seems to be no longer this arrogant and cruel, sometimes being only nettled by Ryota''s cowardice or Yumeko''s reckless behavior, but still deeply caring', '/uploads/images/c_122687.jpg'),
(109, 'Ryouta Suzui', '鈴井涼太', '主角', 'Tatsuya Tokutake', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") Yumeko’s classmate. Cowardly and poor, he quickly ends up being treated as Meari’s livestock, and is called ‘Pochi’ (a common name for a dog). However, he is saved from this predicament by Yumeko.', '/uploads/images/c_122688.jpg'),
(109, 'Sayaka Igarashi', '五十嵐清華', '配角', 'Ayaka Fukuhara', 'Secretary of the Student Council and the right hand of Student council president. She is determined to become Kirari''s ''Number 1,'' and thinks of Yumeko as a plague. Sayaka is intelligent, serious and deeply cares about school and Student Council. She''s endlessly loyal to the Student Council President, Kirari Momobami and will do anything for her. It seems that she has a crush on Kirari, as she expressed concern and sadness when she drove off without telling her where she went and what she was doing. While she seems to be reserved and calm, her subduing of a violent student, Jun Kiwatari and telling him what he now owes in the debt recollection game shows that she''s every bit as terrifying as the rest of the Student Council.', '/uploads/images/c_122690.jpg'),
(109, 'Midari Ikishima', '生志摩妄', '配角', 'Mariya Ise', 'A third-year student and head of the Student Council Beautification Committee. She gets pleasure from taking risks such as starting games of Russian roulette by herself. ~! As she plays a dangerous game with Yumeko while putting both of their lives on the line, she realizes taking risks is such an amazing feeling thanks to Yumeko and her past life. She lost her left eye by stabbing herself with a pen in front of the Student Council, in order to pleasure the President.!~', '/uploads/images/c_122691.jpg'),
(109, 'Kaede Manyuda', '豆生田楓', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', 'A second-year student and student council treasurer. He has a strong desire for power and is very ambitious, to the point where he is plotting to overthrow his seniors, even in the student council, as soon as he has a chance. He is the manipulative Treasurer of the Student Council, having his own goal to take down Kirari Momobami. ~!Became a Housepet with 10 billion Yen debt after losing to Jabami. As a result from his gamble with Yumeko Jabami, his hair turned white. This is an alleged condition called Marie Antoinette syndrome that causes the hair to turn white after facing an abundance of emotional stress.!~', '/uploads/images/c_122692.jpg'),
(109, 'Kirari Momobami', '桃喰綺羅莉', '配角', 'Miyuki Sawashiro', 'Kirari Momobami is the 105th student council president at Hyakkaou Private Academy, and as well as the one responsible for the current hierarchy on the academy.', '/uploads/images/c_122693.jpg'),
(109, 'Yuriko Nishinotouin', '西洞院百合子', '配角', 'Karin Nanami', 'A third-year student, member of the student council, and president of the Tradition Culture Research Society. She ends up challenging [Yumeko](https://anilist.co/character/121889/Jabami-Yumeko) to an original gambling match.', '/uploads/images/c_122694.jpg'),
(109, 'Itsuki Sumeragi', '皇伊月', '配角', 'Yuuki Wakai', 'She''s a first-year student belonging to the "flower" class at Hyakkaou Private Academy and a member of the Student Council. Her father is the president of a prominent toy company in Japan. Her hobby is collecting other people’s nails. ~!Since [Kaede](https://anilist.co/character/122692/Manyuda-Kaede) betted his lifeplan [Yumeko](https://anilist.co/character/121889/Jabami-Yumeko) received it, but gave it to Itsuki. Its apparent, that she actually has feelings for him. She watches over him, as he lays in bed, still under shock. She goes on to collect quite a few votes during the election. And she is also present during Yumemis battle against Kawaru!~', '/uploads/images/c_122696.jpg'),
(109, 'Runa Yomozuki', '黄泉月るな', '配角', 'Mayu Udono', 'She is a member of the Student Council and also a leader of the Election Committee, serving as a referee during election gambling matches. ~!Runa is a sadistic and two-faced person, who seems to be very cute and nice at first but in reality she enjoys watching other people fail and loves to mock them.!~', '/uploads/images/c_122698.jpg'),
(109, 'Ririka Momobami', '桃喰リリカ', '配角', 'Miyuki Sawashiro', 'She is the vice president of the student council and is seen almost entirely throughout the whole time wearing a mask that covers her whole face. Ririka is a very quiet and stoic person. She often acts as an observer.', '/uploads/images/c_122777.jpg'),
(109, 'Yumemi Yumemite', '夢見弖ユメミ', '配角', 'Yuu Serizawa', 'A second-year student in charge of PR for the student council. She also works as an idol, but there’s a huge gap between her facade and her true face. Yumemi has a two-faced personality. On the outside, she is a sweet and lovely girl who loves her fans above all. However, in reality, she''s an arrogant, calculated and sadistic person, who will do everything to be on top. She''s also disgusted by her fans as she often calls them ''pigs'' but at the same time, she doesn''t want to turn in meetings with them, due to her dream of becoming a famous actress in Hollywood and winning an Academy Award. Yumemi never enjoys the dancing routines the fan club comes up with and has shown to be disgusted by their ''sweaty gross palms''. She is motivated by stating on top and achieving an academy reward which is why she involves herself with the fans as much as she can. Even though she is mostly focused on herself, she manages to remember the birthday dates of all her fans in her fan club which she tries using to her advantage when she gets herself caught in a gamble with [Yumeko Jabami](https://anilist.co/character/121889/Jabami-Yumeko). ~!She soon develops a more humble personality later on in Season 2 during her encounter with [Kawaru Natari](https://anilist.co/character/136599/Warakubami-Sumika), an A-List Japanese Hollywood actress whose real identity is Sumika Warakubami.!~', '/uploads/images/c_122778.jpg'),
(109, 'Nanami Tsubomi', '蕾菜々美', '配角', 'Yuka Iguchi', 'She''s a house pet​, who gambled against Yumeko Jabami, Mary Saotome, and Jun Kiwatari in order to lower her debt.', '/uploads/images/c_123178.jpg'),
(109, 'Jun Kiwatari', '木渡潤', '配角', 'Hisao Egawa', 'Jun is portrayed as a typical bully. He is aggressive, arrogant and sadistic person, who loves dominating others. ~!Rank: Housepet Debt: 310 Million Yen He made use of Tsubomi Nanami''s housepet status and cut her long hair, probably only because she really valued them and threatened Yumeko Jabami when she didn''t strip in front of him and his friends. He battle''s Nanami, Yumeko and Mary. In that battle, he was cheating with Nanami. That''s the reason why Yumeko and Mary were allies. In the end, he lost and end up being a Housepet.!~', '/uploads/images/c_123179.jpg'),
(109, 'Shinnouji', '新王寺', '配角', 'Nobuyuki Kobushi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_136607.jpg'),
(109, 'Saori', '沙織', '配角', 'Umeka Shouji', 'She is the manager of the Student Council''s Head of Public Relations, Yumemi Yumemite. She is the daughter of a big time producer', '/uploads/images/c_136613.jpg'),
(109, 'Kumagusu', '熊楠', '配角', 'Haruka Shimizu', 'She cares a lot about Yuriko Nishinotouin and is very worried, when Yuriko collapsed after being poisoned by Miyo Inbami.', '/uploads/images/c_137302.jpg'),
(109, 'Souko Jabami', '蛇喰想子', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_161206.png'),
(110, 'Momonga', 'モモンガ', '主角', 'Satoshi Hino', 'He is the guild master of Ainz Ooal Gown and regarded as the highest of the Almighty 41 Supreme Beings by the NPCs of the Great Tomb of Nazarick. He is also the creator of [Pandora''s Actor](https://anilist.co/character/89154/Pandoras-Actor). A cautious and stingy person, Momonga always tries to plan and control details, avoiding any haphazard actions. Because he doesn''t underestimate his opponents, he will usually overkill them. Since being transferred to a new world and becoming an actual Undead being, Momonga could feel himself becoming very cold and calculating, his emotions repressed. Loyal to his friends and creations, since becoming Lord ruler of Nazarick in the new world he acts with a certain degree of nobility for his devoted followers. Momonga only does things that will benefit Nazarick or himself, whether its information or prestige. Although he does have a sense of justice and doesn''t hate humans as much as his followers, he holds no attachment to them, and he feels nothing toward their deaths. ~!His real name is Satoru Suzuki.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89103.png'),
(110, 'Shalltear Bloodfallen', 'シャルティア・ブラッドフォールン', '配角', 'Sumire Uesaka', 'The Guardian of the First, Second, and Third floors of Nazarick, she has the form of a beautiful vampire girl. She''s also in love with [Momonga](https://anilist.co/character/89103). She and [Albedo](https://anilist.co/character/89122) constantly clash for his attention. While the two don''t mind sharing Momonga, they still fight for superiority and who would ultimately appeal to Momonga. Shalltear is one of the most powerful guardians, allegedly capable of going toe-to-toe with Albedo. ~!Due to an incident where she is subjected to mind control by a member of the Black Scripture, she ends up unintentionally rebelling against Nazarick.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89121.png'),
(110, 'Albedo', 'アルベド', '配角', 'Yumi Hara', 'The overseer of the Floor Guardians and one of the most powerful NPC in Nazarick. She takes the form of a beautiful woman with fallen angel wings and horns. Because [Ainz](https://anilist.co/character/89103) modified her settings on a whim, she ends up madly in love with him. Albedo''s romantic obsessions are so strong that if Ainz were to even glance at her body, she would immediately become excited. Albedo''s obsession with Ainz has led him to greatly regret his actions. While she tries to act calm, as befitting of her role, any perceived insult against Ainz or Nazarick, real or imagined, sends her into a rage. Like most inhabitants of Nazarick, she despises humans which she refers to as "lower life-forms." ~!Though the reason is not yet known, Albedo holds a strong hatred towards all of the 41 Supreme Beings except for Ainz. It is hinted that she is scheming to annihilate all the other guild members if they are found.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89122.png'),
(110, 'Solution Epsilon', 'ソリュシャン・イプシロン', '配角', 'Ayane Sakura', 'One of the Pleiades. She''s a slime and one of the most dangerous Pleiades to humans, since she enjoys devouring humans alive. An assassin and poisoner who can decide to protect or dissolve things she absorbs, she can also control the speed of her digestion. She gets along with [Shalltear](https://anilist.co/character/89121) because of their similar tastes', '/uploads/images/c_89123.png'),
(110, 'Demiurge', 'デミウルゴス', '配角', 'Masayuki Katou', 'The Guardian of the Seventh floor of Nazarick, with the form of a demon wearing glasses. Demiurge is very intelligent, but is also considered the most evil NPC on Nazarick. He greatly enjoys the suffering of others, made clear by his vicious experiments on prisoners. He''s in charge of tactics and defenses of Nazarick. Among the Guardians, he gets along the best with [Mare](https://anilist.co/character/89126/Bello-Fiore-Mare), since he understands the more cunning side of the Dark Elf.', '/uploads/images/c_89125.png'),
(110, 'Mare Bello Fiore', 'マーレ・ベロ・フィオーレ', '配角', 'Yumi Uchiyama', 'One of the Guardians of the Sixth floor of Nazarick alongside his twin sister [Aura](https://anilist.co/character/89129). He''s rather shy and calm in comparison to his sister, although he can fight and be ruthless when necessary. Like his sister, Mare is a Dark Elf. Mare specializes in Druid magic, capable of twisting the earth to his whims.', '/uploads/images/c_89126.png'),
(110, 'Aura Bella Fiora', 'アウラ・ベラ・フィオーラ', '配角', 'Emiri Katou', 'One of the Guardians of the Sixth floor of Nazarick, alongside her twin brother [Mare](https://anilist.co/character/89126). She''s very energetic and extroverted, in contrast with her brother. Aura is a 70-year-old Dark Elf. Despite constantly fighting, she and Shalltear are quite close. Aura specializes in beast-taming and fights with a long, bladed whip.', '/uploads/images/c_89129.png'),
(110, 'Cocytus', 'コキュートス', '配角', 'Kenta Miyake', 'Cocytus is the guardian of the Fifth floor of Nazarick. An insectoid heteromorph, he was created by Warrior Takemikazuchi to be an honourable warrior and is tasked with keeping a cache of powerful weapons for Nazarick. He has a neutral alignment, which stands out against the many evil entities in Nazarick. An extremely skilled fighter, Cocytus is an expert at selecting the right combination of weapons for the fight, and dealing huge amounts of damage quickly. With the help of his extra arms, he is capable of wielding four of his twenty-one weapons at once, allowing him to deal the highest damage per second of any floor guardian.', '/uploads/images/c_89138.png'),
(110, 'Narberal Gamma', 'ナーベラル・ガンマ', '配角', 'Manami Numakura', 'One of the Pleiades, combat maids of the Tenth floor under [Sebas Tian](https://anilist.co/character/89155). She''s a Doppelgänger and, because she''s one of the most human-looking of the maids, she is [Momonga](https://anilist.co/character/89103)''s companion in his exploration of the new world disguised as adventurers. Narberal takes great pride in this duty, often "wearing" it like a badge of honor. However, like most in Nazarick, she holds great disdain towards humans. This proves troublesome, as she becomes incredibly violent when human males make advances on her. While operating as a member of the adventuring guild, "Darkness", Narberal operates under the alias of "Nabe", which becomes "Nabe, the Beautiful Lady" when Darkness becomes famous. Narberal''s beauty has been compared to that of the "Golden Princess of Re-Estize" by many of the country''s inhabitants.', '/uploads/images/c_89152.png'),
(110, 'Sebas Tian', 'セバス・チャン', '配角', 'Shigeru Chiba', 'The butler of the Tenth floor of Nazarick, who specializes in unarmed combat, with power comparable with the other Floor Guardians. He has the appearance of an elderly gentleman with a neat beard, but is actually of a species known as Dragonoids. He has a strong sense of justice, like his creator. Thus, he dislikes when the other Guardians kill humans needlessly. Because of their opposite personalities, he and [Demiurge](https://anilist.co/character/89125/Demiurge) don''t get along.', '/uploads/images/c_89155.png'),
(110, 'Evileye', 'イビルアイ', '配角', 'Yumiri Hanamori', 'Evileye is an adamantite ranked adventurer and magic caster of Blue Roses as well as a former companion of the Thirteen Heroes. Evileye has the figure of a twelve-year-old girl. She covers herself with a reddish robe and an uncanny mask which hides her face. Because of this, she is considered an enigmatic woman by others. Due to her short stature, she is called "Shorty" by Gagaran. Evileye''s young appearance is presumably due to being an immortal vampire, which caused her body to stop developing at the age of twelve.', '/uploads/images/c_125881.jpg'),
(110, 'Entoma Vasilissa Zeta', 'エントマ・ヴァシリッサ・ゼータ', '配角', 'Kei Shindou', 'One of the members of the battle maids originally created by Genjiro. ~!She has the appearance of a normal girl but her true form is that of an arachanid hybrid. She has bug mask to cover her real face. She uses a leech that recreates human voices after it kills them to disguise her original voice. She has insect focused abilities and uses talismans.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126281.jpg'),
(110, 'Shizu Delta', 'シズ・デルタ', '配角', 'Asami Seto', 'One of the members of the battle maids originally created by someone except for Tabula Smaragdina. CZ2I28 Delta is an automaton battle maid and member of the "Pleiades Six Stars," the battle maid squad of the Great Tomb of Nazarick. CZ2128 appears emotionless and has a silent nature. Her Karma is relatively high, which makes her, along with Yuri Alpha, one of the two "safe" Pleiades to humans. Though she usually ignores conversations from humans, sometimes there is a possibility to communicate with her. She hates cannibalism and likes cute things, such as Eclair.', '/uploads/images/c_126841.jpg'),
(110, 'Gazef Stronoff', 'ガゼフ・ストロノーフ', '配角', 'Hiroshi Shirokuma', '__Race:__ Human __Affiliation:__ Re-Estize Kingdom __Occupation:__ Warrior Captain Gazeff Stronoff is the Warrior Captain of the Re-Estize Kingdom and King Ramposa III''s personal bodyguard, and professes his utmost loyalty to him. Incredibly talented with the sword and well-versed in martial arts, he is famously considered the strongest warrior in the entire kingdom, and commands the respect and admiration of everyone who knows his name. Due to internal power struggles among the nobles in the kingdom, Gazeff is not knighted, so the King granted him the title of "Warrior Captain", which allows him to command his own unit comprised of "Warrior Troops". Born a commoner in a frontier village, he later became a mercenary. During his travels, he encountered a former adamantite-ranked adventurer who taught him his extraordinary swordsmanship. He participated in the grand tournament and defeated Brain Unglaus, becoming the champion and earning the King''s trust.', '/uploads/images/c_126869.png'),
(110, 'Lupusregina Beta', 'ルプスレギナ・ベータ', '配角', 'Mikako Komatsu', 'A member of the "Pleiades Six Stars", the battle maid squad of the Great Tomb of Nazarick. She serves as the role of battle cleric and focuses on healing magic. In terms of combat ability, she possesses the highest physical defense and resistances among the Pleiades, and has balanced stats overall. Being a werewolf, she is weak to silver weapons, but is blessed with resistance against other metals. Her appearance is that of a brown-skinned beauty with amber-colored eyes, and red hair which she ties in two long braids. She wears a maid uniform with short sleeves and long black gloves, white stockings, and a skirt that has a long slit on its left side. She is usually seen carrying her signature weapon slung across her back, a menacing black and silver scepter which looks like and oversized religious symbol, the Crosier. Lupusregina boasts a very sociable and outgoing personality, and seems very friendly, even towards humans, a race considered unworthy of respect by other beings of Nazarick. For example, she adds "-chan" to the other maid''s names, and often likes teasing [Enri](https://anilist.co/character/128405) with lewd jokes. The Homunculus Maids (the ordinary maids of Nazarick) are convinced she''s the friendliest of the Pleiades and even believe that being approached by her can be a sign of good fortune. However, her fellow battle-maid [Yuri Alpha](https://anilist.co/character/128288) has commented that Lupusregina''s friendliness is merely a facade, and that in reality she', '/uploads/images/c_126870.jpg'),
(110, 'Jircniv Rune Farlord El Nix', 'ジルクニフ・ルーン・ファーロード・エル＝ニクス', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', 'Jircniv Rune Farlord El Nix is the current Emperor of the Baharuth Empire. He is also known as the Bloody Emperor.', '/uploads/images/c_126961.png'),
(110, 'Renner Theiere Chardelon Ryle Vaiself', 'ラナー・ティエール・シャルドルン・ライル・ヴァイセルフ', '配角', 'Kiyono Yasuno', 'Renner is the third princess of Re-Estize Kingdom and the childhood friend of [Climb](https://anilist.co/character/128287). She is also known as the Golden Princess for being a reformer who brought major changes within the kingdom such as the ban on slavery. She is the youngest daughter of King Lanposa III and the younger sister of [Barbro](https://anilist.co/character/179054) and [Zanac](https://anilist.co/character/128567). Renner is described as a young girl with long golden hair, silky smooth and supple as it drapes over the back of her neck. She has vibrant, dark blue eyes that shine like sapphires filled with warmth. She wears a fashionable white dress which further strengthens her image of purity. Around her neck hangs a golden necklace, appearing to symbolize her noble soul. Renner is known publicly as the Golden Princess for her benevolence and kindness. While she is believed to be a saint, in reality she has a psychopathic personality and doesn''t care about the feelings of others. The only exception to this is her childhood friend, Climb. If Climb was wounded, she would declare that anyone involved would be ruthlessly killed.', '/uploads/images/c_127241.jpg'),
(110, 'Zaryusu Shasha', 'ザリュース・シャシャ', '配角', 'Hiroki Touchi', 'Zaryusu Shasha is a lizardman of the Green Claw Tribe, and he''s the younger brother of its chieftain, Shasuryu Shasha. His scales are dark green and black charcoal in color. A very wise individual, he is also regarded as the strongest lizardman and he is the wielder of the magical blade Frost Pain, one of the few precious treasures the lizardmen possess. Zaryusu is a traveler, which is the name given to a lizardman who left the village in order to explore the outside world, and has a crimson brand/tattoo on his chest which denotes his status as such. Travelers are very respected individuals among the lizardmen, but conversely they don''t have a say in any important matters, which heavily implies they might be socially shunned. He has a Hydra as a pet named Rororo. Zaryusu stumbled upon it during his travels after finding it had been abandoned by its mother. Rororo is actually a deformed Hydra, because it has only four heads, while normally hydras have six. Rororo regards Zaryusu as his parent and would do practically anything to protect him. ~!Zaryusu falls in love with Crusch Lulu the moment he meets her, and claiming it''s love at first sight, he immediately proposes in marriage. She eventually reciprocated his feelings and just before the lizardmen''s final battle, Crusch fearful that he might die asks him to impregnate her with his child. Ainz proposed that the lizardmen fight for the right to their freedom in a duel against Ainz''s champion, Cocytus. Due to the massive skill', '/uploads/images/c_127431.jpg'),
(110, 'Shasuryu Shasha', 'シャースーリュー・シャシャ', '配角', 'Naomi Kusumi', 'Shasuryu Shasha is the leader of the lizardmen''s tribes and chieftain of the Green Claw Tribe. His younger brother is Zaryusu. He is a skilled warrior in addition to a proficient druid, which allows him to complement his weapon attacks with magic. Unlike other lizardmen who have bone weapons, his sword is forged of pure steel. Incredibly huge in stature, he has dark green and charcoal black scales, a trait which he shares with his younger brother. Numerous scars are present all over his body, the most prominent of which is an old, long white scar, which stands out amongst his dark-colored scales. Shasuryu follows his ancestors’ traditions, but he is also not blinded by them and is one of the more practical minded lizardmen, as evidenced by the decision to support his brother''s innovative idea, which led to the creation of the fishery farms near the Green Tribe village. ~!Shasuryu Shasha led the chieftains, save Crusch Lulu, and a band of the strongest warriors of the Lizardmen Alliance in the duel against Cocytus. The majority of the warriors perished in one fell swoop due to Cocytus''s freezing ability, and only the chieftains remained. Ultimately, Shasuryu and Zaryusu were last lizardmen to be left standing. He sacrificed his life in order to create an opening for his brother to attack Cocytus. Unfortunately, his brother was unable to cause damage, and was also slain shortly. However, their acts and sacrifices in battle were not meaningless, since they earned Cocytus'' respec', '/uploads/images/c_127432.jpg'),
(110, 'Zenberu Gugu', 'ゼンベル・ググー', '配角', 'Kouji Ishii', 'Zenberu Gugu is a lizardman and the chieftain of one of the five lizardmen tribes, the Dragon Tusk Tribe. He is a traveler, a lizardman who has explored the outside world. In terms of brute force, he is most likely the strongest of all the lizardmen. Zenberu is not a warrior by profession, but rather a monk which fights utilizing Ki to enhance his natural physical abilities. He often prefers to fight unarmed, using his claws to rip apart his enemies. In armed combat, he wields a three-meter-long steel halberd, a parting gift he received from an acquaintance of his, a dwarf. With a very muscular constitution, he is quite tall for a lizardman, well exceeding two meters in height. His body, covered by several scars, gives the clear impression that he is veteran of battle. His most bizarre feature are his asymmetrical arms. Similar in trait with a fiddler crab, his right arm is especially thicker and muscular when compared to his left. His left arm’s ring finger and pinky are completely gone. The crimson "traveler" brand burned in the form of a two headed snake is displayed on the center of his chest. Overall, his appearance is very crocodile-like, and when he talks, his teeth clash together, making it difficult for others to discern whether he is being casual or threatening. Zenberu is quite blunt when in a conversation, having no need for pointless formalities. Intead of diplomacy, he favors solving disputes with duels, and has somewhat of a cockish attitude, since he likes to ', '/uploads/images/c_127433.jpg'),
(110, 'Crusch Lulu', 'クルシュ・ルールー', '配角', 'Sora Amamiya', 'Crusch Lulu is an albino white lizardman and the chieftain of the Red Eye tribe. Over the course of time, she proved herself to be a strong practitioner of magic. Currently, she is the strongest of all the magic casters that exist within the lizardmen tribes. Her magic consists of controlling nature and summoning spirits to assist her in different ways. She has snow white scales and spotless purity, bright red eyes like rubies and slim limbs. Since she was born an albino, in the lizardmen community that would normally mean that she would be abandoned. In Lulu''s case however, her parents decided to raise her even with this genetic fault. Due to her this, Crusch burns easily in the sun and is very weak against direct sunlight, which forces her to wear a ridiculous bush outfit during the day. [Zenberu](https://anilist.co/character/127433/Gugu-Zenberu) teases her about it and refers to her as ''Plant Monster''. ~!He met [Zaryusu](https://anilist.co/character/127431/Shasha-Zaryusu) when he visited Red Eye tribe in order to propose the formation of an alliance. She revealed that when the famine in the Wetlands occurred, the Red Eye tribe managed to stave off extinction through fratricide. However, unable to bear with the guilt and shame, Crusch led a rebellion against the previous chief. Her rebellion was a success and the mantle of leadership was passed down to her. Eventually she fell in love with Zaryusu, a feeling had been mutual since the moment he had met her. Before the lizard', '/uploads/images/c_127434.jpg'),
(110, 'Touch Me', 'たっち・みー', '配角', 'Ryoutarou Okiayu', 'Touch Me is one of the original founding members of the Ainz Ooal Gown guild and one of the strongest warriors in YGGDRASIL. He is regarded as one of the Forty-One Supreme Beings by the NPCs of the Great Tomb of Nazarick. He is the creator of Sebas Tian. At some point in YGGDRASIL, Touch Me participated in an official martial tournament and defeated all of his adversaries. By winning the tournament, he was awarded a special prize that comes in two. Firstly, he was given a special job class known as the "World Champion" of Álfheimr, and in addition he was awarded with the pure white armor set called "Compliance with Law." Touch Me''s outfit consists of shining white armor and a helm. His chest piece contains a huge sapphire embedded in the middle, which radiates with pure and divine light. He is also adorned with a reddish cape attached around his right shoulder. Additionally, he is armed with both sword and shield. Touch Me''s actual facial appearance in real life is said to look exactly like Sebas Tian. As Touch Me played YGGDRASIL, he decided to assist the heteromorphic players during a time when they were being hunted down for fun through PKing. Thus, that was how he met Momonga, by saving him from a PK party; the two started becoming friends since then. There was also a time when Bukubukuchagama could not find a party to adventure with due to her appearance, so he was the one who approached her before anyone else. Afterwards, they formed a party together with other non-huma', '/uploads/images/c_127437.jpg'),
(110, 'Lakyus Alvein Dale Aindra', 'ラキュース・アルベイン・デイル・アインドラ', '配角', 'Ami Koshimizu', 'Lakyus is an adamantite ranked adventurer and the leader of Blue Rose. She is part of the nobility, friend of the Re-Estize Royal Family, and loyal to the people of Re-Estize Kingdom. She acts as a faith based magic caster and warrior priestess of her adventurer group. She is described as a young women that has long blonde hair with green eyes and pink lips that showed a healthy gleam. Her beauty falls short of Renner but overflows with a different charm. Lakyus is a very bright person who enjoys adventuring with her friends. She sometimes acts weird like wearing apparently meaningless rings or fighting against her dark personality, making her other team members worry about her actually becoming evil. When Lakyus was a young girl, she decided to become an adventurer after hearing the adventure stories about Red Drop. She ran away from home to have an adventure, while she was still inexperienced, she was saved by Gagaran and the two became partners. Lakyus becomes one of the strongest adventurers of the kingdom at the age of 19 for her near Heroic-level abilities. She is also one of the few users of revival magic. (Source: Overlord Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_127667.jpg'),
(110, 'Gagaran', 'ガガーラン', '配角', 'Kimiko Saitou', 'She is an adamantite ranked adventurer and a warrior from Blue Rose', '/uploads/images/c_127669.jpg'),
(110, 'Tina', 'ティナ', '配角', 'Miyu Tomita', 'Tina is an adamantite ranked adventurer and a member of Blue Rose. She is the twin sister of Tia.', '/uploads/images/c_127670.jpg'),
(110, 'Brain Unglaus', 'ブレイン・アングラウス', '配角', 'Kouji Yusa', 'Brain is a warrior turned mercenary after he lost to Gazef Stronoff in a grand tournament to determine the strongest fighter in Re-Estize Kingdom. He has brown eyes with blue hair and the appearance of a wild beast. He is equipped with a chainmail and wears a necklace and ring which are infused with protection magic. His whole body is lean and his muscles are tough as steel and tempered through experience. Originally a farmer, he was gifted with what could only be described as a God-given talent in the mastery of the sword. He has always believed himself to be the strongest fighter inside the Kingdom, having never lost a fight before he entered the grand tournament to decide the King''s guard captain. He easily fought his way to the final where he faced off against Gazef Stronoff. A grand and close battle ensued between the two, but eventually,​ he would taste his first defeat at the hand of Gazef. His fame was shattered and his confidence as an unbeatable warrior took a hit. He then decided to do everything he could to become stronger, so he would truly become unbeatable. At the same time, in order to make a living he started working as a mercenary for the Death Spreading Brigade. ~!When first introduced he is very arrogant, thinking that he is the most powerful, even though he earlier lost to Gazef. While a mercenary, he suffered a devastating defeat at the hand of Shalltear Bloodfallen when she attacked the hideout of the Death Spreading Brigade. After that, his personality', '/uploads/images/c_128263.png'),
(110, 'Tuareninya Veyron', 'ツアレニーニャ・ベイロン', '配角', 'Yuu Shimamura', '~!Tuareninya is the Head Maid Candidate of E-Rantel and the older sister of Ninya. She is under the protection of Ainz Ooal Gown after Sebas Tian saved her from the brothel in the Royal Capital.!~ (Source: Overlord Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_128267.jpg'),
(110, 'Climb', 'クライム', '配角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', 'The Personal Bodyguard of Princess Renner. She saved him when he was just a street urchin about to die from sickness. As such, he views his services to her as a fulfilling of that debt he owes and is even willing to give up his life for her. However, he remains unaware of Renner''s true nature. He is rather disliked due to him having such a position despite not even being a commoner, but an urchin. Despite this position, he holds no talent at fighting, making up for it with sheer effort. He eventually meets Sebas and, after convincing him to teach him some of his skills, they become friends, though he remains unaware of his loyalty towards Ainz. He also has a close friendship with Gazef and Brain as well as several members of Blue Rose. (Source: Wikipedia)', '/uploads/images/c_128287.jpg'),
(110, 'Yuri Alpha', 'アルファユリ', '配角', 'Hiromi Igarashi', 'The Vice-Captain, but de facto leader of the Pleiades. She is a Dullahan who uses a choker to keep her head attached to the rest of her body, causing her to appear to be human. She specializes in unarmed combat and uses Gauntlets in battle. She is programmed to behave like a teacher, because her creator was one, and the other Pleiades look up to her like a big sister. Like Sebas, she holds a primarily neutral stance towards outsiders, but unlike him, her sense of justice is not so strong that she''d help people like him. (Source: Wikipedia)', '/uploads/images/c_128288.jpg'),
(110, 'Nemu Emmot', 'ネム・エモット', '配角', 'Marika Kouno', 'Race: Human Affiliation: Sorcerer Kingdom Re-Estize Kingdom (Formerly) Family: Enri Emmot (Older Sister) Nfirea Bareare (Brother-In-Law) Occupation: Villager Residence: Carne Village Nemu has a childish and naive personality, but it seems that she may actually know more than her older sister. She used to be more bold and rebel, but after the attack to her village and the death of her parents she try to be more useful and obedient to help Enri. However, it seems that her boldness comes back when she gets emotional, like the time that she visited Nazarick', '/uploads/images/c_128402.jpg'),
(110, 'Lizzie Bareare', 'リィジー・バレアレ', '配角', 'Ikuko Tani', 'Race: Human Affiliation: Sorcerer Kingdom Re-Estize Kingdom (Formerly) Family: Nfirea Bareare (Grandson) Occupation: Herbalist Potion Maker Residence E-Rantel (Formerly) Carne Village (Currently) is a pharmacist who used to operate in E-Rantel and the grandmother of Nfirea Bareare. When Nfirea was kidnapped by Zurrernorn, she made a deal with Ainz to rescue him in return for her services. Afterwards, she moved to Carne Village. Though a seemingly old woman, Lizzie Bareare is still quite sharp for her age. Highly knowledgeable about the make-up, properties and lore of potions. She also has a demanding and fastidious personality. Her intense gaze gives other people the shivers. Renown throughout the city of E-Rantel, Lizzie Bareare holds the title as the city''s best pharmacist.', '/uploads/images/c_128403.jpg'),
(110, 'Nfirea Bareare', 'ンフィーレア・バレアレ', '配角', 'Ayumu Murase', '__Race:__ Human __Affiliation:__ Sorcerer Kingdom, Re-Estize Kingdom (Formerly) __Family:__ Lizzie Bareare (Grandmother), Enri Emmot (Wife), Nemu Emmot (Sister-In-Law) __Occupation:__ Herbalist, Potion Maker __Residence:__ E-Rantel (Formerly), Carne Village (Currently) __Birthday:__ Middle Wind Month 18th Day __Hobby:__ Alchemical Experiments. Nfirea is described as a nice, calm and timid person. He works hard at making potions with his grandmother every day. He also has a minor inferiority complex, due to comparing himself to Ainz. At a young age, Nfirea Bareare was raised by his grandmother Lizzie Bareare after his parents died; he only has murky impressions of them. His grandmother made him her apprentice and taught him everything she knew about herbs, alchemy, and potion-making. He met Enri Emmot while delivering potions to Carne Village and developed feelings for her.', '/uploads/images/c_128404.jpg'),
(110, 'Enri Emmot', 'エンリ・エモット', '配角', 'Mao Ichimichi', 'Race: Human Race Affiliation Sorcerer Kingdom Re-Estize Kingdom (Formerly) is the Chieftain of Carne Village and the older sister of Nemu Emmot. Raised by a loving family, Enri has grown up to be a kind person, but has shown to have a strong character. As seen when she is willing to sacrifice herself for the sake of her little sister''s life. She shows great leadership, being the new village head and defending the town from monsters with the other villagers. Growing up in Carne Village and living there all her life, Enri has always lived the life of a simple farmer''s daughter. Due to her healthy lifestyle, Enri has grown to be physically fit to the point where she is considered as one of the strongest five in the village.', '/uploads/images/c_128405.jpg'),
(110, 'Tia', 'ティア', '配角', 'Shizuka Ishigami', 'Tia is an adamantite ranked adventurer and a member of Blue Rose. She is the twin sister of Tina. (Source: Overlord Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_128565.jpg'),
(110, 'Victim', 'ヴィクティム', '配角', 'Nao Touyama', 'Victim is a Floor Guardian on the eighth floor of the Great Tomb of Nazarick. It has the appearance of 1 meter long bright pink embryo with an angelic halo and featherless stick-like wings. Despite being one of the most rarely seen of the Floor Guardians, Victim is courteous to his colleagues. Victim speaks in a different language than the others NPCs, but though he speaks in an alien tongue, they nevertheless seem to have no trouble understanding him. He is humble and modest about his position as a living sacrifice, believing it is his sole duty and purpose to serve the Supreme Beings and Nazarick. Victim did not exist in the web novel version.', '/uploads/images/c_128566.jpg'),
(110, 'Zanac Valleon Igana Ryle Vaiself', 'ザナック・ヴァルレオン・イガナ・ライル・ヴァイセルフ', '配角', 'Kouji Fujiyoshi', 'Zanac is the Second Prince of Re-Estize Kingdom, son of Lanposa III. He is the younger brother of Barbro and older brother of Renner. He is described as a short and fat man. He is described as an incompetent person, but is actually quite sensible, capable of comprehending the true natures of Renner and Marquis Raeven. Zanac is aiming for the throne and as such wants to remove the first prince from the line of succession. (Source: Overlord Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_128567.jpg'),
(110, 'Elias Brandt Dale  Raeven', 'エリアス・ブラント・デイル・レエブン', '配角', 'Takuya Kirimoto', 'Elias is the leader of the King''s Faction and the most powerful noble amongst the six major nobles in Re-Estize Kingdom. He is a tall, thin man with slicked back blonde hair. He looks like a snake due to his pale-white skin and narrow blue eyes. Though his intelligent and careful nature makes him seem cold hearted, Elias is a good father and a patriot in the Kingdom. As one of the six great nobles, Elias possesses clothes of the highest quality. He wears a doublet made from high quality fur woven with golden threads. There are intricate patterns and small jewels sewn into his clothes. Elias originally aimed for the throne, but the birth of his son made him forsake this goal. He now simply wants to give his son a better life. He commands the highest authority among the six major nobles. He is known to be an opportunist, cooperating with both Patricians and Loyalists from time to time and constantly switching between the two factions like a snake in order to further his own goals. However, Elias is in fact the leader of the Loyalists, and his behavior as an opportunist is just a performance to prevent the Kingdom from splitting. His true colors are classified, and even Gazef misunderstands him as a traitor. Web novel: ~!In the web novel version, Elias did not survive the massacre during the war between the Kingdom and the Empire.!~ (Source: Overlord Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_128568.jpg'),
(110, 'Hamusuke', 'ハムスケ', '配角', 'Akeno Watanabe', 'Hamsuke resembles a giant Djungarian hamster with a long snake tail. Six sigils dot her silvery fur. Before being inducted in the Great Tomb of Nazarick, Hamusuke was very boastful and prideful of her ability and power as the "Virtuous King of the Forest." However, since meeting [Momonga](https://anilist.co/character/89103) and witnessing the power of the denizens of Nazarick, she has seen how vastly inferior she is. She accepts this and swears loyalty to Momonga, willing to do anything to please his master and earn his keep.', '/uploads/images/c_128569.jpg'),
(110, 'Antilene Fouche', 'アンティリーネ・ヘラン・フーシェ', '配角', 'Yukari Tamura', 'Antilene Heran Fouche (Zesshi Zetsumei) is the holder of the extra seat in the Black Scripture. She is plagued with extreme boredom with everything except battle.', '/uploads/images/c_177011.png'),
(110, 'Ramposa III', 'ランポッサIII', '配角', 'Katsumi Chou', 'Ramposa III is the current king of the Re-Estize Kingdom. He is the father of Barbro, Zanac and Renner.', '/uploads/images/c_179047.jpg'),
(110, 'Pestonya Shortcake Wanko', 'ペストーニャ・ショートケーキ・ワンコ', '配角', 'Satomi Arai', '**Pestonya Shortcake Wanko** is the Head maid of the Homunculus Maids of the Great Tomb of Nazarick. She is one of the few NPCs who does not look down on normal humans and would prefer to be kind to them, alongside [Sebas](https://anilist.co/character/89155/Sebas-Tian) and [Yuri Alpha](https://anilist.co/character/128288/Yuri-Alpha). (Source: Wikipedia)', '/uploads/images/c_183730.jpg'),
(110, 'Hilma Cygnaeus', 'ヒルマ・シュグネウス', '配角', 'Toa Yukinari', 'Leader of the drug trade department of the criminal organization, Eight Fingers.', '/uploads/images/c_191160.jpg'),
(110, 'Malmvist', 'マルムヴィスト', '配角', 'Hiromichi Tezuka', 'Member of Six Arms, the security department of the criminal organization Eight Fingers.', '/uploads/images/c_191161.png'),
(110, 'Staffan Heivish', 'スタッファン ・ ヘーウィッシュ', '配角', 'Yutaka Aoyama', 'Patrol officer of Re-Estize and he is also an operative of the Eight Fingers.', '/uploads/images/c_191162.png'),
(110, 'Edstrom', 'エドストレーム', '配角', 'Eriko Matsui', 'Sole female member of Six Arms, the security department of the criminal organization Eight Fingers.', '/uploads/images/c_191163.png'),
(110, 'Succulent', 'サキュロント', '配角', 'Atsushi Imaruoka', 'Member of Six Arms, the security department of the criminal organization Eight Fingers.', '/uploads/images/c_191164.png'),
(110, 'Sous-chef', '副料理長', '配角', 'Takuya Satou', 'NPC of the Great Tomb of Nazarick. He normally works in the Restaurant of Nazarick, but during a specific day of the week, he manages a bar on the 9th Floor.', '/uploads/images/c_191165.png'),
(110, 'Eclair Ecleir Eicler', 'エクレア・エクレール・エイクレアー', '配角', 'Nobuyuki Hiyama', 'Assistant butler of the Great Tomb of Nazarick.', '/uploads/images/c_191166.png'),
(110, 'Peshurian', 'ペシュリアン', '配角', 'Shouta Yamamoto', 'Member of Six Arms, the security department of the criminal organization Eight Fingers.', '/uploads/images/c_191167.png'),
(110, 'Davernoch', 'デイバーノック', '配角', 'Shunichi Maki', 'Member of Six Arms, the security department of the criminal organization Eight Fingers.', '/uploads/images/c_191168.png'),
(110, 'Zero', 'ゼロ', '配角', 'Rintarou Nishi', 'Leader of Six Arms, Eight Fingers'' security department. ~!He gets killed by Sebas later in Season 2.!~', '/uploads/images/c_191169.png'),
(110, 'Ampetif Cocco Doll', 'アンペティフ・コッコドール', '配角', 'Yoshimitsu Shimoyama', 'Leader of the slave trafficking department of the criminal organization Eight Fingers. He was freed from by his comrades during Re-Estize''s Destruction to rejoin the orginazation now under the control of Nazarick', '/uploads/images/c_191170.png'),
(110, 'Taichou', '隊長', '配角', 'Kentarou Tone', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_203948.png'),
(111, 'Akira Fudou', '不動明', '主角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', '__Height:__ 182 cm Akira is a shy, soft spoken, and somewhat cowardly teen. His father has recently went to work in America so he is currently living with his friend Miki''s family. He hasn''t seen his best friend Ryo in over a month since moving in with Miki''s family. When they reunite he is in for a big surprise that will forever change him, his life, and all of mankind. ~!Devilman is Akira Fudo after he merged with Amon in order to save mankind from the demons. While he usually stays in his human form, he turns into Devilman when he needs to fight seriously. Akira still retains his human heart after he becomes Devilman, meaning he can feel love and empathy unlike demons, but his personality changes drastically as a result of the merge.!~', '/uploads/images/c_2456.jpg'),
(111, 'Ryo Asuka', '飛鳥了', '主角', 'Ayumu Murase', 'The best friend of Akira Fudo, the main character of Nagai Go''s classical horror manga Devilman. As Akira is the strength, Ryo is the brain. His father discovered the existence of demons in our world and decided to fight them. He asked his friend Akira for help. Ryo knew that to be able to beat a demon, one had to become a demon. He and Akira went through a ritual to fuse with demons, but in the end, only Akira was able to do so and became Devilman, leaving Ryo remain as a normal human. ~!Ryo''s true identity was much more horrible, much more terrifying than he or Akira could''ve ever imagined. Ryo turned out to be Satan himself, who sought to destroy the world. Satan is depicted as a beautiful hermaphroditic Seraphim angel with twelve wings. However, it is later revealed by Zenon that Satan is in fact in love with Akira. The Devil''s love for Akira was developed through the human relationship between Akira and Ryo.!~', '/uploads/images/c_4092.jpg'),
(111, 'Psycho Jenny', 'サイコジェニー', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Takato', '~!Psycho Jenny is one of the leading figures in Satan''s demon army.!~', '/uploads/images/c_7966.jpg'),
(111, 'Tare Makimura', '村健タレ', '配角', 'Eri Inagawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_7967.jpg'),
(111, 'Miki Makimura', '牧村美樹', '主角', 'Megumi Han', '~!Miki Makimura was a lifelong friend to Akira Fudo and had an attraction to him, but Akira often failed to notice, or they never admitted their feelings to one another before Miki’s tragic end. It is tragically rare for Miki to get a good ending. (Source: Go Nagai Wiki)!~', '/uploads/images/c_7968.jpg'),
(111, 'Miki Kuroda', '黒田ミキ', '配角', 'Ami Koshimizu', 'Mikiko Kawamoto is a supporting character in the original Devilman manga. In the 2017 anime adaptation, _Devilman Crybaby_, Miki Kuroda is on the running track team along with Akira Fudo and Miki Makimura.', '/uploads/images/c_7971.jpg'),
(111, 'Amon', 'アモン', '配角', '', 'Amon''s original human appearance resembled a light skinned male with messy black hair and dark eyes that featured markings coming down from those eyes. When on duty, he is always seen wearing black form fitting armor with a helmet that featured horns and small wings. He also featured spikes on his arms and a cape. However after becoming a demon he grew far taller while still retaining his human appearance. His skin depended on the artwork with most being blue, turquoise, pale white, and least of all red with legs covered in black fur and a long thin tail with a spiked spade on the end. Amon has yellow eyes which depending on the story had black pupils or none at all. He had thin fangs in his mouth and large bat like wings in place of his ears with a bright red crest in the middle, he also had a pair of antenna connecting to the top of his head.', '/uploads/images/c_7972.jpg'),
(111, 'Silene', 'シレーヌ', '配角', 'Atsuko Tanaka', 'Once Amon''s lover, Sirene is on a mission to destroy the being that took her beloved Amon away. Sirene has razor-sharp claws that can tear a man in two. She can also launch her arms at targets.', '/uploads/images/c_18590.jpg'),
(111, 'Jinmen', 'ジンメン', '配角', 'Akio Hirose', 'Jinmen is a devil with a shell like turtle. However, the shell has the faces of all the humans he''s ever consumed. Instead of killing them, they remain alive as a part of him. In the manga, Sachiko, who used to be Akira''s neighbor, falls victim to Jinmen. In the OAV, it is Akira''s mother.', '/uploads/images/c_18592.jpg'),
(111, 'Zenon', 'ゼノン', '配角', 'Avu-chan', 'Zennon is among the most powerful of the demon kind, and Satan''s second-in-command alongside Psycho Jenny. While Satan was away, he assumed the role of the leader of the demon race. Zennon is highly respected and feared among his people, with most referring to him as Lord Zennon. (Source: Devilman Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_18593.jpg'),
(111, 'Agwell', 'アグウェル', '配角', 'Hiroshi Shirokuma', 'Is a devil sent by Sirene to attack Akira.', '/uploads/images/c_74617.jpg'),
(111, 'Babo', 'バボ', '配角', 'Hannya', 'A member of Wamu’s gang, Babo is often seen with the gang but never speaks unless it is to rap. ~!He ultimately betrays the gang.!~ (Source: Wikipedia)', '/uploads/images/c_124942.jpg'),
(111, 'Koji Nagasaki', '長崎光司', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', 'Koji Nagasaki is Makimura Miki''s manager and photographer in the Devilman Crybaby. He came from a bad background and dreams of becoming a respected reporter. (Source: Devilman Wiki, edited)', '/uploads/images/c_124947.jpg'),
(111, 'Wamu', 'ワム', '配角', 'Takeshi Sakuma', 'Wamu is the leader of a small street gang in Devilman Crybaby consisting of Gabi, Hie, Babo, and Kukun. ~!He has feelings for Miki Makimura, and helps her and Akira Fudo when chaos digs its claws on the world.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124949.jpg'),
(111, 'Gabi', 'ガビ', '配角', 'Subaru Kimura', 'Gabi is part of a group of rappers alongside Wamu, Kukun, Babo, and Hie. (Source: Devilman Wiki, edited)', '/uploads/images/c_124951.jpg'),
(111, 'Kukun', 'ククン', '配角', 'Young Dais', 'Kukun is a rapper and label cleaner who lives near Miko''s building. He often appears to make small-talk with her after seeing her continuously seeing her planting and watering flowers. (Source: Devilman Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_124952.jpg'),
(111, 'Hie', 'ヒエ', '配角', 'AFRA', 'Hie is the beatboxer for a group of rappers alongside Wamu, Gabi, Babo, and Kukun. (Source: Devilman Wiki, edited)', '/uploads/images/c_124954.jpg'),
(111, 'Moyuru Koda', '幸田燃寛', '配角', 'Junya Hirano', 'Moyuru Koda is a track athlete from Kawa High. (Source: Devilman Wiki, edited)', '/uploads/images/c_124958.png'),
(111, 'Tako', 'ターコ', '配角', 'Rie Takahashi', 'Tako is the pet cat of Makimura family. ~!It later transforms into "devilcat" and becomes Akira Fudo''s aide. During final battle against Satan, he attempts to attack the angel directly, but getting killed again, this time by Satan''s telepathic slash.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124960.png'),
(111, 'Kaori Fudou', '不動香織', '配角', 'Chie Nakamura', 'Akira''s mother.', '/uploads/images/c_232957.png'),
(111, 'Sumi', '受美', '配角', 'Michiyo Murase', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_232958.png'),
(111, 'Akiko Makimura', '牧村亜樹子', '配角', 'Sayaka Kobayashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_232959.png'),
(111, 'Zay', 'ゼイ', '配角', 'Avu-chan', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_232960.png'),
(111, 'Noel Makimura', '牧村ノエル', '配角', 'Masato Obara', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_232961.png'),
(111, 'Reijirou Fudou', '不動礼次郎', '配角', 'Takuya Kirimoto', 'Akira''s father.', '/uploads/images/c_232962.png'),
(111, 'Web Producer', 'ウェブプロデューサー', '配角', 'Osamu Taira', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_232963.png'),
(111, 'Takahama', 'タカハマ', '配角', 'Soushirou Hori', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_232964.png'),
(111, 'Kudou', 'クドウ', '配角', 'Takayuki Nakatsukasa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_232965.png'),
(111, 'Kouzou Rainuma', '雷沼耕造', '配角', 'Daisuke Takahashi', 'Dr. Rainuma is a famous research biologist. After the attacks across the world by the Demon menace he became devoted to finding a way to combat the Demons and set up the Demon Busters.', '/uploads/images/c_327284.png'),
(111, 'Track Coach', 'トラックコーチ', '配角', 'Shinichiro Uchida', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_327286.png'),
(111, 'Sachiko', 'サッちゃん', '配角', 'Nami Miyahara', 'She is the girl that lived next to Fudou Akira.', '/uploads/images/c_327287.png'),
(112, 'Kiyotaka Ayanokouji', '綾小路清隆', '主角', 'Shouya Chiba', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9") Ayanokouji is an inconspicuous and unobtrusive student. He is shown to be extremely intelligent and possesses a profound insight to study the emotions of people around him. Almost everything about his life prior to the entrance exams is unknown. He is shown to be extremely calculating and possessing superhuman intellect, perception, and strength. He''s skilled at fighting and is able to easily manipulate the people around him. He is quite fond of his friends and protects those that he can without standing out. He has little regard for others'' feelings and will coldly let them suffer to succeed, occasionally even his friends.', '/uploads/images/c_123212.png'),
(112, 'Suzune Horikita', '堀北鈴音', '主角', 'Akari Kitou', '__Height:__ 156 cm (5''1") A beautiful girl who sits next to [Ayanokouji](https://anilist.co/character/123212/Ayanokouji-Kiyotaka). She is the opposite of Ayanokouji when it comes to friendship; she disregards it and thinks of making friends unnecessary, thus she does not communicate much with her classmates. She is not convinced that she was placed in the D class, therefore she aims to get promoted to the A class.', '/uploads/images/c_123213.png'),
(112, 'Kikyou Kushida', '櫛田桔梗', '主角', 'Yurika Kubo', '__Height:__ 155 cm She boasts tremendous popularity among men and women as the D class'' idol. She aims to be friends with everyone not just in D class. She wants to get along well with her classmate, [Horikita](https://anilist.co/character/123213/Horikita-Suzune).', '/uploads/images/c_123214.png'),
(112, 'Airi Sakura', '佐倉愛里', '主角', 'Mao Ichimichi', '__Height:__ 153 cm (5''0") A girl who is into photography. She hates standing out and likes to take modeling pictures.', '/uploads/images/c_123215.jpg'),
(112, 'Honami Ichinose', '一之瀬帆波', '配角', 'Nao Touyama', '__Height:__ 159 cm (5''2") If there was one sentence to describe Honami, it would be that she is genuinely kind-hearted, benevolent, and a pacifist to the core who is against using underhanded means and violence. One of her main traits is her unselfish and supportive personality, combined with her excellent social skills and her being naturally people-oriented. Honami is also a charismatic and energetic person, and extends her sweet and benign character even to those of the lower classes, unlike many other upper-class students.', '/uploads/images/c_123216.png'),
(112, 'Sae Chabashira', '茶柱佐枝', '配角', 'Rina Satou', '__Height:__ 160 cm The homeroom teacher of the protagonist''s class (D). She is originally indifferent to her class, doing almost nothing to help them in the battle between classes, and remains unmotivated for the most part.', '/uploads/images/c_123217.png'),
(112, 'Yousuke Hirata', '平田洋介', '配角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', '__Height:__ 174 cm (5''8") The social leader of the D class. He has excellent academic and athletic ability, and is considered extremely handsome by his classmates, he is shown to be extremely compassionate and puts others before himself, considering everybody equal. He is considered a perfect male student and his placement in the D-class is originally considered a mystery.', '/uploads/images/c_123218.png'),
(112, 'Manabu Horikita', '堀北学', '配角', 'Yuuichirou Umehara', '__Height:__ 178 cm (5''10") He is the leader of the school council and is [Horikita Suzune](https://anilist.co/character/123213/Horikita-Suzune)''s elder brother.', '/uploads/images/c_123219.png'),
(112, 'Arisu Sakayanagi', '坂柳有栖', '配角', 'Rina Hidaka', '__Height:__ 150 cm (4''11") Arisu Sakayanagi is one of the class representatives of class 1-A along with [Kohei Katsuragi](https://anilist.co/character/207026). She suffers from congenital heart disease which limits her physical ability. She appears to possess a "go with the flow" attitude as she accepts most situations with no protest though she voices her dislike of boring situations after Katsuragi noted of the class scores. Unlike Kohei Katsuragi, who has a conservative stance, Arisu possesses an innovative attitude. Together, the pair effectively lead class A through the school years. She enjoys situations she finds interesting as shown when she smiled at [Kakeru Ryuen](https://anilist.co/character/159627)''s declaration to rule the school or when she listened to the speech of [Suzune Horikita](https://anilist.co/character/123213) and found it amusing. In the light novels, Arisu enjoys toying with people as seen when she cryptically hinted to [Kiyotaka Ayanokoji](https://anilist.co/character/123212) of knowing him while he had voiced he never saw her before. Later on, while being together with [Honami Ichinose](https://anilist.co/character/123216), she also had the chance to show her confidence and complacency after [Teruhiko Yukimura](https://anilist.co/character/173450) of Ayanokoji Group boldly claimed that D-Class has the plan to overtake A-Class soon. Additionally, although she has an easygoing personality, it was shown in the later part of the series that she''s easil', '/uploads/images/c_124691.jpg'),
(112, 'Mei-Yu Wang', '王美雨', '配角', 'Amisa Sakuragi', 'Mei-Yu is of Chinese descent and is shown to be one of the academically gifted students. She has a visible crush on Hirata Yosuke.', '/uploads/images/c_136233.png'),
(112, 'Kei Karuizawa', '軽井沢恵', '配角', 'Ayana Taketatsu', '__Height:__ 154 cm (5''0") She is a girl with a bad attitude who is located at the top of the D class hierarchy. She fights with [Kushida](https://anilist.co/character/123214/Kushida-Kikyou) for their class'' top 2 places. Even though she gives off the impression of someone who is careless, arrogant, and messy, Kei''s true self is very logical and astute with a sharp mind. She has remarkable ability to read the environment and the people around her, and makes the correct decision often.', '/uploads/images/c_141122.png'),
(112, 'Rokusuke Kouenji', '高円寺六助', '配角', 'Toshiki Iwasawa', 'Rokusuke Kouenji is one of the students of class 1-D. He came from a well-known family of scholars. However, he ended up in D-Class for his egotistical behavior. ~!In Year 1, Volume 11, he watches a scuffle between [Hirata](https://anilist.co/character/123218/Hirata-Yousuke) and [Mii-Chan](https://anilist.co/character/136233/Wang-MeiYu), which ended with Hirata pushing a desperate Mii-Chan, who was trying to help him, on the ground. Kouenji then intervenes and states his annoyance at Hirata "for treating a girl wrong" referring him as "like a fly, very irritating". His friendship with Mii-Chan is then showed to progress in Year 2, Volume 5, when they are seen walking together often, and Mii-chan referring to him as "someone easy to talk to" when asked about their relationship by [Satou](https://anilist.co/character/163519/Satou-Maya) and [Matsushita](https://anilist.co/character/191401/Matsushita-Chiaki).!~ ~!During the Second Year Uninhabited Island Special Exam, he strikes an agreement with [Suzune Horikita](https://anilist.co/character/123213/Horikita-Suzune), in which he would try for a first-place finish and Suzune would reward him with complete protection from class vote expulsion until graduation and exempt him from being forced to co-operate with the rest of the class, which he wins.!~', '/uploads/images/c_158988.png'),
(112, 'Kakeru Ryuuen', '龍園翔', '配角', 'Masaaki Mizunaka', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") Kakeru Ryuuen is the class representative of class 1-C and is known for being an infamous delinquent. He does not lead his class by trust, but rather by fear. He has a group of henchmen who do his dirty work, which contributes to his fearsome reputation.', '/uploads/images/c_159627.png'),
(112, 'Haruka Hasebe', '長谷部波瑠加', '配角', 'Yuiko Tatsumi', 'Haruka is a pretty normal person, but she is not very open to other people as shown when she didn''t participate in the class''s swimming session where she tends to prefer keeping to herself and not bothering people, simply to avoid trouble. She is considered to have good looks and is often viewed lustfully by boys, thus wanting to seclude herself. She is mostly seen wearing the school''s uniform, with the difference that she has the upper button of her shirt undone and her tie relatively loosened. She prefers giving people nicknames the moment she meets them, which is said by Kushida to be a method for her "to appear closer to the people she isn''t close to". ~! In Year 2, Volume 5, Haruka is told off by Kushida when she tries to help the latter. She is then seen aggressively opposing the motion by Ayanokoji to expel Airi Sakura, being her closest friend, to no avail. She is one of the 4 remaining members and the sole remaining girl of the Ayanokoji Group.!~', '/uploads/images/c_163517.png'),
(112, 'Hiyori Shiina', '椎名ひより', '配角', '', 'Hiyori Shiina is one of the students of Class 1-C who is a loner. She''s a quiet girl, though sometimes she is seen occasionally smiling. She always carries books with her in her bag in case she meets someone who shares the same interest in literature as her. Since nobody in class 1-C is into literature, she doesn''t have anyone to talk to. She always speaks politely. She dislikes how the classes are competing with each other, wanting everyone to be friends. ~! She encounters Kiyotaka in the library, and they find themselves having the same taste in books. As she always wanted a friend who has similar interests as her, their friendship gradually blossoms and she refers to him as her "reading buddy". She slowly starts developing romantic feelings for Kiyotaka.!~', '/uploads/images/c_163518.png'),
(112, 'Maya Satou', '佐藤麻耶', '配角', 'Lynn', 'She is a student of class 1-D. ~!In Volume 7.5, Maya asks for [Kei Karuizawa](https://anilist.co/character/141122/Karuizawa-Kei)''s help to plan her "date" with [Kiyotaka Ayanokouji](https://anilist.co/character/123212/Ayanokouji-Kiyotaka). Kei was surprised and suggested other boys to her, but she refused, and said that she only liked Kiyotaka. She told her plan to Kei and made some changes according to her suggestions. She then later asked Kei if they could make it a "double-date", by including her and [Yousuke Hirata](https://anilist.co/character/123218/Hirata-Yousuke) in the plan. Eventually, Kei agreed and decided to schedule the double date on December 25. She confessed to Kiyotaka after the double date during Christmas, but was rejected and ran away crying. They promised each other that they will hang out again in the future and wants to see each other again but Maya couldn’t hold her feelings and excused herself first as she didn’t want him to see her in a pathetic state. She was hinted to have cried an innumerable amount of times behind closed doors after being rejected as the next time we saw her, she was able to frankly tell her friends she was rejected without being choked up. Her friends summarised that this could only had happened if she had come to terms with the rejection showing an immense amount of willpower to move on. That said, she still harbours feelings for Kiyotaka and has admitted that she finds him way cooler and hotter than Hirata not holding against', '/uploads/images/c_163519.jpg'),
(112, 'Teruhiko Yukimura', '幸村輝彦', '配角', 'Tsubasa Gouden', 'Teruhiko Yukimura is a student of class 1-D. Despite his excellent academic ability, he was placed there due to his poor athletic ability and lack of social skills. During the formation of the Ayanokoji Group, it is revealed that he does not like his first name Teruhiko, given to him by his mother who left their family. He prefers the name his father gave him: Keisei', '/uploads/images/c_173450.png'),
(112, 'Mio Ibuki', '伊吹澪', '配角', 'Mikako Komatsu', 'Mio Ibuki is a student of class 1-C. Not only does she possess excellent academic qualities, but her physical ability is also not to be underestimated. She is skilled in combat, having the knowledge of several martial skills that can rival those of many martial artists.', '/uploads/images/c_174781.png'),
(112, 'Chiaki Matsushita', '松下千秋', '配角', 'Masumi Tazawa', 'Matsushita is one of the students of class 2-D. She has a quiet older sister type of personality. She is generally kind to all the boys and girls alike, but she does not actively go out to make friends. ~!Chiaki had believed from early on in the first year that Class D had no hopes of ever reaching Class A and thus resigned herself to a carefree school life, never putting in any real effort into her academics. She considers herself to be a major underachiever, believing that she could easily score in the top 10% of her class if she truly tried to, but believed it to be pointless as long as she was in Class D. Later on in the light novels, she starts seeing improvements in the class and becomes willing to start contributing to the class. She is also known to be skilled at mental arithmetic and can calculate quickly. She even held her own against Kouhei Katsuragi from Class A in the Mental Arithmetic event in the Event Selection Exam.!~ ~!Later, in her monologue, she states that she had started to pay close attention to Kiyotaka after the end of year special exam, but she was not romantically interested in him. According to her, she was probably among the top 10% of students in their year, but had not revealed her abilities since she did not want people to be jealous of her. She had thought that even if she tried her best, the chance of Class-D being able to rank up the classes was minimal. However, after closely observing Kiyotaka, she had arrived at the conclusion that Class-', '/uploads/images/c_191401.jpg'),
(112, 'Akane Tachibana', '橘茜', '配角', 'Konomi Kohara', 'Akane Tachibana is a former student of Advanced Nurturing High School who has graduated from Class 3-A and the former secretary of the Student Council.', '/uploads/images/c_191504.png'),
(112, 'Yume Kobashi', '小橋夢', '配角', 'Narumi Kaho', 'Yume Kobashi is one of the students in class 1-B.', '/uploads/images/c_191505.jpg'),
(112, 'Satsuki Shinohara', '篠原さつき', '配角', 'Saori Kouda', 'Satsuki Shinohara is one of the students of class 2-D. She is considered to have below-average looks. She has an outspoken personality and can often be seen arguing with Ike.', '/uploads/images/c_191506.png'),
(112, 'Masumi Kamuro', '神室真澄', '配角', 'Ayane Sakura', 'Masumi Kamuro is a student of Class 2-A and a member of the Art Club. She is one of the members of the inner circle of Sakayanagi faction but is shown to be only interested in doing so as Sakayanagi has some information about her criminal history.', '/uploads/images/c_191507.png'),
(112, 'Chie Hoshinomiya', '星之宮知恵', '配角', 'Hisako Kanemoto', 'Chie Hoshinomiya is the homeroom teacher of class 1-B. She has a cheerful, flirty personality and is referred to as "never having grown from her high school days" by Ayanokoji. She shows glimpses of a more serious side of hers upon matters relating to reaching Class-A. She was a classmate of her colleague Sae Chabashira during their time in the Advanced Nurturing High School.', '/uploads/images/c_191508.png'),
(112, 'Ryuuji Kanzaki', '神崎隆二', '配角', 'Akihisa Wakayama', '__Height:__ 174 cm (5''8½") Apart of Class 1-B and Honami Ichinose''s right hand man. Not much is known about Ryūji, but he appears to be a diligent student who behaves seriously and he is a very helpful person as shown when he aided Honami Ichinose in the case of Ken Sudō. He is a friendly person as he does not look down on D-Class and gets along with them.', '/uploads/images/c_207022.png'),
(112, 'Haruki Yamauchi', '山内春樹', '配角', 'Mutsuki Iwanaka', 'Haruki is apart of Class 1-D. He is apart of the three idiots of Class D along with Ike and Sudou. He has a tendency to lie and his grades are the lowest in the class. Similar to his friends, Haruki has a perverted side who is attracted to Kikyō Kushida as he was willing to peep on the girls. He is also very attracted to Airi Sakura and Haruka Hasebe, mainly for their well-endowed bodies and quiet nature. ~!Haruki got expelled during the Class Vote Exam.!~', '/uploads/images/c_207023.jpg'),
(112, 'Akito Miyake', '三宅明人', '配角', '', 'In middle school, Akito became fond of archery and joined the club there and even participated in country-level competitions. However, he began to neglect other activities or duties, such as studies, in the process. At that time he started to create some ruckus by causing quarrels with other people. That, and the fact that he neglected his studies lead to his evaluation as a D-Class student. In high school, he once again became a member of the Archery Club. He is a good friend of Kiyotaka and is apart of the Ayanokouji friend group.', '/uploads/images/c_207024.png'),
(112, 'Ken Sudou', '須藤健', '配角', 'Eiji Takeuchi', '__Height:__ 183 cm (6''0") Ken is apart of Class 1-D and is apart of the Basketball Club. Due to his poor academic ability, he is referred to as one of the 3 Idiots of D-Class. Regardless of this, his athletic ability is without a doubt one of the best among the school. He has a crush on Suzune after receiving help from her. Under the constant supervision of Suzune, he gradually matures and begins to improve academically rising out of the bottom ladder of class and earning her trust.', '/uploads/images/c_207025.png'),
(112, 'Kouhei Katsuragi', '葛城康平', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', '**Height:** 180 cm (5''11") Kōhei is an intelligent student who worked very hard to reach Class 1-A that he became one of its representatives alongside Arisu Sakayanagi. He is a serious man who adheres to the rules of manners and good conduct. He has a feud with Sakayanagi for control of the class, leading him to oppose her with his faction. He is bald due to an illness. He has a twin sister and they were originally orphans. Volume 2 Year 2 ~!He''s transferred to Ryuuen''s Class !~', '/uploads/images/c_207026.png'),
(112, 'Masayoshi Hashimoto', '橋本正義', '配角', 'Youhei Azakami', 'Masayoshi is a very self-serving individual with no real loyalty to anyone other than himself. He always sides with and places his bets on the winning team, in order to always stay on top. When the Class-A leadership conflict breaks out at the beginning of the first year, Masayoshi determines that Arisu Sakayanagi is the better candidate for the position of leader and quickly joins her faction and becomes part of her inner circle.', '/uploads/images/c_207027.png'),
(112, 'Tomonari Mashima', '真嶋智也', '配角', 'Ryou Sugisaki', 'Mashima is an English teacher and the homeroom teacher of class 1-A. Mashima is a man who takes his job seriously and puts his students first.', '/uploads/images/c_207028.png'),
(112, 'Kanji Ike', '池寛治', '配角', 'Daiki Abe', 'Kanji Ike is one of the students of Class 1-D who is known as one of the 3 Idiots of D-Class. While his intelligence is poor, his communication skills are excellent.', '/uploads/images/c_273646.jpg'),
(112, 'Albert Yamada', '山田アルベルト', '配角', 'Rikiya Koyama', 'Albert Yamada is one of the students of Class 1-C.', '/uploads/images/c_273647.jpg'),
(112, 'Yahiko Totsuka', '戸塚弥彦', '配角', 'Daisuke Motohashi', 'Yahiko Totsuka is a student of Class 1-A and belongs to Katsuragi Faction.', '/uploads/images/c_273648.jpg'),
(112, 'Hayato Kitou', '鬼頭隼', '配角', '', 'Hayato Kitou is one of the students of Sakayanagi’s class.', '/uploads/images/c_281121.png'),
(112, 'Mako Amikura', '網倉麻子', '配角', 'Yuu Ayase', 'Mako Amikura is one of the students of Ichinose’s class.', '/uploads/images/c_282225.png'),
(112, 'Kayano Onodera', '小野寺かや乃', '配角', 'Makoto Koichi', 'Kayano Onodera is one of the students of Horikita’s class. She is a member of the Swimming Club and she is the best swimmer out of the girls in her class.', '/uploads/images/c_282226.jpg'),
(112, 'Daichi Ishizaki', '石崎大地', '配角', 'Yuuichi Hose', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_282230.jpg'),
(112, 'Kokoro Inogashira', '井の頭心', '配角', 'Shino Shimoji', 'Kokoro Inogashira is one of the students of Horikita’s class.', '/uploads/images/c_282231.jpg'),
(112, 'Sou Shibata', '柴田 颯', '配角', '', 'Sou Shibata is one of the students of Ichinose’s class.', '/uploads/images/c_282232.jpg'),
(112, 'Hideo Sotomura', '外村秀雄', '配角', 'Shunsuke Kawabe', 'Hideo Sotomura is one of the students of Horikita’s class.', '/uploads/images/c_284288.jpg'),
(112, 'Chihiro Shiranami', '白波千尋', '配角', 'Nao Shiraki', 'Chihiro Shiranami is one of the students of Ichinose’s class.', '/uploads/images/c_284289.png'),
(112, 'Nene Mori', '森寧々', '配角', 'Rina Honizumi', 'Nene Mori is one of the students of Horikita’s class.', '/uploads/images/c_284290.jpg'),
(112, 'Atsuomi Ayanokouji', '綾小路篤臣', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_290862.jpg'),
(113, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(113, 'Mikasa Ackerman', 'ミカサ・アッカーマン', '主角', 'Yui Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") - 176 cm (5''9½") __Position:__ 104th Training Corps, Survey Corps __Relatives:__ [Birth Mother](https://anilist.co/character/84341/Mikasa-no-Haha) (Deceased), [Birth Father](https://anilist.co/character/84339/Mikasa-no-Chichi) (Deceased), [Grisha Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/62477/Grisha-Yeager) (Foster Father), [Carla Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/62475/Carla-Yeager) (Foster Mother, Deceased), [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) (Foster Brother) Mikasa is Eren Yaeger''s foster sister and mutual childhood friend of [Armin Arlert](https://anilist.co/character/46494), living with the two of them in Shiganshina District within the southern region of Wall Maria. When she was young, her parents were killed by human traffickers, and she was kidnapped. Eren discovered this and helped her escape her captors. Later, Eren gave her his scarf, which she constantly wears and shares an emotional attachment to. She was adopted by the Yaeger family soon after. Because of these past events, Mikasa shares an unbreakable bond with Eren and lives to protect him, constantly worrying for Eren''s well-being. After the Titans broke through Wall Maria and killed her and Eren''s mother, she chose to follow Eren into the military to try and keep him safe from danger. Even as a child, Mikasa possessed impressive fighting skill and strength, and that skill was only honed further during her training. Mikasa is considered a genius among all th', '/uploads/images/c_40881.png'),
(113, 'Eren Yeager', 'エレン・イェーガー', '主角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") - 183 cm (6''0") __Affiliation:__ 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps. Eren was born to [Carla](https://anilist.co/character/62475/Yeager-Carla) and [Grisha Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/62477/Yeager-Grisha) in Shiganshina District within the southern region of Wall Maria. He grew up in the town with his parents and foster sister [Mikasa](https://anilist.co/character/40881/Ackerman-Mikasa), who moved in with the Yeagers as a child. Eren spent most of his time with Mikasa and their mutual best friend [Armin Arlert](https://anilist.co/character/46494/Arlert-Armin), whom the pair often defended from neighborhood bullies. Eren is a passionate, determined, hardheaded, and impulsive young man. When they were children, Armin showed him a book depicting the wonders of the outside world. Eren grew to share Armin''s curiosity of the world beyond the Walls and resolved to see it for himself. This dream inspired his admiration of the Survey Corps and his desire to join their ranks as soon as he became eligible for enrollment. When the Titans suddenly broke through Wall Maria into Shiganshina, Eren was forced to watch on as his mother became trapped under the rubble of their house and eaten by a titan. Forever changed from this event, Eren vows to kill every last titan.', '/uploads/images/c_40882.jpg'),
(113, 'Levi', 'リヴァイ', '主角', 'Hiroshi Kamiya', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") Squad Captain of the Special Operations Squad (known as Squad Levi) within the Survey Corps. He is known as humanity''s strongest soldier. Levi is abrasive, blunt, and has a strong respect for structure and discipline. He is a clean-freak, demanding spotless cleanliness of himself, his equipment, and his environment. Rumors say he was involved in underground crime in his life before coming a soldier. Despite his emotionless and unfriendly demeanor, Levi cares deeply for his squad and greatly values human life.', '/uploads/images/c_45627.png'),
(113, 'Sasha Blouse', 'サシャ・ブラウス', '配角', 'Yuu Kobayashi', '__Initial Height:__ 168cm __Affiliations__: 104th Cadet Corps, Survey Corps; Soldier __Relatives__: [Artur Blouse](https://anilist.co/character/131281/Artur-Blouse) (Father), [Lisa Blouse](https://anilist.co/character/134952/Lisa-Blouse) (Mother) Originally from Dauper, a remote and scarcely populated village of hunters located in a mountain forest in the southern area of Wall Rose, Sasha joined the military as a cadet of the 104th Training Corps, where she ranked 9th upon graduation. After graduating, she''d choose to enlist in the Scouting Regiment. Sasha is a friendly and fun-loving girl. She speaks with a local accent from her home village, but initially hid it out of embarrassment by using overly formal and polite speech. She is a constant food hoarder and is known to have an incredible appetite; eating provided her with considerable gratification and relief, especially during times of great stress, and food was often the only thing on her mind when at ease. Raised as an animal hunter, Sasha specializes in archery, horseback riding, and tracking, although her eccentricity and unconventional methods tend to make her a poor fit for group operations. ~!She later saves a child named [Kaya](https://anilist.co/character/132738/Kaya) from a titan attack, who her family ends up adopting.!~', '/uploads/images/c_45887.jpg'),
(113, 'Reiner Braun', 'ライナー・ブラウン', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', '__Height__: 185 cm (6''1") Member of the Survey Corps and former cadet of the 104th Training Corps. Reiner is a passionate and strong-willed young man with a strong sense of duty. He ranked 2nd in his training class upon graduation, finishing behind only [Mikasa](https://anilist.co/character/40881). His comrades have great trust in him, and he is stated to be the "big brother" of the 104th cadets.', '/uploads/images/c_46484.png'),
(113, 'Connie Springer', 'コニー・スプリンガー', '配角', 'Hiro Shimono', '__Height__: 158 cm (5''2") __Relatives:__ [Mother](https://anilist.co/character/137287/Conny-no-Haha), Martin Springer (Brother), Sunny Springer (Sister) Connie Springer is a graduate of the 104th Training Corps, having ranked 8th in class. He is known to be one of the quickest soldiers while using ODM gear and is skilled at making very sharp turns. He hails from the rural Ragako Village within Wall Rose, his greatest ambition being to make his family and village proud of him. Upon graduation, he chose to join the Survey Corps. Upbeat and naive, Connie is rather unfocused outside of combat, and enjoys goofing around and messing with his friends, but can also be a bit dense at times, as he can have some difficulty comprehending new developments as they appear. Connie always tries to remain optimistic, consistently caring for the well-being of his friends, family and village, and being willing to help in any way he can. However, this soft spot and the struggles he goes through as a member of the Survey Corps takes a toll on him, as he often responds to grief and loss with anger, irritation and hatred, causing him to at times make rash, impulsive decisions. He will do anything to protect his family, whether it be his biological family or his closest friends.', '/uploads/images/c_46486.png'),
(113, 'Bertolt Hoover', 'ベルトルト・フーバー', '配角', 'Tomohisa Hashizume', '__Height__: 192 cm (6''3") __Affiliation__: Survey Corps Member of the Survey Corps and former cadet of the 104th Training Corps. Bertoldt ranked 3rd in his training class upon graduation, finishing behind only [Mikasa](https://anilist.co/character/40881) and his hometown friend [Reiner](https://anilist.co/character/46484). He is a quiet young man who identifies himself as someone with a weak will that follows popular opinion. Despite ranking 3rd in his class, his training commandant noted him to be a person with great potential, but an utter lack of initiative. Bertoldt originally he enlisted in the military with aspirations of joining the Military Police and living in the safety of the inner wall, but after the Battle of Trost he instead decided to join the Survey Corps.', '/uploads/images/c_46488.jpg'),
(113, 'Hannes', 'ハンネス', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', 'A soldier who saves Eren and Mikasa during the prologue. He owes a debt to the Yeager family.', '/uploads/images/c_46492.jpg'),
(113, 'Armin Arlert', 'アルミン・アルレルト', '主角', 'Marina Inoue', '__Height:__ 163 cm (5''4") __Position:__ 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps __Relatives:__ [Grandfather](https://anilist.co/character/84313/Armin-no-Ojiisan) Armin is a young boy who was born and raised in the Shiganshina District within the walls, being childhood friends with both [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) and [Mikasa Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/40881). After Wall Maria was breached, he chose to join Mikasa and Eren in joining the military, both to try to make a good and meaningful impact on the world, and to fulfill his dream of seeing the outside world. Even when he was young, the naturally curious Armin has always had a deep fascination with the world beyond the Walls. As a child, he found and studied an illegal book about the outside world that was owned by his grandfather. He often shared the book and information contained in it with Eren Yeager, his best friend, and his dreams of seeing the world outside the walls. Armin was branded a heretic by other children for his unusual interest in the outside world and was thus frequently picked on. Too timid to defend himself, Armin would often rely on his friends Eren and Mikasa Ackerman to protect him from local bullies. This, coupled with his frail physique, was a deep shame for Armin, leading him to have poor self-esteem and to believe that he is a burden to others. Because of this, Armin has always been very eager to prove his worth, especially towards his close friends. Armin ', '/uploads/images/c_46494.png'),
(113, 'Erwin Smith', 'エルヴィン・スミス', '主角', 'Daisuke Ono', '**Height:** 188 cm **Position:** 13th Commander, Survey Corps Discerning, intelligent, and widely respected, Erwin is the unshakable and calculated 13th commander of the Survey Corps. While he cares deeply for his men, he does not hesitate to sacrifice them for the good and prosperity of mankind, and his men have proven more than willing to stake their lives at his order. Erwin developed the Long-Distance Enemy Scouting Formation.', '/uploads/images/c_46496.png'),
(113, 'Jean Kirstein', 'ジャン・キルシュタイン', '配角', 'Kishou Taniyama', '__Height__: 175 cm (5''8") __Relatives__: [Mother](https://anilist.co/character/131444/Jean-no-Haha) Jean Kirschtein is a graduate of the 104th Cadet Corps, among whom he ranked 6th for his skills with ODM gear and ability to look at things through a more tactical lense. Jean hails from Wall Rose''s Trost District, and joined the military with hopes of living a peaceful life within the walls as part of the Military Police. However, he would later find himself joining the Survey Corps after being convinced both by his close friend [Marco Bott''s](https://anilist.co/character/62479/Marco-Bott) words, and after witnessing the death of several of his comrades. Jean has a blunt personality. He holds no restraint when it comes to speaking his mind, even when he knows it would not be wise to do so or when it could spark conflict. Jean is also pragmatic: he has a strong aversion to exposing himself to dangerous situations. During his time as a cadet, Jean was extremely hot-headed, easily becoming frustrated and quick to resort to violence when pushed. Jean was also very cynical about defeating the Titans, believing that humanity has no chance against them and openly mocking more idealistic individuals like [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager), and saw resisting the Titans as a hopeless cause. However, despite these things, and although he presents himself as self-centered, Jean places high value on the lives of his comrades, and is willing to risk his life to pr', '/uploads/images/c_46498.png'),
(113, 'Carla Yeager', 'カルラ・イェーガー', '配角', 'Yoshino Takamori', 'Eren''s mother. ~!She''s eaten alive in the second chapter.!~ Note: Carla Yeager is the official English translation by Kodansha.', '/uploads/images/c_62475.png'),
(113, 'Grisha Yeager', 'グリシャ・イェーガー', '配角', 'Hiroshi Tsuchida', 'Father of [Eren Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) and caretaker of [Mikasa Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/40881/Mikasa-Ackerman). He is a renowned doctor who was well respected in the District of Shiganshina after he saved the village from a mysterious viral epidemic by developing vaccines. He also provides a medical house call service to the people of Shiganshina and to various towns in addition to having a network of contacts within the Corps of the Shiganshina District. He is married to [Carla Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/62475). ~!In the basement of the Yeager family house, he hides a secret which he refers to as the "truth". Upon finding Eren after the fall of Wall Maria, he injects him with a series of chemicals and amnesiacs and entrusts him with the key to the "truth", before mysteriously disappearing. This strange serum resulted in Eren gaining the ability to transform into a titan.!~', '/uploads/images/c_62477.jpg'),
(113, 'Krista Lenz', 'クリスタ・レンズ', '主角', 'Shiori Mikami', '__Height__: 145 cm (4''8") __Affiliations__: 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps Ranked tenth in the trainee class, Krista is a very shy and kind, caring person, often being described as a "goddess" or "angel" by her peers. She is good friends with [Ymir](https://anilist.co/character/71479/Ymir).', '/uploads/images/c_62481.png'),
(113, 'Dot Pixis', 'ドット・ピクシス', '配角', 'Masahiko Tanaka', 'The highest-ranked Administrator of the Southern Region. Head of the Garrison''s Southern Territories, Pixis is a cunning leader with astute insights. However, he is also an alcoholic who is constantly watched over by his aid, [Anka](https://anilist.co/character/84331/Anka-Rheinberger), who constantly scolds him for sleeping and drinking during critical moments.', '/uploads/images/c_62485.png'),
(113, 'Hange Zoe', 'ハンジ・ゾエ', '配角', 'Romi Park', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Affiliation:__ Survey Corps; Section Commander, Squad Leader. Leader of the Survey Corps'' Fourth Squad, Hange is also in charge of conducting research on Titans, and pursues this knowledge so passionately that they have become obsessed with Titans as a result. After originally holding a deep hatred for the creatures, Hange decided to take on a new outside-the-box approach to their research by letting go of their resentment towards Titans and approaching the test subjects with compassion. Hange is an energetic, freethinking and quirky scientist, with a unique way of conducting both themselves and their work. Hange is a genius outside of just Titan research too, using their brain to create weapons, tactical plans, and inventions for the benefit of humanity. As a leader, Hange is thoughtful of their comrades, and can easily figure out complex problems in order to create plans for their teammates to carry out.', '/uploads/images/c_71121.png'),
(113, 'Nile Dok', 'ナイル・ドーク', '配角', 'Anri Katsu', 'Chief of the Military Police.', '/uploads/images/c_71123.png'),
(113, 'Darius Zackly', 'ダリス・ザックレー', '配角', 'Hideaki Tezuka', 'The head of all three divisions of the army. __ _Note:___ Darius Zackly is the official English translation by Kodansha.', '/uploads/images/c_71125.png'),
(113, 'Marlo Freudenberg', 'マルロ・フロイデンベルク', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', '__Affiliations:__ Military Police, 104th Cadet Corps. Recruit of the Military Police stationed in Stohess District. While most who join the Military Police Regiment do so because they want a safe position far from the danger of the Titans, Marlo did so because he claims to want "to uphold justice and do what''s right.", much to the amusement of his fellow officer, [Hitch Dreyse](https://anilist.co/character/86017/Hitch-Dreyse), whom he often clashes with due to them being near complete opposites. His goal is to rise to the top of the organization so he can stop the pilfering of taxes and misappropriation of land. Though steadfast in his idealism, he could make moral compromises to achieve his goal, confessing a willingness to act like "scum" in order to move up in rank. Due to his passion towards his ideals, he had often been compared to [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) by people who know both of them.', '/uploads/images/c_71457.png'),
(113, 'Ymir', 'ユミル', '配角', 'Saki Fujita', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5''7") __Affiliations:__ 104th Trainees Squad, Scouting Legion Member of the Scouting Legion. She seems selfish, cynical, bossy, sly, uncooperative, exploitative, and confrontational, but she can apparently be kind, especially to [Krista](https://anilist.co/character/62481/Krista-Lenz).', '/uploads/images/c_71479.png'),
(113, 'Keith Shadis', 'キース・シャーディス', '配角', 'Tsuguo Mogami', 'Keith Shadis was the head instructor of the 104th Trainees Squad. He seemed to be a friend or have some sort of relationship with Dr. Grisha, as he knew Eren is the son of the doctor and praised Eren for his effort.', '/uploads/images/c_84305.png'),
(113, 'Hitch Dreyse', 'ヒッチ・ドリス', '配角', 'Akeno Watanabe', '**Height:** 168 cm __Affiliations:__ 104th Cadet Corps. Recruit of the Military Police stationed in Stohess District. She was roommates with [Annie Leonhart](https://anilist.co/character/46490/Annie-Leonhart). Hitch acts immature in certain ways, she has a sarcastic, easygoing personality and seems to mischievously enjoy teasing and needling her fellow officers, especially [Marlo Freudenberg](https://anilist.co/character/71457/Marlo-Freudenberg). She claims she chose to join the Military Police out of laziness, as it is well known that the senior staff are incredibly corrupt and she wanted to benefit from the system herself; however, she did not take into account that, as a new recruit, her superiors would dump all their work on her. Though she may act a bit air-headed at times, Hitch is not selfish and cares about those around her, especially her fellow comrades.', '/uploads/images/c_86017.jpg'),
(113, 'Zeke', 'ジーク', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', '__Height__: 183 cm Zeke is the current inheritor of the Beast Titan, and is considered by [Reiner Braun](https://anilist.co/character/46484/Reiner-Braun) to be the strongest Warrior, contrasting [Levi''s](https://anilist.co/character/45627/Levi) title of "humanity''s strongest soldier".', '/uploads/images/c_125661.png'),
(113, 'Nifa', 'ニファ', '配角', 'Sayaka Senbongi', '__Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") Nifa is a soldier in the Survey Corps'' Fourth Squad under the command of [Hange Zoe](https://anilist.co/character/71121/Hange-Zoe). Nifa appears to be a loyal and trustworthy member of Fourth Squad, as she is often tasked to record the details of important meetings and entrusted to deliver vital information to others within the Scouting Regiment. She acts serious most of the time, however, she has been seen drinking alcoholic beverages before giving out more intense reports and info.', '/uploads/images/c_126849.jpg'),
(113, 'Rod Reiss', 'ロッド・レイス', '配角', 'Yuusaku Yara', '~!is the true king of humanity, currently masquerading as a noble living in Wall Sina. He is a member of the Reiss family and Historia''s illegitimate father.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127360.jpg'),
(113, 'Traute Caven', 'トラウテ・カーフェン', '配角', 'Saori Terai', 'is the second in command of the Anti-Personnel Control Squad within the Military Police Brigade and is very loyal to her superior, Captain Kenny Ackerman.', '/uploads/images/c_127390.jpg'),
(113, 'Kenny Ackerman', 'ケニー・アッカーマン', '配角', 'Kazuhiro Yamaji', '__Affiliation:__ Military Police; Captain of Anti-Personnel Control Squad. __Relatives:__ [Kuchel Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/127940/Kuchel-Ackerman) (Sister), [Unnamed Grandfather](https://anilist.co/character/128589/Kenny-no-Ojiisan), Kenny Ackerman is a member of the Military Police Brigade''s First Interior Squad and also the Anti-Personnel Control Squad. Decades prior, however, Kenny was known as an infamous serial killer that stalked victims in the capitol. Despite his dark field of work, Kenny appears to be rather jovial and takes pleasure in taunting his adversaries during battle. When fighting, he becomes animated and lively, often making a scene or otherwise throwing insults and witticisms. However, he also fought with control and was able to effortlessly sneak up on his targets when they least expected him. His preferred method of killing during his time as a serial killer was to slit the throats of his victims which earned him his infamous handle "Kenny the Ripper", and it was rumored that he murdered over 100 members of the Military Police Brigade. However, decades later his killings ceased and the terror that he once inspired dwindled into an Urban Legend. He eventually was found working under the Royal Government, the reasoning for his sudden shift in behavior being a mystery. Kenny is ultimately, despite his comical personality, very cold and calculated, sparing little emotional attachment or loyalty to anyone, with only a few exceptions. ~!ㅤ He nota', '/uploads/images/c_127443.png'),
(113, 'Flagel  Reeves', 'フレーゲル・リーブス ', '配角', 'Tasuku Hatanaka', 'Flegel Reeves is the son of Dimo Reeves', '/uploads/images/c_127569.jpg'),
(113, 'Uri Reiss', 'ウーリ・レイス', '配角', 'Toshio Furukawa', 'the younger brother of Rod Reiss and the paternal uncle of Frieda Reiss. ~!He was the true king of the Walls for some time until the year 842 and was Kenny Ackermann''s best friend. He inherited the Founding Titan from his father, and passed it along with the crown to his niece, Frieda Reiss.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127570.png'),
(113, 'Alma', 'アルマ', '配角', 'Michiko Neya', 'Alma is the mother of Historia Reiss.', '/uploads/images/c_127571.png'),
(113, 'Dimo Reeves', 'ディモ・リーブス', '配角', 'Daichi Endou', 'Dimo Reeves is a merchant that leads the company that''s named after him. He''s stationed in Trost District. ~!After the Battle of Trost, his company was assigned a mission to kidnap Eren and Historia by the Military Police Brigade.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127572.jpg'),
(113, 'Moblit Berner', 'モブリット・バーナー', '配角', 'Rintarou Nishi', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9") __Affiliation:__ Survey Corps; Executive Officer, Fourth Squad. A veteran member of the Survey Corps and [Hange Zoe](https://anilist.co/character/71121/Hange-Zoe)''s second-in-command within the Survey Corps'' Fourth Squad. He also serves as Hanji''s assistant and messenger. He comes across as an intelligent and responsible person, which may be the reason he was tasked to keep his overzealous and eccentric superior out of trouble. Much of the time, this leaves him in a state of near-panic, having to constantly remind Hange to be more careful or yanking them to safety. That he remains at Hange''s side constantly suggests he is a loyal person, and that he cares deeply for his superior''s safety, regardless of the stress involved with being under their command. He is also able to show signs of a serious nature when it comes to missions, going out of his way to investigate problems and put himself in danger before others.', '/uploads/images/c_127573.jpg'),
(113, 'Frieda Reiss', 'フリーダ・レイス', '配角', 'Youko Hikasa', 'Frieda was Rod Reiss'' eldest daughter and Historia''s oldest half-sister. ~!She was the true queen of humanity from 842 to 845. She is known to appear in Eren and Historia''s obtained memories. In his Titan form, Grisha invaded an underground cavern under the Reiss family chapel, where the family had gathered to pray. He battled Frieda and consumed her, thus gaining her powers and memories. He then slaughtered her mother and siblings, and finally destroyed the chapel. When Eren later eats Grisha, Frieda''s memories are transferred to him along with Grisha''s.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127624.jpg'),
(113, 'Abel', 'ゴーグル', '配角', 'Kiyohito Yoshikai', 'Goggles is a soldier in the Scout Regiment fourth squad under the command of Hange Zoë, who is noted for his trademark glasses, or "goggles". He participated in the 57th Exterior Scouting Mission and often accompanies higher ups, such as Hange and Levi, on serious missions. (Source: Shingeki no Kyojin Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_127681.jpg'),
(113, 'Djel Sannes', 'ジェル・サネス', '配角', 'Masaki Terasoma', 'Djel Sannes is a member of the Military Police Regiment and part of the First Interior Squad.', '/uploads/images/c_127702.png'),
(113, 'Floch Forster', 'フロック・フォルスター', '配角', 'Kenshou Ono', 'Floch is a new recruit in the Survey Corps. He joined the Survey Corps during the two months between the attack at Orvud District and the return to Shiganshina District. ~!After the rest of the Yeagerists are killed during the port battle, Floch hides on the ship to Marley. After shooting holes in the fuel tank of the flying boat, Floch is ultimately killed by Mikasa.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127703.png'),
(113, 'Kuchel Ackerman', 'クシェル・アッカーマン', '配角', '', '__Relatives:__ [Kenny Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/127443) (Older Brother), [Unnamed Grandfather](https://anilist.co/character/128589/Kenny-no-Ojiisan) She is a member of the Ackerman clan who ended up working in an underground brothel. ~!ㅤ Kuchel ended up getting impregnated by one of her clients. Despite her brother''s advice, she decided to keep the child. She chose to name him [Levi.](https://anilist.co/character/45627/Levi)!~', '/uploads/images/c_127940.jpg'),
(113, 'Ralph', 'ラルフ', '配角', 'Kousuke Takaguchi', 'is a member of the Military Police Regiment and part of the First Interior Squad', '/uploads/images/c_128148.png'),
(113, 'Kenny no Ojii-san', 'ケニーのお祖父さん', '配角', 'Tetsuo Kanao', '__Relatives:__ [Kenny Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/127443), [Kuchel Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/127940) (Granddaughter) The grandfather of [Kenny](https://anilist.co/character/127443) and [Kuchel Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/127940). He was one of the few living remnants of the Ackerman bloodline with knowledge about the reasons for the persecution of his clan.', '/uploads/images/c_128589.png'),
(113, 'Fritz', 'フリッツ', '配角', 'Osamu Sonoe', 'He is the king of the wall. ~!he was a puppet king who acted as a substitute for Rod Reiss, the real king at the time. He is arrested after the coup d''état.!~', '/uploads/images/c_129941.png'),
(113, 'Aurille', 'アウリール', '配角', 'Yoshikazu Nagano', 'high ranking noble and member of King Fritz''s assembly. ~! After a successful uprising led by Scout Regiment commander Erwin Smith, Aurille is imprisoned by the military.!~', '/uploads/images/c_129943.png'),
(113, 'Gerald', 'ゲラルド', '配角', 'Toshitsugu Takashina', 'a member of the King Fritz''s assembly. ~!a selfish man, who values his own interest over that of the citizens of the Walls. As part of the ruling council, he was prepared to disband the Scout Regiment under false pretenses, to further secure his own position in ruling. When Dot Pyxis states that he finds killing humans to be madness, the aristocrat laughs at this notion, displaying his disregard for others in the process.!~ ~!After a successful uprising led by Scout Regiment commander Erwin Smith, he is imprisoned by the military.!~', '/uploads/images/c_129944.png'),
(113, 'Roderich', 'ローデリヒ', '配角', 'Takahiro Sumi', 'He is garbed in the robes of the Order of the Walls and a member of the King Fritz''s assembly. ~!After a successful uprising led by Scout Regiment commander Erwin Smith, he is imprisoned by the military.!~', '/uploads/images/c_129946.png'),
(113, 'Deltoff', 'デレトフ', '配角', 'Masaaki Ihara', 'A member of the King Fritz''s assembly. ~!After a successful uprising led by Scout Regiment commander Erwin Smith, he is imprisoned by the Military.!~', '/uploads/images/c_130060.png'),
(113, 'Roger', 'ロゲール', '配角', 'Isshin Chiba', 'An anime-original character who''s a member of the Military Police Regiment and part of the First Interior Squad.', '/uploads/images/c_130628.png'),
(113, 'Carsten', 'カルステン', '配角', 'Keikou Sakai', 'Occupation: Soldier Rank: Captain Affiliation: Garrison Regiment The captain in charge of the Garrison''s forces in the Orvud District.', '/uploads/images/c_130629.png'),
(113, 'Harold', 'ハロルド', '配角', 'Yasuyuki Sano', 'A team leader in the Scout Regiment.', '/uploads/images/c_130631.png'),
(113, 'Dirk', 'ディルク', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Mamiya', 'A member of the Scout Regiment and a team leader during the mission to reclaim Wall Maria.', '/uploads/images/c_130635.png'),
(113, 'Roy', 'ロイ', '配角', 'Takashi Onozuka', 'As a veteran journalist, Roy has come to accept and conform to the restrictive nature of the monarchy, fearing retaliation for defiance.', '/uploads/images/c_130636.png'),
(113, 'Pierre', 'ピュレ', '配角', 'Kenji Takahashi', 'As a rookie reporter, Pierre has not yet become jaded like his superior Roy. He is very bold in his reporting, unafraid of asking questions of Military Police officers that would otherwise be considered "off-limits." He takes his job of reporting the truth very seriously, becoming frustrated when he is kept from printing news that would be scandalous for the government.', '/uploads/images/c_130637.png'),
(113, 'Klaus', 'クラース', '配角', 'Tooru Nara', 'A member of the Scout Regiment and a team leader during the mission to retake Wall Maria.', '/uploads/images/c_130638.png'),
(113, 'Marlene', 'マレーネ', '配角', 'Saki Endou', 'A member of the Scout Regiment and a team leader during the mission to reclaim Wall Maria.', '/uploads/images/c_130639.png'),
(113, 'Waltz', 'ヴァルツ', '配角', 'Ryouta Asari', 'He is a member of the Military Police Regiment who serves as Nile Dawk''s aide', '/uploads/images/c_131208.png'),
(113, 'Sandra', 'サンドラ', '配角', '', 'She is a recruit of the Survey Corps. She joined at some point after the crowning of Historia Reiss during the two months between the attack at Orvud District and the expedition returning to Shiganshina District, where she was assigned to Squad Klaus.', '/uploads/images/c_137143.jpg'),
(113, 'Dimo no Tsuma', 'ディモの妻', '配角', 'Naomi Maruyama', '~!The wife and daughter of Dimo Reeves are seen mourning his death. When Erwin Smith approaches the body of Reeves, they tell him to stay away, believing it was the Survey Corps who are responsible for his death. Erwin responds by acknowledging Reeves'' dedication to the people of Trost, and vowing to avenge Reeves'' death!~', '/uploads/images/c_137285.jpg'),
(113, 'Abel Reiss', 'エーベル・レイス', '配角', '', 'Abel Reiss was one of the younger daughters of [Rod Reiss](https://anilist.co/character/127360/Rod-Reiss) and his wife.', '/uploads/images/c_310145.png'),
(114, 'Naofumi Iwatani', '岩谷尚文', '主角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', 'A university student that was summoned to another world as the Shield Hero. Typically unsociable, he''s friendly and easy-going to those close to him. ~!After being abandoned by [Malty](https://anilist.co/character/129808) and being treated as a criminal by the people of the world, He unlocked the curse series. The sin he has unlocked is Wrath (against the people of the world).!~', '/uploads/images/c_88817.jpg'),
(114, 'Raphtalia', 'ラフタリア', '主角', 'Asami Seto', '**Race:** Raccoon & Tanuki Raphtalia is a Tanuki-type Demi-Human who was the first real member of the Shield Hero''s party after he purchased her as a slave. ~!Raphtalia later obtain one of the eight vassal weapons from another world granting her the title of Vassal Weapon Wielder and Katana Hero. Due to the passive effects of the Vassal Weapons her slave curse seal was removed.!~', '/uploads/images/c_88889.jpg'),
(114, 'Filo', 'フィーロ', '主角', 'Rina Hidaka', '**Age:** <1 (mentally), 10 (physically) **Race:** Filolial Filo was originally hatched from a monster egg which Naofumi purchased from the slave trader. Filo grew at an abnormally fast rate and in just a few days grown into a fully grown Filolial later developing into a rare species of Filolial Queen where she was later given the ability to transform into a humanoid form strongly resembling a Angel and the ability to talk due to her association with the Shield Hero and the effects of the Legendary Shield.', '/uploads/images/c_126828.jpg'),
(114, 'Malty Melromarc', 'マルティ・メルロマルク', '配角', 'Sarah Emi Bridcutt', 'The first princess of Melromarc who betrayed [Naofumi Iwatani](https://anilist.co/character/88817) in the beginning of the series. She is notorious for manipulating other people in order to satisfy her selfish desires.', '/uploads/images/c_129808.jpg'),
(114, 'Motoyasu Kitamura', '北村元康', '配角', 'Makoto
 Takahashi', 'A university student summoned to another world as the Spear Hero. He is an easy-going and handsome womanizer. ~!After being abandoned by [Malty](https://anilist.co/character/129808), He has developed an obsession for Filolials. After Fio tried to cheer him up, he can now only see women as pigs in the literal sense. He raised three Filolials, called Kuu, Marin and Midori because he couldn''t get Fios attention. He also unlocks the curse series. His sins are Lust (for Fio) and Envy (for Naofumis position of being loved by Fio).!~', '/uploads/images/c_129809.jpg'),
(114, 'Ren Amaki', '天木錬', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'A high school student who was summoned to another world as the Sword Hero. He''s considered a bishounen and tends to stay quiet. ~!After his companions die, he fell into despair, and, thus, he followed [Malty](https://anilist.co/character/129808) when she offered kind words to him. After being abandoned by her, he had a brief stint as a bandit, after which he came under the Female Knight''s tutelage. He also unlocked the curse series after being abandoned by Malty. His sins are Greed (For Power) and Gluttony (For Power).!~', '/uploads/images/c_129812.jpg'),
(114, 'Melty Q Melromarc', 'メルティ・Q・メルロマルク', '配角', 'Maaya Uchida', 'The second princess of Melromarc. Melty is in many ways the exact opposite of her sister, [Malty](https://anilist.co/character/129808/Melromarc-Malty). This includes their personality, appearance, magic specialty (water vs fire), and color schemes (blue and white against red and brown).', '/uploads/images/c_129813.jpg'),
(114, 'Itsuki Kawasumi', '川澄樹', '配角', 'Yoshitaka Yamaya', 'A high school student summoned to another world as the Bow Hero. He is usually calm and well-mannered. However, He has a messiah complex, and is pretty much a justice maniac. He vanquishes evildoers without thinking of the consequences of his actions. However, this is just because he is immature. He doesn''t actually have any bad intentions. ~!When the Spirit Turtle revived, Itsuki and the party was forced to challenge it, but the party ran away, leaving him as a sacrifice to the Turtle.!~', '/uploads/images/c_129814.jpg'),
(114, 'Beloukas', 'ベロウカ', '配角', 'Kenichi Ogata', 'The slave dealer that sells Naofumi Iwatani many slaves. He also conducts slave and monster seal rituals. Despite his appearance and his trade, he is an honest salesman. Upon Naofumi’s request, he searches for and collects slaves who were former villagers of Raphtalia’s village', '/uploads/images/c_133722.jpg'),
(114, 'Aultcray Melromarc XXXII', 'オルトクレイ＝メルロマルク３２世', '配角', 'Yutaka Nakano', 'The king of Melromarc. He shows obvious favoritism towards his daughter [Malty](https://anilist.co/character/129808) and animosity towards the Shield Hero [Naofumi Iwatani](https://anilist.co/character/88817). ~! It was revealed that Aultcray is the Wand Hero who led his country in a war against demi-humans and beastmen. Through that experience, he holds hatred towards non-human species and promotes the idea of human supremacy in Melromarc. He shows biased hatred towards Naofumi because the Shield Hero is revered as the protector of demi-humans and beastmen. When Queen Mirelia Q Melromarc comes back to Melromarc after resolving diplomatic issues, she strips Aultcray of his authorities due to his ineptitude to properly lead the people and officially changed his name to Trash as punishment for his abuse of power.!~ ~!The king''s real name was Luge Lances Forbrey and used the alias Luge Lancarose to hide the fact that he was of royal blood when he battled in the front lines during the war. The name Aultcray Melromarc XXXII was adopted when he married Mirelia and became king. He was the third legitimate heir to the throne of Forbrey, but lost that privilege when the Hakuko race killed his parents and loved ones. Due to that fact that Forbrey did nothing to retaliate against the Hakuko residing in Siltvelt due to political reasons, Luge began to despise both countries and moved to the human supremacy-promoting country of Melromarc. He later challenged and defeated the Hakuko king.!', '/uploads/images/c_133723.jpg'),
(114, 'Erhard', 'エルハルト', '配角', 'Hiroki Yasumoto', 'Erhard is a blacksmith and a weapon shop owner in the castle town of Melromarc. His shop is the only shop in Melromarc to sell shields while others don''t for religious reasons.', '/uploads/images/c_133724.jpg'),
(114, 'Yakkyoku no Owner', '薬局のオーナー', '配角', 'Motoyuki Kawahara', 'The old man that runs the medicinal shop has a relatives that live in Riyuuto Village. Because Naofumi saved many people during the second wave, the old man happily assist Naofumi whenever he''s needed.', '/uploads/images/c_133774.jpg'),
(114, 'Biscas  T. Balmus', 'ビスカス . T . バルマス', '配角', 'Takayuki Sugou', 'The highest priest of the Three Heroes Cult. ~!He used his deep connections in the nation to do away with any opposing authority in the kingdom. He was so narrow-minded that he calls all of his actions "the will of God". He also claims that his followers who died in the fight against the Shield Hero will go to Heaven as a holy reward. When wielding the replica of the Legendary Weapons, Biscas shows a visible "God complex," as he proclaimed himself God while labeling evil anyone who opposed him. he masterminded many events and tried to kill all of the heroes. He killed the queen''s right-hand man who happens to be Eclair''s father so that the authority rest with King Aultcray Melromarc XXXII, who was at the time was very gullible and easy to manipulate.!~', '/uploads/images/c_135197.png'),
(114, 'Mirellia Q Melromarc', 'ミレル＝Q＝メルロマルク', '配角', 'Kikuko Inoue', 'The queen of Melromarc. She holds the true power of the crown and is generally a just ruler. She is known for her diplomacy and negotiation skills.', '/uploads/images/c_135198.png'),
(114, 'Yousaiya', '洋裁屋', '配角', 'Eriko Matsui', 'She is the owner of the tailor store. Her name was never mentioned so she is referred to as the Tailor. She made her debut in both the light novel and anime​ but never made her debut in the manga. She was only mentioned by the Magic Shop Owner as being a friend of hers.', '/uploads/images/c_135363.png'),
(114, 'Mahouya', '魔法屋', '配角', 'Meiko Kawasaki', 'She is an older woman who runs a magic book store at Castle Town of Melromarc. She was mentioned to be a witch by herself. She gave magic books free of cost for Naofumi and his party to learn magic.', '/uploads/images/c_135364.png'),
(114, 'Fitoria', 'フィトリア', '配角', 'Sakura Tange', 'Fitoria is the queen of the Filolials, who rules over them all. She has silver hair with thin streaks of light blue, cut in a short bob with three tufts of hair standing up vertically from the crown of her head, like cowlicks. Her eyes are red and her face is small and well composed. She''s dressed in a red and white gothic lolita-style dress. She''s about the same height as Filo.', '/uploads/images/c_136790.jpg'),
(114, 'Keel', 'キール', '配角', 'Natsumi Fujiwara', '__Race:__ Wanui ~!Gender: Female!~ Keel was born and raised in the same village as Raphtalia. Naofumi purchased them as a slave in order to rebuild the village destroyed by the first wave.', '/uploads/images/c_136792.png'),
(114, 'L''arc  Berg', 'ラルクベルク', '配角', 'Jun Fukuyama', 'L''arc has spiked red hair and is muscular. He has a tattoo of a scythe on his upper arm and appears to be handsome He is carefree and laid back, taking a very relaxed path to every problem. He is, according to Naofumi, an older-brother kind of character. Even though he has become a king, he likes his freedom. Just like Glass, he has a warrior spirit which is shown during his fight with Naofumi. He is a good judge of character just by looking at someone. He did have a childish side which shown by the way, when he acted too excited for the ship ride to Cal Mira island. He had the habit of calling the younger persons "Kiddo". He has high morals and doesn''t want to hurt any others who are irrelevant to his mission.', '/uploads/images/c_136793.jpg'),
(114, 'Rishia Ivyred', 'リーシア＝アイヴィレッド', '配角', 'Natsuko Hara', '__Race__: Human Rishia is the daughter of the House of Ivyred, a noble family. Due to an unfortunate string of events, the family had grown poor and she was forcefully taken as ransom by a neighboring family in exchange for gold. She was rescued by The Bow Hero, whom she would later devote her life to. ~!To show her gratitude and support for her savior, Rishia would go on to join Itsuki''s party. She would then be treated as an errand girl, carrying food and supplies for the Bow Hero''s party, leaving her talent in magic unused and untapped.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136794.png'),
(114, 'Glass', 'グラス', '配角', 'Megumi Han', 'A mysterious girl who seems to be an enemy. ~!She was able to defeat the Sword, Lance and Bow Heroes single-handedly, but lost to Naofumi. She was mistaken as a calamity when she first appeared.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136796.jpg'),
(114, 'Therese Alexandrite', 'テリス・アレキサンドライト', '配角', 'Saori Hayami', 'A companion of Lar''c Berg. She has a white skin which looked like ivory. Her hair was bluish green which sparkled in sunlight.Her hair was pulled back into a braid of three thick strands and draped. She wears bangles with massive gem on both hands. As a jewel she''s able to obtain energy from the different gems that she owns and use it to cast powerful spells.', '/uploads/images/c_136797.jpg'),
(114, 'Hickwaal', 'ヒックバル', '配角', 'Shunichi Maki', 'He is the accessory Merchant protected by the shield hero from Bandits and was also the founder and first president of the Hickwaal Company.', '/uploads/images/c_136956.jpg'),
(114, 'Kishi Danchou', '騎士団長', '配角', 'Shouta Yamamoto', 'The Leader of Melromarc Knight is the highest rank of Knights in Melromarc. His actual name was never revealed in the series.', '/uploads/images/c_136957.jpg'),
(114, 'Roudy', 'ラウド', '配角', 'Yoshihito Sasaki', 'He is the bandit who has the most frequent unfortunate encounter with Naofumi. Later, he founded the Chivalrous Thief Guild with the guidance of Naofumi.', '/uploads/images/c_136958.jpg'),
(114, 'Ake', 'アケ', '配角', 'Gakuto Kajiwara', 'He is one of the Juvenile Knights of Melromarc.. He accompanied the Knight squads to Lute Village in times of the wave, to assists the heroes.', '/uploads/images/c_137277.png'),
(114, 'Van Reichnott', 'ヴァン・ライヒョット', '配角', 'Taku Yashiro', 'He is a member of a wealthy family who happened to have close relations with Lord Seaetto. He is respected by the Demi-humans of his region. His name was not mentioned and Naofumi nicknames him as "Nice Guy."', '/uploads/images/c_138136.jpg'),
(114, 'Rifana', 'リファナ', '配角', 'Miho Okasaki', 'She is the childhood friend of both Keel and Raphtalia. She was resided in the demi-human protected village in Melromarc.', '/uploads/images/c_138140.jpg'),
(114, 'Idol Rabier', 'アイドル・ラビエル', '配角', 'Taisuke Nishimura', 'He is a Melromarc nobleman and Raphtalia''s previous abusive owner.', '/uploads/images/c_138141.png'),
(114, 'Mald', 'マルド', '配角', 'Taiten Kusunoki', 'The leader of the revolutionary army against the Shield Hero. ~!He was in Itsuki''s party. However, when the Spirit Turtle was revived, he and the rest of the party abandoned Itsuki and ran away.!~', '/uploads/images/c_177271.jpg'),
(114, 'Raphtalia no Haha', 'ラフタリアの母', '配角', 'Eriko Matsui', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_244841.png'),
(114, 'Raphtalia no Chichi', 'ラフタリアの父', '配角', 'Hiromichi Tezuka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_244842.png'),
(114, 'Joou no kage', '女王の影', '配角', 'Airi Ootsu', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_244843.png'),
(114, 'Shisai', '司祭', '配角', 'Masaya Fukunishi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_244844.png'),
(114, 'Mamoru Shirono', '城野守', '配角', 'Kousuke Toriumi', 'Mamoru Shirono is a Shield Hero of Raphtalia''s World in the ancient past. He was one of two Legendary Heroes summoned to defend against the waves.', '/uploads/images/c_276961.jpg'),
(115, 'Hiro', 'ヒロ', '主角', 'Yuuto Uemura', '__Height:__ 168 cm (5''6") __Classification:__ Parasite __Affiliation:__ Thirteenth Plantation __Occupation:__ Stamen __Partners:__ [Zero Two](https://anilist.co/character/124381), ~! [Naomi](https://anilist.co/character/144621/Naomi) (formerly), [Ichigo](https://anilist.co/character/124382/Ichigo) (temporarily), [001](https://anilist.co/character/126290/Kyouryuu-no-Hime) (temporarily), [9''α](https://anilist.co/character/161730/9-Alpha) (temporarily) !~ __FRANXX:__ Strelizia, Delphinium (temporarily), ~! 9 Model (temporarily) !~ Hiro was known as a prodigy Parasite with the codename "016" of Thirteenth Plantation, where he''s partnered in a boy-girl pair with Zero Two to pilot a FRANXX called Strelizia.', '/uploads/images/c_124380.jpg'),
(115, 'Zero Two', 'ゼロツー', '主角', 'Haruka Tomatsu', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Classification:__ Parasite __Affiliation:__ APE''s Special Forces Unit __Partner:__ [Hiro](https://anilist.co/character/124380/Hiro) __FRANXX:__ Strelizia Zero Two is an elite FRANXX pilot who is a member of a race of humans with Klaxosaur blood, and the pistil of the FranXX Strelizia.', '/uploads/images/c_124381.jpg'),
(115, 'Ichigo', 'イチゴ', '主角', 'Kana Ichinose', '__Height:__ 152 cm (5’0”) Ichigo is a former Parasite with the codename "015" of the Thirteenth Plantation, where she was partnered in boy-girl pair with [Goro](https://anilist.co/character/124383/Goro) to pilot a FRANXX called Delphinium.', '/uploads/images/c_124382.jpg'),
(115, 'Goro', 'ゴロー', '主角', 'Yuuichirou Umehara', 'Goro pilots the Franxx Delphinium with [Ichigo](https://anilist.co/character/124382).', '/uploads/images/c_124383.jpg'),
(115, 'Miku', 'ミク', '主角', 'Nanami Yamashita', 'Miku is a former Parasite with the codename "390" of the Thirteenth Plantation, where she is partnered in boy-girl pair with [Zorome](https://anilist.co/character/124385/Zorome) to pilot a FRANXX called Argentea. She is the most assertive and head-strong of the girls and is not afraid to clash with the boys. She is motivated to strive and she shares an attitude almost identical to Zorome’s, which makes them perfectly compatible.', '/uploads/images/c_124384.jpg'),
(115, 'Zorome', 'ゾロメ', '主角', 'Mutsumi Tamura', '__Height:__ 161cm Zorome is a former Parasite with the codename "666" of the Thirteenth Plantation, where he is partnered in a boy-girl pair with [Miku](https://anilist.co/character/124384/Miku) to pilot a FRANXX called Argentea. Aside from being the most immature member of the squad, he is the most loyal to the adults and APE, and his long-reaching goal is to become an adult himself. He presents himself as somewhat of a bully and pervert but he is also a dedicated member of the squad and willing to do whatever it takes to help his squadmates.', '/uploads/images/c_124385.jpg'),
(115, 'Kokoro', 'ココロ', '主角', 'Saori Hayami', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") Pilots the Franxx Genista with Futoshi. ~!After the partner shuffle, she rides with Mitsuru. Kokoro becomes pregnant with Mitsuru''s child later on in the anime.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124386.jpg'),
(115, 'Futoshi', 'フトシ', '主角', 'Hiroki Gotou', 'Pilots the Franxx Genista (ジェニスタ) with Kokoro (ココロ)', '/uploads/images/c_124387.jpg'),
(115, 'Ikuno', 'イクノ', '主角', 'Shizuka Ishigami', '__Height:__ 169 cm (5''7") Pilots the Franxx Chlorophytum with Mitsuru.', '/uploads/images/c_124388.jpg'),
(115, 'Mitsuru', 'ミツル', '主角', 'Aoi Ichikawa', 'Mitsuru pilots the FRANXX Chlorophytum with Ikuno, and is part off Plantation 13. ~!Later in the anime, he switches partners with Futoshi, and ends up piloting the FRANXX Genista, along with Kokoro. They fall in love and Kokoro gets pregnant with his child.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124389.jpg'),
(115, 'Franxx Hakase', 'フランクス博士', '配角', 'Kenyuu Horiuchi', 'Creator of the FRANXX used to fight Klaxosaurs.', '/uploads/images/c_124851.jpg'),
(115, 'Nana', 'ナナ', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', 'Parasite administrator of APE Operational Headquarters. ~!She was a FranXX Pilot in the same squadron as Hachi.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124852.jpg'),
(115, 'Hachi', 'ハチ', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', 'Commander of Urban Defense Operation of APE Operational Headquarters.', '/uploads/images/c_124853.jpg'),
(115, 'Kyouryuu no Hime', '叫竜の姫', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', '**Classification:** Klaxo Sapiens **Partner:** N/A (capable of piloting FRANXX without one) **FRANXX:** Model Saurian, 9 Model (temporarily), Strelizia (temporarily) A mysterious being that lurks deep inside Earth, accompanied by numerous Klaxosaurs. She''s capable of speaking telepathically and seems to have a close bond with a serpentine Klaxosaur named **Nawabari** (縄張). ~!She''s the last surviving member of an advanced humanoid race from which the Klaxosaurs evolved, aware of VIRM''s true nature and spiteful of humanity due to their ignorance, as well as playing a part in exterminating her kind.!~ ~![Zero Two](https://anilist.co/character/124381/Zero-Two) was created from her DNA, which [Dr Franxx](https://anilist.co/character/124851/Dr-Franxx-) extracted from a handful of her hair. She''s also the one that bit off his arm, having recognized his key role in developing anti-Klaxosaur weaponry.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126290.png'),
(115, 'Naomi', 'ナオミ', '配角', 'Ami Koshimizu', 'Naomi is a former Parasite from the Thirteenth Plantation with the codename "703". She is the former partner of Hiro, who held her back from becoming a pilot due to his inability to pilot FRANXX. (Source: Franxx Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_144621.png'),
(115, '9'' Alpha', 'ナインアルファ', '配角', 'Souma Saitou', 'Alpha is a character in DARLING in the FRANXX. He was a Parasite and the official leader of the 9''s, a special forces unit that APE directly controls. He was partnered with 9’ζ and piloted a FRANXX called 9 Model. Nine Alpha is a rather short young man, his face framed by pale, honey blond hair, his long bangs low above his green eyes. He wears a special Parasite uniform emblazoned with white and gold, instead of the typical gray uniforms that other Parasite squads use. When in his FRANXX, Alpha, along with the others in his squad, sports a red battle suit. Like his fellow stamens, he appears with golden horns that appear to be holographic klaxosaur horns.', '/uploads/images/c_161730.jpg'),
(115, '9'' Delta', 'ナインデルタ', '配角', 'Ayane Sakura', '9''δ is a Parasite who served in the 9''s, a special forces unit that APE directly controls. She is partners with 9''ε and pilots a FRANXX called the 9 Model. (Source: DARLING in the FRANXX Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_174777.png'),
(115, '9'' Beta', 'ナインベータ', '配角', 'Toshiki Masuda', '9''β was a Parasite who served in the 9''s, a special forces unit that APE directly controls. He was partnered with 9''η and piloted a FRANXX called 9 Model. (Source: DARLING in the FRANXX Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_174778.png'),
(115, 'Shuseki', '主席', '配角', 'Tesshou Genda', '**Age:** More than 60 million years He is the chairman of the APE council and by extension all of known humanity. Like a leader, Shuseki speaks in a refined and sophisticated manner, and tends to handle situations in a methodical order. (Source: DARLING in the FRANXX Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_180881.jpg'),
(115, 'Fukushuseki', '副主席', '配角', 'Nobuo Tobita', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_180882.jpg'),
(115, '9'' Epsilon', '9''ε', '配角', 'Atsushi Tamaru', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_180884.jpg'),
(115, 'Otona Josei', 'オトナ女性', '配角', 'Kikuko Inoue', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_327022.png'),
(116, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Rintarou Nishi', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(116, 'Meliodas', 'メリオダス', '主角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Race:__ ~!Demon!~ __Height:__ 152cm (5''0") Meliodas the leader of the Seven Deadly Sins and the Sin of Wrath with the symbol of the Dragon. He is the main protagonist of the Nanatsu no Taizai and the owner of the Boar Hat bar.', '/uploads/images/c_72921.png'),
(116, 'Elizabeth Liones', 'エリザベス・リオネス', '主角', 'Sora Amamiya', 'Elizabeth Liones is the third adoptive princess of the Kingdom of Liones Originally an alleged survivor of Danafor''s destruction, Elizabeth was adopted and raised by the king [Bartra Liones](https://anilist.co/character/131565/Bartra-Liones). After the Holy Knights rebel, she sets on journey to find Seven Deadly Sins, becoming a waitress for [Meliodas](https://anilist.co/character/72921/Meliodas-)'' tavern Boar Hat. ~!She is 107th and current incarnation of the Goddess Elizabeth, and the lover of Meliodas, captain of the Seven Deadly Sins. She is the deuteragonist of the series.!~', '/uploads/images/c_72923.png'),
(116, 'Gilthunder', 'ギルサンダー', '配角', 'Mamoru Miyano', '__Height:__ 185 cm (6''1") One of the holy knights of the Britannia kingdom. He is a Diamond-ranked Holy Knight.', '/uploads/images/c_74285.png'),
(116, 'Diane', 'ディアンヌ', '主角', 'Aoi Yuuki', 'Diane is a member of the Seven Deadly Sins and is The Sin of Envy with the symbol of the Serpent. She is also a member of the Giant''s Clan. She is a fair maiden with pink eyes and medium length brown hair which is tied up into Mega Twintails. Despite being a beautiful looking maiden, she is in fact a giant from the giant clan, and is several times larger than ordinary humans. She wears a one piece orange suit, boots that extend almost up to the knees, and a metal armband which is embedded with shiny metal pebbles. Her current outfits and attire is believed to be the most fashionable ones. She wears an orange colored short sleeved bodysuit and boots. As the Serpent''s Sin of Envy, her main traits are jealousy and envy. She shows strong affection for Meliodas, so when she met him together with Elizabeth, she grew very jealous and threw him away whilst calling him a cheater. In contrary with Elizabeth who wants to be strong and powerful, she wants to be small.', '/uploads/images/c_74653.jpg'),
(116, 'Ban', 'バン', '主角', 'Tatsuhisa Suzuki', '__Height:__ 210 cm Ban is a member of the Seven Deadly Sins and is The Sin of Greed with the symbol of the Fox. He was imprisoned in the Baste Dungeon.', '/uploads/images/c_77605.png'),
(116, 'King', 'キング', '主角', 'Jun Fukuyama', '__Height:__ 165 cm King is a member of the Seven Deadly Sins and is the Sin of Sloth with the symbol of the Grizzly. He is also Oslo''s master. King''s real identity is Fairy King Harlequin, the king of the fairy race.', '/uploads/images/c_83801.png'),
(116, 'Guila', 'ギーラ', '配角', 'Mariya Ise', 'Geera is a Holy Knight who left herself in a near-death state to have access to the Capital of the Dead and kill the Deadly Sins who had gone there. She is a young female with a slim build. She has long black hair and her eyes are depicted as if they are closed.', '/uploads/images/c_86665.jpg'),
(116, 'Dreyfus', 'ドレファス', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', 'Dreyfus is one of the current Great Holy Knights, thus also making him one of the two people who have command over the entirety of Britannia after the coup d''état. His attire consists of a standard set of a Holy Knight''s armor that has a spike on each shoulder. He has long black hair that reaches up to his shoulder, with a short beard.', '/uploads/images/c_86677.png'),
(116, 'Hendricksen', 'ヘンドリクセン', '配角', 'Yuuya Uchida', 'Hendricksen is one of the current Great Holy Knights, thus also making him one of the two people who have command over the entirety of Britannia after the coup d''état. He wears a set of and covers it with a robe on top. He has short light-colored hair and also a goatee. Hendricksen is a serious man, who, like Dreyfus, appears to be willing to capture the king and enslave the citizens to prepare for the Holy War. However, he also seems to be plotting something.', '/uploads/images/c_86679.png'),
(116, 'Elaine', 'エレイン', '配角', 'Kotori Koiwai', 'Elaine is King''s sister, and the Guardian Saint of the Fountain of Youth. She has long and thin eyelashes, and cut hair that reaches her neck. She wears a single white one-piece dress which is tied together with a butterfly knot at the back. Elaine is shown to be a kind, caring and forgiving girl.', '/uploads/images/c_86681.png'),
(116, 'Hawk', 'ホーク', '主角', 'Misaki Kuno', 'Hawk is a talking pig and Meliodas''s companion. He is introduced as the cleaner of the Boar Hat bar who helps clean the disgusting food scraps. He is a relatively large pink pig who wears an earring with the word star boar on his left ear. His body is well rounded and his legs are fairly short. He has a unique patch of black spots shaped like a four-leafed clover. His body and appearance are fairly similar to a typical Gloucestershire Old Spots Pig.', '/uploads/images/c_86683.png'),
(116, 'Howzer', 'ハウザー', '配角', 'Ryouhei Kimura', 'Hauser is a Holy Knight, a colleague and partner of Gilthunder, and a subordinate of the Great Holy Knight, Dreyfus. He wears a set of Holy Knight armor and has short light-colored curled up hair. Hauser demonstrates a lot of self confidence and is very optimistic, which is the complete opposite of Gilthunder''s personality; he is also shown to be somewhat naive and stupid.', '/uploads/images/c_86685.png'),
(116, 'Veronica Liones', 'ベロニカ・リオネス', '配角', 'Hisako Kanemoto', 'Veronica is the second princess of Britannia. The younger sibling of the first princess, [Margaret](https://anilist.co/character/126382/Liones-Margaret), and elder to her adopted sister; the third princess, [Elizabeth](https://anilist.co/character/72923/Liones-Elizabeth). She has a tomboyish appearance, short light colored hair and a slim build. She wears a stylish fur coat, a knight-styled attire, a belt and a pair of long boots. She is described to be a tomboy, who, as a child, liked to and often used to play with swords with the boys, and would be scolded by her father for doing so. Sharing the Holy Knights'' attitude about enslaving the citizens, she also cares about her younger sister, Elizabeth.', '/uploads/images/c_86691.png'),
(116, 'Jericho', 'ジェリコ', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', 'Jericho is an apprentice Holy Knight who served under the Weird Fangs. She was stationed at the Baste Dungeon, where the Deadly Sin, Ban was imprisoned. She is young woman of slim build, with light hair that is swept over the left side of her face and tied into a ponytail at the back. She wears a black coat over her armor, adorned with a cross on the left side and larger cross covering the back. Underneath her armor are similarly fashioned black clothes. Metal gauntlets cover her arms, while metal greaves and sabatons cover her legs and feet. Jericho is a proud and serious individual. She is stern in her command over the guards of Baste Dungeon and overconfident in her abilities, appearing arrogant at times, which led to her humiliation by Ban.', '/uploads/images/c_86699.jpg'),
(116, 'Griamor', 'グリアモール', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', 'Griamor is a Holy Knight who comes from a lineage of Holy Knights that have served the kingdom of Lyonesse for many generations. He is Veronica''s bodyguard, and shows absolute loyalty towards her. Griamor is a very tall and muscular individual who is at least twice the height of ordinary civilians, and has grey shoulder length hair. His attire consists of a single-spiked helmet, full leg armor and no upper body clothing, except a mysterious metal plate strapped around his chest with two straps. He also wears a glove on one hand and a sleeve-armor on the other arm. He, like many other Holy Knights, is heartless and cruel. Although he is ruthless, he shows absolute loyalty to Veronica and cannot allow himself to displease her, having started to serve her at a quite young age, even role-playing as a horse for her to ride on as a child.', '/uploads/images/c_86703.jpg'),
(116, 'Gowther', 'ゴウセル', '主角', 'Yuuhei Takagi', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") (Human size), 23 - 24 cm (0''9") (doll) He is shown to be completely clueless and unaware of others'' feelings, not understanding the meaning of friendship. He often states things factually, not understanding how what he says can upset people. He decides to assist [Elizabeth](https://anilist.co/character/72923/Liones-Elizabeth) on her journey, not because of a desire for justice, but because he felt obligated as a member of the Seven Deadly Sins. Since Gowther doesn''t understand emotions, he goes to great length to understand them. For example, observing [Meliodas](https://anilist.co/character/72921/Meliodas) and [Ban](https://anilist.co/character/77605/Ban)''s friendship.', '/uploads/images/c_88823.png'),
(116, 'Merlin', 'マーリン', '配角', 'Maaya Sakamoto', 'She is a member of the Seven Deadly Sins. She has the mark of the boars sin of gluttony. She was regarded as the greatest mage in Britannia and is the master of [Vivian](https://anilist.co/character/131564) as well as a teacher of [King Arthur of Camelot](https://anilist.co/character/122210). She came to the aid of the sins in their battle against [Hendirkson](https://anilist.co/character/86679) but had to leave to tend to the King. She has not officially rejoined the sins but said she would as soon as she was finished with her other business.', '/uploads/images/c_89180.png'),
(116, 'Arthur Pendragon', 'アーサー・ペンドラゴン', '配角', 'Sachi Kokuryuu', 'Named the king of Camelot after pulling a sword from the stone that hundreds of holy knights could not. Arthur is a polite, young man who is still adjusting to his role as king. He takes his responsibilities very seriously, but usually undertakes them with a smile and has a very warm, and happy-go-lucky demeanor. He marched toward the kingdom of Liones with an army of illusions created by Merlin in hopes of meeting with the king; however, he was confronted by Hendricksen who tried to kill him before Meliodas came to his aide. (Source: MyAnimeList)', '/uploads/images/c_122210.png'),
(116, 'Margaret Liones', 'マーガレット・リオネス', '配角', 'Nana Mizuki', 'The first princess of the Kingdom of Liones. The elder sibling of the second princess, Veronica and of her adopted sister; the third princess, Elizabeth.', '/uploads/images/c_126382.png'),
(116, 'Zaratras', 'ザラトラス', '配角', 'Rikiya Koyama', 'Zaratras was a Great Holy Knight and was once the strongest in the order of Liones'' Holy Knights before his death ten years prior to the beginning of series. He is also the father of the Holy Knight, Gilthunder, and was the Seven Deadly Sins'' superior.', '/uploads/images/c_131560.png'),
(116, 'Liz', 'リズ', '配角', 'Sora Amamiya', 'Liz, or Elizabeth, was a knight from an enemy kingdom of Danafor, which attempted night ambush at Danafor, but got captured and sentenced to death. She was saved by Meliodas, the leader of the Holy Knights of Danafor and ended up living in Danafor and eventually also became Meliodas'' lover. She is believed to have been killed during Danafor''s complete annihilation.', '/uploads/images/c_131561.jpg'),
(116, 'Vivian', 'ビビアン', '配角', 'Minako Kotobuki', 'Vivian is an enigmatic Holy Knight once directly serving under Great Holy Knight [Hendrickson](https://anilist.co/character/86679/Hendricksen) and used to be an apprentice of [Merlin](https://anilist.co/character/89180/Merlin), the Boar''s Sin Gluttony. Vivian is regarded as the kingdom of Liones'' greatest mage.', '/uploads/images/c_131564.jpg'),
(116, 'Bartra Liones', 'バルトラ・リオネス', '配角', 'Rintarou Nishi', 'The eleventh king of Liones and father of Elizabeth. He was held captive after the Seven Deadly Sins were framed for killing the great holy knight Zaratras.', '/uploads/images/c_131565.jpg'),
(116, 'Gustav', 'グスタフ', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', 'Gustaf is a Ruby ranked Holy Knight and Jericho''s older brother.', '/uploads/images/c_131567.jpg'),
(116, 'Zeal', 'ジール', '配角', 'Yui Nakajima', 'Guila''s younger brother', '/uploads/images/c_131574.jpg'),
(116, 'Slader', 'スレイダー', '配角', 'Shinichirou Miki', 'Slader was kidnapped and raised as a child by savages who held no regard for his worth as a human. After being freed by the king of Liones he pledged loyalty and resolved to hunt down any who wronged the kingdom. He is a member of Dawn Roar who holds a rivalry against Gowther of the Seven Deadly Sins.', '/uploads/images/c_131889.jpg'),
(116, 'Golgius', 'ゴルギウス', '配角', 'Choo', 'A holy knight of the weird fangs. Golgius uses underhanded and deceitful tactics in order to get his way. Contracts a doctor to poison Melodidas while holding his daughter hostage and making off with Elizabeth and his sword, also tries to assassinate Melodidas while holding his hands up in surrender. He has the power of transparency, which he claims to be teleportation', '/uploads/images/c_131891.jpg'),
(116, 'Cain Barzard', 'ケイン・バルザド', '配角', 'Takashi Inagaki', 'Cain is a short elderly man with combed hair, and a long mustache and beard. He also wears a clock, and his eyes seem to be always closed. Under his cloak, Cain wears trousers, and a long shirt that bears the crest of Danafor. He seem like a drunk, and strange, weak old man but deep down he might be a powerful fighter and wanted to have revenge on Meliodas for destroying their kingdom long time ago, he seem to be shock when he found out he wasn''t Meliodas'' son and that he didn''t age.', '/uploads/images/c_131898.jpg'),
(116, 'Mead', 'ミード', '配角', 'Yumiko Kobayashi', 'Mead is an orphan, adopted by the villagers of Bernia after his parents, who were travelers, became victim to an epidemic when they stopped by Bernia.', '/uploads/images/c_131904.jpg'),
(116, 'Ellen', 'エレン', '配角', 'Nozomi Furuki', 'She is the sister of Luigi. She knows the way into the Capital of the Dead.', '/uploads/images/c_131905.jpg'),
(116, 'Weinheidt', 'ワインハイト', '配角', 'Hideki Nakanishi', 'Weinheidt was a member from the group of Holy Knights, Dawn Roar and was the marksman of the team. Weinheidt was a well-built man with a short beard and mustache and wears a set of medieval archer clothing with a small cloak draped around his shoulders. Like the other Dawn Roar members, Weinheidt was willing to kill anybody for the mission. He was faithful to whatever mission his team is assigned to and doesn''t care about the motives behind the mission as long as the job gets done, although he can be curious sometimes. Despite the Holy Knights'' coup, Weinheidt retains his loyalty to the king along with his teammates when Baltra ordered Dawn Roar to stop Slader from hurting himself, to which Weinheidt complied.', '/uploads/images/c_131906.jpg'),
(116, 'Friesia', 'フリージア', '配角', 'Megumi Han', 'Friesia is a Holy Knight with the ability to manipulate insects. Belonging to the infamous Weird Fangs stationed at Baste Dungeon, she aided in the capture of the Deadly Sin, Ban.', '/uploads/images/c_131907.jpg'),
(116, 'Dale', 'デール', '配角', 'Mitsuru Miyamoto', 'A Holy Knight and father of Guila and Zeal. Although Dale is labeled as a traitor after his disappearance, the incident is shrouded in mystery', '/uploads/images/c_131908.png'),
(116, 'Jude', 'ジュド', '配角', 'Nobuyuki Hiyama', 'A Holy Knight, and one of the four Weird Fangs of Baste Dungeon who captured and imprisoned Ban. Jude is known to have tortured Ban mercilessly during the Sin''s imprisonment.', '/uploads/images/c_131909.jpg'),
(116, 'Taizoo', 'タイズー', '配角', 'Kenichirou Matsuda', 'is a mountain bandit-turned merchant, and a three-time champion of Vaizel''s annual fight festival', '/uploads/images/c_131910.jpg'),
(116, 'Ruin', 'ルイン', '配角', 'Atsushi Ono', 'A holy knight of the weird fangs whom wishes to bring ruin to the seven deadly sins. Claims his body is his true armor, and more durable than steel. Hypnotizes both Melodidas and Diane into fighting each other with his bell. Easily defeated by Melodidas after Elizabeth tore the hypnotizing bell off his staff.', '/uploads/images/c_131911.jpg'),
(116, 'Twigo', 'ツイーゴ', '配角', 'Kenta Miyake', 'Twigo is an apprentice Holy Knight who is stationed near Caines Village. ~!After his defeat by Meliodas, he, wanting to gain greater powers, drank the demon''s blood, but died since he was incompatible.!~', '/uploads/images/c_131912.jpg'),
(116, 'Dana', 'ダナ', '配角', 'Tomoyuki Shimura', 'is an elderly doctor who resides in Dalmary Town, and has a daughter named Sennett. Dr. Dana is a level-headed person and is extremely dedicated to his work as he did not stop "treating" Meliodas even when Friesia was destroying the town.He cares deeply about his daughter as he was willing to even poison Meliodas to have her released from imprisonment', '/uploads/images/c_131913.jpg'),
(116, 'Marmas', 'マルマス', '配角', 'Kenichirou Matsuda', 'Marmas is a Holy Knight. He led Guila and Jericho in the assault on Byzel', '/uploads/images/c_131914.jpg'),
(116, 'Alioni', 'アリオーニ', '配角', 'Hirofumi Nojima', 'Alioni is a member of the group of knights, Beard of the Mountain Cat, which was garrisoned at the base of the mountain in Kaynes Village, and claimed to serve under a Holy Knight. He was first seen beside his fellow knights trying to capture to capture the enigmatic and infamous Rust Knight who had appeared at the mysterious bar, the Boar Hat.', '/uploads/images/c_131915.jpg'),
(116, 'Simon', 'サイモン', '配角', 'Ryousuke Kanemoto', 'is a Holy Knight and a member of Dawn Roar', '/uploads/images/c_131916.jpg'),
(116, 'Sennett', 'セネット', '配角', 'Yurie Kobori', 'is the daughter of an elderly doctor, Dana who works at Dalmary Town. Sennett is a polite and caring person. She loves her father very much, and was worried about him when she left; she was extremely happy when he is revealed to be alive.She also cares about her dagger as it is a memento of her mother', '/uploads/images/c_131917.jpg'),
(116, 'Luigi', 'ルイジ', '配角', 'Emiri Katou', 'He is the brother of Ellen.', '/uploads/images/c_131918.jpg'),
(116, 'Hawk Mama', 'ホークママ', '配角', 'Kayou Nakajima', 'She is Hawk''s mother and the extremely large, green pig who transports the Boar Hat bar. She is introduced to live underground and transports the bar Boar Hat with her head. So far, her name remains unknown but she has gained many aliases.', '/uploads/images/c_133377.png'),
(116, 'Helbram', 'ヘルブラム', '配角', 'Hiroshi Kamiya', 'Helbram is a Holy Knight, Geera''s master, and the subordinate of the Great Holy Knight, Hendricksen. He wears a set of copper-colored full body armor, adorning it with a purple coat on top. He usually covers his face with a unique helm with a skyblue crest on it. Helbram has a serious personality, but also a playful side, which is seen when he jokes that Meliodas'' decoration of Geera''s face was not very bad. Helbram was also shown to like doing research, even taking notes during battle. ~!During the fighting festival in the Byzel Arc, he disguised himself as a referee with the alias of Love Helm.!~', '/uploads/images/c_140918.jpg'),
(117, 'Hirotaka Nifuji', '二藤宏高', '主角', 'Kento Itou', '__Height:__ 184 cm He specializes in video games, but he also reads a lot of manga and watches a lot of anime. (He likes all kinds of games, but he''s especially fond of FPS games, fighting games and action games, where it''s not necessary to level up.) He goes for one person in video games and finds everything from visuals to status as being important. He prefers e-mail for communication as the tension isn''t as high as it is otherwise.', '/uploads/images/c_122189.jpg'),
(117, 'Narumi Momose', '桃瀬成海', '主角', 'Arisa Date', '__Height:__ 154 cm Manga, comics and cosplay are up her alley, and at one time she had a superficial knowledge of the fashion scene. She''s a fan of multiple genres, loving many of them at the same time. She''s known [Hirotaka](https://anilist.co/character/122189/Nifuji-Hirotaka) since childhood (the one responsible for getting her into the otaku life) and he is the only one who really knows about her being an otaku.', '/uploads/images/c_122190.jpg'),
(117, 'Hanako Koyanagi', '小柳花子', '主角', 'Miyuki Sawashiro', '__Height:__ 167 cm (5''6") She likes things like drama and stage theatre. She also has a soft spot for anime and manga, as well as BL. She admires wifely characters who love someone with all their might. She doesn''t have much tolerance for alcohol, so she doesn''t bother to drink often, and she smokes very rarely.', '/uploads/images/c_122191.jpg'),
(117, 'Tarou Kabakura', '樺倉太郎', '主角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', '__Height:__ 180 cm He''s majorly into manga and games, which he has good taste in. He also has good taste in the merchandise he owns. Compared to the typical otaku, however, he falls a little short. Before he gets into new characters, he takes into consideration the guilty feeling he has about crime fiction and married life genres, former wives and current wives meeting genres, and the system type of wife-donos entering temples.', '/uploads/images/c_122192.jpg'),
(117, 'Naoya Nifuji', '二藤尚哉', '配角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 177 cm Naoya is a university student and the younger brother of [Hirotaka Nifuji](https://anilist.co/character/122189/Hirotaka-Nifuji) who wants the best for Hirotaka and he is genuinely happy when good things happen to him. He works as a barista in a coffee shop that is next to the office building where his brother is working to. Naoya has a cheerful personality who is often portrayed as a cat due to his cat-like smile and he seems to love his work as a barista since having satisfied customers makes him contented.', '/uploads/images/c_122193.jpg'),
(117, 'Kou Sakuragi', '桜城光', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', 'The way she gets absorbed in games bears an uncanny resemblance to a certain someone. Doesn''t use any social media sites or apps. Her messages tend to be very long, as if she carefully collected all her thoughts before writing them down. As a result, it takes her a while to send a response since she ends up revising them over and over. “Sorry” and “apologize” always come up first as suggestions when she starts typing. The anxiety she feels from having to send messages or make phone calls is akin to having a heart attack.', '/uploads/images/c_124023.jpg'),
(117, 'Yoshiki Ichijou', '一条良樹', '配角', 'Kenji Akabane', '__Height:__ 167cm Cheapskate, well-informed, and super perverted. He has been friends with Naoya Nifuji since kindergarten.', '/uploads/images/c_179958.jpg'),
(117, 'Doumoto', '堂元', '配角', 'Shouto Kashii', 'The section manager.', '/uploads/images/c_179959.jpg'),
(117, 'Chiba', '千葉', '配角', 'Rika Nagae', 'Narumi''s co-worker. She is pretty rich.', '/uploads/images/c_179960.jpg'),
(117, 'Aiba', '相庭', '配角', 'Taku Yashiro', 'Hirotaka''s co-worker. He likes women and is a showoff.', '/uploads/images/c_179961.jpg'),
(117, 'Baba', '馬場', '配角', 'Takuma Terashima', 'Hikotaka''s co-worker. He is a morose pervert.', '/uploads/images/c_179962.jpg'),
(117, 'Kensuke Mitsui', '三井健介', '配角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '__Height:__ 172cm One of Naoya''s friends. A loud and perverted muscle-head. He has been friends with Naoya Nifuji since kindergarten.', '/uploads/images/c_204416.jpg'),
(118, 'Haruki Shiga', '志賀春樹', '主角', 'Mahiro Takasugi', 'A guy who incidentally found a book in the hospital titled "Disease Coexistence Journal" which is owned by his classmate [Sakura Yamauchi](https://anilist.co/character/127118/Yamauchi-Sakura). ~!It is revealed in the last chapter of the novel that his name is Haruki Shiga (志賀春樹).!~', '/uploads/images/c_127116.jpg'),
(118, 'Sakura Yamauchi', '山内桜良', '主角', 'Lynn', 'A high school student who suffers a pancreatic disease, having her lifespan cut in half. She has a diary called "Living with Dying" where she writes about her daily experiences, since her illness was first diagnosed. Despite her situation, she keeps her smile and even makes jokes about it. ~!She was later stabbed after being discharged from the hospital and sadly passed away.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127118.jpg'),
(118, 'Issei Miyata', '宮田一晴', '配角', 'Jun Fukushima', 'A classmate who started talking to Haruki, since meeting Haruki and Sakura. For some reason, he offers a piece of gum to Haruki whenever they talk.', '/uploads/images/c_133276.jpg'),
(118, 'Takahiro', '隆弘', '配角', 'Yuuma Uchida', 'Class representative who is in love with Sakura. He is very obstinate and gets jealous easily yet hides it to keep face with his classmates.', '/uploads/images/c_133277.jpg'),
(118, 'Haruki no Haha', '春樹の母', '配角', 'Atsuko Tanaka', 'As his mother, she quietly and protectively watches over Haruki. Though she rarely intervenes, she has very good instincts.', '/uploads/images/c_134460.jpg'),
(118, 'Kyouko Takimoto', '滝本恭子', '配角', 'Yukiyo Fujii', 'Sakura’s best friend since they were little. She is protective of Sakura and will not let anyone who may be harmful near her. Very assertive.', '/uploads/images/c_134461.jpg'),
(118, 'Haruki no Chichi', '春樹の父', '配角', 'Shinichirou Miki', 'A humble and genuinely nice father, whose relationship with Haruki is neither good nor bad. Has a good relationship with his wife.', '/uploads/images/c_134462.jpg'),
(118, 'Sakura no Haha', '桜良の母', '配角', 'Emi Wakui', 'A very kind hearted woman, who strives to grant all of Sakura’s wishes since her daughter’s diagnosis.', '/uploads/images/c_134463.jpg'),
(118, 'Omawari-san 1', 'お巡りさん1', '配角', 'Kenta Kataoka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_377945.jpg'),
(118, 'Salaryman', 'サラリーマン', '配角', 'Takayuki Ogawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_401315.jpg'),
(119, 'Katsuki Bakugou', '爆豪勝己', '主角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5''7") __Quirk:__ Explosion Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Katsuki is a crude, arrogant, short-tempered, and aggressive person, especially at the beginning of the series. Due to the constant praise of his abilities and powerful Quirk, Katsuki has developed a superiority complex, and because of that, he desires to be the first and best at everything. He loves to win above all else and cannot stand it when he doesn''t, leading him to lose his already short temper if he achieves anything but a complete victory. Katsuki is not only very athletic and talented at fighting, but also very intelligent and extremely perceptive, capable of strategic planning and improvisation. Additionally, his grades are among the highest of his class. Katsuki also possesses surprising talent in other areas, such as cooking and music, even though he doesn''t show a particular interest in them. Overall, Katsuki is considered a natural-born genius with the potential to be one of the best Pro Heroes. Katsuki''s Quirk "Explosion" allows him to secrete nitroglycerin-like sweat from the palms of his hands and ignite it on command, allowing him to create strong explosions. The more Katsuki sweats, the stronger his explosions become. Not only can Katsuki use the explosions for attacking, he can also use them to propel himself and navigate through the air at high speeds, allowing him to fly at his opponents without giving them time to react, as well as evade incoming attacks, even whi', '/uploads/images/c_88892.png'),
(119, 'Izuku Midoriya', '緑谷出久', '主角', 'Daiki Yamashita', '__Height:__ 166 cm (5''5¼") __Quirk:__ One For All Student in Class 1-A at U.A High School. Although he was born without a Quirk, Izuku''s innate heroism and strong sense of justice manages to catch the attention of the legendary hero [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224). Izuku has since become All Might''s closest pupil. Izuku is a very timid, reserved, and polite boy. Although initially portrayed as insecure, tearful, and vulnerable, Izuku gradually matures into a more confident and braver person. His infectious leadership skills, combined with his passion and strategic abilities, have turned Izuku into a central figure of Class 1-A. He is caring and emotional, never hesitating to help or rescue someone in danger, even if he knows that he might not be strong or otherwise qualified enough to do it. Izuku is extremely (and sometimes scarily) enthusiastic about topics related to heroes. His dream drives him to write down notes about everything he learns about heroes'' Quirks and fighting capabilities. Thanks to this practice, Izuku has developed a great analytical mind and can form complex battle plans in a few seconds, factoring in the best ways he can utilize the Quirks of allies and enemies alike for his own advantage. Izuku''s Quirk "One For All" was transferred to him from All Might. His Quirk allows him to stockpile an enormous amount of raw power, allowing him to significantly enhance all of his physical abilities to various boundless levels. This results in unbel', '/uploads/images/c_89028.png'),
(119, 'Shouto Todoroki', '轟焦凍', '配角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9") __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Half-Cold Half-Hot Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School, where he got in through official recommendations. He is the youngest son of the top hero [Endeavor](https://anilist.co/character/126158). Shouto initially has a cold, aloof personality, which stemmed from his complicated family life. Focused and unemotional, Shouto preferred to keep things to himself instead of hanging out with others. After the events of the U.A. Sports Festival, however, he notably became more sociable and kinder than ever before. He even gained a sense of humor and would occasionally smile, although still retaining some fragments of his previous distant attitude and nonchalant demeanor. While usually quiet and reserved, Shouto initially possessed a moderate level of arrogance, which, combined with his solitary tendencies, sometimes made him take the initiative without considering the opinions of others. Shouto''s Quirk Half-Cold Half-Hot gives him the ability to generate ice from the right side of his body, and flames from his left side. Due to years of rejecting his father, Shouto has developed a habit of favoring ice, even when fire would be a better option. This grudge also caused him to have difficulty controlling his flames. If he overuses one element without utilizing the other, then his own body temperature will suffer.', '/uploads/images/c_89220.png'),
(119, 'Ochako Uraraka', '麗日お茶子', '配角', 'Ayane Sakura', '__Height:__ 156 cm (5''1") __Quirk:__ Zero Gravity Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School Ochako is an outgoing, lively person who thinks about everything positively, though she is objective enough to see flaws and virtues. She gets excited over little things very easily. Ochaco has been described by other students as "the most laidback girl" among her class, being very bubbly and kind of an airhead at times. She is often incredibly blunt without being aware of it. She is on good terms with everyone and is particularly close friends with several class members, including [Izuku](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku), [Tenya Ida](https://anilist.co/character/89222/Iida-Tenya), and [Tsuyu](https://anilist.co/character/89223/Asui-Tsuyu). Ochaco''s Quirk gives her the power to manipulate gravity upon touching solid things with the pads on her fingertips. The targets lose their gravitational pull, effectively making them weightless. She is able to activate or cancel her Quirk''s effects by closing her fingers together, and is shown to be careful with her hands in order to avoid accidental quirk activation.', '/uploads/images/c_89221.png'),
(119, 'Tenya Iida', '飯田天哉', '配角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5''10") __Quirk:__ Engine Class representative of Class 1-A at U.A. High School Tenya may look severe, but he''s actually just a very serious person, who takes everything, even the most insignificant thing, seriously. A testament to his generally hyperactive and intense behavior, Tenya often exhibits plenty of peculiar tics, such as moving his arms around in strange chopping patterns or sometimes twitching his body uncontrollably. Tenya is very humble, willing to admit to his mistakes, apologize for rude behavior, and improve in areas he lacks. Being part of the highly-esteemed Ida Family of Heroes, Tenya is proud of his lineage and works hard to meet his expectations. He greatly admires his older brother, Tensei (also known as the Turbo Hero: Ingenium), and aspires to become a similar hero. Tenya''s Quirk Engine gives him car-like engines in each of his calves, giving him incredible running speed and extreme kicking power. Tenya needs to fuel his engines by drinking orange juice. Tenya''s engines have multiple gears; it is currently unknown how many, but it has been implied that there are more than three.', '/uploads/images/c_89222.png'),
(119, 'Tsuyu Asui', '蛙吹梅雨', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', '__Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Frog Tsuyu is a very straight-forward girl that always says what''s on her mind and what she thinks about others. She prefers to be called by her first name.', '/uploads/images/c_89223.png'),
(119, 'Toshinori Yagi', '八木俊典', '主角', 'Kenta Miyake', '__Height:__ 220 cm (7''2") __Quirk:__ One for All All Might is the No. 1 Hero and the "Symbol of Peace." In his hero form, All Might is a very tall and over-muscular man whose design resembles the american hero comics. His hair spikes on top of his head and his whole body has more shadows than a normal human being. However, in his true form, he is an overly-skinny man who spits a lot of blood out of his mouth and his clothes appear loose.', '/uploads/images/c_89224.jpg'),
(119, 'Shouta Aizawa', '相澤消太', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', '__Height: __183 cm (6'') __Occupation:__ Pro Hero, Teacher __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Erasure Aizawa''s hero name, Eraserhead, was coined by [Present Mic](https://anilist.co/character/127425) when they were younger. Using the binding cloth, Aizawa has a unique fighting style that allows him to immobilize his enemies. He is known to expel students that don''t meet his standards, however it should be noted that he did not expel anyone from Class 1-A. Aizawa is extremely vocal, able to voice his opinions very easily. Although seeming emotionless and reserved, he has a soft spot for his students and genuinely cares for them.', '/uploads/images/c_89225.png'),
(119, 'Tomura Shigaraki', '死柄木弔', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9) __Quirk:__ Decay Leader of the League of Villains and protégé of [All For One](https://anilist.co/character/125956/All-For-One). He was raised by his master, All For One, with the goal of killing [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224/Yagi-Toshinori), and ultimately destroying the society he represents. Tomura is a very twisted, malevolent, and maliciously warped young man, who is considered to be the polar opposite of [Izuku Midoriya](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku). He doesn''t care for his or almost anyone else''s life, having no qualms about performing evil deeds like murdering innocent people. Tomura was initially perceived to be a "man-child": arrogant, selfish, dependent, and demanding, becoming angry if things didn''t go his way and likening reality to some sort of video game. Unlike his mentor, Tomura lacked subtlety, preferring to eliminate problems through force. Much like a child, Tomura seemed unable to cope with his own feelings, instead lashing out and abusing both others or himself, tearing at his own neck when he becomes frustrated. Initially, Tomura seemingly caused destruction just for the sake of it and felt directionless about the League''s path forward after [Stain](https://anilist.co/character/126067/Akaguro-Chizome)''s arrest. It would take a fateful meeting with Izuku in a mall for him to develop an epiphany and become aware of his true convictions: to crumble hero society through All Might''s death. Tomur', '/uploads/images/c_89226.jpg'),
(119, 'Momo Yaoyorozu', '八百万百', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") __Quirk:__ Creation Vice class representative of Class 1-A at U.A. High School. She was admitted to the school through official recommendations. Momo is a very prudent, dedicated person who acts as a natural leader. She is generally level-headed and calm in dangerous situations, but she isn''t above falling into a panic. Momo can be blunt with her comments about people''s mistakes and miscalculations, tending to be very direct and wishing to help her peers improve enough to become great heroes. Momo''s Quirk gives her the ability to create any non-living material/object from her exposed skin by transforming the molecular structure of her fat cells. In order to create something, she needs to understand the molecular structure of which the material/object is made.', '/uploads/images/c_89241.png'),
(119, 'Hitoshi Shinsou', '心操人使', '配角', 'Wataru Hatano', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''9½") __Quirk:__ Brainwashing Student at U.A. High School, attending Class 1-C of the Department of General Education. Hitoshi is a stoic and straightforward person with an innate ability to spark conversation with anyone despite holding a reserved and quiet attitude most of the time. He is shown to be rather clever, knowing just the right words to manipulate others into replying to his comments, allowing him to activate his Quirk. He does not mind doing something underhanded to claim victory in a fight. Due to having his Brainwashing Quirk perceived as evil throughout his life, Hitoshi has been somewhat feared by those aware of his power and has been discriminated against solely because of the Quirk he was born with. This persecution led him to become resentful of those who had Quirks more associated with hero work. Regardless of his drawbacks, however, Hitoshi desires to become a Pro Hero more than anything. Hitoshi''s Quirk Brainwashing allows him to put someone in a state where they are forced to obey whatever he commands. He can only activate this power when his target verbally responds to something he says. Brainwashing must be intentionally activated and will not take effect if Hitoshi doesn''t want it to. Using a megaphone or anything that makes his voice artificial will not allow his Quirk to activate, as the said devices would transform his voice into an electronic signal.', '/uploads/images/c_89242.png'),
(119, 'Eijirou Kirishima', '切島鋭児郎', '配角', 'Toshiki Masuda', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Quirk:__ Hardening Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Eijiro is a boisterous and outgoing guy with a fondness for manliness, often using the terms "manly" and "unmanly" to describe things and people he does or doesn''t like, respectively. Eijiro is very honest and kind-hearted, having a straightforward way of thinking and following a specific code of chivalry that motivates him to live without regret. He is determined and selfless, bravely putting the safety of others before himself. He is also a big fan of Crimson Riot, a retro hero from whom he takes inspiration, including personal values and his hero name. Although Eijiro may not be as hot-blooded and competitive as [Katsuki Bakugou](https://anilist.co/character/88892), he does not shy away from comparing himself to him, with [Izuku](https://anilist.co/character/89028) stating that the two have managed to develop a relationship between equals. As a result, Eijiro is notably one of the few people that Katsuki holds in higher esteem. Eijiro''s Quirk gives him the power to harden and sharpen any or all parts of his body, causing his flesh to become jagged and rock-like. There is a limit to how much damage his hardened body can withstand, which causes the Hardening itself to slowly dissipate, and Eijiro to lose stamina from struggling to keep his Quirk active.', '/uploads/images/c_89243.jpg'),
(119, 'Minoru Mineta', '峰田実', '配角', 'Ryou Hirohashi', '__Height:__ 108 cm (3'' 6½") __Quirk:__ Pop Off __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Fighting Style:__ Medium Ranged Support Minoru Mineta, also known as the Fresh-Picked Hero: Grape Juice, is a student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School, training to become a Pro Hero.', '/uploads/images/c_89244.png'),
(119, 'Mina Ashido', '芦戸三奈', '配角', 'Eri Kitamura', '__Height:__ 159 cm (5''3") __Quirk:__ Acid Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Mina is a cheerful and easygoing girl who usually displays a smile. Highly social and excitable, she loves to hang out with her friends and is shown to become very upset when denied an opportunity to be at a gathering. She possesses a strong fashion sense and likes to go shopping. Due to her athleticism and energy, Mina enjoys and is very skilled at dancing. Mina is extremely courageous and is viewed as an ideal personality for hero work. Mina''s Quirk Acid allows her to produce a corrosive liquid from her body. She can control the solubility and viscosity of this corrosive liquid. There is a limit to how long she can produce the corrosive liquid until her skin gradually loses its natural resistance to it. Overusing her Quirk or pushing it too far can also be fatal, as it dehydrates her body very fast. Mina can use her acid offensively, but has shown utility with it as well, such as melting handholds for herself to climb with. She is also known to secrete a non-corrosive version of the acid from her feet in order to slide around.', '/uploads/images/c_89247.png'),
(119, 'Mei Hatsume', '発目明', '配角', 'Shiori Sakurai', '__Height:__ 157 cm (5''2") __Quirk:__ Zoom Mei is a smart, off-setting, and assertive girl, often making those around her uncomfortable. She loves creating gadgets, which she refers to as her "super cute babies". Mei has a habit of "going straight to the point" and is very shameless and opportunistic when it comes to advertising her inventions. While talking to people, she has a habit of getting awkwardly close to them, which usually causes them to back away from her but she still moves up to them.', '/uploads/images/c_89248.png'),
(119, 'Denki Kaminari', '上鳴電気', '配角', 'Tasuku Hatanaka', '__Height:__ 168 cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Electrification Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Denki is a friendly, social, and energetic boy who enjoys hanging out with others. He is rather casual when interacting with other people, including the generally unfriendly [Katsuki Bakugou](https://anilist.co/character/88892/Bakugou-Katsuki). Denki''s Quirk Electrification allows him to store and discharge electricity. While he can also discharge this energy over a distance, Denki has little to no control over it, meaning it will go everywhere indiscriminately. Denki is also able to absorb and neutralize electricity and other lightning-based Quirks. Whenever Denki exceeds his wattage limit, he loses his ability to discharge energy, with his entire personality changing into that of a giggling idiot for a certain period until he reverts to normal. In this state, he is always giving thumbs-ups as a way to let others know that he is okay.', '/uploads/images/c_89249.png'),
(119, 'Jin Bubaigawara', '分倍河原仁', '配角', 'Daichi Endou', '__Height:__ 178 cm (5''10") __Quirk:__ Double Villain affiliated with the League of Villains, and part of its Vanguard Action Squad. Jin has an incredibly unique personality: explosive, and lively with a very comedic demeanor. He enjoys assuming dramatic poses and eccentric facial expressions. Jin constantly contradicts himself, making a statement in one voice and immediately saying the opposite in another. This juxtaposition iss part of a mental instability that Jin embraces as a villain. He believes understanding your own identity is the most essential aspect in life, an understanding he lost during the 9-day conflict with his own clones that left him unsure whether he was the original or not. Now, if his mask is removed, he panics and threatens to "split" until he put his mask back on to become "whole". Jin''s Quirk allows him to create an exact duplicate of anything, living or not. To duplicate something, he needs to know its precise measurements and characteristics. The clones he makes do not disappear; instead, they disintegrate into a mud-like substance after taking a certain amount of damage. The duplicates are less durable than the original, and the second duplicate is even less durable than the first. When Jin creates duplicates of a person, he has no control over the clones because they have their own autonomy, personalities, and abilities that are utterly identical to the original.', '/uploads/images/c_89589.png'),
(119, 'Hanta Sero', '瀬呂範太', '配角', 'Kiyotaka Furushima', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5'' 9¾") __Quirk:__ Tape Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Hanta is amicable and has proven to be one of the more sociable members of Class 1-A. He can sometimes be loud and showy, often trying to impress his peers with his Quirk. He is often the only person to call his classmates out when they act crazy. He is pretty humorous and usually makes jokes with his classmates. However, when push comes to shove, Hanta is a brave hero-in-training who wishes to prosper on his own while helping others do the same. Hanta''s Quirk is that he has tape dispenser-like organs in his elbows, from which he can shoot long cellophane tape-like strips; he can also retract them. They appear to be somewhat sturdier than regular tape. Overuse of his Quirk will cause his skin to dry out. He can use his tape to wrap people, swing long distances, and create traps, among other applications.', '/uploads/images/c_89895.png'),
(119, 'Mashirao Ojiro', '尾白猿夫', '配角', 'Kousuke Miyoshi', '__Height:__ 169 cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Tail Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Mashirao has a very calm and noble attitude and a profound sense of dignity, which prevents him from accepting results he doesn''t feel he earned with his own abilities. He is also described as a hard worker. Along with a strong sense of dignity, Mashirao can be described as sheepish and bashful, not very often enjoying the spotlight and being easily embarrassed. A recurring joke is that others view Mashirao as "plain," which profoundly upsets him. Mashirao''s Quirk is that he has a long, powerful, sturdy tail. His tail effectively functions as a third arm that he can use to grab things. Furthermore, it''s attack power is strong enough to break objects made of metal, he can wrap it around enemies, and it can support Mashirao''s body weight. Mashirao is incredibly adept at using his tail, combining it with his knowledge of martial arts to engage enemies in close-range combat, performing fast and acrobatic moves. His tail can also increase his speed and mobility by whipping it down against the ground to use it like a springboard. (Source: My Hero Academia Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_89896.png'),
(119, 'Kyouka Jirou', '耳郎響香', '配角', 'Kei Shindou', '__Height:__ 154 cm (5''1") __Quirk:__ Earphone Jack __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Fighting Style:__ Medium Ranged + Support Combat Kyoka is a petite, fair-skinned girl with a slender build. She has triangular, lazy-looking onyx eyes with notably long lower eyelashes, and rather small eyebrows. Kyoka has a pragmatic, unenthusiastic and teasing personality that is mostly shown to those she finds irritating. Kyoka is not always like this though, as she does enjoy socializing with others, in which case she is usually nice and friendly. Kyoka''s Quirk (Earphone Jack) allows her to plug the jacks that hang from her earlobes into all sorts of things and channel the sound of her heartbeat into them; causing havoc inside the plugged objects. It''s also used to catch sounds and vibrations from her surroundings.', '/uploads/images/c_89897.png'),
(119, 'Fumikage Tokoyami', '常闇踏陰', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', '__Height:__ 158 cm __Quirk:__ Dark Shadow Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Fumikage is reserved, serious, and focused, albeit noble and valiant. Though not talkative, Fumikage will directly ignore questions or requests that seem in some way pointless. During combat, Fumikage is known to be fierce and dependable, with his strength and capabilities rarely being questioned. Fumikage is fond of darkness and other related concepts, considering himself a "creature of the dark" and employing archaic-sounding speeches that paint him slightly creepy or dramatic. Fumikage''s Quirk "Dark Shadow" allows him to manifest a sentient shadow monster from his body that he can materialize and contract freely. Dark Shadow''s energy is limited and can be drained by bright light. Dark Shadow retracts into Fumikage''s body when it runs out of energy. The shadow entity''s personality, strength, defense, and control depend on the lack of light. In bright light, Dark Shadow is weaker and smaller but still has considerable strength and defense and is easier to control, but in total darkness, Dark Shadow''s size and parameters are drastically enhanced. It is powerful enough to rip out and cut down multiple full-grown trees easily. However, Dark Shadow is more difficult to control in the dark, causing it to rampage based on its own free will.', '/uploads/images/c_89898.png'),
(119, 'Mezou Shouji', '障子目蔵', '配角', 'Masakazu Nishida', '__Height:__ 187 cm (6''2") __Quirk:__ Dupli-Arms Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Shouji is friendly and gentle, and he will work nicely with anyone. He is not the type to hold grudges, showing no ill will towards those that harm him unwillingly. Shouji is entirely selfless and willing to risk his life for anyone. He can be empathetic and understanding, but still shows a sense of maturity and responsibility that prevents him from acting under emotional impulses. He is very protective of his classmates, especially if they are hurt or injured. He is also quite thick-skinned, as he said he is used to being feared due to his appearance. Shouji''s Quirk grants him a set of tentacles alongside his arms. He can transform the tips of these tentacles to replicate other parts of his body (ex: mouth, ears, eyes). The duplicated body parts are more efficient than the originals; as a result, Mezo is able to hear better, see-through more angles at a time, and they grant him much higher degrees of strength. He uses these arms to talk most of the time through duplicate mouths, rather than his actual mouth.', '/uploads/images/c_89899.png'),
(119, 'Tooru Hagakure', '葉隠透', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', '__Height:__ 152 cm (5''0") __Quirk:__ Invisibility Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Tooru is a bubbly, cheery, and easygoing girl who does most things with an upbeat attitude. She is very socially eager and likes shopping, and her room suggests that she likes plushies and other cute things. Tooru''s Quirk is that her body is completely invisible. In addition to the stealth capabilities granted to her by her invisible body, Tooru can refract light that passes through her, allowing her to intensify the light into a blinding flash. She has further refined this application of her Quirk, achieving the ability to manipulate and redirect light-based attacks, such as [Yuuga Aoyama](https://anilist.co/character/127042/Aoyama-Yuuga)''s Navel Laser.', '/uploads/images/c_89900.png'),
(119, 'Kouji Kouda', '口田甲司', '配角', 'Takuma Nagatsuka', '__Height:__ 186 cm (6''1") __Quirk:__ Anivoice Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Contrary to his strong and powerful appearance, Kouji is very timid and quiet. He rarely speaks and prefers using sign language to communicate with his classmates. He hates violence due to his kind-hearted nature. Kouji appears to greatly enjoy the company of animals, as his Quirk allows him to interact with animals in ways others cannot. He owns a small rabbit as a pet. Kouji''s Quirk "Anivoice (生き物ボイス, Ikimono Voice)" gives him the ability to command any creature in the animal kingdom by speaking to them. Whatever command he gives, the animal will carry it out. However, he cannot exert control if they cannot hear his command. The target must also be a real animal and not merely animal-like. Kouji can also exchange information with the animals to find the locations of various people and potential enemies faster. Kouji has been shown to use the Quirk effectively with flocks of birds to create a smokescreen of animals and to attack an opponent, along with his use of insects to distract and attack his opponents. He has now also overcome his fear of bugs, so he often uses bugs to swarm opponents with numbers.', '/uploads/images/c_89901.png'),
(119, 'Rikidou Satou', '砂藤力道', '配角', 'Tooru Nara', '__Height:__ 185 cm (6''1") __Quirk:__ Sugar Rush Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Rikidou is interested in sweets and baking, a valuable skill due to his Quirk. He is surprisingly talented at making sweets. Rikidou''s Quirk Sugar Rush allows him to increase his strength five-fold for three minutes. To activate his Quirk, he needs to consume 10 grams of sugar. When converting sugar into strength, his cognitive functions gradually drop, making him sleepy afterward. For every additional 10 grams of sugar he ingests, he extends the time of increased strength by another three minutes.', '/uploads/images/c_89902.png'),
(119, 'Yuu Takeyama', '岳山優', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', '__Height:__ 162 cm (5''4") (Normal form); 2062cm (67''8") (Transformed) __Quirk:__ Gigantification __Occupation:__ Pro Hero Pro Hero. Her Quirk allows her to grow to a gigantic size. She cannot variate between her base-height and the gigantified height achieved via her Quirk, making her only able to be either her normal height of 162cm (5 feet 4 inches) or her enlarged height of 2,062cm (67 feet 8 inches) tall.', '/uploads/images/c_121529.png'),
(119, 'Sirius', 'シリウス', '配角', 'Ami Koshimizu', 'Sirius is a pro hero and sidekick of Selkie.', '/uploads/images/c_122560.jpg'),
(119, 'Mirio Togata', '通形ミリオ', '配角', 'Tarusuke Shingaki', '__Height:__ 181 cm (5''11") __Occupation:__ Student __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Permeation He is third-year student at U.A. High School and is part of The Big 3 _(the strongest three hero students in all of Japan)_. Before [Izuku Midoriya](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku), Mirio was the top candidate for [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224/Yagi-Toshinori)''s successor and inheritor of One For All. His Quirk, Permeation, gives him the ability to become intangible, letting him pass through any tangible matter; he can phase through walls and/or the ground, as well as let enemy attacks pass through him harmlessly.', '/uploads/images/c_123527.png'),
(119, 'Neito Monoma', '物間寧人', '配角', 'Kouhei Amasaki', '__Height:__ 170cm __Quirk:__ Copy Student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School. Neito has a rather complex personality since it differs depending on who he is addressing; he is particularly mocking, loud, and sarcastic with Class 1-A, but outside of these interactions, he is a calm, kind, and intelligent person. He envies Class 1-A with a passion over how they became the center of attention among U.A.''s first years because of the U.S.J. Incident. Truthfully, he only wants his class to stand out as they do, and he vents this feeling by throwing countless taunts towards his rivals, gloating over Class 1-B''s successes and disparaging 1-A for their failures. Neito''s Quirk is Copy, which allows him to duplicate and use another person''s Quirk after coming into physical contact with the user. He can hold four Quirks simultaneously and maintain copied powers for ten minutes. After the time limit runs out, he loses the copied Quirk until he once again touches the original user.', '/uploads/images/c_125450.png'),
(119, 'Himiko Toga', '渡我被身子', '配角', 'Misato Fukuen', '__Height:__ 157 cm __Quirk:__ Transform Himiko Toga is a villain affiliated with the League of Villains and part of its Vanguard Action Squad. She originally joined the group as a means to get closer to [Stain](https://anilist.co/character/126067). Himiko is a very cheerful girl, to the point of smiling even after having presumably killed someone, displaying apparent sadistic tendencies. She has a very twisted perception of love and friendship Himiko''s Quirk Transform grants her the ability to transform into a physical lookalike of another individual, as well as copy their voice. She can only transform into people whose blood she has ingested. The more blood she drinks, the longer she has access to that person''s form. For example, 1 cup of blood allows her to transform for a total of 18 hours. She can even switch between the appearances of multiple people if she drinks the blood of more than one person.', '/uploads/images/c_125619.png'),
(119, 'Tamaki Amajiki', '天喰環', '配角', 'Yuuto Uemura', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''10") __Quirk:__ Manifest Third-year student in Class 3-A at U.A. High School and part of The Big 3 (the strongest three hero students in all of Japan). Tamaki is extremely shy, aloof, depressed, "intimidating", and introverted, especially around big audiences. He gets nervous very easily when talking to other people. If his anxiety gets the best of him, Tamaki will often face away and lean into a wall to hide his face from others. While his physical abilities and Quirk are outstanding, Tamaki is socially awkward and lacks confidence in his powers. Despite his timid heart, Tamaki can show flashes of bravery. Even though he''s always been a shy and reserved boy, Tamaki was able to hone his skills and climb the ranks into one of U.A.''s Big 3. [Mirio Togata](https://anilist.co/character/123527/Togata-Mirio) is a big inspiration for Tamaki. Tamaki''s Quirk Manifest grants him the ability to manifest the physical characteristics of anything he''s eaten; for example, if he eats takoyaki, he can transform his fingers into octopus tentacles. Additionally, anything Tamaki manifests is significantly stronger than normal. The more of a substance Tamaki eats, the stronger his manifestation will be. He can only manifest the traits of substances still in his system and loses access to those traits once the substance is fully digested. He must resupply his Quirk daily and decide what foods to eat beforehand.', '/uploads/images/c_125934.png'),
(119, 'Melissa Shield', 'メリッサ・シールド', '配角', 'Mirai Shida', 'Melissa is a Quirkless girl and the daughter of Scientist [David Shield](https://anilist.co/character/125952/).', '/uploads/images/c_125951.png'),
(119, 'All For One', 'オール・フォー・ワン', '配角', 'Akio Ootsuka', '__Quirk:__ All For One __Occupation:__ Villain __Fighting Style:__ Close Range and Long Range All For One is the true leader and benefactor of the League of Villains. Once Japan''s most powerful villain and All Might''s arch-nemesis, his true motives are unclear and his true identity unknown. His current goal is to raise Shigaraki to become his eventual successor.', '/uploads/images/c_125956.jpg'),
(119, 'Shuuichi Iguchi', '伊口秀一', '配角', 'Ryou Iwasaki', '__Height:__ 174 cm __Occupation:__ Villain __Affiliation:__ League of Villains (formerly), Paranormal Liberation Front (Lieutenant of Brown Regiment) __Quirk:__ Gecko Shuuichi is a villain affiliated with the League of Villains and part of its Vanguard Action Squad. He is completely obsessed with the ways of [Stain](https://anilist.co/character/126067) to the point where he copies his clothing and weaponry style, aiming to follow the same ideals as him and make his dreams come true.', '/uploads/images/c_126005.png'),
(119, 'Itsuka Kendou', '拳藤一佳', '配角', 'Saki Ogasawara', '__Height:__ 166 cm (5''5") __Quirk:__ Big Fist Class representative of Class 1-B at U.A. High School, Itsuka is a spirited girl who is thoughtful of others. She does not hesitate to criticize even her classmates if she feels what they are doing is not correct. Due to Itsuka''s cheerful personality, she can bring all of Class 1-B together, thus making her the "big sister" of Class 1-B. Itsuka''s Quirk Big Fist grants her the ability to enlarge both of her hands to a gigantic size. With the increased size comes enhanced striking power and gripping capabilities.', '/uploads/images/c_126064.png'),
(119, 'Chizome Akaguro', '赤黒血染', '配角', 'Gou Inoue', '__Height:__ 182 cm (6''0) __Quirk:__ Bloodcurdle Villain and former vigilante that was notorious for having killed many Pro Heroes. He attacks and kills heroes who he believes do not fit his definition of a "true hero." Chizome is a cruel, unforgiving, and merciless man with a sense of duty to cleanse society of false heroes. He believes that those who become Heroes for fame or money are unworthy of being called the name and only [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224/Yagi-Toshinori) is a true hero. Due to his strong ideology, he took it upon himself to become the Hero Killer: Stain to stain his own hands with blood to purge fake heroes and change the current society. Despite his extremist views and beliefs, Stain did have genuine ideals about heroism, which he stood by firmly. He did not hesitate to save people he deemed worthy of being called Heroes, did not like killing without reason, and would even give advice to his enemies. Stain acknowledged that what he did was morally wrong but believed that for society to be put on the right path, someone must be what he was, suggesting that he saw himself as a martyr. Stain''s Quirk "Bloodcurdle" allows him to paralyze his target upon tasting a sample of their blood. The amount of time a victim remains paralyzed depends on their blood type; in ascending order from shortest to longest duration, they are: O, A, AB, and B. The maximum amount of time that anyone can be paralyzed is eight minutes. _In My Hero Academia: Vigilantes', '/uploads/images/c_126067.png'),
(119, 'Enji Todoroki', '轟炎司', '配角', 'Tetsu Inada', '__Height:__ 195 cm (6'' 4¾") __Occupation:__ Pro Hero __Quirk:__ Hellflame Endeavor is a tall man with a muscular physique. He has short and spiky, red hair with bright blue eyes. His beard and mustache appear to be made of fire, but when he turns off his flames on his face voluntarily, his stubble shows. ~!His desire to surpass the number one hero has driven him in family matters. Enji put [Shouto](https://anilist.co/character/89220/Todoroki-Shouto) through ruthless "training" which caused Shouto a severe degree of physical and emotional pain. Shouto, harboring a bitter hatred towards his father on account of this, refuses to use his fire powers in battles until [Izuku Midoriya](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku) reminded him of his mother''s encouragement. Later, Enji understood his mistakes and told his son he would try to be a better hero and father. He hopes for Shouto and the rest his family to forgive him in the future.!~ ~!He''s the former No.2 Hero, but later becomes the new No.1 Hero after [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224/Yagi-Toshinori) loses his Quirk!~', '/uploads/images/c_126158.png'),
(119, 'Nana Shimura', '志村菜奈', '配角', 'Mie Sonozaki', 'Shimura Nana was the seventh user of the One For All Quirk, [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224)''s mentor, and a close friend of [Gran Torino](https://anilist.co/character/127428). ~!It was revealed that she is the grandmother of [Shigaraki](https://anilist.co/character/89226)!~', '/uploads/images/c_126319.png'),
(119, 'Kai Chisaki', '治崎廻', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5''10") __Quirk:__ Overhaul Kai Chisaki, also known by the villain name Overhaul, is the Yakuza Captain of the Shie Hassaikai. Overhaul is a mysophobic, antisocial sociopath obsessed with returning the world to the way it was before the Quirk phenomenon. Due to a combination of an old theory claiming Quirks derived from rats and his own mysophobia, Overhaul believes that Quirks are actually a plague on humanity, having infected people with "syndromes" of heroism and villainy. He looks down upon those that use their abilities for either purpose, referring to acts of heroic sacrifice or petty crime as "sicknesses". Overhaul is extremely determined to his ambition of eradicating Quirks, not only due to his own personal phobias, but also because such a thing would allow the yakuza to reclaim the power they once held over society. Kai''s Quirk "Overhaul" grants him the ability to disassemble anything he touches, as well as reassemble it in any configuration he desires, effectively giving him full control over matter. Kai can disassemble people to kill them or reassemble them to heal their wounds. He can also do this to himself and even merge his body with others, even allowing him to use their Quirks', '/uploads/images/c_126357.jpg'),
(119, 'Dabi', '荼毘', '配角', 'Hiro Shimono', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9¼") __Quirk:__ Blueflame Dabi is a villain affiliated with the League of Villains and a member of the organization''s Vanguard Action Squad. Dabi is a stoic, aloof, confident, and focused individual who rarely shows emotion. While rather crude and violent, he''s also shown to be quite cautious. Overall, Dabi is a highly enigmatic individual who trusts no one, preferring to do things alone and in his way. He also gives off the impression of knowing more about certain people than he lets on. Dabi''s Quirk grants him the ability to generate and control highly destructive blue flames from his body. He has very well-developed control of his flames and can project them far from himself and in large amounts. However, Dabi''s body has a low tolerance for his flame, and he will get burned if he uses them for prolonged periods. ~!It is later revealed that Dabi is Touya Todoroki (轟燈矢), the eldest son of the Pro Hero [Endeavor](https://anilist.co/character/126158/Todoroki-Enji) and his wife [Rei](https://anilist.co/character/150628/Todoroki-Rei), and the older brother to [Shouto Todoroki](https://anilist.co/character/89220/Todoroki-Shouto). For a significant period of time, his whereabouts were unknown.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126378.png'),
(119, 'Camie Utsushimi', '現見ケミィ', '配角', 'Minori Chihara', '__Height:__ 161 cm (5''3") __Affiliation:__ Shiketsu High School (Second-Year Student) __Quirk:__ Glamour Camie seems to be very talkative, especially when learning more about people who pique her interest. She was thrilled upon seeing Shoto Todoroki for the first time, delighted at the fact that she would both meet a handsome man as well as undergo training. According to Inasa Yoarashi, she has impressive "interaction techniques" because she asked for Todoroki''s contact info. She also tends to speak in a unique way and incorporates a strange type of slang in it, which tends to confuse those around her. According to herself she also loves children. Camie''s Quirk allows her to create both visual and auditory illusions for a short period of time.', '/uploads/images/c_126734.png'),
(119, 'Saiko Intelli', '印照才子', '配角', 'Reina Ueda', 'Affiliation: Seiai Academy (Second-Year Student) Quirk: IQ After she drinks tea, when she closes her eyes, her IQ multiplies. Her IQ is already 150 to start with, so she becomes a super genius. There''s a difference in effect based on the brand of tea she drinks.', '/uploads/images/c_126829.jpg'),
(119, 'Nejire Hadou', '波動ねじれ', '配角', 'Kiyono Yasuno', '__Height:__ 164 cm (5''4") __Occupation:__ Student __Quirk:__ Wave Motion (ability to convert body''s vitality into energy that can discharge as blast waves) She is third-year student at U.A. High School and is part of The Big 3 _(the strongest three hero students in all of Japan)_. Nejire is very enthusiastic, affable and cheery, and is always seen moving. She shows great interest in people''s unique physical features and is easily distracted by them. She seems to like knowing more than others, but not in a proud way, as she just enjoys explaining things to people and sharing her knowledge. Despite her happy-go-lucky personality, Nejire is fierce in battle. When the situation calls for it, Nejire can be very calm and focused. Her curiosity never seems to extend to the enemy and she always maintains her focus on taking them down.', '/uploads/images/c_126843.png'),
(119, 'Inasa Yoarashi', '夜嵐イナサ', '配角', 'Ryouta Iwasaki', '**Height:** 190 cm (6''3") **Affiliation:** Shiketsu High School (First-Year Student) **Quirk:** Whirlwind Inasa is an energetic and enthusiastic young man who expresses himself with vigor. He''s very loud, oddly polite, and values passion over anything else. Inasa believes that all heroes have "hot spirits" that enable them to motivate and help others. He disapproves of heroes who do not embody the spirit of passion, which is why he has negative feelings about Endeavor and his son.', '/uploads/images/c_126855.png'),
(119, 'Yuuga Aoyama', '青山優雅', '配角', 'Kousuke Kuwano', '**Height:** 168 cm (5''6") **Quirk:** Navel Lazer Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Yuuga appears to be vain and prideful, thinking of himself as superior to the rest of his classmates, especially regarding his Quirk. He exhibits flamboyant mannerisms, is fond of posing, and likes to grab the attention of those around him despite frequently getting ignored by his peers. He also plays up his French heritage, occasionally implementing French words into his sentences. Yuuga''s Quirk allows him to shoot a powerful sparkling laser cannon from his navel. It is so powerful, it can blast through two meters of solid concrete. If he fires the laser for more than 1 second at a time, he will suffer intestinal distress.', '/uploads/images/c_127042.png'),
(119, 'Tetsutetsu Tetsutetsu', '鉄哲徹鐵', '配角', 'Kouji Okino', '__Height:__ 174cm (5''9") __Quirk:__ Steel Student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School. Tetsutetsu is defined by his very hotheaded and outspoken personality. He is confident, stubborn, and straightforward in his motivations and actions. He tends to be very vocal about his intentions and has a one-track mind, often looking for the simplest solution to problems to solve them most directly. Tetsutetsu''s direct personality shows through his tenacious and upfront fighting style during battles. Tetsutetsu''s Quirk allows him to turn his body into steel. This power grants Tetsutetsu both augmented defensive abilities to withstand attacks and the increased strength of his unarmed physical attacks.', '/uploads/images/c_127043.png'),
(119, 'Hizashi Yamada', '山田ひざし', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', '__Height:__ 185cm (6''1") __Quirk:__ Voice Pro Hero. He also works as an English teacher at U.A. High School and as a radio talk show host. Yamada maintains the eccentric persona of a radio host. He often poses when he talks and maintains a certain level of excitement or volume, regardless of the situation. Though he tends to be a jovial individual, Hizashi is capable of great rage when it comes to his friends and colleagues. Yamada''s Quirk "Voice" allows him to increase the volume of his voice, giving him an ability that is similar to a sonic scream. The sound from his Quirk is strong enough to cause people''s ears to bleed from far away. The only known weakness of this Quirk is that the loud sounds do not travel well underground, making this Quirk ineffective against anything that is underground or separated from him by layers of earth.', '/uploads/images/c_127425.png'),
(119, 'Ibara Shiozaki', '塩崎茨', '配角', 'Miho Masaka', '__Height:__ 167cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Vine Student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School. Ibara is a very modest and courteous person. Although graceful and soft-spoken, she is not afraid to make her pure intentions known. She seems highly religious due to her talking about heaven and divine beings in passing on multiple occasions, and her ultimate moves having somewhat religious names such as "Faith''s Shield" and "Crucifixion". Ibara''s Quirk "Vine (ツル, Tsuru) gives her hair-like vines that grow on her head. She can lengthen and manipulate the vines, allowing her to attack, defend and grapple. She also can detach them at will. The vines will grow back, provided her head receives proper sunlight and water. (Source: MyHero Academia Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_127426.png'),
(119, 'Nemuri Kayama', '香山睡', '配角', 'Akeno Watanabe', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") __Quirk:__ Somnambulist Pro Hero. She also works as a Modern Hero Art History teacher at U.A. High School. Nemuri is a very playful and flirtatious person with an unpredictably serious and temperamental side to her. She gets angry whenever someone interrupts her or insults her. She is especially sensitive about her age. Despite her flirtatious personality, Nemuri was intelligent, perceptive, and articulate. While she comes off as a hero who enjoys her fame derived from her beauty and sex appeal, Nemuri has demonstrated true heroism and bravery, willing to fight on the front lines and put her life at risk for others. Nemuri''s Quirk "Somnambulist" allows her to put nearby people to sleep by exuding a sleep-inducing aroma from her body. Her Quirk works better on males than females.', '/uploads/images/c_127427.png'),
(119, 'Sorahiko Torino', '酉野空彦', '配角', 'Kenichi Ogata', '__Height:__ 128 cm (4''2") __Affiliation:__ Yuuei (Retired) __Quirk:__ Jet A retired hero who is one of All Might''s colleagues and his former homeroom teacher. He was the one who taught All Might to control One For All during the his early days, and his training was so intense that All Might fears him to the point he subconsciously tried to forget about him until Grantorino sent his recommendation for Izuku to help him improve One For All, becoming his work place mentor. His Quirk is "Jet," allowing him to take in air through the sole of his foot to allow him to jump higher. (Source: Wikipedia)', '/uploads/images/c_127428.jpg'),
(119, 'Shinji Nishiya', '西屋森児', '配角', 'Masamichi Kitada', '__Height:__ 168 cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Arbor Pro Hero. Underneath his helmet, he has puffy red leaf-like hair, though his face has remained unseen since he has only been shown while wearing his mask. Shinji is a very serious and focused person when it comes to being a hero in his hero duties; however, he easily feels down when someone takes his glory or credit. Shinji''s Quirk "Arbor" (樹木, Jumoku) allows him to enlarge and control his wooden body parts into strong tree branches. These branches are excellent for binding.', '/uploads/images/c_129758.png'),
(119, 'Mirai Sasaki', '佐々木未来', '配角', 'Shinichirou Miki', '__Height:__ 200 cm (6''6¾") __Birthplace:__ Tokyo, Japan __Quirk:__ Foresight A Pro Hero and [Mirio Togata](https://anilist.co/character/123527)''s mentor. He was formerly [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224)''s sidekick and was considered to be the brains behind All Might''s hero operation before opening his own hero agency. Sir Nighteye is a lean but muscular man with a clean, well-kept appearance. Unlike most Pro Heroes, he seems to prefer plain office clothes (a plain white suit with gold buttons, a white dress shirt, and a red tie with white dots) instead of an elaborate hero costume. Sir Nighteye maintains a stoic and intimidating presence, with a cold and sharp glare, but that is only the side of his personality that he shows in public. He greatly values humor and actually requires people to make him laugh before he acknowledes them. Nighteye believes that humor and energy are vital elements for the future of society and punishes subordinates that fail to display those qualities.', '/uploads/images/c_129761.jpg'),
(119, 'Naomasa Tsukauchi', '塚内直正', '配角', 'Tokuyoshi Kawashima', 'Naomasa Tsukauchi is a police detective in the Police Force. Naomasa is a tall man with short black hair and black eyes. As a member of the police force, he is normally seen in his uniform. He wears a signature tan overcoat and a matching hat. He also sports a black suit underneath with matching slacks and dress shoes. Detective Tsukauchi is an earnest, hardworking individual who has earned the right to be a close friend of All Might. Enough so, that he was even entrusted with the truth about One For All and the latter''s true form. He appears to have a close relationship with All Might, as he even leaked sensitive information to the hero just because he felt it was the right thing to do.', '/uploads/images/c_129762.png'),
(119, 'Shikkui Makabe', '真壁漆喰', '配角', 'Hiromichi Kogami', '__Height:__ 180cm __Quirk:__ Stiffening Second year student at Ketsubutsu Academy, his quirk, ''stiffening'', allows him to harden objects with his hands by rubbing or kneading them', '/uploads/images/c_130942.png'),
(119, 'Itejirou Touteki', '投擲射手次郎', '配角', 'Kenta Ookuma', '__Height:__ 171cm __Affiliation:__ Ketsubutsu Academy __Quirk:__ Boomerang A second year student at Ketsubutsu Academy. His Quirk, "Boomerang," allows him to plan the trajectory of any given object he can throw, including underground.', '/uploads/images/c_131154.jpg'),
(119, 'Seiji Shishikura', '肉倉精児', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', 'A second year student at Shiketsu High. His Quirk, "Meatball," allows him to roll all living flesh up into meatballs, as well as manipulate his own flesh to his liking. He can remotely control his own flesh after detaching it.', '/uploads/images/c_131155.png'),
(119, 'Tatami Nakagame', '中瓶畳', '配角', 'Megumi Han', '__Height:__ 155cm __Occupation:__ Student __Affiliation:__ Ketsubutsu Academy __Quirk:__ Telescopic A second year student as Ketsubutsu Academy. Her Quirk, "Telescopic," allows her to fold her limbs into her body, similar to a turtle.', '/uploads/images/c_131156.jpg'),
(119, 'You Shindou', '真堂揺', '配角', 'Yuuta Kasuya', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9") __Affiliation:__ Ketsubutsu Academy High School __Quirk:__ Vibrate A second year at Ketsubutsu Academy. His quirk, "Vibrate," allows him to create large tremors similar to earthquakes, but firing off strong attacks leaves him immobile.', '/uploads/images/c_131157.jpg'),
(119, 'Nagamasa Moura', '毛原長昌', '配角', 'Volcano Oota', 'A second year student at Shiketsu High. His quirk, "Extend-o-Hair," allows him to manipulate and extend his own body hair for both offense and defense.', '/uploads/images/c_131167.jpg'),
(119, 'Kouta Izumi', '出水洸汰', '配角', 'Michiru Yamazaki', '__Height:__ 107cm (3''5") Kota Izumi is the nephew of Shino Sosaki and the son of the hero team Water Hose.', '/uploads/images/c_133659.jpg'),
(119, 'Inko Midoriya', '绿谷引子', '配角', 'Aya Kawakami', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3'''') Izuku Midoriya''s mother. Her quirk allows her to pull small objects towards her.', '/uploads/images/c_136897.png'),
(119, 'Kurogiri', '黒霧', '配角', 'Takahiro Fujiwara', '__Affiliation:__ League of Villains __Quirk:__ Warp Gate Kurogiri has a level-headed personality, which often serves to ground Tomura Shigaraki''s immaturity. He is intensely loyal to both All For One and Tomura. He is very polite and well-spoken, even to enemies. ~! Kurogiri is actually an intelligent Nomu made from the corpse of Eraserhead and President Mics high school friend Oboro Shirakumo made to serve Tomura Shigaraki. Although he remains unaware of his previous identity after Eraserheads efforts to talk to him it’s shown that a small part of Oboro is still in Kurogiri!~', '/uploads/images/c_137506.jpg'),
(119, 'Mustard', 'マスタード', '配角', 'Kiyotaka Furushima', 'Mustard is a B-rank villain affiliated with the League of Villains and a member of the organization''s Vanguard Action Squad. He and the rest of his team serve as the main antagonists of the Forest Training Camp Arc.', '/uploads/images/c_141746.jpg'),
(119, 'Kenji Hikiishi', '引石健磁', '配角', 'Satoru Inoue', 'Hikiishi Kenji, also known as Magne was a villain affiliated with the League of Villains and part of its Vanguard Action Squad. She and the rest of her team serve as the main antagonists of the Forest Training Camp Arc. Magne preferred to go by female pronouns despite her masculine presentation.', '/uploads/images/c_141747.png'),
(119, 'Atsuhiro  Sako', 'コンプレス', '配角', 'Tsuguo Mogami', 'Mr. Compress''s Quirk allows him to "compress" anything in a spherical area into a small marble without actually damaging it. The weight of the target is reduced alongside them, making them very easy to carry. If used on a person, it effectively entraps them, terminating the fight instantly and allowing Mr. Compress to abduct them without difficulty. The Quirk can also be used on select body parts, maiming the target.', '/uploads/images/c_141748.png'),
(119, 'Giran', '義爛', '配角', 'Seirou Ogino', 'Giran is a B-rank villain and broker in affiliation with the League of Villains, working to scout new recruits for their organization', '/uploads/images/c_141749.jpg'),
(119, 'Muscular', 'マスキュラ', '配角', 'Kousuke Takaguchi', 'Befitting his appearance, Muscular has a very sadistic and bloodthirsty personality. He openly admits that he wants to use his Quirk freely to kill. Muscular enjoys killing and tormenting those he fights, often saying "show me your blood!". Unlike most of the other members of the Vanguard Action Squad, he joined the League of Villains just to let loose his brutal tendencies, rather than following Stain''s ideology', '/uploads/images/c_141750.png'),
(119, 'Moonfish', 'ムーンフィッシ', '配角', 'Shuuhei Matsuda', 'Blade-Tooth (歯刃 Shijin?): Moonfish''s quirk gives him the ability to enlarge and manipulate his teeth into powerful blade. Being one of the most powerful people in the Vanguard action squad being able to take on numerous powerful heros at once', '/uploads/images/c_141751.jpg'),
(119, 'Kaoruko Awata', '泡田薫子', '配角', 'Rie Murakawa', 'Quirk: Bubble (バブル Baburu) With this Quirk, Kaoruko can make bubbles filled with an aroma that she had smelled at least once before. She can make both sweet-smelling bubbles and foul-smelling ones. When she’s too nervous, she produces very unpleasant-smelling bubbles that are self-destructing She is a dedicated hero as well as Sir Nighteyes sidekick', '/uploads/images/c_141893.png'),
(119, 'Emi Fukukado', '福門笑', '配角', 'Mariko Nagai', '__Height:__ 5''5 __Quirk:__ Outburst Pro Hero and a teacher of 2nd year, Class 2 at Ketsubutsu Academy High School.', '/uploads/images/c_142169.png'),
(119, 'Togaru Kamakiri', '鎌切尖', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 158 cm (6''2") __Quirk:__ Razor Sharp __Affiliation:__ Yuuei __Occupation:__ Student Togaru Kamakiri is a student in Class 1-B at U.A.', '/uploads/images/c_143274.png'),
(119, 'Shinya Kamihara', '紙原伸也', '配角', 'Kenta Kamakari', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Quirk:__ Foldabody: Shinya''s Quirk allows him to make his body and limbs extremely thin and long, effectively allowing him to transform himself into a razor sharp string. He is able to transform faster than the speed of sound. Shinya is a calm and focused individual, who is able to maintain a level head even when in a crisis situation, and encourages his teammates when they begin to panic. He is proven to be quite intelligent and is good at analyzing situations and strategy. He is the former Number 5 Pro-Hero, and is currently Number 4.', '/uploads/images/c_143275.png'),
(119, 'Tomoko Shiretoko', '知床知子', '配角', 'Chisa Suganuma', 'Her Quirk allowed her to observe and monitor up to 100 people at a time, including their location and weak points.', '/uploads/images/c_143535.jpg'),
(119, 'Tsunagu Hakamada', '袴田維', '配角', 'Hikaru Midorikawa', '__Height:__ 190cm (6''3") __Quirk:__ Fiber Master Pro Hero, ranked in the top 4. He is the recipient of the "Best Jeanist" award for eight consecutive years. Tsunagu is an elegant man with flamboyant tendencies. He believes very strongly that people with influence must maintain a positive appearance both physically and socially. Tsunagu often uses metaphors referencing jeans, denim, and various other sewing and fabric-based phrases, often inspiring his recruits with speeches, telling them to keep their life straight like their jeans. Tsunagu takes the role of being a hero very seriously. He is selfless, brave, and charismatic, and he aims to spread a sense of a peace to all people, no matter how dire the situation. Tsunagu''s Quirk "Fiber Master (ファイバーマスター)" allows him to freely manipulate the threads in any nearby piece of fabric. He has power over all types of cloth, but his Quirk works best with denim and is less effective on sweats. Fiber Master also works on other types of fiber not related to fabric, such as carbon fibers. He primarily uses this power to restrain his targets, either by using their own clothing against them, or simply unravels portions of his own clothing into strings.', '/uploads/images/c_143536.png'),
(119, 'Shino Sousaki', '送崎信乃', '配角', 'Meiko Kawasaki', 'Telepath: This Quirk allows Shino to utilize a mental transmission and send telepathic messages directly into people''s minds. Shino, has displayed the ability to send a message to tens of people at a time. She can send messages, but she can''t receive them', '/uploads/images/c_143537.jpg'),
(119, 'Yawara Chatora', '茶虎柔', '配角', 'Shinnosuke Ogami ', 'Pliabody: Yawara''s Quirk allows him to stretch, flatten, and bend his body in ways that would normally be impossible', '/uploads/images/c_143538.jpg'),
(119, 'Nezu', '根津', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Takato', '__Height:__ 85 cm __Quirk:__ High Spec Nezu, also known as Mr. Principal is a Pro Hero and the principal of U.A. High School. He is an extremely rare case of an animal who manifested a Quirk. He can be very long-winded at times when explaining or educating.', '/uploads/images/c_143539.png'),
(119, 'Ryuuko Tsuchikawa', '土川流子', '配角', 'Serina Machiyama', '__Height:__ 167cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Earth Flow Ryuko Tsuchikawa also known as Pixie-Bob, is a Pro Hero and a member of the Wild, Wild Pussycats. She is a very hyperactive and loud person with little regard for how she may come off to other people and also is very self-conscious about her age. Ryuko''s Quirk allows her to freely manipulate the earth for a variety of effects.', '/uploads/images/c_143541.jpg'),
(119, 'Hari Kurono', '玄野針', '配角', 'Takumi Asahina', '__Age:__ Unknown __Status:__ ~!Imprisoned!~ __Quirk:__ Chronostasis: Kurono''s Quirk allows him to slow down the movements of anything he hits with his clock hand-like hair. The minute hands slows a targets movements for one minute and the hour hand slows a targets movements for one hour. Kurono can extend his hair, but only if he is not moving. Hari Kurono, also known as Chronostasis, is a yakuza member afflicted with the Shie Hassaikai, and the assistant/right hand man to Overhaul. He is one of the main antagonists of the Shie Hassaikai Arc.', '/uploads/images/c_144520.jpg'),
(119, 'Pony  Tsunotori', '角取ポニー', '配角', 'Kaede Hondo', '__Quirk:__ Horn Cannon Pony is a timid girl. As a foreigner, she does not have much knowledge of the language in Japan. She is shown to be rather naive and innocent in personality, learning nasty phrases from Neito Monoma without realizing what those words mean, as shown when Neito tells Pony unkind phrases to tell Class 1-A. Pony is a thoughtful and diligent person. She is the one who made her team not lose against Class 1-A because of her strategy and perseverance. She is highly observant and seems to be a careful person. Despite this, she made some unkind comments towards Mezo Shoji in their battle, calling him an "octopus" and saying she doesn''t like looking at him. Pony''s Quirk allows her to send her horns flying and remotely control them at will. She is able to control up to four horns that are sent flying. She has also been shown to be able to balance on them as they carry her around, much like Hawks'' wings. When Pony gets angry, she starts speaking in her native language: English.', '/uploads/images/c_145387.png'),
(119, 'Ryou Inui', '犬井猟', '配角', 'Eiji Hanawa', 'Ryo Inui is a Pro Hero and serves as the Lifestyle Guidance Counselor at U.A. High School.', '/uploads/images/c_149178.png'),
(119, 'Setsuna Tokage', '取蔭切奈', '配角', 'Hitomi Nabatame', 'Setsuna Tokage is a student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School, and is one of four students admitted through recommendations; one being her fellow 1-B classmate Juzo Honenuki, as well as rival Class 1-A students Shoto Todoroki and Momo Yaoyorozu.', '/uploads/images/c_149179.png'),
(119, 'Kinoko  Komori', '小森希乃子', '配角', '', 'Kinoko Komori is a student in Class 1-B, and is training to be a Pro Hero. Her quirk, Mushroom, allows her to spread spores that sprout mushrooms wherever they land, including inside of people''s bodies.', '/uploads/images/c_149180.png'),
(119, 'Yui Kodai', '小大唯', '配角', 'Yurianne Eve', 'Yui Kodai is a student in Class 1-B of U.A. High School. She is a quiet girl, but nevertheless cares about her fellow classmates.', '/uploads/images/c_149182.png'),
(119, 'Juzo Honenuki', '骨抜柔造', '配角', 'Masamichi Kitada', '__Height:__ 174 cm (5''8½") __Affiliation:__ U.A High __Quirk:__ Softening Juzo Honenuki is a student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School, and is one of four students admitted through recommendations; one being his fellow 1-B classmate [Setsuna Tokage](https://anilist.co/character/149179/Tokage-Setsuna), the others being rival 1-A students [Shoto Todoroki](https://anilist.co/character/89220/Todoroki-Shouto) and [Momo Yaoyorozu](https://anilist.co/character/89241/Yaoyorozu-Momo). Juzo''s Quirk allows him to soften any non-living thing he touches. For example, he can soften the ground to make it similar to quicksand, hindering movements and mobility. If Juzo makes contact again, he can undo the effect. He is also capable of swimming through softened material.', '/uploads/images/c_149183.png'),
(119, 'Kuugo Sakamata', '逆俣空悟', '配角', 'Shuuhei Matsuda', 'Gang Orca is the current No. 11 Pro Hero, dropping from his previous No. 10 place. He took part in the assault on All For One and the League of Villains at Kamino Ward, and later served as a makeshift villain during the Provisional Hero License Exam.', '/uploads/images/c_149186.png'),
(119, 'Ken Ishiyama', '石山堅', '配角', 'Kenta Ookuma', 'Cementoss is a Pro Hero as well as a teacher at U.A. High School. During the U.A. Sports Festival, he acted as the proctor for the 1-on-1 fights in case things got out of hand. He also faced off against Eijiro Kirishima and Rikido Sato in their Final Exam.', '/uploads/images/c_149188.jpg'),
(119, 'Fuyumi Todoroki', '轟冬美', '配角', '', 'The only daughter of Eiji and Rei. Fuyumi is the younger sister of Touya and the older sister of Natsuo and Shouto. Fuyumi is a hard working girl, often making meals for the family and works as a teacher at an unnamed school. Unlike her family members, she doesn''t resent her father and just wishes they could all be a happy family, though she realizes such a thing is unlikely. Upon hearing Shouto gains friends, however, Fuyumi gets quite excited over it and is happy for him. In the past, Fuyumi took care of Shouto after their mother went to a hospital and never came back. To this day, her wish that she could have done something for Shouto still lingers within her.', '/uploads/images/c_150627.png'),
(119, 'Chiyo  Shuuzenji', '修善寺治与', '配角', '', '__Quirk:__ Heal __Occupation:__ Pro Hero, Nurse Chiyo has a very kind and compassionate personality, where she treats everyone kindly, though she does have a strict and reproaching attitude towards those that have done something foolish. She''s mostly like this with All Might for not teaching Izuku how to use his Quirk properly or with Izuku for using his Quirk recklessly.', '/uploads/images/c_157655.jpg'),
(119, 'Yokumiru Mera', '目良善見', '配角', 'Masami Iwasaki', 'Yokumiru Mera is a worker for the Hero Public Safety Commission. He suffers from sleep deprivation due to overwork, something that he complains about frequently.', '/uploads/images/c_158615.png'),
(119, 'Snipe', 'スナイプ', '配角', '', '__Quirk:__ Homing Snipe is a Pro Hero and a member of the teaching staff at U.A. High School. Snipe has the appearance of a stereotypical western cowboy Snipe''s Quirk allows him to lock on to any target he can see within six hundred meters and make any projectile he releases chase after said target', '/uploads/images/c_191596.jpg'),
(119, 'Higari Maijima', '埋島干狩', '配角', 'You Kitazawa', 'Higari Maijima, also known as the Excavation Hero: Power Loader, is a Pro Hero and faculty member at U.A. High School.', '/uploads/images/c_191597.png'),
(119, 'Sekijiro Kan', '管赤慈郎', '配角', 'Shuuhei Matsuda', 'Sekijiro Kan, also known by his hero name, Blood Hero: Vlad King, is a Pro Hero and the homeroom teacher of U.A. High School''s Class 1-B.', '/uploads/images/c_191598.jpg'),
(119, 'Nirengeki Shoda', '庄田連撃', '配角', '', 'Nirengeki has a very humble attitude, as he will not take credit for something he does not feel he earned by his own strength.', '/uploads/images/c_208143.jpg'),
(119, 'Yosetsu Awase', '泡瀬洋雪', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'Although he is not as social as some others, Yosetsu is foul-mouthed and tense, except for serious or life-or-death situations, in which he becomes very easily startled and much more talkative, although he retains his harsh way of speech.', '/uploads/images/c_208147.jpg'),
(119, 'Hiryu Rin', '鱗飛竜', '配角', 'Kousuke Kuwano', '**Height:** 170 cm (5''7") __Quirk:__ Scales He is a Class 1-B student in U.A. High School, training to become a Pro Hero. It''s notable that Hiryu possesses a serious demeanor when it comes to playing out his abilities into action. He is rather diligent in terms of academic abilities and Quirk functions as well. Hiryu has shown to be a very competent combatant, with a great handle on the applications of his Quirk. Thanks to the versatile nature of his Scales Quirk, Hiryu excels in both close and long-range combat, effectively switching between hand-to-hand combat, and shooting off his scales when it’s most convenient to him.', '/uploads/images/c_208148.png'),
(119, 'Reiko Yanagi', '柳レイ子', '配角', '', 'Reiko is a quiet and emotionless teenager who often shows an odd body posture.', '/uploads/images/c_208149.jpg'),
(119, 'Uwabami', 'ウワバミ', '配角', 'Mai Yamane', 'Uwabami is a Pro Hero.', '/uploads/images/c_210092.jpg'),
(119, 'Masaru Bakugou', '爆豪勝', '配角', 'Taichi Takeda', 'Masaru Bakugou is Katsuki Bakugou''s father and the husband of Mitsuki Bakugou.', '/uploads/images/c_231956.png'),
(119, 'Mitsuki Bakugou', '爆豪光己', '配角', 'Yuka Adachi', 'Mitsuki Bakugou is Katsuki Bakugou''s mother and the wife of Masaru Bakugou.', '/uploads/images/c_231957.png'),
(119, 'Kyoutoku Jirou', '耳郎響徳', '配角', '', 'Kyotoku Jiro is Kyoka Jiro''s father.', '/uploads/images/c_239977.png'),
(119, 'Cathleen Bate', 'キャスリーン・ベイト', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 193 cm __Quirk:__ New Order The current No. 1 Pro Hero of the United States of America. She is stated to be the strongest woman in the whole world. Cathleen''s Quirk allows her to set a rule onto her surroundings, allowing her to manipulate and bestow new properties onto herself and the world around her. In order to activate her Quirk, she has to first make physical contact with the target and speak its name, then explains the rule she wishes to impose. She could only impose two rules at any given time.', '/uploads/images/c_254809.jpg'),
(119, 'Mika Jirou', '耳郎実徳', '配角', 'Akeno Watanabe', 'The mother of Kyoka Jiro.', '/uploads/images/c_290632.png'),
(120, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', '桐ヶ谷和人', '主角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', '__Height:__ 172 cm __Weapon(s) of choice:__ Anneal Blade (1st Level), Queen''s Knightblade (9th Level), Elucidator (50th level) and Dark Repulser (forged by Lisbeth) Kirito is a "solo" player, a player who hasn''t joined a guild and usually works alone. He is also one of the very few people to have had the privilege to play in the beta testing period of Sword Art Online. His game alias, Kirito, is created by taking the syllables of the first and last Kanji of his real last and first names respectively: (Kirigaya Kazuto). In the real world, he lives with his mother and younger sister in a family of 3. When [Kayaba](https://anilist.co/character/36829) announced the start of the death game, he is surprised, but unlike everyone else he quickly gets over it and accepts it to an extent. He invited his friend [Klein](https://anilist.co/character/36830) to go with him but Klein had to find his friends in the game. He was invited to join them but he declined as he couldn''t take the pressure of protecting them even with his beta testing knowledge of the game.', '/uploads/images/c_36765.png'),
(120, 'Asuna Yuuki', '結城明日奈', '配角', 'Haruka Tomatsu', '__Height:__ 160-168 cm __Weapons of choice:__ Wind Fleuret (1st Floor), Lambent Light (Forged by [Lisbeth](https://anilist.co/character/43906/Shinozaki-Rika)) Asuna is a friend of [Kirito](https://anilist.co/character/36765/Kirigaya-Kazuto) and is a sub-leader of the guild Knights of the Blood (KoB), a medium-sized guild of about thirty players, also called the strongest guild in Aincrad. Being one of the few girls that are in SAO, and even more so that she''s extremely pretty, she receives many invitations and proposals. She is a skilled player earning the title "Lightning Flash" for her extraordinary sword skill that is lightning fast. Her game alias is the same as her real world name.', '/uploads/images/c_36828.png'),
(120, 'Akihiko Kayaba', '茅場晶彦', '配角', 'Kouichi Yamadera', 'Director and creator of the Nerve Gear and *Sword Art Online*. He traps all the players within *Sword Art Online* by using the Nerve Gear to cease sending signals to the users'' body. Any attempt of removal, loss of power for a certain period, or if the user dies in the game will also kill the user. His motivation is to observe what happens after he traps them. ~!He is in fact Heathcliff in the game *SAO*, who is the leader of the guild Knights of Blood.!~', '/uploads/images/c_36829.png'),
(120, 'Ryoutarou Tsuboi', '壷井遼太郎', '配角', 'Hiroaki Hirata', 'A friendly player that meets Kirito at the start of the game and quickly befriends and learns from him. He and Kirito later separate because he has friends who were also new to the game so he couldn''t leave them. He survives for the past two years and managed to protect his friends the whole time, something Kirito regretted not doing. He is a katana user and the leader of the small guild Fuurinkazan who participates in the boss battles. As one of the few people close to Kirito, he always keeps him in check and wants Kirito to survive the game. He chose the Salamader race on ALO ~! In the side story Caliber, he fell in love at first sight with the girl on the cage named Freyja and agreed that he will help her find her tribe''s treasure which is a hammer, though the decision still remains to be a team''s decision. The team said yes on Caliber and it turned out that the girl they saved was Thor. It was revealed that Thor disguised as a beautiful girl to get close to Giant King Þrym and retrieve his hammer. Thor defeated Giant King Þrym and that stopped the medallion from being corrupted and ending the quest. !~', '/uploads/images/c_36830.png'),
(120, 'Suguha Kirigaya', '桐ヶ谷直葉', '配角', 'Ayana Taketatsu', '[Kazuto](https://anilist.co/character/36765)''s sister in the real world. She is 15 years old and in her third year of junior high, as well as a member of the Kendou club. She''s a diligent worker and has been practicing Kendou for 8 years. ~!In the VRMMO game *Alfheim Online*, she is known as Leafa, a Sylph fairy. She stumbled onto Kazuto by accident one night and decided to travel with him to the World Tree. She eventually fell in love with him because he showed that he really loves playing VR games as if living in it and is very honest in everything. In the real world she slowly got closer to her brother (actually a cousin) but because they''re family and because he already got [Asuna](https://anilist.co/character/36828) as a girlfriend she decided to give up on him and fall in love with Kazuto instead. But soon afterwards she realized that they''re the same person. After being convinced by Kazuto to have a fierce duel which ended up in them flying in each others'' arms, she decided to help Kazuto in rescuing Asuna.!~', '/uploads/images/c_36831.png'),
(120, 'Midori Kirigaya', '桐ヶ谷翠', '配角', 'Aya Endou', 'Kirito and Suguha''s mother in the real world. After Kazuto got trapped she went to the hospital two months prior to lean by Kazuto''s side, eyes brimming with tears and smile bright with gladness that he was still alive.', '/uploads/images/c_36833.png'),
(120, 'Keiko Ayano', '綾野珪子', '配角', 'Rina Hidaka', 'She is a middle level dagger user. She is a very cheerful and sweet girl. She has a very rare familiar, a feathery dragon that she named [Pina](https://anilist.co/character/212810/Pina) after her cat in the real world. She treasured Pina a lot and was the reason she survived in the game. Aside from being a female player, she is also a Beast Tamer and thus perceived as an idol amongst the middle level players. She received endless invitations from parties and guilds who wanted an idol player to join them to get more fame. Because of the attention she got, she became overly proud of herself and left a party one time after a misunderstanding. She got surrounded by monsters and lost Pina in the end. She was then rescued by [Kirito](https://anilist.co/character/36765/Kirigaya-Kazuto) who was passing by and helped her to resurrect the dead familiar.', '/uploads/images/c_37681.jpg'),
(120, 'Yui', 'ユイ', '配角', 'Kanae Itou', 'A young and cheerful girl with long black hair who looks no older than 10 years old. [Kirito](https://anilist.co/character/36765) and [Asuna](https://anilist.co/character/36828) found her in a forest on the 22nd floor of Aincrad. ~!Her true identity is actually a players'' self-regulation program for mental maintenance, Mental Health Counseling Program or MHCP. After being forbidden by the game master [Akihiko Kayaba](https://anilist.co/character/36829) to come close to the players at the beginning of the death game, she was flooded with errors and broke down. In the process she became an AI that possesses actual intelligence. When the Cardinal system governing *Sword Art Online* decided to erase her, Kirito turned her into a tear shaped crystal pendant. He actually converted her to a part of environmental data for the client program and was saved to his NerveGear''s local memory.!~ ~!In *ALfheim Online*, she was able to return to her normal form because ALO was based on a copy of the SAO server. She supports Kirito there as a Navigation Pixie. Kirito and Asuna still treat her as their daughter.!~', '/uploads/images/c_43892.jpg'),
(120, 'Rika Shinozaki', '篠崎里香', '配角', 'Ayahi Takagaki', 'A mace wielder that runs a blacksmith shop in Aincrad on the 48th floor. She made [Asuna](https://anilist.co/character/36828)’s rapier ‘Lament Light’ and one day got a request from [Kirito](https://anilist.co/character/36765) to make him a sword with similar or better quality than his one handed long sword ‘Elucidator’ that he got from a monster drop. She told him that if she had the right materials she could make weapons that would break any sword, so they formed a party and went on a journey to find the material she needed. Because of that journey she came to the conclusion that she felt lonely and yearned for warmth. In ALO she is Leprechaun race blacksmith. ~!She comes to realize that she loves Kirito but after finding out that the one Asuna had feelings for was in fact Kirito she decided to give up on him despite how she feels so Asuna could express her feelings, however during the moments after Kirito''s victory and SAO''s announcement that the game has been cleared she shouts at the top of her lungs that she loves Kirito and that she will meet him again in the real world, which after the ALO incident she actually does, going to school with him and Asuna.!~', '/uploads/images/c_43906.png'),
(120, 'Andrew Gilbert Mills', 'アンドリュー・ギルバート・ミルズ', '配角', 'Hiroki Yasumoto', '__Height:__ 180cm A merchant stationed at city Algate, located at the 50th floor of Aincrad. His shop motto is "Buy cheap and sell cheap". He is a very strong axe-wielding warrior in the frontlines. Kirito sometimes stays in his shop as sort of a disaster shelter, which he gets annoyed with but later ignores as Asuna also visits, which results in some publicity for his shop. ~!In the real world he is married and owns a Bar called Dicey Cafe!~ ~!In the side story Aria in the Starless Night, he is among the few players who participated in the first floor boss fight and supported Kirito when he knew of the latter''s status as a beta tester and later called a Beater. !~ ~!Upon returning to the real world he helps Kirito implement Kayaba''s "seed" which allows VR games to be easier accessed throughout the world, also vastly decreasing the large licensing cost that companies would pay in servers.!~', '/uploads/images/c_54099.jpg'),
(120, 'Shino Asada', '朝田詩乃', '配角', 'Miyuki Sawashiro', 'Shino is a skilled VRMMO player. She goes by the name Sinon in *Gun Gale Online* and *Alfheim Online*. She is nicknamed Hecate, after her gun PGM Ultima Ratio Hecate II, a .50 caliber anti-material rare sniper rifle. She is one of the main characters of volumes five and six and first female player that [Kirito](https://anilist.co/character/36765/Kazuto-Kirigaya) meets in *GGO*. She plays *GGO* to overcome her trauma concerning guns. Calm and cool are the two words that best describe Sinon''s personality. In battle and most of the time in the game, she keeps a cool head that actually makes other female players admire her. However, Sinon has a violent temper once angered something that is best seen with her interactions with Kirito. It is actually said that Kirito is the first one to make her extremely angry. Despite all this, Sinon, while may be hard to approach, is generally a friendly person and doesn''t mind helping others. ~!She becomes a Cait Sith archer in *ALO* where she is capable of hitting targets from 200m away despite her bow being limited to 100m.!~', '/uploads/images/c_55147.png'),
(120, 'Vassago Casals', 'ヴァサゴ・カザルス', '配角', 'Tsuyoshi Koyama', 'Leader and founder of the red guild "Laughing Coffin", known for his large knife and catch phrase "It''s show time." His guild was later destroyed by other players in SAO, but his whereabouts are missing. He is presumed to be alive because he wasn''t listed as one of the dead players. (Source: SAO Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_70683.jpg'),
(120, 'Atsushi Kanamoto', '金本敦', '配角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', 'Johnny Black was a survivor of Sword Art Online, he''s a member of the infamous red guild Laughing Coffin and is partnered with Xaxa. He is well known for using poisons and such in battles.', '/uploads/images/c_70687.jpg'),
(120, 'Eugeo', 'ユージオ', '主角', 'Nobunaga Shimazaki', 'Eugeo is the deuteragonist of the first half of the Alicization Arc. Eugeo was a child born in a remote village in the Human Empire of Underworld, where he was assigned the Sacred Task of felling a giant tree with his childhood friend [Kirito](https://anilist.co/character/36765). After a mishap during an adventure to the mountains resulted in his other childhood friend [Alice Zuberg](https://anilist.co/character/75450) being apprehended by an Integrity Knight for breaking the Taboo Index, while his memories of Kirito were sealed by the administrators of the world, Eugeo spent the following six years focusing on his work to avoid thinking about his lost friend, until Kirito''s return to Underworld led to Eugeo building the resolve to embark on a journey to become an Integrity Knight himself to rescue Alice, as well as acquiring the skills to wield the Blue Rose Sword he had retrieved from the mountains where Alice had broken the Taboo Index. ~!One year after departing from Rulid Village, Kirito and Eugeo enrolled at the Sword Mastery Academy where Eugeo broke the Taboo Index protecting his valet and her friend from being sexually assaulted by two high-ranked nobles. Kirito and Eugeo were then arrested and brought to prison at the Central Cathedral of the Axiom Church by Integrity Knight Alice Synthesis Thirty, Eugeo''s former childhood friend, who no longer had any recollections of her past. After escaping the prison and learning the truth of the world from Cardinal, the duo fou', '/uploads/images/c_70899.jpg'),
(120, 'Seijirou Kikuoka', '菊岡誠二郎', '配角', 'Toshiyuki Morikawa', 'Seijirou Kikuoka is a member of the Ministry of Internal Affairs and Communications, Technology, Second Separated Advanced Network Division, or «Virtual Division». He uses the nickname «Chrysheight» in «ALfheim Online»', '/uploads/images/c_72205.jpg'),
(120, 'Alice Zuberg', 'アリス・ツーベルク', '主角', 'Ai Kayano', 'The heroine of Sword Art Online''s fourth story arc, Alicization. She is a childhood friend of [Kirito](https://anilist.co/character/36765/Kirigaya-Kazuto) and [Eugeo](https://anilist.co/character/70899/Eugeo). 11 years ago, she broke a taboo in the Taboo Index by entering the Dark Territory by accident, and was later captured by an Integrity Knight of the Axiom Church, the entity that rules the Human World. ~!She later returned as "Alice Synthesis Thirty", devoid of memories before her capture, to arrest Kirito and Eugeo, both who have violated a taboo.!~ ~!She is the very first bottom-up AI developed in the real world, created by RATH, and also the object of interest of the American military.!~', '/uploads/images/c_75450.jpg'),
(120, 'Quinella', 'クィネラ', '配角', 'Maaya Sakamoto', 'Quinella was the actual ruler of the Underworld as the highest minister of the Axiom Church.', '/uploads/images/c_123195.png'),
(120, 'Azurica', 'アズリカ', '配角', 'Akiko Hiramatsu', 'Azurica is the dorm supervisor of the novice trainee dorm in the North Centoria''s Imperial Sword Mastery Academy in Underworld.', '/uploads/images/c_123196.jpg'),
(120, 'Egome Zakkalight', 'イゴーム・ザッカライト', '配角', '', 'Egome Zakkalight is a competitor in the Zakkaria Sword Arts Tournament. He is of noble blood and a blood relative to the Zakkarian Leader.', '/uploads/images/c_123197.png'),
(120, 'Cardinal', 'カーディナル', '配角', 'Sakura Tange', 'Cardinal was the embodiment of the Cardinal System in Underworld that had inherited the Cardinal System''s sub-process of performing error checks on the main process, which was integrated into Quinella. After her first battle with Quinella, she took refuge in the Great Library Room.', '/uploads/images/c_123199.png'),
(120, 'Bercouli', 'ベルクーリ', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', '__Affiliation:__ Axiom Church __Occupation:__ Swordsman (former), Guardsman (former), Integrity Knight (current) __Weapon:__ Time Piercing Sword __Skills:__ Change time Bercouli, also known as Bercouli Synthesis One, was a supporting character in the Alicization Arc. He is one of the founders of Rulid Village, as well as the leader of the Integrity Knights, and the oldest Integrity Knight in existence. ~!He died from Fatal Bleeding in the aftermath of a battle against Emperor Vecta!~', '/uploads/images/c_126740.png'),
(120, 'Ronye Arabel', 'ロニエ・アラベル', '配角', 'Reina Kondou', 'Ronye Arabel is Kirito''s valet who learns swordsmanship under him in the Sword Mastery Academy. She is the daughter of a 6th class Noble Family; like Tiese, she entered Sword Mastery Academy trying to raise her family status. She was one of the top 12 of her year, so she became a valet, but what she does not know is that Kirito did not choose her. Instead she was left along with Tiese after all other elite swordsmen selected their valets. The reason for this was that they were from the lowest Noble Class, so none of the noble elite swordsmen wanted to take them as their valets.', '/uploads/images/c_126746.png'),
(120, 'Selka Zuberg', 'セルカ・ツーベルク', '配角', 'Kaori Maeda', 'She is is an apprentice to Sister Azariya and is Alice''s sister. She is capable of using Sacred Arts and lives at Rulid''s church with the orphans. She dislikes how she is constantly compared to her sister Alice. She takes care of Kirito upon his return to Underworld.', '/uploads/images/c_127688.png'),
(120, 'Tiese Shtolienen', 'ティーゼ・シュトリーネン', '配角', 'Kaori Ishihara', 'Tiese Shtolienen is Eugeo''s former valet who learned swordsmanship under him. She is the eldest daughter of a 6th Class Noble family who entered the Sword Mastery Academy with an intent to rise her family status. She was a valet because she was one of the top 12 of her year, but she stated that it was not because she was a good swordswoman, but instead that it was because the entrance exam was on a Sacred Arts that she was good at. ~!After being saved from two nobles who were trying to rape her by Eugeo and Kirito, she falls in love with Eugeo.!~ (Source: Sword Art Online Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_131080.png'),
(120, 'Fanatio', 'ファナティオ', '配角', 'Hitomi Nabatame', 'She is the Deputy Knight Leader of the Integrity Knights. Fanatio''s weapon of choice is the Heaven Piercing Sword. (Source: Sword Art Online Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_131081.jpg'),
(120, 'Sortiliena Serlut', 'ソルティリーナ・セルルト', '配角', 'Megumi Han', 'Sortiliena Serlut is the mentor of Kirito during his 1st year in the North Centoria Imperial Sword Mastery Academy, and the 2nd-seat elite swordswoman at the Academy where she is known as the "Walking Tactics Manual." She has very long straight hair and can easily be considered beautiful. As an elite-swordswoman, she customized her uniform to a purple one. (Source: Sword Art Online Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_131082.png'),
(120, 'Eldrie Woolsburg', 'エルドリエ・ウールスブルーグ', '配角', 'Takeaki Masuyama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_132281.png'),
(120, 'Deusolbert', 'デュソルバート', '配角', 'Hikaru Hanada', 'Integrity Knight that arrived to apprehend Alice after she broke the Taboo Index.', '/uploads/images/c_133839.png'),
(120, 'Fizel', 'フィゼル', '配角', 'Konomi Kohara', 'A girl who is an Axiom Church Sister-in-training. Born and raised in Central Cathedral with Linel, they call each other "Nel" and "Zel".', '/uploads/images/c_133840.png'),
(120, 'Linel', 'リネル', '配角', 'Hina Kino', 'An Axiom Church Sister-in-training, whom Kirito and Eugeo met in Central Cathedral. Often uses honorifics when speaking.', '/uploads/images/c_133841.png'),
(120, 'Frenica Szeski', 'フレニカ・シェスキ', '配角', 'Mika Itou', 'is a student at the Sword Mastery Academy in North Centoria in Underworld. She is also the valet of Humbert Zizek.', '/uploads/images/c_136725.jpg'),
(120, 'Sister Azalia', 'シスター・アザリヤ', '配角', 'Kumiko Nakane', 'She is a teacher at the church in Rulid Village, who taught Sacred Arts to Alice Zuberg and Selka Zuberg. Sister Azariya houses orphans at the church.', '/uploads/images/c_136726.jpg'),
(120, 'Gasupht Zuberg', 'ガスフト・ツーベルク', '配角', 'Kanehira Yamamoto', 'is the Village Chief of Rulid Village. He is the father of Alice and Selka. He presides over a majority of the village ceremonies and rituals.', '/uploads/images/c_136727.png'),
(120, 'Rinko Koujiro', '神代凛子', '配角', 'Sanae Kobayashi', 'She is a scientist, as well as the former love interest and co-worker of [Akihiko Kayaba](https://anilist.co/character/36829). She studied at the Toto Institute of Technology in Japan, where she was a part of Shigemura Lab in the institute''s Electrical and Electronic Engineering Department.', '/uploads/images/c_136728.jpg'),
(120, 'Natsuki Aki', '安岐ナツキ', '配角', 'Ayako Kawasumi', 'is a nurse who works for the Japan Ground Self-Defense Force (JGSDF) and was assigned by Kikuoka Seijirou to oversee Kirigaya Kazuto''s medical condition at «Chiyoda Hospital» when he was hospitalized as well as during his rehabilitation. She is later assigned to watch over Kazuto during the «Death Gun» incident and after Kazuto is injected with succinylcholine.', '/uploads/images/c_136729.jpg'),
(120, 'Chudelkin', 'チュデルキン', '配角', 'Wataru Takagi', 'the Chief Elder of the Axiom Church in Underworld, who worked directly under the highest minister, Quinella.', '/uploads/images/c_136730.jpg'),
(120, 'Humbert Zizek', 'ウンベール・ジーゼック', '配角', 'Ryuuichi Kijima', 'He is a fourth class noble and swordsman-in-training at the North Centoria''s Imperial Sword Mastery Academy, as well as Raios Antinous''s follower and only friend.', '/uploads/images/c_136731.png'),
(120, 'Volo  Levantein', 'ウォロ・リーバンテイン', '配角', 'Taishi Murata', 'He was the head elite swordsman-in-training at the North Centoria Imperial Master Sword Academy during Eugeo and Kirito''s first year at the academy. He graduated as the second-ranked swordsman from the academy after being defeated by Sortiliena Serlut during the graduation tournament and then participated in the Norlangarth North Empire Swordsmanship Tournament, where he was defeated by Eldrie Woolsburg.', '/uploads/images/c_136732.jpg'),
(120, 'Takeru Higa', '比嘉タケル', '配角', 'Kenji Nojima', 'He is the Chief Developer of the «Soul Translator», working under Kikuoka Seijirou in Rath. He helped create «Underworld» as a means to produce «Bottom-Up-Artificial Intelligence» via nurturing a mass number of Artificial Fluctlights, in order to further advance Japan''s military force.', '/uploads/images/c_136733.jpg'),
(120, 'Raios Antinous', 'ライオス・アンティノス', '配角', 'Shuuhei Iwase', 'He was a swordsman-in-training at the Norlangarth Empire''s Sword Mastery Academy and was the eldest son of a third class noble family.', '/uploads/images/c_136734.jpg'),
(120, 'Gabriel Miller', 'ガブリエル・ミラー', '配角', 'Akira Ishida', 'Chief technology officer of Glowgen Defense Systems and the child of the former president and founder of the company. He was the winner of the 1st and 4th Bullet of Bullets tournament in Gun Gale Online as Subtilizer. ~!Primary antagonist of the War of the Underworld sub-arc of the Alicization Arc. In the Underworld, he is known as Vector, the god of the dark territories. Gabriel plans to steal the Soul Translator technology in order to create his own virtual world where he can analyze souls. In order to achieve that goal, he plans on hunting people with strong souls, especially the Sword Art Online survivors'', and steal their Fluctlights.!~', '/uploads/images/c_155210.png'),
(120, 'Golgorosso Balto', 'ゴルゴロッソ・バルトー', '配角', 'Ryou Sugisaki', 'He was Eugeo''s mentor during his first year in the North Centoria''s Imperial Sword Mastery Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_212600.jpg'),
(120, 'Tecchi', 'テッチ', '配角', 'Nobuyuki Kobushi', 'He is a close-range, tank-build member of the Sleeping Knights, a guild of terminally ill patients who met in Serene Garden and played various virtual reality games as a form of palliative care. Tecchi had played a variety of virtual reality games, until the guild eventually arrived to ALfheim Online, where Tecchi chose to be a Gnome.', '/uploads/images/c_212619.jpg'),
(120, 'Talken', 'タルケン', '配角', 'Atsushi Tamaru', 'He is a medium-range, damage-dealer member of the Sleeping Knights, a guild of terminally ill patients who met in Serene Garden and played various virtual reality games as a form of palliative care. Talken had played a variety of virtual reality games, until the guild eventually arrived to ALfheim Online, where Talken chose to be a Leprechaun.', '/uploads/images/c_212620.jpg'),
(120, 'Pina', 'ピナ', '配角', 'Shiori Izawa', 'is Silica''s Feathered Little Dragon and the first known monster to be tamed in Sword Art Online. It understands Silica''s commands and will protect her in any way it can, as it is her «Tamed Monster». It is also present in ALfheim Online as her Cait Sith familiar.', '/uploads/images/c_212810.png'),
(120, 'Takiguri', '滝栗', '配角', '', 'Eldrie dragon and brother of Amayori.', '/uploads/images/c_213227.png'),
(120, 'Amayori', '雨縁', '配角', '', 'Alice''s dragon and the brother of Takiguri.', '/uploads/images/c_213228.png'),
(120, 'Airy', 'エアリー', '配角', 'Mao Ichimichi', 'A young-looking girl who was assigned to operate the lifting disc between the 50th and 80th floors of the Underworld Central Cathedral.', '/uploads/images/c_213229.png'),
(120, 'Sadore', 'サードレ', '配角', 'Hisao Egawa', 'An Underworld resident craftsman who grants Kirito his representative sword in Underworld.', '/uploads/images/c_213230.png'),
(120, 'Nakanishi', '中西', '配角', 'Takahiro Sumi', 'He is a member of the Japanese Self-Defense Forces and an employee of RATH.', '/uploads/images/c_213231.png'),
(120, 'Alicia Klingerman', 'アリシア・クリンガーマン', '配角', 'Ai Kayano', 'She was the childhood friend of Gabriel Miller''s, by whom she was murdered during the 2008 Global Financial Crisis.', '/uploads/images/c_213232.png'),
(120, 'Ugachi', 'ウガチ', '配角', 'Kousuke Takaguchi', 'He was the leader of a small scouting party of goblins from the Dark Territory.', '/uploads/images/c_213233.png'),
(120, 'Zink', 'ジンク', '配角', 'Haruki Ishiya', 'An inhabitant of the Rluid town, his task is to monitor who enters the town and verify that they are from there', '/uploads/images/c_213234.jpg'),
(120, 'Charlotte', 'シャーロット', '配角', 'Youko Honna', 'It is a form of artificial intelligence subordinate to Cardinal whose main function has been to observe the young Kirito and Eugeo on their journey to the Central Cathedral in the Underworld.', '/uploads/images/c_213430.jpg'),
(120, 'Yanai', '柳井', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_221512.jpg'),
(120, 'Garitta', 'ガリッタ', '配角', 'Takehiro Hasu', 'Garitta was the sixth generation cutter of the Gigas Cedar in the outskirts of Rulid Village, and the last cutter before Eugeo and Kirito were assigned this Sacred Task.', '/uploads/images/c_222963.jpg'),
(121, 'Ken Kaneki', '金木研', '主角', 'Natsuki Hanae', '__Height:__ 169 cm (5''6") Ken Kaneki was originally a human and a normal college student until he encountered a female ghoul named [Rize](https://anilist.co/character/88413/Rize-Kamishiro) who was posing as a human at the time. Rize, using Kaneki''s crush on her as leverage, managed to lure him into an alley and tried to eat him but ended up dying when construction beams fell on top of her. Kaneki, already in a half-dead state from Rize''s attempts at killing him, ends up in a hospital and has some of Rize''s organs transplanted into his body. This results in him absorbing some of Rize''s powers and characteristics, such as a ghoul eye, powers of regeneration, and the inability to stomach human food. Terrified and lost, Kaneki''s life takes a dramatic turn from then on as he tries to find a place for himself in the world, realizing he now belongs to neither the human nor ghoul world and refusing to eat humans to sustain himself. Meeting some of the ​other ghouls, as well as humans, makes him realize that things aren''t just black and white and that there are more to ghouls and humans than originally thought.', '/uploads/images/c_87275.png'),
(121, 'Touka Kirishima', '霧嶋董香', '配角', 'Sora Amamiya', '__Height:__ 156 cm (5''1") Touka is a ghoul successfully posing as a human and working as a waitress at a cafe which serves as a gathering place for other ghouls, as well as a food resource. She saves [Kaneki](https://anilist.co/character/87275/Kaneki-Ken)''s life at one point and acts as a reluctant guide to him and his adaptation to the ghoul society. She doesn''t like Kaneki much and has no qualms about expressing her dislike for him. She is very serious, tough and hard-working, trying to keep their district as safe for ghouls and humans as possible. Her powers and strength are also quite great and she makes for a formidable opponent.', '/uploads/images/c_87277.png'),
(121, 'Hinami Fueguchi', '笛口雛実', '配角', 'Sumire Morohoshi', '__Height:__ 148 cm - 152 cm (4''10" - 4''11") Hinami is a child ghoul whose parents were killed by ghoul investigators. Before, she and her mother seek help from the owner of the Antique Cafe to acquire food. Hinami is initially quite shy, but when she opens up, she is cheerful and earnest. [Ken](https://anilist.co/character/87275/Kaneki-Ken) helps her learn kanji, as she cannot attend school, and is very eager to learn. Currently, she is living together with [Touka Kirishima](https://anilist.co/character/87277/Kirishima-Touka).', '/uploads/images/c_88293.png'),
(121, 'Koutarou Amon', '亜門鋼太朗', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', '__Height:__ 191 cm (6''3") A first class police investigator who investigates Ghouls, also known as a Dove. He comes to the 20th ward with his mentor, [Mado Kureo](https://anilist.co/character/88423), to investigate Ghoul incidents in the area. He has a strong sense of justice, fervently believing it is the right and moral thing to do to exterminate the Ghouls. He hunts the Ghouls in order to prevent more human children from becoming orphaned like himself, and he often works after hours to achieve his goals. He wields a "Quinque" (a weapon made from the "Kagune" of a Ghoul) that has the appearance of a pole-arm with a large cylindrical bludgeon at the end.', '/uploads/images/c_88407.png'),
(121, 'Nishiki Nishio', '西尾錦', '配角', 'Shintarou Asanuma', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''9") Nishiki Nishio is a ghoul whose original feeding ground was taken from Rize. He is a sophomore in the Pharmaceutical Department of Kamii University and Kimi Nishino''s boyfriend.', '/uploads/images/c_88409.png'),
(121, 'Ayato Kirishima', '霧嶋絢都', '配角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 159 cm (5''2") Ayato Kirishima is [Touka Kirishima](https://anilist.co/character/87277/Touka-Kirishima)''s younger brother. He grew up with his sister in the 20th ward but at some point of time, he disappeared. Currently, he is an executive of Aogiri Tree. An arrogant youth with a similar harsh attitude that resembles his sister. Other than physical looks, he shares many similarities with Touka such as his cold, hotblooded attitude and a habit for kicking people. However, he''s more harsh compared to her and surprisingly nicer than his Aogiri superiors.', '/uploads/images/c_88411.png'),
(121, 'Juuzou Suzuya', '鈴屋什造', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") A Rank 3 Ghoul Investigator. In the past, he went by the name Rei Suzuya. He is the partner of [Yukinori Shinohara](https://anilist.co/character/88408). He is a young man with androgynous appearance. He has many stitches used as both first-aid and fashion. His hair is tied with a stitching string in a roman numeral 13 pattern, with large pupils that leaves an eerie and frightening impression.', '/uploads/images/c_88412.png'),
(121, 'Uta', 'ウタ', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', '__Height:__ 177 cm A ghoul that has his own art studio where he makes masks for other ghouls. He has a lot of piercings and tattoos on his body, making him look pretty intimidating, even as a normal-looking human. He''s the one who also made a mask for Kaneki.', '/uploads/images/c_88414.jpg'),
(121, 'Tatara', 'タタラ', '配角', 'Kouji Yusa', 'A direct subordinate of the One-Eyed King and one of Aogiri Tree''s leaders. He was a former member of the Chinese ghoul organization Chi She Lian. As one of the Aogiri Tree leaders and a trusted subordinate working under the One-Eyed King, Tatara comes off as a rather loyal individual. He is portrayed as composed and stoic mostly. He often monitors the activities of the Aogiri executives, but kills in cold-blood when embarking on a mission. He is also proud of his immense stamina when fighting and the accuracy of his calculations as well. Tatara seems to have a taste for precision; as shown when he turns down Kaneki considering he''s an artificial one-eyed ghoul. He appears to hold a grudge against Houji, to the extent that even the Quinque associated with him, is enough to make him enraged and lose his near unflappable composure. As the second-in-command of Aogiri, it can be inferred that he is quite powerful.', '/uploads/images/c_88418.png'),
(121, 'Nico', 'ニコ', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', '__Species:__ Ghoul __Height:__ 175 cm __Affiliations:__ Clown Mask Ghoul Gang A gay ghoul (okama) in love. He was once acting together with Yamori and participating in Aogiri Tree.', '/uploads/images/c_88419.jpg'),
(121, 'Shuu Tsukiyama', '月山習', '配角', 'Mamoru Miyano', '__Height:__ 180 cm Shuu Tsukiyama was the infamous Gourmet ghoul of the 20th ward. He was a fourth-year student studying Social Welfare at the Department of Human Sciences at Seinan Gakuin University. He comes from the extremely wealthy and influential Tsukiyama family which his father, Mirumo Tsukiyama was the head of. Tsukiyama himself became the head of his family after the Tsukiyama Family Extermination Operation. He was also a member of the Ghoul Restaurant, known as MM until he betrayed them. He joined Kaneki''s group with the hidden intention of eating Ken Kaneki, obsessed with his scent and taste but eventually came to genuinely care for Kaneki. Two years later, his severe depression and anorexia after Kaneki''s apparent demise left him emaciated and required constant care from his family servants. After finding out Kaneki was alive and meeting him, he recovers, being able to walk and eat on his own as well as take measures to help Kaneki regain his memories.', '/uploads/images/c_88424.png'),
(121, 'Akira Mado', '真戸暁', '配角', 'Asami Seto', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 164 cm __Affiliations:__ CCG __Quinque:__ Amatsu (Koukaku/Bikaku) __Likes:__ making quinques, solving puzzles and cats Akira Mado is a Rank 2 Ghoul Investigator and Kureo''s daughter. She is currently partnered with Koutarou Amon. She is an intelligent woman and seems to be always serious about work and her daily routine in general. Like her father, she has deep insight and intuition that helps her in investigation and determining what is going on around her while on the field. She shares her father''s "quinque-mania," but it is not as extreme as his was. Akira remains professional in most situations, no matter who she is faced with, and she isn''t one to admit her own feelings on a subject unless provoked to a certain degree. Seen through her interactions with others, it is most likely that she would prefer to make a quinque rather than to interact with someone else.', '/uploads/images/c_88838.png'),
(121, 'Saiko Yonebayashi', '米林才子', '主角', 'Ayane Sakura', '**Height:** 143 cm Saiko Yonebayashi is a Rank 3 Ghoul Investigator, a Quinx, and a member of the Quinx Squad. She dislikes having to work, as she prefers having a peaceful, happy-go-lucky and carefree life by playing video games and eating junk food excessively. Saiko often oversleeps, which earns her the absence from most missions. While not trying to reduce it, she is apparently embarrassed about her weight, humorously covering it during her introduction. She is excessively lazy to the point of being a hikikomori, unable to remove herself from her room without the intervention and often force of others, even jeopardizing her occupation. Saiko is also depicted as greedy, and heavily involved in her video games to the point of escapism.', '/uploads/images/c_88872.jpg'),
(121, 'Tooru Mutsuki', '六月透', '主角', 'Natsumi Fujiwara', '__Height:__ 165 cm (5''4") Tooru Mutsuki is a Rank 3 Ghoul Investigator, a Quinx and a member of the Quinx Squad. Tooru is kind with a gentle heart and seems to be shy with little self-confidence. Having a constant case of Anemia, ironically, Mutsuki feels repulsive when he comes into contact with blood. Because of this anxiety, he faces discouragement as a ghoul investigator, to the point where he feels as though he isn’t even needed for the job. He expresses frustration with his own weakness, feeling anger at his lack of ability compared to his comrades. When not working, he is shown to enjoy reading books and is the one often left to relate information to Haise Sasaki. As such, he is shown to be a reliable and hard-working individual, following orders in contrast to the more troublesome or lazy members of his team. Though lacking in confidence, he shows a strong desire to help others and does not hesitate to place himself at risk to protect the innocent. ~!A flashback reveals him to have been born female, but unable to reconcile his feelings of discomfort towards his birth sex. As such, he has began living as a man and uses highly-masculine personal pronouns.!~', '/uploads/images/c_88886.jpg'),
(121, 'Ginshi Shirazu', '不知吟士', '主角', 'Yuuma Uchida', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9") Ginshi Shirazu is a Rank 3 Ghoul Investigator, a Quinx and the Current Squad Leader of the Quinx Squad. Shirazu, like most of his teammates, is shown to have great respect for his mentor, Haise Sasaki. However, this doesn’t stop him from going out of his way to execute missions without Sasaki’s permission, and so he is constantly seen accompanying Kuki Urie, the former squad leader, on dangerous assignments. Although he is a competent fighter with a ruthless nature, Urie describes Shirazu as a simple-minded person. He also seems to be quite exaggerated in his expressions and movements. His primary motive for joining the Quinx Squad is to get fast money for a purpose unknown at this point in time. Shirazu is also a quite carefree individual, and he seems to have an obsession for exterminating ghouls; both of which are traits that submit to the cocky grin he usually displays. He is stated to be poor at tasks that require thought, such as academics or investigation. However, his consideration for others and attention to his surroundings convince Sasaki he has potential as a Squad Leader. In contrast to his loud and violent mannerisms, he is also someone that cares greatly for his team. While prone to bickering with Urie, he shows a gentler side when interacting with Mutsuki or civilians such as Chie', '/uploads/images/c_88887.jpg'),
(121, 'Kuki Urie', '瓜江久生', '主角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 173 cm __Species:__ Quinx __Affiliations:__ CCG''s Quinx Squad - Former squad leader __RC type:__ Koukaku __Quinque:__ Tsunagi (Bikaku) He is a Rank 2 Ghoul Investigator,a Quinx and the former Squad Leader of the Quinx Squad. Urie often displays himself as a cool-headed individual, holding a monotonous facial expression the majority of the time. As a Ghoul Investigator, he appears to be very dedicated and stern about his work, to the point where it may seem as though he is ruthlessly slaughtering more ghouls than necessary, which is a habit he often gets berated for. Urie also tends to be quite hasty when investigating the slightest details or signs of a suspect. He has a tendency to execute mission objectives independently, without awaiting the arrival of his fellow team mates, or even requesting their help. This is because he is an ambitious person, and does not wish to share credit with others, as he merely wishes to achieve higher ranks as a Ghoul Investigator. To achieve his personal goals, he is willing to go as far as manipulating his comrades or causing discord within the team. But beneath his ambition and cool-headed demeanor is an insatiable jealousy towards his superiors, particularly Sasaki. Urie believes that ghouls, under any circumstance, must cease to exist. He is a person who is always striving for power and as a result, constantly looks for ways to one-up everyone around him which is shown by asking Professor Shiba to help augments his kagune''s po', '/uploads/images/c_88935.jpg'),
(121, 'Kishou Arima', '有馬貴将', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', '__Height:__ 180 cm __Quinque:__ IXA (Koukaku), Narukami (Ukaku), Yukimura 1/3 (Koukaku) Kishou Arima is a famed Special Class Ghoul Investigator known as the CCG''s Reaper. He is undefeated as a Ghoul Investigator and at some point was formerly partnered with Take Hirako. His investigative skills and prowess in combat has led many investigators such as [Koutarou Amon](https://anilist.co/character/88407/Koutarou-Amon) to admire him. __Tokyo Ghoul:Re__ ~!He later passes down his Yukimura 1/3 (Koukaku) quinque to [Sasaki Haise](https://anilist.co/character/87275/Ken-Kaneki), a rank 1 investigator and mentor of Quinx squad. Along with [Akira Mado](https://anilist.co/character/88838/Akira-Mado), he is the overseer of the Quinx squad and keeps a check on Sasaki Haise along with the Quinx members.!~', '/uploads/images/c_88946.jpg'),
(121, 'Eto', 'エト', '配角', 'Maaya Sakamoto', '__Height:__ 151 cm __RC Type:__ Ukaku __Rating:__ ~!S as Eto SSS as One Eyed Owl!~ Eto is an executive of Aogiri Tree from the 24th ward. Eto is often seen interacting with fellow Aogiri member [Tatara](https://anilist.co/character/88418/Tatara). ~!She is the daughter of [Yoshimura](https://anilist.co/character/136024/Yoshimura), and the half-Ghoul known as the One-Eyed Owl. Her human identity is Sen Takatsuki (高槻 泉), a best-selling horror novelist mentioned throughout the series. Her relation with the One-Eyed King is unclear. However the CCG and [Nico](https://anilist.co/character/88419/Nico) speculate that they are the same person.!~', '/uploads/images/c_90231.jpg'),
(121, 'Naki', 'ナキ', '配角', 'Hiro Shimono', 'Naki is a ghoul who was imprisoned in Cochlea until Aogiri Tree''s invasion on the prison. He was liberated by Aogiri Tree due to being a direct underling and supposedly the right hand man of Yamori. He was almost always accompanied by the Twins Gagi and Guge. He eventually climbs the ranks within Aogiri, and has become an Executive in his own right. The number of Ghouls following him has grown considerably, forming a gang known as the White Suits for their distinctive dressing style. Naki is left handed.', '/uploads/images/c_90232.jpg'),
(121, 'Hairu Ihei', '伊丙入', '配角', 'Akira Sekine', 'Hairu Ihei is a First Class Ghoul investigator and the partner of Koori Ui. She is the deputy leader of S1 Squad. She is a veteran of the Owl Suppression Operation and serves as a member of Squad 0, commanded by Kishou Arima. ~!She is killed during the Tsukiyama Extermination Operation.!~', '/uploads/images/c_90234.png'),
(121, 'Chie Hori', '掘ちえ', '配角', 'Megumi Han', 'Chie is a human photographer and information broker. She is a long-time friend of Shuu Tsukiyama, aware of his secret but uninterested in exposing him as a Ghoul. At his request, she serves as an informant to Kaneki''s group. (Source: MAL) She seeks out the members of the Quinx Squad, and offers to sell them information pertaining to Torso. This is because she has an unusual interest in their leader, Sasaki.', '/uploads/images/c_121595.jpg'),
(121, 'Kanae von Rosewald', 'カナエ＝フォン・ロゼヴァルト', '配角', 'Yuu Kobayashi', 'Kanae von Rosewald is a Ghoul and the last survivor of the Rosewald family. After Matsuri Washuu led an extermination operation to destroy the Rosewalds, Kanae was taken in as an employee of the Tsukiyama family. (Source: Tokyo Ghoul Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_124971.jpg'),
(121, 'Noro', 'ノロ', '配角', 'Kenji Hamada', 'He is one of the direct subordinates of the King of an Eye and one of the leaders of the Aogiri Tree, next to Tatara. In the past he was called Noroi and was responsible for raising Eto, when Kuzen surrendered in District 24. He is a giant who intimidates with an overwhelming silence, seems to communicate only through actions, not words.', '/uploads/images/c_125567.jpg'),
(121, 'Seidou Takizawa', '滝澤政道', '配角', 'Shinnosuke Tachibana', '__Height:__ 171 cm Takizawa is a Rank 2 Ghoul Investigator. A classmate of [Akira Mado](https://anilist.co/character/88838/Akira-Mado) at the Academy, he is partnered with Kousuke Houji and assigned to the 20th ward to investigate the Gourmet. He greatly respects [Kishou Arima](https://anilist.co/character/88946/Kishou-Arima) and [Koutarou Amon](https://anilist.co/character/88407/Koutarou-Amon) and admires their achievements. ~!Though he was declared among the casualties of the raid in the 20th Ward, it is revealed that he had actually survived as artificial one-eyed ghoul. He is now a member of Aogiri Tree. As an artificial one-eyed ghoul, he is known as Owl. After betraying Aogiri and killing [Tatara](https://anilist.co/character/88418/Tatara), Takizawa reunited with Akira Mado, and became a member of Ken Kaneki''s organization, Goat. !~', '/uploads/images/c_125884.jpg'),
(121, 'Nimura Furuta', '旧多二福', '配角', 'Daisuke Kishio', '__Height:__ 175 cm ~!__RC Type:__ Rinkaku!~ ~!Kichimura Washuu is the primary antagonist of the Tokyo Ghoul series and the former Bureau Director of the CCG. He is involved in numerous organizations and is responsible for several major events of the series.!~ ~!He was originally the illegitimate son of former CCG Chairman Tsuneyoshi Washuu and an agent of V raised in the Sunlit Garden. To further his own agenda, he has used various identities to infiltrate organizations or build personal alliances. As a member of the Clowns, he was responsible for the Steel Beam Incident. He also joined the Ghoul Restaurant as __PG__, and has been a partner in Akihiro Kanou''s ghoulification experiments. Like [Ken Kaneki](https://anilist.co/character/87275/Ken-Kaneki), he is an artificial one-eyed ghoul who possesses [Rize Kamishiro](https://anilist.co/character/88413/Rize-Kamishiro)''s kagune.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126031.png'),
(121, 'Take Hirako', '平子丈', '配角', 'Takayuki Kondou', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 172 cm __Affiliations:__ CCG __Quinque:__ Nagomi 1/3 (Rinkaku) Take Hirako is a First Class Ghoul Investigator. In the past, he formed a duo with Kishou Arima. Hirako is of average height and his facial features have been described as "plain" or "bland." He usually has a blank expression on his face. Like all members of CCG, he usually wears formal attire. Like his mentor Kishou Arima, Hirako has a very calm personality and has inherited the same cold and calculating approach to fighting ghouls.He is skilled to the point of being able to suppress a S-class Ukaku type ghoul.', '/uploads/images/c_136023.jpg'),
(121, 'Taishi Fura', '富良太志', '配角', 'Ryouhei Kimura', 'Taishi Fura is a First-Class Ghoul Investigator. He is the protagonist of the side story Tokyo Ghoul: Jack, alongside Kishou Arima.', '/uploads/images/c_145217.jpg'),
(121, 'Itsuki Marude', '丸手斎', '配角', 'Yuuji Ueda', 'Itsuki is a Special Class Ghoul Investigator. He is the commander of the 11th Ward Special Countermeasures Unit and Chief of Division II.', '/uploads/images/c_145219.jpg'),
(121, 'Ui Koori', '宇井郡', '配角', 'Makoto Naruse', 'Koori is a Special Class Investigator and an Investigation Commander in Division I. He is the leader of S1 Squad, and a former protege of Kishou Arima and the partner of Hairu Ihei. He is in charge of the 4th ward.', '/uploads/images/c_169534.jpg'),
(121, 'Renji Yomo', '四方蓮示', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Height:__ 182 cm (5''11") Renji Yomo is a worker at Anteiku and the right hand of [Yoshimura](https://anilist.co/character/136024/Yoshimura). He is an old friend of [Uta](https://anilist.co/character/88414/Uta) and [Itori](https://anilist.co/character/88415/Itori). Because of his scavenging habits and long-beaked, avian mask, he has the nickname of "Raven."', '/uploads/images/c_172074.jpg'),
(121, 'Akihiro Kanou', '嘉納明博', '配角', 'Kenji Nomura', 'Akihiro Kanou, often referred to as Professor Kanou, is a physician at Kanou General Hospital.', '/uploads/images/c_189325.png'),
(121, 'Yoriko Kosaka', '小坂依子', '配角', 'Chinatsu Akasaki', 'A university friend of Touka''s. In :re she is revealed to be working in a bakery, often frequented by Rank1 Ghoul Inspector Takeomi Kuroiwa, son of the Special Class Ghoul Investigator Iwao Kuroiwa. ~!Takeomi proposes to Yoriko in chapter 104 of :re!~', '/uploads/images/c_189327.png'),
(121, 'Donato  Porpora ', 'ドナート・ポルポラ', '配角', 'Kazuhiko Inoue', 'Donato Porpora is a Russian ghoul and a prisoner in the 23rd ward''s Ghoul Detention Center. He was once running a Catholic orphanage in Japan. His alias was Priest (神父). He was also Koutarou Amon''s foster father. (Source: Tokyo Ghoul Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_195607.png'),
(121, 'Kuramoto Itou', '伊東倉元', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', '__Height:__ 172 cm Kuramoto Itou is a First Class Ghoul Investigator and the deputy squad leader of the Hirako Squad.', '/uploads/images/c_206156.png'),
(121, 'Mayu', '痲ユ', '配角', 'Nozomi Mikajiri', '__Height:__ 166 cm __Affiliations:__ Ghoul Restaurant Mayu, also known as Nutcracker, was a ghoul that preyed on men by crushing their testicles before drinking the fluids. She was tasked with capturing humans for an underground "Gourmet" society.', '/uploads/images/c_206157.png'),
(121, 'Hanbee Abara', '阿原半兵衛', '配角', 'Masakazu Nishida', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_227329.jpg'),
(121, 'Masami Umeno', '梅野雅巳', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_230227.jpg'),
(121, 'Matsumae', '松前', '配角', 'Chie Nakamura', 'Matsumae is a teacher at Seinan Gakuin High School and the homeroom teacher of Shuu Tsukiyama. She is also a Ghoul in the employment of the Tsukiyama family. She''s responsible for keeping an eye on Tsukiyama while acting as his teacher. She''s shown to keep a cool head, even when surrounded by ghoul investigators, and commanded her group of ghouls in combat. Like her master, Matsumae retains a professional behavior even when under what is normally considered pressuring, such as a CCG extermination. (Source: Tokyo Ghoul Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_236716.png'),
(121, 'Big Madam', 'ビッグマダム', '配角', 'Kimiko Saitou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_241489.png'),
(121, 'Kouitsu Chigyou', '地行甲乙', '配角', 'Shinji Kawada', 'Kouitsu Chigyou is the head ghoul researcher at CCG Laboratory Division. He used to be a researcher in the GFG in Germany.', '/uploads/images/c_241525.png'),
(121, 'Maiko Abe', '阿倍麻衣子', '配角', 'Mayumi Asano', '__Height:__ 160 cm Maiko is a member of the Ghoul Restaurant', '/uploads/images/c_241526.png'),
(121, 'Iwao Kuroiwa', '黒磐巌', '配角', 'Ryuuzaburou Ootomo', 'Iwao Kuroiwa is a Special Class Ghoul Investigator. Currently, he serves as the vice commander of the 11th Ward Special Countermeasures Unit. Yukinori Shinohara calls him by the nickname Iwaccho.', '/uploads/images/c_241539.png'),
(121, 'Roma Hoito', '帆糸ロマ', '配角', 'Suzuko Mimori', 'Roma Hoito is a ghoul and used to be a waitress at Anteiku.', '/uploads/images/c_241540.png'),
(121, 'Nobu Shimoguchi', '下口房', '配角', 'Soushirou Hori', 'Nobu was a First Class Ghoul Investigator and led his own Squad. Until recently, he worked on the Torso case, along with the Quinx Squad.', '/uploads/images/c_241543.png'),
(121, 'Goumasa Tokage', '戸影豪正', '配角', 'Atsuyoshi Miyazaki', 'Goumasa Tokage is a combat instructor at the 2nd Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_241547.png'),
(121, 'Yoshitoki Washuu', '和修吉時', '配角', 'Shunsuke Sakuya', 'Yoshitoki Washuu is the current Bureau Director of CCG''s Main Office and Tsuneyoshi Washuu''s son.', '/uploads/images/c_241552.png'),
(121, 'Tsuneyoshi Washuu', '和修常吉', '配角', 'Katsunosuke Hori', 'Tsuneyoshi Washuu is the current chairman of CCG and Yoshitoki Washuu''s father.', '/uploads/images/c_241555.png'),
(121, 'Miza Kusakari', '草刈ミザ', '配角', 'Yumiri Hanamori', 'She''s a ghoul and a former executive of Aogiri Tree. She is known by the alias Three Blades (三枚刃, Sanmaiba) in reference to the shape of her kagune. She was the leader of the 18th ward and the Blades gang.', '/uploads/images/c_250540.jpg'),
(121, 'Keijin Nakarai', '半井恵仁', '配角', 'Yuuya Hirose', '__Height__: 167 cm __Affiliations__: CCG Keijin is a First Class Ghoul Investigator. He is the Vice-Squad Leader of CCG''s Suzuya Squad that''s assigned to the 13th Ward.', '/uploads/images/c_259906.jpg'),
(121, 'Shiki Kijima', 'キジマ式', '配角', 'Nobuo Tobita', 'Special Class ghoul investigator.', '/uploads/images/c_265042.png'),
(121, 'Ching-Li Hsiao', '小静麗', '配角', '', 'Ching-Li Hsiao is a Taiwanese Rank 1 Ghoul Investigator and one of the second batch of recruits to the Quinx Squad.', '/uploads/images/c_278926.jpg'),
(121, 'Mirumo Tsukiyama', '月山観母', '配角', 'Mitsuru Miyamoto', 'Mirumo Tsukiyama (月山観母) is an extremely wealthy and eccentric ghoul, well-known within ghoul society for being extravagant. He is the father of Shuu Tsukiyama, and took part in the auction as a major bidder under the alias Croque Monsieur.', '/uploads/images/c_282392.png'),
(121, 'Matsuri Washuu', '和修政', '配角', 'Yoshihisa Kawahara', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_310080.png'),
(122, 'Ash Lynx', 'アッシュ・リンクス', '主角', 'Yuuma Uchida', '__Height:__ 180 cm (5''11") __Nationality:__ American-Irish Ash has the personality, charisma, and skill to gather large groups of individuals together under his influence. Not only is he excellent in combat and an incredible marksman, but he''s also highly intelligent with an IQ of 200. His intelligence lends itself well to solving the mystery of ''Banana Fish'' and he has also been stated to be quite well-read, knowing his way around the newspaper''s daily columns and political novels - unusual for someone who did not finish middle school. Along with his remarkable intelligence, Ash''s good looks and charisma allow him to sway the will of people to his benefit in dire situations, and he''s well aware of it. Despite the influence he holds over others, however, Ash is mistrustful and holds most people at arms-length except for a few select friends in his inner circle, the most notable being [Eiji Okumura](https://anilist.co/character/21928). He is not afraid of death not because of courage, as he calls himself a coward, but because of his disillusionment with his own life. (Source: Banana Fish Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_13580.jpg'),
(122, 'Eiji Okumura', '奥村英二', '主角', 'Kenji Nojima', '__Height:__ 172 cm __Nationality:__ Japanese __Languages:__ Japanese, English __Background:__ Eiji was a talented athlete and pole vaulter in Japan, until a injury left him unable to compete. Completely discouraged, faced with losing his sports scholarship, and ridiculed by his former competitors and coaches, Eiji fell into a depressed slump. Then Ibe took him in as his assistant, and the two traveled to New York City, to do a report on youth in street gangs. In New York, Eiji met Ash Lynx. __Best 80''s Fashion Statement:__ Hawaiin shirt over a tank top, tied in the front, falling off one shoulder. __Inspiration:__ In an interview, author Akimi Yoshida said that the character design for Eiji was inspired by Japanese actor Nomura Hironobu.', '/uploads/images/c_21928.jpg'),
(122, 'Sing Soo-Ling', 'シン・スウ・リン', '配角', 'Shouya Chiba', '**Height:** 165 cm, 191 cm (Garden of Light) **Nationality:** Chinese-American Sing Soo-Ling is the current leader of the Chinatown mafia, the younger half-brother of Lao Yen Tai.', '/uploads/images/c_29567.jpg'),
(122, 'Max Lobo', 'マックス・ロボ', '配角', 'Hiroaki Hirata', '__May contain spoilers:__ "Max Lobo" is the pen name of Max Glenreed, a good-natured Vietnam veteran, former cop, journalist, novelist, and jailbird. As a journalist, Max wrote a regular column for the Village Tribune. He also wrote a novel about the Vietnam war called Seven Hundred and Thirty Days in Saigon. When we first meet Max in the manga, he is jailed for punching a cop. However, considering his cozy relationship with Charlie, Antonio, and even the prison guards, there is a strong suggestion that Max is keeping himself in jail as long as he wants. He practically brags that he could get out at any time; however, staying locked up seems to be serving the purpose of good old-fashioned investigative journalism. Ever since the Vietnam war, Max has been hot on the trail of "Banana Fish," and has secretly been collecting notes and research for years. In Vietnam, his close friend Griffin Callenreese took some illicit drugs and went on bad trip, going on a shooting rampage and killing fellow members of his unit; it was Max, ultimately, who shot Griff''s legs out from underneath him and stopped the carnage. Max had to abandon Griffin to the "nut house" in Saigon, although after the end of the war, he spent years searching for Griffin''s whereabouts. To this day, Max is haunted by the memory of Griffin. Later on in the story, this guilt drives him to protect Ash from danger, despite the antagonistic relationship that Ash initially forces him into. Max provides a lot of comic relief', '/uploads/images/c_29575.jpg'),
(122, 'Yue-Lung Lee', '李月龍', '配角', 'Jun Fukuyama', '__Height__:172 cm He is one of the main antagonists of the series and the youngest son of the Lee family, the largest crime family in China. (Source: BANANA FISH Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_29576.jpg'),
(122, 'Shorter Wong', 'ショーター・ウォン', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', 'Shorter is the "boss" of Chinatown, a loyal friend to Ash, and a criminal with a heart of gold. Like Ash, Shorter is an unusual "thug" with a deep sense of honor, and a drive to always do the right thing. He''ll go to any lengths to protect his loved ones... even when the interests of those closest to him come into irreconcilable conflict. Shorter is clever, resourceful, and as tough as steel. He''s equally skilled at brawling, shooting, and sneaking around like a shadowy thief. Shorter can disguise himself as a completely different person, and fool even Eiji into thinking that he is a dotty old Chinese man. Shorter has an irrepressible sense of humor and can wear a lopsided, devilish grin even during the grimmest of circumstances. Like Ash, he is a charismatic leader who can easily unite the other kids on the street under his rule. At the beginning of the series, Shorter has a mohawk hairdo. But by volume two he has shaved off all of his hair and is completely bald. Shorter''s trademark fashion statement is his ever-present sunglasses. He even wears them while sneaking around a cornfield in the middle of the night! In an interview, Akimi Yoshida said that Shorter''s character design was inspired by Sanburaza Nakano. (Source: boukenshin.net, HotaruKara)', '/uploads/images/c_29577.jpg'),
(122, 'Blanca', 'ブランカ', '配角', 'Toshiyuki Morikawa', '__Height:__ 196 cm (6''5") __Hair Color:__ Brown A retired assassin and the man who trained [Ash Lynx](https://anilist.co/character/13580/Ash-Lynx) to become heir to [Dino Golzine](https://anilist.co/character/132705/Dino-Francis-Golzine). Even though he cares for Ash, Blanca is a highly effective killer who dutifully carries out any contract he is hired for, such as when he is hired by [Yut-Lung](https://anilist.co/character/29576/YueLung-Lee) to murder [Eiji Okumura](https://anilist.co/character/21928/Eiji-Okumura). Ultimately declining to, Blanca instead defects to Ash''s gang. He is shown to have excellent hand to hand combat skills, and insanely talented at long-range sniping.', '/uploads/images/c_32597.jpg'),
(122, 'Shunichi Ibe', '伊部 俊一', '配角', 'Shinji Kawada', 'A Japanese photojournalist who comes to New York City to do a report on street gangs.', '/uploads/images/c_127039.jpg'),
(122, 'Skip', 'スキップ', '配角', 'Ayumu Murase', 'An African-American boy, and member of Ash''s gang.', '/uploads/images/c_127040.jpg'),
(122, 'Dino Golzine', 'ディノ・フランシス・ゴルツィネ', '配角', 'Unshou Ishizuka', '__Height__: 178 cm A major mafia boss in New York City, and the adoptive guardian of Ash Lynx. He has a taste for young boys.', '/uploads/images/c_132705.jpg'),
(122, 'Frederick Arthur', 'フレデリック・オーサー', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', '__Height__: 182 cm A vindictive and cruel ex-member of Ash''s street gang, who allies himself with Golzine in order to usurp Ash.', '/uploads/images/c_132720.jpg'),
(122, 'Alex', 'アレックス', '配角', 'Haruki Ishiya', 'Alex is the second-in-command in Ash''s Gang.', '/uploads/images/c_142038.jpg'),
(122, 'Jim Callenreese', 'ジム・カーレンリース', '配角', 'Mitsuaki Hoshino', 'Jim Callenreese is Ash and Griffin''s dad.', '/uploads/images/c_142039.jpg'),
(122, 'Charlie Dickinson', 'チャーリー・ディキンソン', '配角', 'Youji Ueda', 'Charlie Dickinson is a homicide detective as well as a friend of Max, when the two later met in a police academy.', '/uploads/images/c_142040.jpg'),
(122, 'Michael Glenreed', 'マイケル', '配角', 'Miyu Tomita', 'Michael Glenreed is the son of Max and Jessica.', '/uploads/images/c_142043.jpg'),
(122, 'Alexis Dawson', 'アレクシス・ドースン', '配角', 'Hidenari Ugaki', 'Alexis Dawson is a pathologist at the University of California.', '/uploads/images/c_142044.jpg'),
(122, 'Dr. Meredith', 'ドクター・メレディス', '配角', 'Takashi Nagasako', 'Dr. Meredith is a back alley doctor. He helps Ash both with looking after Griffin, and finding out what a white powdery substance is that''s not heroin.', '/uploads/images/c_142152.jpg'),
(122, 'Hua Lung Lee', '李華龍', '配角', 'Shuuhei Sakaguchi', 'Lee Hua Lung is one of the Lee brothers.', '/uploads/images/c_142153.jpg'),
(122, 'Nadia Wong', 'マーディア・ウォン', '配角', 'Umeka Shouji', 'Shorter''s sister. She works at Chang Dai restaurant in Chinatown.', '/uploads/images/c_142154.jpg'),
(122, 'Wang Lung Lee', '李王龍', '配角', 'Hisao Egawa', 'Lee Wang Lung is the eldest child and heir to the Lee family.', '/uploads/images/c_142155.jpg'),
(122, 'Eduardo L. Fox', 'エドアル ・L・フォックス', '配角', 'Kenyuu Horiuchi', '**Height:** 190 cm He is the leader of a mercenary group and former regimental leader of the French Foreign Legion.', '/uploads/images/c_142157.jpg'),
(122, 'Cain Blood', 'ケイン・ブラッド', '配角', 'Kenta Miyake', '__Height__: 192 cm The Boss of African-American youth gang Black Sabbath. Referees Ash''s fight with Arthur and later supports Ash and his gang in the war against the Corsican mafia.', '/uploads/images/c_142159.jpg'),
(122, 'Marvin Crosby', 'マービン・クロスビー', '配角', 'Katashi Ishizuka', 'Works for Dino Golzine.', '/uploads/images/c_142160.jpg'),
(122, 'Yuen-Tai Lao', 'ラオ・イェン・タイ', '配角', 'Souma Saitou', 'Lao Yen Tai is Sing''s half-brother. ~!Though Sing forgives Ash Lynx for killing Shorter Wong, after being told about Banana Fish, Lao is not told the truth about Shorter''s death and continues to distrust him and resents Sing''s deference to Ash in the ongoing gang war.!~', '/uploads/images/c_142161.jpg'),
(122, 'Abraham Dawson', 'エイブラハム・ドースン', '配角', 'Yuu Hayashi', 'Abraham Dawson is the younger brother of Alexis, who defied his brother''s wishes to destroy Banana Fish, and continues to develop and weaponize the drug for the Corsican mob into his adulthood. As a doctor during the Vietnam War, he tested Banana Fish on unknowing soldiers, including Griffin in Banana Fish. ~!He was later shot by Ash Lynx for experimenting on Shorter Wong.!~', '/uploads/images/c_142162.jpg'),
(122, 'Jennifer', 'ジェニファ', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', 'Lives with Jim Callenreese. She''s the stepmom of Ash and Griffin.', '/uploads/images/c_142163.jpg'),
(122, 'Antonio Jenkins', 'ジェンキンズ', '配角', 'Mitsuru Ogata', 'He is a homicide detective.', '/uploads/images/c_142164.jpg'),
(122, 'Jessica Randy', 'ジェシカ・ランディ', '配角', 'Rica Fukami', 'She is a journalist, as well as the ex-wife of Max and mother of Michael.', '/uploads/images/c_142165.jpg'),
(122, 'Bones', 'ボーンズ', '配角', 'Masato Niwa', 'Bones is a lieutenant in Ash''s gang.', '/uploads/images/c_205479.jpg'),
(123, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(123, 'Yousei Yunde', '妖精弓手', '配角', 'Nao Touyama', 'A high elf adventurer. She came with Dwarf Shaman and Lizard Priest to find Goblin Slayer and recruit his help. They face some trouble earlier as they are unable to pronounce "Goblin Slayer" and refer to him in other names, until they find him. They revel their objective; due to the increase in other demon monsters, there are not enough people to deal with Goblins and the elf army cannot mobilize to attack goblins as it would create suspicion and panic, if the army were focusing only on taking out the weakest monsters. They wish to hire Goblin Slayer to help them kill goblins. Her party also joins him to help him. She initially looks down on Goblin Slayer, due to his unkempt and weak appearance, but later comes to respect him, when she sees him in battle. She is a light-weight when it comes to drinking. She is Silver Rank.', '/uploads/images/c_126457.png'),
(123, 'Goblin Slayer', 'ゴブリンスレイヤー', '主角', 'Yuuichirou Umehara', 'The series'' main character, an experienced silver ranked adventurer who only concerns himself with hunting goblins. The jobs he takes merely involve goblins and he takes no interest in others. His appearance is not as glamorous or elegant due to using equipment that would seem lacking for an adventurer of his rank. He wears a gray suit of grubby leather armor, with chainmail underneath, a small buckler shield with a sharpened rim attached on his left forearm. His weapon is a sword of strange length, of cheap quality, which he carries in a makeshift scabbard, allowing him to place swords of any shape he salvages. Due to the excellent sense of smell goblins possess, Goblin Slayer has a habit of neglecting the cleanliness of his armor, as clean equipment would reek of metal, which would immediately alert his foes. Stoic and calm, he seems not to mind the jeers the other adventurers rebuke him for his appearance which doesn''t befit his rank. As he has little regard for matters that don''t include goblins, he has difficulty socializing, since he lacks the ability to understand most basic social norms. Nonetheless, reserved as he might be, he does care about others, as evidenced by when he asks Guild Girl which other parties, usually entirely formed by rookies, have accepted goblin slaying quests, in order to judge if they might be able to handle the job or should he lend them a hand. His style of combat favors more on pragmatism such as setting traps, using their own weapon against', '/uploads/images/c_126458.png'),
(123, 'Onna Shinkan', '女神官', '主角', 'Yui Ogura', '__Race:__ Human __Rank:__ Obsidian (Previously), Porcelain (Previously), Steel (current rank) The main female protagonist. She is a porcelain rank adventurer, the lowest rank as she had just joined. Her personality consist of being young, kind, and a generally helpful person. She is capable of using healing magic and protective spells with a high amount of proficiency. After her first goblin hunt rapidly goes downhill and saved by Goblin Slayer, she joins with him as a new party. Even after the events of her first job, she still wishes to be an adventurer and helps her party however she can. As she fights along Goblin Slayer, she learns how to use spells alternatively, gaining new spells, and has started to wear armour as the story progresses. Her backstory is that of an orphan raised in a temple into priesthood along with other orphans like her. Since coming of age, she decided to leave the temple and help adventurers in need', '/uploads/images/c_126483.jpg'),
(123, 'Ushikai Musume', '牛飼娘', '配角', 'Yuka Iguchi', 'Cow Girl is the childhood friend of [Goblin Slayer](https://anilist.co/character/126458) and a farm hand on her uncle''s farm. ~!Her uncle took her in on his farm after her family was massacred by goblins during her childhood.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126484.jpg'),
(123, 'Uketsuke-jou', '受付嬢', '配角', 'Maaya Uchida', 'A young woman who runs the Guild''s front office as a receptionist and hands out contracts to adventurers. She shows concern over the villages pleading for help against the goblins and is exasperated from how few experienced adventurers would take such jobs. This problem would leave inexperienced rookies to die from them or worse. She holds great amounts of respect for Goblin Slayer, due to his willingness to take on many goblin contracts others would not touch.', '/uploads/images/c_126485.jpg'),
(123, 'Majo', '魔女', '配角', 'Youko Hikasa', 'Witch is a silver ranked adventurer who is in a party with [Spearman](https://anilist.co/character/126488/Yaritsukai). She is a beautiful spell-caster with long, purple hair who wears a revealing set of robes, dark colored with gold yellow outlining. She is usually shown as being rather seductive, acting in a rather amorous manner, often suggesting sexual undertones in otherwise normal conversation, which causes those she interacts with to become flustered or embarrassed. Despite her teasing, she is shown to be caring of those around her, offering advice and help to those who need it. She tends to speak in terse and paused sentences. As a powerful spellcaster, she is known to posess at least the spells Inflammarae (burn), Magic Missile, and Missile Deflect. She is shown using her Inflammarae spell to light a smoking pipe, to which she herself admits is quite the waste. Witch is first shown helping [Priestess](https://anilist.co/character/126483/Onna-Shinkan) get away from a pair of privy newbies who wanted to scout her for their own party. She also gives her advice on her current situation with [Goblin Slayer](https://anilist.co/character/126458/Goblin-Slayer), explaining she did him a favor by selling him a magic scroll not too long ago, but without entering into much more detail.', '/uploads/images/c_126486.png'),
(123, 'Tokage Souryo', '蜥蜴僧侶', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', 'A lizardman adventurer who forms a party with High Elf Archer and Dwarf Shaman. They later team up with Goblin Slayer and Priestess. His rank is silver, the third highest rank. Calm and composed, he speaks to people politely and adresses them in a respectful manner. He seems to be the most soft-spoken, even-tempered, and sociable member of the party. Lizard Priest has green skin and horns on his head. His intimidating visage and towering stature makes him come off as unnerving, even to his friends. He wears what is presumed to be the traditional garb among priests in his people. Lizard Priest is a skilled close quarters combatant, proficient with his curved blades. By using a catalyst, he is able to summon a Dragon-Tooth Warrior, a bipedal draconian skeleton, as an ally. In addition, he is capable of using healing magic to a degree. When he tries out cheese, he instantly becomes enamored with the taste, and often calls it "sweet nectar" or "the nectar of the gods", since he finds it extremely exotic as his people do not practice the art of raising livestock.', '/uploads/images/c_126487.jpg'),
(123, 'Yaritsukai', '槍使い', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'Spearman is a silver-ranked adventurer based in the frontier. He is the partner of Witch. As a silver ranked adventurer, the third highest rank attainable, he induces the respect of his fellow adventurers, especially newbies, who look up to him. He has brown spiky hair, and has light red earrings matching the color of his eyes. He wears a resplendent blue armor and is equipped with his singature weapon, a spear. Extremely confident in his abilities, he is keen on trying to impress other people in the Adventurer''s Guild by boasting about his skills, and he can be often seen doing so at the desk in front of Guild Girl. ~!It is quite apparent he has somewhat of a crush on Guild Girl, since he is always trying to show off in front of her.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126488.jpg'),
(123, 'Kouhito Doushi', '鉱人道士', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', 'A dwarf and a member of the party with Lizard Priest and High Elf Archer. They team up with Goblin Slayer and Priestess in order to infiltrate some ruins invaded by goblins. As a silver adventurer, he is an experienced spell caster. Well-built and with good physique despite his short stature, Dwarf Shaman''s long hair is completely white, which he ties up in a ponytail, and the beard he often strokes is elaborately braided. His earlobes have been elongated and are pierced by earrings. His priest garment is completely white, which contrasts with his dark colored gloves and bracers and the piece of armor he wears on his lower torso. He is cheerful and happy most of the time and can be often seen arguing with High Elf Archer over the most trivial matters, but they do so without malice.', '/uploads/images/c_128254.jpg'),
(123, 'Tsurugi no Otome', '剣の乙女', '配角', 'Aya Endou', 'A former gold-ranked adventurer who currently serves as the Temple of Law''s Archbishop of the Supreme God.', '/uploads/images/c_129080.png'),
(123, 'Minarai Seishokusha', '見習い聖職者', '配角', 'Ayasa Itou', 'A porcelain ranked adventurer who is a two person party with Rookie Warrior', '/uploads/images/c_131808.jpg'),
(123, 'Kajiya', '鍛冶屋', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', 'He is the local blacksmith whose establishment is close to the Adventurer''s Guild.', '/uploads/images/c_131809.jpg'),
(123, 'Yuusha', '勇者', '配角', 'Miyuri Shimabukuro', 'Yuusha is a young girl who became a platinum-ranked adventurer after defeating the Demon Lord. Along with her party, she battles the Demon Lord''s forces and other powerful threats. - In the light novel Yuusha has dark cyan-colored eyes and long black hair, with a single strand pointed upward.', '/uploads/images/c_131810.png'),
(123, 'Rhea Sekkou', '圃人斥候', '配角', 'Mutsuki Iwanaka', 'An adventurer who was a member of a party of steel-ranked adventurers. He is a greedy and selfish individual who attempts to keep up a friendly facade. ~!However, when he loses his composure, he is willing to kill people to vent his frustrations.!~', '/uploads/images/c_131811.png'),
(123, 'Omoi Kenshi', '重い剣士', '配角', 'Daiki Hamano', 'Race: Human Job: Adventurer Rank: Silver Affiliation: Adventurer''s Guildis A silver ranked adventurer. He is currently acting as an instructor teaching new adventurers basic combat.', '/uploads/images/c_131812.jpg'),
(123, 'Ushikai Musume no Oji', '牛飼い娘の叔父', '配角', 'Daichi Hayashi', 'His family runs a dairy farm just outside of town for several generations. When his younger sister married, she moved out of the Dairy Farm to her husband''s village, leaving him the sole heir to the farm. He is the uncle of Cow Girl and the landlord of Goblin Slayer.', '/uploads/images/c_131813.jpg'),
(123, 'Senshi', '戦士', '配角', 'Yasuaki Takumi', 'An adventurer in a newbie party that was tasked with a goblin slaying quest. ~!He was a rookie adventurer in a party with Wizard, Priestess and Fighter. They took on a job to exterminate goblins believing it would be easy. However, upon entering the goblins'' cave, they were ambushed. Warrior managed to kill several goblins but was stabbed in the leg by a goblin. As he attempted to swing his sword again, it fell off his hand when it hit the side of the cave and Warrior was swarmed and hacked to death by goblin!~', '/uploads/images/c_131814.png'),
(123, 'Butouka', '武闘家', '配角', 'Shizuka Ishigami', 'A former adventurer who retired after her disastrous first quest. ~!Along with two of her friends, they decided to become adventurers. They recruited Priestess to be part of their party before taking on a goblin slaying quest. As they entered the caves, they are ambushed by goblins who critically injure Wizard and maul Warrior to death. She tells Priestess to take Wizard and leave her to fend off the goblins. She easily took down some of the goblins until the hobgoblin entered the fray, who easily overpowers her. The goblins proceeded to rape her until Goblin Slayer came to her rescue. After the incident, she became traumatized and unresponsive, thus was immediately relinquished from being an adventurer. She was then seen being brought to a temple with the other women who were also captured by the goblins to recover.!~', '/uploads/images/c_131815.png'),
(123, 'Hitojichi Yousei Teisatsu', '人質妖精偵察', '配角', 'Ikumi Hasegawa', 'An unnamed elf scout was a scout for a nearby Elf settlement in the forest who was assigned to spy on a goblin nest and draw up a map of the ruins they inhabited.', '/uploads/images/c_131816.jpg'),
(123, 'Mahoutsukai', '魔法使い', '配角', 'Kotori Koiwai', 'A spell-casting adventurer who was part of a porcelain-ranked party on a goblin slaying quest. She had graduated at the top of her class from the academy in the Capital where she had learned her spells. ~!After graduating, she joined a party who decided to take a goblin slaying quest. Entering a cave, they were soon attacked by goblins from side tunnels they had failed to notice and quickly overpower Wizard. In a fit of rage she flailed wildly, but stopped after being stabbed in the abdomen. Unable to save the other party members, Priestess attempted to heal Wizard''s wound, but only worsened her condition. When Goblin Slayer arrived, he revealed that the dagger she was stabbed with was poisoned. Wizard begged him to kill her, which Goblin Slayer obliged.!~', '/uploads/images/c_131817.png'),
(123, 'Onna Kishi', '女騎士', '配角', 'Yukiyo Fujii', '__Race:__ Human __Job:__ Adventurer __Title:__ Paladin+__Affiliation:__ Adventurer''s Guild She is a young woman with long blonde hair and is clad in white body-fitting armor and a cape, although the anime shows the former to be grey with gold bits.', '/uploads/images/c_131819.png'),
(123, 'Shoshinsha Senshi', '初心者戦士', '配角', 'Seiji Maeda', 'He is a porcelain ranked adventurer who is in a two person party with Apprentice Cleric', '/uploads/images/c_131820.jpg'),
(123, 'Goblin Slayer no Ane', 'ゴブリンスレイヤーの姉', '配角', 'Reina Ueda', 'Was the sole loved one of Goblin Slayer during his childhood. Her death is the primary circumstance that triggered Goblin Slayer''s obsessive trait to kill all the Goblins.', '/uploads/images/c_131821.png'),
(123, 'Goblins', 'ゴブリン', '配角', 'Kaito Takeda', 'Monsters that destroy and steal anything they come across. They all have a predisposition to hate "those with words".', '/uploads/images/c_132632.jpg'),
(123, 'Goblin Lord', 'ゴブリンロード', '配角', 'Kazuhiko Inoue', 'Having lived a long life, the Goblin Lord fancies himself as being far more cunning and intelligent than the other Goblins in his forces. To that end, he is willing to sacrifice them for the sake of getting away, knowing he can grow even more clever and resourceful over time. However, despite his ambition and position as a leader of goblins, he does not care about the others of his kind and views them as dispensable resources. As such, like every goblin, he prioritizes his personal preservation above all else. He loathes begging for his life and bending the knee to any others, especially to humans, and only uses it as a means of getting the upper hand​.', '/uploads/images/c_132708.jpg'),
(123, 'Shoujo Fujutsushi', '少女巫術師', '配角', 'Sayaka Harada', '__Age:__ +20 __Race:__ Rhea __Job:__ Adventurer __Rank:__ Bronze __Affiliation:__ Adventurer''s Guild - Heavy Warrior''s Party Druid Girl has a kind disposition and is friendly towards others. She tries to give advice to newer adventurers when given the chance.', '/uploads/images/c_132710.jpg'),
(123, 'Goblin Champion', 'ゴブリンチャンピオン', '配角', 'Masashi Yamane', 'Heroes of the Goblin race; those that have become large enough to even be seen as ogres in terms of strength. They often lack in intelligence, but are capable fighters that can give even veteran adventurers trouble. (Considered to be the silver-ranked among goblins).', '/uploads/images/c_134322.jpg'),
(123, 'Kantoku-kan', '監督官', '配角', 'Natsumi Hioka', 'She is a receptionist working at the Adventurer''s Guild in the frontier and a priest of the Supreme God. She is Guild Girl''s co-worker.', '/uploads/images/c_134323.png'),
(124, 'Rimuru Tempest', 'リムル・テンペスト', '主角', 'Miho Okasaki', '__Species:__ Human (past life) → Slime __Kind:__ Reincarnated, Otherworlder Rimuru Tempest, formerly known as Satoru Mikami, is the main protagonist of Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken. They are the founder and King of the monster country Tempest, situated in the Great Jura Forest, and the partner and sworn friend of Storm Dragon, [Veldora Tempest](https://anilist.co/character/128034/Veldora-Tempest).', '/uploads/images/c_123962.png'),
(124, 'Shion', 'シオン', '配角', 'Mao Ichimichi', '"War Lord" Shion is Rimuru’s first servant to be in charge of his care as his personal secretary. She is also the leader of the Yomigaeri and also one of Rimuru''s strongest fighters and is coveted by many of the Demon Lords who have met her.', '/uploads/images/c_128033.png'),
(124, 'Veldora Tempest', 'ヴェルドラ＝テンペスト', '配角', 'Tomoaki Maeno', '__Height:__ 210 cm (human form), 100 m (dragon form) __Species:__ True Dragon __Blessing / Divine Protection:__ Storm Dragon''s Grace, Demon Lord''s Ally __Disaster Rank:__ Catastrophe Veldora Tempest is the youngest of the four strongest dragons (True Dragons). He is connected with [Rimuru](https://anilist.co/character/123962) by an agreement and was known to rampage here and there. He was the one to name Rimuru and Rimuru gave him his last name, since they share the same last name, Rimuru could technically be classified as Veldora''s adoptive brother.', '/uploads/images/c_128034.png'),
(124, 'Ranga', 'ランガ', '配角', 'Chikahiro Kobayashi', '"Star Lord" Ranga is a Wind Spirit Wolf and a loyal follower of [Rimuru](https://anilist.co/character/123962/Tempest-Rimuru). The leader of the Star Wolf Clan, and the son of the previous boss of the Direwolves. He is also one of Rimuru''s Twelve Patrons who has been given the title of a "Lord".', '/uploads/images/c_128035.png'),
(124, 'Milim Nava', 'ミリム・ナーヴァ', '配角', 'Rina Hidaka', '__Kind:__ Inhabitant "Destroyer" Milim Nava is one of the oldest and strongest Demon Lords. She is a Dragonoid. Her nickname, Destroyer, is not just for show. She is a demon lord one should never fight against.', '/uploads/images/c_128036.png'),
(124, 'Shizu', 'シズ', '配角', 'Yumiri Hanamori', 'Shizu was the companion of the previous Hero and a Japanese Summoned One. She is also known as the "Explosive Monarch", an A ranked Adventurer of the Freedom Association''s Headquarters, and the formal homeroom teacher of the Freedom Academy''s S Class students. She was also the mentor of several excellent pupils whom became important figures of society.', '/uploads/images/c_128037.jpg'),
(124, 'Benimaru', 'ベニマル', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', 'Benimaru is one of the third group of subordinate Monsters to be named by Rimuru Tempest. Originally an Ogre, he was uncertain of his servitude and intended for it to be temporary, but after being named, he evolved into a Kijin, immediately becoming Rimuru''s most powerful subordinate for a time, and decided to serve him permanently. He lives in the Capital city of the Jura Tempest Federation: Rimuru City. Soon after, and became Commander-in-Chief, giving him direct command over Tempest''s military forces. Upon Rimuru''s ascension to a True Demon Lord, Benimaru evolved into a Fair Oni and reached the strength of a Disaster-Class Monster.', '/uploads/images/c_128038.png'),
(124, 'Souei', 'ソウエイ', '配角', 'Takuya Eguchi', '__Height__: 180 cm (Kijin), 190 cm (Ogre) Souei is an Ogre that was among the third group of subordinates to be named by Rimuru Tempest. He is Rimuru''s faithful shadow and the leader of the Shadow Squad of the Jura Tempest Federation.', '/uploads/images/c_128039.png'),
(124, 'Shuna', 'シュナ', '配角', 'Sayaka Senbongi', 'Shuna is one of the third group of subordinate Monsters to be named by [Rimuru](https://anilist.co/character/123962), evolving her from an Ogre to a Kijin. She was originally the princess of the Ogre tribe and even though she had the talent for using Magic, she was a sheltered girl, but quickly got along with the Goblinas Shuna is the daughter of the late ogre chieftain and she is also [Benimaru](https://anilist.co/character/128038)''s younger sister, which is why she''s nicknamed "Oni Princess" by Rimuru. Very skilled and knowledgeable in domestic matters, she essentially becomes Rimuru''s chief economic advisor together with [Rigurd](https://anilist.co/character/129348).', '/uploads/images/c_128040.png'),
(124, 'Daikenja', '大賢者', '配角', 'Megumi Toyoguchi', 'Unique Skill Great Sage is one of the first two Unique Skills (the other being Predator) that [Rimuru Tempest](https://anilist.co/character/123962/Rimuru-Tempest) had upon being born into his new world. It had evolved from Extra Skill Sage during his death, as he thought since he was approaching his forties as a virgin, he must be something much greater than a mere wizard. ~!During Rimuru''s evolution into Demon Lord this Unique Skill evolved into the Ultimate Skill: Wisdom King Raphael.!~ ~!Rimuru gave her a name and she evolved into a manas with the name Ciel!~', '/uploads/images/c_129347.jpg'),
(124, 'Rigurd', 'リグルド', '配角', 'Kanehira Yamamoto', 'Formerly the chief of the goblin village Rimuru comes across. He''s now the acting prime minister of the Jura Tempest Federation. He evolved into a hobgoblin when Rimuru named him.', '/uploads/images/c_129348.jpg'),
(124, 'Rigur', 'リグル', '配角', 'Haruki Ishiya', 'Rigur was named after his late elder brother. Rigur, after making Gobuta the garrison squad leader, has been supporting his father Rigurdo.', '/uploads/images/c_129349.jpg'),
(124, 'Gobta', 'ゴブタ', '配角', 'Asuna Tomari', 'Gobta is a hobgoblin and is one of Rimuru Tempest''s followers. Though he seems to be air-headed he tends to be a hard-worker and dependable when the time calls for it.', '/uploads/images/c_129350.jpg'),
(124, 'Myrd', 'ミルド', '配角', 'Masashi Nogawa', 'Myrd is younger brother of Garm and Dord. Though he was a dwarf of few words, he was an expert at what he does. Having knowledge in construction, and well-versed in the arts, he is a one of a kind genius. Myrd was appointed as the captain of the construction team.', '/uploads/images/c_129914.jpg'),
(124, 'Kaijin', 'カイジン', '配角', 'Atsushi Ono', 'Kaijin was a blacksmith of the Dwarven Kingdom, and the brother of Kaidou. After he was exiled from his own country, he became Rimuru Tempest''s subordinate, and helped build the Monster City "Tempest", he acted as a builder, blacksmith, and craftsmen. He also was the former commander of the Dwargon Engineering Corps.', '/uploads/images/c_129915.jpg'),
(124, 'Gido', 'ギド', '配角', 'Ryuuichi Kijima', 'Gido is a member of Cabal''s Party who serves as the ''thief'' role. ~!However, he is actually serving as one of the bodyguards of Lady Elyune secretly while under the guise of an adventurer.!~ (Source: Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_129916.jpg'),
(124, 'Dord', 'ドルド', '配角', 'Ryou Sugisaki', 'Dord, the middle brother of Garm and Mild. He is known for his first-­rate craftsmanship. Dord focuses more on dyes and high class attire.', '/uploads/images/c_129917.jpg'),
(124, 'Kaval', 'カバル', '配角', 'Kengo Takanashi', 'Kaval is the leader of his adventure''s party, where he serves as the ''fighter'' role. ~!Alongside Gido, he is also tasked as the secret bodyguard of Lady Elyune under the guise of an adventurer.!~ (Source: Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_129918.jpg'),
(124, 'Ellen', 'エレン', '配角', 'Akane Kumada', 'Eren is an adventurer and a member of Kaval''s Party. ~!She is actually the daughter of the Duke of Sorcerer''s Dynasty Sarion Elalude, who ran off to be an adventurer due to her selfishness and free-spirited personality.!~ (Source: Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_129919.jpg'),
(124, 'Garm', 'ガルム', '配角', 'Kouichi Souma', 'Garm, the elder brother of Doldo and Mild. He is a skilled blacksmith. Garm is in charge of everyday clothing and underwear. (Source: Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_129923.jpg'),
(124, 'Diablo', 'ディアブロ', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', 'Diablo is the Black Primordial and a loyal servant of [Rimuru Tempest](https://anilist.co/character/123962/Tempest-Rimuru). Before he met Rimuru, he went by the nicknames Black or Noir, the latter which he received from his fellow Primordial kin. After receiving the name Diablo from Rimuru, he evolved to a Demon Peer.', '/uploads/images/c_131033.jpg'),
(124, 'Ramiris', 'ラミリス', '配角', 'Anzu Haruno', 'Ramiris is a fairy that resides inside of Tempest''s Underground Labyrinth. She is also one of the Eight-Star Demon Lords.', '/uploads/images/c_131034.jpg'),
(124, 'Frey', 'フレイ', '配角', '', '"Sky Queen" Frey is an ex-Demon Lord and currently a subordinate of [Demon Lord Milim Nava](https://anilist.co/character/128036/Nava-Milim). She often scolds Milim for playing around when she is supposed to be working.', '/uploads/images/c_131038.jpg'),
(124, 'Gabiru', 'ガビル', '配角', 'Jun Fukushima', 'The captain of the Hiryuu of Tempest, and the former lizardmen raid leader. He suffers from a superiority complex. The root of Gabil''s pride and confidence​ is the thought that he is the chosen one.', '/uploads/images/c_131041.jpg'),
(124, 'Hakurou', 'ハクロウ', '配角', 'Houchuu Ootsuka', 'Hakurou is a Fair Oni and is a loyal follower of Rimuru Tempest. He was one of the survivors of the Orc attack. He was also the teacher of the Dwarven King.', '/uploads/images/c_131043.png'),
(124, 'Karion', 'カリオン', '配角', 'Yasuaki Takumi', '~!Karion is one of the ten demon lords that existed before Rimuru became a demon lord. During the Walpurgis Banquet where Rimuru killed Clayman. Karion became a subordinate of Milim.!~', '/uploads/images/c_131044.png'),
(124, 'Leon Cromwell', 'レオン・クロムウェル', '配角', 'Jun Fukuyama', 'Leon Cromwell is a former hero and a current Demon Lord of the Eight-pointed Star Octagram. He is the ruler of El Dorado, an island nation located south-west of the world.', '/uploads/images/c_131047.png'),
(124, 'Kurobee', 'クロベエ', '配角', 'Junichi Yanagita', 'Kurobee is a Fair Oni and a loyal follower of Rimuru Tempest. Kurobee was originally one of the Oni that survived the Orc attack. He evolved after being named by Rimuru.', '/uploads/images/c_131051.jpg'),
(124, 'Clayman', 'クレイマン', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', 'Demon Lord Clayman, is one of the ten demon lords that ~!existed before Rimuru became a demon lord. He turned into Kazaream''s underling when Kazaream turned him into a demon lord.!~', '/uploads/images/c_131052.png'),
(124, 'Vesta', 'ベスター', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', 'Bester (ベスター Besutā) is a former minister of Dwargon and is currently the lead researcher of Tempest. ~!After joining Tempest he has become more reliable. He got rid of that sharp personality and mellowed out.!~', '/uploads/images/c_132364.jpg'),
(124, 'Gazel Dwargo', 'ガゼル・ドワルゴ', '配角', 'Takaya Hashi', 'Species: Dwarf Blessing / Divine Protection: Divine Protector of Ancestor Title: King of Armament Nation Dwargon. The king of Dwargon, Gazel Dwargo, the third generation king of Dwargon, but possesses a similar aura to that of his grandfather in his younger days. He is renowned as a great hero and celebrated as a wise king for his impartial rule.', '/uploads/images/c_132727.jpg'),
(124, 'Treyni', 'トレイニー', '配角', 'Rie Tanaka', 'Treyni is a dryad that resides in the Jura Forest.', '/uploads/images/c_132729.jpg'),
(124, 'Souka', 'ソーカ', '配角', 'Rumi Ookubo', 'Gabil''s younger sister, and the daughter of Abil. After the Orc Lord incident, she swears her allegeiance to Rimuru. She attends to Souei as a spy.', '/uploads/images/c_132730.png'),
(124, 'Abil', 'アビル', '配角', 'Tomoyuki Shimura', 'Relatives: Gabil (Son) Souka (Daughter) Occupations: Lizardmen Chief He has a bold personality, but with enough humility. He is a serious person, but he also has many good qualities about him and is a good leader.', '/uploads/images/c_132731.png'),
(124, 'Alice Rondo', 'アリス・ロンド', '配角', 'Haruka Shiraishi', 'One of the children who were incompletely summoned. At 9 years old, Alice is the youngest of the group, and she''s also a bit of a tomboy.', '/uploads/images/c_132746.png'),
(124, 'Garde-Myourmiles', 'ガルド・ミョルマイル', '配角', 'Yutaka Aoyama', 'An influential merchant from the kingdom of Burumund. Myorumairu is both the chairman of the Burumund shopping district and also a loan shark.', '/uploads/images/c_132749.jpg'),
(124, 'Kenya Misaki', '三崎剣也', '配角', 'Ayaka Asai', 'A member of a group of children who were incompletely summoned. He is the leader of the pack and has a lively disposition.', '/uploads/images/c_132751.png'),
(124, 'Ryouta Sekiguchi', '関口良太', '配角', 'Shizuka Ishigami', 'One of the children who were incompletely summoned. Ryota has a shy personality, but he generally gets along well with Kenya.', '/uploads/images/c_132753.jpg'),
(124, 'Yuuki Kagurazaka', '神楽坂優樹', '配角', 'Natsuki Hanae', 'A former student of Shizu who originally came from Japan and ~!one of the main antagonists of the series. !~ Yuuki serves as the Guild Master of the Adventurers'' Guild in the kingdom of Ingracia, and he loves manga. ~!Although Yuuki first comes as a friendly person he is actually a master in manipulating others without hesitation to achieve his goal of a just world that treats everyone fairly. Even though Rimuru and Yuuki get along at first he later addresses Rimuru as a very serious threat to his plans. !~', '/uploads/images/c_132755.jpg'),
(124, 'Gale Gibson', 'ゲイル・ギブスン', '配角', 'Gen Satou', 'One of the children who were incompletely summoned. At 11 years old, he is the eldest of the group.', '/uploads/images/c_132757.png'),
(124, 'Chloe Aubert', 'クロエ・オベール', '配角', 'Azusa Tadokoro', 'One of the children who were incompletely summoned. Chloe is a quiet child who loves books.', '/uploads/images/c_132760.jpg'),
(124, 'Gelmud', 'ゲルミュッド', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', 'A majin that served Demon Lord Clayman of the Ten Great Demon Lords. He wanted to make Orc Lord the new Demon Lord and manipulate him but instead was devoured by it.', '/uploads/images/c_133521.jpg'),
(124, 'Geld', 'ゲルド', '配角', 'Tarou Yamaguchi', 'He is one of the fourth group of subordinates to be named by Rimuru Tempest. As the right-hand man of the deceased Orc Lord, he was given the same name as him, as a memento and token of appreciation, similar to how Rigur was named after his older brother. As an Orc King, he is the leader of the Yellow Corps, that acts as both the last line of defense for Tempest as well as the main team of the country''s Department of Construction and Manufacturing. Later on, he was given the Title of a "Lord" as one of Rimuru''s Twelve Patrons.', '/uploads/images/c_133522.jpg'),
(124, 'Tear', 'ティア', '配角', 'Kaede Hondo', 'Member of the Moderate Jesters alongside Laplace and Footman, and as that loyal subordinate of Demon Lord Kazaream.', '/uploads/images/c_134576.jpg'),
(124, 'Miho Sawatari', '沢渡美穂', '配角', 'Yuka Nukui', 'She is Tamura''s fiancee.', '/uploads/images/c_134578.jpg'),
(124, 'Kaidou', '海道', '配角', 'Shouto Kashii', 'He is the captain of the guards of Dwargon, and Kaijin''s younger brother.', '/uploads/images/c_134579.jpg'),
(124, 'Fuze', 'フューズ', '配角', 'Ken Narita', 'He is the Brumund Kingdom''s Freedom Association, Guild Master.', '/uploads/images/c_134580.jpg'),
(124, 'Velyard', 'ベルヤード', '配角', 'Itaru Yamamoto', 'Baron Velyard is one of Blumund’s ministers. He is a landless baron.', '/uploads/images/c_134581.jpg'),
(124, 'Youm Farmenas', 'ヨウム・ファルメナス', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', 'The Hero-King Farmenas of the Farmenas Kingdom. Formerly the Farmas Kingdom, Count Nidole Maigam’s Territory''s, Frontier Garrison Captain Youm.', '/uploads/images/c_134582.png'),
(124, 'Ifrit', 'イフリット', '配角', 'Taku Yashiro', 'Ifrit is a high-ranking spirit; the ruler of flame which was sealed within Shizue Izawa by Demon Lord Leon Cromwell. He used to live in Dwelling of the Spirit before he was stolen by the "Blonde Demon" Leon Cromwell. After that, he was sealed within Shizue Izawa. As a result of this, it gave Shizue an extended lifespan.', '/uploads/images/c_134583.png'),
(124, 'Laplace', 'ラプラス', '配角', 'Kazuya Nakai', 'He is the vice-president of the Moderate Jesters and as that a loyal subordinate of Demon Lord Kazaream.', '/uploads/images/c_134593.jpg'),
(124, 'Phobio', 'フォビオ', '配角', 'Seiichirou Yamashita', '__Species:__ Leopard Lycanthrope He is one of the "Beastketeers" of the Demon Lord Karion. He is proclaimed to be the strongest warrior of the 3 "Beastketeers".', '/uploads/images/c_134594.jpg'),
(124, 'Hikari no Seirei', '光の精霊', '配角', 'Tomo Muranaka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_197874.png'),
(124, 'Footman', 'フットマン', '配角', 'Shinji Kawada', 'Footman is a Majin who is part of the Moderate Harlequin Alliance', '/uploads/images/c_198040.jpg'),
(124, 'Gobzo', 'ゴンゾ', '配角', '', 'A Goblin in Tempest thats friends with Gobuta', '/uploads/images/c_213898.jpg'),
(124, 'Ririna', 'リリナ', '配角', '', 'Ririna is one of the 400 Goblins that migrated to Rimuru''s Goblin Village while he was away in Dwargon. After being named by Rimuru, she evolved to a Goblina. She is entrusted by him to manage Tempest''s production affair as its supervisor.', '/uploads/images/c_219458.jpg'),
(124, 'Touka', 'トーカ', '配角', '', 'Souka''s subordinate. She forms part of the Shadow Squad, where she mostly gathers information. She used to live in the Lizardmen marshes but moved to Tempest by Abiru''s order.', '/uploads/images/c_225187.jpg'),
(124, 'Hokusou', '北槍', '配角', '', 'Souka''s subordinate. He forms part of the Shadow Squad, where he mostly gathers information. He used to live in the Lizardmen marshes but moved to Tempest by Abiru''s order.', '/uploads/images/c_225188.png'),
(124, 'Nansou', '南槍', '配角', '', 'Souka''s subordinate. He forms part of the Shadow Squad, where he mostly gathers information. He used to live in the Lizardmen marshes but moved to Tempest by Abiru''s order.', '/uploads/images/c_225191.jpg'),
(124, 'Saika', '西華', '配角', '', 'Souka''s subordinate. She forms part of the Shadow Squad, where she mostly gathers information. She used to live in the Lizardmen marshes but moved to Tempest by Abiru''s order.', '/uploads/images/c_225196.jpg'),
(124, 'Orthos', 'オルトス', '配角', 'Kazuyuki Okitsu', 'Orthos was the true king of the Kingdom of Filtwood. He was a Demon who was thought to be sealed away by a champion named Orthos, but that story was either entirely fabricated, or the demon managed to kill, and later impersonate the champion.', '/uploads/images/c_255591.png'),
(124, 'Kokuou', '国王', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Kikuchi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_255592.jpg'),
(124, 'Yashichi', 'ヤシチ', '配角', 'Akinori Egoshi', '__Race:__ Dragonewt One of [Gabiru](https://anilist.co/character/131041)''s subordinates and friends. Yashichi fervently supports Gabiru through victory and defeat.', '/uploads/images/c_297837.png'),
(124, 'Kakushin', 'カクシン', '配角', 'Hiromichi Tezuka', '__Race:__ Dragonewt One of [Gabiru](https://anilist.co/character/131041)''s subordinates and friends. Yashichi fervently supports Gabiru through victory and defeat.', '/uploads/images/c_297840.png'),
(124, 'Sukerou', 'スケロウ', '配角', 'Yoshihito Sasaki', '__Race:__ Dragonewt One of [Gabiru](https://anilist.co/character/131041)''s subordinates and friends. Yashichi fervently supports Gabiru through victory and defeat.', '/uploads/images/c_297844.png'),
(124, 'Trya', 'トライア', '配角', 'Kana Asumi', 'Trya is a Dryad that resides in the Jura Forest. She is the sister of Treyni.', '/uploads/images/c_301064.png'),
(124, 'Charybdis', 'カリュブディス', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_302552.jpg'),
(124, 'Goblin A', 'ゴブリンA', '配角', 'Makoto Kaneko', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_317487.jpg'),
(124, 'Goblin B', 'ゴブリンB', '配角', 'Chiaki Kobayashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_317488.jpg'),
(125, 'Sakuta Azusagawa', '梓川咲太', '主角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5''7") A strange 2nd year student in high school, who doesn''t have a cellphone in this day and age. He is currently an outcast at school due to rumors of a violent past... but doesn''t seem to care. ~!Sakuta eventually starts dating [Mai Sakurajima](https://anilist.co/character/127222)!~ (Source: Aniplex USA)', '/uploads/images/c_127221.png'),
(125, 'Mai Sakurajima', '桜島麻衣', '主角', 'Asami Seto', '__Height:__ 162 cm (5''4") A 3rd-year student at Minegahara High School. She is serious and polite, but has a strong will. Well known, famous actress, who is currently on hiatus. Because her life had always revolved around her work in entertainment, she remains isolated at school. (Source: Aniplex USA)', '/uploads/images/c_127222.png'),
(125, 'Kaede Azusagawa', '梓川かえで', '主角', 'Yurika Kubo', '__Height:__ 5''4" (162 cm) She is the younger sister of Sakuta Azusagawa. ~!Suffered amnesia and gained a different personality after her ordeal with Adolescence Syndrome stemming from online bullying. Since then, she has lived with Sakuta and has not attended school.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127613.png'),
(125, 'Rio Futaba', '双葉理央', '主角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', '__Height:__ 155 cm (5''1") __Talent:__ Explaining any strange phenomenon with science She is [Sakuta](https://anilist.co/character/127221/Azusagawa-Sakuta)''s classmate, who is always cool and calm, always willing to give various advice on puberty syndrome. She is also the sole member of the Science Club, and known as an eccentric person at the school. (Source: Aniplex USA)', '/uploads/images/c_127633.png'),
(125, 'Tomoe Koga', '古賀朋絵', '主角', 'Nao Touyama', '__Height:__ 150 cm (4''11") A typical 1st year high-school student at Minegahara High School who can take hints, but is slightly scatterbrained. Being overly concerned about how people look at her, she hides her Hakata accent, which comes out when she panics or is relaxed. (Source: Aniplex USA, edited)', '/uploads/images/c_127840.jpg'),
(125, 'Nodoka Toyohama', '豊浜のどか', '主角', 'Maaya Uchida', '__Height:__ 158cm (5''2") __Talent:__ Changing clothes quickly Mai''s half-sister, related through her father. A member of the idol group "Sweet Bullet" and designated as the most fashionable within the group. Despite her flashy looks, she attends an elite all girls'' high school. She is confident and can be competitive. (Source: Aniplex USA)', '/uploads/images/c_127841.png'),
(125, 'Shouko Makinohara', '牧之原翔子', '配角', 'Inori Minase', '__Height:__ 150 cm (4''11") __Talent:__ Early to bed, early to rise A girl who has the same first and last name as [Sakuta](https://anilist.co/character/127221/Azusagawa-Sakuta)''s first crush. She is a shy middle school girl, but reliable and kind. She bumps into Sakuta, while holding an umbrella over an abandoned cat in the rain. ~!It is later revealed that the older Shouko that Sakuta encounters is from the future, and is able to return to the past due to her puberty syndrome.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127843.jpg'),
(125, 'Saki Kamisato', '上里沙希', '配角', 'Himika Akaneya', '[Yuuma](https://anilist.co/character/130307/Yuuma-Kunimi)''s girlfriend. Popular within the school and can be a standoffish person, but she shows great affection towards Yuuma. She is quite protective of him and often clashes with [Sakuta](https://anilist.co/character/127221/Sakuta-Azusagawa) as a result. ~!It is revealed that Saki has an older sister whom her parents often compare her to, causing her to develop low self-esteem. Sakuta believes this to be the reason why she is so protective of Yuuma''s image and her own, as in her eyes she already has a fragile self-image.!~ ~!After graduating she attends the same college as Sakuta and goes into health studies, in the hopes of becoming a nurse in order to help Yuuma whenever she can due to his decision to partake in firefighter training.!~', '/uploads/images/c_130304.png'),
(125, 'Yousuke Maesawa', '前沢陽介', '配角', 'Masaaki Mizunaka', 'A member of the school basketball team. He has an attractive and charming demeanor, but he is ultimately not above slandering other students. Maezawa has bad-mouthed all of his past girlfriends.', '/uploads/images/c_130305.png'),
(125, 'Mai no Haha', '麻衣の母', '配角', 'Airi Ootsu', 'She is the mother of Mai Sakurajima.', '/uploads/images/c_130306.png'),
(125, 'Yuuma Kunimi', '国見佑真', '配角', 'Yuuma Uchida', 'A good friend of [Sakuta Azusagawa](https://anilist.co/character/127221/Sakuta-Azusagawa) and [Rio Futaba](https://anilist.co/character/127633/Rio-Futaba), as well as the boyfriend of [Saki Kamisato](https://anilist.co/character/130304). He is a member of Minegahara High''s basketball team, being quite athletic and popular within the school.', '/uploads/images/c_130307.png'),
(125, 'Fumika Nanjou', '南条文香', '配角', 'Satomi Satou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_144795.png'),
(125, 'Rena Kashiba', '香芝玲奈', '配角', 'Fumiko Uchimura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_144796.png'),
(125, 'Uzuki Hirokawa', '広川卯月', '配角', 'Sora Amamiya', 'The lead singer of idol group Sweet Bullet. Her nickname is Zukky.', '/uploads/images/c_144797.png'),
(125, 'Kotomi Kano', '鹿野琴美', '配角', 'Miho Okasaki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_144798.png'),
(125, 'Tenchou', '店長', '配角', 'Kento Shiraishi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_203396.png'),
(125, 'Azusagawa no Chichi', '梓川の父', '配角', 'Tomoyuki Shimura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_320165.png'),
(125, 'Nana Yoneyama', '米山奈々', '配角', 'Hisako Toujou', 'She is a classmate of Tomoe Koga.', '/uploads/images/c_328162.png'),
(125, 'Nodoka no Haha', 'のどかの母', '配角', 'Rin Namino', 'She is the mother of Nodoka Toyohama.', '/uploads/images/c_328163.png'),
(126, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Akio Ootsuka', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(126, 'Arataka Reigen', '霊幻新隆', '主角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5''10.5") [Mob''s](https://anilist.co/character/89616) mentor and boss in the Mob Psycho 100 series. He owns a business exorcising ghosts and is a self-proclaimed psychic. He is Mob''s moral compass. He was the first person to ever consider Mob as normal and his teachings have never failed Mob.', '/uploads/images/c_89334.png'),
(126, 'Shigeo Kageyama', '影山茂夫', '主角', 'Setsuo Itou', '**Height:** 157 cm He is the assistant and disciple of [Arataka Reigen](https://anilist.co/character/89334/Reigen-Arataka). He is also the newest member of the Body Improvement Club. Shigeo is a quiet and polite individual who tries to live a normal life despite having strong telepathic power, he wants to be seen as a good human among the people in his social life. This often makes him naive and gullible when those with malicious intent want to use him for a laugh or to cause trouble but Shigeo has very strong beliefs to never use his powers to hurt another person because of an altercation he faced once as a child.', '/uploads/images/c_89616.png'),
(126, 'Ekubo', 'エクボ', '主角', 'Akio Ootsuka', 'Ekubo is a self-proclaimed upper-class evil spirit who has aligned himself with [Mob](https://anilist.co/character/89616) after being defeated by him. Ekubo wants to be a god. Specifically, he wants to be worshipped by all humanity. ~!Despite having that kind of ego, he didn''t hesitate to put himself at Mob''s mercy in the hopes of using the boy to his advantage. At first, he wanted to steal Mob''s body and use it to become a god, but he eventually decided to try to make Mob a god instead.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89617.png'),
(126, 'Ritsu Kageyama', '影山律', '配角', 'Miyu Irino', '__Height:__ 159.4 cm Ritsu is very clever and apparently serious, he also serves on the student council and excels in academics and everything else he tries. None of that matters to him as much as psychic power, however, his brother is more important to him than anyone or anything else. ~!Before he awoke his own psychic powers, he longed for the esper abilities his brother has always had and was frustrated by his own inability to do things like bend spoons. He may have a habit of carrying spoons around with him, for bending purposes. He is a perfectionist with a not-so-hidden dark side. Unlike [Mob](https://anilist.co/character/89616/Kageyama-Shigeo), he finds it okay to use psychic violence against people when necessary.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89618.png'),
(126, 'Tenga Onigawara', '鬼瓦天牙', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', 'Tenga Onigawara is the leader of Salt Middle School and an unofficial member of the Body Improvement Club.', '/uploads/images/c_89619.png'),
(126, 'Tome Kurata', '暗田トメ', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', '__School:__ Salt Middle School __School club:__ Telepathy Club (President) Tome seems to be a slacker but is passionate about the possibility of using telepathy to contact extraterrestrials. However, when the Telepathy Club''s research into the matter bears no results, she quickly gives up. When she learns that [Mob](https://anilist.co/character/89616/Kageyama-Shigeo) is an Esper, her passion is revitalized.', '/uploads/images/c_89620.png'),
(126, 'Teruki Hanazawa', '花沢輝気', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', '__Height:__ 161.4 cm Hanazawa Teruki is an esper who was first introduced as an antagonist, but later became [Mob](https://anilist.co/character/89616/Kageyama-Shigeo)''s friend after being defeated by him. He was the shadow leader (urabanchou) of Black Vinegar Middle School, using his psychic powers to rule over the delinquents at his own school, as well as to defeat those from other schools. Teruki is a talented, quick-thinking, and hardworking esper. In terms of raw power, he is nowhere near Mob''s level, but he compensates for this by putting in effort and training diligently. He is able to analyze other espers'' techniques and their weaknesses in a short amount of time, and often incorporates said techniques in his own fights. He is constantly training to improve himself, and is remarked by various espers as possessing a keen and powerful set of skills.', '/uploads/images/c_89621.png'),
(126, 'Ichi Mezato', '米里イチ', '配角', 'Ayumi Fujimura', 'Ichi Mezato is a school girl who goes to Salt Middle School and is part of the News Club. She is in class 2-1.', '/uploads/images/c_89622.jpg'),
(126, 'Tsubomi Takane', '高嶺ツボミ', '配角', 'Uki Satake', 'She is a middle schooler at Salt Middle School. Mob harbors a large crush on her. ~!Most of what we know about Tsubomi''s personality in the manga is from what Mob and other characters say about her. However, in the anime adaptation, there are extra scenes of Tsubomi that add to her character and personality and make her a more compassionate individual.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89623.jpg'),
(126, 'Shou Suzuki', '鈴木将', '配角', 'Sachi Kokuryuu', '~!Sho Suzuki is the son of the leader of Claw. He led a direct resistance against his father''s world domination plan.!~', '/uploads/images/c_130683.jpg'),
(126, 'Musashi Gouda', 'ムサシ', '配角', 'Toshihiko Seki', 'Musashi Goda is a student of Salt Middle School and the Body Improvement Club''s President. Musashi has a strong sense of justice but strongly disagrees with senseless violence', '/uploads/images/c_132972.jpg'),
(126, 'Gou Asahi', '朝日豪', '配角', 'Gentoku Kumazawa', 'Gou is an esper and one of the children who was invited to the Awakening Lab.', '/uploads/images/c_133190.jpg'),
(126, 'Rei Kurosaki', '黒崎麗', '配角', 'Sanae Fuku', 'Rei is an esper and one of the children who was invited to the Awakening Lab', '/uploads/images/c_133191.jpg'),
(126, 'Takeshi Hoshino', '星野武史', '配角', 'Kouhei Amasaki', 'Takeshi is an esper and one of the children who was invited to the Awakening Lab', '/uploads/images/c_133192.jpg'),
(126, 'Matsuo', '魔津尾', '配角', 'Ryuunosuke Watanuki', 'Matsuo is an esper and a former member of Claw. He was part of the upper echelon called "Scar".', '/uploads/images/c_133194.png'),
(126, 'Yusuke  Sakurai', '桜威遊介', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', 'The partner of Koyama who is also one of the executives of the Tsume group.', '/uploads/images/c_133195.jpg'),
(126, 'Takeuchi', '獄内', '配角', 'Junichi Yanagita', 'Takeuchi is an esper and a former member of Claw. He was part of the upper echelon called "Scar".', '/uploads/images/c_133198.jpg'),
