(126, 'Hiroshi Kumagawa', '隈川弘', '配角', 'Shunsuke Takeuchi', 'He is part of the Body Improvement Club and a student of Salt Middle School.', '/uploads/images/c_133384.png'),
(126, 'Hideki  Yamamura', '山村秀樹', '配角', 'Daiki Hamano', 'He is a student of Salt Middle School and a member of the Body Improvement Club.', '/uploads/images/c_133385.png'),
(126, 'Banshoumaru Shinra', '森羅万象丸', '配角', 'Taiten Kusunoki', 'He is the self-proclaimed "greatest psychic of the century" and a member of the Sun Psychic Union led by Kirin Shoudou.', '/uploads/images/c_133386.jpg'),
(126, 'Minori Asagiri', '浅桐みのり', '配角', 'Mao Ichimichi', 'Minori Asagiri is a middle-school girl and the daughter of a wealthy businessman. Asagiri is very spoiled and very cruel. The first we see of her, she throws a tantrum due to dissatisfaction over lavish birthday presents. This is her true personality, according to her father, that existed before she was possessed by Mogami. Within the world Mogami created and trapped Mob in, she acts very similarly. She bullies, isolates and abuses Mob. Apparently, she does this because she wants to prove herself superior, and by preying on those who are weaker and can''t stand up for themselves, she establishes her position. However, after being saved by Mob, she is brought to tears and resolves to become a better person because of him.', '/uploads/images/c_133387.jpg'),
(126, 'Jun Sagawa', '佐川純', '配角', 'Seiichirou Yamashita', 'He is a student of Salt Middle School and the president of the Body Improvement Club.', '/uploads/images/c_133389.jpg'),
(126, 'Kirin Shodou', '浄堂麒麟', '配角', 'Teruyuki Tanzawa', 'He is a haughty psychic and the President of the Sun Psychic Union. ~!Like many other self-proclaimed psychics, Shodo possesses no special abilities. However, he was able to produce a noticeable aura in his ultimately fruitless attempt to exorcize​ Keiji Mogami from Minori Asagiri''s body.!~', '/uploads/images/c_133393.jpg'),
(126, 'Emi', 'エミ', '配角', 'Eriko Matsui', 'She is a student at Salt Middle School. Emi first appears as a questionably nice girl who shows an interest in Mob. She has an interest in books and writing novels. ​However, she seems to be easily influenced by her friends and quickly interprets things others say about her negatively, even if they weren''t meant that way. She was grateful to Mob for retrieving and restoring her writings after they were torn up.', '/uploads/images/c_133394.png'),
(126, 'Haruto  Kijibayashi', '稚子林春人', '配角', 'Ryuunosuke Watanuki', 'He is a third-year middle school student and a member of the Telepathy Club.', '/uploads/images/c_133395.png'),
(126, 'Keiji Mogami', '最上啓示', '配角', 'Akira Ishida', 'Keiji Mogami is "This Century''s Greatest Psychic" and a former Psychic who turned into an evil spirit upon death. Keiji Mogami is a very bitter man, sick of the greed and selfishness of humanity. Because of the private dealings he did while alive, he has lost his moral compass and has become a twisted variant of his former self. After becoming an evil spirit, he vowed to use his power for his own intentions and fix the world by possessing people who appear to gather grudges around them. To that end, Mogami is willing to destroy a girl''s body and brutally impale her father to achieve his whims.', '/uploads/images/c_133397.png'),
(126, 'Katsuya Serizawa', '芹沢克也', '配角', 'Takanori Hoshino', 'He is an extremely powerful Esper who was formerly a part of the Super 5 of Claw. He now works at the agency alongside Reigen and Mob.', '/uploads/images/c_133399.png'),
(126, 'Hipparu', '引っ張る', '配角', 'Yuu Kobayashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_134010.jpg'),
(126, 'Kunekune', 'くねくね', '配角', '', 'was an upper-class evil spirit who made his home ruining the crops of a farmer.', '/uploads/images/c_134012.jpg'),
(126, 'Mameta  Inukawa', '犬川豆太', '配角', 'Seiichirou Yamashita', 'He is a second-year middle school student and a member of the Telepathy Club.', '/uploads/images/c_134013.jpg'),
(126, 'Akai reinkouto otoko', '赤いレインコート男', '配角', 'Yuuji Ueda', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_134014.jpg'),
