(133, 'Josei Kyoushi', '女性教師', '配角', 'Rika Kinugawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_256759.jpg'),
(133, 'Shikijou Staff', '式場スタッフ', '配角', 'Shiori Izawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_256760.jpg'),
(133, 'Announcer', 'アナウンス', '配角', 'Yukari Anzai', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_256761.jpg'),
(133, 'Kantoku', '監督', '配角', 'Hideki Kanno', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_256762.jpg'),
(133, 'Danshi', '男子', '配角', 'Koudai Sakai', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_256763.jpg'),
(134, 'Sakuta Azusagawa', '梓川咲太', '主角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5''7") A strange 2nd year student in high school, who doesn''t have a cellphone in this day and age. He is currently an outcast at school due to rumors of a violent past... but doesn''t seem to care. ~!Sakuta eventually starts dating [Mai Sakurajima](https://anilist.co/character/127222)!~ (Source: Aniplex USA)', '/uploads/images/c_127221.png'),
(134, 'Mai Sakurajima', '桜島麻衣', '主角', 'Asami Seto', '__Height:__ 162 cm (5''4") A 3rd-year student at Minegahara High School. She is serious and polite, but has a strong will. Well known, famous actress, who is currently on hiatus. Because her life had always revolved around her work in entertainment, she remains isolated at school. (Source: Aniplex USA)', '/uploads/images/c_127222.png'),
(134, 'Kaede Azusagawa', '梓川かえで', '配角', 'Yurika Kubo', '__Height:__ 5''4" (162 cm) She is the younger sister of Sakuta Azusagawa. ~!Suffered amnesia and gained a different personality after her ordeal with Adolescence Syndrome stemming from online bullying. Since then, she has lived with Sakuta and has not attended school.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127613.png'),
(134, 'Rio Futaba', '双葉理央', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', '__Height:__ 155 cm (5''1") __Talent:__ Explaining any strange phenomenon with science She is [Sakuta](https://anilist.co/character/127221/Azusagawa-Sakuta)''s classmate, who is always cool and calm, always willing to give various advice on puberty syndrome. She is also the sole member of the Science Club, and known as an eccentric person at the school. (Source: Aniplex USA)', '/uploads/images/c_127633.png'),
(134, 'Tomoe Koga', '古賀朋絵', '配角', 'Nao Touyama', '__Height:__ 150 cm (4''11") A typical 1st year high-school student at Minegahara High School who can take hints, but is slightly scatterbrained. Being overly concerned about how people look at her, she hides her Hakata accent, which comes out when she panics or is relaxed. (Source: Aniplex USA, edited)', '/uploads/images/c_127840.jpg'),
(134, 'Nodoka Toyohama', '豊浜のどか', '配角', 'Maaya Uchida', '__Height:__ 158cm (5''2") __Talent:__ Changing clothes quickly Mai''s half-sister, related through her father. A member of the idol group "Sweet Bullet" and designated as the most fashionable within the group. Despite her flashy looks, she attends an elite all girls'' high school. She is confident and can be competitive. (Source: Aniplex USA)', '/uploads/images/c_127841.png'),
(134, 'Shouko Makinohara', '牧之原翔子', '主角', 'Inori Minase', '__Height:__ 150 cm (4''11") __Talent:__ Early to bed, early to rise A girl who has the same first and last name as [Sakuta](https://anilist.co/character/127221/Azusagawa-Sakuta)''s first crush. She is a shy middle school girl, but reliable and kind. She bumps into Sakuta, while holding an umbrella over an abandoned cat in the rain. ~!It is later revealed that the older Shouko that Sakuta encounters is from the future, and is able to return to the past due to her puberty syndrome.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127843.jpg'),
(134, 'Saki Kamisato', '上里沙希', '配角', 'Himika Akaneya', '[Yuuma](https://anilist.co/character/130307/Yuuma-Kunimi)''s girlfriend. Popular within the school and can be a standoffish person, but she shows great affection towards Yuuma. She is quite protective of him and often clashes with [Sakuta](https://anilist.co/character/127221/Sakuta-Azusagawa) as a result. ~!It is revealed that Saki has an older sister whom her parents often compare her to, causing her to develop low self-esteem. Sakuta believes this to be the reason why she is so protective of Yuuma''s image and her own, as in her eyes she already has a fragile self-image.!~ ~!After graduating she attends the same college as Sakuta and goes into health studies, in the hopes of becoming a nurse in order to help Yuuma whenever she can due to his decision to partake in firefighter training.!~', '/uploads/images/c_130304.png'),
(134, 'Yousuke Maesawa', '前沢陽介', '配角', 'Masaaki Mizunaka', 'A member of the school basketball team. He has an attractive and charming demeanor, but he is ultimately not above slandering other students. Maezawa has bad-mouthed all of his past girlfriends.', '/uploads/images/c_130305.png'),
(134, 'Mai no Haha', '麻衣の母', '配角', 'Airi Ootsu', 'She is the mother of Mai Sakurajima.', '/uploads/images/c_130306.png'),
(134, 'Yuuma Kunimi', '国見佑真', '配角', 'Yuuma Uchida', 'A good friend of [Sakuta Azusagawa](https://anilist.co/character/127221/Sakuta-Azusagawa) and [Rio Futaba](https://anilist.co/character/127633/Rio-Futaba), as well as the boyfriend of [Saki Kamisato](https://anilist.co/character/130304). He is a member of Minegahara High''s basketball team, being quite athletic and popular within the school.', '/uploads/images/c_130307.png'),
(134, 'Ryouko Hanawa', '花輪涼子', '配角', 'Natsuki Aikawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_285128.jpg'),
(135, 'Katsuki Bakugou', '爆豪勝己', '配角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5''7") __Quirk:__ Explosion Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Katsuki is a crude, arrogant, short-tempered, and aggressive person, especially at the beginning of the series. Due to the constant praise of his abilities and powerful Quirk, Katsuki has developed a superiority complex, and because of that, he desires to be the first and best at everything. He loves to win above all else and cannot stand it when he doesn''t, leading him to lose his already short temper if he achieves anything but a complete victory. Katsuki is not only very athletic and talented at fighting, but also very intelligent and extremely perceptive, capable of strategic planning and improvisation. Additionally, his grades are among the highest of his class. Katsuki also possesses surprising talent in other areas, such as cooking and music, even though he doesn''t show a particular interest in them. Overall, Katsuki is considered a natural-born genius with the potential to be one of the best Pro Heroes. Katsuki''s Quirk "Explosion" allows him to secrete nitroglycerin-like sweat from the palms of his hands and ignite it on command, allowing him to create strong explosions. The more Katsuki sweats, the stronger his explosions become. Not only can Katsuki use the explosions for attacking, he can also use them to propel himself and navigate through the air at high speeds, allowing him to fly at his opponents without giving them time to react, as well as evade incoming attacks, even whi', '/uploads/images/c_88892.png'),
(135, 'Izuku Midoriya', '緑谷出久', '主角', 'Daiki Yamashita', '__Height:__ 166 cm (5''5¼") __Quirk:__ One For All Student in Class 1-A at U.A High School. Although he was born without a Quirk, Izuku''s innate heroism and strong sense of justice manages to catch the attention of the legendary hero [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224). Izuku has since become All Might''s closest pupil. Izuku is a very timid, reserved, and polite boy. Although initially portrayed as insecure, tearful, and vulnerable, Izuku gradually matures into a more confident and braver person. His infectious leadership skills, combined with his passion and strategic abilities, have turned Izuku into a central figure of Class 1-A. He is caring and emotional, never hesitating to help or rescue someone in danger, even if he knows that he might not be strong or otherwise qualified enough to do it. Izuku is extremely (and sometimes scarily) enthusiastic about topics related to heroes. His dream drives him to write down notes about everything he learns about heroes'' Quirks and fighting capabilities. Thanks to this practice, Izuku has developed a great analytical mind and can form complex battle plans in a few seconds, factoring in the best ways he can utilize the Quirks of allies and enemies alike for his own advantage. Izuku''s Quirk "One For All" was transferred to him from All Might. His Quirk allows him to stockpile an enormous amount of raw power, allowing him to significantly enhance all of his physical abilities to various boundless levels. This results in unbel', '/uploads/images/c_89028.png'),
(135, 'Shouto Todoroki', '轟焦凍', '配角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9") __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Half-Cold Half-Hot Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School, where he got in through official recommendations. He is the youngest son of the top hero [Endeavor](https://anilist.co/character/126158). Shouto initially has a cold, aloof personality, which stemmed from his complicated family life. Focused and unemotional, Shouto preferred to keep things to himself instead of hanging out with others. After the events of the U.A. Sports Festival, however, he notably became more sociable and kinder than ever before. He even gained a sense of humor and would occasionally smile, although still retaining some fragments of his previous distant attitude and nonchalant demeanor. While usually quiet and reserved, Shouto initially possessed a moderate level of arrogance, which, combined with his solitary tendencies, sometimes made him take the initiative without considering the opinions of others. Shouto''s Quirk Half-Cold Half-Hot gives him the ability to generate ice from the right side of his body, and flames from his left side. Due to years of rejecting his father, Shouto has developed a habit of favoring ice, even when fire would be a better option. This grudge also caused him to have difficulty controlling his flames. If he overuses one element without utilizing the other, then his own body temperature will suffer.', '/uploads/images/c_89220.png'),
(135, 'Ochako Uraraka', '麗日お茶子', '配角', 'Ayane Sakura', '__Height:__ 156 cm (5''1") __Quirk:__ Zero Gravity Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School Ochako is an outgoing, lively person who thinks about everything positively, though she is objective enough to see flaws and virtues. She gets excited over little things very easily. Ochaco has been described by other students as "the most laidback girl" among her class, being very bubbly and kind of an airhead at times. She is often incredibly blunt without being aware of it. She is on good terms with everyone and is particularly close friends with several class members, including [Izuku](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku), [Tenya Ida](https://anilist.co/character/89222/Iida-Tenya), and [Tsuyu](https://anilist.co/character/89223/Asui-Tsuyu). Ochaco''s Quirk gives her the power to manipulate gravity upon touching solid things with the pads on her fingertips. The targets lose their gravitational pull, effectively making them weightless. She is able to activate or cancel her Quirk''s effects by closing her fingers together, and is shown to be careful with her hands in order to avoid accidental quirk activation.', '/uploads/images/c_89221.png'),
(135, 'Tenya Iida', '飯田天哉', '配角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5''10") __Quirk:__ Engine Class representative of Class 1-A at U.A. High School Tenya may look severe, but he''s actually just a very serious person, who takes everything, even the most insignificant thing, seriously. A testament to his generally hyperactive and intense behavior, Tenya often exhibits plenty of peculiar tics, such as moving his arms around in strange chopping patterns or sometimes twitching his body uncontrollably. Tenya is very humble, willing to admit to his mistakes, apologize for rude behavior, and improve in areas he lacks. Being part of the highly-esteemed Ida Family of Heroes, Tenya is proud of his lineage and works hard to meet his expectations. He greatly admires his older brother, Tensei (also known as the Turbo Hero: Ingenium), and aspires to become a similar hero. Tenya''s Quirk Engine gives him car-like engines in each of his calves, giving him incredible running speed and extreme kicking power. Tenya needs to fuel his engines by drinking orange juice. Tenya''s engines have multiple gears; it is currently unknown how many, but it has been implied that there are more than three.', '/uploads/images/c_89222.png'),
(135, 'Tsuyu Asui', '蛙吹梅雨', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', '__Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Frog Tsuyu is a very straight-forward girl that always says what''s on her mind and what she thinks about others. She prefers to be called by her first name.', '/uploads/images/c_89223.png'),
(135, 'Toshinori Yagi', '八木俊典', '配角', 'Kenta Miyake', '__Height:__ 220 cm (7''2") __Quirk:__ One for All All Might is the No. 1 Hero and the "Symbol of Peace." In his hero form, All Might is a very tall and over-muscular man whose design resembles the american hero comics. His hair spikes on top of his head and his whole body has more shadows than a normal human being. However, in his true form, he is an overly-skinny man who spits a lot of blood out of his mouth and his clothes appear loose.', '/uploads/images/c_89224.jpg'),
(135, 'Shouta Aizawa', '相澤消太', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', '__Height: __183 cm (6'') __Occupation:__ Pro Hero, Teacher __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Erasure Aizawa''s hero name, Eraserhead, was coined by [Present Mic](https://anilist.co/character/127425) when they were younger. Using the binding cloth, Aizawa has a unique fighting style that allows him to immobilize his enemies. He is known to expel students that don''t meet his standards, however it should be noted that he did not expel anyone from Class 1-A. Aizawa is extremely vocal, able to voice his opinions very easily. Although seeming emotionless and reserved, he has a soft spot for his students and genuinely cares for them.', '/uploads/images/c_89225.png'),
(135, 'Tomura Shigaraki', '死柄木弔', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9) __Quirk:__ Decay Leader of the League of Villains and protégé of [All For One](https://anilist.co/character/125956/All-For-One). He was raised by his master, All For One, with the goal of killing [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224/Yagi-Toshinori), and ultimately destroying the society he represents. Tomura is a very twisted, malevolent, and maliciously warped young man, who is considered to be the polar opposite of [Izuku Midoriya](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku). He doesn''t care for his or almost anyone else''s life, having no qualms about performing evil deeds like murdering innocent people. Tomura was initially perceived to be a "man-child": arrogant, selfish, dependent, and demanding, becoming angry if things didn''t go his way and likening reality to some sort of video game. Unlike his mentor, Tomura lacked subtlety, preferring to eliminate problems through force. Much like a child, Tomura seemed unable to cope with his own feelings, instead lashing out and abusing both others or himself, tearing at his own neck when he becomes frustrated. Initially, Tomura seemingly caused destruction just for the sake of it and felt directionless about the League''s path forward after [Stain](https://anilist.co/character/126067/Akaguro-Chizome)''s arrest. It would take a fateful meeting with Izuku in a mall for him to develop an epiphany and become aware of his true convictions: to crumble hero society through All Might''s death. Tomur', '/uploads/images/c_89226.jpg'),
(135, 'Momo Yaoyorozu', '八百万百', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") __Quirk:__ Creation Vice class representative of Class 1-A at U.A. High School. She was admitted to the school through official recommendations. Momo is a very prudent, dedicated person who acts as a natural leader. She is generally level-headed and calm in dangerous situations, but she isn''t above falling into a panic. Momo can be blunt with her comments about people''s mistakes and miscalculations, tending to be very direct and wishing to help her peers improve enough to become great heroes. Momo''s Quirk gives her the ability to create any non-living material/object from her exposed skin by transforming the molecular structure of her fat cells. In order to create something, she needs to understand the molecular structure of which the material/object is made.', '/uploads/images/c_89241.png'),
(135, 'Hitoshi Shinsou', '心操人使', '配角', 'Wataru Hatano', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''9½") __Quirk:__ Brainwashing Student at U.A. High School, attending Class 1-C of the Department of General Education. Hitoshi is a stoic and straightforward person with an innate ability to spark conversation with anyone despite holding a reserved and quiet attitude most of the time. He is shown to be rather clever, knowing just the right words to manipulate others into replying to his comments, allowing him to activate his Quirk. He does not mind doing something underhanded to claim victory in a fight. Due to having his Brainwashing Quirk perceived as evil throughout his life, Hitoshi has been somewhat feared by those aware of his power and has been discriminated against solely because of the Quirk he was born with. This persecution led him to become resentful of those who had Quirks more associated with hero work. Regardless of his drawbacks, however, Hitoshi desires to become a Pro Hero more than anything. Hitoshi''s Quirk Brainwashing allows him to put someone in a state where they are forced to obey whatever he commands. He can only activate this power when his target verbally responds to something he says. Brainwashing must be intentionally activated and will not take effect if Hitoshi doesn''t want it to. Using a megaphone or anything that makes his voice artificial will not allow his Quirk to activate, as the said devices would transform his voice into an electronic signal.', '/uploads/images/c_89242.png'),
(135, 'Eijirou Kirishima', '切島鋭児郎', '配角', 'Toshiki Masuda', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Quirk:__ Hardening Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Eijiro is a boisterous and outgoing guy with a fondness for manliness, often using the terms "manly" and "unmanly" to describe things and people he does or doesn''t like, respectively. Eijiro is very honest and kind-hearted, having a straightforward way of thinking and following a specific code of chivalry that motivates him to live without regret. He is determined and selfless, bravely putting the safety of others before himself. He is also a big fan of Crimson Riot, a retro hero from whom he takes inspiration, including personal values and his hero name. Although Eijiro may not be as hot-blooded and competitive as [Katsuki Bakugou](https://anilist.co/character/88892), he does not shy away from comparing himself to him, with [Izuku](https://anilist.co/character/89028) stating that the two have managed to develop a relationship between equals. As a result, Eijiro is notably one of the few people that Katsuki holds in higher esteem. Eijiro''s Quirk gives him the power to harden and sharpen any or all parts of his body, causing his flesh to become jagged and rock-like. There is a limit to how much damage his hardened body can withstand, which causes the Hardening itself to slowly dissipate, and Eijiro to lose stamina from struggling to keep his Quirk active.', '/uploads/images/c_89243.jpg'),
(135, 'Minoru Mineta', '峰田実', '配角', 'Ryou Hirohashi', '__Height:__ 108 cm (3'' 6½") __Quirk:__ Pop Off __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Fighting Style:__ Medium Ranged Support Minoru Mineta, also known as the Fresh-Picked Hero: Grape Juice, is a student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School, training to become a Pro Hero.', '/uploads/images/c_89244.png'),
(135, 'Mina Ashido', '芦戸三奈', '配角', 'Eri Kitamura', '__Height:__ 159 cm (5''3") __Quirk:__ Acid Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Mina is a cheerful and easygoing girl who usually displays a smile. Highly social and excitable, she loves to hang out with her friends and is shown to become very upset when denied an opportunity to be at a gathering. She possesses a strong fashion sense and likes to go shopping. Due to her athleticism and energy, Mina enjoys and is very skilled at dancing. Mina is extremely courageous and is viewed as an ideal personality for hero work. Mina''s Quirk Acid allows her to produce a corrosive liquid from her body. She can control the solubility and viscosity of this corrosive liquid. There is a limit to how long she can produce the corrosive liquid until her skin gradually loses its natural resistance to it. Overusing her Quirk or pushing it too far can also be fatal, as it dehydrates her body very fast. Mina can use her acid offensively, but has shown utility with it as well, such as melting handholds for herself to climb with. She is also known to secrete a non-corrosive version of the acid from her feet in order to slide around.', '/uploads/images/c_89247.png'),
(135, 'Mei Hatsume', '発目明', '配角', 'Shiori Sakurai', '__Height:__ 157 cm (5''2") __Quirk:__ Zoom Mei is a smart, off-setting, and assertive girl, often making those around her uncomfortable. She loves creating gadgets, which she refers to as her "super cute babies". Mei has a habit of "going straight to the point" and is very shameless and opportunistic when it comes to advertising her inventions. While talking to people, she has a habit of getting awkwardly close to them, which usually causes them to back away from her but she still moves up to them.', '/uploads/images/c_89248.png'),
(135, 'Denki Kaminari', '上鳴電気', '配角', 'Tasuku Hatanaka', '__Height:__ 168 cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Electrification Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Denki is a friendly, social, and energetic boy who enjoys hanging out with others. He is rather casual when interacting with other people, including the generally unfriendly [Katsuki Bakugou](https://anilist.co/character/88892/Bakugou-Katsuki). Denki''s Quirk Electrification allows him to store and discharge electricity. While he can also discharge this energy over a distance, Denki has little to no control over it, meaning it will go everywhere indiscriminately. Denki is also able to absorb and neutralize electricity and other lightning-based Quirks. Whenever Denki exceeds his wattage limit, he loses his ability to discharge energy, with his entire personality changing into that of a giggling idiot for a certain period until he reverts to normal. In this state, he is always giving thumbs-ups as a way to let others know that he is okay.', '/uploads/images/c_89249.png'),
(135, 'Jin Bubaigawara', '分倍河原仁', '配角', 'Daichi Endou', '__Height:__ 178 cm (5''10") __Quirk:__ Double Villain affiliated with the League of Villains, and part of its Vanguard Action Squad. Jin has an incredibly unique personality: explosive, and lively with a very comedic demeanor. He enjoys assuming dramatic poses and eccentric facial expressions. Jin constantly contradicts himself, making a statement in one voice and immediately saying the opposite in another. This juxtaposition iss part of a mental instability that Jin embraces as a villain. He believes understanding your own identity is the most essential aspect in life, an understanding he lost during the 9-day conflict with his own clones that left him unsure whether he was the original or not. Now, if his mask is removed, he panics and threatens to "split" until he put his mask back on to become "whole". Jin''s Quirk allows him to create an exact duplicate of anything, living or not. To duplicate something, he needs to know its precise measurements and characteristics. The clones he makes do not disappear; instead, they disintegrate into a mud-like substance after taking a certain amount of damage. The duplicates are less durable than the original, and the second duplicate is even less durable than the first. When Jin creates duplicates of a person, he has no control over the clones because they have their own autonomy, personalities, and abilities that are utterly identical to the original.', '/uploads/images/c_89589.png'),
(135, 'Hanta Sero', '瀬呂範太', '配角', 'Kiyotaka Furushima', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5'' 9¾") __Quirk:__ Tape Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Hanta is amicable and has proven to be one of the more sociable members of Class 1-A. He can sometimes be loud and showy, often trying to impress his peers with his Quirk. He is often the only person to call his classmates out when they act crazy. He is pretty humorous and usually makes jokes with his classmates. However, when push comes to shove, Hanta is a brave hero-in-training who wishes to prosper on his own while helping others do the same. Hanta''s Quirk is that he has tape dispenser-like organs in his elbows, from which he can shoot long cellophane tape-like strips; he can also retract them. They appear to be somewhat sturdier than regular tape. Overuse of his Quirk will cause his skin to dry out. He can use his tape to wrap people, swing long distances, and create traps, among other applications.', '/uploads/images/c_89895.png'),
(135, 'Mashirao Ojiro', '尾白猿夫', '配角', 'Kousuke Miyoshi', '__Height:__ 169 cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Tail Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Mashirao has a very calm and noble attitude and a profound sense of dignity, which prevents him from accepting results he doesn''t feel he earned with his own abilities. He is also described as a hard worker. Along with a strong sense of dignity, Mashirao can be described as sheepish and bashful, not very often enjoying the spotlight and being easily embarrassed. A recurring joke is that others view Mashirao as "plain," which profoundly upsets him. Mashirao''s Quirk is that he has a long, powerful, sturdy tail. His tail effectively functions as a third arm that he can use to grab things. Furthermore, it''s attack power is strong enough to break objects made of metal, he can wrap it around enemies, and it can support Mashirao''s body weight. Mashirao is incredibly adept at using his tail, combining it with his knowledge of martial arts to engage enemies in close-range combat, performing fast and acrobatic moves. His tail can also increase his speed and mobility by whipping it down against the ground to use it like a springboard. (Source: My Hero Academia Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_89896.png'),
(135, 'Kyouka Jirou', '耳郎響香', '配角', 'Kei Shindou', '__Height:__ 154 cm (5''1") __Quirk:__ Earphone Jack __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Fighting Style:__ Medium Ranged + Support Combat Kyoka is a petite, fair-skinned girl with a slender build. She has triangular, lazy-looking onyx eyes with notably long lower eyelashes, and rather small eyebrows. Kyoka has a pragmatic, unenthusiastic and teasing personality that is mostly shown to those she finds irritating. Kyoka is not always like this though, as she does enjoy socializing with others, in which case she is usually nice and friendly. Kyoka''s Quirk (Earphone Jack) allows her to plug the jacks that hang from her earlobes into all sorts of things and channel the sound of her heartbeat into them; causing havoc inside the plugged objects. It''s also used to catch sounds and vibrations from her surroundings.', '/uploads/images/c_89897.png'),
(135, 'Fumikage Tokoyami', '常闇踏陰', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', '__Height:__ 158 cm __Quirk:__ Dark Shadow Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Fumikage is reserved, serious, and focused, albeit noble and valiant. Though not talkative, Fumikage will directly ignore questions or requests that seem in some way pointless. During combat, Fumikage is known to be fierce and dependable, with his strength and capabilities rarely being questioned. Fumikage is fond of darkness and other related concepts, considering himself a "creature of the dark" and employing archaic-sounding speeches that paint him slightly creepy or dramatic. Fumikage''s Quirk "Dark Shadow" allows him to manifest a sentient shadow monster from his body that he can materialize and contract freely. Dark Shadow''s energy is limited and can be drained by bright light. Dark Shadow retracts into Fumikage''s body when it runs out of energy. The shadow entity''s personality, strength, defense, and control depend on the lack of light. In bright light, Dark Shadow is weaker and smaller but still has considerable strength and defense and is easier to control, but in total darkness, Dark Shadow''s size and parameters are drastically enhanced. It is powerful enough to rip out and cut down multiple full-grown trees easily. However, Dark Shadow is more difficult to control in the dark, causing it to rampage based on its own free will.', '/uploads/images/c_89898.png'),
(135, 'Mezou Shouji', '障子目蔵', '配角', 'Masakazu Nishida', '__Height:__ 187 cm (6''2") __Quirk:__ Dupli-Arms Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Shouji is friendly and gentle, and he will work nicely with anyone. He is not the type to hold grudges, showing no ill will towards those that harm him unwillingly. Shouji is entirely selfless and willing to risk his life for anyone. He can be empathetic and understanding, but still shows a sense of maturity and responsibility that prevents him from acting under emotional impulses. He is very protective of his classmates, especially if they are hurt or injured. He is also quite thick-skinned, as he said he is used to being feared due to his appearance. Shouji''s Quirk grants him a set of tentacles alongside his arms. He can transform the tips of these tentacles to replicate other parts of his body (ex: mouth, ears, eyes). The duplicated body parts are more efficient than the originals; as a result, Mezo is able to hear better, see-through more angles at a time, and they grant him much higher degrees of strength. He uses these arms to talk most of the time through duplicate mouths, rather than his actual mouth.', '/uploads/images/c_89899.png'),
(135, 'Tooru Hagakure', '葉隠透', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', '__Height:__ 152 cm (5''0") __Quirk:__ Invisibility Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Tooru is a bubbly, cheery, and easygoing girl who does most things with an upbeat attitude. She is very socially eager and likes shopping, and her room suggests that she likes plushies and other cute things. Tooru''s Quirk is that her body is completely invisible. In addition to the stealth capabilities granted to her by her invisible body, Tooru can refract light that passes through her, allowing her to intensify the light into a blinding flash. She has further refined this application of her Quirk, achieving the ability to manipulate and redirect light-based attacks, such as [Yuuga Aoyama](https://anilist.co/character/127042/Aoyama-Yuuga)''s Navel Laser.', '/uploads/images/c_89900.png'),
(135, 'Kouji Kouda', '口田甲司', '配角', 'Takuma Nagatsuka', '__Height:__ 186 cm (6''1") __Quirk:__ Anivoice Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Contrary to his strong and powerful appearance, Kouji is very timid and quiet. He rarely speaks and prefers using sign language to communicate with his classmates. He hates violence due to his kind-hearted nature. Kouji appears to greatly enjoy the company of animals, as his Quirk allows him to interact with animals in ways others cannot. He owns a small rabbit as a pet. Kouji''s Quirk "Anivoice (生き物ボイス, Ikimono Voice)" gives him the ability to command any creature in the animal kingdom by speaking to them. Whatever command he gives, the animal will carry it out. However, he cannot exert control if they cannot hear his command. The target must also be a real animal and not merely animal-like. Kouji can also exchange information with the animals to find the locations of various people and potential enemies faster. Kouji has been shown to use the Quirk effectively with flocks of birds to create a smokescreen of animals and to attack an opponent, along with his use of insects to distract and attack his opponents. He has now also overcome his fear of bugs, so he often uses bugs to swarm opponents with numbers.', '/uploads/images/c_89901.png'),
(135, 'Rikidou Satou', '砂藤力道', '配角', 'Tooru Nara', '__Height:__ 185 cm (6''1") __Quirk:__ Sugar Rush Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Rikidou is interested in sweets and baking, a valuable skill due to his Quirk. He is surprisingly talented at making sweets. Rikidou''s Quirk Sugar Rush allows him to increase his strength five-fold for three minutes. To activate his Quirk, he needs to consume 10 grams of sugar. When converting sugar into strength, his cognitive functions gradually drop, making him sleepy afterward. For every additional 10 grams of sugar he ingests, he extends the time of increased strength by another three minutes.', '/uploads/images/c_89902.png'),
(135, 'Yuu Takeyama', '岳山優', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', '__Height:__ 162 cm (5''4") (Normal form); 2062cm (67''8") (Transformed) __Quirk:__ Gigantification __Occupation:__ Pro Hero Pro Hero. Her Quirk allows her to grow to a gigantic size. She cannot variate between her base-height and the gigantified height achieved via her Quirk, making her only able to be either her normal height of 162cm (5 feet 4 inches) or her enlarged height of 2,062cm (67 feet 8 inches) tall.', '/uploads/images/c_121529.png'),
(135, 'Mirio Togata', '通形ミリオ', '主角', 'Tarusuke Shingaki', '__Height:__ 181 cm (5''11") __Occupation:__ Student __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Permeation He is third-year student at U.A. High School and is part of The Big 3 _(the strongest three hero students in all of Japan)_. Before [Izuku Midoriya](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku), Mirio was the top candidate for [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224/Yagi-Toshinori)''s successor and inheritor of One For All. His Quirk, Permeation, gives him the ability to become intangible, letting him pass through any tangible matter; he can phase through walls and/or the ground, as well as let enemy attacks pass through him harmlessly.', '/uploads/images/c_123527.png'),
(135, 'Neito Monoma', '物間寧人', '配角', 'Kouhei Amasaki', '__Height:__ 170cm __Quirk:__ Copy Student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School. Neito has a rather complex personality since it differs depending on who he is addressing; he is particularly mocking, loud, and sarcastic with Class 1-A, but outside of these interactions, he is a calm, kind, and intelligent person. He envies Class 1-A with a passion over how they became the center of attention among U.A.''s first years because of the U.S.J. Incident. Truthfully, he only wants his class to stand out as they do, and he vents this feeling by throwing countless taunts towards his rivals, gloating over Class 1-B''s successes and disparaging 1-A for their failures. Neito''s Quirk is Copy, which allows him to duplicate and use another person''s Quirk after coming into physical contact with the user. He can hold four Quirks simultaneously and maintain copied powers for ten minutes. After the time limit runs out, he loses the copied Quirk until he once again touches the original user.', '/uploads/images/c_125450.png'),
(135, 'Himiko Toga', '渡我被身子', '配角', 'Misato Fukuen', '__Height:__ 157 cm __Quirk:__ Transform Himiko Toga is a villain affiliated with the League of Villains and part of its Vanguard Action Squad. She originally joined the group as a means to get closer to [Stain](https://anilist.co/character/126067). Himiko is a very cheerful girl, to the point of smiling even after having presumably killed someone, displaying apparent sadistic tendencies. She has a very twisted perception of love and friendship Himiko''s Quirk Transform grants her the ability to transform into a physical lookalike of another individual, as well as copy their voice. She can only transform into people whose blood she has ingested. The more blood she drinks, the longer she has access to that person''s form. For example, 1 cup of blood allows her to transform for a total of 18 hours. She can even switch between the appearances of multiple people if she drinks the blood of more than one person.', '/uploads/images/c_125619.png'),
(135, 'Tamaki Amajiki', '天喰環', '配角', 'Yuuto Uemura', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''10") __Quirk:__ Manifest Third-year student in Class 3-A at U.A. High School and part of The Big 3 (the strongest three hero students in all of Japan). Tamaki is extremely shy, aloof, depressed, "intimidating", and introverted, especially around big audiences. He gets nervous very easily when talking to other people. If his anxiety gets the best of him, Tamaki will often face away and lean into a wall to hide his face from others. While his physical abilities and Quirk are outstanding, Tamaki is socially awkward and lacks confidence in his powers. Despite his timid heart, Tamaki can show flashes of bravery. Even though he''s always been a shy and reserved boy, Tamaki was able to hone his skills and climb the ranks into one of U.A.''s Big 3. [Mirio Togata](https://anilist.co/character/123527/Togata-Mirio) is a big inspiration for Tamaki. Tamaki''s Quirk Manifest grants him the ability to manifest the physical characteristics of anything he''s eaten; for example, if he eats takoyaki, he can transform his fingers into octopus tentacles. Additionally, anything Tamaki manifests is significantly stronger than normal. The more of a substance Tamaki eats, the stronger his manifestation will be. He can only manifest the traits of substances still in his system and loses access to those traits once the substance is fully digested. He must resupply his Quirk daily and decide what foods to eat beforehand.', '/uploads/images/c_125934.png'),
(135, 'All For One', 'オール・フォー・ワン', '配角', 'Akio Ootsuka', '__Quirk:__ All For One __Occupation:__ Villain __Fighting Style:__ Close Range and Long Range All For One is the true leader and benefactor of the League of Villains. Once Japan''s most powerful villain and All Might''s arch-nemesis, his true motives are unclear and his true identity unknown. His current goal is to raise Shigaraki to become his eventual successor.', '/uploads/images/c_125956.jpg'),
(135, 'Shuuichi Iguchi', '伊口秀一', '配角', 'Ryou Iwasaki', '__Height:__ 174 cm __Occupation:__ Villain __Affiliation:__ League of Villains (formerly), Paranormal Liberation Front (Lieutenant of Brown Regiment) __Quirk:__ Gecko Shuuichi is a villain affiliated with the League of Villains and part of its Vanguard Action Squad. He is completely obsessed with the ways of [Stain](https://anilist.co/character/126067) to the point where he copies his clothing and weaponry style, aiming to follow the same ideals as him and make his dreams come true.', '/uploads/images/c_126005.png'),
(135, 'Itsuka Kendou', '拳藤一佳', '配角', 'Saki Ogasawara', '__Height:__ 166 cm (5''5") __Quirk:__ Big Fist Class representative of Class 1-B at U.A. High School, Itsuka is a spirited girl who is thoughtful of others. She does not hesitate to criticize even her classmates if she feels what they are doing is not correct. Due to Itsuka''s cheerful personality, she can bring all of Class 1-B together, thus making her the "big sister" of Class 1-B. Itsuka''s Quirk Big Fist grants her the ability to enlarge both of her hands to a gigantic size. With the increased size comes enhanced striking power and gripping capabilities.', '/uploads/images/c_126064.png'),
(135, 'Eri', '壊理', '主角', 'Seiran Kobayashi', '__Height:__ 110 cm __Quirk:__ Rewind Eri is a child with bandages all over her body. She wears a white short sleeve dress and has a small horn on the right side of her forehead and has white, long, choppy, unkempt hair. She also has red eyes. Under her bandages, her arms are shown to have numerous scars. ~!Eri is the key source to [Kai Chisaki''s](https://anilist.co/character/126357/Kai-Chisaki) operation to manufacture a Quirk-Destroying Drug. She is the granddaughter of the Eight Precepts of Death''s boss!~', '/uploads/images/c_126093.jpg'),
(135, 'Enji Todoroki', '轟炎司', '配角', 'Tetsu Inada', '__Height:__ 195 cm (6'' 4¾") __Occupation:__ Pro Hero __Quirk:__ Hellflame Endeavor is a tall man with a muscular physique. He has short and spiky, red hair with bright blue eyes. His beard and mustache appear to be made of fire, but when he turns off his flames on his face voluntarily, his stubble shows. ~!His desire to surpass the number one hero has driven him in family matters. Enji put [Shouto](https://anilist.co/character/89220/Todoroki-Shouto) through ruthless "training" which caused Shouto a severe degree of physical and emotional pain. Shouto, harboring a bitter hatred towards his father on account of this, refuses to use his fire powers in battles until [Izuku Midoriya](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku) reminded him of his mother''s encouragement. Later, Enji understood his mistakes and told his son he would try to be a better hero and father. He hopes for Shouto and the rest his family to forgive him in the future.!~ ~!He''s the former No.2 Hero, but later becomes the new No.1 Hero after [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224/Yagi-Toshinori) loses his Quirk!~', '/uploads/images/c_126158.png'),
(135, 'Kai Chisaki', '治崎廻', '主角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5''10") __Quirk:__ Overhaul Kai Chisaki, also known by the villain name Overhaul, is the Yakuza Captain of the Shie Hassaikai. Overhaul is a mysophobic, antisocial sociopath obsessed with returning the world to the way it was before the Quirk phenomenon. Due to a combination of an old theory claiming Quirks derived from rats and his own mysophobia, Overhaul believes that Quirks are actually a plague on humanity, having infected people with "syndromes" of heroism and villainy. He looks down upon those that use their abilities for either purpose, referring to acts of heroic sacrifice or petty crime as "sicknesses". Overhaul is extremely determined to his ambition of eradicating Quirks, not only due to his own personal phobias, but also because such a thing would allow the yakuza to reclaim the power they once held over society. Kai''s Quirk "Overhaul" grants him the ability to disassemble anything he touches, as well as reassemble it in any configuration he desires, effectively giving him full control over matter. Kai can disassemble people to kill them or reassemble them to heal their wounds. He can also do this to himself and even merge his body with others, even allowing him to use their Quirks', '/uploads/images/c_126357.jpg'),
(135, 'Dabi', '荼毘', '配角', 'Hiro Shimono', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9¼") __Quirk:__ Blueflame Dabi is a villain affiliated with the League of Villains and a member of the organization''s Vanguard Action Squad. Dabi is a stoic, aloof, confident, and focused individual who rarely shows emotion. While rather crude and violent, he''s also shown to be quite cautious. Overall, Dabi is a highly enigmatic individual who trusts no one, preferring to do things alone and in his way. He also gives off the impression of knowing more about certain people than he lets on. Dabi''s Quirk grants him the ability to generate and control highly destructive blue flames from his body. He has very well-developed control of his flames and can project them far from himself and in large amounts. However, Dabi''s body has a low tolerance for his flame, and he will get burned if he uses them for prolonged periods. ~!It is later revealed that Dabi is Touya Todoroki (轟燈矢), the eldest son of the Pro Hero [Endeavor](https://anilist.co/character/126158/Todoroki-Enji) and his wife [Rei](https://anilist.co/character/150628/Todoroki-Rei), and the older brother to [Shouto Todoroki](https://anilist.co/character/89220/Todoroki-Shouto). For a significant period of time, his whereabouts were unknown.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126378.png'),
(135, 'Camie Utsushimi', '現見ケミィ', '配角', 'Minori Chihara', '__Height:__ 161 cm (5''3") __Affiliation:__ Shiketsu High School (Second-Year Student) __Quirk:__ Glamour Camie seems to be very talkative, especially when learning more about people who pique her interest. She was thrilled upon seeing Shoto Todoroki for the first time, delighted at the fact that she would both meet a handsome man as well as undergo training. According to Inasa Yoarashi, she has impressive "interaction techniques" because she asked for Todoroki''s contact info. She also tends to speak in a unique way and incorporates a strange type of slang in it, which tends to confuse those around her. According to herself she also loves children. Camie''s Quirk allows her to create both visual and auditory illusions for a short period of time.', '/uploads/images/c_126734.png'),
(135, 'Nejire Hadou', '波動ねじれ', '配角', 'Kiyono Yasuno', '__Height:__ 164 cm (5''4") __Occupation:__ Student __Quirk:__ Wave Motion (ability to convert body''s vitality into energy that can discharge as blast waves) She is third-year student at U.A. High School and is part of The Big 3 _(the strongest three hero students in all of Japan)_. Nejire is very enthusiastic, affable and cheery, and is always seen moving. She shows great interest in people''s unique physical features and is easily distracted by them. She seems to like knowing more than others, but not in a proud way, as she just enjoys explaining things to people and sharing her knowledge. Despite her happy-go-lucky personality, Nejire is fierce in battle. When the situation calls for it, Nejire can be very calm and focused. Her curiosity never seems to extend to the enemy and she always maintains her focus on taking them down.', '/uploads/images/c_126843.png'),
(135, 'Inasa Yoarashi', '夜嵐イナサ', '配角', 'Ryouta Iwasaki', '**Height:** 190 cm (6''3") **Affiliation:** Shiketsu High School (First-Year Student) **Quirk:** Whirlwind Inasa is an energetic and enthusiastic young man who expresses himself with vigor. He''s very loud, oddly polite, and values passion over anything else. Inasa believes that all heroes have "hot spirits" that enable them to motivate and help others. He disapproves of heroes who do not embody the spirit of passion, which is why he has negative feelings about Endeavor and his son.', '/uploads/images/c_126855.png'),
(135, 'Yuuga Aoyama', '青山優雅', '配角', 'Kousuke Kuwano', '**Height:** 168 cm (5''6") **Quirk:** Navel Lazer Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Yuuga appears to be vain and prideful, thinking of himself as superior to the rest of his classmates, especially regarding his Quirk. He exhibits flamboyant mannerisms, is fond of posing, and likes to grab the attention of those around him despite frequently getting ignored by his peers. He also plays up his French heritage, occasionally implementing French words into his sentences. Yuuga''s Quirk allows him to shoot a powerful sparkling laser cannon from his navel. It is so powerful, it can blast through two meters of solid concrete. If he fires the laser for more than 1 second at a time, he will suffer intestinal distress.', '/uploads/images/c_127042.png'),
(135, 'Tetsutetsu Tetsutetsu', '鉄哲徹鐵', '配角', 'Kouji Okino', '__Height:__ 174cm (5''9") __Quirk:__ Steel Student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School. Tetsutetsu is defined by his very hotheaded and outspoken personality. He is confident, stubborn, and straightforward in his motivations and actions. He tends to be very vocal about his intentions and has a one-track mind, often looking for the simplest solution to problems to solve them most directly. Tetsutetsu''s direct personality shows through his tenacious and upfront fighting style during battles. Tetsutetsu''s Quirk allows him to turn his body into steel. This power grants Tetsutetsu both augmented defensive abilities to withstand attacks and the increased strength of his unarmed physical attacks.', '/uploads/images/c_127043.png'),
(135, 'Hizashi Yamada', '山田ひざし', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', '__Height:__ 185cm (6''1") __Quirk:__ Voice Pro Hero. He also works as an English teacher at U.A. High School and as a radio talk show host. Yamada maintains the eccentric persona of a radio host. He often poses when he talks and maintains a certain level of excitement or volume, regardless of the situation. Though he tends to be a jovial individual, Hizashi is capable of great rage when it comes to his friends and colleagues. Yamada''s Quirk "Voice" allows him to increase the volume of his voice, giving him an ability that is similar to a sonic scream. The sound from his Quirk is strong enough to cause people''s ears to bleed from far away. The only known weakness of this Quirk is that the loud sounds do not travel well underground, making this Quirk ineffective against anything that is underground or separated from him by layers of earth.', '/uploads/images/c_127425.png'),
(135, 'Nemuri Kayama', '香山睡', '配角', 'Akeno Watanabe', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") __Quirk:__ Somnambulist Pro Hero. She also works as a Modern Hero Art History teacher at U.A. High School. Nemuri is a very playful and flirtatious person with an unpredictably serious and temperamental side to her. She gets angry whenever someone interrupts her or insults her. She is especially sensitive about her age. Despite her flirtatious personality, Nemuri was intelligent, perceptive, and articulate. While she comes off as a hero who enjoys her fame derived from her beauty and sex appeal, Nemuri has demonstrated true heroism and bravery, willing to fight on the front lines and put her life at risk for others. Nemuri''s Quirk "Somnambulist" allows her to put nearby people to sleep by exuding a sleep-inducing aroma from her body. Her Quirk works better on males than females.', '/uploads/images/c_127427.png'),
(135, 'Sorahiko Torino', '酉野空彦', '配角', 'Kenichi Ogata', '__Height:__ 128 cm (4''2") __Affiliation:__ Yuuei (Retired) __Quirk:__ Jet A retired hero who is one of All Might''s colleagues and his former homeroom teacher. He was the one who taught All Might to control One For All during the his early days, and his training was so intense that All Might fears him to the point he subconsciously tried to forget about him until Grantorino sent his recommendation for Izuku to help him improve One For All, becoming his work place mentor. His Quirk is "Jet," allowing him to take in air through the sole of his foot to allow him to jump higher. (Source: Wikipedia)', '/uploads/images/c_127428.jpg'),
(135, 'Keigo Takami', '鷹見啓悟', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5'' 7¾") __Occupation:__ Pro Hero (No.3 - former, No.2 - current) __Quirk:__ Fierce Wings __Affiliation:__ Hero Public Safety Commission, ~!Paranormal Liberation Front (as a spy)!~ Hawks is carefree, jovial, and dislikes formalities, often acting in a spontaneous and unpredictable way while being cocky and taunting. He believes that popular approval is the most important metric a Pro Hero should be judged for, and does not appear to take the official rankings seriously, showing a preference for the lower ranks as it would allow him to act more freely and avoid the burdens of being a top hero. He states his wish to patrol in a leisurely fashion and "take it easy". It is hinted that Hawks was a fan of [Endeavor](https://anilist.co/character/126158/Todoroki-Enji) from an early age, as depicted by the drawing of him as a child holding an Endeavor figurine.', '/uploads/images/c_128299.png'),
(135, 'Taishirou Toyomitsu', '豊満太志郎', '配角', 'Kazuyuki Okitsu', '__Height:__ 250 cm (8''2") (Fat form) __Quirk:__ Fat Absorption In his fat form, Taishiro is a big round man, easily towering over other adults. In this form, his mouth is big, and his nose is smaller, which alongside his odd body proportions, give him an odd look. After burning through his fat, however, it is revealed that he is quite muscular, and his body adapts conventional proportions. His hero costume consists of black pants and an orange zippered hood, which has the initials of his alias on the front of Fat Gum. Alongside them, he also wears gloves, metallic boots, and a mask that covers his eyes and his forehead.', '/uploads/images/c_129755.jpg'),
(135, 'Manami Aiba', '相場愛美', '配角', 'Yui Horie', '__Quirk:__ Love Manami is a short woman who wears an elaborate outfit with several heart motifs, such as heart-shaped earrings, belt buckles, and a bowtie. She also wears a buttoned shirt with frilly cuffs, gloves, small high-heeled boots and, similar to Danjuro Tobita, a pair of poofy pinstriped pants, though hers boast a unique heart design near her inner thighs. Manami''s hair is arranged in pigtails with one large side-swept bang in the middle, and her eyes are big with ringed pupils. She appears to have dark circles around them.', '/uploads/images/c_129756.png'),
(135, 'Shinji Nishiya', '西屋森児', '配角', 'Masamichi Kitada', '__Height:__ 168 cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Arbor Pro Hero. Underneath his helmet, he has puffy red leaf-like hair, though his face has remained unseen since he has only been shown while wearing his mask. Shinji is a very serious and focused person when it comes to being a hero in his hero duties; however, he easily feels down when someone takes his glory or credit. Shinji''s Quirk "Arbor" (樹木, Jumoku) allows him to enlarge and control his wooden body parts into strong tree branches. These branches are excellent for binding.', '/uploads/images/c_129758.png'),
(135, 'Natsuo Todoroki', '轟夏雄', '配角', 'Yuuki Shin', '__Height:__ 181 cm Natsuo Todoroki is a college student. He is the son of [Enji](https://anilist.co/character/126158/Todoroki-Enji) and [Rei Todoroki](https://anilist.co/character/150628/Todoroki-Rei), the younger brother of Toya and [Fuyumi](https://anilist.co/character/150627/Todoroki-Fuyumi), and the older brother of [Shoto](https://anilist.co/character/89220/Todoroki-Shouto). Natsuo is a young man of average height, sporting white spiky hair with two small pieces of hair hanging down by his forehead. He greatly resembles his father at his age. Natsuo seems to be a care-free individual, as seen in his interactions with him and his family. However, he can be serious, and cares deeply for his family, except his father who he resents for his abusive treatment to his family. He does not feel forgiving to his father, blaming him for his mother Rei''s hospitalization and Shoto''s suffering.', '/uploads/images/c_129759.png'),
(135, 'Danjuurou Tobita', '飛田弾柔郎', '配角', 'Kouichi Yamadera', '__Height:__ 181cm (5''11") __Quirk:__ Elasticity Danjuro is a man with a refined appearance. He has a slicked back hairdo with a curl at the front. He sports a handlebar mustache along with a well-kept, medium-sized beard. Danjuro''s clothes are also quite extravagant, featuring a jacket with enlarged collars and coattails, a pair of loose pinstriped pants and two belts. He also wears a pair of cuffs and a woolly scarf, and he uses a cane to walk.', '/uploads/images/c_129760.png'),
(135, 'Mirai Sasaki', '佐々木未来', '主角', 'Shinichirou Miki', '__Height:__ 200 cm (6''6¾") __Birthplace:__ Tokyo, Japan __Quirk:__ Foresight A Pro Hero and [Mirio Togata](https://anilist.co/character/123527)''s mentor. He was formerly [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224)''s sidekick and was considered to be the brains behind All Might''s hero operation before opening his own hero agency. Sir Nighteye is a lean but muscular man with a clean, well-kept appearance. Unlike most Pro Heroes, he seems to prefer plain office clothes (a plain white suit with gold buttons, a white dress shirt, and a red tie with white dots) instead of an elaborate hero costume. Sir Nighteye maintains a stoic and intimidating presence, with a cold and sharp glare, but that is only the side of his personality that he shows in public. He greatly values humor and actually requires people to make him laugh before he acknowledes them. Nighteye believes that humor and energy are vital elements for the future of society and punishes subordinates that fail to display those qualities.', '/uploads/images/c_129761.jpg'),
(135, 'Naomasa Tsukauchi', '塚内直正', '配角', 'Tokuyoshi Kawashima', 'Naomasa Tsukauchi is a police detective in the Police Force. Naomasa is a tall man with short black hair and black eyes. As a member of the police force, he is normally seen in his uniform. He wears a signature tan overcoat and a matching hat. He also sports a black suit underneath with matching slacks and dress shoes. Detective Tsukauchi is an earnest, hardworking individual who has earned the right to be a close friend of All Might. Enough so, that he was even entrusted with the truth about One For All and the latter''s true form. He appears to have a close relationship with All Might, as he even leaked sensitive information to the hero just because he felt it was the right thing to do.', '/uploads/images/c_129762.png'),
(135, 'Seiji Shishikura', '肉倉精児', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', 'A second year student at Shiketsu High. His Quirk, "Meatball," allows him to roll all living flesh up into meatballs, as well as manipulate his own flesh to his liking. He can remotely control his own flesh after detaching it.', '/uploads/images/c_131155.png'),
(135, 'Kouta Izumi', '出水洸汰', '配角', 'Michiru Yamazaki', '__Height:__ 107cm (3''5") Kota Izumi is the nephew of Shino Sosaki and the son of the hero team Water Hose.', '/uploads/images/c_133659.jpg'),
(135, 'Kurogiri', '黒霧', '配角', 'Takahiro Fujiwara', '__Affiliation:__ League of Villains __Quirk:__ Warp Gate Kurogiri has a level-headed personality, which often serves to ground Tomura Shigaraki''s immaturity. He is intensely loyal to both All For One and Tomura. He is very polite and well-spoken, even to enemies. ~! Kurogiri is actually an intelligent Nomu made from the corpse of Eraserhead and President Mics high school friend Oboro Shirakumo made to serve Tomura Shigaraki. Although he remains unaware of his previous identity after Eraserheads efforts to talk to him it’s shown that a small part of Oboro is still in Kurogiri!~', '/uploads/images/c_137506.jpg'),
(135, 'Kenji Hikiishi', '引石健磁', '配角', 'Satoru Inoue', 'Hikiishi Kenji, also known as Magne was a villain affiliated with the League of Villains and part of its Vanguard Action Squad. She and the rest of her team serve as the main antagonists of the Forest Training Camp Arc. Magne preferred to go by female pronouns despite her masculine presentation.', '/uploads/images/c_141747.png'),
(135, 'Atsuhiro  Sako', 'コンプレス', '配角', 'Tsuguo Mogami', 'Mr. Compress''s Quirk allows him to "compress" anything in a spherical area into a small marble without actually damaging it. The weight of the target is reduced alongside them, making them very easy to carry. If used on a person, it effectively entraps them, terminating the fight instantly and allowing Mr. Compress to abduct them without difficulty. The Quirk can also be used on select body parts, maiming the target.', '/uploads/images/c_141748.png'),
(135, 'Giran', '義爛', '配角', 'Seirou Ogino', 'Giran is a B-rank villain and broker in affiliation with the League of Villains, working to scout new recruits for their organization', '/uploads/images/c_141749.jpg'),
(135, 'Kaoruko Awata', '泡田薫子', '配角', 'Rie Murakawa', 'Quirk: Bubble (バブル Baburu) With this Quirk, Kaoruko can make bubbles filled with an aroma that she had smelled at least once before. She can make both sweet-smelling bubbles and foul-smelling ones. When she’s too nervous, she produces very unpleasant-smelling bubbles that are self-destructing She is a dedicated hero as well as Sir Nighteyes sidekick', '/uploads/images/c_141893.png'),
(135, 'Shinya Kamihara', '紙原伸也', '配角', 'Kenta Kamakari', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Quirk:__ Foldabody: Shinya''s Quirk allows him to make his body and limbs extremely thin and long, effectively allowing him to transform himself into a razor sharp string. He is able to transform faster than the speed of sound. Shinya is a calm and focused individual, who is able to maintain a level head even when in a crisis situation, and encourages his teammates when they begin to panic. He is proven to be quite intelligent and is good at analyzing situations and strategy. He is the former Number 5 Pro-Hero, and is currently Number 4.', '/uploads/images/c_143275.png'),
(135, 'Tomoko Shiretoko', '知床知子', '配角', 'Chisa Suganuma', 'Her Quirk allowed her to observe and monitor up to 100 people at a time, including their location and weak points.', '/uploads/images/c_143535.jpg'),
(135, 'Tsunagu Hakamada', '袴田維', '配角', 'Hikaru Midorikawa', '__Height:__ 190cm (6''3") __Quirk:__ Fiber Master Pro Hero, ranked in the top 4. He is the recipient of the "Best Jeanist" award for eight consecutive years. Tsunagu is an elegant man with flamboyant tendencies. He believes very strongly that people with influence must maintain a positive appearance both physically and socially. Tsunagu often uses metaphors referencing jeans, denim, and various other sewing and fabric-based phrases, often inspiring his recruits with speeches, telling them to keep their life straight like their jeans. Tsunagu takes the role of being a hero very seriously. He is selfless, brave, and charismatic, and he aims to spread a sense of a peace to all people, no matter how dire the situation. Tsunagu''s Quirk "Fiber Master (ファイバーマスター)" allows him to freely manipulate the threads in any nearby piece of fabric. He has power over all types of cloth, but his Quirk works best with denim and is less effective on sweats. Fiber Master also works on other types of fiber not related to fabric, such as carbon fibers. He primarily uses this power to restrain his targets, either by using their own clothing against them, or simply unravels portions of his own clothing into strings.', '/uploads/images/c_143536.png'),
(135, 'Shino Sousaki', '送崎信乃', '配角', 'Meiko Kawasaki', 'Telepath: This Quirk allows Shino to utilize a mental transmission and send telepathic messages directly into people''s minds. Shino, has displayed the ability to send a message to tens of people at a time. She can send messages, but she can''t receive them', '/uploads/images/c_143537.jpg'),
(135, 'Yawara Chatora', '茶虎柔', '配角', 'Shinnosuke Ogami ', 'Pliabody: Yawara''s Quirk allows him to stretch, flatten, and bend his body in ways that would normally be impossible', '/uploads/images/c_143538.jpg'),
(135, 'Nezu', '根津', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Takato', '__Height:__ 85 cm __Quirk:__ High Spec Nezu, also known as Mr. Principal is a Pro Hero and the principal of U.A. High School. He is an extremely rare case of an animal who manifested a Quirk. He can be very long-winded at times when explaining or educating.', '/uploads/images/c_143539.png'),
(135, 'Gigantomachia', 'ギガントマキア', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Mamiya', 'Gigantomachia is a villain associated with the League of Villains.[1] He is one of All For One''s faithful servants and his former bodyguard, cultivated to be of use to Tomura Shigaraki if anything were to happen to him.', '/uploads/images/c_143540.png'),
(135, 'Ryuuko Tsuchikawa', '土川流子', '配角', 'Kaori Yagi', '__Height:__ 167cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Earth Flow Ryuko Tsuchikawa also known as Pixie-Bob, is a Pro Hero and a member of the Wild, Wild Pussycats. She is a very hyperactive and loud person with little regard for how she may come off to other people and also is very self-conscious about her age. Ryuko''s Quirk allows her to freely manipulate the earth for a variety of effects.', '/uploads/images/c_143541.jpg'),
(135, 'Thirteen', 'スペースヒーロ・13号 ', '配角', 'Inuko Inuyama', 'Thirteen is a wise, well-mannered person. As a rescue hero, Thirteen has displayed how passionate they are about saving people through their teachings. They even developed their own training facility - the Unforeseen Simulation Joint - to train future heroes in search and rescue tactics. They are very passionate about Quirks, specifically on the topic of using Quirks for creation and assistance rather than for destruction and battle. Thirteen has also been shown to be very brave. Despite not being a combat type, they do not hesitate to use their Quirk to fight against villains in the name of protecting others', '/uploads/images/c_143542.png'),
(135, 'Shin Nemoto', '音本真', '配角', 'Takayuki Masuda', 'Shin Nemoto is one of the Eight Expendables who works for Shie Hassaikai. Shin''s Quirk, Confession, allows him to force people to answer his questions with their true feeling. Shin appears to be a very cynic man as a result of the fact that he could never find anyone worthy of his trust and friendship thanks to his Quirk. He states that emotions are unnecessary to carry out objectives, but it is unknown if he actually believes this or if it was just a way to demoralize Mirio Togata as he fought Overhaul. As Overhaul is the only truly sincere person he’s ever met, Shin is extremely devoted to him. Since he is granted knowledge about his boss''s plans, Shin holds himself in high-esteem among the Eight Expendables, viewing himself as special and the only one of the group worthy of walking alongside Overhaul. Shin''s loyalty to Overhaul is enough to make him follow his boss even after getting completely overwhelmed in battle.', '/uploads/images/c_144519.png'),
(135, 'Hari Kurono', '玄野針', '配角', 'Takumi Asahina', '__Age:__ Unknown __Status:__ ~!Imprisoned!~ __Quirk:__ Chronostasis: Kurono''s Quirk allows him to slow down the movements of anything he hits with his clock hand-like hair. The minute hands slows a targets movements for one minute and the hour hand slows a targets movements for one hour. Kurono can extend his hair, but only if he is not moving. Hari Kurono, also known as Chronostasis, is a yakuza member afflicted with the Shie Hassaikai, and the assistant/right hand man to Overhaul. He is one of the main antagonists of the Shie Hassaikai Arc.', '/uploads/images/c_144520.jpg'),
(135, 'Deidoro Sakaki', '酒木泥泥 ', '配角', 'Kouji Takahashi', '__Age:__ Unknown __Status:__ ~!Imprisoned!~ __Quirk:__ Sloshed: Deidoro''s Quirk allows him to subject nearby people to severe dizziness and inhibit their sense of balance, putting them in a state similar to being drunk. He is often seen drinking shortly before using his Quirk, meaning the strength of Sloshed could directly correlate with how much alcohol Deidoro consumes. This may have contributed to his alcoholic nature, or could be a completely independent variable. Deidoro Sakaki is one of the Eight Expendables who works for the Shie Hassaikai.', '/uploads/images/c_144521.png'),
(135, 'Yuu Houjou', '宝生結', '配角', 'Kenichirou Matsuda', 'Yu Hojo is one of the Eight Expendables who works for Shie Hassaikai. Quirk Crystallization: Yu''s Quirk grants him the ability to produce crystals on his body. This is effective for both close-ranged offense and defense. He can also grow his crystals to form a sword around his arm', '/uploads/images/c_144522.png'),
(135, 'Kendou Rappa', '乱波肩動', '配角', 'Shouhei Kajikawa', '__Quirk:__ Strongarm One of the Eight Bullets who serves Overhaul and the Shie Hassaikai. Kendou is a very hot-blooded man who thrives on violence and bloodshed. He has a warrior-like mentality, and he only cares about seeking a battle that can satisfy him. Kendou believes it''s unbecoming for a fighter to use weapons and that everyone should fight with the power of their bodies. Unlike most of the Eight Bullets, Kendou only serves Overhaul because he hopes to one day defeat him. Kendo''s Quirk allows him to rotate his shoulders at extreme speeds, allowing him to attack his targets with a near-endless barrage of bullet punches.', '/uploads/images/c_144523.png'),
(135, 'Rikiya Katsukame', '活瓶力也', '配角', 'Hiroaki Okuda', 'Rikiya Katsukame is one of the Eight Expendables who works under Overhaul for Shie Hassaikai. Quirk Enhanced Strength: Even without activating his Quirk, Rikiya exhibits superhuman brawn, befitting his massive build. On two separate occasions, he effortlessly burst through a wall and a locked gate, knocking several policemen into the air while doing so, and casually damaged the jamb while readying his next punch.', '/uploads/images/c_144524.jpg'),
(135, 'Soramitsu Tabe', '多部空満', '配角', 'Kengo Tsujii', 'Soramitsu Tabe is one of the Eight Expendables who works for Shie Hassaikai. Quirk Food: Soramitsu''s Quirk allows his teeth and jaws to easily chew and consume anything. His stomach is also able to digest what he has eaten with no trouble.', '/uploads/images/c_144558.jpg'),
(135, 'Hekiji Tengai', '天蓋壁慈', '配角', 'Jun Miyamoto', 'Hekiji Tengai is one of the Eight Expendables who works for Shie Hassaikai under Overhaul. Quirk Barrier Hekiji''s Quirk allows him to create telekinetic barriers in the shape of a dome around him, for defensive purposes', '/uploads/images/c_144559.png'),
(135, 'Joui Irinaka', '入中常衣', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Mamiya', 'Joi Irinaka also known as Mimic ミミック is a Yakuza and the general manager of Shie Hassaikai. Quirk Mimicry: Joi''s Quirk allows him to transfer his body and mind into an object, allowing him full control over it. This Quirk, however, only works on objects that are about the size of a refrigerator or smaller', '/uploads/images/c_144560.png'),
(135, 'Touya Setsuno', '窃野トウヤ', '配角', 'KENN', 'Toya Setsuno is one of the Eight Expendables who works for Shie Hassaikai. Quirk Larceny: Toya is capable of instantly moving objects in the possession of someone directly into his hands, in a manner similar to teleportation. However, the limits to his Quirk depend on the size of what he can steal,which must also be within his sight', '/uploads/images/c_144561.png'),
(135, 'Juuzou Moashi', '百足従造', '配角', 'Kenta Ookuma', '__Quirk:__ Centipede: Juuzou''s Quirk grants him long, centipede-like limbs, which he can use to attack or restrain enemies from afar. Moashi is a sidekick affiliated with [Sir Nighteye](https://anilist.co/character/129761/)''s Hero Office. Juuzou is a gentleman and a very well mannered person', '/uploads/images/c_145290.png'),
(135, 'Ryuuko Tatsuma', '竜間龍子', '配角', 'Kaori Yagi', 'When she activates her Quirk, her body transforms into that of a large, winged dragon with pale gray scales, although she still has the same skin tone, hair and eyes, and her hero costume remains visible bar her boots.', '/uploads/images/c_145291.jpg'),
(135, 'Ken Takagi', '高木鍵', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Fujiwara', 'Quirk: Lock Down:/Ken can immobilize anything not living, locking it into a particular place. However, it can be overwhelmed by force and cannot apply to large areas. Ken is a man of average height, with a darker complexion and dark, curly hair. He has pierced ears with padlocks in them. Notably, his fingertips have protrusions that resemble key teeth. Part of his hero costume is a small white mask that covers his eyes. He wears a necklace around his neck with five keys dangling from it. Rock Lock wears a two-colored, short-sleeved shirt with a black section and a white print on it, resembling a keyhole. He wears two light-colored shoulder pads with a dark keyhole shape on both of them.', '/uploads/images/c_145292.png'),
(135, 'Rumi Usagiyama', '兎山ルミ', '配角', 'Sayaka Kinoshita', 'Rumi is the No. 5 Pro Hero. She has an athletic build with muscular arms and legs. She has dark skin, red eyes which are tilted slightly inwards, and straight white hair reaching down past her waist. On her head, she has a pair of long white rabbit ears pointing upwards with a slight crook. Along with these, she also has a round white tail, which gives her overall design a definite resemblance to an albino rabbit. Her hero costume consists of a sleeveless white leotard with dark purple trim around her shoulders and waist, a wide, yellow crescent moon design over her chest, and two thick metal plates on her midriff. She wears purple thigh-high boots to compliment her leotard, with more plating around the heel and toe areas, making her feet look like those of a rabbit. She also has white gloves on her hands, with long cuffs, sporting small triangular protrusions around the edges.', '/uploads/images/c_148985.png'),
(135, 'Ryou Inui', '犬井猟', '配角', 'Eiji Hanawa', 'Ryo Inui is a Pro Hero and serves as the Lifestyle Guidance Counselor at U.A. High School.', '/uploads/images/c_149178.png'),
(135, 'Kuugo Sakamata', '逆俣空悟', '配角', 'Shuuhei Matsuda', 'Gang Orca is the current No. 11 Pro Hero, dropping from his previous No. 10 place. He took part in the assault on All For One and the League of Villains at Kamino Ward, and later served as a makeshift villain during the Provisional Hero License Exam.', '/uploads/images/c_149186.png'),
(135, 'Desutegoro', 'デステゴロ', '配角', 'Shinnosuke Ogami ', 'Death Arms is a Pro Hero. He took part in the fight against the Sludge Villain, and later witnessed the U.A. Sports Festival from outside the arena, along with Mt. Lady and Kamui Woods.', '/uploads/images/c_149187.png'),
(135, 'Ken Ishiyama', '石山堅', '配角', 'Kenta Ookuma', 'Cementoss is a Pro Hero as well as a teacher at U.A. High School. During the U.A. Sports Festival, he acted as the proctor for the 1-on-1 fights in case things got out of hand. He also faced off against Eijiro Kirishima and Rikido Sato in their Final Exam.', '/uploads/images/c_149188.jpg'),
(135, 'Fuyumi Todoroki', '轟冬美', '配角', 'Kei Shindou', 'The only daughter of Eiji and Rei. Fuyumi is the younger sister of Touya and the older sister of Natsuo and Shouto. Fuyumi is a hard working girl, often making meals for the family and works as a teacher at an unnamed school. Unlike her family members, she doesn''t resent her father and just wishes they could all be a happy family, though she realizes such a thing is unlikely. Upon hearing Shouto gains friends, however, Fuyumi gets quite excited over it and is happy for him. In the past, Fuyumi took care of Shouto after their mother went to a hospital and never came back. To this day, her wish that she could have done something for Shouto still lingers within her.', '/uploads/images/c_150627.png'),
(135, 'Rei Todoroki', '轟冷', '配角', 'Michiko Neya', 'The damaged mother of the Todoroki family. Rei has an ice related quirk, which is believed to be powerful, as Eiji would not have had kids with her otherwise. In the past, Rei was very supportive towards Shouto and his dreams to become like All Might. She used to always say that his blood does not define him for him and for herself. Rei, who was once a kind and caring woman, is now in a mental ward. After all the abuse she faced from Eiji, she began to become mentally unstable. Over time, she had slowly began to snap, until she finally poured boiling water onto Shouto''s left side after seeing it. Immediately after burning Shouto, Rei began to apologize and attempt to comfort him when she realized what she had done. Due to her snapping, she was placed into a mental ward for her own safety. Even though Rei is in a mental ward, she has since returned to her former self. When Shouto visited, she was immensely happy and apologized for what she had done to him. Fuyumi and Natsuo also visit her as well, though she has yet to meet Eiji face to face again out of fear.', '/uploads/images/c_150628.png'),
(135, 'Ectoplasm', 'エクトプラズム', '配角', 'Masakazu Nishida', '__Height:__ 180 cm (5'' 11") __Affiliation:__ Yuuei __Quirk:__ Clones Ectoplasm has the ability to produce ectoplasm from his mouth and transform it into clones of himself. He can create up to thirty clones at once, and push his limit to thirty-six if he''s feeling good. He can also produce a giant clone of himself, although this sacrifices his ability to produce normal-sized ones for the time being. His clones can be defeated with a strong blow, but otherwise, only Ectoplasm can dispel them.', '/uploads/images/c_150853.jpg'),
(135, 'Taneo Tokuda ', '特田種男 ', '配角', 'Eiji Hanawa', 'Taneo Tokuda is a freelance journalist working for Juzo News, a magazine publisher. He is an anime-exclusive character', '/uploads/images/c_150854.png'),
(135, 'Hassaikai Kumichou', '八斎會組長', '配角', 'Naomi Kusumi', 'Without revealing his name a man known as “The Boss originally ran the organization known as The Shie Hassaikai. The Boss always believed his gang should follow a set or code and morals, The Boss would be known for raising Kai Chisaki with Chisaki turning on him later to run the organization to follow his own views with him putting the boss into a comatose state. The Boss would be the one to introduce Kai Chisaki to his grand daughter Eri.', '/uploads/images/c_157246.png'),
(135, 'Chiyo  Shuuzenji', '修善寺治与', '配角', 'Etsuko Kozakura', '__Quirk:__ Heal __Occupation:__ Pro Hero, Nurse Chiyo has a very kind and compassionate personality, where she treats everyone kindly, though she does have a strict and reproaching attitude towards those that have done something foolish. She''s mostly like this with All Might for not teaching Izuku how to use his Quirk properly or with Izuku for using his Quirk recklessly.', '/uploads/images/c_157655.jpg'),
(135, 'Yokumiru Mera', '目良善見', '配角', 'Masami Iwasaki', 'Yokumiru Mera is a worker for the Hero Public Safety Commission. He suffers from sleep deprivation due to overwork, something that he complains about frequently.', '/uploads/images/c_158615.png'),
(135, 'Sajin Higawara', '日河原砂塵', '配角', 'Kouji Ishii', '__Quirk:__ SandStorm Sajin Higawara also known as Sand Hero: Snatch was a Pro Hero and a bodyguard for the Police Force.', '/uploads/images/c_158616.jpg'),
(135, 'High End', 'ハイエンド', '配角', 'Tsuguo Mogami', '__Affiliation:__ League of Villains High End Nomu was an intelligent Nomu created and is shown to be obedient to its master. They were one of the main antagonists in the Pro Hero Arc.', '/uploads/images/c_165314.png'),
(135, 'Snipe', 'スナイプ', '配角', 'Tooru Nara', '__Quirk:__ Homing Snipe is a Pro Hero and a member of the teaching staff at U.A. High School. Snipe has the appearance of a stereotypical western cowboy Snipe''s Quirk allows him to lock on to any target he can see within six hundred meters and make any projectile he releases chase after said target', '/uploads/images/c_191596.jpg'),
(135, 'Bibimi Kenranzaki', '絢爛崎美々美', '配角', 'Ayano Shibuya', 'Bibimi Kenranzaki is a student of U.A. High School''s Department of Support from Class 3-G and is the two time winner of the U.A. School Festival''s Miss Con.', '/uploads/images/c_198586.png'),
(135, 'Wash', 'ウォッシュ', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_208144.jpg'),
(135, 'Yosetsu Awase', '泡瀬洋雪', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'Although he is not as social as some others, Yosetsu is foul-mouthed and tense, except for serious or life-or-death situations, in which he becomes very easily startled and much more talkative, although he retains his harsh way of speech.', '/uploads/images/c_208147.jpg'),
(135, 'Reiko Yanagi', '柳レイ子', '配角', 'Ayane Sakura', 'Reiko is a quiet and emotionless teenager who often shows an odd body posture.', '/uploads/images/c_208149.jpg'),
(135, 'Kenji Tsuragamae', '面構犬嗣', '配角', 'Ryouta Takeuchi', 'Kenji is the Chief of the Police Force.', '/uploads/images/c_239975.png'),
(135, 'Kyoutoku Jirou', '耳郎響徳', '配角', '', 'Kyotoku Jiro is Kyoka Jiro''s father.', '/uploads/images/c_239977.png'),
(135, 'Hiroshi Tameda', '為田浩', '配角', 'Serina Machiyama', '__Height:__ 170cm Hiroshi Tameda also known as "Can''t You See?" kid, is a loyal fan of Endeavor.', '/uploads/images/c_242855.png'),
(135, 'Crust', 'クラスト', '配角', '', '__Quirk:__ Shield __Occupation:__ Pro Hero (No.6) __Fighting Style:__ Close-ranged combat', '/uploads/images/c_289314.jpg'),
(135, 'Yoroi Musha', 'ヨロイムシャ', '配角', '', '__Quirk:__ Unknown __Occupation:__ Pro Hero ~!(Retired)!~ No. 9 Pro Hero. ~!He retired due to the high backlash against Heroes following the Paranormal Liberation War.!~', '/uploads/images/c_297175.png'),
(135, 'Yuuyu Haya', '甲矢有弓', '配角', 'Momoko Soyama', '__Height:__ 160 cm Third-year student in U.A. High School''s Hero Course. She has an unnamed Electric Arrow quirk.', '/uploads/images/c_340706.png'),
(135, 'Komari Ikoma', '生駒小麿里', '配角', 'Sara Matsumoto', '__Height:__ 157cm School teacher at Masegaki Primary School. Komari is often exasperated by her students'' near-constant rude antics, and describes them as being "problem children". She is very distressed, nearly to the point of crying, when they constantly ignore her instructions. However, after seeing her students behaving differently at the Provisional Hero License Course, she was inspired to not give up.', '/uploads/images/c_343424.png'),
(135, 'Tamashiro', '玉城', '配角', 'Haruka Shamoto', 'Student from Masegaki Primary School.', '/uploads/images/c_343425.png'),
(135, 'Leader Danshi Jidou', 'リーダー男子児童', '配角', 'Ayano Shibuya', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_343427.png'),
(135, 'Josei Kisha', '女性記者', '配角', 'Yuu Shimamura', 'Television news reporter.', '/uploads/images/c_345848.png'),
(136, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(136, 'Mikasa Ackerman', 'ミカサ・アッカーマン', '主角', 'Yui Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") - 176 cm (5''9½") __Position:__ 104th Training Corps, Survey Corps __Relatives:__ [Birth Mother](https://anilist.co/character/84341/Mikasa-no-Haha) (Deceased), [Birth Father](https://anilist.co/character/84339/Mikasa-no-Chichi) (Deceased), [Grisha Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/62477/Grisha-Yeager) (Foster Father), [Carla Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/62475/Carla-Yeager) (Foster Mother, Deceased), [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) (Foster Brother) Mikasa is Eren Yaeger''s foster sister and mutual childhood friend of [Armin Arlert](https://anilist.co/character/46494), living with the two of them in Shiganshina District within the southern region of Wall Maria. When she was young, her parents were killed by human traffickers, and she was kidnapped. Eren discovered this and helped her escape her captors. Later, Eren gave her his scarf, which she constantly wears and shares an emotional attachment to. She was adopted by the Yaeger family soon after. Because of these past events, Mikasa shares an unbreakable bond with Eren and lives to protect him, constantly worrying for Eren''s well-being. After the Titans broke through Wall Maria and killed her and Eren''s mother, she chose to follow Eren into the military to try and keep him safe from danger. Even as a child, Mikasa possessed impressive fighting skill and strength, and that skill was only honed further during her training. Mikasa is considered a genius among all th', '/uploads/images/c_40881.png'),
(136, 'Eren Yeager', 'エレン・イェーガー', '主角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") - 183 cm (6''0") __Affiliation:__ 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps. Eren was born to [Carla](https://anilist.co/character/62475/Yeager-Carla) and [Grisha Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/62477/Yeager-Grisha) in Shiganshina District within the southern region of Wall Maria. He grew up in the town with his parents and foster sister [Mikasa](https://anilist.co/character/40881/Ackerman-Mikasa), who moved in with the Yeagers as a child. Eren spent most of his time with Mikasa and their mutual best friend [Armin Arlert](https://anilist.co/character/46494/Arlert-Armin), whom the pair often defended from neighborhood bullies. Eren is a passionate, determined, hardheaded, and impulsive young man. When they were children, Armin showed him a book depicting the wonders of the outside world. Eren grew to share Armin''s curiosity of the world beyond the Walls and resolved to see it for himself. This dream inspired his admiration of the Survey Corps and his desire to join their ranks as soon as he became eligible for enrollment. When the Titans suddenly broke through Wall Maria into Shiganshina, Eren was forced to watch on as his mother became trapped under the rubble of their house and eaten by a titan. Forever changed from this event, Eren vows to kill every last titan.', '/uploads/images/c_40882.jpg'),
(136, 'Levi', 'リヴァイ', '主角', 'Hiroshi Kamiya', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") Squad Captain of the Special Operations Squad (known as Squad Levi) within the Survey Corps. He is known as humanity''s strongest soldier. Levi is abrasive, blunt, and has a strong respect for structure and discipline. He is a clean-freak, demanding spotless cleanliness of himself, his equipment, and his environment. Rumors say he was involved in underground crime in his life before coming a soldier. Despite his emotionless and unfriendly demeanor, Levi cares deeply for his squad and greatly values human life.', '/uploads/images/c_45627.png'),
(136, 'Sasha Blouse', 'サシャ・ブラウス', '配角', 'Yuu Kobayashi', '__Initial Height:__ 168cm __Affiliations__: 104th Cadet Corps, Survey Corps; Soldier __Relatives__: [Artur Blouse](https://anilist.co/character/131281/Artur-Blouse) (Father), [Lisa Blouse](https://anilist.co/character/134952/Lisa-Blouse) (Mother) Originally from Dauper, a remote and scarcely populated village of hunters located in a mountain forest in the southern area of Wall Rose, Sasha joined the military as a cadet of the 104th Training Corps, where she ranked 9th upon graduation. After graduating, she''d choose to enlist in the Scouting Regiment. Sasha is a friendly and fun-loving girl. She speaks with a local accent from her home village, but initially hid it out of embarrassment by using overly formal and polite speech. She is a constant food hoarder and is known to have an incredible appetite; eating provided her with considerable gratification and relief, especially during times of great stress, and food was often the only thing on her mind when at ease. Raised as an animal hunter, Sasha specializes in archery, horseback riding, and tracking, although her eccentricity and unconventional methods tend to make her a poor fit for group operations. ~!She later saves a child named [Kaya](https://anilist.co/character/132738/Kaya) from a titan attack, who her family ends up adopting.!~', '/uploads/images/c_45887.jpg'),
(136, 'Reiner Braun', 'ライナー・ブラウン', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', '__Height__: 185 cm (6''1") Member of the Survey Corps and former cadet of the 104th Training Corps. Reiner is a passionate and strong-willed young man with a strong sense of duty. He ranked 2nd in his training class upon graduation, finishing behind only [Mikasa](https://anilist.co/character/40881). His comrades have great trust in him, and he is stated to be the "big brother" of the 104th cadets.', '/uploads/images/c_46484.png'),
(136, 'Connie Springer', 'コニー・スプリンガー', '配角', 'Hiro Shimono', '__Height__: 158 cm (5''2") __Relatives:__ [Mother](https://anilist.co/character/137287/Conny-no-Haha), Martin Springer (Brother), Sunny Springer (Sister) Connie Springer is a graduate of the 104th Training Corps, having ranked 8th in class. He is known to be one of the quickest soldiers while using ODM gear and is skilled at making very sharp turns. He hails from the rural Ragako Village within Wall Rose, his greatest ambition being to make his family and village proud of him. Upon graduation, he chose to join the Survey Corps. Upbeat and naive, Connie is rather unfocused outside of combat, and enjoys goofing around and messing with his friends, but can also be a bit dense at times, as he can have some difficulty comprehending new developments as they appear. Connie always tries to remain optimistic, consistently caring for the well-being of his friends, family and village, and being willing to help in any way he can. However, this soft spot and the struggles he goes through as a member of the Survey Corps takes a toll on him, as he often responds to grief and loss with anger, irritation and hatred, causing him to at times make rash, impulsive decisions. He will do anything to protect his family, whether it be his biological family or his closest friends.', '/uploads/images/c_46486.png'),
(136, 'Bertolt Hoover', 'ベルトルト・フーバー', '配角', 'Tomohisa Hashizume', '__Height__: 192 cm (6''3") __Affiliation__: Survey Corps Member of the Survey Corps and former cadet of the 104th Training Corps. Bertoldt ranked 3rd in his training class upon graduation, finishing behind only [Mikasa](https://anilist.co/character/40881) and his hometown friend [Reiner](https://anilist.co/character/46484). He is a quiet young man who identifies himself as someone with a weak will that follows popular opinion. Despite ranking 3rd in his class, his training commandant noted him to be a person with great potential, but an utter lack of initiative. Bertoldt originally he enlisted in the military with aspirations of joining the Military Police and living in the safety of the inner wall, but after the Battle of Trost he instead decided to join the Survey Corps.', '/uploads/images/c_46488.jpg'),
(136, 'Annie Leonhart', 'アニ・レオンハート', '配角', 'Yuu Shimamura', '__Height__: 153 cm (5") A member of the 104th Southern Division in the Cadet Corps. After graduating from the 104th, ranked 4th place in the top 10, she ends up joining the Military Police. She is roommates with [Hitch Dreyse](https://anilist.co/character/86017). A stoic girl, Annie is considered to be an isolated, solitary type, being rarely seen smiling or socializing and often having an emotionless expression. She is apathetic and somnolent, with little desire to put in any effort into meaningless disciplines or activities. Nonetheless, what drives Annie more than anything is her desire for a normal life.', '/uploads/images/c_46490.jpg'),
(136, 'Armin Arlert', 'アルミン・アルレルト', '主角', 'Marina Inoue', '__Height:__ 163 cm (5''4") __Position:__ 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps __Relatives:__ [Grandfather](https://anilist.co/character/84313/Armin-no-Ojiisan) Armin is a young boy who was born and raised in the Shiganshina District within the walls, being childhood friends with both [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) and [Mikasa Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/40881). After Wall Maria was breached, he chose to join Mikasa and Eren in joining the military, both to try to make a good and meaningful impact on the world, and to fulfill his dream of seeing the outside world. Even when he was young, the naturally curious Armin has always had a deep fascination with the world beyond the Walls. As a child, he found and studied an illegal book about the outside world that was owned by his grandfather. He often shared the book and information contained in it with Eren Yeager, his best friend, and his dreams of seeing the world outside the walls. Armin was branded a heretic by other children for his unusual interest in the outside world and was thus frequently picked on. Too timid to defend himself, Armin would often rely on his friends Eren and Mikasa Ackerman to protect him from local bullies. This, coupled with his frail physique, was a deep shame for Armin, leading him to have poor self-esteem and to believe that he is a burden to others. Because of this, Armin has always been very eager to prove his worth, especially towards his close friends. Armin ', '/uploads/images/c_46494.png'),
(136, 'Erwin Smith', 'エルヴィン・スミス', '主角', 'Daisuke Ono', '**Height:** 188 cm **Position:** 13th Commander, Survey Corps Discerning, intelligent, and widely respected, Erwin is the unshakable and calculated 13th commander of the Survey Corps. While he cares deeply for his men, he does not hesitate to sacrifice them for the good and prosperity of mankind, and his men have proven more than willing to stake their lives at his order. Erwin developed the Long-Distance Enemy Scouting Formation.', '/uploads/images/c_46496.png'),
(136, 'Jean Kirstein', 'ジャン・キルシュタイン', '配角', 'Kishou Taniyama', '__Height__: 175 cm (5''8") __Relatives__: [Mother](https://anilist.co/character/131444/Jean-no-Haha) Jean Kirschtein is a graduate of the 104th Cadet Corps, among whom he ranked 6th for his skills with ODM gear and ability to look at things through a more tactical lense. Jean hails from Wall Rose''s Trost District, and joined the military with hopes of living a peaceful life within the walls as part of the Military Police. However, he would later find himself joining the Survey Corps after being convinced both by his close friend [Marco Bott''s](https://anilist.co/character/62479/Marco-Bott) words, and after witnessing the death of several of his comrades. Jean has a blunt personality. He holds no restraint when it comes to speaking his mind, even when he knows it would not be wise to do so or when it could spark conflict. Jean is also pragmatic: he has a strong aversion to exposing himself to dangerous situations. During his time as a cadet, Jean was extremely hot-headed, easily becoming frustrated and quick to resort to violence when pushed. Jean was also very cynical about defeating the Titans, believing that humanity has no chance against them and openly mocking more idealistic individuals like [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager), and saw resisting the Titans as a hopeless cause. However, despite these things, and although he presents himself as self-centered, Jean places high value on the lives of his comrades, and is willing to risk his life to pr', '/uploads/images/c_46498.png'),
(136, 'Carla Yeager', 'カルラ・イェーガー', '配角', 'Yoshino Takamori', 'Eren''s mother. ~!She''s eaten alive in the second chapter.!~ Note: Carla Yeager is the official English translation by Kodansha.', '/uploads/images/c_62475.png'),
(136, 'Grisha Yeager', 'グリシャ・イェーガー', '配角', 'Hiroshi Tsuchida', 'Father of [Eren Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) and caretaker of [Mikasa Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/40881/Mikasa-Ackerman). He is a renowned doctor who was well respected in the District of Shiganshina after he saved the village from a mysterious viral epidemic by developing vaccines. He also provides a medical house call service to the people of Shiganshina and to various towns in addition to having a network of contacts within the Corps of the Shiganshina District. He is married to [Carla Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/62475). ~!In the basement of the Yeager family house, he hides a secret which he refers to as the "truth". Upon finding Eren after the fall of Wall Maria, he injects him with a series of chemicals and amnesiacs and entrusts him with the key to the "truth", before mysteriously disappearing. This strange serum resulted in Eren gaining the ability to transform into a titan.!~', '/uploads/images/c_62477.jpg'),
(136, 'Marco Bott', 'マルコ・ボット', '配角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', '__Height__: 178 cm (5''9") __Affiliations__: 104th Training Corps Originally from Jinae District. Marco ranked 7th in the 104th Training Corps and is widely respected by other cadets of the 104th. Marco is a very kind, calm, and idealistic person, valuing the good of the group above his own interests, as well as understanding and coping with his own shortcomings and limitations. He is seen as a natural leader, and desires to join the Military Police to serve near the King. *Note: Marco Bott is the official English translation by Kodansha.*', '/uploads/images/c_62479.jpg'),
(136, 'Krista Lenz', 'クリスタ・レンズ', '配角', 'Shiori Mikami', '__Height__: 145 cm (4''8") __Affiliations__: 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps Ranked tenth in the trainee class, Krista is a very shy and kind, caring person, often being described as a "goddess" or "angel" by her peers. She is good friends with [Ymir](https://anilist.co/character/71479/Ymir).', '/uploads/images/c_62481.png'),
(136, 'Dot Pixis', 'ドット・ピクシス', '配角', 'Masahiko Tanaka', 'The highest-ranked Administrator of the Southern Region. Head of the Garrison''s Southern Territories, Pixis is a cunning leader with astute insights. However, he is also an alcoholic who is constantly watched over by his aid, [Anka](https://anilist.co/character/84331/Anka-Rheinberger), who constantly scolds him for sleeping and drinking during critical moments.', '/uploads/images/c_62485.png'),
(136, 'Hange Zoe', 'ハンジ・ゾエ', '配角', 'Romi Park', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Affiliation:__ Survey Corps; Section Commander, Squad Leader. Leader of the Survey Corps'' Fourth Squad, Hange is also in charge of conducting research on Titans, and pursues this knowledge so passionately that they have become obsessed with Titans as a result. After originally holding a deep hatred for the creatures, Hange decided to take on a new outside-the-box approach to their research by letting go of their resentment towards Titans and approaching the test subjects with compassion. Hange is an energetic, freethinking and quirky scientist, with a unique way of conducting both themselves and their work. Hange is a genius outside of just Titan research too, using their brain to create weapons, tactical plans, and inventions for the benefit of humanity. As a leader, Hange is thoughtful of their comrades, and can easily figure out complex problems in order to create plans for their teammates to carry out.', '/uploads/images/c_71121.png'),
(136, 'Nile Dok', 'ナイル・ドーク', '配角', 'Anri Katsu', 'Chief of the Military Police.', '/uploads/images/c_71123.png'),
(136, 'Darius Zackly', 'ダリス・ザックレー', '配角', 'Hideaki Tezuka', 'The head of all three divisions of the army. __ _Note:___ Darius Zackly is the official English translation by Kodansha.', '/uploads/images/c_71125.png'),
(136, 'Marlo Freudenberg', 'マルロ・フロイデンベルク', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', '__Affiliations:__ Military Police, 104th Cadet Corps. Recruit of the Military Police stationed in Stohess District. While most who join the Military Police Regiment do so because they want a safe position far from the danger of the Titans, Marlo did so because he claims to want "to uphold justice and do what''s right.", much to the amusement of his fellow officer, [Hitch Dreyse](https://anilist.co/character/86017/Hitch-Dreyse), whom he often clashes with due to them being near complete opposites. His goal is to rise to the top of the organization so he can stop the pilfering of taxes and misappropriation of land. Though steadfast in his idealism, he could make moral compromises to achieve his goal, confessing a willingness to act like "scum" in order to move up in rank. Due to his passion towards his ideals, he had often been compared to [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) by people who know both of them.', '/uploads/images/c_71457.png'),
(136, 'Ymir', 'ユミル', '配角', 'Saki Fujita', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5''7") __Affiliations:__ 104th Trainees Squad, Scouting Legion Member of the Scouting Legion. She seems selfish, cynical, bossy, sly, uncooperative, exploitative, and confrontational, but she can apparently be kind, especially to [Krista](https://anilist.co/character/62481/Krista-Lenz).', '/uploads/images/c_71479.png'),
(136, 'Gustav', 'グスタフ', '配角', 'Gou Shinomiya', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_84329.png'),
(136, 'Anka Rheinberger', 'アンカ・ラインベルガー', '配角', 'Ikumi Hayama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_84331.png'),
(136, 'Hitch Dreyse', 'ヒッチ・ドリス', '配角', 'Akeno Watanabe', '**Height:** 168 cm __Affiliations:__ 104th Cadet Corps. Recruit of the Military Police stationed in Stohess District. She was roommates with [Annie Leonhart](https://anilist.co/character/46490/Annie-Leonhart). Hitch acts immature in certain ways, she has a sarcastic, easygoing personality and seems to mischievously enjoy teasing and needling her fellow officers, especially [Marlo Freudenberg](https://anilist.co/character/71457/Marlo-Freudenberg). She claims she chose to join the Military Police out of laziness, as it is well known that the senior staff are incredibly corrupt and she wanted to benefit from the system herself; however, she did not take into account that, as a new recruit, her superiors would dump all their work on her. Though she may act a bit air-headed at times, Hitch is not selfish and cares about those around her, especially her fellow comrades.', '/uploads/images/c_86017.jpg'),
(136, 'Zeke', 'ジーク', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', '__Height__: 183 cm Zeke is the current inheritor of the Beast Titan, and is considered by [Reiner Braun](https://anilist.co/character/46484/Reiner-Braun) to be the strongest Warrior, contrasting [Levi''s](https://anilist.co/character/45627/Levi) title of "humanity''s strongest soldier".', '/uploads/images/c_125661.png'),
(136, 'Rod Reiss', 'ロッド・レイス', '配角', '', '~!is the true king of humanity, currently masquerading as a noble living in Wall Sina. He is a member of the Reiss family and Historia''s illegitimate father.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127360.jpg'),
(136, 'Kenny Ackerman', 'ケニー・アッカーマン', '配角', 'Kazuhiro Yamaji', '__Affiliation:__ Military Police; Captain of Anti-Personnel Control Squad. __Relatives:__ [Kuchel Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/127940/Kuchel-Ackerman) (Sister), [Unnamed Grandfather](https://anilist.co/character/128589/Kenny-no-Ojiisan), Kenny Ackerman is a member of the Military Police Brigade''s First Interior Squad and also the Anti-Personnel Control Squad. Decades prior, however, Kenny was known as an infamous serial killer that stalked victims in the capitol. Despite his dark field of work, Kenny appears to be rather jovial and takes pleasure in taunting his adversaries during battle. When fighting, he becomes animated and lively, often making a scene or otherwise throwing insults and witticisms. However, he also fought with control and was able to effortlessly sneak up on his targets when they least expected him. His preferred method of killing during his time as a serial killer was to slit the throats of his victims which earned him his infamous handle "Kenny the Ripper", and it was rumored that he murdered over 100 members of the Military Police Brigade. However, decades later his killings ceased and the terror that he once inspired dwindled into an Urban Legend. He eventually was found working under the Royal Government, the reasoning for his sudden shift in behavior being a mystery. Kenny is ultimately, despite his comical personality, very cold and calculated, sparing little emotional attachment or loyalty to anyone, with only a few exceptions. ~!ㅤ He nota', '/uploads/images/c_127443.png'),
(136, 'Flagel  Reeves', 'フレーゲル・リーブス ', '配角', 'Tasuku Hatanaka', 'Flegel Reeves is the son of Dimo Reeves', '/uploads/images/c_127569.jpg'),
(136, 'Uri Reiss', 'ウーリ・レイス', '配角', '', 'the younger brother of Rod Reiss and the paternal uncle of Frieda Reiss. ~!He was the true king of the Walls for some time until the year 842 and was Kenny Ackermann''s best friend. He inherited the Founding Titan from his father, and passed it along with the crown to his niece, Frieda Reiss.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127570.png'),
(136, 'Moblit Berner', 'モブリット・バーナー', '配角', 'Rintarou Nishi', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9") __Affiliation:__ Survey Corps; Executive Officer, Fourth Squad. A veteran member of the Survey Corps and [Hange Zoe](https://anilist.co/character/71121/Hange-Zoe)''s second-in-command within the Survey Corps'' Fourth Squad. He also serves as Hanji''s assistant and messenger. He comes across as an intelligent and responsible person, which may be the reason he was tasked to keep his overzealous and eccentric superior out of trouble. Much of the time, this leaves him in a state of near-panic, having to constantly remind Hange to be more careful or yanking them to safety. That he remains at Hange''s side constantly suggests he is a loyal person, and that he cares deeply for his superior''s safety, regardless of the stress involved with being under their command. He is also able to show signs of a serious nature when it comes to missions, going out of his way to investigate problems and put himself in danger before others.', '/uploads/images/c_127573.jpg'),
(136, 'Frieda Reiss', 'フリーダ・レイス', '配角', '', 'Frieda was Rod Reiss'' eldest daughter and Historia''s oldest half-sister. ~!She was the true queen of humanity from 842 to 845. She is known to appear in Eren and Historia''s obtained memories. In his Titan form, Grisha invaded an underground cavern under the Reiss family chapel, where the family had gathered to pray. He battled Frieda and consumed her, thus gaining her powers and memories. He then slaughtered her mother and siblings, and finally destroyed the chapel. When Eren later eats Grisha, Frieda''s memories are transferred to him along with Grisha''s.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127624.jpg'),
(136, 'Floch Forster', 'フロック・フォルスター', '配角', 'Kenshou Ono', 'Floch is a new recruit in the Survey Corps. He joined the Survey Corps during the two months between the attack at Orvud District and the return to Shiganshina District. ~!After the rest of the Yeagerists are killed during the port battle, Floch hides on the ship to Marley. After shooting holes in the fuel tank of the flying boat, Floch is ultimately killed by Mikasa.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127703.png'),
(136, 'Harold', 'ハロルド', '配角', 'Yasuyuki Sano', 'A team leader in the Scout Regiment.', '/uploads/images/c_130631.png'),
(136, 'Dirk', 'ディルク', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Mamiya', 'A member of the Scout Regiment and a team leader during the mission to reclaim Wall Maria.', '/uploads/images/c_130635.png'),
(136, 'Roy', 'ロイ', '配角', 'Takashi Onozuka', 'As a veteran journalist, Roy has come to accept and conform to the restrictive nature of the monarchy, fearing retaliation for defiance.', '/uploads/images/c_130636.png'),
(136, 'Pierre', 'ピュレ', '配角', 'Kenji Takahashi', 'As a rookie reporter, Pierre has not yet become jaded like his superior Roy. He is very bold in his reporting, unafraid of asking questions of Military Police officers that would otherwise be considered "off-limits." He takes his job of reporting the truth very seriously, becoming frustrated when he is kept from printing news that would be scandalous for the government.', '/uploads/images/c_130637.png'),
(136, 'Klaus', 'クラース', '配角', 'Tooru Nara', 'A member of the Scout Regiment and a team leader during the mission to retake Wall Maria.', '/uploads/images/c_130638.png'),
(136, 'Marlene', 'マレーネ', '配角', 'Saki Endou', 'A member of the Scout Regiment and a team leader during the mission to reclaim Wall Maria.', '/uploads/images/c_130639.png'),
(136, 'Eren Krueger', 'エレン・クルーガー', '配角', 'Yasunori Matsumoto', 'Eren Kruger was an Eldian spy posing as a Marleyan officer in the Public Security Authorities. He founded the Eldia Restorationists, and used the pseudonym the Owl (フクロウ Fukurō) to communicate. Secretly, he possessed the power of the Attack Titan.', '/uploads/images/c_131440.jpg'),
(136, 'Fay Yeager', 'フェイ・イェーガー', '配角', 'Chiyuki  Miura', 'Fay was the younger sister of Grisha Yeager and as an Eldian, she grew up in the Liberio Internment Zone in Marley. ~!At a young age, she was said to be killed by Marley officers dogs.!~', '/uploads/images/c_133214.jpg'),
(136, 'Dina Fritz', 'ダイナ・フリッツ', '配角', 'Nozomi Kishimoto', '~!Dina is the first wife of Grisha Yeager. One year after their marriage, she gave birth to their son, Zeke Yeager. Dina is of royal blood as member of the Fritz family. When the 145th Fritz King built the walls and decided to move to the island Paradis, her branch of the Fritz family stayed behind due to disagreements with the King''s choice. She joined the Eldia Restorationists on Marley, in order to revive the pride and power of Eldia. In this group, she also met Grisha Yeager, whom she eventually married. She gave birth to their son, Zeke Yeager. At the age of 7, there son reported his parents to the Marley government. As a result, all the Eldia Restorationists were sent to Utopia. Sergeant Major Gross injected Dina with the Titan serum and she was thrown off the Borderline wall to Utopia, as Grisha, in horror, watched his wife turn into a Titan.!~ ~!After the Colossus Titan breaches Shiganshina District in Wall Maria, many Titans proceed inside and among them is Dina. She embarks inside the town and is seen by Eren and Mikasa as they try to free Carla Yeager, who is trapped under the debris of their house. Though Hannes initially comes to their aid and decides to face Dina, he stands catatonic in fear of her frightening appearance. After he realizes that he is too afraid to face it, he opts to instead take Eren and Mikasa to safety, leaving Eren''s mother behind. Afterwards, Eren witnesses Dina pull Carla out of the debris, as it proceeds to violently incapacitate her and ', '/uploads/images/c_133215.png'),
(136, 'Sandra', 'サンドラ', '配角', 'Tomomi  Kawamura', 'She is a recruit of the Survey Corps. She joined at some point after the crowning of Historia Reiss during the two months between the attack at Orvud District and the expedition returning to Shiganshina District, where she was assigned to Squad Klaus.', '/uploads/images/c_137143.jpg'),
(136, 'Grice', 'グライス', '配角', 'Tatsuhisa Suzuki', 'He is a member of the Restorationists.', '/uploads/images/c_140764.png'),
(136, 'Grisha no Chichi Yeager', 'グリシャの父・イェーガー', '配角', 'Seirou Ogino', 'He is the father of [Fay](https://anilist.co/character/133214/) and [Grisha Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/62477/), as well as the grandfather of [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/).', '/uploads/images/c_140765.png'),
(136, 'Grisha no Haha Yeager', 'グリシャの母・イェーガー', '配角', 'Tomo Sakurai', 'She is the mother of [Fay](https://anilist.co/character/133214/) and [Grisha Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/62477/), as well as the grandmother of [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/).', '/uploads/images/c_140851.png'),
(136, 'Tom Ksaver', 'トム・クサヴァー', '配角', 'Kenji Hamada', 'He is a man who knew Grisha Jaeger when he was growing up.', '/uploads/images/c_140852.png'),
(136, 'Mitsumete no Kyojin', '見つめての巨人', '配角', 'Masaaki Ihara', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_140903.png'),
(137, 'Shinra Kusakabe', '日下部森羅', '主角', 'Gakuto Kajiwara', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") __Affiliation:__ Special Fire Force Company 8 __Rank:__ Second Class Soldier Since being accused of using his powers to cause the fire that took his family, his face''s habit of tensing up into a bizarre smile when he gets nervous has earned him the derisive nickname of "devil". He joined the Fire Force to achieve his dream of becoming a hero and saving people from the fear of the flames, as well as uncover the truth behind his family''s death twelve years ago. Though a newcomer in the Special Fire Force, Shinra has posed a challenge to experienced members of the force and has even defeated a Captain. Being a Fire Soldier, Shinra is experienced in rescuing people and is strong enough to carry four people out of a building. While he mostly relies on his Ignition Ability in combat, he has exhibited skill in ordinary fighting as well, being able to pin an opponent to the ground and break their guard with a sturdy kick, as well as being capable of defending himself from ground-breaking attacks.', '/uploads/images/c_120462.png'),
(137, 'Akitaru Oubi', '秋樽桜備', '主角', 'Kazuya Nakai', '__Height:__ 189 cm (6''2") __Affiliation:__ Special Fire Force Company 8 __Rank:__ Captain The popular and charismatic leader of the newly established Company 8. His goal is to investigate the other companies and uncover the truth about spontaneous human combustion. He has no powers, but uses his finely-honed muscles as a weapon in a battle style that''s on even par with [Benimaru](https://anilist.co/character/130848)''s. Loves bodybuilding to an almost creepy extent. Despite not being a Pyrokinetic like most other known Battalion Commanders, Akitaru has a very fit physique, which allows him to face Infernals. In battle, he is seen using different weapons, suitable for the situation, like the Core Annihilating Pile Bunker or a fire fighting axe, which he can veil in white steam and thrust at the opponent. His weapons appear to be designed in order to impale an Infernal''s core with low difficulty. He is able to carry up to 30kg of equipment each time he is on a mission to fight an Infernal. As a fire fighter, Akitaru was recognized enough to be decorated twice, though both were revoked due to actions prioritising saving citizens lives at the expense of defying orders.', '/uploads/images/c_130712.png'),
(137, 'Maki Oze', '尾瀬茉希', '主角', 'Saeko Kamijou', '__Height:__ 167 cm (5''6") __Affiliation:__ Special Fire Force Company 8 __Rank:__ First Class Fire Soldier A former member of the military, she is an excellent fighter who controls fire. She''s a cool lady but is mad about love stories, and her beauty is overshadowed by her "head full of flowers and wedding bells". She''s friendly but goes berserk when anyone comments on her muscles. Apparently,​ she used to be slender. Maki possesses Second Generation abilities, having adapted to Spontaneous Human Combustion by becoming able to control flames from a long distance. In doing so, she can handle herself against two Third Generations simultaneously, being able to extinguish and absorb their generated flames into a giant fireball. Maki''s abilities provide defense for her entire team, as she can reflect incoming fire attacks and use an opponent''s flames against them. While she is unable to deflect or redirect a fire with too much driving force, she is still able to alter its shape in order to reduce its impact.', '/uploads/images/c_130713.png'),
(137, 'Takehisa Hinawa', '武久火縄', '主角', 'Kenichi Suzumura', '__Height:__ 180 cm (5''11") __Affiliation:__ Special Fire Force Company 8 __Rank:__ Lieutenant A dry, unemotional ex-military man, whose stern disciplina is feared among the new recruits. He helped Obi to found Company 8. He never allows the soldiers to play with fire. The gun he uses is a cherished memento from his friend who became an Infernal. Takehisa is a Second Generation, who has awakened the ability to manipulate flames through the use of firearms, such as a machine gun or a pistol, which he wields on the battlefield. Takehisa''s ability allows him to control the gunpowder inside bullets, making the impact they make stronger or weaker, depending on the situation. He can use this ability to make his bullets non-lethal.', '/uploads/images/c_130714.png'),
(137, 'Arthur Boyle', 'アーサー・ボイル', '主角', 'Yuusuke Kobayashi', '**Height:** 174 cm He trained at the academy with [Shinra](https://anilist.co/character/120462/Kusakabe-Shinra). Although he follows his own personal code of chivalry as the self-proclaimed Knight King, he is incredibly stupid. But girls love him. Being a Third Generation Pyrokinetic, Arthur has been identified by individuals as having a strong will of fire. By raising the temperature of the flames he creates, he can fabricate and control plasma, which either elevates or diminishes in relation to Arthur''s disarrangement from reality. The more delusional he is, the stronger Arthur becomes. Being able to use his Ignition Ability on hilt-like objects, Arthur can weld, cut through metal, and generate electricity. He mainly uses his ability on his blade-less sword Excalibur, which is most effective using his right hand and cannot be easily extinguished by an experienced Second Generation. Using it, he can deflect and fend off against flames.', '/uploads/images/c_130715.png'),
(137, 'Iris', 'アイリス', '主角', 'Mao Ichimichi', '__Height:__ 154 cm (5''0) __Affiliation:__ Special Fire Force Company 8 __Rank:__ Nun A sister of the Holy Sol Temple, her prayers are an indispensable part of extinguishing Infernals. Personality-wise she is no less than an angel.', '/uploads/images/c_130716.png'),
(137, 'Tamaki Kotatsu', '環古達', '主角', 'Aoi Yuuki', '__Height:__ 156 cm (5''1") __Affiliation:__ Special Fire Force Company 8 __Rank:__ Second Class Soldier ~!Originally a rookie member of Company 1, she was caught up in the treasonous plot of her superior officer Hoshimiya, and is currently being disciplined under Company 8''s watch.!~ A tough girl with an unfortunate "lucky lecher lure" condition, she nevertheless has a pure heart. Being a Third Generation, she is immune to being burnt by flames and can use her Ignition Ability to gird herself in pink flames, which grant her various cat-like traits, including cat ears, two forked tails and nails on her fingertips, an ability she dubbed "Nekomata". With her Ignition Ability active, Tamaki''s agility and mobility is substantially increased, allowing her to run on all fours. She can use her forked-tails to generate a blast of fire, which is strong enough to break through building walls, restrain her targets in a circle of fire by lengthening them, or using them as a distress signal by the same process.', '/uploads/images/c_130751.png'),
(137, 'Princess Hibana', 'プリンセス火華', '配角', 'Lynn', 'Hibana is a Third Generation pyrokinetic and Captain of the Special Fire Force Company 5.', '/uploads/images/c_130783.png'),
(137, 'Leonard Burns', 'レオナルド・バーンズ', '配角', 'Taiten Kusunoki', 'He is a Third Generation pyrokinetic, and the Captain of Special Fire Force Company 1.', '/uploads/images/c_130785.png'),
(137, 'Huo Yan Li', 'フォイエン・リィ', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', '__Height:__ 184 cm (6'' 0½") __Affiliation:__ Special Fire Force Company 1 Huo Yan Li is a Third Generation pyrokinetic and member of the Special Fire Force Company 1. In contrast to his long-time friends and team-mates Karim Flam and Rekka Hoshimiya, Huo Yan is a rather laid-back and responsible individual, who doesn''t like to get worked-up and waste time with meaningless fighting. He abides to the etiquette of the 1st Special Fire Brigade strongly, going as far as to point out formalities, such as a dress code. Despite the revelation of the Church''s wrongdoing, Yan still abides by the institution because it gives people hope during tragedies and worships the Sun and Sun God and the good it brings to the world and humanity instead of the malicious ideals of the White Clad and the Evangelist.', '/uploads/images/c_130788.png'),
(137, 'Rekka Hoshimiya', '烈火星宮', '配角', 'Tomokazu Seki', 'A Third Generation pyrotechnic, Lieutenant of Special Fire Force Company 1, and priest of the Holy Sol Temple. He is an eccentric and enthusiastic man. Always confident and expressive in his speech. ~!He is one of several people using “insects” to turn people into infernals.!~', '/uploads/images/c_130789.png'),
(137, 'Karim Flam', 'カリム・フラム', '配角', 'Kazuyuki Okitsu', 'Karim is a second generation pyrotechnic, a Lieutenant of Special Fire Force Company 1, and priest of the Holy Sol Temple. He is a serious and cautious young man. He shows a high disrespect towards strangers, which can result in him insulting people.', '/uploads/images/c_130790.png'),
(137, 'Benimaru Shinmon', '紅丸新門', '配角', 'Mamoru Miyano', 'Benimaru Shinmon is a hybrid Second and Third Generation, as well as the Captain of Special Fire Force Company 7. Benimaru is regarded as the strongest Fire Officer in the Special Fire Force. He is known as "Asakusa''s King of Destruction" because of the devastating power that he is capable of unleashing. He is also an extremely skilled hand-to-hand combatant, as shown when he easily outmaneuvered and overpowered the combined might of [Maki Oze](https://anilist.co/character/130713), [Shinra Kusakabe](https://anilist.co/character/120462), [Tamaki Kotatsu](https://anilist.co/character/130751), [Arthur Boyle](https://anilist.co/character/130715), and [Takehisa Hinawa](https://anilist.co/character/130714). He possesses the rare trait of being a Second and Third Generation, which ultimately allows him to ignite his own flames willingly, and also control flames from an external source. He can use his brigade''s matoi as a pole to fly to long-distance areas, and by using his Second Generation ability, can control the flames of other ignited matoi and direct them to a certain place. He can control the direction and speed of bullets in the same fashion as Takehisa. He is also capable of unleashing an immensely powerful blast that resembles a crimson-coloured moon, which is strong enough to kill a Demon Infernal. Benimaru is a practitioner of the iaido martial arts. Instead of using a sword, he can create a sharp blade of flames, a technique branching from his unique Iai Hand-Sword: Firs', '/uploads/images/c_130848.jpg'),
(137, 'Hikage', 'ヒカゲ', '配角', 'Hikaru Akao', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_130849.jpg'),
(137, 'Tooru Kishiri', 'トオル岸里', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_130850.png'),
(137, 'Hinata', 'ヒナタ', '配角', 'Hikaru Akao', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_130851.jpg'),
(137, 'Konro Sagamiya', '相模屋紺炉', '配角', 'Tomoaki Maeno', 'Is a Third Generation pyrokinetic and is the Lieutenant of Special Fire Force Company 7. He is a very loyal subordinate of Benimaru Shinmon, willing to sacrifice his health and life to protect his friend if needed.', '/uploads/images/c_130852.png'),
(137, 'Conehead', 'コーンヘッド', '配角', 'Ryou Sugisaki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_130853.png'),
(137, 'Viktor Licht', 'ヴィクトル・リヒト', '配角', 'Daisuke Sakaguchi', '__Height:__ 187cm (6''1") __Affiliation:__ Special Fire Force Company 8 __Rank:__ Science Team (First Class Fire Soldier Head of Research(Haijima) Viktor Licht is company 8''s Science Officer. Viktor attended the Imperial University of Tokyo, where he wrote a thesis about Spontaneous Human Combustion. After graduating at the top of his class in record time, he joined Haijima Industries. Having locked himself away while doing research, he was eventually appointed head of incendiary research and published a thesis about Spontaneous Human Combustion. Joker eventually made contact with Viktor, and told him he wanted to uncover the truth behind what is happening in the world. (Source: Fire Force Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_130862.png'),
(137, 'Joker', 'ジョーカー', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', 'Joker is a former pyrokinetic and a self-proclaimed anti-hero that serves as the Fourth Pillar''s guardian.', '/uploads/images/c_135385.png'),
(137, 'Takeru Noto', '武能登', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', 'Takeru is a Third Generation Second Class Fire Officer of the 2nd Special Fire Brigade. Takeru received the nickname "Juggernaut", due to his family''s business as potato farmers. (Source: Enen no Shouboutai Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_138308.png'),
(137, 'Vulcan Joseph', 'ヴァルカンジョゼフ', '配角', 'Taku Yashiro', 'Vulcan is a very skilled engineer with a love for animals which often bulids his machines to an animal theme. His goal in life is to build something like his family''s Amaterasu to supply enough energy to the world in order to save the world''s endangered animals. Despite his grand ideals he desires to remain independent. ~!This is rooted in his total hated for Haijima Industeries as he blames them from the death of his family. This also means that he has a total distrust of the Special Fire Force''s requests for him to join their organisations.!~ Vulcan is very passionate about his occupation and loves creating new inventions. ~!Vulcan becomes the Engineer for Special Fire Force Company 8.!~', '/uploads/images/c_143289.png'),
(137, 'Shou Kusakabe', '象日下部', '配角', 'Maaya Sakamoto', 'A Third Generation pyrokinetic, the Commander of the Knights of the Ashen Flame, and the younger brother of [Shinra Kusakabe](https://anilist.co/character/120462/Kusakabe-Shinra).', '/uploads/images/c_150194.jpg'),
(137, 'Lisa Isaribi', 'リサ漁辺', '配角', 'Ayaka Asai', 'Lisa Isaribi, formerly known as Feeler during her service in the Knights of the Ashen Flame, is a former Third Generation Pyrokinetic. She is a member of Special Fire Force Company 8.', '/uploads/images/c_150322.png'),
(137, 'Dr. Giovanni', 'Dr.ジョヴァンニ', '配角', 'Yutaka Aoyama', 'An insect enthusiast. Generally talks calmly, slowly, and drawn out. Has an interesting tendency to repeat words passionately many times, on occasion.', '/uploads/images/c_150692.jpg'),
(137, 'Arrow', 'アロー', '配角', 'Yumi Uchiyama', 'Arrow is the Primary Vice-Commander of the Knights of the Ashen Flame and serves as the Third Pillar''s bodyguard.', '/uploads/images/c_154079.png'),
(137, 'Yona', 'ヨナ', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'Yona is a member of the Knights of the Ashen Flame''s Commando Unit. He is a Third Generation, giving him the ability to ignite and manipulate flames from his palms and fingers. He can use his Ignition Ability to change the appearance of people''s faces. He executes this process by using heat to control the blood flow in people''s faces, and makes the capillaries and lymph nodes expand, and then uses localized edema to change the shape of people''s faces, something he commonly calls art. He is also able to change his own appearance with ease. Using this same process, he can increase the temperature of someone''s blood until they explode. Due to his age, it is speculated Yona is a non-human entity like the Preacher who does not age. (Source: Fire Force Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_160042.png'),
(137, 'Haumea', 'ハウメア', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', 'Haumea is a Third Generation pyrokinetic and a member of the White-Clad. She possesses the Adolla Burst and is known as the Second Pillar.', '/uploads/images/c_160044.png'),
(137, 'Assault', 'アサルト', '配角', 'Chikahiro Kobayashi', 'Assault has dark skin and light spiky hair, three piercing in each of his ears, and two piercings in-place of his absent eyebrows. Being a White Hood, he wears a variation of his organisation''s uniform, which consists of white clothing and the cross of the Sol God symbol across his chest.', '/uploads/images/c_161515.png'),
(137, 'Onyango', 'オニャンゴ', '配角', 'Katsuhisa Houki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_171892.png'),
(137, 'Gustav Honda', 'グスタフ本田', '配角', 'Takaya Hashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_171893.jpg'),
(137, 'Souichirou Hague', '蒼一郎・アーグ', '配角', 'Choo', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_171894.png'),
(137, 'Asako Hague', 'アサコ・アーグ', '配角', 'Hisako Kanemoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_171895.png'),
(137, 'Kayoko Huang', '火代子黄', '配角', 'Sayaka Oohara', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_171896.jpg'),
(137, 'Flail', 'フレイル', '配角', 'Kenji Nomura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_171897.png'),
(137, 'Charon', 'カロン', '配角', 'Hiroki Yasumoto', '__Type:__ Second Generation Charon is a member of the White-Clad, that serves as the Second Pillar''s guardian. He appears to be a devoted member of the White-Clad with a strong loyalty to the Evangalist. He takes his role as a guardian very seriously with protecting pillars at even risking the cost of his life. Charon has taken care of [Haumea](https://anilist.co/character/160044/Haumea) since she was young although she doesn’t seem to appreciate his efforts. He is very durable and is a expert in hand to hand combat with being very confidence and cunning in his battles.', '/uploads/images/c_171898.jpg'),
(137, 'Mirage', 'ミラージユ', '配角', 'Susumu Chiba', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_171899.png'),
(137, 'Raffles III', 'ラフルス三世', '配角', 'Bin Shimada', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_174549.jpg'),
(137, 'Mari Kusakabe', '日下部万里', '配角', 'Ayako Kawasumi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_174550.jpg'),
(137, 'Ogun Montgomery', 'オグン・モンゴメリ', '配角', '', 'Ogun is a Third Generation and member of Special Fire Force Company 4.', '/uploads/images/c_180505.jpg'),
(137, 'Nataku Son', 'ナタク孫', '配角', 'Mutsumi Tamura', 'A young boy who gained Third Generation pyrokinetic abilities after being bitten by an Infernal Bug.', '/uploads/images/c_190921.png'),
(137, 'Amaterasu', 'アマテラス', '配角', '', '~!Amaterasu is a survivor of the Great Cataclysm. Possessing an Adolla Burst, she powers Tokyo and is referred to as the First Pillar.!~ She tends to be very manipulative.', '/uploads/images/c_192562.png'),
(137, 'Sumire ', 'スミレ', '配角', 'Hitomi Shogawa', 'Sumire is a servant of the Evangelist and the Seventh Pillar. She is responsible for creating Pillars for 200 years since the failure of the Great Cataclysm, as well as the burning of St. Raffles Convent and the sisters residing in it.', '/uploads/images/c_193751.jpg'),
(137, 'Haran', 'ハラン', '配角', 'Itaru Yamamoto', 'Haran was a member of the White-Clad, who turned himself into a Demon.', '/uploads/images/c_251814.png'),
(137, 'Mamoru-kun', 'まもる君', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_295094.jpg'),
(137, 'Dendou-sha', '伝道者', '配角', '', 'The Evangelist is the leader of the White-Clad. ~!The Evangelist is the collective unconscious of all humanity personified. It is not a person nor is it conscious, it represents despair itself.!~', '/uploads/images/c_327307.png'),
(137, 'Nise Hikage', '偽ヒカゲ', '配角', 'Kouichi Souma', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_327308.png'),
(137, 'Setsuo Miyamoto', '節男宮本', '配角', 'Kanehira Yamamoto', 'Setsuo was a former firefighter, who turned into a Flame Human. Through the process of the Human Body Ignition Phenomenon, he was able to keep his consciousness, making him a sentient Flame Human.', '/uploads/images/c_327309.png'),
(137, 'Toujou', '灯城', '配角', 'Yuuichirou Umehara', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_327310.png'),
(137, 'Mikako', 'ミカコ', '配角', 'Aoi Koga', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_327311.png'),
(137, 'Kantarou', '勘太郎', '配角', 'Shouta Yamamoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_327313.png'),
(137, 'Pusu Pusu', 'プスプス', '配角', 'Chiaki Omigawa', 'Pusu Pusu is one of [Maki Oze''s](https://anilist.co/character/130713/Maki-Oze) sentient fireballs she creates with her second generation ability.', '/uploads/images/c_339136.png'),
(137, 'Mera Mera', 'メラメラ', '配角', 'Chiaki Omigawa', 'Mera Mera is one of [Maki Oze''s](https://anilist.co/character/130713/Maki-Oze) sentient fireballs she creates with her second generation ability.', '/uploads/images/c_339137.png'),
(137, '5th Angels Three', '5thエンジェルス3', '配角', 'Mariko Higashiuchi', 'Group of identically dressed female fire soldiers of Special Fire Force Company 5. Despite initial appearances and name, there are at least 15 members of this group. At least one of the women possesses an Ignition Ability, making her a Third Generation.', '/uploads/images/c_361639.png'),
(137, 'Shiroshouzoku', '白装束', '配角', 'Kousuke Katayama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_363463.jpg'),
(137, 'Sister Sakura', 'シスター桜', '配角', 'Mayu Mineda', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_376111.jpg'),
(137, 'Shinra no Sobo', '森羅の祖母', '配角', 'Kaori Nakamura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_388905.jpg'),
(138, 'Ryokan Kurita', '栗田良寛', '配角', '', 'Position: Center / Defensive Tackle / Long snapper Jersey: 77 40 yard dash: 6.5 seconds Bench Press: 160 kg (352 lb) Height: 195 cm (6'' 4") Weight: 145 kg (319 lb) Graduated From: Mao 13th Middle School 2nd Year Student (Grade 11) The largest and strongest player in the Deimon American Football club. Kurita lives in a temple with his father, who is the director of a Buddhist sect. His father believed that to grow up big and strong, a young boy had to eat a lot, but unfortunately it seems he has overfed his son. Kurita, as his name would suggest, has a head shaped like a chestnut. He is a very sweet, kind-hearted individual and the only thing bigger than his body is his heart. He became Sena''s second friend after entering Deimon High School. When playing, Kurita shouts his kiai "Funnuraba!" when exerting extra effort. Before coming to Deimon, he attended the Shinryuji school, but was forced out because Kongo Agon was chosen over him for the special athletic scholarship, so he came to Deimon High along with Hiruma and Musashi. Like Hiruma. Kurita is crazy about American football and tries to encourage everyone to join though he does not go to the same extremes as his demonic compatriot. He can get so worked up that he''s been known to begin morning practice as early as 2:00 AM. His "apprentice" is Komusubi, who practices with him whenever he can. His biggest dream is to compete in the Christmas Bowl. He is somewhat dim-witted (nearly giving away Sena''s other identity) and is ins', '/uploads/images/c_946.png'),
(138, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Keiji Fujiwara', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(138, 'Senkuu Ishigami', '石神千空', '主角', 'Yuusuke Kobayashi', '__Height:__ 171 cm (5''7") Senkuu is a genius with a vast amount of scientific knowledge. He is able to invent various kinds of tools and gadgets in a short amount of time with ease. As a child, he designed and built a functioning miniature rocket ship. Senkuu also possesses an analytical mind, being able to correctly discern the situation he is in. Even in his pre-teens, he was intelligent and sharp-minded enough to create advanced machines. Senkuu''s physical abilities are very low and he would lose against someone like [Kohaku](https://anilist.co/character/124143) in a brawl, something he himself admits. ~!In "Village Games Arc" Senku unintentionally won and married [Ruri](https://anilist.co/character/143272), but divorced immediately afterwards.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124142.png'),
(138, 'Kohaku', 'コハク', '主角', 'Manami Numakura', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") Kohaku is a young woman who is a descendant of modern humans. She is Ruri''s younger sister and the daughter of Kokuyo. She appears to be well known in her village due to her combative abilities, as both Kinro and Ginro were afraid of her. Kohaku excels at fighting, hunting, and general survival skills. She is a tomboy by nature, having little interest in more typical feminine activities and has little knowledge about them, although she does seem to enjoy some lavish clothing that was provided to her. She possesses a sharp instinct and intellect. Kohaku is a kind young woman, caring deeply for her sickly older sister, willing to participate in the tournament for her hand in marriage just to protect her. This care extends to her comrades, and anyone she''s loyal to. In addition to this, she has a reckless and hotheaded personality, often reacting in anger to being called a gorilla or lioness due to her strength and physicality. She also acts on her emotions at times, going against rational thought. She also has a bit of a teasing side, asking Chrome if he could fall for her to her resemblance to her sister.', '/uploads/images/c_124143.png'),
(138, 'Tsukasa Shishiou', '獅子王司', '主角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Height:__ 195 cm (6''4") According to [Taiju](https://anilist.co/character/124146/Ooki-Taiju), Tsukasa has the reputation as "The Strongest High School Primate" due to his tremendous fighting abilities. Tsukasa is essentially violent, but extremely careful and aware of his actions. He is a very kind, thoughtful, and polite man outside of his pessimistic ideals towards humanity. He offers help in the beginning to [Senku](https://anilist.co/character/124142/Ishigami-Senkuu) and Taiju after they revive him and becomes their hunter for food, using his skills as a prominent athlete to aid them. It’s revealed later that Tsukasa plans to purge humanity of adults who hurt the young and weak, then thinks Senku will go along with him, but instead Senku rejects him. After this point, Tsukasa becomes fairly determined in carrying out his plans even to the point of leaving their group.', '/uploads/images/c_124144.png'),
(138, 'Chrome', 'クロム', '主角', 'Gen Satou', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") Chrome is the alleged sorcerer - eventually turned scientist - of Ishigami Village. As part of the Kingdom of Science, Chrome serves as the unofficial right hand of [Senku](https://anilist.co/character/124142/Ishigami-Senkuu); this trust is what makes him one of the Five Wise Generals. Chrome is a highly energetic person with a lot of passion and curiosity. He is genuinely interested in science, although at first, he only knows it as sorcery. He is confident in his intellect, enough so to go toe to toe with Senku despite getting destroyed in a battle of wits. He also has a tendency to refer to something as "bad" when he thinks it is cool or amazing. Chrome has a deep love of science, though he admits his expertise and knowledge lies mainly in exploration, particularly pertaining to rocks and minerals and gathering them. He is loyal and selfless to his friends and, while lacking in physical abilities, he is still able to think of clever solutions out of dangerous situations. He is also exceedingly brave, and in addition, while he is usually a loudmouth, he knows when to keep his mouth shut. He loves science and, in many ways, is an accomplished scientist in his own right, managing to create chemical reactions from the rocks he collected through frequent trial and error (reactions which were only made known in the seventeenth century), despite never knowing this knowledge before Senku''s arrival.', '/uploads/images/c_124145.png'),
(138, 'Taiju Ooki', '大木大樹', '主角', 'Makoto Furukawa', '__Height:__ 189 cm (6''2½") Taiju is an outgoing, friendly, and kind person. He''s enthusiastic about performing even small tasks and a diligent worker. He is very determined when something is important to him. He tends to yell loudly and is enthusiastic regardless of the task so long as he proves useful. He is persistent and determined. Despite being emotional and expressive, he has great control of his temper, never losing his cool or acting impulsively. Taiju possesses an extremely sturdy body, something his friend [Senku](https://anilist.co/character/124142) vouches him for. He is the first human to be able to withstand a kick from [Tsukasa](https://anilist.co/character/124144) without losing consciousness. He also possesses immense stamina, able to cross 80 kilometers in 5 hours.', '/uploads/images/c_124146.jpg'),
(138, 'Yuzuriha Ogawa', '小川杠', '主角', 'Kana Ichinose', 'Yuzuriha is the love interest of [Taiju](https://anilist.co/character/124146) and a friend of [Senkuu](https://anilist.co/character/124142). Yuzuriha is a young woman with brown hair, brown eyes, and a slim build. She has two noticeable petrification scars, both in the shape of spirals, located on her shoulder and neck. Before her petrification, Yuzuriha wears a standard High School Uniform. After her depetrification, she wears a white cloth dress that''s spit at her sides and matching cloth shoes. Noticeably, Yuzuriha wears a white hairband that''s vaguely shaped like wrap-around headphones, both before and after her petrification.', '/uploads/images/c_124147.jpg'),
(138, 'Suika', 'スイカ', '配角', 'Karin Takahashi', '__Height:__ 119 cm (3''10") Suika is a young girl who lives in the village with the other stone age humans. Her most notable feature is the large watermelon on her head, which she can climb inside to disguise herself as the fruit. [Senku](https://anilist.co/character/124142/Ishigami-Senkuu) first meets Suika when he, [Chrome](https://anilist.co/character/124145/Chrome), and [Kohaku](https://anilist.co/character/124143/Kohaku) were searching for iron sand in a nearby river. Suika is eager to help Senku build his kingdom of science because she''s never been useful to anyone before. She comes to work as an information gatherer for the kingdom of science, occasionally being referred to as ''Ace Detective Suika.''', '/uploads/images/c_124162.jpg'),
(138, 'Gen Asagiri', 'あさぎりゲン', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") Gen Asagiri is an enemy turned ally of [Senku](https://anilist.co/character/124142/Ishigami-Senkuu). Originally de-petrified by [Tsukasa Shishio](https://anilist.co/character/124144/Shishiou-Tsukasa), he was sent to find Senku, only to defect to the Kingdom of Science. Gen later becomes one of the Five Wise Generals. He is somewhat full of himself and his abilities, taking pride in his status as a magician and a mentalist, along with his knowledge of the human psyche. Gen is rather quirky and can often be seen speaking in Pig Latin. He tends to be lazy, self absorbed, and perverted, and he is also perfectly capable of lying without a hint of stress or change in expression. While he frequently portrays an aura of selfishness, hard self-interest, manipulation and deviousness, Gen is intrinsically a good person who can''t bring himself to harm others. His outward appearance is masked by his mastery in psychology, but his actions tell of loyalty, determination, kindness and even sacrifice at times. While not nearly as intelligent in terms of science compared to Senku, he proves to be his equal and one of his most vital allies due to his ability to understand the human psyche and manipulate people through lies in contrast to Senku''s more honest nature. He uses his abilities to promote cooperation and enthusiasm, motivate allies, conduct negotiations, and outsmart enemies. He tends to shift between acting as a ditzy airhead when it suits him (such as to avo', '/uploads/images/c_127445.png'),
(138, 'Kaseki', 'カセキ', '配角', 'Mugihito', '__Height:__ 155 cm (5''1") Kaseki is an elderly craftsman from the Ishigami Village. When Senku arrives at Ishigami village, Kaseki is introduced as an artisan, and through Senku, his dedication to his craft is reignited tenfold.', '/uploads/images/c_136446.jpg'),
(138, 'Ginrou', '銀狼', '配角', 'Ayumu Murase', 'Ginrou is [Kinrou](https://anilist.co/character/143271/Kinrou)''s younger brother and one of the village guards. He is shorter and scrawnier than his brother, with short blonde hair and green eyes. He usually wears a karate gi-like uniform and belt and carries his spear wherever he goes. He and his brother were two of the first villagers to join the Kingdom of Science. ~!During the adventure on Treasure Island, Ginrou manages to convince [Matsukaze](https://anilist.co/character/188816/Matsukaze) to serve him due to the resemblance Ginrou bears to his late master.!~', '/uploads/images/c_143270.jpg'),
(138, 'Kinrou', '金狼', '配角', 'Tomoaki Maeno', 'Kinrou is the elder brother of [Ginrou](https://anilist.co/character/143270/Ginrou) and the son of Tetsuken and Shirogane. Originally having served as one of the guards of Ishigami Village alongside Ginrou, he quickly joined [Senku](https://anilist.co/character/124142/Ishigami-Senkuu) as a member of the Kingdom of Science. Kinrou is a muscular young man of average height, with a scar on the right side of his face and a cluster of hair hanging in between his eyes. He wears a sleeveless karate gi-like uniform with a belt and a buckler with a star pattern on his back. After the Grand Bout, Kinrou begins wearing a pair of glasses to correct his nearsightedness.', '/uploads/images/c_143271.jpg'),
(138, 'Ruri', 'ルリ', '配角', 'Reina Ueda', 'Ruri is [Kohaku](https://anilist.co/character/124143/Kohaku)''s elder sister and the daughter of [Kokuyo](https://anilist.co/character/150509/Kokuyo), and serves as the priestess of Ishigami Village. She is similar to Kohaku in appearance but has longer hair and a more hourglass-shaped body. She wears a black sundress and a piece of rope around her neck.', '/uploads/images/c_143272.png'),
(138, 'Hyouga', '氷月', '配角', 'Akira Ishida', '__Height:__ 189cm (6''2") Hyoga is a survivor who was revived by Tsukasa Shishio. Initially, he was an elite member of the Tsukasa Empire since he was depetrified by Tsukasa. ~!He ultimately betrays Tsukasa by attempting to take over his leadership and threatens Senku into joining, only to be defeated by the duo in the decisive battle for the Kingdom of Science. When the situation calls for it, he is depetrified once again and summoned to battle - now as a begrudging ally of the Kingdom of Science with a similar but slightly mellowed goal in mind. Since his third depetrification, Hyoga''s goals are unknown.!~ Hyoga has an easy going attitude towards everything. Even in situation that do not work in his favour, he still remains calm. While he claims to share the same values as Tsukasa when it comes to only reviving the young and creating a community where no one takes from others, Hyoga himself is an elitist who believes in social darwinism. He categorizes humans as either enlightened (or strong) and unenlightened (or weak). He believes that the "brainless incompetent masses" should not be allowed to live and that only those who excel should be allowed to live. While he does follow a form of social darwinism, he does not believe it is only the physically strong who should survive, as he wanted Senku to join him in his endeavors and become the strongest duo, indicating he respected Senku''s intelligence and understood his capabilities. He is very manipulative and cunning, seems to', '/uploads/images/c_145062.jpg'),
(138, 'Nikki Hanada', '花田仁姫', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 180 cm (5''11") Nikki is a survivor that was revived by [Tsukasa](https://anilist.co/character/124144/Tsukasa-Shishiou), who assigned her to keep watch over [Taiju](https://anilist.co/character/124146/Taiju-Ooki) and [Yuzuriha](https://anilist.co/character/124147/Yuzuriha-Ogawa). She later defected from the Tsukasa Empire and joined the Kingdom of Science, where her unofficial role is that of disciplinarian. She has great physical strength, constantly being shown keeping people like [Magma](https://anilist.co/character/145095/Magma) and [You](https://anilist.co/character/145061/You-Uei) in line. Nikki is a massive fan of [Lillian Weinberg](https://anilist.co/character/149274/Lillian-Weinberg). In the modern world she was having a rough time at school and listening to Lillian''s songs saved her.', '/uploads/images/c_145063.jpg'),
(138, 'Ukyou Saionji', '西園寺羽京', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") Ukyou is a survivor that was revived by [Tsukasa Shishiou](https://anilist.co/character/124144/Tsukasa-Shishiou). He is pacifistic and dislikes needless bloodshed.', '/uploads/images/c_145064.png'),
(138, 'Homura Momiji', '紅葉ほむら', '配角', 'Aki Toyosaki', '__Height:__ 145 cm (4''9") Homura acts as the right-hand man of [Hyouga](https://anilist.co/character/145062/Hyouga) in [Tsukasa](https://anilist.co/character/124144/Tsukasa-Shishiou)''s army. She was a competitive gymnast before the petrification.', '/uploads/images/c_145065.png'),
(138, 'Magma', 'マグマ', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Mamiya', 'Magma is a villager from the Ishigami village. Magma is known for being the strongest of all the Villagers in terms of strength.', '/uploads/images/c_145095.png'),
(138, 'Minami Hokutouzai', '北東西南', '配角', 'Youko Hikasa', '__Height:__ 166 cm (5''4") Minami is a Pre-Petrification human and former reporter before the Petrification occurred. ~!Originally a member of [Tsukasa](https://anilist.co/character/124144/Shishiou-Tsukasa)''s army before Tsukasa''s downfall at the hands of [Hyoga](https://anilist.co/character/145062/Hyouga)''s betrayal, she later joins and helps the Kingdom of Science.!~', '/uploads/images/c_145096.png'),
(138, 'Chalk', 'チョーク', '配角', 'Sayumi Suzushiro', 'Dog from Ishigami Village. He is Suika''s friend.', '/uploads/images/c_147567.jpg'),
(138, 'Mantle', 'マントル', '配角', 'Shin Matsushige', 'Mantle is a villager of Ishigami Village who idolizes Magma.', '/uploads/images/c_147570.png'),
(138, 'Jasper', 'ジャスパ', '配角', 'Ryouta Takeuchi', 'An inhabitant of Ishigami Village who is a stickler for the rules. He serves alongside [Turquoise](https://anilist.co/character/150511/Turquoise) as guard for the village''s priestess.', '/uploads/images/c_147640.jpg'),
(138, 'Lillian Weinberg', 'リリアン ・ ワインバーグ', '配角', 'Lynn', 'A famous American diva and songstress whose name is known by the whole world. Her passion in adventuring lead her aboard the International Space Station (ISS) alongside Senku''s father, Byuakuya Ishigami.', '/uploads/images/c_149274.jpg'),
(138, 'Byakuya Ishigami', '石神百夜 ', '配角', 'Keiji Fujiwara', 'Byakuya Ishigami was a Japanese astronaut who was residing on the International Space Station when the Petrification on Earth''s surface occurred. He was a kind, playful, and mischievous man who always found a way to amuse himself and keep things lighthearted, no matter the stakes. ~!He was [Senku Ishigami](https://anilist.co/character/124142/Senkuu-Ishigami)''s adoptive father.!~', '/uploads/images/c_149275.jpg'),
(138, 'Shamil  Volkov', 'シャミール・ヴォルコフ', '配角', 'Shoutarou Morikubo', '__Height:__ 180 cm Shamil was a Russian Cosmonaut residing on the International Space Station (ISS) when the Petrification on Earth''s surface occurred. He returned to Earth''s surface along with the rest of the ISS crew, helping to establish Ishigami Village. After returning to Earth, Shamil married fellow ISS astronaut [Connie Lee](https://anilist.co/character/150510/Connie-Lee) and had several children together. His personality was the opposite of [Byakuya](https://anilist.co/character/149275/Byakuya-Ishigami)''s, being a stoic, serious, pragmatic man of few words.', '/uploads/images/c_150497.jpg'),
(138, 'Darya Nikitina', 'ダリヤ・ニキーチナ', '配角', 'Rie Tanaka', '__Height:__ 163 cm Russian cosmonaut and doctor who was on board the International Space Station (ISS) alongside her husband [Yakov Nikitin](https://anilist.co/character/150512/Yakov-Nikitin). While in space, she witnessed the petrification of all human life on Earth''s surface.', '/uploads/images/c_150498.jpg'),
(138, 'Kokuyo', 'コクヨウ', '配角', 'Tetsuo Kanao', 'Father of [Kohaku](https://anilist.co/character/124143/Kohaku) and [Ruri](https://anilist.co/character/143272/Ruri). He was the village chief of Ishigami Village at the time of [Senku](https://anilist.co/character/124142/Senkuu-Ishigami)''s reawakening. ~!Kokuyo at first refuses to accept Senku as the new village chief, even though Senku won the Grand Bout. After witnessing Senku''s antibiotic cure Ruri he officially crowns Senku the new leader of Ishigami Village. Despite not being the chief anymore, he serves as something of a co-leader of Ishigami Village, focusing on more practical concerns like food gathering, while Senku focuses on scientific advancement.!~', '/uploads/images/c_150509.jpg'),
(138, 'Connie Lee', 'コニー・リ', '配角', 'Hisako Kanemoto', 'NASA personnel who was one of the astronauts on the International Space Station at the time when the people of Earth were petrified.', '/uploads/images/c_150510.jpg'),
(138, 'Turquoise', 'ターコイズ', '配角', 'You Taichi', 'A member of the Ishigami village. She serves alongside Jasper as one of Ruri''s guards.', '/uploads/images/c_150511.jpg'),
(138, 'Yakov Nikitin', 'ヤコフ・ニキーチン', '配角', 'Kanehira Yamamoto', '__Height:__ 167 cm Russian cosmonaut, doctor, and husband of Darya Nikitina who was one of the astronauts on the International Space Station at the time when the people of Earth were petrified', '/uploads/images/c_150512.jpg'),
(138, 'Ganen', 'ガンエン', '配角', 'Genki Muro', 'Ganen is a villager from Ishigami Village. He is the son of Sagan and En.', '/uploads/images/c_202545.png'),
