(140, 'Nagi Amano', '天野凪', '配角', 'Sakura Kiryuu', 'He is [Hina](https://anilist.co/character/139710)''s younger brother who is an elementary student. Despite being young, he is popular with the girls due to his "mature behavior". (Source: Tenki no Ko Wikia, edited)', '/uploads/images/c_139703.jpg'),
