(140, 'Detective Yasui', '安井', '配角', 'Sei Hiraizumi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_139708.jpg'),
(140, 'Hodaka Morishima', '森嶋帆高', '主角', 'Kotarou Daigo', '__Height__: >173 cm Hodaka is a high school student of average build with medium length black hair and light brown eyes. He is often seen wearing a plain black t-shirt and jeans along with his yellow knapsack that he carries along everywhere he goes. Hodoka ran away from his parents and home to live a new life in Tokyo as his previous life was too "suffocating" for him. However, after arriving in Tokyo, he struggled to live the new life he was hoping for and was forced to live in manga cafes and in the streets. Fortunately, he met [Keisuke Suga](https://anilist.co/character/139707/Keisuke-Suga), a writer for a small editing company, who took him in as an employee and gave Hodoka a roof over his head. Hodoka is a courageous boy as he was able to leave his home by himself and start a new life in Tokyo. Accompanying his courageous trait however is an impulsive nature which often leads him to make irrational choices that cause many misunderstandings.', '/uploads/images/c_139709.jpg'),
(140, 'Hina Amano', '天野陽菜', '主角', 'Nana Mori', '__Height__: > 160 cm Hina is a young and cheerful girl with long black-blue hair tied into twin ponytails and large blue eyes. She wears a blue stone necklace and often wears a grey hoodie over a sleeveless dress. Hina takes in many jobs in other to support her younger brother who is still in elementary school. She possesses the ability to clear the weather for a short period of time in a desired area by praying to the sky which she obtained after praying and walking through a Torii (traditional Japanese gate) on the roof of an abandoned building. Hina is a cheerful, energetic, and strong-willed teen. She is also a caring and kind individual as seen when she gives Hodoka a free burger when she noticed he looked lost. She uses her power to clear the weather to brighten people''s days and see the smiles on their face. ~!It was later revealed that she''s only 15 years old.!~', '/uploads/images/c_139710.jpg'),
(140, 'Kana Sakura', 'カナ', '配角', 'Kana Hanazawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_172234.png'),
(140, 'Uranai Obaba', '占いおババ', '配角', 'Masako Nozawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_174610.png'),
(140, 'Ayane Hanazawa', '花澤綾音', '配角', 'Ayane Sakura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_174611.png'),
(140, 'Scoutman Kimura', 'スカウトマン木村', '配角', 'Ryouhei Kimura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_174612.jpg'),
(140, 'Ame', 'アメ', '配角', '', 'He''s a stray kitten that is adopted by Hodaka Morishima later Keisuke Suga. ~!He became obese three years later.!~', '/uploads/images/c_174613.png'),
(140, 'Sasaki Junsa', '佐々木巡査', '配角', 'Kana Ichinose', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_174614.jpg'),
(140, 'Kannushi', '神主', '配角', 'Hidekatsu Shibata', 'He is the caretaker of the Meteorological Shrine.', '/uploads/images/c_174615.jpg'),
(140, 'Mamiya', '間宮', '配角', 'Sumi Shimamoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_227910.png'),
(141, 'Shouyou Hinata', '日向翔陽', '主角', 'Ayumu Murase', '__Teams:__ Yukigaoka Junior High (Former); Karasuno High (Current) __Number:__ 1 (Junior High 3rd Year); 10 (High School 1st year); 5 (High School 3rd year) __Position:__ Captain (Junior High); Outside Hitter (Junior High); Middle Blocker (High School) Hinata has an unusually high ability to jump. Since he was young, Hinata trained his legs to compensate for his lack of height. He joins the Karusuno High School Volleyball team and amazes the team with his natural affinity as a spiker. Although he is a complete beginner and never had any experience playing in a volleyball team, he grows rapidly through each match. ~!After graduating from high school, Hinata traveled to Brazil to gain experience by playing beach volleyball. This is when he got the name, Ninja Shoyo. Upon returning to Japan, he became a member of the MSBY Black Jackals, a Division 1 team in the V-League. He became a member of the Japan Men’s National Volleyball Team during the 2021 Olympics. Currently, that is the year 2022, he is a member of Asas São Paulo, a professional team in the Brazil Super League.!~', '/uploads/images/c_64769.png'),
(141, 'Tobio Kageyama', '影山飛雄', '主角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Team:__ Karasuno High, Kitagawa Daiichi Junior High (former) __Height:__ 180.6 cm __Year:__ 1st Year, class 3 __Number:__ 9 __Position:__ Setter A famous setter in his middle school who joins the Karusuno High Volleyball team. He was known as the "King of the Court" in his middle school because of his arrogant demeanor and the way he would order around his teammates. Although he still carries an overbearing attitude, he begins to change when he starts to play with [Hinata Shouyou](https://anilist.co/character/64769) who views him as a rival.', '/uploads/images/c_64771.png'),
(141, 'Koushi Sugawara', '菅原孝支', '配角', 'Miyu Irino', '__Height:__ 174 cm Being the vice captain, Sugawara has a soothing personality for his teammates and acts as a pillar of support for them. Even though he isn''t Karasuno''s official setter anymore, he doesn''t dream of giving up on playing in general. As such, he encourages himself and all of his teammates not to give up, no matter how rough the situation might be. Sugawara''s dedication to volleyball is clear when he decides to continue club activities even when most third years choose to retire to focus on their futures. In a meeting, his teacher asked Sugawara why he''s so determined to continue playing even though he''s not a starting member, and Sugawara replied that he doesn''t want to have regrets in the future. He is also quite perceptive as he noticed how [Tanaka](https://anilist.co/character/67325/Tanaka-Ryuunosuke) asked for the key to the gym (back during the first years'' 3-on-3 match) even though he always comes in late, so Sugawara knew that something was up. He is also intelligent as he can come up with helpful tactics during the game. An example of this is when he came up with the idea of saying "bring it" and "send it to me" for [Kageyama](https://anilist.co/character/64771/Kageyama-Tobio) and [Hinata](https://anilist.co/character/64769/Hinata-Shouyou)''s combo.', '/uploads/images/c_67321.png'),
(141, 'Daichi Sawamura', '澤村大地', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 176.8 cm __Year:__ 3rd year, class 4 __Number:__ 1 __Position:__ Wing Spiker The captain of the Karasuno High volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_67323.png'),
(141, 'Ryuunosuke Tanaka', '田中龍之介', '配角', 'Yuu Hayashi', '__Height:__ 177.2 cm __Team:__ Karasuno High __Number:__ 5 __Position:__ Wing Spiker', '/uploads/images/c_67325.jpg'),
(141, 'Yuu Nishinoya', '西谷夕', '配角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '__Team:__ Karasuno High, Chidoriyama Junior High (former) __Height:__ 159.3 cm (5''2") __Year:__ 2nd year, Class 3 __Number:__ 4 __Position:__ Libero Yuu is a very energetic and temperamental person. His boisterous nature and crazy shenanigans can attract unwanted attention quite easily, which often bodes ill for him. Although he hardly ever worries about the consequences of his actions (and may even revert to violence in order to vent out his anger on certain occasions), he is surprisingly considerate of his friends'' feelings and insecurities. Yuu can be extremely impatient, excitable and impulsive. As [Ryuunosuke Tanaka](https://anilist.co/character/67325) puts it, "he simply gets too fired up for his own good." He doesn''t bother to filter his words, and is therefore prone to blurting out whatever he''s thinking in a loud and tactless manner. In-game, however, his attitude changes drastically: he becomes incredibly focused and serious, remaining calm and doing everything in his power to provide the support his team needs until the very end. For this reason, everyone in the volleyball club respects him greatly.', '/uploads/images/c_67327.jpg'),
(141, 'Kei Tsukishima', '月島蛍', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', '**Height:** 188 cm **Team:** Karasuno High **Year:** 1st year, class 4 **Number:** 11 **Position:** Middle Blocker A member of the Karasuno High volleyball club. Tsukishima is very blunt and will sometimes rile his teammates up due to his antagonistic nature (most notably being [Hinata](https://anilist.co/character/64769/Hinata-Shouyou), [Kageyama](https://anilist.co/character/64771/Kageyama-Tobio), [Nishinoya](https://anilist.co/character/67327/Nishinoya-Yuu), and [Tanaka](https://anilist.co/character/67325/Tanaka-Ryuunosuke)) and sometimes other teams because of his casual smug attitude, taking pride in and relishing when his opponents see him as a nuisance as seen with [Tendou](https://anilist.co/character/126073/Tendou-Satori) and [Shirabu](https://anilist.co/character/137537/Shirabu-Kenjirou). Tsukishima is standoffish and has an arrogant and condescending personality, but he has low self-esteem and thinks of himself as inferior. Although he is only outwardly close with [Yamaguchi](https://anilist.co/character/71609/Yamaguchi-Tadashi), he can be seen occasionally caring about his other club members.', '/uploads/images/c_67329.png'),
(141, 'Chikara Ennoshita', '縁下力', '配角', 'Toshiki Masuda', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 175.4 cm __Year:__ 2nd year, class 4 __Position:__ Wing Spiker Ennoshita seems quiet and reserved but can behave boldly towards the other 2nd years. He''s smart and hasn''t received a failing mark before. Similarly to Sugawara, he is always smiling. He''s supposedly the only one within the 2nd years to be able to control Tanaka and Nishinoya. He''s also able to understand different people, as stated a few times by Tanaka and when he knew what to do to give Yamaguchi some courage before his jump float serve.', '/uploads/images/c_67331.png'),
(141, 'Asahi Azumane', '東峰旭', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 184.7 cm __Year:__ 3rd year, class 3 __Number:__ 3 __Position:__ Wing Spiker In contrast to his appearance, he is rather quiet and gentle and has his difficulties realizing that he is Karasuno''s ace as he initially doesn''t feel that way. He shows to be weak-willed at the beginning when he leaves the team before the first years come, feeling that he let down his entire team when they lost against Date Tech High even though they counted on him. After coming back to Karasuno, he realizes that his will to play volleyball is much stronger than he thought and with the help of his teammates, he acknowledges his position as Karasuno''s ace (even though he is still mocked sometimes by Daichi for not having any "ace-like presence") and gains self-confidence.', '/uploads/images/c_67333.png'),
(141, 'Kiyoko Shimizu', '清水潔子', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 166.2 cm __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 2 The manager of the Karasuno High volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_67689.png'),
(141, 'Keishin Ukai', '烏養繋心', '配角', 'Hisao Egawa', '**Height:** 178.2 cm **Team:** Karasuno High Karasuno High School volleyball club''s alumnus, currently coaching volleyball club and helping out his mother at the shop.', '/uploads/images/c_70861.jpg'),
(141, 'Kenma Kozume', '孤爪研磨', '配角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 169.2 cm The setter of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. Kenma is [Kuroo](https://anilist.co/character/71269)''s childhood friend and keeps playing volleyball because of him. He has a very calm personality and is usually doing things at his own pace. Often seen playing video games and being introverted. Nekoma''s backbone, brain and heart.', '/uploads/images/c_71267.jpg'),
(141, 'Tetsurou Kuroo', '黒尾鉄朗', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 187.7 cm __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 5 __Number:__ 1 __Position:__ Middle Blocker The captain of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. Kuroo has a somehow manipulative and cunning personality, but cares about his friends and teammates very deeply. As Nekoma''s captain he has a sense of responsibility and confidence. Even though Kuroo''s a middle blocker, he often uses offensive plays too.', '/uploads/images/c_71269.jpg'),
(141, 'Tadashi Yamaguchi', '山口忠', '配角', 'Souma Saitou', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 179.5cm - 180.0cm __Year:__ 1st year, class 4 __Number:__ 12 __Position:__ Middle Blocker Yamaguchi always hangs out with Tsukishima and is very protective of him. He has trained himself hard to use a jump float serve. He is also a substitute ace server of the Karasuno Volleyball team.', '/uploads/images/c_71609.png'),
(141, 'Tooru Oikawa', '及川徹', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', '__Height:__ 184 cm The setter and captain of the Aoba Josai High School volleyball club. He was [Kageyama](https://anilist.co/character/64771/Tobio-Kageyama)''s senpai when they were attending Kitagawa Daiichi. According to Kageyama, he is a very talented setter and volleyball player with a ​complex personality. His favourite food is milk bread.', '/uploads/images/c_71611.png'),
(141, 'Taketora Yamamoto', '山本猛虎', '配角', 'Seigo Yokota', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 176.7 cm __Year:__ 2nd Year, class 1 __Number:__ 4 __Position:__ Wing Spiker Yamamoto is proud and short tempered wing spiker of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. He usually doesn''t think what he says and is somewhat similar to Tanaka.', '/uploads/images/c_73673.jpg'),
(141, 'Sou Inuoka', '犬岡走', '配角', 'Kyousuke Ikeda', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 185.3 cm __Year:__ 1st Year, class 1 __Number:__ 7 __Position:__ Middle Blocker Middle blocker of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. He has friendly personality and becomes friends with Hinata after their game.', '/uploads/images/c_73675.jpg'),
(141, 'Yuuki Shibayama', '芝山優生', '配角', 'Takumi Watanabe', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 162.5 cm __Weight:__ 53.3 kg __Year:__ 1st Year, class 4 __Number:__ 12 __Position:__ Libero One of the libero of the Nekoma High School volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_73677.jpg'),
(141, 'Ittetsu Takeda', '武田一鉄', '配角', 'Hiroshi Kamiya', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 166.5 cm Volleyball club faculty advisor of the Karasuno High School. Takeda is inexperienced in volleyball, but still became an advisor for Karasuno. He often doesn''t understand rules and that''s why he takes notes about every new thing he learns. Takeda has an enthusiastic and brave personality.', '/uploads/images/c_73679.png'),
(141, 'Yuutarou Kindaichi', '金田一勇太郎', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', '__Team:__ Aoba Josai High, Kitagawa Daiichi (former) __Height:__ 189.2 cm __Year:__ 1st year __Position:__ Middle Blocker Middle blocker of the Aoba Josai High School volleyball club. He was Kageyama''s teammate back in junior high school. Kindaichi was one of the players who hated Kageyama''s selfish plays and refused to understand him.', '/uploads/images/c_73681.jpg'),
(141, 'Nobuyuki Kai', '海信行', '配角', 'Takanori Hoshino', '__Team__: Nekoma High School __Height__: 176.5 cm __Weight__: 68.9 kg __Year__: 3rd Year, class 4 __Number__: 2 __Position__: Wing Spiker', '/uploads/images/c_74029.jpg'),
(141, 'Morisuke Yaku', '夜久衛輔', '配角', 'Shinnosuke Tachibana', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 165.2 cm __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 5 __Number:__ 3 __Position:__ Libero Currently playing libero of the Nekoma High School volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_74033.png'),
(141, 'Shouhei Fukunaga', '福永招平', '配角', 'Shouta Chounan', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 178.3 cm __Year:__ 2nd Year, class 2 __Number:__ 6 __Position:__ Wing Spiker', '/uploads/images/c_74039.jpg'),
(141, 'Hayato Ikejiri', '池尻隼人', '配角', 'Hiromu Miyazaki', '__Team:__ Tokonami High School __Height:__ 177.2 cm __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 1 __Number:__ 4 __Position:__ Wing Spiker Ikejiri went to the same junior high school as Daichi where they played volleyball together.', '/uploads/images/c_76814.jpg'),
(141, 'Wakatoshi Ushijima', '牛島若利', '配角', 'Ryouta Takeuchi', '__Height:__ 189.5 cm (6'' 2.6") __Team:__ Shiratorizawa Academy __Number:__ 1 __Position:__ Wing Spiker Wakatoshi Ushijima is a third year at Shiratorizawa Academy and the captain and ace of the school''s boys'' volleyball team. Currently, he is the number one ace in Miyagi Prefecture and one of the country''s top three aces, along with Sakusa and Kiryu. Left handed. His favourite food is hayashi rice.', '/uploads/images/c_76816.png'),
(141, 'Kaname Moniwa', '茂庭要', '配角', 'Takashi Onozuka', '**Height:** 176 cm **Team:** Datekougyou High School **Number:** 2 **Position:** Setter The captain of the Datekougyou High School volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_77413.png'),
(141, 'Kenji Futakuchi', '二口堅治', '配角', 'Masatomo Nakazawa', '__Team:__ Datekougyou High School __Height:__ 184.2 cm According to Moniwa, Futakuchi is a problematic kouhai with a very easy going personality. He''s often seen arguing with Kamasaki who is the ​complete opposite of Futakuchi.', '/uploads/images/c_77415.jpg'),
(141, 'Takanobu Aone', '青根高伸', '配角', 'Hiroki Matsukawa', '__Team:__ Datekougyou High School __Height:__ 191.8 cm __Year:__ 2nd Year, class A __Number:__ 7 __Position:__ Middle Blocker Main pillar of Datekou. Even though Aone never smiles and seems serious and scary, he actually has a very kind heart. Futakuchi said that Aone has a habit of "locking on" to you if he knows his opponent is an ace.', '/uploads/images/c_77417.jpg'),
(141, 'Yuusuke Takinoue', '滝ノ上祐輔', '配角', 'Shuuhei Sakaguchi', 'Height: 185.6 cm Position: Middle Blocker Karasuno High School volleyball club''s alumnus. He and Shimada are part of the Karasuno Neighborhood Association team. And they often come to watch current Karasuno''s games as well as to root for them. Yuusuke''s working at Takinoue Electric Goods.', '/uploads/images/c_80511.png'),
(141, 'Makoto Shimada', '嶋田誠', '配角', 'Tomoaki Maeno', '__Height:__ 177.7cm Karasuno High School volleyball club''s alumnus. He and Takinoue are part of the Karasuno Neighborhood Association team. And they often come to watch current Karasuno''s games as well as to root for them. Makoto''s working at Shimada Mart.', '/uploads/images/c_80513.jpg'),
(141, 'Hisashi Kinoshita', '木下久志', '配角', 'Nobuyori Sagara', '__Height:__ 174cm Narita, Ennoshita and Kinoshita are 2nd years who couldn''t keep up with the training when old Ukai returned and that''s why they left volleyball club. However after some time they came back because they realized that they still want to play volleyball, though coach Ukai was no longer there. Ennoshita called them ''''disgraceful'''' 2nd years.', '/uploads/images/c_80515.jpg'),
(141, 'Kazuhito Narita', '成田一仁', '配角', 'Koutarou Nishiyama', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 180.2 cm __Year:__ 2nd Year, class 4 Narita, Ennoshita and Kinoshita are 2nd years who couldn''t keep up with the training when old Ukai returned and that''s why they left volleyball club. However after some time they came back because they realized that they still want to play volleyball, though coach Ukai was no longer there. Ennoshita called them ''''disgraceful'''' 2nd years.', '/uploads/images/c_80517.jpg'),
(141, 'Koutarou Bokuto', '木兎光太郎', '配角', 'Ryouhei Kimura', '__Height:__ 185.3 cm Bokuto is a third year student at Fukurodani Academy and is its volleyball team''s captain and wing spiker. His spikes pack a powerful punch that others can struggle to receive. Despite this, Bokuto has a tendency to not doing well in the middle of games when getting shut out. Luckily, [Akaashi](https://anilist.co/character/88938) has a whole list of things Bokuto does and tries his best to bring Bokuto back up to his usual self. Besides Akaashi, Bokuto is friends with a few other rival team''s players, such as [Kuroo](https://anilist.co/character/71269) and sorta friends with [Tsukishima](https://anilist.co/character/67329).', '/uploads/images/c_88937.png'),
(141, 'Keiji Akaashi', '赤葦京治', '配角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', '__Height:__ 182.3 cm A second year at Fukurodani Academy, and its volleyball team''s vice-captain and setter. Akaashi is often calm and collected, though he does have times where he begins to get worried about things. More often than not, he has to handle Bokuto and all of his antics during the game. When such happens, Akaashi usually thinks of some way to bring Bokuto into peak condition again, though there are times where he struggles with doing so.', '/uploads/images/c_88938.png'),
(141, 'Hitoka Yachi', '谷地仁花', '配角', 'Sumire Morohoshi', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Position:__ Manager __Occupation:__ High School Student (1st Year, Class 5) A 1st year who was recruited by [Shimizu](https://anilist.co/character/67689/Shimizu-Kiyoko) as a manager trainee. She appears to be very nervous, but easily befriends [Hinata](https://anilist.co/character/64769/Hinata-Shouyou). She''s paranoid (which causes her to be intimidated easily), very curious, and is organized with her notes, including the ones that she takes from class; this is largely due to her mother being a graphic designer.', '/uploads/images/c_89124.jpg'),
(141, 'Akira Kunimi', '国見英', '配角', 'Atsushi Tamaru', '__Team:__ Aobajōsai (former Kitagawa Daīchi) (first year at Aoba Johsai) __Height:__ 182.8 cm __Number:__ 13 __Position:__ Wing Spiker He is a quiet and indifferent person, though it''s mostly out of laziness. He occasionally skips practice as well and doesn''t seem to put his full effort into matches; however, his true strength lies in his late game plays. Kunimi dislikes loud, energetic people and was dismayed when Koganegawa yelled at him to "go all out", which is one of his least liked phrases. He also refers to Hinata, Koganegawa, and Hyakuzawa as the "idiot squad" because of their energy. Kageyama has also mentioned that Kunimi is smart, though it''s unknown if that refers to his game sense or general studies.', '/uploads/images/c_89508.jpg'),
(141, 'Lev Haiba', '灰羽リエーフ', '配角', 'Mark Ishii', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 194 cm __Weight:__ 79,7 kg __Year:__ 1st Year __Position:__ Middle Blocker Lev is a half Russian, half Japanese. However he says he doesn''t speak Russian because he was born and raised in Japan. His name in Russian means lion. Lev wasn''t around when Karasuno and Nekoma had their first match together. He started playing volleyball in high school, that''s why he was still a novice and spent whole time on bench at that time so he didn''t come. Lev is blessed with natural physical ability, intuition and height. He declares that he''s an ace even though he''s a middle blocker. Kenma states that Lev is a good and honest guy. Lev is quite childish and cheerful, shown when he was making fun of Hinata''s height. Lev''s appearance, as well as his piercing eyes, causes people to believe he is much more intimidating and serious than he actually is. Though he can be blunt, he never seems to mean any harm and adopts a playful attitude towards most things. He is also shown to be enthusiastic about spiking as he gets excited about it very easily, and can be competitive with people he is interested in.', '/uploads/images/c_89517.png'),
(141, 'Saeko Tanaka', '田中冴子', '配角', 'Yuka Komatsu', 'Saeko Tanaka is a former student of Karasuno High and the older sister of Ryuunosuke Tanaka. She was also a classmate of the Small Giant during her high school years. The second years of the volleyball team views her as a cool older sister, especially Nishinoya, but Tanaka thinks of her as a nuisance whenever she bothers his study sessions. Like her brother, she''s loud and outspoken. Her driving has been described by her brother as dangerous as he had once stated to Hinata and Kageyama that he can''t guarantee their safety in her car.', '/uploads/images/c_90142.jpg'),
(141, 'Akiteru Tsukishima', '月島明光', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', 'Kei Tsukishima''s older brother.', '/uploads/images/c_121624.jpg'),
(141, 'Satori Tendou', '天童覚', '配角', 'Subaru Kimura', '__Height:__ 187.7 cm (6'' 1.9") __Home town:__ Miyagi Prefecture __Home country:__ Japan __Likes:__ Shounen Jump, Chocolate, Ice Cream, Cute Actresses __Jumping Reach:__ 327 cm Satori Tendō is a third year middle blocker in Shiratorizawa Academy. He is often referred to as Guess Monster by other teams. He is cheerful and loud, though a bit sardonic. Tendō enjoys teasing both his teammates and opponents, usually annoying the latter. However, when he gets into the game, he becomes a different, more intimidating person, relishing the look of defeat on people''s faces when they are denied. He has a high success rate with this blocking style due to his analytical skills and predictions, thus he is confident in his abilities . He also greatly values the fun aspect of volleyball. ~!As an elementary student, he was called a monster for his looks also probably due to the meaning of his name (Satori refers to a Yokai) and was told he couldn''t join the volleyball team by other students because of that. Using his guess block, he was able to block the spike of one of his bullies. This event made him feel happy and he continued to use his unique blocking technique to feel that way again despite much opposition until high school. Since his guess block got a lot of points, the Shiratorizawa coach let him join the team without resistance.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126073.png'),
(141, 'Kanji  Koganegawa', '黄金川貫至', '配角', 'Masayuki Shouji', '__Height:__ 191.5 cm __Team:__ Datekougyou High School __Year:__ 1st year __Number:__ 7 __Position:__ Setter Koganegawa is a first year setter at Date Tech High. He is very energetic and enthusiastic but often lacks the ability to think carefully about his actions. Despite being rather simple-minded, he''s also shown to be determined to improve his abilities and support his team as their setter and with his height but tends to focus on improving the wrong areas.', '/uploads/images/c_134003.png'),
(141, 'Takahiro Hanamaki', '花巻貴大', '配角', 'Tooru Sakurai', 'Takahiro is a 3rd year wing spiker at Aobajohsai High.', '/uploads/images/c_137470.png'),
