(141, 'Tarou Onagawa', '女川太郎', '配角', 'Shouya Chiba', 'Tarou is a 2nd year student at Date Tech High. He became one of the team''s wing spikers after the 3rd years retired.', '/uploads/images/c_137488.jpg'),
(141, 'Tsutomu Goshiki', '五色工', '配角', 'Shinba Tsuchiya', '__Height:__ 181 cm (5''11") __Hometown:__ Miyagi Prefecture Tsutomu Goshiki is a first year wing spiker in Shiratorizawa Academy. Goshiki appears to have been a capable volleyball player even before entering Shiratorizawa Academy. In one of his recollections, he is seen being praised by an elderly lady while showing off a volleyball related trophy. He is also frequently acknowledged for his height and reliability as an ace.', '/uploads/images/c_137534.png'),
(141, 'Eita Semi', '瀬見英太', '配角', 'Takuma Terashima', '__Height:__ 179.5 cm (5'' 10.7") __Hometown:__ Miyagi Prefecture Eita Semi is a third year setter in Shiratorizawa Academy. Like most members of the Shiratorizawa Boys'' Volleyball Team, Semi got into the school through a sports scholarship. He was a famous setter during his time at middle school and the main setter for Shiratorizawa before being replaced by Shirabu.', '/uploads/images/c_137535.png'),
(141, 'Reon Ouhira', '大平獅音', '配角', 'Teruyuki Tanzawa', '__Height:__ 182.7 cm (5'' 11.9") __Hometown:__ Miyagi Prefecture __Introduction:__ Reon is a third year wing spiker at Shiratorizawa Academy. It''s implied that he was accepted due to a sports scholarship for volleyball. __Personality:__ Ouhira has a soothing personality and tends to be responsible for calming his teammates down when they''re hyped up. He doesn''t get riled up easily and is similar to Ushijima when it comes to his temperament; along with Ushijima, he wasn''t upset about the hundred serves they had to do upon losing. He is confident in his own abilities, going up against three blockers and performing well despite being aware of the audience''s disappointment that it wasn''t Ushijima attacking. (Source [Haikyuu!! Fandom Wikia](https://haikyuu.fandom.com/wiki/Reon_%C5%8Chira))', '/uploads/images/c_137536.png'),
(141, 'Kenjirou Shirabu', '白布賢二郎', '配角', 'Toshiyuki Toyonaga', '__Height:__ 174.8 cm (5'' 8.8") __Hometown:__ Miyagi Prefecture __Introduction:__ Kenjirou Shirabu is a second year setter at Shiratorizawa Academy. He is the only player on Shiratorizawa''s Boys'' Volleyball Team who didn''t get into the school with a sports scholarship. He took the exam to get into Shiratorizawa in hopes of being able to play with tall and strong players after watching Ushijima play in junior high. __Personality:__ He is respectful towards his upperclassmen but tends to bicker with Goshiki, a first year. Though he appears serious and composed, Shirabu is extremely hot-headed and gets annoyed at nearly every move his opponents pull. However, he is capable of recomposing himself quickly. He is also very studious and hardworking, spending all of his free time studying in order to pass the difficult entrance exam for Shiratorizawa. During junior high, he had good grades.', '/uploads/images/c_137537.png'),
(141, 'Tanji Washijou', '鷲匠鍛治', '配角', 'Ryuusei Nakao', 'Tanji is the head coach of Shiratorizawa Academy Boys'' Volleyball team.', '/uploads/images/c_137539.png'),
(141, 'Hayato Yamagata', '山形隼人', '配角', '', '__Date of Birth:__ February 14, 1995 __Height:__ 174.3 cm (5'' 8.6") __Weight:__ 66.5 kg (146.6 lbs) __Likes:__ Uni donburi (Sea urchin on rice) __Hometown:__ Miyagi Prefecture __Introduction:__ Hayato Yamagata is a third year libero in Shiratorizawa Academy. __Personality:__ He is serious and focused on the game. When Nishinoya pulled off an incredible move, Yamagata grinned widely. It''s been shown he is similar to Nishinoya when it comes to ''getting into'' the game, yet he seems more aggressive than most liberos. Yamagata is also seen being very supportive of his kouhai, Goshiki, and was shown telling Ushijima when he was being unintentionally rude towards him. He appears to be very protective of the younger years and often acts as a mentor. (Source [Haikyuu!! Fandom Wikia](https://haikyuu.fandom.com/wiki/Hayato_Yamagata))', '/uploads/images/c_137540.png'),
(141, 'Ikkei Ukai', '烏養一繋', '配角', 'Hiroshi Naka', 'Ikkei is the former coach of Karasuno High''s Boys'' Volleyball Club. He once led the team to nationals and was well-known. After being hospitalized, he resigned from coaching the team.', '/uploads/images/c_137541.png'),
(141, 'Hiroki Kurokawa', '黒川弘樹', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', 'Hiroki was a member of Karasuno High''s Boys'' Volleyball Club. He played as a wing spiker and was the captain during his third year.', '/uploads/images/c_137543.png'),
(141, 'Hidemi Tashiro', '田代秀水', '配角', 'Kouki Miyata', 'Hidemi is a former member of Karasuno High''s Boys'' Volleyball Club. He was the former team captain during his third year.', '/uploads/images/c_137544.png'),
