(141, 'Kiyoomi Sakusa', '佐久早聖臣', '配角', 'Kousuke Toriumi', 'Itachiyama Academy''s second-year ace and one of the top three aces of Japan. He is calm and collected, yet very competitive and proud. He''s also a germaphobe, often wearing a mask when not playing volleyball. ~!He eventually became an outside hitter for the MSBY Black Jackals, a V-League Division 1 team. He became a member of Japan''s National team during the 2021 Olympics.!~', '/uploads/images/c_139475.jpg'),
(141, 'Motoya Komori', '古森元也', '配角', 'Yuuto Uemura', 'Itachiyama Academy''s second year libero that was featured as the #1 high school libero in Volleyball Monthly. He is [Kiyoomi Sakusa’s](https://anilist.co/character/139475/Sakusa-Kiyoomi) cousin.', '/uploads/images/c_139476.png'),
(141, 'Ren Oomimi', '大耳練', '配角', '', 'A third year at Inarizaki High and a middle blocker.', '/uploads/images/c_139482.png'),
(141, 'Hitoshi Ginjima', '銀島結', '配角', '', 'A second year at Inarizaki High and a wing spiker.', '/uploads/images/c_139483.png'),
(141, 'Aran Ojiro', '尾白アラン', '配角', 'Jun  Kasama', '__Height:__ 184.7 cm (6'' 0.7") __Occupation: __High School Student (3rd Year, Class 5) __Teams:__ Inarizaki High (Former) __Number:__ 4 (High School 3rd Year) __Position:__ Outside Hitter Ace A third year at Inarizaki High and the volleyball club''s wing spiker and ace. He is also one of the top aces in Japan. He is best friends with the Miya twins and good friends with Kita Shinsuke, the teams captain.', '/uploads/images/c_139485.png'),
(141, 'Atsumu Miya', '宮侑', '配角', 'Mamoru Miyano', '__Height:__ 183 cm __Year:__ Second Year Highschool Student __Number:__ 7 __Position:__ Setter __Team:__ Inarizaki High Atsumu Miya is an second year highschool student who lives in Hyogo Prefecture, Japan. Outwardly, Atsumu appears to be a carefree, confident person who''s usually seen with a lazy smile on his face, though he enjoys provoking people and giving offhand compliments. He can be quite condescending, and somewhat selfish at times. His twin brother, [Osamu Miya](https://anilist.co/character/139492/), describes him as someone who doesn''t listen to others, doesn''t return what he borrows, and lies habitually. He also appears to be a perfectionist who has ridiculously high standards for himself and his spikes. Atsumu is a competitive person who hates losing; sometimes, these traits can veer off in a bad direction. ~!As of 2018, he is a member of MSBY Black Jackals, a professional volleyball team in Division 1 of Japan''s V. League. He is also a member of the Japan National Volleyball Team and participated in the 2021 Olympics.!~', '/uploads/images/c_139486.png'),
(141, 'Norimune Kurosu', '黒須法宗', '配角', '', 'The coach of Inarizaki High''s Boys'' volley club.', '/uploads/images/c_139487.png'),
(141, 'Heisuke Riseki', '理石平介', '配角', '', 'A first year at Inarizaki High, along with being a wing spiker and pinch server.', '/uploads/images/c_139488.png'),
(141, 'Rintarou Suna', '角名倫太郎', '配角', 'Nobunaga Shimazaki', '__Height:__ 185.7 cm (6'' 1.1") He is the middle blocker of Inarizaki High', '/uploads/images/c_139489.png'),
(141, 'Yuuto Kosaku', '小作裕渡', '配角', '', 'A second year at Inarizaki High and a wing spiker.', '/uploads/images/c_139490.png'),
(141, 'Michinari Akagi', '赤木路成', '配角', '', 'A third year at Inarizaki High and a libero.', '/uploads/images/c_139491.png'),
(141, 'Osamu Miya', '宮治', '配角', 'Hideaki Kabumoto', '__Height:__183 cm __Number:__11 __Position:__ Opposite Hitter __Team:__ Inarizaki High Osamu is a second-year high school student who lives in Hyogo Prefecture, Japan. Osamu appears to be the calmer of the Miya twins with a laid-back and deadpan personality. Despite his outward demeanor, Osamu is highly competitive and becomes heated even if it isn''t obvious on the surface. Osamu is also shown to have a large passion for food. He thinks about it often in the middle of a match and would get distracted by the smell of it. He can''t seem to pick a favorite food and wouldn''t know what to eat as his last meal. Like his brother, Atsumu Miya, he loses self-control when it comes to eating. He''s shown to have a sense of humor, especially regarding Atsumu, whom Osamu teases whenever he messes up.', '/uploads/images/c_139492.png'),
(141, 'Kourai Hoshiumi', '星海光来', '配角', 'Natsuki Hanae', '__Height:__ 169.2 cm (5''6.6") __Teams:__ Yurisei Middle School (Former); Kamomedai High __Number:__ 5 __Position:__ Outside Hitter, Ace Hoshiumi Originally planned on playing basketball, but he decided to join the volleyball team in second grade. His reason was listed as wanting to be free from his older brother, Akitomo, who constantly sneered at Hoshiumi over their height difference. Despite his reasoning at first, Hoshiumi soon came to love the sport as he watched official matches on TV.', '/uploads/images/c_139509.png'),
(141, 'Sachirou Hirugami', '昼神幸郎', '配角', 'Yuu Miyazaki', '__Height:__ 190.4 cm (6'' 3") A second year at Kamomedai High and a middle blocker. He likes shumai with extra fillings.', '/uploads/images/c_139514.jpg'),
