(141, 'Maiko Yonezawa', '米沢まい子', '配角', 'Ayaka Oohashi', 'From Niiyama Girls'' High. Friends with Amanai Kanoka.', '/uploads/images/c_165620.png'),
(141, 'Kai Akakura', '赤倉櫂', '配角', 'Kouji Seki', '__School (Team):__ Shiratorizawa Academy __Grade:__ 1-10 __Position:__ Libero __Height:__ 171.4 cm (5''7'''') __Weight:__ 59.5 kg __Kai Akakura__ is a first year libero at Shiratorizawa Academy. He helps out during the first year training camp and befriends Hinata when working together.', '/uploads/images/c_167512.jpg'),
(141, 'Fuki Hibarida ', '雲雀田吹', '配角', 'Hiroshi Yanaka', '__Fuki Hibarida__ is the coach for the Japan Olympic Men''s Volleyball Team.', '/uploads/images/c_167514.png'),
(141, 'Shinsuke Kita', '北信介', '配角', 'Kenji Nojima', '__Hometown:__ Hyougo Prefecture __School (Team):__ Inarizaki High __Grade:__ 3-7 __Height:__ 175.2 cm (5''9'''') __Weight:__ 67.5 kg (148.8 lbs) __Likes:__ Tofu Hamburger __Introduction:__ Shinsuke Kita is a third-year wing spiker and the captain of Inarizaki High. __Appearance:__ Kita is of average height with an athletic build. His hair is light gray with black tips at the ends. He also has dark eyes and thin eyebrows.', '/uploads/images/c_167515.png'),
(141, 'Tarou Oomi', '近江太郎', '配角', 'Taichi Takeda', 'Coach of Inarizaki High''s Boys'' Volleyball Team', '/uploads/images/c_290121.jpg'),
(141, 'Kotarou Hitaki', '火焼呼太郎', '配角', 'Takashi Matsuyama', 'Coach of the All Japan''s Boys'' Youth Team. He is the main coach at the Intensive Training Camp.', '/uploads/images/c_290125.jpg'),
(141, 'Shouta Yura', '由良正太', '配角', 'Shuuichi Uchida', 'Third-year at Shiratorizawa Academy Junior High and setter on the volleyball team. He attends the Miyagi First Year Training Camp.', '/uploads/images/c_290127.jpg'),
(141, 'Akira Saitou', '斉藤明', '配角', 'Kenji Sugimura', 'Assistant boys'' volleyball coach for Shiratorizawa Academy', '/uploads/images/c_290129.jpg'),
(141, 'Takeyuki Yamiji', '闇路建行', '配角', '', 'Head Coach of the Fukuroudani Academy boys'' volleyball team.', '/uploads/images/c_290130.jpg'),
(141, 'Yasushi Kamasaki', '鎌先靖志', '配角', 'Takuya Satou', '__Height:__ 186.8cm (6'' 1.5") __Uniform Number:__ 1 __Position:__ Middle Blocker __Ability Parameters (out of 5):__ Power = 5; Jump = 2; Stamina = 4; Game Sense 2; Technique = 2; Speed = 4 Third-year student at Datekougyou High School. Prior to retiring, he played on the boys'' volleyball team as a middle blocker and the vice-captain. He is loud, strict, and often argues with and threatens his problematic kouhai [Futakuchi](https://anilist.co/character/77415/Kenji-Futakuchi). However, he is incredibly supportive of his team and often attends their official and practices matches with [Moniwa](https://anilist.co/character/77413/Kaname-Moniwa) and [Sasaya](https://anilist.co/character/137486/Takehito-Sasaya) after retiring.', '/uploads/images/c_290202.jpg'),
(141, 'Kyoutou', '教頭', '配角', '', 'Vice Principal of Karasuno High School. He is balding and attempts to keep his head covered with a toupee. He is said to have a bad relationship with the volleyball club that has gotten worse since Hinata and Kageyama joined the club. However, once the team starts to win again, he begins supporting the club more.', '/uploads/images/c_290203.jpg'),
(141, 'Kouji Terada', '寺田浩二', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', '[Kanoka Amanai](https://anilist.co/character/139520/Kanoka-Amanai)''s cousin', '/uploads/images/c_290506.jpg'),
(141, 'Yuushou Sagae', '寒河江勇将', '配角', 'Akihiro Mine', '__Height:__ 177.8cm (5''10") First-year at Shiratorizawa Academy and wing spiker on the volleyball team. He is one of the ball boys at the Miyagi First-Year Training Camp.', '/uploads/images/c_290507.jpg'),
(141, 'Junji Kuroishi', '黒石淳二', '配角', 'Takeo Ootsuka', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5’ 8.1”) __Position:__ Libero First-year student at Hakusuikan High School and libero on the volleyball team. He attends the Miyagi FIrst-Year Training Camp at Shiratorizawa Academy. During a practice game against the Shiratorizawa third-years and alumni, he would unintentionally remind [Hinata](https://anilist.co/character/64769/Shouyou-Hinata) of the "split step" technique.', '/uploads/images/c_290508.jpg'),
(141, 'Yumeto Nagamatsu', '長松夢人', '配角', 'Rikuya Yasuda', '__Height:__ 189 cm (6''2") __Position:__ Middle Blocker Third-year middle school student and volleyball player at Kousen Academy. He attends the Miyagi First-Year Training Camp, where it is revealed that he will be attending Shiratorizawa Academy upon graduating middle school.', '/uploads/images/c_290509.jpg'),
(142, 'Legoshi', 'レゴシ', '主角', 'Chikahiro Kobayashi', '__Height:__ 185 cm (debut), 187 cm (currently) Our main character is the quiet and sensitive gray wolf Legoshi. Because of his fearsome appearance and odd habits he is widely mistaken to be a scary, bloodthirsty carnivore. Legoshi is wholly aware of this and does everything in his power to minimize himself and downplay his intimidating aspects. The series is largely about him coming to terms with his place in the world as a wolf. Legoshi develops some complicated feelings for the rabbit [Haru](https://anilist.co/character/125169). ~!He is a 1/4 komodo dragon, because of his grandfather [Gosha](https://anilist.co/character/132981).!~', '/uploads/images/c_125168.jpg'),
(142, 'Haru', 'ハル', '主角', 'Sayaka Senbongi', '__Species:__ Netherland dwarf rabbit Haru is the lone member of Cherryton School''s gardening club. She is earnest and forthright which, in addition to her sexual promiscuity, has earned her a sleazy reputation. Haru is broadly confident, but a defeatist side sometimes peeks through her facade. In spite of her caring nature she tends to keep people at an emotional distance.', '/uploads/images/c_125169.jpg'),
(142, 'Louis', 'ルイ', '主角', 'Yuuki Ono', '__Species:__ Red deer The proud face of Cherryton''s drama club. He has an enormous ego, but with acting skills like his this isn''t surprising. He carries a number of personality complexes owing to his status as a deer, a species traditionally seen as carnivore fodder. While he has shown moments of genuine kindness he is also very emotionally manipulative. Louis'' greatest ambition is to achieve the rank of Beastar. (Source: TV Tropes)', '/uploads/images/c_125170.jpg'),
(142, 'Bill', 'ビル', '配角', 'Takaaki Torashima', 'Bengal Tiger who is a student and member of the Drama Club at Cherryton Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_132945.jpg'),
(142, 'Juno', 'ジュノ', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', '__Species:__ Gray wolf Juno is one of the five main characters of Beastars and is a member of the drama club on the actor team. A feminine, affable wolf, she wishes to become the next Beastar, competing against Louis.', '/uploads/images/c_132946.jpg'),
(142, 'Gouhin', 'ゴウヒン', '配角', 'Akio Ootsuka', 'A back alley psychiatrist who tries to rehabilitate carnivorous animals that crave meat. The wounds on his face were made by violent patients. Despite his gruff appearance and rough character, he''s gentle and caring.', '/uploads/images/c_132948.jpg'),
(142, 'Jack', 'ジャック', '配角', 'Junya Enoki', '__Species:__ Labrador Retriever Both one of [Legoshi](https://anilist.co/character/125168/Legoshi)''s roommates and his best friend for many years, Jack is a rather average guy. He is often weirded out by Legoshi''s behavior, especially involving [Haru](https://anilist.co/character/125169/Haru), but he is always there for his best friend.', '/uploads/images/c_132982.jpg'),
(142, 'Riz', 'リズ', '配角', '', 'Riz is a kindhearted and quiet Bear in the drama club who is loved and respected by his classmates. He prefers to draw little attention to himself by mostly standing in the background. ~!However Riz holds a darker side by being the one who mistakenly killed Tem. He considered Tem to be one of his closest friends with it being hinted that he was somewhat romantically interested in him. However due to Bears aggressive nature and staggering size they must take medication to reduce their strength but these come with awful side affects making Riz miserable and lonely. After Tem was kind to Riz he thought could he go without taking his medication yet by doing so causing him to accidentally kill Tem. After he realized what he has done by eating Tem he developed a taste for killing causing him to slowly lose his sanity developing a twisted mentally where he believes Tem wanted to be eaten and eating Legoshi will cause them to become friends. Riz goes to the point where he’s willingly to kill anyone who’s finds about what he did.!~ ~!However during his fight with Legoshi he comes to realize his actions and that he must face the consequences for what he did so he doesn’t resist arrest.!~', '/uploads/images/c_132983.jpg'),
(142, 'Ibuki', 'イブキ', '配角', 'Taiten Kusunoki', '__Occupation:__ Member of the Shishigumi Ibuki is a Maasai lion in his mid-thirties with an athletic build. He has light golden-yellow fur, light brown mane, and sharp, slanted eyes with small black pupils. Ibuki has tattoos on the left side of his body from his time as a child going to be used for making hyperdrugs.', '/uploads/images/c_132985.jpg'),
(142, 'Tem', 'テム', '配角', 'Takeo Ootsuka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_132986.jpg'),
(142, 'Oguma', 'オグマ', '配角', 'Kenyuu Horiuchi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_132987.jpg'),
(142, 'Mizuchi', 'ミズチ', '配角', 'Hibiku Yamamura', 'She is a minor antagonist in Beastars and a student at Cherryton Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_151287.jpg'),
(142, 'Kai', 'カイ', '配角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', 'Kai is a small, brown-furred mongoose with a slender build and face. His features are small but expressive. Kai is eager, brash and desperate to prove himself. Driven to a fault, he’s shown to be somewhat selfish. He expressed little sorrow after Tem''s death, instead seeing it as an opportunity to advance his career as he assumed that he would be given the role. (Source: Beastars Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_159863.png'),
(142, 'Kitsunezaru ', 'キツネザル', '配角', 'Ayane Sakura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_159866.png'),
(142, 'Collot', 'コロ', '配角', 'Takeo Ootsuka', 'English sheepdog who is part of the canine room 701 with Legoshi. He has a calm and friendly personality and is often seen offering rides to their smallest group member, Voss.', '/uploads/images/c_160347.png'),
(142, 'Durham', 'ダラム', '配角', 'Naoto Kobayashi', 'Coyote who is part of the canine room 701 with Legoshi. He likes to sumo/arm wrestle against Legoshi and Collot, although he hasn''t been able to beat either of them.', '/uploads/images/c_160348.png'),
(142, 'Sanou', 'サヌ', '配角', 'Fukushi Ochiai', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_160349.png'),
(142, 'Shiira', 'シイラ', '配角', 'Yuuko Hara', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") She is a side character in Beastars. She work as the lead choreographer in the drama club at Cherryton Academy. In the manga, Shelia is a cheetah, while in the anime, she is a leopard.', '/uploads/images/c_160350.png'),
(142, 'Mayor', '市長', '配角', 'Mitsuaki Hoshino', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_160351.png'),
(142, 'Chief Lion', 'ボス', '配角', 'Takaya Hashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_160352.png'),
