(143, 'Sylphiette', 'シルフィエット', '主角', 'Ai Kayano', 'Sylphiette is [Rudeus](https://anilist.co/character/88348/Rudeus-Greyrat)'' childhood friend who is part human, elf, and beast race. ~!Following the teleportation incident, during which her hair turned white from mana exhaustion, she became Princess Ariel''s personal bodyguard under the alias Fitz.!~ ~!She is Rudeus'' first wife and gives birth to their daughter [Lucy](https://anilist.co/character/188846/Greyrat-Lucy) and son [Sieghardt](https://anilist.co/character/273377/Greyrat-Saladin-Sieghardt). She is one of the three goddesses Rudeus worships in his religion. A cloth stained with her virgin blood that serves as a relic for the Goddess of Love is enshrined in the basement.!~', '/uploads/images/c_88346.png'),
(143, 'Paul Greyrat', 'パウロ・グレイラット', '配角', 'Toshiyuki Morikawa', 'Paul Greyrat is the father of [Rudeus Greyrat](https://anilist.co/character/88348/Rudeus-Greyrat), [Norn Greyrat](https://anilist.co/character/145458/Greyrat-Norn) and [Aisha Greyrat](https://anilist.co/character/145459/Greyrat-Aisha). He is both a talented man that became advanced in all three sword arts at a young age and a lustful man that attracts and sleeps with many women before [Zenith](https://anilist.co/character/179855/Zenith-Greyrat) chained him down.', '/uploads/images/c_88347.png'),
(143, 'Rudeus Greyrat', 'ルーデウス・グレイラット', '主角', 'Yumi Uchiyama', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") Rudeus is a tall, well-built, and cool-looking man. However, before his reincarnation, he was originally an overweight 34-year-old Japanese NEET who became a recluse following his high-school persecution. Because of his former life, he is careful not to get carried away and become arrogant. As a result, he is extremely self-aware and humble because he does not want to revert to his old self. He is a kind person, helping his friends and protecting his family whenever needed. Due to being capable in many fields, people have high expectations of him. His body possesses a high affinity for magic. Rudeus is very polite to others, often to the point of making them uncomfortable. Rudeus is one of the few people capable of using voiceless magic, and even rarer as someone who can use voiceless incantation with melded magics. He cannot use voiceless incantation for healing magic due to his lack of understanding in regards to how mana is manipulated to heal. A normal Magician takes at least five seconds for a simple spell, while for higher-level spells it''s thirty to sixty seconds. Rudeus can do it almost instantly no matter what the difficulty of the spell, with the exception of healing magic.', '/uploads/images/c_88348.png'),
(143, 'Eris Boreas Greyrat', 'エリス・ボレアス・グレイラット', '主角', 'Ai Kakuma', 'Eris Boreas Greyrat is a noble girl and distant relative of [Rudeus](https://anilist.co/character/88348/Rudeus-Greyrat). She is a tsundere with a short temper but has potential in the Sword-God style. ~!She is Rudeus'' third wife and gives birth to their son [Ars](https://anilist.co/character/273378/Greyrat-Ars) and daughter [Christina](https://anilist.co/character/278862/Greyrat-Christina). She is one of the three goddesses Rudeus worships in his religion. A wooden sword that serves as a relic for the Goddess of War is enshrined in the basement.!~', '/uploads/images/c_88349.png'),
(143, 'Roxy Migurdia', 'ロキシー・ミグルディア', '主角', 'Konomi Kohara', 'Roxy Migurdia is a talented mage from the Migurd race, and a former magic tutor. Because she can''t use telepathy, she left her village due to feeling isolated from her peers. Unable to make a stable living as an adventurer, she became a travelling tutor and eventually becomes [Rudeus''](https://anilist.co/character/88348/Rudeus-Greyrat) teacher. ~!She is Rudeus'' second wife and gives birth to their daughter [Lara](https://anilist.co/character/273376/Greyrat-Lara) & [Lily](https://anilist.co/character/321620/Greyrat-Lily). She is one of the three goddesses Rudeus worships in his religion. Her panties that serves as a relic for the Goddess of Wisdom is enshrined in the basement.!~', '/uploads/images/c_88350.png'),
(143, 'Ruijerd Superdia', 'ルイジェルド・スペルディア', '主角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', 'Ruijerd Superdia is the former leader of the Superd''s Warrior group whom once served under Laplace with unwavering loyalty. He was accompanying [Rudeus](https://anilist.co/character/88348/Rudeus-Greyrat) and [Eris](https://anilist.co/character/88349/Eris-Boreas-Greyrat). ~!Laplace betrayed his group by giving them each a devil spear which made them ecstatic from killing, even their own family. After giving his son a fatal wound, his son managed to destroy the devil spear and Ruijerd finally wakes up from the brainwash. He considered committing suicide but decided not to and everyone of that warrior group swore revenged on Laplace. He finally got his revenge after several years of hiding. He interfered in the battle between Laplace and the three heroes. But even if Laplace was defeated, there was no way to change the things that had already transpired. After exacting his revenge, he now has a goal of removing the infamy the Superd race has.!~', '/uploads/images/c_88351.png'),
(143, 'Shizuka Nanahoshi', '七星静香', '配角', 'Shion Wakayama', '__Light Novel Volume 9 spoiler__ ~! Nanahoshi Shizuka is a Japanese girl that was saved by [Rudeus](https://anilist.co/character/88348/Rudeus-Greyrat) in his past life, but instead of reincarnating like Rudeus, she was teleported to Asura Kingdom and was saved by [Orsted](https://anilist.co/character/187382/Orsted). !~', '/uploads/images/c_137816.png'),
(143, 'Norn Greyrat', 'ノルン・グレイラット', '配角', 'Saya Aizawa', 'Norn Greyrat is the daughter of [Zenith Greyrat](https://anilist.co/character/179855/Zenith-Greyrat) and [Paul Greyrat](https://anilist.co/character/88347/Paul-Greyrat) and is the younger sister of [Rudeus Greyrat](https://anilist.co/character/88348) and older half-sister of [Aisha Greyrat](https://anilist.co/character/145459/Aisha-Greyrat).', '/uploads/images/c_145458.png'),
(143, 'Aisha Greyrat', 'アイシャ・グレイラット', '配角', 'Yuuki Takada', 'Aisha Greyrat is the daughter of [Lilia](https://anilist.co/character/179854/Lilia) and [Paul Greyrat](https://anilist.co/character/88347/Paul-Greyrat) and is the younger half-sister of [Rudeus Greyrat](https://anilist.co/character/88348/Rudeus-Greyrat) and [Norn Greyrat](https://anilist.co/character/145458/Norn-Greyrat).', '/uploads/images/c_145459.png'),
(143, 'Lilia', 'リーリャ', '配角', 'Lynn', 'Lilia is a maid of the Greyrat household. She was [Paul](https://anilist.co/character/88347/Paul-Greyrat)''s classmate in a swordsman dojo. A crippling injury forces her to leave her position as a princess guard, and she becomes a maid to Paul and [Zenith](https://anilist.co/character/179855/Zenith-Greyrat). ~!After working through the revelation with the family, she is taken in as Paul''s second wife and becomes closer friends with Zenith. Lillia gets pregnant with Paul''s daughter and becomes the mother of [Aisha Greyrat](https://anilist.co/character/145459/Aisha-Greyrat)!~', '/uploads/images/c_179854.png'),
(143, 'Zenith Greyrat', 'ゼニス・グレイラット', '配角', 'Hisako Kanemoto', 'Zenith Greyrat is the wife of [Paul Greyrat](https://anilist.co/character/88347) and the mother of [Rudeus Greyrat](https://anilist.co/character/88348) and [Norn Greyrat](https://anilist.co/character/145458/Norn-Greyrat). ~!Zenith was born in the Holy Country of Milis, as the second daughter of an earl of Milis. She grew up following the Milis Church religion, never breaking the rules, getting good grade in school, and had nickname Milis young lady standard. But, when Zenith reached the age of 15, she rebelled against her parents and ran away from home. While trying to find a job as a Healer, she was a solo adventurer for a time. However she was frequently conned out of a large amount of money due to the little knowledge she had on how expensive healer''s are, but was saved by Paul Greyrat. She then join Paul''s party, the Fangs of the Black Wolf, as a healer. She spent a long time in the party as a healer and gradually began to fall in love with Paul and wanted to marry him. However Paul was a womanizer who frequently slept with multiple women and she didn''t want to be with someone like that so she told him if he promised to be faithful to her then she would sleep with him, to which he agreed. Shortly after, she became pregnant with Rudeus and as a result both her and Paul retired from adventuring and settled down in the countryside.!~ __Light Novel Volume 13 Spoiler__ ~!After being freed from the Teleport Labyrinth, she does not express emotions actively since she sees the wo', '/uploads/images/c_179855.png'),
(143, 'Elinalise Dragonroad', 'エリナリーゼ・ドラゴンロード', '配角', 'Rie Tanaka', 'Elinalise is a former member of Paul''s party. She has an erotic nature due to her curse. She is a warrior that is good at managing monster aggro but isn''t a great fighter.', '/uploads/images/c_186490.png'),
(143, 'Kishirika Kishirisu', 'キシリカ・キシリス', '配角', 'Yuka Iguchi', 'Kishirika Kishirisu is The Great Empress of the Demon Realm. She is the demon empress known for her demon eyes'' powers and the ability to bestow others with demon eyes. She is engaged to [Badigadi](https://anilist.co/character/262620/Badigadi), the demon lord of immortality. __Light Novel Volume 4 Spoiler__ ~!Kishirika Kishirisu is the person that is responsible for giving [Rudeus](https://anilist.co/character/88348/Rudeus-Greyrat) his demon eye, among other favors!~', '/uploads/images/c_186588.png'),
(143, 'Orsted', 'オルステッド', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', 'Orsted is the current Dragon God, 2nd-ranked of the 7 World Powers, and the sworn enemy of [Hitogami](https://anilist.co/character/211165/Hitogami). Similar to other Dragon Race people such as [Perugius](https://anilist.co/character/209572/Perugius-Dola), he has silver hair and golden sanpaku eyes with an overpowering look. He carries no visible equipment and wears a white coat adorned with fur. Orsted has a curse that makes every living being feel an overwhelming fear just from being within his presence. Strangely enough, this curse does not affect [Rudeus](https://anilist.co/character/88348/Rudeus-Greyrat) or [Nanahoshi](https://anilist.co/character/137816/Nanahoshi-Shizuka).', '/uploads/images/c_187382.png'),
(143, 'Ghislaine Dedoldia', 'ギレーヌ・デドルディア', '配角', 'Megumi Toyoguchi', '__Ghislaine Dedoldia__ is the daughter of Gustav the former Doldia village chief, and the mentor of [Eris](https://anilist.co/character/88349/Eris-Boreas-Greyrat) and she is also the student of [Rudeus Greyrat](https://anilist.co/character/88348/Rudeus-Greyrat) in magic and other subjects. She is one of the few people who have become a Sword King.', '/uploads/images/c_206392.png'),
(143, 'Pax Shirone', 'パックス・シーローン', '配角', 'Jun Fukushima', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_206430.png'),
(143, 'Philip Boreas Greyrat', 'フィリップ・ボレアス・グレイラット', '配角', 'Daisuke Ono', '**Philip Boreas Greyrat** is the son of Sauros and father of Eris. He holds the position as mayor of Roa.', '/uploads/images/c_207341.png'),
(143, 'Thomas', 'トーマス', '配角', 'Shouta Yamamoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_207342.png'),
(143, 'Sauros Boreas Greyrat', 'サウロス・ボレアス・グレイラット', '配角', 'Binbin Takaoka', '__Sauros Boreas Greyrat__ was the Landlord of the Fittoa Region, Asura Kingdom and the grandfather of [Eris](https://anilist.co/character/88349/Eris-Boreas-Greyrat). ~!After the Teleport Incident, he was blamed for the loss of the Fittoa Region and was executed.!~ (Source: Mushoku Tensei Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_207786.png'),
(143, 'Hilda Boreas Greyrat', 'ヒルダ・ボレアス・グレイラット', '配角', 'Ryouka Yuzuki', '**Hilda Boreas Greyrat** is the mother of Eris and the wife of Philip.', '/uploads/images/c_208081.png'),
(143, 'Alphonse', 'アルフォンス', '配角', 'Nobuo Tobita', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_208082.png'),
(143, 'Edna Leylune', 'エドナ・レイルーン', '配角', 'Kaori Nakamura', '**Edna Rayrune** is a middle-aged woman who is Eris'' tutor in etiquette.', '/uploads/images/c_208754.png'),
(143, 'Maid', 'メイド', '配角', 'Rie Kawamura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_208757.jpg'),
(143, 'Kizoku', '貴族', '配角', 'Masashi Nogawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_208766.jpg'),
(143, 'Kizoku Musuko', '貴族息子', '配角', 'Aoi Ichikawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_208767.png'),
