(143, 'Kankoshi', '看護師', '配角', 'Ayaka Nanase', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_208772.jpg'),
(143, 'Murabito A', '村人A', '配角', 'Mari Kawano', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_208773.jpg'),
(143, 'Keisatsukan', '警察官', '配角', 'Makoto Kaneko', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_208774.jpg'),
(143, 'Ishi', '医師', '配角', 'Hiroki Maeda', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_208775.jpg'),
(143, 'Kyuukyuu Taiin', '救急隊員', '配角', 'Kaito Takeda', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_208776.jpg'),
(143, 'Murabito B', '村人B', '配角', 'Mai Murakami', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_208777.jpg'),
(143, 'Almanfi', 'アルマンフィ', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', 'Almanfi is one of eleven servants of Perugius.', '/uploads/images/c_209571.png'),
(143, 'Perugius Dola', 'ペルギウス・ドーラ', '配角', 'Rikiya Koyama', 'Perugius Dola is one of the heroes who banished Demon God Laplace.', '/uploads/images/c_209572.jpg'),
(143, 'Hitogami', 'ヒトガミ', '配角', 'Kujira', 'Hitogami is the Man God, having the power to see into the future, and the sworn enemy of [Orsted](https://anilist.co/character/187382). He has a blank white face coupled with a grin that eludes memory, which gives off the feeling that his face is covered in a mosaic. He helps [Rudeus](https://anilist.co/character/88348/Rudeus-Greyrat) throughout key points in his journey. ~!Hitogami later becomes the overarching antagonist of the series following the revelation that he actually sought to prevent the birth of Rudeus'' children, who are prophesied to kill him one day.!~ ~!Hitogami''s exact origins are unknown, however it is known that after the Creator God''s death, unbeknownst to anyone, he was born within the Void World. At some point in the distant past, the being who would come to be known as Hitogami killed or otherwise usurped the original Man God and took his form. He then began manipulating the Dragon God and his five Dragon Generals into destroying the other four worlds and then proceeded to help the survivors of those ruined world to flee into the human world.!~', '/uploads/images/c_211165.png'),
(143, 'Rokari Migurdia', 'ロカリー・ミグルディア', '配角', 'Satomi Satou', '[Roxy](https://anilist.co/character/88350)''s mother and [Rowin](https://anilist.co/character/211181)''s wife.', '/uploads/images/c_211180.png'),
(143, 'Rowin Migurdia', 'ロイン・ミグルディア', '配角', 'Yuusuke Kobayashi', '[Roxy](https://anilist.co/character/88350)''s father and [Rokari](https://anilist.co/character/211180)''s husband.', '/uploads/images/c_211181.png'),
(143, 'Rokkus Migurdia', 'ロックス・ミグルディア', '配角', 'Masayuki Katou', 'The Elder of the Migurd Village', '/uploads/images/c_211182.png'),
(143, 'Nokopara', 'ノコパラ', '配角', 'Hironori Saitou', 'A greedy adventurer Rudeus encounters on the Demon Continent. ~!He catches on to Rudeus'' plans, which violates guild procedures, and tries to blackmail him out of his money, but upon facing the wrath of Ruijerd, he pitifully begs for his life before falling unconscious.!~', '/uploads/images/c_212901.png'),
(143, 'Blaze', 'ブレイズ', '配角', 'Ryuunosuke Watanuki', 'An arrogant adventurer Rudeus meets on the Demon Continent. ~!He gets killed in action in the middle of a quest.!~', '/uploads/images/c_212902.png'),
(143, 'Perutko', 'ペルトコ', '配角', 'Yuuki Ishikari', 'An arrogant adventurer Rudeus meets on the Demon Continent.', '/uploads/images/c_212903.png'),
(143, 'Kurt', 'クルト', '配角', 'Ayaka Asai', 'A young adventurer Rudeus encounters on the Demon Continent, and the leader of the Tokurabu Toughs. He aspires to make his party famous.', '/uploads/images/c_212904.png'),
(143, 'Bachirou', 'バチロウ', '配角', 'Ikuji Nose', 'An adventurer Rudeus encounters on the Demon Continent and a member of Kurt''s party.', '/uploads/images/c_212905.png'),
(143, 'Gablin', 'ガブリン', '配角', 'Shouta  Hayama', 'An adventurer Rudeus encounters on the Demon Continent and a member of Kurt''s party.', '/uploads/images/c_212906.png'),
(143, 'Vizquel', 'ヴェスケル', '配角', 'Maaya Torigoe', 'An adventurer Rudeus encounters on the Demon Continent while looking for a lost cat. She was involved in a scheme where pets were poached and once the owners sent a petition to the adventure''s guild looking for them, she would return them, thus earning the reward.', '/uploads/images/c_212907.png'),
(143, 'Jalil', 'ジャリル', '配角', 'Shin Matsushige', 'An adventurer Rudeus encounters on the Demon Continent while looking for a lost cat. He was involved in a scheme where pets were poached and once the owners sent a petition to the adventure''s guild looking for them, he would return them, thus earning the reward.', '/uploads/images/c_212908.png'),
(143, 'Lohman', 'ロウマン', '配角', 'Hiroki Maeda', 'An adventurer Rudeus encounters on the Demon Continent while looking for a lost cat. He was involved in a scheme where pets were poached and once the owners sent a petition to the adventure''s guild looking for them, he would return them, thus earning the reward.', '/uploads/images/c_212909.png'),
(143, 'Talhand', 'タルハンド', '配角', 'Houchuu Ootsuka', 'A dwarf that was member of the Party "Fang of the Black Wolf", with Elinalise and Roxy. He is slow and not agile, so he wears sturdy armor, wields an axe, and uses magic against enemies.', '/uploads/images/c_213958.png'),
(143, 'Uketsukejou', '受付嬢', '配角', 'You Taichi', 'Receptionist at the Rikarisu City Adventurer''s Guild', '/uploads/images/c_295914.jpg'),
(143, 'Somar', 'ソマル', '配角', 'Takuya Kodama', 'One of the kids from Buena Village who bullied [Sylphiette](https://anilist.co/character/88346).', '/uploads/images/c_295915.jpg'),
(143, 'Douguya', '道具屋', '配角', 'Kazumasa Nakamura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_295917.jpg'),
(144, 'Rimuru Tempest', 'リムル・テンペスト', '主角', 'Miho Okasaki', '__Species:__ Human (past life) → Slime __Kind:__ Reincarnated, Otherworlder Rimuru Tempest, formerly known as Satoru Mikami, is the main protagonist of Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken. They are the founder and King of the monster country Tempest, situated in the Great Jura Forest, and the partner and sworn friend of Storm Dragon, [Veldora Tempest](https://anilist.co/character/128034/Veldora-Tempest).', '/uploads/images/c_123962.png'),
(144, 'Shion', 'シオン', '配角', 'Mao Ichimichi', '"War Lord" Shion is Rimuru’s first servant to be in charge of his care as his personal secretary. She is also the leader of the Yomigaeri and also one of Rimuru''s strongest fighters and is coveted by many of the Demon Lords who have met her.', '/uploads/images/c_128033.png'),
(144, 'Veldora Tempest', 'ヴェルドラ＝テンペスト', '配角', 'Tomoaki Maeno', '__Height:__ 210 cm (human form), 100 m (dragon form) __Species:__ True Dragon __Blessing / Divine Protection:__ Storm Dragon''s Grace, Demon Lord''s Ally __Disaster Rank:__ Catastrophe Veldora Tempest is the youngest of the four strongest dragons (True Dragons). He is connected with [Rimuru](https://anilist.co/character/123962) by an agreement and was known to rampage here and there. He was the one to name Rimuru and Rimuru gave him his last name, since they share the same last name, Rimuru could technically be classified as Veldora''s adoptive brother.', '/uploads/images/c_128034.png'),
(144, 'Ranga', 'ランガ', '配角', 'Chikahiro Kobayashi', '"Star Lord" Ranga is a Wind Spirit Wolf and a loyal follower of [Rimuru](https://anilist.co/character/123962/Tempest-Rimuru). The leader of the Star Wolf Clan, and the son of the previous boss of the Direwolves. He is also one of Rimuru''s Twelve Patrons who has been given the title of a "Lord".', '/uploads/images/c_128035.png'),
(144, 'Milim Nava', 'ミリム・ナーヴァ', '配角', 'Rina Hidaka', '__Kind:__ Inhabitant "Destroyer" Milim Nava is one of the oldest and strongest Demon Lords. She is a Dragonoid. Her nickname, Destroyer, is not just for show. She is a demon lord one should never fight against.', '/uploads/images/c_128036.png'),
(144, 'Shizu', 'シズ', '配角', 'Yumiri Hanamori', 'Shizu was the companion of the previous Hero and a Japanese Summoned One. She is also known as the "Explosive Monarch", an A ranked Adventurer of the Freedom Association''s Headquarters, and the formal homeroom teacher of the Freedom Academy''s S Class students. She was also the mentor of several excellent pupils whom became important figures of society.', '/uploads/images/c_128037.jpg'),
(144, 'Benimaru', 'ベニマル', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', 'Benimaru is one of the third group of subordinate Monsters to be named by Rimuru Tempest. Originally an Ogre, he was uncertain of his servitude and intended for it to be temporary, but after being named, he evolved into a Kijin, immediately becoming Rimuru''s most powerful subordinate for a time, and decided to serve him permanently. He lives in the Capital city of the Jura Tempest Federation: Rimuru City. Soon after, and became Commander-in-Chief, giving him direct command over Tempest''s military forces. Upon Rimuru''s ascension to a True Demon Lord, Benimaru evolved into a Fair Oni and reached the strength of a Disaster-Class Monster.', '/uploads/images/c_128038.png'),
(144, 'Souei', 'ソウエイ', '配角', 'Takuya Eguchi', '__Height__: 180 cm (Kijin), 190 cm (Ogre) Souei is an Ogre that was among the third group of subordinates to be named by Rimuru Tempest. He is Rimuru''s faithful shadow and the leader of the Shadow Squad of the Jura Tempest Federation.', '/uploads/images/c_128039.png'),
(144, 'Shuna', 'シュナ', '配角', 'Sayaka Senbongi', 'Shuna is one of the third group of subordinate Monsters to be named by [Rimuru](https://anilist.co/character/123962), evolving her from an Ogre to a Kijin. She was originally the princess of the Ogre tribe and even though she had the talent for using Magic, she was a sheltered girl, but quickly got along with the Goblinas Shuna is the daughter of the late ogre chieftain and she is also [Benimaru](https://anilist.co/character/128038)''s younger sister, which is why she''s nicknamed "Oni Princess" by Rimuru. Very skilled and knowledgeable in domestic matters, she essentially becomes Rimuru''s chief economic advisor together with [Rigurd](https://anilist.co/character/129348).', '/uploads/images/c_128040.png'),
(144, 'Daikenja', '大賢者', '配角', 'Megumi Toyoguchi', 'Unique Skill Great Sage is one of the first two Unique Skills (the other being Predator) that [Rimuru Tempest](https://anilist.co/character/123962/Rimuru-Tempest) had upon being born into his new world. It had evolved from Extra Skill Sage during his death, as he thought since he was approaching his forties as a virgin, he must be something much greater than a mere wizard. ~!During Rimuru''s evolution into Demon Lord this Unique Skill evolved into the Ultimate Skill: Wisdom King Raphael.!~ ~!Rimuru gave her a name and she evolved into a manas with the name Ciel!~', '/uploads/images/c_129347.jpg'),
(144, 'Rigurd', 'リグルド', '配角', 'Kanehira Yamamoto', 'Formerly the chief of the goblin village Rimuru comes across. He''s now the acting prime minister of the Jura Tempest Federation. He evolved into a hobgoblin when Rimuru named him.', '/uploads/images/c_129348.jpg'),
(144, 'Rigur', 'リグル', '配角', 'Haruki Ishiya', 'Rigur was named after his late elder brother. Rigur, after making Gobuta the garrison squad leader, has been supporting his father Rigurdo.', '/uploads/images/c_129349.jpg'),
(144, 'Gobta', 'ゴブタ', '配角', 'Asuna Tomari', 'Gobta is a hobgoblin and is one of Rimuru Tempest''s followers. Though he seems to be air-headed he tends to be a hard-worker and dependable when the time calls for it.', '/uploads/images/c_129350.jpg'),
(144, 'Myrd', 'ミルド', '配角', 'Masashi Nogawa', 'Myrd is younger brother of Garm and Dord. Though he was a dwarf of few words, he was an expert at what he does. Having knowledge in construction, and well-versed in the arts, he is a one of a kind genius. Myrd was appointed as the captain of the construction team.', '/uploads/images/c_129914.jpg'),
(144, 'Kaijin', 'カイジン', '配角', 'Atsushi Ono', 'Kaijin was a blacksmith of the Dwarven Kingdom, and the brother of Kaidou. After he was exiled from his own country, he became Rimuru Tempest''s subordinate, and helped build the Monster City "Tempest", he acted as a builder, blacksmith, and craftsmen. He also was the former commander of the Dwargon Engineering Corps.', '/uploads/images/c_129915.jpg'),
(144, 'Gido', 'ギド', '配角', 'Ryuuichi Kijima', 'Gido is a member of Cabal''s Party who serves as the ''thief'' role. ~!However, he is actually serving as one of the bodyguards of Lady Elyune secretly while under the guise of an adventurer.!~ (Source: Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_129916.jpg'),
(144, 'Dord', 'ドルド', '配角', 'Ryou Sugisaki', 'Dord, the middle brother of Garm and Mild. He is known for his first-­rate craftsmanship. Dord focuses more on dyes and high class attire.', '/uploads/images/c_129917.jpg'),
(144, 'Kaval', 'カバル', '配角', 'Kengo Takanashi', 'Kaval is the leader of his adventure''s party, where he serves as the ''fighter'' role. ~!Alongside Gido, he is also tasked as the secret bodyguard of Lady Elyune under the guise of an adventurer.!~ (Source: Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_129918.jpg'),
(144, 'Ellen', 'エレン', '配角', 'Akane Kumada', 'Eren is an adventurer and a member of Kaval''s Party. ~!She is actually the daughter of the Duke of Sorcerer''s Dynasty Sarion Elalude, who ran off to be an adventurer due to her selfishness and free-spirited personality.!~ (Source: Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_129919.jpg'),
(144, 'Garm', 'ガルム', '配角', 'Kouichi Souma', 'Garm, the elder brother of Doldo and Mild. He is a skilled blacksmith. Garm is in charge of everyday clothing and underwear. (Source: Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_129923.jpg'),
(144, 'Diablo', 'ディアブロ', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', 'Diablo is the Black Primordial and a loyal servant of [Rimuru Tempest](https://anilist.co/character/123962/Tempest-Rimuru). Before he met Rimuru, he went by the nicknames Black or Noir, the latter which he received from his fellow Primordial kin. After receiving the name Diablo from Rimuru, he evolved to a Demon Peer.', '/uploads/images/c_131033.jpg'),
(144, 'Ramiris', 'ラミリス', '配角', 'Anzu Haruno', 'Ramiris is a fairy that resides inside of Tempest''s Underground Labyrinth. She is also one of the Eight-Star Demon Lords.', '/uploads/images/c_131034.jpg'),
(144, 'Frey', 'フレイ', '配角', '', '"Sky Queen" Frey is an ex-Demon Lord and currently a subordinate of [Demon Lord Milim Nava](https://anilist.co/character/128036/Nava-Milim). She often scolds Milim for playing around when she is supposed to be working.', '/uploads/images/c_131038.jpg'),
(144, 'Gabiru', 'ガビル', '配角', 'Jun Fukushima', 'The captain of the Hiryuu of Tempest, and the former lizardmen raid leader. He suffers from a superiority complex. The root of Gabil''s pride and confidence​ is the thought that he is the chosen one.', '/uploads/images/c_131041.jpg'),
(144, 'Hakurou', 'ハクロウ', '配角', 'Houchuu Ootsuka', 'Hakurou is a Fair Oni and is a loyal follower of Rimuru Tempest. He was one of the survivors of the Orc attack. He was also the teacher of the Dwarven King.', '/uploads/images/c_131043.png'),
(144, 'Karion', 'カリオン', '配角', 'Yasuaki Takumi', '~!Karion is one of the ten demon lords that existed before Rimuru became a demon lord. During the Walpurgis Banquet where Rimuru killed Clayman. Karion became a subordinate of Milim.!~', '/uploads/images/c_131044.png'),
(144, 'Leon Cromwell', 'レオン・クロムウェル', '配角', 'Jun Fukuyama', 'Leon Cromwell is a former hero and a current Demon Lord of the Eight-pointed Star Octagram. He is the ruler of El Dorado, an island nation located south-west of the world.', '/uploads/images/c_131047.png'),
(144, 'Kurobee', 'クロベエ', '配角', 'Junichi Yanagita', 'Kurobee is a Fair Oni and a loyal follower of Rimuru Tempest. Kurobee was originally one of the Oni that survived the Orc attack. He evolved after being named by Rimuru.', '/uploads/images/c_131051.jpg'),
(144, 'Clayman', 'クレイマン', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', 'Demon Lord Clayman, is one of the ten demon lords that ~!existed before Rimuru became a demon lord. He turned into Kazaream''s underling when Kazaream turned him into a demon lord.!~', '/uploads/images/c_131052.png'),
(144, 'Vesta', 'ベスター', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', 'Bester (ベスター Besutā) is a former minister of Dwargon and is currently the lead researcher of Tempest. ~!After joining Tempest he has become more reliable. He got rid of that sharp personality and mellowed out.!~', '/uploads/images/c_132364.jpg'),
(144, 'Gazel Dwargo', 'ガゼル・ドワルゴ', '配角', 'Takaya Hashi', 'Species: Dwarf Blessing / Divine Protection: Divine Protector of Ancestor Title: King of Armament Nation Dwargon. The king of Dwargon, Gazel Dwargo, the third generation king of Dwargon, but possesses a similar aura to that of his grandfather in his younger days. He is renowned as a great hero and celebrated as a wise king for his impartial rule.', '/uploads/images/c_132727.jpg'),
(144, 'Treyni', 'トレイニー', '配角', 'Rie Tanaka', 'Treyni is a dryad that resides in the Jura Forest.', '/uploads/images/c_132729.jpg'),
(144, 'Souka', 'ソーカ', '配角', 'Rumi Ookubo', 'Gabil''s younger sister, and the daughter of Abil. After the Orc Lord incident, she swears her allegeiance to Rimuru. She attends to Souei as a spy.', '/uploads/images/c_132730.png'),
(144, 'Abil', 'アビル', '配角', 'Tomoyuki Shimura', 'Relatives: Gabil (Son) Souka (Daughter) Occupations: Lizardmen Chief He has a bold personality, but with enough humility. He is a serious person, but he also has many good qualities about him and is a good leader.', '/uploads/images/c_132731.png'),
(144, 'Alice Rondo', 'アリス・ロンド', '配角', 'Haruka Shiraishi', 'One of the children who were incompletely summoned. At 9 years old, Alice is the youngest of the group, and she''s also a bit of a tomboy.', '/uploads/images/c_132746.png'),
(144, 'Garde-Myourmiles', 'ガルド・ミョルマイル', '配角', 'Yutaka Aoyama', 'An influential merchant from the kingdom of Burumund. Myorumairu is both the chairman of the Burumund shopping district and also a loan shark.', '/uploads/images/c_132749.jpg'),
(144, 'Kenya Misaki', '三崎剣也', '配角', 'Ayaka Asai', 'A member of a group of children who were incompletely summoned. He is the leader of the pack and has a lively disposition.', '/uploads/images/c_132751.png'),
(144, 'Ryouta Sekiguchi', '関口良太', '配角', 'Shizuka Ishigami', 'One of the children who were incompletely summoned. Ryota has a shy personality, but he generally gets along well with Kenya.', '/uploads/images/c_132753.jpg'),
(144, 'Yuuki Kagurazaka', '神楽坂優樹', '配角', 'Natsuki Hanae', 'A former student of Shizu who originally came from Japan and ~!one of the main antagonists of the series. !~ Yuuki serves as the Guild Master of the Adventurers'' Guild in the kingdom of Ingracia, and he loves manga. ~!Although Yuuki first comes as a friendly person he is actually a master in manipulating others without hesitation to achieve his goal of a just world that treats everyone fairly. Even though Rimuru and Yuuki get along at first he later addresses Rimuru as a very serious threat to his plans. !~', '/uploads/images/c_132755.jpg'),
(144, 'Gale Gibson', 'ゲイル・ギブスン', '配角', 'Gen Satou', 'One of the children who were incompletely summoned. At 11 years old, he is the eldest of the group.', '/uploads/images/c_132757.png'),
(144, 'Chloe Aubert', 'クロエ・オベール', '配角', 'Azusa Tadokoro', 'One of the children who were incompletely summoned. Chloe is a quiet child who loves books.', '/uploads/images/c_132760.jpg'),
(144, 'Gelmud', 'ゲルミュッド', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', 'A majin that served Demon Lord Clayman of the Ten Great Demon Lords. He wanted to make Orc Lord the new Demon Lord and manipulate him but instead was devoured by it.', '/uploads/images/c_133521.jpg'),
(144, 'Geld', 'ゲルド', '配角', 'Tarou Yamaguchi', 'He is one of the fourth group of subordinates to be named by Rimuru Tempest. As the right-hand man of the deceased Orc Lord, he was given the same name as him, as a memento and token of appreciation, similar to how Rigur was named after his older brother. As an Orc King, he is the leader of the Yellow Corps, that acts as both the last line of defense for Tempest as well as the main team of the country''s Department of Construction and Manufacturing. Later on, he was given the Title of a "Lord" as one of Rimuru''s Twelve Patrons.', '/uploads/images/c_133522.jpg'),
(144, 'Tear', 'ティア', '配角', 'Kaede Hondo', 'Member of the Moderate Jesters alongside Laplace and Footman, and as that loyal subordinate of Demon Lord Kazaream.', '/uploads/images/c_134576.jpg'),
(144, 'Miho Sawatari', '沢渡美穂', '配角', 'Yuka Nukui', 'She is Tamura''s fiancee.', '/uploads/images/c_134578.jpg'),
(144, 'Kaidou', '海道', '配角', 'Shouto Kashii', 'He is the captain of the guards of Dwargon, and Kaijin''s younger brother.', '/uploads/images/c_134579.jpg'),
(144, 'Fuze', 'フューズ', '配角', 'Ken Narita', 'He is the Brumund Kingdom''s Freedom Association, Guild Master.', '/uploads/images/c_134580.jpg'),
(144, 'Velyard', 'ベルヤード', '配角', 'Itaru Yamamoto', 'Baron Velyard is one of Blumund’s ministers. He is a landless baron.', '/uploads/images/c_134581.jpg'),
(144, 'Youm Farmenas', 'ヨウム・ファルメナス', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', 'The Hero-King Farmenas of the Farmenas Kingdom. Formerly the Farmas Kingdom, Count Nidole Maigam’s Territory''s, Frontier Garrison Captain Youm.', '/uploads/images/c_134582.png'),
(144, 'Ifrit', 'イフリット', '配角', 'Taku Yashiro', 'Ifrit is a high-ranking spirit; the ruler of flame which was sealed within Shizue Izawa by Demon Lord Leon Cromwell. He used to live in Dwelling of the Spirit before he was stolen by the "Blonde Demon" Leon Cromwell. After that, he was sealed within Shizue Izawa. As a result of this, it gave Shizue an extended lifespan.', '/uploads/images/c_134583.png'),
(144, 'Laplace', 'ラプラス', '配角', 'Kazuya Nakai', 'He is the vice-president of the Moderate Jesters and as that a loyal subordinate of Demon Lord Kazaream.', '/uploads/images/c_134593.jpg'),
(144, 'Phobio', 'フォビオ', '配角', 'Seiichirou Yamashita', '__Species:__ Leopard Lycanthrope He is one of the "Beastketeers" of the Demon Lord Karion. He is proclaimed to be the strongest warrior of the 3 "Beastketeers".', '/uploads/images/c_134594.jpg'),
(144, 'Hikari no Seirei', '光の精霊', '配角', 'Tomo Muranaka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_197874.png'),
(144, 'Footman', 'フットマン', '配角', 'Shinji Kawada', 'Footman is a Majin who is part of the Moderate Harlequin Alliance', '/uploads/images/c_198040.jpg'),
(144, 'Gobzo', 'ゴンゾ', '配角', '', 'A Goblin in Tempest thats friends with Gobuta', '/uploads/images/c_213898.jpg'),
(144, 'Ririna', 'リリナ', '配角', '', 'Ririna is one of the 400 Goblins that migrated to Rimuru''s Goblin Village while he was away in Dwargon. After being named by Rimuru, she evolved to a Goblina. She is entrusted by him to manage Tempest''s production affair as its supervisor.', '/uploads/images/c_219458.jpg'),
(144, 'Touka', 'トーカ', '配角', '', 'Souka''s subordinate. She forms part of the Shadow Squad, where she mostly gathers information. She used to live in the Lizardmen marshes but moved to Tempest by Abiru''s order.', '/uploads/images/c_225187.jpg'),
(144, 'Hokusou', '北槍', '配角', '', 'Souka''s subordinate. He forms part of the Shadow Squad, where he mostly gathers information. He used to live in the Lizardmen marshes but moved to Tempest by Abiru''s order.', '/uploads/images/c_225188.png'),
(144, 'Nansou', '南槍', '配角', '', 'Souka''s subordinate. He forms part of the Shadow Squad, where he mostly gathers information. He used to live in the Lizardmen marshes but moved to Tempest by Abiru''s order.', '/uploads/images/c_225191.jpg'),
(144, 'Saika', '西華', '配角', '', 'Souka''s subordinate. She forms part of the Shadow Squad, where she mostly gathers information. She used to live in the Lizardmen marshes but moved to Tempest by Abiru''s order.', '/uploads/images/c_225196.jpg'),
(144, 'Orthos', 'オルトス', '配角', 'Kazuyuki Okitsu', 'Orthos was the true king of the Kingdom of Filtwood. He was a Demon who was thought to be sealed away by a champion named Orthos, but that story was either entirely fabricated, or the demon managed to kill, and later impersonate the champion.', '/uploads/images/c_255591.png'),
(144, 'Kokuou', '国王', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Kikuchi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_255592.jpg'),
(144, 'Yashichi', 'ヤシチ', '配角', 'Akinori Egoshi', '__Race:__ Dragonewt One of [Gabiru](https://anilist.co/character/131041)''s subordinates and friends. Yashichi fervently supports Gabiru through victory and defeat.', '/uploads/images/c_297837.png'),
(144, 'Kakushin', 'カクシン', '配角', 'Hiromichi Tezuka', '__Race:__ Dragonewt One of [Gabiru](https://anilist.co/character/131041)''s subordinates and friends. Yashichi fervently supports Gabiru through victory and defeat.', '/uploads/images/c_297840.png'),
(144, 'Sukerou', 'スケロウ', '配角', 'Yoshihito Sasaki', '__Race:__ Dragonewt One of [Gabiru](https://anilist.co/character/131041)''s subordinates and friends. Yashichi fervently supports Gabiru through victory and defeat.', '/uploads/images/c_297844.png'),
(144, 'Trya', 'トライア', '配角', 'Kana Asumi', 'Trya is a Dryad that resides in the Jura Forest. She is the sister of Treyni.', '/uploads/images/c_301064.png'),
(144, 'Charybdis', 'カリュブディス', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_302552.jpg'),
(144, 'Goblin A', 'ゴブリンA', '配角', 'Makoto Kaneko', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_317487.jpg'),
(144, 'Goblin B', 'ゴブリンB', '配角', 'Chiaki Kobayashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_317488.jpg'),
(145, 'Emilia', 'エミリア', '主角', 'Rie Takahashi', '**Height:** 164 cm (5''5") She is a silver-haired half-elf girl who is one of the candidates to become the next ruler in the royal election. [Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru) first meets her when her insignia is stolen by [Felt](https://anilist.co/character/88574/Felt) as she needs to possess it to be eligible to participate in the election. She introduces herself as Satella when she and Subaru met during the first timeline before introducing herself by her real name when she got her insignia back. Emilia is good natured and likes to take care of others, though she herself refuses to admit it, instead thinking of it as her own selfishness. She is indifferent to her own appearance, leaving [Puck](https://anilist.co/character/90187/Puck) to take care of her clothes and hair. Because her appearance is similar to the [Witch of Envy](https://anilist.co/character/127242/Satella), she has received unfair discrimination from others. She sometimes acts like a child and is unacquainted with the world as she used to live in the woods with other Elves, though despite this she still works hard to become a ruler.', '/uploads/images/c_88572.jpg'),
(145, 'Subaru Natsuki', 'ナツキ・スバル', '主角', 'Yuusuke Kobayashi', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") On the way home from the convenience store, he suddenly finds himself transported into another world. He has the ability that he calls "Return by Death" to go back in time when he dies. Despite being a hikikomori and gamer in his real world, Subaru does a bit of workout and seems to know basic hand-to-hand combat, making him not completely weak. While Subaru tends to not read the situation, he is loyal to those he holds dear, willing to help them, even if that means taking the thorny path. He has his resolve confirmed through the many situations and circumstances he faces in the fantasy world, originally having been one to always take the "easy" route. As a hikikomori, he is hopeful of the possibilities that being sucked into a new realm brings, but later realizes the realities of the predicament he is in. Ultimately, he resolves himself to be faithful and protective of the ones that he cares most about.', '/uploads/images/c_88573.png'),
(145, 'Felt', 'フェルト', '配角', 'Chinatsu Akasaki', '**Height:** 150 cm (4''11") A thief that lives in the slums. Felt stole [Emilia''s](https://anilist.co/character/88572/Emilia) insignia, hoping for quick, easy cash. Though Felt can usually handle her own, she does consider [Rom](https://anilist.co/character/124117/Rom) to be like family. ~!After being chosen by the insignia, she is forced to participate in the Royal Selection and is currently a candidate to become the 42nd King of Lugunica.!~', '/uploads/images/c_88574.jpg'),
(145, 'Rem', 'レム', '配角', 'Inori Minase', '__Height:__ 154 cm (5''1") Rem is one of the twin maids working for [Roswaal L Mathers](https://anilist.co/character/90182/Mathers-L-Roswaal). She has medium length sky blue hair that covers her right eye, large light blue eyes, and young features. She also has hair clips towards left side of her hair, flower-shaped ribbon on the same side of her hair, and a maid hairband. She looks nearly identical to her sister [Ram](https://anilist.co/character/88576) apart from her hair, eyes, and ribbon coloring. She usually wears a maid uniform, and since her chest is slightly larger than her sister''s, she secretly changes the measurements to hide it. Rem tends to speak in a superficially polite manner and sometimes acts without thinking. She holds both respect to the point of worship and guilt toward her sister for an incident in the past. Because of her respect and guilt toward her sister, she used to think of herself as inferior.', '/uploads/images/c_88575.png'),
(145, 'Ram', 'ラム', '配角', 'Rie Murakawa', '__Height:__ 154 cm (5’1”) Ram is one of the twin maids working for [Roswaal L Mathers](https://anilist.co/character/90182). She has medium length light pink hair that covers her left eye, large darkish pink eyes, and young features. She also has hair clips towards right side of her hair, flower-shaped ribbon on the same side of her hair, and a maid hairband. She looks nearly identical to her sister [Rem](https://anilist.co/character/88575/Rem) apart from her hair, eyes, and ribbon coloring. Ram is seemingly self-centered and does things at her own pace, however in actuality she maintains a distance from people to ascertain them. She believes that Roswaal is the greatest and no one else is as precious except for her sister Rem. She is slightly more outgoing in comparison to the generally taciturn Rem, who generally allows Ram to take the lead in their sisterly bond.', '/uploads/images/c_88576.png'),
(145, 'Reinhard van Astrea', 'ラインハルト・ヴァン・アストレア', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Height__: 184 cm (6''0") Reinhard van Astrea is the current Sword Saint and a member of the Royal Guard, currently acting as [Felt](https://anilist.co/character/88574/Felt)''s knight. As the Sword Saint and the Knight of the Royal Guard, Reinhard embodies chivalry and elegance, treating everyone with exceptional respect. He is fair, brave, and always acts in the name of justice, whether on duty or simply strolling through the Royal Capital. As a knight, Reinhard only uses his sword when necessary, since, in addition to being a rule, his iron-clad rule is to not inflict pain to others if not absolutely necessary, be it a normal thug or a member of the Witch Cult.', '/uploads/images/c_88577.png'),
(145, 'Anastasia Hoshin', 'アナスタシア・ホーシン', '配角', 'Kana Ueda', 'Anastasia Hoshin is the head of the Hoshin Trading Company and a candidate to become the 42nd King of Lugnica. Her knight is Julius Juukulius. Despite her surname being "Hoshin", she''s not directly related to Hoshin of the Wilderness. She chose the name because she was inspired by his legacy.', '/uploads/images/c_90177.png'),
(145, 'Wilhelm van Astrea', 'ヴィルヘルム・ヴァン・アストレア', '配角', 'Kenyuu Horiuchi', '__Height:__ 178 cm (5''10") Wilhelm van Astrea né Trias, is a member of the Crusch Camp and was [Theresia van Astrea](https://anilist.co/character/124116/van-Astrea-Theresia)''s husband. Wilhelm is a refined man with a highly gentle and humble demeanor. However unearth that even temperament belied a fierce warrior who often is the first to help when something happens. However this wasn''t always the case as in youth, Wilhelm was very opposite of who he was in his later years. Brash, afoot, short tempered, lonely and often cold with others. He was a troubled individual who devoted himself wholly to the sword and cared for little else. Even so, he knew how to analyze a situation, always finding a way out. Nonetheless, Theresia greatly influenced his personality, becoming increasingly sociable and protective, achieving more results during the Demi-human War. It was through her most of all that he would become the person he is today.', '/uploads/images/c_90179.jpg'),
(145, 'Elsa Granhiert', 'エルザ・グランヒルテ', '配角', 'Mamiko Noto', 'An assassin-for-hire from the Northernmost nation, the Holy Kingdom of Gusteko, known as "The Bowel Hunter". Elsa wishes to make a trade for an insignia, as her client''s wishes. ~!Elsa Granhiert was an assassin working together with [Meili](https://anilist.co/character/175577) for an individual they refer to as "Mother" until her death.!~', '/uploads/images/c_90180.png'),
(145, 'Beatrice', 'ベアトリス', '配角', 'Satomi Arai', '__Height:__ 140 cm (4''7") __Age:__ ~!400+ (Actual)!~ The caretaker of the library in [Roswaal](https://anilist.co/character/90182)''s mansion. She has a distinct way of speaking, adding "I suppose" (かしら, kashira) and "in fact" (のよ, no yo) at the end of some of her sentences. ~!Around 400 years ago, Beatrice was created by [Echidna](https://anilist.co/character/129330). She helped her with her experiments, such as the Sanctuary Barrier, though she wasn''t told everything as she didn''t know that [Ryuuzu Meyer](https://anilist.co/character/174072) would be sealed in a crystal. Sometime later, Echidna ordered her to stand guard over the library while she waited for "that person," an order which she diligently followed.!~ ~!After numerous and painful attempts to convince her to leave the library [Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573) succeeded, and Beatrice became his contract spirit.!~', '/uploads/images/c_90181.png'),
(145, 'Roswaal Mathers', 'ロズワール・Ｌ・メイザース', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', '~!__Mental age:__ 400+!~ The lord of the Roswaal Mansion and a descendant of the original Roswaal. He comes across as an eccentric due to his flamboyant appearance and odd speaking style, the latter which he shares with his grandmother. However, he harbors a more calculating and reserved side with a sharp political mind and gaze that reads others quite well. ~!It is later revealed that he is in fact the original Roswaal, Roswaal A. Mathers, who has been possessing his descendants'' bodies to meet his teacher Echidna again at any cost, even if that means sacrificing himself or those close to him.!~', '/uploads/images/c_90182.png'),
(145, 'Julius Euclius', 'ユリウス・ユークリウス', '配角', 'Takuya Eguchi', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5''10") Julius Euclius is [Anastasia Hoshin''s](https://anilist.co/character/90177/Hoshin-Anastasi) knight and a member of the Royal Guard. Julius lived with his family at the Euclius House. After his father, Klein Euclius died, he started to live with his uncle Alviero and he started to take care of Julius and became his adoptive father. As a member of Lugnica''s nobility, Julius acts in a proper fashion, always having an air of nobility and conviction. He is also considerate and doesn''t forget to show care toward others. He also shows a strict side, giving out accurate assessments of others whether they''re good or bad, which is a result of his upbringing as an elite, and in actuality, he believes that he and others can do better than they currently are. Julius doesn''t like those who forget their place, leading him to have bad relations with [Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru) for a while. While both have apologized to each other after the battle with the Hakugei, Subaru told him he still hated him. Julius said he didn''t intend to be friends. They both became very intimate very quickly during the planning and attacking the Witch Cult. In the end, Julius directly considered Subaru as his friend.', '/uploads/images/c_90183.png'),
(145, 'Felix Argyle', 'フェリックス・アーガイル', '配角', 'Yui Horie', 'Felix Argyle commonly known as Ferris, is [Crusch Karsten](https://anilist.co/character/90185)''s knight. He is a beast human (demi-human).', '/uploads/images/c_90184.png'),
(145, 'Crusch Karsten', 'クルシュ・カルステン', '配角', 'Yuka Iguchi', 'Crusch Karsten is the Matriarch of House Karsten and a candidate to become the 42nd King of Lugnica. While normally calm and serious, Crusch is honest, sincere, right, being a type of person who is destined to stand above others, though she has talent and has worked hard to reach where she is now. She is already the head of her family, finishing her work better than her father. She prefers to act herself and has the pride of a warrior. Crusch is also gentle, often believing the false knowledge jokingly told to her by [Ferris](https://anilist.co/character/90184), and sometimes displays an airheaded side. Like her mother Helena Karsten, she is shown to be ruthless and reckless.', '/uploads/images/c_90185.jpg'),
(145, 'Puck', 'パック', '配角', 'Yumi Uchiyama', '__Height:__ 7 cm Puck is an Artificial Spirit that [Emilia](https://anilist.co/character/88572/Emilia) was formerly contracted with. He is the current Great Spirit of Fire. ~!He is currently known as the Beast of The End.!~ ~!Around 400 years ago, Puck was created by Echidna, though he had apparently left her by the time she moved into the Sanctuary. Seven years before the start of the election, Puck unfroze Emilia and began to act as her friend and mentor, and later on started to live at Roswaal''s mansion where he was reunited with Beatrice.!~ Puck can be described as cute or adorable, thus his skin being pink around his cheeks. His fur is mostly grey with silver in certain spots (i.e. tip of the tail). His eyebrows are pretty small and rhombus-shaped. He also has a gold earring on his left ear. Sometimes, he carries a purple bag. Puck is generally a nice spirit. He is very happy and stays at Emilia''s side to protect her, affectionately calling her "Lia". He occasionally goofs around and gets along especially well with [Beatrice](https://anilist.co/character/90181/Beatrice). ~!However, Puck''s demeanor greatly changes in loops where Emilia dies, showing a complete disregard for anyone except her, and was even willing to destroy the world because of the condition in their contract.!~', '/uploads/images/c_90187.jpg'),
(145, 'Otto Suwen', 'オットー・スーウェン', '主角', 'Kouhei Amasaki', 'Otto Suwen is a merchant appearing in Re:Zero. His remarkable misfortune always takes him to dangerous situations, from which he escapes thanks to his wit. Otto has gray hair that is mentioned to be as long as a gal game protagonist. He is said to be somewhat handsome if he has a serious expression. However, he is usually either retorting, shouting, or panicking, ruining his looks. He has a medium build, but has trained himself since he used to work as a merchant.', '/uploads/images/c_124110.jpg'),
(145, 'Satella', 'サテラ', '配角', 'Rie Takahashi', 'Satella is one of the Witches of Sin, being the Witch of Envy. ~! Contrary to popular belief, Satella and the Witch of Envy are separate personalities. Both of them love Subaru, though the Witch of Envy is aggressive about it.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127242.png'),
(145, 'Echidna', 'エキドナ', '主角', 'Maaya Sakamoto', 'Echidna is one of the Witches of Sin, being the Witch of Greed. She has a strong thirst for knowledge along with a curiosity for the unknown, which defines her behavior. Echidna is described as black hearted, being unable to empathize with others and their feelings due to a lack of understanding. She will do anything to gain knowledge, be it deceit or employed sophistry.', '/uploads/images/c_129330.png'),
(145, 'Garfiel Tinsel', 'ガーフィール・ティンゼル', '主角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', 'Garfiel Tinsel is the former guardian of the Sanctuary and a member of the Emilia Camp. Introduced during Arc 4, he became one of the main supporting characters of the season. He''s a half-beast human and [Frederica Baumann''s](https://anilist.co/character/143378/Baumann-Frederica) half-brother. He can transform himself in a giant golden tiger that can deal powerful attacks but with a cost of losing his reason, so he uses this ability when he''s pushed to the limit. ~!Garfiel and Frederica lived together until she left when he was around 4 years old and he hadn''t seen her since until their reunion 10 years later during the Sanctuary incident. After seeing his mother''s "death" during the trial at a young age, he began to fear the outside world, causing him to try and protect the Sanctuary.!~', '/uploads/images/c_133847.png'),
(145, 'Minerva', 'ミネルヴァ', '配角', 'Mikako Komatsu', 'Minerva is one of the Witches of Sin, being the Witch of Wrath. Minerva dislikes conflict and wishes for all to be well. She also only cares about what''s directly in front of her, not worrying about things she cannot see. Minerva has some history with the elves as she cares deeply for Emilia, along with the other elves. ~!Minerva''s main ability is "Authority of Wrath". Unlike other authorities this ability is only a support skill. Minerva is able to heal others by attacking any part of their body with her own. The authority also gives her increased speed and strength. The drawback is that every time the authority is used it causes a calamity to happen in another part of the world. The calamity can range from many things such as an earthquake.!~', '/uploads/images/c_137521.png'),
(145, 'Carmilla', 'カーミラ', '配角', 'Manaka Iwami', 'Carmilla is one of the Witches of Sin, being the Witch of Lust. She has no self confidence, being timid, and tends to have downcast eyes. Despite this, others find her similar to a scared animal, making them attracted to her. ~!Carmilla''s main ability is "Authority of Lust". With this Ability, Carmilla is able to captivate people, making them absorbed in her atmosphere to the point they wouldn''t be able to know if someone were to hurt them. She can also make Individuals believe they are seeing and hearing what they want to see and hear, an example is when Subaru saw Rem and heard her when facing Carmilla.!~', '/uploads/images/c_137523.png'),
(145, 'Typhon', 'テュフォン', '配角', 'Misaki Kuno', 'Typhon is one of the Witches of Sin, being the Witch of Pride. She is said to judge people with the innocence and ruthlessness of a young girl. ~!Typhon''s main ability is "Authority of Pride". With this authority, Typhon is able to tear apart an individuals body if she decides they are guilty of something. The authority is extremely subjective. If the individual feels guilty, Typhon can punish the individual, even if the act may not be something they should be punished for. The ability has one draw back of not being able to work if the individual has little to no thinking capacity.!~', '/uploads/images/c_137524.jpg'),
(145, 'Sekhmet', 'セクメト', '配角', 'Mai Nakahara', 'Sekhmet is one of the Witches of Sin, being the Witch of Sloth. As her position suggests, she can be summed up to being extremely lazy, enough that she finds breathing to be a pain. ~! Sekhmet''s main ability is "Authority of Sloth". With this Ability, Sekhmet is able to use a more advanced and improved version of the unseen hand used by Petelgeuse. Unlike Petelgeuse her unseen hand is able to hit individuals and objects with an invisible force without her moving and she can use this power in any direction she chooses. She is cited from Echidna to be the strongest of the witches of sin besides Satella !~', '/uploads/images/c_137526.jpg'),
(145, 'Daphne', 'ダフネ', '配角', 'Nao Touyama', 'Daphne is one of the Witches of Sin, being the Witch of Gluttony. All she wants is to be full, it''s her reason for living. Daphne enjoys giving people nicknames, such as Subarun for Subaru. ~! Daphne''s main ability is "Authority of Gluttony". With this authority, Daphne is able to cause a individual to have and feel extreme levels of hunger by just touching them or looking at them. When Subaru encountered Daphne it only look one look from her left eye for him to start eating his arm and ignores everything that was going on around him. Echidna states that a look from Daphne''s left eye isn''t all impressive and the true terror of Daphne comes when she uses her right eye or eats her target. !~', '/uploads/images/c_137527.jpg'),
(145, 'Petra Leyte', 'ペトラ・レイテ', '配角', 'Marika Kouno', 'Petra is a bright and kind girl from Irlam Village. She likes [Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru) very much after he saved her from the Wolgarm incident. ~!She became a maid at the Roswaal Mansion after Subaru came back from the witchcult incident. !~', '/uploads/images/c_141858.jpg'),
(145, 'Frederica Baumann', 'フレデリカ・バウマン', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', 'Frederica Baumann is a maid working for [Roswaal L. Mathers](https://anilist.co/character/90182/Mathers-Roswaal) and a member of the Emilia Camp. She quit her job as a maid a few months before [Subaru''s](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru) appearance, but returned after [Ram](https://anilist.co/character/88576/Ram) couldn''t manage the mansion ~!after [Rem](https://anilist.co/character/88575/Rem) had her name and memories eaten. !~ ~!She is the half-sister of [Garfiel Tinsel](https://anilist.co/character/133847/Tinsel-Garfiel).!~', '/uploads/images/c_143378.png'),
(145, 'Ryuuzu Meyer', 'リューズ・メイエル', '配角', 'Aimi Tanaka', 'Ryuuzu was a half-elf who lived in the Sanctuary during the era of the witches, 400 years ago. She was used by [Echidna](https://anilist.co/character/129330/Echidna) in order to activate the Sanctuary''s barrier. During Echidna''s immortality experiments, she created copies of Ryuzu and tasked them with protecting the Sanctuary.', '/uploads/images/c_174072.png'),
(145, 'Rye Batenkaitos', 'ライ・バテンカイトス', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', 'Rye Batenkaitos is a Sin Archbishop of the Witch Cult, representing the gourmet aspect of gluttony.', '/uploads/images/c_174097.png'),
(145, 'Regulus Corneas', 'レグルス・コルニアス', '配角', 'Akira Ishida', 'Regulus is a young man of a medium height. He has gold eyes, white hair and a middle to skinny build. Regulus Is a part of the Sin Archbishops of the Witch Cult and represents greed. Regulus is known for being very talkative and calls himself unselfish, while in fact he is very prideful and likes to act above others and reference himself as above others.', '/uploads/images/c_174098.jpg'),
(145, 'Meili Portroute', 'メィリィ・ポートルート', '配角', 'Eri Suzuki', 'One of the children that lives in the village within [Roswaal](https://anilist.co/character/90182)''s region. She''s timid, though is friendly, such as when she introduces a small dog to [Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573). ~!Meili Portroute is a Demon Beast User.!~', '/uploads/images/c_175577.jpg'),
(145, 'Patrasche', 'パトラッシュ', '配角', 'Kouichi Souma', '[Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru)''s Earth Dragon that he officially received from [Crusch Karsten](https://anilist.co/character/90185/Karsten-Crusch) for his efforts in the Hakugei battle. Despite being of a species known for being feisty, Patrasche is extremely loyal to Subaru, as she is willing to put her life on the line for him.', '/uploads/images/c_181313.jpg'),
(145, 'Naoko Natsuki', '菜月菜穂子', '配角', 'Ryouka Yuzuki', '[Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru)''s mother.', '/uploads/images/c_182087.jpg'),
(145, 'Kenichi Natsuki', '菜月賢一', '配角', 'Kousuke Toriumi', 'Subaru''s father. Subaru idolized his father and wanted to be like him. However, after this proved to be impossible, he went through a downward spiral that ultimately resulted in him becoming a shut-in. Kenichi is hard-working, diligent, and loved by all, which led to a huge amount of expectations being put on Subaru by his surroundings as he is "Kenichi''s Son", which furthermore increased the burden on him. He was shown to be a very supportive dad which, although always trying to get his son to go out of the house or go back to school, never forgets to put his son''s emotional state before it all through physical bonding and father-to-son talks.', '/uploads/images/c_182088.png'),
(145, 'Rigel Natsuki', 'ナツキ・リゲル', '配角', '', 'Natsuki Rigel is the non canon son of Natsuki Subaru and Rem.', '/uploads/images/c_205863.jpg'),
(146, 'Norman', 'ノーマン', '配角', 'Maaya Uchida', '__Height:__ 145 cm __Farm Identifier:__ 22194 Norman seems to be logical, well-meaning, and devoted, with a slightly naive side. He can easily plan his actions in advance and he anticipates on other''s actions. He is one of the top 3 ranking orphans, along with [Emma](https://anilist.co/character/121725/Emma) and [Ray](https://anilist.co/character/121724/Ray). Norman loves Emma and he is helpful and loyal towards her.', '/uploads/images/c_121700.jpg'),
(146, 'Isabella', 'イザベラ', '配角', 'Yuuko Kaida', '__Height:__ 170 cm __Farm Identifier:__ 73584 Isabella worked as a Mama at Grace Field House, taking care of the orphans that reside within.', '/uploads/images/c_121701.png'),
(146, 'Ray', 'レイ', '主角', 'Mariya Ise', '__Height:__ 150 cm __Farm Identifier:__ 81194 As one of the three perfect students at the orphanage, Ray is very logical, smart, cunning, extremely patient and is usually shown to read books by himself. Although he is extremely book smart he says that he never liked to study. According to data obtained by sister [Krone](https://anilist.co/character/121702/Krone), his weakness is that he gives up easily.', '/uploads/images/c_121724.jpg'),
(146, 'Emma', 'エマ', '主角', 'Sumire Morohoshi', '__Height:__ 145 cm __Farm Identifier:__ 63194 Emma acts as an older sister to the other children and loves her family very intensely. She is sweet, heroic, caring, and has a big heart. She can also be naive and reckless, and doesn''t hesitate to put herself at risk to ensure the safety of the group. The other kids describe her as having monster reflexes and an astounding ability to learn, which enables her to think fast in difficult situations and makes her a very good strategist. She could be considered a beacon of hope for the rest of the children.', '/uploads/images/c_121725.png'),
(146, 'Don', 'ドン', '配角', 'Shinei Ueki', '__Age (2045):__ 10 yo __Farm Identifier:__ 16194 __D.O.B:__ 2035/7/4 __Height (2045-2049):__ 155 - 174 cm Don has dark skin and a tall and slender appearance. He has short, messy black hair with an undercut and brown eyes. He wears the standard white uniform. Like [Emma](https://anilist.co/character/121725/Emma), Don cares deeply about his siblings. Don is portrayed as a cheerful and slightly careless boy, however, he too is fairly intelligent, coming around 5th place in the everyday test, after [Gilda](https://anilist.co/character/126455/Gilda). He also has talents in pick pocketing. His physical ability is also fairly strong.', '/uploads/images/c_126454.jpg'),
(146, 'Gilda', 'ギルダ', '配角', 'Lynn', '__Farm Identifier:__ 65194 __Height (2045-2049):__ 138 - 155 cm Gilda has short olive drab hair kept in a Chinese bob hairstyle and wears circular-lensed glasses. Gilda is an intuitive young girl. She also has a caring personality. She seems to be an introvert, however she also has her moments of bravery. She can also be quite threatening.', '/uploads/images/c_126455.png'),
(146, 'Phil', 'フィル', '配角', 'Hiyori Kouno', '__Height:__ 100 cm __Farm Identifier:__ 34394 (Grace Field House) __D.O.B:__ 2041 Phil is very active and can always be seen running around. ~!He is also shown to be very mature and intelligent for his age, even suspecting something was wrong when [Emma](https://anilist.co/character/121725/Emma) and the other older orphans were trying to find out ways to escape.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126475.jpg'),
(146, 'James Ratri', 'ジェイムズ・ラートリー', '配角', 'Yasuyuki Kase', 'James Latley is the 35th descendant of the Latley Clan who sealed the promise between humans and demons 1000 years ago. After seeing the horrors that humans has been through, he decided to give them a chance to live. He put several codes inside his books so the kids could escape the plantations. ~!The elevator inside Golden Pond is not working anymore, so he said that others can be used, including the one in the Grace Field house. He was betrayed by a person, and so, the Village is not a safe place anymore. The last recording that Emma and Lucas found said that it was the 20th of March, 2031. He is presumed dead.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126494.jpg'),
(146, 'Peter Ratri', 'ピーターラートリー', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', 'Peter Ratri is the 36th and current head of the famous Ratri Clan and the younger brother of [James Ratri](https://anilist.co/character/126494/Ratri-James).', '/uploads/images/c_126495.jpg'),
(146, 'Mujika', 'ムジカ', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', 'Mujika (or Musica) is a demon descent traveling in the forest outside the Grace Field House.', '/uploads/images/c_126498.jpg'),
(146, 'Anna', 'アンナ', '配角', 'Ai Kayano', '__Age (2045):__ 9 yo __Farm Identifier:__ 48194 (Grace Field House) __D.O.B:__ 2036/4/25 __Height (2045-2049):__ 135 - 162 cm Just like every other orphans of Grace Field, she wears the standard Grace Field Orphanage uniform. Anna grows to be a surprisingly big boned, tall girl. She has blonde hair tied into twin braids. ~!Later, she cuts her hair in order to help with the escape.!~~!During her time at the B06-32 shelter, she spends a lot of time studying medicine in order to help her family.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126504.png'),
(146, 'Lannion', 'ラニオン', '配角', 'Yuuko Mori', '__Age (2045):__ 7 yo __Farm Identifier:__ 54294 (Grace Field House) __D.O.B:__ 2038/4/28 __Height (2045-2049):__ 125 - 144 cm Lani is a mischievous and resourceful boy, who enjoys pulling pranks with his best friend, [Thoma](https://anilist.co/character/129784/Thoma). He is a bit cowardly, but also blunt and straightforward.', '/uploads/images/c_129783.jpg'),
(146, 'Thoma', 'トーマ', '配角', 'Mari Hino', '__Height:__ 123 cm __Farm Identifier:__ 55294 (Grace Field House) Thoma is a resourceful and mischievous boy, who enjoys pulling pranks alongside his best friend [Lani](https://anilist.co/character/129783). He is blunt, but can also be quite cowardly.', '/uploads/images/c_129784.jpg'),
(146, 'Nat', 'ナット', '配角', 'Shizuka Ishigami', '__Age (2045):__ 9 yo __Farm Identifier:__ 48194 (Grace Field House) __D.O.B:__ 2036/12/18 __Height (2045-2049):__ 133 - 156 cm Nat is a rather frail boy, with brown eyes and a tall nose line (which he takes great pride in). He wears the standard orphanage uniform. Even though he can be easily intimidated, he does have his moments of bravery.', '/uploads/images/c_129805.png'),
(146, 'Sobo', '祖母', '配角', 'Mami Koyama', 'Grandmother is a high-ranking human and once worked as [Isabella''s](https://anilist.co/character/121701/Isabella) Mama although she treated her more as a pawn than a human. ~!On January 27, 2046, it was revealed that all of Isabella''s mistakes and responsibilities, as in letting the children escape, were placed on Grandma Sarah. Although Isabella wasn''t able to manage her products, Sarah wasn''t able to manage Isabella. As a result, Sarah was shipped out to be served at the upcoming Tifari in order to make up for the escapees. Isabella took the role of Grandmother after that.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136463.jpg'),
(146, 'Zazie', 'ザジー', '配角', 'Hidenori Takahashi', 'Zazie is a former Λ7214 experiment. He is the strongest among the humans. He gets mad when he doesn''t wear the paper bag. He loves his boss, Norman.', '/uploads/images/c_169006.jpg'),
(146, 'Cislo', 'シスロ', '配角', 'Yoshiki Nakajima', 'Cislo is a former Lambda 7214 (aka Λ7214) experiment. His hobby is weight training, despite his looks he is easily moved to tears and he loves boss(Norman) . He was shipped to Lambda at age 12/13 from Goodwill Ridge, along with his close friend Barbara. Goodwill is one of the four premium farms.', '/uploads/images/c_192864.jpg'),
(146, 'Vincent', 'ヴィンセント', '配角', 'Hidenori Takahashi', 'Vincent is a previous Lambda 7214 (aka Λ7214) experiment. He was born in Glory bell. He is known to have medical knowledge and is very fashionable. Also he can make snacks , cloths and weapons. He loves boss(aka Norman).', '/uploads/images/c_192865.jpg'),
(146, 'Barbara', 'バーバラ', '配角', 'Chika Anzai', 'Barbara is a former Lambda 7214 (aka Λ7214) experiment. She eats a lot, and as a result of the experiments that were done on her she has inherited superhuman strength. At age 12, she was shipped from Goodwill Ridge to Lambda along with her close friend [Cislo](https://anilist.co/character/192864/Cislo). Goodwill is one of the four premium farms. ~!She likes to eat demon meat because she is "pissed off" that humans are the only ones getting eaten. It seems to be safe to do, as she shows no symptoms of it affecting her.!~', '/uploads/images/c_192866.jpg'),
(146, 'Yvette', 'イベット', '配角', 'Nao Shiraki', '__Farm Identifier:__ 59294 __Height:__ 110 - 133 cm Yvette is a smart and observant girl who is very artistic. She carries a pencil and a block with her. ~!Once they escape, she helps to collect food and draws maps when asked.!~', '/uploads/images/c_199112.png'),
(146, 'Christie', 'クリスティ', '配角', 'Hiyori Kouno', '__Farm Identifier:__ 70394 (Grace Field House) __Height (2045):__ 103 cm Chris is a curious young boy, who is very cheerful and outspoken.', '/uploads/images/c_199113.png'),
(146, 'Jemima', 'ジェミマ', '配角', 'Kuon Erisa', '__Age (2045):__ 5 yo __Farm Identifier:__ 31394 (Grace Field House) __Height (2045-2049):__ 107 - 134 cm Jemima is cheerful and well-behaved. Though, she can display acts of mischievousness. She is seen to have a strong bond with [Alicia](https://anilist.co/character/199115).', '/uploads/images/c_199114.png'),
(146, 'Alicia', 'アリシア', '配角', 'Yoshino Aoyama', '__Height:__ 109cm __Farm Identifier:__ 71394 (Grace Field House) Alicia is a cheerful, extroverted young girl with a tomboyish personality. She can also be sneaky, and knows how to stand up for herself. She is shown to have a strong bond with [Jemima](https://anilist.co/character/199114/Jemima).', '/uploads/images/c_199115.png'),
(146, 'Rossi', 'ロッシー', '配角', 'Coco Hayashi', '__Age (2045):__ 5 yo __Farm Identifier:__ 50394 (Grace Field House) __D.O.B:__ 2040/4/14 __Height (2045-2049):__ 108 - 130 cm Rossi is a delicate and prudent boy, but he can also be quite mischievous.', '/uploads/images/c_199116.png'),
(146, 'Mark', 'マルク', '配角', 'Yoshino Aoyama', '__Age (2045):__ 5 yo __Farm Identifier:__ 79294 __D.O.B:__ 2040/1/8 __Height (2045-2049):__ 115 - 136 cm', '/uploads/images/c_199117.png'),
(146, 'Dominic', 'ドミニク', '配角', 'Mari Hino', '__Farm Identifier:__ 07294 (Grace Field House) __Height (2045-2049):__ 119 - 147 cm Dominic is an energetic and rather muscular young boy. He is very brave as well as caring towards others, and is willing to risk much to make sure everyone is safe.', '/uploads/images/c_199118.png'),
(146, 'Vylk', 'ヴィルク', '配角', 'Toshiya Ueda', 'A blind demon.', '/uploads/images/c_208450.jpg'),
(147, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(147, 'Mikasa Ackerman', 'ミカサ・アッカーマン', '主角', 'Yui Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") - 176 cm (5''9½") __Position:__ 104th Training Corps, Survey Corps __Relatives:__ [Birth Mother](https://anilist.co/character/84341/Mikasa-no-Haha) (Deceased), [Birth Father](https://anilist.co/character/84339/Mikasa-no-Chichi) (Deceased), [Grisha Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/62477/Grisha-Yeager) (Foster Father), [Carla Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/62475/Carla-Yeager) (Foster Mother, Deceased), [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) (Foster Brother) Mikasa is Eren Yaeger''s foster sister and mutual childhood friend of [Armin Arlert](https://anilist.co/character/46494), living with the two of them in Shiganshina District within the southern region of Wall Maria. When she was young, her parents were killed by human traffickers, and she was kidnapped. Eren discovered this and helped her escape her captors. Later, Eren gave her his scarf, which she constantly wears and shares an emotional attachment to. She was adopted by the Yaeger family soon after. Because of these past events, Mikasa shares an unbreakable bond with Eren and lives to protect him, constantly worrying for Eren''s well-being. After the Titans broke through Wall Maria and killed her and Eren''s mother, she chose to follow Eren into the military to try and keep him safe from danger. Even as a child, Mikasa possessed impressive fighting skill and strength, and that skill was only honed further during her training. Mikasa is considered a genius among all th', '/uploads/images/c_40881.png'),
(147, 'Eren Yeager', 'エレン・イェーガー', '主角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") - 183 cm (6''0") __Affiliation:__ 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps. Eren was born to [Carla](https://anilist.co/character/62475/Yeager-Carla) and [Grisha Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/62477/Yeager-Grisha) in Shiganshina District within the southern region of Wall Maria. He grew up in the town with his parents and foster sister [Mikasa](https://anilist.co/character/40881/Ackerman-Mikasa), who moved in with the Yeagers as a child. Eren spent most of his time with Mikasa and their mutual best friend [Armin Arlert](https://anilist.co/character/46494/Arlert-Armin), whom the pair often defended from neighborhood bullies. Eren is a passionate, determined, hardheaded, and impulsive young man. When they were children, Armin showed him a book depicting the wonders of the outside world. Eren grew to share Armin''s curiosity of the world beyond the Walls and resolved to see it for himself. This dream inspired his admiration of the Survey Corps and his desire to join their ranks as soon as he became eligible for enrollment. When the Titans suddenly broke through Wall Maria into Shiganshina, Eren was forced to watch on as his mother became trapped under the rubble of their house and eaten by a titan. Forever changed from this event, Eren vows to kill every last titan.', '/uploads/images/c_40882.jpg'),
(147, 'Levi', 'リヴァイ', '配角', 'Hiroshi Kamiya', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") Squad Captain of the Special Operations Squad (known as Squad Levi) within the Survey Corps. He is known as humanity''s strongest soldier. Levi is abrasive, blunt, and has a strong respect for structure and discipline. He is a clean-freak, demanding spotless cleanliness of himself, his equipment, and his environment. Rumors say he was involved in underground crime in his life before coming a soldier. Despite his emotionless and unfriendly demeanor, Levi cares deeply for his squad and greatly values human life.', '/uploads/images/c_45627.png'),
(147, 'Sasha Blouse', 'サシャ・ブラウス', '配角', 'Yuu Kobayashi', '__Initial Height:__ 168cm __Affiliations__: 104th Cadet Corps, Survey Corps; Soldier __Relatives__: [Artur Blouse](https://anilist.co/character/131281/Artur-Blouse) (Father), [Lisa Blouse](https://anilist.co/character/134952/Lisa-Blouse) (Mother) Originally from Dauper, a remote and scarcely populated village of hunters located in a mountain forest in the southern area of Wall Rose, Sasha joined the military as a cadet of the 104th Training Corps, where she ranked 9th upon graduation. After graduating, she''d choose to enlist in the Scouting Regiment. Sasha is a friendly and fun-loving girl. She speaks with a local accent from her home village, but initially hid it out of embarrassment by using overly formal and polite speech. She is a constant food hoarder and is known to have an incredible appetite; eating provided her with considerable gratification and relief, especially during times of great stress, and food was often the only thing on her mind when at ease. Raised as an animal hunter, Sasha specializes in archery, horseback riding, and tracking, although her eccentricity and unconventional methods tend to make her a poor fit for group operations. ~!She later saves a child named [Kaya](https://anilist.co/character/132738/Kaya) from a titan attack, who her family ends up adopting.!~', '/uploads/images/c_45887.jpg'),
(147, 'Reiner Braun', 'ライナー・ブラウン', '主角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', '__Height__: 185 cm (6''1") Member of the Survey Corps and former cadet of the 104th Training Corps. Reiner is a passionate and strong-willed young man with a strong sense of duty. He ranked 2nd in his training class upon graduation, finishing behind only [Mikasa](https://anilist.co/character/40881). His comrades have great trust in him, and he is stated to be the "big brother" of the 104th cadets.', '/uploads/images/c_46484.png'),
(147, 'Connie Springer', 'コニー・スプリンガー', '配角', 'Hiro Shimono', '__Height__: 158 cm (5''2") __Relatives:__ [Mother](https://anilist.co/character/137287/Conny-no-Haha), Martin Springer (Brother), Sunny Springer (Sister) Connie Springer is a graduate of the 104th Training Corps, having ranked 8th in class. He is known to be one of the quickest soldiers while using ODM gear and is skilled at making very sharp turns. He hails from the rural Ragako Village within Wall Rose, his greatest ambition being to make his family and village proud of him. Upon graduation, he chose to join the Survey Corps. Upbeat and naive, Connie is rather unfocused outside of combat, and enjoys goofing around and messing with his friends, but can also be a bit dense at times, as he can have some difficulty comprehending new developments as they appear. Connie always tries to remain optimistic, consistently caring for the well-being of his friends, family and village, and being willing to help in any way he can. However, this soft spot and the struggles he goes through as a member of the Survey Corps takes a toll on him, as he often responds to grief and loss with anger, irritation and hatred, causing him to at times make rash, impulsive decisions. He will do anything to protect his family, whether it be his biological family or his closest friends.', '/uploads/images/c_46486.png'),
(147, 'Bertolt Hoover', 'ベルトルト・フーバー', '配角', 'Tomohisa Hashizume', '__Height__: 192 cm (6''3") __Affiliation__: Survey Corps Member of the Survey Corps and former cadet of the 104th Training Corps. Bertoldt ranked 3rd in his training class upon graduation, finishing behind only [Mikasa](https://anilist.co/character/40881) and his hometown friend [Reiner](https://anilist.co/character/46484). He is a quiet young man who identifies himself as someone with a weak will that follows popular opinion. Despite ranking 3rd in his class, his training commandant noted him to be a person with great potential, but an utter lack of initiative. Bertoldt originally he enlisted in the military with aspirations of joining the Military Police and living in the safety of the inner wall, but after the Battle of Trost he instead decided to join the Survey Corps.', '/uploads/images/c_46488.jpg'),
(147, 'Annie Leonhart', 'アニ・レオンハート', '配角', 'Yuu Shimamura', '__Height__: 153 cm (5") A member of the 104th Southern Division in the Cadet Corps. After graduating from the 104th, ranked 4th place in the top 10, she ends up joining the Military Police. She is roommates with [Hitch Dreyse](https://anilist.co/character/86017). A stoic girl, Annie is considered to be an isolated, solitary type, being rarely seen smiling or socializing and often having an emotionless expression. She is apathetic and somnolent, with little desire to put in any effort into meaningless disciplines or activities. Nonetheless, what drives Annie more than anything is her desire for a normal life.', '/uploads/images/c_46490.jpg'),
(147, 'Armin Arlert', 'アルミン・アルレルト', '主角', 'Marina Inoue', '__Height:__ 163 cm (5''4") __Position:__ 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps __Relatives:__ [Grandfather](https://anilist.co/character/84313/Armin-no-Ojiisan) Armin is a young boy who was born and raised in the Shiganshina District within the walls, being childhood friends with both [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) and [Mikasa Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/40881). After Wall Maria was breached, he chose to join Mikasa and Eren in joining the military, both to try to make a good and meaningful impact on the world, and to fulfill his dream of seeing the outside world. Even when he was young, the naturally curious Armin has always had a deep fascination with the world beyond the Walls. As a child, he found and studied an illegal book about the outside world that was owned by his grandfather. He often shared the book and information contained in it with Eren Yeager, his best friend, and his dreams of seeing the world outside the walls. Armin was branded a heretic by other children for his unusual interest in the outside world and was thus frequently picked on. Too timid to defend himself, Armin would often rely on his friends Eren and Mikasa Ackerman to protect him from local bullies. This, coupled with his frail physique, was a deep shame for Armin, leading him to have poor self-esteem and to believe that he is a burden to others. Because of this, Armin has always been very eager to prove his worth, especially towards his close friends. Armin ', '/uploads/images/c_46494.png'),
(147, 'Jean Kirstein', 'ジャン・キルシュタイン', '配角', 'Kishou Taniyama', '__Height__: 175 cm (5''8") __Relatives__: [Mother](https://anilist.co/character/131444/Jean-no-Haha) Jean Kirschtein is a graduate of the 104th Cadet Corps, among whom he ranked 6th for his skills with ODM gear and ability to look at things through a more tactical lense. Jean hails from Wall Rose''s Trost District, and joined the military with hopes of living a peaceful life within the walls as part of the Military Police. However, he would later find himself joining the Survey Corps after being convinced both by his close friend [Marco Bott''s](https://anilist.co/character/62479/Marco-Bott) words, and after witnessing the death of several of his comrades. Jean has a blunt personality. He holds no restraint when it comes to speaking his mind, even when he knows it would not be wise to do so or when it could spark conflict. Jean is also pragmatic: he has a strong aversion to exposing himself to dangerous situations. During his time as a cadet, Jean was extremely hot-headed, easily becoming frustrated and quick to resort to violence when pushed. Jean was also very cynical about defeating the Titans, believing that humanity has no chance against them and openly mocking more idealistic individuals like [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager), and saw resisting the Titans as a hopeless cause. However, despite these things, and although he presents himself as self-centered, Jean places high value on the lives of his comrades, and is willing to risk his life to pr', '/uploads/images/c_46498.png'),
(147, 'Grisha Yeager', 'グリシャ・イェーガー', '配角', 'Hiroshi Tsuchida', 'Father of [Eren Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) and caretaker of [Mikasa Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/40881/Mikasa-Ackerman). He is a renowned doctor who was well respected in the District of Shiganshina after he saved the village from a mysterious viral epidemic by developing vaccines. He also provides a medical house call service to the people of Shiganshina and to various towns in addition to having a network of contacts within the Corps of the Shiganshina District. He is married to [Carla Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/62475). ~!In the basement of the Yeager family house, he hides a secret which he refers to as the "truth". Upon finding Eren after the fall of Wall Maria, he injects him with a series of chemicals and amnesiacs and entrusts him with the key to the "truth", before mysteriously disappearing. This strange serum resulted in Eren gaining the ability to transform into a titan.!~', '/uploads/images/c_62477.jpg'),
(147, 'Marco Bott', 'マルコ・ボット', '配角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', '__Height__: 178 cm (5''9") __Affiliations__: 104th Training Corps Originally from Jinae District. Marco ranked 7th in the 104th Training Corps and is widely respected by other cadets of the 104th. Marco is a very kind, calm, and idealistic person, valuing the good of the group above his own interests, as well as understanding and coping with his own shortcomings and limitations. He is seen as a natural leader, and desires to join the Military Police to serve near the King. *Note: Marco Bott is the official English translation by Kodansha.*', '/uploads/images/c_62479.jpg'),
(147, 'Krista Lenz', 'クリスタ・レンズ', '配角', 'Shiori Mikami', '__Height__: 145 cm (4''8") __Affiliations__: 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps Ranked tenth in the trainee class, Krista is a very shy and kind, caring person, often being described as a "goddess" or "angel" by her peers. She is good friends with [Ymir](https://anilist.co/character/71479/Ymir).', '/uploads/images/c_62481.png'),
(147, 'Thomas Wagner', 'トーマス・ワグナー', '配角', 'Shigeyuki Susaki', 'Thomas Wagner was from Trost District. A member of the 104th Trainees Squad, he first met Eren Yeager while questioning him about the Colossal Titan. Later, he operated the training gear for the Three Dimensional Maneuver Gear during Eren''s second attempt at his aptitude test. At Keith Shadis'' orders, Thomas exchanged gear with Eren and it was discovered that Eren''s gear was defective. After graduating, Thomas planned to join the Scouting Legion. ~!After the second attack of the Colossal Titan, he was assigned to the middle guard along with Eren Yeager and Armin Arlert. Initially tasked with working under the training corps, they eventually were incorporated into the front guard due to the number of titans. Catching the group unaware, a titan lunged at the rooftop they were standing on. The group scattered but unfortunately, Thomas wasn''t fast enough. He was caught and swallowed whole, while his teammate, Eren, looked on in terror.!~', '/uploads/images/c_62483.png'),
(147, 'Dot Pixis', 'ドット・ピクシス', '配角', 'Masahiko Tanaka', 'The highest-ranked Administrator of the Southern Region. Head of the Garrison''s Southern Territories, Pixis is a cunning leader with astute insights. However, he is also an alcoholic who is constantly watched over by his aid, [Anka](https://anilist.co/character/84331/Anka-Rheinberger), who constantly scolds him for sleeping and drinking during critical moments.', '/uploads/images/c_62485.png'),
(147, 'Hange Zoe', 'ハンジ・ゾエ', '配角', 'Romi Park', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Affiliation:__ Survey Corps; Section Commander, Squad Leader. Leader of the Survey Corps'' Fourth Squad, Hange is also in charge of conducting research on Titans, and pursues this knowledge so passionately that they have become obsessed with Titans as a result. After originally holding a deep hatred for the creatures, Hange decided to take on a new outside-the-box approach to their research by letting go of their resentment towards Titans and approaching the test subjects with compassion. Hange is an energetic, freethinking and quirky scientist, with a unique way of conducting both themselves and their work. Hange is a genius outside of just Titan research too, using their brain to create weapons, tactical plans, and inventions for the benefit of humanity. As a leader, Hange is thoughtful of their comrades, and can easily figure out complex problems in order to create plans for their teammates to carry out.', '/uploads/images/c_71121.png'),
(147, 'Nile Dok', 'ナイル・ドーク', '配角', 'Anri Katsu', 'Chief of the Military Police.', '/uploads/images/c_71123.png'),
(147, 'Darius Zackly', 'ダリス・ザックレー', '配角', 'Hideaki Tezuka', 'The head of all three divisions of the army. __ _Note:___ Darius Zackly is the official English translation by Kodansha.', '/uploads/images/c_71125.png'),
(147, 'Ymir', 'ユミル', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5''7") __Affiliations:__ 104th Trainees Squad, Scouting Legion Member of the Scouting Legion. She seems selfish, cynical, bossy, sly, uncooperative, exploitative, and confrontational, but she can apparently be kind, especially to [Krista](https://anilist.co/character/62481/Krista-Lenz).', '/uploads/images/c_71479.png'),
(147, 'Keith Shadis', 'キース・シャーディス', '配角', 'Tsuguo Mogami', 'Keith Shadis was the head instructor of the 104th Trainees Squad. He seemed to be a friend or have some sort of relationship with Dr. Grisha, as he knew Eren is the son of the doctor and praised Eren for his effort.', '/uploads/images/c_84305.png'),
(147, 'Anka Rheinberger', 'アンカ・ラインベルガー', '配角', 'Ikumi Hayama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_84331.png'),
(147, 'Hitch Dreyse', 'ヒッチ・ドリス', '配角', 'Akeno Watanabe', '**Height:** 168 cm __Affiliations:__ 104th Cadet Corps. Recruit of the Military Police stationed in Stohess District. She was roommates with [Annie Leonhart](https://anilist.co/character/46490/Annie-Leonhart). Hitch acts immature in certain ways, she has a sarcastic, easygoing personality and seems to mischievously enjoy teasing and needling her fellow officers, especially [Marlo Freudenberg](https://anilist.co/character/71457/Marlo-Freudenberg). She claims she chose to join the Military Police out of laziness, as it is well known that the senior staff are incredibly corrupt and she wanted to benefit from the system herself; however, she did not take into account that, as a new recruit, her superiors would dump all their work on her. Though she may act a bit air-headed at times, Hitch is not selfish and cares about those around her, especially her fellow comrades.', '/uploads/images/c_86017.jpg'),
(147, 'Pieck Finger', 'ピーク・フィンガー', '配角', 'Manami Numakura', '__Height__: 155 cm Pieck is an Eldian who serves as one of Marley''s Warriors. She is shown to be somewhat sweet and kind, consistently shown to care about her fellow Warriors and the Warrior candidates. ~!She is the current inheritor of the Cart Titan.!~', '/uploads/images/c_125603.png'),
(147, 'Gabi Braun', 'ガビ・ブラウン', '主角', 'Ayane Sakura', '__Height__: 138 cm Gabi Braun is an Eldian living in the Liberio internment zone and the cousin of [Reiner Braun](https://anilist.co/character/46484/Reiner-Braun). She is friends with her fellow warrior candidates [Udo](https://anilist.co/character/125663), [Zofia](https://anilist.co/character/125664/Zofia), and [Falco Grice](https://anilist.co/character/125660). Gabi is very passionate and head-strong, expressing her emotions and opinions without inhibition. She is also brave, possessing boundless determination, and willing to put her life on the line to complete a goal for a perceived greater good. However, these attributes can also make her somewhat overbearing and domineering. This causes her to be tactless at times, forcing her opinions on others and taking charge regardless of whether it was asked for or not. She mostly shows this side around her fellow Warrior candidates, considering herself their de facto leader to an extent, and even threatening to ''punish'' them when they disagree with her. Nonetheless, she is friendly enough that they have no issue with spending their leisure time with her. Aside from her resolve and determination, Gabi is care-free even on the battlefield, making remarks about her cuteness and claiming her commander loves her too much to sacrifice her. ~!She is a Warrior candidate that is likely to inherit the Armored Titan.!~', '/uploads/images/c_125659.png'),
(147, 'Falco Grice', 'ファルコ・グライス', '主角', 'Natsuki Hanae', '__Height__: 140 cm __Position__: Warrior Candidate Falco Grice is an Eldian Warrior candidate working for the Marley government and is the younger brother of [Colt Grice](https://anilist.co/character/125665/Colt-Grice). Falco is close friends with his fellow warrior candidates; [Udo](https://anilist.co/character/125663/Udo), [Zofia](https://anilist.co/character/125664/Zofia), and [Gabi](https://anilist.co/character/125659/Gabi-Braun). While not as physically strong as his fellow soldiers, he makes up for it with his quick wit and improvisation. He is a very merciful and compassionate person, going out of his way to protect and save other people lives, even enemy soldiers. He is also very polite and respectful towards others, and is an empathetic person, being willing to hear people out and properly understand things from their points of view. ~!He is a candidate to inherit the power of the Armored Titan. He has the desire to become the Armored Titan in order to prevent Gabi Braun from inheriting it, as he has a crush on her and wants them to live a long life.!~', '/uploads/images/c_125660.jpg'),
(147, 'Zeke', 'ジーク', '主角', 'Takehito Koyasu', '__Height__: 183 cm Zeke is the current inheritor of the Beast Titan, and is considered by [Reiner Braun](https://anilist.co/character/46484/Reiner-Braun) to be the strongest Warrior, contrasting [Levi''s](https://anilist.co/character/45627/Levi) title of "humanity''s strongest soldier".', '/uploads/images/c_125661.png'),
(147, 'Porco Galliard', 'ポルコガリアード', '配角', 'Toshiki Masuda', '__Height:__ 175 cm __Position:__ Marley''s Warrior Porco Galliard is an Eldian and the younger brother of Marcel Galliard. ~!He is one of Marley''s Warriors and inherited the Jaw Titan from Ymir.!~', '/uploads/images/c_125662.png'),
(147, 'Udo', 'ウド', '配角', 'Ayumu Murase', '__Height__: 146 cm __Position__: Warrior Candidate Udo is an Eldian Warrior candidate working for the Marley government. ~!He is a candidate to inherit the Armored Titan power.!~', '/uploads/images/c_125663.png'),
(147, 'Zofia', 'ゾフィア', '配角', 'Yuumi Kawashima', '__Height__: 142 cm __Position__: Warrior Candidate Zofia is an Eldian Warrior candidate working for the Marley government. ~!She is a candidate to inherit the Armored Titan power.!~', '/uploads/images/c_125664.png'),
(147, 'Colt Grice', 'コルト・グライス', '配角', 'Masaya Matsukaze', '__Height__: 180 cm __Position__: Warrior Candidate Colt Grice is an Eldian living in Marley and the older brother of [Falco Grice](https://anilist.co/character/125660). ~!He is a Warrior candidate who is selected to be the next wielder of the Beast Titan power.!~', '/uploads/images/c_125665.jpg'),
(147, 'Kenny Ackerman', 'ケニー・アッカーマン', '配角', 'Kazuhiro Yamaji', '__Affiliation:__ Military Police; Captain of Anti-Personnel Control Squad. __Relatives:__ [Kuchel Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/127940/Kuchel-Ackerman) (Sister), [Unnamed Grandfather](https://anilist.co/character/128589/Kenny-no-Ojiisan), Kenny Ackerman is a member of the Military Police Brigade''s First Interior Squad and also the Anti-Personnel Control Squad. Decades prior, however, Kenny was known as an infamous serial killer that stalked victims in the capitol. Despite his dark field of work, Kenny appears to be rather jovial and takes pleasure in taunting his adversaries during battle. When fighting, he becomes animated and lively, often making a scene or otherwise throwing insults and witticisms. However, he also fought with control and was able to effortlessly sneak up on his targets when they least expected him. His preferred method of killing during his time as a serial killer was to slit the throats of his victims which earned him his infamous handle "Kenny the Ripper", and it was rumored that he murdered over 100 members of the Military Police Brigade. However, decades later his killings ceased and the terror that he once inspired dwindled into an Urban Legend. He eventually was found working under the Royal Government, the reasoning for his sudden shift in behavior being a mystery. Kenny is ultimately, despite his comical personality, very cold and calculated, sparing little emotional attachment or loyalty to anyone, with only a few exceptions. ~!ㅤ He nota', '/uploads/images/c_127443.png'),
(147, 'Flagel  Reeves', 'フレーゲル・リーブス ', '配角', 'Tasuku Hatanaka', 'Flegel Reeves is the son of Dimo Reeves', '/uploads/images/c_127569.jpg'),
(147, 'Marcel Galliard', 'マルセル・ガリアード', '配角', 'Masamichi Kitada', '~!Marcel was a comrade and childhood friend of Reiner Braun, Bertolt Hoover, and Annie Leonhart. He was part of the group sent by Marley to attack the Eldians of Paradis in year 845, but his mission was cut short by the sudden appearance of Ymir in her mindless Titan form.!~ (Source: Shingeki no Kyojin Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_127683.png'),
(147, 'Djel Sannes', 'ジェル・サネス', '配角', 'Masaki Terasoma', 'Djel Sannes is a member of the Military Police Regiment and part of the First Interior Squad.', '/uploads/images/c_127702.png'),
(147, 'Floch Forster', 'フロック・フォルスター', '配角', 'Kenshou Ono', 'Floch is a new recruit in the Survey Corps. He joined the Survey Corps during the two months between the attack at Orvud District and the return to Shiganshina District. ~!After the rest of the Yeagerists are killed during the port battle, Floch hides on the ship to Marley. After shooting holes in the fuel tank of the flying boat, Floch is ultimately killed by Mikasa.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127703.png'),
(147, 'Roy', 'ロイ', '配角', 'Takashi Onozuka', 'As a veteran journalist, Roy has come to accept and conform to the restrictive nature of the monarchy, fearing retaliation for defiance.', '/uploads/images/c_130636.png'),
(147, 'Pierre', 'ピュレ', '配角', 'Kenji Takahashi', 'As a rookie reporter, Pierre has not yet become jaded like his superior Roy. He is very bold in his reporting, unafraid of asking questions of Military Police officers that would otherwise be considered "off-limits." He takes his job of reporting the truth very seriously, becoming frustrated when he is kept from printing news that would be scandalous for the government.', '/uploads/images/c_130637.png'),
(147, 'Annie no Chichi', 'アニの父', '配角', 'Kouji Ishii', 'Father and trainer of Annie Leonhart. He relentlessly trained Annie to fight, using mostly kicks and the attacker''s weight against them. ~!Memories of his pleas for forgiveness later create an opening for Annie to crystallize herself before Eren Jaeger has the chance to capture her!~', '/uploads/images/c_131257.png'),
(147, 'Artur Blouse', 'アルトゥル・ブラウス', '配角', 'Otoya Kawano', '__Relatives:__ [Lisa Blause](https://anilist.co/character/134952/Lisa-Blouse) (Wife), [Sasha Blause](https://anilist.co/character/45887/Sasha-Blouse) (Daughter). Artur Blouse is the father of Sasha Blouse and a hunter in the Dauper village. It was his words that motivated Sasha to leave home and join the military. Artur appears to be a mature father figure who is deeply devoted to his clan. Though he appreciates his way of life, he realizes that many people''s homes were taken by Titans and that they must share the forest for the greater good. He appears to be very wise, willing to accept change and move beyond their traditions if it meant a better way of life for everyone, and is very clearly a selfless person who puts others before himself. Like his daughter, he has a native Dauper accent. ~!ㅤ After his daughter Sasha saved [Kaya](https://anilist.co/character/132738/Kaya), he and his wife decided to adopt her and open their home up to other orphaned children whose family was slain by the titans, going so far as to refer to them as his "family."!~', '/uploads/images/c_131281.png'),
(147, 'Willy Tybur', 'ヴィリー・タイバー', '配角', 'Kazuhiko Inoue', '~!An Eldian noble living in Marley. He was the head of the Tybur family and controlled Marley behind the shadows, although he chose not to interfere with Marley''s military decisions.!~', '/uploads/images/c_131762.png'),
(147, 'Theo Magath', 'テオ・マガト', '配角', 'Jirou Saitou', 'A commander of the Eldian Unit of the Marley army. Formerly one of the chief overseers of the first Warrior candidates during their training, he later led the Eldian Warriors in the Marley Mid-East War against the Mid-East Allied Forces, playing a key role in Marley''s victory. ~!Through the support of Willy Tybur and the governmental party of Marley, along with the death of General Calvi, Magath is next in line to become the general of the Marleyan military forces.!~ ~!He sacrifices himself by blowing up the Marleyan ship to prevent the Yeagerists from catching the allies!~ (Source: Attack on Titan Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_131763.jpg'),
(147, 'Kaya no Haha', 'カヤの母', '配角', '', '~!During the Wall Rose invasion, she is left stranded in her town with her traumatized daughter as a Titan slowly eats her. Sasha Blouse arrives in the town to alert its citizens and finds the two women in the house they were left in. Sasha unsuccessfully attempts to cut the Titan''s nape with an axe, and then notices the child in the room. Sasha apologizes to the mother as she decides to abandon her, and successfully takes her child to safety. The woman later dies from her wounds!~', '/uploads/images/c_132794.jpg'),
(147, 'Dina Fritz', 'ダイナ・フリッツ', '配角', 'Nozomi Kishimoto', '~!Dina is the first wife of Grisha Yeager. One year after their marriage, she gave birth to their son, Zeke Yeager. Dina is of royal blood as member of the Fritz family. When the 145th Fritz King built the walls and decided to move to the island Paradis, her branch of the Fritz family stayed behind due to disagreements with the King''s choice. She joined the Eldia Restorationists on Marley, in order to revive the pride and power of Eldia. In this group, she also met Grisha Yeager, whom she eventually married. She gave birth to their son, Zeke Yeager. At the age of 7, there son reported his parents to the Marley government. As a result, all the Eldia Restorationists were sent to Utopia. Sergeant Major Gross injected Dina with the Titan serum and she was thrown off the Borderline wall to Utopia, as Grisha, in horror, watched his wife turn into a Titan.!~ ~!After the Colossus Titan breaches Shiganshina District in Wall Maria, many Titans proceed inside and among them is Dina. She embarks inside the town and is seen by Eren and Mikasa as they try to free Carla Yeager, who is trapped under the debris of their house. Though Hannes initially comes to their aid and decides to face Dina, he stands catatonic in fear of her frightening appearance. After he realizes that he is too afraid to face it, he opts to instead take Eren and Mikasa to safety, leaving Eren''s mother behind. Afterwards, Eren witnesses Dina pull Carla out of the debris, as it proceeds to violently incapacitate her and ', '/uploads/images/c_133215.png'),
(147, 'Yelena', 'イェレナ', '配角', 'Mitsuki Saiga', 'Yelena is the leader of the Anti-Marleyan Volunteers working under [Zeke Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/125661/Zeke). She was one of the Marleyan soldiers on board the first survey fleet to Paradis Island after Marley''s failed attack operation. She is a very tall woman with her blonde hair styled in a short bob with straight bangs. She has large dark eyes and somewhat androgynous features due to her build and style. Yelena is a fervent follower of Zeke Yeager, holding great admiration and respect for him. She is usually calm and collected, her demeanour remaining unchanged even when [Jean Kirstein](https://anilist.co/character/46498/Kirstein-Jean) yelled at her for failing to see her job through. Nonetheless, she is willing to take responsibility and apologizes should she fail in her task. Yelena appears to maintain a very relaxed demeanour while having dry, humorous undertones to much of her actions. ~!It is later revealed that Yelena was born into an unassuming family in Marley, and eventually became disillusioned with her own country. After meeting Zeke Yeager, Yelena concocted a plan to solidify herself in history by helping Zeke save the world. As part of her narrative, Yelena created a false background for herself, claiming that her homeland was invaded and conquered by Marley. She was forcibly drafted as a soldier to fight in the Marleyan military, where she met similar-minded soldiers and organized them into the Anti-Marleyan Volunteers to fight against Marley.!', '/uploads/images/c_133216.png'),
(147, 'Niccolo', 'ニコロ', '配角', 'Eiji Hanawa', 'Nicolo is a former Marleyan soldier who served on Marley''s Navy and was part of the first survey fleet to Paradis Island after the failed Paradis Island Operation. After being taken captive, he begins working on the island as a chef for the military. Niccolo was at first a very typical Marleyan, fearing the Eldians of Paradis Island and calling them devils. He was very disgusted with having been captured by them and having to live by their side, but after spending a lot of time with the Survey Corps, he and his comrades have developed grudging respect and shaky friendships with the ones they once thought of as devils. He notably grew a soft spot for a Survey Corp member, [Sasha Blouse](https://anilist.co/character/45887/Sasha-Blouse), after she complimented him on his cooking skills. Over time, the two gradually grew closer, enough for [Kaya](https://anilist.co/character/132738/Kaya) to believe they were in love. Niccolo credits Sasha with saving him from the war and teaching him that he can cook to make people happy.', '/uploads/images/c_133218.png'),
(147, 'Lisa Blouse', 'リサ・ブラウス', '配角', 'Junko Iwao', 'The mother of [Sasha Blouse](https://anilist.co/character/45887/Sasha-Blouse) and wife of [Mr. Blouse](https://anilist.co/character/131281).', '/uploads/images/c_134952.png'),
(147, 'Grice', 'グライス', '配角', 'Tatsuhisa Suzuki', 'He is a member of the Restorationists.', '/uploads/images/c_140764.png'),
(147, 'Grisha no Chichi Yeager', 'グリシャの父・イェーガー', '配角', 'Seirou Ogino', 'He is the father of [Fay](https://anilist.co/character/133214/) and [Grisha Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/62477/), as well as the grandfather of [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/).', '/uploads/images/c_140765.png'),
(147, 'Grisha no Haha Yeager', 'グリシャの母・イェーガー', '配角', 'Tomo Sakurai', 'She is the mother of [Fay](https://anilist.co/character/133214/) and [Grisha Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/62477/), as well as the grandmother of [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/).', '/uploads/images/c_140851.png'),
(147, 'Tom Ksaver', 'トム・クサヴァー', '配角', 'Kenji Hamada', 'He is a man who knew Grisha Jaeger when he was growing up.', '/uploads/images/c_140852.png'),
(147, 'Onyankopon', 'オニャンコポン', '配角', 'Kouji Hiwatari', 'Onyankopon is one of the Anti-Marleyan Volunteers and aids the Survey Corps during the Raid on Liberio. He pilots an airship following orders from [Hange](https://anilist.co/character/71121/) for the Corps to use during their retreat.', '/uploads/images/c_192909.png'),
(147, 'Heishi', '兵士', '配角', 'Noriaki Kanze', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_198633.jpg'),
(147, 'Koslow', 'コスロ', '配角', 'Tooru Nara', 'He is a Marleyan officer who fought in the war against the Mid-East Allied Forces before Marley''s victory. (Source: Attack on Titan Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_199549.png'),
(147, 'Karina Braun', 'カリナ・ブラウン', '配角', 'Atsuko Yuya', 'Karina Braun is the mother of [Reiner Braun](https://anilist.co/character/46484/).', '/uploads/images/c_199712.png'),
(147, 'Calvi', 'カルヴィ', '配角', 'Kiyomitsu Mizuuchi', 'Calvi is the general of the Marleyan military forces.', '/uploads/images/c_199713.jpg'),
(147, 'Gabi no Haha', 'ガビの母', '配角', 'Kaori Yagi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_199714.png'),
(147, 'Colt Chichi', 'コルト父', '配角', 'Motoki Sakuma', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_199715.png'),
(147, 'Douryou', '同僚', '配角', 'Kousuke Tanabe', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_199716.jpg'),
(147, 'Gabi Chichi', 'ガビ父', '配角', 'Masamichi Kitada', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_199717.png'),
(147, 'Colt Haha', 'コルト母', '配角', 'Kanako Takeuchi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_199718.png'),
(147, 'Nambia', 'ナンビア ', '配角', 'Saiko Moriya', 'is an ambassador from a foreign land and a childhood friend of Willy Tybur. She serves as one of several ambassadors for her nation during the Liberio festival following the Marley Mid-East War.', '/uploads/images/c_202797.png'),
(147, 'Ogweno', 'オグウェノ', '配角', 'Kousuke Tanabe', 'Ogweno is an ambassador from a foreign land and a friend of Willy Tybur. He serves as one of several ambassadors for his nation during the Liberio festival following the Marley Mid-East War.', '/uploads/images/c_202798.png'),
(147, 'Kiyomi Azumabito', 'キヨミ・アズマビト', '配角', 'Kiri Yoshizawa', 'Kiyomi is an ambassador of Hizuru and an ally to the Eldians on Paradis Island.', '/uploads/images/c_202799.png'),
(147, 'Reiner Chichi', 'ライナー父', '配角', 'Naomi Kusumi', 'A Marleyan man who had an illegal relationship with the Eldian woman Karina Braun. He is the estranged father of Reiner Braun.', '/uploads/images/c_203936.png'),
(147, 'Lara Tybur', 'ラーラ・タイバー', '配角', 'Mamiko Noto', 'She is Willy Tybur''s sister. ~!She was the previous inheritor of the War Hammer Titan.!~', '/uploads/images/c_205015.png'),
(147, 'Carlo', 'カルロ', '配角', 'Keitarou Tanaka', 'Carlo is a soldier of the Marleyan military and a member of the Panzer Unit.', '/uploads/images/c_205906.png'),
(147, 'Karl Fritz', 'カール・フリッツ', '配角', '', 'The first ruler of humanity inside the Walls and prior to that he ruled also as the 145th Fritz King of Eldia. ~!He possessed the Founding Titan which he used to create the Walls and alter the memories of humanity inside.!~', '/uploads/images/c_205914.png'),
(147, 'Louise', 'ルイーゼ', '配角', 'Mariko Nagai', 'A young girl who was in Trost with her mother attempting to flee when the Titans invaded. After being saved by [Mikasa Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/40881/Mikasa-Ackerman) and the other 104th Cadets, she was inspired by their heroic actions and later joins the military herself as a Survey Corps recruit, hoping to get closer to Mikasa, her idol. Louise believes that strength is the most important attribute one can have in the world, to the point that she almost seems to have a "might equals right" mentality. Much of this mindset stems from her experiences during the Battle of Trost District, where she claims to have learned from watching Mikasa Ackerman fight in the face of adversity to achieve victory. She believes that the ends justify the means, and has no qualms about breaking rules if she believes that disobeying others will get her what she wants.', '/uploads/images/c_209870.png'),
(147, 'Fine Tybur', 'フィーネ・タイバー', '配角', 'Mariko Nagai', 'is the oldest daughter of Willy Tybur.', '/uploads/images/c_209871.png'),
(147, 'Lobov', 'ロボフ', '配角', 'Takahiro Fujiwara', 'A Scout Regiment recruit and former commander of the garrison who participated in the Raid on Liberio.', '/uploads/images/c_209872.png'),
(147, 'Greiz', 'グリーズ', '配角', 'Jun Miyamoto', 'Former Marleyan soldier who served on Marley''s Navy and is part of a survey fleet sent to Paradis Island after the failed Paradis Island Operation. After being taken captive on the island, he begins working as a waiter in a restaurant inside the Walls.', '/uploads/images/c_210461.png'),
(147, 'Roeg', 'ローグ', '配角', 'Toshihiro Ookubo', 'High ranking Military Police Regiment soldier.', '/uploads/images/c_210462.png'),
(147, 'Varis', 'バリス', '配角', 'Kousuke Tanabe', 'Varis is a Scout Regiment soldier who participated in the Raid on Liberio. Varis is a very loyal and trusted member of the Scout Regiment, being one of the few members trusted to help Levi Ackermann guard Zeke Jaeger, and remaining loyal to his superiors even after other soldiers defected to become members of the Jaegerists.', '/uploads/images/c_212204.png'),
(148, 'Tanjirou Kamado', '竈門炭治郎', '主角', 'Natsuki Hanae', '__Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") __Combat Style:__ Water Breathing & ~!Sun Breathing!~ Tanjirou is kind by nature and has been described by others as having very gentle eyes. He has a great deal of determination and will not give up once he has a goal to achieve, an example being finding a cure for [Nezuko](https://anilist.co/character/127518). Even though he is relatively strong on his own, he isn''t opposed to asking others for help when he needs it. He is very protective of his friends and even more so of his younger sister. His biggest attribute is his ability to empathize with anyone, even demons. ~!Eventually, he discovers that he is a legendary Sun Breathing user.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126071.png'),
(148, 'Nezuko Kamado', '竈門禰豆子', '主角', 'Akari Kitou', '__Height:__ 153 cm (5''0") Transformed into a demon and left mute, Nezuko travels with her older brother [Tanjirou](https://anilist.co/character/126071/Kamado-Tanjirou) in a box on his back. She can change her size at will, and is a capable fighter when she needs to be, but has never killed or eaten any humans. Instead of gaining nourishment from humans, it seems that she recovers her energy by sleeping for long periods of time.', '/uploads/images/c_127518.png'),
(148, 'Inosuke Hashibira', '嘴平伊之助', '主角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', '**Height:** 164 cm (5''4") __Combat Style:__ Beast Breathing Inosuke is usually seen wearing a grey boar mask, with a shirtless version of the Demon hunter uniform. Without the mask he has messy shoulder length black hair and large green eyes with long eyelashes. He is described as having a girly looking face which greatly contrasts with his muscular body. Inosuke is extremely short-tempered and proud, and makes a big deal out of fighting opponents stronger than him claiming that''s his only hobby. He is a sore loser and is always trying to compete with Tanjiro and provoke him into fighting him, and usually failing. Due to growing up in the mountains by himself Inosuke has trouble interacting with others and only cares about himself most of the time. Though he''s often seen with 2 swords in hand, Inosuke is left-handed.', '/uploads/images/c_129130.jpg'),
(148, 'Zenitsu Agatsuma', '我妻善逸', '主角', 'Hiro Shimono', '__Height:__ 164 cm (5''4") __Combat Style:__ Thunder Breathing __Affiliation:__ Demon Slayer Corps __Occupation:__ Demon Slayer Zenitsu Agatsuma is one of the main protagonists of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba and along with [Inosuke Hashibira](https://anilist.co/character/129130/Inosuke-Hashibira), a traveling companion of [Tanjiro Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/126071/Tanjirou-Kamado) and [Nezuko Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/127518/Nezuko-Kamado).', '/uploads/images/c_129131.png'),
(148, 'Kyoujurou Rengoku', '煉獄杏寿郎', '主角', 'Satoshi Hino', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''10") __Combat Style:__ Flame Breathing He is greatly enthusiastic in regard to his duties as Flame Pillar and often cheerfully eccentric. He is amiable, kind and boasts extraordinary flame techniques and swordsmanship stemming from strict practice and discipline. He is an honourable warrior who adheres to his code of morals and principles that was instilled into him by his mother at a young age - the most significant being that those who were born strong have a duty to protect the weak.', '/uploads/images/c_129133.png'),
(148, 'Giyuu Tomioka', '冨岡義勇', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9½") __Combat Style:__ Water Breathing Water pillar in the Demon Killing Corps. Giyuu is reserved and displays little emotion, instead giving off a calm feeling most of the time. As a water breath user, Giyuu has created his own style. The eleventh style, Lull, gives him the ability to nullify any oncoming attacks, though rapid attacks can pierce through it. Though Giyuu is reserved, he does have a few friends, such as Tanjirou and, in the past, [Sabito](https://anilist.co/character/137809/Sabito). Shinobu often pokes fun at Giyuu and is merciless when doing so, such as saying he has no friends and that others don''t like him. ~!He is one of the only Pillar, aside from [Sanemi](https://anilist.co/character/137774/Sanemi-Shinazugawa), who survived during the final fight against [Muzan](https://anilist.co/character/129132/Muzan-Kibutsuji).!~', '/uploads/images/c_130050.png'),
(148, 'Muichirou Tokitou', '時透無一郎', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") __Combat Style:__ Mist Breathing Muichiro is an air-headed individual who seems to constantly wander off in thought and never focus on one thing. Impassive and, at times, obtuse, he tends to think only for himself and operates on logic alone, never letting emotion guide him. Despite this, he has been shown to get serious when it is required and is devoted to his position as the Demon Slayer Corps'' Mist Hashira. Alternatively, he seems to display a cold and arrogant side as well. ~!He later died at Kokushibo''s hand.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136069.png'),
(148, 'Shinobu Kochou', '胡蝶しのぶ', '配角', 'Saori Hayami', '__Height:__ 151 cm (4''11") __Combat Style:__ Insect Breathing Shinobu is a demon slayer and the Insect Pillar of the Demon Killing Corps. She is 18 years old and one of two female pillars. Shinobu appears rather laid back, and always has a smile on her face regardless of the situation. Despite her relaxed exterior and her initial claim of wanting to get along with demons, she can be rather cruel and harbors a great deal of anger towards them. She is generally kind to other humans, but is rather sadistic in her treatment of demons. As a pillar, she is a top-class fighter despite her small stature. She is also well-versed in medical knowledge, and can concoct poisons and medicines alike. ~!During the Infinity Castle Arc, she encounters the Upper 2 demon [Douma](https://anilist.co/character/144591) and is slain by him in a fight. However, since she poisoned herself before the fight, Douma is severely incapacitated after eating her.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136070.png'),
(148, 'Tengen Uzui', '宇髄天元', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', '__Height:__ 198 cm (6''6") __Combat Style:__ Sound Breathing A Demon Slayer, and the Sound Pillar of the Demon Slayer Corps. Tengen is a very eccentric person, always wanting to complete actions as flashy as possible. Although he has displayed an uncaring and forceful attitude towards some people, he also has a caring side that is mainly only shown towards his most treasured ones, most notably his three wives, [Makio](https://anilist.co/character/250554), [Suma](https://anilist.co/character/250555), and [Hinatsuru](https://anilist.co/character/250556). He also shows a somewhat nicer side towards [Tanjiro](https://anilist.co/character/126071) after their mission and starts to accept him more as the series goes on.', '/uploads/images/c_136071.png'),
(148, 'Mitsuri Kanroji', '甘露寺蜜璃', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 167 cm (5''5") __Combat Style:__ Love Breathing Demon Hunter and the Love Pillar of the Demon Killing Corps. Mitsuri is a soft and kind person. She is very emotional and passionate, constantly complimenting people in her head, which probably contributes to her nickname of "the Hashira of Love". Although she is rather shy and is easily flustered, she is always kind to others, most notably towards [Obanai](https://anilist.co/character/137777), whom she appears to share a strong bond with. Besides her rather emotional personality, she can also come off as somewhat childish at times. ~!She was taught by Rengoku to use the flame breathing. However, although Mitsuri has learnt it, she was not as skillful with it and cannot fight to her fullest using it, leading her to solely develop the Love Breathing.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136072.png'),
(148, 'Sanemi Shinazugawa', '不死川実弥', '配角', 'Tomokazu Seki', '__Height:__ 179cm (5''10½") Demon Hunter and the Wind Pillar of the Demon Killing Corps. He is the older brother of [Genya Shinazugawa](https://anilist.co/character/137776). Sanemi specializes in Wind Breathing, which has 9 forms. The technique consists of drawing the air from around the user to create whirlwind attacks that follow the user''s movements. Form names include Dust Whirlwind Cutter, Claws-Purifying Wind, Clean Storm Wind Tree, Rising Dust Storm, Cold Mountain Wind, Black Wind Mountain Mist, Gale - Sudden Gusts, Primary Gale Slash, and Idaten Typhoon.', '/uploads/images/c_137774.png'),
(148, 'Genya Shinazugawa', '不死川玄弥', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 180 cm (5''11") Genya Is a Demon Hunter of the Demon Killing Corps. He is also the younger brother of the Wind Pillar [Sanemi Shinazugawa](https://anilist.co/character/137774). ~! Due to his lack of breath forms he is dependent on using his shotgun and demon form. His shotgun pelts are made from sun steel to be effective against demons. His demon form is active when he digests anything from a demon to gain demon like strength and abilities. He is the only demon hunter to have this ability given that it is drastically rare !~', '/uploads/images/c_137776.jpg'),
(148, 'Obanai Iguro', '伊黒小芭内', '配角', 'Kenichi Suzumura', '__Height:__ 162 cm (5''3") Obanai is a Demon Slayer and the Snake Pillar of the Demon Slayer Corps. A young man of short stature and a pale complexion. He has straight-edged black hair of varying lengths, the longest reaching down to his shoulders and the shortest stopping at his cheekbones, which he wears down with two shorter strands hanging between his eyes. He wears a navy blue version of the standard Demon Slayer uniform, along with a black and white pinstriped haori, the hem and cuffs of which are striped lengthways rather than vertically, which covers his hands. Obanai also sports bandages in place of the leg-wraps around his calves, as well as another set of bandages that cover his mouth, and blue-strapped zori on his feet. He is also always seen with his white snake, Kaburamaru, wrapped around his shoulders.', '/uploads/images/c_137777.jpg'),
(148, 'Gyoumei Himejima', '悲鳴嶼行冥', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', '__Height:__ 220cm (7''2½") He is a Demon Slayer and the Stone Hashira of the Demon Slayer Corps. Gyomei also serves as the mentor of Genya Shinazugawa.', '/uploads/images/c_137778.jpg'),
(148, 'Kagaya Ubuyashiki', '産屋敷耀哉', '配角', 'Toshiyuki Morikawa', 'He is the head of the Ubuyashiki Family and 97th leader of the Demon Slayer Corps known mainly as "Oyakata-sama" ("Master") by his subordinates and peers.', '/uploads/images/c_137808.png'),
(148, 'Matsuemon Tennouji', '天王寺松右衛門', '配角', '', 'Kasugai Crow assigned to Tanjirou Kamado. Very intelligent and seems to have a large ego.', '/uploads/images/c_137810.png'),
(148, 'Kanao Tsuyuri', '栗花落カナヲ', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 156 cm (5''1½") Kanao Tsuyuri is a Demon Hunter and the Tsuguko, who is personally looked after by the Demon Killing Corps'' Pillars. She uses Flower Breathing. ~!When Kanao is first introduced, she is an indecisive and quiet girl due to the abuse she endured in her past before meeting the Kocho sisters. She became unable to make decisions by herself and repressed her emotions as a defense mechanism. In order to help rectify this, Kanae gave her a coin to flip to decide which path to follow when she didn''t know what to do. Later on, Tanjiro helps Kanao overcome her indecisiveness and Kanao soon becomes more confident in making decisions with or without her coin. Kanao and Tanjiro would eventually marry and start a family, having two great-great-grandchildren by the names of [Kanata Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/171144/Kanata-Kamado) and [Sumihiko Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/171145/Sumihiko-Kamado) between them.!~', '/uploads/images/c_139038.png'),
(148, 'Enmu', '魘夢', '主角', 'Daisuke Hirakawa', '__Race:__ Demon __Height:__ 168 cm (5''6") Enmu is a sadistic and cruel demon Who is only driven by his liking to making humans suffer. He is shown to be completely loyal to [Muzan](https://anilist.co/character/129132/Kibutsuji-Muzan). Caring about him probably more than what he cares about himself. He also hates the other lower moons, labeling them as "Fools". ~!Enmu was a member of the Twelve Demon Moons, having held the position of Lower Moon One.!~ ~!Enmu was aboard the infinity train, and starts eating humans in order to make himself more powerful. He knocks them unconscious, promising them that he will gift them with nice and peaceful dreams but in reality, after giving them a nice dream, he always likes to follow it up with a horrifying nightmare because he thinks it is so much fun.!~ ~!In the end, Tanjiro''s Hinokami Kagura cuts through Enmu''s train spine and kills him.!~', '/uploads/images/c_139737.png'),
(148, 'Akaza', '猗窩座', '配角', 'Akira Ishida', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") A member of the Twelve Demon Moons, holding the position of Upper Moon Three.', '/uploads/images/c_141694.png'),
(148, 'Ruka Rengoku', '煉獄瑠火', '配角', 'Megumi Toyoguchi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_193378.jpg'),
(148, 'Shinjurou Rengoku', '煉獄槇寿郎', '配角', 'Rikiya Koyama', 'Father of Kyoujurou and Senjurou.', '/uploads/images/c_193379.jpg'),
(148, 'Senjurou Rengoku', '煉獄千寿郎', '配角', 'Junya Enoki', 'Younger brother of Kyoujurou Rengoku and son of Shinjurou Rengoku and Ruka Rengoku.', '/uploads/images/c_193380.png'),
(148, 'Kie Kamado', '竈門葵枝', '配角', 'Houko Kuwashima', 'Kie is Tanjiro Kamado''s mother.', '/uploads/images/c_196849.png'),
(148, 'Shigeru Kamado', '竈門茂', '配角', 'Kaede Hondo', 'Shigeru was Tanjiro''s second youngest brother.', '/uploads/images/c_196851.png'),
(148, 'Takeo Kamado', '竈門竹雄', '配角', 'You Taichi', 'Takeo was Tanjiro Kamado''s first younger brother.', '/uploads/images/c_196852.png'),
(148, 'Hanako Kamado', '竈門花子', '配角', 'Konomi Kohara', 'Hanako was Tanjiro Kamado''s youngest sister.', '/uploads/images/c_196853.png'),
(148, 'Tanjurou Kamado', '竈門炭十郎', '配角', 'Shinichirou Miki', 'Tanjuro Kamadou was the husband of Kie Kamado and the late father of Tanjiro, Nezuko, Takeo, Hanako, Shigeru, and Rokuta. Tanjuro was a quiet, calculating, forgiving, charismatic and loving person. He had a peaceful relationship with his family and regularly lectured Tanjiro about life. While he appeared calm on the outside, he showed a decent, noble aura with a quiet perception to his surroundings. According to his son, he did not like standing out or displaying his true abilities to others. However, if his family is in danger, he would not hesitate to protect them and shows no mercy towards the enemy. ~!Despite not being a Demon Slayer and having a tragic disease that makes his body incredibly frail, Tanjuro was shown to be a phenomenally strong individual. He was born with a demon slayer mark on his forehead, had the ability to access the transparent world, and was constantly using the selfless state.!~', '/uploads/images/c_206330.png'),
(148, 'Rokuta Kamado', '竈門六太', '配角', 'Aoi Koga', 'Tanjiro''s youngest sibling.', '/uploads/images/c_207857.jpg'),
(148, 'Amane Ubuyashiki', '産屋敷あまね', '配角', 'Rina Satou', '__Height:__ 167cm (5''6") She is the wife and caretaker of [Kagaya Ubuyashiki](https://anilist.co/character/137808/Kagaya-Ubuyashiki) and the mother of Hinaki Ubuyashiki, Nichika Ubuyashiki, Kiriya Ubuyashiki, Kanata Ubuyashiki and Kuina Ubuyashiki. Her maiden name is Amane Himorogi.', '/uploads/images/c_221375.jpg'),
(148, 'Kikanshi', '機関士', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', 'A train engineer appears as a minor antagonist in the Mugen Train Arc of Kimetsu No Yaiba. He is a civilian recruited by Enmu to be the train engineer of the Mugen Train.', '/uploads/images/c_310303.jpg'),
(148, 'Shashou', '車掌', '配角', 'Jun  Kasama', 'A train conductor appeared as a minor antagonist in the Mugen Train Arc of Kimetsu No Yaiba. He was a civilian who was recruited by Enmu to trap the Demon Slayers into his Blood Demon Art.', '/uploads/images/c_310305.jpg'),
(149, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Jouji Nakata', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(149, 'Anos Voldigoad', 'アノス・ヴォルディゴード', '主角', 'Tatsuhisa Suzuki', '__Species:__ Mixed Blood (currently), Demon (formerly) Anos is the reincarnation of the man who was feared as the Demon King of Tyranny 2,000 years ago. He is resolute, stalwart, and invincible. His absolute power instils a veritable self-confidence that is only surpassed by his ego. Because of his overwhelming prowess, Anos possesses an easy going attitude and an unrivalled sense of perseverance when facing any challenge that may come his way. Despite his title as the Demon King, Anos has a definitive moral compass and generally has a kind and caring outlook. He takes a great interest in the well-being of not only his family, but also his subordinates and followers, and is quick to reward them for their loyalty. He is willing to go through great lengths to assist in their development, in order for them to reach their full potential. Other people may see him as cruel, but his personal creed is not to kill people needlessly. Even if he would never admit it, Anos is very protective of his fellow subordinates and followers. While Anos is not inherently evil, his chaotic and sometimes ruthless methods when dealing with his enemies, earned him his title. While he originally never proclaimed himself as the Demon King, he has openly embraced it as the rest of the world views him as such. Those who oppose him, fear his power, and are threatened by the mere fact that a single man possesses such power. (Source: Maou Gakuin wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_138595.png'),
(149, 'Misha Necron', 'ミーシャ・ネクロン', '主角', 'Tomori Kusunoki', 'Misha is a student at Delzogade, the Demon King Academy. She quickly becomes friends with [Anos](https://anilist.co/character/138595/Voldigoad-Anos) after they meet. Her magic power is quite high among most students at Delzogade.', '/uploads/images/c_138596.png'),
(149, 'Kanon', 'カノン', '配角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', 'Kanon is a hero that battles against Anos. He seems to have a mutual respect with Anos, with both of them understanding each other. Before Anos was slain by Kanon, Anos wished they could be friends in 2000 years, should they ever meet.', '/uploads/images/c_138598.png'),
(149, 'Izabella', 'イザベラ', '配角', 'Aki Toyosaki', 'The mother of reincarnated Anos. She cares for [Anos](https://anilist.co/character/138595/Voldigoad-Anos), loving him constantly. She is married to [Gusta](https://anilist.co/character/139560/Raizeo-Gusta). When Anos brings home [Misha](https://anilist.co/character/138596/Necron-Misha), Izabella is quick to jump the gun and assumes that Anos is together with Misha. She decides that is the case and supports it through and through.', '/uploads/images/c_139557.jpg'),
(149, 'Emilia Ludowell', 'エミリア・ルードウェル', '配角', 'Ami Koshimizu', 'The homeroom teacher of the class [Anos](https://anilist.co/character/138595/Voldigoad-Anos) is in. Initially, Emilia holds no respect towards Anos; however, that changes after he proves himself to her.', '/uploads/images/c_139558.png'),
(149, 'Zepes Indu', 'ゼペス・インドゥ', '配角', 'Takuya Eguchi', 'Considered a demon duke by some, Zepes is an arrogant student at Delzogade. He is the younger brother of Leorig Indu.', '/uploads/images/c_139559.png'),
(149, 'Gusta Raizeo', 'グスタ・ライゼオ', '配角', 'Shinobu Matsumoto', 'The father of reincarnated Anos. As a father, he cares for Anos and is accepting of his abilities. He is also married to Izabella. When Anos brought Misha to his place, Gusta figured Anos hooked up with Misha, accepting it right away; even willing to distract Issabelle so they can do the deed, to Anos'' dismay.', '/uploads/images/c_139560.png'),
(149, 'Leorig Indu', 'リオルグ・インドゥ', '配角', 'Shinnosuke Tachibana', 'A pure-blood descendant of the Demon Lord. Leorig dislikes disgraceful people that tarnish the pure-blood descendants of the Demon Lord. He is also the older brother of Zepis Indu. Like his brother, he is arrogant, but not to the same extent.', '/uploads/images/c_139561.png'),
(149, 'Sasha Necron', 'サーシャ・ネクロン', '主角', 'Yuuko Natsuyoshi', 'A member of the House of Necron and direct descendant of [Ivis Necron](https://anilist.co/character/186471/Necron-Ivis). Sasha Necron is called the, "Witch of Destruction," by others. She has the Demon Eyes of Destruction, which allow her to destroy anything she chooses within her field of view. Sasha is the older sister of [Misha Necron](https://anilist.co/character/138596/Necron-Misha). Sasha has a cold personality towards her sister, calling her a, "defective doll." Towards others, she acts superior and above them, due to her status. Though she does act as such, she is able to respect others and be friendly towards them.', '/uploads/images/c_139562.png'),
(149, 'Dai Seirei Reno', '大精霊レノ', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_186470.png'),
(149, 'Ivis Necron', 'アイヴィス・ネクロン', '配角', 'Ryoutarou Okiayu', 'One of the Seven Elder Demon Emperors created by Anos, as well as the head of the Necron family.', '/uploads/images/c_186471.png'),
(149, 'Shin Reglia', 'シン・レグリア', '配角', 'Wataru Hatano', 'Right hand of Demon King [Anos Voldigoad](https://anilist.co/character/138595) and the most powerful swordsman among the demons.', '/uploads/images/c_186472.png'),
(149, 'Eugo La Raviaz', 'エウゴ・ラ・ラヴィアズ', '配角', 'Masaki Terasoma', '**Eugo La Raviaz** is the Guardian God of Time, and has the appearance of the traditional Grim Reaper, wearing a long black cloak while wielding a scythe.', '/uploads/images/c_186474.png'),
(149, 'Lay Glanzudlii', 'レイ・グランズドリィ', '配角', 'Takuma Terashima', 'Lay Glanzudlii is a member of the Generation of Chaos, commonly known as "The Demon Sword Saint" and a transfer student at Demon King Academy. ~!He is the reincarnation of the Hero Kanon.!~', '/uploads/images/c_186477.png'),
(149, 'Sheila Glanzudlii', 'シーラ・グランズドリィ', '配角', 'Ayako Kawasumi', '[Lay Glanzudlii](https://anilist.co/character/186477/Lay-Glanzudlii) adoptive mother.', '/uploads/images/c_186478.png'),
(149, 'Misa Ilioroagu', 'ミサ・イリオローグ', '配角', 'Nene Hieda', '**Misa Ilioroagu** is Anos'' classmate, and shows herself as skeptical about the current society in which pure-blooded demons are favored. ~!She is the spirit that was formed from the rumors and traditions of the fictional Demon King Avos Dilhevia!~ ~!She is the daughter of Great Spirit Reno and Spirit King Shin Regalia.!~', '/uploads/images/c_187851.png'),
(149, 'Eleonore Bianca', 'エレオノール・ビアンカ', '配角', 'Sayumi Watabe', 'Eleonore is a humanoid magic. She specializes in root magic and is able to create root clones (Zeshia & Diego). She harbours no ill feelings towards the demons and is considered a failure due to her lack of hatred towards the demons. ~!She later becomes Anos'' magic.!~', '/uploads/images/c_187852.png'),
(149, 'Melheis Boran', 'メルヘイス・ボラン', '配角', 'Houchuu Ootsuka', 'Melheis Boran is one of the Seven Elder Demon Emperors created by Anos Voldigoad.', '/uploads/images/c_189405.png'),
(149, 'Gaios Anzem', 'ガイオス・アンゼム', '配角', 'Tetsu Inada', 'Gaios Anzem is one of the Seven Elder Demon Emperors created by Anos Voldigoad.', '/uploads/images/c_189406.png'),
(149, 'Ydol Anzeo', 'イドル・アンゼオ', '配角', 'Kousuke Toriumi', 'Ydol Anzeo is one of the Seven Elder Demon Emperors created by Anos Voldigoad.', '/uploads/images/c_189407.png'),
(149, 'Minsheng Xia', 'シア・ミンシェン', '配角', 'Yume Miyamoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_190112.png'),
(149, 'Nono Inota', 'ノノ・イノータ', '配角', 'Haruka Shiraishi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_190113.png'),
(149, 'Maia Zemut', 'マイア・ゼムト', '配角', 'Yuuko Oono', 'Maia Zemut is a student of the Demon King Academy and a member of the Anos Fan Union.', '/uploads/images/c_190114.png'),
(149, 'Elen Mihais', 'エレン・ミハイス', '配角', 'Kaori Ishihara', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_190115.png'),
(149, 'Himka Houra', 'ヒムカ・ホウラ', '配角', 'Sayumi Suzushiro', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_190116.png'),
