(149, 'Jessica Arnet', 'ジェシカ・アーネート', '配角', 'Madoka Asahina', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_190118.png'),
(149, 'Carsa Kurnoah', 'カーサ・クルノア', '配角', 'Tomomi Mineuchi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_190119.png'),
(149, 'Laos Kanon Jilfor', 'ラオス・カノン・ジルフォー', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', 'Rank 4 of the Hero Academy and member of the Jerga Kanon class.', '/uploads/images/c_203500.png'),
(149, 'Krut Ludowell', 'クルト・ルードウェル', '配角', 'Tarusuke Shingaki', 'Emilia''s older brother and the previous champion of the Magic Sword Tournament.', '/uploads/images/c_211742.png'),
(149, 'Menou Historia', 'メノウ・ヒストリア', '配角', 'Ai Kakuma', 'A teacher in the Demon King Academy and the homeroom teacher of the 3rd year class 1. ~!She becomes the temporary homeroom teacher of Anos''s class after Emilia''s resignation.!~', '/uploads/images/c_211743.png'),
(149, 'Revest Aynie', 'リーベスト・エイニー', '配角', 'Wataru Komada', 'A student from Class 3-1 of the Demon King Academy. He holds a great respect for the founder, and antagonizes Anos for claiming to be him while not matching his image or personality.', '/uploads/images/c_211744.png'),
(149, 'Militia', 'ミリティア', '配角', '', 'The God of Creation, responsible for the creation of the world. Along with the Demon King Anos, the Hero Kanon and the Great Spirit Reno she created the four great walls that divided the world until the hate between the four races would fade away.', '/uploads/images/c_211745.png'),
(149, 'Heine Kanon Iorg', 'ハイネ・カノン・イオルグ', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', 'Rank 3 of the Hero Academy and member of the Jerga-Kanon class.', '/uploads/images/c_211754.png'),
(149, 'Ledriano Kanon Azeschen', 'レドリアーノ・カノン・アゼスチェン', '配角', 'Ryouhei Kimura', 'Rank 2 of the Hero Academy and member of the Jerga-Kanon class.', '/uploads/images/c_211755.png'),
(149, 'Zeshia Bianca', 'ゼシア・ビアンカ', '配角', 'Misaki Kuno', 'Rank 1 of the Hero Academy and member of the Jerga Kanon class. ~!She''s in truth a massed produced humanoid magic created by Eleonore.!~', '/uploads/images/c_211756.png'),
(149, 'Diego Kanon Ijaysica', 'ディエゴ・カノン・イジェイシカ', '配角', 'Mitsuru Miyamoto', 'The director of the Hero Academy and homeroom of the Selection Class "Jerga Kanon". ~!Like Zeshia, he''s in truth humanoid magic created by Eleonore.!~', '/uploads/images/c_211757.png'),
(149, 'Medoin Garsa', 'メドイン・ガーサ', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', 'One of the Seven Elder Demon Emperors created by Anos.', '/uploads/images/c_211758.png'),
(149, 'Zorro Angart', 'ゾロ・アンガート', '配角', 'Shinichirou Miki', 'One of the Seven Elder Demon Emperors created by Anos.', '/uploads/images/c_211759.png'),
(149, 'Eldora Zaia', 'エルドラ・ザイア', '配角', 'Hikaru Midorikawa', 'One of the Seven Elder Demon Emperors created by Anos.', '/uploads/images/c_211760.png'),
(149, 'Jerga', 'ジェルガ', '配角', 'Akio Ootsuka', 'The general of the demon King Subjugation Army, as well as the mentor of the hero Kanon. Possesses a deep hatred against the demon race after they killed his family. ~!Due disagreeing with the idea of Kanon of making peace with the demon race, he murdered his own student. Later, he created the Hero Academy as a way to assure his hatred and animosity for demons would never be forgotten. Before dying, he divided his root into two; one half was fused with the spell Asc (making anyone who used it develop the same hatred for demons that Jerga did), while the other was used to create the humanoid magic Eleanore. In the 13th episode, Diego revives him as the spell Demon Judgement Jerga, turning him into a gigant made of Holy Magic unable to be killed by conventional means.!~', '/uploads/images/c_211764.png'),
(149, 'Elio Ludowell', 'エリオ・ルードウェル', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', 'The Demon Lord ruling the city of Midhayes, as well as the father of Krut and Emilia.', '/uploads/images/c_211765.png'),
(150, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Yutaka Aoyama', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(150, 'Kaguya Shinomiya', '四宮かぐや', '主角', 'Aoi Koga', '__Height:__ 158 cm The vice president of the student council of Shuchiin Academy, member of the wealthy Shinomiya family, she is a multi-talented genius who can do anything if she sets her mind to it. Due to the way she was raised, she instinctively looks down on others and thinks of ways to use them for her own benefit. Kaguya rarely interacted with other people before she joined the student council, but that has begun to change. She is an incredibly sheltered girl, resulting in her lacking in several pieces of what might be considered common sense. She still doesn’t understand love very well, and her main objective is to make [Miyuki Shirogane](https://anilist.co/character/121101) fall in love and confess to her. Later in the series: ~!She confesses her love to Miyuki Shirogane and they start dating.!~ ~!In a Oshi no Ko special chapter, it was revealed that she married Miyuki and changed her surname to Kaguya Shirogane!~', '/uploads/images/c_120649.png'),
(150, 'Miyuki Shirogane', '白銀御行', '主角', 'Makoto Furukawa', '__Height:__ 175 cm He is a second year student at Shuchi''in Academy and the president of the student council. Miyuki is a handsome young man with blond hair and blue eyes. Due to his constant sleep deprivation and nearsightedness, his eyes appear to glare. He usually wears the regular Shuchi''in Academy black male uniform adorned with the Aiguilette, the golden chain-like accessory around his neck. The Aiguilette symbolizes his authority as student council president. Shirogane is a diligent student who, despite his underprivileged background, climbed his way to the top of his class through hard work and determination. Shirogane holds himself in high regard, consistently working to maintain his perfect image. He is textbook workaholic, enjoying his part-time job and often putting his own health at risk for the sake of his work. Due to his poor background, Shirogane values money greatly and goes to great lengths to not be wasteful, and generally dislikes expensive gifts. ~!Miyuki''s mother left his family when he was a child. Miyuki''s father''s factory was shut down and currently has no stable employment. They live in an apartment that costs ￥50,000 (Approx $450) a month. Due to this grisly past, he has been led to a lifestyle of part time jobs and hard work. He passed the Level 2 Kanji Kentei exam and has passed Grade Pre 1 on Eiken. He has also got second place on the National mock exam.!~ ~!Miyuki transferred into Shuchi''in Academy during his first year of high school on a scho', '/uploads/images/c_121101.png'),
(150, 'Yuu Ishigami', '石上優', '主角', 'Ryouta Suzuki', 'The treasurer of the student council of the Shuchiin Academy. He''s extremely valued by [Miyuki](https://anilist.co/character/121101), given that he single-handedly manages all the school''s funds. He''s also terrified of [Kaguya](https://anilist.co/character/120649), though no one else is sure why that is. Yuu keeps to himself and rarely speaks up, often getting into trouble when he does. He has a depressed outlook on life while having an inferiority complex. In contrast to his attitude, he is willing to help those in need and will sacrifice his pride if need be. Unlike his high school self, he had a much different outlook and demeanor during middle school. Later in the series: ~!Ishigami develops a crush on Tsubame that he inadvertently confesses his feelings for her at the school''s cultural festival. Ishigami does not realize that his actions were perceived as a confession by the rest of the student body and is therefore oblivious to the implications of having given Tsubame a heart-shaped gift (considered akin to a confession in Shuchiin tradition). After some convincing by Kaguya, Tsubame decides to seriously consider Ishigami''s confession, with her original intention being to let him down as gently as possible. It isn''t until Ishigami watches Tsubame''s performance of the traditional play that gave rise to the aforementioned tradition that he realizes his actions had unintended meaning. Even then, Ishigami''s thickheaded nature prevented him from recognizing the full meaning ', '/uploads/images/c_121102.png'),
(150, 'Chika Fujiwara', '藤原千花', '主角', 'Konomi Kohara', 'The secretary of the Shuchiin Academy student council. She could not be predicted, her thoughts could not be read. A natural disaster who unconsciously threw everything into chaos simply by being present, also known as __Subject F__. ~!In chapter 222 of the manga, Chika reveals that she played piano because she wanted to be perfect, and she becomes a prodigy at the piano. The expectations of her family and her fans rose, forcing her to practice more. She quit piano after Kaguya told her to just quit if she didn''t like the piano. Soon after Chika challenged Kaguya to a game battle and if she won, she would get to become Kaguya''s friend. In the end, she becomes Kaguya''s first friend.!~', '/uploads/images/c_121103.png'),
(150, 'Ai Hayasaka', '早坂愛', '配角', 'Yumiri Hanamori', 'Ai Hayasaka is a second-year student at Shuchiin Academy and a valet of the Shinomiya family. She is a member of the Hayasaka family, who have served the Shinomiya family for generations, gaining their trust. Having been personally assigned to enter Shuchiin Academy with her, Ai supports [Kaguya Shinomiya](https://anilist.co/character/120649) in her high school life and has been a part of Kaguya''s life for ten years. Because of their close relationship, Ai is one of the few people around to which Kaguya''s amiability is not an act. Even if she demonstrates maturity as a valet, Ai still has the concerns of a young girl, such as caring to be in fashion and going out with friends, even if she does not have much time for herself due to work. Ai helps Kaguya with the struggles about her feelings for [Shirogane](https://anilist.co/character/121101). ~!She later leaves her job as a maid to Kaguya but still continues her friendship.!~ ~!In the Doujin-ban universe, she starts dating and later gets engaged to Shirogane!~', '/uploads/images/c_121104.png'),
(150, 'Miko Iino', '伊井野ミコ', '主角', 'Miyu Tomita', '__Height:__ 147 cm (4''7") She is a freshman at Shuchiin Private Academy and the Auditor of the Student Council. Miko has a strong sense of justice and will correct others on what''s right and wrong. Unfortunately, this led to her being bullied, though she still continues to uphold her idea of "right". She idolizes [Chika Fujiwara](https://anilist.co/character/121103), listening to anything she says, even if it''s for Chika''s enjoyment.', '/uploads/images/c_125886.png'),
(150, 'Kei Shirogane', '白銀圭', '配角', 'Sayumi Suzushiro', 'Kei Shirogane is [Miyuki Shirogane''s](https://anilist.co/character/121101) little sister. She attends Shuchiin middle school and is the treasurer for the middle school student council. She is a hard worker just like her brother and can be very prideful at times. She also inherited his sense of righteousness and hates it when someone doesn''t do the right thing in a given situation. Like her brother, she likes helping out those who are in trouble even if it means going out of her way to do it. Since she grew up in a family that places emphasis on saving money, she normally carries coupons and works hard for the things she wants to buy. She developed a prickly attitude towards her brother due to his over protectiveness. She''s also entered a rebellious phase and due to her pride and she cannot get herself to have a lighthearted conversation with Miyuki, leading into the similar mind games that Miyuki and [Kaguya](https://anilist.co/character/120649) play against each other, but her objective is to talk to Miyuki without making it look like she has a brother complex. She rarely speaks and most of the time it is only when she exchanges formalities at school or when she hurls abuses at her brother.', '/uploads/images/c_126144.png'),
(150, 'Erika Kose', '巨瀬工リカ', '配角', 'Ayaka Asai', 'She is a member of the mass media club at Shuchi''in Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_126986.png'),
(150, 'Karen Kino', '紀かれん', '配角', 'Madoka Asahina', 'She is a member of the mass media club at Shuchi''in Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_126987.png'),
(150, 'Tsubame Koyasu', '子安つばめ', '配角', 'Haruka Fukuhara', 'Tsubame is a third-year student who is vice-captain of the cheer squad and a rhythmic gymnast. She is very popular. She encourages [Yuu](https://anilist.co/character/121102) in the cheering activities.', '/uploads/images/c_134326.png'),
(150, 'Tsubasa Tanuma ', '田沼翼', '配角', 'Taku Yashiro', 'He is a student in Shuchi''in highschool and always asks [Miyuki Shirogane](https://anilist.co/character/121101) for advice about love. [Kashiwagi](https://anilist.co/character/134330)''s boyfriend.', '/uploads/images/c_134327.png'),
(150, 'Maki Shijo', '四条眞妃', '配角', 'Kana Ichinose', 'Maki is a classmate and friend of [Nagisa](https://anilist.co/character/134330). She has short hair styled in short pigtails. She is friends with Nagisa and is secretly jealous of Nagisa''s relationship with her boyfriend, as she too liked Kashiwagi''s Boyfriend, but could not confess before. As a branch member of the Shinomiya clan, she is [Kaguya](https://anilist.co/character/120649)''s second cousin twice removed so she sometimes refers to Kaguya as "Auntie". [Miyuki](https://anilist.co/character/121101) and [Yuu](https://anilist.co/character/121102/Yuu-Ishigami) observe she acts very tsundere (cold on the outside but wanting to be affectionate), and similar to Kaguya in personality. She declares Yuu and Miyuki as her friends, due to their support in helping her process her failed romance, much to Kaguya''s horror', '/uploads/images/c_134328.png'),
(150, 'Moeha Fujiwara', '藤原萌葉', '配角', 'Ari Ozawa', 'Moeha is [Chika](https://anilist.co/character/121103)''s little sister who is in junior high. She is the student council vice-president at the junior high. She admires [Miyuki](https://anilist.co/character/121101) as well and hopes to confess someday. She has a habit of voicing dark ideas, which unnerve [Kaguya](https://anilist.co/character/120649) a great deal.', '/uploads/images/c_134329.png'),
(150, 'Nagisa Kashiwagi', '柏木渚', '配角', 'Momo Asakura', 'Nagisa is a classmate who occasionally asks [Kaguya](https://anilist.co/character/120649) about what to do in her relationships. [Tsubasa](https://anilist.co/character/134327)''s girlfriend.', '/uploads/images/c_134330.png'),
(150, 'Kobachi Osaragi', '大仏こばち', '配角', 'Rina Hidaka', 'Kobachi is [Miko](https://anilist.co/character/125886)''s classmate with the glasses and a member of the disciplinary committee. She has been looking after Miko for over 10 years. ~!Though she doesn''t love him in a romantic way, she has liked Yu Ishigami since middle school. She believes that Tsubame Koyasu is a kind person and is therefore supportive of Ishigami''s feelings for Tsubame, despite her friend Miko being in love with Ishigami as well.!~', '/uploads/images/c_134331.png'),
(150, 'Adolphe Pescarolo', 'アドルフ・ペスカローロ', '配角', 'Itaru Yamamoto', 'The Principal of Shuchi''in Academy He''s strict regarding school regulations, but knows how to garner the favor of students nonetheless. He helped Yu Ishigami get enrolled to Shuchi''in despite not finishing his task of making an apology letter. Despite being an authority figure within the school, he has shown comical disregard for school rules and discipline when it comes to his own actions, having been openly caught playing Pokemon Go on more than one occasion on school grounds while chastising nearby students for doing the same.', '/uploads/images/c_134892.jpg'),
(150, 'Shirogane no Chichi', '白銀の父', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', 'Father of [Miyuki](https://anilist.co/character/121101) and [Kei Shirogane](https://anilist.co/character/126144). ~!His wife left him and their factory shut down leaving him to not have any stable employment.!~ ~!He later becomes a youtuber.!~', '/uploads/images/c_134893.jpg'),
(150, 'Rei Onodera', '小野寺麗', '配角', 'Yuuki Takada', 'She is a supporting character in the series. She was a member of Shuchi''in''s Red Cheer Team and is a classmate of Yu Ishigami and Miko Iino. She is a fairly calm girl under normal circumstances and is fairly open-minded, but when involved with the Cheer Team or the culture festival committee, she becomes far more energetic.', '/uploads/images/c_157369.png'),
(150, 'Kyoko Ootomo', '大友京子', '配角', 'Reina Ueda', 'She was [Ishigami](https://anilist.co/character/121102/)''s classmate in their last middle school year. She dated Kou Ogino, who cheated on her without her knowledge.', '/uploads/images/c_175432.png'),
(150, 'Kou Ogino', '荻野コウ', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', 'Former president of Shuchiin Junior High''s theater club. Kyoko Ootomo''s ex-boyfriend.', '/uploads/images/c_175438.jpg'),
(150, 'Kazeno', '風野', '配角', 'Taishi Murata', 'Kazeno is a third year high school student at Shuchi''in Academy and was the captain of the Cheer Club during the Sports Festival. He is a very energetic and caring person,cheering on his team and giving support to Yu Ishigami.', '/uploads/images/c_176218.jpg'),
(150, 'Kozue Makihara ', '槇原こずえ', '配角', 'Marika Kouno', 'Makkii-senhai is a first-year high school student at Shuchi''in Academy and the president of the Tabletop Gaming Club, As the president of the Tabletop Gaming Club, Kozue loves games. She also has a somewhat sadistic sense of humor, as shown by her cheerfully torturing Miko while gathering audio for their class'' event during the culture festival. She is shown to be very intelligent, regularly ranking among the top ten students in the freshman class during the end of semester exams.', '/uploads/images/c_176219.jpg'),
(150, 'Terashima', '寺島', '配角', 'Rina Honizumi', 'She''s a third-year high school student at Shuchi''in Academy and a member of the Tabletop Gaming Club which Chika Fujiwara is also a part of. Terashima, being demoted from Terako to Gigako, is a pun on metric prefixes', '/uploads/images/c_176220.png'),
(150, 'Daichi Fujiwara', '藤原大地', '配角', 'Hirohiko Kakegawa', 'A politician and the father of Toyomi, Chika and Moeha Fujiwara. Daichi is very well mannered and professional. He’s also overly protective of his daughters.', '/uploads/images/c_177065.jpg'),
(150, 'Shouzou Tanuma', '田沼正造', '配角', 'Junpei Morita', 'Shouzou Tanuma is a world famous heart surgeon and the physician of the Shinomiya family. He is also Tsubasa''s grandfather', '/uploads/images/c_177066.jpg'),
(150, 'Gou Kazamatsuri', '風祭豪', '配角', '', 'Like Shirogane, he attended an outside middle school before entering Shuchiin. He enrolled in order to look for clues regarding the disappearance of his older brother. He serves as an assistant to the "Investigator of the financial world" Hajime Echizen and, after solving many difficult cases has finally been reunited with his brother.', '/uploads/images/c_275098.jpg'),
(150, 'Pes', 'ペス', '配角', 'Yuuki Ishikari', 'Pes is the beloved pet dog of [Chika Fujiwara](https://anilist.co/character/121103/Chika-Fujiwara). He is quite a large dog, with golden fur and floppy ears. He has piercing eyes like [the president](https://anilist.co/character/121101/Miyuki-Shirogane)', '/uploads/images/c_275599.jpg'),
(150, 'Saburou Toyosaki', '豊崎三郎', '配角', '', 'In the past, he used underhanded tactics to sabotage [Shirogane](https://anilist.co/character/121101/)''s grades, but he now fights fair and square. He only opens his eyes when he shows his "true power."', '/uploads/images/c_275620.jpg'),
(150, 'Subaru Suruga', '駿河すばる', '配角', 'Yuuka Morishima', 'One of [Ai Hayasaka](https://anilist.co/character/121104/)''s closest friends. She wears her Shuchi''in Academy school uniform modified to match up with kogal fashion. She is the daughter of the president of an IT company.', '/uploads/images/c_276146.jpg'),
(150, 'Mirin Hinokuchi', '火口三鈴', '配角', 'Yuka Nukui', 'One of [Ai Hayasaka](https://anilist.co/character/121104/)''s closest friends. She wears her Shuchi''in Academy school uniform modified to match up with kogal fashion. She is the daughter of an advertising executive.', '/uploads/images/c_276147.jpg'),
(150, 'Nayotake Shimizu', '清水名夜竹', '配角', '', '~![Kaguya Shinomiya](https://anilist.co/character/120649/)''s mother. She died 30th of January, 29 days after giving birth to Kaguya.!~ ~!In Chapter 242, it was revealed that she worked in Gion''s red light district as a prostitute.!~', '/uploads/images/c_276148.jpg'),
(151, 'Megumi Fushiguro', '伏黒恵', '主角', 'Yuuma Uchida', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") __Occupation:__ Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 2 Sorcerer __Cursed Technique:__ 10 Shadows Megumi is the deuteragonist of the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is a first-year student at Jujutsu High and also a descendant of the Zenin Family. While outwardly stoic and calculating, Megumi wishes to help protect people he sees as good or kind. He believes that the world is unfair and that a Sorcerer is a tool to ensure kind people are given more chances to live. Claiming it to be his selfish and irrational desire, he does not see himself as a hero for doing this.', '/uploads/images/c_126635.png'),
(151, 'Yuuji Itadori', '虎杖悠仁', '主角', 'Junya Enoki', '**Species:** Human **Height:** 173 cm (5''8") **Occupation:** Sorcerer, Student, Vessel **Affiliation:** Jujutsu High Yuuji is a fair person who cares greatly for not only his comrades but anyone he views as people with their own wills, despite how deep or shallow his connection to them is. He cares greatly for the "value of a life" and to this end, he will ensure that others receive a "proper death." He is easy to anger in the face of pure cruelty and unfair judgment of other people. He doesn''t have the born talent required to use cursed techniques, but he has incredible athletic abilities and he is considered very strong for his age, as shown by when he easily beat a coach in Steel Ball Throw.', '/uploads/images/c_127212.png'),
(151, 'Satoru Gojou', '五条悟', '主角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Height:__ 190 cm (6''3") __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer, Teacher __Affiliation:__ Tokyo Metropolitan Curse Technical College, Gojou Family __Grade:__ Special Grade Sorcerer __Cursed Technique:__ Six Eyes, Limitless Satoru Gojou is one of the main protagonists of the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is a special-grade jujutsu sorcerer and is widely recognized as the strongest in the world. Satoru is the pride of the Gojou Family, the first person to inherit both the Limitless and the Six Eyes in four hundred years. He works as a teacher at the Tokyo Jujutsu High and uses his influence to protect and train strong young allies', '/uploads/images/c_127691.png'),
(151, 'Yuuta Okkotsu', '乙骨憂太', '配角', '', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Special Grade Sorcerer The main protagonist of Jujutsu Kaisen prequel series [Tokyo Metropolitan Curse Technical School](https://anilist.co/manga/105469/Tokyo-Toritsu-Jujutsu-Kodo-Senmon-Gakko). He was initially a Special Grade Cursed Victim haunted by his late childhood friend, [Rika Orimoto](https://anilist.co/character/208533/Orimoto-Rika). [Satoru Gojou](https://anilist.co/character/127691/Satoru-Gojou) mentored Yuuta and enrolled him at Tokyo Jujutsu High.', '/uploads/images/c_129571.jpg'),
(151, 'Suguru Getou', '夏油傑', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 183 cm __Occupation:__ Curse User __Grade:__ Special Grade Curse User __Cursed Technique:__ Cursed Spirit Manipulation Suguru Getou is an antagonist in both the Jujutsu Kaisen series and its prequel Jujutsu Kaisen 0: Jujutsu High. ~!He was originally a student of [Masamichi Yaga](https://anilist.co/character/189237/Yaga-Masamichi)''s alongside [Satoru Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691/Gojou-Satoru) and [Shoko Ieiri](https://anilist.co/character/158154/Ieiri-Shouko) at Tokyo Jujutsu High. His experiences as a jujutsu sorcerer bred a deep hatred for non-sorcerers, leading to an incident where Suguru massacred over a hundred civilians in a single night, later being expelled from Jujutsu High and called for immediate execution as a result.!~', '/uploads/images/c_133699.png'),
(151, 'Nobara Kugisaki', '釘崎野薔薇', '主角', 'Asami Seto', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Tokyo Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 3 Sorcerer She is a first-year student and grade 3 jujutsu sorcerer at Tokyo Jujutsu High studying under [Satoru Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691) alongside [Yuji](https://anilist.co/character/127212) and [Megumi](https://anilist.co/character/126635). Nobara is a confident and brash young woman with an unshakable character. More than anything, Nobara is determined to stay true to herself no matter what. She takes great pride in being both a pretty girl and a strong fighter, refusing to let anyone influence her. Initially, Nobara can appear to be a very obnoxious and arrogant person. She first introduced herself to Yuji and Megumi by expressing how inferior they were. She also argued with Yuji for the greater part of their first mission together. Despite her abrasive attitude, Nobara is actually an incredibly caring and dutiful person, but would never let most people see that side of her. After fighting alongside each other in several missions, Yuji and Megumi grow to become Nobara''s closest allies.', '/uploads/images/c_133700.png'),
(151, 'Sukuna', '宿儺', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', '__Species:__ Human, Reincarnated Sorcerer According to the legend, Sukuna was a demon with four arms and two faces who lived in the golden era of sorcery 1000 years ago. Sorcerers of the era gave their all to defeat him, but to no avail. Without ever being defeated, his body was split into 20 separate indestructible cursed objects, which allowed him to live on and traverse the ages to come. In 2018, [Yuuji Itadori](https://anilist.co/character/127212/Itadori-Yuuji) consumed one of the aforementioned cursed objects, and Sukuna was reincarnated. ~!In reality, Sukuna was not a demon, but rather a deformed human sorcerer. His body was able to be split up into 20 cursed objects because he received assistance from [Kenjaku](https://anilist.co/character/289584).!~ Sukuna is hedonistic and has no regard for the suffering of others, believing that suffering is natural for the weak. He is selfish, and always wants to stay in control of the situation without caring about the consequences.', '/uploads/images/c_133701.png'),
(151, 'Mahito', '真人', '配角', 'Nobunaga Shimazaki', '__Grade__: Special Grade __Cursed Technique:__ Idle Transfiguration Mahito is one of the primary antagonists of the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is a Cursed Spirit allied with Suguru Geto, Jogo, Hanami and several others. Their ultimate goal is the eradication of humanity and ultimately replacing the population with Cursed Spirits.', '/uploads/images/c_133702.png'),
(151, 'Kento Nanami', '七海建人', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', '__Height:__ 184 cm (6''0½") __Occupation:__ Sorcerer __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 1 Sorcerer __Cursed Technique:__ Ratio He is a Grade 1 Jujutsu Sorcerer and a Tokyo Jujutsu High alumni. Nanami is a very intelligent and reserved man who at first appears to be someone who is just very serious about his work. He knows how to separate sentimentalism from service and claims he''s only a Jujutsu Sorcerer because it''s slightly less idiotic than regular careers. As one of [Yuji''s](https://anilist.co/character/127212/Yuji-Itadori) mentors, Nanami is a complete contrast to [Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691/Satoru-Gojou), who is far more outspoken and easy-going.', '/uploads/images/c_133704.png'),
(151, 'Maki Zenin', '禪院真希', '配角', 'Mikako Komatsu', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") Maki Zenin is the older twin sister of [Mai Zenin](https://anilist.co/character/134168/Mai-Zenin). Maki is a grade 4 sorcerer and a second-year at Tokyo Metropolitan Jujutsu Technical High School. She is from the main branch of the Zenin clan, one of the "Prominent Three Families" of the Jujutsu world. She left the Zenin family in order to prove herself capable of being a Sorcerer after being deemed uncapable, since she lacks Cursed Energy. ~!Because Mai and Maki are monozygotic twins, their strength is considerably limited to one another. Monozygotic twins are considered as a single individual in the Jujutsu world and are a sign of bad omen.!~ ~!After the death of her twin sister Mai, Maki has lost all of her cursed energy and gained a Heavenly Restriction. This causes her skills and human capabilities to be on par with [Toji Fushiguro''s](https://anilist.co/character/162722/Touji-Fushiguro).!~', '/uploads/images/c_134167.png'),
(151, 'Mai Zenin', '禪院真依', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") Mai Zenin is the younger twin sister of [Maki Zenin](https://anilist.co/character/134167/Maki-Zenin). Mai is a grade 3 sorcerer and a second-year at Kyoto Jujutsu Technical High School. As a child, Mai always relied on Maki since she was afraid of Cursed Spirits. ~!Because Mai and Maki are monozygotic twins, their strength is considerably limited to one another. Monozygotic twins are considered as a single individual in the Jujutsu world and are a sign of bad omen.!~ ~!In chapter 149, Mai decides to sacrifice herself in order to make Maki stronger.!~', '/uploads/images/c_134168.jpg'),
(151, 'Panda', 'パンダ', '配角', 'Tomokazu Seki', '__Species:__ Cursed Corpse (varies among 3 personalities) __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ 2 He is a second-year at Tokyo Prefectural Jujutsu High. As a Metamorphosed Cursed Corpse, he is the best creation of Principal [Masamichi Yaga](https://anilist.co/character/189237/Masamichi-Yaga). He is sentient and has three cores inside the doll body: the youngest brother "Panda", the eldest brother "Gorilla" and a sister.', '/uploads/images/c_137974.jpg'),
(151, 'Aoi Toudou', '東堂葵', '配角', 'Subaru Kimura', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 190 cm __Occupation:__ Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Kyoto Jujutsu Technical High School __Grade:__ Grade 1 Sorcerer Toudou is a third-year student at Kyoto Jujutsu Technical High School who possesses inhuman physical strength, durability, and speed. ~!He is able to use a technique called Boogie Woogie, in which he can switch the position of two things that posses a certain amount of curse energy within his range.!~', '/uploads/images/c_137975.png'),
(151, 'Kasumi Miwa', '三輪霞', '配角', 'Chinatsu Akasaki', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Kyoto Metropolitan Curse Technical College __Grade:__ Grade 3 Sorcerer A second-year at Kyoto Metropolitan Curse Technical College. Kasumi is a hard-working, restrained, and considerate pacifist. She is also a big fan of [Satoru Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691). ~!She has a very close bond with [Mechamaru](https://anilist.co/character/210154), their friendship is first seen in the Tournament Arc when Miwa offers him a battery telling him not to eat it as [Mai](https://anilist.co/character/134168) and [Momo](https://anilist.co/character/157868) laugh in the background. In the Shibuya Arc, she is seen mourning his death on the train. Over the course of the Tournament Arc and Shibuya Arc it is very apparent their friendship grows as they both strived towards becoming closer to one another. As she mourns his death on the train she holds a mini Mechamaru speaker which tells her to find her happiness. After the recording finishes, she holds the speaker to her heart and cries. The entire Kyoto program seems very distressed by his death on the train. When later entering the battle Miwa is quick to activate her technique out of rage and sadness towards [Mahito](https://anilist.co/character/133702).!~', '/uploads/images/c_156848.png'),
(151, 'Jougo', '漏瑚', '配角', 'Shigeru Chiba', '__Grade:__ Special Grade Cursed Spirit Jogou is an unregistered special grade cursed spirit aligned with Mahito, Hanami, and Dagon. He was born of humanity''s fear and negative association with volcanoes and other fire-related natural disasters. This resulted in a highly intelligent cursed spirit with massive levels of cursed energy even for a special grade. Jogou believes curses are the true humans and desires a world where his kind dominates the earth.', '/uploads/images/c_156991.png'),
(151, 'Toge Inumaki', '狗巻棘', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 2 Sorcerer __Cursed Technique:__ Cursed Speech He is a second-year at Tokyo Metropolitan Jujutsu Technical High School. Due to his curse ability, he is only willing to communicate with ingredients used to make rice balls.', '/uploads/images/c_157115.png'),
(151, 'Chousou', '脹相', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', 'Chousou is half human and half cursed spirit and the first of the Death Painting Wombs with a Special Grade rank. He and his two brothers, [Kechizu](https://anilist.co/character/210832/Kechizu) and [Eso](https://anilist.co/character/210831/Esou) are Cursed Womb: Death Paintings who have sided with [Mahito](https://anilist.co/character/133702/Mahito)''s group. Chousou bears strong attachments to his brothers and is very overprotective of them. ~!However, after receiving a vision during his battle with Itadori, Chousou was eventually convinced that Sukuna''s vessel was actually one of his younger brothers. He then became furious at Mahito and the other cursed spirits for manipulating him into harming Itadori.!~ ~!Chousou is one of nine death painting wombs that came from a woman capable of giving birth to cursed spirit children. At some point, Chousou and his brothers were stored at the Jujutsu High, along with some of Sukuna''s fingers. As stated by Chousou himself, Noritoshi Kamo, the man who experimented on his mother is in fact his third "parent" due to him having mixed in his own blood into Chousou when his mother was pregnant with him. Although seemingly not remembering much about his own past, it is evident that Chousou himself remembers Noritoshi and holds a grudge against him for toying with his mother and siblings'' lives.!~', '/uploads/images/c_157116.png'),
(151, 'Junpei Yoshino', '吉野順平', '配角', 'Yoshitaka Yamaya', 'A student at Satozakura High School.', '/uploads/images/c_157214.jpg'),
(151, 'Mei Mei', '冥冥', '配角', 'Kotono Mitsuishi', '__Height:__ 173 cm __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 1 Sorcerer __Family:__ [Ui Ui](https://anilist.co/character/217290) (Younger Brother) __Abilities__: ~! __Weapon Mastery__: Mei Mei wields a large battle-axe. __Cursed Technique__: Black Bird Manipulation - Mei Mei is able to control crows as well as see through their eyes, making her technique great for recon. __Bird Strike__: by forcing a crow to commit suicide, the trade-off is to erase the Cursed Energy limit of a typical weak bird and hurl it at the enemy. !~ Mei Mei is a grade 1 jujutsu sorcerer who works independently and only in exchange for money. She is also the older sister of Ui Ui. ~!She was the senpai of [Satoru Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691) and [Suguru Geto](https://anilist.co/character/133699) during their time at Jujutsu High.!~', '/uploads/images/c_157215.jpg'),
(151, 'Utahime Iori', '庵歌姫', '配角', 'Youko Hikasa', 'A first grade sorcerer and a teacher at Kyoto Jujutsu Technical High School.', '/uploads/images/c_157864.jpg'),
(151, 'Takuma Ino', '猪野琢真', '配角', 'Yuu Hayashi', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Sorcerer __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 2 Sorcerer Takuma Ino is a grade 2 jujutsu sorcerer and a close associate of Kento Nanami who operates out of Tokyo Jujutsu High. Takuma Ino is a genuine and cheerful person with a more positive outlook on things than most jujutsu sorcerers. He doesn''t believe he''s the smartest person around and has a lot of respect for Nanami. Whenever Ino finds himself in a tough situation, he asks himself what would Nanami do.', '/uploads/images/c_157865.jpg'),
(151, 'Noritoshi  Kamo', '加茂憲紀', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', '__Cursed Technique:__ Blood Manipulation __Grade:__ Semi-Grade 1 Sorcerer He is a third-year at Kyoto Magic Technical College.', '/uploads/images/c_157866.png'),
(151, 'Yoshinobu Gakuganji', '楽巌寺嘉伸', '配角', 'Mugihito', 'The principal of Kyoto Jujutsu Technical High School.', '/uploads/images/c_157867.png'),
(151, 'Momo Nishimiya', '西宮桃', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer __Affiliation:__ Kyoto Magic Technical College __Grade:__ Semi-Grade 2 Sorcerer __Cursed Technique:__ Tool Manipulation She is a third-year at Kyoto Magic Technical College.', '/uploads/images/c_157868.png'),
(151, 'Shouko Ieiri', '家入硝子', '配角', 'Aya Endou', '__Height:__ 168 cm __Ability:__ Reverse Healing Cursed Technique Alumnus of Tokyo Jujutsu High, having been classmates with [Satoru Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691) and [Suguru Geto](https://anilist.co/character/133699). After graduating into a full-fledged jujutsu sorcerer, Shoko became the school''s primary doctor.', '/uploads/images/c_158154.png'),
(151, 'Hanami', '花御 ', '配角', 'Atsuko Tanaka', '__Species:__ Cursed Spirit Hanami is an antagonist intent on ridding the Earth of Humans and reviving Sukuna.', '/uploads/images/c_172743.jpg'),
(151, 'Naobito Zenin', '禪院直毘人', '配角', 'Jouji Nakata', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 184 cm __Age:__ Unknown __Hair Color:__ Grey __Occupation:__ The 26th head of House Zenin __Affiliation:__ House Zenin __Grade:__ Grade 1 Sorcerer', '/uploads/images/c_188432.png'),
(151, 'Masamichi Yaga', '夜蛾正道', '配角', 'Takaya Kuroda', 'He is the current principal of Tokyo Metropolitan Jujutsu Technical High School, the creator of Panda, and the headmaster of Satoru Gojo, Suguru Geto and Shoko Ieiri. ~!After the Shibuya incident Yaga is given a death penalty by the higher ups for inciting Gojo and Geto in the past and "causing the Shibuya incident".!~', '/uploads/images/c_189237.png'),
(151, 'Kiyotaka Ijichi', '伊地知潔高', '配角', 'Mitsuo Iwata', 'An assistant manager at Tokyo Prefectural Jujutsu High School.', '/uploads/images/c_189238.png'),
(151, 'Tsumiki Fushiguro', '伏黒津美紀', '配角', 'Saori Hayami', '~! Megumi''s older sister.!~ ~! Tsumiki was unknowingly chosen by Kenjaku to be a participant of the Culling Game and made into the incarnated host of Yorozu !~', '/uploads/images/c_193479.png'),
(151, 'Nagi Yoshino', '吉野凪', '配角', 'Junko Noda', '__Species:__ Human Nagi Yoshino is the mother of Junpei Yoshino. Nagi is a friendly, laid-back woman who cared deeply for her son. She''s eager for him to make friends and took a liking to Yuji immediately. As a mother, she has some irresponsible tendencies. She was a smoker and drinker who allowed Junpei to skip school if she wished. Nagi believes that her son could take a different avenue other than education to be successful in life. After just one meeting, Yuji recognized that Junpei''s mother was a great person.', '/uploads/images/c_194056.png'),
(151, 'Wasuke Itadori', '虎杖倭助', '配角', 'Shigeru Chiba', 'Yuji''s Grandfather is shown to be a selfless, caring man who taught Yuji to help others. He was also short tempered and stubborn, to the point he would yell at Yuji for visiting him every day and buying him flowers. This temper meant that nobody else wanted to visit him and he tells his grandson to avoid dying alone.', '/uploads/images/c_194074.png'),
(151, 'Yuki Tsukumo', '九十九由基', '配角', 'Noriko Hidaka', 'One of the four Special Grade Sorcerers.', '/uploads/images/c_196502.png'),
(151, 'Nobuko Takada', '高田延子', '配角', 'Tomoyo Kurosawa', '__Height:__ 180 cm Aoi Toudou''s favorite idol.', '/uploads/images/c_197119.png'),
(151, 'Kinji Hakari', '秤金次', '配角', '', 'Kinji Hakari is a character in the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is a third-year student at Tokyo Jujutsu High who is currently suspended for clashing with authority. While away from the school, Kinji is running a fight club between sorcerers for money.', '/uploads/images/c_197584.jpg'),
(151, 'Setsuko Sasaki', '佐々木せつこ', '配角', 'Mariya Ise', 'Sasaki is a second-year student at Sugisawa Third High School and a member of school''s Occult Research Club alongside her friends [Yuuji Itadori](https://anilist.co/character/127212/Yuuji-Itadori) and [Takeshi Iguchi](https://anilist.co/character/200767/Takeshi-Iguchi).', '/uploads/images/c_200765.jpg'),
(151, 'Seito Kaichou', '生徒会長', '配角', 'Yoshiki Nakajima', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_200766.jpg'),
(151, 'Takeshi Iguchi', '井口たけし', '配角', 'Takahiro Sumi', 'Iguchi is a second-year student at Sugisawa Third High School and a member of school''s Occult Research Club alongside his friends [Yuuji Itadori](https://anilist.co/character/127212/Yuuji-Itadori) and [Setsuko Sasaki](https://anilist.co/character/200765).', '/uploads/images/c_200767.png'),
(151, 'Takagi', '高木', '配角', 'Kenji Sugimura', 'Takagi is the athletics club advisor teacher at Sugisawa Third High School.', '/uploads/images/c_200768.jpg'),
(151, 'Dagon', '陀艮', '配角', '', '__Affiliation:__ Mahito’s group Dagon is a antagonist who starts off as a cursed womb but later turns into a powerful cursed spirit. He starts off by being accompanied by Jogo and Hanami.', '/uploads/images/c_204383.jpg'),
(151, 'Sotomura', '外村', '配角', 'Akira Harada', 'Sotomura is a teacher at Satozakura High School, where [Junpei Yoshino](https://anilist.co/character/157214/Junpei--Yoshino) attends.', '/uploads/images/c_206208.png'),
(151, 'Juuzou Kumiya', '組屋鞣造', '配角', 'Tetsu Inada', 'A curse user who wields an axe.', '/uploads/images/c_207988.jpg'),
(151, 'Haruta Shigemo', '重面春太', '配角', 'Wataru Hatano', 'A curse user working with Mahito. He loves picking on the weak.', '/uploads/images/c_209694.png'),
(151, 'Shouta Itou', '伊藤翔太', '配角', 'Takamasa Mogi', 'Shouta is a high school student from Satozakura High School.', '/uploads/images/c_210062.png'),
(151, 'Hijoushikina Isha', '非常識な医者', '配角', 'Tetsuo Kanao', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_210063.png'),
(151, 'Sam', 'サム', '配角', 'Daichi Hayashi', 'Sam is a character from one of the movies Itadori has to see to train to maintain a steady output of cursed energy. It''s a reference to Lord of the Rings', '/uploads/images/c_210064.png'),
(151, 'Koukichi Muta', '与幸吉', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'Koukichi Muta is a Semi-Grade 1 sorcerer and a second-year student at Kyoto Jujutsu High. He attends school by controlling the cursed corpse Ultimate Mechamaru, as Muta was born with a sickly and fragile body due to a Heavenly Restriction. In exchange, he has a nearly boundless amount of cursed energy that spreads over a vast range.', '/uploads/images/c_210154.jpg'),
(151, 'Uraume', '裏梅', '配角', '', '__Gender:__ Unknown A curse user from a thousand years ago who is a direct subordinate to Sukuna.', '/uploads/images/c_210830.jpg'),
(151, 'Esou', '壊相', '配角', 'Nobuyuki Hiyama', '__Cursed Technique__ Rot Eso is an antagonist in the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is a Cursed Womb: Death Painting and the middle brother of Choso and Kechizu.', '/uploads/images/c_210831.png'),
(151, 'Kechizu', '血塗', '配角', 'Kappei Yamaguchi', '__Cursed Technique:__ Rot Kechizu is an antagonist in the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is a Cursed Womb: Death Painting and the youngest brother of Choso and Eso. Kechizu and Eso serve as the primary antagonists of the Death Painting Arc.', '/uploads/images/c_210832.png'),
(151, 'Akari Nitta', '新田明', '配角', 'Sora Tokui', 'Akari Nitta is an Auxiliary Manager at Jujutsu High.', '/uploads/images/c_210846.png'),
(151, 'Takeda', '武田', '配角', 'Shigeru Ushiyama', 'Takeda is one of the faculty members at Saitama Urami East Junior High and has been since even before Megumi Fushiguro attended there.', '/uploads/images/c_222599.png'),
(151, 'Kenjaku', '羂索', '配角', '', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 183 cm __Occupation:__ Curse User __Cursed Technique:__ Cursed Spirit Manipulation Kenjaku is one of the primary antagonists of the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is an ancient sorcerer who pursues the goal of "evolving" humanity via cursed energy, thereby ushering in a new golden age of jujutsu sorcery paralleling the Heian Era. ~!Using his cursed technique that allows him to transplant his brain into different bodies to possess them, he has inhabited different people throughout the centuries, assuming different identities.!~', '/uploads/images/c_289584.jpg'),
(151, 'Yubi no Kishu', '指の寄主', '配角', 'Setsuji Satou', 'Finger Bearers are a type of special grade cursed spirit that emerge from the cursed wombs spawned from eating one of [Sukuna](https://anilist.co/character/133701/Sukuna)''s fingers.', '/uploads/images/c_306189.png'),
(151, 'Taichi Kanada', '金田太一', '配角', 'Yugo Sekiguchi', '__Height:__ 175 cm Taichi Kanada is an alumni of Saitama Urami East Junior High ~!and was one of four victims who were cursed as a result of bungee jumping from Yasohachi Bridge. Like the other cursed humans, Taichi died after a cursed spirit appeared between his auto-lock doors, which were stuck wide open.!~', '/uploads/images/c_306276.png'),
(151, 'Tadashi Okazaki', '岡崎正', '配角', 'Shunichi Maki', 'Tadashi Okazaki was a minor character serving time at the Eishu Juvenile Detention Center.', '/uploads/images/c_306282.png'),
(151, 'Orizuki', '澱月', '配角', '', 'Moon Dregs is a jellyfish shikigami summoned by Junpei Yoshino.', '/uploads/images/c_322042.png'),
(151, 'Garuda', '凰輪', '配角', '', 'Garuda is a shikigami used by Yuki Tsukumo and is connected to her innate technique, Star Rage.', '/uploads/images/c_322043.png'),
