(152, 'Shouyou Hinata', '日向翔陽', '主角', 'Ayumu Murase', '__Teams:__ Yukigaoka Junior High (Former); Karasuno High (Current) __Number:__ 1 (Junior High 3rd Year); 10 (High School 1st year); 5 (High School 3rd year) __Position:__ Captain (Junior High); Outside Hitter (Junior High); Middle Blocker (High School) Hinata has an unusually high ability to jump. Since he was young, Hinata trained his legs to compensate for his lack of height. He joins the Karusuno High School Volleyball team and amazes the team with his natural affinity as a spiker. Although he is a complete beginner and never had any experience playing in a volleyball team, he grows rapidly through each match. ~!After graduating from high school, Hinata traveled to Brazil to gain experience by playing beach volleyball. This is when he got the name, Ninja Shoyo. Upon returning to Japan, he became a member of the MSBY Black Jackals, a Division 1 team in the V-League. He became a member of the Japan Men’s National Volleyball Team during the 2021 Olympics. Currently, that is the year 2022, he is a member of Asas São Paulo, a professional team in the Brazil Super League.!~', '/uploads/images/c_64769.png'),
(152, 'Tobio Kageyama', '影山飛雄', '主角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Team:__ Karasuno High, Kitagawa Daiichi Junior High (former) __Height:__ 180.6 cm __Year:__ 1st Year, class 3 __Number:__ 9 __Position:__ Setter A famous setter in his middle school who joins the Karusuno High Volleyball team. He was known as the "King of the Court" in his middle school because of his arrogant demeanor and the way he would order around his teammates. Although he still carries an overbearing attitude, he begins to change when he starts to play with [Hinata Shouyou](https://anilist.co/character/64769) who views him as a rival.', '/uploads/images/c_64771.png'),
(152, 'Koushi Sugawara', '菅原孝支', '配角', 'Miyu Irino', '__Height:__ 174 cm Being the vice captain, Sugawara has a soothing personality for his teammates and acts as a pillar of support for them. Even though he isn''t Karasuno''s official setter anymore, he doesn''t dream of giving up on playing in general. As such, he encourages himself and all of his teammates not to give up, no matter how rough the situation might be. Sugawara''s dedication to volleyball is clear when he decides to continue club activities even when most third years choose to retire to focus on their futures. In a meeting, his teacher asked Sugawara why he''s so determined to continue playing even though he''s not a starting member, and Sugawara replied that he doesn''t want to have regrets in the future. He is also quite perceptive as he noticed how [Tanaka](https://anilist.co/character/67325/Tanaka-Ryuunosuke) asked for the key to the gym (back during the first years'' 3-on-3 match) even though he always comes in late, so Sugawara knew that something was up. He is also intelligent as he can come up with helpful tactics during the game. An example of this is when he came up with the idea of saying "bring it" and "send it to me" for [Kageyama](https://anilist.co/character/64771/Kageyama-Tobio) and [Hinata](https://anilist.co/character/64769/Hinata-Shouyou)''s combo.', '/uploads/images/c_67321.png'),
(152, 'Daichi Sawamura', '澤村大地', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 176.8 cm __Year:__ 3rd year, class 4 __Number:__ 1 __Position:__ Wing Spiker The captain of the Karasuno High volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_67323.png'),
(152, 'Ryuunosuke Tanaka', '田中龍之介', '配角', 'Yuu Hayashi', '__Height:__ 177.2 cm __Team:__ Karasuno High __Number:__ 5 __Position:__ Wing Spiker', '/uploads/images/c_67325.jpg'),
(152, 'Yuu Nishinoya', '西谷夕', '配角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '__Team:__ Karasuno High, Chidoriyama Junior High (former) __Height:__ 159.3 cm (5''2") __Year:__ 2nd year, Class 3 __Number:__ 4 __Position:__ Libero Yuu is a very energetic and temperamental person. His boisterous nature and crazy shenanigans can attract unwanted attention quite easily, which often bodes ill for him. Although he hardly ever worries about the consequences of his actions (and may even revert to violence in order to vent out his anger on certain occasions), he is surprisingly considerate of his friends'' feelings and insecurities. Yuu can be extremely impatient, excitable and impulsive. As [Ryuunosuke Tanaka](https://anilist.co/character/67325) puts it, "he simply gets too fired up for his own good." He doesn''t bother to filter his words, and is therefore prone to blurting out whatever he''s thinking in a loud and tactless manner. In-game, however, his attitude changes drastically: he becomes incredibly focused and serious, remaining calm and doing everything in his power to provide the support his team needs until the very end. For this reason, everyone in the volleyball club respects him greatly.', '/uploads/images/c_67327.jpg'),
(152, 'Kei Tsukishima', '月島蛍', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', '**Height:** 188 cm **Team:** Karasuno High **Year:** 1st year, class 4 **Number:** 11 **Position:** Middle Blocker A member of the Karasuno High volleyball club. Tsukishima is very blunt and will sometimes rile his teammates up due to his antagonistic nature (most notably being [Hinata](https://anilist.co/character/64769/Hinata-Shouyou), [Kageyama](https://anilist.co/character/64771/Kageyama-Tobio), [Nishinoya](https://anilist.co/character/67327/Nishinoya-Yuu), and [Tanaka](https://anilist.co/character/67325/Tanaka-Ryuunosuke)) and sometimes other teams because of his casual smug attitude, taking pride in and relishing when his opponents see him as a nuisance as seen with [Tendou](https://anilist.co/character/126073/Tendou-Satori) and [Shirabu](https://anilist.co/character/137537/Shirabu-Kenjirou). Tsukishima is standoffish and has an arrogant and condescending personality, but he has low self-esteem and thinks of himself as inferior. Although he is only outwardly close with [Yamaguchi](https://anilist.co/character/71609/Yamaguchi-Tadashi), he can be seen occasionally caring about his other club members.', '/uploads/images/c_67329.png'),
(152, 'Chikara Ennoshita', '縁下力', '配角', 'Toshiki Masuda', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 175.4 cm __Year:__ 2nd year, class 4 __Position:__ Wing Spiker Ennoshita seems quiet and reserved but can behave boldly towards the other 2nd years. He''s smart and hasn''t received a failing mark before. Similarly to Sugawara, he is always smiling. He''s supposedly the only one within the 2nd years to be able to control Tanaka and Nishinoya. He''s also able to understand different people, as stated a few times by Tanaka and when he knew what to do to give Yamaguchi some courage before his jump float serve.', '/uploads/images/c_67331.png'),
(152, 'Asahi Azumane', '東峰旭', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 184.7 cm __Year:__ 3rd year, class 3 __Number:__ 3 __Position:__ Wing Spiker In contrast to his appearance, he is rather quiet and gentle and has his difficulties realizing that he is Karasuno''s ace as he initially doesn''t feel that way. He shows to be weak-willed at the beginning when he leaves the team before the first years come, feeling that he let down his entire team when they lost against Date Tech High even though they counted on him. After coming back to Karasuno, he realizes that his will to play volleyball is much stronger than he thought and with the help of his teammates, he acknowledges his position as Karasuno''s ace (even though he is still mocked sometimes by Daichi for not having any "ace-like presence") and gains self-confidence.', '/uploads/images/c_67333.png'),
(152, 'Kiyoko Shimizu', '清水潔子', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 166.2 cm __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 2 The manager of the Karasuno High volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_67689.png'),
(152, 'Keishin Ukai', '烏養繋心', '配角', 'Hisao Egawa', '**Height:** 178.2 cm **Team:** Karasuno High Karasuno High School volleyball club''s alumnus, currently coaching volleyball club and helping out his mother at the shop.', '/uploads/images/c_70861.jpg'),
(152, 'Kenma Kozume', '孤爪研磨', '配角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 169.2 cm The setter of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. Kenma is [Kuroo](https://anilist.co/character/71269)''s childhood friend and keeps playing volleyball because of him. He has a very calm personality and is usually doing things at his own pace. Often seen playing video games and being introverted. Nekoma''s backbone, brain and heart.', '/uploads/images/c_71267.jpg'),
(152, 'Tetsurou Kuroo', '黒尾鉄朗', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 187.7 cm __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 5 __Number:__ 1 __Position:__ Middle Blocker The captain of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. Kuroo has a somehow manipulative and cunning personality, but cares about his friends and teammates very deeply. As Nekoma''s captain he has a sense of responsibility and confidence. Even though Kuroo''s a middle blocker, he often uses offensive plays too.', '/uploads/images/c_71269.jpg'),
(152, 'Tadashi Yamaguchi', '山口忠', '配角', 'Souma Saitou', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 179.5cm - 180.0cm __Year:__ 1st year, class 4 __Number:__ 12 __Position:__ Middle Blocker Yamaguchi always hangs out with Tsukishima and is very protective of him. He has trained himself hard to use a jump float serve. He is also a substitute ace server of the Karasuno Volleyball team.', '/uploads/images/c_71609.png'),
(152, 'Tooru Oikawa', '及川徹', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', '__Height:__ 184 cm The setter and captain of the Aoba Josai High School volleyball club. He was [Kageyama](https://anilist.co/character/64771/Tobio-Kageyama)''s senpai when they were attending Kitagawa Daiichi. According to Kageyama, he is a very talented setter and volleyball player with a ​complex personality. His favourite food is milk bread.', '/uploads/images/c_71611.png'),
(152, 'Taketora Yamamoto', '山本猛虎', '配角', 'Seigo Yokota', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 176.7 cm __Year:__ 2nd Year, class 1 __Number:__ 4 __Position:__ Wing Spiker Yamamoto is proud and short tempered wing spiker of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. He usually doesn''t think what he says and is somewhat similar to Tanaka.', '/uploads/images/c_73673.jpg'),
(152, 'Sou Inuoka', '犬岡走', '配角', 'Kyousuke Ikeda', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 185.3 cm __Year:__ 1st Year, class 1 __Number:__ 7 __Position:__ Middle Blocker Middle blocker of the Nekoma High School volleyball club. He has friendly personality and becomes friends with Hinata after their game.', '/uploads/images/c_73675.jpg'),
(152, 'Yuuki Shibayama', '芝山優生', '配角', 'Takumi Watanabe', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 162.5 cm __Weight:__ 53.3 kg __Year:__ 1st Year, class 4 __Number:__ 12 __Position:__ Libero One of the libero of the Nekoma High School volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_73677.jpg'),
(152, 'Ittetsu Takeda', '武田一鉄', '配角', 'Hiroshi Kamiya', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 166.5 cm Volleyball club faculty advisor of the Karasuno High School. Takeda is inexperienced in volleyball, but still became an advisor for Karasuno. He often doesn''t understand rules and that''s why he takes notes about every new thing he learns. Takeda has an enthusiastic and brave personality.', '/uploads/images/c_73679.png'),
(152, 'Yuutarou Kindaichi', '金田一勇太郎', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', '__Team:__ Aoba Josai High, Kitagawa Daiichi (former) __Height:__ 189.2 cm __Year:__ 1st year __Position:__ Middle Blocker Middle blocker of the Aoba Josai High School volleyball club. He was Kageyama''s teammate back in junior high school. Kindaichi was one of the players who hated Kageyama''s selfish plays and refused to understand him.', '/uploads/images/c_73681.jpg'),
(152, 'Nobuyuki Kai', '海信行', '配角', 'Takanori Hoshino', '__Team__: Nekoma High School __Height__: 176.5 cm __Weight__: 68.9 kg __Year__: 3rd Year, class 4 __Number__: 2 __Position__: Wing Spiker', '/uploads/images/c_74029.jpg'),
(152, 'Morisuke Yaku', '夜久衛輔', '配角', 'Shinnosuke Tachibana', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 165.2 cm __Year:__ 3rd Year, class 5 __Number:__ 3 __Position:__ Libero Currently playing libero of the Nekoma High School volleyball club.', '/uploads/images/c_74033.png'),
(152, 'Shouhei Fukunaga', '福永招平', '配角', 'Shouta Chounan', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 178.3 cm __Year:__ 2nd Year, class 2 __Number:__ 6 __Position:__ Wing Spiker', '/uploads/images/c_74039.jpg'),
(152, 'Manabu Naoi', '直井学', '配角', 'Kanehira Yamamoto', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School The coach of the Nekoma High School volleyball club and Ukai''s old acquaintance.', '/uploads/images/c_74591.jpg'),
(152, 'Yasufumi Nekomata', '猫又育史', '配角', 'Nobuaki Fukuda', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School The coach of the Nekoma High School volleyball club and Ukai''s rival. He doesn''t like to lose.', '/uploads/images/c_74593.jpg'),
(152, 'Wakatoshi Ushijima', '牛島若利', '配角', 'Ryouta Takeuchi', '__Height:__ 189.5 cm (6'' 2.6") __Team:__ Shiratorizawa Academy __Number:__ 1 __Position:__ Wing Spiker Wakatoshi Ushijima is a third year at Shiratorizawa Academy and the captain and ace of the school''s boys'' volleyball team. Currently, he is the number one ace in Miyagi Prefecture and one of the country''s top three aces, along with Sakusa and Kiryu. Left handed. His favourite food is hayashi rice.', '/uploads/images/c_76816.png'),
(152, 'Kenji Futakuchi', '二口堅治', '配角', 'Masatomo Nakazawa', '__Team:__ Datekougyou High School __Height:__ 184.2 cm According to Moniwa, Futakuchi is a problematic kouhai with a very easy going personality. He''s often seen arguing with Kamasaki who is the ​complete opposite of Futakuchi.', '/uploads/images/c_77415.jpg'),
(152, 'Takanobu Aone', '青根高伸', '配角', 'Hiroki Matsukawa', '__Team:__ Datekougyou High School __Height:__ 191.8 cm __Year:__ 2nd Year, class A __Number:__ 7 __Position:__ Middle Blocker Main pillar of Datekou. Even though Aone never smiles and seems serious and scary, he actually has a very kind heart. Futakuchi said that Aone has a habit of "locking on" to you if he knows his opponent is an ace.', '/uploads/images/c_77417.jpg'),
(152, 'Yuusuke Takinoue', '滝ノ上祐輔', '配角', 'Shuuhei Sakaguchi', 'Height: 185.6 cm Position: Middle Blocker Karasuno High School volleyball club''s alumnus. He and Shimada are part of the Karasuno Neighborhood Association team. And they often come to watch current Karasuno''s games as well as to root for them. Yuusuke''s working at Takinoue Electric Goods.', '/uploads/images/c_80511.png'),
(152, 'Makoto Shimada', '嶋田誠', '配角', 'Tomoaki Maeno', '__Height:__ 177.7cm Karasuno High School volleyball club''s alumnus. He and Takinoue are part of the Karasuno Neighborhood Association team. And they often come to watch current Karasuno''s games as well as to root for them. Makoto''s working at Shimada Mart.', '/uploads/images/c_80513.jpg'),
(152, 'Hisashi Kinoshita', '木下久志', '配角', 'Nobuyori Sagara', '__Height:__ 174cm Narita, Ennoshita and Kinoshita are 2nd years who couldn''t keep up with the training when old Ukai returned and that''s why they left volleyball club. However after some time they came back because they realized that they still want to play volleyball, though coach Ukai was no longer there. Ennoshita called them ''''disgraceful'''' 2nd years.', '/uploads/images/c_80515.jpg'),
(152, 'Kazuhito Narita', '成田一仁', '配角', 'Koutarou Nishiyama', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Height:__ 180.2 cm __Year:__ 2nd Year, class 4 Narita, Ennoshita and Kinoshita are 2nd years who couldn''t keep up with the training when old Ukai returned and that''s why they left volleyball club. However after some time they came back because they realized that they still want to play volleyball, though coach Ukai was no longer there. Ennoshita called them ''''disgraceful'''' 2nd years.', '/uploads/images/c_80517.jpg'),
(152, 'Koutarou Bokuto', '木兎光太郎', '配角', 'Ryouhei Kimura', '__Height:__ 185.3 cm Bokuto is a third year student at Fukurodani Academy and is its volleyball team''s captain and wing spiker. His spikes pack a powerful punch that others can struggle to receive. Despite this, Bokuto has a tendency to not doing well in the middle of games when getting shut out. Luckily, [Akaashi](https://anilist.co/character/88938) has a whole list of things Bokuto does and tries his best to bring Bokuto back up to his usual self. Besides Akaashi, Bokuto is friends with a few other rival team''s players, such as [Kuroo](https://anilist.co/character/71269) and sorta friends with [Tsukishima](https://anilist.co/character/67329).', '/uploads/images/c_88937.png'),
(152, 'Keiji Akaashi', '赤葦京治', '配角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', '__Height:__ 182.3 cm A second year at Fukurodani Academy, and its volleyball team''s vice-captain and setter. Akaashi is often calm and collected, though he does have times where he begins to get worried about things. More often than not, he has to handle Bokuto and all of his antics during the game. When such happens, Akaashi usually thinks of some way to bring Bokuto into peak condition again, though there are times where he struggles with doing so.', '/uploads/images/c_88938.png'),
(152, 'Hitoka Yachi', '谷地仁花', '配角', 'Sumire Morohoshi', '__Team:__ Karasuno High __Position:__ Manager __Occupation:__ High School Student (1st Year, Class 5) A 1st year who was recruited by [Shimizu](https://anilist.co/character/67689/Shimizu-Kiyoko) as a manager trainee. She appears to be very nervous, but easily befriends [Hinata](https://anilist.co/character/64769/Hinata-Shouyou). She''s paranoid (which causes her to be intimidated easily), very curious, and is organized with her notes, including the ones that she takes from class; this is largely due to her mother being a graphic designer.', '/uploads/images/c_89124.jpg'),
(152, 'Akira Kunimi', '国見英', '配角', '', '__Team:__ Aobajōsai (former Kitagawa Daīchi) (first year at Aoba Johsai) __Height:__ 182.8 cm __Number:__ 13 __Position:__ Wing Spiker He is a quiet and indifferent person, though it''s mostly out of laziness. He occasionally skips practice as well and doesn''t seem to put his full effort into matches; however, his true strength lies in his late game plays. Kunimi dislikes loud, energetic people and was dismayed when Koganegawa yelled at him to "go all out", which is one of his least liked phrases. He also refers to Hinata, Koganegawa, and Hyakuzawa as the "idiot squad" because of their energy. Kageyama has also mentioned that Kunimi is smart, though it''s unknown if that refers to his game sense or general studies.', '/uploads/images/c_89508.jpg'),
(152, 'Lev Haiba', '灰羽リエーフ', '配角', 'Mark Ishii', '__Team:__ Nekoma High School __Height:__ 194 cm __Weight:__ 79,7 kg __Year:__ 1st Year __Position:__ Middle Blocker Lev is a half Russian, half Japanese. However he says he doesn''t speak Russian because he was born and raised in Japan. His name in Russian means lion. Lev wasn''t around when Karasuno and Nekoma had their first match together. He started playing volleyball in high school, that''s why he was still a novice and spent whole time on bench at that time so he didn''t come. Lev is blessed with natural physical ability, intuition and height. He declares that he''s an ace even though he''s a middle blocker. Kenma states that Lev is a good and honest guy. Lev is quite childish and cheerful, shown when he was making fun of Hinata''s height. Lev''s appearance, as well as his piercing eyes, causes people to believe he is much more intimidating and serious than he actually is. Though he can be blunt, he never seems to mean any harm and adopts a playful attitude towards most things. He is also shown to be enthusiastic about spiking as he gets excited about it very easily, and can be competitive with people he is interested in.', '/uploads/images/c_89517.png'),
(152, 'Saeko Tanaka', '田中冴子', '配角', 'Yuka Komatsu', 'Saeko Tanaka is a former student of Karasuno High and the older sister of Ryuunosuke Tanaka. She was also a classmate of the Small Giant during her high school years. The second years of the volleyball team views her as a cool older sister, especially Nishinoya, but Tanaka thinks of her as a nuisance whenever she bothers his study sessions. Like her brother, she''s loud and outspoken. Her driving has been described by her brother as dangerous as he had once stated to Hinata and Kageyama that he can''t guarantee their safety in her car.', '/uploads/images/c_90142.jpg'),
(152, 'Kanji  Koganegawa', '黄金川貫至', '配角', 'Masayuki Shouji', '__Height:__ 191.5 cm __Team:__ Datekougyou High School __Year:__ 1st year __Number:__ 7 __Position:__ Setter Koganegawa is a first year setter at Date Tech High. He is very energetic and enthusiastic but often lacks the ability to think carefully about his actions. Despite being rather simple-minded, he''s also shown to be determined to improve his abilities and support his team as their setter and with his height but tends to focus on improving the wrong areas.', '/uploads/images/c_134003.png'),
(152, 'Issei Matsukawa', '松川一静', '配角', 'Yuusen Isamu', 'Issei is a 3rd year student from Aobajohsai High; he is one of the middle blockers.', '/uploads/images/c_137468.png'),
(152, 'Shinji Watari', '渡親治', '配角', '', 'Shinji is a second year libero in Aobajohsai High.', '/uploads/images/c_137469.jpg'),
(152, 'Takahiro Hanamaki', '花巻貴大', '配角', 'Tooru Sakurai', 'Takahiro is a 3rd year wing spiker at Aobajohsai High.', '/uploads/images/c_137470.png'),
(152, 'Shigeru Yahaba', '矢巾秀', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', 'Shigeru is a 2nd year setter at Aobajohsai High.', '/uploads/images/c_137472.jpg'),
(152, 'Tamahiko Teshiro', '手白球彦', '配角', 'Fumiyoshi Shioya', 'Tamahiko is a first year setter and a pinch server at Nekoma High.', '/uploads/images/c_137473.png'),
(152, 'Yamato Sarukui', '猿杙大和', '配角', 'Juunji Tachibana ', '__Height__: 181.5cm Yamato is a third year wing spiker in Fukuroudani Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_137475.jpg'),
(152, 'Haruki Komi', '小見春樹', '配角', '', 'Third-year high school student at Fukuroudani Academy. He is the starting libero on the boys'' volleyball team.', '/uploads/images/c_137477.jpg'),
(152, 'Akinori Konoha', '木葉秋紀', '配角', 'Taishi Murata', 'Akinori is a third year wing spiker from Fukuroudani Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_137480.jpg'),
(152, 'Kousuke Sakunami', '作並浩輔', '配角', 'Junta Terashima', 'Kousuke is a first year libero at Date Tech High.', '/uploads/images/c_137485.png'),
(152, 'Tsutomu Goshiki', '五色工', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 181 cm (5''11") __Hometown:__ Miyagi Prefecture Tsutomu Goshiki is a first year wing spiker in Shiratorizawa Academy. Goshiki appears to have been a capable volleyball player even before entering Shiratorizawa Academy. In one of his recollections, he is seen being praised by an elderly lady while showing off a volleyball related trophy. He is also frequently acknowledged for his height and reliability as an ace.', '/uploads/images/c_137534.png'),
(152, 'Kenjirou Shirabu', '白布賢二郎', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 174.8 cm (5'' 8.8") __Hometown:__ Miyagi Prefecture __Introduction:__ Kenjirou Shirabu is a second year setter at Shiratorizawa Academy. He is the only player on Shiratorizawa''s Boys'' Volleyball Team who didn''t get into the school with a sports scholarship. He took the exam to get into Shiratorizawa in hopes of being able to play with tall and strong players after watching Ushijima play in junior high. __Personality:__ He is respectful towards his upperclassmen but tends to bicker with Goshiki, a first year. Though he appears serious and composed, Shirabu is extremely hot-headed and gets annoyed at nearly every move his opponents pull. However, he is capable of recomposing himself quickly. He is also very studious and hardworking, spending all of his free time studying in order to pass the difficult entrance exam for Shiratorizawa. During junior high, he had good grades.', '/uploads/images/c_137537.png'),
(152, 'Tanji Washijou', '鷲匠鍛治', '配角', 'Ryuusei Nakao', 'Tanji is the head coach of Shiratorizawa Academy Boys'' Volleyball team.', '/uploads/images/c_137539.png'),
(152, 'Ikkei Ukai', '烏養一繋', '配角', 'Hiroshi Naka', 'Ikkei is the former coach of Karasuno High''s Boys'' Volleyball Club. He once led the team to nationals and was well-known. After being hospitalized, he resigned from coaching the team.', '/uploads/images/c_137541.png'),
(152, 'Hiroki Kurokawa', '黒川弘樹', '配角', '', 'Hiroki was a member of Karasuno High''s Boys'' Volleyball Club. He played as a wing spiker and was the captain during his third year.', '/uploads/images/c_137543.png'),
(152, 'Takaaki Anabara', '穴原孝昭', '配角', 'Eiji Hanawa', 'Takaaki is the coach for Johzenji High.', '/uploads/images/c_137603.png'),
(152, 'Yuudai Hyakuzawa', '百沢雄大', '配角', 'Shouta Yamamoto', 'Yuudai is a 1st year at Kakugawa High. He plays as a wing spiker.', '/uploads/images/c_137681.png'),
(152, 'Suguru Daishou', '大将優', '配角', 'Kazuyuki Okitsu', '__Height:__ 178 cm __Year:__ Third Year Highschool Student __Number:__ 1 __Position:__ Captain, Outside Hitter __Team:__ Nohebi Academy Daishou is a competitive person who enjoys mocking others, especially the members of Nekoma. However, he gets flustered and emotional when he is mocked in return, such as when [Kuroo](https://anilist.co/character/71269/Kuroo-Tetsurou) brought up his ex-girlfriend. He is a cunning, manipulative person who uses a polite façade during matches to win the referee''s favor; he would admit to net-touches and apologize loudly to bolster Nohebi''s reputation, but use somewhat underhand tactics without the audience knowing, such as purposely spiking a ball at an opponent''s face and using the referee''s influence to get away with spikes that were originally out. During the match, he shows composure in analyzing the situation of the match, which is pointed out by the Nohebi coach.', '/uploads/images/c_137730.jpg'),
(152, 'Ren Oomimi', '大耳練', '配角', 'Takumu Miyazono', 'A third year at Inarizaki High and a middle blocker.', '/uploads/images/c_139482.png'),
(152, 'Hitoshi Ginjima', '銀島結', '配角', 'Shouma Yamamoto', 'A second year at Inarizaki High and a wing spiker.', '/uploads/images/c_139483.png'),
(152, 'Aran Ojiro', '尾白アラン', '配角', 'Sayaka Fukui', '__Height:__ 184.7 cm (6'' 0.7") __Occupation: __High School Student (3rd Year, Class 5) __Teams:__ Inarizaki High (Former) __Number:__ 4 (High School 3rd Year) __Position:__ Outside Hitter Ace A third year at Inarizaki High and the volleyball club''s wing spiker and ace. He is also one of the top aces in Japan. He is best friends with the Miya twins and good friends with Kita Shinsuke, the teams captain.', '/uploads/images/c_139485.png'),
(152, 'Atsumu Miya', '宮侑', '配角', 'Risae Matsuda', '__Height:__ 183 cm __Year:__ Second Year Highschool Student __Number:__ 7 __Position:__ Setter __Team:__ Inarizaki High Atsumu Miya is an second year highschool student who lives in Hyogo Prefecture, Japan. Outwardly, Atsumu appears to be a carefree, confident person who''s usually seen with a lazy smile on his face, though he enjoys provoking people and giving offhand compliments. He can be quite condescending, and somewhat selfish at times. His twin brother, [Osamu Miya](https://anilist.co/character/139492/), describes him as someone who doesn''t listen to others, doesn''t return what he borrows, and lies habitually. He also appears to be a perfectionist who has ridiculously high standards for himself and his spikes. Atsumu is a competitive person who hates losing; sometimes, these traits can veer off in a bad direction. ~!As of 2018, he is a member of MSBY Black Jackals, a professional volleyball team in Division 1 of Japan''s V. League. He is also a member of the Japan National Volleyball Team and participated in the 2021 Olympics.!~', '/uploads/images/c_139486.png'),
(152, 'Norimune Kurosu', '黒須法宗', '配角', 'Nobuaki Kanemitsu', 'The coach of Inarizaki High''s Boys'' volley club.', '/uploads/images/c_139487.png'),
(152, 'Heisuke Riseki', '理石平介', '配角', 'Masaya Fukunishi', 'A first year at Inarizaki High, along with being a wing spiker and pinch server.', '/uploads/images/c_139488.png'),
(152, 'Rintarou Suna', '角名倫太郎', '配角', 'Nobunaga Shimazaki', '__Height:__ 185.7 cm (6'' 1.1") He is the middle blocker of Inarizaki High', '/uploads/images/c_139489.png'),
(152, 'Yuuto Kosaku', '小作裕渡', '配角', 'Masaya Fukunishi', 'A second year at Inarizaki High and a wing spiker.', '/uploads/images/c_139490.png'),
(152, 'Michinari Akagi', '赤木路成', '配角', 'Yoshiyuki Matsuura', 'A third year at Inarizaki High and a libero.', '/uploads/images/c_139491.png'),
(152, 'Osamu Miya', '宮治', '配角', 'Satsumi Matsuda', '__Height:__183 cm __Number:__11 __Position:__ Opposite Hitter __Team:__ Inarizaki High Osamu is a second-year high school student who lives in Hyogo Prefecture, Japan. Osamu appears to be the calmer of the Miya twins with a laid-back and deadpan personality. Despite his outward demeanor, Osamu is highly competitive and becomes heated even if it isn''t obvious on the surface. Osamu is also shown to have a large passion for food. He thinks about it often in the middle of a match and would get distracted by the smell of it. He can''t seem to pick a favorite food and wouldn''t know what to eat as his last meal. Like his brother, Atsumu Miya, he loses self-control when it comes to eating. He''s shown to have a sense of humor, especially regarding Atsumu, whom Osamu teases whenever he messes up.', '/uploads/images/c_139492.png'),
(152, 'Iori Kanazawa', '金沢伊織', '配角', 'Justin Tomimori', 'A third year at Sarukawa Tech High and a wing spiker.', '/uploads/images/c_139493.png'),
(152, 'Itaru Shiramine', '白峰周', '配角', 'Yuu Miyazaki', 'A third year at Sarukawa Tech High, along with being the volleyball club''s captain and setter.', '/uploads/images/c_139494.jpg'),
(152, 'Hisahiko Wakura', '和倉久彦', '配角', 'Reo Tatsumori', 'A third year at Sarukawa Tech High and a middle blocker.', '/uploads/images/c_139495.jpg'),
(152, 'Kenrou Fukatani', '深谷謙朗', '配角', 'Kentarou Kumagai', 'A second year at Sarukawa Tech High and a wing spiker.', '/uploads/images/c_139496.png'),
(152, 'Tomonari Shiga', '志賀智也', '配角', 'Satoru Okabe', 'A third year at Sarukawa Tech High and a middle blocker.', '/uploads/images/c_139497.jpg'),
(152, 'Aritaka Shishio', '鹿尾有敬', '配角', 'Kentarou Tone', 'The coach of Sarukawa Tech High''s Boys'' volleyball club. He was a former trainee of [Nekomata](https://anilist.co/character/74593/Yasufumi-Nekomata), which is thought to be the origin of Sarukawa Tech''s tight defense.', '/uploads/images/c_139498.jpg'),
(152, 'Souji Yamashiro', '山代総司', '配角', '', 'A second year at Sarukawa Tech High and a wing spiker.', '/uploads/images/c_139499.png'),
(152, 'Tomokazu Wajima', '輪島友和', '配角', 'Yuuki Shin', 'A second year at Sarukawa Tech High and a libero.', '/uploads/images/c_139500.jpg'),
(152, 'Kourai Hoshiumi', '星海光来', '配角', 'Natsuki Hanae', '__Height:__ 169.2 cm (5''6.6") __Teams:__ Yurisei Middle School (Former); Kamomedai High __Number:__ 5 __Position:__ Outside Hitter, Ace Hoshiumi Originally planned on playing basketball, but he decided to join the volleyball team in second grade. His reason was listed as wanting to be free from his older brother, Akitomo, who constantly sneered at Hoshiumi over their height difference. Despite his reasoning at first, Hoshiumi soon came to love the sport as he watched official matches on TV.', '/uploads/images/c_139509.png'),
(152, 'Sachirou Hirugami', '昼神幸郎', '配角', 'Yuu Miyazaki', '__Height:__ 190.4 cm (6'' 3") A second year at Kamomedai High and a middle blocker. He likes shumai with extra fillings.', '/uploads/images/c_139514.jpg'),
(152, 'Kanoka Amanai', '天内叶歌', '配角', 'Saori Oonishi', '__Height:__ 182.5 cm (5'' 11.9") __Uniform Number:__ 6 __Position:__ Wing Spiker (ace) Wing spiker and ace of Niiyama Girls'' High SChool Volleyball Team and [Tanaka](https://anilist.co/character/67325/Ryuunosuke-Tanaka)''s childhood friend.', '/uploads/images/c_139520.png'),
(152, 'Alisa Haiba', '灰羽アリサ', '配角', 'Mao Ichimichi', '__Height:__ 178 cm __Nationality:__ Half-Russian; Half-Japanese __Likes:__ Sushi Alisa is an older sister of first year Nekoma Team player: [Lev Haiba](https://anilist.co/character/89517/Lev-Haiba). From the moment of her debut, Alisa has acted as lively and bubbly, but also as innocent as her brother is. She is very supportive of Lev, affectionately referring to him as "Lyovochka" and cheering him on during his match. It''s also been implied that she''s a bit of an imaginative romantic, which was shown when she quickly jumped to the conclusion that Akane was in love with Lev. (Source: Haikyuu!! Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_139522.png'),
(152, 'Akane Yamamoto', '山本あかね', '配角', 'Miyu Tomita', 'The younger sister of Taketora Yamamoto.', '/uploads/images/c_139526.png'),
(152, 'Maiko Yonezawa', '米沢まい子', '配角', 'Ayaka Oohashi', 'From Niiyama Girls'' High. Friends with Amanai Kanoka.', '/uploads/images/c_165620.png'),
(152, 'Kai Akakura', '赤倉櫂', '配角', '', '__School (Team):__ Shiratorizawa Academy __Grade:__ 1-10 __Position:__ Libero __Height:__ 171.4 cm (5''7'''') __Weight:__ 59.5 kg __Kai Akakura__ is a first year libero at Shiratorizawa Academy. He helps out during the first year training camp and befriends Hinata when working together.', '/uploads/images/c_167512.jpg'),
(152, 'Fuki Hibarida ', '雲雀田吹', '配角', 'Hiroshi Yanaka', '__Fuki Hibarida__ is the coach for the Japan Olympic Men''s Volleyball Team.', '/uploads/images/c_167514.png'),
(152, 'Shinsuke Kita', '北信介', '配角', 'Kenji Nojima', '__Hometown:__ Hyougo Prefecture __School (Team):__ Inarizaki High __Grade:__ 3-7 __Height:__ 175.2 cm (5''9'''') __Weight:__ 67.5 kg (148.8 lbs) __Likes:__ Tofu Hamburger __Introduction:__ Shinsuke Kita is a third-year wing spiker and the captain of Inarizaki High. __Appearance:__ Kita is of average height with an athletic build. His hair is light gray with black tips at the ends. He also has dark eyes and thin eyebrows.', '/uploads/images/c_167515.png'),
(152, 'Mika Yamaka ', '山架美華', '配角', 'Karen Miyama', 'Mika Yamaka is a third year at Nohebi Academy. She is the girlfriend of Suguru Daisho, the captain of the boys'' volleyball team.', '/uploads/images/c_167550.png'),
(152, 'Tarou Oomi', '近江太郎', '配角', 'Taichi Takeda', 'Coach of Inarizaki High''s Boys'' Volleyball Team', '/uploads/images/c_290121.jpg'),
(152, 'Shizuyasu Yokoyama', '横山静康', '配角', '', 'Appears to be a long-time avid fan of Karasuno High School''s boys'' volleyball team. It is said that he will cheer for the plays he thinks are good, and boo the bad ones. The current Karasuno third-years remember him coming to watch their games during their first year and calling the team fallen crows.', '/uploads/images/c_290467.jpg'),
(152, 'Yuushou Sagae', '寒河江勇将', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 177.8cm (5''10") First-year at Shiratorizawa Academy and wing spiker on the volleyball team. He is one of the ball boys at the Miyagi First-Year Training Camp.', '/uploads/images/c_290507.jpg'),
(153, 'Kazuya Kinoshita', '木ノ下和也', '主角', 'Shun Horie', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''10") A struggling university student living in Tokyo. He studies at Nerima University. Kazuya possesses a wishy-washy nature and is susceptible to yielding to his selfish desires. His lies often get him into trouble, because he cannot muster the strength to tell the truth. On the other hand, possessing a straightforward kindness that cares for those around him. He has also developed feelings for [Chizuru](https://anilist.co/character/128106/Ichinose-Chizuru).', '/uploads/images/c_128105.jpg'),
(153, 'Chizuru Ichinose', '一ノ瀬ちづる', '主角', 'Sora Amamiya', '__Height:__ 162 cm (5''4") Chizuru Ichinose, alternatively known as Chizuru Mizuhara in her "rental girlfriend" persona, is a college student at Nerima University who is majoring in Literature and she currently lives in Room 204 of Royal Hills Nerima, just next to [Kazuya Kinoshita](https://anilist.co/character/128105/Kazuya-Kinoshita).', '/uploads/images/c_128106.jpg'),
(153, 'Sumi Sakurasawa', '桜沢墨', '配角', 'Rie Takahashi', '**Height:** 156 cm (5''1") Sumi is a college student who works as a rental girlfriend for the Diamond app. She''s extremely shy which initially made the job quite difficult for her, but she started to improve after spending time with [Kazuya](https://anilist.co/character/128105/Kinoshita-Kazuya).', '/uploads/images/c_144665.jpg'),
(153, 'Ruka Sarashina', '更科瑠夏', '配角', 'Nao Touyama', '__Height:__ 158 cm (5''2") Ruka Sarashina suffers from arrhythmia and seeks a lover that will help her cope with her condition. She''s seen as being a very pushy and possessive kind of person. This personality of hers developed after learning of her condition and being alienated from her peers. Because of this, she became very fixated on the idea that getting a boyfriend would help her in having a faster heartbeat. Along with her rather brash personality, she doesn''t like giving up easily; often making poor decisions to get what she wants.', '/uploads/images/c_147005.jpg'),
(153, 'Mami Nanami', '七海麻美', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', '**Height:** 158 cm (5''2") She is a freshman at Nerima University and the ex-girlfriend of [Kazuya Kinoshita](https://anilist.co/character/128105). ~!She dumped him after only one month. Even though she broke up with him, she can not fathom Kazuya moving on and seizes every moment attempting to sabotage his happiness.!~', '/uploads/images/c_154224.jpg'),
(153, 'Nagomi Kinoshita', '木ノ下和', '配角', 'Yukari Nozawa', 'Kazuya''s grandmother.', '/uploads/images/c_172021.jpg'),
(153, 'Yoshiaki Kibe', '木部芳秋', '配角', 'Masayuki Akasaka', 'Kazuya''s childhood friend from elementary school. He often cares for Kazuya.', '/uploads/images/c_172022.jpg'),
(153, 'Shun Kuribayashi', '栗林駿', '配角', 'Gakuto Kajiwara', 'Kazuya''s friend.', '/uploads/images/c_172023.jpg'),
(153, 'Sayuri Ichinose', '一ノ瀬小百合', '配角', 'Sayuri Sadaoka', 'She is Mizuhara''s grandmother.', '/uploads/images/c_283247.jpg'),
(153, 'Miharu Imai', '今井 みはる', '配角', 'Hisako Toujou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_323409.jpg'),
(154, 'Senkuu Ishigami', '石神千空', '主角', 'Yuusuke Kobayashi', '__Height:__ 171 cm (5''7") Senkuu is a genius with a vast amount of scientific knowledge. He is able to invent various kinds of tools and gadgets in a short amount of time with ease. As a child, he designed and built a functioning miniature rocket ship. Senkuu also possesses an analytical mind, being able to correctly discern the situation he is in. Even in his pre-teens, he was intelligent and sharp-minded enough to create advanced machines. Senkuu''s physical abilities are very low and he would lose against someone like [Kohaku](https://anilist.co/character/124143) in a brawl, something he himself admits. ~!In "Village Games Arc" Senku unintentionally won and married [Ruri](https://anilist.co/character/143272), but divorced immediately afterwards.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124142.png'),
(154, 'Kohaku', 'コハク', '主角', 'Manami Numakura', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") Kohaku is a young woman who is a descendant of modern humans. She is Ruri''s younger sister and the daughter of Kokuyo. She appears to be well known in her village due to her combative abilities, as both Kinro and Ginro were afraid of her. Kohaku excels at fighting, hunting, and general survival skills. She is a tomboy by nature, having little interest in more typical feminine activities and has little knowledge about them, although she does seem to enjoy some lavish clothing that was provided to her. She possesses a sharp instinct and intellect. Kohaku is a kind young woman, caring deeply for her sickly older sister, willing to participate in the tournament for her hand in marriage just to protect her. This care extends to her comrades, and anyone she''s loyal to. In addition to this, she has a reckless and hotheaded personality, often reacting in anger to being called a gorilla or lioness due to her strength and physicality. She also acts on her emotions at times, going against rational thought. She also has a bit of a teasing side, asking Chrome if he could fall for her to her resemblance to her sister.', '/uploads/images/c_124143.png'),
(154, 'Tsukasa Shishiou', '獅子王司', '主角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Height:__ 195 cm (6''4") According to [Taiju](https://anilist.co/character/124146/Ooki-Taiju), Tsukasa has the reputation as "The Strongest High School Primate" due to his tremendous fighting abilities. Tsukasa is essentially violent, but extremely careful and aware of his actions. He is a very kind, thoughtful, and polite man outside of his pessimistic ideals towards humanity. He offers help in the beginning to [Senku](https://anilist.co/character/124142/Ishigami-Senkuu) and Taiju after they revive him and becomes their hunter for food, using his skills as a prominent athlete to aid them. It’s revealed later that Tsukasa plans to purge humanity of adults who hurt the young and weak, then thinks Senku will go along with him, but instead Senku rejects him. After this point, Tsukasa becomes fairly determined in carrying out his plans even to the point of leaving their group.', '/uploads/images/c_124144.png'),
(154, 'Chrome', 'クロム', '主角', 'Gen Satou', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") Chrome is the alleged sorcerer - eventually turned scientist - of Ishigami Village. As part of the Kingdom of Science, Chrome serves as the unofficial right hand of [Senku](https://anilist.co/character/124142/Ishigami-Senkuu); this trust is what makes him one of the Five Wise Generals. Chrome is a highly energetic person with a lot of passion and curiosity. He is genuinely interested in science, although at first, he only knows it as sorcery. He is confident in his intellect, enough so to go toe to toe with Senku despite getting destroyed in a battle of wits. He also has a tendency to refer to something as "bad" when he thinks it is cool or amazing. Chrome has a deep love of science, though he admits his expertise and knowledge lies mainly in exploration, particularly pertaining to rocks and minerals and gathering them. He is loyal and selfless to his friends and, while lacking in physical abilities, he is still able to think of clever solutions out of dangerous situations. He is also exceedingly brave, and in addition, while he is usually a loudmouth, he knows when to keep his mouth shut. He loves science and, in many ways, is an accomplished scientist in his own right, managing to create chemical reactions from the rocks he collected through frequent trial and error (reactions which were only made known in the seventeenth century), despite never knowing this knowledge before Senku''s arrival.', '/uploads/images/c_124145.png'),
(154, 'Taiju Ooki', '大木大樹', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', '__Height:__ 189 cm (6''2½") Taiju is an outgoing, friendly, and kind person. He''s enthusiastic about performing even small tasks and a diligent worker. He is very determined when something is important to him. He tends to yell loudly and is enthusiastic regardless of the task so long as he proves useful. He is persistent and determined. Despite being emotional and expressive, he has great control of his temper, never losing his cool or acting impulsively. Taiju possesses an extremely sturdy body, something his friend [Senku](https://anilist.co/character/124142) vouches him for. He is the first human to be able to withstand a kick from [Tsukasa](https://anilist.co/character/124144) without losing consciousness. He also possesses immense stamina, able to cross 80 kilometers in 5 hours.', '/uploads/images/c_124146.jpg'),
(154, 'Yuzuriha Ogawa', '小川杠', '配角', 'Kana Ichinose', 'Yuzuriha is the love interest of [Taiju](https://anilist.co/character/124146) and a friend of [Senkuu](https://anilist.co/character/124142). Yuzuriha is a young woman with brown hair, brown eyes, and a slim build. She has two noticeable petrification scars, both in the shape of spirals, located on her shoulder and neck. Before her petrification, Yuzuriha wears a standard High School Uniform. After her depetrification, she wears a white cloth dress that''s spit at her sides and matching cloth shoes. Noticeably, Yuzuriha wears a white hairband that''s vaguely shaped like wrap-around headphones, both before and after her petrification.', '/uploads/images/c_124147.jpg'),
(154, 'Suika', 'スイカ', '配角', 'Karin Takahashi', '__Height:__ 119 cm (3''10") Suika is a young girl who lives in the village with the other stone age humans. Her most notable feature is the large watermelon on her head, which she can climb inside to disguise herself as the fruit. [Senku](https://anilist.co/character/124142/Ishigami-Senkuu) first meets Suika when he, [Chrome](https://anilist.co/character/124145/Chrome), and [Kohaku](https://anilist.co/character/124143/Kohaku) were searching for iron sand in a nearby river. Suika is eager to help Senku build his kingdom of science because she''s never been useful to anyone before. She comes to work as an information gatherer for the kingdom of science, occasionally being referred to as ''Ace Detective Suika.''', '/uploads/images/c_124162.jpg'),
(154, 'Gen Asagiri', 'あさぎりゲン', '主角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") Gen Asagiri is an enemy turned ally of [Senku](https://anilist.co/character/124142/Ishigami-Senkuu). Originally de-petrified by [Tsukasa Shishio](https://anilist.co/character/124144/Shishiou-Tsukasa), he was sent to find Senku, only to defect to the Kingdom of Science. Gen later becomes one of the Five Wise Generals. He is somewhat full of himself and his abilities, taking pride in his status as a magician and a mentalist, along with his knowledge of the human psyche. Gen is rather quirky and can often be seen speaking in Pig Latin. He tends to be lazy, self absorbed, and perverted, and he is also perfectly capable of lying without a hint of stress or change in expression. While he frequently portrays an aura of selfishness, hard self-interest, manipulation and deviousness, Gen is intrinsically a good person who can''t bring himself to harm others. His outward appearance is masked by his mastery in psychology, but his actions tell of loyalty, determination, kindness and even sacrifice at times. While not nearly as intelligent in terms of science compared to Senku, he proves to be his equal and one of his most vital allies due to his ability to understand the human psyche and manipulate people through lies in contrast to Senku''s more honest nature. He uses his abilities to promote cooperation and enthusiasm, motivate allies, conduct negotiations, and outsmart enemies. He tends to shift between acting as a ditzy airhead when it suits him (such as to avo', '/uploads/images/c_127445.png'),
(154, 'Kaseki', 'カセキ', '配角', 'Mugihito', '__Height:__ 155 cm (5''1") Kaseki is an elderly craftsman from the Ishigami Village. When Senku arrives at Ishigami village, Kaseki is introduced as an artisan, and through Senku, his dedication to his craft is reignited tenfold.', '/uploads/images/c_136446.jpg'),
(154, 'Ginrou', '銀狼', '配角', 'Ayumu Murase', 'Ginrou is [Kinrou](https://anilist.co/character/143271/Kinrou)''s younger brother and one of the village guards. He is shorter and scrawnier than his brother, with short blonde hair and green eyes. He usually wears a karate gi-like uniform and belt and carries his spear wherever he goes. He and his brother were two of the first villagers to join the Kingdom of Science. ~!During the adventure on Treasure Island, Ginrou manages to convince [Matsukaze](https://anilist.co/character/188816/Matsukaze) to serve him due to the resemblance Ginrou bears to his late master.!~', '/uploads/images/c_143270.jpg'),
(154, 'Kinrou', '金狼', '配角', 'Tomoaki Maeno', 'Kinrou is the elder brother of [Ginrou](https://anilist.co/character/143270/Ginrou) and the son of Tetsuken and Shirogane. Originally having served as one of the guards of Ishigami Village alongside Ginrou, he quickly joined [Senku](https://anilist.co/character/124142/Ishigami-Senkuu) as a member of the Kingdom of Science. Kinrou is a muscular young man of average height, with a scar on the right side of his face and a cluster of hair hanging in between his eyes. He wears a sleeveless karate gi-like uniform with a belt and a buckler with a star pattern on his back. After the Grand Bout, Kinrou begins wearing a pair of glasses to correct his nearsightedness.', '/uploads/images/c_143271.jpg'),
(154, 'Ruri', 'ルリ', '配角', 'Reina Ueda', 'Ruri is [Kohaku](https://anilist.co/character/124143/Kohaku)''s elder sister and the daughter of [Kokuyo](https://anilist.co/character/150509/Kokuyo), and serves as the priestess of Ishigami Village. She is similar to Kohaku in appearance but has longer hair and a more hourglass-shaped body. She wears a black sundress and a piece of rope around her neck.', '/uploads/images/c_143272.png'),
(154, 'You Uei', '上井陽', '配角', 'Yoshiki Nakajima', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''10") You is a pre-petrification human and former policeman who is revived by [Tsukasa](https://anilist.co/character/124144/Tsukasa-Shishiou). He faked his death after [Chrome](https://anilist.co/character/124145/Chrome)''s escape to avoid the blame, then eventually joins the Kingdom of Science after the stone wars are over. As penance, he worked with [Yuzuriha](https://anilist.co/character/124147/Yuzuriha-Ogawa) to rebuild the statues that were destroyed by Tsukasa. He is constantly butting heads with [Magma](https://anilist.co/character/145095/Magma) due to each other''s naivety of their respective worlds.', '/uploads/images/c_145061.png'),
(154, 'Hyouga', '氷月', '配角', 'Akira Ishida', '__Height:__ 189cm (6''2") Hyoga is a survivor who was revived by Tsukasa Shishio. Initially, he was an elite member of the Tsukasa Empire since he was depetrified by Tsukasa. ~!He ultimately betrays Tsukasa by attempting to take over his leadership and threatens Senku into joining, only to be defeated by the duo in the decisive battle for the Kingdom of Science. When the situation calls for it, he is depetrified once again and summoned to battle - now as a begrudging ally of the Kingdom of Science with a similar but slightly mellowed goal in mind. Since his third depetrification, Hyoga''s goals are unknown.!~ Hyoga has an easy going attitude towards everything. Even in situation that do not work in his favour, he still remains calm. While he claims to share the same values as Tsukasa when it comes to only reviving the young and creating a community where no one takes from others, Hyoga himself is an elitist who believes in social darwinism. He categorizes humans as either enlightened (or strong) and unenlightened (or weak). He believes that the "brainless incompetent masses" should not be allowed to live and that only those who excel should be allowed to live. While he does follow a form of social darwinism, he does not believe it is only the physically strong who should survive, as he wanted Senku to join him in his endeavors and become the strongest duo, indicating he respected Senku''s intelligence and understood his capabilities. He is very manipulative and cunning, seems to', '/uploads/images/c_145062.jpg'),
(154, 'Nikki Hanada', '花田仁姫', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', '__Height:__ 180 cm (5''11") Nikki is a survivor that was revived by [Tsukasa](https://anilist.co/character/124144/Tsukasa-Shishiou), who assigned her to keep watch over [Taiju](https://anilist.co/character/124146/Taiju-Ooki) and [Yuzuriha](https://anilist.co/character/124147/Yuzuriha-Ogawa). She later defected from the Tsukasa Empire and joined the Kingdom of Science, where her unofficial role is that of disciplinarian. She has great physical strength, constantly being shown keeping people like [Magma](https://anilist.co/character/145095/Magma) and [You](https://anilist.co/character/145061/You-Uei) in line. Nikki is a massive fan of [Lillian Weinberg](https://anilist.co/character/149274/Lillian-Weinberg). In the modern world she was having a rough time at school and listening to Lillian''s songs saved her.', '/uploads/images/c_145063.jpg'),
(154, 'Ukyou Saionji', '西園寺羽京', '配角', 'Kenshou Ono', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") Ukyou is a survivor that was revived by [Tsukasa Shishiou](https://anilist.co/character/124144/Tsukasa-Shishiou). He is pacifistic and dislikes needless bloodshed.', '/uploads/images/c_145064.png'),
(154, 'Homura Momiji', '紅葉ほむら', '配角', 'Aki Toyosaki', '__Height:__ 145 cm (4''9") Homura acts as the right-hand man of [Hyouga](https://anilist.co/character/145062/Hyouga) in [Tsukasa](https://anilist.co/character/124144/Tsukasa-Shishiou)''s army. She was a competitive gymnast before the petrification.', '/uploads/images/c_145065.png'),
(154, 'Magma', 'マグマ', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Mamiya', 'Magma is a villager from the Ishigami village. Magma is known for being the strongest of all the Villagers in terms of strength.', '/uploads/images/c_145095.png'),
(154, 'Minami Hokutouzai', '北東西南', '配角', 'Youko Hikasa', '__Height:__ 166 cm (5''4") Minami is a Pre-Petrification human and former reporter before the Petrification occurred. ~!Originally a member of [Tsukasa](https://anilist.co/character/124144/Shishiou-Tsukasa)''s army before Tsukasa''s downfall at the hands of [Hyoga](https://anilist.co/character/145062/Hyouga)''s betrayal, she later joins and helps the Kingdom of Science.!~', '/uploads/images/c_145096.png'),
(154, 'Mirai Shishiou', '獅子王未来', '配角', 'Manaka Iwami', '__Initial Age (mental):__ 6 __Initial Age (physical):__ 12 __Height__: 139 cm (4''7") Mirai is the beloved little sister of [Tsukasa](https://anilist.co/character/124144/Tsukasa-Shishiou). Mirai was clinically brain dead prior to the Petrification, the doctors saying she''d never wake up. Tsukasa refused to give up on her and took on his MMA matches to keep paying the medical bills that kept her on life support. ~!She was depetrified by [Senku](https://anilist.co/character/124142/Senkuu-Ishigami) as part of the deal to end the war between the Kingdom of Science and the Tsukasa Empire.!~', '/uploads/images/c_145100.png'),
(154, 'Chalk', 'チョーク', '配角', 'Sayumi Suzushiro', 'Dog from Ishigami Village. He is Suika''s friend.', '/uploads/images/c_147567.jpg'),
(154, 'Mantle', 'マントル', '配角', '', 'Mantle is a villager of Ishigami Village who idolizes Magma.', '/uploads/images/c_147570.png'),
(154, 'Lillian Weinberg', 'リリアン ・ ワインバーグ', '配角', 'Lynn', 'A famous American diva and songstress whose name is known by the whole world. Her passion in adventuring lead her aboard the International Space Station (ISS) alongside Senku''s father, Byuakuya Ishigami.', '/uploads/images/c_149274.jpg'),
(154, 'Byakuya Ishigami', '石神百夜 ', '配角', '', 'Byakuya Ishigami was a Japanese astronaut who was residing on the International Space Station when the Petrification on Earth''s surface occurred. He was a kind, playful, and mischievous man who always found a way to amuse himself and keep things lighthearted, no matter the stakes. ~!He was [Senku Ishigami](https://anilist.co/character/124142/Senkuu-Ishigami)''s adoptive father.!~', '/uploads/images/c_149275.jpg'),
(154, 'Kokuyo', 'コクヨウ', '配角', 'Tetsuo Kanao', 'Father of [Kohaku](https://anilist.co/character/124143/Kohaku) and [Ruri](https://anilist.co/character/143272/Ruri). He was the village chief of Ishigami Village at the time of [Senku](https://anilist.co/character/124142/Senkuu-Ishigami)''s reawakening. ~!Kokuyo at first refuses to accept Senku as the new village chief, even though Senku won the Grand Bout. After witnessing Senku''s antibiotic cure Ruri he officially crowns Senku the new leader of Ishigami Village. Despite not being the chief anymore, he serves as something of a co-leader of Ishigami Village, focusing on more practical concerns like food gathering, while Senku focuses on scientific advancement.!~', '/uploads/images/c_150509.jpg'),
(154, 'Natri', 'なとり', '配角', '', 'Villager from Ishigami Village. He is the father of [Carbo](https://anilist.co/character/255669) and the husband of [Alumi](https://anilist.co/character/255671/).', '/uploads/images/c_255670.png'),
(154, 'Tetsuya Kinomoto', '基本徹夜', '配角', 'Syacho Hajime', '__Height:__ 155 cm A modern member of the Kingdom of Science. He was a manga artist prior to the Petrification. He was revived to test the feasibility of reviving a broken statue, and was later tasked with helping bring back entertainment to the Stone World.', '/uploads/images/c_282320.jpg'),
(155, 'Blair', 'ブレア', '配角', 'Emiri Katou', 'A playful cat with powerful magic that Soul and Maka initially confused for a regular witch. Her life seems to largely revolve around doing whatever she deems fun at any given time, ranging from working as a hostess at Chupa♡Cabra''s to aiding the DWMA''s plans - however, she''s also very sensitive to others'' feelings, often comforting those in need out of kindness. She''s also shown to enjoy long baths and exhibitionism, being very proud of her human form''s body and often looking for opportunities to make others feel embarrassed. Her magic abilities are themed around pumpkins, and she also keeps a hat monster named Zwan (ズワン) as her familiar. Due to being a cat, she has nine lives, which is how she managed to survive her initial defeat at the hands of Soul and Maka. Additionally, her charms seem to transcend gender-altering magic, with her male form being able to seduce a succubus within the Book of Eibon.', '/uploads/images/c_8458.png'),
(155, 'Spirit Albarn', 'スピリット=アルバーン', '配角', 'Tooru Ookawa', 'He is the Shinigami’s current weapon and Maka’s father. He is very protective of Maka and is ready to jump to her aid any time she’s in trouble (he is always stopped by the Shinigami). His wife is Maka’s mother but they are divorced now due to his constant flirting with other women. Even though he visits clubs, he is still insanely loyal to his ex-wife and daughter. He usually runs yelling about much he loves Maka and her mother (he calls Maka’s mother Mama). He is extremely sad that his daughter hates him but he still tries to be a good father by looking out for her in his own silly way. He used to be Dr. Franken’s partner before partnering up with "Mama" who later became his wife (which obviously lead to the divorce); he still suffers nightmares about Dr. Franken trying to dissect him and still has memories from college when he and Stein were roommates. His old name was Spirit.', '/uploads/images/c_8462.jpg'),
(155, 'Shinra Kusakabe', '日下部森羅', '主角', 'Gakuto Kajiwara', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") __Affiliation:__ Special Fire Force Company 8 __Rank:__ Second Class Soldier Since being accused of using his powers to cause the fire that took his family, his face''s habit of tensing up into a bizarre smile when he gets nervous has earned him the derisive nickname of "devil". He joined the Fire Force to achieve his dream of becoming a hero and saving people from the fear of the flames, as well as uncover the truth behind his family''s death twelve years ago. Though a newcomer in the Special Fire Force, Shinra has posed a challenge to experienced members of the force and has even defeated a Captain. Being a Fire Soldier, Shinra is experienced in rescuing people and is strong enough to carry four people out of a building. While he mostly relies on his Ignition Ability in combat, he has exhibited skill in ordinary fighting as well, being able to pin an opponent to the ground and break their guard with a sturdy kick, as well as being capable of defending himself from ground-breaking attacks.', '/uploads/images/c_120462.png'),
(155, 'Akitaru Oubi', '秋樽桜備', '主角', 'Kazuya Nakai', '__Height:__ 189 cm (6''2") __Affiliation:__ Special Fire Force Company 8 __Rank:__ Captain The popular and charismatic leader of the newly established Company 8. His goal is to investigate the other companies and uncover the truth about spontaneous human combustion. He has no powers, but uses his finely-honed muscles as a weapon in a battle style that''s on even par with [Benimaru](https://anilist.co/character/130848)''s. Loves bodybuilding to an almost creepy extent. Despite not being a Pyrokinetic like most other known Battalion Commanders, Akitaru has a very fit physique, which allows him to face Infernals. In battle, he is seen using different weapons, suitable for the situation, like the Core Annihilating Pile Bunker or a fire fighting axe, which he can veil in white steam and thrust at the opponent. His weapons appear to be designed in order to impale an Infernal''s core with low difficulty. He is able to carry up to 30kg of equipment each time he is on a mission to fight an Infernal. As a fire fighter, Akitaru was recognized enough to be decorated twice, though both were revoked due to actions prioritising saving citizens lives at the expense of defying orders.', '/uploads/images/c_130712.png'),
(155, 'Maki Oze', '尾瀬茉希', '主角', 'Saeko Kamijou', '__Height:__ 167 cm (5''6") __Affiliation:__ Special Fire Force Company 8 __Rank:__ First Class Fire Soldier A former member of the military, she is an excellent fighter who controls fire. She''s a cool lady but is mad about love stories, and her beauty is overshadowed by her "head full of flowers and wedding bells". She''s friendly but goes berserk when anyone comments on her muscles. Apparently,​ she used to be slender. Maki possesses Second Generation abilities, having adapted to Spontaneous Human Combustion by becoming able to control flames from a long distance. In doing so, she can handle herself against two Third Generations simultaneously, being able to extinguish and absorb their generated flames into a giant fireball. Maki''s abilities provide defense for her entire team, as she can reflect incoming fire attacks and use an opponent''s flames against them. While she is unable to deflect or redirect a fire with too much driving force, she is still able to alter its shape in order to reduce its impact.', '/uploads/images/c_130713.png'),
(155, 'Takehisa Hinawa', '武久火縄', '主角', 'Kenichi Suzumura', '__Height:__ 180 cm (5''11") __Affiliation:__ Special Fire Force Company 8 __Rank:__ Lieutenant A dry, unemotional ex-military man, whose stern disciplina is feared among the new recruits. He helped Obi to found Company 8. He never allows the soldiers to play with fire. The gun he uses is a cherished memento from his friend who became an Infernal. Takehisa is a Second Generation, who has awakened the ability to manipulate flames through the use of firearms, such as a machine gun or a pistol, which he wields on the battlefield. Takehisa''s ability allows him to control the gunpowder inside bullets, making the impact they make stronger or weaker, depending on the situation. He can use this ability to make his bullets non-lethal.', '/uploads/images/c_130714.png'),
(155, 'Arthur Boyle', 'アーサー・ボイル', '主角', 'Yuusuke Kobayashi', '**Height:** 174 cm He trained at the academy with [Shinra](https://anilist.co/character/120462/Kusakabe-Shinra). Although he follows his own personal code of chivalry as the self-proclaimed Knight King, he is incredibly stupid. But girls love him. Being a Third Generation Pyrokinetic, Arthur has been identified by individuals as having a strong will of fire. By raising the temperature of the flames he creates, he can fabricate and control plasma, which either elevates or diminishes in relation to Arthur''s disarrangement from reality. The more delusional he is, the stronger Arthur becomes. Being able to use his Ignition Ability on hilt-like objects, Arthur can weld, cut through metal, and generate electricity. He mainly uses his ability on his blade-less sword Excalibur, which is most effective using his right hand and cannot be easily extinguished by an experienced Second Generation. Using it, he can deflect and fend off against flames.', '/uploads/images/c_130715.png'),
(155, 'Iris', 'アイリス', '主角', 'Mao Ichimichi', '__Height:__ 154 cm (5''0) __Affiliation:__ Special Fire Force Company 8 __Rank:__ Nun A sister of the Holy Sol Temple, her prayers are an indispensable part of extinguishing Infernals. Personality-wise she is no less than an angel.', '/uploads/images/c_130716.png'),
(155, 'Tamaki Kotatsu', '環古達', '主角', 'Aoi Yuuki', '__Height:__ 156 cm (5''1") __Affiliation:__ Special Fire Force Company 8 __Rank:__ Second Class Soldier ~!Originally a rookie member of Company 1, she was caught up in the treasonous plot of her superior officer Hoshimiya, and is currently being disciplined under Company 8''s watch.!~ A tough girl with an unfortunate "lucky lecher lure" condition, she nevertheless has a pure heart. Being a Third Generation, she is immune to being burnt by flames and can use her Ignition Ability to gird herself in pink flames, which grant her various cat-like traits, including cat ears, two forked tails and nails on her fingertips, an ability she dubbed "Nekomata". With her Ignition Ability active, Tamaki''s agility and mobility is substantially increased, allowing her to run on all fours. She can use her forked-tails to generate a blast of fire, which is strong enough to break through building walls, restrain her targets in a circle of fire by lengthening them, or using them as a distress signal by the same process.', '/uploads/images/c_130751.png'),
(155, 'Princess Hibana', 'プリンセス火華', '配角', 'Lynn', 'Hibana is a Third Generation pyrokinetic and Captain of the Special Fire Force Company 5.', '/uploads/images/c_130783.png'),
(155, 'Leonard Burns', 'レオナルド・バーンズ', '配角', 'Taiten Kusunoki', 'He is a Third Generation pyrokinetic, and the Captain of Special Fire Force Company 1.', '/uploads/images/c_130785.png'),
(155, 'Huo Yan Li', 'フォイエン・リィ', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', '__Height:__ 184 cm (6'' 0½") __Affiliation:__ Special Fire Force Company 1 Huo Yan Li is a Third Generation pyrokinetic and member of the Special Fire Force Company 1. In contrast to his long-time friends and team-mates Karim Flam and Rekka Hoshimiya, Huo Yan is a rather laid-back and responsible individual, who doesn''t like to get worked-up and waste time with meaningless fighting. He abides to the etiquette of the 1st Special Fire Brigade strongly, going as far as to point out formalities, such as a dress code. Despite the revelation of the Church''s wrongdoing, Yan still abides by the institution because it gives people hope during tragedies and worships the Sun and Sun God and the good it brings to the world and humanity instead of the malicious ideals of the White Clad and the Evangelist.', '/uploads/images/c_130788.png'),
(155, 'Rekka Hoshimiya', '烈火星宮', '配角', 'Tomokazu Seki', 'A Third Generation pyrotechnic, Lieutenant of Special Fire Force Company 1, and priest of the Holy Sol Temple. He is an eccentric and enthusiastic man. Always confident and expressive in his speech. ~!He is one of several people using “insects” to turn people into infernals.!~', '/uploads/images/c_130789.png'),
(155, 'Karim Flam', 'カリム・フラム', '配角', 'Kazuyuki Okitsu', 'Karim is a second generation pyrotechnic, a Lieutenant of Special Fire Force Company 1, and priest of the Holy Sol Temple. He is a serious and cautious young man. He shows a high disrespect towards strangers, which can result in him insulting people.', '/uploads/images/c_130790.png'),
(155, 'Benimaru Shinmon', '紅丸新門', '配角', 'Mamoru Miyano', 'Benimaru Shinmon is a hybrid Second and Third Generation, as well as the Captain of Special Fire Force Company 7. Benimaru is regarded as the strongest Fire Officer in the Special Fire Force. He is known as "Asakusa''s King of Destruction" because of the devastating power that he is capable of unleashing. He is also an extremely skilled hand-to-hand combatant, as shown when he easily outmaneuvered and overpowered the combined might of [Maki Oze](https://anilist.co/character/130713), [Shinra Kusakabe](https://anilist.co/character/120462), [Tamaki Kotatsu](https://anilist.co/character/130751), [Arthur Boyle](https://anilist.co/character/130715), and [Takehisa Hinawa](https://anilist.co/character/130714). He possesses the rare trait of being a Second and Third Generation, which ultimately allows him to ignite his own flames willingly, and also control flames from an external source. He can use his brigade''s matoi as a pole to fly to long-distance areas, and by using his Second Generation ability, can control the flames of other ignited matoi and direct them to a certain place. He can control the direction and speed of bullets in the same fashion as Takehisa. He is also capable of unleashing an immensely powerful blast that resembles a crimson-coloured moon, which is strong enough to kill a Demon Infernal. Benimaru is a practitioner of the iaido martial arts. Instead of using a sword, he can create a sharp blade of flames, a technique branching from his unique Iai Hand-Sword: Firs', '/uploads/images/c_130848.jpg'),
(155, 'Hikage', 'ヒカゲ', '配角', 'Hikaru Akao', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_130849.jpg'),
(155, 'Tooru Kishiri', 'トオル岸里', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_130850.png'),
(155, 'Hinata', 'ヒナタ', '配角', 'Hikaru Akao', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_130851.jpg'),
(155, 'Konro Sagamiya', '相模屋紺炉', '配角', 'Tomoaki Maeno', 'Is a Third Generation pyrokinetic and is the Lieutenant of Special Fire Force Company 7. He is a very loyal subordinate of Benimaru Shinmon, willing to sacrifice his health and life to protect his friend if needed.', '/uploads/images/c_130852.png'),
(155, 'Viktor Licht', 'ヴィクトル・リヒト', '配角', 'Daisuke Sakaguchi', '__Height:__ 187cm (6''1") __Affiliation:__ Special Fire Force Company 8 __Rank:__ Science Team (First Class Fire Soldier Head of Research(Haijima) Viktor Licht is company 8''s Science Officer. Viktor attended the Imperial University of Tokyo, where he wrote a thesis about Spontaneous Human Combustion. After graduating at the top of his class in record time, he joined Haijima Industries. Having locked himself away while doing research, he was eventually appointed head of incendiary research and published a thesis about Spontaneous Human Combustion. Joker eventually made contact with Viktor, and told him he wanted to uncover the truth behind what is happening in the world. (Source: Fire Force Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_130862.png'),
(155, 'Joker', 'ジョーカー', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', 'Joker is a former pyrokinetic and a self-proclaimed anti-hero that serves as the Fourth Pillar''s guardian.', '/uploads/images/c_135385.png'),
(155, 'Takeru Noto', '武能登', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', 'Takeru is a Third Generation Second Class Fire Officer of the 2nd Special Fire Brigade. Takeru received the nickname "Juggernaut", due to his family''s business as potato farmers. (Source: Enen no Shouboutai Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_138308.png'),
(155, 'Vulcan Joseph', 'ヴァルカンジョゼフ', '配角', 'Taku Yashiro', 'Vulcan is a very skilled engineer with a love for animals which often bulids his machines to an animal theme. His goal in life is to build something like his family''s Amaterasu to supply enough energy to the world in order to save the world''s endangered animals. Despite his grand ideals he desires to remain independent. ~!This is rooted in his total hated for Haijima Industeries as he blames them from the death of his family. This also means that he has a total distrust of the Special Fire Force''s requests for him to join their organisations.!~ Vulcan is very passionate about his occupation and loves creating new inventions. ~!Vulcan becomes the Engineer for Special Fire Force Company 8.!~', '/uploads/images/c_143289.png'),
(155, 'Shou Kusakabe', '象日下部', '配角', 'Maaya Sakamoto', 'A Third Generation pyrokinetic, the Commander of the Knights of the Ashen Flame, and the younger brother of [Shinra Kusakabe](https://anilist.co/character/120462/Kusakabe-Shinra).', '/uploads/images/c_150194.jpg'),
(155, 'Lisa Isaribi', 'リサ漁辺', '配角', 'Ayaka Asai', 'Lisa Isaribi, formerly known as Feeler during her service in the Knights of the Ashen Flame, is a former Third Generation Pyrokinetic. She is a member of Special Fire Force Company 8.', '/uploads/images/c_150322.png'),
(155, 'Dr. Giovanni', 'Dr.ジョヴァンニ', '配角', 'Yutaka Aoyama', 'An insect enthusiast. Generally talks calmly, slowly, and drawn out. Has an interesting tendency to repeat words passionately many times, on occasion.', '/uploads/images/c_150692.jpg'),
(155, 'Arrow', 'アロー', '配角', 'Yumi Uchiyama', 'Arrow is the Primary Vice-Commander of the Knights of the Ashen Flame and serves as the Third Pillar''s bodyguard.', '/uploads/images/c_154079.png'),
(155, 'Yona', 'ヨナ', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'Yona is a member of the Knights of the Ashen Flame''s Commando Unit. He is a Third Generation, giving him the ability to ignite and manipulate flames from his palms and fingers. He can use his Ignition Ability to change the appearance of people''s faces. He executes this process by using heat to control the blood flow in people''s faces, and makes the capillaries and lymph nodes expand, and then uses localized edema to change the shape of people''s faces, something he commonly calls art. He is also able to change his own appearance with ease. Using this same process, he can increase the temperature of someone''s blood until they explode. Due to his age, it is speculated Yona is a non-human entity like the Preacher who does not age. (Source: Fire Force Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_160042.png'),
(155, 'Haumea', 'ハウメア', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', 'Haumea is a Third Generation pyrokinetic and a member of the White-Clad. She possesses the Adolla Burst and is known as the Second Pillar.', '/uploads/images/c_160044.png'),
(155, 'Assault', 'アサルト', '配角', 'Chikahiro Kobayashi', 'Assault has dark skin and light spiky hair, three piercing in each of his ears, and two piercings in-place of his absent eyebrows. Being a White Hood, he wears a variation of his organisation''s uniform, which consists of white clothing and the cross of the Sol God symbol across his chest.', '/uploads/images/c_161515.png'),
(155, 'Inca Kasugatani', '春日谷因果', '配角', 'Miyuri Shimabukuro', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3'''') Inca Kasugatani is a citizen of Tokyo, whose famously reputed as a fire thief across the country for her acts of saving people from fires in exchange for their valuables. (Source: Fire Force Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_171891.png'),
(155, 'Onyango', 'オニャンゴ', '配角', 'Katsuhisa Houki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_171892.png'),
(155, 'Gustav Honda', 'グスタフ本田', '配角', 'Takaya Hashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_171893.jpg'),
(155, 'Souichirou Hague', '蒼一郎・アーグ', '配角', 'Choo', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_171894.png'),
(155, 'Asako Hague', 'アサコ・アーグ', '配角', 'Hisako Kanemoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_171895.png'),
(155, 'Kayoko Huang', '火代子黄', '配角', 'Sayaka Oohara', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_171896.jpg'),
(155, 'Charon', 'カロン', '配角', 'Hiroki Yasumoto', '__Type:__ Second Generation Charon is a member of the White-Clad, that serves as the Second Pillar''s guardian. He appears to be a devoted member of the White-Clad with a strong loyalty to the Evangalist. He takes his role as a guardian very seriously with protecting pillars at even risking the cost of his life. Charon has taken care of [Haumea](https://anilist.co/character/160044/Haumea) since she was young although she doesn’t seem to appreciate his efforts. He is very durable and is a expert in hand to hand combat with being very confidence and cunning in his battles.', '/uploads/images/c_171898.jpg'),
(155, 'Raffles III', 'ラフルス三世', '配角', 'Bin Shimada', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_174549.jpg'),
(155, 'Mari Kusakabe', '日下部万里', '配角', 'Ayako Kawasumi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_174550.jpg'),
(155, 'Pan Ko Paat', 'パート・コ・パーン', '配角', 'Daisuke Ono', 'Pan is the captain of Special Fire Force Company 4 and an instructor at the Special Fire Force Training Academy. (Source: Fire Force Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_174745.png'),
(155, 'Ogun Montgomery', 'オグン・モンゴメリ', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', 'Ogun is a Third Generation and member of Special Fire Force Company 4.', '/uploads/images/c_180505.jpg'),
(155, 'Yuuichirou Kurono', '優一郎黒野', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', 'Kurono is a Third Generation and a combatant of the Skills Development Laboratory at Haijima Industries.', '/uploads/images/c_180506.png'),
(155, 'Gureo Haijima', '灰島グレオ', '配角', 'Nobuo Tobita', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_190110.png'),
(155, 'Nataku Son', 'ナタク孫', '配角', 'Mutsumi Tamura', 'A young boy who gained Third Generation pyrokinetic abilities after being bitten by an Infernal Bug.', '/uploads/images/c_190921.png'),
(155, 'Ningyoutsukai', '人形使い', '配角', 'Saori Hayami', 'An employee of Haijima Industries who controls a legion of fire-powered puppets called Dominions.', '/uploads/images/c_191537.png'),
(155, 'Ritsu', 'リツ', '配角', 'Rumi Ookubo', 'A White-Clad protector maid.', '/uploads/images/c_191538.png'),
(155, 'Amaterasu', 'アマテラス', '配角', 'Mao Ichimichi', '~!Amaterasu is a survivor of the Great Cataclysm. Possessing an Adolla Burst, she powers Tokyo and is referred to as the First Pillar.!~ She tends to be very manipulative.', '/uploads/images/c_192562.png'),
(155, 'Yaata', 'ヤータ', '配角', 'Shou Hayami', 'A crow from the Chinese Peninsula that possesses the ability to talk.', '/uploads/images/c_193745.png'),
(155, 'Iron', 'アイロン', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Mamiya', 'Iron is a Third Generation member of the Knights of the Purple Haze.', '/uploads/images/c_193746.png'),
(155, 'Scop', 'スコップ', '配角', 'Kentarou Itou', 'A talking fire mole from the Oasis.', '/uploads/images/c_193747.png'),
(155, 'Kuro no Onna', '黒の女性', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', 'One of the original Pillars used for the Great Cataclysm, who was used as a sacrifice for the Tabernacle, henceforth giving abundance to a part of the Chinese Peninsula and creating the Oasis.', '/uploads/images/c_193748.png'),
(155, 'Takigi Oze', '尾瀬滝義', '配角', 'Yuuki Ono', '1st Lieutenant of the Tokyo Imperial Armed Forces, Criminal Investigation Division.', '/uploads/images/c_194520.png'),
