(155, 'Amon Hajiki', '亜門弾木', '配角', 'Kousuke Toriumi', 'The first platoon chief Fire Soldier of Special Fire Force Company 2. ~!He is later killed by [Orochi](https://anilist.co/character/195425/); his head is bisected.!~', '/uploads/images/c_195427.png'),
(155, 'Arthur no Chichi', 'アーサーの父', '配角', 'Kenji Hamada', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_266151.png'),
(155, 'Mamoru-kun', 'まもる君', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_295094.jpg'),
(155, 'Dendou-sha', '伝道者', '配角', '', 'The Evangelist is the leader of the White-Clad. ~!The Evangelist is the collective unconscious of all humanity personified. It is not a person nor is it conscious, it represents despair itself.!~', '/uploads/images/c_327307.png'),
