(155, 'Panda', 'パンダ', '配角', 'Taishi Murata', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_389753.jpg'),
(155, 'Sancho', 'サンチョ', '配角', 'Yasuaki Takumi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_389754.jpg'),
(156, 'March', 'マーチ', '配角', 'Rie Hikisaka', '**Relatives:** Unnamed [mother](https://anilist.co/character/202865/March-no-Haha) & [father](https://anilist.co/character/201554/March-no-Chichi), [Risa](https://anilist.co/character/202890/Risa) (baby sibling) March is a young girl from Ninannah. When running away from her village, she stumbles across [Fushi](https://anilist.co/character/136548/Fushi) near a pond. March is very skilled at climbing trees. She''s also small enough where she can easily crawl through tight spaces adults can''t. March was born in the village of Ninannah. Years later, she is chosen as a sacrifice to the [Spirit Bear](https://anilist.co/character/202861/Oniguma), a god her village worships to bring peace and prosperity, but is rescued by [Parona](https://anilist.co/character/136544/Parona).', '/uploads/images/c_136541.png'),
(156, 'Parona', 'パロナ', '配角', 'Aya Uchida', '**Relatives:** Unnamed mother, father, and [sister](https://anilist.co/character/201557/Paronas-sister). Parona is a girl from Ninannah and a close friend of [March](https://anilist.co/character/136541/March). She looks after March like an older sister.', '/uploads/images/c_136544.jpg'),
(156, 'Hayase', 'ハヤセ', '配角', 'Mitsuki Saiga', '__Residence:__ Yanome __Affiliation:__ The Guardian Force (former) __Relatives:__ [Hisame](https://anilist.co/character/136547/Hisame) (Granddaughter), [Oumi](https://anilist.co/character/202881/Oumi) (Great-Granddaughter), [Ushio](https://anilist.co/character/202869/Ushio) (Descendant), [Chisui](https://anilist.co/character/202867/Chisui) (Descendant), [Kahaku](https://anilist.co/character/138875/Kahaku) (Descendent), [Mizuha](https://anilist.co/character/204189/Mizuha) (Descendant (18th)) __Status:__ ~!Deceased, her "Faie" or soul is being passed down her lineage along with a knocker they control.!~ She is a Yanome government official. She was chosen to oversee the Ninannah sacrificial ceremony for the [Spirit Bear](https://anilist.co/character/202861/Oniguma). ~!After Fushi''s attack in Yanome, Hayase spends about 5 years searching for him. She eventually meets him again on Jananda. Hayase had developed an obessive love for Fushi ever since they first met. Her love was so strong that she would kill anyone that Fushi was close to in order to have Fushi to herself. Her willpower was so strong that her love for Fushi would be passed down to her descendants, leading to the forming of The Guardian Force.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136545.png'),
(156, 'Fushi', 'フシ', '主角', 'Reiji Kawashima', '**Age:** ~!~800 years!~ **Relatives:** [The Beholder](https://anilist.co/character/136553/Kansatsusha) ("father"; creator), [March](https://anilist.co/character/136541/March) (adoptive "mother"), [Gugu](https://anilist.co/character/136554/Gugu) (adoptive brother) Fushi is an immortal being created by The Beholder and placed on Earth to preserve the world. Fushi is an immortal being that can take the form of anything that has given him stimuli. His original form was a featureless white sphere. Without consciousness, he copied the first thing he bumped into, which happened to be a rock. Soon afterward, he became moss and stayed like that for some time. When a wounded wolf wandered close in the middle of winter and died, the immortal copied the wolf. He retains the ability to turn into these things. Later, after the death of the [nameless boy](https://anilist.co/character/201555/Unnamed-Boy), he mimicked the boy''s appearance and took the form of a young boy with white hair, a pale complexion, and green eyes. He wears a short, brown fur cloak and a light blue shirt and pants with fur boots. A rope dangled from his hand and neck as the nameless boy died holding [Joaan](https://anilist.co/character/163694/Joaan)''s leash, though the latter soon disappeared. Fushi commented on the form, saying it felt like it belonged to him the most. Other than the nameless boy (whose form he usually defaults to), he can also take the form of many others; most notably: ~!March, a little girl with lo', '/uploads/images/c_136548.jpg'),
(156, 'Tonari', 'トナリ', '配角', 'Eri Inagawa', '__Affiliation:__ Tonari''s Group (former) Tonari is a girl that [Fushi](https://anilist.co/character/136548/Fushi) meets on the island of Jananda. She has short brown hair, green eyes, and tan skin. She''s seen wearing a blue jacket and shorts, a black and white shirt, and has a pet owl named Ligard. ~!Sometime after Fushi left the island of Jananda, Tonari began ingesting different types of poison to develop strong immunities to them.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136550.jpg'),
(156, 'Rean Cropp', 'リーン・クロップ', '配角', 'Manaka Iwami', 'Rean is a young girl from Takunaha.', '/uploads/images/c_136551.jpg'),
(156, 'Sander', 'サンデル', '配角', 'Yuu Kobayashi', 'Sander is a young boy from Jananda and a member of [Tonari''s](https://anilist.co/character/136550/Tonari) Group.', '/uploads/images/c_136552.jpg'),
(156, 'Kansatsu-sha', '観察者', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', 'The mysterious being and observer who cast the orb onto the Earth. His goal is to preserve the world. He sent [Fushi](https://anilist.co/character/136548/Fushi) to acquire various kinds of information from the world and aid his observations.', '/uploads/images/c_136553.png'),
(156, 'Gugu', 'グーグー', '配角', 'Ryouko Shiraishi', 'Gugu is a young man from Takunaha who originally worked at [Booze Man''s](https://anilist.co/character/136555/Sakejii) shop. As [Fushi''s](https://anilist.co/character/136548/Fushi) sworn brother, he fought the [Nokkers](https://anilist.co/character/232832/Nokkers) and anti-Fushi faction members on several occasions to create the peaceful world the immortal desires. He wears a mask to hide his face. ~!His head got crushed by a wood log while trying to save [Rean](https://anilist.co/character/136551/Cropp-Rean). He has been wearing a mask to cover it ever since.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136554.jpg'),
(156, 'Sakejii', '酒爺', '配角', 'Kentarou Tone', 'An old man who saved [Gugu](https://anilist.co/character/136554/Gugu)''s life and is also [Pyoran](https://anilist.co/character/136556/Pyoran)''s lover.', '/uploads/images/c_136555.jpg'),
(156, 'Pyoran', 'ピオラン', '配角', 'Rikako Aikawa', 'Pyoran is an old woman from Takunaha. She comes to Ninannah as a shaman.', '/uploads/images/c_136556.jpg'),
(156, 'Joaan', 'ジョアン', '配角', '', 'Joaan is the [nameless boy](https://anilist.co/character/201555/Shounen)''s pet Reshy wolf. It was also the first animal that [Fushi](https://anilist.co/character/136548/Fushi) obtained.', '/uploads/images/c_163694.jpg'),
(156, 'March no Chichi', 'マーチの父', '配角', '', 'He is [March’s](https://anilist.co/character/136541/March) father', '/uploads/images/c_201554.png'),
(156, 'Shounen', '少年', '配角', 'Reiji Kawashima', 'It''s the first human our main character meets. It is also the first human form our main character can transform into. His version of this boy is called ''Fushi''. The boys own name has never been mentioned.', '/uploads/images/c_201555.jpg'),
(156, 'Penna', 'ペンナ', '配角', '', 'She''s [Parona''s](https://anilist.co/character/136544/Parona) sister. One day she went out for food and never came back.', '/uploads/images/c_201557.png'),
(156, 'Upa', 'ウーパ', '配角', 'Konomi Kohara', 'One of the girls that [Fushi](https://anilist.co/character/136548/Fushi) meets on the island of Jananda. ~!After she dies she also becomes a form Fushi can take over!~', '/uploads/images/c_202665.jpg'),
(156, 'Mia', 'ミァ', '配角', 'Yuuko Natsuyoshi', 'One of the girls that [Fushi](https://anilist.co/character/136548/Fushi) meets on the island of Jananda. ~!After she dies she also becomes a form Fushi can take over!~', '/uploads/images/c_202667.png'),
(156, 'Ligard', 'リガルド', '配角', '', '[Tonari](https://anilist.co/character/136550/Tonari)''s companion. ~!After [Fushi](https://anilist.co/character/136548/Fushi) leaves the island, Tonari tells Ricard to follow Fushi on his journey. And to one day lead Tonari back to Fushi!~', '/uploads/images/c_202668.png'),
(156, 'Uroy', 'ウーロイ', '配角', 'Nobuyuki Kobushi', 'One of the guys [Fushi](https://anilist.co/character/136548/Fushi) meets on the island of Jananda.', '/uploads/images/c_202669.png'),
(156, 'Erran Dalton', 'エラン・ジー・ダルトン', '配角', '', '[Tonari''s](https://anilist.co/character/136550/Tonari) father. He sent to the island of Jananda because he was suspected of killing his wife', '/uploads/images/c_202670.png'),
(156, 'Oniguma', 'オニグマ', '配角', '', 'He was the Demon Bear dwelling in the forests. [March](https://anilist.co/character/136541/March) was supposed the be the sacrifice to keep the bear away. He has many spikes in his body, which appeared to be spears. After he died, he became one of the forms of our main character.', '/uploads/images/c_202861.jpg'),
(156, 'March no Haha', 'マーチの母', '配角', '', 'She is [March''s](https://anilist.co/character/136541/March) mother', '/uploads/images/c_202865.png'),
(156, 'Nand', 'ナンド', '配角', '', 'He is one of the Jananda prisoners [Fushi](https://anilist.co/character/136548/Fushi) fought in the arena', '/uploads/images/c_203298.jpg'),
(156, 'Lee', 'リー', '配角', 'Reina Aoyama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_230962.png'),
(156, 'Meer', 'ミアー', '配角', '', '[Rean](https://anilist.co/character/136551/)''s friendly dog.', '/uploads/images/c_231456.jpg'),
(156, 'Nokkers', 'ノッカー', '配角', '', 'Nokkers are unknown creatures that were created to impede [Fushi''s](https://anilist.co/character/136548/Fushi) progress in preserving the world. [The Beholder](https://anilist.co/character/136553/Kansatsusha) named them "Nokkers" because they "Knock on the doors of paradise, seeking its destruction." A Nokker''s main form resembles long, presumably sharp, vines. However, they adapt to their environment and take on various other forms - forms stolen from Fushi. Each time a Nokker is defeated they are said to come back stronger each time.', '/uploads/images/c_232832.jpg'),
(156, 'Igoss Cropp', 'イゴス・クロップ', '配角', 'Soushirou Hori', 'Igoss Cropp is part of a wealthy family in Takunaha and father of [Rean Cropp](https://anilist.co/character/136551/Cropp-Rean).', '/uploads/images/c_244762.png'),
(156, 'Nand no Otouto', 'ナンドの弟', '配角', 'Reina Aoyama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_254174.jpg'),
(157, 'Twenty-Fifth Baam', '스물다섯번째 밤', '主角', 'Taichi Ichikawa', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 168 cm (Part 1), 180 cm (Part II) __Rank:__ Irregular __Position:__ Wave Controller __Born:__ ~!Floor of Death!~__Occupation:__ ~!FUG Slayer Candidate!~ Twenty-Fifth Baam is an Irregular and one of the main protagonists of Tower of God. Bam entered in search of his best friend [Rachel](https://anilist.co/character/135466/Rachel), and after passing Headon''s test he was deemed worthy to climb the Tower. In Part I, he is a highly empathetic and caring young man, understanding little of life, having had virtually no contact with people before meeting Rachel and later entering the Tower. He hates loneliness and other people''s loneliness. He is considered very naive and knows little about the Tower. During Part I, his only reason for climbing the Tower is to be with Rachel. In Part II: ~! He was forced to join FUG, and received then the name of Jue Viole Grace (쥬 비올레 그레이스), the Slayer Candidate, to keep his real identity hidden. As Viole, he is far more violent. He now has friends to protect and will not hesitate to fight if it means protecting them. He now completely understands that in order to climb the Tower, he must be pre-emptive and prepared to engage in combat and eradicate all opposition. He''s become more introverted, rarely ever speaking or displaying any signs of emotion. He''s also quite cold and calculating, interacting with others only out of necessity and will take advantage of a situation to defeat his opponents. Later in the Part as FU', '/uploads/images/c_84769.jpg'),
(157, 'Headon', '헤돈', '配角', 'Houchuu Ootsuka', 'Headon is the Guardian of the First Floor and is the caretaker of the Tower. He has an appearance reminiscent of a white rabbit because of his long ears. Headon talks in a friendly tone, but has been shown to have a cruel and manipulative streak. He presents his ideas and opinions in a logical and pragmatic manner, but his goals and desires themselves are not understood. He is perfectly willing to manipulate dozens of lives and create the nucleus of civil unrest to attain his mysterious goal. Although most Administrators normally stay on their Floors, Headon seems to be the only Administrator with the ability to visit other Floors of the Tower. It is said that Headon is the most experienced Administrator of the Tower. Although that only means he was the first Administrator Zahard met and therefore the first one to carry out the roles of a Administrator, that doesn''t mean he''s the oldest.', '/uploads/images/c_84775.jpg'),
(157, 'Yuri Ha Jahad', '하유리자하드', '配角', 'Mariko Honda', 'Ha Yuri Jahad, more commonly known as Yu​ri Jahad (lacking her family name), is a High Ranker and Princess from the Ha Family. Notably, she is one of the most famous Princesses and therefore highly favored, with much political influence throughout The Tower. ~!She is the owner of Black March and Green April, two of the 13 Month Series. She is the first Princess to own two 13 Months at the same time since Garam Jahad. Notably, she is one of the most famed Princesses, and perhaps one of the most favored.!~', '/uploads/images/c_84777.jpg'),
(157, 'Aguero Agnis Khun', '쿤 아게로 아그니스', '主角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 170 cm __Rank:__ Regular __Position:__ Light Bearer Khun Aguero Agnis is a E-Rank Regular from Khun Family, and is often referred to simply as "Khun". He is a best friend of [Twenty-Fifth Bam](https://anilist.co/character/84769/TwentyFifth-Bam), one of the main protagonists of Tower of God. Khun relies heavily on his master intellect, however, this is not his only strong field. He also has exceptional physical attributes and is a skilled Light Bearer. His powers in combat cannot be denied.', '/uploads/images/c_84781.jpg'),
(157, 'Rak Wraithraiser', '라크 레크레이셔', '主角', 'Kenta Miyake', '__Species:__ Wraithraiser, ~!Native One!~ __Height:__ 3m (Decompressed) __Rank:__ Regular C-Rank __Position:__ Spear Bearer Rak Wraithraiser is a Regular. He unwillingly teamed up with [Baam](https://anilist.co/character/84769/TwentyFifth-Baam) and [Khun](https://anilist.co/character/84781/Khun-Aguero-Agnis) during the first test on the Second Floor and passed other tests with them. He was selected for the Spear Bearer position. He is a large and powerful warrior and a very confident individual. Rak is originally a 3 meter tall creature, but after he mocked the Ranker [Yu Han Sung](https://anilist.co/character/141286/Sung-Yu-Han), the Second Floor Test Director, his body was shrunken by them. He eventually found out how to get back to his original size. As a being who can control their body size, he is a Compression Licenser. He is a direct descendant of the Native One, a type of being that is able to rule over the elements in the Tower. Rak doesn''t come off as particularly smart; he thinks he''s superior to almost everyone else and so refers to other people as "turtles". He occasionally calls himself "Rakleader" when he is feeling particularly full of himself, although Khun may be to blame for indulging him. He tries to make himself appear tough, although he''s actually a bit of a baby sometimes. However, he does seem to have a little of a caring side in him.', '/uploads/images/c_84783.jpg'),
(157, 'Endorsi Jahad', '엔도르시자하드', '配角', 'Rie Suegara', '__Height:__ 167 cm Endorsi Jahad is a Regular and one of Jahad''s Princesses, currently climbing the Tower. Among Regulars, Endorsi is unmatched in terms of physical ability. Among the Jahad''s Princesses, she is fairly warm and more human. Her parents weren''t around when she was born. She was then adopted by a couple from the Middle Area before she became a princess. Later, her adoptive parents were killed by Snake Charmer. Her character concept is that of a ''Normal modern girl'' taking great care of her looks, stressed about her weight, wanting to hear she is pretty while acting confident. A girl who is yet to mature fully. Endorsi doesn''t believe in being friends with a guy at first and says that guys and girls cannot be friends and can only be boyfriend and girlfriend and later states that she is not allowed to date anyone because she is a Princess of Jahad, but later on she catches feelings for [Bam](https://anilist.co/character/84769/TwentyFifth-Baam) and calls Bam her boyfriend.', '/uploads/images/c_124138.jpg'),
(157, 'Rachel', '라헬', '主角', 'Saori Hayami', '__Species:__ Human __Rank:__ Extra Rachel, also known as Michelle Light was Baam''s best and only friend as she was the only one to visit him in his "cave". She longs to see the stars which is one of the fabled rewards waiting at the top of the Tower, because she "fears the Night". ~!Like Baam she is an Irregular.!~', '/uploads/images/c_135466.jpg'),
(157, 'Hwaryun', '화련', '配角', 'Youko Hikasa', '__Species:__ Red Witch __Height:__ 168 cm __Rank:__ Regular __Position:__ Wave Controller, Scout, Guide Hwaryun is a quiet person who says little and she has a gloomy and ominous aura. She is also quite manipulative. In Part II, she''s depicted as mischievous and teasing, as she clearly mocked the Viole impostor and repeatedly called him "Pig". She almost always smiles in mischief and probably a little bit of arrogance. She also tends to be extremely blunt, caring very little about other peoples'' feelings; though this could be considered her way of spurring a person on. This leads her to seem very harsh. Hwaryun is Viole''s Guide but is also the Guide for FUG''s Rankers notably Ha Jinsung. ~!It was revealed that she went into the Floor of Death first, instructing another Red-haired lady to lead the way for Yuri and Khun''s team.!~', '/uploads/images/c_135467.jpg'),
(157, 'Anaak Jahad', '아낙자하드', '配角', 'Akira Sekine', 'Anaak is introduced in the second floor, where she forms a team with Shibisu and Hatz. ~!She introduces herself as one of Jahad''s Princesses, but it''s later revealed that she''s actually the daughter of the real Anaak Jahad, who was impregnated by her lover and ran into hiding. Though she is only a demi-princess because of the diluted Jahad''s blood in her, she used to possess two of the 13 Month Series at one point; something only a few Princesses have accomplished. She is climbing the Tower for revenge.!~', '/uploads/images/c_135470.jpg'),
(157, 'Lero-Ro', '레로-로', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', 'Lero-Ro is a former Examiner of the Second Floor. He is an exceptionally strong Ranker, to the point that even Quant, also a former Test Administrator (and a haughty one), would constantly boast about his strength. He was supposedly the strongest Second Floor Test Administrator and is particularly skilled in the use of Shinsoo. He was also the Light Bearer position instructor. He is fairly old, older than Yuri Zahard, as he stated that Anak Zahard didn''t live up to a Princess''s chaotic expectations like Yuri Zahard did, whom he met when they were both Regulars. He and Quant are awkwardly described as a "Set Menu", explained by the fact that Lero-Ro and Quant climbed the Tower together like a team. He is apparently quite famous, and he took over 300 years to climb the Tower.', '/uploads/images/c_137948.jpg'),
(157, 'Evan Edrok', '에반 에드록', '配角', 'Kazuyuki Okitsu', 'Evan Edrok is a High Ranker as well the Chief Guide of Zahard Royalty, which is a unique position in the Tower. He always seems to follow his partner, Ha Yuri Zahard.', '/uploads/images/c_137950.jpg'),
(157, 'Quant Blitz', '퀀트블릿츠', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', 'Quant Blitz is a Ranker. He instructed the Scout position while he was a Test Admin on the Second Floor.', '/uploads/images/c_137951.jpg'),
(157, 'Hatz', '하츠', '配角', 'Toshinari Fukamachi', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 167cm __Position:__ Scout Hatsu (하츠, Hahcheu; or "Hatz") is a Regular and a "devoutly" practising swordsman. He is a quiet and calm warrior, who has been making good progress in the tests merely by doing exactly what each test entails. ~!He teamed up with [Anaak Jahad](https://anilist.co/character/135470/Anaak-Jahad) and [Shibisu](https://anilist.co/character/137957/Shibisu) during the first test on the 2nd Floor and later signed Khun''s friend list.!~ ~!He was last seen on the 52nd Floor having helped [Bam](https://anilist.co/character/84769/Twentyfifth-Bam) and his allies.!~', '/uploads/images/c_137952.png'),
(157, 'Shibisu', '십이수', '配角', 'Takuya Eguchi', 'Shibisu is a D-rank Regular. He is relatively weak, yet possesses a great ability to deduce and an intellect on par with Khun''s. Nonetheless, he made it past all of the tests on the Second Floor, where he was assigned the Scout position and is now climbing the Tower as the leader of his team.', '/uploads/images/c_137957.png'),
(157, 'Lauroe Phonsekal', '폰세칼 라우뢰', '配角', 'Daisuke Ono', 'Phonsekal Lauroe is a Regular and a talented Wave Controller of the Eurasia Family. He loves to sleep and goes everywhere with blanket and his pillows. Despite his sloth, he is an exceptional Wave Controller, capable of firing powerful long-range blasts.', '/uploads/images/c_137958.jpg'),
(157, 'Yu Han Sung', '유한성', '配角', 'Daisuke Kishio', 'Yu Han Sung is an Advanced Ranker and the former Test Director of the Second Floor. Notably, he is a key member of FUG in taking Viole to the top. He is the main antagonist of Part I. He is a well known ranker partly because he rejected becoming a High Ranker.', '/uploads/images/c_141286.png'),
(157, 'No Rang', '노랑', '配角', 'Hazuki Hoshino', 'Yellow is an exam assistant. She gave instructions to the Regulars for Yu Han Sung ''s examination, The Door Test.', '/uploads/images/c_166490.png'),
(157, 'Dede Kancho', '데데 칸초', '配角', 'Takeo Ootsuka', 'Dede Kancho is a Regular found in the Second Floor. ~!He made it through most of the Second Floor tests, teaming up with Shopin and Kon, but eventually failed. !~', '/uploads/images/c_166492.png'),
(157, 'Announcer', 'アナウンスの声', '配角', 'Shouta Ikoma', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_166493.png'),
(157, 'Levin', '레빈', '配角', 'Genki Okawa', 'Levin is a Regular. He has grey skin and sharp teeth and, rather than fighting, he used to snipe using a Sniper Rifle. He was assigned the Light Bearer position. He is quite sly, but is extremely annoyed if someone removes him from his sniping area. He seems quite sadistic, as he enjoys to watch anyone commit violent acts or see someone writhe in agony.', '/uploads/images/c_166495.png'),
(157, 'Serena Rinnen', '세레나 린넨', '配角', 'Hitomi Nabatame', 'Serena Rinnen is a Regular who passed most of the tests on the Second Floor and was assigned the Scout position.', '/uploads/images/c_166496.png'),
(157, 'Inoa Yoran', '이노아 요란', '配角', 'Ryuusei Ogasawara', 'Inoa Yoran is a Regular assigned to the Spear Bearer position. He played a very minor role in Part I before being eliminated from testing.', '/uploads/images/c_166596.png'),
(157, 'Sunwoo Nare', '선우 나래', '配角', 'Chinami Hashimoto', 'Sunwoo Nare is a Regular who came to the Tower for money. She made it through all the tests on the Second Floor and was assigned the Scout position.', '/uploads/images/c_166598.png'),
(157, 'Kon', '콘', '配角', 'Koudai Sakai', 'Kon (콘) is a Regular assigned to the Fisherman position.', '/uploads/images/c_167165.png'),
(157, 'Shopin', '쇼핀', '配角', '', 'Shopin (쇼핀) is a Regular who made it through most of the Second Floor tests and was assigned the Scout position.', '/uploads/images/c_168086.png'),
(157, 'First Emperor', '초패왕', '配角', 'Reo Tatsumori', 'First Emperor (초패왕, Chopaewang) is a Regular assigned to the Scout Position.', '/uploads/images/c_168144.png'),
(157, 'Riron 3', '리론 3', '配角', 'Kousuke Oonishi', 'He is a Regular assigned to the Light Bearer position.', '/uploads/images/c_168145.png'),
(157, 'Leo Clocker', '레오 클록커', '配角', 'Taichi Kusano', 'Leo Cloakeris a Regular that was assigned to the Fisherman position.', '/uploads/images/c_168146.png'),
(157, 'Catan', '카탄', '配角', 'Shin Matsushige', 'Catan is a Regular assigned to the Scout Position.', '/uploads/images/c_168147.png'),
(157, 'Rozeal', '로제알', '配角', 'Hazuki Ogino', 'She is a Regular, who was assigned to the Wave Controller position.', '/uploads/images/c_168148.png'),
(157, 'Palgyon', '팔견', '配角', 'Hikaru Tanaka', 'Palgyunis is a F-Rank Regular, who was assigned to the Scout position.', '/uploads/images/c_168149.png'),
(157, 'Full Black', '풀 블랙', '配角', 'Kousuke Kobayashi', 'Full Black is a Regular and a Light Bearer', '/uploads/images/c_168150.png'),
(157, 'Hoh', '호', '配角', 'Fumiyoshi Shioya', 'Hoh is a seemingly cheerful person who is actually quite conflicted. Making his way up the tower, dealing with flashbacks of the past in his homeplace, and making friends, he struggles to make his way.', '/uploads/images/c_168151.png'),
(157, 'Hyun Seung', '현승', '配角', 'Masaki Hayashi', 'Hyun Seung is a Regular who was assigned to the Spear Bearer position.', '/uploads/images/c_168152.png'),
(157, 'Chungchung', '청청', '配角', 'Nanami Kashiyama', 'Chungchung is an extremely small and fast Regular who was assigned the Light Bearer position.', '/uploads/images/c_168153.png'),
(157, 'Deod', '데오드', '配角', 'Kensuke Shimizu', 'Deod is a Regular that was assigned to the Fisherman position. He teamed up with Leo Cloaker and First Emperor after the "Deathmatch" Test.', '/uploads/images/c_168159.png'),
(157, 'Geomeun Samwol', '검은 삼월', '配角', 'Shizuka Itou', 'Black March is a B-rank Needle and Ignition Weapon lent to Baam for a short time by Yuri Jahad. Black March is one of the 13 Month Series made by the craftsmaster, Ashul Edwaru. The weapon is sentient and has a spirit inside it and when ignited, it is capable of unleashing extreme power like the other 13 Month Series.', '/uploads/images/c_168700.jpg'),
(157, 'Mr. Neon Bag', '형광봉다리씨', '配角', 'Satoshi Tsuruoka', 'He is a Test Assistant in the Door Test. He and his team pretended to be a Regular in order to give hints to all the teams before they took the door-selection exam under the order of the Test Director Yu Han Sung.', '/uploads/images/c_169093.png'),
(157, 'Hachuling Khun', '하츨링', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', 'Khun Hachuling, or simply just Hachuling, is a Ranker, a defected member of the Khun Family and one of the numerous children related to Khun Eduan. He is also a member of Wolhaiksong and is sometimes referred to as Blueberry.', '/uploads/images/c_175047.png'),
(157, 'Aleksai Amigochaz', '알렉세이 아미고챠즈', '配角', 'Junichi Yanagita', 'Aleksai Amigochaz is the red-winged Regular from early 2nd Floor who had been climbing the Tower with Shibisu, Anak Zahard and Androssi Zahard as a member of Team Isu. His position is a Spear Bearer.', '/uploads/images/c_175702.jpg'),
(157, 'Azadni', '아자드니', '配角', '', 'Azadni is a Regular assigned to the Spear Bearer Position.', '/uploads/images/c_175703.jpg'),
(157, 'Baunian', '버니안', '配角', '', 'Baunian is a Regular assigned to the Light Bearer position.', '/uploads/images/c_175704.jpg'),
(157, 'Bok-Dol Yu', '유복돌', '配角', '', 'Yu Bok-Dol is a Ranker. He is the Position Instructor for the Spear Bearers on the Second Floor and therefore one of the judges during the Hide-and-Seek test as well as the judge for the Spear Bearers during the Position Test.', '/uploads/images/c_175705.jpg'),
(157, 'Le-Ara', '레-아라', '配角', 'Junichi Yanagita', 'Le-Ara is a Regular assigned to the Light Bearer position.', '/uploads/images/c_175706.jpg'),
(157, 'Kurdan', '쿠르단', '配角', 'Itaru Yamamoto', 'Kurudan is a Ranker and member of Wolhaiksong. He travelled with Yuri Zahard and her group, whose objective was to navigate the more dangerous parts of the Middle Area in order to infiltrate the Second Floor so she could retrieve the Black March.', '/uploads/images/c_175707.jpg'),
(157, 'Anaak-ui Eomma', '아낙의 엄마', '配角', 'Nanako Mori', '~!She is the real Anaak Jahad. Her daughter decided to take her name while going up the tower to avenge her.!~', '/uploads/images/c_175708.jpg'),
(157, 'Hax', '헥스', '配角', 'Natsumi Murakami', 'Hax is a Ranker. She is the Position Instructor for the Fishermen on the Second Floor and was, therefore, one of the judges during the Hide-and-Seek test as well as the judge for the Fishermen during the overall Position Test.', '/uploads/images/c_175709.jpg'),
(157, 'Chunhwa Hong', '홍천화', '配角', 'Aoi Ichikawa', 'Hong Chunhwa is a Regular. He passed all of the Second Floor tests and was assigned to the Fisherman position. He seems to be quite close to Sunwoo Nare.', '/uploads/images/c_175710.png'),
(157, 'Kukaku Rakukakuka', '쿠카쿠 라쿠카쿠카', '配角', '', 'Kukaku Rakukakuka is a Regular who participated on the 2nd Floor tests. He was one of the people who were "stored" in Khun''s bag throughout the first "Deathmatch" Test. He participated in the Crown Game with his teammates Blarouse and Grey, and helped Khun by attacking the other Regulars. He was then assigned to the Light Bearer position.', '/uploads/images/c_175711.jpg'),
(157, 'Changsoo Yeon', '연창수', '配角', 'Junichi Yanagita', 'Yung Changsoo is a Regular assigned to the Fisherman position.', '/uploads/images/c_175712.png'),
(157, 'Blarouse', '블라루즈', '配角', 'Reo Tatsumori', 'Blarouse is a Regular who participated on the 2nd Floor tests. He was one of the people who were "stored" in Khun''s bag throughout the first "Deathmatch" Test.', '/uploads/images/c_175713.png'),
(157, 'Hoshi', '호시', '配角', '', 'Hoshi is Regular who was assigned the Scout position.', '/uploads/images/c_175714.png'),
(157, 'Grey', '그레이', '配角', '', 'Grey is a Regular who participated on the 2nd Floor tests. She was one of the three people who were "stored" in Khun''s bag throughout the first "Deathmatch" Test.', '/uploads/images/c_175715.png'),
(157, 'Goon', '군', '配角', 'Hikaru Tanaka', 'Goon is a Regular who was assigned to the Spear Bearer position.', '/uploads/images/c_175716.png'),
(157, 'Parakewl', '파라큘', '配角', 'Kouichi Souma', 'Parakewl is a rather unintelligent and useless Regular.', '/uploads/images/c_175717.png'),
(157, 'Angnyeong', '악령', '配角', '', 'A mysterious regular that first appeard during the Crown game on the Floor of tests. ~!It was later revealed that he was a Bodyguard assigned by Headon to help Rachel climb the Tower.!~', '/uploads/images/c_212873.png'),
(158, 'Han-Sung Na', '나한성', '配角', 'Katsuhito Nomura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_15504.png'),
(158, 'Hyun-Bok Ryu', '류현복', '配角', 'Masayoshi Sugawara', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_15505.png'),
(158, 'Seung-Yeon Park', '박승연', '配角', 'Naoko Komatsu', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_15506.png'),
(158, 'Mo-Ri Jin', '진모리', '主角', 'Tatsumaru Tachibana', '__Occupation:__ G.O.H. Participant and Student __Relatives:__ [Jin Tae-Jin](https://anilist.co/character/181867/TaeJin-Jin) (adoptive grandfather) __Style:__ Renewal Taekwondo, Jin Mori Original Jin Mori is introduced as a carefree and energetic student with an obsession for fighting. He loves eating and having fun. Mori can be seen as both confident and arrogant due to his identity later revealed. However, he still cares deeply about his friends and family, and will get serious when either of them are hurt or in danger. Jin Mori was shown to be a dominant competitor in early stages of the G.O.H tournament. His fighting style in the anime is shown to resemble his adoptive grandfather''s renewal taekwondo. He also has his own special technique which he names ''Jin Mori Original.'' The first is called Blue Dragon Kick. His second is called Twin Dragon Blue Kick. His third and final technique is called Blue Dragon Tempest.', '/uploads/images/c_124136.png'),
(158, 'Dae-Wi Han', '한대위', '主角', 'Kentarou Kumagai', '__Height:__ 180 cm Dae-Wi is one of the main protagonists in The God Of Highschool. He was once part of the legendary duo named ''Mad Cows'' and he is a very skilled fighter. Over time, he will become a close friend of [Mo-Ri](https://anilist.co/character/124136/Jin-Mo-Ri) and [Mi-Ra](https://anilist.co/character/153293/Yu-Mi-Ra). He is a practitioner of the Kyokushin Karate (Full Contact Karate). ~!After training from Executive Q Dae-Wi is able to summon the charyeok Haetae!~', '/uploads/images/c_143291.png'),
(158, 'Mi-Ra Yu', '유미라', '主角', 'Ayaka Oohashi', 'Yu Mira is the 25th Master of the Moon Light Sword Style. She was invited to participate in the God Of High School Tournament. ~!During the World Tournament and RagnarÖk, she received Original Greed and through it Ultio R bequeath her Okhwang''s physical power (which he had previously stolen). Due to that, Sang Man-Duk recognized her as the Jade Emperor''s successor.!~', '/uploads/images/c_153293.png'),
(158, 'Il-Pyo Park', '박일표', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', 'Park Ilpyo is the Meridional Jeolla Province Champion of the G.O.H Tournament. He is considered as one of the top 3 fighters in the country and is famously known as Sakyamuni Park Ilpyo. He is one of the main supporting characters of the series. __After RagnarÖk__ ~!17 years after RagnarÖk, he becomes one of The Six and devoted himself to teaching Ssam-Su Taekkyeon.!~ __CHARYEOK__ ~!Nine-Tails Guardian: This is the Charyeok of Park Il-Pyo. It is currently the only Charyeok that changes the appearance of its user, besides Yu Mi-Ra''s Yeo-Po Bong-Seon. It is one of the most powerful Charyeok seen to date it has been seen taking down multiple Charyeok in Greed''s arsenal. The Nine-Tails Guardian is seen to give the wielder health generation, physical enhancements including enhanced strength and speed, and pyrokenesis.!~', '/uploads/images/c_161450.png'),
(158, 'Je-Gal Taek', '택제갈', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_161451.png'),
(158, 'Ju-Gok Jeon', '전주곡 ', '配角', 'Masahiro Yamanaka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_161452.png'),
