(158, 'Jang-Mi Jang', '장장미', '配角', 'Yuu Kobayashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_161454.png'),
(158, 'Bo-Ra Ma', '마보라', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_161455.png'),
(158, 'Seung-Ah Park', '박승아', '配角', 'Ayane Sakura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_161456.png'),
(158, 'Mu-Jin Park', '박무진', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', '__Race__: ~!Supreme God!~ __Style__: Borrowed Power User __Charyeok__: Longinus Mu-Jin Park is a member of the National Assembly of Korea, a member of The Six and the organizer of the G.O.H Tournament. ~!He changed his name from Mu-Bong Park to Mu-Jin Park 17 years before the story begins.!~', '/uploads/images/c_161457.png'),
(158, 'Jae-San Jeon', '전재산', '配角', 'Takaya Hashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_161458.png'),
(158, 'Ungnyeo Kim', '김웅녀', '配角', 'Romi Park', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_161460.png'),
(158, 'Bong-Chim Na', '나봉침', '配角', 'Kenyuu Horiuchi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_161461.png'),
(158, 'Ma-Rin Lee', '이마린', '配角', 'Naomi Maruyama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_161462.png'),
(158, 'Saturn', '세턴', '配角', 'Rie Murakawa', 'Saturn is a G.O.H. Priest of the Nox organization with a foul mouth. As soon as her mouth is opened, she starts cursing non-stop, though the reason is unknown. She is also short tempered as her cool and quiet image was shattered in the battle with Judge O.', '/uploads/images/c_161463.png'),
(158, 'Man-Duk Sang', '상만덕', '配角', 'Yuuma Uchida', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_161465.png'),
(158, 'Fei-Long', '페이롱', '配角', 'Shinichirou Miki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_161466.png'),
(158, 'Axley', '엑슬리', '配角', 'Tatsuhisa Suzuki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_161468.png'),
(158, 'Drake McDonald', '드레이크 맥도널드', '配角', 'Nobuyuki Hiyama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_161469.png'),
(158, 'Man-Suk Kang', '강만석', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_175436.png'),
(158, 'Seung-Chul Baek', '백승철', '配角', 'Yuuya Uchida', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_177044.png'),
(158, 'Gam-Do Go', '고감도', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_177511.png'),
(158, 'Tae-Jin Jin', '진태진', '配角', 'Kazuhiro Yamaji', 'Jin Tae-Jin (Kor: 진태진) is Jin Mo-Ri''s adoptive grandfather and the sole master of Renewal Taekwondo.', '/uploads/images/c_181867.jpg'),
(158, 'Su-Mi Yu', '유수미', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', 'Mi-Ra''s cousin. She appeared in episode 4', '/uploads/images/c_182865.png'),
(158, 'Sung-Jin Oh', '오성진', '配角', 'Shinichirou Miki', 'Sung-Jin Oh is the chairman of the Ohsung group and has affiliations with Nox. He attempted to obtain Bong-Seon from Yu Mi-Ra legally through marriage for Nox. (Source: The God of High School Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_182983.png'),
(158, 'Han-Ryang Seo', '서한량', '配角', 'Hiroki Yasumoto', 'Seo Han-Ryang (서한량, Seohanlyang) was a member of The Six. He was the 27th leader of the National Homeless Association prior to giving that title to Yu Mi-Ra. He is an advanced weapons expert, capable of using 108 National Treasures. (Source: God of High School wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_184367.png'),
(158, 'Hyang-Dan Lee', '이향단', '配角', 'Yuki Shirato', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_188993.png'),
(158, 'Sai', '사이', '配角', 'Saku Minami', 'Sai, also known as Nurse B (간호사B, Ganhosa B), is one of the nurses for the God Of High School Tournament. In the anime she is inverted with Heal.', '/uploads/images/c_189729.jpg'),
(158, 'Heal', '힐', '配角', 'Yuu Kobayashi', 'Heal, also known as Nurse A (간호사A, Ganhosa A), is one of the nurses for the God Of High School Tournament. In the anime she is inverted with Sai.', '/uploads/images/c_189730.jpg'),
(158, 'Gi-Ju Moon', '문기주', '配角', 'Tarou Kiuchi', 'Judge S, whose real name is Moon Gi-Ju. ~!He was one of the Judges for the G.O.H Tournament. He is also a disciple of Seong Gi-Sa, a member of The Six who was defeated and hospitalized by Kim Du-Sik. He seems to have a closer connection with Park Mu-Bong as compared to other Judges. Sometime after RagnarÖk he became the legal guardian of Dean Ockham and had him cured of his childhood illness. At some point he had a fight with Yu Mi-Ra who gravely injured him and took possession of Walmung. He is alive, albeit critical, being monitored and treated by doctors working for Park Mu-Bong.!~ (Source: The God of High School wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_192024.png'),
(158, 'Pum-Gwang Jin', '진품광', '配角', '', 'The Chungcheongbuk-do representative of the G.O.H Tournament.', '/uploads/images/c_254133.jpg'),
(159, 'Shinei Nouzen', 'シンエイ・ノウゼン', '主角', 'Shouya Chiba', '__Height:__ 175 cm Shinei Nouzen is the field commander of Spearhead Squadron. His Personal Name is Undertaker. Having survived five years on the Eastern Front and the Special Reconnaissance Mission, he is considered one of the most elite Processors alive. Among the Eighty-Six, he is known as the Reaper of the Eastern Front. His ability to hear the voices of the Legion allows him to locate the Legion without the use of detection systems like radar. Born on May 19th in Republic Year 351, Shin lived with his family in the First Sector of the Republic before the war with the Giadian Empire began. It is implied he lived a sheltered life, surrounded by "only kindness and affection". He also appeared to have developed his extrasensory ability early on, hearing "voices that spoke without words" from his family. ~!He would often play with the daughter of his father''s colleague, [Henrietta von Penrose](https://anilist.co/character/210923/von-Penrose-Henrietta), whom Shin called Rita.!~', '/uploads/images/c_141060.jpg'),
(159, 'Vladilena Milizé', 'ヴラディレーナ・ミリーゼ', '主角', 'Ikumi Hasegawa', '__Height:__ 160 cm Vladilena Milizé, more commonly known as Lena by her friends and as Handler One to her subordinates, is an elite Republic commissioned officer who rose to the rank of Major at the young age of 16. She is the commander of [Shinei Nouzen](https://anilist.co/character/141060/Nouzen-Shinei) and the Spearhead Squadron, whom she communicates with via the long-distance communication device known as the Para-RAID. ~!After the Spearhead Squadron''s departure, she becomes known for demanding orders and highly competent leadership, earning the nickname of Bloody Regina among the Processors.!~', '/uploads/images/c_141061.jpg'),
(159, 'Frederica Rosenfort', 'フレデリカ・ローゼンフォルト', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 130cm A girl Shin and his team met at Ernst''s residence after being provided shelter by the Federacy. She is assigned as the Mascot to the Spearhead Squadron. She has an intelligence and a manner of speech well beyond her young age of ten. ~!She is the last empress of the Federal Empire of Giad, having been secretly rescued by Ernst during the coup against the nobility. Her royal bloodline imparts her the gift of seeing the past and present of people she has known. She was protected by Kiriya Nouzen, a distant relative of Shin from the Nouzen clan and is on the lookout for him after he was assimilated by the Legion as a Black Sheep, having failed to protect his princess. Shin''s personality constantly reminds her of Kiri and she treats him as a surrogate big brother.!~', '/uploads/images/c_161718.jpg'),
(159, 'Raiden Shuga', 'ライデン・シュガ', '配角', 'Seiichirou Yamashita', '__Height:__ 185 cm Raiden Shuga is the vice captain of Spearhead Squadron. As a First Lieutenant, he holds the position of operations commander of the Eighty-Sixth Strike Package and its 1st Armored Division should Shin be deemed unfit to command. His Personal Name is Wehrwolf. Having survived four years on the Eastern Front and the Special Reconnaissance Mission, he is considered one of the most elite Processors alive. As he spent three years with Shin prior to joining Spearhead Squadron, Raiden is the closest person to him in the squadron.', '/uploads/images/c_174872.jpg'),
(159, 'Kurena Kukumila', 'クレナ・ククミラ', '配角', 'Sayumi Suzushiro', '__Height:__ 160 cm Kurena Kukumila is a platoon leader of Eighty-Sixth Strike Package''s Spearhead Squadron. She is the squadron''s long-range specialist. Her Personal Name is Gunslinger. Having survived four years on the Eastern Front and the Special Reconnaissance Mission, she is considered one of the most elite Processors alive.', '/uploads/images/c_174873.jpg'),
(159, 'Theoto Rikka', 'セオト・リッカ', '配角', 'Natsumi Fujiwara', '__Height:__ 165 cm Theoto Rikka is a platoon leader of the Eighty-Sixth Strike Package''s Spearhead Squadron and the artist of the squadron member''s Personal Marks. His Personal Name is Laughing Fox. Having survived four years on the Eastern Front and the Special Reconnaissance Mission, he is considered one of the most elite Processors alive.', '/uploads/images/c_174874.jpg'),
(159, 'Anju Emma', 'アンジュ・エマ', '配角', 'Saori Hayami', '__Height:__ 170 cm Anju Emma is a platoon member and later platoon leader of the Eighty-Sixth Strike Package''s Spearhead Squadron. She serves as their support fire and artillery provider. Her Personal Name is Snow Witch. Having survived four years on the Eastern Front and the Special Reconnaissance Mission, she is considered one of the most elite Processors alive.', '/uploads/images/c_174875.jpg'),
(159, 'Kaie Taniya', 'カイエ・タニヤ', '配角', 'Haruka Shiraishi', 'A good-humoured girl with no filter. Part of The Republic of San Magnolia''s Spearhead Squadron. ~! Is killed by a Löwe during a sortie. Has her neural network assimilated with a Legion after being taken. !~', '/uploads/images/c_174878.jpg'),
(159, 'Daiya Irma', 'ダイヤ・イルマ', '配角', 'Haruki Ishiya', 'Daiya is the leader of the fifth platoon. As an elite four-year veteran of the Eastern Battlefront, he has earned the personal name Black Dog. He and Anju have been in the same squadron since they were conscripted and are close friends. ~! When his Juggernaut is surrounded by Self-Propelled Mines, moments before they detonate Daiya whispers Anju''s name. He is mortally wounded in the explosion and is later euthanised by Shin, so that he won''t be assimilated into the Legion. !~', '/uploads/images/c_210911.jpg'),
(159, 'Haruto Keats', 'ハルト・キーツ', '配角', 'Daiki Yamashita', 'Haruto is the morale booster of the squadron, often times cheerful and joking.', '/uploads/images/c_210912.jpg'),
(159, 'Kujo Niko', 'クジョー・ニコ', '配角', 'Taishi Murata', 'A member of the Spearhead Squadron''s Fourth Platoon. ~!Fatally wounded against the Legion, he was put to rest by Shin and had his unit''s personal mark passed on.!~', '/uploads/images/c_210913.jpg'),
(159, 'Louis Kino', 'ルイ・キノ', '配角', 'Shinei Ueki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_210914.jpg'),
(159, 'Chise Oosen', 'チセ・オーセン', '配角', 'Masamu Ono', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_210915.png'),
(159, 'Kairou Mikuri', 'ミクリ・カイロゥ', '配角', 'Yuka Nukui', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_210916.png'),
(159, 'Touma Soobi', 'トーマ・ソービ', '配角', 'Katsumi Fukuhara', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_210917.png'),
(159, 'Rin Rekka', 'レッカ・リン', '配角', 'Shizuka Ishigami', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_210918.png'),
(159, 'Sasha Touzan', 'トウザン・サシャ', '配角', 'Taito Ban', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_210919.png'),
(159, 'Jerome Karlsthal', 'ジェローム・カールシュタール', '配角', 'Satoshi Mikami', 'He was Lena''s superior in the Republic Armed Forces. Due to his close relationship with Lena''s father, she thought of him as her uncle.', '/uploads/images/c_210920.jpg'),
(159, 'Lev Aldrecht', 'レフ・アルドレヒト', '配角', 'Taiten Kusunoki', 'The chief mechanic of the Spearhead Squadron. ~!He was an Alba married to a Heliodor wife, whom he had a daughter with. Due to them being taken away to the Eighty-Sixth Sector, he dyed his hair to go after them. By then, it was already too late, both of them had passed. In order to follow his family to the other side, he works as the chief mechanic of the First Ward''s First Defensive Squadron of the Eastern Front.!~', '/uploads/images/c_210921.png'),
(159, 'Mina Atomica', 'マイナ・ヤトミカ', '配角', 'Mayuko Kazama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_210922.png'),
(159, 'Henrietta von Penrose', 'アンリエッタ・ペンローズ', '配角', 'Riho Sugiyama', 'A member of the Republic military and later the Eighty-Sixth Strike Package. She serves in the Research Division and specializes on working on the Para-RAID system her father helped develop.', '/uploads/images/c_210923.png'),
(159, 'Shourei Nouzen', 'ショーレイ・ノウゼン', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', 'Shinei''s older brother. Rei was a generally friendly and reliable older brother, but he was not without his faults. ~!One night when he was on patrol, he came across a young Vladilena Milizé, who was taken by her father to see the injustices brought upon the Eighty-Six. Their helicopter had been shot by a Stachelschwein and was forced to land, leaving them vulnerable to an attack from a nearby Ameise. He took the only survivor, Lena, to his base and sent her back to inside the Gran Mur.!~', '/uploads/images/c_224075.png'),
(159, 'Václav Milizé', 'ヴァーツラフ・ミリーゼ', '配角', 'Masaki Terasoma', 'Vaclav Milizé was Vladilena Milizé''s father and friend of Jerome Karlsthal. He was a member of the Republic Armed Forces', '/uploads/images/c_236363.png'),
(159, 'Fido', 'ファイド', '配角', '', 'Fido is an M101 Barrett Scavenger Drone of the Spearhead Squadron. As a Scavenger, Fido provides aid to the squadron by resupplying ammunition and recharging energy packs, as well as finding and extracting materials from abandoned or destroyed units. He has accompanied Shinei Nouzen in his battles across the Eastern Front and beyond, making him Shin''s oldest surviving companion.', '/uploads/images/c_237557.jpg'),
(159, 'Kiriya Nouzen', 'キリヤ・ノウゼン', '配角', 'Yuuto Uemura', 'He was the personal knight and caretaker of Augusta Frederica Adel-Adler. ~!After the Federacy''s forces managed to breach the defensive line at his posting of Rosenfort and the apparent death of his liege, he was assimilated by a Tausendfüßler and became a Legion Shepherd.!~', '/uploads/images/c_258614.png'),
(160, 'Rimuru Tempest', 'リムル・テンペスト', '主角', 'Miho Okasaki', '__Species:__ Human (past life) → Slime __Kind:__ Reincarnated, Otherworlder Rimuru Tempest, formerly known as Satoru Mikami, is the main protagonist of Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken. They are the founder and King of the monster country Tempest, situated in the Great Jura Forest, and the partner and sworn friend of Storm Dragon, [Veldora Tempest](https://anilist.co/character/128034/Veldora-Tempest).', '/uploads/images/c_123962.png'),
(160, 'Shion', 'シオン', '配角', 'Mao Ichimichi', '"War Lord" Shion is Rimuru’s first servant to be in charge of his care as his personal secretary. She is also the leader of the Yomigaeri and also one of Rimuru''s strongest fighters and is coveted by many of the Demon Lords who have met her.', '/uploads/images/c_128033.png'),
(160, 'Veldora Tempest', 'ヴェルドラ＝テンペスト', '配角', 'Tomoaki Maeno', '__Height:__ 210 cm (human form), 100 m (dragon form) __Species:__ True Dragon __Blessing / Divine Protection:__ Storm Dragon''s Grace, Demon Lord''s Ally __Disaster Rank:__ Catastrophe Veldora Tempest is the youngest of the four strongest dragons (True Dragons). He is connected with [Rimuru](https://anilist.co/character/123962) by an agreement and was known to rampage here and there. He was the one to name Rimuru and Rimuru gave him his last name, since they share the same last name, Rimuru could technically be classified as Veldora''s adoptive brother.', '/uploads/images/c_128034.png'),
(160, 'Ranga', 'ランガ', '配角', 'Chikahiro Kobayashi', '"Star Lord" Ranga is a Wind Spirit Wolf and a loyal follower of [Rimuru](https://anilist.co/character/123962/Tempest-Rimuru). The leader of the Star Wolf Clan, and the son of the previous boss of the Direwolves. He is also one of Rimuru''s Twelve Patrons who has been given the title of a "Lord".', '/uploads/images/c_128035.png'),
(160, 'Milim Nava', 'ミリム・ナーヴァ', '配角', 'Rina Hidaka', '__Kind:__ Inhabitant "Destroyer" Milim Nava is one of the oldest and strongest Demon Lords. She is a Dragonoid. Her nickname, Destroyer, is not just for show. She is a demon lord one should never fight against.', '/uploads/images/c_128036.png'),
(160, 'Benimaru', 'ベニマル', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', 'Benimaru is one of the third group of subordinate Monsters to be named by Rimuru Tempest. Originally an Ogre, he was uncertain of his servitude and intended for it to be temporary, but after being named, he evolved into a Kijin, immediately becoming Rimuru''s most powerful subordinate for a time, and decided to serve him permanently. He lives in the Capital city of the Jura Tempest Federation: Rimuru City. Soon after, and became Commander-in-Chief, giving him direct command over Tempest''s military forces. Upon Rimuru''s ascension to a True Demon Lord, Benimaru evolved into a Fair Oni and reached the strength of a Disaster-Class Monster.', '/uploads/images/c_128038.png'),
(160, 'Souei', 'ソウエイ', '配角', 'Takuya Eguchi', '__Height__: 180 cm (Kijin), 190 cm (Ogre) Souei is an Ogre that was among the third group of subordinates to be named by Rimuru Tempest. He is Rimuru''s faithful shadow and the leader of the Shadow Squad of the Jura Tempest Federation.', '/uploads/images/c_128039.png'),
(160, 'Shuna', 'シュナ', '配角', 'Sayaka Senbongi', 'Shuna is one of the third group of subordinate Monsters to be named by [Rimuru](https://anilist.co/character/123962), evolving her from an Ogre to a Kijin. She was originally the princess of the Ogre tribe and even though she had the talent for using Magic, she was a sheltered girl, but quickly got along with the Goblinas Shuna is the daughter of the late ogre chieftain and she is also [Benimaru](https://anilist.co/character/128038)''s younger sister, which is why she''s nicknamed "Oni Princess" by Rimuru. Very skilled and knowledgeable in domestic matters, she essentially becomes Rimuru''s chief economic advisor together with [Rigurd](https://anilist.co/character/129348).', '/uploads/images/c_128040.png'),
(160, 'Daikenja', '大賢者', '配角', 'Megumi Toyoguchi', 'Unique Skill Great Sage is one of the first two Unique Skills (the other being Predator) that [Rimuru Tempest](https://anilist.co/character/123962/Rimuru-Tempest) had upon being born into his new world. It had evolved from Extra Skill Sage during his death, as he thought since he was approaching his forties as a virgin, he must be something much greater than a mere wizard. ~!During Rimuru''s evolution into Demon Lord this Unique Skill evolved into the Ultimate Skill: Wisdom King Raphael.!~ ~!Rimuru gave her a name and she evolved into a manas with the name Ciel!~', '/uploads/images/c_129347.jpg'),
(160, 'Rigurd', 'リグルド', '配角', 'Kanehira Yamamoto', 'Formerly the chief of the goblin village Rimuru comes across. He''s now the acting prime minister of the Jura Tempest Federation. He evolved into a hobgoblin when Rimuru named him.', '/uploads/images/c_129348.jpg'),
(160, 'Gobta', 'ゴブタ', '配角', 'Asuna Tomari', 'Gobta is a hobgoblin and is one of Rimuru Tempest''s followers. Though he seems to be air-headed he tends to be a hard-worker and dependable when the time calls for it.', '/uploads/images/c_129350.jpg'),
(160, 'Gido', 'ギド', '配角', 'Ryuuichi Kijima', 'Gido is a member of Cabal''s Party who serves as the ''thief'' role. ~!However, he is actually serving as one of the bodyguards of Lady Elyune secretly while under the guise of an adventurer.!~ (Source: Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_129916.jpg'),
(160, 'Kaval', 'カバル', '配角', 'Kengo Takanashi', 'Kaval is the leader of his adventure''s party, where he serves as the ''fighter'' role. ~!Alongside Gido, he is also tasked as the secret bodyguard of Lady Elyune under the guise of an adventurer.!~ (Source: Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_129918.jpg'),
(160, 'Ellen', 'エレン', '配角', 'Akane Kumada', 'Eren is an adventurer and a member of Kaval''s Party. ~!She is actually the daughter of the Duke of Sorcerer''s Dynasty Sarion Elalude, who ran off to be an adventurer due to her selfishness and free-spirited personality.!~ (Source: Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_129919.jpg'),
(160, 'Diablo', 'ディアブロ', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', 'Diablo is the Black Primordial and a loyal servant of [Rimuru Tempest](https://anilist.co/character/123962/Tempest-Rimuru). Before he met Rimuru, he went by the nicknames Black or Noir, the latter which he received from his fellow Primordial kin. After receiving the name Diablo from Rimuru, he evolved to a Demon Peer.', '/uploads/images/c_131033.jpg'),
(160, 'Ramiris', 'ラミリス', '配角', 'Anzu Haruno', 'Ramiris is a fairy that resides inside of Tempest''s Underground Labyrinth. She is also one of the Eight-Star Demon Lords.', '/uploads/images/c_131034.jpg'),
(160, 'Daggrull', 'ダグリュール', '配角', 'Rikiya Koyama', '"Earthquake" Daggrull is a giant that is close friends with Deeno. He is the fourth seat of the Octagram (Eight-Star Demon Lords).', '/uploads/images/c_131035.jpg'),
(160, 'Luminous Valentine', 'ルミナス・バレンタイン', '配角', 'Lynn', '"Queen of Nightmares" Luminous Valentine is an elite vampire and one of the Eight-Star Demon Lords. She is also the true ruler of the Holy Kingdom Ruberion.', '/uploads/images/c_131037.png'),
(160, 'Frey', 'フレイ', '配角', 'Sayaka Oohara', '"Sky Queen" Frey is an ex-Demon Lord and currently a subordinate of [Demon Lord Milim Nava](https://anilist.co/character/128036/Nava-Milim). She often scolds Milim for playing around when she is supposed to be working.', '/uploads/images/c_131038.jpg'),
(160, 'Gabiru', 'ガビル', '配角', 'Jun Fukushima', 'The captain of the Hiryuu of Tempest, and the former lizardmen raid leader. He suffers from a superiority complex. The root of Gabil''s pride and confidence​ is the thought that he is the chosen one.', '/uploads/images/c_131041.jpg'),
(160, 'Hinata Sakaguchi', '坂口日向', '配角', 'Manami Numakura', 'Hinata Sakaguchi is an otherworlder and the leader of the Imperial Guards under the Pope''s direct command. Along with Yuuki and Class S, she''s a former student of Shizue Izawa. ~!At first she thought monsters should all be exterminated. But after her fight with Rimuru, she was convinced that Rimuru is not evil.!~', '/uploads/images/c_131042.png'),
(160, 'Hakurou', 'ハクロウ', '配角', 'Houchuu Ootsuka', 'Hakurou is a Fair Oni and is a loyal follower of Rimuru Tempest. He was one of the survivors of the Orc attack. He was also the teacher of the Dwarven King.', '/uploads/images/c_131043.png'),
(160, 'Karion', 'カリオン', '配角', 'Yasuaki Takumi', '~!Karion is one of the ten demon lords that existed before Rimuru became a demon lord. During the Walpurgis Banquet where Rimuru killed Clayman. Karion became a subordinate of Milim.!~', '/uploads/images/c_131044.png'),
(160, 'Kagali', 'カガリ', '配角', 'Yui Ishikawa', 'Kagali is an elf that serves as secretary to Yuuki Kagurazaka. ~!Her true identity is that of a former Demon Lord, and president of the Moderate Harlequin Alliance, who had once been known as Curse Lord Kazaream. Seemingly killed by Leon Cromwell 200 years ago, Kazaream managed to survive by escaping with just his Astral Body and now occupies a Homunculus body in the shape of a female elf.!~', '/uploads/images/c_131046.png'),
(160, 'Leon Cromwell', 'レオン・クロムウェル', '配角', 'Jun Fukuyama', 'Leon Cromwell is a former hero and a current Demon Lord of the Eight-pointed Star Octagram. He is the ruler of El Dorado, an island nation located south-west of the world.', '/uploads/images/c_131047.png'),
(160, 'Guy Crimson', 'ギィ・クリムゾン', '配角', 'Akira Ishida', 'Guy Crimson is the oldest of the Demon Lords. He has forever ruled over the frozen continent. Being androgynous, he can become a man or woman at will.', '/uploads/images/c_131048.jpg'),
(160, 'Deeno', 'ディーノ', '配角', 'Yuusuke Kobayashi', 'Demon Lord Deeno, known as the Sleeping Ruler, is one of the Eight-Star Demon Lords.', '/uploads/images/c_131049.jpg'),
(160, 'Kurobee', 'クロベエ', '配角', 'Junichi Yanagita', 'Kurobee is a Fair Oni and a loyal follower of Rimuru Tempest. Kurobee was originally one of the Oni that survived the Orc attack. He evolved after being named by Rimuru.', '/uploads/images/c_131051.jpg'),
(160, 'Clayman', 'クレイマン', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', 'Demon Lord Clayman, is one of the ten demon lords that ~!existed before Rimuru became a demon lord. He turned into Kazaream''s underling when Kazaream turned him into a demon lord.!~', '/uploads/images/c_131052.png'),
(160, 'Beretta', 'ベレッタ', '配角', 'Ayako Kawasumi', 'Beretta is a Greater Demon that was summoned by Rimuru to protect Ramiris to make up for destroying her previous golem. They incarnated in a golem made out of pure magisteel and have served her since.', '/uploads/images/c_131053.jpg'),
(160, 'Gazel Dwargo', 'ガゼル・ドワルゴ', '配角', 'Takaya Hashi', 'Species: Dwarf Blessing / Divine Protection: Divine Protector of Ancestor Title: King of Armament Nation Dwargon. The king of Dwargon, Gazel Dwargo, the third generation king of Dwargon, but possesses a similar aura to that of his grandfather in his younger days. He is renowned as a great hero and celebrated as a wise king for his impartial rule.', '/uploads/images/c_132727.jpg'),
(160, 'Treyni', 'トレイニー', '配角', 'Rie Tanaka', 'Treyni is a dryad that resides in the Jura Forest.', '/uploads/images/c_132729.jpg'),
(160, 'Souka', 'ソーカ', '配角', 'Rumi Ookubo', 'Gabil''s younger sister, and the daughter of Abil. After the Orc Lord incident, she swears her allegeiance to Rimuru. She attends to Souei as a spy.', '/uploads/images/c_132730.png'),
(160, 'Yuuki Kagurazaka', '神楽坂優樹', '配角', 'Natsuki Hanae', 'A former student of Shizu who originally came from Japan and ~!one of the main antagonists of the series. !~ Yuuki serves as the Guild Master of the Adventurers'' Guild in the kingdom of Ingracia, and he loves manga. ~!Although Yuuki first comes as a friendly person he is actually a master in manipulating others without hesitation to achieve his goal of a just world that treats everyone fairly. Even though Rimuru and Yuuki get along at first he later addresses Rimuru as a very serious threat to his plans. !~', '/uploads/images/c_132755.jpg'),
(160, 'Geld', 'ゲルド', '配角', 'Tarou Yamaguchi', 'He is one of the fourth group of subordinates to be named by Rimuru Tempest. As the right-hand man of the deceased Orc Lord, he was given the same name as him, as a memento and token of appreciation, similar to how Rigur was named after his older brother. As an Orc King, he is the leader of the Yellow Corps, that acts as both the last line of defense for Tempest as well as the main team of the country''s Department of Construction and Manufacturing. Later on, he was given the Title of a "Lord" as one of Rimuru''s Twelve Patrons.', '/uploads/images/c_133522.jpg'),
(160, 'Tear', 'ティア', '配角', 'Kaede Hondo', 'Member of the Moderate Jesters alongside Laplace and Footman, and as that loyal subordinate of Demon Lord Kazaream.', '/uploads/images/c_134576.jpg'),
(160, 'Fuze', 'フューズ', '配角', 'Ken Narita', 'He is the Brumund Kingdom''s Freedom Association, Guild Master.', '/uploads/images/c_134580.jpg'),
(160, 'Youm Farmenas', 'ヨウム・ファルメナス', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', 'The Hero-King Farmenas of the Farmenas Kingdom. Formerly the Farmas Kingdom, Count Nidole Maigam’s Territory''s, Frontier Garrison Captain Youm.', '/uploads/images/c_134582.png'),
(160, 'Ifrit', 'イフリット', '配角', '', 'Ifrit is a high-ranking spirit; the ruler of flame which was sealed within Shizue Izawa by Demon Lord Leon Cromwell. He used to live in Dwelling of the Spirit before he was stolen by the "Blonde Demon" Leon Cromwell. After that, he was sealed within Shizue Izawa. As a result of this, it gave Shizue an extended lifespan.', '/uploads/images/c_134583.png'),
(160, 'Laplace', 'ラプラス', '配角', 'Kazuya Nakai', 'He is the vice-president of the Moderate Jesters and as that a loyal subordinate of Demon Lord Kazaream.', '/uploads/images/c_134593.jpg'),
(160, 'Phobio', 'フォビオ', '配角', 'Seiichirou Yamashita', '__Species:__ Leopard Lycanthrope He is one of the "Beastketeers" of the Demon Lord Karion. He is proclaimed to be the strongest warrior of the 3 "Beastketeers".', '/uploads/images/c_134594.jpg'),
(160, 'Kumara', 'クマラ', '配角', 'Sayumi Suzushiro', 'One of the ninth group of subordinates to be named by Rimuru Tempest. She was originally a small fox spirit enslaved by Clayman and was freed from his curse by Rimuru. (Source: The Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_188668.png'),
(160, 'Albis', 'アルビス', '配角', 'Ai Kakuma', 'Albis, known as the Golden Serpent, is one of Carrion''s Beastman subordinates. She is the leader of Yuurazania''s Three Beastketeers. ~!She becomes one of Benimaru''s wives later on along with Momiji!~', '/uploads/images/c_195048.jpg'),
(160, 'Grucius', 'グルーシス', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', 'Grucius is a Beastman from the Beast Kingdom Eurazania.', '/uploads/images/c_195066.jpg'),
(160, 'Suphia', 'スフィア', '配角', 'You Taichi', 'Suphia, known as the White Tiger Claw, is one of Beast Kingdom Eurazania''s Three Beastketeers. She is described as having a ferocious aura that has been likened to a "battle-hardened leader".', '/uploads/images/c_195067.jpg'),
(160, 'Mjurran', 'ミュウラン', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', 'A travelling wizard who was granted a place in Youm''s party as their advisor after defeating the aforementioned in a duel. ~!Of Clayman''s "Five Fingers", she was the "Ring Finger", acting as one of his spies until Rimuru severs his control over her heart.!~', '/uploads/images/c_195068.jpg'),
(160, 'Tiss', 'ティス', '配角', '', 'Tiss is a homeroom teacher of the Freedom Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_197872.png'),
(160, 'Footman', 'フットマン', '配角', 'Shinji Kawada', 'Footman is a Majin who is part of the Moderate Harlequin Alliance', '/uploads/images/c_198040.jpg'),
(160, 'Mizeri', 'ミザリー', '配角', 'Yuuki Hirose', 'The green Demon Primordial and a subordinate of fellow Primordial [Guy Crimson](https://anilist.co/character/131048/Guy-Crimson). Guy is the one who gave Mizeri her name. Mizeri''s partner is the Blue Primordial [Raine](https://anilist.co/character/198042/Raine).', '/uploads/images/c_198041.jpg'),
(160, 'Raine', 'レイン', '配角', 'Eri Yukimura', 'The Blue Primordial and subordinate of fellow Primordial Guy Crimson. Guy was the one who gave Raine her name.', '/uploads/images/c_198042.jpg'),
(160, 'Razen', 'ラーゼン', '配角', '', 'Razen is a brilliant sorcerer who has served many years as a Court Mage in Farmus, part of why he has lived so long is his Possession Spell. He was once a student under the Great Sorcerer Gadra. ~!He''s currently possessing Shogo Taguchi''s body!~', '/uploads/images/c_212507.jpg'),
(160, 'Gobzo', 'ゴンゾ', '配角', 'Gakuto Kajiwara', 'A Goblin in Tempest thats friends with Gobuta', '/uploads/images/c_213898.jpg'),
(160, 'Velzard', 'ヴェルザード', '配角', 'Yuka Iguchi', 'Velzard, also known as White Ice Dragon, is the second-oldest of the four True Dragons and the partner of Guy Crimson. Uninterested in most worldly matters, Velzard usually spends her time in the Palace of White Ice, releasing her aura that keeps the Ice Continent frozen.', '/uploads/images/c_215593.png'),
(160, 'Erald Grimwald', 'エラルド・グリムワルト', '配角', 'Kenji Hamada', 'An Archduke of Sorcerer''s Dynasty Sarion. He is the empress'' uncle and Ellen''s father. He''s an envoy representing the empress.', '/uploads/images/c_225266.png'),
(160, 'Yamza', 'ヤムザ', '配角', 'Yuuya Hirose', 'Yamza was the Clayman Army Commander-In-Chief and the Middle-finger of Clayman''s Five Fingers. (Source: That Time I got Reincarnated as a Slime fandom)', '/uploads/images/c_226058.jpg'),
(160, 'Middray', 'ミッドレイ', '配角', 'Atsushi Imaruoka', 'A Dragonewt and the Head Priest of the Dragon Faithful that worships Milim Nava.', '/uploads/images/c_226611.jpg'),
(160, 'Hermes', 'ヘルメス', '配角', 'Daiki Kobayashi', 'A priest of the Dragon Faithful that worships Milim Nava. He is Middray''s assistant.', '/uploads/images/c_226612.jpg'),
(160, 'Roy Valentin', 'ロイ・ヴァレンタイン', '配角', 'Masaaki Mizunaka', 'A member of the Ten Great Demon Lords. In Kagali''s prime, his strength was comparable to hers. ~!It is revealed he was just a stand-in and proxy demon lord for Luminous Valentine, the true ruler of Ruberios, and the god of Luminism.!~', '/uploads/images/c_238224.jpg'),
(160, 'Adalman', 'アダルマン', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', 'Adalman, formerly the Index Finger of Clayman''s Five Fingers, is an Undead and the guardian of the 70th floor of Ramiris'' Labyrinth.', '/uploads/images/c_241937.jpg'),
(160, 'Yashichi', 'ヤシチ', '配角', 'Akinori Egoshi', '__Race:__ Dragonewt One of [Gabiru](https://anilist.co/character/131041)''s subordinates and friends. Yashichi fervently supports Gabiru through victory and defeat.', '/uploads/images/c_297837.png'),
(160, 'Trya', 'トライア', '配角', 'Kana Asumi', 'Trya is a Dryad that resides in the Jura Forest. She is the sister of Treyni.', '/uploads/images/c_301064.png'),
(161, 'Katsuki Bakugou', '爆豪勝己', '主角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5''7") __Quirk:__ Explosion Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Katsuki is a crude, arrogant, short-tempered, and aggressive person, especially at the beginning of the series. Due to the constant praise of his abilities and powerful Quirk, Katsuki has developed a superiority complex, and because of that, he desires to be the first and best at everything. He loves to win above all else and cannot stand it when he doesn''t, leading him to lose his already short temper if he achieves anything but a complete victory. Katsuki is not only very athletic and talented at fighting, but also very intelligent and extremely perceptive, capable of strategic planning and improvisation. Additionally, his grades are among the highest of his class. Katsuki also possesses surprising talent in other areas, such as cooking and music, even though he doesn''t show a particular interest in them. Overall, Katsuki is considered a natural-born genius with the potential to be one of the best Pro Heroes. Katsuki''s Quirk "Explosion" allows him to secrete nitroglycerin-like sweat from the palms of his hands and ignite it on command, allowing him to create strong explosions. The more Katsuki sweats, the stronger his explosions become. Not only can Katsuki use the explosions for attacking, he can also use them to propel himself and navigate through the air at high speeds, allowing him to fly at his opponents without giving them time to react, as well as evade incoming attacks, even whi', '/uploads/images/c_88892.png'),
(161, 'Izuku Midoriya', '緑谷出久', '主角', 'Daiki Yamashita', '__Height:__ 166 cm (5''5¼") __Quirk:__ One For All Student in Class 1-A at U.A High School. Although he was born without a Quirk, Izuku''s innate heroism and strong sense of justice manages to catch the attention of the legendary hero [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224). Izuku has since become All Might''s closest pupil. Izuku is a very timid, reserved, and polite boy. Although initially portrayed as insecure, tearful, and vulnerable, Izuku gradually matures into a more confident and braver person. His infectious leadership skills, combined with his passion and strategic abilities, have turned Izuku into a central figure of Class 1-A. He is caring and emotional, never hesitating to help or rescue someone in danger, even if he knows that he might not be strong or otherwise qualified enough to do it. Izuku is extremely (and sometimes scarily) enthusiastic about topics related to heroes. His dream drives him to write down notes about everything he learns about heroes'' Quirks and fighting capabilities. Thanks to this practice, Izuku has developed a great analytical mind and can form complex battle plans in a few seconds, factoring in the best ways he can utilize the Quirks of allies and enemies alike for his own advantage. Izuku''s Quirk "One For All" was transferred to him from All Might. His Quirk allows him to stockpile an enormous amount of raw power, allowing him to significantly enhance all of his physical abilities to various boundless levels. This results in unbel', '/uploads/images/c_89028.png'),
(161, 'Shouto Todoroki', '轟焦凍', '主角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9") __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Half-Cold Half-Hot Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School, where he got in through official recommendations. He is the youngest son of the top hero [Endeavor](https://anilist.co/character/126158). Shouto initially has a cold, aloof personality, which stemmed from his complicated family life. Focused and unemotional, Shouto preferred to keep things to himself instead of hanging out with others. After the events of the U.A. Sports Festival, however, he notably became more sociable and kinder than ever before. He even gained a sense of humor and would occasionally smile, although still retaining some fragments of his previous distant attitude and nonchalant demeanor. While usually quiet and reserved, Shouto initially possessed a moderate level of arrogance, which, combined with his solitary tendencies, sometimes made him take the initiative without considering the opinions of others. Shouto''s Quirk Half-Cold Half-Hot gives him the ability to generate ice from the right side of his body, and flames from his left side. Due to years of rejecting his father, Shouto has developed a habit of favoring ice, even when fire would be a better option. This grudge also caused him to have difficulty controlling his flames. If he overuses one element without utilizing the other, then his own body temperature will suffer.', '/uploads/images/c_89220.png'),
(161, 'Ochako Uraraka', '麗日お茶子', '配角', 'Ayane Sakura', '__Height:__ 156 cm (5''1") __Quirk:__ Zero Gravity Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School Ochako is an outgoing, lively person who thinks about everything positively, though she is objective enough to see flaws and virtues. She gets excited over little things very easily. Ochaco has been described by other students as "the most laidback girl" among her class, being very bubbly and kind of an airhead at times. She is often incredibly blunt without being aware of it. She is on good terms with everyone and is particularly close friends with several class members, including [Izuku](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku), [Tenya Ida](https://anilist.co/character/89222/Iida-Tenya), and [Tsuyu](https://anilist.co/character/89223/Asui-Tsuyu). Ochaco''s Quirk gives her the power to manipulate gravity upon touching solid things with the pads on her fingertips. The targets lose their gravitational pull, effectively making them weightless. She is able to activate or cancel her Quirk''s effects by closing her fingers together, and is shown to be careful with her hands in order to avoid accidental quirk activation.', '/uploads/images/c_89221.png'),
(161, 'Tenya Iida', '飯田天哉', '配角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5''10") __Quirk:__ Engine Class representative of Class 1-A at U.A. High School Tenya may look severe, but he''s actually just a very serious person, who takes everything, even the most insignificant thing, seriously. A testament to his generally hyperactive and intense behavior, Tenya often exhibits plenty of peculiar tics, such as moving his arms around in strange chopping patterns or sometimes twitching his body uncontrollably. Tenya is very humble, willing to admit to his mistakes, apologize for rude behavior, and improve in areas he lacks. Being part of the highly-esteemed Ida Family of Heroes, Tenya is proud of his lineage and works hard to meet his expectations. He greatly admires his older brother, Tensei (also known as the Turbo Hero: Ingenium), and aspires to become a similar hero. Tenya''s Quirk Engine gives him car-like engines in each of his calves, giving him incredible running speed and extreme kicking power. Tenya needs to fuel his engines by drinking orange juice. Tenya''s engines have multiple gears; it is currently unknown how many, but it has been implied that there are more than three.', '/uploads/images/c_89222.png'),
(161, 'Tsuyu Asui', '蛙吹梅雨', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', '__Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Frog Tsuyu is a very straight-forward girl that always says what''s on her mind and what she thinks about others. She prefers to be called by her first name.', '/uploads/images/c_89223.png'),
(161, 'Toshinori Yagi', '八木俊典', '配角', 'Kenta Miyake', '__Height:__ 220 cm (7''2") __Quirk:__ One for All All Might is the No. 1 Hero and the "Symbol of Peace." In his hero form, All Might is a very tall and over-muscular man whose design resembles the american hero comics. His hair spikes on top of his head and his whole body has more shadows than a normal human being. However, in his true form, he is an overly-skinny man who spits a lot of blood out of his mouth and his clothes appear loose.', '/uploads/images/c_89224.jpg'),
(161, 'Shouta Aizawa', '相澤消太', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', '__Height: __183 cm (6'') __Occupation:__ Pro Hero, Teacher __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Erasure Aizawa''s hero name, Eraserhead, was coined by [Present Mic](https://anilist.co/character/127425) when they were younger. Using the binding cloth, Aizawa has a unique fighting style that allows him to immobilize his enemies. He is known to expel students that don''t meet his standards, however it should be noted that he did not expel anyone from Class 1-A. Aizawa is extremely vocal, able to voice his opinions very easily. Although seeming emotionless and reserved, he has a soft spot for his students and genuinely cares for them.', '/uploads/images/c_89225.png'),
(161, 'Tomura Shigaraki', '死柄木弔', '主角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9) __Quirk:__ Decay Leader of the League of Villains and protégé of [All For One](https://anilist.co/character/125956/All-For-One). He was raised by his master, All For One, with the goal of killing [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224/Yagi-Toshinori), and ultimately destroying the society he represents. Tomura is a very twisted, malevolent, and maliciously warped young man, who is considered to be the polar opposite of [Izuku Midoriya](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku). He doesn''t care for his or almost anyone else''s life, having no qualms about performing evil deeds like murdering innocent people. Tomura was initially perceived to be a "man-child": arrogant, selfish, dependent, and demanding, becoming angry if things didn''t go his way and likening reality to some sort of video game. Unlike his mentor, Tomura lacked subtlety, preferring to eliminate problems through force. Much like a child, Tomura seemed unable to cope with his own feelings, instead lashing out and abusing both others or himself, tearing at his own neck when he becomes frustrated. Initially, Tomura seemingly caused destruction just for the sake of it and felt directionless about the League''s path forward after [Stain](https://anilist.co/character/126067/Akaguro-Chizome)''s arrest. It would take a fateful meeting with Izuku in a mall for him to develop an epiphany and become aware of his true convictions: to crumble hero society through All Might''s death. Tomur', '/uploads/images/c_89226.jpg'),
(161, 'Momo Yaoyorozu', '八百万百', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") __Quirk:__ Creation Vice class representative of Class 1-A at U.A. High School. She was admitted to the school through official recommendations. Momo is a very prudent, dedicated person who acts as a natural leader. She is generally level-headed and calm in dangerous situations, but she isn''t above falling into a panic. Momo can be blunt with her comments about people''s mistakes and miscalculations, tending to be very direct and wishing to help her peers improve enough to become great heroes. Momo''s Quirk gives her the ability to create any non-living material/object from her exposed skin by transforming the molecular structure of her fat cells. In order to create something, she needs to understand the molecular structure of which the material/object is made.', '/uploads/images/c_89241.png'),
(161, 'Hitoshi Shinsou', '心操人使', '配角', 'Wataru Hatano', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''9½") __Quirk:__ Brainwashing Student at U.A. High School, attending Class 1-C of the Department of General Education. Hitoshi is a stoic and straightforward person with an innate ability to spark conversation with anyone despite holding a reserved and quiet attitude most of the time. He is shown to be rather clever, knowing just the right words to manipulate others into replying to his comments, allowing him to activate his Quirk. He does not mind doing something underhanded to claim victory in a fight. Due to having his Brainwashing Quirk perceived as evil throughout his life, Hitoshi has been somewhat feared by those aware of his power and has been discriminated against solely because of the Quirk he was born with. This persecution led him to become resentful of those who had Quirks more associated with hero work. Regardless of his drawbacks, however, Hitoshi desires to become a Pro Hero more than anything. Hitoshi''s Quirk Brainwashing allows him to put someone in a state where they are forced to obey whatever he commands. He can only activate this power when his target verbally responds to something he says. Brainwashing must be intentionally activated and will not take effect if Hitoshi doesn''t want it to. Using a megaphone or anything that makes his voice artificial will not allow his Quirk to activate, as the said devices would transform his voice into an electronic signal.', '/uploads/images/c_89242.png'),
(161, 'Eijirou Kirishima', '切島鋭児郎', '配角', 'Toshiki Masuda', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Quirk:__ Hardening Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Eijiro is a boisterous and outgoing guy with a fondness for manliness, often using the terms "manly" and "unmanly" to describe things and people he does or doesn''t like, respectively. Eijiro is very honest and kind-hearted, having a straightforward way of thinking and following a specific code of chivalry that motivates him to live without regret. He is determined and selfless, bravely putting the safety of others before himself. He is also a big fan of Crimson Riot, a retro hero from whom he takes inspiration, including personal values and his hero name. Although Eijiro may not be as hot-blooded and competitive as [Katsuki Bakugou](https://anilist.co/character/88892), he does not shy away from comparing himself to him, with [Izuku](https://anilist.co/character/89028) stating that the two have managed to develop a relationship between equals. As a result, Eijiro is notably one of the few people that Katsuki holds in higher esteem. Eijiro''s Quirk gives him the power to harden and sharpen any or all parts of his body, causing his flesh to become jagged and rock-like. There is a limit to how much damage his hardened body can withstand, which causes the Hardening itself to slowly dissipate, and Eijiro to lose stamina from struggling to keep his Quirk active.', '/uploads/images/c_89243.jpg'),
(161, 'Minoru Mineta', '峰田実', '配角', 'Ryou Hirohashi', '__Height:__ 108 cm (3'' 6½") __Quirk:__ Pop Off __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Fighting Style:__ Medium Ranged Support Minoru Mineta, also known as the Fresh-Picked Hero: Grape Juice, is a student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School, training to become a Pro Hero.', '/uploads/images/c_89244.png'),
(161, 'Mina Ashido', '芦戸三奈', '配角', 'Eri Kitamura', '__Height:__ 159 cm (5''3") __Quirk:__ Acid Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Mina is a cheerful and easygoing girl who usually displays a smile. Highly social and excitable, she loves to hang out with her friends and is shown to become very upset when denied an opportunity to be at a gathering. She possesses a strong fashion sense and likes to go shopping. Due to her athleticism and energy, Mina enjoys and is very skilled at dancing. Mina is extremely courageous and is viewed as an ideal personality for hero work. Mina''s Quirk Acid allows her to produce a corrosive liquid from her body. She can control the solubility and viscosity of this corrosive liquid. There is a limit to how long she can produce the corrosive liquid until her skin gradually loses its natural resistance to it. Overusing her Quirk or pushing it too far can also be fatal, as it dehydrates her body very fast. Mina can use her acid offensively, but has shown utility with it as well, such as melting handholds for herself to climb with. She is also known to secrete a non-corrosive version of the acid from her feet in order to slide around.', '/uploads/images/c_89247.png'),
(161, 'Mei Hatsume', '発目明', '配角', 'Shiori Sakurai', '__Height:__ 157 cm (5''2") __Quirk:__ Zoom Mei is a smart, off-setting, and assertive girl, often making those around her uncomfortable. She loves creating gadgets, which she refers to as her "super cute babies". Mei has a habit of "going straight to the point" and is very shameless and opportunistic when it comes to advertising her inventions. While talking to people, she has a habit of getting awkwardly close to them, which usually causes them to back away from her but she still moves up to them.', '/uploads/images/c_89248.png'),
(161, 'Denki Kaminari', '上鳴電気', '配角', 'Tasuku Hatanaka', '__Height:__ 168 cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Electrification Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Denki is a friendly, social, and energetic boy who enjoys hanging out with others. He is rather casual when interacting with other people, including the generally unfriendly [Katsuki Bakugou](https://anilist.co/character/88892/Bakugou-Katsuki). Denki''s Quirk Electrification allows him to store and discharge electricity. While he can also discharge this energy over a distance, Denki has little to no control over it, meaning it will go everywhere indiscriminately. Denki is also able to absorb and neutralize electricity and other lightning-based Quirks. Whenever Denki exceeds his wattage limit, he loses his ability to discharge energy, with his entire personality changing into that of a giggling idiot for a certain period until he reverts to normal. In this state, he is always giving thumbs-ups as a way to let others know that he is okay.', '/uploads/images/c_89249.png'),
(161, 'Jin Bubaigawara', '分倍河原仁', '配角', 'Daichi Endou', '__Height:__ 178 cm (5''10") __Quirk:__ Double Villain affiliated with the League of Villains, and part of its Vanguard Action Squad. Jin has an incredibly unique personality: explosive, and lively with a very comedic demeanor. He enjoys assuming dramatic poses and eccentric facial expressions. Jin constantly contradicts himself, making a statement in one voice and immediately saying the opposite in another. This juxtaposition iss part of a mental instability that Jin embraces as a villain. He believes understanding your own identity is the most essential aspect in life, an understanding he lost during the 9-day conflict with his own clones that left him unsure whether he was the original or not. Now, if his mask is removed, he panics and threatens to "split" until he put his mask back on to become "whole". Jin''s Quirk allows him to create an exact duplicate of anything, living or not. To duplicate something, he needs to know its precise measurements and characteristics. The clones he makes do not disappear; instead, they disintegrate into a mud-like substance after taking a certain amount of damage. The duplicates are less durable than the original, and the second duplicate is even less durable than the first. When Jin creates duplicates of a person, he has no control over the clones because they have their own autonomy, personalities, and abilities that are utterly identical to the original.', '/uploads/images/c_89589.png'),
(161, 'Hanta Sero', '瀬呂範太', '配角', 'Kiyotaka Furushima', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5'' 9¾") __Quirk:__ Tape Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Hanta is amicable and has proven to be one of the more sociable members of Class 1-A. He can sometimes be loud and showy, often trying to impress his peers with his Quirk. He is often the only person to call his classmates out when they act crazy. He is pretty humorous and usually makes jokes with his classmates. However, when push comes to shove, Hanta is a brave hero-in-training who wishes to prosper on his own while helping others do the same. Hanta''s Quirk is that he has tape dispenser-like organs in his elbows, from which he can shoot long cellophane tape-like strips; he can also retract them. They appear to be somewhat sturdier than regular tape. Overuse of his Quirk will cause his skin to dry out. He can use his tape to wrap people, swing long distances, and create traps, among other applications.', '/uploads/images/c_89895.png'),
(161, 'Mashirao Ojiro', '尾白猿夫', '配角', 'Kousuke Miyoshi', '__Height:__ 169 cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Tail Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Mashirao has a very calm and noble attitude and a profound sense of dignity, which prevents him from accepting results he doesn''t feel he earned with his own abilities. He is also described as a hard worker. Along with a strong sense of dignity, Mashirao can be described as sheepish and bashful, not very often enjoying the spotlight and being easily embarrassed. A recurring joke is that others view Mashirao as "plain," which profoundly upsets him. Mashirao''s Quirk is that he has a long, powerful, sturdy tail. His tail effectively functions as a third arm that he can use to grab things. Furthermore, it''s attack power is strong enough to break objects made of metal, he can wrap it around enemies, and it can support Mashirao''s body weight. Mashirao is incredibly adept at using his tail, combining it with his knowledge of martial arts to engage enemies in close-range combat, performing fast and acrobatic moves. His tail can also increase his speed and mobility by whipping it down against the ground to use it like a springboard. (Source: My Hero Academia Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_89896.png'),
(161, 'Kyouka Jirou', '耳郎響香', '配角', 'Kei Shindou', '__Height:__ 154 cm (5''1") __Quirk:__ Earphone Jack __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Fighting Style:__ Medium Ranged + Support Combat Kyoka is a petite, fair-skinned girl with a slender build. She has triangular, lazy-looking onyx eyes with notably long lower eyelashes, and rather small eyebrows. Kyoka has a pragmatic, unenthusiastic and teasing personality that is mostly shown to those she finds irritating. Kyoka is not always like this though, as she does enjoy socializing with others, in which case she is usually nice and friendly. Kyoka''s Quirk (Earphone Jack) allows her to plug the jacks that hang from her earlobes into all sorts of things and channel the sound of her heartbeat into them; causing havoc inside the plugged objects. It''s also used to catch sounds and vibrations from her surroundings.', '/uploads/images/c_89897.png'),
(161, 'Fumikage Tokoyami', '常闇踏陰', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', '__Height:__ 158 cm __Quirk:__ Dark Shadow Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Fumikage is reserved, serious, and focused, albeit noble and valiant. Though not talkative, Fumikage will directly ignore questions or requests that seem in some way pointless. During combat, Fumikage is known to be fierce and dependable, with his strength and capabilities rarely being questioned. Fumikage is fond of darkness and other related concepts, considering himself a "creature of the dark" and employing archaic-sounding speeches that paint him slightly creepy or dramatic. Fumikage''s Quirk "Dark Shadow" allows him to manifest a sentient shadow monster from his body that he can materialize and contract freely. Dark Shadow''s energy is limited and can be drained by bright light. Dark Shadow retracts into Fumikage''s body when it runs out of energy. The shadow entity''s personality, strength, defense, and control depend on the lack of light. In bright light, Dark Shadow is weaker and smaller but still has considerable strength and defense and is easier to control, but in total darkness, Dark Shadow''s size and parameters are drastically enhanced. It is powerful enough to rip out and cut down multiple full-grown trees easily. However, Dark Shadow is more difficult to control in the dark, causing it to rampage based on its own free will.', '/uploads/images/c_89898.png'),
(161, 'Mezou Shouji', '障子目蔵', '配角', 'Masakazu Nishida', '__Height:__ 187 cm (6''2") __Quirk:__ Dupli-Arms Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Shouji is friendly and gentle, and he will work nicely with anyone. He is not the type to hold grudges, showing no ill will towards those that harm him unwillingly. Shouji is entirely selfless and willing to risk his life for anyone. He can be empathetic and understanding, but still shows a sense of maturity and responsibility that prevents him from acting under emotional impulses. He is very protective of his classmates, especially if they are hurt or injured. He is also quite thick-skinned, as he said he is used to being feared due to his appearance. Shouji''s Quirk grants him a set of tentacles alongside his arms. He can transform the tips of these tentacles to replicate other parts of his body (ex: mouth, ears, eyes). The duplicated body parts are more efficient than the originals; as a result, Mezo is able to hear better, see-through more angles at a time, and they grant him much higher degrees of strength. He uses these arms to talk most of the time through duplicate mouths, rather than his actual mouth.', '/uploads/images/c_89899.png'),
(161, 'Tooru Hagakure', '葉隠透', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', '__Height:__ 152 cm (5''0") __Quirk:__ Invisibility Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Tooru is a bubbly, cheery, and easygoing girl who does most things with an upbeat attitude. She is very socially eager and likes shopping, and her room suggests that she likes plushies and other cute things. Tooru''s Quirk is that her body is completely invisible. In addition to the stealth capabilities granted to her by her invisible body, Tooru can refract light that passes through her, allowing her to intensify the light into a blinding flash. She has further refined this application of her Quirk, achieving the ability to manipulate and redirect light-based attacks, such as [Yuuga Aoyama](https://anilist.co/character/127042/Aoyama-Yuuga)''s Navel Laser.', '/uploads/images/c_89900.png'),
(161, 'Kouji Kouda', '口田甲司', '配角', 'Takuma Nagatsuka', '__Height:__ 186 cm (6''1") __Quirk:__ Anivoice Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Contrary to his strong and powerful appearance, Kouji is very timid and quiet. He rarely speaks and prefers using sign language to communicate with his classmates. He hates violence due to his kind-hearted nature. Kouji appears to greatly enjoy the company of animals, as his Quirk allows him to interact with animals in ways others cannot. He owns a small rabbit as a pet. Kouji''s Quirk "Anivoice (生き物ボイス, Ikimono Voice)" gives him the ability to command any creature in the animal kingdom by speaking to them. Whatever command he gives, the animal will carry it out. However, he cannot exert control if they cannot hear his command. The target must also be a real animal and not merely animal-like. Kouji can also exchange information with the animals to find the locations of various people and potential enemies faster. Kouji has been shown to use the Quirk effectively with flocks of birds to create a smokescreen of animals and to attack an opponent, along with his use of insects to distract and attack his opponents. He has now also overcome his fear of bugs, so he often uses bugs to swarm opponents with numbers.', '/uploads/images/c_89901.png'),
(161, 'Rikidou Satou', '砂藤力道', '配角', 'Tooru Nara', '__Height:__ 185 cm (6''1") __Quirk:__ Sugar Rush Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Rikidou is interested in sweets and baking, a valuable skill due to his Quirk. He is surprisingly talented at making sweets. Rikidou''s Quirk Sugar Rush allows him to increase his strength five-fold for three minutes. To activate his Quirk, he needs to consume 10 grams of sugar. When converting sugar into strength, his cognitive functions gradually drop, making him sleepy afterward. For every additional 10 grams of sugar he ingests, he extends the time of increased strength by another three minutes.', '/uploads/images/c_89902.png'),
(161, 'Yuu Takeyama', '岳山優', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', '__Height:__ 162 cm (5''4") (Normal form); 2062cm (67''8") (Transformed) __Quirk:__ Gigantification __Occupation:__ Pro Hero Pro Hero. Her Quirk allows her to grow to a gigantic size. She cannot variate between her base-height and the gigantified height achieved via her Quirk, making her only able to be either her normal height of 162cm (5 feet 4 inches) or her enlarged height of 2,062cm (67 feet 8 inches) tall.', '/uploads/images/c_121529.png'),
(161, 'Sirius', 'シリウス', '配角', 'Ami Koshimizu', 'Sirius is a pro hero and sidekick of Selkie.', '/uploads/images/c_122560.jpg'),
(161, 'Mirio Togata', '通形ミリオ', '配角', 'Tarusuke Shingaki', '__Height:__ 181 cm (5''11") __Occupation:__ Student __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Permeation He is third-year student at U.A. High School and is part of The Big 3 _(the strongest three hero students in all of Japan)_. Before [Izuku Midoriya](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku), Mirio was the top candidate for [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224/Yagi-Toshinori)''s successor and inheritor of One For All. His Quirk, Permeation, gives him the ability to become intangible, letting him pass through any tangible matter; he can phase through walls and/or the ground, as well as let enemy attacks pass through him harmlessly.', '/uploads/images/c_123527.png'),
(161, 'Neito Monoma', '物間寧人', '配角', 'Kouhei Amasaki', '__Height:__ 170cm __Quirk:__ Copy Student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School. Neito has a rather complex personality since it differs depending on who he is addressing; he is particularly mocking, loud, and sarcastic with Class 1-A, but outside of these interactions, he is a calm, kind, and intelligent person. He envies Class 1-A with a passion over how they became the center of attention among U.A.''s first years because of the U.S.J. Incident. Truthfully, he only wants his class to stand out as they do, and he vents this feeling by throwing countless taunts towards his rivals, gloating over Class 1-B''s successes and disparaging 1-A for their failures. Neito''s Quirk is Copy, which allows him to duplicate and use another person''s Quirk after coming into physical contact with the user. He can hold four Quirks simultaneously and maintain copied powers for ten minutes. After the time limit runs out, he loses the copied Quirk until he once again touches the original user.', '/uploads/images/c_125450.png'),
(161, 'Himiko Toga', '渡我被身子', '配角', 'Misato Fukuen', '__Height:__ 157 cm __Quirk:__ Transform Himiko Toga is a villain affiliated with the League of Villains and part of its Vanguard Action Squad. She originally joined the group as a means to get closer to [Stain](https://anilist.co/character/126067). Himiko is a very cheerful girl, to the point of smiling even after having presumably killed someone, displaying apparent sadistic tendencies. She has a very twisted perception of love and friendship Himiko''s Quirk Transform grants her the ability to transform into a physical lookalike of another individual, as well as copy their voice. She can only transform into people whose blood she has ingested. The more blood she drinks, the longer she has access to that person''s form. For example, 1 cup of blood allows her to transform for a total of 18 hours. She can even switch between the appearances of multiple people if she drinks the blood of more than one person.', '/uploads/images/c_125619.png'),
(161, 'Tamaki Amajiki', '天喰環', '配角', 'Yuuto Uemura', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''10") __Quirk:__ Manifest Third-year student in Class 3-A at U.A. High School and part of The Big 3 (the strongest three hero students in all of Japan). Tamaki is extremely shy, aloof, depressed, "intimidating", and introverted, especially around big audiences. He gets nervous very easily when talking to other people. If his anxiety gets the best of him, Tamaki will often face away and lean into a wall to hide his face from others. While his physical abilities and Quirk are outstanding, Tamaki is socially awkward and lacks confidence in his powers. Despite his timid heart, Tamaki can show flashes of bravery. Even though he''s always been a shy and reserved boy, Tamaki was able to hone his skills and climb the ranks into one of U.A.''s Big 3. [Mirio Togata](https://anilist.co/character/123527/Togata-Mirio) is a big inspiration for Tamaki. Tamaki''s Quirk Manifest grants him the ability to manifest the physical characteristics of anything he''s eaten; for example, if he eats takoyaki, he can transform his fingers into octopus tentacles. Additionally, anything Tamaki manifests is significantly stronger than normal. The more of a substance Tamaki eats, the stronger his manifestation will be. He can only manifest the traits of substances still in his system and loses access to those traits once the substance is fully digested. He must resupply his Quirk daily and decide what foods to eat beforehand.', '/uploads/images/c_125934.png'),
(161, 'All For One', 'オール・フォー・ワン', '配角', 'Akio Ootsuka', '__Quirk:__ All For One __Occupation:__ Villain __Fighting Style:__ Close Range and Long Range All For One is the true leader and benefactor of the League of Villains. Once Japan''s most powerful villain and All Might''s arch-nemesis, his true motives are unclear and his true identity unknown. His current goal is to raise Shigaraki to become his eventual successor.', '/uploads/images/c_125956.jpg'),
(161, 'Shuuichi Iguchi', '伊口秀一', '配角', 'Ryou Iwasaki', '__Height:__ 174 cm __Occupation:__ Villain __Affiliation:__ League of Villains (formerly), Paranormal Liberation Front (Lieutenant of Brown Regiment) __Quirk:__ Gecko Shuuichi is a villain affiliated with the League of Villains and part of its Vanguard Action Squad. He is completely obsessed with the ways of [Stain](https://anilist.co/character/126067) to the point where he copies his clothing and weaponry style, aiming to follow the same ideals as him and make his dreams come true.', '/uploads/images/c_126005.png'),
(161, 'Itsuka Kendou', '拳藤一佳', '配角', 'Saki Ogasawara', '__Height:__ 166 cm (5''5") __Quirk:__ Big Fist Class representative of Class 1-B at U.A. High School, Itsuka is a spirited girl who is thoughtful of others. She does not hesitate to criticize even her classmates if she feels what they are doing is not correct. Due to Itsuka''s cheerful personality, she can bring all of Class 1-B together, thus making her the "big sister" of Class 1-B. Itsuka''s Quirk Big Fist grants her the ability to enlarge both of her hands to a gigantic size. With the increased size comes enhanced striking power and gripping capabilities.', '/uploads/images/c_126064.png'),
(161, 'Eri', '壊理', '配角', 'Seiran Kobayashi', '__Height:__ 110 cm __Quirk:__ Rewind Eri is a child with bandages all over her body. She wears a white short sleeve dress and has a small horn on the right side of her forehead and has white, long, choppy, unkempt hair. She also has red eyes. Under her bandages, her arms are shown to have numerous scars. ~!Eri is the key source to [Kai Chisaki''s](https://anilist.co/character/126357/Kai-Chisaki) operation to manufacture a Quirk-Destroying Drug. She is the granddaughter of the Eight Precepts of Death''s boss!~', '/uploads/images/c_126093.jpg'),
(161, 'Enji Todoroki', '轟炎司', '配角', 'Tetsu Inada', '__Height:__ 195 cm (6'' 4¾") __Occupation:__ Pro Hero __Quirk:__ Hellflame Endeavor is a tall man with a muscular physique. He has short and spiky, red hair with bright blue eyes. His beard and mustache appear to be made of fire, but when he turns off his flames on his face voluntarily, his stubble shows. ~!His desire to surpass the number one hero has driven him in family matters. Enji put [Shouto](https://anilist.co/character/89220/Todoroki-Shouto) through ruthless "training" which caused Shouto a severe degree of physical and emotional pain. Shouto, harboring a bitter hatred towards his father on account of this, refuses to use his fire powers in battles until [Izuku Midoriya](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku) reminded him of his mother''s encouragement. Later, Enji understood his mistakes and told his son he would try to be a better hero and father. He hopes for Shouto and the rest his family to forgive him in the future.!~ ~!He''s the former No.2 Hero, but later becomes the new No.1 Hero after [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224/Yagi-Toshinori) loses his Quirk!~', '/uploads/images/c_126158.png'),
(161, 'Nana Shimura', '志村菜奈', '配角', 'Mie Sonozaki', 'Shimura Nana was the seventh user of the One For All Quirk, [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224)''s mentor, and a close friend of [Gran Torino](https://anilist.co/character/127428). ~!It was revealed that she is the grandmother of [Shigaraki](https://anilist.co/character/89226)!~', '/uploads/images/c_126319.png'),
(161, 'Dabi', '荼毘', '配角', 'Hiro Shimono', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9¼") __Quirk:__ Blueflame Dabi is a villain affiliated with the League of Villains and a member of the organization''s Vanguard Action Squad. Dabi is a stoic, aloof, confident, and focused individual who rarely shows emotion. While rather crude and violent, he''s also shown to be quite cautious. Overall, Dabi is a highly enigmatic individual who trusts no one, preferring to do things alone and in his way. He also gives off the impression of knowing more about certain people than he lets on. Dabi''s Quirk grants him the ability to generate and control highly destructive blue flames from his body. He has very well-developed control of his flames and can project them far from himself and in large amounts. However, Dabi''s body has a low tolerance for his flame, and he will get burned if he uses them for prolonged periods. ~!It is later revealed that Dabi is Touya Todoroki (轟燈矢), the eldest son of the Pro Hero [Endeavor](https://anilist.co/character/126158/Todoroki-Enji) and his wife [Rei](https://anilist.co/character/150628/Todoroki-Rei), and the older brother to [Shouto Todoroki](https://anilist.co/character/89220/Todoroki-Shouto). For a significant period of time, his whereabouts were unknown.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126378.png'),
(161, 'Nejire Hadou', '波動ねじれ', '配角', 'Kiyono Yasuno', '__Height:__ 164 cm (5''4") __Occupation:__ Student __Quirk:__ Wave Motion (ability to convert body''s vitality into energy that can discharge as blast waves) She is third-year student at U.A. High School and is part of The Big 3 _(the strongest three hero students in all of Japan)_. Nejire is very enthusiastic, affable and cheery, and is always seen moving. She shows great interest in people''s unique physical features and is easily distracted by them. She seems to like knowing more than others, but not in a proud way, as she just enjoys explaining things to people and sharing her knowledge. Despite her happy-go-lucky personality, Nejire is fierce in battle. When the situation calls for it, Nejire can be very calm and focused. Her curiosity never seems to extend to the enemy and she always maintains her focus on taking them down.', '/uploads/images/c_126843.png'),
(161, 'Yuuga Aoyama', '青山優雅', '配角', 'Kousuke Kuwano', '**Height:** 168 cm (5''6") **Quirk:** Navel Lazer Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Yuuga appears to be vain and prideful, thinking of himself as superior to the rest of his classmates, especially regarding his Quirk. He exhibits flamboyant mannerisms, is fond of posing, and likes to grab the attention of those around him despite frequently getting ignored by his peers. He also plays up his French heritage, occasionally implementing French words into his sentences. Yuuga''s Quirk allows him to shoot a powerful sparkling laser cannon from his navel. It is so powerful, it can blast through two meters of solid concrete. If he fires the laser for more than 1 second at a time, he will suffer intestinal distress.', '/uploads/images/c_127042.png'),
(161, 'Tetsutetsu Tetsutetsu', '鉄哲徹鐵', '配角', 'Kouji Okino', '__Height:__ 174cm (5''9") __Quirk:__ Steel Student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School. Tetsutetsu is defined by his very hotheaded and outspoken personality. He is confident, stubborn, and straightforward in his motivations and actions. He tends to be very vocal about his intentions and has a one-track mind, often looking for the simplest solution to problems to solve them most directly. Tetsutetsu''s direct personality shows through his tenacious and upfront fighting style during battles. Tetsutetsu''s Quirk allows him to turn his body into steel. This power grants Tetsutetsu both augmented defensive abilities to withstand attacks and the increased strength of his unarmed physical attacks.', '/uploads/images/c_127043.png'),
(161, 'Hizashi Yamada', '山田ひざし', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', '__Height:__ 185cm (6''1") __Quirk:__ Voice Pro Hero. He also works as an English teacher at U.A. High School and as a radio talk show host. Yamada maintains the eccentric persona of a radio host. He often poses when he talks and maintains a certain level of excitement or volume, regardless of the situation. Though he tends to be a jovial individual, Hizashi is capable of great rage when it comes to his friends and colleagues. Yamada''s Quirk "Voice" allows him to increase the volume of his voice, giving him an ability that is similar to a sonic scream. The sound from his Quirk is strong enough to cause people''s ears to bleed from far away. The only known weakness of this Quirk is that the loud sounds do not travel well underground, making this Quirk ineffective against anything that is underground or separated from him by layers of earth.', '/uploads/images/c_127425.png'),
(161, 'Ibara Shiozaki', '塩崎茨', '配角', 'Miho Masaka', '__Height:__ 167cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Vine Student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School. Ibara is a very modest and courteous person. Although graceful and soft-spoken, she is not afraid to make her pure intentions known. She seems highly religious due to her talking about heaven and divine beings in passing on multiple occasions, and her ultimate moves having somewhat religious names such as "Faith''s Shield" and "Crucifixion". Ibara''s Quirk "Vine (ツル, Tsuru) gives her hair-like vines that grow on her head. She can lengthen and manipulate the vines, allowing her to attack, defend and grapple. She also can detach them at will. The vines will grow back, provided her head receives proper sunlight and water. (Source: MyHero Academia Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_127426.png'),
(161, 'Nemuri Kayama', '香山睡', '配角', 'Akeno Watanabe', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") __Quirk:__ Somnambulist Pro Hero. She also works as a Modern Hero Art History teacher at U.A. High School. Nemuri is a very playful and flirtatious person with an unpredictably serious and temperamental side to her. She gets angry whenever someone interrupts her or insults her. She is especially sensitive about her age. Despite her flirtatious personality, Nemuri was intelligent, perceptive, and articulate. While she comes off as a hero who enjoys her fame derived from her beauty and sex appeal, Nemuri has demonstrated true heroism and bravery, willing to fight on the front lines and put her life at risk for others. Nemuri''s Quirk "Somnambulist" allows her to put nearby people to sleep by exuding a sleep-inducing aroma from her body. Her Quirk works better on males than females.', '/uploads/images/c_127427.png'),
(161, 'Sorahiko Torino', '酉野空彦', '配角', 'Kenichi Ogata', '__Height:__ 128 cm (4''2") __Affiliation:__ Yuuei (Retired) __Quirk:__ Jet A retired hero who is one of All Might''s colleagues and his former homeroom teacher. He was the one who taught All Might to control One For All during the his early days, and his training was so intense that All Might fears him to the point he subconsciously tried to forget about him until Grantorino sent his recommendation for Izuku to help him improve One For All, becoming his work place mentor. His Quirk is "Jet," allowing him to take in air through the sole of his foot to allow him to jump higher. (Source: Wikipedia)', '/uploads/images/c_127428.jpg'),
(161, 'Keigo Takami', '鷹見啓悟', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5'' 7¾") __Occupation:__ Pro Hero (No.3 - former, No.2 - current) __Quirk:__ Fierce Wings __Affiliation:__ Hero Public Safety Commission, ~!Paranormal Liberation Front (as a spy)!~ Hawks is carefree, jovial, and dislikes formalities, often acting in a spontaneous and unpredictable way while being cocky and taunting. He believes that popular approval is the most important metric a Pro Hero should be judged for, and does not appear to take the official rankings seriously, showing a preference for the lower ranks as it would allow him to act more freely and avoid the burdens of being a top hero. He states his wish to patrol in a leisurely fashion and "take it easy". It is hinted that Hawks was a fan of [Endeavor](https://anilist.co/character/126158/Todoroki-Enji) from an early age, as depicted by the drawing of him as a child holding an Endeavor figurine.', '/uploads/images/c_128299.png'),
(161, 'Tensei Iida', '飯田天睛', '配角', 'Masamichi Kitada', '__Quirk:__ Engine Tensei Iida, also known as Turbo Hero "Ingenium", is the older brother of Tenya Iida and a former Pro Hero. Outside of his hero armor Tensei looks much like his younger brother Tenya, with square features and short black spiked hair. A differing feature is that he possesses arrow-shaped eyebrows and has a slightly longer face. Similar to his brother, he has engine exhausts protruding from his body, but out of the ends of his elbows instead of his calves. **Also in Illegals:** Tensei meets with Koichi during an early morning run. Tensei is impressed with Koichi''s Quirk and offers him a place in his agency, even expressing a desire for a sidekick with a fast mobility quirk. Later, when Tensei discovers Koichi has been working as a vigilante hero, he withdraws his offer to Koichi, but only because he believes him to be already in the right place.', '/uploads/images/c_129757.png'),
(161, 'Natsuo Todoroki', '轟夏雄', '配角', 'Yuuki Shin', '__Height:__ 181 cm Natsuo Todoroki is a college student. He is the son of [Enji](https://anilist.co/character/126158/Todoroki-Enji) and [Rei Todoroki](https://anilist.co/character/150628/Todoroki-Rei), the younger brother of Toya and [Fuyumi](https://anilist.co/character/150627/Todoroki-Fuyumi), and the older brother of [Shoto](https://anilist.co/character/89220/Todoroki-Shouto). Natsuo is a young man of average height, sporting white spiky hair with two small pieces of hair hanging down by his forehead. He greatly resembles his father at his age. Natsuo seems to be a care-free individual, as seen in his interactions with him and his family. However, he can be serious, and cares deeply for his family, except his father who he resents for his abusive treatment to his family. He does not feel forgiving to his father, blaming him for his mother Rei''s hospitalization and Shoto''s suffering.', '/uploads/images/c_129759.png'),
(161, 'Naomasa Tsukauchi', '塚内直正', '配角', '', 'Naomasa Tsukauchi is a police detective in the Police Force. Naomasa is a tall man with short black hair and black eyes. As a member of the police force, he is normally seen in his uniform. He wears a signature tan overcoat and a matching hat. He also sports a black suit underneath with matching slacks and dress shoes. Detective Tsukauchi is an earnest, hardworking individual who has earned the right to be a close friend of All Might. Enough so, that he was even entrusted with the truth about One For All and the latter''s true form. He appears to have a close relationship with All Might, as he even leaked sensitive information to the hero just because he felt it was the right thing to do.', '/uploads/images/c_129762.png'),
(161, 'Inko Midoriya', '绿谷引子', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3'''') Izuku Midoriya''s mother. Her quirk allows her to pull small objects towards her.', '/uploads/images/c_136897.png'),
(161, 'Kurogiri', '黒霧', '配角', 'Takahiro Fujiwara', '__Affiliation:__ League of Villains __Quirk:__ Warp Gate Kurogiri has a level-headed personality, which often serves to ground Tomura Shigaraki''s immaturity. He is intensely loyal to both All For One and Tomura. He is very polite and well-spoken, even to enemies. ~! Kurogiri is actually an intelligent Nomu made from the corpse of Eraserhead and President Mics high school friend Oboro Shirakumo made to serve Tomura Shigaraki. Although he remains unaware of his previous identity after Eraserheads efforts to talk to him it’s shown that a small part of Oboro is still in Kurogiri!~', '/uploads/images/c_137506.jpg'),
(161, 'Atsuhiro  Sako', 'コンプレス', '配角', 'Tsuguo Mogami', 'Mr. Compress''s Quirk allows him to "compress" anything in a spherical area into a small marble without actually damaging it. The weight of the target is reduced alongside them, making them very easy to carry. If used on a person, it effectively entraps them, terminating the fight instantly and allowing Mr. Compress to abduct them without difficulty. The Quirk can also be used on select body parts, maiming the target.', '/uploads/images/c_141748.png'),
(161, 'Giran', '義爛', '配角', 'Seirou Ogino', 'Giran is a B-rank villain and broker in affiliation with the League of Villains, working to scout new recruits for their organization', '/uploads/images/c_141749.jpg'),
(161, 'Kaoruko Awata', '泡田薫子', '配角', 'Rie Murakawa', 'Quirk: Bubble (バブル Baburu) With this Quirk, Kaoruko can make bubbles filled with an aroma that she had smelled at least once before. She can make both sweet-smelling bubbles and foul-smelling ones. When she’s too nervous, she produces very unpleasant-smelling bubbles that are self-destructing She is a dedicated hero as well as Sir Nighteyes sidekick', '/uploads/images/c_141893.png'),
(161, 'Togaru Kamakiri', '鎌切尖', '配角', 'Kiyotaka Furushima', '__Height:__ 158 cm (6''2") __Quirk:__ Razor Sharp __Affiliation:__ Yuuei __Occupation:__ Student Togaru Kamakiri is a student in Class 1-B at U.A.', '/uploads/images/c_143274.png'),
(161, 'Tsunagu Hakamada', '袴田維', '配角', 'Hikaru Midorikawa', '__Height:__ 190cm (6''3") __Quirk:__ Fiber Master Pro Hero, ranked in the top 4. He is the recipient of the "Best Jeanist" award for eight consecutive years. Tsunagu is an elegant man with flamboyant tendencies. He believes very strongly that people with influence must maintain a positive appearance both physically and socially. Tsunagu often uses metaphors referencing jeans, denim, and various other sewing and fabric-based phrases, often inspiring his recruits with speeches, telling them to keep their life straight like their jeans. Tsunagu takes the role of being a hero very seriously. He is selfless, brave, and charismatic, and he aims to spread a sense of a peace to all people, no matter how dire the situation. Tsunagu''s Quirk "Fiber Master (ファイバーマスター)" allows him to freely manipulate the threads in any nearby piece of fabric. He has power over all types of cloth, but his Quirk works best with denim and is less effective on sweats. Fiber Master also works on other types of fiber not related to fabric, such as carbon fibers. He primarily uses this power to restrain his targets, either by using their own clothing against them, or simply unravels portions of his own clothing into strings.', '/uploads/images/c_143536.png'),
(161, 'Nezu', '根津', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Takato', '__Height:__ 85 cm __Quirk:__ High Spec Nezu, also known as Mr. Principal is a Pro Hero and the principal of U.A. High School. He is an extremely rare case of an animal who manifested a Quirk. He can be very long-winded at times when explaining or educating.', '/uploads/images/c_143539.png'),
(161, 'Gigantomachia', 'ギガントマキア', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Mamiya', 'Gigantomachia is a villain associated with the League of Villains.[1] He is one of All For One''s faithful servants and his former bodyguard, cultivated to be of use to Tomura Shigaraki if anything were to happen to him.', '/uploads/images/c_143540.png'),
(161, 'Juuzou Moashi', '百足従造', '配角', 'Kenta Ookuma', '__Quirk:__ Centipede: Juuzou''s Quirk grants him long, centipede-like limbs, which he can use to attack or restrain enemies from afar. Moashi is a sidekick affiliated with [Sir Nighteye](https://anilist.co/character/129761/)''s Hero Office. Juuzou is a gentleman and a very well mannered person', '/uploads/images/c_145290.png'),
(161, 'Ryuuko Tatsuma', '竜間龍子', '配角', '', 'When she activates her Quirk, her body transforms into that of a large, winged dragon with pale gray scales, although she still has the same skin tone, hair and eyes, and her hero costume remains visible bar her boots.', '/uploads/images/c_145291.jpg'),
(161, 'Pony  Tsunotori', '角取ポニー', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', '__Quirk:__ Horn Cannon Pony is a timid girl. As a foreigner, she does not have much knowledge of the language in Japan. She is shown to be rather naive and innocent in personality, learning nasty phrases from Neito Monoma without realizing what those words mean, as shown when Neito tells Pony unkind phrases to tell Class 1-A. Pony is a thoughtful and diligent person. She is the one who made her team not lose against Class 1-A because of her strategy and perseverance. She is highly observant and seems to be a careful person. Despite this, she made some unkind comments towards Mezo Shoji in their battle, calling him an "octopus" and saying she doesn''t like looking at him. Pony''s Quirk allows her to send her horns flying and remotely control them at will. She is able to control up to four horns that are sent flying. She has also been shown to be able to balance on them as they carry her around, much like Hawks'' wings. When Pony gets angry, she starts speaking in her native language: English.', '/uploads/images/c_145387.png'),
(161, 'Daruma Ujiko', '氏子達磨', '配角', 'Minoru Inaba', 'Daruma Ujiko is the pseudonym of a villain affiliated with the League of Villains, later the Paranormal Liberation Front. He is a faithful servant of All For One and later Tomura Shigaraki as well.', '/uploads/images/c_148747.jpg'),
(161, 'Oboro Shirakumo', '白雲朧', '配角', 'Kenshou Ono', 'Oboro was a man of average stature with light, wavy hair that was swept back to flow upwards above his head, two shorter, ear-length tufts left hanging downwards to frame his face. He usually wore an expression of excitement, possessing a large, teeth-bearing grin and semicircular, inward-tilting eyes that were often squeezed shut. Quirk: **Cloud** (he is capable of moving through the air by creating clouds and riding on them.)', '/uploads/images/c_148982.png'),
(161, 'Rumi Usagiyama', '兎山ルミ', '配角', 'Sayaka Kinoshita', 'Rumi is the No. 5 Pro Hero. She has an athletic build with muscular arms and legs. She has dark skin, red eyes which are tilted slightly inwards, and straight white hair reaching down past her waist. On her head, she has a pair of long white rabbit ears pointing upwards with a slight crook. Along with these, she also has a round white tail, which gives her overall design a definite resemblance to an albino rabbit. Her hero costume consists of a sleeveless white leotard with dark purple trim around her shoulders and waist, a wide, yellow crescent moon design over her chest, and two thick metal plates on her midriff. She wears purple thigh-high boots to compliment her leotard, with more plating around the heel and toe areas, making her feet look like those of a rabbit. She also has white gloves on her hands, with long cuffs, sporting small triangular protrusions around the edges.', '/uploads/images/c_148985.png'),
(161, 'Setsuna Tokage', '取蔭切奈', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', 'Setsuna Tokage is a student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School, and is one of four students admitted through recommendations; one being her fellow 1-B classmate Juzo Honenuki, as well as rival Class 1-A students Shoto Todoroki and Momo Yaoyorozu.', '/uploads/images/c_149179.png'),
(161, 'Kinoko  Komori', '小森希乃子', '配角', 'Kei Shindou', 'Kinoko Komori is a student in Class 1-B, and is training to be a Pro Hero. Her quirk, Mushroom, allows her to spread spores that sprout mushrooms wherever they land, including inside of people''s bodies.', '/uploads/images/c_149180.png'),
(161, 'Yui Kodai', '小大唯', '配角', 'Yurianne Eve', 'Yui Kodai is a student in Class 1-B of U.A. High School. She is a quiet girl, but nevertheless cares about her fellow classmates.', '/uploads/images/c_149182.png'),
(161, 'Juzo Honenuki', '骨抜柔造', '配角', 'Masamichi Kitada', '__Height:__ 174 cm (5''8½") __Affiliation:__ U.A High __Quirk:__ Softening Juzo Honenuki is a student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School, and is one of four students admitted through recommendations; one being his fellow 1-B classmate [Setsuna Tokage](https://anilist.co/character/149179/Tokage-Setsuna), the others being rival 1-A students [Shoto Todoroki](https://anilist.co/character/89220/Todoroki-Shouto) and [Momo Yaoyorozu](https://anilist.co/character/89241/Yaoyorozu-Momo). Juzo''s Quirk allows him to soften any non-living thing he touches. For example, he can soften the ground to make it similar to quicksand, hindering movements and mobility. If Juzo makes contact again, he can undo the effect. He is also capable of swimming through softened material.', '/uploads/images/c_149183.png'),
(161, 'Rikiya Yotsubashi', '四橋力也', '配角', 'Hiroaki Hirata', 'Rikiya, better known by his code name Re-Destro, is the president and CEO of the Detnerat Company, the son of the infamous villain Destro (for which he named his own code name after), as well as the secret leader of the villainous Meta Liberation Army, an organization that follows the philosophy that the usage of Quirks is a basic human right, and seeks to liberate society and allow for the free use of Quirks.', '/uploads/images/c_149184.png'),
(161, 'Tatsuyuki Tokoname', '常滑達行', '配角', 'Takumu Miyazono', 'A Pro Hero. ~!He is also secretly a member of the villainous Meta Liberation Army.!~', '/uploads/images/c_149185.png'),
(161, 'Kuugo Sakamata', '逆俣空悟', '配角', 'Shuuhei Matsuda', 'Gang Orca is the current No. 11 Pro Hero, dropping from his previous No. 10 place. He took part in the assault on All For One and the League of Villains at Kamino Ward, and later served as a makeshift villain during the Provisional Hero License Exam.', '/uploads/images/c_149186.png'),
(161, 'Ken Ishiyama', '石山堅', '配角', 'Kenta Ookuma', 'Cementoss is a Pro Hero as well as a teacher at U.A. High School. During the U.A. Sports Festival, he acted as the proctor for the 1-on-1 fights in case things got out of hand. He also faced off against Eijiro Kirishima and Rikido Sato in their Final Exam.', '/uploads/images/c_149188.jpg'),
(161, 'Fuyumi Todoroki', '轟冬美', '配角', 'Kei Shindou', 'The only daughter of Eiji and Rei. Fuyumi is the younger sister of Touya and the older sister of Natsuo and Shouto. Fuyumi is a hard working girl, often making meals for the family and works as a teacher at an unnamed school. Unlike her family members, she doesn''t resent her father and just wishes they could all be a happy family, though she realizes such a thing is unlikely. Upon hearing Shouto gains friends, however, Fuyumi gets quite excited over it and is happy for him. In the past, Fuyumi took care of Shouto after their mother went to a hospital and never came back. To this day, her wish that she could have done something for Shouto still lingers within her.', '/uploads/images/c_150627.png'),
(161, 'Ectoplasm', 'エクトプラズム', '配角', 'Masakazu Nishida', '__Height:__ 180 cm (5'' 11") __Affiliation:__ Yuuei __Quirk:__ Clones Ectoplasm has the ability to produce ectoplasm from his mouth and transform it into clones of himself. He can create up to thirty clones at once, and push his limit to thirty-six if he''s feeling good. He can also produce a giant clone of himself, although this sacrifices his ability to produce normal-sized ones for the time being. His clones can be defeated with a strong blow, but otherwise, only Ectoplasm can dispel them.', '/uploads/images/c_150853.jpg'),
(161, 'Chiyo  Shuuzenji', '修善寺治与', '配角', 'Etsuko Kozakura', '__Quirk:__ Heal __Occupation:__ Pro Hero, Nurse Chiyo has a very kind and compassionate personality, where she treats everyone kindly, though she does have a strict and reproaching attitude towards those that have done something foolish. She''s mostly like this with All Might for not teaching Izuku how to use his Quirk properly or with Izuku for using his Quirk recklessly.', '/uploads/images/c_157655.jpg'),
(161, 'Sajin Higawara', '日河原砂塵', '配角', '', '__Quirk:__ SandStorm Sajin Higawara also known as Sand Hero: Snatch was a Pro Hero and a bodyguard for the Police Force.', '/uploads/images/c_158616.jpg'),
(161, 'Chitose Kizuki', '気月置歳', '配角', 'Takako Honda', 'Chitose Kizuki, also known as Curious, is a journalist and a member of the Meta Liberation Army.', '/uploads/images/c_160440.png'),
(161, 'Geten', '外典', '配角', 'Seiichirou Yamashita', 'Geten is a loyal warrior of the Liberation Army and a devout believer in its principles. He feels greatly indebted and thankful to Re-Destro for granting him more power and desires to create a world where the strongest superpowers stand at the top of the hierarchy.', '/uploads/images/c_160441.jpg'),
(161, 'Moe Kamiji', '上路萌', '配角', 'Misato Kawauchi', 'Moe Kamiji, also known as her hero name Burnin, is a pro hero and one of over 30 sidekicks working at the Endeavor Hero Agency.', '/uploads/images/c_160442.png'),
(161, 'Koku Hanabata', '花畑孔腔', '配角', 'Junji Majima', 'Koku Hanabata, also know as Trumpet, is a member of the Meta Liberation Army, a Paranormal Liberation Front lieutenant, and also the leader of the Hearts and Mind party.', '/uploads/images/c_160443.png'),
(161, 'Tomoyasu Chikazoku', '近属友保', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', 'Tomoyasu Chikazoku, also known as Skeptic, is a member of the Meta Liberation Army.', '/uploads/images/c_160444.png'),
(161, 'Sen Kaibara', '回原旋', '配角', 'Tomoaki Maeno', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5''7½") __Quirk:__ Gyrate Kaibara Sen is a student from 1-B. His quirk "Gyrate" allows Kaibara to rotate any part of his body.', '/uploads/images/c_164355.png'),
(161, 'High End', 'ハイエンド', '配角', 'Tsuguo Mogami', '__Affiliation:__ League of Villains High End Nomu was an intelligent Nomu created and is shown to be obedient to its master. They were one of the main antagonists in the Pro Hero Arc.', '/uploads/images/c_165314.png'),
(161, 'Snipe', 'スナイプ', '配角', 'Tooru Nara', '__Quirk:__ Homing Snipe is a Pro Hero and a member of the teaching staff at U.A. High School. Snipe has the appearance of a stereotypical western cowboy Snipe''s Quirk allows him to lock on to any target he can see within six hundred meters and make any projectile he releases chase after said target', '/uploads/images/c_191596.jpg'),
(161, 'Sekijiro Kan', '管赤慈郎', '配角', 'Shuuhei Matsuda', 'Sekijiro Kan, also known by his hero name, Blood Hero: Vlad King, is a Pro Hero and the homeroom teacher of U.A. High School''s Class 1-B.', '/uploads/images/c_191598.jpg'),
(161, 'Shihai Kuroiro', '黒色支配', '配角', 'Kouhei Amasaki', 'Shihai is a sly, deceitful schemer, who prefers to catch people off guard. He appears to enjoy dark concepts and has a penchant for dramatic speech', '/uploads/images/c_208141.jpg'),
(161, 'Juurouta Shishida', '宍田獣郎太', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', 'Juurouta seems to be an intellectual as he uses a fairly verbose way of speaking and often addresses others by respectful titles such as ''sir'' and ''miss''. This is because he was brought up in a very well mannered and doting family. While transformed, however Juurouta is rather boisterous and energetic, which is likely a side effect of his Quirk.', '/uploads/images/c_208142.jpg'),
(161, 'Nirengeki Shoda', '庄田連撃', '配角', 'Kenta Ookuma', 'Nirengeki has a very humble attitude, as he will not take credit for something he does not feel he earned by his own strength.', '/uploads/images/c_208143.jpg'),
(161, 'Kousei Tsuburaba', '円場硬成', '配角', 'Jun Fukuyama', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Affiliation:__ U.A High __Quirk:__ Solid Air Kousei is a very enthusiastic and competitive individual who holds himself to a high standard as he makes an effort to avoid descending to the level of his rivals.', '/uploads/images/c_208145.png'),
(161, 'Manga Fukidashi', '吹出漫我', '配角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', 'Manga appears to be an expressive and dramatic person. He is a regular man with a white speech bubble head that can change shape and display his thoughts in written form.', '/uploads/images/c_208146.jpg'),
(161, 'Yosetsu Awase', '泡瀬洋雪', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'Although he is not as social as some others, Yosetsu is foul-mouthed and tense, except for serious or life-or-death situations, in which he becomes very easily startled and much more talkative, although he retains his harsh way of speech.', '/uploads/images/c_208147.jpg'),
(161, 'Hiryu Rin', '鱗飛竜', '配角', 'Kousuke Kuwano', '**Height:** 170 cm (5''7") __Quirk:__ Scales He is a Class 1-B student in U.A. High School, training to become a Pro Hero. It''s notable that Hiryu possesses a serious demeanor when it comes to playing out his abilities into action. He is rather diligent in terms of academic abilities and Quirk functions as well. Hiryu has shown to be a very competent combatant, with a great handle on the applications of his Quirk. Thanks to the versatile nature of his Scales Quirk, Hiryu excels in both close and long-range combat, effectively switching between hand-to-hand combat, and shooting off his scales when it’s most convenient to him.', '/uploads/images/c_208148.png'),
(161, 'Reiko Yanagi', '柳レイ子', '配角', 'Ayane Sakura', 'Reiko is a quiet and emotionless teenager who often shows an odd body posture.', '/uploads/images/c_208149.jpg'),
(161, 'Kojiro Bondo', '凡戸固次郎', '配角', 'Kouji Okino', 'An easy going guy and described as a gentle giant.', '/uploads/images/c_208150.jpg'),
(161, 'Selkie', 'セルキー', '配角', 'Tomokazu Seki', 'Can do pretty much everything a spotted seal can do. He can even make sonar-like sound and use the echo to determine his opponent''s position. He is also very strong even if he believes that he can make a very cute seal face (which most people think is not).', '/uploads/images/c_210090.jpg'),
(161, 'Yoichi Shigaraki', '死柄木与一', '配角', 'Souichirou Hoshi', 'All For One''s younger brother.', '/uploads/images/c_216391.jpg'),
(161, 'Daigorou Banjou', '万縄大悟郎', '配角', 'Hiroki Yasumoto', '__Occupation:__ Pro Hero __Quirk:__ Blackwhip; One For All (formerly) The 5th user of One For All whose natural Quirk was Blackwhip. His Quirk allowed him to create tendrils of black energy from his arms, excellent for grappling and increasing his mobility.', '/uploads/images/c_229296.jpg'),
(161, 'Flect Turn', 'フレクト・ターン', '配角', 'Kazuya Nakai', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_232024.png'),
(161, 'Aorio Kuraishisu', '暗指数煽雄', '配角', '', 'Aorio Kuraishisu is a Hero Expert.', '/uploads/images/c_242342.png'),
(161, 'Ending', 'エンディング', '配角', 'Kishou Taniyama', 'A villain who appears as an antagonist in the Endeavor Agency Arc. Seven years prior to the beginning of the story, Ending saw Endeavor capture a thief called Takami. Since then Ending was infatuated with Endeavor, desiring the latter to kill him.', '/uploads/images/c_242582.png'),
(161, 'Cider House Leader', 'サイダーハウスリーダー', '配角', '', 'The leader of a gang of pickpockets who operated mainly during the holiday season, having studied the patterns and routes of hero and civilian activity in a specific street for a whole month, with the intent of maximizing profits from their looted items while facing minimal resistance. He possesses a Quirk that allows him to control carbonated water. He also has connections with the black market, having acquired a pair of gauntlets provided by Detnerat that could convert his water blasts into gatling shots.', '/uploads/images/c_242725.png'),
(161, 'Hiroshi Tameda', '為田浩', '配角', 'Serina Machiyama', '__Height:__ 170cm Hiroshi Tameda also known as "Can''t You See?" kid, is a loyal fan of Endeavor.', '/uploads/images/c_242855.png'),
(161, 'Mawata Fuwa', '不和真綿', '配角', 'Arisa Sekine', 'Mawata Fuwa, is a student in Class 2-A at U.A. High School, training to become a Pro Hero.', '/uploads/images/c_244414.png'),
(161, 'Kotarou Shimura', '志村弧太朗', '配角', 'Yuuya Tajima', 'Kotarou Shimura was the father of [Tenko](https://anilist.co/character/89226/Tomura-Shigaraki) and [Hana Shimura](https://anilist.co/character/290001/Shimura-Hana) and the son of [Nana Shimura](https://anilist.co/character/126319/Nana-Shimura).', '/uploads/images/c_251812.png'),
(161, 'Onima', 'オニマー', '配角', 'Tooru Nara', 'One of the many sidekicks who work at Endeavor''s Agency.', '/uploads/images/c_279793.jpg'),
(161, 'Kidou', 'キドウ', '配角', 'Kiyotaka Furushima', '__Occupation:__ Pro Hero (Sidekick) __Affiliation:__ Endeavor Agency (Team Flaming Sidekickers) __Quirk:__ Traject One of many sidekicks who works at Endeavor''s Agency. His Quirk allows him to manipulate the trajectory of anything that passes through his bandages.', '/uploads/images/c_279795.jpg'),
(161, 'Crust', 'クラスト', '配角', '', '__Quirk:__ Shield __Occupation:__ Pro Hero (No.6) __Fighting Style:__ Close-ranged combat', '/uploads/images/c_289314.jpg'),
(161, 'Hana Shimura', '志村華', '配角', 'Chiyuki  Miura', 'Hana was the older sister of [Tenko Shimura](https://anilist.co/character/89226/Tomura-Shigaraki) and granddaughter of [Nana Shimura](https://anilist.co/character/126319/Nana-Shimura). ~!She was killed by her brother when his Quirk went out of control!~', '/uploads/images/c_290001.jpg'),
(161, 'Nao Shimura', '志村直', '配角', 'Atsuko Yuya', 'Nao was the wife of [Kotarou Shimura](https://anilist.co/character/251812/Kotarou-Shimura) and the mother of their two children, [Tenko](https://anilist.co/character/89226/Tomura-Shigaraki) and [Hana](https://anilist.co/character/290001/Hana-Shimura). ~!She died when her son''s Quirk went out of control.!~', '/uploads/images/c_290002.jpg'),
(162, 'Emilia', 'エミリア', '主角', 'Rie Takahashi', '**Height:** 164 cm (5''5") She is a silver-haired half-elf girl who is one of the candidates to become the next ruler in the royal election. [Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru) first meets her when her insignia is stolen by [Felt](https://anilist.co/character/88574/Felt) as she needs to possess it to be eligible to participate in the election. She introduces herself as Satella when she and Subaru met during the first timeline before introducing herself by her real name when she got her insignia back. Emilia is good natured and likes to take care of others, though she herself refuses to admit it, instead thinking of it as her own selfishness. She is indifferent to her own appearance, leaving [Puck](https://anilist.co/character/90187/Puck) to take care of her clothes and hair. Because her appearance is similar to the [Witch of Envy](https://anilist.co/character/127242/Satella), she has received unfair discrimination from others. She sometimes acts like a child and is unacquainted with the world as she used to live in the woods with other Elves, though despite this she still works hard to become a ruler.', '/uploads/images/c_88572.jpg'),
(162, 'Subaru Natsuki', 'ナツキ・スバル', '主角', 'Yuusuke Kobayashi', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") On the way home from the convenience store, he suddenly finds himself transported into another world. He has the ability that he calls "Return by Death" to go back in time when he dies. Despite being a hikikomori and gamer in his real world, Subaru does a bit of workout and seems to know basic hand-to-hand combat, making him not completely weak. While Subaru tends to not read the situation, he is loyal to those he holds dear, willing to help them, even if that means taking the thorny path. He has his resolve confirmed through the many situations and circumstances he faces in the fantasy world, originally having been one to always take the "easy" route. As a hikikomori, he is hopeful of the possibilities that being sucked into a new realm brings, but later realizes the realities of the predicament he is in. Ultimately, he resolves himself to be faithful and protective of the ones that he cares most about.', '/uploads/images/c_88573.png'),
(162, 'Rem', 'レム', '配角', 'Inori Minase', '__Height:__ 154 cm (5''1") Rem is one of the twin maids working for [Roswaal L Mathers](https://anilist.co/character/90182/Mathers-L-Roswaal). She has medium length sky blue hair that covers her right eye, large light blue eyes, and young features. She also has hair clips towards left side of her hair, flower-shaped ribbon on the same side of her hair, and a maid hairband. She looks nearly identical to her sister [Ram](https://anilist.co/character/88576) apart from her hair, eyes, and ribbon coloring. She usually wears a maid uniform, and since her chest is slightly larger than her sister''s, she secretly changes the measurements to hide it. Rem tends to speak in a superficially polite manner and sometimes acts without thinking. She holds both respect to the point of worship and guilt toward her sister for an incident in the past. Because of her respect and guilt toward her sister, she used to think of herself as inferior.', '/uploads/images/c_88575.png'),
(162, 'Ram', 'ラム', '配角', 'Rie Murakawa', '__Height:__ 154 cm (5’1”) Ram is one of the twin maids working for [Roswaal L Mathers](https://anilist.co/character/90182). She has medium length light pink hair that covers her left eye, large darkish pink eyes, and young features. She also has hair clips towards right side of her hair, flower-shaped ribbon on the same side of her hair, and a maid hairband. She looks nearly identical to her sister [Rem](https://anilist.co/character/88575/Rem) apart from her hair, eyes, and ribbon coloring. Ram is seemingly self-centered and does things at her own pace, however in actuality she maintains a distance from people to ascertain them. She believes that Roswaal is the greatest and no one else is as precious except for her sister Rem. She is slightly more outgoing in comparison to the generally taciturn Rem, who generally allows Ram to take the lead in their sisterly bond.', '/uploads/images/c_88576.png'),
(162, 'Petelgeuse Romanee-Conti', 'ペテルギウス・ロマネコンティ', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'Sin Archbishop of the Witch Cult, representing sloth. ~!He was later killed by [Natsuki Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru) with the help of [Julius Juukulius](https://anilist.co/character/90183/Euclius-Julius).!~ ~!A hundred years earlier, Petelgeuse was a moderate, upright and rational man. He was close friends with [Fortuna](https://anilist.co/character/183732/Fortuna) and [Emilia](https://anilist.co/character/88572/Emilia), enough to be described as being like a family. However, when [Regulus](https://anilist.co/character/174098/Corneas-Regulus) and [Pandora](https://anilist.co/character/137522/Pandora) attacked their village, he accidentally killed Fortuna through Pandora''s power, causing him to go mad.!~', '/uploads/images/c_90170.jpg'),
(162, 'Aldebaran', 'アルデバラン', '配角', 'Tomokazu Seki', '**Height:** 173 cm (5''8") Aldebaran, commonly known as Al, is [Priscilla Barielle](https://anilist.co/character/90186/Priscilla-Barielle)''s knight, though he claims to just be a subordinate. He has a frivolous personality and acts aloof, but shows insecurity regarding his disfigured face and wears a helmet to conceal it. Due to that, he is a man of both eccentric appearance and behavior. ~!Like Subaru, he is revealed to be from Japan and was summoned roughly 18 years before Subaru. Shortly after he was summoned, he lost his left arm in an unfortunate incident in the Empire of Vollachia. !~', '/uploads/images/c_90178.png'),
(162, 'Elsa Granhiert', 'エルザ・グランヒルテ', '配角', 'Mamiko Noto', 'An assassin-for-hire from the Northernmost nation, the Holy Kingdom of Gusteko, known as "The Bowel Hunter". Elsa wishes to make a trade for an insignia, as her client''s wishes. ~!Elsa Granhiert was an assassin working together with [Meili](https://anilist.co/character/175577) for an individual they refer to as "Mother" until her death.!~', '/uploads/images/c_90180.png'),
(162, 'Beatrice', 'ベアトリス', '配角', 'Satomi Arai', '__Height:__ 140 cm (4''7") __Age:__ ~!400+ (Actual)!~ The caretaker of the library in [Roswaal](https://anilist.co/character/90182)''s mansion. She has a distinct way of speaking, adding "I suppose" (かしら, kashira) and "in fact" (のよ, no yo) at the end of some of her sentences. ~!Around 400 years ago, Beatrice was created by [Echidna](https://anilist.co/character/129330). She helped her with her experiments, such as the Sanctuary Barrier, though she wasn''t told everything as she didn''t know that [Ryuuzu Meyer](https://anilist.co/character/174072) would be sealed in a crystal. Sometime later, Echidna ordered her to stand guard over the library while she waited for "that person," an order which she diligently followed.!~ ~!After numerous and painful attempts to convince her to leave the library [Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573) succeeded, and Beatrice became his contract spirit.!~', '/uploads/images/c_90181.png'),
(162, 'Roswaal Mathers', 'ロズワール・Ｌ・メイザース', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', '~!__Mental age:__ 400+!~ The lord of the Roswaal Mansion and a descendant of the original Roswaal. He comes across as an eccentric due to his flamboyant appearance and odd speaking style, the latter which he shares with his grandmother. However, he harbors a more calculating and reserved side with a sharp political mind and gaze that reads others quite well. ~!It is later revealed that he is in fact the original Roswaal, Roswaal A. Mathers, who has been possessing his descendants'' bodies to meet his teacher Echidna again at any cost, even if that means sacrificing himself or those close to him.!~', '/uploads/images/c_90182.png'),
(162, 'Puck', 'パック', '配角', 'Yumi Uchiyama', '__Height:__ 7 cm Puck is an Artificial Spirit that [Emilia](https://anilist.co/character/88572/Emilia) was formerly contracted with. He is the current Great Spirit of Fire. ~!He is currently known as the Beast of The End.!~ ~!Around 400 years ago, Puck was created by Echidna, though he had apparently left her by the time she moved into the Sanctuary. Seven years before the start of the election, Puck unfroze Emilia and began to act as her friend and mentor, and later on started to live at Roswaal''s mansion where he was reunited with Beatrice.!~ Puck can be described as cute or adorable, thus his skin being pink around his cheeks. His fur is mostly grey with silver in certain spots (i.e. tip of the tail). His eyebrows are pretty small and rhombus-shaped. He also has a gold earring on his left ear. Sometimes, he carries a purple bag. Puck is generally a nice spirit. He is very happy and stays at Emilia''s side to protect her, affectionately calling her "Lia". He occasionally goofs around and gets along especially well with [Beatrice](https://anilist.co/character/90181/Beatrice). ~!However, Puck''s demeanor greatly changes in loops where Emilia dies, showing a complete disregard for anyone except her, and was even willing to destroy the world because of the condition in their contract.!~', '/uploads/images/c_90187.jpg'),
(162, 'Otto Suwen', 'オットー・スーウェン', '主角', 'Kouhei Amasaki', 'Otto Suwen is a merchant appearing in Re:Zero. His remarkable misfortune always takes him to dangerous situations, from which he escapes thanks to his wit. Otto has gray hair that is mentioned to be as long as a gal game protagonist. He is said to be somewhat handsome if he has a serious expression. However, he is usually either retorting, shouting, or panicking, ruining his looks. He has a medium build, but has trained himself since he used to work as a merchant.', '/uploads/images/c_124110.jpg'),
(162, 'Satella', 'サテラ', '配角', '', 'Satella is one of the Witches of Sin, being the Witch of Envy. ~! Contrary to popular belief, Satella and the Witch of Envy are separate personalities. Both of them love Subaru, though the Witch of Envy is aggressive about it.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127242.png'),
(162, 'Echidna', 'エキドナ', '主角', 'Maaya Sakamoto', 'Echidna is one of the Witches of Sin, being the Witch of Greed. She has a strong thirst for knowledge along with a curiosity for the unknown, which defines her behavior. Echidna is described as black hearted, being unable to empathize with others and their feelings due to a lack of understanding. She will do anything to gain knowledge, be it deceit or employed sophistry.', '/uploads/images/c_129330.png'),
(162, 'Garfiel Tinsel', 'ガーフィール・ティンゼル', '主角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', 'Garfiel Tinsel is the former guardian of the Sanctuary and a member of the Emilia Camp. Introduced during Arc 4, he became one of the main supporting characters of the season. He''s a half-beast human and [Frederica Baumann''s](https://anilist.co/character/143378/Baumann-Frederica) half-brother. He can transform himself in a giant golden tiger that can deal powerful attacks but with a cost of losing his reason, so he uses this ability when he''s pushed to the limit. ~!Garfiel and Frederica lived together until she left when he was around 4 years old and he hadn''t seen her since until their reunion 10 years later during the Sanctuary incident. After seeing his mother''s "death" during the trial at a young age, he began to fear the outside world, causing him to try and protect the Sanctuary.!~', '/uploads/images/c_133847.png'),
(162, 'Minerva', 'ミネルヴァ', '配角', 'Mikako Komatsu', 'Minerva is one of the Witches of Sin, being the Witch of Wrath. Minerva dislikes conflict and wishes for all to be well. She also only cares about what''s directly in front of her, not worrying about things she cannot see. Minerva has some history with the elves as she cares deeply for Emilia, along with the other elves. ~!Minerva''s main ability is "Authority of Wrath". Unlike other authorities this ability is only a support skill. Minerva is able to heal others by attacking any part of their body with her own. The authority also gives her increased speed and strength. The drawback is that every time the authority is used it causes a calamity to happen in another part of the world. The calamity can range from many things such as an earthquake.!~', '/uploads/images/c_137521.png'),
(162, 'Pandora', 'パンドラ', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', 'Pandora is one of the Witches of Sin, being the Witch of Vanity. She acts dignified and graceful, but is quick to being a maniac when things don''t go her way. Pandora also has some ties with the Witch Cult. ~! Pandora''s main ability is "Authority of Vainglory". With this authority, Pandora is able to rewrite phenomenon to her liking as much she desires. Examples include being able to negate death, bury people into the ground instantaneously, teleporting individuals and warp and change individuals memories. The only draw back is her authority not being able to function on the demon beasts for full control, but she can still direct them to go to areas of her choosing. !~', '/uploads/images/c_137522.jpg'),
(162, 'Hector', 'ヘクトール', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', 'Hector is one of the Witches of Sin, being the Warlock of Melancholy. He has a negative personality, usually expressing his negativity in words. Hector has some form of relation with Echidna. He also wears a outfit similar to that of Roswaal''s ~! Hector''s main ability is "Authority of Melancholy". With this authority, Hector is able to create a force that is able to crush living beings and magic. While on paper this ability seems simple, it was enough to easily overpower the original Roswaal and cause severe injuries to him. Roswaal who is extremely powerful and one of the strongest mages of all time. !~', '/uploads/images/c_137525.png'),
(162, 'Petra Leyte', 'ペトラ・レイテ', '配角', 'Marika Kouno', 'Petra is a bright and kind girl from Irlam Village. She likes [Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru) very much after he saved her from the Wolgarm incident. ~!She became a maid at the Roswaal Mansion after Subaru came back from the witchcult incident. !~', '/uploads/images/c_141858.jpg'),
(162, 'Frederica Baumann', 'フレデリカ・バウマン', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', 'Frederica Baumann is a maid working for [Roswaal L. Mathers](https://anilist.co/character/90182/Mathers-Roswaal) and a member of the Emilia Camp. She quit her job as a maid a few months before [Subaru''s](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru) appearance, but returned after [Ram](https://anilist.co/character/88576/Ram) couldn''t manage the mansion ~!after [Rem](https://anilist.co/character/88575/Rem) had her name and memories eaten. !~ ~!She is the half-sister of [Garfiel Tinsel](https://anilist.co/character/133847/Tinsel-Garfiel).!~', '/uploads/images/c_143378.png'),
(162, 'Ryuuzu Meyer', 'リューズ・メイエル', '配角', 'Aimi Tanaka', 'Ryuuzu was a half-elf who lived in the Sanctuary during the era of the witches, 400 years ago. She was used by [Echidna](https://anilist.co/character/129330/Echidna) in order to activate the Sanctuary''s barrier. During Echidna''s immortality experiments, she created copies of Ryuzu and tasked them with protecting the Sanctuary.', '/uploads/images/c_174072.png'),
(162, 'Regulus Corneas', 'レグルス・コルニアス', '配角', 'Akira Ishida', 'Regulus is a young man of a medium height. He has gold eyes, white hair and a middle to skinny build. Regulus Is a part of the Sin Archbishops of the Witch Cult and represents greed. Regulus is known for being very talkative and calls himself unselfish, while in fact he is very prideful and likes to act above others and reference himself as above others.', '/uploads/images/c_174098.jpg'),
(162, 'Meili Portroute', 'メィリィ・ポートルート', '配角', 'Eri Suzuki', 'One of the children that lives in the village within [Roswaal](https://anilist.co/character/90182)''s region. She''s timid, though is friendly, such as when she introduces a small dog to [Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573). ~!Meili Portroute is a Demon Beast User.!~', '/uploads/images/c_175577.jpg'),
(162, 'Patrasche', 'パトラッシュ', '配角', 'Kouichi Souma', '[Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru)''s Earth Dragon that he officially received from [Crusch Karsten](https://anilist.co/character/90185/Karsten-Crusch) for his efforts in the Hakugei battle. Despite being of a species known for being feisty, Patrasche is extremely loyal to Subaru, as she is willing to put her life on the line for him.', '/uploads/images/c_181313.jpg'),
(162, 'Ricardo Welkin', 'リカード・ウェルキン', '配角', 'Kenji Nomura', 'Ricardo Welkin is one of Anastasia Hoshin''s followers and the captain of the mercenary group: Fang of Iron.', '/uploads/images/c_181314.png'),
(162, 'Naoko Natsuki', '菜月菜穂子', '配角', '', '[Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru)''s mother.', '/uploads/images/c_182087.jpg'),
(162, 'Fortuna', 'フォルトナ', '配角', 'Haruka Tomatsu', 'Fortuna was the guardian of Elior Forest and was Emilia''s aunt on her father''s side who took care of her instead of her mother. ~!During her time in Eliot Forest, she developed a close bond with Geuse and they both looked after Emilia. After Pandora and Regulus attacked, she fought alongside Geuse to stop them. However, Pandora tricked Geuse into thinking Fortuna was her and Geuse accidentally killed Fortuna, causing him to go insane.!~', '/uploads/images/c_183732.png'),
(162, 'Archi', 'アーチ', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', 'Archi was a disciple slated to be the next guardian of Elior Forest and a villager of the Elf Village. He was also family friend to Fortuna and Emilia. ~!After Pandora and Regulus attacked, Arch went to bring Emilia to safety however while doing so he was attacked by the Black Serpent, causing him to sacrifice himself so Emilia could escape!~', '/uploads/images/c_183733.jpg'),
(162, 'Reshia Tinzel', 'リーシア・ティンゼル', '配角', 'Aya Endou', 'Mother of [Garfiel](https://anilist.co/character/133847) and [Frederica](https://anilist.co/character/143378).', '/uploads/images/c_205112.png'),
(162, 'Framir Suewen', 'フラミル・スーウェン', '配角', 'Anna Yamaki', 'Framir Suewen is the mother of Otto, Oslo and Regin Suewen.', '/uploads/images/c_205555.jpg'),
(162, 'Mazeran Suewen', 'マゼラン・スーウェン', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Miura', 'Mazeran Suewen is the current head of the Suewen Trading Company based in Picoutatte and is the father of Otto, Oslo and Regin Suewen.', '/uploads/images/c_205556.jpg'),
(162, 'Oslo Suewen', 'オスロー・スーウェン', '配角', 'Yuuki Ishikari', 'Oslo Suewen is the representative of the Suewen Trading Company and Otto''s older brother.', '/uploads/images/c_205557.jpg'),
(162, 'Regin Suewen', 'レギン・スーウェン', '配角', '', 'Regin Suewen is a veterinarian operating at the Suwen Treatment Center in the town of Pappelt.', '/uploads/images/c_205558.jpg'),
(162, 'Annerose Miload', 'アンネローゼ・ミロード', '配角', 'Kana Ichinose', 'Annerose Miload is the heir of the House Miload which is a branch of House Mathers.', '/uploads/images/c_215025.png'),
(162, 'Clind', 'クリンド', '配角', '', 'Clind is a house steward serving the Miload Family. He is well-mannered, highly considerate of others, is extremely skilled as a servant, and tends to add idioms to the end of his sentences. ~!Being born before the Great Calamity, Clind was acquainted with the Witches and Warlocks of that era. At some point in time, he made a contract with a young Roswaal A Mathers which entailed Clind to protect Roswaal''s property by any and all means. According to Roswaal, he had compensated the contract with Clind by forming a united front and defeating Roswaal''s yet-unnamed nemesis. Clind has faithfully abided to his contract ever since, due to his ability to perceive souls and sensing Roswaal A Mathers'' soul in the bodies of his descendants. At some point in the future, Clind came in contact with an unspecified Witch Factor, which granted him an Authority he possesses to this day. Following the end of the Demi-Human War, Clind accompanied Roswaal J Mathers (Julia Mathers) to a pub where she met with the Sword Demon, Wilhelm van Astrea, where they discussed the threat of Stride Vollachia. During their talk, however, the trio were assaulted by a group of Shinobi, who were swiftly dispatched by Roswaal, Wilhelm, and Clind. Wilhelm noted that Clind''s technique was neither sword skill nor magic, but something completely different. Sometime in the following decades, Clind was entrusted with protecting and training Frederica Baumann. During that period, he was also transferred to Miload Manor, ', '/uploads/images/c_219105.jpg'),
(163, 'Hinata Tachibana', '橘日向', '配角', 'Azumi Waki', '__Height:__ 153 cm Hinata Tachibana is the girlfriend of [Takemichi Hanagaki](https://anilist.co/character/145342/Hanagaki-Takemichi) who is the primary reason for Takemichi''s desire to change the past. In 2005, Hinata is a 14 year old girl. Hinata has light brown eyes and wears her rosy brown hair a little longer than before: it goes beyond her shoulders. She is seen wearing a long black dress with embroidered flowers. She also wears a necklace around her neck, materializing her relationship with Takemichi Hanagaki during their middle school years. Hinata has a very outgoing and upbeat personality who is highly optimistic and always finds ways to make undesirable situations better. Even when others become demoralized or despair, Hinata remains strong in order to push them forward. ~!On July 4, 2017, Hinata will be killed during a brawl between two Tokyo gangs, along with her brother [Naoto Tachibana](https://anilist.co/character/167843/Tachibana-Naoto).!~', '/uploads/images/c_138453.jpg'),
(163, 'Manjirou Sano', '佐野万次郎', '主角', 'Yuu Hayashi', '__Height:__ 162 cm He is a founding member and the leader of Tokyo Manji Gang. Mikey is usually a carefree teenager who loves to joke and play pranks around those he considers his close friends. He cares for them greatly and is determined to protect their honor. He rarely shows any sign of weakness, as he believes himself to be the foundation and support for Toman, and if the pillar himself were to display weakness, Toman would also be weakened. ~!Younger brother of [Shinichiro](https://anilist.co/character/221297/Shinichirou-Sano), older half brother of [Emma](https://anilist.co/character/171924/Emma-Sano) and younger "adoptive" brother of [Izana](https://anilist.co/character/170484/Izana-Kurokawa)!~ ~!In the future, it is revealed that Mikey is the leader of the gang "Bonten" ,which is considered Japan''s current worst criminal organization.!~ ~!During the high school timeline it is revealed that Mikey is the leader of the "Kanto Manji Gang".!~', '/uploads/images/c_145341.jpg'),
(163, 'Takemichi Hanagaki', '花垣武道', '主角', 'Yuuki Shin', '__Height:__ 165 cm Takemichi learns that the girl he dated in middle school—the only girl he ever dated—has died. Then, after an accident he finds himself in a time leap back to his middle school years. He vows to change the future and save the girl, and to do that he aims to rise to the top of the Kantou region''s most brutal delinquent gang. ~!After the fight with Valhalla he becomes the First division Capitan of Toman.!~ ~!He later became the eleventh President of the Black Dragons as well as the captain of the First Division of the Tokyo Manji Gang, and a member of Brahman.!~ ~!Takemichi is also the president and founder (with [Chifuyu Matsuno](https://anilist.co/character/145344/Matsuno-Chifuyu)) of the Thousand Winters (later renamed as Tokyo Manji), created to defeat Kanto Manji.!~', '/uploads/images/c_145342.jpg'),
(163, 'Keisuke Baji', '場地圭介', '配角', 'Masaaki Mizunaka', '__Height:__ 175 cm Captain of the 1st division and one of the founders of the Tokyo Manji Gang. Baji has a wild personality. He loves the thrill of adrenaline and [Mikey](https://anilist.co/character/145341) himself says that he would punch someone out on the street for no apparent reason, only because he feels like it. In combat, he is never without his trademark grin.', '/uploads/images/c_145343.jpg'),
(163, 'Chifuyu Matsuno', '松野千冬', '配角', 'Shou Karino', '__Height:__ 168 cm Chifuyu is the vice-captain of the First Division of Tokyo Manji gang and [Baji](https://anilist.co/character/145343)''s best friend. ~!He is the first one to get to know about [Takemichi](https://anilist.co/character/145342)''s time leap ability. After that, he regularly helps Takemichi to think about saving the future.!~ ~!Takemichi sought his help in order to team up and face Kanto Manji, the newest [Mikey](https://anilist.co/character/145341)''s gang. He also demands that their team should be called Thousand Winters. Chifuyu also made the uniforms.!~', '/uploads/images/c_145344.jpg'),
(163, 'Ken Ryuuguji', '龍宮寺 堅', '主角', 'Tatsuhisa Suzuki', '__Height:__ 185 cm (6''1") Draken is [Mikey](https://anilist.co/character/145341/Manjirou-Sano)''s best friend and one of the founders of Toman. Draken is a muscular teenager who is exceptionally tall for his age. His head is shaven on the sides and back to expose his signature dragon tattoo on his left temple. His blonde hair is long on the top of his head and kept in a neat braid. Draken is a serious teen who lives in a brothel, he does not know his biological parents and was ''taken in'' by the owners of the brothel. ~!His mother was a prostitute who abandoned him at birth and died when he was two years old.!~ ~!In the future, Draken owns a bike shop, and is a member of Brahman.!~', '/uploads/images/c_145345.jpg'),
(163, 'Takashi Mitsuya', '三ツ谷隆', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', '__Height:__ 170 cm Mitsuya is the Captain of the Second Division of the Tokyo Manji Gang. He is a calm, levelheaded person who is also the source of positivity in the gang. Despite his rough upbringing, he tackles every day with a smile. Mitsuya is a pacifist, preferring to not get into an altercation if possible, but at the same time, will not hesitate to fight in order to protect what is dear to him. Older brother of [Luna Mitsuya](https://anilist.co/character/272864/Mitsuya-Luna) & Mana Mitsuya. He is a childhood friend of [Draken](https://anilist.co/character/145345/Ken-Ryuuguji).', '/uploads/images/c_167841.jpg'),
(163, 'Hakkai Shiba', '柴八戒', '配角', 'Tasuku Hatanaka', '__Height:__ 183 cm Vice Captain of the Second Division of the Tokyo Manji Gang. The younger brother of [Yuzuha](https://anilist.co/character/170482/Yuzuha-Shiba) and the younger brother of [Taiju](https://anilist.co/character/167845/Taiju-Shiba), the leader of the 10th Generation Black Dragons. Hakkai is shown to be a timid but friendly guy. When it comes to his personality he is nothing like his older brother Taiju who is disciplined and bloodlusted. Hakkai has deep admiration for [Takashi Mitsuya](https://anilist.co/character/167841/Takashi-Mitsuya)', '/uploads/images/c_167842.jpg'),
(163, 'Naoto Tachibana', '橘直人', '配角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', '__Height:__ 148 cm (past), 175 cm (present) Hinata''s younger brother. He very much resembles his father. Naoto is a righteous individual who is also determined to also save his sister. He has a no-nonsense personality and is usually unamused by others'' humorous advances. He is also willing to embrace far-fetched possibilities, such as the fact that Takemichi can time-travel, and even make his own hypotheses about it. ~!Before the first time travel, he died together with Hinata. However, after he was warned of his death by Hanagaki and was subsequently saved, he grew up to become a detective and ended up playing a key role in Hanagaki''s ability to travel through time.!~ ~!Naoto is the key to activating Takemichi''s supernatural time-travel ability. Whether in the past or present, as long as the two shake hands, Takemichi will be transferred to the present (if he is in the past), or the past (if he is in the present). He is also the only person who is aware of the consequences caused by Takemichi''s time-traveling aside from Takemichi thus far.!~', '/uploads/images/c_167843.jpg'),
(163, 'Kazutora Hanemiya', '羽宮一虎', '配角', 'Shunichi Toki', '__Height:__ 174 cm One of the founders of the Tokyo Manji Gang and former number 3 of Valhalla. Kazutora is a very broken soul; as a child, he was forced to pick between his mom and dad in a case of domestic violence. As a result of his fundamentally non-existent family life, he scorned upon other happy families. Something as simple as seeing children having tender moments with their parents, triggered a sore spot within Kazutora and irritated him deeply. ~!He sat 2 years in juvie for the murder of Shinichirou Sano , and he is expected to face at least 10 years in juvie, for stabbing Keisuke Baji. Even though they were the most important people in Mikey''s life, he still forgave Kazutora, and told him that he is a part of Toman.!~', '/uploads/images/c_167846.jpg'),
(163, 'Souya Kawata', '河田ソウヤ', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', '__Height:__ 170cm Vice captain of the Fourth Division of the Tokyo Manji Gang. He''s the younger twin brother of [Nahoya Kawata](https://anilist.co/character/168679/Nahoya-Kawata).', '/uploads/images/c_168678.jpg'),
(163, 'Nahoya Kawata', '河田ナホヤ', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', '__Height:__ 170 cm Captain of the Fourth Division of the Tokyo Manji Gang. Brother to [Souya Kawata](https://anilist.co/character/168678/Souya-Kawata).', '/uploads/images/c_168679.jpg'),
(163, 'Seishuu Inui', '乾青宗', '配角', 'Junya Enoki', '__Height:__ 177 cm Former tenth generation Black Dragons commander and the current vice captain of the Black Dragons. Inupi is usually a stoic and quiet individual. However, he isn''t afraid to voice his thoughts and opinions even if it hurts him in the end. He is very committed to the Black Dragon and loyal to Kokonoi, whom he considers his best friend. When he finds people he trusts, he devotes himself to them. He is brave, but will be willing to show his vulnerable side and open up.', '/uploads/images/c_170479.png'),
(163, 'Hajime Kokonoi', '九井一', '配角', 'Natsuki Hanae', '__Height:__ 174 cm Koko sees the world as a series of calculations. He acts solely in his own interests; every move of his is to benefit himself. He cozies up to those more powerful than he, but will turn his back on them the moment they lose their instrumentality. ~!Former tenth generation Black Dragons commander!~ ~!His goal was to collect 40 million yen to save his loved one, Akane but unfortunately, he was too late.!~', '/uploads/images/c_170480.png'),
(163, 'Tetta Kisaki', '稀咲鉄太', '配角', 'Shoutarou Morikubo', 'Kisaki is the principal antagonist of Tokyo Revengers. He''s especially known for rising to the top of the Toman at full speed. Kisaki is a ruthless, cunning, and ambitious individual who will stop at nothing to achieve his goals. Although average in stature, his power to rule with fear makes even those stronger than he obey him. The entirety of his actions in the entire story revolves around becoming the most powerful and influential criminal in Tokyo. ~! He is also known for organizing the murder of Hinata Tachibana many times. !~ ~!He is later ran over and killed by a truck after a long chase!~', '/uploads/images/c_170483.png'),
(163, 'Atsushi Sendou', '千堂敦', '配角', 'Takuma Terashima', 'One of Takemichi''s best friends in middle school. ~! It''s revealed that he is the person who pushed Takemichi in front of the train at the start of the story.!~', '/uploads/images/c_171920.png'),
(163, 'Masataka Kiyomizu', '清水将貴', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', 'Kiyomasa is the leader of the the third years in Shibuya Third Mid school and a former member of Toman. ~! He is no longer a member of Toman because Tomans leader and vice presidents, Draken and Mikey busted his underground boxing job. !~', '/uploads/images/c_171921.jpg'),
(163, 'Takuya Yamamoto', '山本タクヤ', '配角', 'Yuuya Hirose', 'Takuya Yamamoto is one of Takemichi''s middle school friends and also his childhood friend.', '/uploads/images/c_171922.png'),
(163, 'Nobutaka Osanai', '長内信高', '配角', 'Eiji Takeuchi', 'Osanai is the former president of the Moebius gang. ~!Toman''s leader, Mikey, knocked Osanai out with three kicks when he tried to ambush them with his gang and Draken announced that Moebius will now be under Toman''s command, following which Osanai gets stabbed by Pah, much to everyone''s shock.!~', '/uploads/images/c_171923.jpg'),
(163, 'Emma Sano', '佐野エマ', '配角', 'Yumi Uchiyama', '__Height:__ 150 cm ~![Mikey](https://anilist.co/character/145341/Manjirou-Sano)''s younger half-sister.!~~!Killed by [Tetta Kisaki](https://anilist.co/character/170483/Tetta-Kisaki).!~', '/uploads/images/c_171924.png'),
(163, 'Haruki Hayashida', '林田春樹', '配角', 'Subaru Kimura', 'He is one of the founding members of the Tokyo Manji Gang and its former third divisions captain. ~!He ends up getting sentenced to one year in jail after he stabbed Osanai during the Toman and Moebius confrontation in the hangar or garage. His arrest led to internal conflicts in Toman and the gang getting split in two. !~', '/uploads/images/c_171925.png'),
(163, 'Makoto Suzuki', '鈴木マコト', '配角', 'Shunsuke Takeuchi', 'Takemichis friend and a member of the Mizo Middle Five', '/uploads/images/c_171926.jpg'),
(163, 'Kazushi Yamagishi', '山岸一司', '配角', 'Shouta  Hayama', 'One of Takemichi''s best friends in middle school.', '/uploads/images/c_171927.png'),
(163, 'Yasuhiro Mutou', '武藤泰宏', '配角', 'Daisuke Ono', 'Toman Gang Fifth Division Captain. ~!He later leaves Toman and becomes a Tenjiku Gang executive.!~', '/uploads/images/c_203561.png'),
(163, 'Ran Haitani', '灰谷蘭', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', '__Height:__ 183 cm A Tenjiku executive. [Rindou](https://anilist.co/character/203563/Haitani-Rindou)''s elder brother. ~!He is a member of the S62 generation. He was one of Tenjiku’s 4 Heavenly Kings, and is a Bonten executive in the future.!~', '/uploads/images/c_203562.png'),
(163, 'Rindou Haitani', '灰谷竜胆', '配角', 'Hiro Shimono', '__Height:__ 172 cm A Tenjiku executive. Ran''s younger brother. ~!He''s a Bonten executive in the future.!~', '/uploads/images/c_203563.png'),
(163, 'Ryouhei Hayashi', '林良平', '配角', 'Yukihiro Nozuyama', '__Height:__ 176 cm He is the third division vice-captain of the Tokyo Manji Gang.', '/uploads/images/c_212447.png'),
(163, 'Shuuji Hanma', '半間修二', '配角', 'Takuya Eguchi', '__Height:__ 192cm He is the former acting leader of Moebius following Osanai''s defeat. Hanma''s single purpose is to find excitement, relieving his boredom by street violence. Hanma slowly sinks in to apathy since he was winning fights easily, without any resistance, that''s why he sooner ally with [Kisaki Tetta](https://anilist.co/character/170483).', '/uploads/images/c_215868.png'),
(163, 'Shinichirou Sano', '佐野真一郎', '配角', 'Masaya Matsukaze', 'Older brother of [Mikey](https://anilist.co/character/145341/Manjirou-Sano).', '/uploads/images/c_221297.png'),
(163, 'Haruchiyo Sanzu', '三途春千代', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 172 cm Vice captain of the 5th division in the Tokyo Manji Gang.', '/uploads/images/c_227242.jpg'),
(163, 'Jin Akaishi', '赤石ジン', '配角', 'Eiji Miyashita', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_231804.jpg'),
(163, 'Ryouko Tachibana', '立花亮子', '配角', 'Manami Numakura', 'Mother of Hinata and Naoto.', '/uploads/images/c_233328.png'),
(163, 'Chonbo', 'チョンボ', '配角', 'Shuuhei Iwase', '~!Chonbo is one of the Valhalla captains and expert fighters. !~', '/uploads/images/c_233805.jpg'),
(163, 'Chome', 'チョーム', '配角', 'Daichuu Mizushima', '~!Chome is one of the Valhalla captains and also one of its expert fighters. !~', '/uploads/images/c_233815.jpg'),
(163, 'Hansen', '阪泉', '配角', 'Kenta Miyake', 'Hansen is a character affiliated with the Ikebukuro Criminal Black Members.', '/uploads/images/c_243572.jpg'),
(163, 'Gariman', 'ガリ男', '配角', 'Ryouta Yano', 'Gariman is the leader of Night Dust, a top gang in tokyo, which governs the Ueno territory.', '/uploads/images/c_243575.jpg'),
(163, 'Remi', 'レミ', '配角', 'Saki Fujita', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_264908.jpg'),
(163, 'Choji Ahane', '亜波根チョウジ', '配角', 'Junichi Yanagita', 'Choji is one of Valhalla''s Captains and Kisaki''s cronies.', '/uploads/images/c_264909.jpg'),
(163, 'Masaru', 'マサル', '配角', 'Shinya Hamazoe', '[Takemichi](https://anilist.co/character/145342/)''s cousin and a third year student in Shibuya Middle School. He claimed to be the leader of the delinquents at his school, only to be exposed as the servant of [Kiyomasa](https://anilist.co/character/171921) and his friends.', '/uploads/images/c_296193.png'),
(163, 'Eki Kounai Announcer', '駅構内アナウンス', '配角', 'Sakura Nakamura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_296194.jpg'),
(163, 'TV Newscaster', 'TVニュース', '配角', 'Kousuke Katayama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_296195.jpg'),
(163, 'Kojima', '小島', '配角', 'Daiki Abe', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_296197.png'),
(164, 'Lucy', 'ルーシー', '主角', 'Aoi Yuuki', 'Lucy is a mysterious netrunner from Night City. She is quite introverted and doesn''t like to talk much about her past. Although she looks innocent, she won''t hesitate to kill a person in a heartbeat if they tick her off. Lucy also considers Night City a prison and dreams of one day leaving it for the moon. Lucy is a part of [Maine](https://anilist.co/character/284159)''s crew of edgerunners. One of its members, a netrunner named [Kiwi](https://anilist.co/character/284161), is her mentor. She also becomes acquainted with [David](https://anilist.co/character/284158) and takes him on a tour through Night City''s criminal underworld, leading the two of them to become partners in Maine''s crew. ~!She is Half Polish and Half Japanese!~', '/uploads/images/c_284157.jpg'),
(164, 'David Martinez', 'デイビッド・マルティネズ', '主角', 'KENN', 'David is a street kid from Arroyo, Santo Domingo in Night City, who is enrolled into Arasaka''s educational system at Arasaka Academy. He lives with his mother Gloria in an apartment of Megabuilding H4. After experiencing a personal tragedy, David has the powerful Sandevistan speedware installed in his body and becomes one of Night City''s edgerunners. He also becomes acquainted with [Lucy](https://anilist.co/character/284157/Lucy), who leads him into the city''s criminal underworld, and chooses to join the gang of edgerunners she is a part of, led by [Maine](https://anilist.co/character/284159/Maine).', '/uploads/images/c_284158.png'),
(164, 'Maine', 'メイン', '配角', 'Hiroki Touchi', 'Maine used to be a military soldier before he became a mercenary. Now a veteran edgerunner in Night City, Maine dreams of "making it big", although he values his friendships with his crew more than his own glory.', '/uploads/images/c_284159.png'),
(164, 'Dorio', 'ドリオ', '配角', 'Michiko Kaiden', 'Dorio is a veteran edgerunner and Maine''s right-hand. She''s jacked and strong, but despite her tough exterior, Dorio has a soft side that she only shows to the people she trusts.', '/uploads/images/c_284160.png'),
(164, 'Kiwi', 'キーウィ', '配角', 'Takako Honda', 'A member of Maine''s crew of mercenaries, Kiwi is an enigmatic and snarky netrunner with a detachable cybernetic jaw. She also acts as a mentor to Lucy.', '/uploads/images/c_284161.jpg'),
(164, 'Pilar', 'ピラル', '配角', 'Wataru Takagi', 'Pilar is an edgerunner of Night City, known to be a comical and crude techie who loves to show off. He and his sister, [Rebecca](https://anilist.co/character/284163/Rebecca), often team up with [Maine](https://anilist.co/character/284159/Maine) and his crew to conduct mercenary jobs.', '/uploads/images/c_284162.png'),
(164, 'Rebecca', 'レベッカ', '配角', 'Tomoyo Kurosawa', 'Rebecca is an edgerunner of Night City, and is described as a short, spunky, trigger-happy solo who is always fighting with her brother [Pilar](https://anilist.co/character/284162/Pilar). The two siblings often team up with [Maine](https://anilist.co/character/284159/Maine) and his crew to conduct mercenary jobs.', '/uploads/images/c_284163.jpg'),
(164, 'Ripperdoc', 'リパードク', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_284164.png'),
(164, 'Faraday', 'ファラデー', '配角', 'Kazuhiko Inoue', 'Faraday is a ruthless fixer with ties to Militech and a distinctive optic cyberware that gives him four eyes. He is based in Santo Domingo and often employs Maine to conduct jobs.', '/uploads/images/c_284165.jpg'),
(164, 'Gloria Martinez', 'グロリア・マルティネズ', '配角', 'Yurika Hino', 'Both Gloria and her son David live in an apartment of Megabuilding H4 in Santo Domingo, Night City. She is an emergency medical technician (EMT).', '/uploads/images/c_284166.png'),
(164, 'Katsuo Tanaka', 'カツオ・タナカ', '配角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_287410.jpg'),
(164, 'Falco', 'ファルコ', '配角', 'Yasuyuki Kase', 'Falco is a Nomad wheelman, and part of Maine''s edgerunner crew.', '/uploads/images/c_287420.jpg'),
(164, 'Kouchou', '校長', '配角', 'Hidenari Ugaki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_287421.png'),
