(165, 'Hayase Nagatoro', '長瀞早瀬', '主角', 'Sumire Uesaka', '**Height:** 150 cm (4''11") A high school student that can suddenly pop-up anywhere and anytime. She is always crazy about her [Senpai](https://anilist.co/character/124697). She seems to be a member of the Swimming Club. Nagatoro is an energetic, athletic, popular and rather sadistic - but deep down very sweet - girl, often referred to as a "sadodere". She is part of a ''cool kids'' clique together with her friends [Gamo-chan](https://anilist.co/character/145715/Maki-Gamo), [Yoshi](https://anilist.co/character/145718/Yoshi) and [Sakura](https://anilist.co/character/145716/Sakura), and is a member of the swimming club, despite also having a liking for martial arts such as muay thai, boxing, capoeira and especially judo. ~!Chapter 81 — there''s major development between Nagatoro & [Naoto](https://anilist.co/character/124697/Naoto-Hachiouji) which reveals that Nagatoro is supposedly interested romantically in him and sets out a dare to get a kiss from him as a reward for beating her judo rival [Orihara](https://anilist.co/character/220340/Orihara)!~', '/uploads/images/c_124696.png'),
(165, 'Naoto Hachiouji', '八王子直人', '主角', 'Daiki Yamashita', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9") As a high schooler and a member of the art club, he enjoys illustrating his own mangas and drawing still images of even his kouhai, [Nagatoro](https://anilist.co/character/124696), after meeting her. Naoto spends his time after school in the art club with Nagatoro on most days where the crazy antics ensue. He is an introvert, twitchy, loner, nerdy and shy aspiring artist, who tries to avoid social interaction with other people and doesn''t seem to have any friends. He is also referred as closet-perv by Nagatoro. ~!Naoto eventually notices his romantic feelings for [Nagatoro](https://anilist.co/character/124696/Hayase-Nagatoro) and sets out different scenarios to get closer with her and date her in the future.!~', '/uploads/images/c_124697.jpg'),
(165, 'Gamou', '蒲生', '配角', 'Mikako Komatsu', '**Height:** 168 cm (5''6") A character with semi-long hair. She likes to make fun of people.', '/uploads/images/c_145715.jpg'),
(165, 'Sakura', '桜', '配角', 'Shiori Izawa', '**Height:** 157 cm (5''2") A girl with a tan and soft wavy hair. She actually has a "haraguro" personality. (Haraguro: a character that is kind or friendly on the outside but uses those traits as a means to manipulate others.)', '/uploads/images/c_145716.jpg'),
(165, 'Sana Sunomiya', '須ノ宮さな', '配角', 'Nana Mizuki', '**Height:** 171 cm (5''7") The art club president. She has long hair that frames her face with dark-brown eyes. Her personality is stern and serious based on her interactions with [Senpai](https://anilist.co/character/124697), but she treats him with respect unlike [Nagatoro](https://anilist.co/character/124696). She also bears a resemblance to a female character in one of the manga Senpai wrote. [Sunomiya](https://anilist.co/character/226964/Sunomiya) is her younger cousin.', '/uploads/images/c_145717.jpg'),
(165, 'Yoshi', 'ヨッシー', '配角', 'Aina Suzuki', '**Height:** 160 cm (5''2") A natural airheaded twintail girl. She is a moron who likes [Gamo-chan](https://anilist.co/character/145715) as she usually repeats or follows her up with something she has just said. Yoshi also seems to like animals as she’s been seen with a gorilla shirt and she has a pet dog. She also seems to be into cute things as she once accepted a “Squiddy” plush from [Nagatoro](https://anilist.co/character/124696) in return for [Senpai](https://anilist.co/character/124697) in a contest.', '/uploads/images/c_145718.jpg'),
