(166, 'Kyouko Hori', '堀京子', '主角', 'Haruka Tomatsu', '__Height:__ 163 cm (5''4") Kyouko Hori is one of the main protagonists of [Horimiya](https://anilist.co/anime/124080/Horimiya/), along with [Izumi Miyamura](https://anilist.co/character/66173/Izumi-Miyamura). She is a student in Class 3-1 of Katagiri Senior High School. Kyouko is mostly a very energetic and popular person who always creates a happy atmosphere around herself. She is a hard-worker in all aspects of her life, and, according to Izumi Miyamura, she scores above 90% for all her tests.', '/uploads/images/c_66171.jpg'),
(166, 'Izumi Miyamura', '宮村伊澄', '主角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', '__Height:__ 169 cm Miyamura is often mistaken for an otaku for his sneaky character. The truth behind his long hair and clothes is to hide his piercings and his excessive amount of tattoos. This is a secret that only [Hori](https://anilist.co/character/66171) and [Ishikawa](https://anilist.co/character/66961) know. Izumi is a very thoughtful kid. He is a person who looks weak but is very strong.', '/uploads/images/c_66173.jpg'),
(166, 'Tooru Ishikawa', '石川透', '配角', 'Seiichirou Yamashita', '__Height__: 174 cm Tooru is friendly with everyone, and has a calm personality. He attends Katagiri Senior Highschool. ~!At first he hates Miyamura due to his close relationship with Hori, who he had a crush on at the time. He confessed to her and was immediately rejected. In time he became a great friend of Miyamura.!~', '/uploads/images/c_66961.jpg'),
(166, 'Yuki Yoshikawa', '吉川由紀', '配角', 'Yurie Kozakai', 'A close friend of [Kyouko Hori''s](https://anilist.co/character/66171/Kyouko-Hori) who attends the same high school as her.', '/uploads/images/c_66963.jpg'),
(166, 'Remi Ayasaki', '綾崎レミ', '配角', 'Mao Ichimichi', '__Height:__ 158 cm A member of the Student Council and she is known as the girlfriend of Kakeru Sengoku who attends Katagiri Senior High School where she is enrolled in class 3-5. She is more of a mascot in the student council, and is shown to do little to no work at all. Remi is usually shown as a rather childish and immature girl who has a very straightforward personality, and often wears her emotions on her sleeve. And seems to rely on other people''s help. She''s also not very smart, often compared to [Miyamura](https://anilist.co/character/66173/Miyamura-Izumi) about which one is more of an idiot. She loves insects, though she''s bad with dragonflies. Her room is filled with her insect collection, and she has been nicknamed the Insect Queen. She also enjoys reading, especially fairy tales. She''s also comically bad at cooking, just like [Kakeru Sengoku](https://anilist.co/character/72447/Sengoku-Kakeru).', '/uploads/images/c_66965.jpg'),
(166, 'Shuu Iura', '井浦秀', '配角', 'Daiki Yamashita', '**Height:** 172 cm (5''8") He is a friend of [Izumi Miyamura](https://anilist.co/character/66173/Miyamura-Izumi) and pretty much everyone at school. He has his own way of thinking and always seems excited; he is a colleague from another class.', '/uploads/images/c_66967.jpg'),
(166, 'Souta Hori', '堀創太', '配角', 'Yuka Terasaki', 'Kyouko''s young brother. He sees Kyouko as a motherly figure because she has been the one taking care of him since he was born because of the nature of their parents'' work. In the beginning of the story, he is brought back to the Hori household by Izumi after he had fallen down on the street. Since then he has been very affectionate towards Izumi, going as far as calling him a non blood-related brother.', '/uploads/images/c_66969.jpg'),
(166, 'Yuuna Okuyama', '奥山有菜', '配角', 'Aoi Koga', 'Yunna is a classmate of Souta. She bullies him but actually really likes him. Kyoko Hori is her role model. ~!In the manga timeskip she''s best friend and in a relationship with Souta Hori.!~', '/uploads/images/c_66971.jpg'),
(166, 'Reiko Terajima', '寺島玲子', '配角', 'Hana Satou', 'She is a chemistry teacher at Katagiri High School and the homeroom teacher of class 3-1.', '/uploads/images/c_66973.jpg'),
(166, 'Shin Yasuda', '安田真', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', '__Occupation:__ English Teacher __Affiliation:__ Student Council (Manager), Katagiri Senior High School He is one of the supporting characters for [Horimiya](https://anilist.co/anime/124080/Horimiya/). Yasuda loves high school girls and makes no attempt to hide this either. However, he never actually touches any of the girls, just acts overly friendly towards them and overly cold towards the guys. He often demands that any guys with girlfriends (mainly [Miyamura](https://anilist.co/character/66173/Izumi-Miyamura) and [Sengoku](https://anilist.co/character/72447/Kakeru-Sengoku)) break up with them, so that he can have them instead. Any time he is with only male students, he constantly bemoans the fact, loudly asking why they, and not some girls, are there. He also does not tend to remember the names of his male students, saying that he has no need to learn useless information. Many of Yasuda''s female students also like him as well, thinking he''s a cool, young, good looking teacher who''s kind to them. Many of them like to visit with him in the counseling room. Yasuda even went out of his way to tell [Kyouko Hori](https://anilist.co/character/66171) to keep her ‘chin up’, and his little known fact about him is that he’s into ‘flat-chested’ girls, in an attempt to cheer her up with ‘confidence’.', '/uploads/images/c_66975.jpg'),
(166, 'Kakeru Sengoku', '仙石翔', '配角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '__Height:__ 170 cm He is the charismatic president of the student council of Katagiri Senior High School who is enrolled in class 3-3, the childhood friend of [Kyouko Hori](https://anilist.co/character/66171/Hori-Kyouko) and the boyfriend of [Remi Ayasaki](https://anilist.co/character/66965/Ayasaki-Remi). Sengoku is a rather shy boy who gets embarrassed easily and he is a very wimpy where the slightest thing will make him cower in fear, especially things to do with horror or insects. Sengoku is very smart and serious, normally ranked #1 in the school (and #2 in phys ed). He enjoys reading and has an incredible level of concentration while doing so, the point of ignoring everything else going around him. He is generally not very expressive with his emotions. The sole exception is his anger or irritation, which he shows all the time as he is the Student Councils President. Even though he makes threats and gets angry towards those breaking the rules, he doesn''t actually like doing so. Sengoku is very insecure when it comes to his body. Thinking his slender body is embarrassing and always refusing to show it in various occasions, even going as far as to make up extravagant lies to get out of it. He wears multiple layers of clothing to hide his body type.', '/uploads/images/c_72447.jpg'),
(166, 'Sakura Kouno', '河野桜', '配角', 'Reina Kondou', '__Height:__ 163 cm She is the vice-president of the student council. She is very competent and often does​ support work. ~!She has a crush on Tooru Ishikawa, in chapter 28, she confessed to him.!~', '/uploads/images/c_72449.jpg'),
(166, 'Akane Yanagi', '柳明音', '配角', 'Jun Fukuyama', '__Height:__ 168 cm He is a 3rd year at Katagiri High School​ and a member of Hori and Miyamura''s regular group of friends. He is enrolled in class 3-6. He has very bad eyesight and cannot see properly without his glasses.', '/uploads/images/c_72453.png'),
(166, 'Ichirou Watabe', '渡部一郎', '配角', 'Aoi Ichikawa', '__Height:__ 170 cm He is a friend of [Izumi Miyamura](https://anilist.co/character/66173/Izumi-Miyamura). He attends the same high school, and is enrolled in class 3-1.', '/uploads/images/c_72455.png'),
(166, 'Daiki Mizouchi', '溝内大樹', '配角', 'Haruki Ishiya', '__Height:__ 176 cm He is one of Hori and Miyamura''s classmates. He attends the same school and is enrolled in the same class, 3-1.', '/uploads/images/c_72457.png'),
(166, 'Honoka Sawada', '沢田ほのか', '配角', 'Momo Asakura', '__Height:__ 150 cm Sawada is a very clingy towards Kyouko Hori. Due to her attachment to Hori, she often gets angry when Hori is together with Izumi Miyamura, choosing to push him away. She views Miyamura as a love rival, but also as a brotherly figure. She was very close to her older brother who passed away some years ago. She also appears to have mild androphobia, often freezing up, running away, or hiding when approached by men. However, ever since she got to know Miyamura, she would hide behind him instead whenever a male approaches her. She is slowly getting used to being around Miyamura''s male friends. ~!She is one of the side characters that make​ an appearance in chapter 29. She is first seen stalking Miyamura, causing many people, including Hori, to assume she has a crush on Miyamura. However, it is revealed that the person she has a crush on is Hori.!~', '/uploads/images/c_72459.png'),
(166, 'Kouichi Shindou', '進藤晃一', '配角', 'Taku Yashiro', '__Height:__ 173 cm He is a supporting character in the series. He attended the same junior high school as Izumi and Makio.', '/uploads/images/c_72461.png'),
(166, 'Chika Ichijou', '一条千佳', '配角', 'Sayaka Senbongi', '__Height:__ 154 cm Chika is a 3rd year at Yasaka High School.', '/uploads/images/c_72463.jpg'),
(166, 'Makio Tanihara', '谷原マキオ', '配角', 'Shouya Chiba', '__Height:__ 168 cm He is a 3rd-year​ high school student attending Kashi High School. He attended the same junior high school as Miyamura and Shindou.', '/uploads/images/c_72465.jpg'),
(166, 'Motoko Iura', '井浦基子', '配角', 'Hisako Kanemoto', '__Height:__ 150 cm She is [Shuu Iura](https://anilist.co/character/66967/Iura-Shuu)''s younger sister. Self-described as an untalkative, gloomy type, Motoko is the opposite of Shuu. She tends to keep to herself and has a hard time making friends. However, unlike Shuu, this personality also carries over to her school life, though she is much more forceful and violent towards her brother than others. She is also pretty smart but lacks the confidence to use it too well.', '/uploads/images/c_72467.png'),
(166, 'Yuriko Hori', '堀百合子', '配角', 'Ai Kayano', 'She is the mother of Kyouko and Souta.', '/uploads/images/c_78279.jpg'),
(166, 'Kyousuke Hori', '堀京介', '配角', 'Daisuke Ono', '__Height:__ 180 cm Kyousuke is Kyouko''s father who is often not home because of work.', '/uploads/images/c_89726.jpg'),
(166, 'Takako Nishi', '西貴子', '配角', 'Yuuki Takada', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_203892.png'),
(166, 'Iori Miyamura', '宮村伊織', '配角', 'Sayaka Oohara', '__Occupation:__ Owner and manager of the Miyamura family''s store She''s is the wife of Naozumi Miyamura and the mother of [Izumi Miyamura](https://anilist.co/character/66173/Izumi-Miyamura).', '/uploads/images/c_207325.png'),
(166, 'Miki Yoshikawa', '吉川美紀', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', '[Yuki''s](https://anilist.co/character/66963) older sister.', '/uploads/images/c_212578.png'),
(166, 'Keigo Izumi', '泉圭吾', '配角', 'Natsumi Fujiwara', 'A friend from Souta''s elementary school.', '/uploads/images/c_212579.png'),
(166, 'Kayo Yashiro', '矢代加世', '配角', 'Ryouka Yuzuki', '**Height:** 176 cm Caretaker of the Ishikawa household.', '/uploads/images/c_215830.png'),
(167, 'Rika Kawai', '川井リカ', '主角', 'Shuka Saitou', 'A girl who doesn''t hesitate to say what''s on her mind, even for people she has just met.', '/uploads/images/c_199890.jpg'),
(167, 'Momoe Sawaki', '沢木桃恵', '主角', 'Hinaki Yano', 'A girl who has a very distinct beauty mark and slim figure. She is often mistaken for a man, and is popular among girls.', '/uploads/images/c_199891.png'),
(167, 'Ai Ooto', '大戸アイ', '主角', 'Kanata Aikawa', 'A girl who has very distinct heterochromia and for that she''s bullied at school. Due to a certain event, she is temporarily not attending school. She''s a very introverted girl who spends a lot of time alone, she''s very protective when it comes to people that she cares about. She has no special power or abilities but wields a multi-colored pen which can transform into a weapon.', '/uploads/images/c_199892.png'),
(167, 'Neiru Aonuma', '青沼ねいる', '主角', 'Tomori Kusunoki', 'A girl who has very distinct green eyes and pigtails. She is very quiet and still at most times, loves herself and makes no initiative to get to know people. On the contrary, she avoids contact with people. She confesses to [Ai](https://anilist.co/character/199892/Ai-Ohto) her goal, to save [her sister](https://anilist.co/character/260352), for whose death she feels responsible.', '/uploads/images/c_199893.png'),
(167, 'Koito Nagase', '長瀬小糸', '配角', 'Azusa Tadokoro', 'Koito is [Ai Ohto](https://anilist.co/character/199892/Ai-Ohto)‘s first friend. Because of her friendship with Ai, she was bullied at school. She is very calm by nature and is able to find good sides in all situations, as shown in her reaction to being bullied at school. She is also kind and gentle, especially towards people she cares about. ~!Koito''s eventual suicide is what leads Ai to become a shut-in, avoiding school and refusing to speak to the [teacher](https://anilist.co/character/204921/Shuichiro-Sawaki) when he visits her home. It is for Koito''s sake that Ai begins using the Wonder Eggs.!~', '/uploads/images/c_204115.png'),
(167, 'Tae Ooto', '大戸多恵', '配角', 'Haruka Shiraishi', '[Ai Ooto](https://anilist.co/character/199892/Ai-Ohto)’s mother. She is a very soft spoken woman and cares deeply about Ai. She is always calm, polite and very kind with anyone she talks with. ~!She has divorced Ai''s father and takes care of her alone, both of them living together. She is worried about her daughter and tries to support her in her own way, though Ai rarely leaves her own room. Tae is then relieved to see that she made some friends. She is currently dating [Shuichiro Sawaki](https://anilist.co/character/204921/Shuichiro-Sawaki), who visits the Ohto household quite often.!~ (Source: Wonder Egg Priority Fandom Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_204116.png'),
(167, 'Ura-Acca', '裏アカ', '配角', 'Hiroki Takahashi', 'Ura-Acca, together with Acca, is responsible for leading Ai and the others to the Egg World. In contrast to Acca, Ura-Acca''s speech and appearance are more laidback and informal. Sometimes, he states very pointed opinions. He is also quite honest and prefers telling the truth rather than hiding It or avoiding the subject, as Acca would. ~!Ura-Acca, along with Acca, is one of the founders of Japan Plati. Originally regular humans, both of them abandoned their bodies and uploaded their brains into the bodies of mannequins that only exist in the Egg World.!~ Abilities : ~!He shows the same abilities as Acca to communicate with the protagonists from anywhere or anything, in both reality and Egg World. He can even make electronic objects work remotely such as an arcade when the girls requested it.!~', '/uploads/images/c_204117.png'),
(167, 'Acca', 'アカ', '配角', 'Yuuya Uchida', 'Acca is a mannequin with black glasses and a very slight smile. His build appears to be that of an average male, although it can be hard to tell since he is covered foot to neck. Although his true motives are quite unclear for now, his purpose is to guide the four main protagonists to battle in the Egg World as Ura-Acca does. ~!Acca, along with Ura Acca, is one of the founders of Japan Plati. Originally regular humans, both of them abandoned their bodies and uploaded their brains into the bodies of mannequins that only exist in the Egg World.!~ Abilities : ~!He is capable of making his voice heard by the protagonists from anywhere or anything, or interact with non living objects, in the Egg World and in the reality. For example, in episode 5 and episode 6, he uses speakers or bins. Ura-Acca possesses the same ability. They can also communicate through the pomanders. Both Acca and Ura-Acca can observe what the protagonists are doing, even in their dreams, through a big screen which shows directly what''s happening. They almost always have an eye on them.!~', '/uploads/images/c_204118.png'),
(167, 'Kurumi Saijou', '西城くるみ', '配角', 'Chika Anzai', '~!Kurumi Saijo emerges from Ai''s first Wonder Egg.!~ Kurumi is an empathetic girl. She sometimes speaks to others in an authoritative manner, but is a helpful person. She is very sarcastic in serious situations. ~!Kurumi was a student who had no real friends, only the superficial kind with whom you exchange empty phrases. Her Wonder Killer was an unknown schoolgirl with axes who endlessly laughed at her.!~ (Source: Wonder Egg Priority Fandom Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_204143.jpg'),
(167, 'Minami Suzuhara', '鈴原南', '配角', 'Satomi Satou', '~!Minami Suzuhara is the second person to hatch from a Wonder Egg bought by Ai.!~ Minami is very shy and timid. She has no confidence in herself nor her abilities at all, often describing herself as weak and lacking spirit. She is also very submissive due to her abuse at the hands of her gymnastics coach, obeying her without any questions and accepting the abuse without complaint. ~!Minami was in her school''s gymnastics club, the coach of which physically and emotionally abused her. Minami''s Wonder Killer takes the coach''s form, as her abuse was ultimately the cause of Minami''s presumed suicide.!~ (Source: Wonder Egg Priority Fandom Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_204893.png'),
(167, 'Shuichiro Sawaki', '沢木修一郎', '配角', 'Masatomo Nakazawa', 'Shuichiro Sawaki is [Ai](https://anilist.co/character/199892/Ai-Ohto) and [Koito](https://anilist.co/character/204115/Koito-Nagase)''s homeroom teacher. He is the art club''s advisor and often visits Ai''s home and says he doesn''t mind because her home is on the way to his house.', '/uploads/images/c_204921.jpg'),
(167, 'Mako', 'まこ', '配角', 'Rui Tanabe', '~!Mako and her best friend Miko are hatched from eggs bought by Ai and Rika.!~ Along with her best friend Miko, Mako was a fanatical fan of an idol named Yu-Yu. She and Miko attended concerts and meet-ups together in life. She is very cheerful and enthusiastic when talking about Yu-Yu, and very happy to see her best friend in the dream world. In life, Mako often attended concerts and meet-ups for her favourite idol, Yu-Yu, along with Miko. They both admit to having aquired ''sugar daddies'' in order to be able to afford attending Yu-Yu’s events. ~!When Yu-Yu committed suicide, both Miko and Mako were quick to follow in his death as soon as possible, though they don''t seem particularly remorseful about it.!~', '/uploads/images/c_205833.png'),
(167, 'Miko', 'みこ', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', '~!Miko and her best friend Mako are hatched from eggs bought by Ai and Rika.!~ Along with her best friend Mako, Miko was a fanatical fan of an idol named Yu-Yu. She and Mako attended concerts and meet-ups together in life. She is very cheerful and enthusiastic when talking about Yu-Yu, and very happy to see her best friend in the dream world. In life, Miko often attended concerts and meet-ups for her favourite idol, Yu-Yu, along with Mako. They both admit to having acquired ''sugar daddies'' in order to be able to afford attending Yu-Yu’s events. ~!When Yu-Yu committed suicide, both Miko and Mako were quick to follow in his death as soon as possible, though they don''t seem particularly remorseful about it.!~', '/uploads/images/c_205834.png'),
(167, 'Chiemi', 'ちえみ', '配角', 'Manaka Iwami', 'Chiemi was Rika''s #1 fan when she was a junior idol and the reason why Rika uses the Wonder Eggs. She would frequently attend Rika''s handshake events. ~!Although Chiemi seems very "happy go lucky" at Rika''s handshake events, it is later revealed that she possibly starved herself after taking Rika''s harsh words to heart.!~', '/uploads/images/c_205835.png'),
(167, 'Komon Kyoushi', '顧問教師', '配角', 'Kyou Yaoya', '~!Komon Kyoushi, addressed as Coach, is Minami Suzuhara''s Wonder Killer!~ (Source: Wonder Egg Priority Fandom Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_205889.png'),
(167, 'Sachiko', 'マダムサチコ', '配角', 'Masako Katsuki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_205890.png'),
(167, 'Hamabe no Onnanoko', '浜辺の女の子', '配角', 'Hina Youmiya', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_205891.png'),
(167, 'Hamabe no Kaibutsu', '浜辺の怪物', '配角', 'Ken Mizukoshi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_205893.png'),
(167, 'Miwa', '美和', '配角', 'Yumiri Hanamori', '~!Miwa is a girl hatched from Momoe’s egg.!~ __Background :__ ~!Miwa was a girl who was molested on the train by the same person every day. One day, she gathered up her courage and called the man out for it, shouting for help to the other passengers on the train. Everyone pinned the molester down, helping Miwa. However, the man was actually an executive at her dad’s company. Her dad was fired from the company and her mother asked why she just could not just put up with it. Her mother had said that being groped shows how cute Miwa was, that the molester had picked her because she was cute. She was blamed by her mother for her father’s forced resignation, and expresses emotional distress when recalling this event to Momoe.!~', '/uploads/images/c_206595.png'),
(167, 'Misaki Tanabe', '田辺美咲', '配角', 'Hana Takeda', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_206596.png'),
(167, 'Haruka', 'ハルカ', '配角', 'Kaede Hondo', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_206597.png'),
(167, 'Mizuki', '瑞希', '配角', 'Aoi Koga', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_206603.png'),
(167, 'Aoi', '葵', '配角', 'Lynn', '~!Aoi (葵, Aoi) is a girl hatched from Neiru’s egg.!~ ~!It assumed by her tangent of her mother''s attempts to look young again that Aoi killed herself to preserve her beauty. She even goes as far as to suggesting that Neiru should take her life, due to the fact that she is still young and beautiful.!~ ~!She is the only Wonder Egg Maiden introduced that is actually a Wonder Killer.!~', '/uploads/images/c_207609.jpg'),
(167, 'Ayaka', '綾香', '配角', 'Sayaka Senbongi', '~!Ayaka (綾香, Ayaka) is a girl hatched from Neiru’s egg. Unlike many of the other Wonder Egg girls, Ayaka seems quite headstrong and attempts to attack her Wonder Killer without help or direction.!~ ~!Although not much is known about Ayaka, from the taunts her Wonder Killer made, it can be assumed that she ran away from home and had attempted to run away multiple times. It can also be assumed that she has a strained relationship with her parents. Based of what her Wonder Killer says, we can speculate her reasons for suicide. Because her Wonder Killer, Yodare, refers to itself as "God" and says things like "Love is me" we can assume that Ayaka has a resentment for religion or has atheist beliefs.!~', '/uploads/images/c_207610.jpg'),
(167, 'Yodare', 'ヨダレ', '配角', 'Yasuhiko Kawazu', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_207611.jpg'),
(167, 'Makige', '巻き毛', '配角', 'Ayaka Saitou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_207612.jpg'),
(167, 'Yae Yoshida', '吉田ヤエ', '配角', 'Saki Miyashita', '~!She is a girl hatched from Ai’s egg.!~~!Little is known about Yae’s background, but she had the ability which allowed her to see entities that resembled spirits and ghosts. She was seen as insane and stupid by her parents and teachers, leading her to be sent a psychiatric hospital. Yae was the only one to have that power, feeling afraid of what she saw and being lonely, unable to confide her sufferance to anyone as nobody would trust her. Due to the stress she experienced, she decided to commit suicide as a way to free herself from the shackles that have weighed her down for too long.!~', '/uploads/images/c_208290.png'),
(167, 'Kaibutsu Shoujo', '怪物少女', '配角', 'Hana Takeda', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_208292.png'),
(167, 'Chiaki Kawai', '川井千秋', '配角', 'nao', 'Rika’s mother.', '/uploads/images/c_208307.png'),
(167, 'Shino', '志乃', '配角', 'Miyuri Shimabukuro', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_209099.png'),
(167, 'Mukade', 'ムカデ', '配角', 'Jouji Nakata', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_209100.jpg'),
(167, 'Miteminufuri', 'ミテミヌフリ', '配角', '', 'Seeno Evils (or Miteminufuri) are creatures that appear within the dream world of Wonder Egg Priority. They appear as small child-sized beings in black suits. All of them wear identical red masks, carry kitchen knives, and giggle incessently. They relentlessly chase the people that hatch out of Wonder Eggs in order to harm them. The Seeno Evils are seemingly able to track the Wonder Egg people, regardless of walls or distance. They leave paint-like splotches on every surface they pass by, and a creaking door sound is heard each time they appear. They move by bouncing in large groups, and are able to do so at considerable speed in order to chase their prey. They appear to obey Wonder Killers. ~!Despite their unnerving appearance, they can be destroyed quite easily, with a single hit from a magical weapon (such as the pen Ai wields).!~Seeno Evils are able to transform into a "Hater". (Source: Wonder Egg Priority Fandom Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_210572.png'),
(167, 'Kaisha no Senmu', '会社の専務', '配角', 'Youhei Tadano', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_210573.png'),
(167, 'Hachi Onna', 'ハチ女', '配角', 'Mayumi Shintani', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_210574.png'),
(167, 'Kotobuki Awano', '阿波野寿', '配角', 'Yume Miyamoto', 'She was born into a corporation called Japan Plati as Neiru. Her genetic makeup is identified as extremely rare, presenting the characteristics of heterochromia, albinism and high intelligence at the same time. Kotobuki Awano became both a scientist and a doctor and took the post attributed to Doctor Seki unintentionally. Neiru it''s her only friend in the entire corporation.', '/uploads/images/c_211651.jpg'),
(167, 'Doctor Seki', 'ドクター関', '配角', 'Houchuu Ootsuka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_211652.jpg'),
(167, 'Kaoru Kurita', '栗田薫', '配角', 'Sachika Misawa', 'He is a boy hatched from Momoe’s egg. ~!Having been assigned female at birth and struggling with his gender identity, Kaoru went to his kendo club advisor for advice. However, the teacher forced him down, beat him, and raped him, resulting in him becoming pregnant. This is presumably the reason that Kaoru committed suicide. Momoe fights to protect Kaoru after he emerges from one of her Wonder Eggs!~ (Source: Wonder Egg Priority Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_213443.png'),
(167, 'Kendoubu Komon', '剣道部顧問', '配角', 'Kouzou Mito', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_213454.jpg'),
(167, 'Leon', 'レオン', '配角', '', 'Ai’s pomander pet provided by the Acca and Ura-Acca to be used as a power up in the egg worlds. However in the real world it’s a small and gentle animal.', '/uploads/images/c_214110.jpg'),
(167, 'Panic', 'パニック', '配角', '', 'Momoe’s pomander pet provided by Acca and Ura-Acca to be used as a power up in the egg worlds. However in the real world it’s a small and gentle animal.', '/uploads/images/c_214111.jpg'),
(167, 'Mannen', 'マンネン', '配角', '', 'Rika’s pomander pet provided by Acca and Ura-Acca to be used as a power up in the egg worlds. However in the real world it’s a small and gentle animal.', '/uploads/images/c_214112.jpg'),
(167, 'Pinky', 'ピンキー', '配角', '', 'Neiru’s pomander pet provided by Acca and Ura-Acca to be used as a power up in the egg worlds. However in the real world it’s a small and gentle animal', '/uploads/images/c_214113.jpg'),
(167, 'Hyphen', 'ハイフン', '配角', 'Ikue Ootani', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_214872.jpg'),
(167, 'Dot', 'ドット', '配角', 'Ikue Ootani', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_214873.jpg'),
(167, 'Frill', 'フリル', '配角', 'Megumi Yamaguchi', 'Frill is an artificial human created by Acca and Ura-Acca. Frill is cheerful and clever by design, showing intelligence significantly higher than that of the average fourteen year old. She also has a sense of humour, and is often seen laughing as a result of practical jokes or general silliness. ~!Frill''s true nature however, proves to be far more sinister. She is shown to become easily jealous when anyone threatens to take attention away from her, or be superior to her in any way, growing to even despise these people. She seems to care little about people who are not her two creators. Frill seems to lack the ability to properly develop empathy. Her obsessive and envious nature culminates when Acca and Ura-Acca both begin to turn their attention away from her, causing her to resort to murder. Following this, Frill''s lack of empathy is fully displayed, showing very little, if any, remorse for her actions. After this, her creators call her a monster, and stop treating as if she were a human. This seems to confuse Frill, as she still seeks affection from her creators despite their disdain towards her.!~', '/uploads/images/c_214874.jpg'),
(167, 'Azusa Hoshina', '保科あずさ', '配角', 'Umeka Shouji', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_214880.jpg'),
(167, 'Himari', 'ひまり', '配角', 'Umeka Shouji', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_214881.jpg'),
(167, 'Kirara', 'キララロドリゲスマチュード18世宵の明星SSプラン', '配角', 'Ikue Ootani', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_215986.jpg'),
(168, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Yutaka Aoyama', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(168, 'Kaguya Shinomiya', '四宮かぐや', '主角', 'Aoi Koga', '__Height:__ 158 cm The vice president of the student council of Shuchiin Academy, member of the wealthy Shinomiya family, she is a multi-talented genius who can do anything if she sets her mind to it. Due to the way she was raised, she instinctively looks down on others and thinks of ways to use them for her own benefit. Kaguya rarely interacted with other people before she joined the student council, but that has begun to change. She is an incredibly sheltered girl, resulting in her lacking in several pieces of what might be considered common sense. She still doesn’t understand love very well, and her main objective is to make [Miyuki Shirogane](https://anilist.co/character/121101) fall in love and confess to her. Later in the series: ~!She confesses her love to Miyuki Shirogane and they start dating.!~ ~!In a Oshi no Ko special chapter, it was revealed that she married Miyuki and changed her surname to Kaguya Shirogane!~', '/uploads/images/c_120649.png'),
(168, 'Miyuki Shirogane', '白銀御行', '主角', 'Makoto Furukawa', '__Height:__ 175 cm He is a second year student at Shuchi''in Academy and the president of the student council. Miyuki is a handsome young man with blond hair and blue eyes. Due to his constant sleep deprivation and nearsightedness, his eyes appear to glare. He usually wears the regular Shuchi''in Academy black male uniform adorned with the Aiguilette, the golden chain-like accessory around his neck. The Aiguilette symbolizes his authority as student council president. Shirogane is a diligent student who, despite his underprivileged background, climbed his way to the top of his class through hard work and determination. Shirogane holds himself in high regard, consistently working to maintain his perfect image. He is textbook workaholic, enjoying his part-time job and often putting his own health at risk for the sake of his work. Due to his poor background, Shirogane values money greatly and goes to great lengths to not be wasteful, and generally dislikes expensive gifts. ~!Miyuki''s mother left his family when he was a child. Miyuki''s father''s factory was shut down and currently has no stable employment. They live in an apartment that costs ￥50,000 (Approx $450) a month. Due to this grisly past, he has been led to a lifestyle of part time jobs and hard work. He passed the Level 2 Kanji Kentei exam and has passed Grade Pre 1 on Eiken. He has also got second place on the National mock exam.!~ ~!Miyuki transferred into Shuchi''in Academy during his first year of high school on a scho', '/uploads/images/c_121101.png'),
(168, 'Yuu Ishigami', '石上優', '主角', 'Ryouta Suzuki', 'The treasurer of the student council of the Shuchiin Academy. He''s extremely valued by [Miyuki](https://anilist.co/character/121101), given that he single-handedly manages all the school''s funds. He''s also terrified of [Kaguya](https://anilist.co/character/120649), though no one else is sure why that is. Yuu keeps to himself and rarely speaks up, often getting into trouble when he does. He has a depressed outlook on life while having an inferiority complex. In contrast to his attitude, he is willing to help those in need and will sacrifice his pride if need be. Unlike his high school self, he had a much different outlook and demeanor during middle school. Later in the series: ~!Ishigami develops a crush on Tsubame that he inadvertently confesses his feelings for her at the school''s cultural festival. Ishigami does not realize that his actions were perceived as a confession by the rest of the student body and is therefore oblivious to the implications of having given Tsubame a heart-shaped gift (considered akin to a confession in Shuchiin tradition). After some convincing by Kaguya, Tsubame decides to seriously consider Ishigami''s confession, with her original intention being to let him down as gently as possible. It isn''t until Ishigami watches Tsubame''s performance of the traditional play that gave rise to the aforementioned tradition that he realizes his actions had unintended meaning. Even then, Ishigami''s thickheaded nature prevented him from recognizing the full meaning ', '/uploads/images/c_121102.png'),
(168, 'Chika Fujiwara', '藤原千花', '主角', 'Konomi Kohara', 'The secretary of the Shuchiin Academy student council. She could not be predicted, her thoughts could not be read. A natural disaster who unconsciously threw everything into chaos simply by being present, also known as __Subject F__. ~!In chapter 222 of the manga, Chika reveals that she played piano because she wanted to be perfect, and she becomes a prodigy at the piano. The expectations of her family and her fans rose, forcing her to practice more. She quit piano after Kaguya told her to just quit if she didn''t like the piano. Soon after Chika challenged Kaguya to a game battle and if she won, she would get to become Kaguya''s friend. In the end, she becomes Kaguya''s first friend.!~', '/uploads/images/c_121103.png'),
(168, 'Ai Hayasaka', '早坂愛', '配角', 'Yumiri Hanamori', 'Ai Hayasaka is a second-year student at Shuchiin Academy and a valet of the Shinomiya family. She is a member of the Hayasaka family, who have served the Shinomiya family for generations, gaining their trust. Having been personally assigned to enter Shuchiin Academy with her, Ai supports [Kaguya Shinomiya](https://anilist.co/character/120649) in her high school life and has been a part of Kaguya''s life for ten years. Because of their close relationship, Ai is one of the few people around to which Kaguya''s amiability is not an act. Even if she demonstrates maturity as a valet, Ai still has the concerns of a young girl, such as caring to be in fashion and going out with friends, even if she does not have much time for herself due to work. Ai helps Kaguya with the struggles about her feelings for [Shirogane](https://anilist.co/character/121101). ~!She later leaves her job as a maid to Kaguya but still continues her friendship.!~ ~!In the Doujin-ban universe, she starts dating and later gets engaged to Shirogane!~', '/uploads/images/c_121104.png'),
(168, 'Miko Iino', '伊井野ミコ', '主角', 'Miyu Tomita', '__Height:__ 147 cm (4''7") She is a freshman at Shuchiin Private Academy and the Auditor of the Student Council. Miko has a strong sense of justice and will correct others on what''s right and wrong. Unfortunately, this led to her being bullied, though she still continues to uphold her idea of "right". She idolizes [Chika Fujiwara](https://anilist.co/character/121103), listening to anything she says, even if it''s for Chika''s enjoyment.', '/uploads/images/c_125886.png'),
(168, 'Kei Shirogane', '白銀圭', '配角', 'Sayumi Suzushiro', 'Kei Shirogane is [Miyuki Shirogane''s](https://anilist.co/character/121101) little sister. She attends Shuchiin middle school and is the treasurer for the middle school student council. She is a hard worker just like her brother and can be very prideful at times. She also inherited his sense of righteousness and hates it when someone doesn''t do the right thing in a given situation. Like her brother, she likes helping out those who are in trouble even if it means going out of her way to do it. Since she grew up in a family that places emphasis on saving money, she normally carries coupons and works hard for the things she wants to buy. She developed a prickly attitude towards her brother due to his over protectiveness. She''s also entered a rebellious phase and due to her pride and she cannot get herself to have a lighthearted conversation with Miyuki, leading into the similar mind games that Miyuki and [Kaguya](https://anilist.co/character/120649) play against each other, but her objective is to talk to Miyuki without making it look like she has a brother complex. She rarely speaks and most of the time it is only when she exchanges formalities at school or when she hurls abuses at her brother.', '/uploads/images/c_126144.png'),
(168, 'Erika Kose', '巨瀬工リカ', '配角', 'Ayaka Asai', 'She is a member of the mass media club at Shuchi''in Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_126986.png'),
(168, 'Karen Kino', '紀かれん', '配角', 'Madoka Asahina', 'She is a member of the mass media club at Shuchi''in Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_126987.png'),
(168, 'Tsubame Koyasu', '子安つばめ', '配角', 'Haruka Fukuhara', 'Tsubame is a third-year student who is vice-captain of the cheer squad and a rhythmic gymnast. She is very popular. She encourages [Yuu](https://anilist.co/character/121102) in the cheering activities.', '/uploads/images/c_134326.png'),
(168, 'Tsubasa Tanuma ', '田沼翼', '配角', 'Taku Yashiro', 'He is a student in Shuchi''in highschool and always asks [Miyuki Shirogane](https://anilist.co/character/121101) for advice about love. [Kashiwagi](https://anilist.co/character/134330)''s boyfriend.', '/uploads/images/c_134327.png'),
(168, 'Maki Shijo', '四条眞妃', '配角', 'Kana Ichinose', 'Maki is a classmate and friend of [Nagisa](https://anilist.co/character/134330). She has short hair styled in short pigtails. She is friends with Nagisa and is secretly jealous of Nagisa''s relationship with her boyfriend, as she too liked Kashiwagi''s Boyfriend, but could not confess before. As a branch member of the Shinomiya clan, she is [Kaguya](https://anilist.co/character/120649)''s second cousin twice removed so she sometimes refers to Kaguya as "Auntie". [Miyuki](https://anilist.co/character/121101) and [Yuu](https://anilist.co/character/121102/Yuu-Ishigami) observe she acts very tsundere (cold on the outside but wanting to be affectionate), and similar to Kaguya in personality. She declares Yuu and Miyuki as her friends, due to their support in helping her process her failed romance, much to Kaguya''s horror', '/uploads/images/c_134328.png'),
(168, 'Moeha Fujiwara', '藤原萌葉', '配角', 'Ari Ozawa', 'Moeha is [Chika](https://anilist.co/character/121103)''s little sister who is in junior high. She is the student council vice-president at the junior high. She admires [Miyuki](https://anilist.co/character/121101) as well and hopes to confess someday. She has a habit of voicing dark ideas, which unnerve [Kaguya](https://anilist.co/character/120649) a great deal.', '/uploads/images/c_134329.png'),
(168, 'Nagisa Kashiwagi', '柏木渚', '配角', 'Momo Asakura', 'Nagisa is a classmate who occasionally asks [Kaguya](https://anilist.co/character/120649) about what to do in her relationships. [Tsubasa](https://anilist.co/character/134327)''s girlfriend.', '/uploads/images/c_134330.png'),
(168, 'Kobachi Osaragi', '大仏こばち', '配角', 'Rina Hidaka', 'Kobachi is [Miko](https://anilist.co/character/125886)''s classmate with the glasses and a member of the disciplinary committee. She has been looking after Miko for over 10 years. ~!Though she doesn''t love him in a romantic way, she has liked Yu Ishigami since middle school. She believes that Tsubame Koyasu is a kind person and is therefore supportive of Ishigami''s feelings for Tsubame, despite her friend Miko being in love with Ishigami as well.!~', '/uploads/images/c_134331.png'),
(168, 'Adolphe Pescarolo', 'アドルフ・ペスカローロ', '配角', 'Itaru Yamamoto', 'The Principal of Shuchi''in Academy He''s strict regarding school regulations, but knows how to garner the favor of students nonetheless. He helped Yu Ishigami get enrolled to Shuchi''in despite not finishing his task of making an apology letter. Despite being an authority figure within the school, he has shown comical disregard for school rules and discipline when it comes to his own actions, having been openly caught playing Pokemon Go on more than one occasion on school grounds while chastising nearby students for doing the same.', '/uploads/images/c_134892.jpg'),
(168, 'Shirogane no Chichi', '白銀の父', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', 'Father of [Miyuki](https://anilist.co/character/121101) and [Kei Shirogane](https://anilist.co/character/126144). ~!His wife left him and their factory shut down leaving him to not have any stable employment.!~ ~!He later becomes a youtuber.!~', '/uploads/images/c_134893.jpg'),
(168, 'Saburo Odajima', '小田島三郎', '配角', 'Haruo Satou', 'One of the Four Ramen Emperors of Tokyo. In the past, Saburo was in a relationship with [The Glutton Girl of Jinbocho](https://anilist.co/character/276380/Jinbouchou-no-Glutton-Girl), but he broke up with her over their polar opposite ramen styles, believing they''ll eventually end up at each other''s throats.', '/uploads/images/c_137169.png'),
(168, 'Rei Onodera', '小野寺麗', '配角', 'Yuuki Takada', 'She is a supporting character in the series. She was a member of Shuchi''in''s Red Cheer Team and is a classmate of Yu Ishigami and Miko Iino. She is a fairly calm girl under normal circumstances and is fairly open-minded, but when involved with the Cheer Team or the culture festival committee, she becomes far more energetic.', '/uploads/images/c_157369.png'),
(168, 'Kazeno', '風野', '配角', 'Taishi Murata', 'Kazeno is a third year high school student at Shuchi''in Academy and was the captain of the Cheer Club during the Sports Festival. He is a very energetic and caring person,cheering on his team and giving support to Yu Ishigami.', '/uploads/images/c_176218.jpg'),
(168, 'Kozue Makihara ', '槇原こずえ', '配角', 'Marika Kouno', 'Makkii-senhai is a first-year high school student at Shuchi''in Academy and the president of the Tabletop Gaming Club, As the president of the Tabletop Gaming Club, Kozue loves games. She also has a somewhat sadistic sense of humor, as shown by her cheerfully torturing Miko while gathering audio for their class'' event during the culture festival. She is shown to be very intelligent, regularly ranking among the top ten students in the freshman class during the end of semester exams.', '/uploads/images/c_176219.jpg'),
(168, 'Terashima', '寺島', '配角', 'Rina Honizumi', 'She''s a third-year high school student at Shuchi''in Academy and a member of the Tabletop Gaming Club which Chika Fujiwara is also a part of. Terashima, being demoted from Terako to Gigako, is a pun on metric prefixes', '/uploads/images/c_176220.png'),
(168, 'Daichi Fujiwara', '藤原大地', '配角', 'Hirohiko Kakegawa', 'A politician and the father of Toyomi, Chika and Moeha Fujiwara. Daichi is very well mannered and professional. He’s also overly protective of his daughters.', '/uploads/images/c_177065.jpg'),
(168, 'Zen Seito Kaichou', '生前徒会長', '配角', 'Nobunaga Shimazaki', 'The Previous Student Council President (real name unknown) is a supporting character in the series. He is a third-year high school student at Shuchi''in Academy and the president of the 66th Student Council. He is a third year student at Shuchi''in Academy and was the president of the School Council when Miyuki Shirogane was in his first year.', '/uploads/images/c_212389.jpg'),
(168, 'Momo Ryuuju', '龍珠桃', '配角', 'Saori Hayami', 'Momo Ryuuju is a supporting character in the series. She is the president of the Astronomy Club and one of The Impossible Girls. As a member of a yakuza family, she places little value on the school rules, as seen by her wearing a hat and playing games on her cellphone while on school grounds. She also has a short temper, and others view her as being threatening.', '/uploads/images/c_212390.jpg'),
(168, 'Gou Kazamatsuri', '風祭豪', '配角', 'Yuu Okano', 'Like Shirogane, he attended an outside middle school before entering Shuchiin. He enrolled in order to look for clues regarding the disappearance of his older brother. He serves as an assistant to the "Investigator of the financial world" Hajime Echizen and, after solving many difficult cases has finally been reunited with his brother.', '/uploads/images/c_275098.jpg'),
(168, 'Nao Hayasaka', '早坂奈央', '配角', 'Toa Yukinari', 'Nao Hayasaka is Ai''s mother. The two of them are shown to have a close relationship, though Ai is often upset by her mother''s job keeping them from spending much time together. She also works for the Shinomiya family. Daughter: [__Ai Hayasaka__](https://anilist.co/character/121104/) Spouse: __Masato Hayasaka__', '/uploads/images/c_275116.png'),
(168, 'Ouji', '王子', '配角', 'Haruki Ishiya', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_275117.png'),
(168, 'J Suzuki', '鈴木J', '配角', 'Takeshi Maruyama', 'A taxi driver and one of the Four Ramen Emperors of Tokyo.', '/uploads/images/c_275597.jpg'),
(168, 'Saburou Toyosaki', '豊崎三郎', '配角', 'Masamu Ono', 'In the past, he used underhanded tactics to sabotage [Shirogane](https://anilist.co/character/121101/)''s grades, but he now fights fair and square. He only opens his eyes when he shows his "true power."', '/uploads/images/c_275620.jpg'),
(168, 'Fujiwara Sofu', '藤原祖父', '配角', 'Kenta Sasa', 'The grandfather of the Fujiwara sisters.', '/uploads/images/c_275621.jpg'),
(168, 'Yume Atenbo', '阿天防ゆめ', '配角', 'Ai Kakuma', 'President of the Occult Research Club. Her grandfather is a high ranking Shinto priest. She loves to tease couples, so most of her predictions are excuses for sexual harassment.', '/uploads/images/c_276379.jpg'),
(168, 'Jinbouchou no Glutton Girl', '神保町のグラットンガール', '配角', '', 'One of the Four Ramen Emperors of Tokyo. She dated [Saburo Odajima](https://anilist.co/character/137169/Saburo-Odajima) in the past, but he broke up with her over their conflicting ramen styles. She felt unable to change her way of life and continued to pursue her style. In the present she had forgotten why she began eating ramen like this, until she happens to see [Chika Fujiwara](https://anilist.co/character/121103/Chika-Fujiwara)''s satisfaction from finishing a bowl of ramen.', '/uploads/images/c_276380.jpg'),
(168, 'Takahiko Tanuma', '田沼 尊彦', '配角', '', 'One of the Four Ramen Emperors of Tokyo.', '/uploads/images/c_276381.jpg'),
(168, 'Masaru Kobayashi', '小林マサル', '配角', 'Kouhei Amasaki', 'Treasurer of the culture festival committee. He has a crush on [Tsubame Koyasu](https://anilist.co/character/134326/Tsubame-Koyasu).', '/uploads/images/c_276519.jpg'),
(168, 'Teppei Tanaka', '田中哲平', '配角', 'Chiaki Kobayashi', 'A member of Shuchi''in Academy''s Public Relations team. He has a crush on [Tsubame Koyasu](https://anilist.co/character/134326/Tsubame-Koyasu).', '/uploads/images/c_276520.jpg'),
(168, 'Daiki Satou', '佐藤ダイキ', '配角', 'Gen Satou', 'Safety Officer of the Shuchi''in Academy culture festival committee. He has a crush on [Tsubame Koyasu](https://anilist.co/character/134326/Tsubame-Koyasu)', '/uploads/images/c_276521.jpg'),
(169, 'Denji', 'デンジ', '主角', 'Kikunosuke Toya', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8"), Devil Form - 180 cm (5''11") Denji is Chainsaw Man''s Human Form. He became Chainsaw Man after his dead body was resurrected by his pet dog, [Pochita](https://anilist.co/character/170266/Pochita). He is a Public Safety Devil Hunter who works under [Makima](https://anilist.co/character/137080/Makima) as a member of an experimental squad in Special Tokyo Division 4. He works alongside his partner [Power](https://anilist.co/character/137079/Power) and under the supervision of [Aki Hayakawa](https://anilist.co/character/137081/Aki-Hayakawa). Denji''s personality is both brash and naive as a result of being unable to have a formal education and socialize due to living in severe poverty. He comes off as rude and harsh, yet in an almost childish way. He doesn''t know how to be clever or wise but he knows how to lighten the mood. As the Chainsaw Devil, he has the ability to grow chainsaws out of his body.', '/uploads/images/c_130102.jpg'),
(169, 'Power', 'パワー', '主角', 'Fairouz Ai', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") Power is a fiend, a dead body possessed by a devil. She is a Public Safety Devil Hunter who works (against her will) under [Makima](https://anilist.co/character/137080/Makima) as a member of an experimental squad in Tokyo Special Division 4. She works alongside her partner [Denji](https://anilist.co/character/130102/Denji), and under supervision by [Aki Hayakawa](https://anilist.co/character/137081/Aki-Hayakawa). Power is childish, greedy, and almost entirely self-motivated. She tends to fights if she has something to gain and is certain of her victory and has no problems in running away from a fight where she is outmatched. She also feels the need to boast her superiority over her fellow Devil Hunters due to her status as a fiend. She has no loyalty to humanity, openly admitting that she will join the winning side. Power is often rude, unkempt, and feels as though those around her should clean up after her. She self-admittedly rarely bathes or flushes the toilet and sees humans as being sensitive for caring about their hygiene so much. As the Blood Fiend, she has the power to freely manipulate the blood within her own body.', '/uploads/images/c_137079.jpg'),
(169, 'Makima', 'マキマ', '主角', 'Tomori Kusunoki', '__Height:__ 168 cm (5''6") __Affiliation:__ Public Safety Devil Hunters Makima is a Public Safety Devil Hunter, who took [Denji](https://anilist.co/character/130102/Denji) as her human pet. She is one of the leading figures of Public Safety in Japan and has a considerable reputation among experienced Devil Hunters.', '/uploads/images/c_137080.jpg'),
(169, 'Aki Hayakawa', '早川アキ', '主角', 'Shougo Sakata', '__Height:__ 182 cm (6''0") __Devil Contracts:__ [Fox Devil](https://anilist.co/character/290671/Kitsune-no-Akuma), [Curse Devil](https://anilist.co/character/174265/Noroi-no-Akuma), ~![Future Devil](https://anilist.co/character/172887/Mirai-no-Akuma)!~ __Relatives:__ [Hahaoya Hayakawa](https://anilist.co/character/291241/Hayakawa-Hahaoya) (Mother), [Chichioya Hayakawa](https://anilist.co/character/291240/Hayakawa-Chichioya) (Father), [Taiyou Hayakawa](https://anilist.co/character/174261/Taiyou) (Younger Brother). A Public Safety Devil Hunter working under [Makima](https://anilist.co/character/137080/Makima) as a member of Tokyo Special Division 4. He is partnered with [Himeno](https://anilist.co/character/144596/Himeno) and tasked with supervising both [Power](https://anilist.co/character/137079/Power) and [Denji](https://anilist.co/character/130102/Denji). Aki Hayakawa generally appears to be a very stoic person. He acts mature and dependable when he''s with his fellow Devil hunters but is actually very soft when he is alone. He has a tendency to get attached to others easily, and hates to see people get hurt, especially his close friends. Aki''s primary goal and reasoning for becoming a Devil Hunter is to kill the [Gun Devil](https://anilist.co/character/208942/Juu-no-Akuma) to get revenge for his family. ~!He later loses his contract with the Fox Devil and gains a new contract with the Future Devil!~', '/uploads/images/c_137081.jpg'),
(169, 'Yuutarou Kurose', '黒瀬ユウタロウ', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', '__Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") __Devil Contract:__ ~![Punishment Devil](https://anilist.co/character/306237/Batsu-no-Akuma)!~ A Public Safety Devil Hunter from Kyoto. He is partnered with [Michiko Tendou](https://anilist.co/character/144595/Michiko-Tendou).', '/uploads/images/c_144592.jpg'),
(169, 'Kishibe', '岸辺', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', '__Height:__ 194 cm __Devil Contracts:__ ~!Claw Devil, Knife Devil, Needle Devil!~ A Public Safety Devil Hunter from Special Division 1. ~!After the assault on the Special Divisions, he became captain of the Special Division 4.!~ Kishibe is a grizzled man with scraggly facial hair and a stitched scar running across his left cheek from his mouth. He normally wears the standard Public Safety devil hunter uniform with a large overcoat. He has two piercings on his left ear, and one on his right ear. He is often seen with a hip flask which he frequently drinks from. Kishibe is a stoic, straightforward individual. Due to his immense strength and skill, he often undertakes his work with a calm formality, displaying little emotion as he does so. Though he tends to speak in a relaxed, polite manner, his actions often showcase an immense brutality garnered through many years of Devil Hunting. Though he sometimes expresses emotions such as surprise and sadness at certain events, his face and voice remain entirely neutral. Kishibe has been hunting devils for a long time, making him somewhat insane. He espouses a belief that the most fearsome devil hunters to devils isn''t the brave or the strong, but the craziest as they are the ones without fear. He admits that he enjoys booze, women and killing devils. ~!He is the former partner of [Quanxi](https://anilist.co/character/162123/Quanxi).!~', '/uploads/images/c_144593.jpg'),
(169, 'Kobeni Higashiyama', '東山コベニ', '配角', 'Karin Takahashi', '__Height:__ 155 cm A Public Safety Devil Hunter, she is a new recruit working under [Makima](https://anilist.co/character/137080/Makima) as a member of Tokyo Special Division 4. She is partnered with [Hirokazu Arai](https://anilist.co/character/174263). She is not very courageous and gets scared easily by devils. Kobeni is shown to easily crack under pressure and break into tears during serious moments. Even though Kobeni is timid, she is pretty talented as a devil hunter. When Kobeni gets into action, she has proven to be cool-headed and efficient in battle, only breaking down in a panic once the fighting is over. Kobeni chooses to keep her devil contract a secret.', '/uploads/images/c_144594.jpg'),
(169, 'Michiko Tendou', '天童ミチコ', '配角', 'Hitomi Ueda', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") __Devil Contracts:__ ~![Punishment Devil](https://anilist.co/character/306237/Batsu-no-Akuma)!~ A Public Safety Devil Hunter from Kyoto. She is partnered with [Yuutarou Kurose](https://anilist.co/character/144592/Yuutarou-Kurose).', '/uploads/images/c_144595.jpg'),
(169, 'Himeno', '姫野', '配角', 'Mariya Ise', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") __Devil Contract:__ [Ghost Devil](https://anilist.co/character/174262/Yuurei-no-Akuma) __Relatives:__ [Unnamed Younger Sister](https://anilist.co/character/174283/Himeno-no-Imouto) A Public Safety Devil Hunter, working under [Makima](https://anilist.co/character/137080/Makima) as a member of Tokyo Special Division 4. She is partnered with [Aki Hayakawa](https://anilist.co/character/137081/Aki-Hayakawa), whom she shares a close personal bond with. Himeno is shown to be a mature and experienced superior to the new recruits working under her. She generally carries herself with an upbeat body language and is capable of staying calm under extremely stressful situations. Himeno is very efficient and blunt in her duty as a Devil Hunter. Himeno is also shown to be a rather caring and empathetic person, however she does have a sterner side and little tolerance for behavior from new recruits that would endanger or harm her subordinates. Himeno holds an extremely pessimistic worldview as a result of having witnessed multiple partners die suddenly in her line of work. Her knowledge that Devil Hunters typically die as a result of their career combined with the teachings of her [master](https://anilist.co/character/144593/Kishibe) eventually lead to her developing a nicotine addiction as a coping mechanism. She also tends to acts extremely aloof and sexual, enjoying a hedonistic lifestyle. However, similarly to her smoking addiction, her hedonistic ways are not us', '/uploads/images/c_144596.jpg'),
(169, 'Reze', 'レゼ', '配角', 'Reina Ueda', 'Reze is a young girl who met [Denji](https://anilist.co/character/130102/Denji) in a phone cabin. She works at a local café and is a kind and gentle girl who seems to have a crush on Denji soon after meeting him. She laughs at his jokes and isn''t afraid to get close to and intimate with him. ~!‌‌‌‌‌‌‌‌She is secretly the Bomb Devil hybrid, owned by the Soviet Union and allied to the Gun Devil. Her true personality is manipulative and brutal, as she is shown killing many Devil Hunters without care or mercy. She does, however, not enjoy killing and prefers to avoid it, unless necessary for her mission. Her objective is to retrieve the Chainsaw Heart from Denji, but the feelings she developed for him quickly made things more complicated.!~', '/uploads/images/c_148740.jpg'),
(169, 'Tenshi no Akuma', '天使の悪魔', '配角', 'Maaya Uchida', '__Height:__ 155 cm Angel Devil is a devil who embodies the fear of angels, and a Public Safety Devil Hunter from Special Division 4. The Angel Devil is a unique case among devils having virtually no hostility towards humans. He dislikes being ordered around and doesn''t seem inclined towards combat. His extreme laziness holds him back from being a strong fighter and he often refuses to work, even claiming to prefer dying to working.', '/uploads/images/c_152231.jpg'),
(169, 'Bouryoku no Majin', '暴力の魔人', '配角', 'Yuuya Uchida', 'He is a Fiend and Public Safety Devil Hunter from Special Division 4. Despite his moniker as the Violence Fiend, he is extremely polite and straightforward. He apologized to [Beam](https://anilist.co/character/157232/Beam) after hitting him in self-defense and told the [Spider Devil](https://anilist.co/character/157277/Prinz) to evacuate the area when he mistook her for a human lady. ~!He is later partnered with [Kobeni Higashiyama](https://anilist.co/character/144594/Higashiyama-Kobeni) following the events of the Katana Man Arc!~', '/uploads/images/c_157231.jpg'),
(169, 'Beam', 'ビーム', '配角', 'Natsuki Hanae', '__Height:__ 165 cm (With fin: 176 cm) He is a Shark Fiend and a Public Safety Devil Hunter from Special Division 4. Beam is very eccentric. He often goes along with [Denji](https://anilist.co/character/130102/Denji)''s plans no matter how crazy they are due to having a lot of respect for the [Chainsaw Devil](https://anilist.co/character/170266/Pochita).', '/uploads/images/c_157232.jpg'),
(169, 'Eien no Akuma', '永遠の悪魔', '配角', 'Hironori Kondou', 'The Eien no Akuma is a devil that embodies the fear of eternity. He is the primary antagonist of the titular Eternity Devil arc.', '/uploads/images/c_157240.png'),
(169, 'Samurai Sword', 'サムライソード', '配角', 'Daiki Hamano', 'Samurai Sword is a human-devil hybrid who merged with the Katana Devil. His [grandfather](https://anilist.co/character/289198/Yakuza) was killed by [Denji](https://anilist.co/character/130102/Denji) when they initially fused with [Pochita](https://anilist.co/character/170266/Pochita), and because of that, he affiliated with the [Gun Devil](https://anilist.co/character/208942/Juu-no-Akuma) to get revenge on Denji. He works alongside [Akane Sawatari](https://anilist.co/character/174264/Akane-Sawatari) and other fellow members of the Yakuza.', '/uploads/images/c_157241.jpg'),
(169, 'Prinz', 'プリンシ', '配角', 'Saori Gotou', 'She is a devil who embodies the fear of spiders, and is a Public Safety Devil Hunter from Special Division 4. The Spider Devil usually takes a human shape so she tends to be friendly to humans and works as a devil hunter herself, however she will still kill people for just looking at her the wrong way.', '/uploads/images/c_157277.jpg'),
(169, 'Pochita', 'ポチタ', '配角', 'Shiori Izawa', 'Pochita appears to be a small red canine with a chainsaw like appendage protruding from the center of his head. Handles emerge from his body allowing him to be wielded like a chainsaw and his short tail is in the shape of a chainsaw''s pull cord. Unlike most devils, Pochita communicated solely through barks and whines like an actual dog.', '/uploads/images/c_170266.png'),
(169, 'Fushi', '伏', '配角', 'Chikahiro Kobayashi', 'A Public Safety Devil Hunter.', '/uploads/images/c_172885.png'),
(169, 'Mirai no Akuma', '未来の悪魔', '配角', 'Hiroki', 'The Future Devil is a devil that embodies the fear of the future. ~!After seeing [Aki Hayakawa](https://anilist.co/character/137081/Aki-Hayakawa)''s future, it made a contract with him, so he can see that future himself.!~', '/uploads/images/c_172887.png'),
(169, 'Taiyou', 'タイヨウ', '配角', 'Mana Nakatomi', '[Aki Hayakawa](https://anilist.co/character/137081)''s younger brother.', '/uploads/images/c_174261.png'),
(169, 'Yuurei no Akuma', '幽霊の悪魔', '配角', 'Hiroko Kiso', 'The Ghost Devil is a devil that embodies the fear of ghosts. **Known Contractors:** ~![Himeno](https://anilist.co/character/144596/Himeno)!~', '/uploads/images/c_174262.png'),
(169, 'Hirokazu Arai ', '荒井ヒロカズ', '配角', 'Taku Yashiro', '__Devil Contract:__ [Fox Devil](https://anilist.co/character/290671/Kitsune-no-Akuma) A Public Safety Devil Hunter, he is a new recruit working under [Makima](https://anilist.co/character/137080/Makima) as a member of Tokyo Special Division 4. He is partnered with [Kobeni Higashiyama](https://anilist.co/character/144594/Kobeni-Higashiyama). Hirokazu is shown to have high moral standards and cares a lot about his teammates and their wellbeing, going out of his way to assist and support others whenever possible, especially towards those who are sick. He was trained by [Himeno](https://anilist.co/character/144596) for half a year. Himeno has stated that what he lacks in ability, he makes up for in drive. He likes writing haikus in his free time as a hobby.', '/uploads/images/c_174263.png'),
(169, 'Akane Sawatari ', '沢渡アカネ', '配角', 'You Taichi', '__Devil Contract:__ [Snake Devil](https://anilist.co/character/174269/Hebi-no-Akuma) An enigmatic former Private Detective Hunter, she pledged her allegiance with the [Gun Devil](https://anilist.co/character/208942/Juu-no-Akuma) after making a contract with him and as a result, she seeks to obtain [Denji](https://anilist.co/character/130102/Denji)''s heart for her master. To that end, she conspires with members of the yakuzas, including the likes of [Katana Man](https://anilist.co/character/157241/Samurai-Sword), while acting as a weapons dealer for them in order to obtain Denji''s heart easier.', '/uploads/images/c_174264.png'),
(169, 'Noroi no Akuma', '呪いの悪魔', '配角', 'Yuuko Ueda', 'The Curse Devil is a Devil that embodies the fear of curses. __Known Contractors:__ ~![Aki Hayakawa](https://anilist.co/character/137081/Aki-Hayakawa), [Tolka''s Master](https://anilist.co/character/172888/Tolka-no-Shishou)!~', '/uploads/images/c_174265.png'),
(169, 'Madoka', '円', '配角', 'Tadashi Mutou', 'A Public Safety Devil Hunter. ~!After the assault on the Devil Hunters by the [Gun Devil](https://anilist.co/character/208942/Juu-no-Akuma-)''s associates, he was one of the few survivors and decided to leave his job as a Devil Hunter.!~', '/uploads/images/c_174267.png'),
(169, 'Namako no Akuma', 'ナマコの悪魔', '配角', '', 'The Sea Cucumber Devil is a devil that embodies the fear of sea cucumbers.', '/uploads/images/c_174270.png'),
(169, 'Nyaako', 'ニャーコ', '配角', '', '[Power](https://anilist.co/character/137079/Power)''s cat. ~!Now currently owned by [Denji](https://anilist.co/character/130102/Denji).!~', '/uploads/images/c_174271.png'),
(169, 'Koumori no Akuma', 'コウモリの悪魔', '配角', 'Kenichirou Matsuda', 'The Bat Devil is a devil who embodies the fear of bats. ~!He is the primary antagonist of the titular Bat Devil arc and a minor antagonist in the Justice Devil arc.!~', '/uploads/images/c_174272.png'),
(169, 'Sakana no Akuma', '魚の悪魔', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_174273.png'),
(169, 'Hiru no Akuma', 'ヒルの悪魔', '配角', 'Uko Tachibana', 'The Leech Devil is a devil that embodies the fear of leeches. ~!She is the secondary antagonist of the Bat Devil arc.!~', '/uploads/images/c_174275.png'),
(169, 'Zombie no Akuma', 'ゾンビの悪魔', '配角', 'Kouki Miyata', 'A devil contracted by [Denji''s](https://anilist.co/character/130102/Denji) yakuza employer at the beginning of the series and the first that Denji killed as the Chainsaw Man. Any person it bit would become a zombie.', '/uploads/images/c_174282.png'),
(169, 'Himeno no Imouto', '姫野の妹', '配角', 'Sara Matsumoto', '[Himeno](https://anilist.co/character/144596/Himeno)''s sister.', '/uploads/images/c_174283.png'),
(169, 'Yakuza', 'ヤクザ', '配角', 'Kousei Hirota', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_289198.png'),
(169, 'Kobun', '子分', '配角', 'Takashi Uezumiya', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_289199.png'),
(169, 'Tomato no Akuma', 'トマトの悪魔', '配角', 'Hinata Tadokoro', 'The Tomato Devil is a devil that embodies the fear of tomatoes. ~!The Tomato Devil was walking around a house, when [Denji](https://anilist.co/character/130102/Denji) with the help of [Pochita](https://anilist.co/character/170266/Pochita) went and killed him.!~', '/uploads/images/c_289200.jpg'),
(169, 'Buka A', '部下A', '配角', 'Mitsutoshi Shundou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_289201.png'),
