(171, 'Keiun', '慶雲', '配角', 'Shunichi Maki', '__Height:__ 210 cm Death row convict who is recruited to find the Elixir of Life. While undergoing training as a souhei (warrior monk), Keiun developed an obsession for weapons and armor and decided to take his training to the next level by slaughtering martials artists and stealing their weapons.', '/uploads/images/c_302522.jpg'),
(171, 'Akaginu', 'あか絹', '配角', '', 'Death row convict recruited to find the Elixir of Life. She is a cannibal with a taste for male flesh, especially after first making them succumb to her sexual temptations.', '/uploads/images/c_302523.jpg'),
(171, 'Hourubou', '法流坊', '配角', '', 'Death row convict recruited to find the Elixir of Life. Due to how his body is constructed, he has the unique ability to stretch or contort his limbs to restrain and constrict his opponents.', '/uploads/images/c_302525.jpg'),
(171, 'Makiya Moro', '茂籠牧耶', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 191 cm Death row convict recruited to find the Elixir of Life. Makiya had an ambition to overthrow the shogun and went about it by forming a cult that was based off of multiple religions.', '/uploads/images/c_302526.jpg'),
