(171, 'Tanio Seikichi', '谷尾清吉', '配角', '', 'Tanio Seikichi was a criminal put on death row and a candidate to partake in the expedition to Shinsenkyou.', '/uploads/images/c_306736.png'),
(171, 'Tesshin', '鉄心', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 173 cm Tesshin was a former Asaemon of the Yamada clan and the first apprentice of [Shion](https://anilist.co/character/137267/Shion).', '/uploads/images/c_306847.png'),
(171, 'Shuukan Kido', '木戸周監', '配角', '', 'Kido Shuukan was a well known vicious criminal.', '/uploads/images/c_306858.png'),
(171, 'Houko-tachi no Koe', '木人たちの声', '配角', 'Takahiro Sumi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_306994.jpg'),
(171, 'Shokushu Doushi', '道士', '配角', 'Takahiro Sumi', 'A subordinate of Lord Tensen who was ordered to check to see if [Aza Chōbei](https://anilist.co/character/137269/Aza-Choubei) and [Tōma](https://anilist.co/character/137261/Touma) were still in the pit becoming Tan.', '/uploads/images/c_307701.jpg'),
(172, 'Tanjirou Kamado', '竈門炭治郎', '主角', 'Natsuki Hanae', '__Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") __Combat Style:__ Water Breathing & ~!Sun Breathing!~ Tanjirou is kind by nature and has been described by others as having very gentle eyes. He has a great deal of determination and will not give up once he has a goal to achieve, an example being finding a cure for [Nezuko](https://anilist.co/character/127518). Even though he is relatively strong on his own, he isn''t opposed to asking others for help when he needs it. He is very protective of his friends and even more so of his younger sister. His biggest attribute is his ability to empathize with anyone, even demons. ~!Eventually, he discovers that he is a legendary Sun Breathing user.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126071.png'),
(172, 'Nezuko Kamado', '竈門禰豆子', '主角', 'Akari Kitou', '__Height:__ 153 cm (5''0") Transformed into a demon and left mute, Nezuko travels with her older brother [Tanjirou](https://anilist.co/character/126071/Kamado-Tanjirou) in a box on his back. She can change her size at will, and is a capable fighter when she needs to be, but has never killed or eaten any humans. Instead of gaining nourishment from humans, it seems that she recovers her energy by sleeping for long periods of time.', '/uploads/images/c_127518.png'),
(172, 'Inosuke Hashibira', '嘴平伊之助', '主角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', '**Height:** 164 cm (5''4") __Combat Style:__ Beast Breathing Inosuke is usually seen wearing a grey boar mask, with a shirtless version of the Demon hunter uniform. Without the mask he has messy shoulder length black hair and large green eyes with long eyelashes. He is described as having a girly looking face which greatly contrasts with his muscular body. Inosuke is extremely short-tempered and proud, and makes a big deal out of fighting opponents stronger than him claiming that''s his only hobby. He is a sore loser and is always trying to compete with Tanjiro and provoke him into fighting him, and usually failing. Due to growing up in the mountains by himself Inosuke has trouble interacting with others and only cares about himself most of the time. Though he''s often seen with 2 swords in hand, Inosuke is left-handed.', '/uploads/images/c_129130.jpg'),
(172, 'Zenitsu Agatsuma', '我妻善逸', '主角', 'Hiro Shimono', '__Height:__ 164 cm (5''4") __Combat Style:__ Thunder Breathing __Affiliation:__ Demon Slayer Corps __Occupation:__ Demon Slayer Zenitsu Agatsuma is one of the main protagonists of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba and along with [Inosuke Hashibira](https://anilist.co/character/129130/Inosuke-Hashibira), a traveling companion of [Tanjiro Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/126071/Tanjirou-Kamado) and [Nezuko Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/127518/Nezuko-Kamado).', '/uploads/images/c_129131.png'),
(172, 'Kyoujurou Rengoku', '煉獄杏寿郎', '主角', 'Satoshi Hino', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''10") __Combat Style:__ Flame Breathing He is greatly enthusiastic in regard to his duties as Flame Pillar and often cheerfully eccentric. He is amiable, kind and boasts extraordinary flame techniques and swordsmanship stemming from strict practice and discipline. He is an honourable warrior who adheres to his code of morals and principles that was instilled into him by his mother at a young age - the most significant being that those who were born strong have a duty to protect the weak.', '/uploads/images/c_129133.png'),
(172, 'Giyuu Tomioka', '冨岡義勇', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9½") __Combat Style:__ Water Breathing Water pillar in the Demon Killing Corps. Giyuu is reserved and displays little emotion, instead giving off a calm feeling most of the time. As a water breath user, Giyuu has created his own style. The eleventh style, Lull, gives him the ability to nullify any oncoming attacks, though rapid attacks can pierce through it. Though Giyuu is reserved, he does have a few friends, such as Tanjirou and, in the past, [Sabito](https://anilist.co/character/137809/Sabito). Shinobu often pokes fun at Giyuu and is merciless when doing so, such as saying he has no friends and that others don''t like him. ~!He is one of the only Pillar, aside from [Sanemi](https://anilist.co/character/137774/Sanemi-Shinazugawa), who survived during the final fight against [Muzan](https://anilist.co/character/129132/Muzan-Kibutsuji).!~', '/uploads/images/c_130050.png'),
(172, 'Muichirou Tokitou', '時透無一郎', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") __Combat Style:__ Mist Breathing Muichiro is an air-headed individual who seems to constantly wander off in thought and never focus on one thing. Impassive and, at times, obtuse, he tends to think only for himself and operates on logic alone, never letting emotion guide him. Despite this, he has been shown to get serious when it is required and is devoted to his position as the Demon Slayer Corps'' Mist Hashira. Alternatively, he seems to display a cold and arrogant side as well. ~!He later died at Kokushibo''s hand.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136069.png'),
(172, 'Shinobu Kochou', '胡蝶しのぶ', '配角', 'Saori Hayami', '__Height:__ 151 cm (4''11") __Combat Style:__ Insect Breathing Shinobu is a demon slayer and the Insect Pillar of the Demon Killing Corps. She is 18 years old and one of two female pillars. Shinobu appears rather laid back, and always has a smile on her face regardless of the situation. Despite her relaxed exterior and her initial claim of wanting to get along with demons, she can be rather cruel and harbors a great deal of anger towards them. She is generally kind to other humans, but is rather sadistic in her treatment of demons. As a pillar, she is a top-class fighter despite her small stature. She is also well-versed in medical knowledge, and can concoct poisons and medicines alike. ~!During the Infinity Castle Arc, she encounters the Upper 2 demon [Douma](https://anilist.co/character/144591) and is slain by him in a fight. However, since she poisoned herself before the fight, Douma is severely incapacitated after eating her.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136070.png'),
(172, 'Tengen Uzui', '宇髄天元', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', '__Height:__ 198 cm (6''6") __Combat Style:__ Sound Breathing A Demon Slayer, and the Sound Pillar of the Demon Slayer Corps. Tengen is a very eccentric person, always wanting to complete actions as flashy as possible. Although he has displayed an uncaring and forceful attitude towards some people, he also has a caring side that is mainly only shown towards his most treasured ones, most notably his three wives, [Makio](https://anilist.co/character/250554), [Suma](https://anilist.co/character/250555), and [Hinatsuru](https://anilist.co/character/250556). He also shows a somewhat nicer side towards [Tanjiro](https://anilist.co/character/126071) after their mission and starts to accept him more as the series goes on.', '/uploads/images/c_136071.png'),
(172, 'Mitsuri Kanroji', '甘露寺蜜璃', '配角', 'Kana Hanazawa', '__Height:__ 167 cm (5''5") __Combat Style:__ Love Breathing Demon Hunter and the Love Pillar of the Demon Killing Corps. Mitsuri is a soft and kind person. She is very emotional and passionate, constantly complimenting people in her head, which probably contributes to her nickname of "the Hashira of Love". Although she is rather shy and is easily flustered, she is always kind to others, most notably towards [Obanai](https://anilist.co/character/137777), whom she appears to share a strong bond with. Besides her rather emotional personality, she can also come off as somewhat childish at times. ~!She was taught by Rengoku to use the flame breathing. However, although Mitsuri has learnt it, she was not as skillful with it and cannot fight to her fullest using it, leading her to solely develop the Love Breathing.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136072.png'),
(172, 'Sanemi Shinazugawa', '不死川実弥', '配角', 'Tomokazu Seki', '__Height:__ 179cm (5''10½") Demon Hunter and the Wind Pillar of the Demon Killing Corps. He is the older brother of [Genya Shinazugawa](https://anilist.co/character/137776). Sanemi specializes in Wind Breathing, which has 9 forms. The technique consists of drawing the air from around the user to create whirlwind attacks that follow the user''s movements. Form names include Dust Whirlwind Cutter, Claws-Purifying Wind, Clean Storm Wind Tree, Rising Dust Storm, Cold Mountain Wind, Black Wind Mountain Mist, Gale - Sudden Gusts, Primary Gale Slash, and Idaten Typhoon.', '/uploads/images/c_137774.png'),
(172, 'Genya Shinazugawa', '不死川玄弥', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 180 cm (5''11") Genya Is a Demon Hunter of the Demon Killing Corps. He is also the younger brother of the Wind Pillar [Sanemi Shinazugawa](https://anilist.co/character/137774). ~! Due to his lack of breath forms he is dependent on using his shotgun and demon form. His shotgun pelts are made from sun steel to be effective against demons. His demon form is active when he digests anything from a demon to gain demon like strength and abilities. He is the only demon hunter to have this ability given that it is drastically rare !~', '/uploads/images/c_137776.jpg'),
(172, 'Obanai Iguro', '伊黒小芭内', '配角', 'Kenichi Suzumura', '__Height:__ 162 cm (5''3") Obanai is a Demon Slayer and the Snake Pillar of the Demon Slayer Corps. A young man of short stature and a pale complexion. He has straight-edged black hair of varying lengths, the longest reaching down to his shoulders and the shortest stopping at his cheekbones, which he wears down with two shorter strands hanging between his eyes. He wears a navy blue version of the standard Demon Slayer uniform, along with a black and white pinstriped haori, the hem and cuffs of which are striped lengthways rather than vertically, which covers his hands. Obanai also sports bandages in place of the leg-wraps around his calves, as well as another set of bandages that cover his mouth, and blue-strapped zori on his feet. He is also always seen with his white snake, Kaburamaru, wrapped around his shoulders.', '/uploads/images/c_137777.jpg'),
(172, 'Gyoumei Himejima', '悲鳴嶼行冥', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', '__Height:__ 220cm (7''2½") He is a Demon Slayer and the Stone Hashira of the Demon Slayer Corps. Gyomei also serves as the mentor of Genya Shinazugawa.', '/uploads/images/c_137778.jpg'),
(172, 'Kagaya Ubuyashiki', '産屋敷耀哉', '配角', 'Toshiyuki Morikawa', 'He is the head of the Ubuyashiki Family and 97th leader of the Demon Slayer Corps known mainly as "Oyakata-sama" ("Master") by his subordinates and peers.', '/uploads/images/c_137808.png'),
(172, 'Matsuemon Tennouji', '天王寺松右衛門', '配角', 'Takumi Yamazaki', 'Kasugai Crow assigned to Tanjirou Kamado. Very intelligent and seems to have a large ego.', '/uploads/images/c_137810.png'),
(172, 'Kanao Tsuyuri', '栗花落カナヲ', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 156 cm (5''1½") Kanao Tsuyuri is a Demon Hunter and the Tsuguko, who is personally looked after by the Demon Killing Corps'' Pillars. She uses Flower Breathing. ~!When Kanao is first introduced, she is an indecisive and quiet girl due to the abuse she endured in her past before meeting the Kocho sisters. She became unable to make decisions by herself and repressed her emotions as a defense mechanism. In order to help rectify this, Kanae gave her a coin to flip to decide which path to follow when she didn''t know what to do. Later on, Tanjiro helps Kanao overcome her indecisiveness and Kanao soon becomes more confident in making decisions with or without her coin. Kanao and Tanjiro would eventually marry and start a family, having two great-great-grandchildren by the names of [Kanata Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/171144/Kanata-Kamado) and [Sumihiko Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/171145/Sumihiko-Kamado) between them.!~', '/uploads/images/c_139038.png'),
(172, 'Gyuutarou', '妓夫太郎', '配角', '', '~!Gyuutarou is a member of the Twelve Demon Moons, holding the position of Upper Moon Six, which he shares with his younger sister Daki.!~', '/uploads/images/c_139735.png'),
(172, 'Enmu', '魘夢', '配角', 'Daisuke Hirakawa', '__Race:__ Demon __Height:__ 168 cm (5''6") Enmu is a sadistic and cruel demon Who is only driven by his liking to making humans suffer. He is shown to be completely loyal to [Muzan](https://anilist.co/character/129132/Kibutsuji-Muzan). Caring about him probably more than what he cares about himself. He also hates the other lower moons, labeling them as "Fools". ~!Enmu was a member of the Twelve Demon Moons, having held the position of Lower Moon One.!~ ~!Enmu was aboard the infinity train, and starts eating humans in order to make himself more powerful. He knocks them unconscious, promising them that he will gift them with nice and peaceful dreams but in reality, after giving them a nice dream, he always likes to follow it up with a horrifying nightmare because he thinks it is so much fun.!~ ~!In the end, Tanjiro''s Hinokami Kagura cuts through Enmu''s train spine and kills him.!~', '/uploads/images/c_139737.png'),
(172, 'Akaza', '猗窩座', '配角', 'Akira Ishida', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") A member of the Twelve Demon Moons, holding the position of Upper Moon Three.', '/uploads/images/c_141694.png'),
(172, 'Hinaki Ubuyashiki', '産屋敷 ひなき', '配角', '', 'Hinaki Ubuyashiki is one of the older daughters of Kagaya Ubuyashiki.', '/uploads/images/c_167549.png'),
(172, 'Ruka Rengoku', '煉獄瑠火', '配角', 'Megumi Toyoguchi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_193378.jpg'),
(172, 'Shinjurou Rengoku', '煉獄槇寿郎', '配角', 'Rikiya Koyama', 'Father of Kyoujurou and Senjurou.', '/uploads/images/c_193379.jpg'),
(172, 'Senjurou Rengoku', '煉獄千寿郎', '配角', 'Junya Enoki', 'Younger brother of Kyoujurou Rengoku and son of Shinjurou Rengoku and Ruka Rengoku.', '/uploads/images/c_193380.png'),
(172, 'Kie Kamado', '竈門葵枝', '配角', 'Houko Kuwashima', 'Kie is Tanjiro Kamado''s mother.', '/uploads/images/c_196849.png'),
(172, 'Shigeru Kamado', '竈門茂', '配角', 'Kaede Hondo', 'Shigeru was Tanjiro''s second youngest brother.', '/uploads/images/c_196851.png'),
(172, 'Takeo Kamado', '竈門竹雄', '配角', 'You Taichi', 'Takeo was Tanjiro Kamado''s first younger brother.', '/uploads/images/c_196852.png'),
(172, 'Hanako Kamado', '竈門花子', '配角', 'Konomi Kohara', 'Hanako was Tanjiro Kamado''s youngest sister.', '/uploads/images/c_196853.png'),
(172, 'Tanjurou Kamado', '竈門炭十郎', '配角', 'Shinichirou Miki', 'Tanjuro Kamadou was the husband of Kie Kamado and the late father of Tanjiro, Nezuko, Takeo, Hanako, Shigeru, and Rokuta. Tanjuro was a quiet, calculating, forgiving, charismatic and loving person. He had a peaceful relationship with his family and regularly lectured Tanjiro about life. While he appeared calm on the outside, he showed a decent, noble aura with a quiet perception to his surroundings. According to his son, he did not like standing out or displaying his true abilities to others. However, if his family is in danger, he would not hesitate to protect them and shows no mercy towards the enemy. ~!Despite not being a Demon Slayer and having a tragic disease that makes his body incredibly frail, Tanjuro was shown to be a phenomenally strong individual. He was born with a demon slayer mark on his forehead, had the ability to access the transparent world, and was constantly using the selfless state.!~', '/uploads/images/c_206330.png'),
(172, 'Rokuta Kamado', '竈門六太', '配角', 'Aoi Koga', 'Tanjiro''s youngest sibling.', '/uploads/images/c_207857.jpg'),
(172, 'Amane Ubuyashiki', '産屋敷あまね', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 167cm (5''6") She is the wife and caretaker of [Kagaya Ubuyashiki](https://anilist.co/character/137808/Kagaya-Ubuyashiki) and the mother of Hinaki Ubuyashiki, Nichika Ubuyashiki, Kiriya Ubuyashiki, Kanata Ubuyashiki and Kuina Ubuyashiki. Her maiden name is Amane Himorogi.', '/uploads/images/c_221375.jpg'),
(172, 'Fuku', 'ふく', '配角', 'Inori Minase', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_251681.jpg'),
(172, 'Kirisaki', '切り裂き', '配角', 'Kentarou Itou', 'Kirisaki was the nickname given to a demon that appeared during the investigation of the Mugen Train and was responsible for a number of human attacks. ~!He was defeated by Kyoujurou Rengoku.!~', '/uploads/images/c_252147.jpg'),
(172, 'Tomi', 'トミ', '配角', 'Kikuko Inoue', 'A bento vendor. ~!She and her daughter were previously saved from a demon 20 years earlier by [Kyoujurou Rengoku''s](https://anilist.co/character/129133) father, [Shinjurou](https://anilist.co/character/193379).!~', '/uploads/images/c_257801.png'),
(172, 'Onisatsu Taishi', '鬼殺隊士', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_285838.jpg'),
(172, 'Shoujo', '少女', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_285839.jpg'),
(172, 'Seinen', '青年', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_285841.jpg'),
(172, 'Sobaya', '蕎麦屋', '配角', 'Issei Futamata', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_285843.jpg'),
(172, 'Kikanshi', '機関士', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', 'A train engineer appears as a minor antagonist in the Mugen Train Arc of Kimetsu No Yaiba. He is a civilian recruited by Enmu to be the train engineer of the Mugen Train.', '/uploads/images/c_310303.jpg'),
(172, 'Shashou', '車掌', '配角', 'Jun  Kasama', 'A train conductor appeared as a minor antagonist in the Mugen Train Arc of Kimetsu No Yaiba. He was a civilian who was recruited by Enmu to trap the Demon Slayers into his Blood Demon Art.', '/uploads/images/c_310305.jpg'),
(173, 'Hitori Gotou', '後藤ひとり', '主角', 'Yoshino Aoyama', 'Gotou Hitori is a shy, gloomy high-schooler who started learning guitar after seeing rock bands on TV, in the hope that she too could become as popular as them. However, after 2 years she has yet to make a single friend or join a band. She instead sits in her closet at home, recording guitar covers and posting them to her YouTube channel, "guitarhero", on which she has amassed a reasonable following.', '/uploads/images/c_257562.png'),
(173, 'Nijika Ijichi', '伊地知虹夏', '主角', 'Sayumi Suzushiro', 'An energetic and cheerful second-year high school student. She is the drummer of Kessoku Band and the organizer who takes care of [Hitori](https://anilist.co/character/257562). She has an older sister, [Seika](https://anilist.co/character/289054), who is the manager of the live house "STARRY" and has a special feeling for the live house.', '/uploads/images/c_261674.png'),
(173, 'Ryou Yamada', '山田リョウ', '主角', 'Saku Mizuno', 'A cool and solitary second year of high school. She is in charge of the bass of Kessoku Band. She''s the best friend of [Nijika](https://anilist.co/character/261674). Her hobbies are out of the ordinary, and she rejoices when called a weirdo. She lives with a wealthy family, but she spends much of her money on instruments and always runs out of money. She occasionally eats weeds to get rid of her hunger.', '/uploads/images/c_264529.png'),
(173, 'Ikuyo Kita', '喜多郁代', '主角', 'Ikumi Hasegawa', 'A bright and popular first year of high school. She is in charge of the guitar and vocals of Kessoku Band. She is a cheerful character who likes to interact with people and can talk to her with a smile without hesitation, even when she meets her for the first time. She longs for [Ryo](https://anilist.co/character/264529), and her feelings can go too far. She often takes photos and uploads to Isosta.', '/uploads/images/c_266041.png'),
(173, 'Seika Ijichi', '伊地知星歌', '配角', 'Maaya Uchida', 'Nijika''s older sister and manager of the live house "STARRY".', '/uploads/images/c_289054.png'),
(173, 'PA-san', 'PAさん', '配角', 'Kotori Koiwai', '__Height:__ 162cm Mysterious looking female PA engineer with a mouth piercing. In her private life, she is active as a virtual Youtuber under the name "Otogi Alto" producing gameplay videos.', '/uploads/images/c_289055.jpg'),
