(173, 'Eliza Shimizu', '清水イライザ', '配角', 'Sally Amaki', 'Guitarist of the band "SICK HACK". She originally came from England, and moved to Japan 3 years ago so she could attend Comiket ("Comima" in the Japanese release of the manga) and be in an anison cover band. On top of her band activities, she also makes doujinshi.', '/uploads/images/c_293862.png'),
