(174, 'Cid Kagenou', 'シド・カゲノー', '主角', 'Seiichirou Yamashita', '__Race:__ Human Cid Kagenou, under the moniker of "Shadow," is the founder and leader of the secret organization "Shadow Garden." He founded the organization to help realize his fantasy of becoming an “Eminence in Shadow". However, unbeknownst to him, his fabrications are often revealed to be quite genuine in reality. Cid is the reincarnation of Minoru Kagenou. (Source: The Eminence in Shadow Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_136837.jpg'),
(174, 'Gamma', 'ガンマ', '配角', 'Suzuko Mimori', '__Race:__ Elf Gamma is a member of Shadow Garden, being third of the original Seven Shadows as well as the director of the Mitsugoshi Company. Despite her lack of coordination, Gamma''s knowledge has allowed her to recreate many of the items described by her master [Shadow](https://anilist.co/character/136837/Cid-Kagenou) to sell as Mitsugoshi''s exclusive products. (Source: To Be a Power in the Shadows! Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_162245.jpg'),
(174, 'Alpha', 'アルファ', '主角', 'Asami Seto', '__Race:__ Elf Alpha is the second-in-command of Shadow Garden. After being cured of Demon Possession by [Cid Kagenou](https://anilist.co/character/136837/Cid-Kagenou), she would devote her life to his cause, becoming the first member to be recruited into his organization, Shadow Garden. ~!She is the descendant of the elf [Hero Olivier](https://anilist.co/character/204203/Olivier).!~', '/uploads/images/c_162246.jpg'),
(174, 'Beta', 'ベータ', '主角', 'Inori Minase', '__Race:__ Elf Beta is the second member of Shadow Garden, supporting her master [Shadow](https://anilist.co/character/136837/Cid-Kagenou) against the Order of Diabolos. ~!Outside of her Shadow Garden activities, she adopts the identity of Natsume Kafka, an up-and-coming author of numerous original pieces of literature.!~', '/uploads/images/c_162247.jpg'),
(174, 'Delta', 'デルタ', '配角', 'Fairouz Ai', '__Race:__ Beastkin Delta is a member of Shadow Garden, being fourth of the original Shadow Seven to join the organization after her Demonic Possession was healed by her master [Shadow](https://anilist.co/character/136837/Cid-Kagenou). As the most physically gifted of the Seven, Delta is also often the most destructive and brutal of the group due to her lack of sense and self-control. (Source: To Be a Power in the Shadows! Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_162248.jpg'),
(174, 'Epsilon', 'イプシロン', '配角', 'Hisako Kanemoto', '__Race:__ Elf Epsilon is the fifth member of Shadow Garden. Due to her insecurities with having a flat-chest, she manipulated her slime bodysuit every year to slowly increase the mass on her chest, eventually developing a fake large breast. As a consequence of this, she developed extreme magic control earning her the title, "The Precision."', '/uploads/images/c_162249.jpg'),
(174, 'Claire Kagenou', 'クレア・カゲノー', '配角', 'Rina Hidaka', '__Race:__ Human Claire is the older sister of [Cid Kagenou](https://anilist.co/character/136837/Cid-Kagenou) and heir to the Kagenou Family. (Source: To Be a Power in the Shadows! Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_168798.jpg'),
(174, 'Alexia Midgar', 'アレクシア・ミドガル', '配角', 'Kana Hanazawa', '__Race:__ Human Alexia Midgar is the second princess of the Kingdom of Midgar and younger sister of [Iris Midgar](https://anilist.co/character/204204/Iris--Midgar). She is also a student of Midgar Royal Spellsword Academy. (Source: To Be a Power in the Shadows! Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_168799.jpg'),
(174, 'Rose Oriana', 'ローズ・オリアナ', '配角', 'Haruka Shiraishi', '__Race:__ Human Rosa Oriana is a noble Princess from the Oriana kingdom. She is known for being a genius in art in her kingdom. However, she came to Midgar Royal Spellsword Academy in order to learn swordsmanship. ~!Later [Alpha](https://anilist.co/character/162246/Alpha) discovered Rose, who became a fugitive for assassinating her father and was then offered membership into Shadow Garden.!~', '/uploads/images/c_168800.jpg'),
(174, 'Nu', 'ニュー', '配角', 'Maaya Uchida', '__Race:__ Human Nu is the thirteenth member of Shadow Garden and an employee of Mitsugoshi Company. (Source: To Be a Power in the Shadows! Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_168968.jpg'),
(174, 'Sherry Barnett', 'シェリー・バーネット', '配角', 'Saya Aizawa', '__Race:__ Human Sherry Barnett is a student of Midgar Royal Spellsword Academy. She is also the adopted daughter of [Lutheran Barnett](https://anilist.co/character/291390/Barnett-Lutheran).', '/uploads/images/c_197922.jpg'),
(174, 'Annerose Nichtsehen', 'アンネローゼ・フシアナス', '配角', 'Shion Wakayama', '__Race:__ Human She is a Dark Knight of the Velgalta Empire. Originally a member of "Velgalta''s Seven Blades," she abandoned her position to embark on a journey of self-improvement. While participating in the Bushin Festival to test her strength, she was left impressed by [Mundane Mann](https://anilist.co/character/136837/Kagenou-Cid)''s ability and is now training to reach his level. While she possesses skills and brains, she can sometimes be a little klutzy.', '/uploads/images/c_204202.jpg'),
(174, 'Olivier', 'オリヴィエ', '配角', '', '__Race:__ Elf Olivier is one of the three heroes that managed to defeat the demon Diabolos. As a result, her descendants were cursed by the demon. (Source: To Be a Power in the Shadows! Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_204203.png'),
(174, 'Iris  Midgar', 'アイリス・ミドガル', '配角', 'Youko Hikasa', '__Race:__ Human Iris Midgar is the first princess of the Kingdom of Midgar and older sister of [Alexia Midgar](https://anilist.co/character/168799/Alexia-Midgar). She is also leader of the Crimson Order. (Source: *The Eminence in Shadow* Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_204204.jpg'),
(174, 'Aurora', 'アウロラ', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', '__Race:__ Human A woman known as the Calamity Witch who once brought chaos and destruction to the world. In the Goddess'' Trial in the Sacred Land, she is summoned in reaction to Cid''s presence and does battle with him in the form of Shadow. Her body is sealed in the sanctuary, and after helping Cid to escape she disappears together with its destruction. ~!Aurora''s true identity is the great demon Diabolos but it is unknown if she founded the Order of Diabolos or cursed the three heroes with possession. !~', '/uploads/images/c_215409.png'),
(174, 'Akane Nishino', '西野アカネ', '配角', 'Yui Horie', '__Race:__ Human Akane Nishino is the daughter of the CEO of Nishino Conglomerate and the former classmate of Minoru Kagenou, Cid''s pre-reincarnated self.', '/uploads/images/c_229652.png'),
(174, 'Beatrix', 'ベアトリクス', '配角', 'Mikako Komatsu', '__Race:__ Elf Beatrix is the champion of the God of War Tournament. ~!She is presumed to be the long lost aunt of [Alpha](https://anilist.co/character/162246/Alpha).!~', '/uploads/images/c_229656.png'),
(174, 'No.665', '665番', '配角', 'Hina Youmiya', '__Race:__ Elf 665 is a member of Shadow Garden''s Numbers and is in a squad with [664](https://anilist.co/character/229662/No664) and 666. She has a calm personality and is good at providing support.', '/uploads/images/c_229658.png'),
(174, 'Mordred', 'モードレッド', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_229659.png'),
(174, 'No.664', '664番', '配角', 'Miyu Tomita', '664 is a member of Shadow Garden''s Numbers and is the squad leader of the squad with [665](https://anilist.co/character/229658/No665) and 666. She has a serious personality, but is kind at heart.', '/uploads/images/c_229662.png'),
(174, 'Zeta', 'ゼータ', '配角', 'Ayaka Asai', '__Race:__ Beastkin Zeta is the sixth member of Shadow Garden, being one of the original Seven Shadows. She usually travels around the world alone gathering intelligence.', '/uploads/images/c_264565.png'),
(174, 'Hyoro Gali', 'ヒョロ・ガリ', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'One of Cid Kageno''s chosen "friends" he is using to blend in as a background character', '/uploads/images/c_287012.jpg'),
(174, 'Jaga Imo', 'ジャガ・イモ', '配角', 'Shin Matsushige', 'One of Cid Kagenou''s chosen "friends" to help him blend in as a background character', '/uploads/images/c_287013.jpg'),
(174, 'Yuukai-han', '誘拐犯', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_289166.jpg'),
(174, 'Eta', 'イータ', '配角', 'Reina Kondou', '__Race:__ Elf Eta is the seventh member of Shadow Garden, being one of the original Seven Shadows. She specializes and is in charge of the research faction of Shadow Garden and as a result has her own laboratory. She is known as Eta Lloyd Wright, the genius architect, whose work won unanimous first place in an Architecture of the Year.', '/uploads/images/c_289297.jpg'),
(174, 'Zenon Griffey', 'ゼノン・グリフィ', '配角', 'Masaya Matsukaze', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_290064.jpg'),
(174, 'Glen', 'ゲレン', '配角', 'Shouta Yamamoto', 'Vice-Commander of the Crimson Order', '/uploads/images/c_290846.jpg'),
(174, 'Marco Granger', 'マルコ・グレンジャー', '配角', 'Rikuya Yasuda', 'Knight of the Crimson Order', '/uploads/images/c_290847.jpg'),
(174, 'Lutheran Barnett', 'ルスラン・バーネット', '配角', 'Houchuu Ootsuka', 'Assistant Principal of Midgar Academy for Dark Knights and adoptive father to [Sherry Barnett](https://anilist.co/character/197922/Sherry-Barnett).', '/uploads/images/c_291390.jpg'),
(174, 'Rex', 'レックス', '配角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_291391.jpg'),
(174, 'Jack Nelson', 'ジャック・ネルソン', '配角', 'Mugihito', 'Acting Archbishop', '/uploads/images/c_294236.jpg'),
(174, 'Kai', 'カイ', '配角', 'Mayu Minami', 'Member of Shadow Garden, and one of the Numbers (no. 22). She is a subordinate of [Epsilon](https://anilist.co/character/162249). She has a serious and stern demeanor but is surprisingly shy and blushes often.', '/uploads/images/c_295292.png'),
(174, 'Omega', 'オメガ', '配角', 'Ryouko Maekawa', 'Member of Shadow Garden, and one of the Numbers (No. 24). She is a subordinate of [Epsilon](https://anilist.co/character/162249). Omega is usually calm and collected but is troubled by her tendency to laugh at silly jokes.', '/uploads/images/c_295293.png'),
(174, 'Cid no Chichi', 'シドの父', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Mamiya', 'Head of the Kagenou family and father to [Cid](https://anilist.co/character/136837) and [Claire](https://anilist.co/character/168798).', '/uploads/images/c_295296.png'),
(174, 'Cid no Haha', 'シドの母', '配角', 'Mai Nakahara', 'Mother of [Cid](https://anilist.co/character/136837) and [Claire](https://anilist.co/character/168798).', '/uploads/images/c_295297.png'),
(174, 'Doumoto', '胴元', '配角', 'Reigo Yamaguchi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_295298.png'),
(174, 'Olba', 'オルバ', '配角', 'Rikiya Koyama', 'A Viscount who was a member of the Cult of Diabolos. He was the mastermind behind the kidnapping of [Claire Kagenou](https://anilist.co/character/168798). ~!Despite consuming multiple of the strength increasing pills, he was easily overwhelmed by [Shadow](https://anilist.co/character/136837) and was soon slain with a single stroke.!~', '/uploads/images/c_295300.png'),
(174, 'Hakui no Otoko', '白衣の男', '配角', 'Hirofumi Nojima', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_295305.jpg'),
(174, 'Tsugiide Makkenjii', 'ツギーデ・マッケンジー', '配角', 'Ryuunosuke Watanuki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_296392.jpg'),
(174, 'Quinton', 'クイントン', '配角', 'Kenta Miyake', 'A ferocious swordsman who has participated in the Bushin Festival many times.', '/uploads/images/c_296393.jpg'),
(174, 'Goldou Kinmekki', 'ゴルドー・キンメッキ', '配角', 'Kazuyuki Okitsu', 'A swordsman who participated in the God of War Tournament. ~!While publicly known as the Unbeaten Legend and Victorious Golden Dragon, in reality, he is a coward whose unbeaten streak was the result of him forfeiting matches he was unsure he''d win.!~', '/uploads/images/c_296394.jpg'),
(174, 'Raphael Oriana', 'ラファエロ・オリアナ', '配角', 'Yutaka Aoyama', 'King of the Oriana Kingdom and [Rose](https://anilist.co/character/168800)''s father.', '/uploads/images/c_297028.jpg'),
(174, 'Doem Ketsuhat', 'ドエム・ケツハット', '配角', 'Shou Hayami', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_297029.jpg'),
(174, 'Joshi Seito', '女子生徒', '配角', 'Misato Matsuoka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_297816.jpg'),
(174, 'Danshi Seito', '男子生徒', '配角', 'Haruki Ishiya', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_297817.jpg'),
(174, 'Shinpan', '審判', '配角', 'Junichi Yanagita', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_297818.png'),
(174, 'Kurofuku', '黒服', '配角', 'Ken Mizukoshi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_297819.jpg'),
(174, 'Midgar Kokuou', 'ミドガル国王', '配角', 'Satoshi Mikami', 'King of the Midgar Kingdom and father of [Alexia](https://anilist.co/character/168799) and [Iris](https://anilist.co/character/204204).', '/uploads/images/c_298257.jpg'),
(174, 'Lambda', 'ラムダ', '配角', 'Ikumi Hasegawa', 'Member of Shadow Garden, and one of The Numbers (No. 11). She is in charge of training new recruits.', '/uploads/images/c_298851.jpg'),
(175, 'Satoru Gojou', '五条悟', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Height:__ 190 cm (6''3") __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer, Teacher __Affiliation:__ Tokyo Metropolitan Curse Technical College, Gojou Family __Grade:__ Special Grade Sorcerer __Cursed Technique:__ Six Eyes, Limitless Satoru Gojou is one of the main protagonists of the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is a special-grade jujutsu sorcerer and is widely recognized as the strongest in the world. Satoru is the pride of the Gojou Family, the first person to inherit both the Limitless and the Six Eyes in four hundred years. He works as a teacher at the Tokyo Jujutsu High and uses his influence to protect and train strong young allies', '/uploads/images/c_127691.png'),
(175, 'Yuuta Okkotsu', '乙骨憂太', '主角', 'Megumi Ogata', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Special Grade Sorcerer The main protagonist of Jujutsu Kaisen prequel series [Tokyo Metropolitan Curse Technical School](https://anilist.co/manga/105469/Tokyo-Toritsu-Jujutsu-Kodo-Senmon-Gakko). He was initially a Special Grade Cursed Victim haunted by his late childhood friend, [Rika Orimoto](https://anilist.co/character/208533/Orimoto-Rika). [Satoru Gojou](https://anilist.co/character/127691/Satoru-Gojou) mentored Yuuta and enrolled him at Tokyo Jujutsu High.', '/uploads/images/c_129571.jpg'),
(175, 'Suguru Getou', '夏油傑', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 183 cm __Occupation:__ Curse User __Grade:__ Special Grade Curse User __Cursed Technique:__ Cursed Spirit Manipulation Suguru Getou is an antagonist in both the Jujutsu Kaisen series and its prequel Jujutsu Kaisen 0: Jujutsu High. ~!He was originally a student of [Masamichi Yaga](https://anilist.co/character/189237/Yaga-Masamichi)''s alongside [Satoru Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691/Gojou-Satoru) and [Shoko Ieiri](https://anilist.co/character/158154/Ieiri-Shouko) at Tokyo Jujutsu High. His experiences as a jujutsu sorcerer bred a deep hatred for non-sorcerers, leading to an incident where Suguru massacred over a hundred civilians in a single night, later being expelled from Jujutsu High and called for immediate execution as a result.!~', '/uploads/images/c_133699.png'),
(175, 'Kento Nanami', '七海建人', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', '__Height:__ 184 cm (6''0½") __Occupation:__ Sorcerer __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 1 Sorcerer __Cursed Technique:__ Ratio He is a Grade 1 Jujutsu Sorcerer and a Tokyo Jujutsu High alumni. Nanami is a very intelligent and reserved man who at first appears to be someone who is just very serious about his work. He knows how to separate sentimentalism from service and claims he''s only a Jujutsu Sorcerer because it''s slightly less idiotic than regular careers. As one of [Yuji''s](https://anilist.co/character/127212/Yuji-Itadori) mentors, Nanami is a complete contrast to [Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691/Satoru-Gojou), who is far more outspoken and easy-going.', '/uploads/images/c_133704.png'),
(175, 'Maki Zenin', '禪院真希', '配角', 'Mikako Komatsu', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") Maki Zenin is the older twin sister of [Mai Zenin](https://anilist.co/character/134168/Mai-Zenin). Maki is a grade 4 sorcerer and a second-year at Tokyo Metropolitan Jujutsu Technical High School. She is from the main branch of the Zenin clan, one of the "Prominent Three Families" of the Jujutsu world. She left the Zenin family in order to prove herself capable of being a Sorcerer after being deemed uncapable, since she lacks Cursed Energy. ~!Because Mai and Maki are monozygotic twins, their strength is considerably limited to one another. Monozygotic twins are considered as a single individual in the Jujutsu world and are a sign of bad omen.!~ ~!After the death of her twin sister Mai, Maki has lost all of her cursed energy and gained a Heavenly Restriction. This causes her skills and human capabilities to be on par with [Toji Fushiguro''s](https://anilist.co/character/162722/Touji-Fushiguro).!~', '/uploads/images/c_134167.png'),
(175, 'Mai Zenin', '禪院真依', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") Mai Zenin is the younger twin sister of [Maki Zenin](https://anilist.co/character/134167/Maki-Zenin). Mai is a grade 3 sorcerer and a second-year at Kyoto Jujutsu Technical High School. As a child, Mai always relied on Maki since she was afraid of Cursed Spirits. ~!Because Mai and Maki are monozygotic twins, their strength is considerably limited to one another. Monozygotic twins are considered as a single individual in the Jujutsu world and are a sign of bad omen.!~ ~!In chapter 149, Mai decides to sacrifice herself in order to make Maki stronger.!~', '/uploads/images/c_134168.jpg'),
(175, 'Panda', 'パンダ', '配角', 'Tomokazu Seki', '__Species:__ Cursed Corpse (varies among 3 personalities) __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ 2 He is a second-year at Tokyo Prefectural Jujutsu High. As a Metamorphosed Cursed Corpse, he is the best creation of Principal [Masamichi Yaga](https://anilist.co/character/189237/Masamichi-Yaga). He is sentient and has three cores inside the doll body: the youngest brother "Panda", the eldest brother "Gorilla" and a sister.', '/uploads/images/c_137974.jpg'),
(175, 'Aoi Toudou', '東堂葵', '配角', 'Subaru Kimura', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 190 cm __Occupation:__ Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Kyoto Jujutsu Technical High School __Grade:__ Grade 1 Sorcerer Toudou is a third-year student at Kyoto Jujutsu Technical High School who possesses inhuman physical strength, durability, and speed. ~!He is able to use a technique called Boogie Woogie, in which he can switch the position of two things that posses a certain amount of curse energy within his range.!~', '/uploads/images/c_137975.png'),
(175, 'Kasumi Miwa', '三輪霞', '配角', 'Chinatsu Akasaki', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Kyoto Metropolitan Curse Technical College __Grade:__ Grade 3 Sorcerer A second-year at Kyoto Metropolitan Curse Technical College. Kasumi is a hard-working, restrained, and considerate pacifist. She is also a big fan of [Satoru Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691). ~!She has a very close bond with [Mechamaru](https://anilist.co/character/210154), their friendship is first seen in the Tournament Arc when Miwa offers him a battery telling him not to eat it as [Mai](https://anilist.co/character/134168) and [Momo](https://anilist.co/character/157868) laugh in the background. In the Shibuya Arc, she is seen mourning his death on the train. Over the course of the Tournament Arc and Shibuya Arc it is very apparent their friendship grows as they both strived towards becoming closer to one another. As she mourns his death on the train she holds a mini Mechamaru speaker which tells her to find her happiness. After the recording finishes, she holds the speaker to her heart and cries. The entire Kyoto program seems very distressed by his death on the train. When later entering the battle Miwa is quick to activate her technique out of rage and sadness towards [Mahito](https://anilist.co/character/133702).!~', '/uploads/images/c_156848.png'),
(175, 'Toge Inumaki', '狗巻棘', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 2 Sorcerer __Cursed Technique:__ Cursed Speech He is a second-year at Tokyo Metropolitan Jujutsu Technical High School. Due to his curse ability, he is only willing to communicate with ingredients used to make rice balls.', '/uploads/images/c_157115.png'),
(175, 'Mei Mei', '冥冥', '配角', 'Kotono Mitsuishi', '__Height:__ 173 cm __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 1 Sorcerer __Family:__ [Ui Ui](https://anilist.co/character/217290) (Younger Brother) __Abilities__: ~! __Weapon Mastery__: Mei Mei wields a large battle-axe. __Cursed Technique__: Black Bird Manipulation - Mei Mei is able to control crows as well as see through their eyes, making her technique great for recon. __Bird Strike__: by forcing a crow to commit suicide, the trade-off is to erase the Cursed Energy limit of a typical weak bird and hurl it at the enemy. !~ Mei Mei is a grade 1 jujutsu sorcerer who works independently and only in exchange for money. She is also the older sister of Ui Ui. ~!She was the senpai of [Satoru Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691) and [Suguru Geto](https://anilist.co/character/133699) during their time at Jujutsu High.!~', '/uploads/images/c_157215.jpg'),
(175, 'Takuma Ino', '猪野琢真', '配角', 'Yuu Hayashi', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Sorcerer __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 2 Sorcerer Takuma Ino is a grade 2 jujutsu sorcerer and a close associate of Kento Nanami who operates out of Tokyo Jujutsu High. Takuma Ino is a genuine and cheerful person with a more positive outlook on things than most jujutsu sorcerers. He doesn''t believe he''s the smartest person around and has a lot of respect for Nanami. Whenever Ino finds himself in a tough situation, he asks himself what would Nanami do.', '/uploads/images/c_157865.jpg'),
(175, 'Noritoshi  Kamo', '加茂憲紀', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', '__Cursed Technique:__ Blood Manipulation __Grade:__ Semi-Grade 1 Sorcerer He is a third-year at Kyoto Magic Technical College.', '/uploads/images/c_157866.png'),
(175, 'Momo Nishimiya', '西宮桃', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer __Affiliation:__ Kyoto Magic Technical College __Grade:__ Semi-Grade 2 Sorcerer __Cursed Technique:__ Tool Manipulation She is a third-year at Kyoto Magic Technical College.', '/uploads/images/c_157868.png'),
(175, 'Shouko Ieiri', '家入硝子', '配角', 'Aya Endou', '__Height:__ 168 cm __Ability:__ Reverse Healing Cursed Technique Alumnus of Tokyo Jujutsu High, having been classmates with [Satoru Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691) and [Suguru Geto](https://anilist.co/character/133699). After graduating into a full-fledged jujutsu sorcerer, Shoko became the school''s primary doctor.', '/uploads/images/c_158154.png'),
(175, 'Masamichi Yaga', '夜蛾正道', '配角', 'Takaya Kuroda', 'He is the current principal of Tokyo Metropolitan Jujutsu Technical High School, the creator of Panda, and the headmaster of Satoru Gojo, Suguru Geto and Shoko Ieiri. ~!After the Shibuya incident Yaga is given a death penalty by the higher ups for inciting Gojo and Geto in the past and "causing the Shibuya incident".!~', '/uploads/images/c_189237.png'),
(175, 'Kiyotaka Ijichi', '伊地知潔高', '配角', 'Mitsuo Iwata', 'An assistant manager at Tokyo Prefectural Jujutsu High School.', '/uploads/images/c_189238.png'),
(175, 'Atsuya Kusakabe', '日下部篤也', '配角', 'Shinichirou Miki', 'Atsuya Kusakabe is a character in Jujutsu Kaisen. He is a Grade 1 Sorcerer, and a teacher at Jujutsu High. ~!At the end of the Shibuya Incident Arc he blocks Kenjaku''s Maximum Uzumaki Technique.!~', '/uploads/images/c_205234.jpg'),
(175, 'Rika Orimoto', '祈本里香', '配角', 'Kana Hanazawa', 'Rika Orimoto is the childhood friend of Yuta Okkotsu who tragically died when she was hit by a car. Her spirit was cursed, transforming her into a powerful Special Grade Vengeful Cursed Spirit worthy of the moniker "Queen of Curses".', '/uploads/images/c_208533.jpg'),
(175, 'Koukichi Muta', '与幸吉', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'Koukichi Muta is a Semi-Grade 1 sorcerer and a second-year student at Kyoto Jujutsu High. He attends school by controlling the cursed corpse Ultimate Mechamaru, as Muta was born with a sickly and fragile body due to a Heavenly Restriction. In exchange, he has a nearly boundless amount of cursed energy that spreads over a vast range.', '/uploads/images/c_210154.jpg'),
(175, 'Akari Nitta', '新田明', '配角', 'Sora Tokui', 'Akari Nitta is an Auxiliary Manager at Jujutsu High.', '/uploads/images/c_210846.png'),
(175, 'Mimiko Hasaba', '枷場美々子', '配角', 'Risae Matsuda', 'Mimiko Hasaba is a character in Jujutsu Kaisen and Jujutsu Kaisen 0: Jujutsu High. She is an ally of Suguru Geto.', '/uploads/images/c_228986.jpg'),
(175, 'Nanako Hasaba', '枷場菜々子', '配角', 'Satsumi Matsuda', 'Nanako Hasaba is a character in Jujutsu Kaisen and Jujutsu Kaisen 0: Jujutsu High. She is [Mimiko](https://anilist.co/character/228986/Mimiko-Hasaba)''s twin sister and they were both allies of Suguru Geto.', '/uploads/images/c_228987.jpg'),
(175, 'Larue', 'ラルゥ', '配角', 'Shou Hayami', 'A large, shirtless muscular man and an ally of [Suguru Getou](https://anilist.co/character/133699/).', '/uploads/images/c_268297.png'),
(175, 'Miguel', 'ミゲル', '配角', 'Kouichi Yamadera', 'He was initially one of Suguru Geto''s commanders who wished to see him become king. Following the Night Parade of a Hundred Demons, Miguel was forcefully recruited by Satoru Gojo. He returned to his homeland of Africa and the community of sorcerers there to train Yuta Okkotsu.', '/uploads/images/c_272175.png'),
(175, 'Manami Suda', '菅田真奈美', '配角', 'Shizuka Itou', 'Curse user who used to be [Suguru Getou](https://anilist.co/character/133699/Suguru-Getou)''s secretary as well as a commander in his "family" of sorcerers. ~!After Suguru''s death, Manami and Toshihisa Negi both decided to carry on his will by joining the entity to who stole his body.!~', '/uploads/images/c_306254.png'),
(175, 'Toshihisa Negi', '祢木利久', '配角', '', 'Curse user who used to be a commander in [Suguru Getou](https://anilist.co/character/133699/Suguru-Getou)''s "family" of sorcerers. After Suguru''s death, Negi and Manami Suda both decided to carry on his will by joining the entity to who stole his body.', '/uploads/images/c_306257.png'),
(175, 'Kakunou Jurei', '格納呪霊', '配角', '', 'A cursed spirit that can store many different objects within its body. First seen as the servant of Touji Fushiguro, it contains Touji''s entire wide arsenal of weapons.', '/uploads/images/c_311131.png'),
(176, 'Mikasa Ackerman', 'ミカサ・アッカーマン', '主角', 'Yui Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") - 176 cm (5''9½") __Position:__ 104th Training Corps, Survey Corps __Relatives:__ [Birth Mother](https://anilist.co/character/84341/Mikasa-no-Haha) (Deceased), [Birth Father](https://anilist.co/character/84339/Mikasa-no-Chichi) (Deceased), [Grisha Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/62477/Grisha-Yeager) (Foster Father), [Carla Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/62475/Carla-Yeager) (Foster Mother, Deceased), [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) (Foster Brother) Mikasa is Eren Yaeger''s foster sister and mutual childhood friend of [Armin Arlert](https://anilist.co/character/46494), living with the two of them in Shiganshina District within the southern region of Wall Maria. When she was young, her parents were killed by human traffickers, and she was kidnapped. Eren discovered this and helped her escape her captors. Later, Eren gave her his scarf, which she constantly wears and shares an emotional attachment to. She was adopted by the Yaeger family soon after. Because of these past events, Mikasa shares an unbreakable bond with Eren and lives to protect him, constantly worrying for Eren''s well-being. After the Titans broke through Wall Maria and killed her and Eren''s mother, she chose to follow Eren into the military to try and keep him safe from danger. Even as a child, Mikasa possessed impressive fighting skill and strength, and that skill was only honed further during her training. Mikasa is considered a genius among all th', '/uploads/images/c_40881.png'),
(176, 'Eren Yeager', 'エレン・イェーガー', '主角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") - 183 cm (6''0") __Affiliation:__ 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps. Eren was born to [Carla](https://anilist.co/character/62475/Yeager-Carla) and [Grisha Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/62477/Yeager-Grisha) in Shiganshina District within the southern region of Wall Maria. He grew up in the town with his parents and foster sister [Mikasa](https://anilist.co/character/40881/Ackerman-Mikasa), who moved in with the Yeagers as a child. Eren spent most of his time with Mikasa and their mutual best friend [Armin Arlert](https://anilist.co/character/46494/Arlert-Armin), whom the pair often defended from neighborhood bullies. Eren is a passionate, determined, hardheaded, and impulsive young man. When they were children, Armin showed him a book depicting the wonders of the outside world. Eren grew to share Armin''s curiosity of the world beyond the Walls and resolved to see it for himself. This dream inspired his admiration of the Survey Corps and his desire to join their ranks as soon as he became eligible for enrollment. When the Titans suddenly broke through Wall Maria into Shiganshina, Eren was forced to watch on as his mother became trapped under the rubble of their house and eaten by a titan. Forever changed from this event, Eren vows to kill every last titan.', '/uploads/images/c_40882.jpg'),
(176, 'Levi', 'リヴァイ', '配角', 'Hiroshi Kamiya', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") Squad Captain of the Special Operations Squad (known as Squad Levi) within the Survey Corps. He is known as humanity''s strongest soldier. Levi is abrasive, blunt, and has a strong respect for structure and discipline. He is a clean-freak, demanding spotless cleanliness of himself, his equipment, and his environment. Rumors say he was involved in underground crime in his life before coming a soldier. Despite his emotionless and unfriendly demeanor, Levi cares deeply for his squad and greatly values human life.', '/uploads/images/c_45627.png'),
(176, 'Sasha Blouse', 'サシャ・ブラウス', '配角', 'Yuu Kobayashi', '__Initial Height:__ 168cm __Affiliations__: 104th Cadet Corps, Survey Corps; Soldier __Relatives__: [Artur Blouse](https://anilist.co/character/131281/Artur-Blouse) (Father), [Lisa Blouse](https://anilist.co/character/134952/Lisa-Blouse) (Mother) Originally from Dauper, a remote and scarcely populated village of hunters located in a mountain forest in the southern area of Wall Rose, Sasha joined the military as a cadet of the 104th Training Corps, where she ranked 9th upon graduation. After graduating, she''d choose to enlist in the Scouting Regiment. Sasha is a friendly and fun-loving girl. She speaks with a local accent from her home village, but initially hid it out of embarrassment by using overly formal and polite speech. She is a constant food hoarder and is known to have an incredible appetite; eating provided her with considerable gratification and relief, especially during times of great stress, and food was often the only thing on her mind when at ease. Raised as an animal hunter, Sasha specializes in archery, horseback riding, and tracking, although her eccentricity and unconventional methods tend to make her a poor fit for group operations. ~!She later saves a child named [Kaya](https://anilist.co/character/132738/Kaya) from a titan attack, who her family ends up adopting.!~', '/uploads/images/c_45887.jpg'),
(176, 'Reiner Braun', 'ライナー・ブラウン', '主角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', '__Height__: 185 cm (6''1") Member of the Survey Corps and former cadet of the 104th Training Corps. Reiner is a passionate and strong-willed young man with a strong sense of duty. He ranked 2nd in his training class upon graduation, finishing behind only [Mikasa](https://anilist.co/character/40881). His comrades have great trust in him, and he is stated to be the "big brother" of the 104th cadets.', '/uploads/images/c_46484.png'),
(176, 'Connie Springer', 'コニー・スプリンガー', '主角', 'Hiro Shimono', '__Height__: 158 cm (5''2") __Relatives:__ [Mother](https://anilist.co/character/137287/Conny-no-Haha), Martin Springer (Brother), Sunny Springer (Sister) Connie Springer is a graduate of the 104th Training Corps, having ranked 8th in class. He is known to be one of the quickest soldiers while using ODM gear and is skilled at making very sharp turns. He hails from the rural Ragako Village within Wall Rose, his greatest ambition being to make his family and village proud of him. Upon graduation, he chose to join the Survey Corps. Upbeat and naive, Connie is rather unfocused outside of combat, and enjoys goofing around and messing with his friends, but can also be a bit dense at times, as he can have some difficulty comprehending new developments as they appear. Connie always tries to remain optimistic, consistently caring for the well-being of his friends, family and village, and being willing to help in any way he can. However, this soft spot and the struggles he goes through as a member of the Survey Corps takes a toll on him, as he often responds to grief and loss with anger, irritation and hatred, causing him to at times make rash, impulsive decisions. He will do anything to protect his family, whether it be his biological family or his closest friends.', '/uploads/images/c_46486.png'),
(176, 'Bertolt Hoover', 'ベルトルト・フーバー', '配角', 'Tomohisa Hashizume', '__Height__: 192 cm (6''3") __Affiliation__: Survey Corps Member of the Survey Corps and former cadet of the 104th Training Corps. Bertoldt ranked 3rd in his training class upon graduation, finishing behind only [Mikasa](https://anilist.co/character/40881) and his hometown friend [Reiner](https://anilist.co/character/46484). He is a quiet young man who identifies himself as someone with a weak will that follows popular opinion. Despite ranking 3rd in his class, his training commandant noted him to be a person with great potential, but an utter lack of initiative. Bertoldt originally he enlisted in the military with aspirations of joining the Military Police and living in the safety of the inner wall, but after the Battle of Trost he instead decided to join the Survey Corps.', '/uploads/images/c_46488.jpg'),
(176, 'Annie Leonhart', 'アニ・レオンハート', '配角', 'Yuu Shimamura', '__Height__: 153 cm (5") A member of the 104th Southern Division in the Cadet Corps. After graduating from the 104th, ranked 4th place in the top 10, she ends up joining the Military Police. She is roommates with [Hitch Dreyse](https://anilist.co/character/86017). A stoic girl, Annie is considered to be an isolated, solitary type, being rarely seen smiling or socializing and often having an emotionless expression. She is apathetic and somnolent, with little desire to put in any effort into meaningless disciplines or activities. Nonetheless, what drives Annie more than anything is her desire for a normal life.', '/uploads/images/c_46490.jpg'),
(176, 'Hannes', 'ハンネス', '配角', '', 'A soldier who saves Eren and Mikasa during the prologue. He owes a debt to the Yeager family.', '/uploads/images/c_46492.jpg'),
(176, 'Armin Arlert', 'アルミン・アルレルト', '主角', 'Marina Inoue', '__Height:__ 163 cm (5''4") __Position:__ 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps __Relatives:__ [Grandfather](https://anilist.co/character/84313/Armin-no-Ojiisan) Armin is a young boy who was born and raised in the Shiganshina District within the walls, being childhood friends with both [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) and [Mikasa Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/40881). After Wall Maria was breached, he chose to join Mikasa and Eren in joining the military, both to try to make a good and meaningful impact on the world, and to fulfill his dream of seeing the outside world. Even when he was young, the naturally curious Armin has always had a deep fascination with the world beyond the Walls. As a child, he found and studied an illegal book about the outside world that was owned by his grandfather. He often shared the book and information contained in it with Eren Yeager, his best friend, and his dreams of seeing the world outside the walls. Armin was branded a heretic by other children for his unusual interest in the outside world and was thus frequently picked on. Too timid to defend himself, Armin would often rely on his friends Eren and Mikasa Ackerman to protect him from local bullies. This, coupled with his frail physique, was a deep shame for Armin, leading him to have poor self-esteem and to believe that he is a burden to others. Because of this, Armin has always been very eager to prove his worth, especially towards his close friends. Armin ', '/uploads/images/c_46494.png'),
(176, 'Erwin Smith', 'エルヴィン・スミス', '配角', '', '**Height:** 188 cm **Position:** 13th Commander, Survey Corps Discerning, intelligent, and widely respected, Erwin is the unshakable and calculated 13th commander of the Survey Corps. While he cares deeply for his men, he does not hesitate to sacrifice them for the good and prosperity of mankind, and his men have proven more than willing to stake their lives at his order. Erwin developed the Long-Distance Enemy Scouting Formation.', '/uploads/images/c_46496.png'),
(176, 'Jean Kirstein', 'ジャン・キルシュタイン', '主角', 'Kishou Taniyama', '__Height__: 175 cm (5''8") __Relatives__: [Mother](https://anilist.co/character/131444/Jean-no-Haha) Jean Kirschtein is a graduate of the 104th Cadet Corps, among whom he ranked 6th for his skills with ODM gear and ability to look at things through a more tactical lense. Jean hails from Wall Rose''s Trost District, and joined the military with hopes of living a peaceful life within the walls as part of the Military Police. However, he would later find himself joining the Survey Corps after being convinced both by his close friend [Marco Bott''s](https://anilist.co/character/62479/Marco-Bott) words, and after witnessing the death of several of his comrades. Jean has a blunt personality. He holds no restraint when it comes to speaking his mind, even when he knows it would not be wise to do so or when it could spark conflict. Jean is also pragmatic: he has a strong aversion to exposing himself to dangerous situations. During his time as a cadet, Jean was extremely hot-headed, easily becoming frustrated and quick to resort to violence when pushed. Jean was also very cynical about defeating the Titans, believing that humanity has no chance against them and openly mocking more idealistic individuals like [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager), and saw resisting the Titans as a hopeless cause. However, despite these things, and although he presents himself as self-centered, Jean places high value on the lives of his comrades, and is willing to risk his life to pr', '/uploads/images/c_46498.png'),
(176, 'Carla Yeager', 'カルラ・イェーガー', '配角', 'Yoshino Takamori', 'Eren''s mother. ~!She''s eaten alive in the second chapter.!~ Note: Carla Yeager is the official English translation by Kodansha.', '/uploads/images/c_62475.png'),
(176, 'Grisha Yeager', 'グリシャ・イェーガー', '配角', 'Hiroshi Tsuchida', 'Father of [Eren Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) and caretaker of [Mikasa Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/40881/Mikasa-Ackerman). He is a renowned doctor who was well respected in the District of Shiganshina after he saved the village from a mysterious viral epidemic by developing vaccines. He also provides a medical house call service to the people of Shiganshina and to various towns in addition to having a network of contacts within the Corps of the Shiganshina District. He is married to [Carla Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/62475). ~!In the basement of the Yeager family house, he hides a secret which he refers to as the "truth". Upon finding Eren after the fall of Wall Maria, he injects him with a series of chemicals and amnesiacs and entrusts him with the key to the "truth", before mysteriously disappearing. This strange serum resulted in Eren gaining the ability to transform into a titan.!~', '/uploads/images/c_62477.jpg'),
(176, 'Marco Bott', 'マルコ・ボット', '配角', '', '__Height__: 178 cm (5''9") __Affiliations__: 104th Training Corps Originally from Jinae District. Marco ranked 7th in the 104th Training Corps and is widely respected by other cadets of the 104th. Marco is a very kind, calm, and idealistic person, valuing the good of the group above his own interests, as well as understanding and coping with his own shortcomings and limitations. He is seen as a natural leader, and desires to join the Military Police to serve near the King. *Note: Marco Bott is the official English translation by Kodansha.*', '/uploads/images/c_62479.jpg'),
(176, 'Krista Lenz', 'クリスタ・レンズ', '配角', 'Shiori Mikami', '__Height__: 145 cm (4''8") __Affiliations__: 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps Ranked tenth in the trainee class, Krista is a very shy and kind, caring person, often being described as a "goddess" or "angel" by her peers. She is good friends with [Ymir](https://anilist.co/character/71479/Ymir).', '/uploads/images/c_62481.png'),
(176, 'Dot Pixis', 'ドット・ピクシス', '配角', 'Masahiko Tanaka', 'The highest-ranked Administrator of the Southern Region. Head of the Garrison''s Southern Territories, Pixis is a cunning leader with astute insights. However, he is also an alcoholic who is constantly watched over by his aid, [Anka](https://anilist.co/character/84331/Anka-Rheinberger), who constantly scolds him for sleeping and drinking during critical moments.', '/uploads/images/c_62485.png'),
(176, 'Petra Ral', 'ペトラ・ラル', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 158 cm (5''2") __Affiliation:__ Survey Corps; Soldier, Special Operations Squad. __Relatives:__ [Father](https://anilist.co/character/131987/Petra-no-Chichi) Petra Ral is a soldier of the Survey Corps hand-picked by [Captain Levi](https://anilist.co/character/45627/Levi) to join the Special Operations Squad. Petra is a very kind and caring woman, going out of her way to look after and guiding [Eren Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) when he was first admitted to the squad. She seemed to have the most attachment to Eren among Levi Squad, as she was often the only one shown to actually worry about him and his wellbeing, at least at first. Although all of Levi''s squad wished for Eren''s unconditional trust, it was ultimately Petra who convinced him to do so. Despite her kind nature, Petra was a conditioned soldier with a quick reaction time against perceived danger. She displays extreme loyalty to her leaders, superiors and their orders, and cares deeply for her team, although she tends to be at odds with [Oluo Bozad](https://anilist.co/character/71687/Oluo-Bozard) due to his irritating tendency to try and imitate Levi. She greatly looks up to Levi as her superior and is deeply devoted to him, willing to completely dedicate her life to his cause. It is implied that she may harbor romantic feelings for her captain.', '/uploads/images/c_62501.jpg'),
(176, 'Mike Zacharias', 'マイク・ザカリアス', '配角', '', 'Squad Captain of his own squad, Squad Mike, a major division within the Survey Corps. He has been described by others as "humanity''s second strongest soldier", being only behind [Levi](https://anilist.co/character/45627/Levi). Mike is an extremely strong and durable soldier and an acknowledged leader with a brave heart and a tactical mind. He also has a remarkably good sense of smell, which allows him to detect Titans from great distances. During times of ease, Mike is shown to be a quiet and reserved man, rarely speaking unless it concerned a more serious matter. He also has a bizarre habit of "sniffing" people when he meets them.', '/uploads/images/c_71119.jpg'),
(176, 'Hange Zoe', 'ハンジ・ゾエ', '配角', 'Romi Park', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Affiliation:__ Survey Corps; Section Commander, Squad Leader. Leader of the Survey Corps'' Fourth Squad, Hange is also in charge of conducting research on Titans, and pursues this knowledge so passionately that they have become obsessed with Titans as a result. After originally holding a deep hatred for the creatures, Hange decided to take on a new outside-the-box approach to their research by letting go of their resentment towards Titans and approaching the test subjects with compassion. Hange is an energetic, freethinking and quirky scientist, with a unique way of conducting both themselves and their work. Hange is a genius outside of just Titan research too, using their brain to create weapons, tactical plans, and inventions for the benefit of humanity. As a leader, Hange is thoughtful of their comrades, and can easily figure out complex problems in order to create plans for their teammates to carry out.', '/uploads/images/c_71121.png'),
(176, 'Nile Dok', 'ナイル・ドーク', '配角', 'Anri Katsu', 'Chief of the Military Police.', '/uploads/images/c_71123.png'),
(176, 'Dieter Ness', 'ディータ・ネス', '配角', '', 'A member of the Scout Regiment and a team leader in the 57th Exterior Scouting Mission. ~!He encounters the Female Titan, who catches Ness''s line and whips it to the ground, killing him instantly.!~', '/uploads/images/c_71459.jpg'),
(176, 'Luke Siss', 'ルーク・シス', '配角', '', 'Luke Siss was a skilled member of the Survey Corps and a participant during the 57th Expedition Outside the Walls.', '/uploads/images/c_71461.jpg'),
(176, 'Ymir', 'ユミル', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5''7") __Affiliations:__ 104th Trainees Squad, Scouting Legion Member of the Scouting Legion. She seems selfish, cynical, bossy, sly, uncooperative, exploitative, and confrontational, but she can apparently be kind, especially to [Krista](https://anilist.co/character/62481/Krista-Lenz).', '/uploads/images/c_71479.png'),
(176, 'Eld Gin', 'エルド・ジン', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 182 cm (6''0") Eld Gin is an elite soldier in the Survey Corps. He was hand-picked by [Captain Levi](https://anilist.co/character/45627/Levi) and placed in the Special Operations Squad, of which he is second-in-command. Eld is a responsible and firm leader with a strong sense of duty. He does not talk much, but when he does, he did so bluntly and in a straightforward manner. He also seems to have been a veteran of sorts as he teased [Petra Ral](https://anilist.co/character/62501) and [Oluo Bozad](https://anilist.co/character/71687/Oluo-Bozard) about how they acted during their first expedition. He also seems to hold some sort of belief of what makes a true soldier, saying that a kill record alone does not make a great soldier.', '/uploads/images/c_71689.png'),
(176, 'Gunther Schultz', 'グンタ・シュルツ', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 183 cm (6''0") __Relatives:__ [Mother](https://anilist.co/character/131990/Gunther-no-Haha), [Grandfather](https://anilist.co/character/131986/Gunther-no-Ojsan). Gunther Schultz is one of the Survey Corps soldiers hand-picked by [Captain Levi](https://anilist.co/character/45627/Levi) to join the Special Operations Squad, both for his strength and his distrust for [Eren Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager). Being a soldier of the Survey Corps who survived multiple encounters with Titans significantly affected Gunther''s personality, making him deeply obedient and loyal to his superiors. Within the Special Operations Squad, Gunther seems to be the most reasonable one. However, he is shown to get irritated when his comrades joke around with one another, showing he also possesses a stern side and does not take kindly if a soldier doesn''t focus on the task at hand.', '/uploads/images/c_71691.png'),
(176, 'Keith Shadis', 'キース・シャーディス', '配角', 'Tsuguo Mogami', 'Keith Shadis was the head instructor of the 104th Trainees Squad. He seemed to be a friend or have some sort of relationship with Dr. Grisha, as he knew Eren is the son of the doctor and praised Eren for his effort.', '/uploads/images/c_84305.png'),
(176, 'Samuel Linke-Jackson ', 'サムエル・リンケ-ジャクソン', '配角', 'Kenji Takahashi', 'Samuel is a member of the 104th Trainees Squad. He appears in Ch. 3. When the Colossal Titan appears outside Trost District, the burst of steam from its body knocks a number of trainees off the Wall. While most are able to switch to their Three Dimensional Maneuver Gear and anchor themselves to the Wall, Samuel is struck in the head by a piece of falling rock and stunned. Sasha saves him from falling to his death by firing one of her grappling hooks into his leg. Eren tells Sasha to take Samuel somewhere safe, then instructs the other trainees to attack the Colossal Titan. ~!He is killed by Connie after being shot three times in the head.!~', '/uploads/images/c_84315.png'),
(176, 'Franz Kefka', 'フランツ・ケフカ', '配角', '', 'Franz is a member of the 104th Trainees Squad. Franz first appears Ch.3 in walking through Trost District with Eren and Hannah. Eren refers to Hannah and Franz as a couple, which they both embarrassedly deny. ~!At some point following the breach of the Wall by the Colossal Titan, Franz is attacked by a Titan. He is bitten in half and dies. Armin finds Hannah futilely attempting CPR on what remains of Franz''s corpse. He tells her it''s useless, and advises her to retreat to the Wall before it''s too late.!~ (Source: Shingeki no Kyojin Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_84317.png'),
(176, 'Daz', 'ダズ', '配角', 'Shuuhei Takubo', 'Daz is a member of the 104th Trainees Squad. ~!In Ch. 40, Ymir and Historia Reiss recount a story about Dazz from training. Wanting praise and recognition, Dazz undertook harsh physical training in the snowy mountains. However, he wasn''t strong enough to endure it, and nearly died. Ymir told Krista to leave him behind or her own life would be endangered; when Krista refused, Ymir used her Titan shifter powers to bring Dazz back to the camp safely. In Ch. 12, when Dot Pixis announces the plan to reconquer Trost District, Dazz has a breakdown and starts screaming that he doesn''t want to die. Though Marco Bott tries to quiet him, a commanding officer overhears and threatens to execute him. Dazz replies that execution would be better then being eaten by a Titan. However, Dot Pixis then announces that all deserters will be pardoned -- but have to live with the guilt that they abandoned their families to the Titans. Dazz is unable to leave his family to that fate, and returns to participate in the operation to plug the breach. After the mission, he briefly appears in Chapter 21 standing next to Sasha Blouse when Irvin Smith gives a speech urging the 104th Training Squad members to join the Scouting Legion. As he is not present in the group of trainees who join, he presumably opted for the Stationary Guard instead.!~ (Source: Shingeki no Kyojin Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_84321.png'),
(176, 'Ian Dietrich', 'イアン・ディートリッヒ', '配角', '', 'Ian is a member of the Stationary Guard in Trost District. Ian first appears in Ch. 5 after Trost District is breached by the Colossal Titan. He compliments Mikasa for killing a Titan that was attacking a group of evacuating civilians. ~!In Ch. 12, a plan is formed for Eren to use his Titan powers to seal the breach with a boulder. Ian is placed in charge of the elite squad assigned to protect Eren on his mission. When Eren loses control of his Titan form in Ch. 13, Mitabi and Rico advise Ian to abort the mission and retreat. However, Ian orders his soldiers to continue to defend Eren down to the last man, as Eren is their only hope against the Titans. In Ch. 14, Eren regains his senses due to Armin''s intervention, and Ian orders his soldiers to protect him until he reaches the breach even at the cost of their own lives. Ian uses himself as bait to lure Titans away from Eren, sacrificing his life in order to ensure the success of the mission.!~ (Source: Shingeki no Kyojin Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_84333.png'),
(176, 'Hitch Dreyse', 'ヒッチ・ドリス', '配角', 'Akeno Watanabe', '**Height:** 168 cm __Affiliations:__ 104th Cadet Corps. Recruit of the Military Police stationed in Stohess District. She was roommates with [Annie Leonhart](https://anilist.co/character/46490/Annie-Leonhart). Hitch acts immature in certain ways, she has a sarcastic, easygoing personality and seems to mischievously enjoy teasing and needling her fellow officers, especially [Marlo Freudenberg](https://anilist.co/character/71457/Marlo-Freudenberg). She claims she chose to join the Military Police out of laziness, as it is well known that the senior staff are incredibly corrupt and she wanted to benefit from the system herself; however, she did not take into account that, as a new recruit, her superiors would dump all their work on her. Though she may act a bit air-headed at times, Hitch is not selfish and cares about those around her, especially her fellow comrades.', '/uploads/images/c_86017.jpg'),
(176, 'Pieck Finger', 'ピーク・フィンガー', '配角', 'Manami Numakura', '__Height__: 155 cm Pieck is an Eldian who serves as one of Marley''s Warriors. She is shown to be somewhat sweet and kind, consistently shown to care about her fellow Warriors and the Warrior candidates. ~!She is the current inheritor of the Cart Titan.!~', '/uploads/images/c_125603.png'),
(176, 'Gabi Braun', 'ガビ・ブラウン', '主角', 'Ayane Sakura', '__Height__: 138 cm Gabi Braun is an Eldian living in the Liberio internment zone and the cousin of [Reiner Braun](https://anilist.co/character/46484/Reiner-Braun). She is friends with her fellow warrior candidates [Udo](https://anilist.co/character/125663), [Zofia](https://anilist.co/character/125664/Zofia), and [Falco Grice](https://anilist.co/character/125660). Gabi is very passionate and head-strong, expressing her emotions and opinions without inhibition. She is also brave, possessing boundless determination, and willing to put her life on the line to complete a goal for a perceived greater good. However, these attributes can also make her somewhat overbearing and domineering. This causes her to be tactless at times, forcing her opinions on others and taking charge regardless of whether it was asked for or not. She mostly shows this side around her fellow Warrior candidates, considering herself their de facto leader to an extent, and even threatening to ''punish'' them when they disagree with her. Nonetheless, she is friendly enough that they have no issue with spending their leisure time with her. Aside from her resolve and determination, Gabi is care-free even on the battlefield, making remarks about her cuteness and claiming her commander loves her too much to sacrifice her. ~!She is a Warrior candidate that is likely to inherit the Armored Titan.!~', '/uploads/images/c_125659.png'),
(176, 'Falco Grice', 'ファルコ・グライス', '主角', 'Natsuki Hanae', '__Height__: 140 cm __Position__: Warrior Candidate Falco Grice is an Eldian Warrior candidate working for the Marley government and is the younger brother of [Colt Grice](https://anilist.co/character/125665/Colt-Grice). Falco is close friends with his fellow warrior candidates; [Udo](https://anilist.co/character/125663/Udo), [Zofia](https://anilist.co/character/125664/Zofia), and [Gabi](https://anilist.co/character/125659/Gabi-Braun). While not as physically strong as his fellow soldiers, he makes up for it with his quick wit and improvisation. He is a very merciful and compassionate person, going out of his way to protect and save other people lives, even enemy soldiers. He is also very polite and respectful towards others, and is an empathetic person, being willing to hear people out and properly understand things from their points of view. ~!He is a candidate to inherit the power of the Armored Titan. He has the desire to become the Armored Titan in order to prevent Gabi Braun from inheriting it, as he has a crush on her and wants them to live a long life.!~', '/uploads/images/c_125660.jpg'),
(176, 'Zeke', 'ジーク', '主角', 'Takehito Koyasu', '__Height__: 183 cm Zeke is the current inheritor of the Beast Titan, and is considered by [Reiner Braun](https://anilist.co/character/46484/Reiner-Braun) to be the strongest Warrior, contrasting [Levi''s](https://anilist.co/character/45627/Levi) title of "humanity''s strongest soldier".', '/uploads/images/c_125661.png'),
(176, 'Porco Galliard', 'ポルコガリアード', '配角', 'Toshiki Masuda', '__Height:__ 175 cm __Position:__ Marley''s Warrior Porco Galliard is an Eldian and the younger brother of Marcel Galliard. ~!He is one of Marley''s Warriors and inherited the Jaw Titan from Ymir.!~', '/uploads/images/c_125662.png'),
(176, 'Colt Grice', 'コルト・グライス', '配角', 'Masaya Matsukaze', '__Height__: 180 cm __Position__: Warrior Candidate Colt Grice is an Eldian living in Marley and the older brother of [Falco Grice](https://anilist.co/character/125660). ~!He is a Warrior candidate who is selected to be the next wielder of the Beast Titan power.!~', '/uploads/images/c_125665.jpg'),
(176, 'Nifa', 'ニファ', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") Nifa is a soldier in the Survey Corps'' Fourth Squad under the command of [Hange Zoe](https://anilist.co/character/71121/Hange-Zoe). Nifa appears to be a loyal and trustworthy member of Fourth Squad, as she is often tasked to record the details of important meetings and entrusted to deliver vital information to others within the Scouting Regiment. She acts serious most of the time, however, she has been seen drinking alcoholic beverages before giving out more intense reports and info.', '/uploads/images/c_126849.jpg'),
(176, 'Rod Reiss', 'ロッド・レイス', '配角', '', '~!is the true king of humanity, currently masquerading as a noble living in Wall Sina. He is a member of the Reiss family and Historia''s illegitimate father.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127360.jpg'),
(176, 'Frieda Reiss', 'フリーダ・レイス', '配角', 'Youko Hikasa', 'Frieda was Rod Reiss'' eldest daughter and Historia''s oldest half-sister. ~!She was the true queen of humanity from 842 to 845. She is known to appear in Eren and Historia''s obtained memories. In his Titan form, Grisha invaded an underground cavern under the Reiss family chapel, where the family had gathered to pray. He battled Frieda and consumed her, thus gaining her powers and memories. He then slaughtered her mother and siblings, and finally destroyed the chapel. When Eren later eats Grisha, Frieda''s memories are transferred to him along with Grisha''s.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127624.jpg'),
(176, 'Abel', 'ゴーグル', '配角', '', 'Goggles is a soldier in the Scout Regiment fourth squad under the command of Hange Zoë, who is noted for his trademark glasses, or "goggles". He participated in the 57th Exterior Scouting Mission and often accompanies higher ups, such as Hange and Levi, on serious missions. (Source: Shingeki no Kyojin Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_127681.jpg'),
(176, 'Marcel Galliard', 'マルセル・ガリアード', '配角', '', '~!Marcel was a comrade and childhood friend of Reiner Braun, Bertolt Hoover, and Annie Leonhart. He was part of the group sent by Marley to attack the Eldians of Paradis in year 845, but his mission was cut short by the sudden appearance of Ymir in her mindless Titan form.!~ (Source: Shingeki no Kyojin Wikia)', '/uploads/images/c_127683.png'),
(176, 'Floch Forster', 'フロック・フォルスター', '配角', 'Kenshou Ono', 'Floch is a new recruit in the Survey Corps. He joined the Survey Corps during the two months between the attack at Orvud District and the return to Shiganshina District. ~!After the rest of the Yeagerists are killed during the port battle, Floch hides on the ship to Marley. After shooting holes in the fuel tank of the flying boat, Floch is ultimately killed by Mikasa.!~', '/uploads/images/c_127703.png'),
(176, 'Fritz', 'フリッツ', '配角', '', 'He is the king of the wall. ~!he was a puppet king who acted as a substitute for Rod Reiss, the real king at the time. He is arrested after the coup d''état.!~', '/uploads/images/c_129941.png'),
(176, 'Annie no Chichi', 'アニの父', '配角', 'Kouji Ishii', 'Father and trainer of Annie Leonhart. He relentlessly trained Annie to fight, using mostly kicks and the attacker''s weight against them. ~!Memories of his pleas for forgiveness later create an opening for Annie to crystallize herself before Eren Jaeger has the chance to capture her!~', '/uploads/images/c_131257.png'),
(176, 'Artur Blouse', 'アルトゥル・ブラウス', '配角', 'Otoya Kawano', '__Relatives:__ [Lisa Blause](https://anilist.co/character/134952/Lisa-Blouse) (Wife), [Sasha Blause](https://anilist.co/character/45887/Sasha-Blouse) (Daughter). Artur Blouse is the father of Sasha Blouse and a hunter in the Dauper village. It was his words that motivated Sasha to leave home and join the military. Artur appears to be a mature father figure who is deeply devoted to his clan. Though he appreciates his way of life, he realizes that many people''s homes were taken by Titans and that they must share the forest for the greater good. He appears to be very wise, willing to accept change and move beyond their traditions if it meant a better way of life for everyone, and is very clearly a selfless person who puts others before himself. Like his daughter, he has a native Dauper accent. ~!ㅤ After his daughter Sasha saved [Kaya](https://anilist.co/character/132738/Kaya), he and his wife decided to adopt her and open their home up to other orphaned children whose family was slain by the titans, going so far as to refer to them as his "family."!~', '/uploads/images/c_131281.png'),
(176, 'Theo Magath', 'テオ・マガト', '配角', 'Jirou Saitou', 'A commander of the Eldian Unit of the Marley army. Formerly one of the chief overseers of the first Warrior candidates during their training, he later led the Eldian Warriors in the Marley Mid-East War against the Mid-East Allied Forces, playing a key role in Marley''s victory. ~!Through the support of Willy Tybur and the governmental party of Marley, along with the death of General Calvi, Magath is next in line to become the general of the Marleyan military forces.!~ ~!He sacrifices himself by blowing up the Marleyan ship to prevent the Yeagerists from catching the allies!~ (Source: Attack on Titan Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_131763.jpg'),
(176, 'Yelena', 'イェレナ', '配角', 'Mitsuki Saiga', 'Yelena is the leader of the Anti-Marleyan Volunteers working under [Zeke Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/125661/Zeke). She was one of the Marleyan soldiers on board the first survey fleet to Paradis Island after Marley''s failed attack operation. She is a very tall woman with her blonde hair styled in a short bob with straight bangs. She has large dark eyes and somewhat androgynous features due to her build and style. Yelena is a fervent follower of Zeke Yeager, holding great admiration and respect for him. She is usually calm and collected, her demeanour remaining unchanged even when [Jean Kirstein](https://anilist.co/character/46498/Kirstein-Jean) yelled at her for failing to see her job through. Nonetheless, she is willing to take responsibility and apologizes should she fail in her task. Yelena appears to maintain a very relaxed demeanour while having dry, humorous undertones to much of her actions. ~!It is later revealed that Yelena was born into an unassuming family in Marley, and eventually became disillusioned with her own country. After meeting Zeke Yeager, Yelena concocted a plan to solidify herself in history by helping Zeke save the world. As part of her narrative, Yelena created a false background for herself, claiming that her homeland was invaded and conquered by Marley. She was forcibly drafted as a soldier to fight in the Marleyan military, where she met similar-minded soldiers and organized them into the Anti-Marleyan Volunteers to fight against Marley.!', '/uploads/images/c_133216.png'),
(176, 'Niccolo', 'ニコロ', '配角', 'Eiji Hanawa', 'Nicolo is a former Marleyan soldier who served on Marley''s Navy and was part of the first survey fleet to Paradis Island after the failed Paradis Island Operation. After being taken captive, he begins working on the island as a chef for the military. Niccolo was at first a very typical Marleyan, fearing the Eldians of Paradis Island and calling them devils. He was very disgusted with having been captured by them and having to live by their side, but after spending a lot of time with the Survey Corps, he and his comrades have developed grudging respect and shaky friendships with the ones they once thought of as devils. He notably grew a soft spot for a Survey Corp member, [Sasha Blouse](https://anilist.co/character/45887/Sasha-Blouse), after she complimented him on his cooking skills. Over time, the two gradually grew closer, enough for [Kaya](https://anilist.co/character/132738/Kaya) to believe they were in love. Niccolo credits Sasha with saving him from the war and teaching him that he can cook to make people happy.', '/uploads/images/c_133218.png'),
(176, 'Lisa Blouse', 'リサ・ブラウス', '配角', 'Junko Iwao', 'The mother of [Sasha Blouse](https://anilist.co/character/45887/Sasha-Blouse) and wife of [Mr. Blouse](https://anilist.co/character/131281).', '/uploads/images/c_134952.png'),
(176, 'Onyankopon', 'オニャンコポン', '配角', 'Kouji Hiwatari', 'Onyankopon is one of the Anti-Marleyan Volunteers and aids the Survey Corps during the Raid on Liberio. He pilots an airship following orders from [Hange](https://anilist.co/character/71121/) for the Corps to use during their retreat.', '/uploads/images/c_192909.png'),
(176, 'Koslow', 'コスロ', '配角', 'Tooru Nara', 'He is a Marleyan officer who fought in the war against the Mid-East Allied Forces before Marley''s victory. (Source: Attack on Titan Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_199549.png'),
(176, 'Ymir Fritz', 'ユミル・フリッツ', '配角', 'Chiyuki  Miura', 'Ymir Fritz was the progenitor of the Eldians. When she was a young girl, she awakened the power of the Titans and became the first Titan, the Founding Titan. After she died, her spirit was split into the Nine Titans. She is observed to be a quiet character that does not reveal her true intentions/motives. ~! She submitted to the Eldian king in life, building him his empire, brutally destroying his enemies, and bearing his children as he commanded. Ymir even went so far as to sacrifice her own life for his. Even in death, her soul remained blindly obedient to the Eldian royal family, creating Titans by hand for about 2,000 years in the unknown land surrounding the Coordinate. She has only shown signs of embracing her own free will after she encountered Eren Yeager. However, it is possible she always had some free will, as she had intentionally freed a group of pigs from their pen and let them run free as a slave. According to Eren, Ymir waited thousands of years for someone to come to her and free her from the love she felt for King Fritz. That person was Mikasa. !~ (Source: Attack on Titan Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_199551.png'),
(176, 'Karina Braun', 'カリナ・ブラウン', '配角', 'Atsuko Yuya', 'Karina Braun is the mother of [Reiner Braun](https://anilist.co/character/46484/).', '/uploads/images/c_199712.png'),
(176, 'Kiyomi Azumabito', 'キヨミ・アズマビト', '配角', 'Kiri Yoshizawa', 'Kiyomi is an ambassador of Hizuru and an ally to the Eldians on Paradis Island.', '/uploads/images/c_202799.png'),
(176, 'Louise', 'ルイーゼ', '配角', 'Mariko Nagai', 'A young girl who was in Trost with her mother attempting to flee when the Titans invaded. After being saved by [Mikasa Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/40881/Mikasa-Ackerman) and the other 104th Cadets, she was inspired by their heroic actions and later joins the military herself as a Survey Corps recruit, hoping to get closer to Mikasa, her idol. Louise believes that strength is the most important attribute one can have in the world, to the point that she almost seems to have a "might equals right" mentality. Much of this mindset stems from her experiences during the Battle of Trost District, where she claims to have learned from watching Mikasa Ackerman fight in the face of adversity to achieve victory. She believes that the ends justify the means, and has no qualms about breaking rules if she believes that disobeying others will get her what she wants.', '/uploads/images/c_209870.png'),
(176, 'Roeg', 'ローグ', '配角', 'Toshihiro Ookubo', 'High ranking Military Police Regiment soldier.', '/uploads/images/c_210462.png'),
(176, 'Surma', 'スルマ', '配角', 'Shougo Sakata', 'A member of the Jaegerists and a former cadet of the 109th Cadet Corps.', '/uploads/images/c_268344.png'),
(176, 'Maria Fritz', 'マリア・フリッツ', '配角', '', '~!Tthe eldest daughter of Ymir Fritz the Founder. She would later become the namesake of the outermost wall of Karl Fritz''s three Titan Walls, Wall Maria.!~', '/uploads/images/c_268345.png'),
(176, 'Rose Fritz', 'ローゼ・フリッツ', '配角', '', '~!Tthe second daughter of Ymir Fritz the Founder. She would later become the namesake of the middle wall of Karl Fritz''s three Titan Walls, Wall Rose!~', '/uploads/images/c_268346.png'),
(176, 'Sina Fritz', 'シーナ・フリッツ', '配角', '', '~!The youngest daughter of Ymir Fritz the Founder. She would later become the namesake of the innermost wall of Karl Fritz''s three Titan Walls, Wall Sina!~', '/uploads/images/c_268347.png'),
(176, 'Abel Reiss', 'エーベル・レイス', '配角', 'Chiyuki  Miura', 'Abel Reiss was one of the younger daughters of [Rod Reiss](https://anilist.co/character/127360/Rod-Reiss) and his wife.', '/uploads/images/c_310145.png'),
(177, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Misako Tomioka', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(177, 'Kaoru Gojou', '五条薫', '配角', 'Atsushi Ono', '[Wakana](https://anilist.co/character/133678)''s grandfather.', '/uploads/images/c_133675.png'),
(177, 'Marin Kitagawa', '喜多川海夢', '主角', 'Hina Suguta', '__Height:__ 164 cm (5''3") Marin is an extravagant, messy, and while quite mature, she''s also clumsy. She isn''t very skilled at handiwork. Marin is a cosplayer and a huge otaku, being a fan of magical girl anime and adult video games. She is very kind, friendly, cheerful and outgoing. She loves eating but still despite that she manages to maintain her slender figure. ~!Marin realizes she is in love with [Wakana](https://anilist.co/character/133678), and throughout the series, continually does whatever she can to invite him to places and spend time with him.!~', '/uploads/images/c_133676.png'),
(177, 'Sajuna Inui', '乾紗寿叶', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', 'A famous cosplayer that [Marin Kitagawa](https://anilist.co/character/133676) looks up to. Her younger sister is [Shinju](https://anilist.co/character/207937/Shinju-Inui).', '/uploads/images/c_133677.jpg'),
(177, 'Wakana Gojou', '五条新菜', '主角', 'Shouya Ishige', '__Height:__ 185 cm (6''1") __Hobbies:__ Hina Dolls Wakana Gojou is a fifteen-year-old high-schooler who is not very social, and doesn''t fit in well with his fellow classmates, leading to him having no friends at the start of the story. Gojou has a strong appreciation for hina dolls and loves making them, although he is not as skilled as he wants to be. This changes when Gojou ends up meeting someone who doesn''t find his love for doll making weird, and instead is amazed at his artistic ability and craftsmanship.', '/uploads/images/c_133678.png'),
(177, 'Shinju Inui', '乾心寿', '配角', 'Hina Youmiya', '__Height:__ 178 cm (5''10") Sister of [Sajuna Inui](https://anilist.co/character/133677).', '/uploads/images/c_207937.png'),
(177, 'Nobara', 'のばら', '配角', 'Mai Kanno', '[Wakana](https://anilist.co/character/133678) was a childhood friend of hers, but when she discovered that Wakana, a man, was obsessed with hina dolls, she called him "disgusting" and ended their relationship.', '/uploads/images/c_260976.png'),
