(177, 'Miori Gojou', '五条美織', '配角', 'Misako Tomioka', 'Miori is the cousin of [Wakana Gojou](https://anilist.co/character/133678/Wakana-Gojou). She supports him on his seemingly bizarre behavior (buying stockings).', '/uploads/images/c_261779.png'),
