(177, 'Shion Nikaidou', '二階堂シオン', '配角', 'Rumi Shishido', 'Shion is the main character from the in-story anime ''Flower Princess Blaze''. Sajuna wants Gojou to make a cosplay outfit based on this characters'' ''Black Lily'' form.', '/uploads/images/c_264037.png'),
(177, 'Neon Nikaidou', '二階堂ネオン', '配角', 'Houko Kuwashima', 'Shion''s sister and main enemy from the in-story anime ''Flower Princess Blaze''.', '/uploads/images/c_264038.png'),
