(177, 'Liz', 'リズ', '配角', 'Misaki Kuno', 'A character from the manga "I''m a Mega-Best-Selling High-School-Student Light Novel Author That Has a Succubus Thirsting for Me Every Night and I Don''t Know What to Do."', '/uploads/images/c_267568.jpg'),
