(177, 'Suzuka Itou', '伊藤涼香', '配角', 'Marie Miyake', 'Suzuka is a photographer who often attends cosplay events. She gets overly excited by a variety of cosplay. She gets especially excited by cross-playing.', '/uploads/images/c_306932.jpg'),
(177, 'Kensei Morita', '森田健星', '配角', 'Shuuichi Uchida', 'Kensei Morita is a member of class 1-5 who is a friend and classmate of [Marin Kitagawa](https://anilist.co/character/133676/Marin-Kitagawa) and later [Wakana Gojou](https://anilist.co/character/133678/Wakana-Gojou).', '/uploads/images/c_306939.png'),
(178, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Noriko Hidaka', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(178, 'Hitohito Tadano', '只野仁人', '主角', 'Gakuto Kajiwara', '**Height**: 168 cm (170.2 cm later) **Position:** President **Relatives**: [Hitomi Tadano](https://anilist.co/character/130878/Hitomi-Tadano) (younger sister) Hitohito Tadano is a person average in almost every way. His name means, *just some guy*. He is the first to befriend [Shouko Komi](https://anilist.co/character/121956/Shouko-Komi). Tadano is often described as an ordinary student with normal looks and average height and weight. His style of clothing is also considered to be relatively typical. His lone stand-out feature is the white cowlick in his black hair. When he was forced to cross-dress during the Cultural Festival, he was admired implicitly by the boys and Komi. His cross-dressing incorporates a short, red-haired girl''s wig with pigtails. Tadano suffered from chuunibyou in his second year of middle school. After confessing to a girl who immediately rejected him, he began to be self-conscious of his identity and drastically altered his style and outlook on life, making himself less noticeable to others. Almost everything about him - height, weight, appearance, academic achievements, athletic abilities, ice skating skills - is perfectly average. Despite his lack of talents, he''s been shown to be good at observing and buying gifts for people. On his first day of high school, he met Komi and was seated next to her. He later deduced that she had a communication disorder and became invested in helping her make 100 friends. ~!Tadano can be clueless when it comes to rom', '/uploads/images/c_78093.png'),
(178, 'Shouko Komi', '古見硝子', '主角', 'Aoi Koga', '**Height**: 168 cm (later 169 cm) **Position:** Goddess **Relatives**: [Shousuke Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130870/Shousuke-Komi) (younger brother), [Shuuko Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130867/Shuuko-Komi) (mother), [Masayoshi Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130865/Masayoshi-Komi) (father), [Yuiko Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130875/Yuiko-Komi) (grandmother), [Akira Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130876/Akira-Komi) (cousin), [Sadayoshi Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130873/Sadayoshi-Komi) (uncle) Shouko Komi is the main character of the series. Though she''s regarded as the *Madonna* of their school, she''s incapable of socializing with others to such a level where it can be called a communication disorder. Shouko is described by her admirers as a girl with glossy dark purple/black hair that flows to her lower back, a slender body, and an incredibly beautiful face. She is usually seen wearing her school uniform. Shouko hardly talks with people. She is unable to utter a word nor sound in her daily life due to her crippling anxiety and fear of rejection by her peers. She often writes whenever she can on her notebook and to the blackboard in class to answer people. She dreams of overcoming her adversity and desires to build friendly relationships with others and make 100 friends. Shouko''s first friend was [Hitohito Tadano](https://anilist.co/character/78093/Hitohito-Tadano). He was the first to discover her bad communication. He helps her make friend', '/uploads/images/c_121956.png'),
(178, 'Najimi Osana', '長名なじみ', '主角', 'Rie Murakawa', '**Position:** Vice President Najimi is a mysterious student whose gender is unknown. They are talented enough at communicating to easily befriend someone within minutes of meeting them. Growing up, Najimi was constantly transferring from one school to another, allowing them to make millions of friends.', '/uploads/images/c_126825.png'),
(178, 'Omoharu Nakanaka', '中々思春', '配角', 'Rumi Ookubo', 'A student who usually speaks in dubious speech as a result of being a chuunibyou. She states that she was Arsot Les Primavera and that [Shouko Komi](https://anilist.co/character/121956/) is Princess Komilia.', '/uploads/images/c_128378.png'),
(178, 'Masayoshi Komi', '古見将賀', '配角', 'Mitsuaki Hoshino', '**Relatives**: [Yuiko Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130875) (mother), [Sadayoshi Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130873/Sadayoshi-Komi) (brother), [Shuuko Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130867/Shuuko-Komi) (wife), [Shouko Komi](https://anilist.co/character/121956) (daughter), [Shousuke Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130870/Shousuke-Komi) (son), [Akira Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130876/Akira-Komi) (niece) Masayoshi Komi is Shouko''s and Shousuke''s father. He is seen as a dandy middle-aged man. Masayoshi rarely speaks and sometimes struggles to express himself verbally and can, at times, be easily flustered. Complementary to his wife''s youthful attitude, Masayoshi often appears mature and stoic. While he may come across as stern, he is often shown to be kind, considerate, and supportive. Like his son, Masayoshi tends to make up for his lack of communication with strong actions and is generally talented in a variety of skills, including baking, woodworking, motorcycle riding, and sandcastle construction. Despite his stoic expression, he is adept at non-verbal communication and often holds silent conversations with his children, much to Shuuko''s amusement.', '/uploads/images/c_130865.png'),
(178, 'Shuuko Komi', '古見秀子', '配角', 'Kikuko Inoue', '**Relatives**: [Yuiko Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130875) (mother-in-law), [Masayoshi Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130865) (husband), [Sadayoshi Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130873/Sadayoshi-Komi) (brother-in-law), [Shouko Komi](https://anilist.co/character/121956) (daughter), [Shousuke Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130870/Shousuke-Komi) (son), [Akira Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130876/Akira-Komi) (niece) Shuuko Komi, formerly known as Shuuko Nimi, is Shouko and Shousuke''s mother. She looks like her daughter, but her personality is that of a teenager, claiming to be forever 17 years old. When despaired, she ages into *forever 18* Corresponding to her son and daughter, Shuuko is considered beautiful. In contrast, she''s very communicative and wonders how her family gets along despite not talking. When young, she was bored of school and did not think much of Masayoshi until seeing him do various things on par with professionals. She slowly fell in love with him, despite his deadpan and silent demeanor. (Source: Komi-san Wiki, edited)', '/uploads/images/c_130867.png'),
(178, 'Himiko Agari', '上理卑美子', '配角', 'Yukiyo Fujii', 'Himiko Agari is introduced as a shy insecure girl. She also runs a ramen shop review blog and considers herself a "ramen expert."', '/uploads/images/c_130869.jpg'),
(178, 'Shousuke Komi', '古見笑介', '配角', 'Junya Enoki', '**Relatives**: [Yuiko Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130875) (grandmother), [Masayoshi Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130865) (father), [Shuuko Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130867) (mother), [Sadayoshi Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130873/Sadayoshi-Komi) (uncle), [Ryouko Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130877/Ryouko-Komi) (aunt), [Shouko Komi](https://anilist.co/character/121956) (older sister), [Akira Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130876/Akira-Komi) (cousin) Shousuke Komi is Shouko''s younger brother. He''s quiet most of the time but can converse well. Shousuke has short trimmed hair and his eyes are usually hidden with his bangs. Still, his very appearance is similar to his mother and sister and can be referred to as a handsome man. Shousuke appears to share many traits with his older sister, often choosing to remain silent and being widely popular among his peers as a result. Unlike Shouko, who stays quiet mainly because of her anxieties and problems communicating, Shousuke doesn''t feel bothered talking, perfectly capable of communicating without speaking in the first place. He is very apathetic, often neglecting to do anything he deems annoying or pointless, such as introducing himself to the class, instead opting to remain silent. In contrast to his sister, whose goal is to make friends, Shousuke seems to be perfectly content being by himself as he often flat-out ignores any classmates who invite him to eat lunch with them. (Source: Komi-san Wiki', '/uploads/images/c_130870.png'),
(178, 'Makeru Yadano', '矢田野まける', '配角', 'Ami Maeshima', 'Makeru Yadano is a competitive girl who likes to compete herself to Shouko.', '/uploads/images/c_130871.png'),
(178, 'Nene Onemine', '尾根峰ねね', '配角', 'Ruriko Aoki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_130872.png'),
(178, 'Sadayoshi Komi', '古見定義', '配角', '', 'Sadayoshi Komi is Shouko''s uncle and her father''s brother. Shouko thinks she gets along well with him because they have similar personality just like her father.', '/uploads/images/c_130873.png'),
(178, 'Ren Yamai', '山井恋', '配角', 'Rina Hidaka', 'Ren Yamai is one of Komi Shouko''s classmates from Class 1-1.', '/uploads/images/c_130874.png'),
(178, 'Yuiko Komi', '古見結子', '配角', 'Kumiko Takizawa', '**Relatives**: [Masayoshi Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130865/Masayoshi-Komi) (son), [Sadayoshi Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130873/Sadayoshi-Komi) (son), [Shuuko Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130867/Shuuko-Komi) (daughter-in-law), [Ryouko Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130877/Ryouko-Komi) (daughter-in-law), [Akira Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130876/Akira-Komi) (granddaughter), [Shouko Komi](https://anilist.co/character/121956/Shouko-Komi) (granddaughter), [Shousuke Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130870/Shousuke-Komi) (grandson) Yuiko Komi is Shouko, Akira, and Shousuke''s grandmother. She''s strict but gentle towards her family. When visiting, she usually challenges them to games.', '/uploads/images/c_130875.png'),
(178, 'Akira Komi', '古見晶', '配角', 'Kaede Hondo', 'Akira Komi is Shousuke and Shouko''s cousin. She was originally scared of Shouko before because of Shouko''s inability to speak and constant staring at Akira silently. The two become close during her Udon festival visit after Shouko tickled her.', '/uploads/images/c_130876.png'),
(178, 'Ryouko Komi', '古見良子', '配角', 'Emi Shinohara', 'Ryokuo Komi is Shouko''s aunt. She is just as lively as Shouko''s mother so she sometimes unknowingly intimidate Shouko.', '/uploads/images/c_130877.png'),
(178, 'Hitomi Tadano', '只野瞳', '配角', 'Maaya Uchida', '**Relatives**: [Hitohito Tadano](https://anilist.co/character/78093) (older brother) Hitomi Tadano is the younger sister of Hitohito Tadano. She bears resemblance to her brother in terms of understanding people''s minds. She is active, unlike her brother who is timid and more passive in doing things. Hitomi is a short girl that shares the same big beady eyes as her older brother and make similar expressions. She wears her medium length hair in two short twin-tails. In contrast to her older brother, who is usually seen as "normal", Hitomi is an energetic and eccentric girl. Unlike her more self-conscious brother, she''s not as concerned with what others think, doing odd things such as introducing herself via rapping and not being embarrassed by it. Because of her cheery nature, she is well-liked among her peers. Hitomi is rather blunt and forthright, openly claiming that she''s not very good in either grades or sports during her class introduction. She does not seem to possess the same level of self-awareness as her older brother and tends to jump to conclusions. When [Shousuke Komi](https://anilist.co/character/130870/Shousuke-Komi) wasn''t talking to her, Hitomi assumed he had a communication disorder when he was choosing to ignore her. Nonetheless, she does her best to "help" him communicate.', '/uploads/images/c_130878.png'),
(178, 'Nokoko Inaka', '井中のこ子', '配角', 'Megumi Han', 'Nokoko Inaka is a with a complex about her coming from the countryside. She later became friends with Shouko.', '/uploads/images/c_130879.png'),
(178, 'Akako  Onigashima ', '鬼ヶ島朱子', '配角', 'Sarah Emi Bridcutt', 'Onigashima Akako is originally part of Yamai Ren''s friend group. Her name translates to Red Girl from Oni Island which is a reference to the tale of Momotarou.', '/uploads/images/c_158375.png'),
(178, 'Shizuka Odoka', '小戸日静', '配角', 'Saki Kobari', 'Odoka Shizuka is a second-year at Itan Private High School', '/uploads/images/c_160201.jpg'),
(178, 'Chika Netsuno', '根津野ちか', '配角', 'Megumi Han', 'Chika Netsuno is a student one year above Tadano, Shouko, and Najimi, and serves as Shouko''s athletic rival.', '/uploads/images/c_160203.png'),
(178, 'Gorimi', '檎林美', '配角', '', 'Gorimi is a student one year above the main characters. She is the Head Librarian, and the disciplinarian of Itan Private High School.', '/uploads/images/c_160209.png'),
(178, 'Maki Karisu', '雁巣真姫', '配角', 'Shizuka Itou', 'Karisu Maki is Komi Shouko''s hair dresser. Karisu is seen to be very professional with her clients. When Komi comes in to her shop Karisu is able to understand exactly what she wants even without Komi speaking to her.', '/uploads/images/c_160218.png'),
(178, 'Shigeo Chiarai', '地洗井茂夫', '配角', 'Kenji Akabane', 'Chiarai Shigeo is a student in class 1-1. Chiarai is friends with Sonoda and Shinobino.', '/uploads/images/c_160221.png'),
(178, 'Mono Shinobino', '忍野裳乃', '配角', 'Kenshou Ono', 'Shinobino Mono is a student in class 1-1. He is friends with Chiarai and Sonoda. The three are most prominently seen in Volume 6 Chapters 75 and 77 where the three discuss which of the girls in class (+Najimi) would be the best to date.', '/uploads/images/c_160222.png'),
(178, 'Taisei Sonoda', '園田大勢', '配角', 'Yuuga Satou', 'Sonoda Taisei is a student in class 1-1. Sonoda is friends with Chiarai and Shinobino. The three are most prominently seen in Volume 6 Chapters 75 and 77 where the three discuss which of the girls in class (+Najimi) would be the best to date.', '/uploads/images/c_160224.png'),
(178, 'Hoshiko Teshigawara', '勅使河原欲子', '配角', 'Live Mukai', 'Hoshiko first appears in pages 8-9 of Chapter 43 "Part Time Job", where Komi is handing out pocket tissues, and Hoshiko really needs some tissues. Hoshiko sees Komi, but going to get a handout herself is awfully desperate. Komi, a good reader of nonverbal cues, recognizes the strong aura of tissue-needing-ness emanating from Hoshiko, and successful hands out her first pack of pocket tissues.', '/uploads/images/c_160225.png'),
(178, 'Kaede Otori', '尾鶏かえで', '配角', 'Yurika Moriyama', 'An airhead who likes to take things slow, to the point where she kept on watching a fireplace recording from Christmas to New Year''s Day.', '/uploads/images/c_249856.png'),
(178, 'Shatekiya no Tenshu', '射的屋の店主', '配角', 'Norihito Hase', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_257286.png'),
(178, 'Kamiko Arai', '新井嘉美子', '配角', 'Rika Nagae', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_257377.png'),
(178, 'Himeko Kishi', '岸姫子', '配角', 'Maaya Uchida', 'Himeko is an enigmatic girl who appears as part of Ren Yamai''s troupe of popular girls.', '/uploads/images/c_270955.png'),
(178, 'Eiko Ushiroda', '牛路田 影子', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_276886.png'),
(178, 'Yuuji Otaku', '小宅優司', '配角', 'Tooru Arizumi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_278385.png'),
(178, 'Tsukasa Aizawa', '会沢司', '配角', 'Yuuki Yonai', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_282223.png'),
(178, 'Tatsuhito Akido', '明戸達人', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_282224.png'),
(178, 'Maa', 'まあ', '配角', 'Nobuaki Kanemitsu', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_282233.png'),
(178, 'Shii', 'しい', '配角', 'Norihito Hase', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_282234.png'),
(178, 'Rami Kawai', '河合らみ', '配角', '', 'Kawai is the girl who rejected Tadano in middle school.', '/uploads/images/c_282322.png'),
(179, 'Thorfinn Karlsefni', 'トルフィン・カルルセヴニ', '主角', 'Yuuto Uemura', '__Birthyear:__ 996 __Height:__ 100 cm (6-7 years old), 153 cm (16-18 years old), 155 cm (19 years old) Thorfinn is a courageous young man armed with two twin blades he inherited from his deceased [father](https://anilist.co/character/13021). He''s traveling with [Askeladd](https://anilist.co/character/13020), who is the leader of a ruthless group of mercenaries who take jobs from whoever they think can offer them a reasonable reward. Besides, Askeladd is the man who killed Thorfinn''s father, Thors, and the only reason Thorfinn is traveling with Askeladd is so he can defeat him in a duel and win back his father''s pride. Thorfinn only wants to win his father''s pride with a fair duel. Askeladd only agrees to these duels when Thorfinn completes a certain task (like bringing him the head of the opposing armies general on the battlefield). He does not fight for the love of battle, but is still prone to losing his composure when in combat. This hotheadedness often costs him battles against more experienced opponents.', '/uploads/images/c_10138.png'),
(179, 'Askeladd', 'アシェラッド', '配角', 'Naoya Uchida', 'Askeladd is the commander of a small but powerful Viking band, which owed its success to Askeladd''s exceptional intelligence. Ten years before the main Vinland Saga storyline, Askeladd accepted a contract to assassinate [Thors](https://anilist.co/character/13021), father of [Thorfinn](https://anilist.co/character/10138). During the Viking invasion and war in England, he manipulated Thorfinn''s desire for revenge against him as a way of keeping the gifted young fighter in his service. Askeladd is one of the most skilled fighters in the series, and is particularly adept at predicting his opponents'' moves in combat. Askeladd shares the name of Askeladden, a Norwegian folk character known for his cleverness. ~!He is half-Danish and half-Welsh, being the son of a Welsh princess captured by a Viking raider. He believes in the legend of Avalon, which inspired him to support Prince [Canute](https://anilist.co/character/17438)''s bid for kingship of the Danes and ultimately sacrifices himself assassinating King [Sweyn](https://anilist.co/character/27957) in order to install Canute as the Danish King and to ensure the safety of Wales from Denmark.!~', '/uploads/images/c_13020.png'),
(179, 'Thors Snorresson', 'トールズ・スノーレソン', '配角', 'Kenichirou Matsuda', '__Height:__ 180 cm (5''11") Thors is the father of [Thorfinn](https://anilist.co/character/10138), a Jomsviking general whose phenomenal combat prowess earns him the epithet "The Troll of Jom". Thors grows weary of battle after the birth of his children, fakes his own death, and retires to become a pacifist farmer. Thors is largely considered the greatest fighter to appear in the series, having defeated the likes of Askeladd and [Thorkell](https://anilist.co/character/17440) in single combat. Such was his strength that Floki was unwilling to engage him directly, even with an entire squadron of Jomsviking warriors. Unlike his son, Thors has no explicit or implied historical basis.', '/uploads/images/c_13021.png'),
(179, 'Canute Svenson', 'クヌート', '配角', 'Kenshou Ono', '__Birthyear:__ 996 __Height:__ 170 cm Canute is the prince of the Danes. He is initially portrayed as timid and womanly, with a bishounen appearance and inability to function without his retainer [Ragnar](https://anilist.co/character/82533). These traits, along with his strong Christianity, earn him the mockery of the Vikings with whom he works. ~!After Ragnar''s death, however, he has a sharp reversal of personality, becomes strong and kingly, and develops an ambition to create utopia on earth before God''s return. Towards this end, he plots to overthrow his father [Sweyn Forkbeard](https://anilist.co/character/27957) and take the crown of the Danes. Canute is based on the historical King Canute the Great, the most prominent Danish ruler of England.!~', '/uploads/images/c_17438.png'),
(179, 'Thorkell', 'トルケル', '配角', 'Akio Ootsuka', '__Height:__ 230 cm (7''7") Thorkell is a Jomsviking general and brother of the Jomsviking Chief. A giant man who loves combat, Thorkell defected from the Danish army to become a mercenary for the English, believing that fighting his fellow Vikings will give him a better challenge. This same love of war leads him to support Prince [Canute](https://anilist.co/character/17438)''s bid for kingship of the Danes. Before [Thors](https://anilist.co/character/13021)'' defection he works with and highly respects the man, and bears a fondness for his son [Thorfinn](https://anilist.co/character/10138) in the main plot. He duels twice with Thorfinn and dominates each time, though he loses two fingers in the first duel and an eye in the second. In battle, Thorkell typically wields a pair of axes as his primary weapons, but his greatest asset is probably his vast physical strength. During a skirmish with [Askeladd](https://anilist.co/character/13020)''s band, he hurled a spear with such force that it skewered three men at once, despite having been thrown from several hundred feet away. Thorkell''s character is based on Thorkell the Tall, a historical Jomsviking lord who is a mentor to Canute in the Flateyjarbók. ~!Joined Canute as his servant after seeing him change in front of Askeladd and Thorfinn.!~', '/uploads/images/c_17440.png'),
(179, 'Bjorn', 'ビョルン', '配角', 'Hiroki Yasumoto', 'Bjorn is [Askeladd](https://anilist.co/character/13020)''s second in command, a burly man who fights for the love of combat. He is a berserker, able to enter powerful rages through the consumption of certain mushrooms.', '/uploads/images/c_19485.png'),
(179, 'Leif Erikson', 'レイフ', '配角', 'Youji Ueda', '__Birthyear:__ 965 __Height:__ 152 cm (4''11") ~!An explorer who joins [Thorfinn](https://anilist.co/character/10138) in his quest to find paradise.!~', '/uploads/images/c_19486.png'),
(179, 'Ylva', 'ユルヴァ', '配角', 'Hitomi Nabatame', 'She is [Thorfinn](https://anilist.co/character/10138)''s older sister. After Thorfinn has set on a journey to avenge his father, [Thors](https://anilist.co/character/13021), she takes care of household and [her mother](https://anilist.co/character/141589).', '/uploads/images/c_27876.jpg'),
(179, 'Sweyn', 'スヴェン', '配角', 'Takayuki Sugou', 'Danish king who managed to conquer almost the entirety of England and Wales, all the while keeping control of his more northern kingdoms. Father of [Canute](https://anilist.co/character/17438). ~!After being provoked by Sweyn, [Askeladd](https://anilist.co/character/13020) executes the king by cutting off his head with a sword.!~', '/uploads/images/c_27957.png'),
(179, 'Einar', 'エイナル', '主角', 'Shunsuke Takeuchi', '__Height:__ 184 cm Einar is a man from Northern England that was sold into slavery. He ends up in Denmark, where he meets [Thorfinn](https://anilist.co/character/10138). Together with him, Einar is working his way out of slavery by harvesting the land his master has lent to him and Thorfinn. ~!After [Arnheid''s](https://anilist.co/character/75590) death, he and Thorfinn agree to create a country of peace in Vinland!~', '/uploads/images/c_28030.jpg'),
(179, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Halldór Elís Ólafsson', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(179, 'Arnheid', 'アルネイズ', '配角', 'Mayumi Saco', '__Height:__ 155cm One of Ketil''s slaves, serving as his personal maid and concubine. Arnheid is kind, hard-working, honest, and tries her best to get through her slave life without trouble.', '/uploads/images/c_75590.jpg'),
(179, 'Hebi', '蛇', '配角', 'Fuminori Komatsu', '__Height:__ 172 cm __Occupation:__ Leader of the Guests A warrior employed by Ketil as head of his farm''s guards. He is an extremely formidable warrior, with Thorfinn attesting that Snake is faster than anyone he has ever fought. ~!Snake was formerly a warrior of Miklagard (the Old Norse name of Constantinople).!~', '/uploads/images/c_79913.jpg'),
(179, 'Ragnar', 'ラグナル', '配角', 'Jin Urayama', 'He is the main adviser for Prince [Canute](https://anilist.co/character/17438). Ragnar is bald apart from very long, black, curly hair on the sides of his head. He has very thick black eyebrows that lie close to his deepset eyes. His wrinkles are also very deep, especially in his cheeks, just above his thick beard. (Source: Vinland Saga Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_82533.png'),
(179, 'Thorgil', 'トールギル', '配角', 'Taiten Kusunoki', '__Height:__ 176 cm Eldest son of [Ketil](https://anilist.co/character/223346) and brother of [Olmar](https://anilist.co/character/224512). Much like [Thorkell](https://anilist.co/character/17440) he loves a good fight and has no qualms killing anybody who gets in his way. Served as a Thegn under Canute.', '/uploads/images/c_82535.jpg'),
(179, 'Floki', 'フローキ', '配角', 'Atsushi Ono', 'A Jomsviking commander whom contracted [Askeladd](https://anilist.co/character/13020) to assassinate [Thors](https://anilist.co/character/13021), Floki''s former comrade.', '/uploads/images/c_82537.jpg'),
(179, 'Ari', 'アーレ', '配角', 'Mitsuhiro Ichiki', '__Height:__ 170 cm Ari is from [Thorfinn](https://anilist.co/character/10138/Thorfinn-Karlsefni)’s village in Iceland.~!He is the husband of [Ylva](https://anilist.co/character/27876) and the father of their four children.!~', '/uploads/images/c_140357.png'),
(179, 'Helga', 'ヘルガ', '配角', 'Ao Takahashi', 'She is the mother of [Thorfinn](https://anilist.co/character/10138) and [Ylva](https://anilist.co/character/27876), and the wife of [Thors](https://anilist.co/character/13021). ~!She''s the daughter of the Jomsviking Chief.!~', '/uploads/images/c_141589.jpg'),
(179, 'Asgeir', 'アスゲード', '配角', 'Ryouta Takeuchi', '__Height:__ 170cm [Thorkell](https://anilist.co/character/17440)''s first mate. Asgeir is one of the few characters Thorkell outwardly respects, meeting him at eye-level in conversation, listening to his advice, and putting him in charge of strategies and planning. Asgeir is often shown yelling at Thorkell and becoming easily worried and even panicked when Thorkell is in danger.', '/uploads/images/c_141590.png'),
(179, 'Hordaland ', 'ホルザランド', '配角', 'Reina Kondou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_147777.jpg'),
(179, 'Mols', 'モルズ', '配角', 'Takayuki Nakatsukasa', '[Leif](https://anilist.co/character/19486)''s traveling partner.', '/uploads/images/c_156507.jpg'),
(179, 'Gunnar', 'グンナル', '配角', 'Tsuguo Mogami', 'He is Ragnar''s Brother. ~!now he is a politician who currently serves as an adviser to King Canute.!~', '/uploads/images/c_156517.png'),
(179, 'Bug-Eyes', 'ギョロ', '配角', 'Tatsumaru Tachibana', '__Height:__ 175cm Thorfinn, better known by his nickname Bug-Eyes, is a trader working with [Leif Erikson](https://anilist.co/character/19486/). A former slave, Bug-Eyes was bought by Leif under the false assumption that he was [Thorfinn](https://anilist.co/character/10138/), son of Thors.', '/uploads/images/c_172744.png'),
(179, 'Ketil', 'ケティル', '配角', 'Hideaki Tezuka', '__Height:__ 175cm Owner of a farm in Southern Denmark, and father of Thorgil and Olmar. ~!Thorfinn, Einar and Arnheid work his farm as slaves!~', '/uploads/images/c_223346.jpg'),
(179, 'Olmar', 'オルマル', '配角', 'Yuu Hayashi', '__Height:__ 170 cm (initial) Youngest son of [Ketil](https://anilist.co/character/223346).', '/uploads/images/c_224512.jpg'),
(179, 'Sverkell', 'スヴェルケル', '配角', 'Mugihito', 'Sverkel is the elderly father of Ketil, living on the ground of his son''s farm in Jutland, Denmark. ~!At first glance he seems to be quite a grumpy person, but he appears to actually be soft at heart. This is suggested by the fact that he helps out Thorfinn and Einar by lending them his farming utensils in exchange for their helping hands on his fields. This is further implied by his deep bond with Snake, even though they are depicted fighting a lot. On top of that, Sverkel is strong-willed, hardworking and stubborn.!~', '/uploads/images/c_255607.jpg'),
(179, 'Lotta', 'ロタ', '配角', 'Nao Touyama', '[Einar](https://anilist.co/character/28030)''s sister.', '/uploads/images/c_296218.jpg'),
(179, 'Emma', 'エッマ', '配角', 'Tomoko Shiota', '[Einar](https://anilist.co/character/28030) and [Lotta](https://anilist.co/character/296218)''s mother', '/uploads/images/c_296227.jpg'),
(179, 'Kitsune', 'キツネ', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', 'Member of [Snake](https://anilist.co/character/79913/)''s mercenaries employed as guards of [Ketil](https://anilist.co/character/223346)''s farm.', '/uploads/images/c_296842.jpg'),
(179, 'Anaguma', 'アナグマ', '配角', 'Hiroki Gotou', 'Member of [Snake](https://anilist.co/character/79913/)''s mercenaries employed as guards of [Ketil](https://anilist.co/character/223346)''s farm.', '/uploads/images/c_296843.jpg'),
