(179, 'Eadric', 'エアドリク', '配角', 'Jirou Saitou', 'An earl loyal to [Ethelred II](https://anilist.co/character/2981050) who was pressured into serving [Canute](https://anilist.co/character/17438) for his family''s safety.', '/uploads/images/c_298107.jpg'),
