(179, 'Gardar', 'ガルザル', '配角', 'Takuya Masumoto', '__Height:__ 180 cm A former Viking warrior turned slave. ~!Before being a slave, he had a happy life with his wife [Arnheid](https://anilist.co/character/75590) and son [Hjatli](https://anilist.co/character/302134).!~', '/uploads/images/c_301732.jpg'),
(179, 'Tokage', '蜥蜴', '配角', 'Shinya Hamazoe', 'A member of Snake''s band of mercenaries employed by Ketil.', '/uploads/images/c_301733.jpg'),
