(179, 'Murabito A', '村人', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_308187.jpg'),
(180, 'Yoichi Isagi', '潔世一', '主角', 'Kazuki Ura', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") Second-year high school student at Ichinan High School in Saitama. Isagi grew up watching soccer and aspiring to be like [Noel Noa](https://anilist.co/character/268966), a forward for France''s National Team. Due to this, he dreams of becoming the best striker in the world. In turn, Isagi played striker for his school soccer team, who was defeated in the Prefectural Finals by Matsukaze Kokou High. After this loss, Isagi is invited to participate in the Blue Lock Project, ranked 299th of 300 strikers, and is assigned to Team Z. Isagi is easygoing and has a generally friendly, cheery personality, but his simple and innocent habits often get on the nerves of the people around him. As time goes on, Isagi develops a more assertive presence on and off the field, becoming the foundation for Team Z and garnering the respect of some of the best players in Blue Lock.', '/uploads/images/c_140856.jpg'),
(180, 'Jinpachi Ego', '絵心甚八', '配角', 'Hiroshi Kamiya', '__Height:__ 189 cm (6''2") General Director/Manager of the Blue Lock Project, handpicked to lead the project by [Anri Teieri](https://anilist.co/character/169405). Ego is introduced as a man who radiates ambition and confidence. His egotistical nature is undeniable, especially given his belief that only his methods can lead to Japan''s victory in the World Cup. Ego used to play football in his earlier career, with Noel Noa being his rival and former teammate.', '/uploads/images/c_140857.jpg'),
(180, 'Ryousuke Kira', '吉良涼介', '配角', 'Kenichi Suzumura', 'Previously a second year football player at Matsukaze Kokuo High and now #289 in Blue Lock. He is a pretty boy with girls swooning over him. He plays as a striker and, like Yoichi, is a team-based player. Ryousuke is skeptical about the whole Blue Lock program and is against the thought of an ego-driven striker. Due to this, he is trying to defeat all 299 other strikers at Blue Lock. ~!He is kicked out of Blue Lock after being defeated by Yoichi and Meguru.!~', '/uploads/images/c_140859.jpg'),
(180, 'Meguru Bachira', '蜂楽廻', '主角', 'Tasuku Kaito', '__Birthplace:__ Chiba __Height:__ 176 cm (5''9") Meguru Bachira is a contender in the Blue Lock Project who currently plays as a center forward for Spain’s FC Barcha during the Neo Egoist League. Bachira is a whimsical forward who plays instinctively.', '/uploads/images/c_162213.jpg'),
(180, 'Rensuke Kunigami', '國神錬介', '主角', 'Yuuki Ono', '__Height:__ 188 cm __Team:__ Team Z Rensuke Kunigami is very serious about his football career and training; he''s always the first in the training room in the morning and the last to leave at night. Kunigami tends to get into arguments with Raichi, but is also the one who restrains him the most when he picks a fight with someone. ~! During the second selection Kunigami is eliminated from Blue Lock project, but afterwards gets a second chance through the Wild Card training !~ ~! After Blue Lock vs. Japan U20 match, Kunigami gets back into Blue Lock project. His appearance changed a bit and his attitude too. !~', '/uploads/images/c_162214.jpg'),
(180, 'Seishirou Nagi', '凪誠士郎', '配角', 'Nobunaga Shimazaki', '__Height:__ 190 cm (6''3") Contender for the Blue Lock Project. He attends Hakuho High School alongside [Reo Mikage](https://anilist.co/character/169394/Mikage-Reo). As a striker, Nagi''s perfect ball control, flexible movements, and technical ability allow him to breathe life into even the most difficult or hopeless plays. Nagi is a very lazy and unmotivated person with an outstanding aptitude for football. He''s unnaturally talented, with amazing reflexes, good speed, and jumping skills. He has no interest in going pro or even playing at all at first. As long as he can get a decent job and keep living a lax life, he is content with doing nothing forever and often appears lethargic in his speech and body language. Introverted to a fault, he lives by himself in an apartment his parents pay for with only a pet cactus for company.', '/uploads/images/c_162969.jpg'),
(180, 'Hyouma Chigiri', '千切豹馬', '主角', 'Souma Saitou', '__Height:__ 177cm (5''10") Hyoma Chigiri is a contender for the Blue Lock Project and member of Team Z. As a young child, he was thought of as a prodigy due to his incredible speed. However, he is now psychologically scarred by a life-changing injury during his first year of high school.', '/uploads/images/c_167444.jpg'),
(180, 'Wataru Kuon', '久遠渡', '配角', 'Masatomo Nakazawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_169392.jpg'),
(180, 'Yudai Imamura', '今村遊大', '配角', 'Shouya Chiba', '__Birthplace:__ Tokushima Prefecture __Height:__ 178 cm (5''10") __Team:__ Team Z Yudai Imamura is a contender in the Blue Lock Project.', '/uploads/images/c_169393.jpg'),
(180, 'Reo Mikage', '御影玲王', '配角', 'Yuuma Uchida', '**Height:** 185 cm Reo Mikage is the heir of the Mikage Corporation. Prior to entering Blue Lock, he was a student at an elite high school, the same school as [Seishiro Nagi](https://anilist.co/character/162969/Nagi-Seishirou).', '/uploads/images/c_169394.jpg'),
(180, 'Rin Itoshi', '糸師凛', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', '__Height:__ 186 cm (6''1") First-year high school student and contender for the Blue Lock Project. He is the younger brother of Sae Itoshi, a prodigy considered one of the best youth soccer players in the world. Rin once had the aspiration of being the greatest in the world alongside his brother, but after a disagreement, he became obsessed with beating his brother in football to demonstrate he can succeed without him. Rin is a player who loves to play perfectly efficient football but isn’t hesitant to be daring and take surprising risks to fully embrace the live-or-die attitude he has grown fond of and appreciates. Whether on offense or defense, Rin''s play style consists of him grasping the abilities of both his teammates and his opponents and forcing out their best plays and abilities. He either manipulates them in his efforts to score goals for himself or aims to crush them at their strongest.', '/uploads/images/c_169395.jpg'),
(180, 'Aoshi Tokimitsu', '時光青志', '配角', 'Shinnosuke Tachibana', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_169396.jpg'),
(180, 'Sae Itoshi', '糸師冴', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', '__Height:__ 180 cm (5''11") Sae Itoshi is regarded as the best player in Japan and is [Rin Itoshi](https://anilist.co/character/169395/Rin-Itoshi)''s older brother. He is a member of Re AL youth team and is regarded as one of the best youth players in the world. ~!He is a member of the New Generation World XI.!~', '/uploads/images/c_169397.jpg'),
(180, 'Gurimu Igarashi', '五十嵐栗夢', '配角', 'Aoi Ichikawa', '__Height:__ 175 cm', '/uploads/images/c_169398.png'),
(180, 'Okuhito Iemon', '伊右衛門送人', '配角', 'Ryuunosuke Watanuki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_169399.jpg'),
(180, 'Jyuubei Aryuu', '蟻生十兵衛', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_169400.png'),
(180, 'Shouei Barou', '馬狼照英', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', '__Height:__ 187 cm', '/uploads/images/c_169401.png'),
(180, 'Jingo Raichi', '雷市陣吾', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', '__Height:__ 184 cm __Team:__ Team Z Raichi is the most hot-headed of the group and argues with just about everyone on everything, often to the point of needing to be restrained by Kunigami.', '/uploads/images/c_169402.png'),
(180, 'Ikki Niko', '二子一揮', '配角', 'Natsuki Hanae', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_169403.png'),
(180, 'Gin Gagamaru', '我牙丸吟', '配角', 'Shuugo Nakamura', '__Height:__ 191 cm Gagamaru was a forward who aspired to be the best in the world, along with the others of Blue Lock. When first arriving at Blue Lock, he was a member of Team Z during the First Selection.', '/uploads/images/c_169404.jpg'),
(180, 'Anri Teieri', '帝襟アンリ', '配角', 'Eri Yukimura', '__Height:__ 157cm (5''2") Anri is a new member of the Japan Football Association. Sometime after the defeat of the Japanese National Team in the 2018 World Cup, Anri proposes the Blue Lock plan to the executives of the Japan Football Union to help Japan win the World Cup.', '/uploads/images/c_169405.png'),
(180, 'Zantetsu Tsurugi', '剣城斬鉄', '配角', 'Kazuyuki Okitsu', '__Birthplace:__ Saitama Prefecture __Height:__ 187 cm (6''2") Zantetsu Tsurugi is a contender in the Blue Lock Project. ~!He was a member of Team V during the First Selection and remained among the selected contenders after the Second Selection. Known for his simplicity and remarkable speed, he played as a right winger for France’s Paris X Gen during the Neo Egoist League. Following the conclusion of the 5th round, he was ranked 19th overall and qualified as one of the 23 players selected for the U-20 World Cup.!~', '/uploads/images/c_169406.jpg'),
(180, 'Asahi Naruhaya', '成早朝日', '配角', 'Daishi Kajita', '__Height:__ 171 cm __Team:__ Team Z Naruhaya is the youngest member of Team Z and is always seen stealing food from Gin. ~!During the Second Selection Naruhaya teams up with Barou, but loses in a 2v2 match against Isagi and Nagi, and is eliminated from Blue Lock!~', '/uploads/images/c_179957.png'),
(180, 'Ryuusei Shidou', '士道龍聖', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Birthplace:__ Tokyo __Height:__ 185 cm (6''1") Ryuusei Shidou is a contender in the Blue Lock Project. ~!He was ranked #2 during the Third Selection and was initially chosen as the wildcard for the Blue Lock Eleven in their match against Japan’s U-20 team, but was instead selected by [Itoshi Sae](https://anilist.co/character/169397/Itoshi-Sae) to play for the U-20 side. He later stood out as one of the top players in the project. During the Neo Egoist League, he played as a center forward for France’s Paris X Gen. Following the conclusion of the 5th round, he was ranked 3rd overall and qualified as one of the 23 players for the new Japan U-20 team.!~', '/uploads/images/c_186875.png'),
(180, 'Eita Otoya', '乙夜影汰', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', '__Birthplace:__ Aichi __Height:__ 177 cm (5''10") Eita Otoya is a contender in the Blue Lock Project. ~!When first introduced, he was ranked #4 during the Third Selection and later played both right wing and right-back for the Blue Lock Eleven in their match against Japan’s U-20 team. He played as a right winger for Spain’s FC Barcha during the Neo Egoist League.!~', '/uploads/images/c_187523.png'),
(180, 'Tabito Karasu', '烏旅人', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', '__Birthplace:__ Osaka __Height:__ 183 cm (6''0") Tabito Karasu is a contender in the Blue Lock Project. ~!He played as a central midfielder for France’s Paris X Gen during the Neo Egoist League. When first introduced, he was ranked #3 during the Third Selection and later played as a defensive midfielder for the Blue Lock Eleven in their match against Japan’s U-20 team.!~', '/uploads/images/c_187524.png'),
(180, 'You Hiori', '氷織羊', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 183 cm (6''0") Hiori Yo one of friends that Isagi made before Third Selection begins', '/uploads/images/c_187546.png'),
(180, 'Nanase  Nijirou', '七星虹郎', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 178 cm (5''10") Nananse Nijirou is one of friends that Isagi made before Third Selection begins', '/uploads/images/c_187547.png'),
(180, 'Kyouhei Shiguma', '志熊恭平', '配角', '', 'One of the players Isagi played aganist in Third Selection.', '/uploads/images/c_191408.jpg'),
(180, 'Kenyu Yukimiya', '雪宮剣優', '配角', 'Takuya Eguchi', '__Team:__ Team C; 3rd Clear Team (formerly); Blue Lock 11 (Left Wing) __Position:__ Forward; Winger He is currently ranked #5 out of the original 300 forwards chosen to be apart of the Blue Lock Project ~!and is currently starting as a winger for the Blue Lock Eleven team against the Japan U-20.!~ Yukimiya is highly confident in his own abilities, declaring himself the strongest player in Japan, when it comes to one-on-one battles. He is also a likable and charismatic personality, appearing to make friends easily, like with Nagi. In addition to this, Yukimiya likes to make banter even with his opponents, indicating a playful element to his personality. Yukimiya claims that he is a pacifist, which forms part of his ego, since he sees the easiest and most peaceful way to score would be to do so himself. He is also inquisitive, often being the first to ask questions of Ego, about his selection criteria.', '/uploads/images/c_191409.png'),
(180, 'Kairu  Saramadara', '皿斑海琉', '配角', '', 'One of the players Isagi played aganist in Third Selection.', '/uploads/images/c_191410.png'),
(180, 'Noel Noa', 'ノエル・ノア', '配角', '', 'He is a 31-year old forward from France who plays on France''s National Team and on the German club team Bastard München. Noa is known as the best striker in the world and he is Yoichi Isagi''s idol. He is initially introduced at the beginning of the series but he officially makes his debut in the Neo Egoist League when he comes to Blue Lock as the master striker/coach of the Germany Stratum.', '/uploads/images/c_268966.jpg'),
(180, 'Julian Loki', 'ジュリアン・ロキ', '配角', 'Hiro Shimono', '__Team:__ Paris X Gen, France National Team, Team World Five (Former) __Position:__ Forward Julian Loki is a young French football prodigy renowned for his exceptional speed and skill. He plays as a forward for the French club Paris X Gen (PXG) and is also a member of the France National Team. First introduced during Third Selection, as a member of the Team World 5, he is initially at Blue Lock to analyze and rate the last string of Blue Lock players. He later returns to help train the Blue Lock players and participate in the Neo Egoist League as the master striker and coach of the France Stratum, all in order to train his protégé, [Charles Chevalier](https://anilist.co/character/334890/Charles-Chevalier), into becoming his personal passer so they may become the best in the world together. ~!He is a member of the New Generation World XI.!~', '/uploads/images/c_269064.jpg'),
(180, 'Adam Blake', 'アダム・ブレイク', '配角', 'Daisuke Takahashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_269065.jpg'),
(180, 'Junichi Wanima', '鰐間淳壱', '配角', 'Ryouta Suzuki', '__Birthplace:__ Kagoshima Prefecture __Height:__ 182 cm (6''0") Junichi Wanima is a contender in the Blue Lock Project and the older twin brother of [Keisuke Wanima](https://anilist.co/character/284965).', '/uploads/images/c_284964.jpg'),
(180, 'Keisuke Wanima', '鰐間計助', '配角', 'Ryouta Suzuki', 'Younger twin brother of [Junichi Wanima](https://anilist.co/character/284964).', '/uploads/images/c_284965.jpg'),
(180, 'Hibiki Ookawa', '大川響鬼', '配角', 'Yuuki Shin', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_289961.png'),
(180, 'Hirotoshi Buratsuta', '不乱蔦宏俊', '配角', 'Bin Shimada', 'The man who serves as the chairman of the Japan Football Association. He sees soccer as a business and doesn''t really think about helping the Japanese national team win The World Cup. He is also skeptical of the "Blue Lock" project.', '/uploads/images/c_290639.png'),
(180, 'Ranze Kurona', '黒名蘭世', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 168 cm (5''6") __Team:__ Bastard München (NEL) __Position:__ Wingback, Forward Ranze Kurona is a participant of the Blue Lock project and plays for Bastard München during the Neo Egoist League. He typically plays as a post-player who can be easily utilized to exchange possession in the instance [Isagi](https://anilist.co/character/140856/Yoichi-Isagi) gets pressured.', '/uploads/images/c_290887.png'),
(180, 'Shuusaku Nihei', '弐瓶集作', '配角', 'Yoshihito Sasaki', 'Editor-in-Chief of _SoccerDirect_', '/uploads/images/c_291170.jpg'),
(180, 'Girolan Dabadie', 'ジローラン・ダバディ', '配角', 'Souta Arai', '[Sae Itoshi](https://anilist.co/character/169397/Sae-Itoshi)''s manager', '/uploads/images/c_291176.jpg'),
(180, 'Reo no Chichi', '玲王の父', '配角', 'Hiroki Touchi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_293017.jpg'),
(180, 'Reo no Haha', '玲王の母', '配角', 'Saori Hayami', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_293018.jpg'),
(180, 'Issei Isagi', '潔一生', '配角', 'Kouichi Souma', 'Father of [Yoichi Isagi](https://anilist.co/character/140856)', '/uploads/images/c_293893.jpg'),
(180, 'Iyo Isagi', '潔伊世', '配角', 'Mai Nakahara', 'Mother of [Yoichi Isagi](https://anilist.co/character/140856/)', '/uploads/images/c_293894.jpg'),
(180, 'Youta Naruhaya', '成早陽太', '配角', 'Misa Ishii', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_297188.png'),
(180, 'Tenka Naruhaya', '成早天花', '配角', 'Misaki Watada', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_297189.png'),
(180, 'Mahiru Naruhaya', '成早真昼', '配角', 'Yui Horie', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_297190.png'),
(180, 'Yuuya Naruhaya', '成早星奈', '配角', 'Serika Hiromatsu', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_297191.png'),
(180, 'Yuu Bachira', '蜂楽優', '配角', 'Yuuko Kaida', 'Mother of [Meguru Bachira](https://anilist.co/character/162213). She is a painter.', '/uploads/images/c_299060.jpg'),
(180, 'Coach', 'コーチ', '配角', 'Hiromichi Tezuka', 'Middle soccer coach of Meguru Bachira.', '/uploads/images/c_299064.jpg'),
(180, 'Dada Silva', 'ダダ・シウバ', '配角', 'Robert Waterman', '__Jersey Number:__ 5 __Position:__ Forward A member of Team World 5. Silva currently plays for Brazi''s National Football Team.', '/uploads/images/c_300790.jpg'),
(180, 'Aiki Himizu', '日不見愛基', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_300807.jpg'),
(180, 'Leonardo Luna', 'レオナルド・ルナ', '配角', 'Shinichirou Kamio', 'Professional player from Spain known as ''The Scion of Real Madrid'' who plays on Spain''s Real Madrid and the Spain National Team. He arrives at Blue Lock as member of the Team World 5 to analyze and rate the last string of Blue Lock players.', '/uploads/images/c_300811.jpg'),
(180, 'Pablo Cabassos', 'パブロ・カバソス', '配角', 'Wataru Komada', 'Member of the Team World 5. Pablo currently plays for Argentina''s National Football Team.', '/uploads/images/c_300812.jpg'),
(180, 'Haruhiko Yuzu', '柚春彦', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_301235.jpg'),
(180, 'Yukio Ishikari', '石狩幸雄', '配角', '', 'A contender for the Blue Lock Project, known as the tallest high school soccer athlete in Japan.', '/uploads/images/c_301251.jpg'),
(180, 'Shingen Tanaka', '田中信玄', '配角', '', 'A contender for the Blue Lock Project. Ranked 5th after the third selection.', '/uploads/images/c_301254.png'),
(180, 'Shizuka Haiji', '灰地静', '配角', '', 'A contender for the Blue Lock Project.', '/uploads/images/c_301255.jpg'),
(180, 'Taiga Tsunzaki', '劈大河', '配角', '', 'Contender of the Blue Lock Project.', '/uploads/images/c_301256.png'),
(180, 'Akira Endoji', '猿堂寺暁', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_301257.jpg'),
(180, 'Reiji Hiiragi', '柊零次', '配角', '', 'Contender for the Blue Lock Project.', '/uploads/images/c_301258.jpg'),
(180, 'Tetsu Sokura', '曽倉哲', '配角', '', 'Contender for the Blue Lock Project.', '/uploads/images/c_301259.jpg'),
(180, 'Jin Kiyora', '清羅刃', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 165cm Contender for the Blue Lock Project. Plays for Bastard München during the Neo Egoist League', '/uploads/images/c_301260.png'),
(180, 'Hajime Nishioka', '西岡初', '配角', '', 'Contender for the Blue Lock Project. He makes it to the third selection, but is mentioned as being treated for an injury sustained during the World''s Select Battle and is not introduced with the rest of his team.', '/uploads/images/c_301261.jpg'),
(180, 'Sena Naruhaya', '成早夕夜', '配角', 'Serika Hiromatsu', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_302965.png'),
(181, 'Katsuki Bakugou', '爆豪勝己', '配角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5''7") __Quirk:__ Explosion Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Katsuki is a crude, arrogant, short-tempered, and aggressive person, especially at the beginning of the series. Due to the constant praise of his abilities and powerful Quirk, Katsuki has developed a superiority complex, and because of that, he desires to be the first and best at everything. He loves to win above all else and cannot stand it when he doesn''t, leading him to lose his already short temper if he achieves anything but a complete victory. Katsuki is not only very athletic and talented at fighting, but also very intelligent and extremely perceptive, capable of strategic planning and improvisation. Additionally, his grades are among the highest of his class. Katsuki also possesses surprising talent in other areas, such as cooking and music, even though he doesn''t show a particular interest in them. Overall, Katsuki is considered a natural-born genius with the potential to be one of the best Pro Heroes. Katsuki''s Quirk "Explosion" allows him to secrete nitroglycerin-like sweat from the palms of his hands and ignite it on command, allowing him to create strong explosions. The more Katsuki sweats, the stronger his explosions become. Not only can Katsuki use the explosions for attacking, he can also use them to propel himself and navigate through the air at high speeds, allowing him to fly at his opponents without giving them time to react, as well as evade incoming attacks, even whi', '/uploads/images/c_88892.png'),
(181, 'Izuku Midoriya', '緑谷出久', '主角', 'Daiki Yamashita', '__Height:__ 166 cm (5''5¼") __Quirk:__ One For All Student in Class 1-A at U.A High School. Although he was born without a Quirk, Izuku''s innate heroism and strong sense of justice manages to catch the attention of the legendary hero [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224). Izuku has since become All Might''s closest pupil. Izuku is a very timid, reserved, and polite boy. Although initially portrayed as insecure, tearful, and vulnerable, Izuku gradually matures into a more confident and braver person. His infectious leadership skills, combined with his passion and strategic abilities, have turned Izuku into a central figure of Class 1-A. He is caring and emotional, never hesitating to help or rescue someone in danger, even if he knows that he might not be strong or otherwise qualified enough to do it. Izuku is extremely (and sometimes scarily) enthusiastic about topics related to heroes. His dream drives him to write down notes about everything he learns about heroes'' Quirks and fighting capabilities. Thanks to this practice, Izuku has developed a great analytical mind and can form complex battle plans in a few seconds, factoring in the best ways he can utilize the Quirks of allies and enemies alike for his own advantage. Izuku''s Quirk "One For All" was transferred to him from All Might. His Quirk allows him to stockpile an enormous amount of raw power, allowing him to significantly enhance all of his physical abilities to various boundless levels. This results in unbel', '/uploads/images/c_89028.png'),
(181, 'Shouto Todoroki', '轟焦凍', '配角', 'Yuuki Kaji', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9") __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Half-Cold Half-Hot Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School, where he got in through official recommendations. He is the youngest son of the top hero [Endeavor](https://anilist.co/character/126158). Shouto initially has a cold, aloof personality, which stemmed from his complicated family life. Focused and unemotional, Shouto preferred to keep things to himself instead of hanging out with others. After the events of the U.A. Sports Festival, however, he notably became more sociable and kinder than ever before. He even gained a sense of humor and would occasionally smile, although still retaining some fragments of his previous distant attitude and nonchalant demeanor. While usually quiet and reserved, Shouto initially possessed a moderate level of arrogance, which, combined with his solitary tendencies, sometimes made him take the initiative without considering the opinions of others. Shouto''s Quirk Half-Cold Half-Hot gives him the ability to generate ice from the right side of his body, and flames from his left side. Due to years of rejecting his father, Shouto has developed a habit of favoring ice, even when fire would be a better option. This grudge also caused him to have difficulty controlling his flames. If he overuses one element without utilizing the other, then his own body temperature will suffer.', '/uploads/images/c_89220.png'),
(181, 'Ochako Uraraka', '麗日お茶子', '配角', 'Ayane Sakura', '__Height:__ 156 cm (5''1") __Quirk:__ Zero Gravity Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School Ochako is an outgoing, lively person who thinks about everything positively, though she is objective enough to see flaws and virtues. She gets excited over little things very easily. Ochaco has been described by other students as "the most laidback girl" among her class, being very bubbly and kind of an airhead at times. She is often incredibly blunt without being aware of it. She is on good terms with everyone and is particularly close friends with several class members, including [Izuku](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku), [Tenya Ida](https://anilist.co/character/89222/Iida-Tenya), and [Tsuyu](https://anilist.co/character/89223/Asui-Tsuyu). Ochaco''s Quirk gives her the power to manipulate gravity upon touching solid things with the pads on her fingertips. The targets lose their gravitational pull, effectively making them weightless. She is able to activate or cancel her Quirk''s effects by closing her fingers together, and is shown to be careful with her hands in order to avoid accidental quirk activation.', '/uploads/images/c_89221.png'),
(181, 'Tenya Iida', '飯田天哉', '配角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5''10") __Quirk:__ Engine Class representative of Class 1-A at U.A. High School Tenya may look severe, but he''s actually just a very serious person, who takes everything, even the most insignificant thing, seriously. A testament to his generally hyperactive and intense behavior, Tenya often exhibits plenty of peculiar tics, such as moving his arms around in strange chopping patterns or sometimes twitching his body uncontrollably. Tenya is very humble, willing to admit to his mistakes, apologize for rude behavior, and improve in areas he lacks. Being part of the highly-esteemed Ida Family of Heroes, Tenya is proud of his lineage and works hard to meet his expectations. He greatly admires his older brother, Tensei (also known as the Turbo Hero: Ingenium), and aspires to become a similar hero. Tenya''s Quirk Engine gives him car-like engines in each of his calves, giving him incredible running speed and extreme kicking power. Tenya needs to fuel his engines by drinking orange juice. Tenya''s engines have multiple gears; it is currently unknown how many, but it has been implied that there are more than three.', '/uploads/images/c_89222.png'),
(181, 'Tsuyu Asui', '蛙吹梅雨', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', '__Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Frog Tsuyu is a very straight-forward girl that always says what''s on her mind and what she thinks about others. She prefers to be called by her first name.', '/uploads/images/c_89223.png'),
(181, 'Toshinori Yagi', '八木俊典', '配角', 'Kenta Miyake', '__Height:__ 220 cm (7''2") __Quirk:__ One for All All Might is the No. 1 Hero and the "Symbol of Peace." In his hero form, All Might is a very tall and over-muscular man whose design resembles the american hero comics. His hair spikes on top of his head and his whole body has more shadows than a normal human being. However, in his true form, he is an overly-skinny man who spits a lot of blood out of his mouth and his clothes appear loose.', '/uploads/images/c_89224.jpg'),
(181, 'Shouta Aizawa', '相澤消太', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', '__Height: __183 cm (6'') __Occupation:__ Pro Hero, Teacher __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Erasure Aizawa''s hero name, Eraserhead, was coined by [Present Mic](https://anilist.co/character/127425) when they were younger. Using the binding cloth, Aizawa has a unique fighting style that allows him to immobilize his enemies. He is known to expel students that don''t meet his standards, however it should be noted that he did not expel anyone from Class 1-A. Aizawa is extremely vocal, able to voice his opinions very easily. Although seeming emotionless and reserved, he has a soft spot for his students and genuinely cares for them.', '/uploads/images/c_89225.png'),
(181, 'Tomura Shigaraki', '死柄木弔', '主角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9) __Quirk:__ Decay Leader of the League of Villains and protégé of [All For One](https://anilist.co/character/125956/All-For-One). He was raised by his master, All For One, with the goal of killing [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224/Yagi-Toshinori), and ultimately destroying the society he represents. Tomura is a very twisted, malevolent, and maliciously warped young man, who is considered to be the polar opposite of [Izuku Midoriya](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku). He doesn''t care for his or almost anyone else''s life, having no qualms about performing evil deeds like murdering innocent people. Tomura was initially perceived to be a "man-child": arrogant, selfish, dependent, and demanding, becoming angry if things didn''t go his way and likening reality to some sort of video game. Unlike his mentor, Tomura lacked subtlety, preferring to eliminate problems through force. Much like a child, Tomura seemed unable to cope with his own feelings, instead lashing out and abusing both others or himself, tearing at his own neck when he becomes frustrated. Initially, Tomura seemingly caused destruction just for the sake of it and felt directionless about the League''s path forward after [Stain](https://anilist.co/character/126067/Akaguro-Chizome)''s arrest. It would take a fateful meeting with Izuku in a mall for him to develop an epiphany and become aware of his true convictions: to crumble hero society through All Might''s death. Tomur', '/uploads/images/c_89226.jpg'),
(181, 'Momo Yaoyorozu', '八百万百', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") __Quirk:__ Creation Vice class representative of Class 1-A at U.A. High School. She was admitted to the school through official recommendations. Momo is a very prudent, dedicated person who acts as a natural leader. She is generally level-headed and calm in dangerous situations, but she isn''t above falling into a panic. Momo can be blunt with her comments about people''s mistakes and miscalculations, tending to be very direct and wishing to help her peers improve enough to become great heroes. Momo''s Quirk gives her the ability to create any non-living material/object from her exposed skin by transforming the molecular structure of her fat cells. In order to create something, she needs to understand the molecular structure of which the material/object is made.', '/uploads/images/c_89241.png'),
(181, 'Eijirou Kirishima', '切島鋭児郎', '配角', 'Toshiki Masuda', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Quirk:__ Hardening Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Eijiro is a boisterous and outgoing guy with a fondness for manliness, often using the terms "manly" and "unmanly" to describe things and people he does or doesn''t like, respectively. Eijiro is very honest and kind-hearted, having a straightforward way of thinking and following a specific code of chivalry that motivates him to live without regret. He is determined and selfless, bravely putting the safety of others before himself. He is also a big fan of Crimson Riot, a retro hero from whom he takes inspiration, including personal values and his hero name. Although Eijiro may not be as hot-blooded and competitive as [Katsuki Bakugou](https://anilist.co/character/88892), he does not shy away from comparing himself to him, with [Izuku](https://anilist.co/character/89028) stating that the two have managed to develop a relationship between equals. As a result, Eijiro is notably one of the few people that Katsuki holds in higher esteem. Eijiro''s Quirk gives him the power to harden and sharpen any or all parts of his body, causing his flesh to become jagged and rock-like. There is a limit to how much damage his hardened body can withstand, which causes the Hardening itself to slowly dissipate, and Eijiro to lose stamina from struggling to keep his Quirk active.', '/uploads/images/c_89243.jpg'),
(181, 'Minoru Mineta', '峰田実', '配角', 'Ryou Hirohashi', '__Height:__ 108 cm (3'' 6½") __Quirk:__ Pop Off __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Fighting Style:__ Medium Ranged Support Minoru Mineta, also known as the Fresh-Picked Hero: Grape Juice, is a student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School, training to become a Pro Hero.', '/uploads/images/c_89244.png'),
(181, 'Mina Ashido', '芦戸三奈', '配角', 'Eri Kitamura', '__Height:__ 159 cm (5''3") __Quirk:__ Acid Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Mina is a cheerful and easygoing girl who usually displays a smile. Highly social and excitable, she loves to hang out with her friends and is shown to become very upset when denied an opportunity to be at a gathering. She possesses a strong fashion sense and likes to go shopping. Due to her athleticism and energy, Mina enjoys and is very skilled at dancing. Mina is extremely courageous and is viewed as an ideal personality for hero work. Mina''s Quirk Acid allows her to produce a corrosive liquid from her body. She can control the solubility and viscosity of this corrosive liquid. There is a limit to how long she can produce the corrosive liquid until her skin gradually loses its natural resistance to it. Overusing her Quirk or pushing it too far can also be fatal, as it dehydrates her body very fast. Mina can use her acid offensively, but has shown utility with it as well, such as melting handholds for herself to climb with. She is also known to secrete a non-corrosive version of the acid from her feet in order to slide around.', '/uploads/images/c_89247.png'),
(181, 'Denki Kaminari', '上鳴電気', '配角', 'Tasuku Hatanaka', '__Height:__ 168 cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Electrification Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Denki is a friendly, social, and energetic boy who enjoys hanging out with others. He is rather casual when interacting with other people, including the generally unfriendly [Katsuki Bakugou](https://anilist.co/character/88892/Bakugou-Katsuki). Denki''s Quirk Electrification allows him to store and discharge electricity. While he can also discharge this energy over a distance, Denki has little to no control over it, meaning it will go everywhere indiscriminately. Denki is also able to absorb and neutralize electricity and other lightning-based Quirks. Whenever Denki exceeds his wattage limit, he loses his ability to discharge energy, with his entire personality changing into that of a giggling idiot for a certain period until he reverts to normal. In this state, he is always giving thumbs-ups as a way to let others know that he is okay.', '/uploads/images/c_89249.png'),
(181, 'Jin Bubaigawara', '分倍河原仁', '配角', 'Daichi Endou', '__Height:__ 178 cm (5''10") __Quirk:__ Double Villain affiliated with the League of Villains, and part of its Vanguard Action Squad. Jin has an incredibly unique personality: explosive, and lively with a very comedic demeanor. He enjoys assuming dramatic poses and eccentric facial expressions. Jin constantly contradicts himself, making a statement in one voice and immediately saying the opposite in another. This juxtaposition iss part of a mental instability that Jin embraces as a villain. He believes understanding your own identity is the most essential aspect in life, an understanding he lost during the 9-day conflict with his own clones that left him unsure whether he was the original or not. Now, if his mask is removed, he panics and threatens to "split" until he put his mask back on to become "whole". Jin''s Quirk allows him to create an exact duplicate of anything, living or not. To duplicate something, he needs to know its precise measurements and characteristics. The clones he makes do not disappear; instead, they disintegrate into a mud-like substance after taking a certain amount of damage. The duplicates are less durable than the original, and the second duplicate is even less durable than the first. When Jin creates duplicates of a person, he has no control over the clones because they have their own autonomy, personalities, and abilities that are utterly identical to the original.', '/uploads/images/c_89589.png'),
(181, 'Hanta Sero', '瀬呂範太', '配角', 'Kiyotaka Furushima', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5'' 9¾") __Quirk:__ Tape Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Hanta is amicable and has proven to be one of the more sociable members of Class 1-A. He can sometimes be loud and showy, often trying to impress his peers with his Quirk. He is often the only person to call his classmates out when they act crazy. He is pretty humorous and usually makes jokes with his classmates. However, when push comes to shove, Hanta is a brave hero-in-training who wishes to prosper on his own while helping others do the same. Hanta''s Quirk is that he has tape dispenser-like organs in his elbows, from which he can shoot long cellophane tape-like strips; he can also retract them. They appear to be somewhat sturdier than regular tape. Overuse of his Quirk will cause his skin to dry out. He can use his tape to wrap people, swing long distances, and create traps, among other applications.', '/uploads/images/c_89895.png'),
(181, 'Kyouka Jirou', '耳郎響香', '配角', 'Kei Shindou', '__Height:__ 154 cm (5''1") __Quirk:__ Earphone Jack __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Fighting Style:__ Medium Ranged + Support Combat Kyoka is a petite, fair-skinned girl with a slender build. She has triangular, lazy-looking onyx eyes with notably long lower eyelashes, and rather small eyebrows. Kyoka has a pragmatic, unenthusiastic and teasing personality that is mostly shown to those she finds irritating. Kyoka is not always like this though, as she does enjoy socializing with others, in which case she is usually nice and friendly. Kyoka''s Quirk (Earphone Jack) allows her to plug the jacks that hang from her earlobes into all sorts of things and channel the sound of her heartbeat into them; causing havoc inside the plugged objects. It''s also used to catch sounds and vibrations from her surroundings.', '/uploads/images/c_89897.png'),
(181, 'Fumikage Tokoyami', '常闇踏陰', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', '__Height:__ 158 cm __Quirk:__ Dark Shadow Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Fumikage is reserved, serious, and focused, albeit noble and valiant. Though not talkative, Fumikage will directly ignore questions or requests that seem in some way pointless. During combat, Fumikage is known to be fierce and dependable, with his strength and capabilities rarely being questioned. Fumikage is fond of darkness and other related concepts, considering himself a "creature of the dark" and employing archaic-sounding speeches that paint him slightly creepy or dramatic. Fumikage''s Quirk "Dark Shadow" allows him to manifest a sentient shadow monster from his body that he can materialize and contract freely. Dark Shadow''s energy is limited and can be drained by bright light. Dark Shadow retracts into Fumikage''s body when it runs out of energy. The shadow entity''s personality, strength, defense, and control depend on the lack of light. In bright light, Dark Shadow is weaker and smaller but still has considerable strength and defense and is easier to control, but in total darkness, Dark Shadow''s size and parameters are drastically enhanced. It is powerful enough to rip out and cut down multiple full-grown trees easily. However, Dark Shadow is more difficult to control in the dark, causing it to rampage based on its own free will.', '/uploads/images/c_89898.png'),
(181, 'Mezou Shouji', '障子目蔵', '配角', 'Masakazu Nishida', '__Height:__ 187 cm (6''2") __Quirk:__ Dupli-Arms Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Shouji is friendly and gentle, and he will work nicely with anyone. He is not the type to hold grudges, showing no ill will towards those that harm him unwillingly. Shouji is entirely selfless and willing to risk his life for anyone. He can be empathetic and understanding, but still shows a sense of maturity and responsibility that prevents him from acting under emotional impulses. He is very protective of his classmates, especially if they are hurt or injured. He is also quite thick-skinned, as he said he is used to being feared due to his appearance. Shouji''s Quirk grants him a set of tentacles alongside his arms. He can transform the tips of these tentacles to replicate other parts of his body (ex: mouth, ears, eyes). The duplicated body parts are more efficient than the originals; as a result, Mezo is able to hear better, see-through more angles at a time, and they grant him much higher degrees of strength. He uses these arms to talk most of the time through duplicate mouths, rather than his actual mouth.', '/uploads/images/c_89899.png'),
(181, 'Tooru Hagakure', '葉隠透', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', '__Height:__ 152 cm (5''0") __Quirk:__ Invisibility Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Tooru is a bubbly, cheery, and easygoing girl who does most things with an upbeat attitude. She is very socially eager and likes shopping, and her room suggests that she likes plushies and other cute things. Tooru''s Quirk is that her body is completely invisible. In addition to the stealth capabilities granted to her by her invisible body, Tooru can refract light that passes through her, allowing her to intensify the light into a blinding flash. She has further refined this application of her Quirk, achieving the ability to manipulate and redirect light-based attacks, such as [Yuuga Aoyama](https://anilist.co/character/127042/Aoyama-Yuuga)''s Navel Laser.', '/uploads/images/c_89900.png'),
(181, 'Kouji Kouda', '口田甲司', '配角', 'Takuma Nagatsuka', '__Height:__ 186 cm (6''1") __Quirk:__ Anivoice Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Contrary to his strong and powerful appearance, Kouji is very timid and quiet. He rarely speaks and prefers using sign language to communicate with his classmates. He hates violence due to his kind-hearted nature. Kouji appears to greatly enjoy the company of animals, as his Quirk allows him to interact with animals in ways others cannot. He owns a small rabbit as a pet. Kouji''s Quirk "Anivoice (生き物ボイス, Ikimono Voice)" gives him the ability to command any creature in the animal kingdom by speaking to them. Whatever command he gives, the animal will carry it out. However, he cannot exert control if they cannot hear his command. The target must also be a real animal and not merely animal-like. Kouji can also exchange information with the animals to find the locations of various people and potential enemies faster. Kouji has been shown to use the Quirk effectively with flocks of birds to create a smokescreen of animals and to attack an opponent, along with his use of insects to distract and attack his opponents. He has now also overcome his fear of bugs, so he often uses bugs to swarm opponents with numbers.', '/uploads/images/c_89901.png'),
(181, 'Rikidou Satou', '砂藤力道', '配角', 'Tooru Nara', '__Height:__ 185 cm (6''1") __Quirk:__ Sugar Rush Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Rikidou is interested in sweets and baking, a valuable skill due to his Quirk. He is surprisingly talented at making sweets. Rikidou''s Quirk Sugar Rush allows him to increase his strength five-fold for three minutes. To activate his Quirk, he needs to consume 10 grams of sugar. When converting sugar into strength, his cognitive functions gradually drop, making him sleepy afterward. For every additional 10 grams of sugar he ingests, he extends the time of increased strength by another three minutes.', '/uploads/images/c_89902.png'),
(181, 'Yuu Takeyama', '岳山優', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', '__Height:__ 162 cm (5''4") (Normal form); 2062cm (67''8") (Transformed) __Quirk:__ Gigantification __Occupation:__ Pro Hero Pro Hero. Her Quirk allows her to grow to a gigantic size. She cannot variate between her base-height and the gigantified height achieved via her Quirk, making her only able to be either her normal height of 162cm (5 feet 4 inches) or her enlarged height of 2,062cm (67 feet 8 inches) tall.', '/uploads/images/c_121529.png'),
(181, 'Mirio Togata', '通形ミリオ', '配角', 'Tarusuke Shingaki', '__Height:__ 181 cm (5''11") __Occupation:__ Student __Affiliation:__ U.A. High School __Quirk:__ Permeation He is third-year student at U.A. High School and is part of The Big 3 _(the strongest three hero students in all of Japan)_. Before [Izuku Midoriya](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku), Mirio was the top candidate for [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224/Yagi-Toshinori)''s successor and inheritor of One For All. His Quirk, Permeation, gives him the ability to become intangible, letting him pass through any tangible matter; he can phase through walls and/or the ground, as well as let enemy attacks pass through him harmlessly.', '/uploads/images/c_123527.png'),
(181, 'Himiko Toga', '渡我被身子', '配角', 'Misato Fukuen', '__Height:__ 157 cm __Quirk:__ Transform Himiko Toga is a villain affiliated with the League of Villains and part of its Vanguard Action Squad. She originally joined the group as a means to get closer to [Stain](https://anilist.co/character/126067). Himiko is a very cheerful girl, to the point of smiling even after having presumably killed someone, displaying apparent sadistic tendencies. She has a very twisted perception of love and friendship Himiko''s Quirk Transform grants her the ability to transform into a physical lookalike of another individual, as well as copy their voice. She can only transform into people whose blood she has ingested. The more blood she drinks, the longer she has access to that person''s form. For example, 1 cup of blood allows her to transform for a total of 18 hours. She can even switch between the appearances of multiple people if she drinks the blood of more than one person.', '/uploads/images/c_125619.png'),
(181, 'Tamaki Amajiki', '天喰環', '配角', 'Yuuto Uemura', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''10") __Quirk:__ Manifest Third-year student in Class 3-A at U.A. High School and part of The Big 3 (the strongest three hero students in all of Japan). Tamaki is extremely shy, aloof, depressed, "intimidating", and introverted, especially around big audiences. He gets nervous very easily when talking to other people. If his anxiety gets the best of him, Tamaki will often face away and lean into a wall to hide his face from others. While his physical abilities and Quirk are outstanding, Tamaki is socially awkward and lacks confidence in his powers. Despite his timid heart, Tamaki can show flashes of bravery. Even though he''s always been a shy and reserved boy, Tamaki was able to hone his skills and climb the ranks into one of U.A.''s Big 3. [Mirio Togata](https://anilist.co/character/123527/Togata-Mirio) is a big inspiration for Tamaki. Tamaki''s Quirk Manifest grants him the ability to manifest the physical characteristics of anything he''s eaten; for example, if he eats takoyaki, he can transform his fingers into octopus tentacles. Additionally, anything Tamaki manifests is significantly stronger than normal. The more of a substance Tamaki eats, the stronger his manifestation will be. He can only manifest the traits of substances still in his system and loses access to those traits once the substance is fully digested. He must resupply his Quirk daily and decide what foods to eat beforehand.', '/uploads/images/c_125934.png'),
(181, 'All For One', 'オール・フォー・ワン', '配角', 'Akio Ootsuka', '__Quirk:__ All For One __Occupation:__ Villain __Fighting Style:__ Close Range and Long Range All For One is the true leader and benefactor of the League of Villains. Once Japan''s most powerful villain and All Might''s arch-nemesis, his true motives are unclear and his true identity unknown. His current goal is to raise Shigaraki to become his eventual successor.', '/uploads/images/c_125956.jpg'),
(181, 'Shuuichi Iguchi', '伊口秀一', '配角', 'Ryou Iwasaki', '__Height:__ 174 cm __Occupation:__ Villain __Affiliation:__ League of Villains (formerly), Paranormal Liberation Front (Lieutenant of Brown Regiment) __Quirk:__ Gecko Shuuichi is a villain affiliated with the League of Villains and part of its Vanguard Action Squad. He is completely obsessed with the ways of [Stain](https://anilist.co/character/126067) to the point where he copies his clothing and weaponry style, aiming to follow the same ideals as him and make his dreams come true.', '/uploads/images/c_126005.png'),
(181, 'Itsuka Kendou', '拳藤一佳', '配角', 'Saki Ogasawara', '__Height:__ 166 cm (5''5") __Quirk:__ Big Fist Class representative of Class 1-B at U.A. High School, Itsuka is a spirited girl who is thoughtful of others. She does not hesitate to criticize even her classmates if she feels what they are doing is not correct. Due to Itsuka''s cheerful personality, she can bring all of Class 1-B together, thus making her the "big sister" of Class 1-B. Itsuka''s Quirk Big Fist grants her the ability to enlarge both of her hands to a gigantic size. With the increased size comes enhanced striking power and gripping capabilities.', '/uploads/images/c_126064.png'),
(181, 'Chizome Akaguro', '赤黒血染', '配角', 'Gou Inoue', '__Height:__ 182 cm (6''0) __Quirk:__ Bloodcurdle Villain and former vigilante that was notorious for having killed many Pro Heroes. He attacks and kills heroes who he believes do not fit his definition of a "true hero." Chizome is a cruel, unforgiving, and merciless man with a sense of duty to cleanse society of false heroes. He believes that those who become Heroes for fame or money are unworthy of being called the name and only [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224/Yagi-Toshinori) is a true hero. Due to his strong ideology, he took it upon himself to become the Hero Killer: Stain to stain his own hands with blood to purge fake heroes and change the current society. Despite his extremist views and beliefs, Stain did have genuine ideals about heroism, which he stood by firmly. He did not hesitate to save people he deemed worthy of being called Heroes, did not like killing without reason, and would even give advice to his enemies. Stain acknowledged that what he did was morally wrong but believed that for society to be put on the right path, someone must be what he was, suggesting that he saw himself as a martyr. Stain''s Quirk "Bloodcurdle" allows him to paralyze his target upon tasting a sample of their blood. The amount of time a victim remains paralyzed depends on their blood type; in ascending order from shortest to longest duration, they are: O, A, AB, and B. The maximum amount of time that anyone can be paralyzed is eight minutes. _In My Hero Academia: Vigilantes', '/uploads/images/c_126067.png'),
(181, 'Eri', '壊理', '配角', 'Seiran Kobayashi', '__Height:__ 110 cm __Quirk:__ Rewind Eri is a child with bandages all over her body. She wears a white short sleeve dress and has a small horn on the right side of her forehead and has white, long, choppy, unkempt hair. She also has red eyes. Under her bandages, her arms are shown to have numerous scars. ~!Eri is the key source to [Kai Chisaki''s](https://anilist.co/character/126357/Kai-Chisaki) operation to manufacture a Quirk-Destroying Drug. She is the granddaughter of the Eight Precepts of Death''s boss!~', '/uploads/images/c_126093.jpg'),
(181, 'Enji Todoroki', '轟炎司', '配角', 'Tetsu Inada', '__Height:__ 195 cm (6'' 4¾") __Occupation:__ Pro Hero __Quirk:__ Hellflame Endeavor is a tall man with a muscular physique. He has short and spiky, red hair with bright blue eyes. His beard and mustache appear to be made of fire, but when he turns off his flames on his face voluntarily, his stubble shows. ~!His desire to surpass the number one hero has driven him in family matters. Enji put [Shouto](https://anilist.co/character/89220/Todoroki-Shouto) through ruthless "training" which caused Shouto a severe degree of physical and emotional pain. Shouto, harboring a bitter hatred towards his father on account of this, refuses to use his fire powers in battles until [Izuku Midoriya](https://anilist.co/character/89028/Midoriya-Izuku) reminded him of his mother''s encouragement. Later, Enji understood his mistakes and told his son he would try to be a better hero and father. He hopes for Shouto and the rest his family to forgive him in the future.!~ ~!He''s the former No.2 Hero, but later becomes the new No.1 Hero after [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224/Yagi-Toshinori) loses his Quirk!~', '/uploads/images/c_126158.png'),
(181, 'Nana Shimura', '志村菜奈', '配角', 'Mie Sonozaki', 'Shimura Nana was the seventh user of the One For All Quirk, [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224)''s mentor, and a close friend of [Gran Torino](https://anilist.co/character/127428). ~!It was revealed that she is the grandmother of [Shigaraki](https://anilist.co/character/89226)!~', '/uploads/images/c_126319.png'),
(181, 'Kai Chisaki', '治崎廻', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5''10") __Quirk:__ Overhaul Kai Chisaki, also known by the villain name Overhaul, is the Yakuza Captain of the Shie Hassaikai. Overhaul is a mysophobic, antisocial sociopath obsessed with returning the world to the way it was before the Quirk phenomenon. Due to a combination of an old theory claiming Quirks derived from rats and his own mysophobia, Overhaul believes that Quirks are actually a plague on humanity, having infected people with "syndromes" of heroism and villainy. He looks down upon those that use their abilities for either purpose, referring to acts of heroic sacrifice or petty crime as "sicknesses". Overhaul is extremely determined to his ambition of eradicating Quirks, not only due to his own personal phobias, but also because such a thing would allow the yakuza to reclaim the power they once held over society. Kai''s Quirk "Overhaul" grants him the ability to disassemble anything he touches, as well as reassemble it in any configuration he desires, effectively giving him full control over matter. Kai can disassemble people to kill them or reassemble them to heal their wounds. He can also do this to himself and even merge his body with others, even allowing him to use their Quirks', '/uploads/images/c_126357.jpg'),
(181, 'Dabi', '荼毘', '配角', 'Hiro Shimono', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9¼") __Quirk:__ Blueflame Dabi is a villain affiliated with the League of Villains and a member of the organization''s Vanguard Action Squad. Dabi is a stoic, aloof, confident, and focused individual who rarely shows emotion. While rather crude and violent, he''s also shown to be quite cautious. Overall, Dabi is a highly enigmatic individual who trusts no one, preferring to do things alone and in his way. He also gives off the impression of knowing more about certain people than he lets on. Dabi''s Quirk grants him the ability to generate and control highly destructive blue flames from his body. He has very well-developed control of his flames and can project them far from himself and in large amounts. However, Dabi''s body has a low tolerance for his flame, and he will get burned if he uses them for prolonged periods. ~!It is later revealed that Dabi is Touya Todoroki (轟燈矢), the eldest son of the Pro Hero [Endeavor](https://anilist.co/character/126158/Todoroki-Enji) and his wife [Rei](https://anilist.co/character/150628/Todoroki-Rei), and the older brother to [Shouto Todoroki](https://anilist.co/character/89220/Todoroki-Shouto). For a significant period of time, his whereabouts were unknown.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126378.png'),
(181, 'Nejire Hadou', '波動ねじれ', '配角', 'Kiyono Yasuno', '__Height:__ 164 cm (5''4") __Occupation:__ Student __Quirk:__ Wave Motion (ability to convert body''s vitality into energy that can discharge as blast waves) She is third-year student at U.A. High School and is part of The Big 3 _(the strongest three hero students in all of Japan)_. Nejire is very enthusiastic, affable and cheery, and is always seen moving. She shows great interest in people''s unique physical features and is easily distracted by them. She seems to like knowing more than others, but not in a proud way, as she just enjoys explaining things to people and sharing her knowledge. Despite her happy-go-lucky personality, Nejire is fierce in battle. When the situation calls for it, Nejire can be very calm and focused. Her curiosity never seems to extend to the enemy and she always maintains her focus on taking them down.', '/uploads/images/c_126843.png'),
(181, 'Yuuga Aoyama', '青山優雅', '配角', 'Kousuke Kuwano', '**Height:** 168 cm (5''6") **Quirk:** Navel Lazer Student in Class 1-A at U.A. High School. Yuuga appears to be vain and prideful, thinking of himself as superior to the rest of his classmates, especially regarding his Quirk. He exhibits flamboyant mannerisms, is fond of posing, and likes to grab the attention of those around him despite frequently getting ignored by his peers. He also plays up his French heritage, occasionally implementing French words into his sentences. Yuuga''s Quirk allows him to shoot a powerful sparkling laser cannon from his navel. It is so powerful, it can blast through two meters of solid concrete. If he fires the laser for more than 1 second at a time, he will suffer intestinal distress.', '/uploads/images/c_127042.png'),
(181, 'Tetsutetsu Tetsutetsu', '鉄哲徹鐵', '配角', 'Kouji Okino', '__Height:__ 174cm (5''9") __Quirk:__ Steel Student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School. Tetsutetsu is defined by his very hotheaded and outspoken personality. He is confident, stubborn, and straightforward in his motivations and actions. He tends to be very vocal about his intentions and has a one-track mind, often looking for the simplest solution to problems to solve them most directly. Tetsutetsu''s direct personality shows through his tenacious and upfront fighting style during battles. Tetsutetsu''s Quirk allows him to turn his body into steel. This power grants Tetsutetsu both augmented defensive abilities to withstand attacks and the increased strength of his unarmed physical attacks.', '/uploads/images/c_127043.png'),
(181, 'Hizashi Yamada', '山田ひざし', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', '__Height:__ 185cm (6''1") __Quirk:__ Voice Pro Hero. He also works as an English teacher at U.A. High School and as a radio talk show host. Yamada maintains the eccentric persona of a radio host. He often poses when he talks and maintains a certain level of excitement or volume, regardless of the situation. Though he tends to be a jovial individual, Hizashi is capable of great rage when it comes to his friends and colleagues. Yamada''s Quirk "Voice" allows him to increase the volume of his voice, giving him an ability that is similar to a sonic scream. The sound from his Quirk is strong enough to cause people''s ears to bleed from far away. The only known weakness of this Quirk is that the loud sounds do not travel well underground, making this Quirk ineffective against anything that is underground or separated from him by layers of earth.', '/uploads/images/c_127425.png'),
(181, 'Ibara Shiozaki', '塩崎茨', '配角', 'Miho Masaka', '__Height:__ 167cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Vine Student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School. Ibara is a very modest and courteous person. Although graceful and soft-spoken, she is not afraid to make her pure intentions known. She seems highly religious due to her talking about heaven and divine beings in passing on multiple occasions, and her ultimate moves having somewhat religious names such as "Faith''s Shield" and "Crucifixion". Ibara''s Quirk "Vine (ツル, Tsuru) gives her hair-like vines that grow on her head. She can lengthen and manipulate the vines, allowing her to attack, defend and grapple. She also can detach them at will. The vines will grow back, provided her head receives proper sunlight and water. (Source: MyHero Academia Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_127426.png'),
(181, 'Nemuri Kayama', '香山睡', '配角', 'Akeno Watanabe', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") __Quirk:__ Somnambulist Pro Hero. She also works as a Modern Hero Art History teacher at U.A. High School. Nemuri is a very playful and flirtatious person with an unpredictably serious and temperamental side to her. She gets angry whenever someone interrupts her or insults her. She is especially sensitive about her age. Despite her flirtatious personality, Nemuri was intelligent, perceptive, and articulate. While she comes off as a hero who enjoys her fame derived from her beauty and sex appeal, Nemuri has demonstrated true heroism and bravery, willing to fight on the front lines and put her life at risk for others. Nemuri''s Quirk "Somnambulist" allows her to put nearby people to sleep by exuding a sleep-inducing aroma from her body. Her Quirk works better on males than females.', '/uploads/images/c_127427.png'),
(181, 'Sorahiko Torino', '酉野空彦', '配角', 'Kenichi Ogata', '__Height:__ 128 cm (4''2") __Affiliation:__ Yuuei (Retired) __Quirk:__ Jet A retired hero who is one of All Might''s colleagues and his former homeroom teacher. He was the one who taught All Might to control One For All during the his early days, and his training was so intense that All Might fears him to the point he subconsciously tried to forget about him until Grantorino sent his recommendation for Izuku to help him improve One For All, becoming his work place mentor. His Quirk is "Jet," allowing him to take in air through the sole of his foot to allow him to jump higher. (Source: Wikipedia)', '/uploads/images/c_127428.jpg'),
(181, 'Keigo Takami', '鷹見啓悟', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5'' 7¾") __Occupation:__ Pro Hero (No.3 - former, No.2 - current) __Quirk:__ Fierce Wings __Affiliation:__ Hero Public Safety Commission, ~!Paranormal Liberation Front (as a spy)!~ Hawks is carefree, jovial, and dislikes formalities, often acting in a spontaneous and unpredictable way while being cocky and taunting. He believes that popular approval is the most important metric a Pro Hero should be judged for, and does not appear to take the official rankings seriously, showing a preference for the lower ranks as it would allow him to act more freely and avoid the burdens of being a top hero. He states his wish to patrol in a leisurely fashion and "take it easy". It is hinted that Hawks was a fan of [Endeavor](https://anilist.co/character/126158/Todoroki-Enji) from an early age, as depicted by the drawing of him as a child holding an Endeavor figurine.', '/uploads/images/c_128299.png'),
(181, 'Taishirou Toyomitsu', '豊満太志郎', '配角', 'Kazuyuki Okitsu', '__Height:__ 250 cm (8''2") (Fat form) __Quirk:__ Fat Absorption In his fat form, Taishiro is a big round man, easily towering over other adults. In this form, his mouth is big, and his nose is smaller, which alongside his odd body proportions, give him an odd look. After burning through his fat, however, it is revealed that he is quite muscular, and his body adapts conventional proportions. His hero costume consists of black pants and an orange zippered hood, which has the initials of his alias on the front of Fat Gum. Alongside them, he also wears gloves, metallic boots, and a mask that covers his eyes and his forehead.', '/uploads/images/c_129755.jpg'),
(181, 'Shinji Nishiya', '西屋森児', '配角', 'Masamichi Kitada', '__Height:__ 168 cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Arbor Pro Hero. Underneath his helmet, he has puffy red leaf-like hair, though his face has remained unseen since he has only been shown while wearing his mask. Shinji is a very serious and focused person when it comes to being a hero in his hero duties; however, he easily feels down when someone takes his glory or credit. Shinji''s Quirk "Arbor" (樹木, Jumoku) allows him to enlarge and control his wooden body parts into strong tree branches. These branches are excellent for binding.', '/uploads/images/c_129758.png'),
(181, 'Natsuo Todoroki', '轟夏雄', '配角', 'Yuuki Shin', '__Height:__ 181 cm Natsuo Todoroki is a college student. He is the son of [Enji](https://anilist.co/character/126158/Todoroki-Enji) and [Rei Todoroki](https://anilist.co/character/150628/Todoroki-Rei), the younger brother of Toya and [Fuyumi](https://anilist.co/character/150627/Todoroki-Fuyumi), and the older brother of [Shoto](https://anilist.co/character/89220/Todoroki-Shouto). Natsuo is a young man of average height, sporting white spiky hair with two small pieces of hair hanging down by his forehead. He greatly resembles his father at his age. Natsuo seems to be a care-free individual, as seen in his interactions with him and his family. However, he can be serious, and cares deeply for his family, except his father who he resents for his abusive treatment to his family. He does not feel forgiving to his father, blaming him for his mother Rei''s hospitalization and Shoto''s suffering.', '/uploads/images/c_129759.png'),
(181, 'Mirai Sasaki', '佐々木未来', '配角', 'Shinichirou Miki', '__Height:__ 200 cm (6''6¾") __Birthplace:__ Tokyo, Japan __Quirk:__ Foresight A Pro Hero and [Mirio Togata](https://anilist.co/character/123527)''s mentor. He was formerly [All Might](https://anilist.co/character/89224)''s sidekick and was considered to be the brains behind All Might''s hero operation before opening his own hero agency. Sir Nighteye is a lean but muscular man with a clean, well-kept appearance. Unlike most Pro Heroes, he seems to prefer plain office clothes (a plain white suit with gold buttons, a white dress shirt, and a red tie with white dots) instead of an elaborate hero costume. Sir Nighteye maintains a stoic and intimidating presence, with a cold and sharp glare, but that is only the side of his personality that he shows in public. He greatly values humor and actually requires people to make him laugh before he acknowledes them. Nighteye believes that humor and energy are vital elements for the future of society and punishes subordinates that fail to display those qualities.', '/uploads/images/c_129761.jpg'),
(181, 'Naomasa Tsukauchi', '塚内直正', '配角', 'Tokuyoshi Kawashima', 'Naomasa Tsukauchi is a police detective in the Police Force. Naomasa is a tall man with short black hair and black eyes. As a member of the police force, he is normally seen in his uniform. He wears a signature tan overcoat and a matching hat. He also sports a black suit underneath with matching slacks and dress shoes. Detective Tsukauchi is an earnest, hardworking individual who has earned the right to be a close friend of All Might. Enough so, that he was even entrusted with the truth about One For All and the latter''s true form. He appears to have a close relationship with All Might, as he even leaked sensitive information to the hero just because he felt it was the right thing to do.', '/uploads/images/c_129762.png'),
(181, 'Shikkui Makabe', '真壁漆喰', '配角', 'Hiromichi Kogami', '__Height:__ 180cm __Quirk:__ Stiffening Second year student at Ketsubutsu Academy, his quirk, ''stiffening'', allows him to harden objects with his hands by rubbing or kneading them', '/uploads/images/c_130942.png'),
(181, 'Itejirou Touteki', '投擲射手次郎', '配角', 'Kenta Ookuma', '__Height:__ 171cm __Affiliation:__ Ketsubutsu Academy __Quirk:__ Boomerang A second year student at Ketsubutsu Academy. His Quirk, "Boomerang," allows him to plan the trajectory of any given object he can throw, including underground.', '/uploads/images/c_131154.jpg'),
(181, 'Tatami Nakagame', '中瓶畳', '配角', 'Megumi Han', '__Height:__ 155cm __Occupation:__ Student __Affiliation:__ Ketsubutsu Academy __Quirk:__ Telescopic A second year student as Ketsubutsu Academy. Her Quirk, "Telescopic," allows her to fold her limbs into her body, similar to a turtle.', '/uploads/images/c_131156.jpg'),
(181, 'You Shindou', '真堂揺', '配角', 'Yuuta Kasuya', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9") __Affiliation:__ Ketsubutsu Academy High School __Quirk:__ Vibrate A second year at Ketsubutsu Academy. His quirk, "Vibrate," allows him to create large tremors similar to earthquakes, but firing off strong attacks leaves him immobile.', '/uploads/images/c_131157.jpg'),
(181, 'Kouta Izumi', '出水洸汰', '配角', 'Michiru Yamazaki', '__Height:__ 107cm (3''5") Kota Izumi is the nephew of Shino Sosaki and the son of the hero team Water Hose.', '/uploads/images/c_133659.jpg'),
(181, 'Inko Midoriya', '绿谷引子', '配角', 'Aya Kawakami', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3'''') Izuku Midoriya''s mother. Her quirk allows her to pull small objects towards her.', '/uploads/images/c_136897.png'),
(181, 'Atsuhiro  Sako', 'コンプレス', '配角', 'Tsuguo Mogami', 'Mr. Compress''s Quirk allows him to "compress" anything in a spherical area into a small marble without actually damaging it. The weight of the target is reduced alongside them, making them very easy to carry. If used on a person, it effectively entraps them, terminating the fight instantly and allowing Mr. Compress to abduct them without difficulty. The Quirk can also be used on select body parts, maiming the target.', '/uploads/images/c_141748.png'),
(181, 'Giran', '義爛', '配角', 'Seirou Ogino', 'Giran is a B-rank villain and broker in affiliation with the League of Villains, working to scout new recruits for their organization', '/uploads/images/c_141749.jpg'),
(181, 'Muscular', 'マスキュラ', '配角', 'Kousuke Takaguchi', 'Befitting his appearance, Muscular has a very sadistic and bloodthirsty personality. He openly admits that he wants to use his Quirk freely to kill. Muscular enjoys killing and tormenting those he fights, often saying "show me your blood!". Unlike most of the other members of the Vanguard Action Squad, he joined the League of Villains just to let loose his brutal tendencies, rather than following Stain''s ideology', '/uploads/images/c_141750.png'),
(181, 'Moonfish', 'ムーンフィッシ', '配角', 'Shuuhei Matsuda', 'Blade-Tooth (歯刃 Shijin?): Moonfish''s quirk gives him the ability to enlarge and manipulate his teeth into powerful blade. Being one of the most powerful people in the Vanguard action squad being able to take on numerous powerful heros at once', '/uploads/images/c_141751.jpg'),
(181, 'Emi Fukukado', '福門笑', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 5''5 __Quirk:__ Outburst Pro Hero and a teacher of 2nd year, Class 2 at Ketsubutsu Academy High School.', '/uploads/images/c_142169.png'),
(181, 'Shinya Kamihara', '紙原伸也', '配角', 'Kenta Kamakari', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") __Quirk:__ Foldabody: Shinya''s Quirk allows him to make his body and limbs extremely thin and long, effectively allowing him to transform himself into a razor sharp string. He is able to transform faster than the speed of sound. Shinya is a calm and focused individual, who is able to maintain a level head even when in a crisis situation, and encourages his teammates when they begin to panic. He is proven to be quite intelligent and is good at analyzing situations and strategy. He is the former Number 5 Pro-Hero, and is currently Number 4.', '/uploads/images/c_143275.png'),
(181, 'Tomoko Shiretoko', '知床知子', '配角', 'Chisa Suganuma', 'Her Quirk allowed her to observe and monitor up to 100 people at a time, including their location and weak points.', '/uploads/images/c_143535.jpg'),
(181, 'Tsunagu Hakamada', '袴田維', '配角', 'Hikaru Midorikawa', '__Height:__ 190cm (6''3") __Quirk:__ Fiber Master Pro Hero, ranked in the top 4. He is the recipient of the "Best Jeanist" award for eight consecutive years. Tsunagu is an elegant man with flamboyant tendencies. He believes very strongly that people with influence must maintain a positive appearance both physically and socially. Tsunagu often uses metaphors referencing jeans, denim, and various other sewing and fabric-based phrases, often inspiring his recruits with speeches, telling them to keep their life straight like their jeans. Tsunagu takes the role of being a hero very seriously. He is selfless, brave, and charismatic, and he aims to spread a sense of a peace to all people, no matter how dire the situation. Tsunagu''s Quirk "Fiber Master (ファイバーマスター)" allows him to freely manipulate the threads in any nearby piece of fabric. He has power over all types of cloth, but his Quirk works best with denim and is less effective on sweats. Fiber Master also works on other types of fiber not related to fabric, such as carbon fibers. He primarily uses this power to restrain his targets, either by using their own clothing against them, or simply unravels portions of his own clothing into strings.', '/uploads/images/c_143536.png'),
(181, 'Shino Sousaki', '送崎信乃', '配角', 'Meiko Kawasaki', 'Telepath: This Quirk allows Shino to utilize a mental transmission and send telepathic messages directly into people''s minds. Shino, has displayed the ability to send a message to tens of people at a time. She can send messages, but she can''t receive them', '/uploads/images/c_143537.jpg'),
(181, 'Yawara Chatora', '茶虎柔', '配角', '', 'Pliabody: Yawara''s Quirk allows him to stretch, flatten, and bend his body in ways that would normally be impossible', '/uploads/images/c_143538.jpg'),
(181, 'Nezu', '根津', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Takato', '__Height:__ 85 cm __Quirk:__ High Spec Nezu, also known as Mr. Principal is a Pro Hero and the principal of U.A. High School. He is an extremely rare case of an animal who manifested a Quirk. He can be very long-winded at times when explaining or educating.', '/uploads/images/c_143539.png'),
(181, 'Gigantomachia', 'ギガントマキア', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Mamiya', 'Gigantomachia is a villain associated with the League of Villains.[1] He is one of All For One''s faithful servants and his former bodyguard, cultivated to be of use to Tomura Shigaraki if anything were to happen to him.', '/uploads/images/c_143540.png'),
(181, 'Ryuuko Tsuchikawa', '土川流子', '配角', 'Serina Machiyama', '__Height:__ 167cm (5''6") __Quirk:__ Earth Flow Ryuko Tsuchikawa also known as Pixie-Bob, is a Pro Hero and a member of the Wild, Wild Pussycats. She is a very hyperactive and loud person with little regard for how she may come off to other people and also is very self-conscious about her age. Ryuko''s Quirk allows her to freely manipulate the earth for a variety of effects.', '/uploads/images/c_143541.jpg'),
(181, 'Thirteen', 'スペースヒーロ・13号 ', '配角', 'Inuko Inuyama', 'Thirteen is a wise, well-mannered person. As a rescue hero, Thirteen has displayed how passionate they are about saving people through their teachings. They even developed their own training facility - the Unforeseen Simulation Joint - to train future heroes in search and rescue tactics. They are very passionate about Quirks, specifically on the topic of using Quirks for creation and assistance rather than for destruction and battle. Thirteen has also been shown to be very brave. Despite not being a combat type, they do not hesitate to use their Quirk to fight against villains in the name of protecting others', '/uploads/images/c_143542.png'),
(181, 'Ryuuko Tatsuma', '竜間龍子', '配角', 'Kaori Yagi', 'When she activates her Quirk, her body transforms into that of a large, winged dragon with pale gray scales, although she still has the same skin tone, hair and eyes, and her hero costume remains visible bar her boots.', '/uploads/images/c_145291.jpg'),
(181, 'Ken Takagi', '高木鍵', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Fujiwara', 'Quirk: Lock Down:/Ken can immobilize anything not living, locking it into a particular place. However, it can be overwhelmed by force and cannot apply to large areas. Ken is a man of average height, with a darker complexion and dark, curly hair. He has pierced ears with padlocks in them. Notably, his fingertips have protrusions that resemble key teeth. Part of his hero costume is a small white mask that covers his eyes. He wears a necklace around his neck with five keys dangling from it. Rock Lock wears a two-colored, short-sleeved shirt with a black section and a white print on it, resembling a keyhole. He wears two light-colored shoulder pads with a dark keyhole shape on both of them.', '/uploads/images/c_145292.png'),
(181, 'Daruma Ujiko', '氏子達磨', '配角', 'Minoru Inaba', 'Daruma Ujiko is the pseudonym of a villain affiliated with the League of Villains, later the Paranormal Liberation Front. He is a faithful servant of All For One and later Tomura Shigaraki as well.', '/uploads/images/c_148747.jpg'),
(181, 'Oboro Shirakumo', '白雲朧', '配角', 'Kenshou Ono', 'Oboro was a man of average stature with light, wavy hair that was swept back to flow upwards above his head, two shorter, ear-length tufts left hanging downwards to frame his face. He usually wore an expression of excitement, possessing a large, teeth-bearing grin and semicircular, inward-tilting eyes that were often squeezed shut. Quirk: **Cloud** (he is capable of moving through the air by creating clouds and riding on them.)', '/uploads/images/c_148982.png'),
(181, 'Rumi Usagiyama', '兎山ルミ', '配角', 'Sayaka Kinoshita', 'Rumi is the No. 5 Pro Hero. She has an athletic build with muscular arms and legs. She has dark skin, red eyes which are tilted slightly inwards, and straight white hair reaching down past her waist. On her head, she has a pair of long white rabbit ears pointing upwards with a slight crook. Along with these, she also has a round white tail, which gives her overall design a definite resemblance to an albino rabbit. Her hero costume consists of a sleeveless white leotard with dark purple trim around her shoulders and waist, a wide, yellow crescent moon design over her chest, and two thick metal plates on her midriff. She wears purple thigh-high boots to compliment her leotard, with more plating around the heel and toe areas, making her feet look like those of a rabbit. She also has white gloves on her hands, with long cuffs, sporting small triangular protrusions around the edges.', '/uploads/images/c_148985.png'),
(181, 'Setsuna Tokage', '取蔭切奈', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', 'Setsuna Tokage is a student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School, and is one of four students admitted through recommendations; one being her fellow 1-B classmate Juzo Honenuki, as well as rival Class 1-A students Shoto Todoroki and Momo Yaoyorozu.', '/uploads/images/c_149179.png'),
(181, 'Kinoko  Komori', '小森希乃子', '配角', 'Kei Shindou', 'Kinoko Komori is a student in Class 1-B, and is training to be a Pro Hero. Her quirk, Mushroom, allows her to spread spores that sprout mushrooms wherever they land, including inside of people''s bodies.', '/uploads/images/c_149180.png'),
(181, 'Juzo Honenuki', '骨抜柔造', '配角', 'Masamichi Kitada', '__Height:__ 174 cm (5''8½") __Affiliation:__ U.A High __Quirk:__ Softening Juzo Honenuki is a student in Class 1-B at U.A. High School, and is one of four students admitted through recommendations; one being his fellow 1-B classmate [Setsuna Tokage](https://anilist.co/character/149179/Tokage-Setsuna), the others being rival 1-A students [Shoto Todoroki](https://anilist.co/character/89220/Todoroki-Shouto) and [Momo Yaoyorozu](https://anilist.co/character/89241/Yaoyorozu-Momo). Juzo''s Quirk allows him to soften any non-living thing he touches. For example, he can soften the ground to make it similar to quicksand, hindering movements and mobility. If Juzo makes contact again, he can undo the effect. He is also capable of swimming through softened material.', '/uploads/images/c_149183.png'),
(181, 'Rikiya Yotsubashi', '四橋力也', '配角', 'Hiroaki Hirata', 'Rikiya, better known by his code name Re-Destro, is the president and CEO of the Detnerat Company, the son of the infamous villain Destro (for which he named his own code name after), as well as the secret leader of the villainous Meta Liberation Army, an organization that follows the philosophy that the usage of Quirks is a basic human right, and seeks to liberate society and allow for the free use of Quirks.', '/uploads/images/c_149184.png'),
(181, 'Tatsuyuki Tokoname', '常滑達行', '配角', 'Takumu Miyazono', 'A Pro Hero. ~!He is also secretly a member of the villainous Meta Liberation Army.!~', '/uploads/images/c_149185.png'),
(181, 'Kuugo Sakamata', '逆俣空悟', '配角', 'Shuuhei Matsuda', 'Gang Orca is the current No. 11 Pro Hero, dropping from his previous No. 10 place. He took part in the assault on All For One and the League of Villains at Kamino Ward, and later served as a makeshift villain during the Provisional Hero License Exam.', '/uploads/images/c_149186.png'),
(181, 'Desutegoro', 'デステゴロ', '配角', 'Shinnosuke Ogami ', 'Death Arms is a Pro Hero. He took part in the fight against the Sludge Villain, and later witnessed the U.A. Sports Festival from outside the arena, along with Mt. Lady and Kamui Woods.', '/uploads/images/c_149187.png'),
(181, 'Ken Ishiyama', '石山堅', '配角', 'Kenta Ookuma', 'Cementoss is a Pro Hero as well as a teacher at U.A. High School. During the U.A. Sports Festival, he acted as the proctor for the 1-on-1 fights in case things got out of hand. He also faced off against Eijiro Kirishima and Rikido Sato in their Final Exam.', '/uploads/images/c_149188.jpg'),
(181, 'Fuyumi Todoroki', '轟冬美', '配角', 'Kei Shindou', 'The only daughter of Eiji and Rei. Fuyumi is the younger sister of Touya and the older sister of Natsuo and Shouto. Fuyumi is a hard working girl, often making meals for the family and works as a teacher at an unnamed school. Unlike her family members, she doesn''t resent her father and just wishes they could all be a happy family, though she realizes such a thing is unlikely. Upon hearing Shouto gains friends, however, Fuyumi gets quite excited over it and is happy for him. In the past, Fuyumi took care of Shouto after their mother went to a hospital and never came back. To this day, her wish that she could have done something for Shouto still lingers within her.', '/uploads/images/c_150627.png'),
(181, 'Rei Todoroki', '轟冷', '配角', 'Michiko Neya', 'The damaged mother of the Todoroki family. Rei has an ice related quirk, which is believed to be powerful, as Eiji would not have had kids with her otherwise. In the past, Rei was very supportive towards Shouto and his dreams to become like All Might. She used to always say that his blood does not define him for him and for herself. Rei, who was once a kind and caring woman, is now in a mental ward. After all the abuse she faced from Eiji, she began to become mentally unstable. Over time, she had slowly began to snap, until she finally poured boiling water onto Shouto''s left side after seeing it. Immediately after burning Shouto, Rei began to apologize and attempt to comfort him when she realized what she had done. Due to her snapping, she was placed into a mental ward for her own safety. Even though Rei is in a mental ward, she has since returned to her former self. When Shouto visited, she was immensely happy and apologized for what she had done to him. Fuyumi and Natsuo also visit her as well, though she has yet to meet Eiji face to face again out of fear.', '/uploads/images/c_150628.png'),
(181, 'Ectoplasm', 'エクトプラズム', '配角', 'Masakazu Nishida', '__Height:__ 180 cm (5'' 11") __Affiliation:__ Yuuei __Quirk:__ Clones Ectoplasm has the ability to produce ectoplasm from his mouth and transform it into clones of himself. He can create up to thirty clones at once, and push his limit to thirty-six if he''s feeling good. He can also produce a giant clone of himself, although this sacrifices his ability to produce normal-sized ones for the time being. His clones can be defeated with a strong blow, but otherwise, only Ectoplasm can dispel them.', '/uploads/images/c_150853.jpg'),
(181, 'Geten', '外典', '配角', 'Seiichirou Yamashita', 'Geten is a loyal warrior of the Liberation Army and a devout believer in its principles. He feels greatly indebted and thankful to Re-Destro for granting him more power and desires to create a world where the strongest superpowers stand at the top of the hierarchy.', '/uploads/images/c_160441.jpg'),
(181, 'Moe Kamiji', '上路萌', '配角', 'Misato Kawauchi', 'Moe Kamiji, also known as her hero name Burnin, is a pro hero and one of over 30 sidekicks working at the Endeavor Hero Agency.', '/uploads/images/c_160442.png'),
(181, 'Koku Hanabata', '花畑孔腔', '配角', 'Junji Majima', 'Koku Hanabata, also know as Trumpet, is a member of the Meta Liberation Army, a Paranormal Liberation Front lieutenant, and also the leader of the Hearts and Mind party.', '/uploads/images/c_160443.png'),
(181, 'Tomoyasu Chikazoku', '近属友保', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', 'Tomoyasu Chikazoku, also known as Skeptic, is a member of the Meta Liberation Army.', '/uploads/images/c_160444.png'),
(181, 'Snipe', 'スナイプ', '配角', 'Tooru Nara', '__Quirk:__ Homing Snipe is a Pro Hero and a member of the teaching staff at U.A. High School. Snipe has the appearance of a stereotypical western cowboy Snipe''s Quirk allows him to lock on to any target he can see within six hundred meters and make any projectile he releases chase after said target', '/uploads/images/c_191596.jpg'),
(181, 'Shihai Kuroiro', '黒色支配', '配角', 'Kouhei Amasaki', 'Shihai is a sly, deceitful schemer, who prefers to catch people off guard. He appears to enjoy dark concepts and has a penchant for dramatic speech', '/uploads/images/c_208141.jpg'),
(181, 'Juurouta Shishida', '宍田獣郎太', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', 'Juurouta seems to be an intellectual as he uses a fairly verbose way of speaking and often addresses others by respectful titles such as ''sir'' and ''miss''. This is because he was brought up in a very well mannered and doting family. While transformed, however Juurouta is rather boisterous and energetic, which is likely a side effect of his Quirk.', '/uploads/images/c_208142.jpg'),
(181, 'Nirengeki Shoda', '庄田連撃', '配角', 'Kenta Ookuma', 'Nirengeki has a very humble attitude, as he will not take credit for something he does not feel he earned by his own strength.', '/uploads/images/c_208143.jpg'),
(181, 'Wash', 'ウォッシュ', '配角', 'Hiro Shimono', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_208144.jpg'),
(181, 'Reiko Yanagi', '柳レイ子', '配角', 'Ayane Sakura', 'Reiko is a quiet and emotionless teenager who often shows an odd body posture.', '/uploads/images/c_208149.jpg'),
(181, 'Selkie', 'セルキー', '配角', '', 'Can do pretty much everything a spotted seal can do. He can even make sonar-like sound and use the echo to determine his opponent''s position. He is also very strong even if he believes that he can make a very cute seal face (which most people think is not).', '/uploads/images/c_210090.jpg'),
(181, 'Masaki Mizushima', '水島正規', '配角', 'Kenta Ookuma', '__Height:__ 176 cm __Occupation:__ Pro Hero Masaki Mizushima, also known as Normal Hero: Manuais, is the current No. 222 Pro Hero. He is based out of Hosu City.', '/uploads/images/c_210091.jpg'),
(181, 'Yoichi Shigaraki', '死柄木与一', '配角', 'Souichirou Hoshi', 'All For One''s younger brother.', '/uploads/images/c_216391.jpg'),
(181, 'Kaina Tsutsumi', '筒美火伊那', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', '__Quirk:__ Rifle A villain who used to be a Pro Hero. Kaina Tsutsumi can protrude and retract a rifle from her right elbow, which she can fire bullets out of with a range of 3 kilometers. She can create and use different types of bullets by mixing and molding her hair, such as hollow-point bullets and curving bullets.', '/uploads/images/c_225724.png'),
(181, 'Daigorou Banjou', '万縄大悟郎', '配角', 'Hiroki Yasumoto', '__Occupation:__ Pro Hero __Quirk:__ Blackwhip; One For All (formerly) The 5th user of One For All whose natural Quirk was Blackwhip. His Quirk allowed him to create tendrils of black energy from his arms, excellent for grappling and increasing his mobility.', '/uploads/images/c_229296.jpg'),
(181, 'Mitsuki Bakugou', '爆豪光己', '配角', '', 'Mitsuki Bakugou is Katsuki Bakugou''s mother and the wife of Masaru Bakugou.', '/uploads/images/c_231957.png'),
(181, 'Sansa Tamakawa', '玉川三茶', '配角', '', 'Sansa is a member in the Police Force.', '/uploads/images/c_241582.jpg'),
(181, 'Cider House Leader', 'サイダーハウスリーダー', '配角', 'Kouji Okino', 'The leader of a gang of pickpockets who operated mainly during the holiday season, having studied the patterns and routes of hero and civilian activity in a specific street for a whole month, with the intent of maximizing profits from their looted items while facing minimal resistance. He possesses a Quirk that allows him to control carbonated water. He also has connections with the black market, having acquired a pair of gauntlets provided by Detnerat that could convert his water blasts into gatling shots.', '/uploads/images/c_242725.png'),
(181, 'Hiroshi Tameda', '為田浩', '配角', 'Serina Machiyama', '__Height:__ 170cm Hiroshi Tameda also known as "Can''t You See?" kid, is a loyal fan of Endeavor.', '/uploads/images/c_242855.png'),
(181, 'Kotarou Shimura', '志村弧太朗', '配角', 'Yuuya Tajima', 'Kotarou Shimura was the father of [Tenko](https://anilist.co/character/89226/Tomura-Shigaraki) and [Hana Shimura](https://anilist.co/character/290001/Shimura-Hana) and the son of [Nana Shimura](https://anilist.co/character/126319/Nana-Shimura).', '/uploads/images/c_251812.png'),
(181, 'Cathleen Bate', 'キャスリーン・ベイト', '配角', 'Romi Park', '__Height:__ 193 cm __Quirk:__ New Order The current No. 1 Pro Hero of the United States of America. She is stated to be the strongest woman in the whole world. Cathleen''s Quirk allows her to set a rule onto her surroundings, allowing her to manipulate and bestow new properties onto herself and the world around her. In order to activate her Quirk, she has to first make physical contact with the target and speak its name, then explains the rule she wishes to impose. She could only impose two rules at any given time.', '/uploads/images/c_254809.jpg'),
(181, 'Kidou', 'キドウ', '配角', 'Kiyotaka Furushima', '__Occupation:__ Pro Hero (Sidekick) __Affiliation:__ Endeavor Agency (Team Flaming Sidekickers) __Quirk:__ Traject One of many sidekicks who works at Endeavor''s Agency. His Quirk allows him to manipulate the trajectory of anything that passes through his bandages.', '/uploads/images/c_279795.jpg'),
(181, 'Backdraft', 'バックドラフト', '配角', '', 'Backdraft is a pro hero. His quirk, Hydrokinesis, allows him to create and manipulate water through spigots that he has in place of hands. He is affiliated with Musutafu Fire Department', '/uploads/images/c_283096.png'),
(181, 'Crust', 'クラスト', '配角', 'Tsuguo Mogami', '__Quirk:__ Shield __Occupation:__ Pro Hero (No.6) __Fighting Style:__ Close-ranged combat', '/uploads/images/c_289314.jpg'),
(181, 'X-Less', 'エクスレス', '配角', 'Yuuki Hoshi', '__Occupation:__ Pro Hero __Quirk:__ Laser One of the heroes who raided Jaku General Hospital, coming into conflict with several High-End Nomu. ~!During the raid, X-Less destroys a strange looking machine which is later revealed to produce Quirk-Destroying Drugs!~ ~!When Shigaraki awakens from his near-death state, he kills X-Less and takes the deceased hero''s cape for himself.!~', '/uploads/images/c_289999.jpg'),
(181, 'Hana Shimura', '志村華', '配角', 'Chiyuki  Miura', 'Hana was the older sister of [Tenko Shimura](https://anilist.co/character/89226/Tomura-Shigaraki) and granddaughter of [Nana Shimura](https://anilist.co/character/126319/Nana-Shimura). ~!She was killed by her brother when his Quirk went out of control!~', '/uploads/images/c_290001.jpg'),
(181, 'Nao Shimura', '志村直', '配角', 'Atsuko Yuya', 'Nao was the wife of [Kotarou Shimura](https://anilist.co/character/251812/Kotarou-Shimura) and the mother of their two children, [Tenko](https://anilist.co/character/89226/Tomura-Shigaraki) and [Hana](https://anilist.co/character/290001/Hana-Shimura). ~!She died when her son''s Quirk went out of control.!~', '/uploads/images/c_290002.jpg'),
(181, 'Eel Boy', 'イールボーイ', '配角', '', '__Occupation:__ Pro Hero __Quirk:__ Unnamed Eel Quirk Takes part in the raid on Gunga Mountain Villa led by [Edgeshot](https://anilist.co/character/143275/Shinya-Kamihara). ~!After using his Quirk to capture Mr. Compress and Himiko Toga, Eel Boy is stabbed and killed by a Double of [Twice](https://anilist.co/character/89589/Jin-Bubaigawara). Himiko would later take on Eel Boy''s appearance using her Transform Quirk, slicing through many heroes while impersonating him in a blind rampage.!~', '/uploads/images/c_291124.jpg'),
(181, 'Salaam', 'サラーム', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 190 cm __Occupation:__ Pro Hero (Egypt No. 1) __Quirk:__ Papyrus The No. 1 Pro Hero in Egypt. He has a strange aura that makes the Egyptian citizens feel at ease when they see him fight, but to this day no one has ever seen his back. Salaam''s Quirk Papyrus allows the user to flatten their body like papyrus. He can slip through narrow spaces and ride the wind to move at incredible speed. His weakness is mold in places with high humidity.', '/uploads/images/c_291608.jpg'),
(181, 'Joseikei High-End', '女性型ハイエンド', '配角', 'Arisa Sekine', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_291614.jpg'),
(181, 'Tiger Hero', '虎ヒーロー', '配角', 'Shinnosuke Ogami ', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_291615.jpg'),
(181, 'Enma Kannagi', '巫円真', '配角', 'Shougo Sakata', '__Height:__ 183 cm __Occupation:__ Pro Hero __Fighting Style:__ Long Range Support __Quirk:__ Magic Pro Hero. During U.A. High School''s Work Studies II, he takes in [Creati](https://anilist.co/character/89241) and [Lizardy](https://anilist.co/character/149179). He is one of the heroes assigned to the Villa Raid Team led by Edgeshot.', '/uploads/images/c_291616.jpg'),
(181, 'Souryo Hero', '僧侶ヒーロー', '配角', 'Shinnosuke Ogami ', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_291617.jpg'),
(181, 'Daikaku Miyagi', '宮城大角', '配角', 'Gou Inoue', '__Occupation:__ Newscaster __Quirk:__ Big Horn A newscaster who occasionally reports daily news of recent events occurring throughout the series. His most prominent features are the two horns protruding from each side of his forehead, which is a result of his Quirk. Daikaku cut off one of his horns in order to relay the news with more ease, a decision considered controversial by his viewers.', '/uploads/images/c_292849.png'),
(181, 'Hero Kouan Iinkai Kaichou', 'ヒーロー公安委員会会長', '配角', 'Sayaka Kinoshita', 'Head of the Hero Public Safety Commission which is in charge of the Hero Association in Japan. She tasked [Hawks](https://anilist.co/character/128299) to infiltrate the League of Villains in order to gather intel on the group and learn more on their current agenda.', '/uploads/images/c_296084.jpg'),
(181, 'Gyges', 'ギュゲス', '配角', 'Yuuki Onodera', 'One of the guards at the main entrance of Tartarus', '/uploads/images/c_296712.jpg'),
(181, 'Briareos', 'ブリアレオス', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Mamiya', 'One of the guards of the main entrance of Tartarus.', '/uploads/images/c_296713.jpg'),
(181, 'Hawks no Chichi', 'ホークスの父', '配角', 'Motohiro Yoneda', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_297172.jpg'),
(181, 'Tomie Takami', '鷹見遠見絵', '配角', 'Megumi Matsumoto', 'Mother of [Keigo Takami](https://anilist.co/character/128299).', '/uploads/images/c_297173.jpg'),
(181, 'Hawks no Smartphone Onsei', 'ホークスのスマートフォン音声', '配角', 'Masaya Fukunishi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_297174.jpg'),
(181, 'Yoroi Musha', 'ヨロイムシャ', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Fujiwara', '__Quirk:__ Unknown __Occupation:__ Pro Hero ~!(Retired)!~ No. 9 Pro Hero. ~!He retired due to the high backlash against Heroes following the Paranormal Liberation War.!~', '/uploads/images/c_297175.png'),
(181, 'Ishi', '医師', '配角', 'Kousuke Gotou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_297609.jpg'),
(181, 'Rei no Chichi', '冷の父', '配角', 'Masaaki Ihara', 'Father of [Rei Todoroki](https://anilist.co/character/150628).', '/uploads/images/c_297610.jpg'),
(181, 'Hikage Shinomori', '四ノ森避影', '配角', 'Toshiyuki Morikawa', '__Quirk:__ Danger Sense; ~!One For All (formerly)!~ Hikage Shinomori was a valiant and noble man who was determined to defeat [All For One](https://anilist.co/character/125956). His Quirk, Danger Sense, allowed him to sense incoming threats in the surrounding area, giving him ample opportunity to react. ~!He was the fourth user of the One For All Quirk.!~', '/uploads/images/c_297937.jpg'),
(181, 'En Tayutai', '揺蕩井煙', '配角', 'Tetsuya Kakihara', '__Quirk:__ Smokescreen; ~!One For All (formerly)!~ En is a former Pro Hero. His Quirk, Smokescreen, allowed him to generate clouds of smoke which could obscure vision. ~!He was the sixth user of the One For All Quirk.!~', '/uploads/images/c_297940.jpg'),
(181, 'Ippan Josei', '一般女性', '配角', 'Minori Suzuki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_299021.jpg'),
(181, 'Bruce Lee', 'ブルース・リー', '配角', 'Ryouta Suzuki', '__Quirk:__ ~!Fa Jin; One For All (formerly)!~ The Third user of the One For All Quirk. He was part of the resistance fighting against All For One, alongside the second user. ~!Fa Jin, the Quirk he was born with, allows the user to build up kinetic energy by repeating regular motions and store it for later use. When the user chooses to release the energy, they gain an explosive burst of speed and power.!~', '/uploads/images/c_299022.png'),
(181, 'Toshigtsugu Kudou', '駆藤敏次', '配角', 'Daisuke Ono', '__Quirk:__ ~!Gearshift; One For All (formerly)!~ The Second user of the One For All Quirk. He was the leader of a resistance movement who fought against All For One during the peak of his power. ~!Gearshift, the Quirk he was born with, allows the user to change the speed at which things accelerate through space. It is even capable of changing speeds while ignoring the laws of inertia.!~', '/uploads/images/c_299023.jpg'),
(181, 'Ochako no Chichi', 'お茶子の父', '配角', 'Shuuhei Matsuda', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_300789.jpg'),
(181, 'Big Red Dot', 'ビッグ・レッド・ドット', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 215cm (7''0¾") __Birthplace:__ Singapore __Occupation:__ Pro Hero (No. 1 in Singapore) __Quirk:__ Tidal Bore The Number 1 Hero in Singapore. He helped to fight Humarise in his home country. He was one of the foreign heroes contacted by the Hero Public Safety Commission to fight All For One, and is frustrated at all the red tape involved in aiding his friend All Might.', '/uploads/images/c_301302.jpg'),
(181, 'Wedge', 'ウェッジ', '配角', 'Yuuki Hoshi', 'One of the fighter jet pilots loyal to [Star and Stripe](https://anilist.co/character/254809), accompanying her on her flight to Japan. **His name is a reference to the Star Wars character Wedge Antilles, a renowned starfighter pilot.*', '/uploads/images/c_301303.png'),
(181, 'Egypt Taishi', 'エジプト大使', '配角', 'Michitake Kikuchi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_301304.png'),
(181, 'America Taishi', 'アメリカ大使', '配角', 'Naomi Kusumi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_301305.jpg'),
(181, 'Singapore Taishi', 'シンガポール大使', '配角', 'Masaaki Ihara', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_301306.jpg'),
(181, 'Ouji Harima', '張間歐児', '配角', '', 'A former infamous villain and the great-great-grandfather of [Atsuhiro Sako](https://anilist.co/character/141748) (Mr. Compress). He was a Robin Hood-like figure, stealing from wealthy heroes and giving back to the civilians. Harima is considered one of the great villains of the past.', '/uploads/images/c_301505.jpg'),
(182, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Akio Ootsuka', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(182, 'Puri-Puri Prisoner', 'ぷりぷりプリズナー', '配角', '', '__Occupation:__ Superhero __Level:__ S-Class; Rank 17 Puri-Puri Prisoner is a flamboyant, openly homosexual superhero. He takes an interest in other, up-and-coming heroes and criminals; an interest which led to his titular jail sentence, as he kept attacking them. Criminals that he apprehends are then added to his harem.', '/uploads/images/c_86029.png'),
(182, 'Arataka Reigen', '霊幻新隆', '主角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5''10.5") [Mob''s](https://anilist.co/character/89616) mentor and boss in the Mob Psycho 100 series. He owns a business exorcising ghosts and is a self-proclaimed psychic. He is Mob''s moral compass. He was the first person to ever consider Mob as normal and his teachings have never failed Mob.', '/uploads/images/c_89334.png'),
(182, 'Shigeo Kageyama', '影山茂夫', '主角', 'Setsuo Itou', '**Height:** 157 cm He is the assistant and disciple of [Arataka Reigen](https://anilist.co/character/89334/Reigen-Arataka). He is also the newest member of the Body Improvement Club. Shigeo is a quiet and polite individual who tries to live a normal life despite having strong telepathic power, he wants to be seen as a good human among the people in his social life. This often makes him naive and gullible when those with malicious intent want to use him for a laugh or to cause trouble but Shigeo has very strong beliefs to never use his powers to hurt another person because of an altercation he faced once as a child.', '/uploads/images/c_89616.png'),
(182, 'Ekubo', 'エクボ', '主角', 'Akio Ootsuka', 'Ekubo is a self-proclaimed upper-class evil spirit who has aligned himself with [Mob](https://anilist.co/character/89616) after being defeated by him. Ekubo wants to be a god. Specifically, he wants to be worshipped by all humanity. ~!Despite having that kind of ego, he didn''t hesitate to put himself at Mob''s mercy in the hopes of using the boy to his advantage. At first, he wanted to steal Mob''s body and use it to become a god, but he eventually decided to try to make Mob a god instead.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89617.png'),
(182, 'Ritsu Kageyama', '影山律', '主角', 'Miyu Irino', '__Height:__ 159.4 cm Ritsu is very clever and apparently serious, he also serves on the student council and excels in academics and everything else he tries. None of that matters to him as much as psychic power, however, his brother is more important to him than anyone or anything else. ~!Before he awoke his own psychic powers, he longed for the esper abilities his brother has always had and was frustrated by his own inability to do things like bend spoons. He may have a habit of carrying spoons around with him, for bending purposes. He is a perfectionist with a not-so-hidden dark side. Unlike [Mob](https://anilist.co/character/89616/Kageyama-Shigeo), he finds it okay to use psychic violence against people when necessary.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89618.png'),
(182, 'Tenga Onigawara', '鬼瓦天牙', '配角', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya', 'Tenga Onigawara is the leader of Salt Middle School and an unofficial member of the Body Improvement Club.', '/uploads/images/c_89619.png'),
(182, 'Tome Kurata', '暗田トメ', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', '__School:__ Salt Middle School __School club:__ Telepathy Club (President) Tome seems to be a slacker but is passionate about the possibility of using telepathy to contact extraterrestrials. However, when the Telepathy Club''s research into the matter bears no results, she quickly gives up. When she learns that [Mob](https://anilist.co/character/89616/Kageyama-Shigeo) is an Esper, her passion is revitalized.', '/uploads/images/c_89620.png'),
(182, 'Teruki Hanazawa', '花沢輝気', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', '__Height:__ 161.4 cm Hanazawa Teruki is an esper who was first introduced as an antagonist, but later became [Mob](https://anilist.co/character/89616/Kageyama-Shigeo)''s friend after being defeated by him. He was the shadow leader (urabanchou) of Black Vinegar Middle School, using his psychic powers to rule over the delinquents at his own school, as well as to defeat those from other schools. Teruki is a talented, quick-thinking, and hardworking esper. In terms of raw power, he is nowhere near Mob''s level, but he compensates for this by putting in effort and training diligently. He is able to analyze other espers'' techniques and their weaknesses in a short amount of time, and often incorporates said techniques in his own fights. He is constantly training to improve himself, and is remarked by various espers as possessing a keen and powerful set of skills.', '/uploads/images/c_89621.png'),
(182, 'Ichi Mezato', '米里イチ', '配角', 'Ayumi Fujimura', 'Ichi Mezato is a school girl who goes to Salt Middle School and is part of the News Club. She is in class 2-1.', '/uploads/images/c_89622.jpg'),
(182, 'Tsubomi Takane', '高嶺ツボミ', '配角', 'Uki Satake', 'She is a middle schooler at Salt Middle School. Mob harbors a large crush on her. ~!Most of what we know about Tsubomi''s personality in the manga is from what Mob and other characters say about her. However, in the anime adaptation, there are extra scenes of Tsubomi that add to her character and personality and make her a more compassionate individual.!~', '/uploads/images/c_89623.jpg'),
(182, 'Shou Suzuki', '鈴木将', '配角', 'Sachi Kokuryuu', '~!Sho Suzuki is the son of the leader of Claw. He led a direct resistance against his father''s world domination plan.!~', '/uploads/images/c_130683.jpg'),
(182, 'Musashi Gouda', 'ムサシ', '配角', 'Toshihiko Seki', 'Musashi Goda is a student of Salt Middle School and the Body Improvement Club''s President. Musashi has a strong sense of justice but strongly disagrees with senseless violence', '/uploads/images/c_132972.jpg'),
(182, 'Tsuyoshi Edano', '枝野剛', '配角', 'Yuu Hayashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_133189.jpg'),
(182, 'Gou Asahi', '朝日豪', '配角', 'Yuusuke Kuwahata', 'Gou is an esper and one of the children who was invited to the Awakening Lab.', '/uploads/images/c_133190.jpg'),
(182, 'Rei Kurosaki', '黒崎麗', '配角', 'Sanae Fuku', 'Rei is an esper and one of the children who was invited to the Awakening Lab', '/uploads/images/c_133191.jpg'),
(182, 'Takeshi Hoshino', '星野武史', '配角', 'Kouhei Amasaki', 'Takeshi is an esper and one of the children who was invited to the Awakening Lab', '/uploads/images/c_133192.jpg'),
(182, 'Chihiro', 'チヒロ', '配角', 'Ai Kayano', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_133193.jpg'),
(182, 'Matsuo', '魔津尾', '配角', 'Ryuunosuke Watanuki', 'Matsuo is an esper and a former member of Claw. He was part of the upper echelon called "Scar".', '/uploads/images/c_133194.png'),
