(182, 'Hikaru Tokugawa', '徳川光', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'He is the vice-president of the school council of Salt Mid.', '/uploads/images/c_133382.jpg'),
(182, 'Tenjouyaburi', '天井破り', '配角', 'Takashi Onozuka', 'He was a spirit who appeared early on in the series. He was the first ghost to appear and be exorcized.', '/uploads/images/c_133383.png'),
(182, 'Hiroshi Kumagawa', '隈川弘', '配角', 'Shunsuke Takeuchi', 'He is part of the Body Improvement Club and a student of Salt Middle School.', '/uploads/images/c_133384.png'),
(182, 'Hideki  Yamamura', '山村秀樹', '配角', 'Daiki Hamano', 'He is a student of Salt Middle School and a member of the Body Improvement Club.', '/uploads/images/c_133385.png'),
(182, 'Momozou  Takenaka', '竹中桃蔵', '配角', 'Ikuji Nose', 'Takenaka is originally introduced as an image-conscientious character pushed into the Telepathy Club similarly to Mob. However, once it is revealed that he is a Telepath, he is shown to be standoffish despite his humor and tendency to tease others. He feels lonely given his telepathy and is overwhelmed by the consciousness of society. ~!Takenaka had previously filled a gap in the Telepathy Club to maintain the minimum number of members needed for the club. He had no interest in the club or in telepathy. He worried about how people looked at him because of his club membership, so he decided to leave the club. As a result of him leaving the club, Tome Kurata had to find a new member to keep the club open. He is later revealed to have joined the tennis club. In chapter 98 he is revealed to be a telepath. He returned to their former club room investigate the telepathic ringing generated by Mob and Shiratori brothers. He is subsequently recruited to help contact extraterrestrial life, although he only joins out of obligation. Later, he is revealed to have actually memorized the summoning formation and incantation despite knowing it to be a hoax, as he didn''t want to ruin their memory. He proceeds to spend his New Years'' with the others after successfully coming into contact with alien lifeforms.!~', '/uploads/images/c_133388.jpg'),
(182, 'Jun Sagawa', '佐川純', '配角', 'Seiichirou Yamashita', 'He is a student of Salt Middle School and the president of the Body Improvement Club.', '/uploads/images/c_133389.jpg'),
(182, 'Hanako', '花子', '配角', 'Tomomi Watanabe', 'She is Reigen''s first client to appear in the series. ~!Hanako had engaged in a sort of test of courage before coming to see Reigen; consequently, a ghost has been haunting her in her dreams. She had asked many psychics to help her and get rid of the ghost and eventually, accompanied by her boyfriend Taro, she asks for help from Arataka Reigen. She guides Reigen and Taro to the building with the ghost in question, after much scepticism about Reigen coming from her boyfriend. She recounts a tale of a man who struck his head on the ceiling of the building after seeing a cockroach, frightening Reigen. The ghost, Ceiling Crasher, haunting her appears, leading Reigen to attempt to exorcise it (unsuccessfully). Reigen calls in Mob, who exorcizes​ the ghost in front of her.!~', '/uploads/images/c_133390.jpg'),
(182, 'Tarou', '太郎', '配角', 'Wataru Hatano', 'Tarou is Hanako''s lover and a character that appears early on in the series. He is an aggressive skeptic of the supernatural and of psychics. He seems protective or relatively concerned about his lover.', '/uploads/images/c_133391.png'),
(182, 'Nioikagi', '匂い嗅ぎ', '配角', 'Kouzou Douzaka', 'He was a spirit who appeared and made his home terrorizing the students at a private girls'' high school.', '/uploads/images/c_133392.png'),
(182, 'Haruto  Kijibayashi', '稚子林春人', '配角', 'Ryuunosuke Watanuki', 'He is a third-year middle school student and a member of the Telepathy Club.', '/uploads/images/c_133395.png'),
(182, 'Mariko', 'マリコ', '配角', 'Juri Kimura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_133396.jpg'),
(182, 'Shirihiko Saruta', '猿田尻彦', '配角', 'Daiki Hamano', 'He is a first-year middle school student and a member of the Telepathy Club.', '/uploads/images/c_133398.jpg'),
(182, 'Kamen no on''na', '仮面の女', '配角', 'Chinatsu Akasaki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_133871.jpg'),
(182, 'Yamazaki', '山崎', '配角', 'Tetsu Kimishima', 'Yamazaki is a student of the Salt Middle School and a member of Tenga Onigawara''s gang.', '/uploads/images/c_133872.jpg'),
(182, 'Mameta  Inukawa', '犬川豆太', '配角', 'Seiichirou Yamashita', 'He is a second-year middle school student and a member of the Telepathy Club.', '/uploads/images/c_134013.jpg'),
(182, 'Ryohei Shimura', '志村遼平', '配角', 'Ryuunosuke Watanuki', 'He is a student of Salt Middle School and a member of the Body Improvement Club.', '/uploads/images/c_135297.png'),
(182, 'Mari', 'まり', '配角', 'Kotori Koiwai', 'She is a student of the Highso Private Girls'' Academy and was a client of Arataka Reigen.', '/uploads/images/c_137017.jpg'),
(182, 'Hitoshi', '人氏', '配角', 'Tooru Sakurai', 'He was a client of Arataka Reigen, he wanted to speak with his deceased father about a password to a safe. ~!He attempted to stab Reigen to get the combo but was knocked out by Reigen.!~', '/uploads/images/c_137026.jpg'),
(182, 'Fuji', '富士', '配角', 'Rintarou Nishi', 'Fuji is the gang leader of the Miso Middle School.', '/uploads/images/c_216563.jpg'),
(182, 'Gen', 'ゲン', '配角', 'Naoki Makishima', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_216565.jpg'),
(182, 'Gozu', '五頭', '配角', '', 'Gozu is the gang leader of the Mayo Middle School. He attempts to fight Koyama, but is defeated.', '/uploads/images/c_216566.jpg'),
(182, 'Bandai', '磐梯', '配角', 'Seiichirou Yamashita', 'Bandai is the gang leader of the Soy Sauce Middle School.', '/uploads/images/c_216567.jpg'),
(182, 'Joutenin', '女店員', '配角', 'Rina Satou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_216573.jpg'),
(182, 'Otoko Tenin', '男店員', '配角', 'Wataru Takagi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_216574.jpg'),
(183, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Kenichirou Matsuda', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(183, 'Anya Forger', 'アーニャ・フォージャー', '主角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', '__Height:__ 99.5 cm (3''2") __Occupation:__ First-Grade Student, Test Subject (Formerly) __Affiliation:__ Eden Academy, Unknown Organization (Formerly) __Relatives:__ Loid Forger (Adoptive Father), Yor Forger (Adoptive Mother) Anya Forger is the deuteragonist of the SPY x FAMILY series. She is a young girl who Twilight finds at an orphanage. Believing her to be a smart child, he decides to adopt her for his mission. What he doesn''t know is that Anya is an esper who escaped from the Lab that gave her the power to read minds. Starving for excitement in her life after spending most of it so far in a lab, Anya actively sought to be the one adopted by Loid and then make sure Loid and Yor got together, so she could have a spy and assassin for parents. Anya is the only Forger aware of just about everyone''s Secret Identities, but keeps it to herself out of fear that if her psychic powers are exposed she''ll be put in a lab again.', '/uploads/images/c_138100.png'),
(183, 'Loid Forger', 'ロイド・フォージャー', '主角', 'Takuya Eguchi', '__Height:__ 187 cm __Occupation:__ Psychiatrist, Spy (Covertly) __Affiliation:__ Berlint General Hospital, WISE (Covertly) __Relatives:__ Yor Forger (Wife), Anya Forger (Adoptive Daughter) Loid Forger is the main protagonist of the SPY x FAMILY series. He is the top spy of the Westalian Intelligence Bureau, who is only known by his code name Twilight. In order to investigate the activities of a highly ranked politician, Donovan Desmond , Twilight has assumed the identity of a psychiatrist named Loid Forger. Further, to appear like a normal family man and get close to his target, Loid then adopted a young orphan girl, Anya , and entered a Marriage of Convenience with an Ostanian woman named Yor Briar ... who unknown to Twilight are themselves a Telepath and Professional Killer respectively.', '/uploads/images/c_138101.png'),
(183, 'Yor Forger', 'ヨル・フォージャー', '主角', 'Saori Hayami', '__Height:__ 170 cm __Occupation:__ City Hall Clerk, Assassin (Covertly) __Affiliation:__ Berlint City Hall, Garden (Covertly) __Relatives:__ [Loid Forger](https://anilist.co/character/138101/Loid-Forger) (Husband), [Anya Forger](https://anilist.co/character/138100/Anya-Forger) (Adoptive Daughter), [Yuuri Briar](https://anilist.co/character/150425/Yuuri-Briar) (Younger Brother) Yor Forger is the tritagonist of the SPY x FAMILY series. She is a clerical employee at the Berlint City Hall. She is soft-spoken and mild-mannered, but has a strong sense of humor. She has a bad drinking habit and falls into a coma when she drinks. At home, she struggles to be a good wife and a kind mother. Although her cooking skills are not very good, she likes to keep clean and is good at cleaning. While she works in the capital of Ostania''s city hall... or at least that''s her civilian cover. In truth, she is an infamous Professional Killer known as "Thorn Princess". After becoming overly fixated on the idea her cover might be blown after a coworker ribs her about not being married or even having a boyfriend, Yor suggests to Loid a Marriage of Convenience, which he accepts, as he needs a mother for Anya for his own mission. ~!As of Mission (Chapter) 44, it is revealed that Yor is part of Garden, a powerful paramilitary assassin organization operating within Ostania.!~', '/uploads/images/c_138102.png'),
(183, 'Becky Blackbell', 'ベッキー・ブラックベル', '配角', 'Emiri Katou', '__Affiliation:__ Blackbell Family, Blackbell Heavy Industries, Eden Academy, Cecile Hall __Occupation:__ Student The daughter of the CEO of Blackbell, a major military manufacturer. Attends Eden Academy as part of Cecil House, Group 3. Best friends with Anya Forger. Becky is a very kind child but with her being the daughter of a major military manufacturer, she is shown to be somewhat prideful and tries to be mature, attempting to take Anya under her wing as an act of benevolence when she views Anya as a brat. She does not attempt to get close to Damian Desmond despite his social position, even looking down on their classmates who try to befriend Damian and Anya who is initially bullied by Damian''s group. Anya''s confident smile later wins over Becky''s admiration.', '/uploads/images/c_150423.jpg'),
(183, 'Damian Desmond', 'ダミアン・デズモンド', '配角', 'Natsumi Fujiwara', '__Height:__ 110 cm (3′7″) __Affiliation:__ Desmond Family, Eden Academy, Cecile Hall __Occupation:__ Student The second son of [Donovan Desmond](https://anilist.co/character/180192/Desmond-Donovan) and attends Eden Academy as part of Cecile House, Group 3. A young child with an arrogant and rude personality, caused by him being the second son of Donovan Desmond, the leader of the National Unity Party, a group important and powerful enough to threaten the peace between the East and the West. This has caused Damian to gain a highly respected status among his peers and making him incredibly arrogant, assuming [Anya](https://anilist.co/character/138100/Forger-Anya) gained a crush on him when she stared at him. He is shown to prefer being called Lord Damian when spoken to. He gets angry when he is looked down upon by Anya''s smile, quickly resorting to insulting her with his limited vocabulary and harassing Anya.', '/uploads/images/c_150424.png'),
(183, 'Yuuri Briar', 'ユーリ・ブライア', '配角', 'Kenshou Ono', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5′10") __Affiliation:__ Ostania, Ministry for Foreign Affairs (Cover), State Security Service __Occupation:__ Diplomat (Formerly, Cover), Counterintelligence Agent Yor Briar''s younger brother who works in the State Security Service (SSS). He keeps his job at the SSS a secret from Yor, while pretending to be a normal civil servant at the foreign ministry. Yuri has a sister-complex, and even at an early age, he would be doing everything he could to get Yor to praise him with affection. Though this could be due to his mother dying at a very early stage in his life causing him to get very attached to Yor as a mother figure.', '/uploads/images/c_150425.jpg'),
(183, 'Sylvia Sherwood', 'シルヴィア・シャーウッド', '配角', 'Yuuko Kaida', 'She is [Twilight](https://anilist.co/character/138101/Forger-Loid)''s main contact at WISE.', '/uploads/images/c_157887.png'),
(183, 'Franky Franklin', 'フランキー・フランクリン', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', '__Height:__ 166 cm (5′5") __Affiliation:__ Ostania __Occupation:__ Tobacco Store Clerk (False Front), Informant, Soldier (formerly) Franky is an informant who seemingly works at a tobacco store and presumably works for Loid Forger''s agency. He gets information regarding Eden Academy''s exam and Anya Forger''s past records for Loid Forger. Franky is a kind person willing to help Loid out when he''s in a pinch even though the danger is high. He frequently warns Loid Forger not to get too close to other people in their line of work. He frequently falls in love with other women but his love life typically fails due to lack of mutual interest or they are already with someone else.', '/uploads/images/c_157888.png'),
(183, 'Bond', 'ボンド', '配角', '', 'Bond is the recently adopted pet of the Forger Family. Formally known as Subject 8, Bond has been used for experiments that resulted in the dog gaining precognition abilities.', '/uploads/images/c_169679.jpg'),
(183, 'Henry Henderson', 'ヘンリー・ヘンダーソン', '配角', 'Kazuhiro Yamaji', '__Affiliation:__ Eden Academy __Occupation:__ History Teacher, Housemaster of Cecile Hall Henry is a mature and noble person, who places a high importance on "elegance". To him, elegance seems to be the way a person conducts themselves, and is not afraid to correct inelegant behavior in others.', '/uploads/images/c_180190.jpg'),
(183, 'Camilla', 'カミラ', '配角', 'Umeka Shouji', 'One of Yor Forger''s three co-workers at Berlint City Hall.', '/uploads/images/c_180191.png'),
(183, 'Donovan Desmond', 'ドノバン・デズモンド', '配角', '', 'Donovan Desmond is the President of the Nation Unity Party and Twilight''s current target.', '/uploads/images/c_180192.png'),
(183, 'Ewen Egeburg', 'ユーイン・エッジバーグ', '配角', 'Haruka Okamura', 'Best Friend of Damian and Student at Eden Academy. He is a loyal person, devotedly following Damian, almost always holding his bag when they walk to class. He also genuinely cares for Damian as a friend, getting concerned for Damian when he is hurt or pushing himself too hard.', '/uploads/images/c_213881.png'),
(183, 'Emile Elman', 'エミールぅ・エルマン', '配角', 'Hana Satou', 'Best Friend of Damian and Student at Eden Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_213882.png'),
(183, 'Millie', 'ミリー', '配角', 'Manaka Iwami', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_270958.png'),
(183, 'Sharon', 'シャロン', '配角', 'Mirei Kumagai', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_270959.png'),
(183, 'Dominic', 'ドミニク', '配角', 'Shouhei Kajikawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_270960.png'),
(183, 'Garden Tenchou', '〈ガーデン〉店長', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_270961.png'),
(183, 'WISE Kyokuchou', '〈WISE〉局長', '配角', 'Akio Ootsuka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_272642.jpg'),
(183, 'Bondman', 'ボンドマーン', '配角', 'Taisuke Nakano', 'The protagonist of Spy Wars and the number one spy in the show. He frequently has to take down enemies from the League of Evil in order to save Princess Honey.', '/uploads/images/c_274081.png'),
(183, 'Edgar', 'エドガー', '配角', 'Atsushi Ono', 'The father of Karen and the boss of an unknown organization in Ostania. He expresses strong hostility towards Westalis and their people. He antagonizes Twilight by kidnapping Anya Forger in an attempt to blackmail Twilight into working for him.', '/uploads/images/c_274082.png'),
(183, 'Karen', 'カレン', '配角', 'Marie Ooi', 'The daughter of Edgar. Twilight formerly dated her as "Robert" with the intention of investigating her father. Karen is known to have participated in a fair amount of criminal activity, enough to get her in trouble if Loid so wishes.', '/uploads/images/c_274083.png'),
(183, 'Murdoch Swan', 'マードック・スワン', '配角', 'Jin Urayama', 'The Economics Teacher and the Housemaster of Dormitory 2, Cline Hall at Eden Academy. He is the only son of the former Headmaster of Eden Academy. His wife filed for divorce a month before the Eden Academy admissions interview, where she won full custody of their only daughter.', '/uploads/images/c_274084.png'),
(183, 'Walter Evans', 'ウォルター・エバンス', '配角', 'Hiroshi Yanaka', 'The English Teacher and the Housemaster of Dormitory 5, Malcom Hall at Eden Academy. He is regarded as gentle, reliable, conservative and well-liked by his students.', '/uploads/images/c_274085.png'),
(183, 'Benedict Goodfellow', 'ベネディクト・アイヴァン・グッドフェラー', '配角', 'Youhei Tadano', 'Current headmaster of Eden Academy. During the entrance ceremony for the new Eden Academy students, he gives a speech welcoming them. According to some facility members, he does not accept "donations" from parents and cannot be bought.', '/uploads/images/c_277083.jpg'),
(183, 'Honey-hime', 'ハニー姫', '配角', 'Miyu Komaki', 'Princess of the kingdom where Spy Wars takes place. She is frequently saved by Bondman which has caused her to develop feelings for him.', '/uploads/images/c_277084.png'),
(183, 'Jim Hayward', 'ジム・ヘイワード', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', 'He was an informant for WISE working at Berlint City Hall in the financial department. He was caught selling documents to WISE agents in photographs by [Yuuri Briar](https://anilist.co/character/150425/Yuuri-Briar).', '/uploads/images/c_278136.jpg'),
(183, 'Burns', 'バーンズ', '配角', 'Masafumi Kobatake', 'Section chief of Berlint City Hall, overseeing the work of [Yor Forger](https://anilist.co/character/138102/Yor-Forger), [Camilla](https://anilist.co/character/180191/Camilla), [Millie](https://anilist.co/character/270958/Millie), and [Sharon](https://anilist.co/character/270959/Sharon).', '/uploads/images/c_278137.jpg'),
(183, 'Bill Watkins', 'ビル・ワトキンス', '配角', 'Hiroki Yasumoto', 'The 6-year-old son of a major in the National Army who attends Eden Academy as part of Wald Hall. He was given the nickname "Bazooka Bill" by his peers for his mental and physical domination in sports since nursery school.', '/uploads/images/c_278821.jpg'),
(183, 'Kokkahoankyoku Chuui', '国家保安局中尉', '配角', 'Yasuyuki Kase', 'A scarred man who is a lieutenant and a higher position than [Yuuri Briar](https://anilist.co/character/150425/Yuuri-Briar) in the SSS. He seems to be fairly close to Yuuri and is aware of his drinking habits and sister complex, advising Yuri to get over his sister and focus on his work.', '/uploads/images/c_279677.jpg'),
(183, 'Kokkahoankyoku Kyokuchou', '国家保安局局長', '配角', 'Jirou Saitou', 'The boss of the SSS who dotes on [Yuuri](https://anilist.co/character/150425/Yuuri-Briar) because he finds him adorable like a puppy.', '/uploads/images/c_279678.png'),
(183, 'Roujo', '老女', '配角', 'Yuko Sasaki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_301863.jpg'),
(183, 'Kojiin no Shujin', '孤児院の主人', '配角', 'Hiroki Gotou', 'An inebriated middle-aged man who is the owner of the orphanage where Anya Forger is adopted by Loid Forger. He is apathetic about his orphanage, as shown by the neglected state of the children and his indifference to Loid''s given background. He thinks of Anya as a "creepy little brat", attempting to give her away to Loid upon hearing he wants a literate child. (Source: Spy x Family Wiki)', '/uploads/images/c_301867.jpg'),
(183, 'WISE Kikanin A', 'WISE機関員', '配角', 'Miho Hino', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_301868.jpg'),
(183, 'Bondman no Shirei-kan', 'ボンドマンの司令官', '配角', 'Motoki Sakuma', 'He is the headman of Bondman''s organization.', '/uploads/images/c_301871.jpg'),
(183, 'Shitateya no Tenin', '仕立て屋の店員', '配角', 'Emiko Takeuchi', 'An elderly lady who works as a clerk at Mona & Monacca.', '/uploads/images/c_316686.png'),
(183, 'Shitateya no Tenshu', '仕立て屋の店主', '配角', 'Hana Satou', 'The owner of Mona & Monacca, a tailor shop in Berlint. She was one of [Loid](https://anilist.co/character/138101/Forger-Loid)''s candidates as an unmarried woman, but was rejected due to having been arrested for political activities in the past and her somewhat older age. When the Forgers come to her shop to purchase Eden Academy''s uniforms for [Anya](https://anilist.co/character/138100/Forger-Anya), she warns them about the bullying and kidnappings in Eden Academy. She also appears to be familiar with [Yor](https://anilist.co/character/138102/Forger-Yor) as she is suggested to be a regular at the shop.', '/uploads/images/c_316687.png'),
(184, 'Nazuna Nanakusa', '七草ナズナ', '主角', 'Sora Amamiya', '~!__Family:__ [Haru Nanakusa](https://anilist.co/character/364736) (Mother), [Kabura Honda](https://anilist.co/character/175661) (Adoptive Mother)!~ Nazuna is a female vampire who likes the night itself more than the daylight. A certain day she meets with a fourteen-year-old boy called [Kou Yamori](https://anilist.co/character/168866/). Kou is a guy who can''t sleep very well every night, so to satisfy Kou''s will, Nazuna shows him how to sleep very well at night. On the same night, Kou discovers that Nazuna is a vampire, and that makes Kou feel the will of becoming a vampire too, but the problem began here, because neither Nazuna nor Kou knows what is love, and it is required that Kou falls in love with Nazuna in order for him to become a vampire.', '/uploads/images/c_168774.png'),
(184, 'Kou Yamori', '夜守コウ', '主角', 'Gen Satou', '__Height:__ 157 cm (5''1") A second-year junior high school boy, who slowly finds himself restless because of his boring life. To reinvigorate himself, he slips out at night to walk the streets. He wants to become a vampire.', '/uploads/images/c_168866.png'),
(184, 'Kiyosumi Shirakawa', '白河清澄', '配角', 'Youko Hikasa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_175656.png'),
(184, 'Niko Hirata', '平田ニコ', '配角', 'Eri Kitamura', 'Niko Hirata is a vampire and a teacher who teaches night classes.', '/uploads/images/c_175657.png'),
(184, 'Seri Kikyou', '桔梗セリ', '配角', 'Haruka Tomatsu', 'Seri Kikyou is a vampire and a gyaru that seeks enjoyment in life and finds it increasingly challenging to have fun.', '/uploads/images/c_175658.png'),
(184, 'Anko Uguisu', '鶯餡子', '配角', 'Miyuki Sawashiro', 'A private detective with an odd personality. Likes to smoke when she is not solving cases. ~!Ten years ago, she went by her real name Kyouko Mejiro and was a member of a literature club at the school [Nico Hirata](https://anilist.co/character/175657) taught the night class of. She became [Nazuna Nanakusa](https://anilist.co/character/168774)''s first friend until her father was turned into a vampire, causing both parents to die and Kyouko to quit school and disappear.!~', '/uploads/images/c_175659.png'),
(184, 'Akihito Akiyama', '秋山昭人', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_175660.png'),
(184, 'Kabura Honda', '本田カブラ', '配角', 'Shizuka Itou', 'She is a vampire and a friend in [Nico Hirata''s](https://anilist.co/character/175657/Niko-Hirata) clique. ~!Before becoming a vampire, Kabura was a very sick, but kind person, who couldn''t go out with her friends much, and stayed in the hospital with Haru Nanakusa, as anything her friends want her to do were too much energy for her. Later, she wanted a way out of the hatred and neglect from both family and friends, so she agreed on the request of being turned into a vampire by Haru.!~', '/uploads/images/c_175661.png'),
(184, 'Midori Kohakobe', '小繁縷ミドリ', '配角', 'Naomi Oozora', 'Midori Kohakobe is a vampire and the number 1 maid at the maid cafe Vamps.', '/uploads/images/c_175662.png'),
(184, 'Akira Asai', '朝井アキラ', '配角', 'Yumiri Hanamori', 'Akira Asai is the childhood friend of [Kou](https://anilist.co/character/168866/ ) and [Mahiru Seki](https://anilist.co/character/269129/Mahiru-Seki), and also lives in the same apartment complex as Kou. Akira is a disciplined student who obediently follows her school duties. She is friendly and maintains a close relationship with Kou and Mahiru. Her suspicion of vampires is strong and so she doesn''t really want to have much to do with them. She is seemingly very attached to Kou and often lets him get her into trouble.', '/uploads/images/c_175663.png'),
(184, 'Hatsuka Suzushiro', '蘿蔔ハツカ', '配角', 'Azumi Waki', 'Hatsuka is a man of small stature with an androgynous physique, having a rather masculine, but very thin, upper body and feminine hips, his head adorned with shoulder-length black hair, and a narrow face. He prefers to dress femininely, which he says is apparently because it suits him better. The clothes he mainly wears are dresses and coats, his footwear consisting of dark calf length boots, smaller shoes and slippers when he is at home.', '/uploads/images/c_233097.png'),
(184, 'Kiku Hoshimi', '星見キク', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_269128.png'),
(184, 'Mahiru Seki', '夕真昼', '配角', 'Kenshou Ono', 'Mahiru Seki is a former middle school student and a childhood friend of [Kou Yamori](https://anilist.co/character/168866/Kou-Yamori) and [Akira Asai](https://anilist.co/character/175663/Akira-Asai). ~!Died with [Kiku Hoshimi](https://anilist.co/character/269128/Kiku-Hoshimi) at the sunrise after she turned him into a vampire!~', '/uploads/images/c_269129.png'),
(184, 'Kai', 'カイ', '配角', 'Kouki Koyasu', 'A man who is often out drinking at night with Tonio and Matsuda.', '/uploads/images/c_284207.jpg'),
(184, 'Tonio', 'トニオ', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', 'A man who is often out at night drinking with Kai and Matsuda.', '/uploads/images/c_284208.jpg'),
(184, 'Matsuda', 'マツダ', '配角', 'Michiru Satou', 'A man who is often out drinking at night with Tonio and Kai.', '/uploads/images/c_284209.jpg'),
(184, 'Yura', 'ユラ', '配角', 'Hina Suguta', 'A character in the galge "Toki Doki Shugei-bu", described as "the busty girl with glasses".', '/uploads/images/c_284211.png'),
(184, 'Mio', 'ミオ', '配角', 'Rika Nagae', 'A character in the galge "Toki Doki Shugei-bu".', '/uploads/images/c_284212.png'),
(184, 'Azusa', 'アズサ', '配角', 'Ikumi Hasegawa', 'A character in the galge "Toki Doki Shugei-bu".', '/uploads/images/c_284213.jpg'),
(184, 'Matsunaga', 'マツナガ', '配角', 'DJ Matsunaga', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_294658.jpg'),
(184, 'Kyouhei', 'キョーヘー', '配角', 'R-Shitei', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_294659.jpg'),
(184, 'Chuugakkou Kyoushi', '中学校教師', '配角', 'Kazuhiro Yamaji', 'A teacher who is rumored to appear in the Classroom late at night since 10 years ago.', '/uploads/images/c_343822.jpg'),
(185, 'Tanjirou Kamado', '竈門炭治郎', '主角', 'Natsuki Hanae', '__Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") __Combat Style:__ Water Breathing & ~!Sun Breathing!~ Tanjirou is kind by nature and has been described by others as having very gentle eyes. He has a great deal of determination and will not give up once he has a goal to achieve, an example being finding a cure for [Nezuko](https://anilist.co/character/127518). Even though he is relatively strong on his own, he isn''t opposed to asking others for help when he needs it. He is very protective of his friends and even more so of his younger sister. His biggest attribute is his ability to empathize with anyone, even demons. ~!Eventually, he discovers that he is a legendary Sun Breathing user.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126071.png'),
(185, 'Nezuko Kamado', '竈門禰豆子', '主角', 'Akari Kitou', '__Height:__ 153 cm (5''0") Transformed into a demon and left mute, Nezuko travels with her older brother [Tanjirou](https://anilist.co/character/126071/Kamado-Tanjirou) in a box on his back. She can change her size at will, and is a capable fighter when she needs to be, but has never killed or eaten any humans. Instead of gaining nourishment from humans, it seems that she recovers her energy by sleeping for long periods of time.', '/uploads/images/c_127518.png'),
(185, 'Inosuke Hashibira', '嘴平伊之助', '主角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', '**Height:** 164 cm (5''4") __Combat Style:__ Beast Breathing Inosuke is usually seen wearing a grey boar mask, with a shirtless version of the Demon hunter uniform. Without the mask he has messy shoulder length black hair and large green eyes with long eyelashes. He is described as having a girly looking face which greatly contrasts with his muscular body. Inosuke is extremely short-tempered and proud, and makes a big deal out of fighting opponents stronger than him claiming that''s his only hobby. He is a sore loser and is always trying to compete with Tanjiro and provoke him into fighting him, and usually failing. Due to growing up in the mountains by himself Inosuke has trouble interacting with others and only cares about himself most of the time. Though he''s often seen with 2 swords in hand, Inosuke is left-handed.', '/uploads/images/c_129130.jpg'),
(185, 'Zenitsu Agatsuma', '我妻善逸', '主角', 'Hiro Shimono', '__Height:__ 164 cm (5''4") __Combat Style:__ Thunder Breathing __Affiliation:__ Demon Slayer Corps __Occupation:__ Demon Slayer Zenitsu Agatsuma is one of the main protagonists of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba and along with [Inosuke Hashibira](https://anilist.co/character/129130/Inosuke-Hashibira), a traveling companion of [Tanjiro Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/126071/Tanjirou-Kamado) and [Nezuko Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/127518/Nezuko-Kamado).', '/uploads/images/c_129131.png'),
(185, 'Muzan Kibutsuji', '鬼舞辻無惨', '配角', 'Toshihiko Seki', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5''10") He is the Demon King, the first of his kind, and the progenitor of all other demons in existence. Muzan is also the leader of the Twelve Kizuki, an organization of the twelve strongest demons in existence that serve directly under him. ~!A millennium ago, during the Heian Era, Muzan was turned into a demon during an experimental treatment trying to cure his terminal illness, and his goal since then was to live without the fear of death and become truly eternal. He believes that Sun Breathing users are his only threat. He has a grand total of seven hearts and five brains.!~', '/uploads/images/c_129132.jpg'),
(185, 'Kyoujurou Rengoku', '煉獄杏寿郎', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''10") __Combat Style:__ Flame Breathing He is greatly enthusiastic in regard to his duties as Flame Pillar and often cheerfully eccentric. He is amiable, kind and boasts extraordinary flame techniques and swordsmanship stemming from strict practice and discipline. He is an honourable warrior who adheres to his code of morals and principles that was instilled into him by his mother at a young age - the most significant being that those who were born strong have a duty to protect the weak.', '/uploads/images/c_129133.png'),
(185, 'Giyuu Tomioka', '冨岡義勇', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9½") __Combat Style:__ Water Breathing Water pillar in the Demon Killing Corps. Giyuu is reserved and displays little emotion, instead giving off a calm feeling most of the time. As a water breath user, Giyuu has created his own style. The eleventh style, Lull, gives him the ability to nullify any oncoming attacks, though rapid attacks can pierce through it. Though Giyuu is reserved, he does have a few friends, such as Tanjirou and, in the past, [Sabito](https://anilist.co/character/137809/Sabito). Shinobu often pokes fun at Giyuu and is merciless when doing so, such as saying he has no friends and that others don''t like him. ~!He is one of the only Pillar, aside from [Sanemi](https://anilist.co/character/137774/Sanemi-Shinazugawa), who survived during the final fight against [Muzan](https://anilist.co/character/129132/Muzan-Kibutsuji).!~', '/uploads/images/c_130050.png'),
(185, 'Muichirou Tokitou', '時透無一郎', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") __Combat Style:__ Mist Breathing Muichiro is an air-headed individual who seems to constantly wander off in thought and never focus on one thing. Impassive and, at times, obtuse, he tends to think only for himself and operates on logic alone, never letting emotion guide him. Despite this, he has been shown to get serious when it is required and is devoted to his position as the Demon Slayer Corps'' Mist Hashira. Alternatively, he seems to display a cold and arrogant side as well. ~!He later died at Kokushibo''s hand.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136069.png'),
(185, 'Shinobu Kochou', '胡蝶しのぶ', '配角', 'Saori Hayami', '__Height:__ 151 cm (4''11") __Combat Style:__ Insect Breathing Shinobu is a demon slayer and the Insect Pillar of the Demon Killing Corps. She is 18 years old and one of two female pillars. Shinobu appears rather laid back, and always has a smile on her face regardless of the situation. Despite her relaxed exterior and her initial claim of wanting to get along with demons, she can be rather cruel and harbors a great deal of anger towards them. She is generally kind to other humans, but is rather sadistic in her treatment of demons. As a pillar, she is a top-class fighter despite her small stature. She is also well-versed in medical knowledge, and can concoct poisons and medicines alike. ~!During the Infinity Castle Arc, she encounters the Upper 2 demon [Douma](https://anilist.co/character/144591) and is slain by him in a fight. However, since she poisoned herself before the fight, Douma is severely incapacitated after eating her.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136070.png'),
(185, 'Tengen Uzui', '宇髄天元', '主角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', '__Height:__ 198 cm (6''6") __Combat Style:__ Sound Breathing A Demon Slayer, and the Sound Pillar of the Demon Slayer Corps. Tengen is a very eccentric person, always wanting to complete actions as flashy as possible. Although he has displayed an uncaring and forceful attitude towards some people, he also has a caring side that is mainly only shown towards his most treasured ones, most notably his three wives, [Makio](https://anilist.co/character/250554), [Suma](https://anilist.co/character/250555), and [Hinatsuru](https://anilist.co/character/250556). He also shows a somewhat nicer side towards [Tanjiro](https://anilist.co/character/126071) after their mission and starts to accept him more as the series goes on.', '/uploads/images/c_136071.png'),
(185, 'Mitsuri Kanroji', '甘露寺蜜璃', '配角', 'Kana Hanazawa', '__Height:__ 167 cm (5''5") __Combat Style:__ Love Breathing Demon Hunter and the Love Pillar of the Demon Killing Corps. Mitsuri is a soft and kind person. She is very emotional and passionate, constantly complimenting people in her head, which probably contributes to her nickname of "the Hashira of Love". Although she is rather shy and is easily flustered, she is always kind to others, most notably towards [Obanai](https://anilist.co/character/137777), whom she appears to share a strong bond with. Besides her rather emotional personality, she can also come off as somewhat childish at times. ~!She was taught by Rengoku to use the flame breathing. However, although Mitsuri has learnt it, she was not as skillful with it and cannot fight to her fullest using it, leading her to solely develop the Love Breathing.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136072.png'),
(185, 'Sanemi Shinazugawa', '不死川実弥', '配角', 'Tomokazu Seki', '__Height:__ 179cm (5''10½") Demon Hunter and the Wind Pillar of the Demon Killing Corps. He is the older brother of [Genya Shinazugawa](https://anilist.co/character/137776). Sanemi specializes in Wind Breathing, which has 9 forms. The technique consists of drawing the air from around the user to create whirlwind attacks that follow the user''s movements. Form names include Dust Whirlwind Cutter, Claws-Purifying Wind, Clean Storm Wind Tree, Rising Dust Storm, Cold Mountain Wind, Black Wind Mountain Mist, Gale - Sudden Gusts, Primary Gale Slash, and Idaten Typhoon.', '/uploads/images/c_137774.png'),
(185, 'Obanai Iguro', '伊黒小芭内', '配角', 'Kenichi Suzumura', '__Height:__ 162 cm (5''3") Obanai is a Demon Slayer and the Snake Pillar of the Demon Slayer Corps. A young man of short stature and a pale complexion. He has straight-edged black hair of varying lengths, the longest reaching down to his shoulders and the shortest stopping at his cheekbones, which he wears down with two shorter strands hanging between his eyes. He wears a navy blue version of the standard Demon Slayer uniform, along with a black and white pinstriped haori, the hem and cuffs of which are striped lengthways rather than vertically, which covers his hands. Obanai also sports bandages in place of the leg-wraps around his calves, as well as another set of bandages that cover his mouth, and blue-strapped zori on his feet. He is also always seen with his white snake, Kaburamaru, wrapped around his shoulders.', '/uploads/images/c_137777.jpg'),
(185, 'Gyoumei Himejima', '悲鳴嶼行冥', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', '__Height:__ 220cm (7''2½") He is a Demon Slayer and the Stone Hashira of the Demon Slayer Corps. Gyomei also serves as the mentor of Genya Shinazugawa.', '/uploads/images/c_137778.jpg'),
(185, 'Kagaya Ubuyashiki', '産屋敷耀哉', '配角', 'Toshiyuki Morikawa', 'He is the head of the Ubuyashiki Family and 97th leader of the Demon Slayer Corps known mainly as "Oyakata-sama" ("Master") by his subordinates and peers.', '/uploads/images/c_137808.png'),
(185, 'Matsuemon Tennouji', '天王寺松右衛門', '配角', 'Takumi Yamazaki', 'Kasugai Crow assigned to Tanjirou Kamado. Very intelligent and seems to have a large ego.', '/uploads/images/c_137810.png'),
(185, 'Hotaru Haganezuka', '鋼鐵塚蛍', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', 'Hotaru Haganezuka is a swordsmith affiliated with the Demon Killing Corps.', '/uploads/images/c_138990.jpg'),
(185, 'Kanao Tsuyuri', '栗花落カナヲ', '配角', 'Reina Ueda', '__Height:__ 156 cm (5''1½") Kanao Tsuyuri is a Demon Hunter and the Tsuguko, who is personally looked after by the Demon Killing Corps'' Pillars. She uses Flower Breathing. ~!When Kanao is first introduced, she is an indecisive and quiet girl due to the abuse she endured in her past before meeting the Kocho sisters. She became unable to make decisions by herself and repressed her emotions as a defense mechanism. In order to help rectify this, Kanae gave her a coin to flip to decide which path to follow when she didn''t know what to do. Later on, Tanjiro helps Kanao overcome her indecisiveness and Kanao soon becomes more confident in making decisions with or without her coin. Kanao and Tanjiro would eventually marry and start a family, having two great-great-grandchildren by the names of [Kanata Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/171144/Kanata-Kamado) and [Sumihiko Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/171145/Sumihiko-Kamado) between them.!~', '/uploads/images/c_139038.png'),
(185, 'Kiriya Ubuyashiki', '産屋敷輝利哉', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', '~!Kiriya Ubuyashiki is the son and middle child of Kagaya Ubuyashiki. He is the current head of the Ubuyashiki Household and leader of the Demon Slaying Corps!~', '/uploads/images/c_139460.png'),
(185, 'Daki', '堕姫', '配角', 'Miyuki Sawashiro', 'Daki, known as Warabihime in her oiran guise, is a member of the Twelve Demon Moons, holding the position of Upper Moon Six.', '/uploads/images/c_139734.jpg'),
(185, 'Gyuutarou', '妓夫太郎', '配角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', '~!Gyuutarou is a member of the Twelve Demon Moons, holding the position of Upper Moon Six, which he shares with his younger sister Daki.!~', '/uploads/images/c_139735.png'),
(185, 'Akaza', '猗窩座', '配角', 'Akira Ishida', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") A member of the Twelve Demon Moons, holding the position of Upper Moon Three.', '/uploads/images/c_141694.png'),
(185, 'Douma', '童磨', '配角', 'Mamoru Miyano', '__Height:__ 187 cm (6''1½") He is Upper Moon Two, making him the third-strongest demon after Muzan and Upper Moon One. He has a very friendly attitude, and fights with a pair of metal fans. He is the founder of a cult known as the "Eternal Paradise Cult," and eats his followers, allegedly in order to release them from the pain of living. ~!He is the demon who killed Shinobu Kochou''s older sister and Shinobu, as well as Inosuke''s mother.!~', '/uploads/images/c_144591.png'),
(185, 'Naho Takada', '高田なほ', '配角', 'Yuuki Kuwahara', 'She is a servant of the Butterfly Estate.', '/uploads/images/c_145286.jpg'),
(185, 'Kiyo Terauchi', '寺内きよ', '配角', 'Nanami Yamashita', 'She is a servant of the Butterfly Estate.', '/uploads/images/c_145287.jpg'),
(185, 'Aoi Kanzaki', '神崎アオイ', '配角', 'Yuri Ehara', 'She is a Demon Slayer, though she works as a servant in the Butterfly Estate rather than taking to the front lines.', '/uploads/images/c_145288.jpg'),
(185, 'Sumi Nakahara', '中原すみ', '配角', 'Ayumi Mano', 'She is a servant of the Butterfly Estate.', '/uploads/images/c_145289.jpg'),
(185, 'Yoriichi Tsugikuni', '継国緑壱', '配角', 'Kazuhiko Inoue', '__Combat Style:__ Sun Breathing Yoriichi Tsugikuni is a major supporting character of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba. He was a legendary Demon Slayer of the Demon Slayer Corps during the Sengoku Era. ~!Yoriichi is the younger twin brother of Michikatsu Tsugikuni, who later became a Demon and joined the Twelve Kizuki, holding the position of Upper Rank 1.!~ ~!Yoriichi is also the progenitor of Breathing Styles as a whole and was an immensely gifted individual who was fated and meant to defeat Muzan Kibutsuji, but failed.!~', '/uploads/images/c_149220.jpg'),
(185, 'Nichika Ubuyashiki', '産屋敷 にちか', '配角', 'Ari Ozawa', 'Nichika Ubuyashiki is one of the older daughters of Kagaya Ubuyashiki.', '/uploads/images/c_167548.png'),
(185, 'Hinaki Ubuyashiki', '産屋敷 ひなき', '配角', 'Yumiri Hanamori', 'Hinaki Ubuyashiki is one of the older daughters of Kagaya Ubuyashiki.', '/uploads/images/c_167549.png'),
(185, 'Murata', '村田', '配角', 'Kouki Miyata', 'Murata is a member of the Demon Slayer Corps.', '/uploads/images/c_171150.png'),
(185, 'Shinjurou Rengoku', '煉獄槇寿郎', '配角', 'Rikiya Koyama', 'Father of Kyoujurou and Senjurou.', '/uploads/images/c_193379.jpg'),
(185, 'Senjurou Rengoku', '煉獄千寿郎', '配角', 'Junya Enoki', 'Younger brother of Kyoujurou Rengoku and son of Shinjurou Rengoku and Ruka Rengoku.', '/uploads/images/c_193380.png'),
(185, 'Kie Kamado', '竈門葵枝', '配角', 'Houko Kuwashima', 'Kie is Tanjiro Kamado''s mother.', '/uploads/images/c_196849.png'),
(185, 'Shigeru Kamado', '竈門茂', '配角', 'Kaede Hondo', 'Shigeru was Tanjiro''s second youngest brother.', '/uploads/images/c_196851.png'),
(185, 'Takeo Kamado', '竈門竹雄', '配角', 'You Taichi', 'Takeo was Tanjiro Kamado''s first younger brother.', '/uploads/images/c_196852.png'),
(185, 'Hanako Kamado', '竈門花子', '配角', 'Konomi Kohara', 'Hanako was Tanjiro Kamado''s youngest sister.', '/uploads/images/c_196853.png'),
(185, 'Tanjurou Kamado', '竈門炭十郎', '配角', 'Shinichirou Miki', 'Tanjuro Kamadou was the husband of Kie Kamado and the late father of Tanjiro, Nezuko, Takeo, Hanako, Shigeru, and Rokuta. Tanjuro was a quiet, calculating, forgiving, charismatic and loving person. He had a peaceful relationship with his family and regularly lectured Tanjiro about life. While he appeared calm on the outside, he showed a decent, noble aura with a quiet perception to his surroundings. According to his son, he did not like standing out or displaying his true abilities to others. However, if his family is in danger, he would not hesitate to protect them and shows no mercy towards the enemy. ~!Despite not being a Demon Slayer and having a tragic disease that makes his body incredibly frail, Tanjuro was shown to be a phenomenally strong individual. He was born with a demon slayer mark on his forehead, had the ability to access the transparent world, and was constantly using the selfless state.!~', '/uploads/images/c_206330.png'),
(185, 'Rokuta Kamado', '竈門六太', '配角', 'Aoi Koga', 'Tanjiro''s youngest sibling.', '/uploads/images/c_207857.jpg'),
(185, 'Amane Ubuyashiki', '産屋敷あまね', '配角', 'Rina Satou', '__Height:__ 167cm (5''6") She is the wife and caretaker of [Kagaya Ubuyashiki](https://anilist.co/character/137808/Kagaya-Ubuyashiki) and the mother of Hinaki Ubuyashiki, Nichika Ubuyashiki, Kiriya Ubuyashiki, Kanata Ubuyashiki and Kuina Ubuyashiki. Her maiden name is Amane Himorogi.', '/uploads/images/c_221375.jpg'),
(185, 'Ninju Mukimuki Nezumi', '忍にん獣ムキムキねずみ', '配角', 'Subaru Kimura', 'Intelligent mice that work for Tengen Uzui. The mice are specially trained for the purpose of being assistants to Tengen and his acquaintances, as seen during the events at Yoshiwara, Tokyo. They are strong enough to carry one sword per mouse, and are capable of navigating small spaces humans normally wouldn''t be able to.', '/uploads/images/c_246712.png'),
(185, 'Makio', 'まきを', '配角', 'Shizuka Ishigami', 'Makio is a kunoichi and one of Tengen Uzui''s wives. ~! According to the second official fanbook, Makio is actually a distant cousin of Tengen''s.!~', '/uploads/images/c_250554.jpg'),
(185, 'Suma', '須磨', '配角', 'Nao Touyama', 'Suma is a kunoichi and one of Tengen Uzui''s wives.', '/uploads/images/c_250555.jpg'),
(185, 'Hinatsuru', '雛鶴', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', 'Hinatsuru is a kunoichi and one of Tengen Uzui''s wives.', '/uploads/images/c_250556.jpg'),
(185, 'Koinatsu', '鯉夏', '配角', 'Chiwa Saitou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_259262.jpg'),
(185, 'Chachamaru', '茶々丸', '配角', '', 'Chachamaru is a feline familiar that assists in Tamayo''s medical research with Demon blood. ~!Chachamaru is seen during the battle with Muzan, after the Infinity Castle collapses. The cat jumps above the remaining Hashira in order to administer an antidote to stave off the poisonous effects of Muzan''s attacks. As a result, it is sliced in half by the demon. However, it was later reassembled by Yushirou.!~', '/uploads/images/c_268212.jpg'),
(185, 'Daki no Obi no Oni', '堕姫の帯の鬼', '配角', 'Shizuka Itou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_294235.jpg'),
(185, 'Omitsu', 'お三津', '配角', 'Kaoru Katakai', 'Manager of the Kyogoku House in the Entertainment District of Yoshiwara, Tokyo.', '/uploads/images/c_294247.jpg'),
(186, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Kenichirou Matsuda', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(186, 'Anya Forger', 'アーニャ・フォージャー', '主角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', '__Height:__ 99.5 cm (3''2") __Occupation:__ First-Grade Student, Test Subject (Formerly) __Affiliation:__ Eden Academy, Unknown Organization (Formerly) __Relatives:__ Loid Forger (Adoptive Father), Yor Forger (Adoptive Mother) Anya Forger is the deuteragonist of the SPY x FAMILY series. She is a young girl who Twilight finds at an orphanage. Believing her to be a smart child, he decides to adopt her for his mission. What he doesn''t know is that Anya is an esper who escaped from the Lab that gave her the power to read minds. Starving for excitement in her life after spending most of it so far in a lab, Anya actively sought to be the one adopted by Loid and then make sure Loid and Yor got together, so she could have a spy and assassin for parents. Anya is the only Forger aware of just about everyone''s Secret Identities, but keeps it to herself out of fear that if her psychic powers are exposed she''ll be put in a lab again.', '/uploads/images/c_138100.png'),
(186, 'Loid Forger', 'ロイド・フォージャー', '主角', 'Takuya Eguchi', '__Height:__ 187 cm __Occupation:__ Psychiatrist, Spy (Covertly) __Affiliation:__ Berlint General Hospital, WISE (Covertly) __Relatives:__ Yor Forger (Wife), Anya Forger (Adoptive Daughter) Loid Forger is the main protagonist of the SPY x FAMILY series. He is the top spy of the Westalian Intelligence Bureau, who is only known by his code name Twilight. In order to investigate the activities of a highly ranked politician, Donovan Desmond , Twilight has assumed the identity of a psychiatrist named Loid Forger. Further, to appear like a normal family man and get close to his target, Loid then adopted a young orphan girl, Anya , and entered a Marriage of Convenience with an Ostanian woman named Yor Briar ... who unknown to Twilight are themselves a Telepath and Professional Killer respectively.', '/uploads/images/c_138101.png'),
(186, 'Yor Forger', 'ヨル・フォージャー', '主角', 'Saori Hayami', '__Height:__ 170 cm __Occupation:__ City Hall Clerk, Assassin (Covertly) __Affiliation:__ Berlint City Hall, Garden (Covertly) __Relatives:__ [Loid Forger](https://anilist.co/character/138101/Loid-Forger) (Husband), [Anya Forger](https://anilist.co/character/138100/Anya-Forger) (Adoptive Daughter), [Yuuri Briar](https://anilist.co/character/150425/Yuuri-Briar) (Younger Brother) Yor Forger is the tritagonist of the SPY x FAMILY series. She is a clerical employee at the Berlint City Hall. She is soft-spoken and mild-mannered, but has a strong sense of humor. She has a bad drinking habit and falls into a coma when she drinks. At home, she struggles to be a good wife and a kind mother. Although her cooking skills are not very good, she likes to keep clean and is good at cleaning. While she works in the capital of Ostania''s city hall... or at least that''s her civilian cover. In truth, she is an infamous Professional Killer known as "Thorn Princess". After becoming overly fixated on the idea her cover might be blown after a coworker ribs her about not being married or even having a boyfriend, Yor suggests to Loid a Marriage of Convenience, which he accepts, as he needs a mother for Anya for his own mission. ~!As of Mission (Chapter) 44, it is revealed that Yor is part of Garden, a powerful paramilitary assassin organization operating within Ostania.!~', '/uploads/images/c_138102.png'),
(186, 'Becky Blackbell', 'ベッキー・ブラックベル', '配角', 'Emiri Katou', '__Affiliation:__ Blackbell Family, Blackbell Heavy Industries, Eden Academy, Cecile Hall __Occupation:__ Student The daughter of the CEO of Blackbell, a major military manufacturer. Attends Eden Academy as part of Cecil House, Group 3. Best friends with Anya Forger. Becky is a very kind child but with her being the daughter of a major military manufacturer, she is shown to be somewhat prideful and tries to be mature, attempting to take Anya under her wing as an act of benevolence when she views Anya as a brat. She does not attempt to get close to Damian Desmond despite his social position, even looking down on their classmates who try to befriend Damian and Anya who is initially bullied by Damian''s group. Anya''s confident smile later wins over Becky''s admiration.', '/uploads/images/c_150423.jpg'),
(186, 'Damian Desmond', 'ダミアン・デズモンド', '配角', 'Natsumi Fujiwara', '__Height:__ 110 cm (3′7″) __Affiliation:__ Desmond Family, Eden Academy, Cecile Hall __Occupation:__ Student The second son of [Donovan Desmond](https://anilist.co/character/180192/Desmond-Donovan) and attends Eden Academy as part of Cecile House, Group 3. A young child with an arrogant and rude personality, caused by him being the second son of Donovan Desmond, the leader of the National Unity Party, a group important and powerful enough to threaten the peace between the East and the West. This has caused Damian to gain a highly respected status among his peers and making him incredibly arrogant, assuming [Anya](https://anilist.co/character/138100/Forger-Anya) gained a crush on him when she stared at him. He is shown to prefer being called Lord Damian when spoken to. He gets angry when he is looked down upon by Anya''s smile, quickly resorting to insulting her with his limited vocabulary and harassing Anya.', '/uploads/images/c_150424.png'),
(186, 'Yuuri Briar', 'ユーリ・ブライア', '配角', 'Kenshou Ono', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5′10") __Affiliation:__ Ostania, Ministry for Foreign Affairs (Cover), State Security Service __Occupation:__ Diplomat (Formerly, Cover), Counterintelligence Agent Yor Briar''s younger brother who works in the State Security Service (SSS). He keeps his job at the SSS a secret from Yor, while pretending to be a normal civil servant at the foreign ministry. Yuri has a sister-complex, and even at an early age, he would be doing everything he could to get Yor to praise him with affection. Though this could be due to his mother dying at a very early stage in his life causing him to get very attached to Yor as a mother figure.', '/uploads/images/c_150425.jpg'),
(186, 'Sylvia Sherwood', 'シルヴィア・シャーウッド', '配角', 'Yuuko Kaida', 'She is [Twilight](https://anilist.co/character/138101/Forger-Loid)''s main contact at WISE.', '/uploads/images/c_157887.png'),
(186, 'Franky Franklin', 'フランキー・フランクリン', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', '__Height:__ 166 cm (5′5") __Affiliation:__ Ostania __Occupation:__ Tobacco Store Clerk (False Front), Informant, Soldier (formerly) Franky is an informant who seemingly works at a tobacco store and presumably works for Loid Forger''s agency. He gets information regarding Eden Academy''s exam and Anya Forger''s past records for Loid Forger. Franky is a kind person willing to help Loid out when he''s in a pinch even though the danger is high. He frequently warns Loid Forger not to get too close to other people in their line of work. He frequently falls in love with other women but his love life typically fails due to lack of mutual interest or they are already with someone else.', '/uploads/images/c_157888.png'),
(186, 'Bond', 'ボンド', '配角', 'Kenichirou Matsuda', 'Bond is the recently adopted pet of the Forger Family. Formally known as Subject 8, Bond has been used for experiments that resulted in the dog gaining precognition abilities.', '/uploads/images/c_169679.jpg'),
(186, 'Henry Henderson', 'ヘンリー・ヘンダーソン', '配角', 'Kazuhiro Yamaji', '__Affiliation:__ Eden Academy __Occupation:__ History Teacher, Housemaster of Cecile Hall Henry is a mature and noble person, who places a high importance on "elegance". To him, elegance seems to be the way a person conducts themselves, and is not afraid to correct inelegant behavior in others.', '/uploads/images/c_180190.jpg'),
(186, 'Camilla', 'カミラ', '配角', 'Umeka Shouji', 'One of Yor Forger''s three co-workers at Berlint City Hall.', '/uploads/images/c_180191.png'),
(186, 'Donovan Desmond', 'ドノバン・デズモンド', '配角', 'Takaya Hashi', 'Donovan Desmond is the President of the Nation Unity Party and Twilight''s current target.', '/uploads/images/c_180192.png'),
(186, 'Fiona Frost', 'フィオナ・フロスト', '配角', 'Ayane Sakura', '__Height:__ 172 cm __Occupation:__ Hospital Assistant (secretly a spy) A spy who works undercover as an assistant to [Loid Forger](https://anilist.co/character/138101/Loid-Forger) at Berlint General Hospital to provide him with mission details. Fiona is deeply in love with Loid, even telling Loid to replace [Yor](https://anilist.co/character/138102/Forger-Yor) and let her take over the role of the Forger wife.', '/uploads/images/c_184936.png'),
(186, 'Ewen Egeburg', 'ユーイン・エッジバーグ', '配角', 'Haruka Okamura', 'Best Friend of Damian and Student at Eden Academy. He is a loyal person, devotedly following Damian, almost always holding his bag when they walk to class. He also genuinely cares for Damian as a friend, getting concerned for Damian when he is hurt or pushing himself too hard.', '/uploads/images/c_213881.png'),
(186, 'Emile Elman', 'エミールぅ・エルマン', '配角', 'Hana Satou', 'Best Friend of Damian and Student at Eden Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_213882.png'),
(186, 'Millie', 'ミリー', '配角', 'Manaka Iwami', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_270958.png'),
(186, 'Sharon', 'シャロン', '配角', 'Mirei Kumagai', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_270959.png'),
(186, 'Dominic', 'ドミニク', '配角', 'Shouhei Kajikawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_270960.png'),
(186, 'Bondman', 'ボンドマーン', '配角', 'Taisuke Nakano', 'The protagonist of Spy Wars and the number one spy in the show. He frequently has to take down enemies from the League of Evil in order to save Princess Honey.', '/uploads/images/c_274081.png'),
(186, 'Honey-hime', 'ハニー姫', '配角', 'Miyu Komaki', 'Princess of the kingdom where Spy Wars takes place. She is frequently saved by Bondman which has caused her to develop feelings for him.', '/uploads/images/c_277084.png'),
(186, 'Kokkahoankyoku Chuui', '国家保安局中尉', '配角', 'Yasuyuki Kase', 'A scarred man who is a lieutenant and a higher position than [Yuuri Briar](https://anilist.co/character/150425/Yuuri-Briar) in the SSS. He seems to be fairly close to Yuuri and is aware of his drinking habits and sister complex, advising Yuri to get over his sister and focus on his work.', '/uploads/images/c_279677.jpg'),
(186, 'Keith Kepler', 'キース・ケプラー', '配角', 'Hiroki Takahashi', 'The leader of a terrorist group consisting of isolationist college students from Berlint University, intending on assassinating Foreign Minister Brantz to start a war between Westalis and Ostania.', '/uploads/images/c_280308.jpg'),
(186, 'Kris', 'クリス', '配角', 'Takaaki Torashima', 'A student at Berlint University and a member of the Berlint Terrorist group led by [Keith Kepler](https://anilist.co/character/280308/Keith-Kepler).', '/uploads/images/c_288562.jpg'),
(186, 'Kurt', 'カート', '配角', 'Masafumi Kobatake', 'A student at Berlint University and a member of the Berlint Terrorist group led by [Keith Kepler](https://anilist.co/character/280308/Keith-Kepler).', '/uploads/images/c_288563.jpg'),
(186, 'Monica McBride', 'モニカ・マクブライド', '配角', 'Akari Tadano', 'Works at Mokumoku Club, a cigar club on Fifth Street.', '/uploads/images/c_289991.png'),
(186, 'Brantz Daijin', 'ブランツ大臣', '配角', 'Naoki Bandou', 'A foreign minister from Westalis. He is the target of [Keith Kepler](https://anilist.co/character/280308/Keith-Kepler)''s assassination plan.', '/uploads/images/c_290003.jpg'),
(186, 'Shinonome', '東雲', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', 'An Ostanian spy who thinks of himself as a rival to [Twilight](https://anilist.co/character/138101/Loid-Forger). He is shown to be a highly untalented, yet lucky, spy.', '/uploads/images/c_290959.jpg'),
(186, 'George Glooman', 'ジョージ・グルーマン', '配角', 'Shun Horie', 'A student at Eden Academy and a member of Cecile Hall. He is the son of the CEO of Glooman Pharmaceuticals, a company later bought by the Desmond Group.', '/uploads/images/c_291621.jpg'),
(186, 'George no chichi', 'ジョージの父', '配角', 'Hiroki Gotou', 'Father of George Glooman. He was the CEO of Glooman Pharmaceuticals until the company was bought by The Desmond Group.', '/uploads/images/c_291622.jpg'),
(186, 'Kim Campbell', 'キム・キャンベル', '配角', 'Satsumi Matsuda', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_293393.png'),
(186, 'Carrol Campbell', 'キャロル・キャンベル', '配角', 'Yuuki Shin', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_293394.png'),
(186, 'Cavi Campbell', 'キャビー・キャンベル', '配角', 'Yuuji Ueda', 'After obtaining a fortune in the energy sector, he became known as one of the world''s foremost collectors of classical art. He is one of the organizers of Campbelldon, an underground tennis competition.', '/uploads/images/c_293395.png'),
(186, 'Erik Zacharis', 'エリック・ザカリス', '配角', 'Katsunori Okai', 'Colonel Zacharis was in the East''s Military Intelligence Division during the war and played a major role in ending the war. He previously owned the Lady In The Sun painting that holds a clue to the location of the Zacharis Dossier, rumored to contain information that could "reignite the war."', '/uploads/images/c_293859.jpg'),
(186, 'WISE Kikanin', '<WISE> 機関員', '配角', 'Hiroki Gotou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_293860.jpg'),
(186, 'Martha Marriott', 'マーサ・マリオット', '配角', 'Shouko Tsuda', 'Butler of the Blackbell family and typically acts as [Becky](https://anilist.co/character/150423)''s caretaker.', '/uploads/images/c_294502.jpg'),
(186, 'Becky no Chichi', 'ベッキーの 父', '配角', 'Shoumaru Zouza', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_294503.jpg'),
(186, 'Demetrius Desmond', 'デミトリアス・デズモンド', '配角', 'Aoi Ichikawa', 'First son of the Desmond family and the older brother of [Damian Desmond](https://anilist.co/character/150424/). He is an Imperial Scholar and is noted by [Loid Forger](https://anilist.co/character/138101/) to be an exceptional student, barely getting a single question wrong on the midterm exams.', '/uploads/images/c_294960.png'),
(187, 'Megumi Fushiguro', '伏黒恵', '主角', 'Yuuma Uchida', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") __Occupation:__ Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 2 Sorcerer __Cursed Technique:__ 10 Shadows Megumi is the deuteragonist of the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is a first-year student at Jujutsu High and also a descendant of the Zenin Family. While outwardly stoic and calculating, Megumi wishes to help protect people he sees as good or kind. He believes that the world is unfair and that a Sorcerer is a tool to ensure kind people are given more chances to live. Claiming it to be his selfish and irrational desire, he does not see himself as a hero for doing this.', '/uploads/images/c_126635.png'),
(187, 'Yuuji Itadori', '虎杖悠仁', '主角', 'Junya Enoki', '**Species:** Human **Height:** 173 cm (5''8") **Occupation:** Sorcerer, Student, Vessel **Affiliation:** Jujutsu High Yuuji is a fair person who cares greatly for not only his comrades but anyone he views as people with their own wills, despite how deep or shallow his connection to them is. He cares greatly for the "value of a life" and to this end, he will ensure that others receive a "proper death." He is easy to anger in the face of pure cruelty and unfair judgment of other people. He doesn''t have the born talent required to use cursed techniques, but he has incredible athletic abilities and he is considered very strong for his age, as shown by when he easily beat a coach in Steel Ball Throw.', '/uploads/images/c_127212.png'),
(187, 'Satoru Gojou', '五条悟', '主角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Height:__ 190 cm (6''3") __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer, Teacher __Affiliation:__ Tokyo Metropolitan Curse Technical College, Gojou Family __Grade:__ Special Grade Sorcerer __Cursed Technique:__ Six Eyes, Limitless Satoru Gojou is one of the main protagonists of the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is a special-grade jujutsu sorcerer and is widely recognized as the strongest in the world. Satoru is the pride of the Gojou Family, the first person to inherit both the Limitless and the Six Eyes in four hundred years. He works as a teacher at the Tokyo Jujutsu High and uses his influence to protect and train strong young allies', '/uploads/images/c_127691.png'),
(187, 'Yuuta Okkotsu', '乙骨憂太', '配角', '', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Special Grade Sorcerer The main protagonist of Jujutsu Kaisen prequel series [Tokyo Metropolitan Curse Technical School](https://anilist.co/manga/105469/Tokyo-Toritsu-Jujutsu-Kodo-Senmon-Gakko). He was initially a Special Grade Cursed Victim haunted by his late childhood friend, [Rika Orimoto](https://anilist.co/character/208533/Orimoto-Rika). [Satoru Gojou](https://anilist.co/character/127691/Satoru-Gojou) mentored Yuuta and enrolled him at Tokyo Jujutsu High.', '/uploads/images/c_129571.jpg'),
(187, 'Suguru Getou', '夏油傑', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 183 cm __Occupation:__ Curse User __Grade:__ Special Grade Curse User __Cursed Technique:__ Cursed Spirit Manipulation Suguru Getou is an antagonist in both the Jujutsu Kaisen series and its prequel Jujutsu Kaisen 0: Jujutsu High. ~!He was originally a student of [Masamichi Yaga](https://anilist.co/character/189237/Yaga-Masamichi)''s alongside [Satoru Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691/Gojou-Satoru) and [Shoko Ieiri](https://anilist.co/character/158154/Ieiri-Shouko) at Tokyo Jujutsu High. His experiences as a jujutsu sorcerer bred a deep hatred for non-sorcerers, leading to an incident where Suguru massacred over a hundred civilians in a single night, later being expelled from Jujutsu High and called for immediate execution as a result.!~', '/uploads/images/c_133699.png'),
(187, 'Nobara Kugisaki', '釘崎野薔薇', '主角', 'Asami Seto', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Tokyo Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 3 Sorcerer She is a first-year student and grade 3 jujutsu sorcerer at Tokyo Jujutsu High studying under [Satoru Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691) alongside [Yuji](https://anilist.co/character/127212) and [Megumi](https://anilist.co/character/126635). Nobara is a confident and brash young woman with an unshakable character. More than anything, Nobara is determined to stay true to herself no matter what. She takes great pride in being both a pretty girl and a strong fighter, refusing to let anyone influence her. Initially, Nobara can appear to be a very obnoxious and arrogant person. She first introduced herself to Yuji and Megumi by expressing how inferior they were. She also argued with Yuji for the greater part of their first mission together. Despite her abrasive attitude, Nobara is actually an incredibly caring and dutiful person, but would never let most people see that side of her. After fighting alongside each other in several missions, Yuji and Megumi grow to become Nobara''s closest allies.', '/uploads/images/c_133700.png'),
(187, 'Sukuna', '宿儺', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', '__Species:__ Human, Reincarnated Sorcerer According to the legend, Sukuna was a demon with four arms and two faces who lived in the golden era of sorcery 1000 years ago. Sorcerers of the era gave their all to defeat him, but to no avail. Without ever being defeated, his body was split into 20 separate indestructible cursed objects, which allowed him to live on and traverse the ages to come. In 2018, [Yuuji Itadori](https://anilist.co/character/127212/Itadori-Yuuji) consumed one of the aforementioned cursed objects, and Sukuna was reincarnated. ~!In reality, Sukuna was not a demon, but rather a deformed human sorcerer. His body was able to be split up into 20 cursed objects because he received assistance from [Kenjaku](https://anilist.co/character/289584).!~ Sukuna is hedonistic and has no regard for the suffering of others, believing that suffering is natural for the weak. He is selfish, and always wants to stay in control of the situation without caring about the consequences.', '/uploads/images/c_133701.png'),
(187, 'Mahito', '真人', '配角', 'Nobunaga Shimazaki', '__Grade__: Special Grade __Cursed Technique:__ Idle Transfiguration Mahito is one of the primary antagonists of the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is a Cursed Spirit allied with Suguru Geto, Jogo, Hanami and several others. Their ultimate goal is the eradication of humanity and ultimately replacing the population with Cursed Spirits.', '/uploads/images/c_133702.png'),
(187, 'Kento Nanami', '七海建人', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', '__Height:__ 184 cm (6''0½") __Occupation:__ Sorcerer __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 1 Sorcerer __Cursed Technique:__ Ratio He is a Grade 1 Jujutsu Sorcerer and a Tokyo Jujutsu High alumni. Nanami is a very intelligent and reserved man who at first appears to be someone who is just very serious about his work. He knows how to separate sentimentalism from service and claims he''s only a Jujutsu Sorcerer because it''s slightly less idiotic than regular careers. As one of [Yuji''s](https://anilist.co/character/127212/Yuji-Itadori) mentors, Nanami is a complete contrast to [Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691/Satoru-Gojou), who is far more outspoken and easy-going.', '/uploads/images/c_133704.png'),
(187, 'Maki Zenin', '禪院真希', '配角', 'Mikako Komatsu', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") Maki Zenin is the older twin sister of [Mai Zenin](https://anilist.co/character/134168/Mai-Zenin). Maki is a grade 4 sorcerer and a second-year at Tokyo Metropolitan Jujutsu Technical High School. She is from the main branch of the Zenin clan, one of the "Prominent Three Families" of the Jujutsu world. She left the Zenin family in order to prove herself capable of being a Sorcerer after being deemed uncapable, since she lacks Cursed Energy. ~!Because Mai and Maki are monozygotic twins, their strength is considerably limited to one another. Monozygotic twins are considered as a single individual in the Jujutsu world and are a sign of bad omen.!~ ~!After the death of her twin sister Mai, Maki has lost all of her cursed energy and gained a Heavenly Restriction. This causes her skills and human capabilities to be on par with [Toji Fushiguro''s](https://anilist.co/character/162722/Touji-Fushiguro).!~', '/uploads/images/c_134167.png'),
(187, 'Mai Zenin', '禪院真依', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") Mai Zenin is the younger twin sister of [Maki Zenin](https://anilist.co/character/134167/Maki-Zenin). Mai is a grade 3 sorcerer and a second-year at Kyoto Jujutsu Technical High School. As a child, Mai always relied on Maki since she was afraid of Cursed Spirits. ~!Because Mai and Maki are monozygotic twins, their strength is considerably limited to one another. Monozygotic twins are considered as a single individual in the Jujutsu world and are a sign of bad omen.!~ ~!In chapter 149, Mai decides to sacrifice herself in order to make Maki stronger.!~', '/uploads/images/c_134168.jpg'),
(187, 'Panda', 'パンダ', '配角', 'Tomokazu Seki', '__Species:__ Cursed Corpse (varies among 3 personalities) __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ 2 He is a second-year at Tokyo Prefectural Jujutsu High. As a Metamorphosed Cursed Corpse, he is the best creation of Principal [Masamichi Yaga](https://anilist.co/character/189237/Masamichi-Yaga). He is sentient and has three cores inside the doll body: the youngest brother "Panda", the eldest brother "Gorilla" and a sister.', '/uploads/images/c_137974.jpg'),
(187, 'Aoi Toudou', '東堂葵', '配角', 'Subaru Kimura', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 190 cm __Occupation:__ Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Kyoto Jujutsu Technical High School __Grade:__ Grade 1 Sorcerer Toudou is a third-year student at Kyoto Jujutsu Technical High School who possesses inhuman physical strength, durability, and speed. ~!He is able to use a technique called Boogie Woogie, in which he can switch the position of two things that posses a certain amount of curse energy within his range.!~', '/uploads/images/c_137975.png'),
(187, 'Kasumi Miwa', '三輪霞', '配角', 'Chinatsu Akasaki', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Kyoto Metropolitan Curse Technical College __Grade:__ Grade 3 Sorcerer A second-year at Kyoto Metropolitan Curse Technical College. Kasumi is a hard-working, restrained, and considerate pacifist. She is also a big fan of [Satoru Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691). ~!She has a very close bond with [Mechamaru](https://anilist.co/character/210154), their friendship is first seen in the Tournament Arc when Miwa offers him a battery telling him not to eat it as [Mai](https://anilist.co/character/134168) and [Momo](https://anilist.co/character/157868) laugh in the background. In the Shibuya Arc, she is seen mourning his death on the train. Over the course of the Tournament Arc and Shibuya Arc it is very apparent their friendship grows as they both strived towards becoming closer to one another. As she mourns his death on the train she holds a mini Mechamaru speaker which tells her to find her happiness. After the recording finishes, she holds the speaker to her heart and cries. The entire Kyoto program seems very distressed by his death on the train. When later entering the battle Miwa is quick to activate her technique out of rage and sadness towards [Mahito](https://anilist.co/character/133702).!~', '/uploads/images/c_156848.png'),
(187, 'Jougo', '漏瑚', '配角', 'Shigeru Chiba', '__Grade:__ Special Grade Cursed Spirit Jogou is an unregistered special grade cursed spirit aligned with Mahito, Hanami, and Dagon. He was born of humanity''s fear and negative association with volcanoes and other fire-related natural disasters. This resulted in a highly intelligent cursed spirit with massive levels of cursed energy even for a special grade. Jogou believes curses are the true humans and desires a world where his kind dominates the earth.', '/uploads/images/c_156991.png'),
(187, 'Toge Inumaki', '狗巻棘', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 2 Sorcerer __Cursed Technique:__ Cursed Speech He is a second-year at Tokyo Metropolitan Jujutsu Technical High School. Due to his curse ability, he is only willing to communicate with ingredients used to make rice balls.', '/uploads/images/c_157115.png'),
(187, 'Chousou', '脹相', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', 'Chousou is half human and half cursed spirit and the first of the Death Painting Wombs with a Special Grade rank. He and his two brothers, [Kechizu](https://anilist.co/character/210832/Kechizu) and [Eso](https://anilist.co/character/210831/Esou) are Cursed Womb: Death Paintings who have sided with [Mahito](https://anilist.co/character/133702/Mahito)''s group. Chousou bears strong attachments to his brothers and is very overprotective of them. ~!However, after receiving a vision during his battle with Itadori, Chousou was eventually convinced that Sukuna''s vessel was actually one of his younger brothers. He then became furious at Mahito and the other cursed spirits for manipulating him into harming Itadori.!~ ~!Chousou is one of nine death painting wombs that came from a woman capable of giving birth to cursed spirit children. At some point, Chousou and his brothers were stored at the Jujutsu High, along with some of Sukuna''s fingers. As stated by Chousou himself, Noritoshi Kamo, the man who experimented on his mother is in fact his third "parent" due to him having mixed in his own blood into Chousou when his mother was pregnant with him. Although seemingly not remembering much about his own past, it is evident that Chousou himself remembers Noritoshi and holds a grudge against him for toying with his mother and siblings'' lives.!~', '/uploads/images/c_157116.png'),
(187, 'Junpei Yoshino', '吉野順平', '配角', 'Yoshitaka Yamaya', 'A student at Satozakura High School.', '/uploads/images/c_157214.jpg'),
(187, 'Mei Mei', '冥冥', '配角', 'Kotono Mitsuishi', '__Height:__ 173 cm __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 1 Sorcerer __Family:__ [Ui Ui](https://anilist.co/character/217290) (Younger Brother) __Abilities__: ~! __Weapon Mastery__: Mei Mei wields a large battle-axe. __Cursed Technique__: Black Bird Manipulation - Mei Mei is able to control crows as well as see through their eyes, making her technique great for recon. __Bird Strike__: by forcing a crow to commit suicide, the trade-off is to erase the Cursed Energy limit of a typical weak bird and hurl it at the enemy. !~ Mei Mei is a grade 1 jujutsu sorcerer who works independently and only in exchange for money. She is also the older sister of Ui Ui. ~!She was the senpai of [Satoru Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691) and [Suguru Geto](https://anilist.co/character/133699) during their time at Jujutsu High.!~', '/uploads/images/c_157215.jpg'),
(187, 'Utahime Iori', '庵歌姫', '配角', 'Youko Hikasa', 'A first grade sorcerer and a teacher at Kyoto Jujutsu Technical High School.', '/uploads/images/c_157864.jpg'),
(187, 'Takuma Ino', '猪野琢真', '配角', 'Yuu Hayashi', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Sorcerer __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 2 Sorcerer Takuma Ino is a grade 2 jujutsu sorcerer and a close associate of Kento Nanami who operates out of Tokyo Jujutsu High. Takuma Ino is a genuine and cheerful person with a more positive outlook on things than most jujutsu sorcerers. He doesn''t believe he''s the smartest person around and has a lot of respect for Nanami. Whenever Ino finds himself in a tough situation, he asks himself what would Nanami do.', '/uploads/images/c_157865.jpg'),
(187, 'Noritoshi  Kamo', '加茂憲紀', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', '__Cursed Technique:__ Blood Manipulation __Grade:__ Semi-Grade 1 Sorcerer He is a third-year at Kyoto Magic Technical College.', '/uploads/images/c_157866.png'),
(187, 'Yoshinobu Gakuganji', '楽巌寺嘉伸', '配角', 'Mugihito', 'The principal of Kyoto Jujutsu Technical High School.', '/uploads/images/c_157867.png'),
(187, 'Momo Nishimiya', '西宮桃', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer __Affiliation:__ Kyoto Magic Technical College __Grade:__ Semi-Grade 2 Sorcerer __Cursed Technique:__ Tool Manipulation She is a third-year at Kyoto Magic Technical College.', '/uploads/images/c_157868.png'),
(187, 'Shouko Ieiri', '家入硝子', '配角', 'Aya Endou', '__Height:__ 168 cm __Ability:__ Reverse Healing Cursed Technique Alumnus of Tokyo Jujutsu High, having been classmates with [Satoru Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691) and [Suguru Geto](https://anilist.co/character/133699). After graduating into a full-fledged jujutsu sorcerer, Shoko became the school''s primary doctor.', '/uploads/images/c_158154.png'),
(187, 'Hanami', '花御 ', '配角', 'Atsuko Tanaka', '__Species:__ Cursed Spirit Hanami is an antagonist intent on ridding the Earth of Humans and reviving Sukuna.', '/uploads/images/c_172743.jpg'),
(187, 'Naobito Zenin', '禪院直毘人', '配角', 'Jouji Nakata', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 184 cm __Age:__ Unknown __Hair Color:__ Grey __Occupation:__ The 26th head of House Zenin __Affiliation:__ House Zenin __Grade:__ Grade 1 Sorcerer', '/uploads/images/c_188432.png'),
(187, 'Masamichi Yaga', '夜蛾正道', '配角', 'Takaya Kuroda', 'He is the current principal of Tokyo Metropolitan Jujutsu Technical High School, the creator of Panda, and the headmaster of Satoru Gojo, Suguru Geto and Shoko Ieiri. ~!After the Shibuya incident Yaga is given a death penalty by the higher ups for inciting Gojo and Geto in the past and "causing the Shibuya incident".!~', '/uploads/images/c_189237.png'),
(187, 'Kiyotaka Ijichi', '伊地知潔高', '配角', 'Mitsuo Iwata', 'An assistant manager at Tokyo Prefectural Jujutsu High School.', '/uploads/images/c_189238.png'),
(187, 'Tsumiki Fushiguro', '伏黒津美紀', '配角', 'Saori Hayami', '~! Megumi''s older sister.!~ ~! Tsumiki was unknowingly chosen by Kenjaku to be a participant of the Culling Game and made into the incarnated host of Yorozu !~', '/uploads/images/c_193479.png'),
(187, 'Nagi Yoshino', '吉野凪', '配角', 'Junko Noda', '__Species:__ Human Nagi Yoshino is the mother of Junpei Yoshino. Nagi is a friendly, laid-back woman who cared deeply for her son. She''s eager for him to make friends and took a liking to Yuji immediately. As a mother, she has some irresponsible tendencies. She was a smoker and drinker who allowed Junpei to skip school if she wished. Nagi believes that her son could take a different avenue other than education to be successful in life. After just one meeting, Yuji recognized that Junpei''s mother was a great person.', '/uploads/images/c_194056.png'),
(187, 'Wasuke Itadori', '虎杖倭助', '配角', 'Shigeru Chiba', 'Yuji''s Grandfather is shown to be a selfless, caring man who taught Yuji to help others. He was also short tempered and stubborn, to the point he would yell at Yuji for visiting him every day and buying him flowers. This temper meant that nobody else wanted to visit him and he tells his grandson to avoid dying alone.', '/uploads/images/c_194074.png'),
(187, 'Yuki Tsukumo', '九十九由基', '配角', 'Noriko Hidaka', 'One of the four Special Grade Sorcerers.', '/uploads/images/c_196502.png'),
(187, 'Nobuko Takada', '高田延子', '配角', 'Tomoyo Kurosawa', '__Height:__ 180 cm Aoi Toudou''s favorite idol.', '/uploads/images/c_197119.png'),
(187, 'Kinji Hakari', '秤金次', '配角', '', 'Kinji Hakari is a character in the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is a third-year student at Tokyo Jujutsu High who is currently suspended for clashing with authority. While away from the school, Kinji is running a fight club between sorcerers for money.', '/uploads/images/c_197584.jpg'),
(187, 'Setsuko Sasaki', '佐々木せつこ', '配角', 'Mariya Ise', 'Sasaki is a second-year student at Sugisawa Third High School and a member of school''s Occult Research Club alongside her friends [Yuuji Itadori](https://anilist.co/character/127212/Yuuji-Itadori) and [Takeshi Iguchi](https://anilist.co/character/200767/Takeshi-Iguchi).', '/uploads/images/c_200765.jpg'),
(187, 'Seito Kaichou', '生徒会長', '配角', 'Yoshiki Nakajima', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_200766.jpg'),
(187, 'Takeshi Iguchi', '井口たけし', '配角', 'Takahiro Sumi', 'Iguchi is a second-year student at Sugisawa Third High School and a member of school''s Occult Research Club alongside his friends [Yuuji Itadori](https://anilist.co/character/127212/Yuuji-Itadori) and [Setsuko Sasaki](https://anilist.co/character/200765).', '/uploads/images/c_200767.png'),
(187, 'Takagi', '高木', '配角', 'Kenji Sugimura', 'Takagi is the athletics club advisor teacher at Sugisawa Third High School.', '/uploads/images/c_200768.jpg'),
(187, 'Dagon', '陀艮', '配角', '', '__Affiliation:__ Mahito’s group Dagon is a antagonist who starts off as a cursed womb but later turns into a powerful cursed spirit. He starts off by being accompanied by Jogo and Hanami.', '/uploads/images/c_204383.jpg'),
(187, 'Sotomura', '外村', '配角', 'Akira Harada', 'Sotomura is a teacher at Satozakura High School, where [Junpei Yoshino](https://anilist.co/character/157214/Junpei--Yoshino) attends.', '/uploads/images/c_206208.png'),
(187, 'Juuzou Kumiya', '組屋鞣造', '配角', 'Tetsu Inada', 'A curse user who wields an axe.', '/uploads/images/c_207988.jpg'),
(187, 'Haruta Shigemo', '重面春太', '配角', 'Wataru Hatano', 'A curse user working with Mahito. He loves picking on the weak.', '/uploads/images/c_209694.png'),
(187, 'Shouta Itou', '伊藤翔太', '配角', 'Takamasa Mogi', 'Shouta is a high school student from Satozakura High School.', '/uploads/images/c_210062.png'),
(187, 'Hijoushikina Isha', '非常識な医者', '配角', 'Tetsuo Kanao', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_210063.png'),
(187, 'Sam', 'サム', '配角', 'Daichi Hayashi', 'Sam is a character from one of the movies Itadori has to see to train to maintain a steady output of cursed energy. It''s a reference to Lord of the Rings', '/uploads/images/c_210064.png'),
(187, 'Koukichi Muta', '与幸吉', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'Koukichi Muta is a Semi-Grade 1 sorcerer and a second-year student at Kyoto Jujutsu High. He attends school by controlling the cursed corpse Ultimate Mechamaru, as Muta was born with a sickly and fragile body due to a Heavenly Restriction. In exchange, he has a nearly boundless amount of cursed energy that spreads over a vast range.', '/uploads/images/c_210154.jpg'),
(187, 'Uraume', '裏梅', '配角', '', '__Gender:__ Unknown A curse user from a thousand years ago who is a direct subordinate to Sukuna.', '/uploads/images/c_210830.jpg'),
(187, 'Esou', '壊相', '配角', 'Nobuyuki Hiyama', '__Cursed Technique__ Rot Eso is an antagonist in the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is a Cursed Womb: Death Painting and the middle brother of Choso and Kechizu.', '/uploads/images/c_210831.png'),
(187, 'Kechizu', '血塗', '配角', 'Kappei Yamaguchi', '__Cursed Technique:__ Rot Kechizu is an antagonist in the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is a Cursed Womb: Death Painting and the youngest brother of Choso and Eso. Kechizu and Eso serve as the primary antagonists of the Death Painting Arc.', '/uploads/images/c_210832.png'),
(187, 'Akari Nitta', '新田明', '配角', 'Sora Tokui', 'Akari Nitta is an Auxiliary Manager at Jujutsu High.', '/uploads/images/c_210846.png'),
(187, 'Takeda', '武田', '配角', 'Shigeru Ushiyama', 'Takeda is one of the faculty members at Saitama Urami East Junior High and has been since even before Megumi Fushiguro attended there.', '/uploads/images/c_222599.png'),
(187, 'Kenjaku', '羂索', '配角', '', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 183 cm __Occupation:__ Curse User __Cursed Technique:__ Cursed Spirit Manipulation Kenjaku is one of the primary antagonists of the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is an ancient sorcerer who pursues the goal of "evolving" humanity via cursed energy, thereby ushering in a new golden age of jujutsu sorcery paralleling the Heian Era. ~!Using his cursed technique that allows him to transplant his brain into different bodies to possess them, he has inhabited different people throughout the centuries, assuming different identities.!~', '/uploads/images/c_289584.jpg'),
(187, 'Yubi no Kishu', '指の寄主', '配角', 'Setsuji Satou', 'Finger Bearers are a type of special grade cursed spirit that emerge from the cursed wombs spawned from eating one of [Sukuna](https://anilist.co/character/133701/Sukuna)''s fingers.', '/uploads/images/c_306189.png'),
(187, 'Taichi Kanada', '金田太一', '配角', 'Yugo Sekiguchi', '__Height:__ 175 cm Taichi Kanada is an alumni of Saitama Urami East Junior High ~!and was one of four victims who were cursed as a result of bungee jumping from Yasohachi Bridge. Like the other cursed humans, Taichi died after a cursed spirit appeared between his auto-lock doors, which were stuck wide open.!~', '/uploads/images/c_306276.png'),
(187, 'Tadashi Okazaki', '岡崎正', '配角', 'Shunichi Maki', 'Tadashi Okazaki was a minor character serving time at the Eishu Juvenile Detention Center.', '/uploads/images/c_306282.png'),
(187, 'Orizuki', '澱月', '配角', '', 'Moon Dregs is a jellyfish shikigami summoned by Junpei Yoshino.', '/uploads/images/c_322042.png'),
(187, 'Garuda', '凰輪', '配角', '', 'Garuda is a shikigami used by Yuki Tsukumo and is connected to her innate technique, Star Rage.', '/uploads/images/c_322043.png'),
