(188, 'Tanjirou Kamado', '竈門炭治郎', '主角', 'Natsuki Hanae', '__Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") __Combat Style:__ Water Breathing & ~!Sun Breathing!~ Tanjirou is kind by nature and has been described by others as having very gentle eyes. He has a great deal of determination and will not give up once he has a goal to achieve, an example being finding a cure for [Nezuko](https://anilist.co/character/127518). Even though he is relatively strong on his own, he isn''t opposed to asking others for help when he needs it. He is very protective of his friends and even more so of his younger sister. His biggest attribute is his ability to empathize with anyone, even demons. ~!Eventually, he discovers that he is a legendary Sun Breathing user.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126071.png'),
(188, 'Nezuko Kamado', '竈門禰豆子', '主角', 'Akari Kitou', '__Height:__ 153 cm (5''0") Transformed into a demon and left mute, Nezuko travels with her older brother [Tanjirou](https://anilist.co/character/126071/Kamado-Tanjirou) in a box on his back. She can change her size at will, and is a capable fighter when she needs to be, but has never killed or eaten any humans. Instead of gaining nourishment from humans, it seems that she recovers her energy by sleeping for long periods of time.', '/uploads/images/c_127518.png'),
(188, 'Inosuke Hashibira', '嘴平伊之助', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', '**Height:** 164 cm (5''4") __Combat Style:__ Beast Breathing Inosuke is usually seen wearing a grey boar mask, with a shirtless version of the Demon hunter uniform. Without the mask he has messy shoulder length black hair and large green eyes with long eyelashes. He is described as having a girly looking face which greatly contrasts with his muscular body. Inosuke is extremely short-tempered and proud, and makes a big deal out of fighting opponents stronger than him claiming that''s his only hobby. He is a sore loser and is always trying to compete with Tanjiro and provoke him into fighting him, and usually failing. Due to growing up in the mountains by himself Inosuke has trouble interacting with others and only cares about himself most of the time. Though he''s often seen with 2 swords in hand, Inosuke is left-handed.', '/uploads/images/c_129130.jpg'),
(188, 'Zenitsu Agatsuma', '我妻善逸', '配角', 'Hiro Shimono', '__Height:__ 164 cm (5''4") __Combat Style:__ Thunder Breathing __Affiliation:__ Demon Slayer Corps __Occupation:__ Demon Slayer Zenitsu Agatsuma is one of the main protagonists of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba and along with [Inosuke Hashibira](https://anilist.co/character/129130/Inosuke-Hashibira), a traveling companion of [Tanjiro Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/126071/Tanjirou-Kamado) and [Nezuko Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/127518/Nezuko-Kamado).', '/uploads/images/c_129131.png'),
(188, 'Muzan Kibutsuji', '鬼舞辻無惨', '配角', 'Toshihiko Seki', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5''10") He is the Demon King, the first of his kind, and the progenitor of all other demons in existence. Muzan is also the leader of the Twelve Kizuki, an organization of the twelve strongest demons in existence that serve directly under him. ~!A millennium ago, during the Heian Era, Muzan was turned into a demon during an experimental treatment trying to cure his terminal illness, and his goal since then was to live without the fear of death and become truly eternal. He believes that Sun Breathing users are his only threat. He has a grand total of seven hearts and five brains.!~', '/uploads/images/c_129132.jpg'),
(188, 'Kyoujurou Rengoku', '煉獄杏寿郎', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', '__Height:__ 177 cm (5''10") __Combat Style:__ Flame Breathing He is greatly enthusiastic in regard to his duties as Flame Pillar and often cheerfully eccentric. He is amiable, kind and boasts extraordinary flame techniques and swordsmanship stemming from strict practice and discipline. He is an honourable warrior who adheres to his code of morals and principles that was instilled into him by his mother at a young age - the most significant being that those who were born strong have a duty to protect the weak.', '/uploads/images/c_129133.png'),
(188, 'Muichirou Tokitou', '時透無一郎', '主角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") __Combat Style:__ Mist Breathing Muichiro is an air-headed individual who seems to constantly wander off in thought and never focus on one thing. Impassive and, at times, obtuse, he tends to think only for himself and operates on logic alone, never letting emotion guide him. Despite this, he has been shown to get serious when it is required and is devoted to his position as the Demon Slayer Corps'' Mist Hashira. Alternatively, he seems to display a cold and arrogant side as well. ~!He later died at Kokushibo''s hand.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136069.png'),
(188, 'Tengen Uzui', '宇髄天元', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', '__Height:__ 198 cm (6''6") __Combat Style:__ Sound Breathing A Demon Slayer, and the Sound Pillar of the Demon Slayer Corps. Tengen is a very eccentric person, always wanting to complete actions as flashy as possible. Although he has displayed an uncaring and forceful attitude towards some people, he also has a caring side that is mainly only shown towards his most treasured ones, most notably his three wives, [Makio](https://anilist.co/character/250554), [Suma](https://anilist.co/character/250555), and [Hinatsuru](https://anilist.co/character/250556). He also shows a somewhat nicer side towards [Tanjiro](https://anilist.co/character/126071) after their mission and starts to accept him more as the series goes on.', '/uploads/images/c_136071.png'),
(188, 'Mitsuri Kanroji', '甘露寺蜜璃', '主角', 'Kana Hanazawa', '__Height:__ 167 cm (5''5") __Combat Style:__ Love Breathing Demon Hunter and the Love Pillar of the Demon Killing Corps. Mitsuri is a soft and kind person. She is very emotional and passionate, constantly complimenting people in her head, which probably contributes to her nickname of "the Hashira of Love". Although she is rather shy and is easily flustered, she is always kind to others, most notably towards [Obanai](https://anilist.co/character/137777), whom she appears to share a strong bond with. Besides her rather emotional personality, she can also come off as somewhat childish at times. ~!She was taught by Rengoku to use the flame breathing. However, although Mitsuri has learnt it, she was not as skillful with it and cannot fight to her fullest using it, leading her to solely develop the Love Breathing.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136072.png'),
(188, 'Sanemi Shinazugawa', '不死川実弥', '配角', 'Tomokazu Seki', '__Height:__ 179cm (5''10½") Demon Hunter and the Wind Pillar of the Demon Killing Corps. He is the older brother of [Genya Shinazugawa](https://anilist.co/character/137776). Sanemi specializes in Wind Breathing, which has 9 forms. The technique consists of drawing the air from around the user to create whirlwind attacks that follow the user''s movements. Form names include Dust Whirlwind Cutter, Claws-Purifying Wind, Clean Storm Wind Tree, Rising Dust Storm, Cold Mountain Wind, Black Wind Mountain Mist, Gale - Sudden Gusts, Primary Gale Slash, and Idaten Typhoon.', '/uploads/images/c_137774.png'),
(188, 'Genya Shinazugawa', '不死川玄弥', '主角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '__Height:__ 180 cm (5''11") Genya Is a Demon Hunter of the Demon Killing Corps. He is also the younger brother of the Wind Pillar [Sanemi Shinazugawa](https://anilist.co/character/137774). ~! Due to his lack of breath forms he is dependent on using his shotgun and demon form. His shotgun pelts are made from sun steel to be effective against demons. His demon form is active when he digests anything from a demon to gain demon like strength and abilities. He is the only demon hunter to have this ability given that it is drastically rare !~', '/uploads/images/c_137776.jpg'),
(188, 'Obanai Iguro', '伊黒小芭内', '配角', 'Kenichi Suzumura', '__Height:__ 162 cm (5''3") Obanai is a Demon Slayer and the Snake Pillar of the Demon Slayer Corps. A young man of short stature and a pale complexion. He has straight-edged black hair of varying lengths, the longest reaching down to his shoulders and the shortest stopping at his cheekbones, which he wears down with two shorter strands hanging between his eyes. He wears a navy blue version of the standard Demon Slayer uniform, along with a black and white pinstriped haori, the hem and cuffs of which are striped lengthways rather than vertically, which covers his hands. Obanai also sports bandages in place of the leg-wraps around his calves, as well as another set of bandages that cover his mouth, and blue-strapped zori on his feet. He is also always seen with his white snake, Kaburamaru, wrapped around his shoulders.', '/uploads/images/c_137777.jpg'),
(188, 'Kagaya Ubuyashiki', '産屋敷耀哉', '配角', 'Toshiyuki Morikawa', 'He is the head of the Ubuyashiki Family and 97th leader of the Demon Slayer Corps known mainly as "Oyakata-sama" ("Master") by his subordinates and peers.', '/uploads/images/c_137808.png'),
(188, 'Matsuemon Tennouji', '天王寺松右衛門', '配角', 'Takumi Yamazaki', 'Kasugai Crow assigned to Tanjirou Kamado. Very intelligent and seems to have a large ego.', '/uploads/images/c_137810.png'),
(188, 'Yushirou', '愈史郎', '配角', 'Daiki Yamashita', '__Height:__ 157 cm (5''2") Yushiro is a traveling companion of Tamayo and close ally of Kamado Tanjirou. He was turned into a Demon by Tamayo. Yushiro was a human who was under the care of Tamayo as she was practicing as a medical practitioner. He was in the frail state fighting disease when Tamayo gave him the choice of succumbing to his illness or to live longer as a Demon. He agreed to become a Demon and has since stayed by Tamayo''s side serving as an assistant as well as her guard. ~!Yushiro would become the last known survivor of the Demon race. In time he would dedicate himself to a life of art and become a world famous painter in the present day under the name of Yushiro Yamamoto, known for his paintings of Tamayo to wide critical acclaim!~', '/uploads/images/c_138846.jpg'),
(188, 'Tamayo', '珠世', '配角', 'Maaya Sakamoto', '__Height:__ 150 cm (4''11") Tamayo is a doctor and close ally of [Kamado Tanjirou](https://anilist.co/character/126071/Kamado-Tanjirou). She was turned into a Demon by [Kibutsuji Muzan](https://anilist.co/character/129132/Kibutsuji-Muzan).', '/uploads/images/c_138847.jpg'),
(188, 'Hotaru Haganezuka', '鋼鐵塚蛍', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', 'Hotaru Haganezuka is a swordsmith affiliated with the Demon Killing Corps.', '/uploads/images/c_138990.jpg'),
(188, 'Kanao Tsuyuri', '栗花落カナヲ', '配角', 'Reina Ueda', '__Height:__ 156 cm (5''1½") Kanao Tsuyuri is a Demon Hunter and the Tsuguko, who is personally looked after by the Demon Killing Corps'' Pillars. She uses Flower Breathing. ~!When Kanao is first introduced, she is an indecisive and quiet girl due to the abuse she endured in her past before meeting the Kocho sisters. She became unable to make decisions by herself and repressed her emotions as a defense mechanism. In order to help rectify this, Kanae gave her a coin to flip to decide which path to follow when she didn''t know what to do. Later on, Tanjiro helps Kanao overcome her indecisiveness and Kanao soon becomes more confident in making decisions with or without her coin. Kanao and Tanjiro would eventually marry and start a family, having two great-great-grandchildren by the names of [Kanata Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/171144/Kanata-Kamado) and [Sumihiko Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/171145/Sumihiko-Kamado) between them.!~', '/uploads/images/c_139038.png'),
(188, 'Kiriya Ubuyashiki', '産屋敷輝利哉', '配角', '', '~!Kiriya Ubuyashiki is the son and middle child of Kagaya Ubuyashiki. He is the current head of the Ubuyashiki Household and leader of the Demon Slaying Corps!~', '/uploads/images/c_139460.png'),
(188, 'Nakime', '鳴女', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', 'Nakime is a mysterious Biwa Demon that dwells in the Dimensional Infinity Fortress. ~!Actually she is a member of the Twelve Demon Moons, replacing Hantengu and holding the position of Upper Moon Four.!~ (Source: Fandom)', '/uploads/images/c_139736.png'),
(188, 'Akaza', '猗窩座', '配角', 'Akira Ishida', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") A member of the Twelve Demon Moons, holding the position of Upper Moon Three.', '/uploads/images/c_141694.png'),
(188, 'Kokushibo', '黒死牟', '配角', 'Ryoutarou Okiayu', '__Height:__ 190 cm (6''3") __Combat Style:__ ~!Moon breathing!~ Kokushibo is a member of the Twelve Demon Moons, holding the position of Upper Moon One. ~!When he was a human he went by the name Michikatsu Tsugikuni. He is also the brother of Yoriichi Tsugikuni.!~', '/uploads/images/c_141918.png'),
(188, 'Douma', '童磨', '配角', 'Mamoru Miyano', '__Height:__ 187 cm (6''1½") He is Upper Moon Two, making him the third-strongest demon after Muzan and Upper Moon One. He has a very friendly attitude, and fights with a pair of metal fans. He is the founder of a cult known as the "Eternal Paradise Cult," and eats his followers, allegedly in order to release them from the pain of living. ~!He is the demon who killed Shinobu Kochou''s older sister and Shinobu, as well as Inosuke''s mother.!~', '/uploads/images/c_144591.png'),
(188, 'Naho Takada', '高田なほ', '配角', 'Yuuki Kuwahara', 'She is a servant of the Butterfly Estate.', '/uploads/images/c_145286.jpg'),
(188, 'Kiyo Terauchi', '寺内きよ', '配角', 'Nanami Yamashita', 'She is a servant of the Butterfly Estate.', '/uploads/images/c_145287.jpg'),
(188, 'Aoi Kanzaki', '神崎アオイ', '配角', 'Yuri Ehara', 'She is a Demon Slayer, though she works as a servant in the Butterfly Estate rather than taking to the front lines.', '/uploads/images/c_145288.jpg'),
(188, 'Sumi Nakahara', '中原すみ', '配角', 'Ayumi Mano', 'She is a servant of the Butterfly Estate.', '/uploads/images/c_145289.jpg'),
(188, 'Yoriichi Tsugikuni', '継国緑壱', '配角', 'Kazuhiko Inoue', '__Combat Style:__ Sun Breathing Yoriichi Tsugikuni is a major supporting character of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba. He was a legendary Demon Slayer of the Demon Slayer Corps during the Sengoku Era. ~!Yoriichi is the younger twin brother of Michikatsu Tsugikuni, who later became a Demon and joined the Twelve Kizuki, holding the position of Upper Rank 1.!~ ~!Yoriichi is also the progenitor of Breathing Styles as a whole and was an immensely gifted individual who was fated and meant to defeat Muzan Kibutsuji, but failed.!~', '/uploads/images/c_149220.jpg'),
(188, 'Kanata Ubuyashiki', '産屋敷かなた', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_153220.jpg'),
(188, 'Nichika Ubuyashiki', '産屋敷 にちか', '配角', 'Ari Ozawa', 'Nichika Ubuyashiki is one of the older daughters of Kagaya Ubuyashiki.', '/uploads/images/c_167548.png'),
(188, 'Hinaki Ubuyashiki', '産屋敷 ひなき', '配角', 'Yumiri Hanamori', 'Hinaki Ubuyashiki is one of the older daughters of Kagaya Ubuyashiki.', '/uploads/images/c_167549.png'),
(188, 'Kotetsu', '小鉄', '配角', 'Ayumu Murase', 'Kotetsu is a young villager from the Swordsmith Village. His ancestors built the battle doll Yoriichi Type Zero.', '/uploads/images/c_171768.jpg'),
(188, 'Gyokko', '玉壺', '配角', 'Kousuke Toriumi', '__Height:__ 150 cm (4''11") (Normal), 170 cm (5''7") (Molted) Gyokko is a major supporting antagonist in the Swordsmith Village Arc of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba. He is also a member of the Twelve Kizuki, holding the position of Upper Rank 5.', '/uploads/images/c_205590.jpg'),
(188, 'Kozo Kanamori', '鉄穴森鋼蔵', '配角', 'Eiji Takemoto', 'Kozo Kanamori is a swordsmith affiliated with the Demon Slayer Corps.', '/uploads/images/c_206331.png'),
(188, 'Gotou', '後藤', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', 'Goto is a member of the Kakushi, the clean-up brigade of the Demon Slayers. He is the one who found a near-dead Tanjiro, Inosuke, and Zenitsu in the aftermath of the Entertainment District Arc. He possesses deep respect for the three because of their capability and bravery. At one point in his life, he was found worthy of being a Demon Slayer, but for unknown reasons, he decided to become one of the Kakushi.', '/uploads/images/c_207949.png'),
(188, 'Amane Ubuyashiki', '産屋敷あまね', '配角', 'Rina Satou', '__Height:__ 167cm (5''6") She is the wife and caretaker of [Kagaya Ubuyashiki](https://anilist.co/character/137808/Kagaya-Ubuyashiki) and the mother of Hinaki Ubuyashiki, Nichika Ubuyashiki, Kiriya Ubuyashiki, Kanata Ubuyashiki and Kuina Ubuyashiki. Her maiden name is Amane Himorogi.', '/uploads/images/c_221375.jpg'),
(188, 'Hantengu', '半天狗', '配角', 'Toshio Furukawa', '__Height:__ 166 cm (5''5¼") Demon of the 12 Kizuki with the rank of Upper Moon 4. ~!Through his Blood Demon Art, he is able to create clones that are manifestations of his emotions, each of them possessing an Upper Rank demon''s level of strength.!~', '/uploads/images/c_260323.png'),
(188, 'Chachamaru', '茶々丸', '配角', '', 'Chachamaru is a feline familiar that assists in Tamayo''s medical research with Demon blood. ~!Chachamaru is seen during the battle with Muzan, after the Infinity Castle collapses. The cat jumps above the remaining Hashira in order to administer an antidote to stave off the poisonous effects of Muzan''s attacks. As a result, it is sliced in half by the demon. However, it was later reassembled by Yushirou.!~', '/uploads/images/c_268212.jpg'),
(188, 'Yuuichirou Tokitou', '時透有一郎', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', 'Older twin brother of [Muichirou.](https://anilist.co/character/136069/Muichirou-Tokitou) He had a cold and harsh personality, speaking critically of his dead parents and brother. ~!He is killed when a demon attacks him and Muichiro, and his last words were encouragement toward Muichiro to live on.!~', '/uploads/images/c_269650.png'),
(188, 'Tecchin Tecchikawahara', '鉄地河原鉄珍', '配角', 'Yuusaku Yara', 'Chief of the Swordsmith Village.', '/uploads/images/c_299978.jpg'),
(188, 'Sumiyoshi', '炭吉', '配角', 'Hirofumi Nojima', 'Ancestor of the Kamado family and close acquaintance of [Yoriichi Tsugikuni](https://anilist.co/character/149220).', '/uploads/images/c_302101.jpg'),
(188, 'Ginko', '銀子', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', 'Kasugai Crow assigned to [Muichirou Tokitou](https://anilist.co/character/136069). Does not get along well with [Tanjirou](https://anilist.co/character/126071) and his crow or the other crows in general. She is very proud of Muichirou.', '/uploads/images/c_304323.jpg'),
(188, 'Urara', '麗', '配角', 'Yui Horie', 'Kasugai Crow assigned to [Mitsuri Kanroji](https://anilist.co/character/136072). Wears a clover-shaped crown similar to Mitsuri''s Nichirin Sword tsuba. Often appears to be nervous and fidgety, and is rumored to have a sweet tooth as a result of how often she has tea time with Mitsuri.', '/uploads/images/c_304324.jpg'),
(188, 'Suyako', '珠彌子', '配角', 'Misato Fukuen', 'Wife of [Sumiyoshi](https://anilist.co/character/302101) and ancestor of the Kamado family.', '/uploads/images/c_304940.jpg'),
(188, 'Shizu Shinazugawa', '不死川志津', '配角', 'Ryouka Yuzuki', 'Mother to the 7 Shinazugawa children, including Sanemi and Genya.', '/uploads/images/c_305514.jpg'),
(188, 'Sumi Shinazugawa', '不死川寿美', '配角', 'Kaori Maeda', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_305515.jpg'),
(188, 'Shuya Shinazugawa', '不死川就也', '配角', 'Misato Matsuoka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_305516.jpg'),
(188, 'Hiroshi Shinazugawa', '不死川弘', '配角', 'Maki Kawase', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_305517.jpg'),
(188, 'Koto Shinazugawa', '不死川こと', '配角', 'Aimi Tanaka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_305518.jpg'),
(188, 'Teiko Shinazugawa', '不死川貞子', '配角', 'Azumi Waki', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_305519.jpg'),
(188, 'Tokitou no Chichi', '時透の父', '配角', 'Noriaki Sugiyama', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_306030.jpg'),
(188, 'Tokitou no Haha', '時透の母', '配角', 'Manami Numakura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_306575.png'),
(188, 'Tetsuido', '鉄井戸', '配角', 'Atsushi Ono', 'A swordsmith affiliated with the Demon Slayer Corps. He was responsible for Muichirou Tokitou''s swords until he died from a heart attack.', '/uploads/images/c_306576.png'),
(188, 'Kanroji no Chichi', '甘露寺の父', '配角', 'Kenji Nojima', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_307747.jpg'),
(188, 'Kanroji no Haha', '甘露寺の母', '配角', 'Junko Minagawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_307748.jpg'),
(188, 'Kyougo Shinazugawa', '不死川恭梧', '配角', '', 'Father of of the Shinazugawa family and husband to Shizu.', '/uploads/images/c_310541.png'),
(189, 'Kiyotaka Ayanokouji', '綾小路清隆', '主角', 'Shouya Chiba', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9") Ayanokouji is an inconspicuous and unobtrusive student. He is shown to be extremely intelligent and possesses a profound insight to study the emotions of people around him. Almost everything about his life prior to the entrance exams is unknown. He is shown to be extremely calculating and possessing superhuman intellect, perception, and strength. He''s skilled at fighting and is able to easily manipulate the people around him. He is quite fond of his friends and protects those that he can without standing out. He has little regard for others'' feelings and will coldly let them suffer to succeed, occasionally even his friends.', '/uploads/images/c_123212.png'),
(189, 'Suzune Horikita', '堀北鈴音', '主角', 'Akari Kitou', '__Height:__ 156 cm (5''1") A beautiful girl who sits next to [Ayanokouji](https://anilist.co/character/123212/Ayanokouji-Kiyotaka). She is the opposite of Ayanokouji when it comes to friendship; she disregards it and thinks of making friends unnecessary, thus she does not communicate much with her classmates. She is not convinced that she was placed in the D class, therefore she aims to get promoted to the A class.', '/uploads/images/c_123213.png'),
(189, 'Kikyou Kushida', '櫛田桔梗', '主角', 'Yurika Kubo', '__Height:__ 155 cm She boasts tremendous popularity among men and women as the D class'' idol. She aims to be friends with everyone not just in D class. She wants to get along well with her classmate, [Horikita](https://anilist.co/character/123213/Horikita-Suzune).', '/uploads/images/c_123214.png'),
(189, 'Airi Sakura', '佐倉愛里', '主角', 'Mao Ichimichi', '__Height:__ 153 cm (5''0") A girl who is into photography. She hates standing out and likes to take modeling pictures.', '/uploads/images/c_123215.jpg'),
(189, 'Honami Ichinose', '一之瀬帆波', '配角', 'Nao Touyama', '__Height:__ 159 cm (5''2") If there was one sentence to describe Honami, it would be that she is genuinely kind-hearted, benevolent, and a pacifist to the core who is against using underhanded means and violence. One of her main traits is her unselfish and supportive personality, combined with her excellent social skills and her being naturally people-oriented. Honami is also a charismatic and energetic person, and extends her sweet and benign character even to those of the lower classes, unlike many other upper-class students.', '/uploads/images/c_123216.png'),
(189, 'Sae Chabashira', '茶柱佐枝', '配角', 'Rina Satou', '__Height:__ 160 cm The homeroom teacher of the protagonist''s class (D). She is originally indifferent to her class, doing almost nothing to help them in the battle between classes, and remains unmotivated for the most part.', '/uploads/images/c_123217.png'),
(189, 'Yousuke Hirata', '平田洋介', '配角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', '__Height:__ 174 cm (5''8") The social leader of the D class. He has excellent academic and athletic ability, and is considered extremely handsome by his classmates, he is shown to be extremely compassionate and puts others before himself, considering everybody equal. He is considered a perfect male student and his placement in the D-class is originally considered a mystery.', '/uploads/images/c_123218.png'),
(189, 'Manabu Horikita', '堀北学', '配角', 'Yuuichirou Umehara', '__Height:__ 178 cm (5''10") He is the leader of the school council and is [Horikita Suzune](https://anilist.co/character/123213/Horikita-Suzune)''s elder brother.', '/uploads/images/c_123219.png'),
(189, 'Arisu Sakayanagi', '坂柳有栖', '配角', 'Rina Hidaka', '__Height:__ 150 cm (4''11") Arisu Sakayanagi is one of the class representatives of class 1-A along with [Kohei Katsuragi](https://anilist.co/character/207026). She suffers from congenital heart disease which limits her physical ability. She appears to possess a "go with the flow" attitude as she accepts most situations with no protest though she voices her dislike of boring situations after Katsuragi noted of the class scores. Unlike Kohei Katsuragi, who has a conservative stance, Arisu possesses an innovative attitude. Together, the pair effectively lead class A through the school years. She enjoys situations she finds interesting as shown when she smiled at [Kakeru Ryuen](https://anilist.co/character/159627)''s declaration to rule the school or when she listened to the speech of [Suzune Horikita](https://anilist.co/character/123213) and found it amusing. In the light novels, Arisu enjoys toying with people as seen when she cryptically hinted to [Kiyotaka Ayanokoji](https://anilist.co/character/123212) of knowing him while he had voiced he never saw her before. Later on, while being together with [Honami Ichinose](https://anilist.co/character/123216), she also had the chance to show her confidence and complacency after [Teruhiko Yukimura](https://anilist.co/character/173450) of Ayanokoji Group boldly claimed that D-Class has the plan to overtake A-Class soon. Additionally, although she has an easygoing personality, it was shown in the later part of the series that she''s easil', '/uploads/images/c_124691.jpg'),
(189, 'Mei-Yu Wang', '王美雨', '配角', 'Amisa Sakuragi', 'Mei-Yu is of Chinese descent and is shown to be one of the academically gifted students. She has a visible crush on Hirata Yosuke.', '/uploads/images/c_136233.png'),
(189, 'Kei Karuizawa', '軽井沢恵', '配角', 'Ayana Taketatsu', '__Height:__ 154 cm (5''0") She is a girl with a bad attitude who is located at the top of the D class hierarchy. She fights with [Kushida](https://anilist.co/character/123214/Kushida-Kikyou) for their class'' top 2 places. Even though she gives off the impression of someone who is careless, arrogant, and messy, Kei''s true self is very logical and astute with a sharp mind. She has remarkable ability to read the environment and the people around her, and makes the correct decision often.', '/uploads/images/c_141122.png'),
(189, 'Rokusuke Kouenji', '高円寺六助', '配角', 'Toshiki Iwasawa', 'Rokusuke Kouenji is one of the students of class 1-D. He came from a well-known family of scholars. However, he ended up in D-Class for his egotistical behavior. ~!In Year 1, Volume 11, he watches a scuffle between [Hirata](https://anilist.co/character/123218/Hirata-Yousuke) and [Mii-Chan](https://anilist.co/character/136233/Wang-MeiYu), which ended with Hirata pushing a desperate Mii-Chan, who was trying to help him, on the ground. Kouenji then intervenes and states his annoyance at Hirata "for treating a girl wrong" referring him as "like a fly, very irritating". His friendship with Mii-Chan is then showed to progress in Year 2, Volume 5, when they are seen walking together often, and Mii-chan referring to him as "someone easy to talk to" when asked about their relationship by [Satou](https://anilist.co/character/163519/Satou-Maya) and [Matsushita](https://anilist.co/character/191401/Matsushita-Chiaki).!~ ~!During the Second Year Uninhabited Island Special Exam, he strikes an agreement with [Suzune Horikita](https://anilist.co/character/123213/Horikita-Suzune), in which he would try for a first-place finish and Suzune would reward him with complete protection from class vote expulsion until graduation and exempt him from being forced to co-operate with the rest of the class, which he wins.!~', '/uploads/images/c_158988.png'),
(189, 'Kakeru Ryuuen', '龍園翔', '配角', 'Masaaki Mizunaka', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8") Kakeru Ryuuen is the class representative of class 1-C and is known for being an infamous delinquent. He does not lead his class by trust, but rather by fear. He has a group of henchmen who do his dirty work, which contributes to his fearsome reputation.', '/uploads/images/c_159627.png'),
(189, 'Haruka Hasebe', '長谷部波瑠加', '配角', 'Yuiko Tatsumi', 'Haruka is a pretty normal person, but she is not very open to other people as shown when she didn''t participate in the class''s swimming session where she tends to prefer keeping to herself and not bothering people, simply to avoid trouble. She is considered to have good looks and is often viewed lustfully by boys, thus wanting to seclude herself. She is mostly seen wearing the school''s uniform, with the difference that she has the upper button of her shirt undone and her tie relatively loosened. She prefers giving people nicknames the moment she meets them, which is said by Kushida to be a method for her "to appear closer to the people she isn''t close to". ~! In Year 2, Volume 5, Haruka is told off by Kushida when she tries to help the latter. She is then seen aggressively opposing the motion by Ayanokoji to expel Airi Sakura, being her closest friend, to no avail. She is one of the 4 remaining members and the sole remaining girl of the Ayanokoji Group.!~', '/uploads/images/c_163517.png'),
(189, 'Hiyori Shiina', '椎名ひより', '配角', '', 'Hiyori Shiina is one of the students of Class 1-C who is a loner. She''s a quiet girl, though sometimes she is seen occasionally smiling. She always carries books with her in her bag in case she meets someone who shares the same interest in literature as her. Since nobody in class 1-C is into literature, she doesn''t have anyone to talk to. She always speaks politely. She dislikes how the classes are competing with each other, wanting everyone to be friends. ~! She encounters Kiyotaka in the library, and they find themselves having the same taste in books. As she always wanted a friend who has similar interests as her, their friendship gradually blossoms and she refers to him as her "reading buddy". She slowly starts developing romantic feelings for Kiyotaka.!~', '/uploads/images/c_163518.png'),
(189, 'Maya Satou', '佐藤麻耶', '配角', 'Lynn', 'She is a student of class 1-D. ~!In Volume 7.5, Maya asks for [Kei Karuizawa](https://anilist.co/character/141122/Karuizawa-Kei)''s help to plan her "date" with [Kiyotaka Ayanokouji](https://anilist.co/character/123212/Ayanokouji-Kiyotaka). Kei was surprised and suggested other boys to her, but she refused, and said that she only liked Kiyotaka. She told her plan to Kei and made some changes according to her suggestions. She then later asked Kei if they could make it a "double-date", by including her and [Yousuke Hirata](https://anilist.co/character/123218/Hirata-Yousuke) in the plan. Eventually, Kei agreed and decided to schedule the double date on December 25. She confessed to Kiyotaka after the double date during Christmas, but was rejected and ran away crying. They promised each other that they will hang out again in the future and wants to see each other again but Maya couldn’t hold her feelings and excused herself first as she didn’t want him to see her in a pathetic state. She was hinted to have cried an innumerable amount of times behind closed doors after being rejected as the next time we saw her, she was able to frankly tell her friends she was rejected without being choked up. Her friends summarised that this could only had happened if she had come to terms with the rejection showing an immense amount of willpower to move on. That said, she still harbours feelings for Kiyotaka and has admitted that she finds him way cooler and hotter than Hirata not holding against', '/uploads/images/c_163519.jpg'),
(189, 'Teruhiko Yukimura', '幸村輝彦', '配角', 'Tsubasa Gouden', 'Teruhiko Yukimura is a student of class 1-D. Despite his excellent academic ability, he was placed there due to his poor athletic ability and lack of social skills. During the formation of the Ayanokoji Group, it is revealed that he does not like his first name Teruhiko, given to him by his mother who left their family. He prefers the name his father gave him: Keisei', '/uploads/images/c_173450.png'),
(189, 'Mio Ibuki', '伊吹澪', '配角', 'Mikako Komatsu', 'Mio Ibuki is a student of class 1-C. Not only does she possess excellent academic qualities, but her physical ability is also not to be underestimated. She is skilled in combat, having the knowledge of several martial skills that can rival those of many martial artists.', '/uploads/images/c_174781.png'),
(189, 'Chiaki Matsushita', '松下千秋', '配角', 'Masumi Tazawa', 'Matsushita is one of the students of class 2-D. She has a quiet older sister type of personality. She is generally kind to all the boys and girls alike, but she does not actively go out to make friends. ~!Chiaki had believed from early on in the first year that Class D had no hopes of ever reaching Class A and thus resigned herself to a carefree school life, never putting in any real effort into her academics. She considers herself to be a major underachiever, believing that she could easily score in the top 10% of her class if she truly tried to, but believed it to be pointless as long as she was in Class D. Later on in the light novels, she starts seeing improvements in the class and becomes willing to start contributing to the class. She is also known to be skilled at mental arithmetic and can calculate quickly. She even held her own against Kouhei Katsuragi from Class A in the Mental Arithmetic event in the Event Selection Exam.!~ ~!Later, in her monologue, she states that she had started to pay close attention to Kiyotaka after the end of year special exam, but she was not romantically interested in him. According to her, she was probably among the top 10% of students in their year, but had not revealed her abilities since she did not want people to be jealous of her. She had thought that even if she tried her best, the chance of Class-D being able to rank up the classes was minimal. However, after closely observing Kiyotaka, she had arrived at the conclusion that Class-', '/uploads/images/c_191401.jpg'),
(189, 'Akane Tachibana', '橘茜', '配角', 'Konomi Kohara', 'Akane Tachibana is a former student of Advanced Nurturing High School who has graduated from Class 3-A and the former secretary of the Student Council.', '/uploads/images/c_191504.png'),
(189, 'Yume Kobashi', '小橋夢', '配角', 'Narumi Kaho', 'Yume Kobashi is one of the students in class 1-B.', '/uploads/images/c_191505.jpg'),
(189, 'Satsuki Shinohara', '篠原さつき', '配角', 'Saori Kouda', 'Satsuki Shinohara is one of the students of class 2-D. She is considered to have below-average looks. She has an outspoken personality and can often be seen arguing with Ike.', '/uploads/images/c_191506.png'),
(189, 'Masumi Kamuro', '神室真澄', '配角', 'Ayane Sakura', 'Masumi Kamuro is a student of Class 2-A and a member of the Art Club. She is one of the members of the inner circle of Sakayanagi faction but is shown to be only interested in doing so as Sakayanagi has some information about her criminal history.', '/uploads/images/c_191507.png'),
(189, 'Chie Hoshinomiya', '星之宮知恵', '配角', 'Hisako Kanemoto', 'Chie Hoshinomiya is the homeroom teacher of class 1-B. She has a cheerful, flirty personality and is referred to as "never having grown from her high school days" by Ayanokoji. She shows glimpses of a more serious side of hers upon matters relating to reaching Class-A. She was a classmate of her colleague Sae Chabashira during their time in the Advanced Nurturing High School.', '/uploads/images/c_191508.png'),
(189, 'Ryuuji Kanzaki', '神崎隆二', '配角', 'Akihisa Wakayama', '__Height:__ 174 cm (5''8½") Apart of Class 1-B and Honami Ichinose''s right hand man. Not much is known about Ryūji, but he appears to be a diligent student who behaves seriously and he is a very helpful person as shown when he aided Honami Ichinose in the case of Ken Sudō. He is a friendly person as he does not look down on D-Class and gets along with them.', '/uploads/images/c_207022.png'),
(189, 'Haruki Yamauchi', '山内春樹', '配角', 'Mutsuki Iwanaka', 'Haruki is apart of Class 1-D. He is apart of the three idiots of Class D along with Ike and Sudou. He has a tendency to lie and his grades are the lowest in the class. Similar to his friends, Haruki has a perverted side who is attracted to Kikyō Kushida as he was willing to peep on the girls. He is also very attracted to Airi Sakura and Haruka Hasebe, mainly for their well-endowed bodies and quiet nature. ~!Haruki got expelled during the Class Vote Exam.!~', '/uploads/images/c_207023.jpg'),
(189, 'Akito Miyake', '三宅明人', '配角', '', 'In middle school, Akito became fond of archery and joined the club there and even participated in country-level competitions. However, he began to neglect other activities or duties, such as studies, in the process. At that time he started to create some ruckus by causing quarrels with other people. That, and the fact that he neglected his studies lead to his evaluation as a D-Class student. In high school, he once again became a member of the Archery Club. He is a good friend of Kiyotaka and is apart of the Ayanokouji friend group.', '/uploads/images/c_207024.png'),
(189, 'Ken Sudou', '須藤健', '配角', 'Eiji Takeuchi', '__Height:__ 183 cm (6''0") Ken is apart of Class 1-D and is apart of the Basketball Club. Due to his poor academic ability, he is referred to as one of the 3 Idiots of D-Class. Regardless of this, his athletic ability is without a doubt one of the best among the school. He has a crush on Suzune after receiving help from her. Under the constant supervision of Suzune, he gradually matures and begins to improve academically rising out of the bottom ladder of class and earning her trust.', '/uploads/images/c_207025.png'),
(189, 'Kouhei Katsuragi', '葛城康平', '配角', 'Satoshi Hino', '**Height:** 180 cm (5''11") Kōhei is an intelligent student who worked very hard to reach Class 1-A that he became one of its representatives alongside Arisu Sakayanagi. He is a serious man who adheres to the rules of manners and good conduct. He has a feud with Sakayanagi for control of the class, leading him to oppose her with his faction. He is bald due to an illness. He has a twin sister and they were originally orphans. Volume 2 Year 2 ~!He''s transferred to Ryuuen''s Class !~', '/uploads/images/c_207026.png'),
(189, 'Masayoshi Hashimoto', '橋本正義', '配角', 'Youhei Azakami', 'Masayoshi is a very self-serving individual with no real loyalty to anyone other than himself. He always sides with and places his bets on the winning team, in order to always stay on top. When the Class-A leadership conflict breaks out at the beginning of the first year, Masayoshi determines that Arisu Sakayanagi is the better candidate for the position of leader and quickly joins her faction and becomes part of her inner circle.', '/uploads/images/c_207027.png'),
(189, 'Tomonari Mashima', '真嶋智也', '配角', 'Ryou Sugisaki', 'Mashima is an English teacher and the homeroom teacher of class 1-A. Mashima is a man who takes his job seriously and puts his students first.', '/uploads/images/c_207028.png'),
(189, 'Kanji Ike', '池寛治', '配角', 'Daiki Abe', 'Kanji Ike is one of the students of Class 1-D who is known as one of the 3 Idiots of D-Class. While his intelligence is poor, his communication skills are excellent.', '/uploads/images/c_273646.jpg'),
(189, 'Albert Yamada', '山田アルベルト', '配角', 'Rikiya Koyama', 'Albert Yamada is one of the students of Class 1-C.', '/uploads/images/c_273647.jpg'),
(189, 'Yahiko Totsuka', '戸塚弥彦', '配角', 'Daisuke Motohashi', 'Yahiko Totsuka is a student of Class 1-A and belongs to Katsuragi Faction.', '/uploads/images/c_273648.jpg'),
(189, 'Hayato Kitou', '鬼頭隼', '配角', '', 'Hayato Kitou is one of the students of Sakayanagi’s class.', '/uploads/images/c_281121.png'),
(189, 'Mako Amikura', '網倉麻子', '配角', 'Yuu Ayase', 'Mako Amikura is one of the students of Ichinose’s class.', '/uploads/images/c_282225.png'),
(189, 'Kayano Onodera', '小野寺かや乃', '配角', 'Makoto Koichi', 'Kayano Onodera is one of the students of Horikita’s class. She is a member of the Swimming Club and she is the best swimmer out of the girls in her class.', '/uploads/images/c_282226.jpg'),
(189, 'Daichi Ishizaki', '石崎大地', '配角', 'Yuuichi Hose', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_282230.jpg'),
(189, 'Kokoro Inogashira', '井の頭心', '配角', 'Shino Shimoji', 'Kokoro Inogashira is one of the students of Horikita’s class.', '/uploads/images/c_282231.jpg'),
(189, 'Sou Shibata', '柴田 颯', '配角', '', 'Sou Shibata is one of the students of Ichinose’s class.', '/uploads/images/c_282232.jpg'),
(189, 'Hideo Sotomura', '外村秀雄', '配角', 'Shunsuke Kawabe', 'Hideo Sotomura is one of the students of Horikita’s class.', '/uploads/images/c_284288.jpg'),
(189, 'Chihiro Shiranami', '白波千尋', '配角', 'Nao Shiraki', 'Chihiro Shiranami is one of the students of Ichinose’s class.', '/uploads/images/c_284289.png'),
(189, 'Nene Mori', '森寧々', '配角', 'Rina Honizumi', 'Nene Mori is one of the students of Horikita’s class.', '/uploads/images/c_284290.jpg'),
(189, 'Atsuomi Ayanokouji', '綾小路篤臣', '配角', '', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_290862.jpg'),
(190, 'Sylphiette', 'シルフィエット', '主角', 'Ai Kayano', 'Sylphiette is [Rudeus](https://anilist.co/character/88348/Rudeus-Greyrat)'' childhood friend who is part human, elf, and beast race. ~!Following the teleportation incident, during which her hair turned white from mana exhaustion, she became Princess Ariel''s personal bodyguard under the alias Fitz.!~ ~!She is Rudeus'' first wife and gives birth to their daughter [Lucy](https://anilist.co/character/188846/Greyrat-Lucy) and son [Sieghardt](https://anilist.co/character/273377/Greyrat-Saladin-Sieghardt). She is one of the three goddesses Rudeus worships in his religion. A cloth stained with her virgin blood that serves as a relic for the Goddess of Love is enshrined in the basement.!~', '/uploads/images/c_88346.png'),
(190, 'Rudeus Greyrat', 'ルーデウス・グレイラット', '主角', 'Yumi Uchiyama', '__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") Rudeus is a tall, well-built, and cool-looking man. However, before his reincarnation, he was originally an overweight 34-year-old Japanese NEET who became a recluse following his high-school persecution. Because of his former life, he is careful not to get carried away and become arrogant. As a result, he is extremely self-aware and humble because he does not want to revert to his old self. He is a kind person, helping his friends and protecting his family whenever needed. Due to being capable in many fields, people have high expectations of him. His body possesses a high affinity for magic. Rudeus is very polite to others, often to the point of making them uncomfortable. Rudeus is one of the few people capable of using voiceless magic, and even rarer as someone who can use voiceless incantation with melded magics. He cannot use voiceless incantation for healing magic due to his lack of understanding in regards to how mana is manipulated to heal. A normal Magician takes at least five seconds for a simple spell, while for higher-level spells it''s thirty to sixty seconds. Rudeus can do it almost instantly no matter what the difficulty of the spell, with the exception of healing magic.', '/uploads/images/c_88348.png'),
(190, 'Eris Boreas Greyrat', 'エリス・ボレアス・グレイラット', '配角', '', 'Eris Boreas Greyrat is a noble girl and distant relative of [Rudeus](https://anilist.co/character/88348/Rudeus-Greyrat). She is a tsundere with a short temper but has potential in the Sword-God style. ~!She is Rudeus'' third wife and gives birth to their son [Ars](https://anilist.co/character/273378/Greyrat-Ars) and daughter [Christina](https://anilist.co/character/278862/Greyrat-Christina). She is one of the three goddesses Rudeus worships in his religion. A wooden sword that serves as a relic for the Goddess of War is enshrined in the basement.!~', '/uploads/images/c_88349.png'),
(190, 'Shizuka Nanahoshi', '七星静香', '配角', 'Shion Wakayama', '__Light Novel Volume 9 spoiler__ ~! Nanahoshi Shizuka is a Japanese girl that was saved by [Rudeus](https://anilist.co/character/88348/Rudeus-Greyrat) in his past life, but instead of reincarnating like Rudeus, she was teleported to Asura Kingdom and was saved by [Orsted](https://anilist.co/character/187382/Orsted). !~', '/uploads/images/c_137816.png'),
(190, 'Elinalise Dragonroad', 'エリナリーゼ・ドラゴンロード', '配角', 'Rie Tanaka', 'Elinalise is a former member of Paul''s party. She has an erotic nature due to her curse. She is a warrior that is good at managing monster aggro but isn''t a great fighter.', '/uploads/images/c_186490.png'),
(190, 'Kishirika Kishirisu', 'キシリカ・キシリス', '配角', '', 'Kishirika Kishirisu is The Great Empress of the Demon Realm. She is the demon empress known for her demon eyes'' powers and the ability to bestow others with demon eyes. She is engaged to [Badigadi](https://anilist.co/character/262620/Badigadi), the demon lord of immortality. __Light Novel Volume 4 Spoiler__ ~!Kishirika Kishirisu is the person that is responsible for giving [Rudeus](https://anilist.co/character/88348/Rudeus-Greyrat) his demon eye, among other favors!~', '/uploads/images/c_186588.png'),
(190, 'Linia Dedoldia', 'リニア・デドルディア', '配角', 'Fairouz Ai', 'Linia Dedoldia is the granddaughter of the Village Chief, Gustav, of the Doldia Tribe. ~!She later becomes the slave of Rudeus Greyrat for buying/saving her from the slave trader.!~', '/uploads/images/c_187380.png'),
(190, 'Pursena Adoldia', 'プルセナ・アドルディア	', '配角', 'Minami Tanaka', 'Together with Linia Dedoldia they are the two troublemakers in Ranoa Magic Academy, but when it comes to fulfilling her dreams of becoming the Village Chief she will do her best. She likes eating meat.', '/uploads/images/c_187381.png'),
(190, 'Orsted', 'オルステッド', '配角', '', 'Orsted is the current Dragon God, 2nd-ranked of the 7 World Powers, and the sworn enemy of [Hitogami](https://anilist.co/character/211165/Hitogami). Similar to other Dragon Race people such as [Perugius](https://anilist.co/character/209572/Perugius-Dola), he has silver hair and golden sanpaku eyes with an overpowering look. He carries no visible equipment and wears a white coat adorned with fur. Orsted has a curse that makes every living being feel an overwhelming fear just from being within his presence. Strangely enough, this curse does not affect [Rudeus](https://anilist.co/character/88348/Rudeus-Greyrat) or [Nanahoshi](https://anilist.co/character/137816/Nanahoshi-Shizuka).', '/uploads/images/c_187382.png'),
(190, 'Zanoba  Shirone', 'ザノバ・シーローン', '配角', 'Satoshi Tsuruoka', 'Zanoba Shirone is a doll loving prince of Shirone. When he was three years old, he killed his brother, the Fourth prince, as if his brother was a doll. When he was 15 years old, he killed his wife, as if she was a doll.', '/uploads/images/c_187710.jpg'),
(190, 'Ariel Asura', 'アリエル・アネモイ・アスラ', '配角', 'Reina Ueda', 'Second Princess of the Asura Kingdom. She is hardly ever seen without her two bodyguards, [Luke](https://anilist.co/character/226703) and "[Silent Fitz](https://anilist.co/character/88346)". After surviving many assassination attempts, she and her bodyguards flee to The Magic City of Sharia and enroll at the Ranoa Magic Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_187716.png'),
(190, 'Ghislaine Dedoldia', 'ギレーヌ・デドルディア', '配角', '', '__Ghislaine Dedoldia__ is the daughter of Gustav the former Doldia village chief, and the mentor of [Eris](https://anilist.co/character/88349/Eris-Boreas-Greyrat) and she is also the student of [Rudeus Greyrat](https://anilist.co/character/88348/Rudeus-Greyrat) in magic and other subjects. She is one of the few people who have become a Sword King.', '/uploads/images/c_206392.png'),
(190, 'Sara', 'サラ', '配角', 'Haruka Shiraishi', 'Sara was born in Asura in the Milbotts Region ruled by the Notos Greyrat Family. Her father was a hunter from whom she learned how to use the bow. Now a prodigy for her talent with the bow, she is an A-ranked adventurer and member of the party Counter Arrow. ~!When a horde of monsters attacked her hometown, the Notos family refused to send their soldier, because of that she lost her father, which lead to her hatred of the nobility in general. Suzanne who was helping in the subjugation of the monsters, picked up Sara. After some years, she became a official member of the party Counter Arrow.!~', '/uploads/images/c_206604.png'),
(190, 'Hitogami', 'ヒトガミ', '配角', 'Kujira', 'Hitogami is the Man God, having the power to see into the future, and the sworn enemy of [Orsted](https://anilist.co/character/187382). He has a blank white face coupled with a grin that eludes memory, which gives off the feeling that his face is covered in a mosaic. He helps [Rudeus](https://anilist.co/character/88348/Rudeus-Greyrat) throughout key points in his journey. ~!Hitogami later becomes the overarching antagonist of the series following the revelation that he actually sought to prevent the birth of Rudeus'' children, who are prophesied to kill him one day.!~ ~!Hitogami''s exact origins are unknown, however it is known that after the Creator God''s death, unbeknownst to anyone, he was born within the Void World. At some point in the distant past, the being who would come to be known as Hitogami killed or otherwise usurped the original Man God and took his form. He then began manipulating the Dragon God and his five Dragon Generals into destroying the other four worlds and then proceeded to help the survivors of those ruined world to flee into the human world.!~', '/uploads/images/c_211165.png'),
(190, 'Luke Notos Greyrat', 'ルーク・ノトス・グレイラット', '配角', 'Kazuyuki Okitsu', 'Luke Notos Greyrat is the second prince of the Asura kingdom Ariel Anemoi Asura''s personal guardian and also holds the status of Knight. He''s also the cousin of Rudeus Greyrat, but from another of the four different branch families in the Greyrat genus, namely the Notos family.', '/uploads/images/c_226703.jpg'),
(190, 'Juliette', 'ジュリエット', '配角', 'Sumire Morohoshi', 'Juliette is an orphaned Dwarf and slave purchased by Rudeus and Zanoba with the purpose of helping them in the making of dolls. She was acquired because she fit the criteria of being a child, a Dwarf and by being a Dwarf having dexterous hands, which is preferable in doll-making. She''s wary of Rudeus to an extent because of him befitting the behaviour of a folklore individual characterised by typical traits parents tell their children to deter them.', '/uploads/images/c_230591.png'),
(190, 'Soldat Heckler', 'ゾルダート・ヘッケラー', '配角', 'Kousuke Toriumi', 'Soldat Heckler is an S-ranked adventurer and the leader of the S-ranked party Stepped Leader. He is a skilled swordsman with advanced-ranked Sword God Style and intermediate-ranked Water God Style.', '/uploads/images/c_245377.jpg'),
(190, 'Cliff Grimoire', 'クリフ・グリモル', '配角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', 'Cliff Grimoire is the Grandson of the Pope, and a friend of Rudeus. Cliff has a very high amount of pride, so much so that he will proudly tell people when they ask him for help. Though this trait may irk many people it cannot be said that he is arrogant since he is shown to be constantly studying to improve himself showing that he is very diligent as well. He is also very loyal to his friends, since it is shown that if he is asked for help, then that becomes his main priority', '/uploads/images/c_255894.jpg'),
(190, 'Suzanne', 'スザンヌ', '配角', 'Yuu Kobayashi', 'Suzanne is the vice leader of the party Counter Arrow.', '/uploads/images/c_261304.jpg'),
(190, 'Timothy', 'ティモシー', '配角', 'Wataru Hatano', 'Timothy is the leader of the adventurer party Counter Arrow.', '/uploads/images/c_261305.jpg'),
(190, 'Mimir', 'ミミル', '配角', 'Chiharu Sawashiro', 'Mimir is a member of the party Counter Arrow.', '/uploads/images/c_262617.jpg'),
(190, 'Patrice', 'パトリス', '配角', 'Itaru Yamamoto', 'Patrice is a member of the party Counter Arrow.', '/uploads/images/c_262618.jpg'),
(190, 'Badigadi', 'バーディガーディ', '配角', 'Taiten Kusunoki', 'Engaged to the Great Demon Emperor Kishirika Kishirisu, it is said that he is the demon lord who grants wisdom to those who deserve it. He is the current Fighting God and has been alive even before the war with Laplace. He has an immortal body, being able to regenerate injuries and body parts instantly. ~!He disappears later in the series with his whereabouts unknown, to reappear once again as Hitogami''s apostle.!~', '/uploads/images/c_262620.png'),
(190, 'Nina Farion', 'ニナ・ファリオン', '配角', '', 'The eldest daughter of the current Sword God Gal Farion.', '/uploads/images/c_262624.png'),
(190, 'Grabell Zafin Asura', 'グラーヴェル・ザフィン・アスラ', '配角', 'Masaaki Mizunaka', 'First Prince of Asura Kingdom and half-brother of Ariel Anemoi Asura.', '/uploads/images/c_309043.jpg'),
(190, 'Derek Redbat', 'デリック・レッドバット', '配角', 'Seiichirou Yamashita', 'An advanced ranked magician and the previous guardian knight of Ariel before Fitz.', '/uploads/images/c_309049.jpg'),
(190, 'Pilemon Notos Greyrat', 'ピレモン・ノトス・グレイラット', '配角', 'Masaki Terasoma', 'Head of the Notos family. Brother of Paul Greyrat and father of Luke.', '/uploads/images/c_309050.jpg'),
