(191, 'Sumiaki Raida', '雷田澄彰', '配角', 'Kenichi Suzumura', 'Sumiaki Raida works for the company "Magic Flow". He is an executive producer on the 2.5D stage play *Tokyo Blade*.', '/uploads/images/c_245513.jpg'),
(191, 'Toshirou Kindaichi', '金田一敏郎', '配角', '', 'Leader of the Lala Lai Theatrical Company, and one of its founding members. He is the Director of the 2.5D Stage Play *Tokyo Blade*.', '/uploads/images/c_245514.jpg'),
(191, 'Melt Narushima', '鳴嶋メルト', '配角', 'Seiji Maeda', 'Model and actor affiliated with Sonic Stage Productions. He appeared while still an untrained, yet arrogant, actor on the TV Drama *I''ll Go With Sweet Today*. Melt was then cast in the role of Kizami in the 2.5D Stage Play *Tokyo Blade*.', '/uploads/images/c_245515.png'),
(191, 'GOA', 'ゴア', '配角', '', 'GOA is a popular scriptwriter.', '/uploads/images/c_245516.png'),
(191, 'Sakuya Kamoshida', '鴨志田朔夜', '配角', '', 'Sakuya Kamoshida is an actor specialized in theater adaptations.', '/uploads/images/c_245517.png'),
(191, 'Masaya Kaburagi', '鏑木勝也', '配角', 'Masaki Terasoma', 'Masaya Kaburagi is a TV and Web-TV producer.', '/uploads/images/c_245518.jpg'),
(191, 'Taishi Gotanda', '五反田泰志', '配角', 'Yasuyuki Kase', 'Taishi Gotanda is a movie director, and the "mentor" of [Aquamarine Hoshino](https://anilist.co/character/183885/Aquamarine-Hoshino). He still lives with his [mother](https://anilist.co/character/302910).', '/uploads/images/c_245519.jpg'),
(191, 'Ichigo Saitou', '斉藤壱護', '配角', 'Hisao Egawa', 'Ichigo Saitou is the director of the agency Ichigo Production. He is the one who scouted [Ai](https://anilist.co/character/172759/Ai-Hoshino) and made her a star.', '/uploads/images/c_245521.jpg'),
(191, 'Mana Suzushiro', '鈴城まな', '配角', 'Hiyori Nitta', 'Mana Suzushiro is an underground idol who decided to stop her show business career after seeing the new idol group B-Komachi on stage.', '/uploads/images/c_245523.jpg'),
(191, 'Yuki Sumi', '鷲見ゆき', '配角', 'Saori Oonishi', 'Yuki Sumi is a model in 1st year of high school.', '/uploads/images/c_245524.jpg'),
(191, 'Minami Kotobuki', '寿みなみ', '配角', 'Hina Youmiya', 'She''s a classmate and friend of Ruby Hoshino. Minami is a Gravure model who uses a fake accent.', '/uploads/images/c_252073.jpg'),
(191, 'Kengo Morimoto', '森本ケンゴ', '配角', 'Taito Ban', 'Third-year high schooler and professional musician signed with a record label. He writes all of the music and lyrics for his band and occasionally for others. He was a cast member of the reality dating show "LoveNow."', '/uploads/images/c_282773.jpg'),
(191, 'Ryousuke Sugano', '菅野良介', '配角', 'Atsushi Tamaru', 'A shut-in, Ryosuke is a mentally unstable person who turns towards idols to feel loved in his life. He is an obsessive fan of [Ai Hoshino](https://anilist.co/character/172759). ~!Ryousuke became enraged after learning of Ai''s pregnancy and murdered Gorou Amemiya when the doctor interfered in his first attempt to kill Ai. Years later Ryousuke murdered Ai, fatally stabbing her at her home. Shortly afterwards Ryousuke commited suicide.!~', '/uploads/images/c_302241.jpg'),
(191, 'Taishi no Haha', '泰志の母', '配角', 'Kimiko Saitou', 'Mother of [Taishi Gotanda](https://anilist.co/character/245519).', '/uploads/images/c_302910.jpg'),
(191, 'Lala', 'らら', '配角', 'Ayano Shibuya', 'An idol from a company that wants to scout [Ruby Hoshino](https://anilist.co/character/183884/Ruby-Hoshino) to become its idol.', '/uploads/images/c_302911.jpg'),
