(192, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Hiroaki Hirata', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(192, 'Mash Burnedead', 'マッシュ・バーンデッド', '主角', 'Chiaki Kobayashi', '__Height:__ 171 cm The main protagonist of the series. Mash is a first-year student at Easton Magic Academy and member of Adler dorm. He has the peculiarity of not possessing any magic but also has inhuman strength which makes him a standout in the academy. Mash is generally quiet and kind. However, if he sees someone hurting his family or friends, he gets incredibly angry. He is also extremely innocent and obedient, making people abuse those qualities, but thanks to his strength he can twist almost every situation. He also loves cream puffs a lot.', '/uploads/images/c_158734.jpg'),
(192, 'Lemon  Irvine', 'レモン・アーヴィン', '主角', 'Reina Ueda', '__Height:__ 162 cm __Affiliation:__ Easton Magic Academy __Occupation:__ Student Lemon Irvine is a first-year student at Easton Magic Academy. She has short, blonde hair with an orange ribbon. Her mark is under her right eye, straight with a half-moon curve. Usually wears the Easton Magic School uniform. Lemon is a little kooky, but she''s honest to goodness person and seems incapable of betraying others. She also gets scared very easily and tends to exaggerate in the conversations she has with other people.', '/uploads/images/c_167819.jpg'),
(192, 'Lance Crown', 'ランス・クラウン', '主角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', '__Height:__ 178 cm __Affiliation:__ Easton Magic Academy __Occupation:__ Student Lance Crown is a student at Easton Magic Academy known for being ranked the first in the entrance exams and having two marks. When Lance was younger he is shown to be a very caring person who was willing to protect people who were being mistreated by other people even if the repercussions are him getting into fights. Lance is very protective of his sister where he vows to become a Divine Visionary so he can save his sister from being taken by the Bureau of Magic. ~! After a fight with Mash, he later approaches Mash and Finn to reconcile. Now he acts as the brains of their group of misfits. !~', '/uploads/images/c_172075.jpg'),
(192, 'Finn Ames', 'フィン・エイムズ', '主角', 'Reiji Kawashima', '__Height:__ 170 cm Finn Ames is a first-year student at Easton Magic Academy and member of Adler dorm. He is the younger brother of [Rayne Ames](https://anilist.co/character/202422). Finn is Mash''s roommate and his first and best friend.', '/uploads/images/c_174368.jpg'),
(192, 'Dot Barrett', 'ドット・バレット', '主角', 'Takuya Eguchi', '__Affiliation:__ Easton Magic Academy __Occupation:__ Student Dot Barrett is a first-year student at Easton Magic Academy and one of the main characters of the Mashle series. Dot is hot-blooded and obnoxious, however, deep down, he''s a nice guy and will apologize if he''s wrong about something. He also is shown to fall in love easily.', '/uploads/images/c_174369.jpg'),
(192, 'Regro Burnedead', 'レグロ・バーンデッド', '配角', 'Choo', 'He is Mash''s father.', '/uploads/images/c_202421.jpg'),
(192, 'Rain Ames', 'レイン・エイムズ', '配角', 'Yuuki Kaji', 'Rayne Ames is a second-year student at Easton Magic Academy, the current Sword Cane of the Divine Visionaries, the prefect of the Adler dorm and the older brother of Finn Ames.', '/uploads/images/c_202422.jpg'),
(192, 'Wahlberg Baigan', 'ウォールバーグ・バイガン', '配角', 'Mugihito', 'Wahlberg is the Headmaster of Easton Magic Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_202423.jpg'),
(192, 'Abel Walker', 'アベル・ウォーカー', '配角', 'Yuuichirou Umehara', '__Height:__ 176 cm Abel Walker is a third-year student at Easton Magic Academy. He is the leader of the Magia Lupus and the prefect for Lang dorm.', '/uploads/images/c_207410.png'),
(192, 'Wirth Mádl', 'ワース・マドル', '配角', 'Kento Itou', 'The Third Fang of the Magia Lupus. Younger brother of [Orter Mádl](https://anilist.co/character/264316).', '/uploads/images/c_207867.jpg'),
(192, 'Cell War', 'セル・ウォー', '配角', 'Natsuki Hanae', '__Height:__ 171 cm Cell War is a core member of Innocent Zero.', '/uploads/images/c_215260.jpg'),
(192, 'Abyss Razor', 'アビス・レイザー', '配角', 'Hiroki Nanami', 'Second Fang of the Magia Lupus.', '/uploads/images/c_262134.png'),
(192, 'Anna Crown', 'アンナ・クラウン', '配角', 'Riona Imaizumi', 'Anna Crown is Lance Crown''s younger sister.', '/uploads/images/c_262135.jpg'),
(192, 'Innocent Zero', 'イノセント・ゼロ', '配角', 'Shinichirou Miki', 'Innocent Zero is the alias of the leader of the criminal organization of the same name and the primary antagonist of the series. He was once a pupil of Adam Jobs alongside Wahlberg.', '/uploads/images/c_262136.png'),
(192, 'Claude Lucci', 'クロード・ルッチ', '配角', 'Shinnosuke Tachibana', 'Claude Lucci is a Professor at Easton Magic Academy, he is tasked with guiding the next generation of mages.', '/uploads/images/c_262138.jpg'),
(192, 'Tom Knowles', 'トム・ノエルズ', '配角', 'Wataru Komada', 'Tom Knowles is a second-year student at Easton Magic Academy.', '/uploads/images/c_262141.jpg'),
