(192, 'Silva Iron', 'シルバ・アイアン', '配角', 'Toshiki Masuda', 'Second-year student at Easton Magic Academy, and a member of House Lang. During his first year at Easton he managed to acquire two Gold Coins. However, due to constantly attacking students and teachers, he was held back, much to his shock.', '/uploads/images/c_304809.jpg'),
(192, 'Lauren Cabasse', 'ローレン・キャバス', '配角', 'Ikumi Hasegawa', 'Student at Eason Magic Academy. A manipulative and selfish girl, Lauren has an unnamed magic that causes men to fall for her.', '/uploads/images/c_304810.jpg'),
(192, 'Mandragora', 'マンドラゴラ', '配角', 'Shunsuke Takeuchi', 'A magical type of living plant that is used as a universal ingredient for making potions.', '/uploads/images/c_304811.jpg'),
