(193, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Banjou Ginga', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(193, 'Jin-U Seong', '성진우', '主角', 'Taito Ban', '__Class:__ Mage __Relatives:__ [Park Kyung-Hye](https://anilist.co/character/209396/KyungHye-Park) (Mother), [Seong Jin-Ah](https://anilist.co/character/138791/JinAh-Sung) (Sister), ~![Seong Il-Hwan](https://anilist.co/character/138790/IlHwan-Sung) (Father), [Cha Hae-In](https://anilist.co/character/138789/HaeIn-Cha) (Wife), [Seong Su-Ho](https://anilist.co/character/306654/Suho-Sung) (Son)!~ ~!__Guild:__ Ahjin Guild (Guild Master) __Affiliation:__ Korean Hunters Association (helper), White Tiger Guild (helper), Hunters Guild (helper), Knights Guild (helper), Ahjin Guild (Guild Master)!~ Seong Jin-U is known as an infamously weak E-Rank Hunter. He is a humble and benevolent individual who cares deeply for his family and has an ardent desire to become stronger. As a result, he shares a close relationship with his sister and his mother, and rarely wastes an opportunity to refine his skills and gain more power. ~!He becomes an S-Rank hunter after being given a chance to become stronger by the System.!~', '/uploads/images/c_129928.png'),
(193, 'Chi-Yul Song', '송치율', '配角', 'Eiji Hanawa', '__Magic Type:__ Fire Korean C-Rank Hunter and kumdo teacher. He is also one of Jinwoo''s old friends, having known him since he was a E-Rank Hunter.', '/uploads/images/c_136073.png'),
(193, 'Ju-Hui Lee', '이주희', '配角', 'Rina Honizumi', 'She is a healer with rank B.', '/uploads/images/c_136074.png'),
(193, 'Dong-Su Hwang', '황동수', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', 'Hwang Dong-su is an​ S-class hunter who works for Scavenger''s Guild in America.', '/uploads/images/c_136075.png'),
(193, 'Jin-Ho Yu', '유진호', '配角', 'Genta Nakamura', '__Class:__ Tanker __Guild:__ ~!Ahjin Guild (Vice-Guild Master)!~ Yoo Jin-Ho is a D rank hunter and is [Jin-U Seong](https://anilist.co/character/129928/JinWoo-Sung)''s faithful assistant and combat partner.', '/uploads/images/c_136076.jpg'),
(193, 'Yun-Ho Baek', '백윤호', '配角', 'Hiroki Touchi', 'He is a S rank hunter and master of the White Tiger guild.', '/uploads/images/c_136077.png'),
(193, 'Jin-Cheol U', '우진철', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', 'An A rank hunter that works for Hunter''s association of Korea.', '/uploads/images/c_136819.png'),
(193, 'Hae-In Cha', '차해인', '配角', 'Reina Ueda', '__Guild:__ Hunters Guild __Class:__ Sword Fighter __Affiliations:__ Jeju Island Raid Party, [Song Chi-Yul](https://anilist.co/character/136073/ChiYul--Song)’s Dojo (Disciple) Cha Hae-In is the Vice-Guild Master of the Hunters Guild. She is an S rank hunter and the 9th ranked hunter in South Korea. She possesses the unique ability of mana smell and hates the smell of hunters except for [Sung Jin-Woo](https://anilist.co/character/129928/JinWoo-Sung).', '/uploads/images/c_138789.png'),
(193, 'Jin-A Seong', '성진아', '配角', 'Haruna Mikawa', '[Jin-U](https://anilist.co/character/129928)''s younger sister.', '/uploads/images/c_138791.png'),
(193, 'Geon-Hui Go', '고건희', '配角', 'Banjou Ginga', 'Go Gun-Hee (고건희) is a South Korean S-Rank Hunter and the Chairman of the Korean Hunters Association.', '/uploads/images/c_138792.png'),
(193, 'Song-I Han', '한송이', '配角', 'Miyu Tomita', 'Han Song-I is an E-Rank hunter who quit school after gaining money through the Yoo Jin-Ho and Sung Jin-Woo motley group of party. She is friends with Sung Jin-Ah. She first appeared when Jin-Ah visited Jin-Woo in the hospital but she didn''t know him then.', '/uploads/images/c_138793.png'),
(193, 'Jong-In Choi', '최종인', '配角', 'Daisuke Hirakawa', 'Choi Jong-In is one of the 10 S-Rank Hunters of South Korea. He is also the Guild Master of the Hunters Guild.', '/uploads/images/c_138794.png'),
(193, 'Igris', '이그리트', '配角', '', 'Igris is one of the first Shadows that [Sung Jin-Woo](https://anilist.co/character/129928/Seong-Jin-U) acquired. He was initially protecting an empty throne in an Instant Dungeon where Jin-Woo was doing his Job Quest in the Job Change Quest Dungeon. After two failed attempts of Shadow Extraction, Sung Jin-Woo convinced him to protect him instead of protecting an Empty throne, obtaining him as a Knight Grade Shadow.', '/uploads/images/c_145722.png'),
(193, 'Byeong-Gu Min', '민병구', '配角', 'Junya Enoki', 'Min Byung-Gu was a retired hunter and one of the 10 S-Rank and only S-Rank Healer of South Korea. He was a close friend with the White Tiger''s Guild Master Baek Yoon-Ho. He took part in the 4th Jeju Island Reclamation Raid and was a member of the Korean Raid Team tasked with killing the boss of the Jeju Island Gate.', '/uploads/images/c_148789.png'),
(193, 'Tae-Shik Kang', '강태식', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', 'B-rank Hunter and An inspector working for South Korea''s Hunter Association, Monitoring Division.', '/uploads/images/c_181155.png'),
(193, 'Myung-Han Yu', '유명한', '配角', 'Shunsuke Sakuya', 'Yu Myung-Han (유명한) is Jin-Ho''s father and the CEO of Yoojin Construction.', '/uploads/images/c_184530.png'),
(193, 'Hee-Jin Park', '박희진', '配角', 'Ruriko Aoki', 'Park Hee-Jin (박희진) is a member of White Tiger Guild that Sung Jin-Woo helped when they got stuck inside the Red Gate.', '/uploads/images/c_184538.png'),
(193, 'Ki-Hoon Son', '손기훈', '配角', '', 'Son Ki-Hoon (손기훈) is the Team Leader of Attack Force B of the Hunters Guild.', '/uploads/images/c_184541.png'),
(193, 'Iron', '아이언', '配角', 'Chikahiro Kobayashi', 'A shadow Sung Jin-Woo gained after entering the Red Gate. ~!Before being reawakened as a Shadow he was Chul Kim (김철), an A-Rank Hunter of the White Tiger Guild.!~', '/uploads/images/c_184956.png'),
(193, 'Kyung-Hye Park', '박경혜', '配角', '', 'Park Kyung-He is the mother of Jin-U and Jin-Ah. She was in the hospital because of the Eternal Sleep. Her sickness served as the primary motivation for Jin-U becoming a hunter alongside his desire to support his sister with the absence of their father.', '/uploads/images/c_209396.png'),
(193, 'Gina', '지나', '配角', 'Kotomi Aihara', 'Gina is an A-Rank mage and was one of the Raid Members in Son Ki-Hoon''s Party in an A-Ranked Gate. She has long blonde hair and deep red eyes. Her height is average and she has a very attractive body. Gina has a serious personality this can be seen when she answers Son Ki-Hoon''s question about if she was responsible for killing one of the High Orcs.', '/uploads/images/c_210098.png'),
(193, 'Laura', '로라', '配角', 'Haruka Shiraishi', 'Laura is the secretary of Scavenger Guild, the strongest guild in the USA. She is a composed individual who rarely ever shows any emotion.', '/uploads/images/c_210099.png'),
(193, 'Jae-Hwan Ju', '주재환', '配角', 'Ikuto Kanemasa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_210101.png'),
(193, 'Sin Sang', '신상', '配角', '', 'Statue of God is the hidden boss of the Double Dungeon. It is first introduced during the D-Rank Dungeon Arc as Jin-Woo and other hunters entered the Cartenon Temple unaware of the dangers that were present inside.', '/uploads/images/c_210102.png'),
(193, 'Kyu-Hwan Jo', '조규환', '配角', 'Kakeru Hatano', 'Cho Kyuhwan is a C-rank Hunter and a member of Dongsuk Hwang''s raid party.', '/uploads/images/c_306638.png'),
(193, 'Sang-Min Ahn', '안상민', '配角', 'Hironori Kondou', 'Sangmin Ahn is the chief of the White Tiger Guild''s 2nd Division Management Department.', '/uploads/images/c_306652.png'),
(193, 'Dong-Suk Hwang', '황동숙', '配角', 'Yasuhiro Mamiya', 'Hwang Dongsuk is a C-rank Hunter and the older brother of [Dong-Su Hwang](https://anilist.co/character/136075/DongSu-Hwang).', '/uploads/images/c_306666.png'),
(193, 'Beom-Shik Park', '박범식', '配角', 'Daichi Hayashi', 'Park Gi-Sool is a Korean D-Rank Hunter and a good friend of Sangshik Kim. ~!He was tragically killed during the first Double Dungeon Incident when a statue sliced him clean in half from behind.!~', '/uploads/images/c_306673.png'),
(193, 'Sang-Sik Kim', '김상식', '配角', 'Manta Yamamoto', 'Sang-Sik Kim is a Korean D-Rank Hunter. ~!He was a survivor of the Double Dungeon. He was tragically killed by [Tae-Shik Kang](https://anilist.co/character/181155/TaeShik-Kang) after accidentally witnessing him kill a man during a raid.!~', '/uploads/images/c_306674.png'),
(193, 'Cheol-Jin Lee', '이철진', '配角', 'Yuuichi Hose', 'Korean C-Rank Hunter and a member of Dong-Suk Hwang''s strike squad.', '/uploads/images/c_306675.png'),
(193, 'Myung-Hwan Go', '고명환', '配角', 'Takehisa Hirose', 'Myung-Hwan Go is a Korean C-Rank Hunter under the White Tiger Guild.', '/uploads/images/c_306678.png'),
(193, 'Ki-Cheol Hyeon', '현기철', '配角', 'Ayato Morinaga', 'Kichul Hyun is the deputy manager of the White Tiger Guild''s 2nd Division Management Department and Sangimn Ahn''s assistant.', '/uploads/images/c_306680.png'),
(193, 'Eun-Seok', '은석', '配角', 'Takuma Terashima', 'Former Korean S-Rank Hunter. ~!About one year before the events of the main storyline, Eunseok participated in the 3rd Jeju Island Raid alongside Baek Yoonho and Min Byung-Gyu. Unfortunately, the raid went sideways and Eunseok was killed under unknown circumstances.!~', '/uploads/images/c_323043.png'),
