(193, 'Jin-Seong Yu', '유진성', '配角', 'Kouji Okino', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_331026.png'),
(194, 'Kafka Hibino', '日比野カフカ', '主角', 'Masaya Fukunishi', '__Height:__ 181 cm Kafka Hibino, also known as Monster #8, is a Defense Force member and a former worker for the Professional Kaiju Cleaning Company "Monster Sweeper Inc.". Kafka''s personality is a bit childish and funny, as well as a very determined and dedicated person who loves his comrades dearly. After a kaijuu managed to enter his body, he obtained the ability to turn himself into a humanoid kaijuu.', '/uploads/images/c_180692.png'),
(194, 'Mina Ashiro', '亜白ミナ', '配角', 'Asami Seto', 'Mina is a very talented member of the Defense Force and an extremely talented marksman. She is the captain of the Defense Force''s Third Division. When she was a child, she and [Kafka](https://anilist.co/character/180692/Kafka-Hibino) met each other after a Kaiju attack, swearing that they will both join the Defense Force and fight Kaiju alongside each other.', '/uploads/images/c_180693.png'),
(194, 'Reno Ichikawa', '市川レノ', '主角', 'Wataru Katou', 'He briefly worked at Monster Sweeper Inc, where he met and befriended [Kafka Hibino](https://anilist.co/character/180692/Hibino-Kafka). After witnessing Kafka''s transformation, Reno helped him enter the Defense Force and joined with him. ~!He was a member of the Third Division and after destruction of Tachikawa Base he was transferred to the Fourth Division.!~', '/uploads/images/c_180694.png'),
(194, 'Kikoru Shinomiya', '四ノ宮キコル', '主角', 'Fairouz Ai', '__Height:__ 157 cm She is the young daughter of Defense Force Director General [Isao Shinomiya](https://anilist.co/character/257340) and a member of the Third Division. After Tachikawa Base was destroyed, Kikoru was transferred to the First Division.', '/uploads/images/c_183889.png'),
(194, 'Soushirou Hoshina', '保科宗四郎', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', '__Height:__ 171 cm Soushirou is a Vice-Commander of the Defense Force''s Third Division. Despite his laid back nature, he is shown to be very powerful, specializing with bladed weapons. Soushirou comes from a family of Kaijuu slayers dating back to the Muromachi Period.', '/uploads/images/c_205579.jpg'),
(194, 'Gen Narumi', '鳴海弦', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', 'Gen Narumi is the Captain of the First Division of the Defense Force. He is known to be Japan''s strongest anti-kaiju combatant, hence his position. Gen has a rather lazy and child-like personality, obsessing over followers on social media and video games as well as his action figures. He appears informal and rude when confronting other people. Despite this, he is serious about his work, valuing skills above all else, and demanding results from all those serving in his division.', '/uploads/images/c_241577.jpg'),
(194, 'Isao Shinomiya', '四ノ宮功', '配角', 'Tesshou Genda', '__Height:__ 190 cm Isao Shinomiya is the Director General of the Defense Force and Kikoru Shinomiya''s father. Isao is a very authoritative and serious man, being also very demanding towards both his subordinates and his daughter. As the Director General of the Defense Force and serving many years in its ranks, Isao is a far-sighted man who gives his orders firmly in sight of future threats. Isao is not above using living kaiju as weapons to empower the Defense Force. Despite is apparent cold and serious behavior, Isao shows a more human side when he remembered Kikoru''s words about Kafka Hibino and when he personally informed the latter about his decision towards him, going against his high-ranked colleagues to give Kafka a chance to prove himself to them.', '/uploads/images/c_257340.png'),
(194, 'Kaijuu Kyuu-gou', '怪獣9号', '配角', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', 'The main antagonist in the manga Kaiju No. 8. Kaiju No. 9 is a humanoid numbered Daikaiju who goes around reviving the kaiju killed by the Defense Force. He previously infiltrated Professional Kaiju Cleaning Company Monster Sweeper. ~! In his fused form with an Ant-type kaiju, No. 9 has the lower part of his body replaced by an Ant kaiju which he controls and uses to move around. In this form, No. 9 lacks forearms and hands. !~ ~! After fusing with Kaiju No. 2, No. 9 is now much larger than before, keeping his darker skin tone, with a long tail, three sets of eyes, and only protuberance on his head instead of two. !~', '/uploads/images/c_259598.jpg'),
(194, 'Keiji Itami', '伊丹啓司', '配角', 'Takayuki Sugou', '__Height__: 178cm Deputy Director of the Japan Anti-Kaiju Defense Force even though he dislikes being in a position of power over others. He likes quiet places, taiga (historical) dramas and tangerines.', '/uploads/images/c_305719.png'),
(194, 'Juzo Nogizaka', '乃木坂十藏', '配角', 'Miou Tanaka', 'Nogizaka is a high-ranking member of the Defense Force. Nogizaka is very rational when making decisions, making him clash with [Isao Shinomiya](https://anilist.co/character/257340/Isao-Shinomiya)''s new ideals for the next generation. In spite of that, he still trusts and respects the Director. He seems to get annoyed when denied a chance to fight.', '/uploads/images/c_305767.png'),
(194, 'Bakko', '伐虎', '配角', '', 'Bakko is a tiger owned by [Mina Ashiro](https://anilist.co/character/180693/Mina-Ashiro) Bakko seems to be rather calm and totally obedient to his owner Mina. Always present at Mina''s side, even in battle, Bakko is inferred to be strong enough to take on and possibly eliminate kaiju.', '/uploads/images/c_305768.png'),
(194, 'Aoi Kaguragi', '神楽木葵', '配角', 'Shunsuke Takeuchi', '__Height:__ 183 cm Aoi Kaguragi is a young member of the Third Division of the Defense Force. ~!After the destruction of Tachikawa Base, he was transferred to the Second Division.!~ ~!Aoi was a rising star on Japan Ground Self-Defense Force, but turned down his future in the JGSDF to apply to the Defense Force.!~', '/uploads/images/c_308014.png'),
(194, 'Sebas', '瀬羽須', '配角', 'Choo', '__Occupation:__ Butler Sebas is the butler of the Shinomiya Family and serves [Kikoru Shinomiya](https://anilist.co/character/183889/Kikoru-Shinomiya). Sebas appears as a calm man in a subservient relationship with Kikoru. ~!He is also very protective towards her since he hit [Kafka Hibino](https://anilist.co/character/180692/Kafka-Hibino) just for touching Kikoru.!~', '/uploads/images/c_308017.png'),
(194, 'Iharu Furuhashi', '古橋伊春', '配角', 'Yuuki Shin', '__Height:__ 177 cm Iharu Furuhashi is a young officer of the Third Division of the Defense Force. ~!After the destruction of Tachikawa Base, he was transferred to the Fourth Division.!~ ~!Back when Iharu was still in middle school, he was saved from a kaiju by [Mina Ashiro](https://anilist.co/character/180693/Mina-Ashiro). This event would later inspire him to become a Defense Force member.!~', '/uploads/images/c_308020.png'),
(194, 'Haruichi Izumo', '出雲ハルイチ', '配角', 'Keisuke Koumoto', '__Height:__ 178 cm Haruichi Izumo is a wealthy young man and a prominent member of the Third Division of the Defense Force. Haruichi is also the scion of Izumo Tech.', '/uploads/images/c_308023.png'),
(194, 'Ebina', '海老名', '配角', 'Hinata Tadokoro', '__Occupation:__ Third Division Platoon Leader As a Platoon Leader, Ebina is inferred to be a top-notch Officer of the Defense Force, able to take multiple kaiju and guide his men in battle with determination.', '/uploads/images/c_308024.png'),
(194, 'Konomi Okonogi', '小此木このみ', '配角', 'Sayaka Senbongi', '__Height:__ 149 cm __Occupation:__ Third Division Operations Leader Konomi is a determined and professional person. She doesn''t seem to approve of [Soushirou Hoshina](https://anilist.co/character/205579/Soushirou-Hoshina)''s unprofessional remarks and blurts of laughter, caring deeply for him and for everyone else when they are in danger. In return, she''s held in high regard by Soushirou. While working, Konomi displays a professional and serious behavior, quickly getting a grasp of the current situation to offer support to her comrades. She also displayed remarkable levels of intuition and analytical skills.', '/uploads/images/c_308027.png'),
(194, 'Tae Nakanoshima', '中之島タエ', '配角', 'Mutsumi Tamura', '__Height:__ 163 cm __Occupation:__ Third Division Platoon Leader Tae seems to be some kind of "man-eater", praising the newbies in the platoon not only for their fighting ability but also for their looks. Tae seems to have a rivalry with [Rin Shinonome](https://anilist.co/character/305763/Rin-Shinonome)', '/uploads/images/c_308028.png'),
(194, 'Itakura', '板倉', '配角', 'Taito Ban', '__Occupation:__ Third Division Platoon Leader During the Raid on Tachikawa Base, his platoon arrived to aid the rest of the Third Division against the wyvern-type kaiju, securing the storehouse area.', '/uploads/images/c_308029.png'),
(194, 'Ryou Ikaruga', '斑鳩亮', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', '__Height:__ 187 cm __Occupation:__ Third Division Platoon Leader Ryou seems to have a rivarly with [Tachibana](https://anilist.co/character/305762/Tachibana)', '/uploads/images/c_308030.png'),
(194, 'Kaijuu 10-gou', '怪獣10号', '配角', 'Kenta Miyake', 'Kaiju Juu-gou is an Identified Kaiju who attacked Tachikawa Base. It is created by [Kaijuu Kyuu-gou](https://anilist.co/character/259598/Kaijuu-Kyuugou) and is considered a "prototype". ~!It was then weaponized into Numbers Weapon 10, currently used by [Soushirou Hoshina](https://anilist.co/character/205579/Soushirou-Hoshina).!~ ~!Its fight with Soushirou Hoshina managed to excite it so much that, even after being defeated, it still felt linked to Soushirou and wished to be turned into a weapon for him, to fight with him once more. Kaiju Juu-gou seems to be a rather independent individual, easily betraying its progenitor Kaijuu Kyuu-gou just to get closer to Soushirou.!~ Kaiju Juu-gou is a extremely powerful Identified Kaiju, with a fortitude level of 8.3 when it first appeared, ~!and 9.0 after growing larger in size.!~', '/uploads/images/c_308033.png'),
(194, 'Soratobu Kaijuu', '空飛ぶ怪獣', '配角', 'TARAKO', 'This unnamed kaiju is the one responsible for infecting [Kafka Hibino](https://anilist.co/character/180692) and turning him into Kaiju 8-gou.', '/uploads/images/c_311251.png'),
(194, 'Ichitaka Miike', '三池イチタカ', '配角', 'Jun Fukushima', 'Employee at the professional Kaiju cleanup company Monster Sweeper Inc.', '/uploads/images/c_311256.png'),
(194, 'Hiroto Mori', '森ヒロト', '配角', 'Ivan Shibata', 'Hiroto Mori is a man working at Professional Kaiju Cleanup Company Monster Sweeper Inc.', '/uploads/images/c_311259.jpg'),
(194, 'Masahide Tokuda', '徳田マサヒデ', '配角', 'Yutaka Aoyama', '__Height:__ 188 cm Masahide Tokuda also known as Toku is a man working at Professional Kaiju Cleaning Company Monster Sweeper Inc.', '/uploads/images/c_311260.png'),
(194, 'Kanji Nagamine', '長嶺カンジ', '配角', 'Youji Ueda', 'Kanji Nagamine was one of the victims of [Kaijuu Kyuu-gou](https://anilist.co/character/259598/Kaijuu-Kyuugou) and its second disguise.', '/uploads/images/c_311262.png'),
(194, 'Hakua Igarashi', '五十嵐 ハクア', '配角', 'Mayuko Kazama', 'Hakua Igarashi is a Defense Force officer in the Third Division.', '/uploads/images/c_311264.jpg'),
(194, 'Akari Minase', '水無瀬あかり', '配角', 'Nene Hieda', '__Height:__ 153 cm Akari Minase is a Defense Force officer of the Third Division.', '/uploads/images/c_311279.png'),
