(194, 'Takamichi Hotaka', '穂高タカミチ', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', 'Worker at Professional Kaiju Cleaning Company Monster Sweeper Inc. ~!At some point he was killed by Kaiju No. 9 who took his appearance as his first human disguise.!~', '/uploads/images/c_335998.png'),
(194, 'Jiei Taiin A', '自衛隊員', '配角', 'Ivan Shibata', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_336132.jpg'),
