(194, 'Senpai Taiin B', '先輩隊員', '配角', 'Eiji Takeuchi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_336137.jpg'),
(194, 'Akira Kurusu', '来栖アキラ', '配角', 'Ryouta Suzuki', '__Height:__ 168 cm Operations Leader of the First Division in the Defense Force. He used to be Director Isao Shinomiya''s personal aid in battle.', '/uploads/images/c_340313.png'),
(194, 'Doujima Itaosa', '堂島板長', '配角', 'Shinpachi Tsuji', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_340314.png'),
(195, 'Frieren', 'フリーレン', '主角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', 'Frieren is the protagonist of _Sousou no Frieren_ and [Fern](https://anilist.co/character/183965)''s master. She was the Mage of the Hero Party and traveled alongside Hero [Himmel](https://anilist.co/character/184311/Himmel), Warrior [Eisen](https://anilist.co/character/184312/Eisen), and Priest [Heiter](https://anilist.co/character/184310/Heiter) in a 10-year journey to defeat the Demon King. She was a magic prodigy at a young age, with an impressive quantity of mana, which caught the interest of [Flamme](https://anilist.co/character/219733/Flamme), a human wizard who taught her everything there is to know about magic and mana control until she passed away. Frieren persists in collecting magic knowledge no matter how trivial it may be.', '/uploads/images/c_176754.jpg'),
(195, 'Fern', 'フェルン', '主角', 'Kana Ichinose', 'Fern is the young mage apprentice of [Frieren](https://anilist.co/character/176754/Frieren) and accompanies her as a member of her party. She is an orphaned war refugee originally from the Southern Lands, later adopted by [Heiter](https://anilist.co/character/184310/Heiter) and placed under Frieren''s care.', '/uploads/images/c_183965.jpg'),
(195, 'Heiter', 'ハイター', '配角', 'Hiroki Touchi', 'A priest who is a part of the Hero''s party. He later took care of [Fern](https://anilist.co/character/183965/Fern) until [Frieren](https://anilist.co/character/176754/Frieren) arrived.', '/uploads/images/c_184310.jpg'),
(195, 'Himmel', 'ヒンメル', '配角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', 'Hero and Leader of the party that defeated the Demon King, and a self-proclaimed handsome narcissist. He cares about his friends and can''t help but help those in need. He had a great influence on [Frieren](https://anilist.co/character/176754/Frieren), with whom he had adventures for 10 years.', '/uploads/images/c_184311.jpg'),
(195, 'Eisen', 'アイゼン', '配角', 'Youji Ueda', 'Dwarf warrior who was a part of the Hero''s party, later became a mentor to [Stark](https://anilist.co/character/184313/Stark).', '/uploads/images/c_184312.jpg'),
(195, 'Stark', 'シュタルク', '主角', 'Chiaki Kobayashi', 'Stark is a warrior who fights alongside [Frieren](https://anilist.co/character/176754/Frieren) and [Fern](https://anilist.co/character/183965/Fern). After his village was attacked by demons, he fled and became [Eisen](https://anilist.co/character/184312/Eisen)''s apprentice. At Eisen''s instruction, he joined Frieren''s party as their vanguard.', '/uploads/images/c_184313.jpg'),
(195, 'Sein', 'ザイン', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', 'Sein is a Priest from a small village in the Alt Woods. After [Frieren](https://anilist.co/character/176754/Frieren) spotted his talent, he joined her group for a period of time with the goal of reuniting with his childhood friend Gorilla.', '/uploads/images/c_205177.jpg'),
(195, 'Aura', 'アウラ', '配角', 'Ayana Taketatsu', 'Aura is one of the Seven Sages of Destruction directly serving the Demon King. ~!She later was killed by [Frieren](https://anilist.co/character/176754/Frieren) after being commanded to kill herself using her own Auserlese.!~', '/uploads/images/c_219110.jpg'),
(195, 'Kraft', 'クラフト', '配角', 'Takehito Koyasu', 'He is an elf that Frieren''s group meets in a cabin in the mountains. He''s a monk and believed to be the last elf alive until meeting Frieren.', '/uploads/images/c_219732.jpg'),
(195, 'Flamme', 'フランメ', '配角', 'Atsuko Tanaka', 'She lived a millennium before the story and was [Frieren](https://anilist.co/character/176754/Frieren)''s teacher.', '/uploads/images/c_219733.jpg'),
(195, 'Serie', 'ゼーリエ', '配角', 'Mariya Ise', 'An elven mage who is said to possess knowledge about nearly every magic that exists. She was Flamme''s master. She founded the Continental Magic Association around 20 years before Himmel''s death. First-class mages get the privilege of meeting her and can ask for any magic they desire.', '/uploads/images/c_219734.jpg'),
(195, 'Methode', 'メトーデ', '配角', 'Reina Ueda', 'A mage that can use restraint and mental manipulation magic. Good at detecting mana and can use simple recovery magic.', '/uploads/images/c_246054.jpg'),
(195, 'Genau', 'ゲナウ', '配角', 'Tarusuke Shingaki', 'First-class mage who was a proctor for the first examination.', '/uploads/images/c_246055.png'),
(195, 'Laufen', 'ラオフェン', '配角', 'Shizuka Ishigami', 'A third-class mage. Specializes in magic that makes her move at high speed. Treats [Denken](https://anilist.co/character/246058/Denken) as her grandfather.', '/uploads/images/c_246056.png'),
(195, 'Übel', 'ユーベル', '配角', 'Ikumi Hasegawa', 'Übel is a third-class mage. Was disqualified in an earlier examination due to killing a first-class wizard. Specializes in magic that allows her to copy the spells of people she can empathize with. Relies mostly on her intuition and is not bound by logical reasoning. ~!Becomes a first-class mage after the examination.!~', '/uploads/images/c_246057.png'),
(195, 'Denken', 'デンケン', '配角', 'Jirou Saitou', 'Denken is an imperial mage of the second-class. In his youth he belonged to an army but became an imperial mage after winning a power struggle. Often calm and calculating, however he still has a fire burning within despite his old age. He saw [Frieren](https://anilist.co/character/176754/Frieren) as his motivation to become a mage. ~!Becomes a first-class mage after the examination.!~', '/uploads/images/c_246058.png'),
(195, 'Lawine', 'ラヴィーネ', '配角', 'Sayumi Suzushiro', 'Lawine is a third-class mage in the Second Party of the First Class Mage Examinations. She specializes in manipulating ice.', '/uploads/images/c_293727.png'),
(195, 'Kanne', 'カンネ', '配角', 'Azumi Waki', 'Kanne is a third-class mage who graduated from the Academy of Magic. She is childhood friends and classmates with [Lawine](https://anilist.co/character/293727), and the two entered the first-class mage exam together. In the first stage of the exam, she was paired with Lawine and [Frieren](https://anilist.co/character/176754).', '/uploads/images/c_293728.png'),
(195, 'Qual', 'クヴァール', '配角', 'Hiroki Yasumoto', 'A feared and powerful demon who served the Demon King.', '/uploads/images/c_315278.png'),
(195, 'Sanretsu-sha C', '参列者', '配角', 'Kento Shiraishi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_315628.jpg'),
(195, 'Ou-sama', '王様', '配角', 'Kenta Sasa', 'The King resides in the Royal Capital in the Central Lands. The King''s influence reaches across the Central and Northern Lands. When the Hero Party first set out on their journey to defeat the Demon King, he provided them with ten copper coins.', '/uploads/images/c_315630.png'),
(195, 'Mahou-ten Tenshu', '魔法店店主', '配角', 'Masafumi Kobatake', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_315631.png'),
(195, 'Yakusou-ka', '葉草家', '配角', 'Ai Satou', 'A herbalist that lives in a village in the Turk Region.', '/uploads/images/c_315634.png'),
(195, 'Noufu A', '農夫', '配角', 'Kazuki Kyan', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_315636.png'),
(195, 'Chounin A', '町人', '配角', 'Kento Shiraishi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_315637.png'),
(195, 'Arakuremono A', '荒くれ者', '配角', 'Masafumi Kobatake', 'An adventurer that hangs out in a tavern in Warm.', '/uploads/images/c_315638.png'),
(195, 'Roujin', '老人', '配角', 'Keiichi Sonobe', 'An elder wearing a straw hat in the village by where Qual is sealed. Himmel would talk with him when he visited to check on the condition of the seal.', '/uploads/images/c_315640.png'),
(195, 'Neko', 'ネコ', '配角', 'Hana Satou', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_315641.png'),
(195, 'Sonchou A', '村長', '配角', 'Tadashi Miyazawa', 'An elder that lives in the Granz Channel. He offers [Frieren](https://anilist.co/character/176754/Frieren) and [Fern](https://anilist.co/character/183965/Fern) a fake of one of the [Great Mage Flamme](https://anilist.co/character/219733/Flamme)''s grimoires as payment for cleaning up the shore of the channel by the New Year''s Anniversary and checks up on them throughout their stay in town.', '/uploads/images/c_315642.png'),
(195, 'Pan-ya Tenshu', 'パン屋店主', '配角', 'Marie Ooi', 'A kind woman that owns a bakery in the Granz Channel. She gives [Fern](https://anilist.co/character/183965/Fern) extra bread for being a regular customer while [Frieren](https://anilist.co/character/176754/Frieren) and Fern stay in town to clean up the shore.', '/uploads/images/c_315643.png'),
(195, 'Baasan', '婆さん', '配角', 'Sachiko Okada', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_315644.png'),
(195, 'Edel', 'エーデル', '配角', 'Tomoyo Kurosawa', 'Edel is a second-class mage in the Seventeenth Party, alongside Blei and Dunst, of the First Class Mage Exam. She specializes in Hypnosis Magic.', '/uploads/images/c_315929.png'),
(195, 'Murabito A', '村人', '配角', 'Mika Doi', 'A old lady that is seen taking care of two young children in Riegel Canyon.', '/uploads/images/c_316456.png'),
(195, 'Kodomo A', '子供', '配角', 'Saya Hirose', 'A child from Riegel Canyon. He adores [Stark](https://anilist.co/character/184313/Stark) and seek his attention.', '/uploads/images/c_316459.png'),
(195, 'Lügner', 'リュグナー', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', 'Lügner was a demon who served [Aura the Guillotine](https://anilist.co/character/219110/Aura).', '/uploads/images/c_316985.png'),
(195, 'Linie', 'リーニエ', '配角', 'Manaka Iwami', 'Linie is a Demon working under [Aura](https://anilist.co/character/219110/Aura). Under Aura''s instruction, she was sent to assist [Lügner](https://anilist.co/character/316985/Lgner) alongside [Draht](https://anilist.co/character/316987/Draht) to perform negotiations with [Graf Granat](https://anilist.co/character/318147/Granat-Hakushaku).', '/uploads/images/c_316986.png'),
(195, 'Draht', 'ドラート', '配角', 'Kouki Oosuzu', 'Draht was a demon who served [Aura the Guillotine](https://anilist.co/character/219110/Aura).', '/uploads/images/c_316987.png'),
(195, 'Granat Hakushaku', 'グラナト伯爵', '配角', 'Shunsuke Sakuya', 'Ruler of Graf Granat''s Domain, a fortified city in the Northern Lands constantly at war with Aura.', '/uploads/images/c_318147.png'),
(195, 'Akuma no Ko', '悪魔の子', '配角', 'Ami Naitou', 'A young demon girl that ate the daughter of two villagers in a town the Hero Party visited. She called for "mother" when Himmel attempted to kill her, and the village chief takes her in as his own family and tries to give her a chance to atone.', '/uploads/images/c_318148.png'),
(195, 'Mazoku', '魔族', '配角', 'Rie Kawamura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_319165.jpg'),
(195, 'Stoltz', 'シュトルツ', '配角', 'Takuya Eguchi', 'Stark''s older brother, referred to as the strongest warrior in the village.', '/uploads/images/c_319598.png'),
(195, 'Tsurugi no Sato no Satoosa', '剣の里の里長', '配角', 'Konomi Kohara', 'The current chief of the Village of the Sword. Her position was inherited. She is young for the position and postures to try to make up for her lack of height, but when faced with danger or matters regarding the Hero''s Blade, she is collected and calm.', '/uploads/images/c_319599.png'),
(195, 'Wirbel', 'ヴィアベル', '配角', 'Kishou Taniyama', 'Second-class mage and the leader of the eighth party during the first stage of the First Class Mage Exam. He is the captain of the Northern Magic Corps and is thus a very experienced mage. Specializes in magic that restrains the opponent when their body is in full-view.', '/uploads/images/c_321716.png'),
(195, 'Richter', 'リヒター', '配角', 'Eiji Hanawa', 'Second-class mage who participates in the First Class Mage Exam at the same time as Frieren and Fern. He owns a magical store in Äußerst where he specializes in repairing broken staves.', '/uploads/images/c_321717.png'),
(195, 'Ehre', 'エーレ', '配角', 'Kanae Itou', 'Second-class mage in the Eighth Party, alongside Wirbel and Scharf, in the First Class Mage Exam. Fern feels that she is the strongest within both the Fourth and Eighth parties.', '/uploads/images/c_321718.png'),
(195, 'Land', 'ラント', '配角', 'Shouhei Komatsu', 'Second-class mage in the Fourth Party of the First Class Mage Examination. He specializes in illusion magic.', '/uploads/images/c_321719.png'),
(195, 'Sense', 'ゼンゼ', '配角', 'Haruka Terui', 'First-class mage that is proctoring the Second Exam of the First Class Mage Examination. She is a solemn person who rarely speaks.', '/uploads/images/c_321720.png'),
(195, 'Blei', 'ブレイ', '配角', 'Shinya Takahashi', 'Participant in the examination for the title of mage first class. ~!Sacrificed himself to help Dunst deliver important information to his comrades in the lower level of the dungeon.!~', '/uploads/images/c_325587.png'),
(195, 'Falsch', 'ファルシュ', '配角', 'Kento Shiraishi', 'First class mage. Acts as an observer in magical exams.', '/uploads/images/c_325588.png'),
(195, 'Länge', 'レンゲ', '配角', 'Haruka Terui', 'Participant in the examination for the title of mage first class. Slightly distracted girl. Likes to read books and learn new spells.', '/uploads/images/c_325589.png'),
(195, 'Tenshu', '店主', '配角', 'Marie Ooi', 'A woman who live in the village [Stark](https://anilist.co/character/184313/Stark) protected in Riegel Canyon.', '/uploads/images/c_326328.png'),
(195, 'Eihei A', '衛兵', '配角', 'Kento Shiraishi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_326365.png'),
(195, 'Joudai', '城代', '配角', 'Satoshi Yamaguchi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_326366.png'),
(195, 'Eihei Taichou', '衛兵隊長', '配角', 'Takuya Nakashima', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_326367.png'),
