(195, 'Stark no Chichi', 'シュタルクの父', '配角', 'Yasuyuki Kase', '[Stark](https://anilist.co/character/184313/Stark)''s father is a harsh, militant man. He considers Stark a failure. He is also strict with the other warriors of the village, scolding them for their pathetic display against a monster and praising [Stoltz](https://anilist.co/character/319598/Stoltz), who he considered the pride of the village, for defeating it while keeping his white cape pristine.', '/uploads/images/c_326420.png'),
(195, 'Senshi Gorilla', '戦士ゴリラ', '配角', 'Hiromichi Tezuka', 'Childhood friend of [Sein](https://anilist.co/character/205177) who dreamed of going on an adventure and becoming a legendary hero. A long time ago, he asked Sein to start adventuring with him, which Sein refused and regretted since.', '/uploads/images/c_326423.png'),
(195, 'Sein no Ani', 'ザインの兄', '配角', 'Daisuke Hirakawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_326424.png'),
(195, 'Shounin', '商人', '配角', 'Kento Shiraishi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_326425.png'),
(195, 'Orden', 'オルデン', '配角', 'Yuuya Uchida', 'Nobleman presiding over the Vorig Fortified City and the current head of the Orden family, one of the Three Great Knightly Houses of the Northern Lands.', '/uploads/images/c_326825.png'),
(195, 'Gabel', 'ガーベル', '配角', 'Takayuki Nakatsukasa', 'Servant of [Lord Orden](https://anilist.co/character/326825).', '/uploads/images/c_326826.png'),
(195, 'Mut', 'ムート', '配角', '', 'Lord Orden''s youngest son and the next heir of the Orden family.', '/uploads/images/c_326827.png'),
(195, 'Wirt', 'ヴィルト', '配角', '', 'Lord Orden''s oldest son. Wirt passed away in a melee against demon forces but managed to kill the enemy general.', '/uploads/images/c_326828.png'),
(195, 'Ryoushu', '領主', '配角', 'Sara Matsumoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_326829.png'),
(195, 'Voll Jii', 'フォル爺', '配角', 'Mitsuaki Hoshino', 'Elderly Dwarf warrior and a long-time friend of Frieren. He resides in a village in the Klar Region.', '/uploads/images/c_326830.png'),
(195, 'Gankobaa-san', '頑固婆さん', '配角', 'Tamie Kubota', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_326833.png'),
(195, 'Koya no Omo', '小屋の主', '配角', 'Masafumi Kobatake', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_327208.png'),
(195, 'Uufu', 'ウーフ', '配角', 'Takako Tanaka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_327210.png'),
(195, 'Lernen', 'レルネン', '配角', 'Atsushi Miyauchi', 'An old friend of Denken. First Class Mage and Serie''s apprentice. Rarely acts directly, preferring stealth. ~!Helped in the extraction and transfer of information necessary for the liberation of Denken''s hometown.!~', '/uploads/images/c_327299.png'),
(195, 'Scharf', 'シャルフ', '配角', 'Yuuji Murai', 'Scharf is a third-class mage and member of the eighth party along with Wirbel and Ehre for the First Class Mage Examination.', '/uploads/images/c_327305.png'),
(195, 'Toun', 'トーン', '配角', 'Taito Ban', 'Participant in the examination for the title of mage first class. Distrustful and self-confident mage.', '/uploads/images/c_327306.png'),
(195, 'Touzoku A', '盗賊', '配角', 'Taishi Hashimoto', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_327493.jpg'),
(195, 'Juken-sha A', '受験者', '配角', 'Seiyu Fujiwara', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_327496.png'),
(195, 'Wakamono', '若者', '配角', 'Kento Shiraishi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_327519.png'),
(195, 'Take no Ojii-san', '武のおじいさん', '配角', 'Choo', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_327520.png'),
(195, 'Roufujin', '老婦人', '配角', 'Kaoru Katakai', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_327521.png'),
(195, 'Lecker', 'レッカー', '配角', 'Shinji Kawada', 'The head chef for the restaurant Bell in Äußerst.', '/uploads/images/c_327522.png'),
(195, 'Dünste', 'ドゥンスト', '配角', 'Masafumi Kobatake', 'Participant in the First Class Mage Exam.', '/uploads/images/c_327560.png'),
(196, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Sumi Shimamoto', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(196, 'Maomao', '猫猫', '主角', 'Aoi Yuuki', 'Maomao works as an apothecary in the red light district, helping her mentor and father [Luomen](https://anilist.co/character/261968) in caring for its residents, with special attention given to the Verdigris Hall brothel, where she was born and was initially raised. One day, while gathering herbs, she gets kidnapped and sold to be a common servant in the inner court of the imperial palace, where only the Emperor''s consorts and their servants reside. Not allowed to leave, her curious personality and skills begin to rope her into mysterious problems that can affect the whole country. ~! It was later revealed that Loumen was actually her adoptive father. Her biological father is [Lakan](https://anilist.co/character/232926), the tactician in the Li military. Loumen is actually Maomao''s biological great-uncle. Her biological mother is [Fengxian](https://anilist.co/character/274191), who was a high ranking courtesan at the Verdigris House. !~', '/uploads/images/c_126824.png'),
(196, 'Jinshi', '壬氏', '主角', 'Takeo Ootsuka', 'Jinshi is the eunuch in charge of the affairs of the inner palace. He is described as having a face capable even of outshining the consorts in beauty, amazing women and men alike. He is constantly accompanied by his attendant [Gaoshun](https://anilist.co/character/244317/Gaoshun) and has taken an interest to [Maomao](https://anilist.co/character/126824/Maomao)''s intelligence and active demeanor.', '/uploads/images/c_127278.jpg'),
(196, 'Koutei', '皇帝', '配角', 'Daichi Endou', 'The current Emperor fulfills the role expected of him. He is hated by his mother, the Empress dowager, for being the product of her rape. His most trustworthy relationship is with his brother, who manages small things behind the scenes for him.', '/uploads/images/c_144110.jpg'),
(196, 'Riishu', '里樹妃', '配角', 'Hina Kino', 'The Virtuous consort, residing in the Diamond Palace within the inner court. She was sent to be a high consort on the inner court as a young child because her prominent family was aware of the previous Emperor''s pedophilic tendencies. When he died, she was allowed to leave as she was never visited by him, but her family arranged for her to return to her high consort position. Due to how young she is, she doesn''t get any interest from the current Emperor, commands no respect, nor does she have any influence. She''s very naive and gets bullied even by her own attendants.', '/uploads/images/c_156764.jpg'),
(196, 'Aaduo', '阿多', '配角', 'Yuuko Kaida', 'The Pure consort, residing in the Garner Palace within the inner court. She was the current Emperor''s milk sibling and childhood crush, being just a year older than him. She became the previous Emperor''s consort and gave birth to his child at 18, who was stillborn. The ordeal made her infertile, but circumstances between her and the royal family allowed her to keep her position as a High Consort. She is very spartan on the outside yet has a motherly side to her. ~!She is Jinshi''s real mother!~', '/uploads/images/c_156765.jpg'),
(196, 'Rifa', '梨花妃', '配角', 'Yui Ishikawa', 'The Able consort, residing in the Crystal Palace within the inner court. The second most favoured consort of the Emperor, said to be so in big part due to her voluptuous chest. She gave birth to a boy who succumbed for unknown reasons and she herself is in grave health condition at the start of the story.', '/uploads/images/c_156766.jpg'),
(196, 'Gyokuyou', '玉葉妃', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', 'The Noble consort, residing in the Jade Palace within the inner court. Her red hair and green eyes distinguish her from the other consorts, that being part of the reasons she became the Emperor''s favoured consort, having already given birth to a girl of his. Despite these circumstances, she is very careful of whom she keeps around so she has the smallest retinue of all the high consorts. ~! Later on, she gives birth to a boy, the new heir to the crown, thus becoming the Empress. !~', '/uploads/images/c_156767.jpg'),
(196, 'Lakan', '羅漢', '配角', 'Takuya Kirimoto', 'Lakan is a renowned strategist known for his nonchalant disregard of proper manners. His plotting ability causes fear even in the Emperor himself. He sees people''s faces as a piece of shogi representing their worth, with a few exceptions like the woman he loved and his daughter. Currently heads the La clan. ~!He is [Maomao](https://anilist.co/character/126824/Maomao)''s biological father and the nephew of [Luomen](https://anilist.co/character/261968/Ruomen)!~', '/uploads/images/c_232926.jpg'),
(196, 'Gaoshun', '高順', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', 'Gaoshun is [Jinshi](https://anilist.co/character/127278/Jinshi)''s attendant. He''s shown to be extremely dependable. A stern believer in deference to authority and proper etiquette, his disapproval is often splattered in his transparent facial expressions, even if he says nothing.', '/uploads/images/c_244317.png'),
(196, 'Hongniang', '紅娘', '配角', 'Megumi Toyoguchi', 'Lady Gyokuyou''s head lady-in-waiting.', '/uploads/images/c_244318.png'),
(196, 'Meimei', '梅梅', '配角', 'Megumi Han', 'Meimei is one of the Three Princesses of Verdigris Hall. She started as Fenshen''s apprentice and, being somewhat cunning herself, inherited Fenshen''s taste for strategy board games. She is the most attached to the brothel and the people within.', '/uploads/images/c_244319.jpg'),
(196, 'Fuyou', '芙蓉', '配角', 'Natsumi Kawaida', 'A mid-rank consort, princess of a distant land. She became the Emperor''s middle consort against her will.', '/uploads/images/c_244321.png'),
(196, 'Rouran', '楼蘭', '配角', '', 'The (new) Pure consort, residing in the Garnet Palace within the inner court. She makes a big show of her exorbitant and ever changing clothing, jewellery and make up. Despite that, she doesn''t talk any more than she needs to, keeping her distance.', '/uploads/images/c_244995.jpg'),
(196, 'Lingli', '鈴麗', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', 'Lingli is the baby of high consort Gyokuyou. She''s the first child of the current Emperor to survive. She''s nicknamed Xiaoling by her mother, meaning Little Bell.', '/uploads/images/c_244996.jpg'),
(196, 'Ruomen', '羅門', '配角', 'Hiroshi Yanaka', 'Ruomen is a physician of the Inner Court, a physician in the red-light district, and Maomao''s father.', '/uploads/images/c_261968.png'),
(196, 'Xiaolan', '小蘭', '配角', 'Misaki Kuno', 'Xiaolan is a servant in the inner court of the palace. Carefree and easy to please, she looks at her sale to the inner palace as a good thing, since at least she now has proper bedding and meals. She loves gossiping and constantly serves as a source of possibilities for Maomao to brainstorm over.', '/uploads/images/c_274186.jpg'),
(196, 'Yarite Baba', 'やり手婆', '配角', 'Kimiko Saitou', 'Once a high ranking courtesan herself, the Madam is now the runner of the Vergidris Hall.', '/uploads/images/c_274187.png'),
(196, 'Anshi', '安氏', '配角', 'Mamiko Noto', 'Anshi, the Empress Dowager, is the wife of the previous Emperor, mother to the current one. She joined the inner court at 10 years of age as the attendant to a consort and unwillingly got the previous Emperor''s attention with her childish innocence. He jumped her and, at 11, she gave birth to the current Emperor. Her relationship with the previous Emperor was cold, for she was disgusted by him while he feared her ever more adult (dominant) presence. Later in life, she found him making advances on underage maid and in a pit of rage, she raped him, resulting in her getting pregnant with the second prince.', '/uploads/images/c_274188.png'),
(196, 'Pairin', '白鈴', '配角', 'Ami Koshimizu', 'Pairin is the oldest of the Three Princesses of Verdigris Hall. She loves men''s bodies and dreams of being taken away by a muscular prince.', '/uploads/images/c_274189.png'),
(196, 'Fenshen', '鳳仙', '配角', 'Houko Kuwashima', 'Fenshen used to be a high ranking courtesan in Verdigris Hall. With a flinty and hard personality, she was unmatched at strategy board games. She fell in love with a man who could challenge her at those, but was later abandoned after bedding him. ~!Her mental condition degraded heavily and she mistreated her baby to the point the other courtesans took Maomao to raise her themselves. Ultimately she contracted syphilis and got bedridden in a backroom of Verdigris.!~', '/uploads/images/c_274191.png'),
(196, 'Guen', '虞淵', '配角', 'Mitsuaki Kanuka', 'Guen is the current physician of the inner court. The requirement of being castrated to be allowed to work inside the inner court does not attract many physicians to choose from. Guen, not a very good one, accepted such employment terms to prevent his sister being forced to become a court lady.', '/uploads/images/c_274192.png'),
(196, 'Joka', '女華', '配角', 'Hiroki Nanami', 'Joka is the youngest of the Three Princesses of Verdigris Hall and one of Maomao''s adopted sisters.', '/uploads/images/c_274193.jpg'),
(196, 'Suirei', '翠苓', '配角', 'Kaori Nazuka', 'Suirei is a court lady, doing menial tasks in the outer court.', '/uploads/images/c_274194.png'),
(196, 'Lihaku', '李白', '配角', 'Kenji Akabane', 'Lihaku is a military officer, residing in the outer court of the palace. He''s strong and honest, but not exactly brilliant.', '/uploads/images/c_274195.png'),
(196, 'Yinghua', '桜花', '配角', 'Rie Hikisaka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_317874.png'),
(196, 'Ailan', '愛藍', '配角', 'Misa Ishii', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_317875.png'),
(196, 'Guiyuan', '貴園', '配角', 'Takako Tanaka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_317876.png'),
(196, 'Xing', '杏', '配角', 'Sayaka Kinoshita', 'The head lady-in-waiting of the Crystal Pavillion.', '/uploads/images/c_318472.jpg'),
(196, 'Huanguan B', '宦官', '配角', 'Takaaki Torashima', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_318473.jpg'),
(196, 'Xia Nu B', '下女', '配角', 'Natsumi Kawaida', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_318475.jpg'),
(196, 'Rikuson', '陸孫', '配角', 'Kouki Uchiyama', 'Subordinate of [Rakan](https://anilist.co/character/232926). A very capable official, he is gentle, diligent, and quick-witted.', '/uploads/images/c_323687.png'),
(196, 'Basen', '馬閃', '配角', 'Tatsumaru Tachibana', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_327822.png'),
(196, 'Kanan', '河南', '配角', 'Umeka Shouji', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_327823.png'),
(196, 'Suiren', '水蓮', '配角', 'Mika Doi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_327824.png'),
(196, 'Fengming', '風明', '配角', 'Noriko Hidaka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_327827.png'),
(197, 'Tanjirou Kamado', '竈門炭治郎', '主角', 'Natsuki Hanae', '__Height:__ 165 cm (5''5") __Combat Style:__ Water Breathing & ~!Sun Breathing!~ Tanjirou is kind by nature and has been described by others as having very gentle eyes. He has a great deal of determination and will not give up once he has a goal to achieve, an example being finding a cure for [Nezuko](https://anilist.co/character/127518). Even though he is relatively strong on his own, he isn''t opposed to asking others for help when he needs it. He is very protective of his friends and even more so of his younger sister. His biggest attribute is his ability to empathize with anyone, even demons. ~!Eventually, he discovers that he is a legendary Sun Breathing user.!~', '/uploads/images/c_126071.png'),
(197, 'Nezuko Kamado', '竈門禰豆子', '配角', 'Akari Kitou', '__Height:__ 153 cm (5''0") Transformed into a demon and left mute, Nezuko travels with her older brother [Tanjirou](https://anilist.co/character/126071/Kamado-Tanjirou) in a box on his back. She can change her size at will, and is a capable fighter when she needs to be, but has never killed or eaten any humans. Instead of gaining nourishment from humans, it seems that she recovers her energy by sleeping for long periods of time.', '/uploads/images/c_127518.png'),
(197, 'Inosuke Hashibira', '嘴平伊之助', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', '**Height:** 164 cm (5''4") __Combat Style:__ Beast Breathing Inosuke is usually seen wearing a grey boar mask, with a shirtless version of the Demon hunter uniform. Without the mask he has messy shoulder length black hair and large green eyes with long eyelashes. He is described as having a girly looking face which greatly contrasts with his muscular body. Inosuke is extremely short-tempered and proud, and makes a big deal out of fighting opponents stronger than him claiming that''s his only hobby. He is a sore loser and is always trying to compete with Tanjiro and provoke him into fighting him, and usually failing. Due to growing up in the mountains by himself Inosuke has trouble interacting with others and only cares about himself most of the time. Though he''s often seen with 2 swords in hand, Inosuke is left-handed.', '/uploads/images/c_129130.jpg'),
(197, 'Zenitsu Agatsuma', '我妻善逸', '配角', 'Hiro Shimono', '__Height:__ 164 cm (5''4") __Combat Style:__ Thunder Breathing __Affiliation:__ Demon Slayer Corps __Occupation:__ Demon Slayer Zenitsu Agatsuma is one of the main protagonists of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba and along with [Inosuke Hashibira](https://anilist.co/character/129130/Inosuke-Hashibira), a traveling companion of [Tanjiro Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/126071/Tanjirou-Kamado) and [Nezuko Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/127518/Nezuko-Kamado).', '/uploads/images/c_129131.png'),
(197, 'Muzan Kibutsuji', '鬼舞辻無惨', '配角', 'Toshihiko Seki', '__Height:__ 179 cm (5''10") He is the Demon King, the first of his kind, and the progenitor of all other demons in existence. Muzan is also the leader of the Twelve Kizuki, an organization of the twelve strongest demons in existence that serve directly under him. ~!A millennium ago, during the Heian Era, Muzan was turned into a demon during an experimental treatment trying to cure his terminal illness, and his goal since then was to live without the fear of death and become truly eternal. He believes that Sun Breathing users are his only threat. He has a grand total of seven hearts and five brains.!~', '/uploads/images/c_129132.jpg'),
(197, 'Giyuu Tomioka', '冨岡義勇', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', '__Height:__ 176 cm (5''9½") __Combat Style:__ Water Breathing Water pillar in the Demon Killing Corps. Giyuu is reserved and displays little emotion, instead giving off a calm feeling most of the time. As a water breath user, Giyuu has created his own style. The eleventh style, Lull, gives him the ability to nullify any oncoming attacks, though rapid attacks can pierce through it. Though Giyuu is reserved, he does have a few friends, such as Tanjirou and, in the past, [Sabito](https://anilist.co/character/137809/Sabito). Shinobu often pokes fun at Giyuu and is merciless when doing so, such as saying he has no friends and that others don''t like him. ~!He is one of the only Pillar, aside from [Sanemi](https://anilist.co/character/137774/Sanemi-Shinazugawa), who survived during the final fight against [Muzan](https://anilist.co/character/129132/Muzan-Kibutsuji).!~', '/uploads/images/c_130050.png'),
(197, 'Muichirou Tokitou', '時透無一郎', '配角', 'Kengo Kawanishi', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") __Combat Style:__ Mist Breathing Muichiro is an air-headed individual who seems to constantly wander off in thought and never focus on one thing. Impassive and, at times, obtuse, he tends to think only for himself and operates on logic alone, never letting emotion guide him. Despite this, he has been shown to get serious when it is required and is devoted to his position as the Demon Slayer Corps'' Mist Hashira. Alternatively, he seems to display a cold and arrogant side as well. ~!He later died at Kokushibo''s hand.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136069.png'),
(197, 'Shinobu Kochou', '胡蝶しのぶ', '配角', 'Saori Hayami', '__Height:__ 151 cm (4''11") __Combat Style:__ Insect Breathing Shinobu is a demon slayer and the Insect Pillar of the Demon Killing Corps. She is 18 years old and one of two female pillars. Shinobu appears rather laid back, and always has a smile on her face regardless of the situation. Despite her relaxed exterior and her initial claim of wanting to get along with demons, she can be rather cruel and harbors a great deal of anger towards them. She is generally kind to other humans, but is rather sadistic in her treatment of demons. As a pillar, she is a top-class fighter despite her small stature. She is also well-versed in medical knowledge, and can concoct poisons and medicines alike. ~!During the Infinity Castle Arc, she encounters the Upper 2 demon [Douma](https://anilist.co/character/144591) and is slain by him in a fight. However, since she poisoned herself before the fight, Douma is severely incapacitated after eating her.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136070.png'),
(197, 'Tengen Uzui', '宇髄天元', '配角', 'Katsuyuki Konishi', '__Height:__ 198 cm (6''6") __Combat Style:__ Sound Breathing A Demon Slayer, and the Sound Pillar of the Demon Slayer Corps. Tengen is a very eccentric person, always wanting to complete actions as flashy as possible. Although he has displayed an uncaring and forceful attitude towards some people, he also has a caring side that is mainly only shown towards his most treasured ones, most notably his three wives, [Makio](https://anilist.co/character/250554), [Suma](https://anilist.co/character/250555), and [Hinatsuru](https://anilist.co/character/250556). He also shows a somewhat nicer side towards [Tanjiro](https://anilist.co/character/126071) after their mission and starts to accept him more as the series goes on.', '/uploads/images/c_136071.png'),
(197, 'Mitsuri Kanroji', '甘露寺蜜璃', '配角', 'Kana Hanazawa', '__Height:__ 167 cm (5''5") __Combat Style:__ Love Breathing Demon Hunter and the Love Pillar of the Demon Killing Corps. Mitsuri is a soft and kind person. She is very emotional and passionate, constantly complimenting people in her head, which probably contributes to her nickname of "the Hashira of Love". Although she is rather shy and is easily flustered, she is always kind to others, most notably towards [Obanai](https://anilist.co/character/137777), whom she appears to share a strong bond with. Besides her rather emotional personality, she can also come off as somewhat childish at times. ~!She was taught by Rengoku to use the flame breathing. However, although Mitsuri has learnt it, she was not as skillful with it and cannot fight to her fullest using it, leading her to solely develop the Love Breathing.!~', '/uploads/images/c_136072.png'),
(197, 'Sakonji Urokodaki', '鱗滝左近次 ', '配角', '', 'Retired member of the Demon Slayer Corps, previously holding the title of Water Hashira. He is the main cultivator of the Water Breathing style, having trained Makomo, Sabito, Giyu Tomioka, and Tanjiro Kamado.', '/uploads/images/c_137773.png'),
(197, 'Sanemi Shinazugawa', '不死川実弥', '配角', 'Tomokazu Seki', '__Height:__ 179cm (5''10½") Demon Hunter and the Wind Pillar of the Demon Killing Corps. He is the older brother of [Genya Shinazugawa](https://anilist.co/character/137776). Sanemi specializes in Wind Breathing, which has 9 forms. The technique consists of drawing the air from around the user to create whirlwind attacks that follow the user''s movements. Form names include Dust Whirlwind Cutter, Claws-Purifying Wind, Clean Storm Wind Tree, Rising Dust Storm, Cold Mountain Wind, Black Wind Mountain Mist, Gale - Sudden Gusts, Primary Gale Slash, and Idaten Typhoon.', '/uploads/images/c_137774.png'),
(197, 'Genya Shinazugawa', '不死川玄弥', '配角', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '__Height:__ 180 cm (5''11") Genya Is a Demon Hunter of the Demon Killing Corps. He is also the younger brother of the Wind Pillar [Sanemi Shinazugawa](https://anilist.co/character/137774). ~! Due to his lack of breath forms he is dependent on using his shotgun and demon form. His shotgun pelts are made from sun steel to be effective against demons. His demon form is active when he digests anything from a demon to gain demon like strength and abilities. He is the only demon hunter to have this ability given that it is drastically rare !~', '/uploads/images/c_137776.jpg'),
(197, 'Obanai Iguro', '伊黒小芭内', '配角', 'Kenichi Suzumura', '__Height:__ 162 cm (5''3") Obanai is a Demon Slayer and the Snake Pillar of the Demon Slayer Corps. A young man of short stature and a pale complexion. He has straight-edged black hair of varying lengths, the longest reaching down to his shoulders and the shortest stopping at his cheekbones, which he wears down with two shorter strands hanging between his eyes. He wears a navy blue version of the standard Demon Slayer uniform, along with a black and white pinstriped haori, the hem and cuffs of which are striped lengthways rather than vertically, which covers his hands. Obanai also sports bandages in place of the leg-wraps around his calves, as well as another set of bandages that cover his mouth, and blue-strapped zori on his feet. He is also always seen with his white snake, Kaburamaru, wrapped around his shoulders.', '/uploads/images/c_137777.jpg'),
(197, 'Gyoumei Himejima', '悲鳴嶼行冥', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', '__Height:__ 220cm (7''2½") He is a Demon Slayer and the Stone Hashira of the Demon Slayer Corps. Gyomei also serves as the mentor of Genya Shinazugawa.', '/uploads/images/c_137778.jpg'),
(197, 'Kagaya Ubuyashiki', '産屋敷耀哉', '配角', 'Toshiyuki Morikawa', 'He is the head of the Ubuyashiki Family and 97th leader of the Demon Slayer Corps known mainly as "Oyakata-sama" ("Master") by his subordinates and peers.', '/uploads/images/c_137808.png'),
(197, 'Sabito', '錆兎', '配角', 'Yuuki Kaji', 'He is a former apprentice of [Urokodaki Sakonji](https://anilist.co/character/137773/Urokodaki-Sakonji). ~!He dies saving the participators in the final selection, including [Giyuu](https://anilist.co/character/130050/Tomioka-Giyuu).!~', '/uploads/images/c_137809.png'),
(197, 'Matsuemon Tennouji', '天王寺松右衛門', '配角', 'Takumi Yamazaki', 'Kasugai Crow assigned to Tanjirou Kamado. Very intelligent and seems to have a large ego.', '/uploads/images/c_137810.png'),
(197, 'Yushirou', '愈史郎', '配角', 'Daiki Yamashita', '__Height:__ 157 cm (5''2") Yushiro is a traveling companion of Tamayo and close ally of Kamado Tanjirou. He was turned into a Demon by Tamayo. Yushiro was a human who was under the care of Tamayo as she was practicing as a medical practitioner. He was in the frail state fighting disease when Tamayo gave him the choice of succumbing to his illness or to live longer as a Demon. He agreed to become a Demon and has since stayed by Tamayo''s side serving as an assistant as well as her guard. ~!Yushiro would become the last known survivor of the Demon race. In time he would dedicate himself to a life of art and become a world famous painter in the present day under the name of Yushiro Yamamoto, known for his paintings of Tamayo to wide critical acclaim!~', '/uploads/images/c_138846.jpg'),
(197, 'Tamayo', '珠世', '配角', 'Maaya Sakamoto', '__Height:__ 150 cm (4''11") Tamayo is a doctor and close ally of [Kamado Tanjirou](https://anilist.co/character/126071/Kamado-Tanjirou). She was turned into a Demon by [Kibutsuji Muzan](https://anilist.co/character/129132/Kibutsuji-Muzan).', '/uploads/images/c_138847.jpg'),
(197, 'Hotaru Haganezuka', '鋼鐵塚蛍', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', 'Hotaru Haganezuka is a swordsmith affiliated with the Demon Killing Corps.', '/uploads/images/c_138990.jpg'),
(197, 'Kanao Tsuyuri', '栗花落カナヲ', '配角', 'Reina Ueda', '__Height:__ 156 cm (5''1½") Kanao Tsuyuri is a Demon Hunter and the Tsuguko, who is personally looked after by the Demon Killing Corps'' Pillars. She uses Flower Breathing. ~!When Kanao is first introduced, she is an indecisive and quiet girl due to the abuse she endured in her past before meeting the Kocho sisters. She became unable to make decisions by herself and repressed her emotions as a defense mechanism. In order to help rectify this, Kanae gave her a coin to flip to decide which path to follow when she didn''t know what to do. Later on, Tanjiro helps Kanao overcome her indecisiveness and Kanao soon becomes more confident in making decisions with or without her coin. Kanao and Tanjiro would eventually marry and start a family, having two great-great-grandchildren by the names of [Kanata Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/171144/Kanata-Kamado) and [Sumihiko Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/171145/Sumihiko-Kamado) between them.!~', '/uploads/images/c_139038.png'),
(197, 'Kiriya Ubuyashiki', '産屋敷輝利哉', '配角', 'Aoi Yuuki', '~!Kiriya Ubuyashiki is the son and middle child of Kagaya Ubuyashiki. He is the current head of the Ubuyashiki Household and leader of the Demon Slaying Corps!~', '/uploads/images/c_139460.png'),
(197, 'Nakime', '鳴女', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', 'Nakime is a mysterious Biwa Demon that dwells in the Dimensional Infinity Fortress. ~!Actually she is a member of the Twelve Demon Moons, replacing Hantengu and holding the position of Upper Moon Four.!~ (Source: Fandom)', '/uploads/images/c_139736.png'),
(197, 'Ukogi', 'うこぎ', '配角', 'Manaka Iwami', 'Ukogi is Zenitsu''s Kasugai Crow. He is the only sparrow to appear in the series and pass the Kasugai Crow Test and also the only Kasugai Crow without the ability to talk. His family was killed by Demons.', '/uploads/images/c_142420.jpg'),
(197, 'Naho Takada', '高田なほ', '配角', 'Yuuki Kuwahara', 'She is a servant of the Butterfly Estate.', '/uploads/images/c_145286.jpg'),
(197, 'Kiyo Terauchi', '寺内きよ', '配角', 'Nanami Yamashita', 'She is a servant of the Butterfly Estate.', '/uploads/images/c_145287.jpg'),
(197, 'Aoi Kanzaki', '神崎アオイ', '配角', 'Yuri Ehara', 'She is a Demon Slayer, though she works as a servant in the Butterfly Estate rather than taking to the front lines.', '/uploads/images/c_145288.jpg'),
(197, 'Sumi Nakahara', '中原すみ', '配角', 'Ayumi Mano', 'She is a servant of the Butterfly Estate.', '/uploads/images/c_145289.jpg'),
(197, 'Kaigaku', '獪岳', '配角', '', '__Height:__ 167 cm (5''6") A member of the Demon Slaying Corps, who was taught the Breath of Thunder by former Thunder Pillar, Jigoro, with fellow disciple Zenitsu.', '/uploads/images/c_165862.jpg'),
(197, 'Murata', '村田', '配角', 'Kouki Miyata', 'Murata is a member of the Demon Slayer Corps.', '/uploads/images/c_171150.png'),
(197, 'Kozo Kanamori', '鉄穴森鋼蔵', '配角', 'Eiji Takemoto', 'Kozo Kanamori is a swordsmith affiliated with the Demon Slayer Corps.', '/uploads/images/c_206331.png'),
(197, 'Gotou', '後藤', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', 'Goto is a member of the Kakushi, the clean-up brigade of the Demon Slayers. He is the one who found a near-dead Tanjiro, Inosuke, and Zenitsu in the aftermath of the Entertainment District Arc. He possesses deep respect for the three because of their capability and bravery. At one point in his life, he was found worthy of being a Demon Slayer, but for unknown reasons, he decided to become one of the Kakushi.', '/uploads/images/c_207949.png'),
(197, 'Amane Ubuyashiki', '産屋敷あまね', '配角', 'Rina Satou', '__Height:__ 167cm (5''6") She is the wife and caretaker of [Kagaya Ubuyashiki](https://anilist.co/character/137808/Kagaya-Ubuyashiki) and the mother of Hinaki Ubuyashiki, Nichika Ubuyashiki, Kiriya Ubuyashiki, Kanata Ubuyashiki and Kuina Ubuyashiki. Her maiden name is Amane Himorogi.', '/uploads/images/c_221375.jpg'),
(197, 'Makio', 'まきを', '配角', 'Shizuka Ishigami', 'Makio is a kunoichi and one of Tengen Uzui''s wives. ~! According to the second official fanbook, Makio is actually a distant cousin of Tengen''s.!~', '/uploads/images/c_250554.jpg'),
(197, 'Suma', '須磨', '配角', 'Nao Touyama', 'Suma is a kunoichi and one of Tengen Uzui''s wives.', '/uploads/images/c_250555.jpg'),
(197, 'Hinatsuru', '雛鶴', '配角', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', 'Hinatsuru is a kunoichi and one of Tengen Uzui''s wives.', '/uploads/images/c_250556.jpg'),
(197, 'Ginko', '銀子', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', 'Kasugai Crow assigned to [Muichirou Tokitou](https://anilist.co/character/136069). Does not get along well with [Tanjirou](https://anilist.co/character/126071) and his crow or the other crows in general. She is very proud of Muichirou.', '/uploads/images/c_304323.jpg'),
(197, 'Urara', '麗', '配角', '', 'Kasugai Crow assigned to [Mitsuri Kanroji](https://anilist.co/character/136072). Wears a clover-shaped crown similar to Mitsuri''s Nichirin Sword tsuba. Often appears to be nervous and fidgety, and is rumored to have a sweet tooth as a result of how often she has tea time with Mitsuri.', '/uploads/images/c_304324.jpg'),
(197, 'Kagaya no Kasugai Garasu', '耀哉の鎹鴉', '配角', 'Shou Hayami', '[Kagaya Ubayashiki](https://anilist.co/character/137808)''s kasugai crow.', '/uploads/images/c_335996.png'),
(197, 'Takeuchi', '竹内', '配角', 'Shouya Chiba', 'Member of the Demon Slayer Corps. He is close friends with Murata.', '/uploads/images/c_335997.png'),
(198, 'Ken Takakura', '高倉健', '主角', 'Natsuki Hanae', 'He is a young male student with a firm belief that UFOs and aliens exist. Upon meeting [Momo Ayase](https://anilist.co/character/222594/Ayase-Momo) and taking up on her challenge to see if ghosts were real, Okarun became cursed by a yokai known as the [Turbo-Granny](https://anilist.co/character/239956/Turbo-Babaa) and seeks to return to normal.', '/uploads/images/c_222593.png'),
(198, 'Momo Ayase', '綾瀬桃', '主角', 'Shion Wakayama', 'After making friends with [Ken Takakura](https://anilist.co/character/222593), who she calls "Okarun" (due to refusing to call him by the same name as the actor she idolizes), Momo wishes to help restore his body back to normal after being cursed by a yokai and must overcome other paranormal activities that are involved.', '/uploads/images/c_222594.png'),
(198, 'Seiko Ayase', '綾瀬星子', '配角', 'Nana Mizuki', '[Momo Ayase](https://anilist.co/character/222594/Ayase-Momo)''s grandmother. Despite being a grandmother, Seiko possesses a youthful appearance that does not match her age and is recognized as being quite beautiful.', '/uploads/images/c_234824.png'),
(198, 'Turbo Babaa', 'ターボババア', '配角', 'Mayumi Tanaka', 'The yokai took on the form of a very elderly woman with long white shaggy hair and eyes that were stuck looking to the sides. When possessing her targets, she has her victims transform into a mirror image of herself, albeit with a large mouth with teeth that is capable of biting off body parts. ~!After having her consciousness extracted from [Okarun](https://anilist.co/character/222593/Takakura-Ken), the Turbo-Granny is forced to inhabit a maneki-neko doll.!~', '/uploads/images/c_239956.png'),
(198, 'Aira Shiratori', '白鳥愛羅', '配角', 'Ayane Sakura', '__Relatives:__ [Father](https://anilist.co/character/349655/Aira-no-Chichi) After becoming aware of the existence of the supernatural after collecting a mysterious golden ball, Aira proclaims herself as the "chosen one" that is on a mission to protect the world from evil and directs her attention towards [Momo Ayase](https://anilist.co/character/222594/Momo-Ayase), believing that she is a demon that has to be stopped after seeing her use her psychic powers. Aira revels in her social status as the popular girl at Kami High and strives to maintain her reputation. Outwardly, she appears sweet, innocent, and somewhat air headed. However, internally, she is far more vain and prideful, a side she only shows to people she becomes close with. Whilst antagonistic towards Momo, she harbors feelings towards her close friend [Okarun](https://anilist.co/character/222593/Ken-Takakura). ~!She later gains the powers of a powerful spirit named [Acrobatic Silky](https://anilist.co/character/245467/Acrobatic-Sarasara) and becomes allies / friends with Momo and Okarun, learning to be more mindful of her actions and being more open with her true self.!~', '/uploads/images/c_245466.png'),
(198, 'Acrobatic Sarasara', 'アクロバティックさらさら', '配角', 'Kikuko Inoue', 'Acrobatic Silky took on the form of a tall woman with long silky black hair. She had a narrow face with hollowed eyes, wrinkles on the upper half of her face, and a permanent lipstick smile that exposes her teeth. She walked around barefooted while wearing a red wide brimmed hat and a red dress.', '/uploads/images/c_245467.png'),
(198, 'Jin Enjouji', '円城寺 仁', '配角', 'Kaito Ishikawa', 'Jin Enjouji is [Momo Ayase](https://anilist.co/character/222594/Momo-Ayase)''s childhood friend and first crush. After his parents were hospitalized as a result of his house being haunted, Enjouji moved in with Momo and [Seiko](https://anilist.co/character/234824/Seiko-Ayase) and transferred over to Momo''s school. Jiji comes off as being a very hyper-active young man who likes to express himself with dramatic mannerisms and expressions. He also has a habit of usually ending his sentences with strange verbal tics and is known to be very athletic and enjoy sports, primarily soccer. Past his initial over-the-top presentation, Jiji is a good-natured guy who deeply values his friendships and is committed to protecting those close to him, striving to improve himself and act as a reliable ally in moments of danger. Despite his immaturity, Jiji demonstrates a strong sense of accountability and empathy. ~!He later gets possessed by a mountain yokai called [the Evil Eye](https://anilist.co/character/309809/Jashi). Thus, whenever he touches cold water, Evil Eye comes out, and when he touches hot water, he is himself.!~', '/uploads/images/c_258506.png'),
(198, 'Naki Kitou', '鬼頭ナキ', '配角', 'Masako Isobe', 'Naki Kitou, the ringleader of the Kitou Family who for generations have been sacrificing people to the "tsuchinoko". ~!She is a subterranean.!~', '/uploads/images/c_270700.png'),
(198, 'Hana', '花', '配角', 'Fumi Hirano', 'Hana is an anthropomorphized anatomical model that resides with Ayase and Seiko.', '/uploads/images/c_270703.png'),
(198, 'Tarou', '太郎', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', 'Taro is an anthropomorphized anatomical model that resides at Ayase''s and Takakura''s school.', '/uploads/images/c_270704.png'),
(198, 'Penny Chinkosu', 'ぺニーチンコス', '配角', 'Tomokazu Seki', 'Peeny-Weeny, also known as the Dover Demon, is a Dover Demon''s Race, he works for the Serpo in order to earn money for [his son''s](https://anilist.co/character/270706/) blood transfusion.', '/uploads/images/c_270705.png'),
(198, 'Chiquitita', 'チキチータ', '配角', 'Naomi Oozora', 'The son of the [Dover Demon](https://anilist.co/character/270705/Penny-Chinkosu), also known as the Mantisian. He needed to ingest new blood every day, but his life was saved thanks to [Seiko](https://anilist.co/character/234824/Seiko-Ayase) and crew giving them a cow. Currently lives on Earth with his father.', '/uploads/images/c_270706.jpg'),
(198, 'Jibakurei Kani', '地縛霊蟹', '配角', '', 'Jibakurei Kani is an earthbound spirit that was previously bound to a tunnel in Shono City.', '/uploads/images/c_309807.png'),
(198, 'Jashi', '邪視', '配角', '', 'Jashi is a yokai who has spent years bound to the [Tsuchinoko](https://anilist.co/character/309811/Tsuchinoko) sacrificial house and is known for cursing humans to commit suicide with his gaze.', '/uploads/images/c_309809.jpg'),
(198, 'Tsubame', 'つばめ', '配角', 'Aya Yamane', 'Aira''s former closest friend at high school.', '/uploads/images/c_309812.png'),
(198, 'Dansei Kyoushi', '男性教師', '配角', 'Kousuke Echigoya', 'A staff member at the high school setting of Dandadan.', '/uploads/images/c_309814.png'),
(198, 'Serpod Dover Demon Nessie', 'セルポドーバーデーモンネッシー', '配角', '', 'Serupo Doubaadeemon Nesshii was the result of a Serupo fusing with the Dover Demon and Nessie as a last resort to eliminate Momo, Okarun and Aira.', '/uploads/images/c_309817.jpg'),
(198, 'Shouma', '翔馬', '配角', 'Hayato Kashiwazaki', 'Shouma is a young man who valued having a good reputation as an idol.', '/uploads/images/c_309820.png'),
(198, 'Momo no Motokare', 'モモの元彼', '配角', 'Ryuunosuke Watanuki', 'Momo''s first and former boyfriend.', '/uploads/images/c_309821.png'),
(198, 'Joou Sensei', '女王先生', '配角', 'Chiaki Takahashi', 'Joou is the school nurse of Momo Ayase and Okarun''s high school.', '/uploads/images/c_309822.png'),
(198, 'Nessie', 'ネッシー', '配角', '', 'Nessie, also called Kamissie by Okarun since the creature had previously arrived in Kamikoshi City, was a cryptid and a disgruntled subordinate of the Serpod.', '/uploads/images/c_309826.jpg'),
(198, 'Serpo Seijin', 'セルポ星人', '配角', 'Kazuya Nakai', 'Serupo Seijin are an entirely male alien race who come from Planet Serpo.', '/uploads/images/c_309827.png'),
(198, 'Flatwoods Monster', 'フラットウッズ・モンスター', '配角', 'Ryuuzaburou Ootomo', 'Furattouzzu Monsutaa was an alien that was first sighted in the American town of Flatwoods.', '/uploads/images/c_309828.png'),
(198, 'Miiko', 'ミーコ', '配角', 'Kaori Maeda', 'Miiko is the best friend and classmate of Momo Ayase and Kei in high school.', '/uploads/images/c_335283.png'),
(198, 'Muuko', 'ムーコ', '配角', 'Miyu Tomita', 'Best friend and classmate of Momo Ayase and Miko in high school.', '/uploads/images/c_335284.png'),
