(199, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Yoshiko Sakakibara', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(199, 'Megumi Fushiguro', '伏黒恵', '主角', 'Yuuma Uchida', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 175 cm (5''9") __Occupation:__ Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 2 Sorcerer __Cursed Technique:__ 10 Shadows Megumi is the deuteragonist of the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is a first-year student at Jujutsu High and also a descendant of the Zenin Family. While outwardly stoic and calculating, Megumi wishes to help protect people he sees as good or kind. He believes that the world is unfair and that a Sorcerer is a tool to ensure kind people are given more chances to live. Claiming it to be his selfish and irrational desire, he does not see himself as a hero for doing this.', '/uploads/images/c_126635.png'),
(199, 'Yuuji Itadori', '虎杖悠仁', '主角', 'Junya Enoki', '**Species:** Human **Height:** 173 cm (5''8") **Occupation:** Sorcerer, Student, Vessel **Affiliation:** Jujutsu High Yuuji is a fair person who cares greatly for not only his comrades but anyone he views as people with their own wills, despite how deep or shallow his connection to them is. He cares greatly for the "value of a life" and to this end, he will ensure that others receive a "proper death." He is easy to anger in the face of pure cruelty and unfair judgment of other people. He doesn''t have the born talent required to use cursed techniques, but he has incredible athletic abilities and he is considered very strong for his age, as shown by when he easily beat a coach in Steel Ball Throw.', '/uploads/images/c_127212.png'),
(199, 'Satoru Gojou', '五条悟', '配角', 'Yuuichi Nakamura', '__Height:__ 190 cm (6''3") __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer, Teacher __Affiliation:__ Tokyo Metropolitan Curse Technical College, Gojou Family __Grade:__ Special Grade Sorcerer __Cursed Technique:__ Six Eyes, Limitless Satoru Gojou is one of the main protagonists of the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is a special-grade jujutsu sorcerer and is widely recognized as the strongest in the world. Satoru is the pride of the Gojou Family, the first person to inherit both the Limitless and the Six Eyes in four hundred years. He works as a teacher at the Tokyo Jujutsu High and uses his influence to protect and train strong young allies', '/uploads/images/c_127691.png'),
(199, 'Yuuta Okkotsu', '乙骨憂太', '主角', 'Megumi Ogata', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Special Grade Sorcerer The main protagonist of Jujutsu Kaisen prequel series [Tokyo Metropolitan Curse Technical School](https://anilist.co/manga/105469/Tokyo-Toritsu-Jujutsu-Kodo-Senmon-Gakko). He was initially a Special Grade Cursed Victim haunted by his late childhood friend, [Rika Orimoto](https://anilist.co/character/208533/Orimoto-Rika). [Satoru Gojou](https://anilist.co/character/127691/Satoru-Gojou) mentored Yuuta and enrolled him at Tokyo Jujutsu High.', '/uploads/images/c_129571.jpg'),
(199, 'Nobara Kugisaki', '釘崎野薔薇', '配角', 'Asami Seto', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3") __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Tokyo Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 3 Sorcerer She is a first-year student and grade 3 jujutsu sorcerer at Tokyo Jujutsu High studying under [Satoru Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691) alongside [Yuji](https://anilist.co/character/127212) and [Megumi](https://anilist.co/character/126635). Nobara is a confident and brash young woman with an unshakable character. More than anything, Nobara is determined to stay true to herself no matter what. She takes great pride in being both a pretty girl and a strong fighter, refusing to let anyone influence her. Initially, Nobara can appear to be a very obnoxious and arrogant person. She first introduced herself to Yuji and Megumi by expressing how inferior they were. She also argued with Yuji for the greater part of their first mission together. Despite her abrasive attitude, Nobara is actually an incredibly caring and dutiful person, but would never let most people see that side of her. After fighting alongside each other in several missions, Yuji and Megumi grow to become Nobara''s closest allies.', '/uploads/images/c_133700.png'),
(199, 'Sukuna', '宿儺', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', '__Species:__ Human, Reincarnated Sorcerer According to the legend, Sukuna was a demon with four arms and two faces who lived in the golden era of sorcery 1000 years ago. Sorcerers of the era gave their all to defeat him, but to no avail. Without ever being defeated, his body was split into 20 separate indestructible cursed objects, which allowed him to live on and traverse the ages to come. In 2018, [Yuuji Itadori](https://anilist.co/character/127212/Itadori-Yuuji) consumed one of the aforementioned cursed objects, and Sukuna was reincarnated. ~!In reality, Sukuna was not a demon, but rather a deformed human sorcerer. His body was able to be split up into 20 cursed objects because he received assistance from [Kenjaku](https://anilist.co/character/289584).!~ Sukuna is hedonistic and has no regard for the suffering of others, believing that suffering is natural for the weak. He is selfish, and always wants to stay in control of the situation without caring about the consequences.', '/uploads/images/c_133701.png'),
(199, 'Kento Nanami', '七海建人', '配角', 'Kenjirou Tsuda', '__Height:__ 184 cm (6''0½") __Occupation:__ Sorcerer __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 1 Sorcerer __Cursed Technique:__ Ratio He is a Grade 1 Jujutsu Sorcerer and a Tokyo Jujutsu High alumni. Nanami is a very intelligent and reserved man who at first appears to be someone who is just very serious about his work. He knows how to separate sentimentalism from service and claims he''s only a Jujutsu Sorcerer because it''s slightly less idiotic than regular careers. As one of [Yuji''s](https://anilist.co/character/127212/Yuji-Itadori) mentors, Nanami is a complete contrast to [Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691/Satoru-Gojou), who is far more outspoken and easy-going.', '/uploads/images/c_133704.png'),
(199, 'Maki Zenin', '禪院真希', '配角', 'Mikako Komatsu', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") Maki Zenin is the older twin sister of [Mai Zenin](https://anilist.co/character/134168/Mai-Zenin). Maki is a grade 4 sorcerer and a second-year at Tokyo Metropolitan Jujutsu Technical High School. She is from the main branch of the Zenin clan, one of the "Prominent Three Families" of the Jujutsu world. She left the Zenin family in order to prove herself capable of being a Sorcerer after being deemed uncapable, since she lacks Cursed Energy. ~!Because Mai and Maki are monozygotic twins, their strength is considerably limited to one another. Monozygotic twins are considered as a single individual in the Jujutsu world and are a sign of bad omen.!~ ~!After the death of her twin sister Mai, Maki has lost all of her cursed energy and gained a Heavenly Restriction. This causes her skills and human capabilities to be on par with [Toji Fushiguro''s](https://anilist.co/character/162722/Touji-Fushiguro).!~', '/uploads/images/c_134167.png'),
(199, 'Mai Zenin', '禪院真依', '配角', 'Marina Inoue', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") Mai Zenin is the younger twin sister of [Maki Zenin](https://anilist.co/character/134167/Maki-Zenin). Mai is a grade 3 sorcerer and a second-year at Kyoto Jujutsu Technical High School. As a child, Mai always relied on Maki since she was afraid of Cursed Spirits. ~!Because Mai and Maki are monozygotic twins, their strength is considerably limited to one another. Monozygotic twins are considered as a single individual in the Jujutsu world and are a sign of bad omen.!~ ~!In chapter 149, Mai decides to sacrifice herself in order to make Maki stronger.!~', '/uploads/images/c_134168.jpg'),
(199, 'Panda', 'パンダ', '配角', 'Tomokazu Seki', '__Species:__ Cursed Corpse (varies among 3 personalities) __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ 2 He is a second-year at Tokyo Prefectural Jujutsu High. As a Metamorphosed Cursed Corpse, he is the best creation of Principal [Masamichi Yaga](https://anilist.co/character/189237/Masamichi-Yaga). He is sentient and has three cores inside the doll body: the youngest brother "Panda", the eldest brother "Gorilla" and a sister.', '/uploads/images/c_137974.jpg'),
(199, 'Aoi Toudou', '東堂葵', '配角', 'Subaru Kimura', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 190 cm __Occupation:__ Sorcerer, Student __Affiliation:__ Kyoto Jujutsu Technical High School __Grade:__ Grade 1 Sorcerer Toudou is a third-year student at Kyoto Jujutsu Technical High School who possesses inhuman physical strength, durability, and speed. ~!He is able to use a technique called Boogie Woogie, in which he can switch the position of two things that posses a certain amount of curse energy within his range.!~', '/uploads/images/c_137975.png'),
(199, 'Chousou', '脹相', '配角', 'Daisuke Namikawa', 'Chousou is half human and half cursed spirit and the first of the Death Painting Wombs with a Special Grade rank. He and his two brothers, [Kechizu](https://anilist.co/character/210832/Kechizu) and [Eso](https://anilist.co/character/210831/Esou) are Cursed Womb: Death Paintings who have sided with [Mahito](https://anilist.co/character/133702/Mahito)''s group. Chousou bears strong attachments to his brothers and is very overprotective of them. ~!However, after receiving a vision during his battle with Itadori, Chousou was eventually convinced that Sukuna''s vessel was actually one of his younger brothers. He then became furious at Mahito and the other cursed spirits for manipulating him into harming Itadori.!~ ~!Chousou is one of nine death painting wombs that came from a woman capable of giving birth to cursed spirit children. At some point, Chousou and his brothers were stored at the Jujutsu High, along with some of Sukuna''s fingers. As stated by Chousou himself, Noritoshi Kamo, the man who experimented on his mother is in fact his third "parent" due to him having mixed in his own blood into Chousou when his mother was pregnant with him. Although seemingly not remembering much about his own past, it is evident that Chousou himself remembers Noritoshi and holds a grudge against him for toying with his mother and siblings'' lives.!~', '/uploads/images/c_157116.png'),
(199, 'Takuma Ino', '猪野琢真', '配角', 'Yuu Hayashi', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Sorcerer __Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High __Grade:__ Grade 2 Sorcerer Takuma Ino is a grade 2 jujutsu sorcerer and a close associate of Kento Nanami who operates out of Tokyo Jujutsu High. Takuma Ino is a genuine and cheerful person with a more positive outlook on things than most jujutsu sorcerers. He doesn''t believe he''s the smartest person around and has a lot of respect for Nanami. Whenever Ino finds himself in a tough situation, he asks himself what would Nanami do.', '/uploads/images/c_157865.jpg'),
(199, 'Yoshinobu Gakuganji', '楽巌寺嘉伸', '配角', 'Mugihito', 'The principal of Kyoto Jujutsu Technical High School.', '/uploads/images/c_157867.png'),
(199, 'Momo Nishimiya', '西宮桃', '配角', 'Rie Kugimiya', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer __Affiliation:__ Kyoto Magic Technical College __Grade:__ Semi-Grade 2 Sorcerer __Cursed Technique:__ Tool Manipulation She is a third-year at Kyoto Magic Technical College.', '/uploads/images/c_157868.png'),
(199, 'Shouko Ieiri', '家入硝子', '配角', 'Aya Endou', '__Height:__ 168 cm __Ability:__ Reverse Healing Cursed Technique Alumnus of Tokyo Jujutsu High, having been classmates with [Satoru Gojo](https://anilist.co/character/127691) and [Suguru Geto](https://anilist.co/character/133699). After graduating into a full-fledged jujutsu sorcerer, Shoko became the school''s primary doctor.', '/uploads/images/c_158154.png'),
(199, 'Touji Fushiguro', '伏黒甚爾', '配角', '', 'Touji Fushiguro, born Touji Zenin, is the father of [Megumi Fushiguro](https://anilist.co/character/126635/). He took a job from the Star Religious Group to assassinate the Star Plasma Vessel.', '/uploads/images/c_162722.jpg'),
(199, 'Masamichi Yaga', '夜蛾正道', '配角', 'Takaya Kuroda', 'He is the current principal of Tokyo Metropolitan Jujutsu Technical High School, the creator of Panda, and the headmaster of Satoru Gojo, Suguru Geto and Shoko Ieiri. ~!After the Shibuya incident Yaga is given a death penalty by the higher ups for inciting Gojo and Geto in the past and "causing the Shibuya incident".!~', '/uploads/images/c_189237.png'),
(199, 'Tsumiki Fushiguro', '伏黒津美紀', '配角', '', '~! Megumi''s older sister.!~ ~! Tsumiki was unknowingly chosen by Kenjaku to be a participant of the Culling Game and made into the incarnated host of Yorozu !~', '/uploads/images/c_193479.png'),
(199, 'Wasuke Itadori', '虎杖倭助', '配角', 'Shigeru Chiba', 'Yuji''s Grandfather is shown to be a selfless, caring man who taught Yuji to help others. He was also short tempered and stubborn, to the point he would yell at Yuji for visiting him every day and buying him flowers. This temper meant that nobody else wanted to visit him and he tells his grandson to avoid dying alone.', '/uploads/images/c_194074.png'),
(199, 'Yuki Tsukumo', '九十九由基', '配角', 'Noriko Hidaka', 'One of the four Special Grade Sorcerers.', '/uploads/images/c_196502.png'),
(199, 'Kinji Hakari', '秤金次', '配角', 'Kazuya Nakai', 'Kinji Hakari is a character in the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is a third-year student at Tokyo Jujutsu High who is currently suspended for clashing with authority. While away from the school, Kinji is running a fight club between sorcerers for money.', '/uploads/images/c_197584.jpg'),
(199, 'Setsuko Sasaki', '佐々木せつこ', '配角', 'Mariya Ise', 'Sasaki is a second-year student at Sugisawa Third High School and a member of school''s Occult Research Club alongside her friends [Yuuji Itadori](https://anilist.co/character/127212/Yuuji-Itadori) and [Takeshi Iguchi](https://anilist.co/character/200767/Takeshi-Iguchi).', '/uploads/images/c_200765.jpg'),
(199, 'Takeshi Iguchi', '井口たけし', '配角', 'Takahiro Sumi', 'Iguchi is a second-year student at Sugisawa Third High School and a member of school''s Occult Research Club alongside his friends [Yuuji Itadori](https://anilist.co/character/127212/Yuuji-Itadori) and [Setsuko Sasaki](https://anilist.co/character/200765).', '/uploads/images/c_200767.png'),
(199, 'Atsuya Kusakabe', '日下部篤也', '配角', 'Shinichirou Miki', 'Atsuya Kusakabe is a character in Jujutsu Kaisen. He is a Grade 1 Sorcerer, and a teacher at Jujutsu High. ~!At the end of the Shibuya Incident Arc he blocks Kenjaku''s Maximum Uzumaki Technique.!~', '/uploads/images/c_205234.jpg'),
(199, 'Naoya Zenin', '禪院直哉', '配角', 'Kouji Yusa', 'Naoya Zenin is one of the sons of [Naobito Zenin](https://anilist.co/character/188432/Zenin-Naobito) and believes himself to be the true heir of the Zenin Family.', '/uploads/images/c_208204.jpg'),
(199, 'Rika Orimoto', '祈本里香', '配角', 'Kana Hanazawa', 'Rika Orimoto is the childhood friend of Yuta Okkotsu who tragically died when she was hit by a car. Her spirit was cursed, transforming her into a powerful Special Grade Vengeful Cursed Spirit worthy of the moniker "Queen of Curses".', '/uploads/images/c_208533.jpg'),
(199, 'Akari Nitta', '新田明', '配角', 'Sora Tokui', 'Akari Nitta is an Auxiliary Manager at Jujutsu High.', '/uploads/images/c_210846.png'),
(199, 'Tengen', '天元', '配角', 'Yoshiko Sakakibara', 'Tengen, often referred to as Master Tengen is a supporting character in Jujutsu Kaisen. They are an immortal jujutsu sorcerer that remains within their chamber; the Tombs of the Star Corridor at all times in order to reinforce the barriers that protect both Jujutsu High locations. Master Tengen is also known as the "Star". They were responsible for preaching the foundation of jujutsu sorcerers and spawning religious groups that worship the Star as their deity.', '/uploads/images/c_217291.png'),
(199, 'Hana Kurusu', '来栖華', '配角', '', 'Hana is a young girl with as light colored eyes and short light hair with bangs that curve inward. She wears a large turtleneck sweater, dark pants and heeled ankle boots. She appears to have a halo and a pair of wings.', '/uploads/images/c_220724.png'),
(199, 'Ogi Zenin', '禪院扇', '配角', 'Keiichi Sonobe', 'He is the brother of Naobito Zenin and father of Maki and Mai Zenin. He believes he couldn''t become head of the clan because his kids are worthless.', '/uploads/images/c_227443.jpg'),
(199, 'Ranta Zenin', '禪院蘭太', '配角', 'Shouya Chiba', 'He is a member of the Zenin Family and its elite unit of jujutsu sorcerers, the Hei. ~!He is later killed by Maki after confronting her with Jinichi.!~', '/uploads/images/c_229951.png'),
(199, 'Jinichi Zenin', '禪院甚壱', '配角', 'Hiroshi Shirokuma', 'He is a high ranking member of the Zenin Family and a member of its elite unit of jujutsu sorcerers, the Hei. ~!He is later decapitated by Maki after their confrontation.!~', '/uploads/images/c_229952.png'),
(199, 'Choujurou Zenin', '禪院長寿郎', '配角', 'Kazuho Takei', 'He is a member of the Zenin Family and its elite unit of jujutsu sorcerers, the Hei.', '/uploads/images/c_229953.png'),
(199, 'Nobuaki Zenin', '禪院信朗', '配角', 'Hinata Tadokoro', 'He is a member of the Zenin Family and captain of its Kukuru Unit, which is a unit specialized in martial arts for clan members that aren''t sorcerers. ~!He is later stabbed in the throat by Maki after confronting her in her rampage.!~', '/uploads/images/c_229954.png'),
(199, 'Kirara Hoshi', '星キララ', '配角', 'Yuuki Sakakihara', 'A third-year student at Tokyo Jujutsu High who is currently suspended for clashing with authority. While away from the school, Kirara has partnered with [Kinji](https://anilist.co/character/197584) while running his fight club. Their cursed technique is Interstellar Flight (Love Rendezvous), a complex technique whose motif is based on the Southern Cross constellation.', '/uploads/images/c_243828.png'),
(199, 'Hajime Kashimo', '鹿紫雲一', '配角', 'Ryouhei Kimura', 'Hajime Kashimo is a sorcerer from 400 years ago, currently inhabiting the body of someone Kenjaku prepared as a vessel, and has served as a player in the Culling Game, seeking to find and consequently battle Sukuna', '/uploads/images/c_248143.jpg'),
(199, 'Hiromi Higuruma', '日車寛見', '配角', 'Tomokazu Sugita', 'A defense lawyer who deems the Japanese justice system as unfair. After losing another case, he realizes his client was going to be ruled guilty from the beginning. With these negative emotions, he awakened his cursed power in the courtroom demanding a retrial. He is currently the top player of the Culling Game.', '/uploads/images/c_248818.png'),
(199, 'Miguel', 'ミゲル', '配角', 'Kouichi Yamadera', 'He was initially one of Suguru Geto''s commanders who wished to see him become king. Following the Night Parade of a Hundred Demons, Miguel was forcefully recruited by Satoru Gojo. He returned to his homeland of Africa and the community of sorcerers there to train Yuta Okkotsu.', '/uploads/images/c_272175.png'),
(199, 'Kurourushi', '黒沐死', '配角', 'Yukihiro Nozuyama', 'Kurourushi is a special grade cockroach cursed spirit released from Kenjaku''s Cursed Spirit Manipulation in order to participate in the Culling Game as a player.', '/uploads/images/c_276133.jpg'),
(199, 'Fumihiko Takaba', '髙羽史彦', '配角', 'Satoshi Tsuruoka', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Comedian He is a failing comedian who was turned into a sorcerer by [Kenjaku](https://anilist.co/character/289584/Kenjaku) in order to participate in the Culling Game. Fumihiko is an exceptionally goofy individual whose jokes aren''t funny, but he still lives to entertain above all else. He found himself failing as a comedian and was down on his luck. A co-worker encouraged him to keep going because there''s always a demand for comedians who think they''re funny. Takaba acts on those words and has a very energetic attitude. He''s very outspoken and comedy-focused in everything he does.', '/uploads/images/c_280467.png'),
(199, 'Ryu Ishigori', '石流龍', '配角', 'Hiroki Touchi', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer He is a jujutsu sorcerer from the past who was incarnated by [Kenjaku](https://anilist.co/character/289584/Kenjaku) to participate in the Culling Game as a player. Ryu is a classic hotshot that both men and women admire. In his past life, he enjoyed both a good fight and the company of ladies. Even though Ryu has no regrets, he likens his previous life to a "moderate eater" with no "dessert" to satisfy him. Ryu intends to use his second life to seek a worthy opponent to fulfill his insatiable hunger. Despite his persistent desire for combat, he appears calm and rational. [Yuta](https://anilist.co/character/129571/Okkotsu-Yuuta) further speculates that his point score in the Culling Game is a result of Ryu''s choice not to target ordinary citizens but also his indifference to their deaths due to collateral damage in his fights.', '/uploads/images/c_280468.png'),
(199, 'Takako Uro', '鳥鷺亨子', '配角', 'Nana Mizuki', '__Species:__ Human __Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer Takako Uro is a jujutsu sorcerer from the past who was incarnated by Kenjaku for the Culling Game. In her first life, Takako Uro was the captain of the Sun, Moon, and Stars Squad, a group of assassins affiliated with the Toh.', '/uploads/images/c_283136.jpg'),
(199, 'Jin Itadori', '虎杖仁', '配角', 'Toshiyuki Toyonaga', 'He is the father of [Yuji Itadori](https://anilist.co/character/127212/Yuuji-Itadori) and son of [Wasuke Itadori](https://anilist.co/character/194074/Wasuke-Itadori).', '/uploads/images/c_283137.png'),
(199, 'Kenjaku', '羂索', '配角', 'Takahiro Sakurai', '__Species:__ Human __Height:__ 183 cm __Occupation:__ Curse User __Cursed Technique:__ Cursed Spirit Manipulation Kenjaku is one of the primary antagonists of the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is an ancient sorcerer who pursues the goal of "evolving" humanity via cursed energy, thereby ushering in a new golden age of jujutsu sorcery paralleling the Heian Era. ~!Using his cursed technique that allows him to transplant his brain into different bodies to possess them, he has inhabited different people throughout the centuries, assuming different identities.!~', '/uploads/images/c_289584.jpg'),
(199, 'Hanyu', '羽生', '配角', 'Junko Takeuchi', 'Hanyu is a minor antagonist in the Jujutsu Kaisen series. ~!She and her partner Haba are Culling Game players who targeted rookies in the Tokyo No. 1 Colony until they were both defeated by [Yuuji Itadori](https://anilist.co/character/127212/Yuuji-Itadori).!~', '/uploads/images/c_306185.jpg'),
(199, 'Rin Amai', '甘井凛', '配角', 'Souma Saitou', 'Rin Amai is a minor character in the Jujutsu Kaisen series. ~!He was a citizen of Sendai City until he was involuntarily turned into a sorcerer by [Kenjaku](https://anilist.co/character/289584/Kenjaku) and forced to participate in the Culling Game.!~', '/uploads/images/c_306187.png'),
(199, 'Reggie Star', 'レジィ・スター', '配角', 'Yutaka Aoyama', 'He is a jujutsu sorcerer from the past ~!who was incarnated to participate in the Culling Game. Rejii led his own group of sorcerers and served as an antagonist for the Culling Game Arc.!~', '/uploads/images/c_306194.png'),
(199, 'Haba', '羽場', '配角', 'Eiji Takemoto', 'Haba is a minor antagonist in the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He and his partner Hanyu were Culling Game players who targetted rookies in the Tokyo No. 1 Colony ~!until they were both defeated by [Yuuji Itadori](https://anilist.co/character/127212/Yuuji-Itadori).!~', '/uploads/images/c_306197.png'),
(199, 'Remi', '麗美', '配角', 'Ari Ozawa', 'She was a normal human turned jujutsu sorcerer by [Kenjaku](https://anilist.co/character/289584/Kenjaku) for the Culling Game. ~!Remi aligned herself with [Reggie Star](https://anilist.co/character/306194/Reggie-Star)''s group who all serve as antagonists for the Culling Game Arc.!~', '/uploads/images/c_306240.png'),
(199, 'Iori Hazenoki', '黄櫨折', '配角', 'Ryouta Oosaka', 'He is a jujutsu sorcerer from the past ~!who was incarnated by [Kenjaku](https://anilist.co/character/289584/Kenjaku) for the Culling Game. Hazenoki aligned himself with [Reggie Star](https://anilist.co/character/306194/Reggie-Star)''s group, who all serve as antagonists for the Culling Game Arc.!~', '/uploads/images/c_306243.png'),
(199, 'Chizuru Hari', '針千釣', '配角', 'Toshitsugu Takashina', 'He was a jujutsu sorcerer participating in the Culling Game and was aligned with [Reggie Star](https://anilist.co/character/306194/Reggie-Star)''s group.', '/uploads/images/c_306245.png'),
(199, 'Dhruv Lakdawalla', 'ドルゥヴ・ラクダワラ', '配角', '', 'He is a jujutsu sorcerer from the past ~!who was incarnated by [Kenjaku](https://anilist.co/character/289584/Kenjaku) for the Culling Game. This is the second incarnation for the veteran sorcerer who once conquered Japan on his own during the Civil War of Wa.!~', '/uploads/images/c_306266.png'),
(199, 'Keita Oue', '大江圭太', '配角', 'Gen Satou', 'Keita Oue is a minor character in the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He was the defendant in a murder case where he was represented by [Hiromi Higuruma](https://anilist.co/character/248818/Hiromi-Higuruma) and unjustly found guilty.', '/uploads/images/c_306273.png'),
(199, 'Furudate', 'フルダテ', '配角', 'Tomomichi Nishimura', 'Furudate is a minor character in the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is the executor of [Naobito Zenin](https://anilist.co/character/188432/Naobito-Zenin)''s will.', '/uploads/images/c_306278.png'),
(199, 'Kaori Itadori', '虎杖香織', '配角', 'Megumi Hayashibara', 'Wife of Jin Itadori and the biological mother of Yuuji Itadori.', '/uploads/images/c_380084.png'),
(199, 'Maki to Mai no Haha', '真希と真依の母', '配角', 'Yurika Hino', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_385827.jpg'),
(199, 'Jurei', '呪霊', '配角', 'Shitan En', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_385828.jpg'),
(199, 'Ken-san', 'ケンさん', '配角', 'Kendo Kobayashi', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_386892.png'),
(199, 'Senpai Geinin', '先輩芸人', '配角', 'Shinichi Yamada', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_386893.png'),
(199, 'Kankyaku', '観客', '配角', 'Mitsuo Iwata', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_386894.jpg'),
(199, 'Takeru', 'タケル', '配角', 'Mayumi Shintani', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_388743.jpg'),
(199, 'John☆Bobby', 'ジョン☆ボビ', '配角', 'Takahiro Kameoka', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_388744.png'),
(199, 'Kusakabe no Imouto', '日下部の妹', '配角', 'Yurika Aizawa', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_388745.png'),
(199, 'Shikaku', '刺客', '配角', 'Kentarou Takano', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_388746.png'),
(199, 'Club Member', 'クラブのメンバー', '配角', 'Souichi Abe', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_388747.jpg'),
(199, 'Kankyakutachi', '観客達', '配角', 'Taihi Kimura', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_388748.jpg'),
(199, 'Kogane', 'コガネ', '配角', 'Neeko', 'Shikigami that act as the interface of the Culling Game, serving as the liaison between the player and the game. Each Culling Game player receives a Kogane that services them as their main point of contact with the Culling Game. It goes over the rules with each player and tells them every time they''ve scored points. Any non-players who decide to declare participation will need to confirm with Kogane upon entering a barrier colony. Kogane also allows the players to contact the game master in order to negotiate new rules. Kogane will announce newly added rules to their players in a different voice than when acting as a liaison for a player.', '/uploads/images/c_389616.png'),
(199, 'Mihari', '見張り', '配角', 'Shoumaru Zouza', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_389617.jpg'),
(199, 'Judgeman', 'ジャッジマン', '配角', 'Mie Sonozaki', 'Shikigami connected to Hiromi Higuruma''s innate cursed technique and serves as the judge for his Domain Expansion, Deadly Sentencing.', '/uploads/images/c_392884.jpg'),
(200, 'Narrator', 'ナレーター', '配角', 'Banjou Ginga', 'This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven''t been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work. Please add other narrator characters, which were given a visual representation of themselves, separately from this narrator page.', '/uploads/images/c_36309.jpg'),
(200, 'Jin-U Seong', '성진우', '主角', 'Taito Ban', '__Class:__ Mage __Relatives:__ [Park Kyung-Hye](https://anilist.co/character/209396/KyungHye-Park) (Mother), [Seong Jin-Ah](https://anilist.co/character/138791/JinAh-Sung) (Sister), ~![Seong Il-Hwan](https://anilist.co/character/138790/IlHwan-Sung) (Father), [Cha Hae-In](https://anilist.co/character/138789/HaeIn-Cha) (Wife), [Seong Su-Ho](https://anilist.co/character/306654/Suho-Sung) (Son)!~ ~!__Guild:__ Ahjin Guild (Guild Master) __Affiliation:__ Korean Hunters Association (helper), White Tiger Guild (helper), Hunters Guild (helper), Knights Guild (helper), Ahjin Guild (Guild Master)!~ Seong Jin-U is known as an infamously weak E-Rank Hunter. He is a humble and benevolent individual who cares deeply for his family and has an ardent desire to become stronger. As a result, he shares a close relationship with his sister and his mother, and rarely wastes an opportunity to refine his skills and gain more power. ~!He becomes an S-Rank hunter after being given a chance to become stronger by the System.!~', '/uploads/images/c_129928.png'),
(200, 'Chi-Yul Song', '송치율', '配角', 'Eiji Hanawa', '__Magic Type:__ Fire Korean C-Rank Hunter and kumdo teacher. He is also one of Jinwoo''s old friends, having known him since he was a E-Rank Hunter.', '/uploads/images/c_136073.png'),
(200, 'Ju-Hui Lee', '이주희', '配角', 'Rina Honizumi', 'She is a healer with rank B.', '/uploads/images/c_136074.png'),
(200, 'Dong-Su Hwang', '황동수', '配角', 'Junichi Suwabe', 'Hwang Dong-su is an​ S-class hunter who works for Scavenger''s Guild in America.', '/uploads/images/c_136075.png'),
(200, 'Jin-Ho Yu', '유진호', '配角', 'Genta Nakamura', '__Class:__ Tanker __Guild:__ ~!Ahjin Guild (Vice-Guild Master)!~ Yoo Jin-Ho is a D rank hunter and is [Jin-U Seong](https://anilist.co/character/129928/JinWoo-Sung)''s faithful assistant and combat partner.', '/uploads/images/c_136076.jpg'),
(200, 'Yun-Ho Baek', '백윤호', '配角', 'Hiroki Touchi', 'He is a S rank hunter and master of the White Tiger guild.', '/uploads/images/c_136077.png'),
(200, 'Jin-Cheol U', '우진철', '配角', 'Makoto Furukawa', 'An A rank hunter that works for Hunter''s association of Korea.', '/uploads/images/c_136819.png'),
(200, 'Hae-In Cha', '차해인', '配角', 'Reina Ueda', '__Guild:__ Hunters Guild __Class:__ Sword Fighter __Affiliations:__ Jeju Island Raid Party, [Song Chi-Yul](https://anilist.co/character/136073/ChiYul--Song)’s Dojo (Disciple) Cha Hae-In is the Vice-Guild Master of the Hunters Guild. She is an S rank hunter and the 9th ranked hunter in South Korea. She possesses the unique ability of mana smell and hates the smell of hunters except for [Sung Jin-Woo](https://anilist.co/character/129928/JinWoo-Sung).', '/uploads/images/c_138789.png'),
(200, 'Il-Hwan Seong', '성일환', '配角', 'Rikiya Koyama', 'Il-Hwan is a muscular middle-aged man with black eyes, shaggy black hair, and slight facial hair. When using his powers or agitated, his eyes glows bright yellow.', '/uploads/images/c_138790.jpg'),
(200, 'Jin-A Seong', '성진아', '配角', 'Haruna Mikawa', '[Jin-U](https://anilist.co/character/129928)''s younger sister.', '/uploads/images/c_138791.png'),
(200, 'Geon-Hui Go', '고건희', '配角', 'Banjou Ginga', 'Go Gun-Hee (고건희) is a South Korean S-Rank Hunter and the Chairman of the Korean Hunters Association.', '/uploads/images/c_138792.png'),
(200, 'Song-I Han', '한송이', '配角', 'Miyu Tomita', 'Han Song-I is an E-Rank hunter who quit school after gaining money through the Yoo Jin-Ho and Sung Jin-Woo motley group of party. She is friends with Sung Jin-Ah. She first appeared when Jin-Ah visited Jin-Woo in the hospital but she didn''t know him then.', '/uploads/images/c_138793.png'),
(200, 'Jong-In Choi', '최종인', '配角', 'Daisuke Hirakawa', 'Choi Jong-In is one of the 10 S-Rank Hunters of South Korea. He is also the Guild Master of the Hunters Guild.', '/uploads/images/c_138794.png'),
(200, 'Igris', '이그리트', '配角', '', 'Igris is one of the first Shadows that [Sung Jin-Woo](https://anilist.co/character/129928/Seong-Jin-U) acquired. He was initially protecting an empty throne in an Instant Dungeon where Jin-Woo was doing his Job Quest in the Job Change Quest Dungeon. After two failed attempts of Shadow Extraction, Sung Jin-Woo convinced him to protect him instead of protecting an Empty throne, obtaining him as a Knight Grade Shadow.', '/uploads/images/c_145722.png'),
(200, 'Byeong-Gu Min', '민병구', '配角', 'Junya Enoki', 'Min Byung-Gu was a retired hunter and one of the 10 S-Rank and only S-Rank Healer of South Korea. He was a close friend with the White Tiger''s Guild Master Baek Yoon-Ho. He took part in the 4th Jeju Island Reclamation Raid and was a member of the Korean Raid Team tasked with killing the boss of the Jeju Island Gate.', '/uploads/images/c_148789.png'),
(200, 'Beru ', '베르', '配角', 'Akira Ishida', 'Born from the Ant Queen on Jeju Island, The Ant King becomes the main threat during the Fourth Jeju Island Raid. ~!Single-handedly responsible for the deaths of over 8 of the 16 S-Rank Hunters during the raid.!~ ~!After being killed by Sung Jinwoo, the Ant King was revived as one of his shadow soldiers, and was given him the new name of Beru.!~', '/uploads/images/c_159849.png'),
(200, 'Esil Radiru', '에실 라디르', '配角', 'Riho Sugiyama', 'Esil Radiru, or Elisa Radiru, is a daughter of the Radiru chief and an Aristocratic Demon found at the S-Rank Demon''s Castle Instant Dungeon.', '/uploads/images/c_164675.png'),
(200, 'Atsushi Kumamoto', '쿠마모토 아츠시', '配角', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'Atsushi Kumamoto is one of Japan''s strongest S-Rank Hunters. He is a member of Japan''s most powerful guild, the Draw Sword Guild led by Goto Ryuji.', '/uploads/images/c_174040.png'),
(200, 'Goto Ryuji', '고토 류지', '配角', 'Satoshi Mikami', 'Goto Ryuji is Japan''s strongest S-Ranked Hunter and the Guild Master of Draw Sword Guild, one of the most powerful guilds in Asia.', '/uploads/images/c_181154.png'),
(200, 'Myung-Han Yu', '유명한', '配角', 'Shunsuke Sakuya', 'Yu Myung-Han (유명한) is Jin-Ho''s father and the CEO of Yoojin Construction.', '/uploads/images/c_184530.png'),
(200, 'Min-Sung Lee', '이민성', '配角', 'Gen Satou', 'Famous Korean actor, known as Asia''s biggest movie star. He is also an A-Rank Hunter.', '/uploads/images/c_184535.png'),
(200, 'Hee-Jin Park', '박희진', '配角', 'Ruriko Aoki', 'Park Hee-Jin (박희진) is a member of White Tiger Guild that Sung Jin-Woo helped when they got stuck inside the Red Gate.', '/uploads/images/c_184538.png'),
(200, 'Thomas Andre', '트마스아드레', '配角', '', 'Thomas Andre (트마스 아드레) is one of only 5 National Level Hunters that exist and is considered to be the strongest Tank on Earth. He is also the Guild Master of the Scavenger Guild.', '/uploads/images/c_184540.png'),
(200, 'Ki-Hoon Son', '손기훈', '配角', 'Takaaki Torashima', 'Son Ki-Hoon (손기훈) is the Team Leader of Attack Force B of the Hunters Guild.', '/uploads/images/c_184541.png'),
(200, 'Minoru Hoshino', '호시노미노루', '配角', 'Jun  Kasama', 'Minoru Hoshino (호시노 미노루) is one of Japan''s strongest S-Rank Hunters. He is a member of Japan''s strongest guild, the Draw Sword Guild led by Goto Ryuji.', '/uploads/images/c_184543.png'),
(200, 'Tank', '탱크', '配角', 'Shouta Yamamoto', 'Shadow of an ice bear that Jinwoo encountered during the Red Gate Incident.', '/uploads/images/c_184545.png'),
(200, 'Kaisel', '카이셀', '配角', '', 'Kaisel is a shadow Sung Jin-Woo obtained in the Demon Castle. Kaisel is the shadow of Kaisellin, a Drake/Wyvern that Demon King Baran used as a mount. Kaisel used to be a mount that the Demon King Baran rode in battle. After Sung Jin-Woo''s fight, he looks around and found that Iron already killed Kaisellin, dragging his corpse towards Sung Jin-Woo. After he was extracted, his grade was Knight, which concludes he was at least an A-Rank.', '/uploads/images/c_184546.png'),
(200, 'Kei', '케이', '配角', 'Tetsuya Kakihara', 'Kei (케이) was one of Japan''s strongest S-Rank Hunters who was a member of the Draw Sword Guild, the strongest guild in japan led by Goto Ryuji. He was a powerful mage class hunter specializing in ice magic.', '/uploads/images/c_184547.png'),
(200, 'Reiji Sugimoto', '스기모토레이지', '配角', 'Yuuya Uchida', 'Reiji Sugimoto is the Vice-Master of Draw Sword Guild, the second most powerful guild in Asia. During the 4th Jeju Island Reclamation Raid, Reiji Sugimoto did not directly participate in the raid like his guild master Goto Ryuji. However, he was onboard the second DDH-184, one of the numerous Japanese boats surrounding the island.', '/uploads/images/c_184549.png'),
(200, 'Mari Ishida', '이시다마리', '配角', 'Yuuko Natsuyoshi', 'Mari Ishida was one of Japans strongest S-Rank Hunters. ~!She was effortlessly killed during the 4th Jeju Island Reclamation Raid.!~', '/uploads/images/c_184551.png'),
(200, 'Ippei Izawa', '이자와잇페이', '配角', 'Kento Itou', 'One of Japan''s strongest S-Rank Hunters. He took part in the 4th Jeju Island Reclamation Raid.', '/uploads/images/c_184552.png'),
(200, 'Zhigang Liu', '류즈캉', '配角', 'Tomokazu Seki', 'Zhigang Liu is one of the top five National Level Hunters in the world. Zhigang, who originated from China, was hired by the United States Government to aid with the first S-Rank Gate that appeared in the US.', '/uploads/images/c_184553.png'),
(200, 'Dong-Wook Ma', '마동욱', '配角', 'Akio Ootsuka', 'Ma Dong-Wook (마동욱) is one of the 10 S-Rank hunters of South Korea and the guild master of Fame Guild.', '/uploads/images/c_184555.png'),
(200, 'Baruka', '바루카', '配角', 'Ryuuji Satou', 'S-Rank Ice Elf and the boss of the Red Gate Dungeon.', '/uploads/images/c_184954.png'),
(200, 'Iron', '아이언', '配角', 'Shouta Yamamoto', 'A shadow Sung Jin-Woo gained after entering the Red Gate. ~!Before being reawakened as a Shadow he was Chul Kim (김철), an A-Rank Hunter of the White Tiger Guild.!~', '/uploads/images/c_184956.png'),
(200, 'Tusk', '어금니', '配角', 'Kenta Miyake', 'A shadow Sung Jin-Woo gained after entering the Hunters Guild Gate. ~!Tusk is a shadow of Kargalgan, originally a High Orc Shaman defeated by Jinwoo Sung during the Hunters Guild Gate Arc. After being resurrected, Tusk becomes one of Jinwoo''s most potent magic users, known for his devastating area-of-effect spells and high intelligence. Even as a Shadow, Tusk kept his powerful abilities and spells, making him just as capable and even stronger than when he was alive.!~', '/uploads/images/c_184957.png'),
(200, 'Kyung-Hye Park', '박경혜', '配角', 'Yuri Amano', 'Park Kyung-He is the mother of Jin-U and Jin-Ah. She was in the hospital because of the Eternal Sleep. Her sickness served as the primary motivation for Jin-U becoming a hunter alongside his desire to support his sister with the absence of their father.', '/uploads/images/c_209396.png'),
(200, 'Hanekawa', '하네카와', '配角', 'Nanako Mori', 'Hanekawa is a member and official translator of Japan''s most powerful Guild, Draw Sword. Despite serving primarily as a translator of Japan''s best hunter, Goto Ryuji, she is also an A-Rank Hunter.', '/uploads/images/c_209397.png'),
(200, 'Akari Shimizu', '시미즈 아카리', '配角', 'Nene Hieda', 'Japanese S-Rank healer and a member of the Draw Sword Guild.', '/uploads/images/c_209901.png'),
(200, 'Gina', '지나', '配角', 'Kotomi Aihara', 'Gina is an A-Rank mage and was one of the Raid Members in Son Ki-Hoon''s Party in an A-Ranked Gate. She has long blonde hair and deep red eyes. Her height is average and she has a very attractive body. Gina has a serious personality this can be seen when she answers Son Ki-Hoon''s question about if she was responsible for killing one of the High Orcs.', '/uploads/images/c_210098.png'),
(200, 'Michael Connor', '마이클 코너', '配角', 'Taisuke Nakano', 'Michael Connor is the Deputy Director of the Federal Bureau of Hunters.', '/uploads/images/c_217286.png'),
(200, 'Kenzo Tanaka', '타나카 켄죠', '配角', 'Tomoaki Maeno', 'Kenzo Tanaka is a Japanese S-Rank Hunter who specialized in melee combat and a member of the Draw Sword Guild.', '/uploads/images/c_306508.png'),
(200, 'Tatsumi Fujishima', '후지시마 타츠미', '配角', 'Chiharu Sawashiro', 'Tatsumi Fujishima is a Japanese S-Rank Hunter and a member of the Draw Sword Guild.', '/uploads/images/c_306509.png'),
(200, 'Tae-Gyu Lim', '임태규', '配角', 'Kousuke Toriumi', 'Tae-Gyu Lim is a Korean S-Rank hunter who specializes in archery magic and the Guild Master of the Fiend Guild.', '/uploads/images/c_306512.png'),
(200, 'Yun-Tae Jeong', '정윤탷', '配角', 'Tomohiro Oono', 'Yoontae Jung is a Korean A-Rank Hunter under the Knights Guild.', '/uploads/images/c_306513.png'),
(200, 'Jong-Su Park', '박종수', '配角', 'Kazuyuki Okitsu', 'Jongsoo Park is a Korean A-Rank Hunter and the Guild Master of the Knights Guild.', '/uploads/images/c_306514.png'),
(200, 'Kanae Tawata', '타와타 카나에', '配角', 'Yui Ishikawa', 'Kanae Tawata is a Japanese S-Rank Hunter under the Draw Sword Guild.', '/uploads/images/c_306517.png'),
(200, 'Baran', '바란', '配角', 'Shouta Yamamoto', 'King of Demons and the Monarch of White Flames.', '/uploads/images/c_306643.png'),
(200, 'Shigeo Matsumoto', '마쓰모토 시게오', '配角', 'Naoya Uchida', 'Shigeo Matsumoto was the Chairman of the Japanese Hunters Association.', '/uploads/images/c_306649.png'),
(200, 'Sang-Min Ahn', '안상민', '配角', 'Hironori Kondou', 'Sangmin Ahn is the chief of the White Tiger Guild''s 2nd Division Management Department.', '/uploads/images/c_306652.png'),
(200, 'Sang-Sik Kim', '김상식', '配角', 'Manta Yamamoto', 'Sang-Sik Kim is a Korean D-Rank Hunter. ~!He was a survivor of the Double Dungeon. He was tragically killed by [Tae-Shik Kang](https://anilist.co/character/181155/TaeShik-Kang) after accidentally witnessing him kill a man during a raid.!~', '/uploads/images/c_306674.png'),
(200, 'Ki-Joong Yoon', '윤기중', '配角', 'Hayato Kaneko', 'Kijoong Yoon is a Korean C-Rank Hunter under the White Tiger Guild. ~!He is one of the five survivors of the Red Gate Incident.!~', '/uploads/images/c_306676.png'),
(200, 'Myung-Hwan Go', '고명환', '配角', 'Takehisa Hirose', 'Myung-Hwan Go is a Korean C-Rank Hunter under the White Tiger Guild.', '/uploads/images/c_306678.png'),
(200, 'Ki-Cheol Hyeon', '현기철', '配角', 'Ayato Morinaga', 'Kichul Hyun is the deputy manager of the White Tiger Guild''s 2nd Division Management Department and Sangimn Ahn''s assistant.', '/uploads/images/c_306680.png'),
(200, 'Eun-Seok', '은석', '配角', 'Takuma Terashima', 'Former Korean S-Rank Hunter. ~!About one year before the events of the main storyline, Eunseok participated in the 3rd Jeju Island Raid alongside Baek Yoonho and Min Byung-Gyu. Unfortunately, the raid went sideways and Eunseok was killed under unknown circumstances.!~', '/uploads/images/c_323043.png'),
(200, 'Bo-Ra Lee', '이보라', '配角', 'Riria Ito', 'A-Rank Mage from the Hunters Guild who specializes in summoning magic.⁣ She is straightforward, very meticulous, and believes that the only way to overcome difficulties is by laying out the known facts.', '/uploads/images/c_326616.png'),
(200, 'Vulcan', 'ヴォルカン', '配角', 'Shouta Yamamoto', 'S-Ranked magic beast. Vulcan was the second boss of the Demon Castle and the Ruler of the Lower Floors.', '/uploads/images/c_353704.png'),
(200, 'Se-Mi Han', '한세미', '配角', 'Sayaka Senbongi', 'Korean A-Rank Hunter and a healer serving under the Hunters Guild, assigned to Strike Squad B.', '/uploads/images/c_354512.png'),
(200, 'Yun-Seok Bae', '배윤석', '配角', 'Kanehira Yamamoto', 'Leader of the Hunters Guild''s Mining Team.', '/uploads/images/c_354513.png'),
(200, 'Seok-Jin Sin', '신석진', '配角', 'Shouya Ishige', 'Pro Hunter working for the Hunters Guild. He is on Strike Team B.', '/uploads/images/c_356080.png'),
(200, 'Ji-U Seo', '서지우', '配角', 'Mayuko Kazama', 'Korean A-Rank Hunter and a fighter serving under the Hunters Guild, assigned to Strike Squad B.', '/uploads/images/c_356081.png'),
(200, 'Myung-Cheol', '명철', '配角', 'Masaya Fukunishi', 'Korean Hunter serving under the Hunters Guild, assigned to Strike Squad B.', '/uploads/images/c_356083.png'),
(200, 'Eun-Su Kim', '김은수', '配角', 'Keisuke Koumoto', 'Korean B-Rank Hunter serving under the Hunters Guild, assigned to Strike Squad B.', '/uploads/images/c_356084.png'),
(200, 'Geon-Guk Lee', '이건국', '配角', 'Motoki Sakuma', NULL, '/uploads/images/c_356085.png'),
(200, 'Rakan', '라칸', '配角', 'Hiroshi Shirokuma', 'King of Beasts and the Monarch of Fangs.', '/uploads/images/c_360010.png')
;
INSERT INTO sekai_dataobject_anime_quote (series_id, character_id, character_name, content, episode, time_point, audio_url) VALUES
(169, 8906, 'マキマ', '「はい」か「ワン」で答えればいい、「いいえ」と言う犬はいらない。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, 8906, 'マキマ', '「すべての悪魔は名前を持って生まれます。 その名を恐れれば恐れるほど、悪魔そのものが強力になる」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, 8906, 'マキマ', '「あなたが言う必要悪は、あなたが行う悪事を正当化する言い訳にすぎません。 社会はその言い訳をする必要はありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, 8906, 'マキマ', '「死が私たちをバラバラにするまで、私たちは一緒に働きます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, 8906, 'マキマ', '「パートナーを知れば知るほど、エッチなことが気持ちよくなる。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, 8920, 'ポチタ', '「代わりに、私の心をあげます..あなたの夢を見せてください.」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, NULL, 'こべに東山', '"ごめんなさい！ ごめんなさい！ 辞めるから殺さないで！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, NULL, 'こべに東山', '「もう我慢できない…こんな仕事をしていると頭がおかしくなる」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, NULL, 'こべに東山', '「私も大学に行きたかった。 でもここで死ぬ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, NULL, '力', '「この詐欺師は私にそうするように言いました！ 悪魔は嘘をつかない！ 嘘をつくのは人間だけだ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, NULL, '力', '「あなたが私の話を真実だと思ったなんて信じられない。 人間は本当に愚かだ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, NULL, '力', '「人間よ、我が前にひれ伏せ！ 私の名前はパワーです！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, NULL, '力', '"人間！ 早く何かを殺させてくれ！ 血が渇く！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, NULL, '力', '「デンジ、これ見て！ そして世界に伝えよう……力は最強だと！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, NULL, '力', '「人間嫌い！ 彼らが私に何かをしたからではありません。 悪魔のような本能です。 私はただそうします。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, NULL, '早川亜希', '「雌犬がトラブルメーカーであることは事実です...そして、彼が去ったとしても、誰も影響を受けません. しかし、彼は銃の悪魔を殺そうとしています...私は銃の悪魔を殺すことはできません.彼を殺すために...私は彼に立ち向かうことができるすべての有能な悪魔のハンターの助けが必要です. 命が縮んでも……デンジを殺させはしない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, NULL, '早川亜希', '「敵は敵……使うだけ。 仲良くする気はありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, NULL, '早川亜希', '「新しいハンターはどちらも強いと思いますし、私のハンターは死んだり、民間部門に移ったりすることはありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, NULL, '早川亜希', '「私の家族を殺した者も、仲間を殺した者も生きている。 それで、私は何のために辞めるのですか？', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, NULL, '早川亜希', '「殺したい奴を殺せるなら、次に何が起こっても構わない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, NULL, '早川亜希', '「たとえ寿命が縮んでも……デンジを殺させはしない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, 8909, '岸辺', '「俺は最強のデビルハンター。 だから俺を倒せる悪魔は最強だ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, 8909, '岸辺', '「ほら、悪魔が怖がるデビルハンターってネジが一番緩んでるやつだからな」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, 8912, '姫野', '「依存症を持つことはとても素晴らしいことです。 この人生では、エッジを取り除く何かが必要です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, 8912, '姫野', '「死なないでアキ…死んだら泣いてほしい」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, 8913, 'レゼ', '"教えてあげる！ 知らないこと、できないこと。 全部教えます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1378, '黒崎一心', '「マサキが死んだのは誰のせいでもない。 ただ……私が恋に落ちた女性は……息子を守って死ぬことのできる女性だった。 そして、忘れないでください。 あなたは男です…私が愛した女性は守るために命を捧げました.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1378, '黒崎一心', '「元気に生きてね、一護。 よく生き、よく年をとり、よく禿げ、そして私の後に死ぬ。 そして……できることなら、笑顔で死ね」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1378, '黒崎一心', '「あなたの心が望むようにしなさい！ お父さんの胸に飛び込め！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1378, '黒崎一心', '「言うほど嫌いじゃなかった。 そのくぼみ、つまり。 20年間、何も考えずに本当に嫌だったことがあるとすれば、それはあの夜、マサキを助けられなかったことだろう」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1378, '黒崎一心', '「ああ！ 大丈夫、ゆず、泣かないで！ パパが本当に面白いものを見せてあげるよ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1378, '黒崎一心', '「基本の一つです……だから教えます。 隊長級の死神は斬魄刀の大きさを自在に操れるんだっけ？ そうでなければ、誰もが巨大な剣を持ち歩くことになるだろう.あなたのように. これをよく覚えておいてください。 斬魄刀の大きさだけではライバルの強さは計り知れない。 それを理解するまでは死神の講義をするべきではない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1378, '黒崎一心', '「Good Moooorning Ichigooooo!」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, NULL, '–立花直人', '「私の妹を救うことができるのはあなただけです。」 –立花直人', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, 8691, '花垣武道', '「自分の人生がこのように終わるとは思っていませんでした。 私は壁の薄いボロボロのアパートに住んでいます。 私より年下のマネージャーは、私をバカ扱いします。 子供たちにもからかわれて、謝らなければなりませんでした。 中学時代の彼女は一人しかいません。 どこで間違ったの？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, 8691, '花垣武道', '「立花を救いたいという気持ちなら直人には負けない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, 8691, '花垣武道', '「私は戦わなければならない。 逃げられない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, 8691, '花垣武道', '「すっかり忘れてた!! 「私」はただの「私」です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, 8691, '–花垣武道', '「私はあきらめていません！ あきらめないために、私には理由があります。」 –花垣武道', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, 8691, '花垣武道', '「これが本当なら、未来を変えたい」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, 8691, '花垣武道', '「二度目の人生でも、失敗は失敗のまま」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, 8691, '–花垣武道', '「死ぬと思った瞬間、日向立花を思い出しました。」 –花垣武道', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, 8691, '–花垣武道', '「勝ちたいのなら、実際に私を殺さなければならないでしょう。」 –花垣武道', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, 8691, '–花垣武道', '「私は今、真剣に最も恥ずかしがり屋の気分になっています。 腹を立ててください、さもないと私はあなたを殺します。」 –花垣武道', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, NULL, '–マイキー', '「彼は、私たちが国全体を一緒に所有することを私に約束したので、そのような不誠実なことは決してありませんでした。」 –マイキー', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, NULL, 'マイキー', '「俺のストリートタカに指を一本当てたら、お前を殺してやる」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, NULL, '–マイキー', '「トーマンは私のものです。 私がバックグラウンドに立っている限り、誰も失うことはできません。」 –マイキー', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, NULL, '–マイキー', '「あなたたちはグループなしでは行動することさえできません。 地獄が欲しいの？」 –マイキー', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, NULL, '–ドラケン', '「戦うのが得意な人はたくさんいますが、あなたのような人はあまりいません、武道。」 –ドラケン', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, NULL, 'ドラケン', '「私たちは私たち自身の世界で私たちの問題に対処します。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, NULL, '–ドラケン', '「頭を下げる必要はありません。 他人を気遣う心を持っているだけです。」 –ドラケン', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, NULL, 'ドラケン', '「諦めきれない時もある」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(163, NULL, 'あっくん', '「みんなを救ってください。 私たちの泣き虫ヒーロー!!」 ・あっくん', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(107, 5946, 'アスタ', '「魔法に恵まれないことがずっと嫌だった。 でも、その代わりに素晴らしいチームメイトに恵まれました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(107, 5946, 'アスタ', '「私の魔法は決してあきらめない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(107, 5946, 'アスタ', '「生きていると、理由や希望を失います。 でも、続けていくと、新しい理由と希望が見えてきます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(107, 5946, 'アスタ', '「魔力がなくても……魔法帝になる」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(107, 5946, 'アスタ', '「生まれた時からずっと逆境！ あなたが何人いても、何が起こっても、私はすべてを乗り越えます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(107, 5946, 'アスタ', '「俺は魔法帝になる！ これは私が決してあきらめないものです！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(107, 5946, 'アスタ', '「表紙で本を判断しないでください。 彼女の事情を知らないでしょ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(107, 5946, 'アスタ', '「あきらめなければ、必ず乗り越えられる」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(107, 5946, 'アスタ', '「私たちは血のつながった家族ではないかもしれませんが、将来作るすべてのチームメイトを家族として扱うべきです!」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(107, 5946, 'アスタ', '「砂利は砂利かもしれませんが、私は？ 私はダイヤを砕く砂利だ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(107, NULL, 'ヴァネッサ・エノテカ', '「自分の力で運命を打ち負かすことができないときは、友人やチームに頼ることになります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(107, 5984, 'フエゴレオン・ヴァーミリオン', '「弱いことは恥ずかしいことじゃない……弱いことは恥ずかしいことじゃない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(107, 5954, 'ヤミ・スケヒロ', '「王族が失敗作とされたのは初めて見ました… 抵抗したいなら、私と一緒に来てください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(107, 5954, 'ヤミ・スケヒロ', '「あなたの大切なものを守りなさい。 いつの日か、他の何かを守るように導くでしょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(107, 5954, 'ヤミ・スケヒロ', '「限界を超えろ。 いまここで。"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, '春野サクラ', '「私たち一人一人が、自分の力でできることをしなければなりません! どうせ死ぬなら、何もしないよりは戦って死ぬ方がましだ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, '春野サクラ', '「最も重要なことは書かれていない。 図書. 自分で経験することでそれらを学ばなければなりません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, '春野サクラ', '「私はいつも自分が本当の忍者だと思っていました…でも、サスケとナルトが常にリードしていたので、それはただの空虚な言葉でした! でも今度は私が主導権を握る番です。皆さんは後ろから私を見守ることができます!」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, '春野サクラ', '「あの日君は孤独がつらいと教えてくれた！ それが今とてもよくわかります。 私には家族がいて、友達がいますが、あなたがいなくなったら… 私にとって… 一人でいることと同じです。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, '春野サクラ', '「ナルトは決心したからここにいる。 私の決意は彼の今とは比較にならない！ 私は忍者になるはずなのに、彼に寄りかかって泣いてばかりでした… それを変えるはずだった… 私はここに来て、準備ができていると思いました。 でも何もできない… 何も言えない。 私に残っているのは、彼らを信じることだけです！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, '春野サクラ', '「笑顔は困難な状況から抜け出す最も簡単な方法です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, '春野サクラ', '「心から愛してる！…君と一緒にいられたら悔いはない…だって毎日楽しいことしてるから幸せだって誓うよ…！」 あなたのためならば私はなんでもできる！ だから……お願い、そばにいて！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, '春野サクラ', '「知らなかった？ 女性は生き残るために強くなければならない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, '春野サクラ', '「ナルトを一番苦しめたのは俺だ……勘違いしてるだけだ。 ぐちゃぐちゃにしているだけ… もう間違えたくない… もう台無しにしたくない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, '春野サクラ', '「私…サスケ…私…私はこれができると思いました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, '春野サクラ', '「いつものことだけど…ナルトにはバカなことしかできない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, '春野サクラ', '「いつもこうだ。 私がナルトのためにできる唯一のことは、誰でもできる小さなことだけです...」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, '春野サクラ', '「ずっと後ろから二人を見てたのに…さあ、私の背中をよく見て！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, '春野サクラ', '「犬豚！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(77, 4540, 'ダイン・ウッドワンダー', '「あなたが言った言葉は取り返しがつきません。 ですから、すでに言ったことを塗り替えるために行動を起こさなければなりません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(77, 4538, 'ニグン・グリッド・ルイン', '「魔物を超える力。 あなたはいったい何者なの？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(77, 4516, 'アルベド', '「アインズ様。 我らに寄り添ってくれた慈悲深きアインズ様。 お願いします！ 私たちを永遠に支配してください。 心よりお願い致します！ お願いします！ お願いします！"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(77, 4516, 'アルベド', '「慈悲深きアインズ様のことを考えるクズを生かすわけにはいきません！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(77, 4516, 'アルベド', '「どうして約束してくれないの!? 何が不満なの!? 教えていただければ、すぐに問題を解決します！ 私が邪魔だと言うなら、私はすぐに自殺します！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(77, 4516, 'アルベド', '「ガーディアンのリーダー、アルベド。 私は至高者の前に頭を下げます。 四層の守護者ガルガンチュアと八層の守護者ヴィクティムを除く全ての守護者が集まって頭を下げる。 私たちに命令を下してください、至高の者よ。 私たちはあなたに完全な忠誠を捧げます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(77, NULL, 'タッチミー', '「困っている人を助けるのは常識！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(77, 4515, 'シャルティア・ブラッドフォールン', '「今気づいた？ 私は残酷で、冷たく、ひどいです。 だけでなく、かなり 美しい 小さな怪物。"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(77, 4518, 'デミウルゴス', '「アインズ様が滅びたら、あなたはどう責任を取りますか？！ アインズ様こそ、我らが忠誠を誓うマスターです！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(77, NULL, 'なべ', '"そうか。 あなたは素晴らしいです、アインズ様。 あなたのすべてに対する配慮は、至高の者として当然です。 改めて畏敬の念を抱いております。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(77, NULL, 'リジー', '「それで、この偉大な魔法生物は、伝説の森の賢王ですか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(77, NULL, 'オーラ', '「彼を殺すつもりですか？ もしそうなら、私は彼の皮を剥ぎたいと思っていました. 彼の肌は素敵な皮になると思います。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, 3334, 'リアス・グレモリー', '「私の名前はリアス・グレモリーです。 そして私は悪魔です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, 3334, 'リアス・グレモリー', '「ポーン 　 重要。 それらは決してゲームで最も弱い部分ではありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, 3334, 'リアス・グレモリー', '「先制攻撃が勝負を決める」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, 3334, 'リアス・グレモリー', '「ポーンが敵の領土の奥深くまで進んだ場合、キング以外の他の駒に昇格できます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, 3334, 'リアス・グレモリー', '「まだ負けてない！ 諦めたら負け！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, 3338, '姫島朱乃', '「そんな風に彼女をからかうのは、あまり良い考えではなかったのかもしれません。 おっと！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, 3338, '姫島朱乃', '「灰の中から蘇る鳳凰でさえ、精神的なダメージから即座に回復することはできません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, 3345, 'ライザーフェネックス', '「どれだけ長生きしても、私がしていることは決して得られない。 お前はただの下級悪魔だ」 ・ライザーフェネックス', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, NULL, '兵藤一成', '「バカでいいよ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, NULL, '兵藤一成', '「この悪魔のたわごとをしゃぶるのをやめたら、私が望むすべての女性を手に入れます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, NULL, '兵藤一成', '「すべてを力に委ねないでください。心に集中してください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, NULL, '兵藤一成', '「好きでもない人とは絶対に付き合ってはいけません。 それはただ間違っている。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, NULL, '兵藤一成', '「バカでもいい。 私の実力で勝てないなら、最後まで馬鹿でいよう！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, NULL, '兵藤一成', '「これが避けられない宿命なら、前向きにならなきゃ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, NULL, '兵藤一成', '「ただの痛みなら我慢する」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, 3342, 'ドナシーク', '「あのバカの能力なんてどうでもいい。 レディ・レイナーレに勝てるはずがない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, 3347, 'ドライグ', '「彼のことを思い出してほしい。 兵藤一誠という男だ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, 3347, 'ドライグ', '「ドラゴンの腕は悪魔の弱さに苦しむことはありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, 3347, 'ドライグ', '「私はいつもあなたと話していましたが、あなたは私のことを聞いていませんでした。 あなたが弱いからかもしれません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, 3347, 'ドライグ', '「愚か者でも、最後までやり通せば、不可能を可能にすることができる。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, NULL, 'アザゼル', '「この世界の物事はたいていうまくいく。 将来を心配しても無駄だ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, NULL, 'アザゼル', '「挑戦しなければ勝てない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, NULL, '木場', '「私はすでに受け取ったものを助けることはできません。 ありがたく使わせていただきます！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, NULL, 'サイラオーグ・バエル', '「私はただ自分の体を信じている、それだけです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, NULL, 'ゼノバ・クオータ', '「腐った卵を救うことはできません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, 3339, 'レイナーレ', '「二度も何もないままです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, NULL, 'バリ', '「あなたが平和だと思っていることは、他の人にとっては苦痛かもしれません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'ソフィー・ハッター', '「まあ、年を取ってよかったのは、失うものは何もないということだ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'ソフィー・ハッター', '「なんてダンプだ。 城について考えるとき、それは私が想像するものではありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'ソフィー・ハッター', '「心は重荷です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'ソフィー・ハッター', '「私もあなたがいなくて寂しいです、カルシファー。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'ソフィー・ハッター', '「それは…あなたは私を怖がらせています。 私はあなたが去ろうとしているこの奇妙な感じを持っています. ハウル、何が起こっているのか教えて！ お願いします。 怪物でも構いません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'ソフィー・ハッター', '「だから君は去っていく。 頼むよ、ハウル。 私はきれいではなく、掃除が得意なだけですが、あなたの助けになることを知っています.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'ソフィー・ハッター', '「私はこれを行うことはできません！ 自分で来るなら、どうして私をここに連れてきたの？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'ソフィー・ハッター', '「年をとったら、なんでこんなに体が冷えるの？ 私はこれまで以上に太っていますが、風は私を通り抜けます！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'ソフィー・ハッター', '「彼らは、状況が最悪のときに最高の炎が最も明るく燃えると言います。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'ソフィー・ハッター', '「よし、カルシファー、料理しよう」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'ソフィー・ハッター', '「マダム・スリマンが何と言ったか知っていますか？ 彼女は、ハウルの心臓は悪魔に盗まれたと言いました。 教えてください、あなたは何を知っていますか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'ソフィー・ハッター', '「もしハウルの心を返してしまったら、あなたはどうなるの？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'ソフィー・ハッター', '「すべてがとても馴染み深いものですが、ここに行ったことがないことはわかっています。 私は家にいるように感じます。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'ソフィー・ハッター', '「掃除してほしくないものは、今すぐ隠したほうがいいよ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'ソフィー・ハッター', '「お会いできてうれしかったです。たとえあなたが私の一番嫌いな野菜でも！ 気をつけてね、カブ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'ソフィー・ハッター', '「ハウル、なぜ荒地の魔女はあなたを追い詰めようとしているのですか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'ソフィー・ハッター', '「年をとったら、景色を眺めるだけでいい。 とても奇妙です。 こんなに平和だと感じたことは今までありませんでした。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'ソフィー・ハッター', '「自分がどこにいるか知っている！ 私はハウルの子供時代にいます！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'ソフィー・ハッター', '「ハウルは何に変装したのかしら？ きっとカラスじゃない。 ハトにはなれません、彼は派手すぎます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '"あきらめる。 私ができないなら、私は生きている意味がないと思います 美しい」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '「あの帽子かぶってる？ 私があなたのドレスを美しくするために使ったすべての魔法の後ですか？', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '「あなたは恋人です、遅くなってごめんなさい。 私はどこでもあなたを探していました。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '「このお守りは、あなたの安全な帰還を保証します。 安心してください、変装してついて行きます。 さぁ出発だ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '「胸に重みがあるように、ひどい気分です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '「私の友人を苦しめないでくれれば幸いです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '「家族がまた一つ増えたようです。 うーん、あなたもかなり厄介な呪文を持っていますよね？ この家族は皆、問題を抱えているようだ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '「戦後、彼らは自分が人間だったことを思い出すことはありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '「ソフィー、皆さんが快適に暮らせるように準備をしています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '「荒地の魔女とマダム・サリマンの犬が私のテーブルに？ どうして彼らを私の家に入れさせたのですか。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '「流れ星を飲み込んだ君、無情な男よ、君の心はもうすぐ僕のものになるだろう。」 それはテーブルにとって良いことではありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '「この戦争はひどいものです。彼らは南の海岸から北の国境まで爆撃します。 今、すべてが燃えています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '「あなたがそこにいると知ったことが、私に勇気を与えてくれました。 あの女は私を怖がらせる。 私は彼女と一人で向き合うことはできません。 あなたは私を救ってくれました、ソフィー。 私はそこで大変な目に遭いました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '「心配はいりませんが、私は追跡されています。 普通に振る舞う。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '「すまない、逃げるのはもう十分だ、ソフィー。 今、守りたいものがある。 それはあなたです。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '「ソフィー！ あなた、あなたは私を妨害した ！ 見て！ あなたが私の髪に何をしたか見てください！ 見て！"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '「文字盤に新しい色が見えますか？ 新しいポータルがあります。 あなたへのプレゼントです。 見に来る。"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '「うわー、ソフィー、あなたの髪は星の光のように見えます。 これは 美しい」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '「彼女はかつてかなりだった 美しい、だから私は彼女を追跡することに決めたが、そうではないことに気づいたので、いつものように逃げた.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '遠吠え', '「ソフィー！ ソフィー！ あなたは 美しい！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, 'マダム・スリマン', '「あの少年は非常に危険です。彼の力は、心臓のない者には大きすぎます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1603, 'マルクル', '「私の部屋は最後にとっておきますよね？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1603, 'マルクル', '「彼は闇の精霊を呼んでいます…私は彼が女の子が彼を捨てたときにこれをするのを見たことがあります！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, NULL, '廃棄物の魔女', '「あなたの本当の恋人は別の誰かに恋をしているようです！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1606, 'カルシファー', '「料理しない！ 私は怖くて強力な火の悪魔です！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1606, 'カルシファー', '"もちろんそうよ！ ここでは誰も何もしません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1606, 'カルシファー', '「私は彼らをここに入れませんでした！ ソフィーが墜落して、私の顔に飛行機が着陸しました！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1606, 'カルシファー', '「あの魔法使いたちは、そんなことをしたことを後悔するだろう。 人間に戻ることはありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1606, 'カルシファー', '「これはあなたのための別の呪いです - すべてのあなたのベーコンが燃えますように。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1606, 'カルシファー', '「火と火薬には耐えられない。 あの馬鹿野郎は絶対にマナーが悪い」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1606, 'カルシファー', '「ええ、ちょっと寂しかったです。雨が降りそうです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1606, 'カルシファー', '「このまま飛び回ってはいけません。 もうすぐ人間に戻れなくなる。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1606, 'カルシファー', '「申し訳ありませんが、それは機密情報です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(63, NULL, '司馬達也', '「『次回』を信じるのはいい考えだ。 本当の戦場だったら「次」はない。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(63, NULL, '司馬達也', '「誰もが平等で同じ待遇を受ける世界。 そのような場所は存在しません。 才能や適性が問題にならない平等の世界があったとしたら、私たちは皆、平等に冷遇されるでしょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(63, NULL, '司馬達也', '「恋愛感情と呼べるものをすべて失いました。 彼らは封印されていなかったので、解放することはできません。 壊れていないので、直せません。 失ったものは取り戻せない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(63, NULL, '司馬達也', '「あなたが何人殺したか、何人生きさせたかは、私には関係ありません。 お前達は俺の怒りを買った……それはお前達が死ぬ理由として十分だ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(63, NULL, '司馬達也', '「差別されている人ほど差別を意識している人はいませんよね？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(63, NULL, '芝みゆき', '「あたかも何も起こらなかったかのように、ありとあらゆる怪我を一掃する。 そのような呪文…彼が何の代価も払わずに唱えられると本当に信じていますか? Eidos の変更ログを巻き戻して完全なコピーを作成するには、保存されている情報をすべて読み取る必要があります。 言うまでもなく、それには負傷者が経験した痛みや苦しみも含まれます。 それだけでなく、凝縮された形で瞬時に送信されます。 例えば磯里が怪我をしてから兄が呪文を唱えるまで、およそ30秒。 ブラザーがエイドスの変更ログを読むのに費やした時間は…約0.2秒でした。 その瞬間、弟の心は五十里の150倍の痛みと苦しみを凝縮した。 ブラザーが誰かの傷を癒すたびに、それは彼が支払う代価です. それでもその力を他人のために使うべきだと言うつもりですか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1248, 'ハク', '「橋を渡るときは息を止めなければなりません。 ほんの少しの息でも呪文が解け、誰もがあなたを見るでしょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1248, 'ハク', '「湯婆婆はそうやって君を支配する……君の名を盗む」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, NULL, 'ゼニバ', '「一度何かをやると、決して忘れることはありません。 思い出せなくても。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, NULL, 'ゼニバ', '「髪を結ぶのに使ってください。 それはあなたを保護します。 友達が一緒に織った糸から作られています。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, NULL, 'ゼニバ', '「あなたはエンドウ豆の脳です。 自分の母親から教えてもらえませんか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, NULL, 'ゼニバ', '「一度会った人は、本当に忘れることはありません。 記憶がよみがえるまでに時間がかかります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, NULL, 'ゼニバ', '「私たちは一卵性双生児で、正反対です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1247, '荻野千尋', '「仕事をくれるまで行かない！！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1247, '荻野千尋', '「ただの……悪い夢です！ 起きて起きて。"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1247, '荻野千尋', '「私はそれを処理できると思います。」 荻野千尋', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1247, '荻野千尋', '「聞いて、ハク。 覚えていませんが、母に言われました… 小さい頃、川に落ちたことがあります。 彼女は、彼らがそれを排出し、その上に物を作ったと言いました. でも、ふと思い出しました。 川は紅白川と呼ばれた。 あなたの本当の名前は…コハクです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1247, '荻野千尋', '"来て！ 食べるのをやめる！ ここから出ましょう！"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1247, '荻野千尋', '「ここには彼が二人いないよね？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1247, '荻野千尋', '「やっと花束をもらってさよならのプレゼント。 それは憂鬱です。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, NULL, '荻野裕子', '「ちひろ、くっつくなよ、つまずくぞ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, NULL, 'ゆばば', '"手を下げて。 あなたは私たちのゲストを侮辱するでしょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, NULL, 'ゆばば', '「ここは私がここで走っている高級な場所です！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, NULL, '荻野昭夫', '"心配しないで！ ここにパパがいます。 彼はクレジットカードと現金を持っています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, NULL, 'ちちやく', '「しっぽをしゃぶらせてください！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, NULL, '釜地', '「あなたが認識できない何か。 それは愛と呼ばれる。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1250, 'リン', '"人間！ あなたは困っています！ あなたはみんなが探していた人です！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1250, 'リン', '「私はこの場所から出なければなりません。 いつかあの電車に乗ります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1250, 'リン', '「ノーフェイス、あの娘に傷一つでもつけたら大変なことになるぞ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, NULL, 'ボー', '「私と遊んでください、さもないとあなたの腕を折ってしまいます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, NULL, 'ボー', '「センを泣かせたら、もう好きじゃない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, NULL, 'アニヤク', '「ようこそ金持ちよ、彼はあなたにとって見逃すことのできない人です。 お尻がどんどん大きくなっていくから、キスしたいところがいっぱい！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, 3815, '林田奈々', '「何かを言う機会を逃すと、その言葉はますます有毒になります。 最善の方法は、ただすべてを話すことです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, 3815, '林田奈々', '「あなたはまるで爆弾のようで、一歩間違えばまたあなたを失うかもしれませんでした。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, 3812, '加賀香子', '「あなたが愛する人があなたを愛してくれなければ、あなたは無価値です。 それは私がいつも自分に言い聞かせていたことです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, 3812, '加賀香子', '「もっと一緒にいたい！ でも迷惑だと思われたくないので、我慢してます。 あなたが離れているとき、私はいつもあなたが何をしていて何を考えているのだろうと思っています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, 3812, '加賀香子', '「拒絶されることを心配することは、自分自身を拒絶することと同じかもしれません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, 3813, '多田万里', '「あなたは事故に遭った。 その後、あなたは何もできませんでした。 それを恥ずかしく思うのは構わない。 しかし、その恥から逃げるな！ その屈辱を背負って生きていかなければならない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, 3813, '多田万里', '「事故でも記憶喪失でも、人生を巻き戻してやり直すことはできません。 苦労すれば、自分自身と周りの人を傷つけるだけです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, 3813, '多田万里', '「私は頼りにならないかもしれないし、何もできないかもしれないけど、私はここにいる。 私はいつもあなたと一緒にいます。 私はいつもあなたのそばにいます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, 3813, '多田万里', '「なんでまだ友達になりたいの？ 一緒にいて心地いいから？ ぎこちなくて役立たずな自分を理解して、それでも愛しているから? 甘やかされた演技はやめましょう。 あなたが私を拒絶したとき、あなたはそれらを望む権利を失いました！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, 3813, '多田万里', '「面倒くさいと思っても、どこへ行っても必ず見つけます。 私はいつもあなたの声に耳を傾けます。 雨が降る時、風が吹く時、花が散る時、影が迫る時。 すべての兆候で、私はあなたの声を探します。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, 3813, '多田万里', '「あなたが叫びたいとき、泣きたいとき、私はそこにいます。 私はあなたの気持ちを分かち合い、あなたと一緒にいます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, 3813, '多田万里', '「プレゼントは終わります。 ここでは、過去の自分の無数のバージョンが常に泣いたり、笑ったり、恋に落ちたり、傷ついたり、冗談を言ったり、幸せを感じたり、苦しんだりしています。 これらの感情は常に生まれ、次の瞬間には過去となって死んでいきます。 もう終わったんだ。 これで終わりですが、本当はみんなそんな時間です。 生まれてすぐ、一瞬一瞬が過去になって死ぬ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, NULL, 'ナナ', '「人生は苦しみ、痛み、悲惨さです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, NULL, 'ナナ', '「あなたは誰かに会って別れます。 それは人間の経験の自然な部分です。 永遠に一緒にいるとは誰も約束できません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, 'ドワーフシャーマン', '「彼らが彼女にしたことの代償を払わせます。 皆が死ぬまでここを離れません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, 'ドワーフシャーマン', '「敵地を騒がせてはならない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, 6697, 'ゴブリンスレイヤー', '「あなたの家が突然モンスターに襲われたらどう思うか考えてみてください. 彼らはあたかもその場所を所有しているかのように振る舞い、あなたの友人を殺し、あなたの家族を殺し、村の残りを略奪します. 例えば、姉が襲われたり、いじめられたり、慰められたり、殺されたり… 仮にあなたが息を殺して隠れて、最初から最後まで目撃したとしたら… 許すわけがありません。 」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, 6697, 'ゴブリンスレイヤー', '「勝てると言うなら無謀だな」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, 6697, 'ゴブリンスレイヤー', '「彼らは一生恨みを持ち続けます。 そして、巣の生存者は過ちから学び、適応します。 彼らを生かす理由は一つもありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, 6697, 'ゴブリンスレイヤー', '「私はいつも彼らの首がどこにあるかを目指しています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, 6697, 'ゴブリンスレイヤー', '「お腹をいっぱいにしないでください。 血流が遅くなり、動きが鈍くなります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, 6697, 'ゴブリンスレイヤー', '「魔物が世界を滅ぼす前に、ゴブリンが村を滅ぼす。 世界が危機に瀕しているからといって、ゴブリンを生かしておく理由にはなりません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, 6697, 'ゴブリンスレイヤー', '「みんなまだ食べてないの？ 正しい。 私たちは約束しました、覚えていますか？ あの戦いを乗り越えたら、一緒に食事を楽しみましょう」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, 6697, 'ゴブリンスレイヤー', '「いいゴブリン？ あなたが本当に一生懸命見れば、あるかもしれないと思います。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, 6697, 'ゴブリンスレイヤー', '「結局のところ、穴から出てこないゴブリンだけが良いゴブリンだ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, 6718, 'ゴブリンスレイヤーのお姉さん', '「持っていないものばかりにこだわっていると、心も体も醜いものに歪んでしまう。 そして、力ずくで他人から物を奪おうとし始めます。」 ・ゴブリンスレイヤーのお姉さん', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, 6718, 'ゴブリンスレイヤーのお姉さん', '「守らなければならない 女の子」 ・ゴブリンスレイヤーのお姉さん', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, 6718, 'ゴブリンスレイヤーのお姉さん', '「何かを蔑むとゴブリンになる」 ・ゴブリンスレイヤーのお姉さん', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, 'カウガール', '「あの日、彼は帰ってこなかった。 それとも翌日……まだ戦ってるのかしら」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, 'カウガール', '「人は年を取り、傷つきます。 彼らは疲れると倒れます。 やがて誰もが限界に達します。 冒険者であろうと英雄であろうと。 たとえ死ななくても。 これらの日は永遠に続くことはありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, 'カウガール', '「先のことはじっくり考えましょう、焦る必要はありません」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, 'カウガール', '「『ごめんなさい』と言うのが難しい場合があります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, '重戦士', '「私には選択肢がないと思います。 ゴブリンスレイヤーはどうでもいいけど、ご褒美はあるよ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, '泥棒', '「何かをするという決断を下し、それに基づいて行動した瞬間、あなたは勝ちます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, '泥棒', '「あなたを勝利に導くのはあなたの力ではなく、あなたの行動です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, '泥棒', '「運と知恵と勇気！ やるかやらないかから全ては始まる。 だから何とかしろ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, '検査官', '「正義は悪を倒すことではない。 しかし、世界に悪が存在することを人々に認識させることです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, 'リザードプリースト', '「彼女は生き残るでしょう。 これ以上傷が深かったらどうしようもなかった」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, 'リザードプリースト', '「一緒に楽しむ食事ほど素晴らしいものはありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, '女新幹線', '「はい、恐れ入りますが……きっと……きっと大丈夫ですよ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, '女新幹線', '「あなたは本当に絶望的です、あなたはそれを知っていますか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, '女新幹線', '「約束は守らなきゃいけないでしょ？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, '女新幹線', '「もう頑張らないって言ったでしょ！ ゴブリンスレイヤー……もう少し考えてみてください！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, '女新幹線', '「相手に選択肢を与えないことは、議論の対象にはなりません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, 'ハイエルフアーチャー', '「冒険者は楽しいはずです。 未知の体験、新しい発見の喜び。 高揚感または達成感。 それが私の冒険者たちです。 これは冒険ではありません。 いつか本当の冒険に連れて行ってあげるよ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, 'ハイエルフアーチャー', '「ドワーフからアドバイスを受けるのは嫌いですが、あなたは正しいです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, 'ハイエルフアーチャー', '「エルフの矢は、目を閉じていても命中する。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, 'ソードメイデン', '「皮肉なことだと思いませんか？ 最高神の使者が街と街を一人で守らなければならないなんて」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, 'ソードメイデン', '「あなたは優しい人です。 私がこの話をすると、ほとんどの人は「ごめんなさい」と言うだけです。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, 'ソードメイデン', '「奇跡的にあの夜からゴブリンに悩まされなくなり、今は平和に暮らしています。 これもひとえにあなたと仲間のおかげです。 心より感謝申し上げます。 魔王は、世界を平和へと導くはずの勇者に倒された。 しかし、まだ魔王軍の多くが残っているので、油断は禁物です。 冒険者達は戦いを続けなければならないと思いますが、あなたの安全をいつも祈っています..」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, 'ソードメイデン', '「人は…女性は弱い生き物です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(123, NULL, 'スピアマン', '「腕に自信のない奴は辞退しろ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(57, 3824, '名瀬美月', '「他の人とは一線を画す個性は大きな財産です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(57, 3834, '神原弥生', '「妖夢か精霊戦士か……結局どっちでもいい。 あなたが誰であるかという問題もありません。 大切なのは、大切な人の近くにいることです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(57, 3834, '神原弥生', '「私たちの愛が私たちの中にある憎しみよりも強い限り、私たちはそれを封印しておくことができます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(57, NULL, '名瀬浩臣', '「人は自分の理想のために働くことができます。 しかし、その理想を見失っては、思い通りにいかないと何も成し遂げられません！ 自分自身や大切な人を守ることはできません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(57, NULL, '名瀬浩臣', '「自分の気持ちに耳を傾ける代わりに、自分自身で推論しようとし続けると、本当の幸せを感じることができなくなります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(57, 3823, '栗山未来', '「どこかで、私は他人と交流できないと決めていました。 一人でいるしかないけど、ここにいる新たな理由を見つけた。 みんな一人だからだよ先輩。 みんな一人ぼっちです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(57, NULL, '神原明人', '「夜に光があり、昼に闇があるように、世界には常に闇があります。 同時に、世界が闇に飲み込まれることはありません。 そのあいまいな色の組み合わせの中で、すべてが進み、私たちの運命が決定されます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, NULL, 'サビト', '「ウロコダキが教えてくれた奥義を忘れないようにします。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, NULL, 'サビト', '「あなたがしたことは事実を暗記したことだけです。 あなたの体は、それが何をする必要があるのか​​見当がつかない.」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, NULL, 'サビト', '「もっと行け！ あなたが男なら。 男と名乗るなら！ 前に進むしか道はない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7019, '冨岡義勇', '「怒りを感じてください。許せないという強い純粋な怒りが、あなたの行動への揺るぎない原動力になります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7013, '竈門炭治郎', '「お兄ちゃんは絶対に助けてあげる！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7013, '竈門炭治郎', '「人を殺すことは……許されない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7013, '竈門炭治郎', '「俺と禰豆子の絆は誰にも切れない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7013, '竈門炭治郎', '「妹を傷つける者は……柱だろうが、だろうが逃がしはしない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7013, '竈門炭治郎', '「何人失っても生きていくしかない。 どんなに壊滅的であっても、打撃は多分。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7013, '竈門炭治郎', '「自分の行動を後悔した人。 私はそれらを踏みにじることはありません。 悪魔もかつては人間だったからです。 私と同じように、彼らも人間でした。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7013, '竈門炭治郎', '「弱気になるな！ 彼を保護する！ 彼を保護する！ 彼を保護する！ 私はもう無力じゃない！ 動く！！"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7013, '竈門炭治郎', '「やればできる、やれるとわかっている。 私はそれをやり遂げる男だ. 戦える！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7013, '竈門炭治郎', '「真っ向勝負はシンプル。 より強くて速い方が勝ちます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7013, '竈門炭治郎', '「精神だけでなく頭を使いなさい。 考えて考えてください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7013, '竈門炭治郎', '「指先まで息を吸って！ 瞑想は集中力を高めます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7013, '竈門炭治郎', '"真っすぐ前を見ます。 奮起せよ！ がんばれ炭治郎！ 持てる力をすべて出しなさい！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7013, '竈門炭治郎', '「がんばれ。 私にできることは一生懸命働くことだけです！ それが私の人生の物語です！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7013, '竈門炭治郎', '"いいえ！ 自分でマスターしたら、教えることもできるから！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7016, '我妻善逸', '「私は…守ってきました…あなたが…そう言ったので…これはあなたにとって…あなた自身の命よりも重要です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7016, '我妻善逸', '「こんなに可愛い子を毎日背負って……楽しそうに旅してたのに……血を流した血を返して！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7016, '我妻善逸', '「決してあきらめないでください。 辛くても辛くても楽な道を歩もうとするな。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7016, '我妻善逸', '「明らかに、おじいちゃんは私を少し叩きすぎました。 しかし、彼は決して私を見捨てませんでした。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7016, '我妻善逸', '「もしあなたがそれをマスターしたら、それはお祝いの理由です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7016, '我妻善逸', '「戦いには勝ったけど戦争には負けた！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, NULL, 'こくしぼう', '「血に感謝せよ……一滴たりとも地面にこぼしてはならない……となれば……胴体と頭が悲しく別れてしまう」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, NULL, 'こくしぼう', '「あなたは道を開きました…さらなる高みに到達するために…そしてあなたはそれを放棄しました…非常に弱いです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, NULL, 'こくしぼう', '「私は…何も…言うことはありません…うぶやしき…巧みに…隠れた…彼自身。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7014, '竈門禰豆子', '「禰豆子は生まれた時から人間です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7014, '竈門禰豆子', '「飛車みたいな男に出会えたらいいな」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7021, '胡蝶しのぶ', '「柱の中で鬼の首を斬れない女剣士は私だけかもしれません。 でも、魔物を殺す毒を作る人は、本当にすごい人です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7017, '鬼舞辻無惨', '「私は無限に完璧に近い完璧な生き物です。」 ・鬼舞辻無惨', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7017, '鬼舞辻無惨', '「私に何か欲しいものはありますか？ あなたはかなりパニックに陥っています。」 ・鬼舞辻無惨', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7017, '鬼舞辻無惨', '「この世界でただ一人、その血管に流れる血が人間を悪魔に変える力を持つ悪魔がいる。」 ・鬼舞辻無惨', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7017, '鬼舞辻無惨', '「魔族が人間を倒すのは当然だ」 ・鬼舞辻無惨', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7017, '鬼舞辻無惨', '「花札の耳飾りをつけた、あの鬼狩りの首をとってほしい」 ・鬼舞辻無惨', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7017, '鬼舞辻無惨', '「たまよと同じように、私の手に負えなくなった魔物がいる。 彼女を見つけて、彼女に終止符を打ちます。 私が頼めるのはあなただけです。」 ・鬼舞辻無惨', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, 7024, '鱗滝左近次', '「刀は折れやすい」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, NULL, '辻国頼一', '「私は、鬼舞辻無惨を倒すために特別な力を持って生まれてきたのだと思います。 しかし、私は欠けていました。 結局、私は失敗しました。 そのせいで、これからもたくさんの人が死ぬことになる……それが私を苦しめる」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, NULL, '辻国頼一', '「私は何の価値もない男です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(131, NULL, '辻国頼一', '「お兄ちゃんの夢は国一の武士になることだったでしょ？ 私もあなたのようになりたいです。 全国で二番目に強い侍になりたい」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'アロイス・トランシー', '「闇の深みに溺れると、光が見えなくなる。 その光が分散すると、戻ることはありません。 私の光はずっと前に消えてしまったので、私が戻ることは何もありません、または楽しみにしています私は完全に私を消費するまで、この暗闇に身を任せ続けます。 ＆腐敗する残酷な世界。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'アロイス・トランシー', '「私の心は蜘蛛の巣に絡まっていた。 あなたはいつも私の殿下です。 あなたの愛が欲しかった。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'アロイス・トランシー', '「やっと夢が叶いました。 クモの巣に閉じ込められた蝶には羽がありません。 その蝶は……私です」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'アロイス・トランシー', '「みんな、すべてが幸せです！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'アロイス・トランシー', '「ハンナ、目玉焼きなんてかわいそうじゃない？ 殻を破られ、公の場で卑猥な姿をさらすことを強いられる。 その後、眼球、内臓、またはプルームになります。 そして、私はあらゆる可能性を奪います。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'アロイス・トランシー', '「じゃあ、その目を見せて。 ゲロの山を見たような村人の目ではない。 老人の貪欲で炎症を起こした目ではありません。 あの日、その目。 私だけを慕うその瞳、クロード」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'アロイス・トランシー', '「私の血の匂いはどうですか？ 今、私をむさぼり食うつもりですか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'アロイス・トランシー', '「みんな死ねばいいのに！ それらのすべて！ すべて、全滅！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2509, 'ヴィンセント・ファントムハイヴ', '「愛は素晴らしいものですが、同時に恐ろしい悲劇を生むこともあります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「死は生まれるようなものですが、後ろ向きです。 痛みは少しの間だけで、その後、新しい生活が始まります。 悲しみも痛みもない人生、輝かしい新たな始まり。 永遠に続く始まり。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「私は目を開けたまま悪夢を見るほうが好きです。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「言葉は 安い. 彼女が誰にも言わないという保証はありません。 人間は何も考えずに嘘をつきます。 もちろん私も含めて」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「愛というのは お金 この日。" ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「『ウソ』に固執すれば、それはやがて『真実』になる。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「彼らの切実な願いを嘲笑し、蟲のように踏みにじる！ 臆病者、ベース – 私たちは悪魔よりも悪魔的です! 私は彼らと同じです。 私は彼らと同じ醜さでいっぱいです。 これが人間のあり方です。 それが私たちのやり方だ、セバスチャン！」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「私は他人のために命を賭けるほど高貴な人間ではありません。 また、傍観者が私を踏みにじるのを許すほど寛容でもありません。 私は利己的です…そして独善的な人間です！ それが理由です！ 私は…自分の恥を晴らすために…あなたの力を使いました。 他の誰のためでもありません！ でも自分のために！」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「いつか死ぬとしたら、後悔しないほうがいいんじゃない？」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「悲しみと悲しみでうろつきまくって…どうなるの？ 死んだ人でさえそれを行うことができます。 しかし、私は自分の二本足で生きていきます。 いつか死ぬなら、後悔しないほうがいいんじゃない？」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「傲慢でない人間なんて本当にいるの？」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「この世界には、盗む者と盗まれる者の二種類しか存在しない。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「生きたいなら距離を置いた方がいい。 私の居場所は影の中にあり、あなたの居場所は光の中にあります。 私たちは反対の道を歩きます、アバーライン。 覚えておいたほうがいいですよ。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「過去は必要ありません。 必要なのは現在と未来だけです。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「以前は好きだったものを憎むのは、とてもつらい気持ちです。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「どんなに落ちても、糸が少しでも残っている限り、それを使って登ります。 つかみます。 私はまだ人間である間、私はあきらめることを拒否します。 しかし、誰もがそれをつかむかどうかを自分で決めなければなりません。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「明白な真実ほど欺くものはない。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「この世の正義とは、権力者が勝手に作った原則の集まりに過ぎない」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「まるで楽しんでいるかのように笑う方法を長い間忘れていました。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「はい、子供たちは自分自身について非常に厳しいことがあります 賭ける」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「痛みは時間が経てば治る傾向にありますが、個人的には傷を癒すのに時間がかかりたくないです。 痛みから逃れて忘れたと思っているかもしれませんが、それは停滞に過ぎません。 痛みがないと前に進めません。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「表面的な掟に縛られ、手先を極限まで使わない者は愚か者である。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '"泣かないで; それは哀れです。 泣いても何も変わらない。 世界は誰にも優しくない。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「何かが本当に失われると、二度と取り戻すことはできないのではないかと心配しています。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「私は一人になるために生まれてきた。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「私たち人間にはそれを行う力がありますが、糸をつかむかどうかは私たちの選択です。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「私は…ペットとして屈辱を与えられました…家は焼け、家族は殺されました。 私はとても… 無力な子供でした。 故に、俺をこの地に引き戻したのは、俺をそんな運命に追いやった者たちに同じ屈辱を味わわせるためだ。 三年前に殺された世代の後継者は、私がファントムハイヴ家の当主である限り、彼らの前に立ちはだかるだろう。 私は待っています…彼らが来て、ここで私を殺そうとするのを待っています。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「復讐のことは忘れて生きていこう」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「私は傲慢ですが、自慢するために誰かを無責任に救うほどではありません。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「あなたは何のために怠惰に立っているのですか？ あなたは私の復讐を得ました。 これは注文です！ もう私の魂を食べに来てください！ あなたが私の魂をすべて食べる瞬間まで、あなたは私の執事です – セバスチャン・ミカエリス!」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '"だから何？ あなたは別人なので、当然見た目も違います。 何を恥じる必要がある？ それに、誰と付き合っても自由です。 それについて何かを言う権利は誰にもありません。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「何かがなくなったら、それは決して戻ってこない。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「遊ぶのは趣味が悪い 賭ける 吐きそうです、デーモン！」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「死者をそこまで汚すことはできない」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「あなたは間違っていません。 あなたは自分の世界を守るために戦った。 それのどこが悪いんだい？ 結局のところ、「正義」とは、権力者が自らの目的を果たすためにとる公式の方針にすぎません。 誰も他人に気を配っていません。 うっかりすると、奪われます。 この世には二種類しかいない。 盗む者、奪われる者。 そして今日、私はあなたの未来を盗みます。 これだけです。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「人があなたに話しかけているときに耳を傾けてください！」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「泣いているなら戦え！ 悔しかったら前を向いて！ 不幸を嘆いてるだけじゃ、ただの豚じゃない！」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '"もういい！ このまま生きていたらクビになるぞ！」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「どんなに努力しても取り戻せないものがあります。また、決して振り払うことのできない絶望感もあります。」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'シエル・ファントムハイヴ', '「幸せそうに笑うこと、忘れてた…」 ・シエル・ファントムハイヴ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'アンダーテイカー', '「笑いが消えたら、どんなに悲しいだろう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'アンダーテイカー', '「私に言わなくても、あなたが来た理由はわかっています。一目見ただけで、あなたが何を考えているかがわかります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'アンダーテイカー', '「人生は甘くない。 だから誰もが甘いものを欲しがるのです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'アンダーテイカー', '「無駄な努力は若者の特権の一つです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'アンダーテイカー', '「今日は特定の女性の特別なガラです。 人それぞれの人生最後の大儀式。 葬儀。"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'アンダーテイカー', '「私は女王のものは欲しくない お金！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'アンダーテイカー', '「一人一人の魂を大切にするように言ったのに。 あなたは大きな力を持っているので、回復できないものの重要性を徐々に理解できなくなります。 それが実現し、支持を失ったら……何回同じ警告をしたことか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'アンダーテイカー', 'ヴィクトリア「え？ 私はファンではありません。 彼女は他の誰よりも高い地位にあり、つらい汚い仕事は伯爵に任せています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'アンダーテイカー', '「指輪は私には首輪のように思えます。 いつの日か、その首輪があなたを窒息させることを願っています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2506, 'エリザベス・ミッドフォード', '「哲学よりも詩。 料理というより刺繍。 チェスの代わりにダンス。 無知な天使になりましょう。 バラの国に生まれた女の子は、この３つの言葉で育つ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2506, 'エリザベス・ミッドフォード', '「愛するためには弱く、守るためには強く、共にそばにいるために。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '"はい私の殿下。 私は全身をあなたに捧げます。 嘘が真実になる日まで…」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「あなたは未来を捨て、夢を失い、絶望に染まり……同時に、過去を振り払い、現実と戦い、気高さを失うことはありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「人は誘惑されやすい。 彼らが地獄のような絶望の淵に立たされ、クモのように細い救いの糸が現れたとき、彼らは必ずそれを掴みます。 人間関係ない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「人は誘惑を退けることはできません。 地獄に例えられた絶望のどん底に突き落とされた時、彼らはどんな人間であろうと、たとえそれが蜘蛛の糸であったとしても、彼らが置かれている状況から逃れるのに役立つであろうあらゆるものにしがみつきます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「お腹が空いている人ほど、夕食の満足度が高い。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「常に駒を巧みに操り、それが生き残る道だ。 私とマダムレッド、あなたの手の届くところにあるものを使ってください。 投げた駒の前に駒の死体が山積みになっても。 王様が倒れたら、このゲームは終わりです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「彼は迷わず光に背を向ける。 凛とした足取りで奈落へと突き進むその姿。 どうやって 美しい そして愚かです。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「悪魔と違って卑しい、複雑な悪意を秘めている、嘘をついている……必死にもがき、邪魔をする者を倒している……盗んでは盗まれ、言い訳は尽きない……それでも坂を越えようと努力する」そして遠くへ。 だからこそ、人間は面白いのだと思います。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「イギリスやインドとは何の関係もありません。 いつ、どこで、同じです。 人間性、つまり。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「私は執事です。 私の評判を悪く言う姿をご主人様に見せるわけにはいきません」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「愛されたい、ただそれだけの頑固な理由で、人はここまで行ける。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「憎しみと悲しみは力です。 それらはあなたがコントロールするものです。 それを力に変えて、その力で前に進めばいいのです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「猫は素晴らしい。 彼らは無駄なことを話しません。 またはそれらを行います。 かわいいものは何もありません。 それらは私の世界には存在しないものです。 あちらにもペットがいますが……比較にならないほどです」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「これで俺の本性を見せられる」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「私は長い間生きてきましたが、宇宙人に会うのは初めてです。 あのキラキラした笑顔が俺にどんな反撃を期待してるんだ？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「あなたのダンスの才能は皆無のようです。 圧倒されますよ、若様。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「ひとたび信仰を拒むと、天国の門に入ることができなくなる。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「あなたの命令で、私はあなたのポーンとなり、あなたの剣となります。 では、お嬢様、私を制圧してください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「穢れや汚さを知らない丸くて無邪気な目、貴族のもののように愛情を込めて揺れる尻尾、暖かい淡いピンクの柔らかい色合いの足！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「人に蹴られるのは嫌いですが、人を蹴る感覚は好きです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「契約がある限り、あなたの命は私が守ります。 しかし、自分の意思でミスをすると、生きている間に辛い経験をすることになるかもしれません。 それはもうわかってるでしょ？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「正直、なんて無意味なんだろう……意味も形もない愛というものに。 笑えますよね？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「王が生き残るためには、騎士と女王の両方を使って他の駒を巧みに操作できることが彼にとって良いことです。 御座の下には、あなたの破片の体があなたの罪とともに積み上げられます。 負けてはいけない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「はい……私は鬼です。 獲物、人間の味覚を理解できるわけがない。 私が理解しているのは……人間の魂の味だけです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「どんなゲームも、スリルが欠けると退屈になります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'セバスチャン・ミカエリス', '「君が望むなら、君の王座が崩れ、君の輝く王冠が錆びても、僕は君について行く。 底なしの死体の山の上に死体が際限なく積み重なっても。 そっと横たわるあなたのそばに、「チェックメイト」という言葉が聞こえるまで、私はそばにいます。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2498, 'グレル・サトクリフ', '「ああ、やっと本当の姿であなたの前に現れることができます！ 素っ裸のイケメンの前に出るのは恥ずかしくないから？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2498, 'グレル・サトクリフ', '「靴のかかとで、この冷たく無関心な顔を踏んでやる！ 私の靴をきれいに舐めてほしい！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2498, 'グレル・サトクリフ', '「最近、素っ気ない獲物しか出てこない。 私の鎌と私は満足していません。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2498, 'グレル・サトクリフ', '「スピードが足りないとどうなるか見てみよう！ あなたはカットされます！ 少し痛い方が楽しいですけどね？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2498, 'グレル・サトクリフ', '「あ、ちびセバスちゃん、赤が一番好きです。 髪も服も口紅も赤いのが好き。 そういうわけで、私は新鮮な血を使って醜い女性の化粧をするのが大好きです. 華やかな女性ほど、 美しい 毒の花みたいでしょ？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2498, 'グレル・サトクリフ', '「いい男の過去は人の好奇心をくすぐる！ でもダメ男ならもっと見たくなる！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'アラン・ハンフリーズ', '「私はこの世に一人で生まれ、一人で死ぬ。 これが私の運命なら、なぜ私の目から涙が出るのですか?」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'ラウ', '「こんなに面白い世界が本当に現実になるの？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'ラウ', '「蜘蛛の巣はもう編まれています。 もがくほど、その束縛から逃れることは難しくなります。 どんな獲物でも、一度絡んでしまえば捕まえるのは時間の問題です」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'ラウ', '「伯爵はフライドポテトを狙っても意味がないって言ってたけど、一度食べたらまた食べちゃうでしょ？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'ラウ', '「街に出没する悪いネズミを退治しなければなりませんね。 だから私は猫を飼っています。 ニャー！"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'ラウ', '「それは、どんどん泥に沈んでいくということです。 戻れない場所に足を踏み入れたとしても、助けを求める叫びを他人に明かさないことを選んでいるだろ？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'ラウ', '「この世界にはアール様、現実の厳しさで生きていけない人がいます。 私はそれらの人々に夢を売ります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'ラウ', '「永遠に夢から覚めないことと、永遠に夢を見ることができないこと、どちらが不幸だと思いますか？ それでも、私たちが永遠だと思っていた夢も、この現実も、いつかは終わる運命にあるのです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'クロード・ファウスタス', '「もし彼が悪魔の長く怠惰な生活に波紋を作ったなら、アロイス・トランシーの魂も割って開ける価値があったのかもしれません.」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'クロード・ファウスタス', '「シエル・ファントムハイヴ、あなたの柔らかな肌に針を突き刺し……ゆっくりとあなたの官能的な魂を吸い出します」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'クロード・ファウスタス', '「ただの執事で、そこまでするなんて……安心してください、若旦那。 人を愛せる卑しい魂はただの執事だ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'クロード・ファウスタス', '「私はあなたの忠実なしもべです。 気を引こうとしなくても、最後まで貪欲に食い尽くしたい」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'クロード・ファウスタス', '「ご主人様……私はいつもあなたのそばにいます。 昼と夜、砂糖と塩、生と死、不純と純。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'クロード・ファウスタス', '「というか、あの人間の魂に注ぎ込みすぎて魔感覚が弱まった？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'クロード・ファウスタス', '「不誠実への情熱、現実への嘘、伯爵への野良犬。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'クロード・ファウスタス', '「落ち着きへの情熱、解決への躊躇、墓石への愛。 それがトランシーの執事だ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'マダム・レッド', '「殺された妹に復讐したいの？ シスターは絶対に……あなたがこんな風になってほしくないわ」 マダム・レッド', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'マダム・レッド', '「私を過小評価していませんか？ 私って人気者じゃないですか？ あちらこちらで少し言葉を交わすと、それがアレンジされます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'マダム・レッド', '「父そっくりの赤い髪が好きになりました。 赤が好きになりました。 私はあなたを愛するようになりました。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'マダム・レッド', '「ずっと娘が欲しかったから！ あ かわいい 長く流れるようなドレスを着て素敵に見える娘！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'マダム・レッド', '「父そっくりの赤い髪が嫌いだった。 私は赤が嫌いだった。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'マイリーン', '「これらは私の大切なものです メガネ 若いマスターが私のために買ったもの！ こちらのメイド服も。 ここに来る前は、スカートなどを履いたことがありませんでした。 私は今、メイドになってとても幸せです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'マイリーン', '"無駄だ。 小さなねずみはどこでも走れますが、いつも私の視界の中にいます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'マイリーン', '「若きご主人様の言うことは守ります。 毎日きれいな屋敷で主人と向き合うこと。 それがメイドの仕事です。 屋敷の汚れを拭き取ります」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2500, 'フィニアン', '「親切に扱ってください」ですね。 ここに来る前は、理解できなかったと思います。 でも、今ならできる気がする！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2500, 'フィニアン', '「若いマスターは私に毎日注射をするわけではありません。 若いマスターは私の友達を殺しません。 若いマスターは私を閉じ込めません。 私はここが大好きです。 だから守ると決めた」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2500, 'フィニアン', '「昔はこうやって外に出られなかった。 だから今は毎日やっていて楽しいです。 木や虫や人に触れることができます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2500, 'フィニアン', '「でも私の力が大きすぎるので、セバスチャンさんは私がキッチンにあるものに触れることを禁じています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6931, 'アシェラッド', '「金の奴隷である男が鞭を握り、自分が主人であると主張するかのように、その金で買った奴隷を殴る。 彼はそれを自分で見ていないだけです。 すべての生きている人間は何かの奴隷です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6931, 'アシェラッド', '「あなたは若い。 時間はあなたの味方です。 あなたは成長し、私は年をとります。 いつかあなたは私を倒すでしょう。 それは自然なことです。 最強の男も死ななければならない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6931, 'アシェラッド', '「勝てない戦いは強迫観念になる。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6931, 'アシェラッド', '「戦場で仕事をした者だけが望む報酬を得る。 それが戦士の生き方だ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6931, 'アシェラッド', '「彼は自分で気づいていないだけです。 誰もが何かの奴隷です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6931, 'アシェラッド', '「適切なアプローチで誰でも利用できます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6931, 'アシェラッド', '「戦場では弱い者が先に死ぬ。 あなたのような。"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6931, 'アシェラッド', '「戦場で偉大なことを達成してみてください。 あなたはバイキングです。 じゃあ、デュエルでご褒美をあげよう」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6931, 'アシェラッド', '「戦場で戦った者だけが望むものを手に入れる。 それが戦士のやり方だ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'ウィリバルド神父', '「死を求める者に死を見つけさせよ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'ウィリバルド神父', '「愛は世界のすべてのものに価値をもたらします。 愛がなければ、金も銀も馬も女も価値がない。」 ウィリバルド神父', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6934, 'トルケル', '「戦うのも好きだけど、それ以上に負けず嫌い！ 勝つために戦うだけだ!!」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'イルバ', '「まあ、死んだらそれで終わりだ。 それについて泣いても、お腹が空くだけです。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6933, 'クヌート', '「世界…神の神聖なる創造物…愛に溢れている…それでも人の心には愛がない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6933, 'クヌート', '「この世界のどこに正気の人間がいる？ 私たちは同じです。 私たちは皆同じです。 すべてを愛するということの意味を理解している人は誰もいません。 生きる意味か、死の意味か、自分たちの戦いの意味か」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'レイフ・エリクソン', '「すべての戦士が剣を手に戦場で戦うわけではありません。 船乗りは海と戦って生計を立てる。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'トールズ', '「私がこの剣に頼らなければならない唯一の理由は、私が不完全だからです。 真の戦士……剣はいらない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'トールズ', '「あなたには敵がいません。 誰も…敵はいません。 誰もいない…あなたが傷つけるべきだと。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'トールズ', '「自分のしたことの責任を取る時が来た」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'トールズ', '「さっさと立ち去れ、お前の命は奪わない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'トールズ', '「私はまだマスターではないので、このような剣に頼らなければなりません。 真の戦士に剣はいらない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'トールズ', '「戦士としての約束を守りなさい。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'トールズ', '「あなたには敵がいません。 誰も敵を持っていません。 傷つけていい人なんていない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6935, 'ビョルン', '」のために戦わないでください お金. 私は殺すのが好きです」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6945, 'ヘルガ', '「この子に名前をつけてください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'フロキ', '「質問をするべきではありません。それはあなた自身の利益のためです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'フロキ', '「彼は空っぽの言葉の男ではないようです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, '–トルフィン', '「私はすぐに何かを達成します。 そしたらお前は俺の手で死ぬ」 –トルフィン', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6431, '–ヘルブラム', '「悪役が悪さを見せないと困ります。 騎士を英雄にするためにはヴィランが必要だ」 –ヘルブラム', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '「誰もがいつか死ななければならない。 しかし、彼らが信じたものは、誰かが守る限り決して色褪せることはありません。 どれだけの血と涙を流しても、それらの原則を受け入れると決心したら、それを実行します。 それが騎士であるということだ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '「質の良い酒を好まない者は、それを飲むに値しない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '「ああ、心配しないで！ サイズチェックを行うだけです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '「大丈夫、何かあったら駆けつけるから！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '「どんな嘘をついても、自分の心をだますことはできない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '「勝てないと感じ、頼れる人が周りにいないときはいつでも、これらの魔法の言葉を言ってください. 確かに、私は他の七つの大罪よりも強力です!」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '「貴様は、失おうとしている無価値な力と引き換えに、貴いものを全て捨てた！ それはあなたの罪です！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '「たとえあなたが死んでも、あなたとの約束は必ず守ります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '「剣はいらない。 誰も殺したくありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '「どれだけ出血しても、涙が枯れ果てても、あなたはそれに固執します。 それが騎士の姿です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '「心拍異常なし！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '「まあまあまあ……エリザベートを返してもらう」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '"さあ行こう！ 私たちは戦うべき戦いを持っています！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '「あなたの長老が親切にしようとしているのが分かりませんか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '「ギルは愛する少女のために命を賭けたのだから、私の命を懸けたのは、私が良き相棒であるということだ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '「すべてを守りたかった。 しかし、私は失敗し、それが私が負った罪です。 だから今回は、守り抜かないわけにはいかない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '「あの人すごい！ 彼の言うことはすべて性的なことです！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '「急いで私を殺してください。 そうすれば、あなたの愛する人が生き返ります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '「いつも一緒に戦ってくれたみんなの為に。 3000年続いたこの戦争。 一旦終わらせます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'メリオダス', '「前戯の一部として見れば、実際にはそれほど悪くはありません！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6402, 'ゴウセル', '「私が望むのは心…感情を理解する心です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6403, 'マーリン', '「互いに矛盾するものがあるときは、すべての反対側を見るべきです。 そして、一見不自然な行動の意味が明らかになったとき、まったく別の答えにたどり着くかもしれません… 正義は悪になることができます. 現実は幻想になることがあります。 無意味に見えるものに意味を見出すことができる。 考え。 そして、自分で答えを見つけてください。 人間は思考を止めた瞬間に存在しなくなる。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2912, '岸谷新羅', '「世界中の人が死んでも、最愛の人が生きていれば構わない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2912, '岸谷新羅', '「あの三人は親友だ。 彼らにはそれぞれの秘密があります。 そして、彼らは意図的に自分自身をあきらめないようにしています。 しかし、折原も静雄も秘密は何も持っていなかった。 その結果、まったく逆の種類の個人的な関係が生まれました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2912, '岸谷新羅', '「最近は、暗い場所でも快適に過ごせるようになりました。 私はこれらの影をあなたの一部として見ています。 それらはすべての光を吸収します。 この色を持っている人は世界にあなたしかいません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2912, '岸谷新羅', '「彼は冷血に見えるかもしれませんが、彼は誰よりも人間的で、彼の心は他の誰よりも脆く、人間の愛や裏切りで満たされると簡単に壊れてしまうほどです.最初からそれをすべて避けてください：人類を愛することです。 わかりますか？ それを受け入れず、直面せず、しかし彼はそれを避けることを選んだ.」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, 'ボロナ', '"愛。 私自身、人を愛したことがありません。 おそらく、私は自分自身を愛していません。 私はそれについての知識を持っています。 しかし、それが私の人生に不可欠かどうかを判断することはできません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, 'ボロナ', '「故郷から遠く離れた街。 そこで、見知らぬ人と知り合って、私は変わったのだろうか？ 抑えきれない衝動…今は消えてしまったのかな？ 私はこの街で一体何をしているのだろう？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2910, '平和島静雄', '「あなたは私の頭に行っただけですよね？ 頭の急所を叩けば殺せるって知ってるでしょ？ これを知っているなら、あなたは私を殺そうとしていたのですよね？ だから私が次に何をするにしても、あなたは当然のことですよね？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2910, '平和島静雄', '「ほら、あなた。 モンスターの話ばかり…子供の頃から人々は私をモンスターと呼んでいました。 身の回りのものをパチンと見失ったり、セルティに迷惑をかけたことは一度や二度ではありません。 それでも、彼女は中断することなく、私の話を聞いてくれました。 今度は私が彼女の話を聞く番ですよね？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2910, '平和島静雄', '「私は暴力が本当に嫌いです…いつか怒りを抑えられるように、強くなりたいだけです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2910, '平和島静雄', '「ほら、それが意味するのは、私がそれを失うと、物事が意味をなさないということです. 理屈があれば、撃たれたり刺されたりしても怒らない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2910, '平和島静雄', '"聞く。 見た目は殺すことができます。 少なくとも 0.00000000000000000000675% の確率で、呪いや凝視が誰かを殺す可能性があります。 だから睨みつけたら殺されても文句は言えない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「人間として、どんな成果を残しますか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「例外なく、みんな同じ。 それらのすべては、神の前に平等です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「人を善悪で分けるのはばかげている。 人々は魅力的か退屈かのどちらかです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「人をいじめるのはダメ。 可哀想だな、本当に」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「あなたの素敵な女性が殴られて死んでも私の問題ではありません. 私はあなたの歯をあなたの喉に叩きつけることができました. あるいは、私が実際には23歳のときに私の年齢を気にすることができます. 私は気にしません.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「ああ、どうぞ。 この世界は誰の命令にも従わないから面白いんだ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「過去からはいくらでも逃げられるが、それはいつでもついて来る。 いつまでも、いつまでも、いつまでも。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「私は無礼ではありません…我慢できない人に丁寧に親切にするように教えられなかっただけです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「死ぬということは、いなくなるということです。 そして進むのは、あなたの痛みではなく、あなたの存在そのものです。 でも、心の中では、死んだ後は「何もない」という感覚があると思っています。 それをどうして「無」と呼べるの？ 言い換えれば、あなたは死が実際にどのようなものかについての考えさえ持っていません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「平凡な人生を楽しむためには、常に進化しなければならない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「あなたは彼らがどのようにパラメータを持っているか知っています 賭ける? 魔法は得意だけど戦闘スキルが下手とか、格闘技は得意だけど頭脳が足りないとか。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「なぜ自分は優秀で、親が悪いのか考えたことはありますか？ よろしければ、答えを教えてください。 浮気をしていても、だまされていても、みんな下手な冗談で笑ったり、甘すぎる煮物を食べたりするからです」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「あなたは自分が特別だと思いますか？ あなたではない。 誰もが嘘をつき、誰もが物事を隠します...誰もこの人生を完全に正直に生き抜くことができません。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「思い出に残るものをたくさんくれた人を忘れるのはつらい」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「私は私であり、それは何も悪いことではありません。 行き過ぎた欲望も絶望もせず、何も変わらない日々が続く。 でも、この充実感には圧倒されます。 私はここにいます、あなたはあそこにいます。 私があなたの救世主なら、あなたは私のものです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「人々が私をどれほど信頼しているかは、ちょっと怖いです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「ありふれた日常から逃れる唯一の方法は、常に進化し続けることです。 高みを目指すか、低めを目指すか。 ありのままの毎日を楽しんでください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「まあ、自分の行動に理由を付けるとしたら、それは人を愛しているからだと思います。 人類の顔が見たかったのかな」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「私は神を信じていません。 彼が存在するという証拠はありません。 未来の証拠さえない世界に、過去が存在する。 誤解や妄想にまみれても、本人が信じていれば過去は真実。 そして、それを行動や生活の基盤とするならば、ある意味、それ自体が一種の神です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「ストーカーは自分がストーカー行為をしていることに気づいていないと聞きました。 どうやら、彼らは自分たちが「保護している」と信じているようです.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, '折原臨也', '「私が存在する限り、地獄があっても、そこに苦しみだけがあってもかまいません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, '門田恭平', '「どんなに逃げようとしても、自分の一部だったものから逃れることはできません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, '門田恭平', '「過去から逃げたいならいい。 しかし、何をするにしても、現在から、さらに悪いことに、未来から逃げないでください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, 'シモン・ブレジネフ', '「50％オフの日でも、料理に人を入れません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, 'シモン・ブレジネフ', '「思春期は終わったの？ それじゃ、お寿司を食べましょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, 'シモン・ブレジネフ', '「あなたは十分幸せだから、他人の幸せを奪わないで。 共有する必要があります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, '矢切誠司', '「本当に彼女を愛しているなら、何があっても目をそらさないでください。 何を見ても、彼女について何を学んでも、目をそらさないでください. 彼女を抱きしめたら、離さないでください。 誰かを愛すると決めたら、それはあなたの責任です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, '矢切誠司', '「誰かを愛することと名前は関係ありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2919, 'セルティ・ストゥルルソン', '「あなたが見ているものは、必ずしも現実とは限りません。 誰にでも、誰にも言えない秘密、感じていることがあります。 普通の人間なんてありえない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2919, 'セルティ・ストゥルルソン', '「世界はあなたが思っているほど残酷ではありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2909, '園原杏里', '「本当に普通ではない人生とはどのようなものだと思いますか? 本当にユニークなもの。 毎日何も新しいことが起こらないような生活です。 何も変わっていません。 そのような人生は本当に珍しいです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, '竜ヶ峰ミカド', '「私はクリシェが好きで、予測可能な台本が好きで、それらが問題に貼り付けられるのが好きで、ハッピーエンドを強制するのも好きです。 それに向かって努力して何が悪いの？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, '竜ヶ峰ミカド', '「私の故郷では、空はどこまでも続くように見えました…でも、見るものは何もありませんでした。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, '竜ヶ峰ミカド', '「私には、理屈の通らない人に立ち向かう力も知恵もありません。 努力する時間すら与えてくれない。 だから数字に頼る！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, '刈沢エリカ', '「フィクションを現実と同じくらい価値のあるものにすれば、必要のない現実はすべて妄想になる」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, '刈沢エリカ', '「現実はとても苦痛です。 そして、そのような現実にうんざりしている私たちは、単に新しいものを作ることを選択します. 私たちは小さな壁を作り、ゴミと好きなものを分けます。それがすべて終わったら、気にかけているものを残して、残りを縁石に蹴り飛ばします。 あなたはそれがどれほどうまく機能するかに驚くでしょう! 萌えとツンデレとBLだけの世界、最高の発見です！ 私に言わせれば、それがフィクションから現実を切り離す最良の方法です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1737, '藤岡ハルヒ', '「お互いに正直に向き合わないとしたら、これはどんな家族ですか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1737, '藤岡ハルヒ', '「本当の気持ちを隠し続けて、誰が幸せになる？ 悲しいなら声に出して言え！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1737, '藤岡ハルヒ', '「それに、たいしたことじゃないでしょ？ とにかく、外観とラベルを気にする必要があるのはなぜですか。 重要なのは中身です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1737, '藤岡ハルヒ', '「人は変わろうと思った瞬間に変われる」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1737, '藤岡ハルヒ', '「私は友人の問題を解決します…そして、彼らが新しい問題に陥らないようにする方法も見つけます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1737, '藤岡ハルヒ', '「お母さん…天国のお母さん…。 恋はこんな風に突然やってくるの？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1737, '藤岡ハルヒ', '「人柄を見て、少しずつその人を知っていくのが楽しいと思います。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1737, '藤岡ハルヒ', '「私はこれらすべての金持ちが大嫌いです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '大鳥恭也', '「自分に害がなければ、どうでもいい。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '大鳥恭也', '「勝つつもりなら、その過程で最善の取引をしたほうがいいでしょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '大鳥恭也', '「彼を気の毒に思うのは簡単ですが、彼が子供の頃に耐えた困難が、彼を今日の人間に形作ったのです。 彼は大丈夫です。ホスト クラブは彼の避難所です。つまり、すべてが完了しても、彼にはまだ私たちがいます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '大鳥恭也', '「彼が私のことを知ろうとせずに悪い判断をしても大丈夫です。 本当の意味は、私を理解したい人だけに本当の私のことを知ってもらうことです.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '大鳥恭也', '「味方か敵か、手元にあるものは何でも使おう」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '大鳥恭也', '「私たちのモットーは、私たちの特性を生かしてお客様のニーズに応えることです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '周防環', '「仕事ばかりしているのに、夢なんて何の役にも立たない。 人生には、ヒットするよりも多くのことがあります 図書、あなたが知っていることを願っています。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '周防環', '「自分はある程度知的な人間だと思っていました。 自分がバカだと気づいた時は本当にショックでした！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '周防環', '「愛しい君のさわやかな笑顔を見ると、私の胸がわくわくします。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '周防環', '「本当の強さとは何か教えてくれると思いますか？ 的外れかもしれませんが、素顔を隠して気取っているのは、逃げるのと変わらないようです。 自分が本当に好きなものを受け入れて、それを楽しめることが何よりの価値だと思います。 ありのままの自分でいること…それが本当の強さだと思います。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '周防環', '「ですから、他の人に心を開いてあげることを恐れないでください。 人々をテストし続けることは無意味です。 あなたがしていることは、あなた自身を傷つけているだけです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '周防環', '「藤岡、あなたは他の貧しい人々にとってヒーローです。 あなたは、貧乏人でも一流の私立アカデミーで優秀な成績を収めることができることを世界に示しました。 常に他人から見下されているのはつらいでしょう… けなされ、無視されますが、それは今はどうでもいいことです。 貧乏人万歳！ 私たちはあなたを歓迎します、かわいそうな男、私たちの世界…美の世界へ！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '周防環', '「無礼で申し訳ありませんが、本当の自分を隠して虚飾をすることは……それは現実逃避だと思います。 本当の自分を知り、それを認めること……楽しむポジティブ思考……それが本当の強さじゃないですか？」 周防環', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '周防環', '「少量の水は誰にも害を及ぼすことはありません。 その上、人々はいつも私が格好良いと言っています。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '周防環', '「なぜならあなたの光景は 美しい 笑顔が私の中にある泉を溢れさせます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1741, '常陸院光', '「はい、私は素敵な双子ですが、この会話は退屈です。 渋滞で遊んでください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1741, '常陸院光', '「言葉なしでは何も伝えられませんが、誰かを本当に気にかけているなら、どんな些細なことでも気づくことが重要です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1741, '常陸院光', '「自分の都合で人を虐待したり利用したりしないでください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1741, '常陸院光', '「なんてこった、彼女は「これまでで最も勇敢な王女」を目指しているのですか？ 彼女が育ったとき、腐って甘やかされていたに違いない.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1741, '常陸院光', '「うーん、何がそんなに面白いのか分からない。 私は正直です、私は自分の心を話します、そして私は躊躇しません。 トラブルメーカーは薫のようなずるい奴らだ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1741, '常陸院光', '「世界中を探しても、あなたに匹敵する人はいませんでした。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '森の塚貴志', '「いちご好きでしょ？ ここで、あなたは私のものを手に入れることができます。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '森の塚たかし', '「人を傷つけるたびに、最終的に傷つくのはあなたです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '埴塚光圀', '「自分を大事にできない人は、誰も守れないと思います。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '埴塚光圀', '「もう十分だ！ あなたは両方ともこの戦いの責任があります ！ ひかちゃんとかおちゃん、このケーキで仲直りしてハーフシーズしてほしいよね？ でも、私も一枚欲しいので、サードシーに行かないといけないかな。 ただし、いちごを上に割ることはできません。 私たちは何をすべきか？ たぶん私はそれを取るべきです。 やっぱりいちごが大好物。 あ、聞くの忘れてた、ひかちゃん、かおちゃん、イチゴは好き？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '埴塚光圀', '「決められない奴はクズだと思う」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '埴塚光圀', '「下手でも努力する人が好きです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, '薫', '「お互いの気持ちは声に出さなければ分からない」 – 常陸院 薫', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6972, 'エマ', '「私はあなたにその全体の一部になってもらいたいのです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6972, 'エマ', '「無理でもみんなと一緒に逃げたい。 それを理解しましょう。 私たち全員が死にたくない。 しかし、彼らを置き去りにするという選択肢はありません。 コニーを最後にしたい。 もう誰もあんな風になってほしくありません。 無いなら外に人が住める場所を作ろう。 世界を変えよう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6972, 'エマ', '「私たちをスパイする代わりに、彼らは出荷されずに生きられるということですか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6972, 'エマ', '「逃げたら、あの人の命はもう保障されない。 あと、やっぱり信じたい。 ギルダとの事件でそれを実感した。 レイは皆を疑うように言ったが、たとえ魔族の手先である裏切り者がいたとしても、兄妹に悪人はいない。 私たちは一緒に育った家族です。 その人が邪魔をしても、裏切っても、私がナイーブだと言っても、私はその人を信じたいです！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6972, 'エマ', '「ここは農場ですか？ 私たちは皆…食べ物ですか？ いいえ、それはできません。 誰もが里親を見つけました。 そしてお母さん… いつもの親族お母さんでしたよね？ 私たちは間違っていました。 あの子はコニーじゃないよね？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6972, 'エマ', '"ドン。 ギルダ。 もう嘘はつきませんので、もう一度質問させてください。 下手したら死ぬ。 外の世界は最悪、魔物だらけの世界。 それでも一緒に逃げてくれないか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6972, 'エマ', '「あなたは私たちと一緒に来ています。 あなたは私たちと一緒にいる必要があります。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6971, 'レイ', '「ねえ、エマ。 本当に諦めましたか？ 実は諦めていませんよね？ エマ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6971, 'レイ', '" 私は誓います。 私は二度とそれをしません。 みんなでここから逃げましょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6971, 'レイ', '「ねえ、お母さん。 どうして私を産んだの？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6971, 'レイ', '「ダン。 そして、私はとてもうまくやっていると思いました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6971, 'レイ', '「あんた……最初から帰るつもりだったの？ 自分で言ったでしょ？ 一緒に生きていけるなんて！ しかし、あなたはすでに計画していました。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, NULL, 'シスタークローネ', '「ガキどもは逃げたほうがいい。 鬼ごっこ上手ですよね？ 走る…そして走る…そして生き残る。 そして、私たちが住んでいるこの忌まわしい世界を破壊してください！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, NULL, 'シスタークローネ', '「ノーマンとレイでしょ？ はい。 あなたはテストで満点を取ると聞きました。 すごいですね。 お会い出来て嬉しいです。 私たちが仲良くできることを願っています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, NULL, 'シスタークローネ', '「二人の子供を抱えて走る。 あなたは疲れているに違いない、エマ。 休まないと動けない。 知ってますか？ ノーマンの弱点は体力。 彼は若い頃、体が弱かったと聞きました。 レイの弱点は、ちょっと諦めが早いこと。 彼はすぐに決定を下しますが、同じようにすぐに放棄します。 そして、あなた、エマ！ あなたの弱点はあなたの素朴さです。 追われているのに他人を背負ってしまうあなたの甘さのように。 さっさと諦めて出てこい。 私はあなたを間違ったことはしません。 聞いて、エマ。 その日の収穫を見たなら…私はあなたの味方です。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, NULL, 'シスタークローネ', '「では、追跡装置の場所とその破壊方法はすでに知っていたということですか？ 私が感銘を受けた。 そうか。 今はよくわかります。 情報を提供するのは言葉だけではありません。 人間はそこに立っているだけで多くの情報を与えてくれます。 態度。 視線。 点滅。 汗。 ジェスチャー。 生徒。 脈。 これらはすべて、自分が何を考えているのかを知るためのヒントです。 追跡装置があなたの耳の中にあると言いましたが、あなたはそれらに触れて確認しませんでした。 彼らを追い出す準備は整ったが、あなたはまったく幸せそうには見えなかった。 では、追跡装置が必要ないのに、なぜ追跡装置について尋ねたのですか? 私に隠したいことはありますか？ 秘密を守っているのですか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6969, 'イザベラ', '「レイ。 どうしてその曲を知ったの？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6969, 'イザベラ', '"はい。 私は幸せです。 あなたみたいな人に出会えたから」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6969, 'イザベラ', '"私は失いました。 続ける。 お気をつけください。 そして、あなたが光を見つけることを祈っています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, NULL, 'おばあちゃん', '「面倒ですね、シスター・クローネ、イザベラの邪魔をするなんて。 彼らは特別です。 イザベラと彼女の植物。 イザベラは私にとってなくてはならないポーンです。 あなたは彼女の代わりをするには不十分です。 私にとって面倒なことになります。 ティファリで最高の一皿をご提供できますように。 農場の利益が最大になりますように。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6974, 'ギルダ', '「もしそうなら、これがここにあるはずがないからです。 それはコニーに届けられたでしょう。 リトルバニーだけではありません。 彼らが去ったとき、彼らはすべてママによって彼らから奪われました、そして彼らはすべて悪い人々によって連れ去られました.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6974, 'ギルダ', '「だから、彼らの言ったことは本当だった。 お母さんは嘘をついていた。 里親に送られる人は誰もいなかった。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6968, 'ノーマン', '「脱出は成功する」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6968, 'ノーマン', '「あの人を置き去りにしますか？ それとも私たちと一緒に連れて行きますか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6968, 'ノーマン', '「計画はまだ終わっていない。 あなたの足は治ります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6968, 'ノーマン', '「ねぇ…お母さん、幸せ？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(129, 6968, 'ノーマン', '「誰であろうと逃がしはしない」 お母さんの言いたいことは、たぶんそれだ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(100, 5571, 'ターニャ・デグレチャフ', '「奇跡とは、不十分な観察と理解によって引き起こされる幻想です。 それらはただ… 輝かしい誤解です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(100, 5571, 'ターニャ・デグレチャフ', '「無駄なおしゃべりの時間があれば、生き残るためにできる限りのことをしてください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(100, 5571, 'ターニャ・デグレチャフ', '「うまくいかないことは、必ずうまくいく。 有名な法律です。 長生きすればわかる。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(100, 5571, 'ターニャ・デグレチャフ', '「私は神の存在を認めません！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(100, 5571, 'ターニャ・デグレチャフ', '「彼らは、天才と狂気を分ける細い線があると言います。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(100, 5571, 'ターニャ・デグレチャフ', '「どれだけ近代化しても、社会規範が私たちにどのような影響を与えても、人間は愚かな生き物です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(100, 5571, 'ターニャ・デグレチャフ', '"勝利。 そのような魅力的なこと。 誰もが味を味わいたいと思うのは当然です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(100, 5571, 'ターニャ・デグレチャフ', '「人間の行動を促すのは合理主義だけではありません。 私たちは愚かな生き物です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(109, 6126, '蛇喰夢子', '「その量は、 お金 所有者が最終的に勝者を決定します。 これは、カジノの壁やキャッシュ フローにとどまりません。 資本主義社会の基本となるルールだ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(109, 6126, '蛇喰夢子', '「友達って、いざという時に助け合いますよね？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(109, 6126, '蛇喰夢子', '「自分の血を流す準備ができていなければ、誰もだますことはできません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(109, 6126, '蛇喰夢子', '「疑い、怒り、絶望、叫びたくなるような気持ちに違いない。 私は正しいですか？', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(109, 6126, '蛇喰夢子', '「もっとギャンブルしたい！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(109, 6126, '蛇喰夢子', '「勝つか負けるかがはっきりとわかっている状況は嫌いです。 ギャンブルじゃないから。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(109, 6126, '蛇喰夢子', '「あなたがギャンブル好きかどうかはわかりませんが、あなたは人間として最低です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(109, NULL, 'よもづきるな', '「彼らが言うように、知らないほどよく眠れます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(109, NULL, 'よもづきるな', '「では、予定通りか。 しかし、物事がうまくいくように見えるときはいつでも、バックグラウンドで常に問題が発生していることは間違いありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(109, NULL, '百喰きらり', '「人間は理不尽な生き物だと言われますが、理由もなくここまで来ることは稀です。 ギャンブルは彼らに何ももたらさず、何かを失うだけです。 それでも、私たちはギャンブルを続けています。 リスクを楽しんでいるからそうするのです。」 ・百喰きらり', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, '黒子テツヤ', '「好きだったものを嫌いになると、信じられないほど辛い」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, '黒子テツヤ', '「ゲーム終了時にいくらポイントを獲得しても、満足できなければ勝利とは言えません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, '黒子テツヤ', '「他の人が無意味だと思っても、可能性が0でもやめるのはもったいない。だから、絶対に……あきらめない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, '黒子テツヤ', '「私は光に打ち勝った影です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, '黒子テツヤ', '「一人で勝っても意味がない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, '黒子テツヤ', '「変わっていないということは、改善されていないということです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, '黒子テツヤ', '「好きなことに全力を尽くせば、心の底から勝利を楽しむことができます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, '黒子テツヤ', '「そこに着いたら、将来が心配になるでしょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'むらさきばらあつし', '「君たちが求めているものはすべて……ハードワーク、根性、信念……全部ぶち壊してやる」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'むらさきばらあつし', '「誰もが努力によって夢をかなえることができると思いますか? 努力が報われるとは限りません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'むらさきばらあつし', '「私は練習が好きではありません。 これ以上負けるのが嫌なだけです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '加賀美大河', '「これは私たちのショーです。 脚本を書いているのは私たちです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '加賀美大河', '「君はいつも光のそばにいる。 それがあなたのバスケットボールです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '加賀美大河', '「人生は挑戦の連続 強い相手がいなければ生きていけない 勝てない方がいい」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '加賀美大河', '「私たちが負ける運命にあるのは、フィクションの物語だけです。 これが私たちのドラマです！ プロットがどうなるかは私たちが決めます！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '加賀美大河', '「強い敵がいなければ、生きていて楽しくない。 勝てなければ完璧です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '加賀美大河', '「他人の気持ちがわかれば、誰も戦争を始めない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '加賀美大河', '「無駄な努力はない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '加賀美大河', '「今は怖がっている時ではない。 もちろん相手が弱いより強いほうがいいですよね！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '加賀美大河', '「オリジナルはコピーよりも価値があるので、自分らしくありなさい。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '日向純平', '「先輩に話し方教えてあげるよ、ハゲ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '日向純平', '「みんなを信じて行かないで メガネ 賢い！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '日向純平', '「あなたの頑張りは必ず報われます。」 そんな馬鹿げたことを思いついたのは、どんな馬鹿だ？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3424, '伊月俊', '「恐れることは悪いことではありません。 臆病者にしかできないことがある。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3424, '伊月俊', '「数学はあなたの怒りを引き出しますか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '緑間慎太郎', '「スポーツの世界では、素早さは必ずしも最速というわけではありません。 また、ゼロから最高速度までの加速、または最高速度からゼロまでの減速を意味することもあります。 これは敏捷性として知られています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '緑間慎太郎', '「どう変わるかはあなた次第」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '緑間慎太郎', '「『男はプロポーズする』ということわざを知らない？ 神は処分しますか？ まず、あなたが最善を尽くし、その後、運命がどうなるかを決めます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '緑間慎太郎', '"あきらめてはいけない！ 転んでも恥ずかしくない！ 真の恥は二度と立ち上がらないことだ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '緑間慎太郎', '「一人でプレーできない人は、一人で上達することはできません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '明石清十郎', '「他のすべてを排除するまで、私たちは満足することはできません。 理屈とは関係ありません。 それは本能です。」 明石清十郎', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '明石誠十郎', '「この世界は勝つことがすべて。 勝者は歴史を書きます。 敗者はそこから一掃されます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '明石誠十郎', '「なんてばかげた試みだ。 その場に留まって、私の足元にひれ伏すだけでいいのよ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '明石誠十郎', '「出て行けと言ったら出て行け。 この世界では、勝つことがすべてです。 勝者は完全に肯定され、敗者は完全に否定されます。 私はこれまでに何かに負けたことはありません。 私はいつも勝つし、いつも正しいから。 私に敵対する者には容赦しません、たとえ私の両親であってもです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '明石清十郎', '「私はまったく変わっていません。 最初から二人いました。 それは私たちの間の単なる交換でした。 これを隠すつもりはありません。 信じるか信じないかはあなた次第です、テツヤ。 しかし、それを「変化」と呼ぶなら、それは必要だったからです。 私が変わったからチームが変わったのではない。 チームが変わったので、私も変わりました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '明石清十郎', '「私に敵対する者が私を見下すことは許しません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '明石誠十郎', '「この世界では勝利がすべて。 勝利が認められ、敗者は否認されます。 私は全体的に勝利しているので、私は常に正義です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3430, '青峰大輝', '「諦めなければ必ずできるとは言いません。 でも、諦めたら絶対に何もない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3430, '青峰大輝', '「役立たずの選手などいない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3430, '青峰大輝', '「勝者にとって、敗者には何も言うことはありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3430, '青峰大輝', '「俺を倒せるのは俺だけだ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '氷室達也', '「何が得意で、何が好きか…。自分が何者であるかを人々に理解してもらうために、何かを示す必要があります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '花宮誠', '「壊せばただのゴミだ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3423, '黄瀬涼太', '「ひとたび人を尊敬すると、追い越すことはできません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3423, '黄瀬涼太', '「動揺する時間があれば、その時間を使って先に進むべきだった… 一歩でも前に！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '会田理子', '「何かが終わると、別のことが始まる。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '清鉄平', '「勝つために懸命に働き続け、少しずつ良くなっていく。 好きなことにどっぷり浸かる、それが何かを存分に楽しむということです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '清鉄平', '「チームは守るだけのものではない。 チームもあなたを守ります。 私たちはチームなので、それぞれをサポートするわけではありません。 私たちはお互いをサポートしているから、私たちはチームです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '清鉄平', '「山に登りたければ頂上を目指すのは当然だが、景色も楽しまなければならない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, '清鉄平', '「彼らは、いくつかの敗北は意味があり、敗北はあなたを強くすると言います. それが何を意味するか分かりますか？ 生物にとって勝利は生であり、敗北は死を意味する。 極端な例ですが、人間にはその本能があります。 敗北の恐ろしさを知る者は、勝利に飢えている。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, 3864, '一条楽', '「でも……あなたがそのように誰かのために尽くせる人なら、きっとあなたに恋をする人がいるでしょう」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, 3864, '一条楽', '「私は偽の彼氏かもしれませんが、何かあったら…私があなたを守ります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, 3864, '一条楽', '「私は彼女や他の人たちに打ちのめされるのに慣れています。 しかし、いまいましい。 顔を平手打ちするともっと痛い」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, 3864, '一条楽', '「不必要な苦痛に耐えられるのは愚か者だけだ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, 3864, '一条楽', '"あなたが正しい。 あの娘に再び会えるかどうかにかかわらず、この約束が私にとって重要であるという事実は変わりません. これからも大事にしていきます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '舞妓衆', '「それで、あなたは自分が不誠実であるかのように感じますか？ それは真実ではない。 誰かを好きになることは素晴らしいことです。 私に言わせれば……ここで重要なことは、どちらかを明確に選択しなければならないということです。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '舞妓衆', '「悔いのないように……それは自分勝手で、それ以上のことはありません。 大丈夫。 というか、これ自体がいい思い出ですよね？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '舞妓衆', '「恋をしている時間の長さだけじゃないでしょ？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '–舞妓周', '「この片思いは、甘酸っぱい青春のページとして心の片隅にそっとしまっておくことにした」 –舞妓周', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '舞妓衆', '「ただ……迷うことなく何年も続いた愛は、誰が見ても 美しい そして失敗することは不可能です。 でも……短いかもしれないし、途中で曲がったり曲がったりするかもしれないけど、本気で感じているのなら……そうじゃないってことはないと思うんです。 美しい」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '舞妓衆', '「青春をちゃんと楽しむこと。 こんなことを話していたのかもしれません。 結果や周りのことを考えずに全力で生きること。 それがそれについてのことでした。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '舞妓衆', '「私が聞いた、あなたが誰かを好きかどうかを判断する方法を教えましょう。 虹を見つけたとき、流れ星を見つけたとき、お気に入りのカフェを見つけたとき、お釣りが777円か何かを想像してみてください。 楽ならお茶の中で初めて葉っぱが立った瞬間を想像してみてもいいですよね。 あなたが見つけたとき 美しい 日没、またはあなたの好みを見つけた場合 音楽、または宝くじでかなりの賞金を獲得した場合、日常生活の小さなこと。 そんな小さな幸せや幸運に出会ったとき、真っ先に伝えたい相手は誰ですか？ 誰の顔が思い浮かびましたか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '舞妓衆', '「同じように見るのは間違っている。 デリケートな話だけど、自分の力で背負えるものと、誰かの力で背負うものの重さは違う」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '橘まりか', '「マイ、マイ！ 私は本当にあなたのためにそれを綴る必要がありますか? 自ら行動しなければ得られるものはありません。 と同じです ロマンス – あなたの唯一の望みは、よりアグレッシブになることです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '橘まりか', '「私はあなたを憎むつもりはありません！ 一度もない！ 未来がどうなろうとも！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '橘まりか', '「これからは忘れないようにします！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '橘まりか', '「告白したよね！？ 何度も何度も！ 答えは口で知ってるのに…声で！ 告白したよ!? 楽を真っ直ぐに見たことがありますか!? 楽はそれだけか!? せめて最後に、もう少し自分に正直になってください!! 彼が本当に好きなら、何もなかったかのように振る舞うことはできません!」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '橘まりか', '「そんな自分の気持ちを抱えて……誰にも見せないから、誰も傷つかないと思ってるの？ それはとにかく周りを傷つけることと同じです！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '橘まりか', '「この世界の何ものも、手に入れようと動かなければ、あなたのものにはなりません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '橘まりか', '「適切な人を愛しているとき、愛は傷つきません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '橘まりか', '"おお？ 何にビックリ!? 私が一度断られたら諦めるタイプだと思いますか!? 入院してもしなくても、もっと自分を磨いて、もっと素敵な女性になって、あなたの元に戻ってきます！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '立花千佳', '「娘の気持ちに報いるつもりはないですよね？ では、そのように話す権利をあなたに与えるものは何ですか？ 罪悪感をなだめたいのかもしれません。 それを「偽善」と呼びませんか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '立花千佳', '「今日の人々に利益をもたらさない伝統は無価値です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '小野寺浩咲', '「千棘ちゃんなんで逃げたの？ いや…いらない… 諦めたって嬉しくない… 同じ人を好きになってしまうなんて。 辛いのは確かだけど、千棘ちゃん、その後もう顔を合わせられないくらい好きだよね？ 誰と結ばれるとしても、そのときは満足したい。 きっとあなたも同じように考えていると思いました。 それが出来ない理由があるのですか？ 教えて千棘ちゃん」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '小野寺浩咲', '「あなたがいなくて寂しくて、どうすることもできないのは本当に嫌です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '金倉結衣', '「約束した相手が分かったら、本当に好きになれるの？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'つぐみせいしろう', '「私は恋に落ちるつもりはありませんでした。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'つぐみせいしろう', '「仕方ない、どうしようもないなら仕方がない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, 3866, '宮本るり', '「彼がすでに他の誰かに恋をしているという理由だけで、誰かを追いかけてはいけないという法律はありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, 3863, '桐崎千棘', '「あなたを失うことを気にしない人にしがみつくときは、決して自分を見失わないでください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, 3863, '桐崎千棘', '「あなたは絶対に孤独になることはありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, 3863, '桐崎千棘', '「私があなたと戦うときは心配しないでください…私たちが戦うために何も残っていないので、私がやめるときに心配してください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, 3863, '桐崎千棘', '「時には何かを知っている…何も知らないよりも悪い」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, 3863, '桐崎千棘', '「誰もが能力を持っています。 そしてそれは、誰もがその能力を最大限に活用すべきだということです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '小野寺春', '「一緒にいても不満はありません……先輩……あなたはわたしが探し求めていた王子様ですか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '小野寺春', '「あなたは去っていきます…私たちもとても良い友達にならなければなりません。 本当に寂しくなります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '福田忍次郎', '「この世には二種類の人がいます。 嫌いなものを先に食べる人、最後に食べる人。」 ・福田忍次郎', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, '桐崎花', '「時間はそうではない お金。 あなたはできません 購入 時間、今できますか？', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, 3870, 'クロード', '「私たちにとって、あなたはどんな宝石よりも価値があります。 最も大切な貴重品を自分の家の境界の外に置いてきたら、安心できますか? 宝物とは、常に身につけているものです。 それは常識です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「人生は運のゲームではありません。 勝ちたいなら頑張れ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「試合に勝つ方法は一つではありません。 戦わなくても勝てる！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「誤解されている人々の可能性を確実に実現するのは、普通の人々としての私たちの仕事です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「私たちは何も持たずに生まれたのだから、何にでもなれることを受け入れよう！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「体が弱かったので、私たちは目と耳と考える力を鍛えました。 生き残る方法を学ぶ、それが人間としての私たちの特徴です! 人間という種族は魔法を使うことができず、それを知覚することさえできません – しかし、私たちは弱いので、魔法から逃げる知恵とそれを見抜く知性を持っています. 私たちは特別な感覚を持っていません。 しかし、私たちは弱いので、学び、経験を積むことで、達成不可能なことを達成するための知恵を得ました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「あなたを疑う人ほど信頼できる観察者はいません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「おとぎ話って、主人公が異世界に行った時、頑張って家に帰ろうとしますよね？ でも、そんな世界に誰が戻りたいと思う？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「それが、私たちが決して勝てない理由です。」 そんなことを考えているなら、あなたは失敗する運命にあります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「いつの時代も、どの世界も、強い者は牙を磨き、弱い者は知恵を磨く。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「誰かが飛びたいと思ったら、それで翼が生えますか？ 私はそうは思わない。 あなたは自分自身を変えません。 問題へのアプローチ方法が変わります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '"ごめん。 私たちの世界はあなたの世界ほど素晴らしい場所ではありません。 戦争と殺害に関しては、私たちはあなたよりもはるかに多くの専門知識を持っています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '"は？ 本当の戦争で、敵の「出番」を待つ愚か者は？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「二人で弱者として生き、弱者として戦い、弱者のように強者を倒す！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「人は速いより遅いほうがいい。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「自分が馬鹿だと知っている馬鹿は、自分が馬鹿だと思っている馬鹿よりも対処するのが難しい.」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「失敗しても、シロがそばにいてくれる。 だからこそ、ブランクが常に勝つのです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「チェックメイト」とは、単に敵の王を追い詰めたという意味ではありません。 敵の王はあなたのものであるという宣言です。 だから初めて会った時に言った。 「チェックメイト」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「強者の天敵は弱者だが、弱者の天敵は強者ではなく、それよりも弱い者だ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「部下を前線で戦わせながら、後ろでくつろいでいるのはどのような王ですか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「確率は？ 描画 ジョーカーのないデッキからスペードのエース？ 通常は 1/50 です。 しかし、それが真新しいデッキだったらどうでしょうか? 新しいデッキのカードの位置は通常同じです。つまり、ジョーカーを取り出して一番下のカードを引くと、ほぼ 100% の確率でスペードのエースになります。 ああ、そうです！ それが新しいデッキであることについては一言も言いませんでした。 むしろ、あなたは尋ねませんでした。 「知っている」ということは、勝率を 1.92% から 100% に変える力を与えてくれます。 パーティーの知識が多ければ多いほど、必然的に勝者になります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「体力と長寿が自分を強くすると考えるなら、脳の部分が深刻に欠けているに違いない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「私たちはプレーをやめません 賭ける 私たちは年をとるから、遊ぶのをやめるから年をとるのです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '「人間を見下すなよ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'ソラ', '"抑圧。 恐怖による支配。 独裁。 それは奇妙なことです。 歴史を通じて、何らかの理由で、そのような支配者の命は常に同じ方法で終わりました: 戦闘部隊の一員でさえない誰かによる暗殺.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3910, 'テト', '「実際には、通常、最も面白くない答えが正しい答えです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3910, 'テト', '「自分の世界についてどう思いますか？ それ楽しいですか？ 住みやすいですか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'シロ', '「チェスは三目並べと変わらない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'シロ', '「満たされた人は都市伝説にすぎない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3905, 'ステファニー・ドーラ', '「一時の敗北は、それが最終的な勝利につながるなら問題ありません！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7093, '空条承太郎', '「お前は本当に史上最低のクズだ。 借りたものを返せない お金」 ・空条承太郎', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7093, '空条承太郎', '「もう黙ってろ。 もう何も言うことはありません。 可哀想すぎる… 息を切らしてしまった」 ・空条承太郎', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7093, '空条承太郎', '"持て！ 私にはまだ育てる権利があります…私はあなたを私の母の魂として育てます。 ・空条承太郎', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7093, '空条承太郎', '「あんたが殺した女、エンヤに許しを請え。 でも、私としては、あなたを許すつもりは微塵もありませんでした。」 ・空条承太郎', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7093, '空条承太郎', '「DIO……どうしてあんなに忠誠を尽くすのか理解できない。 あなたは正直に私に言っています… 彼のために死ぬと思いますか？ ・空条承太郎', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7093, '空条承太郎', '「匂いを追跡できるように、ガソリンをまぶしました。 落ち込んでいる奴を蹴るのも気持ち悪いけど…いや、別に悪い気はしないよ。 あなたのせいで、私の友人と多くの傍観者が死んでいます。」 ・空条承太郎', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7093, '空条承太郎', '「すまない、子供だからといって過小評価しないでください。」 ・空条承太郎', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7093, '空条承太郎', '"不可能？ 私たちはこの旅で多くの不可能なことをしました。 物事が不可能または役に立たないというのは聞き飽きました。 それらの言葉は私たちにとって何の意味もありません。」 ・空条承太郎', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, NULL, 'ムハンマド', '「四つ目の願い、それは……あなたの願いを聞かないこと、マジシャンズ・レッドはあなたを許しません。 起きていません。"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7096, 'ジョナサン・ジョースター', '「ディオー！ 赤ちゃんみたいに泣かせてやる！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7096, 'ジョナサン・ジョースター', '「私たちの取引を完了させたいと思っています。よろしいですか？ 私は自分の家族を害を望む者から守るために戦っているのですが、あなたの決意が私のものと同等であるかどうかは非常に疑わしいです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7096, 'ジョナサン・ジョースター', '「お父さん……安らかに。 煙があなたの魂を天国へと導きますように。 でも最後にお願いだから、あなたの力で炎を燃やしてください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7096, 'ジョナサン・ジョースター', '「ここで終わり！ 生きてこの場所を離れることはできません！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7098, 'エリナ・ペンドルトン', '「ジョジョ、あなたはとても思慮深い少年です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7098, 'エリナ・ペンドルトン', '「半世紀の悪に連れ去られたくない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7098, 'エリナ・ペンドルトン', '"いいえ。 人は自分の意見を持つ権利があります。 しかし、この生意気なオアフは私たちの友人を侮辱しました! 今は他のゲストに気をつけてください、しかし彼にレッスンを教えてください！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, NULL, '吉良吉影', '「私が子供の頃、グラマースクールのアートブックでモナリザを見ました….彼女を初めて見たとき、彼女は膝に手を置いていました…何と言いますか…私はばかげていました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, NULL, 'ウィル・アントニオ・ツェペリ', '「もしかしたら……彼が予言した時が来たのかもしれません。 これが私の運命なら、私はそれを受け入れます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, NULL, 'ウィル・アントニオ・ツェペリ', '「『勇気』とは？ 勇気はあなたの恐れを所有しています！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7104, 'リサリサ', '「適切なトレーニングが明らかに不足しているときに水の上を歩くことは、かなりの成果です。 しかし、本当に一ヶ月で波紋をマスターしたいのなら、死ぬ覚悟をしなければなりません！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7104, 'リサリサ', '「私が今必要としている最後のことは、あなたに触れられることは言うまでもなく、あなたのようなゴミに耳を傾けることです. でも私を抱きしめたいと思うなら、どうぞお気軽に… 死ぬのが辛くても構わないのなら」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7094, 'ディオ・ブランドー', '「ジョジョ、人間であるということは限界があるということだ。 私は何かを学びました。 慎重に計画すればするほど、予想外の出来事が起こります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, NULL, 'ディオ', '「だから、これは私が奪わなければならないガキです。 彼は自分の心を袖にまとい、すぐに怒ります….この甘やかされた愚か者は、ディオ・ブランドのようなものには何もありません!」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, NULL, 'ディオ', '「ほとんどの人の心は定命のものによって抑制されており、素晴らしい悪の果実からの恐怖に後ずさりしている。 しかし、死亡率とその専制政治に縛られない人もいます。 彼らはヴァンガードです。 仕えろ、切り裂きジャック。 私に服従してください。そうすれば、私はあなたの信念を超えた力を与えます。 その見返りに一つだけお願いします。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, NULL, 'ディオ', '「本当に私を撃とうとしているのですか？ あなたが好き。 あなたが私を殺そうとした瞬間、あなたは汗をかいておらず、呼吸も整っていました。 ホル・ホースに期待するように、あなたは絶対に落ち着いていました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, NULL, 'ディオ', '「そこに出て、この役に立たない世界を手に入れてください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, NULL, 'ディオ', '「私はすべての雑種を軽蔑します。 彼らは私を怖がらせることはありません。 ですから、あなたの狡猾な猫を私から遠ざけてください、ジョースター!」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, NULL, '面白いバレンタイン', '「あなたがテーブルに座っていたとします。 目の前にナプキンがありますが、どのナプキンを取りますか? あなたの「左」のものは？ それともあなたの「右側」のものですか？ あなたの左側の人？ それとも右側の人？ 通常、あなたはあなたの左側にあるものを取ります。 それも「正解」です。 しかし、社会のより大きな意味で、それは間違っています。 おそらく、「社会」を「宇宙」に置き換えることさえできるかもしれません。 正解は「自分のナプキンを先に取った人が決める」。 …はい？ 最初の人がナプキンを右に持っていった場合、他の人も「右」のナプキンを取るしかありません。 左も同様です。 他に選択肢がないので、他の人はナプキンを左に持っていきます。 これが『社会』です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, NULL, 'スピードワゴン', '「今頃、あなたはおそらく私が誰だろうと思っているでしょう。 解明させてください！ その名もロバートEOスピードワゴン！ ジョナサンの一連のトラブルは解決しないかもしれないという予感がしたので、私は彼の後を追って家に帰りました。 私はジョナサン、あなたが好きなので、このちょっとしたプロボノを提供します. 溝に住んでいると、明日を見たい場合は、低生活をすぐに見つけることができます. 匂いを嗅ぐだけで悪いものと良いものを区別するように鼻を訓練しました. この男は、私が今まで目にした誰よりも硫黄と血の悪臭を放っています!」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7095, 'ジョセフ・ジョースター', '"その通りだ！ 計画通りにすべてがうまくいきました…最初から！ （運が良かっただけですが、彼の裏をかいたと思ったら、カーズは気が狂ってしまいます）。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7095, 'ジョセフ・ジョースター', '「まあ、30分も座っていられるなら、これ以上することはありません。 待つのに最適な場所は、リサ リサのドアのすぐ前です。 そして、たまたま鍵穴の近くで目が合ったら… にぃぃぃぃぃす」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7095, 'ジョセフ・ジョースター', '「ええと、腕を組んで目を閉じています。これは勝利の笑いです、エシディシ。 2000年間居眠りしたから、今日負けたんだ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7095, 'ジョセフ・ジョースター', '「撃ちたいなら撃て！ しかし、あなたはその結果に直面する準備をしたほうがよいでしょう。 引き金を引こうとした瞬間、マッチ棒のように指を真っ二つに折るぞ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, NULL, 'ジャン・ピエール', '「復讐する前に、もっとこういうことを言わなきゃ。 私の名前はジャン＝ピエール・ポルナレフです。 妹の名誉のため、そして友人アヴドゥルの安らかな眠りのために……あなたを絶望のどん底に突き落とします！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, 7110, 'カーズ', '「究極の存在は、あらゆる生物の力を体現し、すべての生命がひとつに集まる。 そしてどうやって 美しい 光る！ 私が今まで見た中で本当に最も素晴らしいものです…私はついに、ついに太陽を飼いならしました!」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, NULL, 'まゆ', '「心配してくれる人がいるだけでうらやましい」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1311, 'ルーシー', '「この機会を得るために、私は軍隊と戦ってきました。しかし今、私が言えることは何もありません..それで十分です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1311, 'ルーシー', '「あなたはこの地獄で突然私の前に現れました。 逢える日…ずっと謝りたかった…それだけで耐えた！ 私は生き続けた。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1311, 'ルーシー', '「私たちは皆、中身が怪物ではありませんか。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1311, 'ルーシー', '「私はあなたを手放すつもりでした。 結局のところ、私たちの多くはそこにいませんが、あなたはa **でとても苦痛です.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1311, 'ルーシー', '「人じゃないもの……人じゃないもの……実はあなたなのよ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1311, 'ルーシー', '「私があなたにもたらしたすべての悲しみについて、本当に申し訳ありません。 ごめんなさい。"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1311, 'ルーシー', '「私はこれらの角が嫌いです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1311, 'ルーシー', '「私が人をたくさん殺してしまったら…光太…それなら私を殺してください」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, NULL, 'クラマ', '「後悔は ドメイン 過去を振り返る権利を獲得した人々の。 私が持っているのは恥だけです。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, NULL, 'クラマ', '「温もり、愛、愛情。 これらは私があなたから奪ったものです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, NULL, 'クラマ', '「過去の過ちを悔い改めることができると考える人は許されません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1317, '坂東', '「誰かがあなたに迷惑をかけたら、私に電話してください…私はあなたのためにそれらを殺します。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1317, '坂東', '「サッククリアランスがまだ有効なうちに行ったほうがいいよ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1317, '坂東', '「私は引き金を引く。 銃が消える。 あなたの脳は砂の上に飛び散ります。 ビーチは血まみれになり、あなたは死んでしまいます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(15, NULL, '日下部めい', '「ととろ？ あなたはトトロです!…私はあなたがトトロだと確信しています…」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(15, NULL, '日下部めい', '「幽霊は二階に住めますか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(15, NULL, '日下部めい', '「ママ、精霊は好き？ ぼやけたものでも？', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(15, NULL, '日下部達夫', '「皆さん、笑ってみてください。 そうすれば、どんな恐怖も消え去ります！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(15, NULL, '日下部達夫', '「木と人は昔は仲良しだった。 あの木を見て決めた 購入 家。 お母さんも気に入ってくれますように。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(15, NULL, '日下部達夫', '「森の王様メイにも会えたと思いますし、彼に会えたのは幸運の印です。 しかし、あなたがいつも彼に会えるという保証はありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(15, NULL, '日下部達夫', '"それは素晴らしいです。 よかったね！ 私はずっとお化け屋敷を持ちたいと思っていました。 それは私の生涯の夢でした！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(15, NULL, '日下部達夫', '「うーん、幽霊はもっと見えにくい。 しかし、明るい部屋から暗い部屋に突然移動すると、一瞬見えなくなり、ほこりのバニーが出てきます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(15, NULL, '日下部さつき', '「トトロ、お願いだからメイを守って。 彼女は道に迷い、おそらく怖がるでしょう。 信じてください、もう一度彼女に会えれば、残りの人生は大丈夫です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(15, NULL, '日下部さつき', '"私は男の子が嫌い！ でも、私はナニーの食べ物が世界中で一番好きです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(15, NULL, '日下部さつき', '「お化け屋敷が家にあふれていることに、あなたはあまり満足していないのではないかと思ったのです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(15, 1620, 'カンタのおばあちゃん', '「これは世界の終わりではありません。 あなたの古いナニーが助けに来ました。 それを見てみましょう 美しい 笑顔。"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(15, 1620, 'カンタのおばあちゃん', '「みんなで笑顔でいれば、精霊は少しずつ消えて、この場を離れていくかもしれません。 はい、あの天井のどこかで、彼らは家を出る計画について忙しく話し合っているに違いありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(15, NULL, '日下部靖子', '「よくわかりませんが、私は両方を見たと断言できました。 女の子 木のてっぺんに上がって笑っている」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(15, NULL, '日下部靖子', '「家に帰ってからは気をつけた方がいいよ、しばらく腐らせてあげるつもりだから」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, NULL, '霊源新高', '「強すぎる力を乱用すれば、自らを滅ぼすだけだ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, NULL, '霊源新高', '「やるなモブ。 南下する時は逃げていいよ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, NULL, '霊源新高', '「少なくとも、彼らは私にとって役に立ちます。 そして、それは私だけではありません。 あなたがそれらの力で助けたすべてのクライアントについて考えてください。 ネガに焦点を合わせないでください。 ナイフの使い方がすべてです、覚えていますか？ 自分を抑圧しないでください。 あなたの可能性を最大限に引き出す力を持っているのはあなたです。 大丈夫だと信じて。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, NULL, '霊源新高', '「いいですか、私たちは生まれつき特別な力を持っているので、普通の人とは違います。 しかし、それはあなたが特別な存在であるという錯覚を与えるべきではありません. 私たちは人類の一部です。 私たちのまれな力を除けば、私たちは彼らと何ら変わりはありません。 走るのが速い人、歌が上手い人、勉強が上手い人、面白い人、超能力者。 私たちは彼らとは違うのですか？ 自分の力に自信を持つことは良いことですが、調子に乗ってはいけません。 私たちの力は危険な武器です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, NULL, '合田武蔵', '「あなたが彼に何を反対しているのかはわかりません..しかし、彼はあなたが踏むことができる男ではありません. 影山？ あなたのような人…私は彼をあきらめるつもりはありません ！ トレーニング仲間です！ あなたはいつも一生懸命働いてきました！ 貧血や怪我で何回倒れましたか？ それでもあなたはいつも立ち上がって進み続けました。 運動神経がなくても構いません。 それはあなたの成長の過程です.あなたは私たちにあなたがどれだけ苦労したかを示しました. あなたは私たちに勇気をくれました。 それは……そう簡単に潰せるものじゃない！ お前より弱い者を襲う……だから影山は渡さない！！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, NULL, 'えくぼ', '"驚いた？ サイキックパワーで構築された筋肉は、適切に訓練された筋肉ほど優れていることはありません! シゲオはずっと正しかった！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, 9679, '影山茂夫', '「私を追い出そうとしても無駄よ、私たちは兄弟だから」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, NULL, '影山茂雄', '「何がしたいんだ…やりたいことある？ 他の人は何か持っていますか？ 何か楽しい？ 私がうらやましいことはありますか？', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, 9679, '影山茂夫', '「そもそも生き残るのに超能力は必要ない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, NULL, '影山茂雄', '「詐欺師は本当にひどい人です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, 9679, '影山茂夫', '「他の誰かが人を傷つけたり、誰かが傷ついたりするのを見たくありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, 9679, '影山茂夫', '「それはもう知っている、ずっと知っていた。 私の師匠の正体。 彼は「いい人」です。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, NULL, '鈴木藤一郎', '「俺より強いエスパーはこの世にいない。 私はそれらすべての中で最大の力を持っています。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, NULL, '鈴木藤一郎', '「自分の好きなように生きられる人は強い人です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, NULL, '鈴木翔', '「結局のところ、あなたと友達になろうとするのは正しい電話でした。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, NULL, '鈴木翔', '「攻撃は最大の防御である。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, NULL, '鈴木翔', '「超能力の仕業なら、なんとなく思いつく」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, 9681, '影山律', '「恐怖に打ちのめされて洗脳されるなら、死んでも逃げたい」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, 9681, '影山律', '「お兄ちゃん以外に負けるなんて認めない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, 9681, '影山律', '「自分の劣等感とあなたへの恐怖心に耐えきれず、憧れだと思って自分を守っていた」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, 9681, '影山律', '「私はあなた方を裁くことはしません。 私は今知っているので... 人々が正しい道から迷うとき、通常、実際の理由はありません. 今でもそうです。 戦う気力を失った敵と対峙し、暴力のために動いている。 本当の理由はありません… この種の自由は強いです、私はあなた方全員よりもはるかに自由です… なぜですか？ 自分の限界を失ったからです。 損をした！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, 9681, '影山律', '「えくぼ……本当にうるさい。 ねぇ…この力を制御できたら…君も始末できる？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, 9681, '影山律', '「私は自分にうんざりしているからです。 私はただ…自分の「愚かさ」を感じたかっただけです。 そして、新しい自分を作るために。 私、ばかとして。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, NULL, '最上圭司', '「あなたの優しさですべての問題を解決することはできません。 時には、他人に厳しくする必要があります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, 4366, '神崎由紀子', '「私は以前、他の人が私をどう見ていたかについてとてもストレスを感じていました。 私はいつも自分自身を二番目に推測しました。 しかし、コロ先生が私に気づかせてくれました。 あなたが内面にいる人に忠実であること.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, '赤羽カルマ', '「才能のある人は、自分の思い通りに物事が進むという間違った印象を持っていることがよくあります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, '赤羽カルマ', '「指を指す時間があれば、頭を使ってそれについて何をしたいのかを考えてみませんか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, '赤羽カルマ', '「完全な勝利とは、いつものことをすることで簡単に勝利を収めることです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, 'コロ先生', '「初心者とマスターの違いは、マスターは初心者が試した回数よりも多く失敗したことです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, 'コロ先生', '「試験は勝ち負け、強弱を正しく教える機会。 生徒たちは、成功と挫折の山盛りの助けを吸収します。 勝つとはどういうことか、負けるとはどういうことか、今、考えてみよう！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, 'コロ先生', '「バックアップ計画は自信の礎です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, 'コロ先生', '「窮地に追い込まれたとき、最初にすべきことは選択肢を評価することです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, 'コロ先生', '「どの教師も、自分が生徒たちに進ませた道が正しいかどうか、ひそかに悩んでいます。 しかし、彼は彼らに見える最高の未来への道を示しています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, 'コロ先生', '「失った過去は二度と戻ってこない。 私自身、多くの過ちを犯してきました…しかし、過去から学ぶことができるので、それを繰り返さないようにします。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, 'コロ先生', '「正直、ご両親がつけた立派な名前にあまり意味はありません。 意味があるのは、その名前の背後にいる人が実際の生涯で何をするかです。 名前は人を作りません。 人が歩む道に残る足跡の中に、その名はただそっと残るだけだ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, 'コロ先生', '「誰かの手を引いて先導することもあるということを覚えておいてください…しかし、厳しくしなければならない時もあります。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, 'コロ先生', '「状況に応じて柔軟に対応する準備ができていなければ、教師にはなれなかったでしょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, 'コロ先生', '「彼らが真の競争を経験せずに成長するのは危険です。 問題を真剣に受け止めなくても、彼らは泣き言を言い続けるからです。 適性が高い者は……敗戦の悔しさを早く知れば知るほど成長する」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, 'コロ先生', '「あなたは強くなりすぎたのかもしれません。 自分の力に酔いしれ、自分より弱い者の立場に身を置くことを忘れた。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, 'コロ先生', '「すべてが簡単に手に入る若い人にとって、敗北の痛みは非常に必要なモーニングコールになる可能性があります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, 'コロ先生', '「世界は常に不正に満ちている。 あきらめたり、その不正を恨んだりする時間がある場合は、その時間を代わりにそれらの不正と戦うことを楽しんでください。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, 'コロ先生', '「真実の瞬間に座ってチップをどこにでも落とすことに決めた自分自身を適用することに失敗した人は、失望する運命にあります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, 'コロ先生', '「私も勉強しますよ。 日々成長し、学ばなければ、どうして誰かに教えられるでしょうか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, 4358, 'イリーナ・イェラビッチ', '「子供たちが何を決めるにしても、まずよく考えてください。 感情を殺すのは難しいが、復活させるのはもっと難しい。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, 'あさながくほう', '「その自信があなたを台無しにしないでください、私の少年。 物事は変わります。 うろこは一瞬のうちに瓦礫に有利に傾く可能性があります。 エリートは注意を払うのがよい。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, 'あさながくほう', '「上に立つ者はバランスを気にしなければならない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, '烏丸忠臣', '「何かが可能であれば、計画どおりに進めてください。 無理でもやってみよう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, '烏丸忠臣', '「すべての経験は、道を切り開くためのツールです。」 それを教えてくれたのは、他ならぬ生徒たちだった」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, '塩田渚', '「すべてが楽しくて 賭ける 物事が現実になるまで。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, '塩田渚', '「あの梢が学校で、地面がこの場所だとしたら……私たちは皆、地面に力を見出していました。 見上げたり、見下ろしたりしながら、登る前に高所恐怖症をたくさん知った。 だからこそ、私たちは今、自分の道を歩むことができます。 それでも…途中で高所恐怖症を忘れてしまったので、時々地面に倒れます。 だからここで学ぶ。 ゲームの計画ができたら、学校に行くことができます。 それが私からあなたへの秘密のレッスンです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, '塩田渚', '「十分に磨けば、どんなものでも剣になる」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4497, 'フェリド・バートリ', '「人間を過小評価しないほうがいい。 彼らは貪欲で、狡猾で、粘り強いのです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4497, 'フェリド・バートリ', '「絶望と希望の狭間を歩くあなた…叫ぶ声はどんな風に聞こえるのかしら」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4497, 'フェリド・バートリ', '「よかった。 なんとも可愛らしいリアクション。 あなたが彼にとても愛着を持っているのも不思議ではありません。 では、始めましょうか。 大切なリトル・ユウ以外のすべての人間は死ななければなりません。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4497, 'フェリド・バートリ', '「私はあなたを待っていました…私のかわいそうな子羊。 はい。 その表情！ 人間のその表情は、希望が一瞬にして絶望に変わる。 それ だからこそ、この小さなゲームをやめられないのです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4497, 'フェリド・バートリ', '「少年、永遠に生きることは時々とても退屈になる。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4497, 'フェリド・バートリー', '「うん。 私たちの心は長い間死んでいます。 人間が生きてるのが羨ましいだけじゃないの？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4497, 'フェリド・バートリ', '「なんと侮辱的。 私が仲間を裏切る愚か者を何よりも憎むのは、誰もが知っていることです」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, 'フェリド百夜', '「ほら、手を貸そう。 私は他の人間を占領させておきます...あなたがあなたの最愛の王女を助けに行く間。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '君月志保', '「私たちがそんなに簡単に死ぬと思ったなんて言わないで。 私たちを信じてくれませんか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '君月志保', '「私はそのためにだけ参加します お金. 私たちが「友達」だからではありません。 私はあなたの輝く鎧の騎士にはなりません。 仲良くしているふりをして、嫌悪感から吐き出さないようにします。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '君月志保', '「悪魔は吸血鬼よりもさらに信用できない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '君月志保', '「このサークルに立っている人以外は誰も信用しません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '君月志保', '「嘘だとしても、この話は理不尽です。 中佐は本当に大惨事を引き起こしたのでしょうか? 多分。 そのおかげで、妹は病気になりました。 その後、彼女はモルモットとして使用されました。 私が知りたいのは、それがどのように機能するかです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '君月志保', '「さて、秘密を守ることが『正解』っていつまで？ 私たちは同盟国からそれを守ろうとするつもりですか? 彼に–永久に？ グレン中佐が説明してくれると思っていた。 しかし、彼はそうしていません。 そして、このバカのやり方からして、彼は知らないように見える。 シノア。 彼はあなたを殺そうとしたことを覚えていません…または他のことは覚えていませんよね？ それで、ここに私の質問があります。 私たちは皆、本当に友達ですか？ この「家族」は本当ですか？ もしそうなら、彼が目を覚ますとすぐに... 私は彼にすべてを話しています.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, 'ミツバ・サング', '「あの百夜優一郎は誰だと思っているの!? 命令無視！ 自ら行動！ 彼のような者が月魔商会に入ることができるのか!? 私はそれを支持しません！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, 'ミツバ・サング', '「柊家の相手に正解なんてない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, 'ミツバ・サング', '「屋根の上に乗るような馬鹿げた子供っぽいことをするのが好きなの？ あなたとユウがとても仲良くしているのも不思議ではありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, 'ミツバ・サング', '「私のせいで誰かが死んだけど、私は罰を受けなかった！ 戦闘では全然役立たずだったのに昇進してくれました！ 私に起こる唯一の悪いことは、エリートの妹よ​​り劣っていると笑われることです！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, 'ミツバ・サング', '「あんたみたいな馬鹿は…嫌いだ…何よりも！ あなたのような者は… 分隊全体を一掃します。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4500, '一ノ瀬グレン', '「いや。 彼は実際には私の子供ではありません。 でも……吸血鬼に捕らえられているのを見かけたので、捕まえることにしました。 今、彼は私がそうしなければよかったと思うほど、お尻の痛みです. ・一ノ瀬グレン', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4500, '一ノ瀬グレン', '「戦場では、あなたを殺さないものはあなたをより強くします。」 ・一ノ瀬グレン', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4500, '一ノ瀬グレン', '「そこに彼がいます。 預言のとおりです。 日本を滅ぼした百夜研究所の実験ネズミの一人。 男の子。 吸血鬼退治の参考になれば」 ・一ノ瀬グレン', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4500, '一ノ瀬グレン', '「あなたはあの娘を守った。 選択肢を与えられたあなたは、復讐よりも誰かを救うことを選んだ。」 ・一ノ瀬グレン', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4500, '一ノ瀬グレン', '「こちらはムーンデーモンカンパニー！ 私たちは地獄への道を行進します。 それとも無意味な遊びをしに来たの？ 賭ける 復讐の？」 ・一ノ瀬グレン', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4500, '一ノ瀬グレン', '「みんな聞いて。 この任務中、私は規則に従わない者に対しては一切容赦しません。 また、これをゲームのように扱ったり、いじったりする人も容認しません。 繰り返しますが、これはゲームではありません。 これは、私たちがこれまでに引き受けた中で最も困難で危険な任務です。 私たちの中には死ぬ人もいます。 私たちは皆ここにいる家族です。 そして、このミッションで、私たちは多くの家族を失うことになります。 しかし、その危険にもかかわらず、これは私たちの命を危険にさらす価値のある使命です!」 ・一ノ瀬グレン', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4500, '一ノ瀬グレン', '「あなたの罰です。 シノア。 これはあなたのチームです。 私はあなたに恩恵を与え、少しの間違いでも起こり得ることを教えています それらを殺す…。 あなたはそれを理解していません。 あなたにとって大切な人は今までいなかった。 誰かを失うことを恐れることがどのようなものか、あなたは知りません。 しかし、今は事情が異なります。 ちょっとしたミスでも命取りになります。 あなたのちょっとしたいたずらがあなたの家族の命を奪うかもしれません。」 ・一ノ瀬グレン', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4500, '一ノ瀬グレン', '「ただの復讐じゃないなら、剣をあげてもいいじゃないか。 友達を見つけて、これを使って安全を確保してください。」 ・一ノ瀬グレン', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4500, '一ノ瀬グレン', '「私は物事を複雑にするのが好きではないので、これを試してみましょう. 死ぬ者は、訓練を怠った自分を責めろ！」 ・一ノ瀬グレン', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4500, '一ノ瀬グレン', '「人間の罪。 どんな人間でも、大切な人を救うためなら、喜んで手を罪で汚します。 人を死からよみがえらせる費用は、地球上のすべての人間の命です。」 ・一ノ瀬グレン', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4500, '一ノ瀬グレン', '「あなたには才能があります。 しかし、妹を救えなかったことに罪悪感を覚えます。 それはあなたの生きる希望を奪っています。 でも今日は…十分な理由が見つかりました。 あなたが今生きている理由は…今日、あなたを救ってくれた人を守るためです。 あなたの友人。 復讐？ ささいなことであなたを消費させないでください。 お前もそうだよ、バカ。 古い家族を忘れてください。 新しい家族ができたからです。 目の前にいる人のために命を懸けましょう。 過去はなくなりました。 未来しかない。」 ・一ノ瀬グレン', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '成海誠', '「私たちが日本にいる限り、軍隊は私たちを追い詰めることができます。 海外に行くべきだと言いたいのですか？ 人類はもう海を渡れないって知ってる？ 大災害の間、世界の海は酸性で有毒になりました。 それだけでなく、海は騎手よりもひどいモンスターと一緒に泳いでいます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '成海誠', '「あなたの実験のせいで仲間を失いました、冗談はやめてください。 私が何としてもあなたを守ります、さもなければ彼らの死は意味がありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '成海誠', '「遊びの時間は終わりだ、子供たち。 さびたスプーンのように役に立たなくても、私たちのチームはこれを成功させます.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '成海誠', '「彼らは私たち人間を動物のように群がらせます。 そのため、自然はその道を歩み、獲物として、私たちは捕食者に対する本能的な恐怖を発達させます. 吸血鬼と友達になることは私たちには不可能です。 考えてみてください。 捕食者と被食者は共存できますか？ ライオンと羊は本当に一緒に寝ますか？ 猫はネズミと友達になれますか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '早乙女洋一', '「姉のことは忘れていません。 私は決して忘れません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '早乙女洋一', '「裕一郎はいい人！ 全世界は空虚で壊れていますが、彼はあきらめることを拒否します! 彼は家族を取り戻し、友人を守るために最善を尽くし続けています。 すごい！ 本当に、本当にすごい！ もし幸運にも彼の家族の一員になれなかったら、きっと絶望と絶望に飲み込まれて、今頃死んでいたでしょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '早乙女洋一', '「とにかく、誰が何であるかが本当に重要なのですか？ 人間は他の人間を殺します。 彼らはいつも持っています。 では、吸血鬼が友達を持つことを許可されていないとどうして言えますか? 彼らが私たちの家族を殺していないのなら、私たちがお互いに親切にできない理由がわかりません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '早乙女洋一', '「殺すなら殺せ！ でも……優一郎の家族なら、私たちの家族でもあるんです！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4494, 'クルル・ツェペシュ', '「はは。 愛？ あなたが愛しているのは私の力だけです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4494, 'クルル・ツェペシュ', '「とても良い質問です。 さて、わがままな我が子をなだめ終えたところで、評議会からの命令に就こうと思います。 真の軍隊を配備して、日本中のすべての人間を虐殺する時が来ました。 ヴァンパイアと人間の戦争を始めましょう。 あなた、ミカは、大騒ぎの中で都合よく「道に迷う」でしょう。 人間と吸血鬼の両方から隠れて、その機会を利用してユウを見つけてください…そしてあなたの家族を見つけに行きましょう. 了解した？"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4494, 'クルル・ツェペシュ', '「私に逆らうために何ができるでしょうか？ 私はあなたのようなちっぽけな人生を簡単に消すことができます。 それを超えて、あなたは私の血に依存しています。 どうやって私に逆らうことができますか？ 私の道具になるよりは死んだ方がましだと言うつもりですか？ 悪人どもに利用されたユウはどうなる？ 彼を捨てますか？ 終わりのセラフを実験した国もあるが、人間の汚らわしさは地域や集団に限定されない。 ユウを運命に任せますか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '相原愛子', '"出来た。 でも最後にお願いがあります、ヴァンパイア… 私を殺して。 彼らが私を捕まえて、さらなる情報を得るために私を拷問する前に。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '相原愛子', '「」あなたが言ったことのために。 あなたは新人を「ユウ」と呼びました。 あだ名です。 私はあなたが近くにいることを意味する希望に賭けることにしました. 彼を守れ、吸血鬼。 他の吸血鬼を市役所に行かせないでください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '相原愛子', '「ただいま、百夜優一郎二等兵は名古屋市役所に向かっております。 あそこに吸血鬼が来たら、百夜優一郎を含め、そこにいる人間は皆殺しだ。 行かないで。 お願いします。"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4503, 'クロウリー・ユースフォード', '「先に攻めたのはお前だ、あとは俺を追わせたくないのか？ あなたたち人間はいつも利己的です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4503, 'クロウリー・ユースフォード', '"残念な。 私はあなたのことをとても感じています...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4503, 'クロウリー・ユースフォード', '「私はただ、人間が少し得ているのではないかと思っていました. あまりに 強力な、 あまりに 速い。 ほら… 人間は常に力への欲望を持っていました。 しかし、彼らはかつてあったでしょうか この 前は強い？ 不思議に思います。 誰かが、どこかで……関係のない情報を人間に与えているのですか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4503, 'クロウリー・ユースフォード', '「あの人たちが来たら、もっと面白くなるといいな」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '阿修羅丸', '「あなたは私に興味があります。 あなたの心が強い限り、私はあなたに従います。 でも、ほんの一瞬でも弱みを見つけたら、あなたの体は私のものです。」 ・阿修羅丸', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '阿修羅丸', '「人を信じるな、ユウ。 吸血鬼よりも人間の方が恐ろしい。 鬼よりも恐ろしい。 へー。 それを人間に言うのはなんと奇妙なことでしょう。 ・阿修羅丸', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '阿修羅丸', '「愛と欲望が絡み合っている。 なんて信じられないほどの矛盾。 これが、人間が世界を滅ぼす理由です。」 ・阿修羅丸', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '阿修羅丸', '"空を見て。 あなたはそれを醜く黒く染め、呪いのように世界中に広めました。 ゆう？ ミカ そうです。 まだ時間があるなら……二人とも、人からできるだけ離れたほうがいい。 そうしないと、人間性が失われます。 ええとああ。 結局、あなたは時間がありません。 あなたの人間でない部分が暴走しそうです。」 ・阿修羅丸', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '阿修羅丸', '「ほら…考えずにはいられません…あなたは完全に正気ではありません。 手には天使のトランペットを持っていますが、その天使の力を制御するために必要な薬によって、腕全体が悪魔のようなものに変わりました。 それだけでなく…あなたの体の残りの部分全体が悪魔に乗っ取られています。 ええ。 あなたは何になろうとしていますか？ 一体……そもそもお前は何だ？」 ・阿修羅丸', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '阿修羅丸', '「私が選んだ主が誰かに操られているという考えは嫌いです。 鬼軍団。 百夜宗。 一ノ瀬グレン。 フェリド・バートリ。 誰があなたの糸を引いているのかはわかりませんが、周りの人を踊らせたのはあなたの欲望だったのですが… あなたには頭脳があります。 うまく機能するもの - それを使用してください。 そうしないと……結局誰も救えない……。 少なくとも、それはあなたのパートナーが言うことだと思います。」 ・阿修羅丸', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '阿修羅丸', '「悪魔である私が、私が所有している人間がどれほど巨大であるかを恐れるだろうと誰が思ったでしょうか？」 ・阿修羅丸', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, '阿修羅丸', '「人間は恐ろしい生き物です。 彼らは禁じられた芸術を掘り下げることに何の躊躇もありません。 そのうちの少なくとも一つは、あなたの中に隠された恐ろしいものです. ・阿修羅丸', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '奥村幸雄', '「これから……私が父に代わって弟を守ります」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '奥村幸雄', '「成功する最善の方法は、自分の能力を最大限に活用することです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '奥村幸雄', '「どんなに望んでも、彼はもう普通の人間にはなれない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '奥村凛', '「あなたが私を信頼してくれたから、私もあなたを信頼します。 それが友達ってことだよね？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '奥村凛', '「あなたは私の父をとても愛していましたよね？ だからあなたは悲しかった。 私も同じです、友達になりましょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '奥村凛', '「勝手に人を勝手に判断するな」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '奥村凛', '「人生はくだらないものだから、もしそれが簡単なら、あなたは間違ったことをしている.」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '奥村凛', '「私はどれだけ時間をかけて考えても、答えを導き出せるほど頭が良くありません。 今できることは、頭を空っぽにして突進することだけです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '奥村凛', '「料理で誰かを幸せにしたいから、私たちは料理をします。 よかったと言っていただけると、私たちもうれしいです。 だから私は料理が好きで、料理をしたいのです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '奥村凛', '「とりあえず、俺みたいなバカは前に進むしかない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '奥村凛', '「私の炎をもっと良い目的のために使います！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '奥村凛', '「ここは降りられない！ 私は父の墓で、彼のような偉大なエクソシストになり、サタンのお尻を蹴ると誓った.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '奥村凛', '「今、満足していますか？ それでも足りないなら、何度でも戦ってやる。 私はこのがらくたに慣れています。 お願いだから罪のない人を巻き込んではいけない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '奥村凛', '「あなたが何を言おうと、何を考えようと、私は気にしません。 父は藤本四郎であり、他の誰でもない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '奥村凛', '「頭がいいのは確かにいいけど、世の中にはいろんな人がいるほうがいいと思う」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '奥村凛', '「私はあなたの武器でも魔王でも救世主でもありません！ 奥村凛です！ そして、私が終わったとき、私はあなたが今まで見た中で最高のエクソシストになるでしょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '奥村凛', '「悪口はいくらでもいいけど、兄さんをからかうなよ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, 'イゴール', '「私はサタンも彼の悪魔も決して許しません！ そして間違いなくサタンの息子ではありません！ 命を落としても殺してやる！」 – ノイハウス イゴール', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, 'イゴール', '「どう見ても判断力が鈍っている限り真実は見えない」 – ノイハウス イゴール', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '藤本史郎', '「私はあなたのような子供を守るには年を取りすぎています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '藤本史朗', '「手を汚すことを恐れていては、前に進めません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '藤本史朗', '「ばか、悪魔は存在します、大丈夫です。 彼らは私たちの心の中にいます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '藤本史朗', '「聞いて、リン。 このままだと一人ぼっちになってしまう。 あなたの力を他の誰かのために、より親切なことのために使ってください。 愛される仲間がたくさんいるカッコイイ男になってほしい 女の子！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '藤本四郎', '「子供扱いされるのが嫌なら、自分がどれだけ成長したか見せてみませんか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '島蓮蔵', '「運勢しか分からない 女の子」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '島金蔵', '「あなたはいい人です。私はあなたを信頼しています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, 'パク・ノリコ', '「真面目な人を馬鹿にする人は嫌いです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '勝呂竜二', '「私はあなたのように背骨がないわけではありません！ 真のエクソシストになって魔王を倒す！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '勝呂竜二', '「他人の野望を笑うな！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '勝呂竜二', '「一人ですべてを解決しようとするのはやめなさい。 一人じゃないことを忘れないで！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '勝呂竜二', '「あなたはなんて悪い人だ！ このままだと人を遠ざけてしまう」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, 3041, '神木出雲', '「『サタンを倒す』とか『友達』とか言う臆病者が大嫌いです。 彼らが知っているのは、最も重要な時期に逃げることだけです…いくつかのきれいな言葉を吐き出した後.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, 3041, '神木出雲', '「収穫の神々を謙虚に呼びます。 私の願いに従ってください、何も満たされないままにしないでください！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '森山しえみ', '「泣いてはいけない。 今日は泣いて過ごすより、絶対友達作ろう！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '森山しえみ', '「あなたが私を嫌いでも、私はあなたのことが大好きです！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '森山しえみ', '「いつ生まれても、ここにいてよかった！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '森山しえみ', '「私はこの場所が大好きです…そして祖母をさらに愛しています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '森山しえみ', '「それらの胞子がどんなに腐っていても、私たちはすべてを千倍も新鮮で緑に咲かせることができます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, '森山しえみ', '「いつもあんな風に泣いていて、こんな風にはいられない。 私はもっ​​と強く、もっと弾力的にならなければなりません。 雑草の精神に到達するまでには、まだ長い道のりがあります。 必ず追いつくから待っててね」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, 3040, '霧隠シュラ', '「士郎、あなたは武器を構えていたのではありません。 あなたは息子を育てていた。」 ・霧隠シュラ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, NULL, '櫛枝みのり', '「泣くことは心の鼻血です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, NULL, '櫛枝みのり', '「私の幸せは・・・この手でしか作れない！ 私の幸せは私以外の誰にも依存していません！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, NULL, '櫛枝みのり', '「廊下を走っているときにつまずくと、鼻血が出ます。 人生でつまずいたら泣くよ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, NULL, '櫛枝みのり', '「私は幽霊を信じていますが、これまで一度も見たことがなく、これを手に入れました. 私は、以前に見たと言った人の誰も信じていません。 それは、愛の概念について私がどのように考えているかのようなものです。 いつか恋に落ちて、結婚して幸せに暮らすと信じているように、まだ実際に誰かと恋に落ちたことはありません. 私が言っていることがわかりますか？ 恋に落ちることは第二の性質のような人もいますが、私はそれを理解することさえできません. もし私が一度も恋に落ちたことがないなら、それは本当ですか? そして、それは幽霊が実在するかどうか疑問に思います. 私はまだ見たことがないので、そうではないかもしれません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, NULL, '櫛枝みのり', '「空が暗くて何も見えなくても、星は輝いている。 もし彼女がより明るく輝くことを学べれば、私たちは彼女を見ることができるでしょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, NULL, '櫛枝みのり', '「見えないものを探すことに夢中になって、見えるものを見失いたくない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, NULL, '小和島あみ', '「崇拝は決してバランスの取れた関係にはつながらない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, NULL, '小和島あみ', '「理解してくれる人が一人でもいれば大丈夫」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, NULL, '小和島あみ', '「自分らしくいると、自分を好きになるのが難しい。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, NULL, '高須隆二', '「キタムラの前に立って…胸を張れるようにします」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, NULL, '高須隆二', '「太古の昔から、龍は虎に匹敵する唯一の獣でした。 今あなたがそばにいなくても、時空を飛び越えてずっとそばにいます。 この気持ちは決して変わることはありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, NULL, '高須隆二', '「逢坂！ 私に……あなたの台所を掃除させてください！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, NULL, '北村優作', '"心配しないで。 あなたは完全に一人ではありません。 あなたには私がいます。"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2471, '逢坂大河', '「素敵な天使 ロマンス、タイガが助けてあげる」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, NULL, '入栖冬美', '「自分自身に気づいていない才能のある人は、才能のない人に苦痛を与えます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, NULL, '入栖冬美', '「どんなに情熱を傾けても、技術的専門知識の欠如を克服することはできません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, NULL, '入栖冬美', '「すべての人は自分自身を認識しなければなりません。 そうでなければ、それらを見ている人は自分自身をばかだと思います。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, NULL, '氷菓', '「みんなと比べて特別だろうが普通だろうが気にしなくていい！ それが誰であるかは関係ありません。 彼らがあなたを特別だと思っている限り、あなたは特別なのです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3464, '千反田える', '「最善を尽くすことが役に立つかどうかはわかりませんが、最善を尽くさなければ、確実に役に立たないことはわかっています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3464, '千反田える', '「時々、自分のことを理解するのが難しいと感じることがあります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3463, '折木奉太郎', '「誰も私を好きじゃなくても構わない。 私は、みんなを楽しませるためにこの世に生まれてきたわけではありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3463, '折木奉太郎', '「ミステリーを飼いならす最善の方法は、別のミステリーを使うことです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3463, '折木奉太郎', '「人は自分のことを覚えている 高等学校 彼らの人生の最高点としての日々。 人々がこのようなことを言うのは、誰もがその時代の楽しい思い出を持っているからです。 高等学校; しかし、私はすべての 高等学校 学生は学校生活をそのように思い出したいと思うでしょう。 たとえば、勉強もスポーツも社交も興味のない人にとってはどうでしょうか。 目立たないようにすることを好む学生がいる場合はどうなりますか? それはかなり孤独な生き方だと思いますが。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3463, '折木奉太郎', '「疲れない限り、社交に反対しているわけではありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3463, '折木奉太郎', '「経験が浅いほど、見せびらかしたくなる。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3463, '折木奉太郎', '「やる必要がないならやらない。 やらなければならないことがあれば、急いでやります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, NULL, '福部聡', '「冗談は一瞬、誤解を残せば嘘になる。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, NULL, '福部聡', '「データベースは結論を引き出すことができません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, NULL, '福部聡', '「私は何事においても最高になることはありません。 というか、そうしようとするのをやめたと言うかもしれません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, NULL, '福部聡', '「私が何をしようとも、私はいつも私であり続ける。 溶け込むために調子を落とすことはありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, NULL, '福部聡', '「勝ってもつまらない。 面白い方法で勝たなければ、どうして面白いことができるでしょうか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, '桐生もえか', '「ほら、あなたがいた世界では敵だったとしても、今は私だけがあなたの味方です。 たとえ世界中があなたに敵対しても、私はあなたの唯一の味方であり続けます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, '桐生もえか', '「人は……生きるためには誰かに必要とされなければならない。 必要とされない人は無価値だ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, '桐生萌香', '「気がついたらビルの屋上にいて……何もかもが嫌になっていた。 私も膝を抱えて部屋に座っているのにうんざりしていました。 もし私が死んでも誰も気づかなかったり、気にかけなかったりしたら… 生きていて何の意味があるの？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3005, '岡部倫太郎', '「最大の愚か者は知恵を持つ者である。 歴史は私たちにこれを示しています。 これは、抵抗する者への神の最後の警告と言っていいでしょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3005, '岡部倫太郎', '「他の誰にもできないことを思い出すのはつらいことです。 それについて誰にも話すことはできません。 誰もあなたを理解できません。 あなたは一人になるでしょう。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3005, '岡部倫太郎', '「宇宙には始まりがありますが、終わりはありません。 —無限。 星にもそれぞれの始まりがありますが、その力が破壊をもたらします。 - 有限の。"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3005, '岡部倫太郎', '「すべての意図と目的のために、過去をそのままにしておいてください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3005, '岡部倫太郎', '「生きるということは、やり直しを意味するべきではありません。 これが最善です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3005, '岡部倫太郎', '「自分の願いを叶えたいなら、自分で道を切り開いてください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3005, '岡部倫太郎', '「今」は川の上に浮かぶ葉っぱ。 過去から未来への流れに沿って動いています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3005, '岡部倫太郎', '「理論は言葉に過ぎない。 あなたが見たものを受け入れなさい。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3005, '岡部倫太郎', '「コンスピラシーの邪悪な影響力は、あなたが思っているよりもはるかに近くにあり、いつでもあなたを欺こうとしています!」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3005, '岡部倫太郎', '「正常な人間が持っている知覚の99%は閉鎖されています。 自分のことを考えていない人は、まったく愚かな存在です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3005, '岡部倫太郎', '「野菜不足を心配するマッドサイエンティストってどんな人？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3005, '岡部倫太郎', '「一度確立された過去を変えてはならない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3005, '岡部倫太郎', '「未来がどうなるかは誰にもわかりません。 だからこそ、その可能性は無限大です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3004, '牧瀬紅莉栖', '「亡くなった人のために、輝かしい毎日を生きるべきです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3004, '牧瀬紅莉栖', '「時間が経つのがとても早く感じます。 くそー、アインシュタイン！ あなたの科学は私たちのキスに群がっています! 彼は正しかったです。 時間の経過は、あなたが立っている場所に完全に依存します。 相対性理論…とてもロマンチックです。 しかし、それはあまりにも悲劇的です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3004, '牧瀬紅莉栖', '「もしかしたら無数の世界線に私の写しがあるかもしれません。 みんなの心がつながって、ひとつの「私」を形成しているのかもしれません。 素晴らしいですね。 いつでも、どこにでもいる。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3004, '牧瀬紅莉栖', '「誰かへの強い愛、何かへの強い信念、何かを伝えたいという強い思い…それらすべてが時を超えて『あなた』を創り出したら、それは素晴らしいことです。 だから、死なせてやるとは思わないでください。 世界線が変わっても、あなたが私のことを忘れない限り、私はずっとそこにいる……きっと、あなたはこれから苦しむことになるでしょう。 あなただけが私のことを覚えている世界になります。 あなたは何よりも友達のことを考えているので、あなたは辛いと思います。 ごめんなさい。 しかし、その痛みは私にとって大きな意味を持つでしょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3004, '牧瀬紅莉栖', '「私は18年しか生きていませんが、どれも変えたくありません。 失敗も含めて、それらはすべて私の人生の一部です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3004, '牧瀬紅莉栖', '「誰もが自分以外の、自分にとって大切な人を見ている。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3004, '牧瀬紅莉栖', '「人の気持ちは時を超えた記憶」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3004, '牧瀬紅莉栖', '「逃げることはできますが、それは事態を悪化させるだけです！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, '天音すずは', '「誰もが人生のある時点で誰かの助けを借ります。 だからいつか、あなたも誰かを助けるべきです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, '天音すずは', '「時間を支配することは、世界を支配することです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3006, '椎名まゆり', '「私たちは世界平和のために努力すべきです。 世界中のみんなにウパクッションをあげるようなものです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1143, '渚カヲル', '「人間は無から何かを生み出すことはできません。 人間は、何かにしがみつかなければ何も成し遂げることができません。 結局のところ、人間は神ではありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1143, '渚カヲル', '「人は常に心に痛みを感じています。 心臓は痛みにとても敏感なので、人間も生きることは苦しむことだと感じています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1143, '渚カヲル', '「人の希望の糸は、悲しみの亜麻で紡がれる。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1143, '渚カヲル', '「帰れる場所があることが幸せにつながる。 それは良い事実です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1131, 'アスカ・ラングレー', '「無知な大衆を守ることは、エリートの義務です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1131, 'アスカ・ラングレー', '「私の心は侵食されています…梶さん、それは私の心を解きほぐしています！ 私は何をしますか？ それは私の心を汚しています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, NULL, 'ゼーレ', '「人は愚かさを忘れ、過ちを繰り返す。 人間は自ら進んで贖わなければ変わらない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1130, '碇シンジ', '「幸せな瞬間をロザリオに結び付けて人生を正当化できる人は誰もいません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1130, '碇シンジ', '「これは、痛みも不確実性もない世界であるべきだと思っていました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1130, '碇シンジ', '「私は一人暮らしでいいです。 とにかく一人です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1130, '碇シンジ', '「どこに幸せがあるのか​​、まだわからない。 でも、ここにいてよかったのか……生まれてきてよかったのか、これからも考えていきます。 でも結局は、当たり前のことを何度も何度も実現しているだけです。 私は私だから。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1130, '碇シンジ', '「殴られるに値するのは私だ。 あなたじゃない！ 私は臆病者です。 私は不誠実です。 私は卑劣です。 そして弱虫！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, NULL, '梶良二', '「すべてを 100% 理解することは不可能です。 だからこそ、私たちは他人の考えを理解しようと一生を費やします。 それが人生をとても面白くするものです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1140, '碇ユイ', '「生きる意志さえあれば、どこでも楽園になれる。 結局のところ、あなたは生きているので、いつでも幸せになるチャンスがあります。 太陽と月と地球があれば大丈夫です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1140, '碇ユイ', '「一人でも生きていれば……それは人類が存在したことの永遠の証となる」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1139, '碇ゲンドウ', '「人類の最大の恐怖は人類そのものです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1139, '碇ゲンドウ', '「記憶を埋めることは、人間が生き残るための方法です。 しかし、男性には絶対に忘れてはいけないことがあります。 唯一のかけがえのないもの、シンジをユイが教えてくれた。 それが、そのコミットメントを確認するために、私がここに来る理由です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1138, '伊吹マヤ', '「あなたが自分の現実を見る新しい立場は、その性質に対するあなたの認識を変えるでしょう。 それはすべて文字通り視点の問題です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1141, '葛城ミサト', '「なんてこった *** もし私があなたじゃなかったら?! だからといって、あきらめていいわけではありません！ だったら一生許しません。 神は私も完璧ではないことを知っています。 私はたくさんのばかげた過ちを犯し、後で後悔しました。 そして、私はそれを何度も何度も、何千回もやりました。 虚ろな喜びと悪質な自己嫌悪のサイクル。 それでも、毎回、自分自身について何かを学びました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1141, '葛城ミサト', '「動物が環境に適応する能力を過小評価してはいけません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1141, '葛城ミサト', '「生き残るに値するのは、それを実現する意志を持っている人です。 彼は死を望んだ。 彼は生き残る意志を無視し、偽りの希望のために死ぬことを選んだ. 生き残ったのは間違いじゃないぞ、シンジ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1141, '葛城ミサト', '「なんでシンジ？ 正確には、なぜここに来たのですか？ 逃げてはいけません。 あなたは父親と向き合い、自分自身と向き合わなければなりません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1141, '葛城ミサト', '「今はここがあなたの家ですので、快適に過ごしてください。 そして、私を除いて、ここにあるすべてを利用してください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1141, '葛城ミサト', '「成長の一部は、痛みを遠ざけながら他の人と交流する方法を見つけることを意味します。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, NULL, '冬月浩三', '「あなたの真実は、あなたがそれをどのように受け入れるかによって変えることができます。 それだけ人間にとって真実は儚いものです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1129, '綾波レイ', '「自分を憎む者は、他人を愛することも信頼することもできません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1129, '綾波レイ', '「一人になりたくないでしょ？ 私たちはたくさんいますが、あなたは一人です。 嫌ですよね？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1129, '綾波レイ', '「人は闇を恐れ、その縁を火で削ぎ落とす。 彼は闇を減少させることによって生命を創造します。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, NULL, '赤木律子', '「彼が引きこもっているように見えるのは、傷つくことを恐れているからです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'ズイコー僧侶', '「自由は強制的に存在させることも、苦痛を伴う闘争によって勝ち取ることもできません。 自由は売買できません。 社会的地位とは何の関係もありません。 自分の職業は重要ではありません。 ありのままの自分を受け入れ、魂と共に安らかに生きるためには、そのままにしておくことを自分自身に教えなければなりません。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'ズイコー僧侶', '「自由とは、苦しむことや自分を追い込むことで得られるものではありません。 ありのままの自分を受け入れ、物事の流れに沿って生きなければなりません。 それが真の自由です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'かすみふう', '「よし、これで十分だ！ 約束してくれたお二人。 忘れていませんよね？ 「ひまわりの匂いがするサムライ」を見つけるまで、殺し合うなよ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'かすみふう', '「この世界は義務感がなければ暗闇になるでしょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'ジン', '「わざわざ騒ぎ立てて自分の馬鹿さをさらけ出す気か？ 自分の重要性を控えめにするようにしてください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'ジン', '「あなたを殺す気はありません。 実際、あなたは殺す価値がありません。 あなたを殺しても、私の刃を汚すだけです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'ジン', '「ずっと探していたものを見つけたと思います。 いつも一人ぼっちだった私が……初めて仲間を見つけた」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'ジン', '「何も悪いことをしていない男を斬る。 それがあなたがそれらのスキルを磨くためにずっと費やしたものですか？ 私の意見では、あなたは無価値です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'ムゲン', '「私は自分以外の誰も、そして自分ができることを信じていません。 じゃあ。"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'ムゲン', '「釣りは人と魚の生死をかけた戦い。 これを忘れると、あなたは間違いなく傷つくでしょう。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'ムゲン', '「言い訳をして人生を送るな。 選ぶのは自分自身だ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'ムゲン', '「私は地獄に行くことについてネズミのようなことはしません。 すでにそこにいるような気がするからだと思います。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'ムゲン', '「私を追うなら、最強の者を連れて来い」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'ムゲン', '「誰かに剣を向ける時、あなたがその人を殺すか、彼らがあなたを殺すか、その中間はない。 だから、アホみたいにしゃべるのやめろ。 それを処理できない人は、ただシャットダウンして、それを乗り越えるべきです！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'ムゲン', '「毎日太陽が昇ると思いますが、日光浴をするのはこれが最後かもしれません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'ムゲン', '「私たちがずっとそこにいたら、ここにいる人は砂粒よりも大きく見えるでしょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'ムゲン', '「生きるとは、貴様等に頭を下げることだと言うなら、俺は頭を高く上げて立ったまま死ぬ方がましだ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, '刈谷景時', '「私たちが絶望と呼ぶ感情を生み出すことができるのは、希望だけです。 しかし、人間が希望なしに生きようとすることはほとんど不可能なので、絶望を仲間として歩き回るしかないのではないでしょうか。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'サラ', '「あなたが出会う人は、それぞれ独自のオーラを持っています。それは私が感じることができるものです…ほら、私は非常に長い間暗闇の中を歩いてきました。人は何にでも慣れることができます…私は視力を失ったかもしれませんが、私は持っています。その結果、他のことに対する多くの内面的な感覚があるので、私を気の毒に思わないでください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 2, 'フェイ・バレンタイン', '「過去はどうでもいいから忘れろって言ってたけど、それでも過去に縛られているのは君だよ、スパイク」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 2, 'フェイ・バレンタイン', '「戦闘の最初のルールを知っていますか？ 彼らがあなたを撃つ前に彼らを撃ってください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 13, 'ロンデス', '「神が私たちに与えてくださった魂、私たちの霊。 巨大なネットワークを泳ぎ、無限の宇宙に生きる道を見つけた私たちの魂。 人間の体はただの殻ではないですか？ このような広大な到達範囲と可能性を備えた意識にとって、存在の形態は小さすぎて弱すぎます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, NULL, 'ヴィンセント・ヴォラジュ', '「私は死を恐れていません。 それはただ黙って夢を見ることを意味します。 永遠に続く夢。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, NULL, 'ヴィンセント・ヴォラジュ', '「私が生きてきた日々の中で、あなたと過ごした日々だけが本当のように思えました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, NULL, 'ヴィンセント・ヴォラジュ', '「正気と狂気の間に明確な線を引くことは誰にもできません。 自分に合うと思うように、その線を移動します。 他の誰もできません。 すぐにわかるだろう……狂っているのはこの世界だということを。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, NULL, 'ヴィンセント・ヴォラジュ', '「煉獄についてよく知っていますか？ そこは天国と地獄の間にある場所で、取り残され、天国に行けなかった人々が苦しみ続ける場所であり、闘争と苦痛の場所です。 言い換えれば、私たちが今いる世界です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 3, 'ジェットブラック', '「あなたはいつも私のためにそこにいてくれました、そしてそれは私が必要としていたすべてです. あなただけ。 どういうわけか、私は悲しんだり、壊れたりしたとは感じませんでした。 しかし、ゆっくりとそれが現実であることに気づきました – あなたがいなくなったということです。 そして少しずつ、自分の中の何かがしびれるのをゆっくりと感じました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 3, 'ジェットブラック', '「何事にも始まりと終わりがある。 人生は始まりと終わりの繰り返しです。 望まない結末もありますが、それは避けられません。 私たちは彼らに立ち向かわなければなりません。 それが人間であることのすべてです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 3, 'ジェットブラック', '「あなたと私が初めて会ったとき、あなたは私に何かを言いました。 あなたは一度死んだ、死を見たと言いました。 どうして手放せないの？ 過去を忘れる。"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 1, 'スパイク・スピーゲル', '「私の目を見て、フェイ。 片方は事故で紛失したため偽物です。 それ以来、片方の目で過去を、もう片方の目で現在を見ています。 だから、現実の断片しか見えず、全体像は見えないと思っていました。 覚めない夢を見ているような気分だった。 いつの間にか夢は終わっていた。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 1, 'スパイク・スピーゲル', '「あの頃はまだ若かったし、何も怖くなかったし、死ぬことなんて一瞬たりとも考えなかった。 無敵だと思いました。 それから私はある女の子に会いました。 生きたい、そう思うようになった。 初めて死が怖かった。 以前は、そのように感じたことはありませんでした。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, NULL, 'カウボーイビバップ', '「天国から追放された堕天使は、神の慈悲によって受け取られるために光の中に現れます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 1, 'スパイク・スピーゲル', '「私たちと一緒に遊んで人生を無駄にしませんか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 1, 'スパイク・スピーゲル', '「私は死ぬためにそこに行くつもりはありません。 本当に生きているか確かめるために行くんだ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, NULL, '笑う牛', '「死を恐れるな。 死は常に私たちの側にあります。 私たちが恐怖を示すとき、それは光よりも速く私たちに飛びつきます。 しかし、私たちが恐れを示さなければ、それは私たちに優しく目を向け、私たちを無限へと導きます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, NULL, '悪質', '「天界から追放された天使は悪魔になるしかない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, NULL, '悪質', '「信じるものは何も残っていません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 20, 'アンディ・フォン・デ・オニヤテ', '「私とあなたの素敵な目に映る私のために、お酒を飲みませんか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 8, 'グレン', '「仲間はいらないとおっしゃいましたが、その言葉に涙が出るほど愛着があります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(104, NULL, 'ギルバート・ブーゲンビリア', '「生きて…そして自由になりなさい。 心の底から、あなたを愛しています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(104, 5720, 'ヴァイオレット・エヴァーガーデン', '「『愛してる』の意味が知りたい…」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(104, 5720, 'ヴァイオレット・エヴァーガーデン', '「お客様が望むところならどこへでも全力で走ります。 私は自動手記人形、ヴァイオレット・エヴァーガーデンです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(104, 5720, 'ヴァイオレット・エヴァーガーデン', '「送れるはずの手紙が配達されないわけにはいかない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(104, 5720, 'ヴァイオレット・エヴァーガーデン', '「武器として多くの人を殺した後、私に何か権利はありますか？ 私は彼らが約束を守るのを防いだに違いない！ 大切な人との約束！ 私がこれまでしてきたことはすべて、今私を燃やしている炎に火をつけました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(104, NULL, 'シャーロット・アベルフレイヤ・ドロッセル', '「彼の本当の気持ちを知りたい」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(104, 5731, 'クラウディア・ホッジンズ', '「あなたは多くのことを学ぶだろう。しかし、それらを学ばなければ、知らなければ、生き続けることはより簡単かもしれない. 自分のしたことのせいで、自分の体に火がつき、燃え尽きていることに気づきません。 あなたはいつか理解するでしょう。 そうすれば、やけどが多いことに初めて気付くでしょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(104, 5747, 'オスカー・ウェブスター', '「私は本当に、あなたが死なないでほしかったのです。 私はあなたに生きてほしかった…生きて成長してほしかった。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(104, 5747, 'オスカー・ウェブスター', '「私の夢を叶えてくれてありがとう。 ありがとう。 奇跡を目撃したような気がします。 私は神が存在するとは信じていませんが、もしいるとしたらそれはきっとあなたでしょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, '画斎ゆの', '"私は夢中だ？？ 私と一緒にいることを拒否するこの世界はおかしいです！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, '画斎ゆの', '「私は利己的です、私は知っています。 でも、あなたを私だけのものにするために、たとえ違法であっても、私がする必要があるすべてのことをします。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, '画斎ゆの', '「半月。 明るい半分と暗い半分。 私と同じように。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, '画斎ゆの', '「この世界のすべてはただのゲームであり、私たちはただの駒にすぎません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, '画斎ゆの', '「たぶん未来は悪い。 でも、その先に未来があるでしょ？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'カリュウド月島', '「最も親切に見える人は、しばしば最も知らぬ間に残酷です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, '天野幸輝', '「私は哀れです。 私は安全な距離から世界を観察していました。 傷つくのが怖かっただけです。 私は孤独だった。"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, '天野幸寺', '「最後まで戦って辿り着ける奇跡があるなら見てみたい」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, '雨竜みねね', '「過去を掘り起こしても何も良いことはない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, '雨竜みねね', '「たとえそれが大した価値がなくても、戦い続けてください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, '雨竜みねね', '「私の子供時代は血と争いに満ちていました。 私は愛を必要としたことはありません。 その時も、今も。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, '雨竜みねね', '「これが俺の住む世界だ。大人の汚い世界だ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, '雨竜みねね', '「弱くても、最後まで戦い続ければ、その手で掴める奇跡がある。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, '雨竜みねね', '「私も救われたかった…」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, '秋瀬ある', '「この世界のすべてを知らないことは楽しいです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, '秋瀬ある', '「他人の考えを知りたければ、まず自分の考えを言わなければならない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, '秋瀬ある', '「勝つも負けるも自分次第」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'いくさばマルコ', '「私たちは神として永遠に一緒に暮らすことはできないと思います。 それでも……これも永遠です」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(115, 6365, 'ゼロツー', '「死んだら統計にすぎない。 私たちが何と呼ばれたかは問題ではありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(115, 6365, 'ゼロツー', '「弱いものは死ぬ。 ビッグディール」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(115, 6365, 'ゼロツー', '「言いたいことがあるなら、吐き出せるうちに吐き出したほうがいい。 遅かれ早かれ皆死ぬから」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(115, 6365, 'ゼロツー', '「心配しないで、私たちは死ぬまでずっと一緒にいます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(115, 6365, 'ゼロツー', '「人間の泣き声を最後に見たのは久しぶりです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(115, 6365, 'ゼロツー', '「私はあなたのことが好きになったと思います。 私のダーリンになってくれませんか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(115, 6365, 'ゼロツー', '「あなたがここに属していないのなら、あなたがいる場所を作ればいいのです。 パートナーがいない場合は、別のパートナーを見つけてください。 見つからない場合は、力ずくで取ってください！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(115, 6364, 'ヒロ', '「パートナーがいないことで嘲笑されることもあるでしょう。 でも、それを望んでいた部分がまだ残っていたという事実は、私を哀れに感じさせました.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(115, 6364, 'ヒロ', '「理由はわかりませんが、彼女の唇の温かいタッチに胸がドキドキしました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(115, 6364, 'ヒロ', '「初めて会った時、目が離せなかった。 あなたは自信を持っていて、頭を高く上げていました。 美しい」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(115, 6364, 'ヒロ', '「あなたに出会えたからこそ、今ここに立つことができるのです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(115, 6373, 'ミツル', '「何事にも希望を託せば裏切られる。 約束は果たされず、信仰はあなたを失望させるでしょう」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, '服部善蔵', '「人間が大人になるのは簡単だけど、子供のような心で何事も楽しい気持ちでいることはそう簡単なことじゃない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1769, '志村新八', '「強くなるのに近道はない。 外側を強く見せようとしても、その薄い層はすぐに剥がれます.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, '志村たえ', '「子供たちに夢を与えるには、ある程度の嘘が必要です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, '志村たえ', '"どんなに 美しい 人はそうかもしれませんが、それでも年を取り、最終的には死にます。 でも、見た目は変わっても、私たちの中に変わらないものがあると思いませんか？ 私たちの体が崩れても、月や年が犠牲になったとしても…私たちは皆、時間が台無しにできないものを持っていると信じていませんか? 皺だらけになっても負けません。 それは、私たちが真の美しさを知っているからです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, '志村たえ', '「友達が泣いているときは一緒に泣きなさい。 友達が心配しているときは、一緒に心配するべきです。 そして、友達が便通がぎこちないときは、しんちゃんも便通がぎこちないはずです。 友達なら、どんなことがあっても、相手の痛みを分かち合えるはずです。 そして、しんちゃん、友達が道を間違えたら…。 それが真の武士の友情です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1771, '桂小太郎', '「信念があれば夢は必ず叶う」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1771, '桂小太郎', '「昔からの友達が今も昔も変わらないのも悪くないと思う。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1771, '桂小太郎', '「この世界では変化は決して容易ではありません。 国全体はおろか、一人の友人さえも変えることはできません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1771, '桂小太郎', '「愛は予測不可能な出来事に基づいています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'タマ', '「もし生き残ったとしても、大切なものを守れなかったとしたら、死んだも同然です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, '寺門一', '「子供のことを考えない親などいない。 でも、親の気持ちを理解してくれる子は少ない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1778, '坂本辰馬', '「惑星は人が立つ場所にすぎません。 惑星はただの岩です。 世界を作るには人が必要です。 好きなだけ「地球」を持つことができます。 中身しか気にしない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1770, '神楽', '「私は自分の戦場を選ぶ。 私の血ではなく、私の心で！ 大切なものを守るために戦場に立つ。 そして、誰かが私の邪魔をしたとしても、それが私の同類であろうと、私の兄弟であろうと、他の誰かであろうと、私は気にしません... 私はそれらをすべて粉砕します！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1770, '神楽', '「枯れていない。 枯れさせません。 私たちは小さな枝かもしれませんが、枝が折れると、木は本当に枯れてしまいます。 だからと言って別れません。 冬が来て葉が落ちても、風が吹いて他の小さな枝がすべて折れても… たとえ私が最後の枝になっても、私は折れません。 きっと最後まで一緒にいるよ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1770, '神楽', '「最近の子供たちは、顔を埋めて甘い恋をしたいだけです。 少なくとも銀ちゃんはそう言ってるよ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1770, '神楽', '「善悪を問わず、私がボスになります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, '土方藤四郎', '「証拠など必要ありません。 作成する必要はありません。 一秒一秒を精一杯生きればいいし、生きてきた道の跡は地に焼き付いていく。 それが私たちの存在の証明となるでしょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, '土方藤四郎', '「壁にぶち当たって、それが存在しないふりをしていたら、進歩はありません。 壁は永遠に変わらないから、変わるのは君だ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1781, '高杉晋助', '「そう言う人ばかり お金 この世界では、それがたくさんあるものは問題ではありません。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1773, '沖田総悟', '「未来に進むためには、時には過去を振り返ることも必要です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1773, '沖田総悟', '「この世界には、手を血に染めても守らなければならないものがある。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, '海ぼうず', '「私は魚が好きです、biiig FISH。 あと、ナルトみたいな髪型してます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1863, 'きらら', '「結局のところ、私は自分のことだけを気にかけているだけだと思います。 私が愛し、尊敬していたのは私だけでした。 だからこそ、他人が自分のことをどう思っているかを知るのが怖かったのです。 傷つくのが怖くて逃げ出し、自分の殻に閉じこもりました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, '坂田銀時', '「残念ながら、私はあなたのようにあれこれと見分けることができる優れた眼球を持っていません。 目の前の一つのことを追求するために私にできること。 だから、死の淵でも虚空でも、お墓に奉納する饅頭のためには戦いません。 明日の朝食のために戦う。 それで全部です。"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, '坂田銀時', '「あなたは絶対に正しい。 私は一人では何もできません。 誰もが欠点や不完全さを持っていますが、それが私たちが協力する原動力です…それらの欠点を補うために。 一緒に、私たちは完璧な主人公を作ります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, '坂田銀時', '「夜は夜明け前が一番暗い。 しかし、目を開けたままにしてください。 暗闇から目をそらすと、新しい日の光に目がくらんでしまいます。 ですから、目の前の夜がどんなに暗くても、目を開けていてください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, '坂田銀時', '「勝っても負けても、戦争に意味はない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, '坂田銀時', '「まず自分自身が変わらなければなりません。さもないと、何も変わりません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, '坂田銀時', '「人は古い自分を壊すとき、新しい自分を見つける旅に出ます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, '坂田銀時', '「私には心臓よりも重要な臓器があります。 目には見えませんが、頭から足元まで伝わってきて、自分の中にあることを知っています。 自分の足で立つことができ、震えずに前に進むことができます。 ここで止めたら壊れそうな気がする……魂が壊れる」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, '坂田銀時', '「アニメは、会議室で考えられるものではありません。 アニメーターの脳から流れ出る奇妙なジュースから作られています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, '坂田銀時', '「別れはコインの裏表のようなもの。 出会いがあった時だけです。 別れの日を恐れるよりも、今日会えたことを嬉しく思いませんか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, '坂田銀時', '「人生は山のようなものです。頂上に到達したと言うことができますが、それは降りた後でのみです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, '坂田銀時', '「人々は明確な良心を持って人生を送る必要があります。 まっすぐな道を歩もうとすると、なぜか泥まみれになってしまう。 でも、あきらめない限り、いつかあなたの泥は乾いて落ちます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1772, '猿飛あやめ', '「あらかじめ決められたスクリプトに従って、あらかじめ決められたプログラムに閉じ込められているようなものです。 あなたが本当に現実に生きたいのなら、それと戦ってください。 自分の手で運命を打ち破り、自分の現実を築き上げろ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, '近藤功', '「前にも言ったけど、オタエさんは信用できない。 死んだ魚の目のような目をした信頼できる人はいません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3976, '日向翔陽', '「未来は、自分の夢の美しさを信じる者のものです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3976, '日向翔陽', '「私の目の前で、それは私の道を塞いでいます。 高い、高い壁。 その向こうにはどんなシーンが？ 私はそこで何を見ることができるでしょうか？ 「頂上からの眺め」。 自分だけでは絶対に見られない景色。 でも一人じゃなかったら……見えるかもしれない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3976, '日向翔陽', '「負けたくないのに理由が必要ですか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3976, '日向翔陽', '「でも今なら戦える。 彼らが私たちを読んだり、追いついたりしても、私たちは戦うことができます.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3976, '日向翔陽', '"T最初に機能した武器が最後まで機能し続けるという保証はありません。 私は前進し続けなければなりません。 私は続けなければならない！ 私の最大の 武器が引っかからない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3977, '影山飛雄', '「史上最高のおとりであることは、エースであることと同じくらいクールです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3977, '影山飛雄', '「もし彼らが私に順応するなら、私も順番に順応する必要があります。 調整をやめた人は、前に進むことができません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3977, '影山飛雄', '「もっと高く飛べる」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '西谷ゆう', '「私はボールを空中に保ちました。それはあなたがあきらめる場所ではありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, 'ニシノヤユウ', '「挑戦しないと人生つまらない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, 'ニシノヤユウ', '「私はリベロです。 私がしなければならないなら、私は私の人生であなたの背中を守ります.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, 'ニシノヤユウ', '「他の選択肢があることを知ってから試してみないと面白くない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '田中世子', '「寄り道してこそ見える花もある」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '武田一徹', '「今、風を羽ばたかせた鳥たちが、大いなる青空を飛んでいます。 そして、皆さんはそれを成し遂げることができるはずです！ 限界まで、限界まで！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '武田一徹', '「弱いということは、成長する余地があるということです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '武田一徹', '「負けたら弱いってこと？ みなさん、負けるのって大変じゃないですか？ 四つんばいになった後、再び立ち上がれるかどうかを確認する必要があるチャレンジですか？ 四つん這いでいれば、それはあなたが弱い証拠です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '武田一徹', '「色が混ざると、濁って散らかります。 しかし、それらがすべて混ざり合ったとき、最終的な結果は、他のすべてに勝つ色です…黒!」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '武田一徹', '「四つん這いになった後、再び立ち上がれるかどうかを確認する必要があるチャレンジ? 四つん這いでいれば、それはあなたが弱い証拠です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '武田一徹', '「はしごを登る者は一番下から始めてください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3992, '及川徹', '「打つなら壊れるまで打て！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3992, '及川徹', '「才能は開花させるもの、本能は磨くもの。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3992, '及川徹', '「カラスが群がると、巨大なオジロワシを殺すことさえあります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3979, '澤村大地', '「私は派手な芝居はできませんが、皆さんにしっかりとした土台を与えることはできます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3979, '澤村大地', '「彼はエネルギッシュなガキです。 アスレチックモンスター。 彼は完全に見知らぬ人でした。 そして時々…彼はまったく未知の力のようです。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3979, '澤村大地', '「冷静さを失った瞬間に失敗したことを誰よりもよく知っているべきだ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '清水清子', '「少しずつ、あなたが始めたことは自然にあなたにとって重要なものになります。 最初に必要なのは、少しの好奇心です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '鵜飼一恵', '「勝てない試合はないし、必ず勝てる試合もない」 ・鵜飼一恵', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '赤葦圭司', '「木兎は、全力を尽くすことを強いられるような人です。なぜなら、彼が全力を尽くしていることを知っているからです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '鵜飼圭信', '「勝つためにやるべきことはただ一つ。 練習練習練習。 内臓を吐いても、ボールを拾って続けます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '鵜飼圭信', '「まっすぐ前を向かずに上を向いたら、足場を失うかもしれません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '白布健次郎', '「優秀なエースがいれば、その存在自体が優秀な囮だ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '星海こうらい', '「誰もが、小さいことは実際よりも有害だと考えています。 バレーボールは体が小さいから不利だけど、無力になるわけじゃないよ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '香爪けんま', '「最初はクリアできそうにないゲームでも、何度もプレイすればクリアできます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '墨東光太郎', '「スパイクとは、ボールを床に叩きつけることだけではありません。 冷静になれば、取るべき行動が見えてきます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '菅原浩志', '「ここでいくらか安全を確保したとしても、それは私たちが決して変わっていないことを意味します。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3980, '田中龍之介', '「そんな風に見下されたら、噛み砕いて吐き出しますよ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '天童さとり', '「わからないものって怖いですよね？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '大平レオン', '「励ましではなく、ただの真実です。 大エースからもう一人のエースへ、これ以上言葉はいらない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '内井隆', '「人と違うところが、きっと彼の強みになるだろう」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '鷲城丹治', '「大きいほど常に強くなります。 それが自然の論理です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '山口正', '"モチベーション？ プライド以上に必要なものはありません！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '月島圭', '「勝敗にこだわってないから、負けたら困るよ。 ゲームを投げてみませんか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '黒尾哲郎', '「倒したらゲームオーバーになるから、負けられない方が楽しいんじゃない？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 4005, '牛島若利', '「穴のない防御は存在しない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '東峰朝陽', '「すべての障害を打ち破るために…。 それがエースです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, '五色勉', '"ラック？ とんでもない。 奇跡を起こすことができれば、あなたはただのエースです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 4003, '岩泉一', '「目の前にいる相手が見えない者は、その先にいる相手に勝てない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1633, 'ピッコロ', '「ベジータ、あなたには嘘をつくつもりはありませんが、あなたには答えが聞き取りにくいかもしれません。 これが真実だ。 悟空は他人の命を守ることに人生を捧げました。 彼の無私無欲のために、彼が死んだとき、彼は体を保ち、カイ王の惑星に旅行することを許されました. 一方、あなたは自分の利己的な欲望を追求するために人生を費やしてきました。 あなたはあまりにも多くの苦痛を引き起こしました。 あなたが死んだら、同じ報酬を受け取ることはできません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1633, 'ピッコロ', '「あなたが私からエネルギーを奪ったとしても、私の力はあなたよりもはるかに優れています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1633, 'ピッコロ', '「自分が誰であるかを知ると、恐怖を笑うでしょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1633, 'ピッコロ', '「時には、自分が望むものを超えて、最善を尽くさなければならないこともあります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1633, 'ピッコロ', '「悟飯、君は、愛がなければ導かれなければ力は何もないことを教えてくれた」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1633, 'ピッコロ', '「私の耳は、顔をフレーミングするだけではありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'ブルマブリーフ', '「悟空を見て、あなたが望むなら、人前に出て、髪をあらゆる方向に突き出すことができますが、私はそうではありません！」 ・ブルマブリーフ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'ブルマブリーフ', '「ヤムチャ、心配してた。 私が知っていた限り、あなたは発音できない国の溝で死んでいました。 あなたは私にこれを補わなければならないでしょう。 そして、あなたはそれを楽しむつもりです。」 ・ブルマブリーフ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, '黒悟空', '「私はあなたよりもはるかに高い視点から物事を見ています。 私はこの世界、この宇宙、万物の真実を観察します。 そして、人間は滅びなければならないことに気づきました。 神々が作ったすべてのものの中で、人間は彼らの唯一の失敗です. この世界を、この宇宙を、 美しい ユートピアよ、自らの過ちを認めようとしない神々に代わって、人類を排除しなければならない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, '–ウィス', '「あなたは自分の寛大さのせいで、地球を守れませんでした。 この結末を回避する唯一の方法は、フリーザを彼の花畑に送り返すことです。」 –ウィス', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, '–ウィス', '「まあ、ベジータ星の滅亡を最初から許可していると知ったら、王子様はどうするのかしら？」 –ウィス', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1664, 'クリリン', '「ねえフン！ 良いアイデアを思いついたので、取引しましょう! よし、俺がヘラクレスと戦うぞ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1664, 'クリリン', '「最初は私たちは牛乳屋でしたが、今では悪臭を放つ農家です。 おりん寺ではやったことがありません」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'ビルス', '「正義について説教する人は決して善人ではありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'ビルス', '「私は心ある神ですが、一つだけ許せないことがあります…他人に適切な敬意を払わない人々です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'ビルス', '「創造の前に…破壊が来なければならない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'ビルス', '「あとは地球を滅ぼすだけですが、滅ぼすのはもったいないと思います。 この星の食べ物はとてもおいしいです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'ビルス', '「サイヤ人は前回見た時から変わったようです。 彼らは臆病になりました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'ビルス', '「破壊神より強い者など存在しない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「トランクス、赤ちゃんの頃は抱きしめたことがなかった…抱きしめさせて」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '"伺いします。 あなたのような機械が恐怖を経験することはありますか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「カカロット、あなたはとても印象的です。 魔人ブウと戦えるチャンスは一度もなかった。彼と戦えるのはあなただけだ。 私のような天才があなたを超えることはできないということが、ようやく理解できた気がします。 守るものがあるからだと思った。 保護したいというあなたの意欲が、あなたの能力を生かすことを可能にしていると思っていました… これが理由だったのかもしれませんが、私もこの意欲を持っているわけではありません。 敵を殺してプライドを養うのが楽しかったので、好きなように戦った。 でも彼は違う、勝つためではなく、絶対に負けないから限界を突破し、相手が誰であろうと本当に気にしない。 だから、彼が私を殺さなかったのは、私が今のように他人を気遣うことができるのを見たからです... カカロットに行け、あなたが一番です!」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「私の細胞があなたの体の中にあるとは信じがたいです。 どうしてそんなに醜いことが判明したのですか？ なんてもったいない。 ただし、どこで力を発揮したかは明らかです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「戦いに公平も不公平もありません。 勝利か、あなたの場合は敗北しかありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「カカロット…お願い…フリーザを倒して…彼が私を作ってくれた。 やめて… 彼に… やらせて… 他の誰にも。 何があっても…彼を止めて…お願いします。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「彼は私を完全に打ちのめしました。 最初は彼自身の行動によって、次に息子の行動によって。 そして、彼はここで私に何を残しましたか? どうやって？ どうしてそんなに死ぬことができたの？ どう、カカロット？ 私には機会がありません…あなたに対して私の強さを証明する. あなたは恐れることなく死にました。 それは私を何にしますか？ 私は戦士ではありません。 そして二度と戦うことはありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「何千年も見られなかった力を目の当たりにする準備はできていますか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「最強の戦士でさえ恐怖を経験します。 彼らを真の戦士たらしめているのは、恐れを克服する勇気です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「痛みを乗り越えて、あきらめることはもっと痛い。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「いいえ、負けません！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「私が新しいレベルの強さに到達するたびに、より大きな力が私の権威に挑戦するように見えます. カカロットと同じように、運命がバカバカしい笑みを浮かべて私を笑っているようだ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「この世界で重要なのは強さだけだ。 それ以外は弱者の妄想に過ぎない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「男性の仕事をするために男の子を派遣してはいけません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「サーカス好きには絶対に屈しない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「どうして息子にこんなことをさせることができるでしょうか。 彼は私のためにすべてを犠牲にしました ！ そして、私は彼を無視するだけでした！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「私はこの新たな挑戦を恐れず、むしろ真の戦士のように立ち向かいます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「人生において確実なことはただ一つ。 強い男が上に立ち、すべてを征服する！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「死の神による死、これは誇りに思う瞬間かもしれません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「私はここで暇つぶしをしているのに、カカロットの修行はどれくらい大変なの？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'ヘラクレス', '「地球が永遠に平和であることを誓った。 私がその誓いを立てて以来、地球に対する脅威は一度もありません。 それも銀河全体に私の名前が知れ渡っているおかげです」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'ごわす', '「たとえ悪が道に迷ったとしても、あなたは自分の立場にとどまり、善の道を探し続けます。 その検索は、正義とは何ですか？ 神々が人間に知識を与えたのはそのためです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'フロスト', '「私は戦争を始め、自分で解決し、そして私は 購入 戦争で荒れ果てた土地を低君主のために立ち上げ、再開発と再建の譲歩を殺します! それは素晴らしい計画です.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, '17', '" 美しい 言葉、今ならわかります、あなたは本当にサイヤ人の王族の血を引いた王子様です。」 – アンドロイド 17', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, '17', '「教えて、サイヤ人はみんな自分でいっぱいなの？ これがあなたの無能さを隠す方法ですか？ 私たちアンドロイドは、常にあなたのようなものよりも優れています。」 – アンドロイド 17', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'グランドエルダーグル', '「死は私たちの人生の別の段階です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, '16', '「悟飯、任せて。 正当な理由のために戦うことは歌ではありません。 言葉だけでは届かない人がいる。」 – アンドロイド 16', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1666, 'トランクス', '「あなたは本当のスーパーサイヤ人と戦うことがどのようなものかを知ろうとしています…そして私は悟空のことを話しているのではありません.」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'エドワード・エルリック', '「もしかしたら、人生に平等な取引はないかもしれない。もしかしたら、得たものをすべて捨てて、何も返ってこないかもしれない。 本当だと証明できなくても、アルのためにやってみるしかない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'エドワード・エルリック', '「いつも言っているように、ドアが見つからない？ 自分で作ってください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1173, 'ロイ・マスタング', '「失われた命は二度と戻らない。 その真実こそが、私たちに生きる意味と価値を示してくれるのです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1173, 'ロイ・マスタング', '「考える頭脳と国民の利益のために行動する神経を持っている人は、停滞に満足し、災害に耐えることを厭わない人から、急進派と見なされます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1175, 'リザ・ホークアイ', '「戦争は誰が正しいかを決定するのではなく、誰が残されるかを決定します。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1175, 'リザ・ホークアイ', '「錬金術が言うように、この世界のやり方が等価交換に基づいているなら、新しい世代が幸運を享受できるようにするために、私たちが支払わなければならない代償は、死体を川を渡って運ぶことです。血。"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'アルフォンス・エルリック', '「何かを得るためには、それと同等の価値がなければならない。 それは錬金術における保存の法則です。 当時、私たちはそれが世界の真実だと信じていました。 しかし、現実の世界は完璧ではないため、その中で起こるすべてを支配する単一の法則は存在しません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'アルフォンス・エルリック', '「私たちが去った日、私たちは実家と家の中の身近なものをすべて焼き払いました。 痕跡を残してはいけない記憶もあるから」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'アルフォンス・エルリック', '「兄弟、私たちが正しい道を選んだかどうかはわかりません。 しかし、私はこれを知っています：私はもうこのスーツを着たくない. もう一度感じたい。 おかしいです。 私たちはずっと隣り合わせでした。 でも、あなたの肌がどんな感じだったのか、どんなにおいがしたのか思い出せません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'アルフォンス・エルリック', '「確かに私は体を持っていませんが、私はここにいます。 これは、人間が立ち入ることを禁じられている聖地に足を踏み入れたことへの罰です。 私たちは間違いを犯しました、ローズ、私たちはその代償を払っています。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'アルフォンス・エルリック', '「あなたは何の役にも立たない人です。 何事にも一生懸命になれること、それ自体が才能だと思います。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1198, 'マリア・ロス', '「道に迷い、理由がなくても大丈夫です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1176, 'グリード', '「貪欲は良くないかもしれないが、それほど悪くもない。 あなたの人間は、貪欲はただのためだと思っています お金 または力ですが、誰もが手にできないものを望んでいます。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1176, 'グリード', '「亡くなった人に会いたい」「お金持ちになりたい」「女性が欲しい」「世界を守りたい」。 それらはすべて欲望です。 いわば願い事。 私に言わせれば、貪欲に『善』も『悪』もない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1192, 'ソルフ・J・キンブリー', '「これ以上のことはありません 美しい 魂を危険にさらすような仕事をするよりも、それが生きているということだからです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1200, 'トリシャ・エルリック', '「ほら、私たちは変わることができると確信しています。私たちは弱いからです。 そして、私たちは死ぬからです。 私たちは生きるために戦わなければならず、それが私たちを強くするのです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1200, 'トリシャ・エルリック', '「私たちは本当に弱い生き物ですが、だからこそ強くなろうと努力することができます。 役に立たないと感じても、私たちが踏む一歩一歩が素晴らしいことにつながります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1169, 'ウィンリィ・ロックベル', '「なぜあなたは常に難しい方法で物事を学ぶことに固執するのですか?」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1169, 'ウィンリィ・ロックベル', '「人生には、言葉でしか分からないものがある。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, NULL, 'メイズ・ヒューズ', '「自分の神に見捨てられた宗教など、私には何の役にも立たない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, NULL, 'メイズ・ヒューズ', '「一般的に、男性は言葉よりも自分の行動を語ることを好みます。 彼らが苦しんでいるとき、彼らはそれを助けることができるかどうかではなく、誰かに負担をかけたくありません. 彼らは誰にも心配してほしくありません。 それが彼らのやり方です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, NULL, 'メイズ・ヒューズ', '「彼女が愛する男になるためなら何でもする。 私はこの戦争を生き抜く。 家に帰ったら、ここでやったことをすべて飲み込み、彼女と一緒にいるときは笑顔になります。 命をかけて誓います。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1221, 'ダンテ', '「人々はバランスがあり、すべてが理由で起こるという論理があると言うことができます…しかし、真実ははるかに設計されていません. どんなに頑張っても死ぬ時は死ぬ。 人生のすべてをトップへの道を切り開くことに費やし、それでも貧困の中で死ぬ人もいます。 他の人は、まったく働かずに富に生まれます。 それは残酷でランダムな世界です。 それでもカオスは 美しい」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1172, 'イズミ・カーティス', '「生きていれば、遅かれ早かれ人生は終わります。 身体は土に還る。 その上に草や花が生えます。 魂は心を養い、人々の心の中で生き続けます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, NULL, 'ローズ・トーマス', '「起きなさい、エド。 起きて前へ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1179, 'アレックス・ルイ・アームストロング', '「破壊と創造は表裏一体！ 作成するには破壊する必要があります。 それが宇宙の法則です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, NULL, 'オリヴィエ・ミラ・アームストロング', '「死者への愛は無意味です。 私たちは彼らを生かし続けるために戦う、それだけです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, '–ウィス', '「まあ、最初から惑星ベジータの滅亡を許可したと王子が知ったらどうするんだろう？」 –ウィス', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, '–ウィス', '「あなたは自分の寛大さのせいで、地球を守れませんでした。 これを回避する唯一の方法は、フリーザを彼の花畑に送り返すことです。」 –ウィス', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'フロスト', '「私は戦争を始め、自分で解決し、そして私は 購入 戦争で荒廃した土地を低価格で買い取り、再開発と再建の譲歩を一掃します。 見事な計画だ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'ベジータ', '「私はここで暇つぶしをしているのに、カカロットの修行はどれだけ大変なのだろう」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'ごわす', '「たとえ悪によって道に迷ったとしても、あなたは自分の立場にとどまり、善の道を探し続けます。 その探求こそが正義ではないでしょうか。 神々が人間に知識を与えたのはそのためです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1699, '(ミスターサタン)', '「地球が永遠に平和であることを誓った。 私がその誓いを立てて以来、地球に対する脅威は一度もありません。 それも、私の名前が全銀河に知れ渡っているおかげです。」 – ヘラクレス (ミスターサタン)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, 5398, '緑谷出久', '「笑顔で頼りがいのあるクールなヒーロー……そうなりたい！ だからこそ全てを捧げる。 すべての人のために！"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, 5398, '緑谷出久', '「目の前にいる一人の少女を救うことができなければ……みんなを救うヒーローになれるとは思えません」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, 5398, '緑谷出久', '「今夜攻撃しているすべての悪役が彼のレベルにある場合...誰もが困っています. そして、彼らは私たち学生を狙っているかもしれません。 ミスター・アイザワとワイルド・ワイルド・プッシーキャッツに私の知っていることを話さなければならない。 私の行動で誰かを救えるのなら……何かしなきゃ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, 5399, '轟焦凍', '「法律の名の下に、人々を死なせるべきだったのだろうか？ 人を救うのがヒーローの仕事じゃないの？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, 5399, '轟焦凍', '「やめたいなら立ち上がれ」 言いたいことが一つあるから。 なりたい自分を忘れないで！」 ・轟焦凍', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, 5399, '轟焦凍', '「しっかりしろ、お前は 成人 そうじゃない？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, 5399, '轟焦凍', '「ママの力だけで勝つ。 お前の力は絶対に戦わせない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, 5399, '轟焦凍', '「お兄ちゃんが寝取られてから…
私はあなたに目を向けてきました。 その建物の恨みはすべてあなたの顔に書かれていたからです。 それは見ればわかる。 そして、私はそのような恨みがどれほど人のビジョンを曇らせることができるかを知っています.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '戸村信楽', '「ヒーローもヴィランもどちらも暴力で繁栄しますが、私たちはまだ分類されています。 「あなたはいい」「あなたは悪い」。 その通りです！ 平和の象徴？ ハッ！ 結局のところ、あなたは暴力の道具にすぎず、私たちを抑圧するために作られています. そして、暴力はさらなる暴力を生むだけです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '戸村信楽', '「たとえこのヒーロー社会が崩壊しても…たとえ私が裏社会を支配するために立ち上がっても…私の心の重みは決して消えません. だから全部嫌い。 生きていて呼吸しているすべてのものは、私を間違った方向にこすります。 では、すべてを破壊してみませんか？ なぜすべてを破壊しないのですか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '戸村信楽', '「オールマイトのいない世界を作れ。 そして、彼らの正義が本当にどれほど脆弱であるかを彼ら全員に示すのに十分な破壊を引き起こします. 今日から…それが私の信念です。 オールマイトがすべてです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '戸村信楽', '「君たちヒーローは社会の守護者のふりをする。 何世代にもわたって、あなたは守ることができなかった人々に会わないふりをして、彼らの痛みを敷物の下に押し流しました. あなたが築き上げてきたものすべてが汚れています。 つまり、あなたのシステムはすべて内側から腐っており、ウジが這い出しています. それはすべて、時間の経過とともに少しずつ積み上げられます。 保護されていることに大きく依存している、一般的なゴミがあります。 そして、甘やかす必要のあるゴミを作った勇敢なガーディアン。 それは腐敗した悪循環です。 私が目撃したすべて、あなたが構築したこのシステム全体は、常に私を拒絶してきました。 今、私はそれを拒否する準備ができています。 だからこそ壊します。 だから私はこの力を自分のために取ったのです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'オールマイト', '「最も膨らんだ自我は、多くの場合、最も脆弱です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'オールマイト', '「夢を見ることは悪くない。 しかし、現実的なことも考慮する必要があります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'オールマイト', '「勝っても負けても、振り返って経験から学ぶことは人生の一部です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'オールマイト', '「自分の限界にぶつかっていると感じたら、拳を握りしめる理由を思い出してください！ なぜこの道を歩み始めたのかを思い出し、その記憶が限界を超えてあなたを運ぶようにしてください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'オールマイト', '「何も得られない時、その時に立ち向かうことが、きっと真のヒーローの証だ…！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, 5401, '飯田天哉', '「やりたいことと、それに向いていることは別問題」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'シンソウヒトシ', '「今回は失敗したかもしれませんが、あきらめません。 ヒーローコースに行けるだけの実力を持っていることを見せつけて、みんなよりも偉大なヒーローになるわ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '相沢翔太', '「夢を途中で終わらせることほど残酷なことはない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '相沢翔太', '「彼らは外の世界に接し、間近で個人的に接してきました。 彼らにはその恐れが植え付けられています。 そして、彼らはそれに耐えてきました。 それを克服します。 それぞれがその経験から成長しました。 そして躊躇することを忘れた。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '相沢翔太', '「勇者になるなら、そんなのんびりしたイベントをしている暇はない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, 5397, '爆豪勝己', '「あんたみたいな要領を得ないバカは我慢できない！ 基本的には、「トラブルを起こしたい、仲間になりたい！」と言っているのです。 なんて冗談だ！ 私はいつもオールマイトの勝利を賞賛してきました。 馬鹿が何と言おうと、それを変えるものは何もありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, 5397, '爆豪勝己', '「私はあなたたち全員を倒すつもりです。 あなたの勝利をお楽しみください。 二度と起こらないぞ、くそっ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, 5397, '爆豪勝己', '「おしゃべりやめろ、俺が勝つ。 それが……勇者のすることだ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, 5397, '爆豪勝己', '「私を馬鹿にしたことを後悔するだろう…私はあなたを殺します！ 私はすべての最初を終わらせるために最初に取っています。 中途半端なパンクに勝っても意味がない。 デクより上手にできなかったらダメ！ だから、勝とうとしていないなら、私の顔から出ていけ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, 5397, '爆豪勝己', '「私を過小評価しないでください！ それに演技だけでも上級生でもヴィランはヴィラン！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, 5400, '麗日お茶子', '「だから俺はヒーローになる。 私はそれを作ります お金…私の母と父がより楽な生活を送れるように。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, 5400, '麗日お茶子', '「彼が苦戦しているのを見たとき、彼に対してオッズが積み上げられました…考えさせられました…保護が必要なときにヒーローを保護するのは誰ですか?」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '–ダビ', '「UAの教官に相応しいよね、勇者？ 生徒がとても貴重だからですか？ 彼らを守るのに必要なものをあなたが手に入れてくれることを願っています… またね。 –ダビ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '–ダビ', '「これはただの合図射撃だ。 私たちは穴だらけのヒーローたちを埋めていきます…そして彼らをその場所に置きます。 すべては明るい未来のために。」 –ダビ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '–ダビ', '「未来を見据えていれば、もっと良くなれる！」と思ったことがあるでしょう。 言葉に詰まると思いますが、ここに答えがあります！ 過去は死なない！ まだ手に入れる!? あなたが蒔いたものを刈り取りましょう！ Let''s tango 君と僕 轟焦凍!! 息子と一緒に踊りましょう、ここは地獄です!!」 –ダビ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '加山ねむり', '「時間がたくさんあるので、ゲートに車を停めようと思ったのですが…まあ、そのアプローチをとることはまったく面白くありません…赤ちゃんのように走ったり金切り声を上げたりするのを見ると…私の心のサディストが痛みます。プレーするチャンス。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'うさぎやまるみ', '「明日がないように毎日を生きているので、番号が上がったときに後悔することなくチェックアウトできます！ まさか、このゾンビの大群がミルコ・ザ・ヒーローを終わらせるはずがない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'うさぎやまるみ', '「うさぎのように速く！ それは汗ではありません。 死ぬならまず仕事を片付けろ…ミルコ!! まだやっていない！ ヒーローは決して、決して…あきらめないからです！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'うさぎやまるみ', '「ニュースを見て飛び乗った！ あなたはリーグの一員ですよね？ お尻を蹴ります！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '高見圭吾', '「特に後継者育成とかには興味ないんですけど……近距離戦とか弱点カバーに力を入れてるのもいいけど、長所を伸ばすのも怠ってはいけませんね」 . より自由に動けるようになります。 ほら…仲間の鳥から取ってください。 翼があるなら伸ばして飛べばいい。 地面に閉じ込められる必要はありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '高見圭吾', '「人は窮地に立たされたとき、真に自由になったとき……それが本性を現すとき。 だから、分倍河原はまともな人だったと思うんだ…ただ必死に助けてくれる人だったと思うし、私も同じように感じている.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '高見圭吾', '「私はホークスです。 ちょっと早すぎる男。 英雄たちが少しの退屈を楽しむことができる社会…私はそれをトレードマークのトップスピードで実現することを約束します.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '高見圭吾', '「あなたが立ち直るのを手伝います…あなたは悪い手で扱われましたが、あなたは自分の行いを償ってやり直すことができます. いい人だから。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '高見圭吾', '「私は自分自身を楽しみたいだけです。 真剣に。 のんびりとパトロールをして、いくつかの出演をして、「ああ、今日は問題ありません」と言って、ぐっすり眠りましょう！ それが私の理想の人生です！ 私はこの世界を、ヒーローが殺す暇がある世界にしたいのです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '等々力エンジ', '「爆豪、できないことを学びたいって言ったでしょ？ あなたの能力は一流です。少なくとも新人としては十分です。 でも、このままでは私を超えることはできません。 この冬はただのトレーニングかもしれませんが、遅すぎると、いつもの言い訳が使えなくなります。 ここは教室ではありません。遅すぎても点数を失うことはなく、むしろ人の命を失うことになります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '等々力エンジ', '「私は翔太にすべてを与えました。 20歳までに、私はすでに2位に上昇していました. あの登攀をしたからこそわかったのですが……頂上にたどり着かないと駄目なのです。 肩書きさえあれば、あなたのような笑顔を浮かべて……愛すべきバカを演じられたのに。 でも一番強くなりたかった！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'トガヒミコ', '「オチャコ、好きな人のことを考えると、その人になりたくなる。 彼らの血をすべて自分のために取りたいというこの欲求は、私が我慢できなくなるまで噴出します. 考えただけで感情的になってしまいます。 私はそうですが、他の人はそうではありません。 このまま生きていくのはとてもつらいです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'トガヒミコ', '「彼らはどこで線を引くのですか？ ヒーローが人を救うのなら、ジンは人じゃないの？ 彼らも私を殺しますか？ 出久とお茶子に聞きたいこと。 彼らの答え次第で、私は大丈夫です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'トガヒミコ', '「私は自分のやり方で愛し、生き、死にたい。 私の通常の方法。 愛する人たちのようになりたい。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '鳥野空彦', '「早く強くならなきゃ」と君は言う。 それは本当です。 時間はあなたの味方ではなく、敵の味方でもありません。 そして、彼らはあなたが強くなるのを待ちません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '芦戸美奈', '「あのエモい顔じゃどこにも行けない年寄り！ その暗い自分を乗り越えたら…教えてください。 さもないと高校デビューの男の噂を流してしまう」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '京香次郎', '「これをやれば勝てるかもしれない。 でも躊躇している時間はないので、今すぐやりましょう！ あなたはヒーローになりたいですよね!? では、この試練を乗り越えましょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, '常闇文影', '「あなたの位置が明らかになったので、あなたは私の十字線にいます。 そして、来る嵐から隠れることはできません。 として ホークス











 言うだろう…スピードはパワーに勝る。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, '埼玉', '「私はあなたの承認を得たいからヒーローではありません。 やりたいからやる！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, '埼玉', '「明日の問題は明日の私に任せます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, '埼玉', '「圧倒的な強さはつまらない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, '埼玉', '「髪の毛が抜けるところまで必死に練習しなきゃ。 それが真に強くなる唯一の方法です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, '埼玉', '「腕立て伏せ100回。 腹筋100回。 そしてスクワット100回。 続いて10キロラン。 毎日やりましょう！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, '埼玉', '「自分を変えられるから人間は強い」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, '埼玉', '「やり続けなければならない。 どんなに難しくても。 ここまで強くなるのに丸3年かかりました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, '埼玉', '「小さい頃はヒーローになりたかった。 いまいましいビジネスマンではありません。 しかし、あなたのような腐った悪役を一撃で吹き飛ばすことができるスーパーヒーロー.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, '埼玉', '「ヒーローたちが逃げ隠れしたら、残って戦うのは誰？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, '埼玉', '「本当に強くなりたいのなら、他人があなたについてどう思うかを気にするのをやめなさい。 自分の人生を生きることは、他の人の考えとは何の関係もありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, '埼玉', '「それがお前の力の限界か？ 明日のあなたは今日のあなたに勝てますか？ 屈服するのではなく、前に進みなさい。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, '埼玉', '「力と引き換えに、人間にとって必要不可欠なものを失ったのではないか？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, '無免ライダー', '「誰も私に多くを期待していないことはわかっています。 そして、C級ヒーローがいかに役立たずかを誰よりもよく知っている。 B級でも弱いのはわかってる！ 絶対に勝てないことは誰よりも分かっている。 しかし、とにかくあなたと戦わなければなりません！', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, 'スウィートマスク', '「民衆の不安を鎮めるためには、英雄はタフで強く、 美しい、そして迅速かつ見事に悪を根絶することができます。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5079, 'ガロウ', '「誰にも負けない。 私は史上最強の怪物になります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5079, 'ガロウ', '「自分をヒーローと呼ぶことで、大きな代償を払うことになるでしょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5079, 'ガロウ', '「悪とは何か？ 正義とは？ これらのきれいな言葉はすべて、大多数が私を死にたいと思っているので、私が死ぬべきだということを意味しています! これはばかげている！ 彼らは皆、地獄に行くことができます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5079, 'ガロウ', '「できれば止めてください。 それまでは、この生意気でいよう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5079, 'ガロウ', '「ランクなんか気にするのは……アホかよ」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5079, 'ガロウ', '「周りからののしられたり、からかわれたりしたくないのなら、もっと強くなるしかない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5079, 'ガロウ', '「こいつらは階段だ。 本物のモンスターになるために登らなければならない階段です。 引き下がらない！ 一つ一つ歩いて上っていきます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5079, 'ガロウ', '「怖いほどいい。 怖いってかっこいいと思わない？」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5079, 'ガロウ', '「楽しすぎて我慢できません！ もっと強くなれる！ 体はまだ動いていて、痛みは感じません。 じわじわと力が湧いてくるのを感じて、本当にワクワクしています！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5079, 'ガロウ', '「人気者が勝ち、嫌われ者が負けるなんて悲劇だ。 そしたら誰にも負けない。 私は史上最強の怪物となり、このシナリオを変えます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5066, '–ハンマーヘッド', '「なんで払わなきゃいけないの？ お金 たべる？！ みんなでシェアしませんか？！ 世界の自由はどこにある!? みんな労働の奴隷!! 金持ちは太る…貧乏人は死ぬ！」 –ハンマーヘッド', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5050, 'ジェノス', '「私は正義のために戦う孤独なサイボーグです！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5050, 'ジェノス', '「これがあなたの選んだ道なら……邪魔はしません。 しかし、人々を敵に回せば…あなたはヒーローとして活躍できるでしょうか？ これは心配です。 でももしあなたが窮地に立たされたら…私はそこにいます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5050, 'ジェノス', '「あなたはキングを狙っているかもしれませんが、私はもっと強い人を知っています。 それよりも、私はあなたよりも強いです！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5053, 'バング', '「あなたは失敗を心配するには若すぎる。 いざという時はぐちゃぐちゃに。 結果は変わらないから、それでいい」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5047, 'クセノ博士', '「君は冷静で頭がいいが、若者は災難を招くことがある。 一人で戦わないでください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, 'オートミックサムライ', '「強い者しか認めない」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, '属博士', '「自分は進化する必要がないと思っているクレチンに…自分の遺伝子を引き継ぐ権利はない！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5268, '中島敦', '「人々は、誰かに生きていく価値がある、さもないと続けられないと言われる必要があります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, NULL, '淳', '「私は正義にはあまり興味がありません。 私はただ、自分の大切な人たちの安全を確認したいだけなのです。」 – 中島 淳', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, NULL, '淳', '「暗闇に満ちた世界では、光は常に明るく輝きます。」 – 中島 淳', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5269, '太宰治', '「正義は武器。 危害を加えるために使用することはできますが、他人を保護したり救ったりすることはできません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5269, '太宰治', '「良い本は、何度読んでも良いものです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5269, '太宰治', '「痛みは人を成長させるものです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5273, '谷崎潤一郎', '「死は終わりではありません。 それは新たな旅の始まりにすぎません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5277, '中原中也', '「世界は残酷な場所ですが、それは私たちが正しいことのために戦うのをやめるべきだという意味ではありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5272, '江戸川乱歩', '「まず自分が変わらなければ世界を変えることはできない。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5270, '芥川龍之介', '「どんなに力があっても、ポーンはただのポーンです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5267, '福沢諭吉', '「過去を恐れる必要はない。 過去は単なる思い出です。 それは本当ではない。"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5267, '福沢諭吉', '「時には、前に進む唯一の方法は、過去を後に残すことです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5274, '宮沢賢治', '「人は変わります。 それはまさに人生の事実です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5274, '宮沢賢治', '「本当の友達とは、あなたのことをすべて知っていて、それでもあなたを愛してくれる人のことです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5275, '与謝野晶子', '「本当の自分を受け入れられない人は失敗する運命にある。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5275, '与謝野晶子', '「恐れることは何も悪いことではありません。 重要なのは恐怖に直面したときに何をするかだ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, NULL, 'フランシス・スコット・キー', '「富は悪夢です。 切望されたものごとに、私たちは 購入、私たちは夢見ていたものを失います。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5281, 'フランシス・スコット・フィッツジェラルド', '「勝ち負けの問題ではない。 重要なのは、どのようにゲームをプレイするかだ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5283, 'ルーシー・モード・モンゴメリ', '「真実は苦痛を伴うかもしれないが、嘘をついて生きるよりはずっと良い。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, NULL, '森鴎外', '「私たちは自分の能力によって決まるのではなく、それをどう使うかによって決まるのです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, NULL, '佐々木信子', '「人が理想を強く信じ、心血を注いでいる姿は素晴らしいと思います。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, '今野祐希', '「時には、自分の主張を伝えるために戦わなければならないこともあります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, '今野祐希', '「私はいつも自分が感じていることを正確に言います。彼らが私を気に入らなくても、それでいいのです! 私が彼らの心の近くにいたという事実は変わりません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'キリト', '「ここでも現実の世界でも、痛いときは泣いていい。 ゲームだからって感情を出してはいけないというルールはありません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'キリト', '「現実世界と仮想世界が近くなればなるほど、未来は良くなると思いました。 しかし、それらの間の境界が曖昧になるほど、人々をだますようになります。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'キリト', '「あの二人……いや、あの時殺した三人の本名も知らない。 目を閉じて、両手を耳に当てて、すべてを忘れようとしました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'キリト', '「誰でも戦える。 それはあなたがすべきかどうかの選択にすぎません。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'キリト', '「この世界では、私たちが感じているものは現実です。 そしてそれが彼らを重要なものにするのです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'キリト', '「誰かを理解する最良の方法は、彼らと戦うことだ。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'キリト', '「たとえ道がどんなに暗くても、私は前に進み続けます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'キリト', '「たとえ仮想世界であっても、私たちは自分自身の運命を創造します。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3379, '結城明日奈', '「最も重要なことは、目の前にあることがある。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3379, '結城明日奈', '「ここで学んだことが一つあります。 最後まで頑張ってください。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3379, '結城明日奈', '「私は毎晩一人で泣いていました。 ここで過ごした毎日が、私の実生活の一部を奪っていくように感じました。 泣いた後は思いっきり戦いに行った。 勝つこと、前進すること、そして強くなることだけを考えていました。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3379, '結城明日奈', '「人間の意志の力を過小評価しないでください。 それはどんな障害も乗り越えることができる。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3379, '結城明日奈', '「仮想世界であっても、私たちが経験する感情は本物です。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3379, '結城明日奈', '「時には、勝つための唯一の方法は犠牲を払うことです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'ゆい', '「あなたと一緒にいると、誰もが笑顔になります。 お願い…これからは私の代わりに人を助けに行ってください。 あなたの幸せを彼らと分かち合いましょう。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'リズベット', '「私も、何かを探していました。 この世に実在する何か。 私にとっては、あなたの手のぬくもりでした。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3389, 'サチ', '「私が死んでも、あなたは生き続けますか？ この世界の終わりを見て、なぜそれが生まれたのかを見て生きてください。 私のような弱い女の子がここにたどり着いた理由を見てみましょう。 そして、あなたと私が出会った理由。', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'ユージオ', '「愛は求めるものではなく、与えるものです。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'ユージオ', '「アリスを取り戻すためにここまで来たんだ！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'アリス・ツーバーグ', '「私は他人に私の運命を決めさせません。 自分の道は自分で切り拓いていきます。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'アリス・ツーバーグ', '「私の大切なものは奪わせません！」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'アリス・ツーバーグ', '「誰かを守る強さは、絶対に傷つけさせたくないという気持ちから生まれる。」', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, 5161, 'Korosensei', 'You must not hope for society to change for you. Do not reject society. To put it bluntly, that is simply a waste of time.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, NULL, 'Killua', 'People only find me interesting because they can''t tell whether I''m serious or not.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Eater', 'In the end the shape and form don''t matter at all, it''s only the soul that matters, right? Nothing else.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Ooga Kazuomi', 'I''m still a man too, I wanted to look calm and composed in front of everyone. Especially in front of the one I''m in love with.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 168, 'Pain', 'Because of the existence of love - sacrifice is born. As well as hate. Then one comprehends... one knows PAIN.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(82, 4721, 'Nona', 'Everyone Makes Mistakes. But people''s feelings can manifest through the most subtle of expressions.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Kaizaki Arata', 'Slowly, by spending time together with that person, your love for him will grow bigger.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(85, NULL, 'Shōyō Hinata', 'It''s best to go up against strong guys, if you want to get stronger.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, NULL, 'Oreki Houtarou', 'The inexperienced draw attention by acting differently.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(100, 5571, 'Tanya Degurechaff', 'You should try persuasion when people are mentally defenseless. The fascist who proposed that was a demonic genius.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, NULL, 'Father', 'Humans who would dare to play God must pay a steep price for their arrogance, that is Truth.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(78, NULL, 'Kaneki Ken', '"Never trust anyone too much... Remember the devil was once an angel..."', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(63, 3943, 'Tatsuya Shiba', 'A world where everyone is equal and receives the same treatment. No such place exists. If there was a world of equality, where talent and aptitude didn’t matter, we would all be equally snubbed there.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(86, 4930, 'Yuu Otosaka', 'DEATH is so unfair. It comes to those who don''t need it. But not the people who are asking for it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(86, 4930, 'Yuu Otosaka', 'In this world, nobody is free. Even the flying birds are chained to the sky.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, NULL, 'Sasuke Uchiha', 'No man chooses evil because it is evil; he only mistakes it for happiness, the good he seeks', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2781, 'Zeref', 'If this world continues to reject me, then I shall reject the world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, 4356, 'Karma Akabane', 'Even if the questions change, it makes no difference to me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, NULL, 'Shalnark', 'But the big difference is who I work for. I''d rather die than be a yes-man to someone I don''t even like.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2729, 'Gildarts Clive', 'Fear is "evil", it tells your weakness. If you can know your weakness, people become strong and gentle.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, 2565, 'King Bradley', '"Why must everyone make such a fuss over the death of a single soldier? The moment a soldier dons his uniform, he accepts the reality that he might be buried in it."', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Zaraki Kenpachi', 'It isn''t even interesting fighting against someone who doesn''t have their own goals.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(62, 3922, 'Yato', 'You''ve finally realized that the one thing you want, something greater than money, it can never be yours.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'I can conquer the world with one hand as long as you are Holding the other', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Donquixote Doflamingo', 'That''s right! Whatever the tragedy or the blunder is, only the things that actually happened are written in stone!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Donquixote Doflamingo', 'The weaker person is the more he gets hung up on other people''s pain and then he self-destructs', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Donquixote Doflamingo', 'That''s ridiculous. People usually have a stereotypical idea, or an assumption like that and that''s what creates a blind spot', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 207, 'Yashamaru', 'Physical wounds will definitely bleed and may look painful
but over time they heal by themselves and if you apply medicine,
they will heal faster. What''s troublesome are wounds of the heart. Nothing is harder to heal. They''re a bit different from physical injuries. You can''t apply medicine for one thing and sometimes, they never heal. There''s only one cure for a wound of the heart.
It''s a bit bothersome and you can only receive it from someone else. What is it? Love.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(121, 6616, 'Koutarou Amon', 'What is right... what is wrong... you can''t easily tell the difference. That''s why you must keep thinking, whether what you are doing is right or not. That act itself, alone, can be called right.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, NULL, 'Sakunosuke Oda', 'People live to save themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, NULL, 'Sakunosuke Oda', 'Be on the Side that saves people, if both sides are the same, become a good man.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2296, 'Kamina', 'Don''t believe in the me that believe in you, don''t believe in the you that believes in me, believe in yourself who believes in you!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(75, 4451, 'Dio Brando', 'Advantages and disadvantages come hand in hand. That is inevitable', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1331, 'Kisuke Urahara', 'Yes, we have no destiny. Only those swallowed up by ignorance and fear who take false steps, shall plunge us into the waters called “destiny”.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(94, 5310, 'Crusch Karsten', 'Stand up! lift your faces! Take up your weapons! Look at that boy. He''s so weak and fragile a breath could blow him away and he''s unarmed! He is a powerless boy, whose defeat I have seen with my own eyes! He''s weaker than anyone else here! Yet he''s shouting louder than anyone that we can still do this so how can we sit down, with downcast gaze? If our weakest man has not given up how is kneeling in defeat acceptable for us? Did you come this far to wallow in shame?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(99, 5558, 'Taki Tachibana', 'I wanted to tell you that… Wherever you may end up in this world, I will be searching for you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(99, 5558, 'Taki Tachibana', 'Why does the scenery of a town that no longer exists wring my heart so?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(99, 5557, 'Mitsuha Miyamizu', 'If I suddenly showed up, would I bother him? Surprise him? There’s no way we could meet. But what if we did? What should I do? Would I annoy him? Would it be awkward? Or maybe… He’d be a bit glad to see me?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(99, 5558, 'Taki Tachibana', 'Once in a while when I wake up, I find myself crying. The dream I must’ve had, I can never seem to recall...But the sensation that I’ve lost something lingers for a long time after I wake up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(99, 5561, 'Hitoha Miyamizu', 'Treasure the experience. Dreams fade away after you wake up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Your unconditional trust is more than I''m willing to bear.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, NULL, 'Makarov', 'There is great value in the time spent in ones own company, but a life time of total isolation is a fate no one should endure.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(86, 4931, 'Nao Tomori', 'The scars that you can''t see are the hardest to heal.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'You can run from your past all you want, but it will always follow you. Forever and ever and ever and ever.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, NULL, 'Sasuke Uchiha', 'Having too many bonds causes one to lose focus, weakening their strongest wish, their greatest desire.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, NULL, 'Obito Uchiha', 'The moment people come to know love, they run the risk of carrying hate.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 169, 'Shino Aburame', 'Trying to improve by learning from others that is what calls friendship.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(189, 10032, 'Kiyotaka Ayanokouji', 'All people are nothing but tools. It doesn''t matter how it''s done. It doesn''t matter what needs to be sacrificed. In this world, winning is everything. As long as I win in the end...That''s all that matters.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'All Might', 'It''s not bad to dream. But you also have to consider what''s realistic.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Rikako Oryo', 'This epidemic leads innocent people to their deaths, and yet it''s pathogen will never be eradicated. This is a disease called serenity, a form of death that people have wished for.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(83, 4752, 'Shouya Ishida', 'Things would have been so much better back then... If we had heard each other''s voices. I hate myself. I was selfish, and I never thought about anyone else''s feelings. Since then, my classmates have all looked down on me. I''ve lived for seventeen years, and I haven''t lived one of them as a good person. The only time I heard your voice was when we got into that fight. And what pisses me off the most is the fact that I haven''t changed at all since back then! But.,. But now, I think I can understand what you were saying... Nishimiya. Me and you... Can we be... friends? Shit!! I went way too far!! I was just gonna apologize and get out of here! Why the hell did I end up asking her to be friends?... Why did I even say that?! Jeez, that''s so embarrassing! How can you even say that?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(83, 4752, 'Shouya Ishida', 'Back then, if we could have have heard each other''s voices, everything would have been so much better.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Yoake Ryou', 'If I''m going to disappear no matter what, I at least want to leave them having fun and smiling.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Onoya An', 'Even though everything is going to disappear, it isn''t supposed to be meaningless. It''s exactly because you know you''re going to part ways, that now and only now is your only chance.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, NULL, 'Akasaka Ryuunosuke', 'It''s a programmer''s job to make the most of limited resources to turn an impractical idea into reality.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Maiko Shuu', 'Making sure I have no regrets... that would just be self-serving, nothing more. It''s all right. I mean, this is a great memory in itself, right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(91, 5220, 'Kazuma Satou', 'I yearn for true gender equality. I have no patience for one who talks about female privilege when it suits them, and then complains about someone "not being a man" when it''s convenient.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Ichijou Raku', 'But... If you''re the kind of person who can devote herself like that to someone, then I''ll bet you anything there''s someone out there who''ll fall in love with you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Ichijou Raku', 'You''re right. Whether I ever see that girl again or not, that doesn''t change the fact that this promise is important to me. I''m gonna go on treasuring it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(91, 5217, 'Megumin', 'Explosion!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(109, NULL, 'Jabami Yumeko', 'The only one who can decide your worth.. is you. If you want to earn something, you need to reach out for it. Pro-athletes give up their teenage years to train. Business owners put up collateral to borrow money. That''s how it always works. To make your ambitions come true, you have to take risks. The larger the ambition the greater the risk. That might involve time or enough work to affect your lifespan... So make your choice. Live in peace as a wannabe or risk losing it all to reach the very top. You''re the one who needs to decide.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4183, 'Esdeath', 'I have so many things I want to say, so many things I want to ask you, but... When I see your face... None of that matters anymore!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(109, NULL, 'Jabami Yumeko', 'The amount of money one owns ultimately decides the victor. This doesn''t stop within the walls of a casino, or it''s cash flow. It''s a rule that forms the basis for a capitalist society!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4177, 'Leone', 'The lifespan of a human is certainly way too short. That''s why you''ve got to make the most of it and live your life to the fullest.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'I want to reply with a long message, but if it''s too long, that might be kind of revolting. But if it''s too short, then I might come off as cold instead. Feeling apprehensive of what to do, I decided to reply back with a similar word count instead. This was what they called "mirroring" in psychology. By emulating the actions of the other party, your affection levels would increase!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(75, NULL, 'Jotaro Kujo', 'A road is something that you make yourself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'If what I wished for was granted to me, if what I wanted was given to me. Then, as I thought, I wouldn''t wish for anything nor want anything. Because the things you were granted and the things you were given were surely shams that would one day be lost.

The things you wished for had no shape and the things you wanted were untouchable. Or possibly, they might be the most wonderful treasures that would become nothing if you were to touch them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'It'' because you were embarrassed, frustrated, bitter, and jealous. If there''s a time when those ill feelings surfaced, then there''s also going to be a time where you restrained yourself, smiled, and then cut your relationships afterwards.

Being aware of your eventual break up was a rather complicated thing. If you wanted to graduate with a smile, shouldn''t you avoid approaching your friends too much? And that''s where having no friends was super convenient!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Hishiro Chizuru', 'I don''t think I''ll learn anything if I don''t try to do something about it on my own.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Hishiro Chizuru', 'If at some point in life, you made a mistake or keep failing over and over again, and you can''t help but think it''s useless and you''re a good for nothing; Remember, you''re only taking a detour. And I''m sure further along your path will come a day where you think, "It was a good life experience". That''s why it''ll be fine.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, NULL, 'Kaneki Ken', 'You''re wrong. It''s not the world that''s messed up; it''s those of us in it. Yes, some ghouls walk a path that leaves sorrow in their wake, but just like humans, we can choose a different path altogether. We have a lot to learn, both your kind and mine. We need to stop fighting, and start talking. Because when it comes to the state of the world, you can''t point your finger at ghouls or humans. We''re all to blame.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'Even if we walk on different paths, one must always live on as you are able! You must never treat your own life as something insignificant! You must never forget the friends you love for as long as you live! Let bloom the flowers of light within your hearts.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Eren Kruger', 'There is no such thing as truth in this world. That is our reality. Anyone can become a God or a Devil. All it takes is for someone to claim that to be the truth.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'Those who forgive themselves, and are able to accept their true nature... They are the strong ones!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Unfortunately, I don''t have a nice eyeball like you, that can see this and that. All I can do to pursue one thing in front of me. So whether it''s the abyss of death or an empty void, I won''t fight for the manju offered to my grave. I''ll fight for tomorrow''s breakfast. That''s all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Well it''s not like the world is full of sunshine and daisies. If society was only shaped by the view that one must be happy-go-lucky all the time, Hollywood wouldn''t make tear-jerking movies, would they?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'You''re absolutely right. I can''t do anything alone.  Everyone has their flaws and imperfections, but that''s what drives us to work together... To make up for those flaws. Together, we make the perfect main character.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(100, 5571, 'Tanya Degurechaff', 'Miracles are illusions caused by insufficient observation and understanding. They''re just... glorious misunderstandings.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(92, 5248, 'Satoru Fujinuma', 'Every day, the words cross my mind.  "If I had done this back then..." but they don''t take the sincere form of regret.  The words are just an excuse that come to my mind then disappear.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(83, 4752, 'Shouya Ishida', 'I intended to listen to your voice, but it really was nothing but intentions. It''s pretty obvious, huh? Of course there''s more going on than what people choose to tell you... But I convinced myself that was all there is to a person. I knew that, but still I interpreted the stuff I didn''t understand about you in ways convenient for me... That''s just how I am.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(85, 4828, 'Tooru Oikawa', 'Today might be the chance to grasp the chance to let your talent bloom. Maybe tomorrow, the day after, or next year... Maybe even when you''re thirty. I''m not sure if physique has anything to do with it, but if you think that it will never come, it probably never will.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4145, 'Shuu Tsukiyama', 'Books are nice, aren''t they? With just one sentence you can get lost in all sorts of dreams. They way I think of it, literature allows the reader''s consciousness to deeply relish the author and be closer to him. And so, we freely walk around the world of the story from the yarn spinner''s point of view. It''s only when you immerse yourself in the world of a book that you are able to forget just who you are.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, 'Okabe Rintarou', 'The universe has a beginning, but no end. — Infinity.
Stars, too, have their own beginnings, but their own power results in their destruction. — Finite.
It is those who possess wisdom who are the greatest fools. History has shown us this.
You could say that this is the final warning from God to those who resist.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'For a pregnant woman to give birth, she''s gotta feel the pain of pulling a watermelon out of her nostril. For an Artist to create a masterpiece, he''s gotta feel the pain of pulling entire galaxies out  of his ass.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Jinbei', 'It may be hard right now... But you must silence those thoughts! Stop counting only those things that you have lost! What is gone, is gone! So ask yourself this: What is there... that still remains to you?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(58, 3837, 'Satsuki Kiryuuin', 'A castle that vanishes at the first gust of wind is worthless. A skyscraper within your mind will never fall down.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2912, 'Shinra Kishitani', 'Even if everyone in the whole world dies, I won''t care, as long as my beloved survives.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(157, NULL, 'Ja Wangnan', 'I believe the difference between those up there and me is the question of whether you have given up or not.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kyouraku Shunsui', 'That’s just the way it is. Change is inevitable. Instead of resisting it, you’re better served simple going with the flow.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(157, 8369, 'Twenty-Fifth Baam', 'Your god is a fragment of your imagination from your weakness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'Remember that a sword held by someone who is about to die… will never be able to protect anything.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shigekuni Yamamoto-Genryusai', 'Do not live bowing down. You must die standing up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(75, NULL, 'Jotaro Kujo', 'Evil is when you use the weak for your own gain and crush them under your foot.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ichimaru Gin', 'Are you afraid? You don’t want to die, do you? Not just Abarai, if anyone… acts upon the thought of not wanting you to die, you will suddenly begin to fear your impending death, right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, 'Vorona', 'A city far away from my homeland.  There, after becoming acquainted with strangers, have I changed, perhaps?  That uncontrollable impulse I harbored within me...Has it faded away now, I wonder? What exactly am I doing here in this city?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1407, 'Dordonii Alessandro Del Socacchio', 'Don’t hesitate to cut the enemy. Don’t falter to finish them off. Much less heal their wounds. That’s unspeakable, nino. Leave the chocolate here. Become a demon, nino. As strong as a demon. As wicked as a demon. You have to learn that the only way to stand up against ruthlessness, is to become ruthless yourself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3747, 'Hange Zoe', 'I want everyone to feel safe again soon...I want this to be a world where people can without fighting each other.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2912, 'Shinra Kishitani', 'Those three are best friends.  They have their respective secrets.  And they''re deliberately trying not to give themselves away.  But neither Orihara or Shizuo had any secrets whatsoever.  And that resulted in the complete opposite kind of personal relationship.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'You are fighting out of obligation, not out of hatred. You will never reach me like that. Battle without hatred is like a bird without wings. You’ll never defeat anyone like that. You powerless friends are just weights that will break your legs.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Zaraki Kenpachi', 'Don’t be so stuck-up. Just enjoy this! Killing and being killed. They are just a way to pass time.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'As a human, what kind of achievements will you leave behind?  I bet you''ll leave behind a legacy as a psychotic killer, and that thrills me!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'Father Willibald', 'Let those who seek death find it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Historia Reiss', 'We need to stop living for others. From now on...Let''s live for ourselves!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6934, 'Thorkell', 'I love fighting, but even more than that, I hate losing! I only fight to win!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2706, 'Gajeel Redfox', 'After everything I''ve faced.... Having a future with you snatched away from me ...is definitely the most terrifying thing I''ve ever had to endure....', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, 'Vorona', 'Love. I myself have never loved another person.  Most likely, I don''t even love myself.  I do have knowledge of it.  But I am incapable of determining whether or not it is vital in my life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3727, 'Mikasa Ackerman', 'There are only so many lives I can value. And...I decided who those people were six years ago. So...You shouldn''t try to ask for my pity. Because right now, I don''t have...Time to spare or room in my heart.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', 'Kill me. Make it quick. I no longer have the strength left in me to even walk. If you do not cut me down now, then this will go unsettled for eternity.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, 'Vorona', 'If there''s any possibility that I might visit this city again...Then I challenge you to a duel.  I wish to speak with you head-on, to within an inch of my life...To actually experience the joy of existing in this world...that is my desire.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6938, 'Ylva', 'Well, if they''re dead, then that''s the end of it. Crying about it gets you nothing but an empty stomach', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, NULL, 'Francis Scott Key Fitzgerald', 'Wealth is a nightmare. With each coveted thing we buy, we lose a thing we dream about.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3754, 'Ymir', 'I want to survive...And see her again. As a person, I''m really lower than shit...But she knows that, and she smiles kindly at me anyway.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(62, NULL, 'Bishamonten', 'You are human, are you not? You are allowed to make mistakes.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'Father Willibald', 'Love provides the worth of everything in the world. Without love...gold, silver, horses, and women...all are worthless.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(62, 3926, 'Kazuma', 'I''m a coward. But I wanted to stay by your side. The truth is I was so happy to hear that you needed me, I took advantage of your words. But you''re crying again, because of me. I''m no blessed vessel. I''m just a piece of junk. I was supposed to guide you, but this was the only way I knew how.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6934, 'Thorkell', 'Doesn''t it ever get boring always being on the winning side?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(62, NULL, 'Bishamonten', 'You asked me if I was ready to carry on. In all honesty, I am not sure of myself. But there is something that must be done now. And I will do it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'Yhwach. You desired a world... Where fear would no longer be a burden. But... In a world without fear of death... People will never attain the hope that is to be found from casting their fears aside and preserving through them. While it is true that people can continue to press forward through the simple act of living... That is no way comparable to marching forward in the face of death, while doing their damndest to keep it at bay. That is why... That is why people have given that very march a unique and special name. "COURAGE."', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(94, 5296, 'Subaru Natsuki', 'I have no Strength, but I want it all. I have no Knowledge, but all I do is dream. There''s nothing I can do, but I struggle in vain', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, 3083, 'Gilgamesh', 'Mongrels though they may be, they''re still figures of some slight renown', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, 'Dr. Kuseno', 'You are calm and intelligent, but youth can invite disaster. Do not fight alone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5268, 'Atsushi Nakajima', 'People need to be told they''re worthy of being alive by someone else or they can''t go on.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6934, 'Thorkell', 'I''d had fifteen years to think about him. And I realized that it wasn''t a matter of the life or death of flesh. What''s important to a warrior is the soul...And where it lies.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, 3083, 'Gilgamesh', 'Surely there must be limits to which one may sink.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'Canute', 'The world...God''s divine creation...Is so brimming with love...Yet there is no love in the hearts of men.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(62, 3923, 'Hiyori Iki', 'If you''re in a position to save people, you should never even joke like that. My father...The doctor...Would never abandon anyone. He''d never give up on a person''s life, even if they tried to throw it away.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2910, 'Shizuo Heiwajima', 'Look, you.  All this talk about monsters...that''s what people have called me ever since I was a kid.  I''ve snapped and lost sight of everything around me, and I''ve made trouble for Celty more than once or twice.  Even so, she still heard me out, without interrupting.  And so now it''s my turn to hear her out, all right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'Leif Ericson', 'Not all warriors fight on the battlefield with a sword in hand. A sailor makes his living battling the sea', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, 3083, 'Gilgamesh', 'You brake the law and I''ll punish you, there is no room for discussion.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Fujitora', 'If you were to be troubled over something as trivial as losing face, then it''s better to not have it at all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'Canute', 'Where in this world can a sane man be found? We''re the same. We''re all the same. None of us understands what it means to love all. Or the meaning of life...Or the meaning of death...Or the meaning of our own battles.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(62, NULL, 'Bishamonten', 'If you hurt me, then so be it. Do you think that there is any human in all the world who has never hurt another? You are all so kind...It hurts you to hurt others. That is why I had been hiding my pain, as well.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6931, 'Askeladd', 'Only those who do their jobs on the battlefield get the rewards they desire. That''s the life of a warrior.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'Being strong isn''t just about having power or move, it about one''s spirit', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3737, 'Erwin Smith', 'Humanity will never stop fighting itself.. until it shrinks to a size of one or fewer.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2912, 'Shinra Kishitani', 'These days, I feel more comfortable in dark places.  I look at these shadows as a part of you.  They absorb all the light.  There''s no one in the world who has this color but you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'Thors', 'You have no enemies. No one...Has any enemies. There is no one...That you should hurt', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(121, NULL, 'Karren von Rosewald', 'The sorrows of life...To not be able to live like yourself. The joys of life...To be able to die like yourself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6931, 'Askeladd', 'You''re young. Time is on your side. You''ll grow up and I''ll grow old. Someday you''ll likely beat me. It''s only natural. Even the strongest man must die.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4337, 'Shizuka Hiratsuka', 'The present isn''t everything, but there are things you can only do now, things you can only find here.
It''s now or never. Think, Writhe, Struggle and agonize. If not, what you are going through isn’t genuine.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2910, 'Shizuo Heiwajima', 'Look, all it means is that when I lose it, it''s cause things make no sense.  If there was any logic to it, then I wouldn''t get pissed even if I got shot or stabbed.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, 3083, 'Gilgamesh', 'You mongrels. By our next meeting see that you''ve culled your numbers. Only a true hero is worthy to look upon my glorious presence.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6931, 'Askeladd', 'A fight you can''t win becomes an obsession', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2706, 'Gajeel Redfox', 'You taught me what it means to love, and for that I will be eternally grateful.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2912, 'Shinra Kishitani', 'He may seem cold-blooded, but he''s more human and his heart is more brittle than anyone else... so much so that if you filled it with human love or betrayal, it''d break easily... which is why I think he chose to avoid it all from the start: to love humanity. Do you understand? Not to accept it, not to face it, but he chose to avoid it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(80, NULL, 'Bors Elder', 'We''ve never worked together before, so don''t worry about teamwork! Just stay out of each other''s way. Fight the way you want to fight!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Haschwalth Jugram', 'Even if doesn''t alter or change the end result in the slightest, making decisions based on convictions that you believe in and walking your own path has its own merit and worth. There''s something to be said for not having... even one regret.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Mr. Blouse', 'Those who don''t fulfill their obligation to others ''ave no right to ask ''em for such privilege...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(80, NULL, 'Ouka Kashima', 'I don''t want to be a loser who can''t do anything but talk. I don''t want to be somebody who can sacrifice others, but won''t risk himself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(80, 4627, 'Mia Grand', 'When you''re just starting out, put all your energy into surviving. No matter how pathetic you feel, or how people laugh at you, if you come back alive, you win.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Yoake Ryou', 'If someone always follows the perfect path without ever facing hardship... Is it really what''s best for that person?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(62, 3922, 'Yato', 'Life and death are like light and shadow. They''re both always there. But people don''t like thinking about death, so subconsciously, they always look away from it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, NULL, 'Thors', 'The only reason I must rely on this sword is because I am imperfect. A true warrior...Needs no sword', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1737, 'Haruhi Fujioka', 'If you keep on hiding your true feelings, who is going to be happy? If you are sad, you should say it out loud!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1737, 'Haruhi Fujioka', 'If you don''t face each other with honesty, what kind of family is this?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Marlowe Sand', 'They''ll learn that a man without reason is no different from an animal who defecates wherever it pleases.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3754, 'Ymir', 'Living this way is my way of getting revenge!! I''m going to be living proof that your fate isn''t decided at birth!! So what about you?! You''re going to kill yourself, the ultimate act of submission. Is that how much you want to please the people who treated you like a nuisance?! Why are you trying to hurt yourself?! If your will is that strong... Then shouldn''t you be able to change your fate?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Sengoku the Buddha', 'Don''t try to find a reason for somebody''s love!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(128, 6931, 'Askeladd', 'A man, slave to gold, holds a whip...And beats the slave he bought with that gold as if to claim HE is the master. He just doesn''t see it for himself. Every living human being is a slave to something', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3754, 'Ymir', 'Just because you want other people to think of you as someone who''d literally die for another... dragging someone else to his death just for that... only a bad girl would do that, right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3747, 'Hange Zoe', 'Even in moments of the deepest despair... I guess we can still find hope, huh?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5049, 'Saitama', 'If you really want to be strong... Stop caring about what your surrounding thinks of you!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', '(To Ichigo Kurosaki) You are a fool, Ichigo Kurosaki. You willingly seek to challenge an opponent so much more powerful than you that it strikes a primal fear into your being. Incomprehensible. If this is the work of the ''heart'' that you people speak of, then it is because you possess this ''heart'' that you humans bring hurt upon yourself, because you possess this ''heart'' that you lose your lives', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3747, 'Hange Zoe', 'Even if all we accomplished were small steps forward... We continued to give our lives if it meant that one day... humanity would be free from this terror.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Annie Leonhardt', 'Going against the flow... takes a lot of courage. I respect that. Maybe people who can do it are just stupid, but... Well... What I''m sure of is that people like that are rare. So you can''t call them common. You can''t call them normal, either. People like you... get called special.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 332, 'Usopp', 'Man or Child, Strong or Weak, None of those matter once you are out at sea!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, 2212, 'Madara Uchiha', 'Love is not necessary, power is the only true necessity.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2, 74, 'Wolfgang Grimmer', 'You can''t just erase people''s feelings. It''s as if my emotions were lost somewhere hundreds of miles away. It''s as if they were sent long ago, in a letter that was always intended for me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3239, 'Pariston Hill', 'Normally, as people love and are loved, they feel happiness. When I am hated by people, that is when I feel happiness. And then I want to tear apart and inflict unimaginable harm to the things I love. But is that really all that strange, I wonder?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, NULL, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'I actually don''t think something like perfection exists. That is I think why we are born able to absorb things... and by comparing ourselves with something else we can finally head in a good direction.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, 'Sweet Mask', 'A hero must be tough, strong and beautiful... As well as able to promptly and splendidly eradicate evil.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, 'Tetsuya Kuroko', 'So long as I don''t give up, the possibility of winning will never fall to zero.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'No Game No Life', 'This blank space represents infinite potential. One day, it may become anything.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, 2212, 'Madara Uchiha', 'People cannot show each other their true feelings. Fear, suspicion, and resentment never subside.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'Those painful memories are what help us make it to tomorrow and become stronger.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(80, 4619, 'Bell Cranel', 'I can''t forgive myself. I wanted something to happen without doing anything myself! I have to do it. I have to do it all... Or I can''t even stand by her side!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(81, NULL, 'Arato Hisako', 'If there''s something you want to go through with, you should stick to it without keeping up appearances.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(80, NULL, 'Ryu Lion', 'Humility is a virtue, but do not insult yourself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', '(To Ichigo Kurosaki) Do not allow yourself to be shaken. Do not weaken your stance. Open your senses. And do not let your guard down for an instant.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2424, 'Crona', 'I hate, hate, HATE everyone. But that’s okay. I can use my screams to blow them all away. I’m sure dead people are a lot easier to deal with.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, 3083, 'Gilgamesh', 'You have yet to see what form your soul has taken. That''s what it actually means when you claim that you lack joy in your life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3910, 'Tet', 'What do you think about your world? Is it fun? Is it easy to live in?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Marco Bodt', 'You''re not a strong person, so you can really understand how weak people feel. I mean... Most humans are weak, including me... But if I got an order from someone who saw things like I do, no matter how tough it was, I''d do my damnedest to carry it out.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3731, 'Reiner Braun', 'There are times we can''t run away, no matter how bad the odds are. When the people we''re supposed to protect are threatened, we have to enter the fray and shield them. And it doesn''t matter who or what the enemy is. We need to master skills and get stronger, with artillery as well as hand-do-hand combat. I think that''s our responsibility as strong soldiers.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(80, 4621, 'Eina Tulle', 'Listen, girls like guys who are strong and can protect them. So if you keep working hard and get stronger, she just might like you back.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Armin Arlelt', 'You''re only resorting to physical abuse because you can''t prove that I''m wrong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(80, 4617, 'Hestia', 'In the end, guilt is just the question of whether you''re capable of forgiving yourself or not. If you''ve really changed, then prove it with your actions.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3992, 'Tooru Oikawa', 'If you think too hard when you don''t have a brain, you''re going to hurt your head.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Levi Ackerman', 'The lesson you need to learn right now, can''t be taught with words... only with action.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(80, 4619, 'Bell Cranel', 'I wanted to save you because you''re you. I didn''t want you to leave, because you''re you. I can''t find another reason. I don''t need another reason to save you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3992, 'Tooru Oikawa', 'If you''re gonna hit it, hit it until it breaks!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'All of the Arrancar follow me... because they see me as fearless and the only individual who can actually bring forth the new world... the new future where you can belong. Without me, that dream can''t be fulfilled and without me the gotei 13 will destroy you all...  Do you see it now from my point of view?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Armin Arlelt', 'I think there are times people have to die... even if I don''t like it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(80, 4641, 'Hephaestus', 'Don''t make yourself weigh your pride against your friends.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5268, 'Atsushi Nakajima', 'After being driven out of the orphanage, I had nothing to eat, nowhere to sleep, and, as one might expect, not a cent to my name. Yet, I lack the courage to commit theft. That is how I''ve arrived at my current predicament... However... if I wish to live, I have no choice but to steal and take from others!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, 2545, 'Edward Elric', 'There''s no such thing as a painless lesson, they just don''t exist. Sacrifices are necessary, you can''t gain something without losing something first... Although if you can endure that pain and walk away from it, you''ll find that you now have a heart strong enough to overcome any obstacle... Yeah... A Fullmetal Heart.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Hishiro Chizuru', 'Maybe worrying about the future partings so much that you miss out on happiness in the present is a waste.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5269, 'Osamu Dazai', 'A good book is always good, no matter how many times you’ve already read it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Levi Ackerman', 'A lot of the times, you''re going into a situation you know nothing about. So what you need is to be quick to act... and make tough decisions in worst-case scenarios.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(80, 4619, 'Bell Cranel', 'If I don''t stand up here... If I don''t reach higher here... When am I ever going to do it?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'The fact that you consider yourself as an equal to me, is being arrogant in itself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2694, 'Makarov Dreyar', 'Now listen up, any power that surpasses reason, still comes from reason, right? Magic isn''t some kind of miraculous power. It is a talent that only works when the flow of energy inside of us and the flow of energy in the natural world are in perfect synchronization. To perform magic one must have a strong mind and the ability to focus. It should take over your being and come pouring out of your soul! If all we do is worry about following rules, then our magic will never progress.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2693, 'Mirajane Strauss', 'No matter how hurt someone is, they''re meant to overcome it and try to go forward.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Fujitora', 'If you lose credibility by just admitting fault, then you didn''t have any in the first place.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Hishiro Chizuru', 'If I can''t even manage a polite smile, I''ll be in trouble in the real world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Armin Arlelt', 'When people are faced with a situation they don''t understand, it''s easy for fear to take hold.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5049, 'Saitama', 'Prophecies don''t ever come true.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Kaizaki Arata', 'Someday we''ll part. Maybe be forgotten. But we''re living in the moment. So... make lots of friends, fall madly in love, and enjoy every moment to the fullest.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3727, 'Mikasa Ackerman', 'That''s right... This world... is cruel. It hit me that living was like a miracle.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5049, 'Saitama', 'Heroes and the police don''t do their jobs because someone says "please". Right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, NULL, 'Netero', 'Ant king , you believe I cannot pray with a single arm? A prayer comes from the heart. If the heart achieves the correct form, it becomes emotions and emotions can be manifested.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 337, 'Dracule Mihawk', 'My name is Dracule Mihawk! Find your self, true world, become stronger! No matter how long it may take, I will wait for you in my strongest form! Surpass this sword! Surpass me! Roronoa Zoro!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(121, NULL, 'Kaneki Ken', 'Donato has to keep proving himself. He wants to prove just how valuable he is. Isn''t that the case with you as well? Because you are the same as Donato. All you''re doing is indulging in this twisted self-value that you have to yourself. And if you don''t, you won''t last. Eventually, you will break and become useless. Once that happens, you''ll break and become discarded.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2690, 'Natsu Dragneel', 'I wont stop fighting when im tired, i''ll stop fighting when you''ve shattered my heart into a thousand pieces', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2823, 'Rogue Cheney', 'I want to become a man who treasures his friends.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2537, 'Meme Oshino', 'If praying does not work, and words are ineffective... what''s left is to fight.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3747, 'Hange Zoe', 'Ever since I joined the survey corps, I''ve had people dying on me everyday. But... you understand, don''t you? One day or another, everyone you care about eventually dies. It''s something we simply can''t accept. It''s a realization that could drive you insane... It''s painful... so painful... I get it. And still... we must keep moving forward.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(66, NULL, 'Konno Yuuki', 'Sometimes you have to fight to get your point across.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4319, 'Kousei Arima', 'This silence belongs to us... and every single person out there, is waiting for us to fill it with something.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'But being optimistic isn''t a bad thing, is it? It''s not like you''re doing anything bad. It''s also not like you''re cheating either.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4492, 'Mikaela Hyakuya', 'The vampires don''t really care about humanity in general. It''s only specific humans like you that concern them... The kind of humans who will stop at nothing to acquire more power.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(76, 4492, 'Mikaela Hyakuya', 'In the end, the best way to live down here is to be smart. You''ve got to be clever to survive.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(85, 4832, 'Ittetsu Takeda', 'Birds with the wind in their wings are flying across the great blue sky right now. And all of you should be able to make it! To the highest limit, to the farthest limit!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, NULL, 'Sumire Kanō', 'Haven''t you already lifted your foot, preparing to step forward? Then you only have one option! Finish taking that step!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Kaizaki Arata', 'Being rivals does not mean being an enemy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Hishiro Chizuru', 'The more fun I have, the more it''ll hurt when we part ways. I know that all too well.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Kaizaki Arata', 'Studying is important, but I think love is too. It''s the last summer of high school. It''s a precious time that won''t come again.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Yoake Ryou', 'Fight with all your might. With those young kids, give your mind and heart a solid workout. Let your heart, which had dried up and gotten stiff, beat once more.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Kaizaki Arata', 'Please, let that iron guard down for a minute. It''s only hurting you. I know when you''ve hit rock bottom, people trying to cheer you up can be really annoying. "What would you know?" "Just leave me alone." But what if someone you''re pushing away is really worried about you? That''d be a shame.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4127, 'Touka Kirishima', 'After you''ve gobbled him down you''d be left alone to regret it while covered in blood and guts. That''s the hunger of a ghoul. That''s our destiny.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Kaizaki Arata', 'But there''s something a little sad about them [fireworks], too. They''re so flashy, pretty and exciting, but as they fade, you feel sort of lonely.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(70, 4301, 'Five', 'You should just steal the things you want.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4154, 'Renji Yomo', 'All we can do is live while losing things.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(66, NULL, 'Konno Yuuki', 'It''s okay to live, even if there''s no greater point to living.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, NULL, 'Kaneki Ken', 'As my fingers and toes re-grew like fingernails or hair over and over and over and over... and over again, every single time I got the feeling that I truly, truly truly was a monster.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, 2545, 'Edward Elric', 'No matter how big the place is, we''ll eventually reach the edge if we keep moving forward!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Hishiro Chizuru', 'I don''t understand what I say that makes people so mad. I don''t understand how they feel. I know that''s because I haven''t properly socialized, I''ve tried to learn. I''ve tried to study up on it, but I just don''t know what''s right.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, NULL, 'Kaneki Ken', 'Never trust anyone too much, remember the devil was once an angel.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(70, 4298, 'Nine', 'Falling is just another way of flying.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Ooga Kazuomi', 'I thought that without you, everything would be so boring. The idea of someone else touching you... was just not okay. I only realized this recently. But I think... I''ve loved you for a long time, too.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'Eraserhead', 'They''ve been exposed to the outside world, up close and personal. They''ve had that fear planted in them. And they''ve endured it. Overcome it. Each has grown from that experience... and forgotten how to hesitate.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Yoake Ryou', 'I think it''s a good thing, you know. You''re paying attention to those around you. You don''t just notice, you take action to help. I think it''s one of your strength. But don''t you wonder? Is getting rid of all the thorns in someone''s path really what''s best for them? While they''re still young enough to be allowed to trip and fall, it''s important for them to learn the pain of it and how to pick themselves up again.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'All Might', 'The slight difference between those who always aim for the top and those who don''t... It''ll come to matter in a big way once you all emerge into society.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Ooga Kazuomi', 'I can''t just leave a crying girl alone and go home. I''m too wimpy to carry you, but I can lend you a shoulder, and get you down the stairs.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'All Might', 'The most inflated egos are often the most fragile.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(70, NULL, 'Mishima Lisa', 'I''m so stupid. At that time, I thought I could escape. I thought I''d be taken somewhere out of this world. I got my hopes up a little. But that''s impossible isn''t it? I''m not playing by the rules. As if anyone would just take me away when I wanted them to. I''m so stupid.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, 5040, 'Saiki Michiru', 'Knocking others down to gain an advantage is a fruitless endeavor. It means they''ve given up on winning any other way.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Kaizaki Arata', 'You''re just too busy comparing yourself to others to see. Those comparisons aren''t the only measure. Don''t say it''s all pointless. You''ve work hard and made yourself better. That''s what you got in return. So don''t put yourself down like this.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Yeah, I''m being stupid.  I know that it''s out of question. I know how this will end. I''ll be left with nothing.  Even so, I want us to think, writhe, struggle... and find... [something genuine].', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Hishiro Chizuru', 'I want to defeat the me that''s dragging this failure around. I don''t want to forget my failure. But if I carry it with me as a bad memory and keep running away, I will never change.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Just as stand users attract other stand users, loners seems to have an ability to attract other loners as well.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'However far I fall as long as there''s so much as a thread left I will use it to climb. I''ll take hold of it. I refuse to give up while I''m still human I can do that much. But every person must decide on his own whether to grab it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'A lone warrior surviving hundreds of battles, when it comes to losing, I''m the strongest.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, 2545, 'Edward Elric', 'We''re going to be moving forward! If we move forward, we''ll get stronger, both physically and mentally.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'All Might', 'When there''s nothing to be gained, rising to the challenge at those times... is surely the mark... of a true hero!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Kaizaki Arata', 'Trying to knock others down a peg just means lowering yourself. Don''t go trampling all the hardwork and trust you''ve build up. It insults the effort you put in.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1315, 'Mayu', 'I envy you just for having someone who''s worried about you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Tachibana Marika', 'Love does not hurt when you''re loving the right person.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5050, 'Genos', 'If this is the path you choose to walk... I will not interfere. But if you turn the people against you... Will you be able to function as a hero? This worries me. But if you ever get in a tight spot... I will be there.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'Shigaraki Tomura', 'Heroes and villains both thrive on violence, but we''re still categorized. "You''re good." "You''re evil." That''s how it is!! Symbol of peace? Hah!! In the end you''re just a tool for violence, made to keep us down! And violence only breeds more violence.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Hishiro Chizuru', 'It''s ineffective to deal with many problems at once.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Kaizaki Arata', 'There is no right answer for getting along. Different people require different answers.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'All Might', 'If you feel yourself hitting up against your limit remember for what cause you clench your fists... remember why you started down this path, and let that memory carry you beyond your limit.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 'Hishiro Chizuru', 'If I don''t understand how a friend feels, am I not allowed to worry about them? If I don''t experience what you do, am I not allowed to worry about you, my friend?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'Midoriya Izuku', 'People... are not born equal. That''s the hard truth I learned at age four. But that... was my first and last setback.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(157, 8369, 'Twenty-Fifth Baam', 'The heart moves where the heart wills.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Fate/stay night', 'The storyteller may fall silent, the music may cease, but the story will not end. Be it tragedy or comedy, as long as there is applause, the story will not end. It is just like the multitude of human lives. Warm blessings to we who were not rewarded, and we who are still on our way. Our travels continue on.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3746, 'Mike Zacharias', 'We will have lost only the moment humans give up and stop fighting. As long as they keep on fighting, our defeat is not certain.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 'All Might', 'Whether you win or lose... You can always come out ahead by learning from the experience.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3735, 'Hannes', 'You couldn''t save your mom because you... weren''t strong enough. I didn''t face the Titan... because I wasn''t brave enough.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, 'Kyoya Ootori', 'It''s fine if he holds bad judgements without trying to get to know me. The real point is letting just the ones who want to understand me know my real self.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Okita Sougo', 'Sometimes, it''s necessary to look back at the past in order to move on to the future.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(94, 5304, 'Wilhelm van Astrea', 'Even if you have regrets, even if you have remorse, you must fight. If you have made the decision for yourself to fight, to struggle, then fight with all you have. Do not give up for one second, one moment, or one instant. Cling greedily to the victory you have within your sight. If you can still stand, if your fingers still move, if all your teeth have not broken, stand and fight. You must fight!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(85, NULL, 'Ukai Keishin', 'You need someone else to become more disciplined. No matter how hard you try by yourself, there´s a limit.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(98, NULL, 'Sōma Yukihira', 'Even if all the confidence and pride you''ve built over the years is blown to pieces by a major failure, even if you''ve had a soul-crushing experience, you still have to open the shop the next day. That''s who chefs are.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Tachibana Marika', 'Oh? What are you surprised about!? Do you think that I''m someone who would give up after being rejected just once!? Hospitalized or not, I shall continue to polish myself and become even moooore of a spectacular lady, and return to you!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Maiko Shuu', 'To enjoy my youth properly. She might''ve been talking about something like this. To live without thinking about consequences or what''s around me with all my strength. That''s what it was about...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Tachibana Marika', 'I confessed you know!? Many, many times! Even though I knew the answer from my mouth... with my voice! I confessed you know!? Have you ever looked at Raku straight in the eyes!? Is that all you''ve got for Raku!? At least for the last time, you need to be a little more truthful to yourself!! If you really liked him, then you can''t just pretend like nothing ever happened!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Maiko Shuu', 'The length of time you''ve been in love isn''t the only thing that matters, right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Tachibana Chika', 'Traditions that don''t benefit people today are worthless.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Maiko Shuu', 'So you feel like you''re being dishonest or something? That''s not true. It''s a great thing to come to like someone. If you ask me... The important thing here is, that you have to make a clear choice between the two of them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Tachibana Marika', 'I won''t come to hate you! Never! Regardless of what happens in the future!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Onodera Kosaki', 'Why did you run away, Chitoge-chan? No... I don''t want this... I won''t be happy with you just giving up... To end up liking the same person. It''s painful, for sure but Chitoge-chan, you like him enough to not be able to face him again after that, don''t you? Regardless of who ends up with him, I want to be satisfied when it happens. I thought for sure that you think the same way. Is there a reason why that can''t happen? Tell me Chitoge-chan...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Tachibana Marika', 'Holding in your own feelings like that... ye think tha'' no one''s gonna get hurt since ye''re not lettin'' it show to anyone? Tha''s just the same as goin'' ''round hurting everyone anyway!! What ye''re doin'' isn''t ye keepin'' everyone dear to ye!! Ye''re just protectin'' yerself!!! Ye''re just ''fraid of gettin'' hurt! Losin'' yer nerve! Ye''re just scared!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Kanakura Yui', 'Once you find out whom you made the promise to, will you really be able to fall in love with her?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Maiko Shuu', 'It''s just... a love that''s continued for many years without straying is something that, to anyone who sees it, is beautiful and impossible to fault. But... Though it may be short, and it may be something that''s become crooked and bent partway through, if they''re serious about the way they feel... then I don''t think that''s something that isn''t beautiful.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Tachibana Chika', 'You have no intention of reciprocating my daughter''s feelings, do you? So what gives you the right to speak in that way? Perhaps you wish to appease your guilty conscience. Would you not call that "hypocrisy"?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Maiko Shuu', 'I''ll tell you a way that I heard to figure out if you like someone or not. Imagine, when you find a rainbow, when you found a shooting star, when you found a cafe you like, when your change is 777 yen or something. If it''s Raku, it''s fine to imagine the first time a leaf stood up in your tea. When you found a beautiful sunset, or if you found your taste in music, or if you win a pretty good prize in the lottery, those small things in everyday life. When you encounter those small happiness or luck, who is the very first person you want to tell that to? Whose face came into your mind?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5053, 'Bang', 'You are too young to worry about failure. In a pinch, just muddle through. The outcome won''t change, so that''s best.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5049, 'Saitama', 'Who decides limits? And based on what? You said you worked hard? Well, maybe you need to work a little harder. Is that really the limit of your strength? Could the you of tomorrow beat you today? Instead of giving in, move forward.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5066, 'Hammerhead', 'Why do you have to pay money to eat?! Can''t we all just share?! Where is freedom in the world?! All are slaves to labor!! The rich grow fat... While the poor die!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5049, 'Saitama', 'You may be able to get stronger with simply the right attitude. In other words, train your spirit before worrying about strength through power and technology.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5049, 'Saitama', 'In exchange for gaining strength, have I lost something more important as a human being? Emotions used to swirl within me when I fought. Fear, impatience, anger... But now... Day after day, after one punch I go home unharmed and wash my gloves.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, 'Okabe Rintarou', 'Deceive your other self. Deceive the world. That is what you must do to reach the Steins Gate. Good Luck. El Psy Congroo.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(94, NULL, 'Rem (re:zero)', 'No matter what painful things happens, even when it looks like you''ll lose... when no one else in the world believes in you... when you don''t even believe in yourself... I will believe in you!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(94, NULL, 'Rem (re:zero)', 'Ever since that fiery night, my time has been stopped. But it was you who melted my frozen heart and kindly made my stopped time begin to move forward again.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(94, NULL, 'Rem (re:zero)', 'I can always tell when you’re lying. I also know that you cannot tell me why you do so. So there is no need to convince me, or wrap everything in lies, or try to take the blame on yourself like that. Because I have complete faith in you, Subaru-kun.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(94, NULL, 'Rem (re:zero)', 'When you said that you hate yourself, it made me want to tell you all the wonderful things I know about you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, 3083, 'Gilgamesh', 'Do exactly as you like. That is the true meaning of pleasure. Pleasure leads to joy and joy leads to happiness. Your path is now clear, Kirei. So clear there is no longer any need to hesitate.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Historia Reiss', 'There are many ways of thinking as there are people.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, 'Suoh Tamaki', 'So don''t be afraid to open your hearts to others. It''s pointless to keep testing people. All you''re doing is hurting yourselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 145, 'Rock Lee', 'Stop it! How dare you disrespect an opponent that fought you with all he had!?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2471, 'Taiga Aisaka', 'It doesn''t matter if you grew up without parents, and it doesn''t matter if you don''t believe in God. There''s someone out there watching over you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Alois Trancy', 'I have a dream at last. The butterfly trapped in spiderweb has no wings. That butterfly is... me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2471, 'Taiga Aisaka', 'Stop living in the past like an old man.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3996, 'Ittetsu Takeda', 'Is "defeat" proof that you are weak? Isn''t "defeat" more like a trial to overcome? Of whether you can stand up and walk again after falling to you knees? If you remain on your knees like that, then it would be a sign of weakness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2, 74, 'Wolfgang Grimmer', 'As long as we are under the same sky, we shouldn''t be sad when we part ways.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, 5161, 'Korosensei', 'What does it feel like, having your own death right before your eyes? That grand kaleidoscope glimpsed in the moments before death... What could be flashing through that perfect mind of yours?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, NULL, 'Karasuma Tadaomi', '"Every experience is a tool to clear your path." It was none other than those students who taught me that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, 'Karasuma Tadaomi', 'If something is possible, carry on as planned. Even if it isn''t possible, do it anyway.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3891, 'Gilgamesh', 'If a couple curses stopped me, what kind of hero would I be?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, NULL, 'Asano Gakuho', 'Well I do have abilities you haven''t yet been given, just like not everyones has the strengths you do.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, 4354, 'Korosensei', 'To kill is an action which overflows in everyday life. In actuality the more you try to be accepted, the more you kill your unrestrained self.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, 5161, 'Korosensei', 'I study too, you know. How could I teach anyone if I didn''t grow and learn day by day. Now let''s get rid of this dangerous cloth. Experiencing my Absolute Defense Form over summer vacation taught me yet another skill: compressing not my whole body, but a portion of my tentacles to release a burst of energy. Remember this Itona, I say assassination is education. The assassination classrooms teacher will get stronger every time he teaches!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, 3083, 'Gilgamesh', 'Isn''t the foolishness of the few a more precious commodity than the wisdom of the masses? There are those who were born human but harbor wishes that man was not meant for and have renounced their humanity in its pursuit.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, 3083, 'Gilgamesh', 'There are two kinds of arrogance. One where you are unequal to the task and one where your dreams are too big. The former is commonplace stupidity... but the latter is a rare species that is difficult to find.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, 2545, 'Edward Elric', 'We''re not Demons or Gods. We''re just humans.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'The night is in its darkest just before dawn. But keep your eyes open. If you avert your eyes from the dark, you''ll be blinded by the rays of a new day. So keep your eyes open, no matter how dark the night ahead may be.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'Death is like being born, but backwards. It only hurts for a little while, then a new life begins. A life with no sorrow, no pain, a glorious new beginning. A beginning that will last an eternity.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'That''s right. It''s not like I ever felt superior to anyone else because I could see ghosts. And I never planned to take it up as a profession. Hell, I never even felt the need to use my ability to help others. All I ever wanted was the normal life I couldn''t have. I''ve finally achieved what I always wanted.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'No matter whether you win or not, there''s no meaning to war.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'You give up your future, lose your dream, are stained with despair... yet at the same time, you shake off you past, fight reality, and never lose your nobility.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Gintama', 'A prison, you say? You think you''ll be free if you go to the world above? A girl like you can never be free no matter where you go. After all, we humans are apes put in a cage called Earth. There is no difference between the world above and the world below. The only difference is which is bigger or smaller. People who pout about how confining the cage is can never be happy. They live their lives only seeing the iron bars. A true lack of freedom is when you cage your soul.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'Ichigo Kurosaki, all of the battles you''ve fought, were all part of my plan.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, 3587, 'Shizuku Mizutani', 'Even when the answer’s obvious, making one wait for it is the worst thing you can do.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2509, 'Vincent Phantomhive', 'Love is a magnificent thing but, incidentally, it can also give birth to dreadful tragedy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(94, 5296, 'Subaru Natsuki', 'I finally remembered why I''m here to begin with. I''ll kill you, you shitbag! I won''t let you play your trump card! I''ll blow you away and get a happy ending.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(157, 8369, 'Twenty-Fifth Baam', 'Those who try to step over someone else and go up higher... are actually only running away from some fear that they cannot see. Trying to step over someone is an cowardly action. It means you''re not confident enough to face the opponent and speak to them with the same viewpoint. It doesn''t matter how much power I have in me. By using that "power" that''s taking over you. I do not want to become such a cowardly person. I will fight and get hurt in order to survive....', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(63, 3942, 'Miyuki Shiba', 'Wiping out any and all injuries as if they never happened. A spell like that... Do you really believe he can cast it without paying any price? In order to rewind the Eidos changelog and make a full copy,the stored information must be read in its entirely. Needless to say, that includes the pain and suffering experienced by the injured party. Not only that, but it''s transmitted instantaneously in condensed form. For example, from the time that Isori was injured until brother cast his spell, roughly 30 seconds had gone by. Whereas the time Brother spent reading the Eidos changelog... was approximately 0.2 seconds. In that blink of an eye, my Brother''s mind felt 150 times the pain and suffering experienced by Isori, condensed. Everytime Brother heals someone''s wounds, that is the price he pays. Do you really mean to say that he should still use that power for others?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 2, 'Faye Valentine', 'You know the first rule in combat? [Empties sub-machine gun through closed door] ... shoot them before they shoot you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, NULL, 'Londes', 'The souls that God has given us, our spirits. Our spirits, which found a way to swim through the immense network and live in the infinity of space. Is not the human body a mere shell? A form of existence all too small and weak for consciousness with such vast reach and potential.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2840, 'Minerva Orland', 'Power is not the only connection you can have.  This world is filled with much warmer things.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2365, 'C.C.', 'In their heart, everyone has faith that their victory exists. However, in the face of time and destiny, the act of faith is fruitless and fleeting at best.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2365, 'C.C.', 'In this world, evil can arise from the best of intentions. And there is good which can come from evil intentions.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'I must spill yet more blood, so the blood already split will not be in vain.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ginjo Kugo', 'Time will try to constantly try to catch up with you. And with a roar, it will overcome you. Do not look ahead. Hope only lies within the unforeseeable current that will close in from behind.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, 'Tanaka Saeko', 'There are some flowers you only see when you take detours.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurotsuchi Mayuri', 'Do you know what a scientist fears most in this world above all else? It''s oblivion, my friend. A scientist measures our lives in the ways we develop and expand our knowledge through myriad variations. Nothing can take its place. It''s our very soul. I have done the worst thing one scientist can do to another: I have altered your thought process. When my drug takes effect, you will find your mind has lost the ability to think.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(94, 5296, 'Subaru Natsuki', 'All those times I got hurt, all the crying I did, all the pain I felt, all the fighting I did with my life at stake... And my reward was her name and a single smile. Jeez... Talk about unequal compensation.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1551, 'Riruka Dokugamine', 'If you ask anyone to name a universal rule that governs animals and humans alike, I bet you most people would answer "survival of the fittest". There are strong people and there are weak people. At a glance, it looks like the difference is pretty clear-cut. But the truth is, there''s a lot more to it than just a simple battle of "strong" against "weak", of kill or be killed. You must understand what I''m talking about too, right? The true meaning of "survival of the fittest" isn''t as simple as all that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(94, 5296, 'Subaru Natsuki', 'I guess, as long as I have life, all I can do is fight with all my might.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, NULL, 'Run', '...There are two ways to change a country. Destroy it from the outside, or correct it from the inside.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 173, 'Genma Shiranui', 'When captured birds grow wiser, they try to open the cage with their beaks. They don''t give up, because they want to fly again.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2819, 'Mavis Vermillion', 'I''ll always be by your side. You''ll never be alone. You have as many hopes as there are stars that light up the sky. The wind that brushes your skin is a presentiment of tomorrow. Come, lets walk in time with the song of the fairies...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'Unfortunately, a psychotic virgin, starved for love and likely to fall for anyone who would be a little nice to her, has set eyes on you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(94, NULL, 'Rem (re:zero)', 'I love it when you stroke my hair. I feel as if we can understand each other through the contact between your hand and my hair. I love your voice. Just hearing you say one word makes my heart feel warmer. I love your eyes. Normally, they look stern,  but when you''re being kind to someone,  I love the way they soften. I love your fingers. For a boy, you have such lovely fingers. But when they clutch me, I know they are the strong, slender fingers of a man. I love the way you walk. When we walk together, I love the way you occasionally turn, to make sure I keep up. I love the way you look when you sleep. You look unguarded, like an infant, and your eyelashes are on the long side. When I touch your cheek, you calm down... And when I playfully touch your lips, you don''t even notice... And it makes my heart ache terribly. I love you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(94, 5296, 'Subaru Natsuki', 'It was rough. It was so painful. I was so scared. I was so sad. It hurt so much, I thought I''d die. I tried so hard... I tired so hard! I was so desperate, so desperate to make everything right! It''s the truth. I''ve honestly never tried so hard at anything in my life! Because I loved this place... Because it was so important to me! I was so desperate to get back. I was scared... I was so scared! I didn''t want those eyes looking at me like that again... And I hated myself so much for feeling that way!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Gasai Yuno', 'I''m crazy!? What''s crazy is this world that refuses to let me be with you!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, NULL, 'Ryōma Terasaka', 'Some of us showed a strength we didn''t expect. Some of us went ballistic like we thought they would, some got all fired up for next time and some irresponsible- lookin'' types turned out to be crazy serious. The guy we thought was just a little runt turned out to be a genius assassin, and a guy we thought was a genius was secretly workin'' hard all along. With all these different skillsets...we just might be able to handle any challenge that comes our way.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, 3033, 'Rin Okumura', 'I’ll use my flames for a better purpose!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4319, 'Kousei Arima', 'Spring will be here soon. Spring, the season I met you, is coming. A Spring without you...is coming.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3147, 'Gon Freecss', 'Being able to cry for his companion. I was thinking you couldn''t cry, nor did you have a heart. But in that case why... even a little... don''t you share that feeling... with all the people you kill !!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(85, 4839, 'Hajime Iwaizumi', 'Someone who can''t see the opponent before them can''t see the opponent lying beyond.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'It doesn''t matter if we''re wrong...because every time we go wrong, we''ll continue to look for the right answer.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, 5161, 'Korosensei', 'Take advantage of what you have, while you have it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'Only those who have suffered long, can see the light within the shadows', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Donquixote Doflamingo', 'The time is almost here. Go and lay the groundwork. A world where only true pirates can survive will soon be upon us. Those without power, flee while you can. The tide will bring those of unmatched power and the New Era will begin!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, 5162, 'Nagisa Shiota', 'Examined from another angle, your faults and weaknesses can be weapons.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4144, 'Kureo Mado', 'As long as it''s for the right cause, there''s nothing wrong with playing dirty.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Hattori Zenzou', 'It''s quite easy for humans to become adults, but to always have a child-like heart that makes everything joyful isn''t such an easy task.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Nico Robin', 'Fools who don''t respect the past are likely to repeat it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, 3083, 'Gilgamesh', 'Fool… I belong among the heavens? Yet you would have me trod upon the ground?! Your impudence has guaranteed your death! Mongrel! When I am through with you, nothing will remain of your corpse!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, 3083, 'Gilgamesh', 'So, you would question me, you filthy mongrel? Me, the one true king? If you cannot now discern my identity in the presence of my magnificent glory, then you’re ignorant blindness will serve to seal your doom!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(94, 5296, 'Subaru Natsuki', 'I''m not sure what you''re talking about, but to atone for that you got mad and decided to do this alone? Rem... Super slap! For starters, are you dumb? No, you are dumb! Listen, where I''m from there''s a saying, "3 heads are better than 1." Wait, is it 2 heads? Whatever, the point is, 3 heads, thinking together are harder to break than only 1 arrow. It means you should rely on those around you instead of thinking about stuff alone!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Ichijou Raku', 'I''m used to gettting clobbered by her and all. But damn. A slap on the face hurts so much more.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4154, 'Renji Yomo', 'We can only live while we lose.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2712, 'Aquarius', 'Quit acting like a spoiled child. What''s important, the memories? The keys? The feelings of guilt? No. It''s the power to save your friends. That''s the power of a celestial spirit wizard.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2694, 'Makarov Dreyar', 'It is the role of a parent to stand in front of their children... and protect them even if their legs were to give out at any moment.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(94, 5296, 'Subaru Natsuki', 'While we talk,  look forward to making up for all the time you''ve wasted looking back! We can start by talking about tomorrow. You can say anything like, whether you''ll make Japanese or Western style breakfast tomorrow, or whether you''ll put on your right or left shoe first. It can be something silly like that. No matter how silly it is, you can talk about tomorrow because you have a tomorrow.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, 5161, 'Korosensei', 'Fun times are bound to end.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, 5161, 'Korosensei', 'As you go through life, the might current of society is bound to get in your way and there will certainly be times that things don''t go as you''d hoped. When this happens, don''t look to society for a cause. Do not renounce society. Frankly, you''d be wasting your time. Instead just say, "That''s life!" and muddle your way through with frustration. Once you''re past it, consider: If society''s swift current is tossing you around, how should you be swimming there in it''s midst. You should have learned how, here in the E class, in this assassination classroom. You don''t always have to stand and face it head-on. You can run and you can hide. If it''s not against the rules, you can try a sneak attack. You can use unconventional weapons. Stay determined - not impatient nor discouraged - and with repeated trial and error, you''re bound to reach a splendid outcome eventually.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'Shiro', 'Fulfilled people are just an urban legend.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'If the dark sky is me, then the sparkling stars are Tsubaki.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Youth is both a lie and a form of evil.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, 5167, 'Kaede Kayano', 'Not even your closest friends get to see your true blade.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'The natural enemy of the strong is the weak, but the natural enemy of the weak is not the strong - it is the ones that are even weaker.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'In fairy tales, when the protagonists end up in a different world, they do their best to get back home, right? But who would want to go back to a world like that?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, 5161, 'Korosensei', 'The past you''ve lost will never come back. I myself have made so many mistakes... But we can learn from the past so we don''t repeat it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, 5161, 'Korosensei', 'Is anything ever truly wasted?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(57, 3834, 'Yayoi Kanbara', 'As long as our love is stronger than the hatred within us, we can keep it sealed away.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Fate/stay night', 'Dreams are more beautiful if they stay as dreams.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, 5161, 'Korosensei', 'If I wasn''t prepared to be flexible as the situations demands, I wouldn''t have become a teacher.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(92, NULL, 'Hinazuki Kayo', 'When I get bigger, big enough to go somewhere by myself, I want to go to a land that’s far away.
I want to go to a faraway island. I want to go to an island that has no people. I want to go to an island that has no pain or sadness.
There are no adults, children, classmates, teachers or my mom on that island.
On that island, I can climb a tree when I want to climb, swim in the sea when I want to swim, and sleep when I want to sleep.
In the island, I think about the town that I left behind. Kids go to school, as if nothing has changed.
Adults go to the office, as if nothing has changed. Mom eats, as if nothing has changed.
When I think about the town without me, I feel a sense of relief. I want to go far, far away.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, 4354, 'Korosensei', 'The world will always be filled with injustice. If you have time to give up or hold a grudge against that injustice, then use that time to enjoy battling those injustices instead.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5079, 'Garou', 'If you weren''t here, I would have become the world''s absolute evil. Unbiased terror scattered throughout the world that can establish real peace. Don''t think that all children are waiting for heroes. There are even kids around the world waiting for a great monster to take the stage. Can you save them? Can you follow the ugly kid being picked on in the park? I can. I can save the whole world with terror! While humanity is fearing Garou the Monster, everyone''s hearts will unite to survive. Is there any peace other than this? Can you create peace? Can you, unbiased, save the world with that flimsy cape? Do you have the means to stop the unseen tragedies? You''re strong... but so what? You may defeat me, but can you handle it? The responsibility. Well? If you''re going to defeat me then answer the question! What will you accomplish? Why will you kill me now? Do you have a sense of duty like mine? Why are YOU a hero!?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, 5162, 'Nagisa Shiota', 'If that treetop is school, and the ground is this place here... we all found our strength down on the ground. While looking up... and getting looked down on... we learned plenty about how scary heights were before we started climbing. That''s why we can go our own way now. Still... Somewhere along the way we forgot our fear of heights, so we do still fall to the ground every now and then. So learn here. You can go on to school once you have a game plan. That''s my secret lesson, from me to you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(92, NULL, 'Fujinuma Sachiko', 'Thinking it''s your fault after the fact is just pointless.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5079, 'Garou', 'The phony peace that heroes create will dye people with evil. That''s why I''m doing this. I will be the Count Devil that plunges humanity into terror! In a world with no room for survival, evil will disappear. And so will bullying, and discrimination, even war! What this world needs is not biased Justice but unbiased, absolute Evil! I''m fighting for world peace. No justice will be able to overthrow me. I will be stronger than anyone! I will be an absolute MONSTER!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, 5161, 'Korosensei', 'You may have grown too strong. Drunk on your own power, you forgot to put yourself in the shoes of someone weaker than you. That makes you no different than the student in the main campus.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(92, 5248, 'Satoru Fujinuma', 'To get what you want, you put up with something, make an effort, learn a skill, and inspire yourself. Is that how it is with Hinazuki too? Right now... I can tell she''s enduring something. Just the opposite of me, she is pretending to be indifferent. She pretends to feel nothing, but a 10 year old girl isn''t that strong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(92, NULL, 'Hinazuki Kayo', 'While I''m performing it feels like it''ll become real somewhere along the line.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5079, 'Garou', 'The popular will win, the hated will lose, it''s such a tragedy. Then I won''t lose to anyone. I will become the strongest monster ever and change this scenario.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(92, NULL, 'Yashiro Gaku', 'The essence of good deeds and evil is the same. They''re both no more than a person''s actions to make up for a defect in themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5079, 'Garou', 'This strength doesn''t make any sense. It''s not fair. It''s like he''s made up of the world''s unfairness. As if he is the personification of justice... of course. Didn''t I already know? This world is unfair. Justice and evil are decided by others. That''s how the world is. To oppose the unfair power known as justice, I have to obtain the unfair power known as evil. To defeat the unfair beings known as heroes I have to become an unfair being myself!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 5269, 'Osamu Dazai', 'Justice is a weapon. It can be used to cause harm, but it cannot protect or save others.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Donquixote Doflamingo', 'There is a difference in the look of the ordinary vagabond and that of a determined man.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3421, 'Taiga Kagami', 'Be Yourself because an Original is worth more than a Copy', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1740, 'Takashi Morinozuka', 'Every time you hurt others, you''re the one who end up being hurt.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4134, 'Juuzou Suzuya', 'Why should I apologize for being a monster? Has anyone ever apologized for turning me into one?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, NULL, 'Oreki Houtarou', 'I don''t care if no one likes me. I wasn''t created in this world to entertain everyone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'Like God, you mean? That might be pleasurable in its own way, but unfortunately I''m not into being an umpire or a referee, as I can''t genuinely enjoy the game unless I''m part of it. And I love this game that people call "life" from the bottom of my heart. That''s why I''d like to continue to participate in it as a player, forever and ever.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1741, 'Hikaru Hitachiin', 'You don''t abuse and use people for your own convenience.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Akashi Seijuurou', 'Victory is everything in this world. The victory is acknowledged, and the vanquished is disavowed. Because I am victorious overall, I am always the just.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, 5161, 'Korosensei', 'Broadly speaking, there are two reasons a person feels the desire to teach something: Either he wants to pass on his successes or he wants to pass on his failures.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3738, 'Jean Kirstein', 'I just really don''t wanna meet a disappointing end, with someone burning my bones without even knowing who they belonged to.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4183, 'Esdeath', 'I don''t understand the feelings of the weak. The law of the world is survival at its fittest. Its how the weak are weeded out. It just means those people that died were too weak. Its only natural for the weak to perish.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(58, 3837, 'Satsuki Kiryuuin', 'I understand now. The world is not cut from the same cloth. It is because it is overflowing with inexplicable, unidentifiable things that the world is so beautiful.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1739, 'Mitsukuni Haninozuka', 'A person who can''t care about himself can''t protect anyone, I think.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'Oppression. Rule by fear. dictatorships. It''s a strange thing. Throughout history, for some reason, the lives of such rulers have always ended in the same way: Assassination by someone who isn''t even part of a combat unit.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(92, 5248, 'Satoru Fujinuma', '"Believing in someone." That''s a weird phrase, isn''t it? After all, if you truly believed in a person, you wouldn''t need to say, "I believe you." It''s like saying, "I believe in air." I don''t mean to say that "believing in something" is like a lie. "Believing" is really a term of hope of wanting to believe.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(92, 5248, 'Satoru Fujinuma', 'The future is always blank. Only your willpower can leave footsteps there.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, 5161, 'Korosensei', 'All of the connections we encounter in this world serve as teachers who nurture us.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3992, 'Tooru Oikawa', 'Talent is something you make bloom, instinct is something you polish.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(85, NULL, 'Ryūnosuke Tanaka', 'Even if you put aside regret, you´ll end up feeling it anyway. Right now, you need to make sure you grasp this good feeling and never forget it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Yoshino Yūsuke', 'Being unable to trust anything is the same as being unable to sense other people''s love.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1741, 'Hikaru Hitachiin', 'Nothing can be communicated without words but if you really care about someone, even the smallest details are important to notice.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Matsu''s Husband', 'Matsu, you said that people and fireworks bloom like beautiful flowers for an instant and then fade away. That may be true, but Matsu, even if it''s only for a moment, I want you to bloom by my side and when you fade away... do so at my side. In return, I will... make beautiful flowers bloom by your side again and again.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3432, 'Atsushi Murasakibara', 'I don''t like practice. I just hate losing even more.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(58, 3837, 'Satsuki Kiryuuin', 'Those who lack resolve are incapable of even wiping away their own tears.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(58, 3837, 'Satsuki Kiryuuin', 'Fear is freedom! Subjugation is liberation! Contradiction is truth! These are the truths of this world! Surrender to those truths, you pigs who fawn over clothing!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'There are no inherently bad people. Everyone believes that, myself included. I don’t doubt the existence of virtue. And yet people bare their fangs when it seems they can profit. People will rationalize their own behavior whenever they become tainted with evil; they’re not supposed to be evil. In order to preserve their own twisted integrity, the world becomes twisted.
Someone you praised as “cool” until yesterday is “stuck up” today; someone you respected as “smart and knowledgeable” is now scorned as someone who “looks down on bad students”, and “energetic vigor” becomes “annoying and overly carried away”.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4321, 'Kaori Miyazono', 'Was I able to live inside someone’s heart? Was I able to live inside your heart? Do you think you’ll remember me at least a little? You’d better not hit "reset!" Don’t forget me, okay? That’s a promise, okay? I''m glad it’s you, after all. Will I reach you? I hope I can reach you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Really, what a joke. I just didn’t understand what these nice guys were thinking about. Because they were so in love with everyone getting along, they ended up opening up other problems when they try to fix one. I didn’t even ask to be thrown into that circle either.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4185, 'Wave', 'When a man of the sea falls in love, he dives in head first!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'I prefer to have my nightmares with open eyes.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'We do not stop playing games because we grow old, we grow old because we stop playing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'There is more than one way to win a game. You can win without fighting!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(77, NULL, 'Ainz Ooal Gown', 'Death by sword. Death by broken bones. Death by crushing. There''s not much difference, right? You die at the end.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, 3033, 'Rin Okumura', 'I''m not your weapon, demon king, or savior! I''m Rin Okumura! And when I''m done, I''m going to be the best exorcist you ever laid your eyes on!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5049, 'Saitama', 'Is that really... the limit to your power? Do you honestly think that you won''t get any stronger for the rest of your life? Instead of sitting around frustrated, it''s better to keep on moving forward.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, 'Mumen Rider', 'I know no one expects much from me! And I know better than anyone how useless a C Class hero is! I know I''m too weak even for B Class! I know more than anyone else that I''ll never beat you! But I must fight you anyway! I''m the only one left! It''s not about winning or losing! I just have to stand here and face you!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5049, 'Saitama', 'I''m not a hero because I want your approval. I do it because I want to!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(86, 4934, 'Misa Kurobane', 'Forget about me, and starting tomorrow live your own life. Don''t keep dragging the dead into your life, otherwise your life would get screwed up and you won''t be happy in the future, okay?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, NULL, 'Kyubee', 'On this planet you call females who have yet to become adults, girls. It makes sense then that since you''ll eventually become withes, you should be called Magical Girls.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'Everyone''s the same, no exceptions.  All of them, equal before god.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Shimura Shinpachi', 'There''s no short-cut to becoming strong. Even if you try to look strong on the outside, that thin layer will soon fall off.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(57, 3826, 'Hiroomi Nase', 'If you keep trying to reason with yourself instead of listening to your feelings, you''ll never be able to feel true happiness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Gol D. Roger', 'Destiny. Fate. Dreams. These unstoppable ideas are held deep in the heart of man. As long as there people who seek freedom in this life, These things shall not vanish from the Earth.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, NULL, 'Hagoromo Ōtsutsuki', 'The past does not exist to remind us that the future cannot be changed. It exists to remind us what the future can be.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, 3524, 'Nobuchika Ginoza', 'No matter how severe the situation is, if you continue to stay there, you''ll accept everything as a everyday life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1551, 'Riruka Dokugamine', 'Survival of the fittest'' is just a pretty lie that they tell you. A lie to make weak people believe that if they try their best, they can come out on top. Truth is, it isn''t the weak that get eaten. It''s not about strength, it''s about numbers. The ones who stand at the top of the food chain are the brainless dolts. The loudmouths. Because there are so, so many of them. You know it''s true. Everybody does. You all just turn a blind eye and pretend not to notice.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(58, NULL, 'Aikurō Mikisugi', 'One who relies overly on a single skill will be brought low by that very same skill.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'Whats the probability of drawing the ace of spades from a deck with no jokers? Normaly it would be 1/50. But what if its a brand new deck? The position of cards in a new deck are typically identical, so that means if you take out the jokers and draw the card at the very bottom, it''s the ace of spades almost 100% of the time. Oh that''s right! I didn''t say a word about it being a new deck. Rather, you didn''t ask. Being in the "no" gives you the power to turn the probability of winning from 1.92% to 100%. The more knowledge of a party will be the inevitable victor.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'I am the God placed here to save the weak and create a perfect world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3977, 'Tobio Kageyama', 'The last ones standing are the victors. Only the strongest. If you want to be the last one standing become strong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'A victor must speak not of the current state of the world, but of how it should rightfully be.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Alois Trancy', 'Once drowned in the depths of darkness, you lose sight of light. When that light has dispersed there is no return. My light has died out long ago and so there''s nothing back for me to go back, or look forward to I shall continue to indulge myself in this darkness until it completely consumes me, then I will be nothing but an empty course left on this cold & cruel world to rot.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(85, 4882, 'Ikkei Ukai', 'There''s no match you can''t win, and there''s no match that you''ll win for sure.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Armin Arlelt', 'I''ll sooner die than become burden.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3424, 'Shun Izuki', 'Does math bring out your wrath?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Do you know the phrase “enough specks of dust creates a mountain”? Or maybe “three heads are better than one.” In other words, when people gathered together, they become even stronger and more secure. However, we were a group of failures who had gathered to do pointless things.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'If you realize you made a mistake with the way you''ve been living your life, you just have to take the next moment and start over.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(66, NULL, 'Konno Yuuki', 'God would never put us through all this suffering if he didn''t think we could bear it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(63, 3943, 'Tatsuya Shiba', 'How many people you killed, or how many you let live, it doesn''t matter to me. You people incurred my wrath... That''s reason enough, for you to meet your demise.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(62, 3922, 'Yato', 'To put things simply, if your past makes your present... Then your present can and will make your future. When you think about it that way... You absolutely have the potential to be anything you want to be, don''t you agree?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3979, 'Daichi Sawamura', 'We''re basically developing at this point, and we don''t know the limits of our potential. Even if we felt those limits we would still keep aiming higher.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3977, 'Tobio Kageyama', 'Y-you actually used your head??? You''re going to get a fever!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, 'Shōyō Hinata', 'But now we can fight. Even if they read us or catch up to us...
We can fight!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'I''m bothered by the very fact that people exist, but you''re an exception.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'If I can, I''d like to bring back what she has lost, what she threw away.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'I''m not highly aware. I''m highly self-aware.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Kiritsugu', 'Unfortunately... being a hero is a limited-time thing. When you grow up, it becomes harder to call yourself one. I wish it hadn''t taken me so long to realize that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2690, 'Natsu Dragneel', 'I''ll keep my promise, I''ll save the world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5049, 'Saitama', 'Human beings are strong because we have the ability to change ourselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2913, 'Kyohei Kadota', 'If you want to run from your past, fine. But whatever you do, don''t run away from your present or worse, your future.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4321, 'Kaori Miyazono', 'Maybe there’s only a dark road up ahead. But you still have to believe and keep going. Believe that the stars will light your path, even a little bit.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5049, 'Saitama', 'I''ll leave tomorrow''s problems to tomorrow''s me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5049, 'Saitama', 'I''m just a guy who''s a hero for fun.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, 4356, 'Karma Akabane', 'People with talent often have the wrong impression that things will go as they think.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2473, 'Minori Kushieda', 'Crying is a nosebleed of the heart.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2706, 'Gajeel Redfox', 'It''s not a sin to fall in love. You can''t even arrest someone over that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3144, 'Killua Zoldyck', 'If I ignore a friend I have the ability to help, wouldn''t I be betraying him?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, 3033, 'Rin Okumura', 'Don''t just mindlessly judge people as you please.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2473, 'Minori Kushieda', 'Even when the sky''s so dark you can''t see a thing, there are still stars shining out there. So if she can learn to shine brighter, we''ll be able to see her.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'If you''re going to selfishly admire someone only to be disillusioned later, then maybe you shouldn''t try to get to know them better at all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'You may be unfortunate, but that doesn''t mean you have to suffer. You may not be blessed, but that doesn''t mean you have to throw a fit over it. Even if bad things happen to you, just be strong!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'It is absurd to divide people into good and bad. People are either charming or tedious.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2473, 'Minori Kushieda', 'I don''t want to get so caught up in searching for what I can''t see, that I lose sight of what I can.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'There was no meaning to things that were only superficial. That was a single belief that both me and her once shared.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2473, 'Minori Kushieda', 'My happiness can only be... can only be made with my own hands! My happiness doesn''t depend on anyone but me!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 382, 'Brook', '"Loneliness" is no longer part of my vocabulary.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 382, 'Brook', 'Death is never an apology.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2473, 'Minori Kushieda', 'I believe in ghosts, even though I''ve never seen one before and get this. I don''t believe in anyone of the people that have said they seen one before. It''s kind of like how I think about the concept of love. Like I believe one day I''ll fall in love, get married and live happily ever after, even though I''ve never actually fallen in love with anyone yet. You see what I''m saying? For some people falling in love is like second nature, but I can''t even relate to that. So if I''ve never fallen in love before is it real? And that makes me wonder if ghost are real. I haven''t seen one yet so maybe they''re not.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, 4354, 'Korosensei', 'Those who can''t do what they have to when the time comes for action will find their presence fading in our classroom. An assassin who neglects to sharpen his blade is no assassin at all. He''s just a boastful brat swinging around a rusty sword.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(77, NULL, 'Ainz Ooal Gown', 'It''s fine. Everyone makes mistakes. You just need to make an effort not to make the same mistake again.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(77, 4540, 'Dyne Woodwonder', 'The words you''ve said cannot be taken back. So you must take action to paint over what you have already said.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, 4354, 'Korosensei', 'The difference between the novice and the master is that the master has failed more times than the novice has tried.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'One Piece', 'If you hurt somebody or if someone hurts you, - the same red blood will be shed.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Trafalgar Law', 'There are things you can''t see unless you change your standing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'If the drive behind one''s actions is the thought for another, then it is never meaningless.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'If they find out what you did there, a lot of people will say a lot of things to you. Some will say you did the right thing. And some will say you did the wrong thing. But that''s not what matters. No matter what anyone says, you don''t have to worry. Because you didn''t do the right thing, and you didn''t do the wrong thing. It was all part of being young.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'One Piece', 'They are more like “people who don’t follow rules…” There are different kinds of people in different worlds! … Between you two and them, what is the difference? It isn’t unusual… to put it to an extreme… A hero during a war would be just another murderer in peaceful times.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Everyone is a slave to their past. No matter how much you wish to move forward, the events of last year will bear down on you like the light of the stars as soon as you glance up. Unable to laugh or to banish your past, you carry it ceaselessly in a corner of your heart, waiting for it to resurrect at an inopportune moment.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(62, 3922, 'Yato', 'You shouldn''t judge people by how they look.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'It is better to be hated for what you are. Than to be loved for what you are not.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'The Devil''s finest trick is to persuade you that he does not exist.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3891, 'Gilgamesh', 'The things we can''t obtain are the most beautiful ones.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'We have no need for the past. All we need are the present and the future.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(81, NULL, 'Kojirō Shinomiya', 'If you want to grow just look above you, there are plenty of people perfect to serve as fodder for your growth.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 341, 'Crocodile', 'Wake up princess, I''m tired of your useless ideals. It''s gotten pathetic. What good are your happy ideals if you can''t do anything to make them a reality? They''re nothing but dreams, and your dreams don''t stand a chance.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1354, 'Ganju Shiba', 'I think you and I have different concepts of beauty. I was taught that it''s beautiful to survive, unsightly or not.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Jimbei', 'It is a sad truth that greater the authority a person possesses, the more he tends to fear change.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, 'Simon Brezhnev', 'You''re happy enough, so don''t take away the happiness of others. You should share it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4337, 'Shizuka Hiratsuka', 'Your impression of people is renewed every day. As you spend time with them and grow with them, you come to understand more.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'There are people who ruin the atmosphere just by existing, you know.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Hyuuga Junpei', 'Don''t go believing everyone with glasses is smart!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3421, 'Taiga Kagami', 'If we understood how other people felt, then nobody would ever start wars!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'As they say about the vulgar masses, the more people flock to a group, the more foolish they become. No matter how prominent an individual is, no, it’s because he is prominent that he would be blotted out by the sheer force of numbers when thrown into that lump of people. Individual will, qualifications, and personality, let alone emotions aren’t considered at all.
We see only what we want to see, listen only to what we want to listen to, but for the things we want to say, we aren’t able to. This is the society that we’re living in right now.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 382, 'Brook', 'What do you know of death?!! Have you ever died?!! You think death will preserve your cause forever?!! Ridiculous!! Death leaves nothing behind!! Once a person passes on, nothing remains but dead bones!! If there is one thing I can’t stand, it is a person with no respect for life!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 382, 'Brook', 'Neither God nor the Devil can give aid to those without the will to fight…', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 357, 'Arlong', 'Living is important! It is because one lives, one can enjoy things! Everyone has their own designated place and position in life! This man understands the futility of resisting against that fact! You see, not all living things, are born equal!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Maiko Shuu', 'I''ve decided to take this unrequited love, and quietly put it away in a corner of my heart as a bittersweet page of my youth.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2426, 'Medusa Gorgon', 'Fear is what creates order.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Tsugumi Seishirou', 'It can''t be helped, if there''s nothing you can do, then there''s nothing else you can do.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(66, NULL, 'Konno Yuuki', 'Because of my last moments are such fulfillment.
I can end my journey surrounded by so many people, in the arms of the person I love.
I... I did my best to live, I lived here.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'You yourself have to change first, or nothing will change for you!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Sake sure is nice. You can forget your troubles if only for a moment. You''ll have to remember them tomorrow though, and they''ll be even more painful than they were the night before. You can''t run away from things like this. Especially from things you really want to forget.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3187, 'Shoot McMahon', 'I''ve always gone to any lengths to avoid facing danger and risk, hiding myself within  a safe cage, where no one could hurt me. I hated myself for it.. But I couldn''t change myself.. Friends and teachers encouraged me, but I never truly listened, considering it the logic of the strong. Yet somehow... A boy with less than half my strength managed to break my cage!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4333, 'Yui Yuigahama', 'Why is it that what I want, and what''s expected of me are so similar, yet so different?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, 4354, 'Korosensei', 'Honestly, there isn''t much meaning to the splendid names given to you by your parents. What does have meaning, is what the person behind that name does during their actual lifetime. The name doesn''t make the person. The name simply remains gently within the footprint left on the path a person walks.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 345, 'Smoker', 'Don''t ever think there''s any perfect society made by humans!! If you think that way you''ll overlook the enemy!! Don''t be fooled by appearances!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3147, 'Gon Freecss', 'In my next life, I want to be me, and meet you again.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3891, 'Gilgamesh', '"Hero of Justice? A world where no one is hurt?" Don''t be absurd. "Humanity" is the name for an animal that cannot find joy in life without sacrifice. The pretty lie that is "equality" is nonsense spouted by weaklings who cannot look upon the darkness. Nothing but an excuse to cover up life''s ugliness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', '"True to herself", "True to myself". We all have our own personal image that''s dictated by others, one that''s always off the mark. We wish to remain true to ourselves, but who gets to decide who we are as people? When our image never goes hand-in-hand with reality, where can we find something genuine? Where can we find our true selves?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4337, 'Shizuka Hiratsuka', 'People usually don''t look back to see how far they''ve come while they''re still walking. Of course, when they come to a standstill, the more progress they''ve made, the more betrayed they feel by their expectations.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'The past makes you wanna die out of regret and future makes you depressed out of anxiety. So by elimination, the present is likely the happiest time.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Don''t worry. When people break their old selves they embark a journey to find their new selves.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(79, 4599, 'Michiru Kinushima', 'It''s more cruel to give someone false hope, you know.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(79, 4597, 'Isla', 'Because nothing makes one happier than being with the one you love.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'When people reach the halfway mark of a long ordeal, how do they feel? Does being only halfway there make them despair? Or do they feel relief at making it halfway there? Most people have to feel one way or the other, and both emotions create an opening in their hearts. That''s why I pushed myself this far.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3688, 'Hayato Hayama', 'When you pick the only option you have to choose from, can you really call that your own decision?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(79, 4601, 'Kazuki Kuwanomi', 'That''s human nature. We have regrets, and go on blaming ourselves forever.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(44, NULL, 'Vali Lucifer', 'What you think of as peace can be painful for others.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'Sovereignty means absolutely nothing in front of me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4320, 'Tsubaki Sawabe', 'I don''t like this, I don''t like this, I don''t like this. Sure, I know that I have no right to be feeling this way. But I still don''t like it! I just don''t like it. We were always together. I was always by his side. During time of joy, and grief as well. But...I realize he''s far away from me now... I''m not by his side...there''s somebody else there... I don''t like this! Look at me! Look at me, will you? Not with those eyes... Don''t look at someone else!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'You can’t take back the answer you already gave out. There’s no use in crying over spilt milk. The egg you broke won’t come back. All the horses and soldiers of a king will never return to his side again.
It doesn’t matter what was said. You can never wipe away a bad impression.
Even though the opposite is so simple in comparison. Just one word will make someone appear hateful. Just doing one thing would make you seem hateful.
That’s why excuses are meaningless. Because even those excuses will make you look hateful.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4336, 'Komachi Hikigaya', 'Identity? What? The people who yap about identities all the time are usually the ones with no identity. Like something that changes so easily could really be an "identity", anyway.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4320, 'Tsubaki Sawabe', 'Even though I''m bitter over losing, even though I''m depressed, even though my ankle hurts, and my eyes are smeared with tears...even though I''ve never felt worse...I wonder why the stars are sparkling like this. The scent of the music room in his hair. I can hear his slightly ragged breathing. His shoulder, wet with tears, is so warm. I am by his side. I wish time would just stand still.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'If wishes could be granted, if desires could be fulfilled,  then I wouldn''t wish or desire for anything after all. The things you''re handed on a silver platter are never genuine, and never everlasting. And that is why I''ll always keep searching.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'I don''t mind losing to someone, but I won''t be beaten by myself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4337, 'Shizuka Hiratsuka', 'It is impossible to not hurt someone. Humans unconsciously hurt others by simply existing. Whether you are alive or dead, you keep hurting people. Getting involved will hurt them, but trying not to get involved might hurt them too. But if it''s someone you don''t care about, you won''t notice you''ve hurt them. What''s important is your awareness of it. It''s because you care about them, that you feel like you''ve hurt them. Caring about someone means being resolved to the fact that you''ll hurt them. The more people care for each other, the farther out of reach certain things get. But that''s not something to be sad about, I think it''s probably something to be proud of.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Thinking you''ll understand without being told anything is an illusion.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(79, 4599, 'Michiru Kinushima', 'Losing sight of who you really are... that can be pretty scary.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Don''t put me on their level. I don''t care about looking interesting. I''m just self-conscious.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'It''s arrogant to think just saying things out loud is enough. Self-gratifying on the part of the speaker, and conceited on the part of the listener. You won''t always come to an understanding by talking things out.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Expecting others to read your mind is delusional. But... But... I... I..."It''s not empty words I''m after. There was something else I desired all along. Not mutual understanding, friendship, companionship, or anything of the sort. I don''t care about being understood. I simply wish to understand. Understand, know, and rest easy in that knowledge-- gain some peace of mind. Wanting to know people inside-out because being in the dark terrifies me is an awfully self-indulgement, egoistic, and arrogant wish. It''s downright despicable and disgusting. Having a desire like that makes me sick to the stomach! But if it''s at all possible to share that desire-- if it''s possible to have a relationship where you''re free to burden one another with that repulsive self-gratification...I know that it''s out of the question! I know that it''s out of my reach! Even so!" Even so, I... I want something genuine.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Gintama', 'When you are down, how do you pick yourself up? People fall into two categories... depending on how they pick themselves up. The first one sees somebody who is worse off and thinks, "Hey! I am better off than that guy." And the second kind of guy sees a challenge and tries to raise himself to it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4337, 'Shizuka Hiratsuka', 'People''s thoughts don''t always mirror how they feel. That''s why they sometimes make decisions that seem nonsensical.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, 'Moeka Kiryū', 'That day four years ago... When I wasn''t needed by anyone. When nobody cared about me. When I had given up on living and was about to jump off the roof of a building... FB saved me with a single message. I didn''t care if it was a joke or not. I was just happy that somebody knew... that I was alive... that it was OK for me to live...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, 4355, 'Nagisa Shiota', 'Anything can be a sword if you polish it enough.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4332, 'Yukino Yukinoshita', 'If this is all it takes to tear us apart, then maybe we weren''t all that close to begin with.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, 'Moeka Kiryū', '(In Gamma worldline, to Okabe) Look, even if we were enemies in the world you were before, right now I''m your only ally. Even if the whole world turned against you, I would continue to be your only ally.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, 4354, 'Korosensei', 'Exams are an opportunity to teach correctly the meaning of winning and losing, of strong and weak. Students soak up heaping helpings of successes and setbacks! Take in now what it means to win, what it means to lose!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, 'Moeka Kiryū', 'When I realized, I was already on the roof of a building. ...I had come to hate everything. I was sick of sitting in my room holding my knees too. If nobody was going to notice or care if I died then... what''s the point in living?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, 4356, 'Karma Akabane', 'Total victory is scoring an easy win by doing what you always do.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, 4354, 'Korosensei', 'Tests are a good thing. The knowledge gained from a night of cramming will be all but forgotten once you hit adulthood. And that''s fine. The experience you gain through competition, having sharpened your skills and broadened your minds all under the same set of rules? That''s the real treasure.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, 4354, 'Korosensei', 'It’s dangerous for them to grow up without experiencing true competition. Because they’ll keep whining, even without taking the matter seriously. For those with a high level of aptitude... The sooner they know the frustration of defeat, the greater their growth will be.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(52, 3668, 'Kumin Tsuyuri', 'Do you know how they say that love is like a dream? With a dream, you eventually wake up from it. It''s hard to force yourself to wake up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'Have you ever thought about why you''re so good and your parents are so bad? If you''d so kindly let me give away the answer; it''s because even if you''re cheating on someone or you''re being cheated on, everyone laughs at bad jokes and eats over-sweet boiled vegetables.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Tohsaka Tokiomi', 'Taking responsibility for yourself is the first condition for humanity. One who cannot do even that is less than human. Just a dog, Kariya.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, 4354, 'Korosensei', 'Please remember that there are times to take someone''s hand and lead them along... But also times when you must be stern and let them fend for themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2802, 'Lucy Ashley', 'If one really wants to change the world...they have to do it by their own hands!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'There are people who can''t act unless they''re faced with a problem. Unless they find their reason. All I was left with was the sinking suspicion that I''d gone horribly wrong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(79, 4597, 'Isla', 'Having happy and beautiful memories won''t always bring you salvation. The more beautiful a memory is, the more painful it can become. It can even become terrifying. Both for the one who''s leaving... And for the one left behind.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2664, 'Yuri Nakamura', 'Let me tell you something. Humans don''t even have the patience to wait even ten minutes for something!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'So long as a problem doesn''t cause problems, it can''t be called a problem.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'If they''re not given a problem, if they''re unable to find a reason, some people can''t bring themselves to act. Maybe I got something wrong somewhere. Only that bit of doubt stayed with me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, 3133, 'Karyuudo Tsukishima', 'Those who seem kindest, are often the most insidiously cruel.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'To hate something that you used to love is such a painful feeling.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'Love means money these days.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Madarame Ikkaku', 'No man''s life is worth more than another! If you''re gonna put your life on the line, you do it as equals! I don''t care if you''re brothers, or master and apprentice, or whatever! You should only die for a guy who''d die for you! There''s nothing honorable about throwing your life away as though it''s nothing! That''s just showing off like a kid.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Armin Arlelt', 'Willpower alone isn''t enough in battle.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3144, 'Killua Zoldyck', 'Who wants to have their life planned out for them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(78, 4575, 'Yoshimura', 'Life is a succession of committing sin. Life is evil itself. I''m conscious that I''m evil. And so are all of you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, 'Okabe Rintarou', 'Keep the past, for all intents and purposes, where it is.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ukitake Jyuushirou', 'Friends are a good thing, even if they tread a different path.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, NULL, 'Hisoka', 'It takes a mere second for treasure to turn to trash.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'What if, and this is strictly hypothetical, what if you could reload your save data to change your previous choice, like in a game? Would it change your life? The answer is a resounding no.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'A problem is not a problem as long as nobody sees it as one.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'Brilliant people shine more brightly than ordinary ones. They never regret or agonize over what they''ve done.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(43, 3301, 'Mei Misaki', 'How does it feel to not exist?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(43, 3301, 'Mei Misaki', 'If you''re here, can you prove you''re really here?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4183, 'Esdeath', 'Panicking leads to an early grave.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3019, 'Mami Tomoe', 'If you use your wish to grant someone else''s, you should be careful you know exactly why you are doing it.
Are you really doing it for someone else''s benefit?
Or the opposite, you''re doing it for that person''s everlasting gratitude.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kariya Jin', 'Let me tell you the truth. The truth behind fighting. Fighting continues forever. After you''ve defeated one person, someone stronger appears. If you manage to defeat him, then an even stronger person comes along. If you don''t have the resolve to endure that eternal struggle, then eventually your confidence will erode. But it doesn''t end there! The battle will continue elsewhere, fought by others. It''s an endless cycle! And it doesn''t end with a person''s death. The cycle will continue! As long as people and their souls exist, there will be disputes and those disputes will lead to fights. And those fights will continue without limit, for all eternity.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1986, 'Misa Amane', 'Unless someone makes the first move, nothing will happen.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1413, 'Don Kanonji', 'Run? Is that how you speak to a hero? How little you understand. Allow me to educate you. If a hero were to run from battle... the children could no longer call him a hero.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Zaraki Kenpachi', 'It''s been so long that I forgot the pain of not having a name. Everyone had a name that friends use to call them, but I didn''t. That pain.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3747, 'Hange Zoe', 'If there''s something you don''t understand, learn to understand it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'Alphonse Elric', 'You''re not a good-for-nothing person. I think that being able to try your hardest to be something is a talent by itself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1176, 'Greed', 'Greed may not be good, but it’s not so bad either. You humans think greed is just for money or power, but everyone wants something they can’t have.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2504, 'Undertaker', 'How sad it would be if laughter should disappear.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'I''m always alone. Other people don''t factor into what I do. The things that happen in front of me are parts of my life and my life alone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2413, 'Maka Albarn', 'You''re the one who decides who you are.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, NULL, 'Vincent Volaju', 'I have no fear of death. It just means dreaming in silence. A dream that lasts for eternity', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', '[After getting hit by Yammy Llargo''s Bala] You mean do I have a defence? Truth is, I’ve never really had any plans against any attacks. I just knew I had to win so I did. That’s my plan. I don’t care if you’re higher ranked than the other Espadas'' were, to me it’s all the same. I’ve gotta defeat you so I’ll find a way to do it. Simple.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, 4356, 'Karma Akabane', 'If you’ve got time to point fingers, then how about using your head to figure out what you want to do about it?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Food tastes best when you don''t have to work for it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Merits, demerits, risks, returns; if they were these things then I understood. I could understand.

Desire and self-protection, hatred from jealousy. I could analyze the mentality of the actions that were grounded on these abundant, repulsive emotions. That''s because I had plenty of those ugly feelings inside of me. That''s why it was simple to imagine. if they were similar things, then there was still room to understand it. I could explain using logic.

However, if there wasn''t, then it was difficult.

Without the concept of profit and loss, it was hard to imagine the feelings of people who went beyond people who went beyond logic and theory. I had too little to go on and above all else. I had committed too many mistakes up until now.

Good will, friendship, or even love; they were all things I had been mistaken with. I was sure that I was mistaken with them even now as I thought about them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3170, 'Biscuit Krueger', 'There are liars who only lie when there''s a reason to, and there are liars who also lie without a reason.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Akashi Seijuurou', 'I have not changed at all. There were two of me to begin with. It was merely a swap between us. I have no intent on hiding this. Whether or not you believe it is up to you, Tetsuya. However, if you want to call it a "change", then that was because it was necessary. The team did not change because I had changed. I changed because the team had changed.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3143, 'Ging Freecss', 'If I can get my target to move as I want, I''ve succeeded as a Hunter.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3183, 'Meruem', 'Ha-ha these humans are definitely foolish creatures.  Think as hard as those weak brains of yours can manage. Do you humans ever listen to the cries of mercy coming from pigs and cows you slaughter?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1130, 'Shinji Ikari', 'No one can justify life by linking happy moments into a rosary.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(13, 1587, 'Lain Iwakura', 'If you''re not remembered, then you never existed.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Mello', 'Oh, I almost forgot. In the event that anyone besides big-headed Near or the deluded murderer is reading these notes, then I should at least perform the basic courtesy of introducing myself, here at the end of the prologue. I am your narrator, your navigator, your storyteller. For anyone else but those two, my identity may be of no interest, but I am the old world''s runner-up, the best dresser that died like a dog, Mihael Keehl. I once called myself Mello and was addressed by that name, but that was a long time ago.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'There is no heaven or hell. No matter what you do while you''re alive, everybody goes to the same place once you die. Death is Equal.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2840, 'Minerva Orland', 'Manipulating the pieces according to your strategy... That is what defines a King.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3737, 'Erwin Smith', 'If we only focus on making the best moves, we will never get the better of our opponent. When necessary, we must be willing to take big risks, and be prepared to lose everything. Unless we change how we fight, we cannot win.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4332, 'Yukino Yukinoshita', 'Even if we know each other, understanding each other is another matter.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'That''s not exactly right. If you had to sacrifice many things to protect one, you''re more likely to give up and throw it away. Including relationships you have in your hand now.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Trafalgar Law', 'You can''t see the whole picture until you look at it from the outside.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'There are some people who don''t want a solution. Some want things to stay the way they are. There''s no way to make things convenient for everyone. So the only option is to find a compromise.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Having people acknowledge your existence is a wonderful thing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'The opposite of boredom is not pleasure... but excitement. People will gladly seek out any kind of excitement, even pain.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3145, 'Kurapika', 'There are two things that collectors always want. The first is any item of extreme rarity. The second is colleagues to whom they can brag about their collection.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4337, 'Shizuka Hiratsuka', 'A person''s mentality and feelings aren''t always equal. There are times the conclusion you arrive at is completely irrational and the reason is because of that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'A perfect plan doesn''t mean having everything go within expectations. A perfect plan is achieved when it has the plasticity needed to flexibly deal with troubles.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(82, NULL, 'Chiyuki', 'I''m sure it''s not wrong for people to want to understand each other. And even if it is, I want us to understand each other.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Uryuu Minene', 'Nothing good comes from digging up the past.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, 'Fujimoto Shirou', 'You''ll never be able to move forward if you''re afraid of soiling your hands.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2, NULL, 'Johann Liebert', 'Tell me, what do you think is the ultimate fear? I really thought I''d already reached the darkest of the dark, but then, ahead of me, I beheld a darkness even greater still.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4337, 'Shizuka Hiratsuka', 'If you could calculate feelings, then we''d be in a digital age by now... The remaining answer that you couldn''t calculate is what they call the feelings of people.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4134, 'Juuzou Suzuya', 'If an angelic being fell from the sky and tried to live in this world of ours, I think even they would commit many wrongs.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3004, 'Kurisu Makise', 'Maybe there are copies of me on countless world lines. Maybe all their minds are connected, forming a single "me." That sounds wonderful, don''t you think? Being in all times and in all places. A strong love for someone... a strong belief in something... a strong desire to convey something... If all those things go beyond time to create "you"... ...then that would be magnificent. So don''t think of it as letting me die. Even if the world line changes, as long as you don''t forget me, I''ll always be there. ... I''m sure that from now on you''re going to suffer. You''ll be in a world where no one but you remembers me. You care more about your friends than anything else, so I think it''s going to be painful for you. I''m so sorry. But that pain will mean a lot to me. Whenever you''re sitting around in the lab, whenever you sip a drink, whenever you walk around town ... it doesn''t have to be every time - one time out of a hundred is fine. All I ask is that you remember me ... because I''ll', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4337, 'Shizuka Hiratsuka', 'Don''t understand? Then think more. If you can only think by calculating, then keep doing so until you can''t. Think of all the answers you can and destroy them one by one with the process of elimination. Whatever remains is your answer.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3737, 'Erwin Smith', 'If you begin to regret, you''ll dull your future decisions and let others make your choices for you. All that''s left for you then is to die. Nobody can foretell the outcome. Each decision you make holds meaning only by affecting your next decision.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Everyone has something they hold dear, something they never want to lose. That''s why they pretend. That''s why they hide the truth. And that''s why they lie.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(82, 4722, 'Ginti', 'Humans all behave the same way, like idiots. They all forget that someday, they''re gonna die, so the moment they come face to face with death, they cling to life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, NULL, 'Yūzan Yoshida', 'If you don''t hold any regret in your choice, that means you must''ve made the right decision.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'Those bound by superficial rules who do not use their pawns to the utmost are fools.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3287, 'Koala', 'I was trying to take the easy way out by running away from everything. No matter the pain, I will keep living. So when I die, I''ll feel I did the best I could.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(82, NULL, 'Death Parade', 'There aren''t many things you can believe. That''s how human beings work. They only care about themselves, and no one else really matters. They get caught up in their own lackadaisical dialogue, lying their way through life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, 'Moeka Kiryū', 'People... need to be needed by someone in order to live. If a person isn''t needed, they''re worthless!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, NULL, 'Pain', 'Even innocent foolish children will grow up in the face of pain, until their thoughts and beliefs are the same as their doubts.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Bakemonogatari', 'Oddities are the world itself. They''re linked to the world, unlike living beings. Science alone cannot shed light upon them, as there will always be people who''ll be afraid of vampires. Although all forms of darkness could be lit up, darkness will never cease to exist.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Hollow Ichigo', 'I''m going to keep getting closer and closer to you. And not just day after day, oh no. It''s going to happen much faster than that! See I''m already closer to you than I was a moment ago. And I''ll keep getting closer and closer to you, until I swallow you up and then, you''ll disappear. Things are not turning out well for you at all, are they? (laughs) See you around.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'In order to measure a person’s worth, you must do more than push them. The real way to test their worth is to give them power. When they gain the freedom to act outside the boundaries of law and ethics, you can sometimes see their souls. When the weak become strong... When good citizens become free to engage in violence... I''m interested to see what is the outcome of that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'School trips are simply a simulation of adult social life. If you ever go on a business trip with your boss, you won''t get to choose where to stay or what to eat, but if you compromise, you can still have a modicum of fun. School trips train you to trick yourself into that kinda mindset.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4337, 'Shizuka Hiratsuka', 'Getting into trouble is not a bad thing. It''s proof that someone is watching you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 4331, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'When a girl calls someone a "nice guy", it means she couldn''t care less about him.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'Always trying to make myself seem strong... So I locked my own heart in a suit of armor.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'There is a history to humans. Humans are shaped by the experience obtained from living as time continued to wind and wind. To be reborn meant being rid of that history; complete annihilation. However, that just wasn’t possible in reality. That’s why the only thing you could do was to continue living on, bearing the scars on your body and holding the weight of the sins on your back, without wishing for reincarnation.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, 2552, 'Maes Hughes', 'I will do anything it takes to be the man she loves. I will survive this war. And when I return home, I will swallow every horrible thing I''ve done here, and I will smile when I''m with her. I swear on my life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 329, 'Sanji', 'I couldn''t confess my feelings for you, so I watched you from afar, being happy with someone else.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Kougami Shinya', 'When something impossible happens, there are only two possibilities. Either your assumptions are wrong, or you have gone crazy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Boa Hancock', 'Whether I kick a kitten... Tear off your ears... Even slaughter innocent people... The world will never cease to forgive my actions! Why, you ask? That''s right, it is because I am... Beautiful!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3421, 'Taiga Kagami', 'The only times we''re fated to lose are in fictional stories. This is our drama! We decide what the plot will be!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(82, 4721, 'Nona', 'The truth is, there are no lives that are nothing but pretty.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4319, 'Kousei Arima', 'A lump of steel, like a shooting star. Just seeing the same sky as you makes familiar scenery look different. I swing between hope and despair at your slightest gesture, and my heart starts to play a melody. What kind of feeling is this again? What do they call this kind of feeling? I think it''s probably... Called Love. I''m sure this is what they call love.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Ichinose Kotomi', 'Those who seek out the truth must not be arrogant. You must not laugh at miracles just because they cannot be explained scientifically. You must not turn away from the beauty of this world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4319, 'Kousei Arima', 'Isn''t it funny how the most unforgettable scenes can be so trivial ?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4319, 'Kousei Arima', 'Hold on. Don''t go! Let''s argue again. I''ll bribe you with a canelé. I''ll call you to kill time. I don''t mind being Friend A. Please don''t go. Please don''t go. Please don''t go...please don''t leave me behind.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3018, 'Homura Akemi', 'Do you value your life? Do you think that your family and friends are important to you? If they are, then you should never think of changing yourself. Otherwise, you will lose everything that is precious to you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'I just long for a world in which ordinary things are done in an ordinary way.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'Just because someone is important to you, it doesn''t necessarily mean that, that person is good. Even if you knew that person was evil... People cannot win against their loneliness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3996, 'Ittetsu Takeda', 'When ''colors'' mix, they become muddy and messy. But when they all blend together, the final result is the color that wins against all others... Black.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(69, 4253, 'Shinichi Izumi', 'In the end, I couldn''t see things from the parasites'' perspective, never mind from Migi''s. Of course not. It wasn''t possible from the beginning. As two different species, we may at times take advantage of each other and kill each other, but it''s impossible to understand each other. Actually, you shouldn''t even think that you''ve figured out another species based on your standards. I think it''s human arrogance to think we understand how other life forms feel. There may be no other life forms that are truly a "friend" to man. Still, even if we can''t comprehend them, they are, without a doubt, neighbors deserving of our respect. We protect other species because humans themselves are lonely creatures. We protect the environment because humans themselves don''t want to go extinct. What drives us is simply self-gratification. But I think that''s fine, and that it''s really all there is to it. There''s no point in despising humans by human standards. That''s right. So in the end, it''s hyp', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(82, 4749, 'Tatsumi', 'In order to accomplish anything, sacrifices must be made.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'Vegeta', '*To Android 19* Just as I thought... you''re nothing. Silly robot, you really think you have a chance against a super saiyan like me? Your brain must be malfunctioning. Fresh out of the factory with no warranty and already broken. What a pity.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, NULL, 'Kaneki Ken', 'I led me by the hand, as if to fill the niches in the memories in my oozing brain fluid. Without even a destination, we kept walking. Disgusting clouds were floating in the sky. I already know what will happen to me the next time I wake up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, NULL, 'Tokyo Ghoul', 'The bird fights it''s way out of the egg. The egg is the world. Who would be born, must first destroy a world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Happiness depends on each person. If you think you''re happy, then you must be happy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2, NULL, 'Inspector Lunge', 'Even a child that receives one bit of praise has the ability to excel in a single talent, and those who receive regular encouragement can feel confidence, achieve success, and become leading members of society. Because they don’t believe they are worthless, they don’t need to raise a fist and have vengeance against fate or the world at large…', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'Curiosity is like a cockroach. It likes to stumble upon secrets that are supposed to stay hidden.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2665, 'Yuzuru Otonashi', 'I... don''t know why I''m alive. I have no reason to live. I have no interest in others. Living without concern for others... That''s the way to live. Working a job that earns me just enough to eat... A life like that was enough...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4319, 'Kousei Arima', 'Maybe... just maybe, the light can reach even the bottom of a dark ocean.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2665, 'Yuzuru Otonashi', 'My life after losing her... Is it over as well? The days I spent satisfied with the happiness I never noticed... Those times had passed away. For me... There''s nothing left at all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4321, 'Kaori Miyazono', 'You''re you. "To be like you..." - it''s not so ambiguous as that. No matter what you do, no matter how you change, it doesn''t mean a thing. you''re just you, no matter what.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4319, 'Kousei Arima', 'Sure I''m okay. Because that''s how I was built, after all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2665, 'Yuzuru Otonashi', 'Watching TV or playing games alone is more fun. Playing along with your friends'' hobbies... Laughing at their jokes when they''re not funny... All that does is tire me out.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3977, 'Tobio Kageyama', 'Being the best decoy ever is as cool as being the ace.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Hollow Ichigo', 'You can''t spell "slaughter" without "laughter."', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(35, 2980, 'Saeko Busujima', 'Protecting a man’s pride… is a woman’s duty.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(82, 4718, 'Decim', 'I say... that people do not live just so that they can someday die. It is because they are alive that they someday die. There is no point to living. The same goes for judgment. Judgment must be performed hand in hand with both life and death. It is something that must be performed hand in hand with humans.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, NULL, 'Irimi Kaya', 'I know I haven''t always made the right decisions up to now... Whether I was right, or whether I was wrong, may not even matter in the first place. However, running up against my sins like this-- all of the choices I''ve made up to this point-- today, being able to die for someone-- is something I''m glad for...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4321, 'Kaori Miyazono', 'So ephemeral and weak. But its shining with all its might. Thump, Thump, like a heartbeat. This is the light of life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4321, 'Kaori Miyazono', 'After the first note resonated through the hall, You became everything I yearn for.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, NULL, 'Hisoka', 'Love and hate are two sides of the same coin.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Gasai Yuno', 'I''m selfish, I know. But to keep you only mine, I will do everything I needed to do, even if it''s illegal.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 168, 'Pain', 'Even the most ignorant, innocent child will eventually grow up as they learn what true pain is. It affects what they say, what they think… and they become real people.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'In this world, there are very few people who actually trust each other.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'Forgetting is like a wound. The wound may heal but it has already left a scar.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 331, 'Nami', 'Life is like a pencil that will surely run out, but will leave the beautiful writing of life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'Kindness can sometime translate to hostility.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'One ought to experience loneliness at least once or twice in life. No, you have to experience it. The idea of being chained to another person without reprieve is far more abnormal and disquieting. One has no choice but to learn about loneliness. I’m sure some things can’t be experienced without it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'If there are things you learn with friends, there must also be things you learn without friends. They must be of equal worth, two sides of the same coin.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(82, NULL, 'Chiyuki', 'Everyone lives with the sins they''ve committed.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2, NULL, 'Mikhail Petrov', 'What is education? Isn''t education meant to create a person that conforms to society? What kind of education must be administrated to create a human being that meets the society''s demands? Education is an experiment.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3979, 'Daichi Sawamura', 'We''ll never win if we don''t believe we can.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4321, 'Kaori Miyazono', 'Such a cruel boy. Telling me to dream one more time. I thought I was satisfied because my dream had come true... And I''d told myself it was enough... Yet here you are, watering this withered heart again.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1175, 'Riza Hawkeye', 'War does not determine who is right - only who is left.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2, 74, 'Wolfgang Grimmer', 'It''s impossible for humans to forget their emotions.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1311, 'Lucy', 'All this time, I''ve lived in hope of telling you how sorry I am, I''ve fought armies, just to have this chance, but now, there''s nothing I can say.. That''s good enough.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4319, 'Kousei Arima', 'The piano is meant to be played like you''re embracing it, right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4327, 'Hiroko Seto', 'We''re all connected. Just like the notes are intermittently connected. It''s shared by us all. Through music, with the people you know, with the people you don''t know, with all the people in this world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(82, 4749, 'Tatsumi', 'It''s only obvious that the world is a cruel place. If you can''t change the world, then you have to change yourself!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(82, NULL, 'Chiyuki', 'It''s not just grief. There are as many emotions as there are people. The fragility of someone who lets their anger get the best of them... The strength to overcome fear because of love... You can''t comprehend anything about them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Yoshino Yūsuke', 'Keep on living your life in such a way that love doesn''t fade away. I shall work... so that love may shine brightly, even today.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4127, 'Touka Kirishima', 'There''s no way someone who can''t even protect himself can protect anyone else, is there?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(82, 4721, 'Nona', 'Do you know what the most primitive emotion people have is? It’s fear.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(82, NULL, 'Chiyuki', 'People aren''t as complex as you think they are. They''re simple, and they get sad or angry over simple things. That''s how they are. They''re quickly affected by the littlest things, and live without knowing where they''re going to fall down. That''s who people are!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(82, NULL, 'Death Parade', 'Country of birth, time period, parents, location... various factors make people''s lives unequal from the very beginning.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, NULL, 'Kaneki Ken', 'I was wrong. I wasn''t eating ghouls. I''m the one who was being eaten.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2, NULL, 'Inspector Lunge', 'If you don''t want to be betrayed anymore, then start by doubting the person you want to doubt the least.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, NULL, 'Kaneki Ken', 'Human relationships are chemical reactions. If you have a reaction then you can never return back to your previous state of being.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(82, 4718, 'Decim', 'Life is never fair. I''m sure you''re well aware of that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(69, 4253, 'Shinichi Izumi', 'When you feel your life''s on the line, your true nature surfaces.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'I have long forgotten how to laugh as if I were having fun.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', 'Those who know despair, once knew hope. Those who know loss, once knew love.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3467, 'Fuyumi Irisu', 'Those with talent who aren''t aware of themselves cause pain for those who have none.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Claude', 'To us, you are more valuable than any jewel. Would you be at ease if you left your most treasured valuable outside the bounds of your own home? A treasure is something you keep with you at all times. It is common sense.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6431, 'Helbram', 'It''s troublesome if the villain doesn''t show their evil. Villains are necessary to make knights into heroes.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Midorima Shintarou', 'The only lucky item you''ll need is already within - CONFIDENCE.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(69, 4253, 'Shinichi Izumi', 'You shouldn''t mouth off when you don''t know shit.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(69, 4253, 'Shinichi Izumi', 'If talking won''t resolve matters, maybe inflicting some pain will.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2506, 'Elizabeth Midford', 'Weak in order to love, strong in order to protect, both in order to stay at your side.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'If I die here, then I''m a man that could only make it this far.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4327, 'Hiroko Seto', 'It''s not just allies who support each other. From your enemies, you learn so much and gain so much. Until the day you meet again... Just knowing they exist helps you to withstand the loneliness. Those who compete, even if they''re enemies, help each other out.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', 'Fear. That is what we live with. And we live it everyday. Only in death are we free of it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'Humans aren''t made perfectly. Everyone lies. Even so... I''ve been careful not to tell lies that hurt others.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Shimura Tae', 'Some lies are necessary for giving children dreams.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6402, 'Gowther', 'What I desire is a heart... A heart that understands emotions.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'I refuse to stand by and watch you give up. I won''t lose you, I can''t. We''ll walk away from this battle together.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'Even the strongest of opponents always has a weakness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1329, 'Rukia Kuchiki', 'I know the loneliness of being a prisoner. I know the joy you feel when your friends come to rescue you and the fear of them being injured and defeated.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Akashi Seijuurou', 'I do not allow anyone acting against me to look down upon me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2506, 'Elizabeth Midford', 'Poetry over philosophy. Embroidery rather than cooking. Dance instead of chess. Be an unknowing angel. Every girl born in the country of roses is raised by these three words.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Have faith in your inspiration. Feel the imagination!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Ritsu Sohma', 'I’m a complete failure. At everything I do, I’m absolutely worthless. I know this, and yet I continue to burden the human race with my presence. Every day I rob the world of valuable air by breathing. I’m a thief, and I hate myself for it. I don’t deserve to exist. But even though I know it’s the right thing to do, I’m such a useless coward. I don’t even have the courage to jump!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'Then just become stronger. I have my ambition, you have your ambition too. Which means you should just keep walking forward towards that goal.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'We have walked through the darkness of this world, that’s why we are able to see even a sliver of light.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Whether I go or not, I''ll die anyway. I have an organ more important than my heart. Although you can''t see it, I feel it going through my head down to my feet, and I know it exists within me. It lets me stand on my feet, it lets me walk forward without trembling. If I stop here, I feel like it would break... My soul will break.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3432, 'Atsushi Murasakibara', 'All these things you guys seek....hard work, guts, faith....I''ll crush them all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, NULL, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'There is no telling what kind of pain will come  after me, but... if I stop believing because of that, if the hero should change, it''ll turn into another story from the one my master left behind. Then it wont be Naruto! I can''t write novels like my master did. That''s why the sequel has to come from the life I live no matter how great the pain, I''ll continue walking because that''s who Naruto is!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(13, 1587, 'Lain Iwakura', 'People only have substance within the memories of other people. And that''s why there were all kinds of mes. There weren''t a lot of mes per se, I was just inside all sorts of people, that''s all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2, NULL, 'Kenzo Tenma', 'I was only able to get back to being a real doctor by saving your life! I realized that human lives have equal value by saving you! Nobody has the right to take another''s life! I''ve been living as a doctor with that engraved upon my heart for years!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', 'No one really starts out kind. All we know how to do at first is want. We want food, we want attention... It''s just natural survival instinct, I guess... But kindness is something that we all have to learn as we go. It''s something that grows and develops slowly over time... The same way our bodies do...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Katsura Kotarou', 'If you have faith, your dreams will surely come true.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(69, NULL, 'Tamura Reiko', 'I''ve been thinking... for a long while. For what purpose was I born into this world? Whenever I resolved one question, another would arise in its place. I sought the beginning. I sought the end. I''ve just been walking and walking, thinking all the while. Perhaps nothing will change, no matter how far I go. If I''m to stop my journey, that is fine, too. Even if I were informed that everything has reached its end, I''d just accept it. But even so, I found an answer to yet another of my questions today.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Even if you''re a main character, you can still die... I better be careful-ttebayo.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4319, 'Kousei Arima', 'You''re like a cat. If I get close, you''ll ignore me and go far away. If I get hurt, you''ll play around to share the pain.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'To enjoy an ordinary life, you must constantly evolve.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(82, 4718, 'Decim', 'I do not think humans are foolish. I have respect for people who live fulfilled lives.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(69, NULL, 'Tamura Reiko', 'You all underestimate humans. Individually, they may appear weak, but that is not the case. What we need to recognize is that humans are a single life-form comprised of millions of individuals. Besides their individual brains, humans possess a different "brain" of enormous magnitude. The moment we act in opposition to that brain, we will lose.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2440, 'Marie Mjolnir', 'An apple a day keeps any one away, if you throw it hard enough!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Amano Yukiteru', 'I''m pathetic. I was observing the world from a safe distance. I was just scared of being hurt. I was lonely.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', 'We’re searching for a reason of existence. With our own strength, because maybe the truth is that there’s no reason for life from the very beginning. Everyone hopes and tries so hard to find a reason of existence. The reason of birth, of staying with someone, of existence, believing we have to find them all with our own hands. Like finding a place for ourselves in dreams, in jobs, in people. The reasons we conclude may be indefinite and fragile. We may lose it too, but even so, we want a reason. As long as I’m alive, I want it too. If possible, I want to find a reason of existence within a person, within someone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, 7498, 'Megumi Hanajima', 'There are things that take a long time to acquire. Friends. Love. Really, nothing has been a waste.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, NULL, 'Tada Banri', 'Accident or amnesia, you can''t rewind your life and start again. If you struggle, you''ll just hurt yourself, and the people around you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, 'Shōyō Hinata', 'Do you need a reason to not want to lose?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, 3593, 'Chizuru Ooshima', 'I''m always just waiting. Waiting for someone to reach out to me. But at the same time, I''m really self-conscious and a coward.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, 3587, 'Shizuku Mizutani', 'Does it really matter that people don''t like you?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Kyoko Honda', 'If you become perplexed or make errors, in the end have the kind of life that you can have pride in living. The kind where you can say, "I persevered." Repeating delightful things and sad things. And in that way keep getting older. I persevered.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2, NULL, 'Kenzo Tenma', 'Even if you can forget, you can''t erase the past.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2, NULL, 'Johann Liebert', 'Hatred is born when people gather together.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Yuki', 'I''m not sure why I''ve decided to do this. I''m not any stronger than I was, and nothing else has changed. But all the same, this time I''m not going to run away. It''s okay to feel weak sometimes. It''s okay to be afraid. The important thing is that we face our fears. That''s... that''s what makes us strong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, 3587, 'Shizuku Mizutani', 'It would be cruelest to keep your hopes up when I already know the answer.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, NULL, 'Natsume Asako', 'There''s nothing more repulsive than being touched by a guy you don''t like.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(78, 4557, 'Juuzou Suzuya', 'Whether we die or not, isn''t really that big a deal.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(82, 4718, 'Decim', 'Life really is a mysterious thing. Each and every life spins its own, totally separate tale, yet they become intricately entwined in each other. And no one knows how they will end up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Kazuma Sohma', 'You''re afraid to face what you know you must. So instead... you run away. The air that you said was smothering you... you know that it can also heal you. But you refuse to let it. You refuse to let anyone see you for your true self. You''re too afraid of what you might lose. You''re running away because you''re afraid to admit your feelings even to yourself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Jinbei', 'You can''t bring back what you''ve lost, think about what you have now!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2384, 'Lloyd Asplund', 'I think that "truth" is something that is covered up most of the time.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4319, 'Kousei Arima', 'I want to hear it again, yet I don''t want to hear it again. I want to see her, yet I don''t want to see her. What do you call this kind of feeling again?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4135, 'Rize Kamishiro', 'Whose fault is it that things ended up like this? Coincidence? An accident? Fate? There''s no such thing as fate. It''s simply a combination of one circumstance and the next. And who is it that creates those circumstances? Who is it? It''s you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4146, 'Yakumo Oomori', 'All suffering in the world is born from an individual''s incompetence.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, 7489, 'Saki Hanajima', 'To truly love someone, is to always put their feelings before your own... no matter what.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3378, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'It is pointless to question who someone really is. All you can do is believe and accept. Because the way you perceive someone is their true identity.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Kazuma Sohma', 'Just as no matter how hard you try to keep it away, despair will attack you again and again. In the same manner, hope will return to you. Again and again.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4151, 'Yoshimura', 'We''re always trying to justify our actions with ideals. But ideals cannot give grounds for killing another person. The act of taking a life will always be considered... evil.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Shigure', 'When you get anxious about the future, it is better not to think about it. The more you think about it the more anxious you''ll get. Of course it''s important to think about what lies ahead, too, but if you only look at what''s down the road, you''ll get tangled by the "laundry" by your feet and fall, won''t you? You see, it''s also important to think about what you can do now. What you can do today, and if you keep washing things one at a time, you''ll be done before you know it. Sometimes the anxiety will start to well up, but when it does... take a little break. Read a book, watch tv, or eat soumen with everyone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, NULL, 'Lan Fan', 'A king is no king without his people. But people without a king are lost as well!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'Because of our weakness, we trained our eyes, ears and the ability to think. Learning how to survive, that''s our trait as humans! The human species can''t use magic and can''t even perceive it—but because we are weak, we have the wisdom to run away from magic and the intelligence to see through it! We don''t have any extraordinary senses. But because we are weak, by learning and gaining experience, we gained the wisdom to achieve the unachievable—to predict the future...Rejoice! We are humans; we are the most talented people! Precisely because we were born without any ability, we can achieve anything. This is the will of the weakest race!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', 'I don''t think anyone is born with a reason to live. It''s something you have to find for yourself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'A life that lives without doing anything is the same as a slow death.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Mikami Teru', 'In this world, there is only good and evil, that was the first universal truths I grasped from observing the world around me when I was a child. Every human being without exception ends up falling into one category or the other.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3378, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'I''d rather die with someone than let that person die before my eyes. More so if she''s a girl like you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'You see, the world will not change through naive talks.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, NULL, 'Kaneki Ken', 'You think something like that would hurt, after all I''ve been through?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, 4354, 'Korosensei', 'Whether a fish lives in a clear stream or a water ditch, so long as it continues swimming forward, it will grow up beautifully.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', 'Sometimes living can be hard! But it''s only because we''re alive that we can make each other laugh, cry, and be happy!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3004, 'Kurisu Makise', 'It feels like time is passing so quickly. Damn you, Einstein! Your science is crowding in on our kiss! He was right. The passage of time depends entirely on where you''re standing. Relativity Theory... it''s so romantic. But it''s just so tragic too.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Damn. My eyes are naturally drawn in her direction. Is this the unibreastal law of gravitation? Leave it to Sir Isaac Newtit.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'I''m not rude... I just wasn''t taught to politely pretend to be nice to people I can''t stand.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, NULL, 'Kaneki Ken', 'Why is it that the beautiful things are entwined more deeply with death than with life?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3679, 'Yukino Yukinoshita', 'We do not give a starving man a fish. We teach him how to fish and make him independent.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Maybe life has no equal trade, maybe you can give up all you got, and get nothing back. Even if I can''t prove it''s true, I have to try, for your sake, Al.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(62, NULL, 'Rabō', 'Loathe me, o fierce deity. Accept and awaken to your maelstrom of hate...god of calamity, Yato!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(62, 3922, 'Yato', 'Duh!! There''s no such thing as free wish.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3020, 'Sayaka Miki', 'Whenever we pray for someone''s happiness, someone else must be cursed in exchange.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(62, 3922, 'Yato', 'You should treat me with awe and wonder!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(43, 3306, 'Reiko Mikami', 'Talent is a key factor, of course, but without some luck on your side you''re likely to fail.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(43, 3307, 'Yuuya Mochizuki', 'It doesn''t do any good to pretend you can''t see what''s going on.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2729, 'Gildarts Clive', 'I find no fault with you when it comes to standing against your enemy with courage. However, every few have the strength to sheath their sword once it''s out.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4319, 'Kousei Arima', 'Music speaks louder than words.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Water, 35 litres. Carbon, 20 kg. Ammonia, 4 litres. Lime, 1.5 kg. Phosphorus, 800 g. Salt, 250 g. Niter, 100 g. Sulphur, 80 g. Fluoride, 7.5 g. Iron, 5 g. Silicon, 3g. And fifteen other elements. Those are the elements to make an average adult human body. You can buy these elemental ingredients at the market with the pocket money of a child. Humans are made so cheaply.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, 2554, 'Greed', 'Oh, you''re one of those guys... You don''t care if somebody beats the crap out of you, but if someone lays a finger on a family member, you completely freak out. What a waste...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, 'Shōyō Hinata', 'Before my eyes, it blocks my path. A high, high wall. What sort of scene is on the other side? What will I be able to see there? “The view from the top”. A scenery I will never be able to see on my own. But if I’m not alone, then... I might be able to see it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'For some time researchers have understood that moderate stress has beneficial effects. It boosts the immune system for example. Stress motivates and prepares us for action. It compels our body to survive. However, routine psycho pass checks take away the stress from us. There are patients whose stress reaction is so numb, they can’t even recognize the basic stimulation of their senses. Once that happens, it’s a neurological downward spiral, they become like living corpses. Eventually their autonomic nervous system stops working and their vital functions shut down.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'Humans cannot reject temptation. When they are plunged into the depths of despair, likened to hell, they will hold on to anything that may help them escape from the situation they are in, even if it''s merely a spider''s thread, no matter what sort of humans they are.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'What the hell is with everyone telling me to change? I don''t want other people telling me who I am.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(78, NULL, 'Kaneki Ken', 'All the liabilities in this world are due to the inadequacies of the person involved.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(66, 4082, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'I thought that the closer the real and virtual world got, the better the future would be. But the more the boundary between them blurs, the more it starts to trick people.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'Asuna Yūki', 'Sometimes the things that matter the most are right in front of you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1140, 'Yui Ikari', 'As long as one person still lives...it shall be proof eternal that mankind ever existed.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2709, 'Ultear Milkovich', 'I always cursed my own life. The anxiety, anger and hatred I couldn''t suppress. However, when I stopped to look at the sky... I realized just how small I am. There is an endless world spreading before me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Huh? What are you, retarded? I''m super thoughtful. That''s why I stay in the corner and don''t cause anyone trouble.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(66, NULL, 'Asuna Yūki', 'It''s better not to look for more meaning than there is in a name. You''ll lose sight of a lot more than you notice.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(66, NULL, 'Aki Natsuki', 'You did it because you had to protect someone else. In medicine, there are times when you must pick who lives and who dies. Of course, that doesn''t mean it''s okay to kill someone if you have a good reason. But everyone involved has the right to consider the lives they saved. You have the right. You have the right to save yourself, by thinking of the people you''ve saved.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, NULL, 'Tada Banri', 'You got in an accident. You couldn''t do anything afterward. It''s okay to feel ashamed about that. But don''t run from that shame! You have to carry that humiliation with you and live on!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Kuroko No Basket', 'Human minds are not designed to accept negative statements like ‘don’t do this’ or ‘I can’t do that’, ‘we can’t make any mistakes’, ‘failure is not accepted’. These kinds of thoughts only serve to counter productively stress the body and lead to further mistakes. And if just one mistake is made, it turns into a vicious cycle. The more they think about it, the more mistakes will be made, and the more the quality of their plays will drop.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Tatsuya Himuro', 'What are you good at, what do you like… You need to show something that makes people understand who you are.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1793, 'Tama', 'It''s true that your luster may not have been as bright as gold. You only shined on occasion. You were always arguing and fighting. You have wavy hair. You were lazy. You were the king of sexual harassment. You never paid the rent. You paid your people late. Still, you were brighter than the fake glint of gold plating. When you were angry, your entire soul was enraged. When you laughed, you laughed with all your heart. Your silver was much more beautiful.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2931, 'Kasuka Heiwajima', 'I''m always being told that I don''t understand other people''s feelings, and also that I don''t understand what others are thinking. And I agree. But... If you don''t try to stem the tears of a girl crying out for help, you''re the lowest kind of man.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(52, 3665, 'Makoto Isshiki', 'You don''t need a reason to love someone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Okazaki Tomoya', 'If I''m around you, I don''t think I''ll ever be bored.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(81, NULL, 'Jōichirō Yukihira', 'Everyone wants to think like this: "It can''t be helped if I lose against someone with talent". Like that, be it consciously or unconsciously... People put a lid on their hearts. They want to protect their pride, self-esteem... or whatever.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2296, 'Kamina', 'Don''t be distracted by the what-if''s, should-have''s, and if-only''s. The one thing you choose for yourself - that is the truth of your universe.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'If you truly desire greatness, you must first know what makes you weak!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, NULL, 'Might Guy', 'It''s not always possible to do what we want to do, but it''s important to believe in something before you actually do it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', 'We are nothingness. Our head is a void. And without anything around us, we are nothing. We become what we perceive.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3023, 'Junko Kaname', 'That sort of thing happens all the time. You get drunk on your own “correctness,” and the more stubborn you get, the further happiness flies away from you. It’s a bitter pill to swallow.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3684, 'Shizuka Hiratsuka', 'Trying to not hurt others is something you can’t do. People are creatures who hurt others just by existing even if they’re not aware of it. Whether you’re living or dying, you’ll always be hurting someone. Once you’re involved, you’ll hurt someone, and even by not being involved, you might be hurting someone else as well…', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, 'Okabe Rintarou', 'Remembering something that no one else can is a painful thing. You can''t talk to anyone about it. No one will understand you. You''ll be alone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatori', 'If it’s possible for one person to be hurt by another, then it’s possible for that person to be healed by another.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1848, 'Ichi Terakado', 'There’s no such thing as parents who don’t think about their children. But there are few children who understand their parents feelings.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, NULL, 'Dante (Fullmetal Alchemist)', 'People can say there is a balance, a logic that everything happens for a reason... But the truth is far less designed. No matter how hard you work, when you die, you die. Some spend their entire life trying to scratch their way to the top, and still die in poverty. While others are born into wealth without ever working at all. It''s a cruel and random world. And yet the chaos is all so beautiful.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, NULL, 'Luciano Bradley', 'I think being able to openly take away the most important thing people have... "life"... is the best thing that ever happened!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, 3818, 'Nana', 'Life is suffering, pain, and misery.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', 'If there is such a thing like happiness in this world, it should resemble the endless nothingness. Nihility is having nothing and having nothing to lose. If that isn''t happiness... then what is?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4319, 'Kousei Arima', 'I look like I''m suffering, huh? That''s not good... But of course I''d be suffering. I mean, I''m gonna sail in uncharted waters, right? Both, taking on a challenge and creating something. It is painful, but it''s fulfilling.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4321, 'Kaori Miyazono', 'We’re all afraid, you know.. to get up on stage. Maybe you’ll mess up. Maybe they’ll totally reject you. Even so, you grit your teeth and get up on stage anyway. Something compels us… moves us to play music.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Tachibana Marika', 'My, my! Do I really need to spell it out for you? There is nothing that you can acquire without making a move on your own. It''s the same with romance - your only hope is to be more aggressive.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Midorima Shintarou', 'In the world of sports, quickness doesn''t necessarily mean having the fastest time. It could also mean the acceleration from zero to maximum speed or the deceleration from maximum speed to zero. This is known as agility.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'When boys get to a certain age, family becomes a bother. That''s how they become independent.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Mr. 2 Bon Clay', 'Even in the depths of Hell... blooms a beautiful flower of friendship... leaving its petals as mementos... bobbing back and forth on the waves... may it one day bloom once more...the Okama Way.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3430, 'Daiki Aomine', 'I won''t say you''ll definitely be able to do it if you don''t give up. But if you do give up, then there''ll definitely be nothing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Life is too bitter, so coffee, at least, should be sweet…', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6391, 'Ban', 'Let me tell you something... Real sin is something you can never atone for.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3910, 'Tet', 'In reality, the least interesting answer is usually the correct one.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, NULL, 'William A. Zeppeli', 'What is "Courage"? Courage is owning your fear!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'Dying means to be gone. And what goes, is not your pain, but your existence itself. But in your mind, you think that you’d have a sense of “nothing” after you die. How can you call that “nothing”? In other words, you don''t even have an idea of what death is really like.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'A life with no changes can’t be called life. You can only call it experience.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2471, 'Taiga Aisaka', 'I hate waiting, but if waiting means being able to be with you I''ll wait for as long as forever.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3421, 'Taiga Kagami', 'With out strong opponents, living isn''t fun. It''s perfect if I can''t win.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2688, 'Gray Fullbuster', 'The pain of getting hit, the frustration of loosing, the joy of winning, all of that. They''ve been driven into this body, fists, and this head. It becomes my strength in the next fight. All of my battles up to now, those memories, they are all of my power.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'So, yeah. Strong animals don’t gather in herds or anything like that. Do they not know the expression “a lone wolf”? Cats are cute and wolves are cool. In other words, loners are cute and cool.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, NULL, 'Fullmetal Alchemist', 'Men are not men on the battlefield. We turn into some other creature. You can do the cruelest things... It doesn''t even matter if it''s an order or not. To protect yourself, your mind shuts out any emotions you have. It''s like a steel door. But once the war is over, you can''t keep it closed forever.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', 'Rejection is a part of any man’s life. If you can’t accept and move past rejection, or at least use it as writing material - you’re not a real man.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(78, 4567, 'Kishou Arima', 'Events that happen in this world, are a continuous series of trifling things, and within those myriad pieces of puzzles, there is always a fragment that leads to the truth.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4176, 'Tatsumi', 'Everyone has their own reasons to fight! Sometimes, you have to settle it yourself or there''s no way forward!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Hyuuga Junpei', '“Your hard work will be rewarded.” What kind of idiot came up with that nonsense?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', 'It’s because we help out when they’re in trouble that we can count on them to come running when we need it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4178, 'Mine', 'No one would help me. And that''s when I understood... That only I could help myself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Ironic, isn''t it? How people without truly important things know about them more than those who have them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Kotarō Katsura', 'But I suppose it’s not so bad that an old friend is the same as ever.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2782, 'Ichiya Vandalay Kotobuki', 'Everyone makes mistakes, but then you recover. Look at all of the friends you have here who adore you. It would be difficult for anything to change that. If you keep that in mind, you should be able to get back on your feet any number of times.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, NULL, 'Tada Banri', 'Why do you still want to be my friend? Is it because you feel comfortable being with me? Because I understand your awkward and useless self, and yet still love you? Quit acting so spoiled. When you rejected me, you lost the right to want those things!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, NULL, 'Hayashida Nana', 'You were like a bomb, one wrong move and I might have lost you again.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, NULL, 'Tada Banri', 'The Present is ending. Here, countless versions of our past selves are always crying, laughing, falling in love, getting hurt, joking around, feeling happy and suffering. These feelings are born all the time and in the next moment, they became the past and die. It''s over now. This is the end, but the truth is everyone''s time is like that. Right after it''s born, every moment becomes the past and dies.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, NULL, 'Kaga Kouko', 'Worrying about rejection may be the same as rejecting yourself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, NULL, 'Kaga Kouko', 'If a person you love doesn''t love you back, you''re worthless. That''s what I always told myself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, NULL, 'Kaga Kouko', 'I want to spend a lot more time with you! But I don’t want you to think I’m annoying, so I’m holding myself back. When you’re away, I always wonder what you’re doing and thinking.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, NULL, 'Tada Banri', 'I may be unreliable, and I may not be able to do anything, but I’m here. I’ll always be with you. I’ll be always by your side.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, NULL, 'Tada Banri', 'When you want to scream or cry, I’ll be there. I’ll share your feelings and stay with you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, NULL, 'Tada Banri', 'Even if you think I’m a nuisance, no matter where you go, I’ll find you. I’ll always be listening for your voice. When the rain falls, when the wind blows, when the flowers scatter, when shadow looms. In every sign, I’ll search for your voice.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, NULL, 'Kaga Kouko', 'I don’t want to waste a single second or meter. From your first step and second of the day, I want to be with you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, 3818, 'Nana', 'You meet someone and then part ways. It’s a natural part of the human experience. No one can promise they’ll be together forever.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(66, 4082, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'No one dies alone. When someone dies, the part of them that lives inside someone else also dies. You already live inside me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'I don’t believe in crap like coincidence, fate, or destiny.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'There are two things people fear... those are death and embarrassment. Those who try to overcome death are just idiots, but I won''t laugh at those who try to overcome their embarrassment. I like those kind of idiots.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Yoshino Yūsuke', 'He realized that he had lost sight of something important. No matter what turn he took he should have kept singing. Even if his songs couldn’t save the world, he could still sing songs for her. Don’t ever lose sight of what’s important to you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Saiga Jouji', 'Charisma has three points. The nature of a hero or prophet, the ability to simply make you feel good when you’re around them, and the intelligence to eloquently talk about all sorts of things.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3378, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'All this time, I seriously thought that it''s better to die than to live your life alone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(66, NULL, 'Konno Yuuki', 'You hit me with everything you had, so I decided I could trust you with everything I had.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'You see, for as long as we draw breath into our lungs, we shall keep hope alive inside our hearts.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3144, 'Killua Zoldyck', 'Not killing people is really hard. Clean living is tough.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'There''s probably no one who''s more of a realist than the unpopular loner. I have lived my life with the Three Nevers of the Unpopular: Never to hold (hope), Never to open (your heart), and Never to treasure (sweet words).', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nagato', 'If you don''t share someone''s pain. You can never understand them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3679, 'Yukino Yukinoshita', 'If all you''re good for is breathing in and out, then even an AC unit is more useful than you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'It''s meaningless to just live, and it''s meaningless to just fight. I want to win.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 168, 'Pain', 'Love breeds sacrifice... which in turn breeds hatred. Then you can know pain.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Fukuda Nanjirou', 'There are two kinds of people in this world. Those who eat the things they hate first, and those who eat them last.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(13, 1596, 'Chisa Yomoda', 'There was no reason for me to stay in the real world any longer. In the real world, it didn''t matter if I was there or not. When I realized that, I was no longer afraid of losing my body.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2, NULL, 'Johann Liebert', 'How weak the mind is when it wants to forget. Maybe you didn''t forget. Maybe you''re lying. Is it a lie you tell everyone around you, or perhaps a lie you tell yourself?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, 3522, 'Akane Tsunemori', 'Society doesn''t always do what''s right. That''s exactly why we ourselves must live virtuous lives.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1143, 'Kaworu Nagisa', 'Humans constantly feel pain in their hearts. Because the heart is so sensitive to pain, humans also feel that to live is to suffer.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(13, NULL, 'Serial Experiments Lain', 'History is not merely a linear collection of points that we pass through on a timeline. They are connected by a line. No, perhaps it is more accurate to say that they are made to connect.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4145, 'Shuu Tsukiyama', 'Isn''t it arrogant to put a price on whether life is "higher" or "lower", Kaneki? We are just bags of meat. The weak bow down and the strong devour them. Rather, if you compared them to all living things, it''s humans who have shaved away the most lives. We are different than them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4145, 'Shuu Tsukiyama', 'You don''t need to blame yourself just because you''ve hurt someone, just like when you''re walking you can''t really blame yourself to crush some ants... that''s what being stronger ones means.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'You need to accept the fact that you''re not the best and have all the will to strive to be better than anyone you face.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'It''s not a sense of justice. Figuring out difficult cases is my hobby. If you measured good and evil deeds by current laws, I would be responsible for many crimes. The same way you all like to solve mysteries and riddles, or clear video games more quickly. For me too, it''s simply prolonging something I enjoy doing. That''s why I only take on cases that pique my interest. It''s not justice at all. And if it means being able to clear a case, I don''t play fair, I''m a dishonest, cheating human being who hates losing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4145, 'Shuu Tsukiyama', 'I''m not going to protect you by being your shield or armor, but I''ll be the dagger hidden below your pillow.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4178, 'Mine', 'People who abuse power they were born into piss me off more than anything else.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1130, 'Shinji Ikari', 'I still don''t know where to find happiness. But I''ll continue to think about whether it''s good to be here... whether it was good to have been born. But in the end, it''s just realizing the obvious over and over again. Because I am myself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(13, NULL, 'Taro', 'The truth has power because it''s the truth. And because it is the truth, that makes it just. It''s persuasive, isn''t it? Don''t you want truth like that?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, NULL, 'Kaneki Ken', 'My severe injuries had healed and the sweet taste of blood coated my mouth. I kept walking, my goal vague...trying to dispel the building unease in my chest... Upon entering an open area was the scent of rotting flowers and in the middle of the flowerbed, he stood... Without anyone saying a thing, without his name given, like an unsolved puzzle falling into place by itself, just by seeing that figure, I--understood exactly who I faced. The CCG''s reaper. The undefeated ghoul investigator. A cold, vivid gaze. There, stood the God of Death. Why was it that I was seeing beauty in death rather than life? Strangely, I thought he was beautiful... Disoriented, I had failed to comprehend the scene before my eyes. It was not anything like flowers but a large amount of "Death". Had he done this alone?... It''s a lie... Koma...Irimi...After all that... No matter how I tried to rouse my will to fight with hatred, more than sorrow, more than rage, the emotion that arose within me was despai', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(13, 1587, 'Lain Iwakura', 'No matter where you go, everyone''s connected.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4151, 'Yoshimura', '...The act of taking is equally evil. We, from the moment of birth, continue to take. Food, connections, even fellow blood. Living to utmost. Continuing to slaughter, kill, take. Life is to constantly sin. Life is evil itself. I am aware I am evil... And so are you all. Now, come kill me. And I shall do the same!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4144, 'Kureo Mado', 'You only need a strong will and a clear purpose.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'I lie all the time. Who cares if you know something, but you say you don''t? Forcing something out of someone without permission is worse.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'Being alone is more painful than getting hurt.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Saul Jaguar D', 'There is no such thing as being born into the world to be alone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, 'Tetsuya Kuroko', 'When you come to hate something you liked it is incredibly painful.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, 'Tetsuya Kuroko', 'If we give our best in something we love, we''ll enjoy the victories from the bottom of our hearts.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'If I''m protecting someone, I won''t let her die, and if I''m attacking, I''ll cut you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 329, 'Sanji', 'Don''t start a fight if you can''t end it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2688, 'Gray Fullbuster', 'I''ll do what I want till the end. Cut me down if you want.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'I like myself. I have never once hated myself. My high specs, my half-decent looks, my pessimistic, realist point of view... I don''t hate any of it at all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 140, 'Sasuke Uchiha', 'Tears and rain, fall down on my face, my body is unable to stay yet my heart is unwilling to leave.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1793, 'Tama', 'If I were to survive, but couldn''t protect what was important to me, then I might as well be dead.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Kuroko No Basket', '* The Zone * In this state of extreme focus, all unnecessary thoughts disappear and the athlete becomes absorbed in his play. Only those who have practiced and practiced earn the right to stand before the door, and it only opens unpredictably. It is the ultimate domain, open only to the chosen.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Sakagami Tomoyo', 'I''ve already decided. Getting good grades and listening to teachers can take me somewhere high and far away, but what if that''s not where I want to go? Right here, by your side, Tomoya, is the only place I want to be.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2642, 'Yui Hirasawa', 'I’m scared of hot and cold. In winter, I hide under the heating table and in summer, I lie in bed and do nothing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2536, 'Tsubasa Hanekawa', 'I don’t know everything, I just know what I know.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Sunohara Youhei', 'You''re trying to stay unscarred, aren''t you? If you''ve come this far, you''ll have to hurt someone. The more time you take to decide, the deeper and more it''ll hurt. For all of you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'I will fight for my friends than watching them get hurt, I will fight for those I love.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 205, 'Tobirama Senju', 'Grown-ups are idiots. If they really want to bring an end to this endless fighting, they need to sit down with one another and reach a truce.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Dragon', 'There can be no happiness in a world where the undesirables are thrown away.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'Feelings can be controlled, but tears never lie.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1143, 'Kaworu Nagisa', 'Humans cannot create anything out of nothingness. Humans cannot accomplish anything without holding onto something. After all, humans are not gods.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'I''ve been around longer than you have, kid. And I''ve seen my share of troubles. You''re not the only one who knows what it''s like to lose somebody. It looks like neither of us has led a charming life, have we? Still, it''s not that bad. At least you and I have been lucky enough to find new comrades to help fill the void.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Akashi Seijuurou', 'We cannot be satisfied until we have eliminated all others. It has nothing to do with reason. It is instinct.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, 'Tetsuya Kuroko', 'No matter how many more points you have at the end of the game, if you''re not happy, that''s not a victory.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, 3549, 'Kouzaburou Touma', 'There''s a limit to the amount of pleasure a person can obtain. But pleasure brought out by intellect is infinite.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'Don''t break anyone''s heart, they only have one. Break their bones, they have 206.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3385, 'Keiko Ayano', 'It''s impossible to work hard for something you don''t enjoy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2, 139, 'Rosso', 'Killing''s easier than you think; you just have to forget how sweet the sugar is.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Walls are an unavoidable part of youth.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', 'Laziness is the mother of all bad habits. But ultimately she is a mother and we should respect her.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'The concept of lateness being evil is wrong in the first place... The police don''t mobilize until after an accident happens, and it''s standard for heroes to show up late. But would anyone condemn them for being late? So, speaking paradoxically, lateness is justice.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4133, 'Ayato Kirishima', 'The world runs on power. Everything is determined by the superior power. You are weak. That is why you lose.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'You''ve underestimated me, snow woman. When you thought you couldn''t beat me, you should have run. Of course, there are things that I don''t wanna cut. But... let me ask you something.
Have you ever seen a fierce animal you were sure would never bite? Because I haven''t.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', '(To Ichigo Kurosaki before getting shot point-blank by his Cero) I see. So you show no mercy. Just like a true Hollow. I care not. Defeated by you as I stand, my existence holds no further meaning. Do it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'Humans are easily tempted. When they are poised on the edge of hellish despair, and a spider-thin thread of salvation presents itself, they will invariably grasp it. No matter the human.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, 2545, 'Edward Elric', 'The cycle of life goes only one direction, not even alchemy can change that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1143, 'Kaworu Nagisa', 'Are you afraid of other people? I know that by keeping others at a distance you avoid a betrayal of your trust, but you must endure the loneliness. Man can never completely erase this sadness, because all men are fundamentally alone. Pain is something man must carry in his heart, and since the heart feels pain so easily, some believe that life is pain.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Akashi Seijuurou', 'Winning is everything in this world. The victors write history. The losers are wiped from it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2642, 'Yui Hirasawa', 'To the me back then, you don’t need to worry. You’ll soon find something you can do, something you can set your heart on.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, NULL, 'Fullmetal Alchemist: Brotherhood', 'The beginning is what comes after the ending. Carve out with your own hands a future, filled with hope.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, NULL, 'Truth', 'Despair to the ones who become swelled with pride.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, 2562, 'Olivier Mira Armstrong', 'Obeying a superior you can''t even believe doesn''t make you loyal. You''re just fooling yourself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, 3522, 'Akane Tsunemori', 'It is not society that determines people''s futures.  It is people who determine society''s future.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'But the mass we call "world" keeps turning, ignoring our individual desires.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2362, 'Suzaku Kururugi', 'To desire some results, one must take actions.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Shut up! I did what I had to do. People lie to survive. No one is blameless.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2365, 'C.C.', 'Death may be my only freedom.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Makoto Hanamiya', 'Break them and they''re all just trash.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Reo Mibuchi', 'It''s not about doing what it takes to win. Sei-chan told me before "Winning is just like breathing". Victory isn''t something that Sei-chan seeks. It''s a natural part of his life. It''s a basic bodily function.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3421, 'Taiga Kagami', 'It’s not the time to be scared. Of course it’s better if the opponent is strong rather than weak, right!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Midorima Shintarou', 'Don’t you know the saying ‘Man proposes; God disposes’ ? First, you do your best and then fate will decide how it will turn out.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, 'Tetsuya Kuroko', 'There’s no meaning if you win alone!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, 'Tetsuya Kuroko', 'Even if other people think it’s meaningless, it’s disgusting for me to quit, even when the possibility is 0. Therefore, I will never... Give up !', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Kise Ryouta', 'If we have time to get upset, we should have used that time to move on… Even if just one step forward!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4136, 'Uta', 'We need to have a mask that we never take off.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, NULL, 'Fullmetal Alchemist: Brotherhood', 'If it''s a fight between a man and man, choose the path you believe is right. Only a fool would stand indecisive after being frightened at the thought of being soiled by the mud.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'When a man faces fear, his soul is tested. What he was born to seek... what he was born to achieve... his true nature will become clear.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, NULL, 'Fullmetal Alchemist: Brotherhood', 'Memories. They are recollections of the heart. If those who are not human come to possess memories, people begin to fear the result.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, NULL, 'Fullmetal Alchemist: Brotherhood', 'If you only feel fear after knowing both the abilities of your enemy and yourself, flee with your tail between your legs. However, if you''re going to stand firm and fight with a focused mind, you will definitely have victory within reach.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, 2560, 'Ling Yao', 'Friends are connected by heart! You can''t just rinse off something that''s stained on your soul!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, NULL, 'Homunculus (Character)', 'Humans are inconvenient creatures, aren''t they? The species can''t live on unless they all create a community and expand.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, NULL, 'Scar''s Brother', 'If many negative emotions gather, they will end up influencing the entire world. But on the other hand, it is also possible to gather positive emotions and lead the world in that direction.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, 3562, 'Sorata Kanda', 'I haven''t done anything yet. Getting depressed and losing confidence is way too egotistical.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, NULL, 'Fullmetal Alchemist: Brotherhood', '"Obey the ones with power". That''s the true meaning of the law of the jungle. If you don''t wish to be bound by that, obtain greater power. Because there''s always times one must fight power with power.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, 2551, 'Roy Mustang', 'There''s no telling when this war will end. No matter how many troops the country deploys, the desert just absorbs them like water. We suffer, conquer, and what''s left? Nothing but sand.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, NULL, 'Fullmetal Alchemist: Brotherhood', 'If you''ll cower at the sight of the great foe before you, leave at once, coward. If you''ll lose the strength you believed in, then fall to the ground, weakling.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, 2560, 'Ling Yao', 'The king exists for his people. Without his people, there is no king.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, 3562, 'Sorata Kanda', 'There''s no point in dwelling on the past, so I''m trying to think of the future instead.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4179, 'Lubbock', 'It isn''t like I understand what you want. You want to change the world, huh? I understand, everyone feels that way... But it doesn''t give you the right to treat other''s lifes like toys. You can''t just destroy what you want!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4319, 'Kousei Arima', 'Even in the depths of the darkest oceans, some light always pierces through.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4327, 'Hiroko Seto', 'When you say you "can''t hear the sound", doesn''t it really mean you "aren''t restrained by the sound"? Rather than the sound you hear with your ears, an image inside you is boiling up from the depths of yourself and taking over without you even knowing. The sound inside, the landscape in your heart, your wishes, a sound loaded with your thoughts; didn''t you feel it, even for a moment? "Not being able to hear the sound." That is a gift.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4319, 'Kousei Arima', 'You know, I discovered something. Everyone has something... Something deep inside their hearts. For some, it might have been enmity. For others, admiration. Wishes, a craving for the spotlight, feelings that one wants to deliver, feelings for one''s mother. Everyone was supported by their own feelings. I realize now that, perhaps, no one can stand alone on stage.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4321, 'Kaori Miyazono', 'By exchanging notes, you get to know one another, to understand one another. As if your souls were connected and your hearts were overlapping. It''s a conversation through instruments. A miracle that creates harmony. In that moment, music transcends words.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4321, 'Kaori Miyazono', 'Didn''t you know... girls are greedy?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4327, 'Hiroko Seto', 'Defiance toward parents is an establishment of one''s self; it''s a sign of independence.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4327, 'Hiroko Seto', 'As a musician, in the process of learning from a teacher, your differences breed a sense of discomfort which you should cherish. It''s because of those differences that we have individuality.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4179, 'Lubbock', 'There is no way to train your heart to be invulnerable.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, 3559, 'Mashiro Shiina', 'It''s more interesting when the future''s uncertain.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4181, 'Bulat', 'You won''t survive if you just let your boiling blood dictate your actions.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, 2551, 'Roy Mustang', 'One human only has the power to do so much. That''s why I''m going to protect...even if it''s just a handful of them...the ones most important to me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, NULL, 'Watari Ryouta', 'Setbacks are inevitable to superstars. Adversity is what separates the good from the great. After all, stars can only shine during the night.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3422, 'Riko Aida', 'When one thing ends, another begins.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4321, 'Kaori Miyazono', 'Music is freedom.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4319, 'Kousei Arima', 'The more I concentrate, the more I get consumed by my performance. The sounds I play fade away from my reach, tangling up like flowers seized by the spring wind and vanish.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, 3083, 'Gilgamesh', 'To unite dreams beneath a banner of conquest. I praise your efforts. But, warriors... did you not understand? That all dreams must disappear when the dreamer wakes. Every last one of them. Therefore, it was inevitable that I would stand in your way. King of Conquerors, know the end of your eternal dream. I, myself, shall show you harsh reality. Now awaken, Ea! A worthy stage has been set for you! Look up and behold... Enuma Elish!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(66, NULL, 'Konno Yuuki', 'There are things you can only share with someone by fighting. For instance, how serious you are.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'Asuna Yūki', 'Life isn''t just doing things for yourself. It''s possible to live in such a way that other people''s happiness, makes you happy too.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(66, NULL, 'Asada Shino', 'If it''s just a game, at least be brave enough to run towards the guns and die!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'If we are to die one day, wouldn''t it be better to have no regrets?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Okazaki Tomoya', 'If you feel like crying you should not hold back your tears. You should let it all out while you still can - because when you get bigger sometimes you can''t cry even if you have something to cry about.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Sakagami Tomoyo', 'Time and titles do not matter in the bonds between people.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Furukawa Nagisa', 'Meeting you was the best thing that ever happened to me. You made me so happy. I don’t want you to be lost or afraid or anything like that. From here on out, I know things might be hard sometimes. But no matter what may await, please don’t regret meeting me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1986, 'Misa Amane', 'I can’t even imagine a world without Light.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Armin Arlelt', 'We''re going to explore the outside world someday, right? Far beyond these walls, there''s flaming water, land made of ice, and fields of sand spread wide. It''s the world my parents wanted to go to.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Armin Arlelt', 'People are crazy for believing that these walls will protect us forever. Even though the walls have been intact for the past 100 years, there’s nothing that can guarantee they won’t be broken down today…', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Sakuya Tougane', 'My role is to darken souls, even pure ones, until they become pitch black. By doing so, you can stay beautiful and shine bright, Mother. I do everything because of my love for you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'You disappointed me. So I have to give you a punishment. Regret your helplessness and feel despair.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'What are humans’ desires? What I think the most troublesome desire is the desire for attention. It’s the source of jealousy and relationship problems, too.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4319, 'Kousei Arima', 'But I wasn''t slacking at all. I practiced till I passed out. I gave my all. And if I still turned in a sloppy performance after all that, then... That''s who I am now. It''s the current me, playing with everything I''ve got.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Furukawa Nagisa', 'If you can move on, then you should.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Furukawa Nagisa', 'Nothing can stay unchanged. Fun things… Happy things… They can’t possibly remain the same.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Ichinose Kotomi', 'The day before yesterday, I saw a rabbit. Yesterday, it was a deer. And today, it’s you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4181, 'Bulat', 'The hot blood that flows through my body... is not something that can be suppressed by other people!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, 3565, 'Chihiro Sengoku', 'If you forced someone to do something they didn’t want to do, they’d just end up hating life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, 3563, 'Jin Mitaka', 'You need to decide where you belong before anything else. If you can do that, you can decide what you want to do.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', '<About Ciel> He turns his back towards the light without hesitation. That figure that charges into the abyss at a dignified pace. How beautiful and foolish.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(66, NULL, 'Konno Yuuki', 'I always say what exactly what I''m feeling, and if they don''t like me, that''s fine! It doesn''t change the fact that I was close to their hearts.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, NULL, 'Kaneki Ken', 'It''s better to be hurt than to hurt others. Nice people can be happy with just that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3378, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'The main reason I got stronger was so I’d be able to survive.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Sakuya Tougane', 'My will is society''s will. My eyes are society''s eyes. Since you vowed to respect the law, you cannot deny me... no matter how much you despise latent criminals.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, 3550, 'Jouji Saiga', 'If the being casting judgment is perfect, then it has to judge itself as well.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'Monk Zuikou', 'Freedom, isn’t something earned through suffering or pushing yourself. You must accept yourself just as you are and live according to the flow of things; that is true freedom.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'If comrades that you trust gather around you, hope can take physical form and become visible. That`s what I believe...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, NULL, 'Kaneki Ken', 'I''m begging you, don''t make me a killer!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, NULL, 'Luciano Bradley', 'Do you know the truth of the battlefield? Kill a man normally, and it''s considered a crime. But kill many on the battlefield and you become a hero!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3679, 'Yukino Yukinoshita', 'People aren''t all perfect. They''re weak, ugly, and they get jealous and try to bring others down. Oddly enough, the better you are, the harder it is to live. That''s why I''m going to change this world and the people in it...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6403, 'Merlin', 'When some things contradict each other, you should look at the opposite side of everything. And when the meanings behind the seemingly unnatural actions are made clear, a completely different answer might be reached... Justice can become evil. Reality can become an illusion. Meaning can be found in something that appears meaningless. Think. And find the answer for yourselves. A human ceases to be once he or she stops thinking.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3679, 'Yukino Yukinoshita', 'I think, if you want to improve yourself, you should challenge your own limits.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'It’s hard to forget someone who gave you so much to remember.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, NULL, 'Bismarck Waldstein', 'War is merely one method of diplomacy. However, it is the least efficient one.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2394, 'Charles Zi Britannia', 'Only fools wage war.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2374, 'Shirley Fenette', 'Lelou? I''m glad that I could talk to you in the end. You know? When I got my memories back, I was so scared... A fake teacher... Friends with no memories... Everyone was... lying to me... It was as if... the whole world was watching over me... Lelou, you''ve been fighting... all by yourself against this world... All by yourself... So that''s why... I wanted to become the one thing truthful to you... I love you, Lelou. Even when I knew you killed my father... I couldn''t... bring myself to hate you. Even when you tried to make me forget everything... I still fell... in love with you again... Even when my memories were altered... I still fell in love again... No matter how many times I''m reborn... I''m sure I''ll... fall in love with you again, Lelou... This... is fate, right? So, it''s okay, right, Lelou? That I fall in love with you when I''m reborn... No matter... how many times... I''ll... fall in... love with you...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'Throughout all of history, no wise king has ever forced his army to obey him through oppression. People will only truly fight for what is right. And there is only one thing that is truly right in this world! The one true, unchanging righteousness in the world is... cuteness! Cute makes right! All our needs, desires, and instincts seek cuteness, and it is for cuteness that we will give everything we have! That''s just the way men are!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4181, 'Bulat', 'You''ll have some painful, despair-ridden experiences. In fact, most of them will be tragic. But we chose to walk this path. We''ll take on the dirty work. And change the world. After we finish, we can disappear.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4185, 'Wave', 'Protecting the powerless is simply a soldier''s duty!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3386, 'Yui', 'Everyone smiles, when they are with you. Please... from now on, go and help people in my place. Share your happiness with them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3378, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'You stole this world and it''s people. You''re a king of thieves, alone upon a stolen throne!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2688, 'Gray Fullbuster', 'If  you are lookin'' back all the time, you''ll never get ahead!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(54, 3710, 'Rika Suzuki', 'If people want to, they can become angels or demons themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(54, 3710, 'Rika Suzuki', 'There''s no way of telling what people will do when their entire world gets turned upside down. There are people who selfishly take advantage  of the chaos and nice people who try to help others before even worrying about themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(54, NULL, 'Ashiya Shirou', 'Sometimes it''s necessary to courageously retreat.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(54, 3705, 'Chiho Sasaki', 'I fell for you out of my own free will. So if I ever fall out of love, that''ll be my own decision too.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(54, NULL, 'Emi Yusa', 'The peaceful world I''m fighting for is one where everyone has a smile on their face, not one where I have to pretend I didn''t see you make my friend cry. I don''t think that kind of peace is worth fighting for. And I don''t think it''s worth making sacrifices to achieve it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1316, 'Kurama', 'Regret is the domain of those who have earned the right to look back at the past. All I have is shame.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Okazaki Tomoya', 'The city is changing. Our surroundings, and even ourselves. And then one day, just about everything will change…', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Fujibayashi Ryou', 'Please don’t apologize. If you did, and I forgave you, then it’d be like it was all a lie. I want to hold those memories we had dear. The fun times… The painful times… All of it. So please, don’t apologize.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Sunohara Youhei', 'You’re the spore of a flower. You’ll be going on a trip, taken away by the wind. To go to new places and meet new people. You shouldn’t always rely on your sister. Even if you’re apart, your bonds still remain. That’s what family is.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Sagara Misae', 'If you get all worked up yourself, you’ll always get someone who’ll rebel. Being too eager brings negative results.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Yoshino Yūsuke', 'What’s important is not losing sight of your path.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4178, 'Mine', 'Only I can help myself, and in the future, I can make up for all my misfortunes and change the world into a place where there''s no irrational discrimination and that''s why there''s no way in hell that I can die here!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2380, 'Diethard Ried', 'At times the life of a single man is worth more than that of a million, I thought that''d be common sense to a soldier.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, NULL, 'Hisoka', 'Right now, I''m letting you live. And I''ll continue to keep you alive... until you''ve grown enough to become worth killing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(52, NULL, 'Satone Shichimiya', 'The moment you say a word of parting, you''ve already parted. So long as you and I are both somewhere in this world, we haven’t parted. So long as you don’t say it, you haven’t parted.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Akashi Seijuurou', 'What a laughable attempt. You should just stay where you are, groveling at my feet.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, 'Tetsuya Kuroko', 'I am the shadow that has overcome the light.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3183, 'Meruem', 'Violence is the greatest power of the world!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'That’s right. I’m nice. After everything that has happened in my life, I still haven’t gone after anyone or anything in revenge. If I were normal I would have destroyed the world by now. In a sense it makes me a savior of sorts.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Knowing more means having more shit to deal with, you know.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, NULL, 'Solf J. Kimblee', 'Good… death is chasing me. Ones who kill are also chased by death, always living alongside death… Jobs that risk one’s soul are truly beautiful! How rewarding… my battlefield!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Maiko Shuu', 'Seeing them as the same is wrong. It''s a touchy subject, but the weight of something you bear with your own power and with someone else''s are different.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Maiko Shuu', 'In the end, mustering the courage to confess is up to the people

concerned.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, NULL, 'Gensei', 'If a person continues killing, their heart changes into that of a demon without them even noticing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, NULL, 'Gensei', 'Old, young, man, woman,  a life is a life. Sinner or Saint it makes no difference at all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4180, 'Sheele', 'No matter how many good deeds you perform, your past sins cannot be erased.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4184, 'Kurome', 'To kill the one you love... If someone else will do it anyway, I''d rather do it myself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3144, 'Killua Zoldyck', 'Nanika, will you forgive me for being a bad big brother?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, 'Shōyō Hinata', 'Once my stomach settles down... You better be prepared, ''cause we''ll really give you something to cry about in the mat... ugh... ch... uughh...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, 'Shōyō Hinata', 'It''s true that I''m not very tall. However! I can jump!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3981, 'Yuu Nishinoya', 'I kept the ball in the air, it’s not your place to give up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2693, 'Mirajane Strauss', 'Magic is not meant to be used to kill people... but without power we can''t even protect the ones we love...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3977, 'Tobio Kageyama', 'You don’t win alone. That’s just how it is.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, 'Shōyō Hinata', 'The future belongs to those who believe in the beauty of their dreams.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3985, 'Kiyoko Shimizu', 'Little by little, what you’ve begun will naturally become important to you. What you need at the start is a little bit of curiosity.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'You came without fear. Don''t have any regrets, no matter what happens. This is the duel you wanted.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2910, 'Shizuo Heiwajima', 'You just went for my head, didn''t you? You know you could kill someone by hitting a vital spot in their head, right? If you know this, then you were trying to kill me, right? So whatever I do next is what you deserve, right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'Because they saved me from myself, they rescued me from my loneliness. They were the first to accept me for who I am. They''re my friends.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2819, 'Mavis Vermillion', 'They all grow up, the youths that are going to live in this era. Go forward, youths. Like a wind on a field. Your burning blood, sweat, and tears... are as beautiful as a parasol. Show no fear, youths.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2720, 'Wendy Marvell', 'The fact that I’m standing here means that I’m resolved to fight for my guild. I do not need your sympathy. As long as I’m still standing, please come at me with all you’ve got! Please do!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Furukawa Akio', 'It’s natural that men have things they need to protect.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2663, 'Kanade Tachibana', 'Truly and deeply, thank you for giving, my life to me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Furukawa Nagisa', 'You shouldn’t stop like that. If you can move forward, then you should.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3440, 'Teppei Kiyoshi', 'Team isn''t just something to be protected. A team also protects you. We don''t support each because we are a team. We are a team because we support each other.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4175, 'Akame', 'As the survivors, we carry the feelings of those who''ve passed away on our shoulders.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'It''s kinda scary how much people trust me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4178, 'Mine', 'Wrong or not, I''ll follow my own path!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Furukawa Nagisa', 'I, Okazaki Nagisa, will no longer cry. No matter what painful things I face, I’ll hang in there and overcome it. But, I might cry during moments of happiness. I hope that you can get along… with someone like me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(70, 4301, 'Five', 'Playing a game by yourself is boring. You need a loser to crush so badly they can''t recover.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(13, 1587, 'Lain Iwakura', 'What isn''t remembered never happened.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(43, NULL, 'Teshigawara Naoya', 'Don''t mess with things that don''t exist! It''s dangerous!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Fujibayashi Kyou', 'Isn’t there something strange in becoming friends because you’re asked? Friends aren’t given; you’re supposed to make them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Okazaki Tomoya', 'What are you so hesitant about? It’s your dream, isn’t it? It’s right in front of you and you’re wavering? You gotta be reckless, and take whatever you can!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', 'The difference between stupidity and genius, is that genius has its limits.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Okazaki Tomoya', 'You are who you are. You have to do what you can.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, 5049, 'Saitama', 'The true power of us human beings is that we can change ourselves on our own.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'Sometimes, the questions are complicated - and the answers are simple.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2943, 'Takumi Usui', 'Love, passion, why do we get caught up by such troublesome feelings? The mind couldn''t ever get things straight, and you lose control to know what is sensible. Deep down it''s all so vexing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kyo', 'If you love someone, they could make you sad. They could even make you feel lonely sometimes. But, that someone can also make you happier than you''ll ever be.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2365, 'C.C.', 'People... humans are the being who look for happiness. What the Britannian boy, Lelouch, wanted to have was nothing but a small happiness. It''s nothing special. At least at the root of his motives, there were only humble wishes that were simply natural to any human. Who could ever disclaim such dreams and such vows? Who could ever have the right to do that? However, whoever you might be, without choice, you have to deal with others and with the world, and have yourself be regulated and set down. Therefore, in the face of the world''s wills, your personal speculations are so ephemeral they can''t help being overwhelmed. Sins and punishments, destiny and judgment. What stands in front of Lelouch is the past he brought forth by himself. Is it a hatred resulting from the fact that humans are humans? Nonetheless, for now, we should be grateful... Yes, at least, to the fact that humans are the beings who look for happiness.
A remaining piece of hope, a faint sign of wishes will be bo', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4146, 'Yakumo Oomori', 'Doing what one likes is the right of the powerful.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(43, 3301, 'Mei Misaki', 'There are no guarantees. But if there’s a chance it could help everyone avoid the calamity, isn’t it worth it? It’s sad when people die.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(43, 3306, 'Reiko Mikami', 'But if that’s what you want to do, you might as well try. It’s just pathetic to give up on something before you even give it a shot.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(43, 3306, 'Reiko Mikami', 'That’s important, isn’t it? Whether you look good or pathetic in your own eyes.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, 3048, 'Noriko Paku', 'I don’t like someone who makes a fool out of earnest people.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, 'Fujimoto Shirou', 'Little fool, demons exist, all right. They’re inside our hearts.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, NULL, 'Kaneki Ken', 'If you were to write a story with me in the lead role, it would certainly be... a tragedy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4135, 'Rize Kamishiro', 'There are times when you have to give up on one thing to preserve the other. Your mother couldn''t. That isn''t kindness. That''s just being weak.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4148, 'Kishou Arima', 'Sometimes good people make bad choices. It doesn''t mean they are bad people. It means they''re human.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(39, NULL, 'Tetsudō Hisakawa', 'Goodbyes aren''t a one-sided affair!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(35, 2984, 'Kouta Hirano', 'Humans don’t see what they don’t want to see. No one wants to be put down. That’s why people do nothing even when they do know something is happening.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(39, 3067, 'Chiriko Tsurumi', 'I’m not the same as you. I’ll never dream about things that I know won’t come true.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, 'Suoh Tamaki', 'What good are dreams, if all you do is work? There''s more to life than hitting the books, I hope you know.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, 3587, 'Shizuku Mizutani', 'Every time I deal with another person, I’m reminded how little control I have over my life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(39, NULL, 'Tetsudō Hisakawa', 'People do change, little by little.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2296, 'Kamina', 'God gave us eyes at the front of our heads so we can look forward to the future.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, NULL, 'Yoshida Haru', 'I have someone I like. I never had the confidence and I’ve doubted my feelings countless of times. But, when she stays by my side and smiles with me, I feel like I can do anything.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, 3086, 'Irisviel von Einzbern', 'I am who I am because I learned your ideals and took your prayers to the heart. You''ve guided me. You''ve given me a life a mere puppet wouldn''t have. You need not to pity me. I am a part of you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1257, 'Zeniba', 'Nothing that happens is ever forgotten, even if you can''t remember it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, 3524, 'Nobuchika Ginoza', 'As a leader, you need to learn from the mistakes of others, not your own.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(54, 3720, 'Mitsuki Sarue', 'No matter what troubles you shoulder, remember that in time, things will change. You shouldn''t blame yourself when things don''t go your way.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Yoshino Yūsuke', 'Children, this is the only gift I can give you right now. A formless gift you call a memory. I don’t have any money and I can’t give you something tangible. But even so, even if it isn’t tangible, a memory is something that will continue to be with you. That is what I believe…', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4144, 'Kureo Mado', 'When you''re in front of the enemy, even if your hands are trembling - fight.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'You can''t change the world without getting your hands dirty.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'Don’t use such strong words. It''ll only make you look weak.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Our crying for them won''t bring the dead back to life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1248, 'Haku', 'You still haven’t noticed that something precious to you has been replaced.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2681, 'Ayato Naoi', 'No matter what kind of past you had, don''t lose sight of yourself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'Kabuto: Isn''t acknowledging what you can''t do the same as giving up?

Itachi: No, it means to forgive yourself for what you aren''t able to do. Your comrades are there to make up for what you cannot do and to prevent you from ignoring things that you actually might have been able to do.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3147, 'Gon Freecss', 'If you want to get to know someone, find out what makes them angry.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'If you stick to a "lie", it''ll eventually become the "truth".', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'Once you question your own belief, it''s over.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 3, 'Jet Black', 'Humans were meant to work and sweat for their money after all. Those that try to get rich quickly or live at expense of others - all get divine retribution along the way. That is the lesson. But, one thing about humans is that they quickly forget the lesson they have learnt.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(54, NULL, 'Emi Yusa', 'You don''t have to be reasonable when you''re in love.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Sakamoto Tatsuma', 'Planets are just places for people to stand on. Planets are just rocks. It takes people to make it a world. You can have as many "Earths" as you want. I only care about what''s inside.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'Forget about revenge. The fate of those who seek revenge is grim. It''s tragic, You will end up suffering and hurting yourself even more. Even if you do succeed in getting revenge, the only thing that remains is emptiness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4186, 'Susanoo', 'No matter how sturdy something appears, it should have some weakness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4183, 'Esdeath', 'The weak are destined to lie beneath the boots of the strong. If that angers you, overcome your deficits.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, 3033, 'Rin Okumura', 'It''s certainly good to be smart, but I think it''s better that there are all kinds of people in the world', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'Being alone is better than being with the wrong person.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, 2082, 'Sai', 'Even if I force myself to smile. It seems I''m the type of person who ends up being hated.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'Alphonse Elric', 'Dedication is a talent all on its own.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(57, 3824, 'Mitsuki Nase', 'Individuality that stands apart from the rest is a great asset.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2781, 'Zeref', 'There are things in this world that you cannot oppose, no matter how hard you try.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Uryuu Minene', 'My childhood was filled with blood and strife. I have never needed love. Not then, not now.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4185, 'Wave', 'If you see a girl lookin'' unhappy, be a man and help her.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, NULL, 'Kaneki Ken', 'What''s wrong isn''t me, what''s wrong is the world!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4175, 'Akame', 'It''s because I loved her the most that I wanted to kill her as swiftly as possible.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Goodbyes are only one side of the coin. You can''t say goodbye until you''ve said hello.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, NULL, 'Fairy Tail', 'Sincere feelings transcend time and connect hearts.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Midorima Shintarou', 'Don’t give up! There’s no shame in falling down! True shame is to not stand up again!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, 3033, 'Rin Okumura', 'Don''t you think that true memories are a combination of fun ones and painful ones?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, NULL, 'Akasaka Ryuunosuke', 'Being able to realize your own fault is a virtue.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Donquixote Rosinante', 'I''ll die smiling! Because if you ever think of me in the future, I want you to remember me smiling.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3004, 'Kurisu Makise', 'Every brilliant day should be lived for those who passed away.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3684, 'Shizuka Hiratsuka', 'You should realize that there are people whose hearts break each time they see you hurt yourself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'I can''t tell you that… You have to figure it out. Stand up and walk. Keep moving forward. You''ve got two good legs. So get up and use them. You''re strong enough to make your own path.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3143, 'Ging Freecss', 'You should enjoy the little detours. To the fullest. Because that''s where you''ll find the things more important than what you want.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 4321, 'Kaori Miyazono', 'If you can''t move with your hands then play with your feet! If you don''t have enough fingers, then use your nose as well! Whether you''re sad, you''re a mess, or you''ve hit rock bottom, you still have to play! That''s how people like us survive.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'I will do what I can, even if my chance of passing is minuscule, if that will allow me to move forward.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1329, 'Rukia Kuchiki', 'We are taught never to shed tears. For to shed tears means that the body has been defeated by emotion. And to us, this simple act of crying proves, without question, that the existence of emotion is nothing but a burden.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1173, 'Roy Mustang', 'I lost my pawns, my knight, my rook, my bishop, and even my queen. But, it''s not checkmate, just yet.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2694, 'Makarov Dreyar', 'Even if I can’t see you… Even if we are separated far apart from each other… I’ll always be watching after you. I’ll definitely watch over you forever…', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2819, 'Mavis Vermillion', 'In that case, you have nothing to fear. Mistakes aren’t made by locking your feelings away and holding back… They’re made while wearing your heart on your sleeve.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, 'Ukai Keishin', 'Because people don''t have wings... We look for ways to fly.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'Meliodas', 'Everyone has to die someday. But what they believed in will never fade away as long as someone protects it. Once you''ve resolved to take on those principles, no matter how much blood and tears you shed, you follow through with it! That''s what it means to be a knight.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2694, 'Makarov Dreyar', 'Listen up, brats! Today’s defeat is the seed for tomorrow’s victory! We’ll rise up and show them! We don’t know the meaning of giving up!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2690, 'Natsu Dragneel', 'Comrades are comrades because they help each other out.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2664, 'Yuri Nakamura', 'We have no choice but to accept the one and only life we''re given, no matter how cruel and heartless it might be.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurotsuchi Mayuri', 'There is no such thing as perfect in this world. That may sound cliche, but it’s the truth. The average person admires perfection and seeks to obtain it. But what’s the point of achieving perfection? There is none. Nothing. Not a single thing. I spit on perfection! If something is perfect, then there is nothing left. There is no room for imagination. No place left for that person to gain additional knowledge or abilities. Do you know what that means? For scientists such as us, perfection only brings despair. It is our job to create things more wonderful than anything before them, but never to obtain perfection. A scientist must be a person who finds ecstasy while suffering from that antinomy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Revenge that involves unrelated people isn’t valid at all. All he’s doing is hiding his vengeful hate with the title of God’s representative and acting sublime.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2691, 'Happy', 'They are your words! This is your heart! Our desire to help our friends belongs to us!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2689, 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'There were many times I felt on the verge of giving up… And many times when I met with big trouble, and met with some really tough opponents… But during that time, he would always be there. And so would everyone else from the guild. Crying together, laughing together, so many of these things. Well, a lot of things really did take place… I’m sure that’s the way it should be… I’m sure that everybody carries a certain burden of their own. But even then, everyone tries their best to keep moving forward. That’s what makes Fairy Tail what it is. I really joined the best guild ever.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2689, 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'If someone here were hurt or lost their life because of me, I think I would also be in pain much like Loke. But, it’ll be all right. If everyone works together and unites in power, we can overcome any pinch ahead, right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Kurusu Keigo', 'Think of your shivers as excitement rather than fear. Cover the anxiety on your face with a smile.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, 3033, 'Rin Okumura', 'Life''s a bitch, so if it''s easy, you''re doing it wrong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 3, 'Jet Black', 'You were always there for me, and that’s all I needed. Just you. For some reason, I didn''t feel sad or broken up, it just didn''t seem real. But slowly I realized it was real – that you were gone. And little by little, I slowly felt something inside me go numb.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(132, NULL, 'Funny Valentine', 'Suppose that you were sitting down at a table. The napkins are in front of you, which napkin would you take? The one on your ‘left’? Or the one on your ‘right’? The one on your left side? Or the one on your right side? Usually you would take the one on your left side. That is ‘correct’ too. But in a larger sense on society, that is wrong. Perhaps I could even substitute ‘society’ with the ‘Universe’. The correct answer is that ‘It is determined by the one who takes his or her own napkin first.’ …Yes? If the first one takes the napkin to their right, then there’s no choice but for others to also take the ‘right’ napkin. The same goes for the left. Everyone else will take the napkin to their left, because they have no other option. This is ‘society’… Who are the ones that determine the price of land first? There must have been someone who determined the value of money, first. The size of the rails on a train track? The magnitude of electricity? Laws and Regulations? Who was the', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'Alphonse Elric', 'In order to obtain something, there must be something of equal value. It is the Law of Conservation in Alchemy. Back then, we believed that it was the truth of the world. However, the real world isn’t perfect, so there is not just a single law that governs everything that happens within it. It is the same for the Law of Conservation in Alchemy. Even so, I believe that people cannot obtain something without paying a price. The pain we felt was surely enough of a price to pay. And anyone who pays the price known as hard work surely gains something. The Law of Conservation is not the law governing this
world. Until the day I meet with him again, that is the promise… Ni-san and I made.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3996, 'Ittetsu Takeda', 'Does losing prove that you are weak? Isn''t losing difficult for all of you? A challenge where, after ending up on your hands and knees, you must see if you can stand up again? If you stay on your hands and knees, that proves that you are weak.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'I killed many people to act on my ideal. I killed so many that I stopped caring about innocent people and I saved a thousand times as many as I killed.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Lancer', 'Do all of you really want... to win that badly? You all want the Grail that desperately?! You''d crush the only wish I have in my heart... do none of you feel any shame at all?! I won''t forgive you... I? won''t forgive ANY of you for this! All of you monsters who''d disregard a knight''s honor for personal gain... let my blood taint your dreams! Let the Grail be cursed! Let the wish it grants bring disaster! And when you fall into the pits of hell... remember the rage of Diarmuid!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Kotomine Kirei', 'Pleasure is another thing that I lack. I seek for it but cannot find it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Assassin', 'A warrior would rather die, than survive defeat.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Kaminski Natalia', 'If you cut a thread, and then tie it, the thickness will be different where you originally cut it, right? In that sense, it means irreversible change.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, NULL, 'Oreki Houtarou', 'People remember their high school days as the high point of their lives. People say these things because everyone holds fond memories of their time in high school; however, I doubt that every high school student would want to remember their school life that way. For example, if neither studying, nor sports, nor socializing are of interest to someone, what then? What if there are students who prefer to keep a low profile? Though I guess that would be a pretty lonely way to live.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3465, 'Satoshi Fukube', 'People who are confident in themselves never talk about expectations. "Expectation" is a word rooted in giving up. It leaves you with no other choice. It makes it obvious that you''re powerless.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, NULL, 'Oreki Houtarou', 'The best way to tame a mystery is with another mystery.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2, 74, 'Wolfgang Grimmer', 'Do you have any idea how terrible the things you did really mean? Do you understand what it means to destroy a human being''s sense of good and evil? Can you even begin to comprehend what happens when you awaken the monster inside each us? People should know in their hearts that food tastes good. They should always look forward to having picnics and wonderful places on their weekends. They should think that beer tastes good after a hard day''s work. People should know how they should feel, that they''re suppose to grieve, from the bottom of their hearts when they have to bury their own child.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3378, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'Whether here or in the real world, you can cry when it hurts. There''s no rule that you can''t show feelings just because it''s a game.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3380, 'Akihiko Kayaba', 'In every world, once you die, you''re gone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'Asuna Yūki', 'When I began thinking of him as I fell asleep, I stopped having nightmares. I began to look forward to seeing him. For the first time since I arrived here, I was happy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Gasai Yuno', 'A half moon. A bright half and a dark half. Just like me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, 3561, 'Nanami Aoyama', 'There are some things you can''t say to someone, no matter how close you are.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, 3559, 'Mashiro Shiina', 'This area feels weird, it''s been throbbing hard since that time. When you told me not to go. When you held me so tight. It won''t go away. Your voice is still in my ear. What happened to me? Is this... love?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Eren Jaeger', 'What is the point if those with the means and power do not fight?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3754, 'Ymir', 'I too used to believe that the world would be a better place if I hadn’t been born. I was hated merely for the fact that I existed, and I died for the happiness of many people. But there was one thing I wished for with all my heart... If I’m ever given a second chance in life, I want to live for only myself. That is my sincere wish.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Historia Reiss', 'Even if you have your reasons and there are things you can''t tell me, no matter what, I''m on your side.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Armin Arlelt', 'I was, I am, and I remain a soldier, sworn to devote my heart and soul to the restoration of humankind! There is no greater glory than than dying for that belief!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Furukawa Akio', 'We didn’t give up on our dreams! We changed our dreams into your dream! That’s what parents do! That’s what a family does!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Okazaki Tomoya', 'I hate this town. It’s too filled with memories I’d rather forget. I go to school every day, hang out with my friends, and then go home. There’s no place I’d rather not go ever again. I wonder if anything will ever change? Will that day ever come?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Okazaki Tomoya', 'Isn’t it fine as long as you find it? Isn’t it fine as long as you find the next fun and happy moments again?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'Even if I could redo the past, I must not take back what has already happened, because if I do that, everything would be a lie: those tears, that pain, those memories, that cold reality that hurts my heart, all of it. There were people who died in pain. There were people who risked their lives to save others. There were people who mourned for the deaths. But then, if everything were taken back and it did not happen, where would all of those go? The dead people would not come back. Reality cannot be overturned. To continue on remembering the pain and the weight… isn''t that how lost things remain? People will eventually die and death itself is sad, but pain shouldn''t be the only thing that remains. A death is painful, but it also leaves behind bright memories. As I am bound by these people''s deaths… As I am protected by my memories of Kiritsugu... I believe memories become constraints and change the people living now... Even if... They are memories that will eventually be forgo', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2817, 'Acnologia', 'I will acknowledge you as my enemy and destroy you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, NULL, 'Mard Geer', 'I particularly dislike this emotion you call ANGER. It makes me lose sight of myself, you know. Just thinking of what happens to me if I''m not MYSELF. Disgusts me to no end.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2, 74, 'Wolfgang Grimmer', 'Everyone in this world carries around their own sins, and they never go away...but that doesn''t change the fact that we do what we must.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Saber', 'Only brute warriors find glory in destruction!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Rider', 'A king must live a life more vivid than any other and be figure for all to admire! The king is the one who collects the envy of all his heroes and stands as their guide! Therefore, the king is not alone! For his will equals that of all his followers combined!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'Only two kinds of people exist in this world, those who steal and those who are stolen from.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'Is it really worth saving this sad and ugly world, when there is nothing left after it is saved? With all this death, cruelty and sadness, do you still want to become a hero?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'We''re all the same. No one really remembers the day he was born. We all have to trust another''s word on the matter. It doesn''t matter if it''s true or not. Just having a birthday makes one happy I think.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'He who forgives and acknowledges himself... that is what it truly means to be strong!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2, NULL, 'Johann Liebert', 'Do you think your sin will disappear if you lie?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'I am not so noble that I would stake my life for someone else. Nor am I so forgiving that I would sit by and allow someone to trample me. I am selfish... and self righteous human being! That''s why! I... to clear my own shame... I used your power. Not for anyone else! But for myself!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, 3045, 'Igor Neuhaus', 'No matter how you look, as long as your judgement is clouded you won''t find the truth.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, 3034, 'Yukio Okumura', 'The best way to succeed is to use your own abilities to the fullest.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2473, 'Minori Kushieda', 'We all live under the same sky. If each of us learns to shine, it won''t matter how far apart we are. We''ll be able to see each other.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, NULL, 'Kyubee', 'I can only say that the human curiosity is something completely irrational.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2471, 'Taiga Aisaka', 'Those stars look like they''re close to each other, but they''re actually very far away, aren''t they? It''s like Kitamura-kun and I. The things you see aren''t always real. How hard must I try in order to understand the unseen truth?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, NULL, 'Netero', 'Human potential for evolution is limitless.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'Asuna Yūki', 'There is one thing I''ve learned here. To keep doing your best, up until the very end.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(57, 3823, 'Mirai Kuriyama', 'Somewhere along the line, I had decided that I can''t interact with others. That I have no choice but to be alone, but I''ve found a new reason to stay. It''s because everyone is alone, senpai. Everyone is all alone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(57, 3825, 'Akihito Kanbara', 'Just as there is a light at night and darkness in the day, there will always be darkness in the world. At the same time, the world will never be engulfed by the darkness. In that mix of ambiguous colors, everything moves on: our fates determined...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(57, 3826, 'Hiroomi Nase', 'A person can work for their ideals. But if you lose sight of those ideals, when things don''t work out as you hoped, you''ll never accomplish anything! You won''t be able to protect yourself or those dear to you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'The difference in ability... What about it? Do you think I should give up just because you''re stronger than me?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 157, 'Haku', 'It is only through the eyes of others that our lives have any meaning.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2296, 'Kamina', 'Don''t believe in the you that believes in me and don''t believe in the me that believes in you. Believe in the you that believes in yourself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1385, 'Coyote Starrk', 'I want to become weak and if that''s not possible, then I at least want to make friends that are as strong as me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'If you give me wings, I will soar for you even if this whole land sinks down to the water. If you give me a sword, I will fight for you even if this whole sky shoots through with your light.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'Don''t underestimate me! I don''t quit and I don''t run! You can act tough all you want! You''re not gonna scare me off! No way! I don''t care if I DO get stuck as a Genin for the rest of my life! I''ll still be Hokage someday!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'No matter how colossal a power you obtain, no matter how gigantic an army you bring with you, I ain''t scared. While you''ve abandoned a hundred, I''ve connected with a thousand. While you''ve destroyed a thousand, I''ve been helped by ten thousand. So what''s an army of a few thousand? We have protected everything as just three people. We''re the Yorozuya.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Portgas D. Ace', 'Sometimes the blood rushes to my head and I feel like, if I run I''ll lose something important.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, NULL, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'In this moment, I am euphoric. Not because of any phony Shinobi''s blessing. But because, I''m enlightened by my intelligence.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, 3033, 'Rin Okumura', 'You trusted me, so I''ll trust you too. That''s what being friends means, doesn''t it?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, NULL, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'Knowledge and awareness are vague, and perhaps better called illusions. Everyone lives within their own subjective interpretation.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, NULL, 'Pain', 'Learn to embrace the fear of feeling about what it''s like to contemplate what it is to know true pain. Because when I had nothing and no one - I always had Pain.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2442, 'Asura', 'There''s nothing unusual here… The appropriate one stands in the appropriate place after the inappropriate ones have collapsed to the ground, defeated. There is nothing unexpected or odd about it. Because this is reality. Not one shred of uncertainty exists here. Not even fear, of course…', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2297, 'Simon', 'I don''t want fear for a future, that may not even come, to stop me from acting today.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'I''ll never show you my tears. These are the tears of those who died with regrets. If there''s a way to take away these regrets, I''ll make sure I''ll find it. If it''s fear that you speak of, then I''ll stand and face it. I''ll never give up. The only time I lose is when I die!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2442, 'Asura', 'Sitting there in the dark, I had the chance to think about a lot of things, including the nature of the world itself. And after lengthy consideration, I realized something; When all is said and done, this world is an unknowable place. On the surface, all appears rational, orderly. But what lies beyond that thin veneer of reason? Stability and reality? Or chaos and madness? What are we really made of in the end? Is there truly any meaning to the lives we lead? Or are we nothing more than hollow vessels? These are questions we can never answer, because we cannot hope to see beyond the world''s fragile layer of skin. So we live our lives filled with uncertainty, never knowing who or what we truly are, or what the future will bring. All we can do is imagine. Life becomes an unsolvable mystery with any number of twists and turns awaiting us. And that''s enough to fill any soul with terror.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2417, 'Franken Stein', 'There is no inherent right or wrong in this world, those labels are just artificial constructs. Right and wrong are held by positions of authority. That is the way it''s always been, so how then could anyone know this truth you speak of? Don''t you see the reality is that truth long ago became nothing more than a shadow of itself; it''s a mere echo of the past now... The world is one big moral gray area, it just makes you feel safer that it can be categorized into good and bad, but that''s not how it actually works.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, NULL, 'Watari Ryouta', 'It''s only natural for the girl you''re crushing on to be in love with someone else. Since you''re in love with her, she sparkles in your eyes. That''s why people fall so irrationally in love.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(69, 4254, 'Migi', 'Upon researching the concept of demons, I believe that, among all life, humans are the closest thing to it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1770, 'Kagura', 'I choose my own battlefields. Not by my blood, but by my heart! I stand on the battlefield to protect what''s important to me. And if anyone stands in my way, I don''t care if it''s one of my kind, my brother or anyone else… I''ll crush them all!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Sakagami Tomoyo', 'No matter how cold and distant people may become, on the inside something warm and precious always remains, something that never changes. To me, that’s what family is like.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, NULL, 'Sasuke Uchiha', '(About Sakura) Was she having fun in her little make-believe fantasy of true love? As for me, I have absolutely no reason to love her and likewise, I can see no reason why she would love me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3440, 'Teppei Kiyoshi', 'They say some defeats are meaningful and losing makes you stronger. Do you understand what that means? For living creatures victory is life, and defeat means death. It''s an extreme example, but humans retain that instinct. Those who know the terror of defeat, hunger for victory.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3018, 'Homura Akemi', 'You’re too kind. Remember this and take it to heart: kindness sometimes leads to even greater tragedy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Zaraki Kenpachi', 'Don''t just accept loss or defeat! Accept it after you''re dead. If you lose without dying... it means that luck is on your side. If that happens - focus on surviving! Survive and Kill the one who couldn''t kill YOU!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4136, 'Uta', 'If you like, you can stay over here tonight. If you''re lucky, you may see some cannibalism and that''s always fun...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4136, 'Uta', 'I  can neither live with you. Nor without you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, 2212, 'Madara Uchiha', 'The longer you live... The more you realize that reality is just made of pain, suffering and emptiness...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'If failure is the hallmark of being young, like they say. then someone who has failed to make friends must be at the peak of his youth, right? However, I''m sure they will disagree. All of this is just their double standards at play and nothing else. Here''s the bottom line: Fools that enjoy their youth should go kill themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'About marriage or about future, I don''t know what will happen in the future. In this world, it''s normal that when there''s a preparation, then a new grief is born, but everyone has the right to desire happiness. Our efforts need to be held for the sake of our future.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Forcing yourself to like something you don''t like brings sorrow.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Gasai Yuno', 'Everything in this world is just a game and we are merely the pawns.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1982, 'Ryuk', 'I didn’t choose you. Don’t you see this is all just an accident. You actually thought you were chosen because you’re so smart or something? Don’t be so vain. It just happened to fall around here and you just happen to pick it up, and that’s all there is to it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'Only I could do it! I was well aware that killing people is crime in itself! Yet at that point it was the only way to make things right! I thought to myself that someday people will come to realize this as much, and regard it as an act of justice! I had no choice but to act as Kira… it was the destiny given to me. I was chosen to renew this rotten world, to bring about true peace – a utopia.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'This world is rotten and those who are making it rot deserve to die. Someone has to do it, so why not me? Even if it means sacrificing my own mind and soul, it''s worth it. Because the world... can''t go on like this. I wonder... what if someone else had picked up this notebook? Is there anyone out there other than me who''d be willing to eliminate the vermin from the world? If I don''t do it, then who will? That''s just it: there''s no one, but I can do it. In fact, I''m the only one who can. I''ll do it. Using the death note, I''ll change the world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3145, 'Kurapika', 'A beast in human''s clothing understands better than anyone how people want to be treated.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, 'Tetsuya Kuroko', 'If you haven''t changed, that means you haven''t improved.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2417, 'Franken Stein', 'How did you learn of the reality that you speak of? The entire world is governed by the reasoning of dirty-minded adults. We''re able to obscure reality according to our obsessions. We''re never actually shown what reality is. In this case, the reality that you speak of is a half-baked nonsense that has been altered. Trying to conform this bullshit reality into the one you want is like trying to join two pieces of a puzzle that do not fit.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Working hard alone doesn''t assure you that you''ll achieve your dreams. Actually there are more cases where you don''t. Even so, working hard and achieving something is some consolation at least.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Anime - it''s not something that can be thought of in a hall for conferences. It is made out of strange juices current from the brain of animators.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3380, 'Akihiko Kayaba', 'A person is very strong when he seeks to protect something.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Amano Yukiteru', 'If there''s a miracle that can be reached by fighting to the end, then I want to see it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Akise Aru', 'Not knowing everything in this world is fun.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'Become strong not just for your own sake, but for your friends.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2362, 'Suzaku Kururugi', 'A victory won through dishonesty means it''s no victory at all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, NULL, 'Ryoji Kaji', 'If you know pain and hardship, it''s easier to be kind to others.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'People who grow up in different environments will invariably have different tastes and preferences. Therefore, could one say that the subsequent marriages necessarily lead to happiness?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'An idiot that knows he''s an idiot, is even harder to deal with than an idiot that thinks he isn''t.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2471, 'Taiga Aisaka', 'Having someone saying you''re okay as you are and being needed by that person... It was nice to have someone like that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Akise Aru', 'If you want to know what others think, you first have to say what you think.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 168, 'Pain', 'Just by living, people hurt others without even realizing it. So long as humanity exists, hate will also exist. There is no peace in this cursed world. War is just a crime paid for by the pain of the defeated...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, 3562, 'Sorata Kanda', 'A normal person looks away from what they don''t want to see even though they know there are things they can only acquire if they face the things they hate.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 4176, 'Tatsumi', 'The reason doesn''t matter. As long as tiny bit of hope exists, that''s all that matters.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(56, NULL, 'Hayashida Nana', 'Once you miss the opportunity to say something, the words become increasingly toxic. The best thing to do is to just say everything.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'A farewell is like the other side of a coin. It will only happen when there is an encounter. Rather than dreading the day we have to part, shouldn''t we be happy that we had the chance to meet today instead?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(116, 6387, 'Meliodas', 'No matter what lies you tell, you can''t fool your own heart.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Change will never come about if you don''t make it happen.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, 'Liu Cheng-Long', 'If you have memories no one else remembers, what''s the point in remembering them?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, 3033, 'Rin Okumura', 'Your past shouldn''t stop you from achieving your goals and dreams.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Portgas D. Ace', 'Sometimes, the blood rushes to my head and I feel like, if I run, I''ll lose something important.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Ōnoki', 'Never give up without even trying. Do what you can, no matter how small the effect it may have!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3727, 'Mikasa Ackerman', 'Once I''m dead, I won''t even be able to remember you. So I''ll win, no matter what. I''ll live, no matter what!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Being hurt on the outside is better than being hurt on the inside.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'I''ll admit that you''re stronger than before. But because of that, you seem to have lost sight of what''s truly important. Now listen carefully. The people of the village, who once abhorred you, have begun to admire you. They think of you as a comrade. It''s because you fought hard for their acceptance. You once said it was everyone who cares about you who helped you get where you are now. If you forget others because you have power, and become arrogant and egotistical, you''ll eventually become just like Madara. No matter how powerful you become, do not try to shoulder everything alone. Becoming the Hokage doesn''t mean people will acknowledge you. But when the people acknowledge you, you can become Hokage. Never forget your friends!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'The ones who aren''t able to acknowledge their own selves are bound to fail.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'I understood that killing people was a crime. There was no other way! The world had to be fixed! A purpose given to me! Only I could do it. Who else could have done it, and come this far? Would they have kept going? The only one who can create a new world is me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'People who continue to put their lives on the line to defend their faith become heroes and continue to exist on in legend.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Yoshino Yūsuke', 'Everyone makes mistakes. What''s important is how to make up for it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 337, 'Dracule Mihawk', 'The world has too many heroes. It needs a monster.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Marriage, the institution where one''s existence goes to die. All married people prattle on about their so-called marital bliss about how they love saying "I''m home!" to their spouses, or how seeing their sleeping kids motivates them for tomorrow. But think about it: you can say "I''m home!" if you live your parents, you can even buy some mouthwash and say "I''m home!" to the hippos on the label. And if they''re talking about seeing their sleeping kids, that just means they''re working hellish overtime hours. How is that in any way blissful?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, 2212, 'Madara Uchiha', 'It seems that you still want to dance but... You will not be able to make steps anymore.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Obito Uchiha', 'No one cared who I was until I put on a mask.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, 2212, 'Madara Uchiha', 'I''d be lying if I said things are going according to my plan... but beggars can''t be choosers, right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, 2212, 'Madara Uchiha', '[Last words to Hashirama] As comrades, huh... well... if that''s how... we... will.... *smiles*', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Madara Uchiha', '....Would you consider dying together "Teamwork" as well?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, 3524, 'Nobuchika Ginoza', 'If you look away and just turn your back on those you don''t understand, you''ll regret it someday. Accept what''s happening before your eyes as a fact. That''s a shortcut to becoming an adult.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, NULL, 'Yoshida Haru', 'I don''t understand you! You said you don''t love me, but you act like you do! Then you tell me to stay away. Do I have a chance or not?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'People''s lives don''t end when they die. It ends when they lose faith.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', 'The scariest and the most painful thing is to be hated by someone you truly love.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Choji Akamichi', 'You can steal the very last bite of my very best food. You can mock me all you want. But if you insult my best friend, I will obliterate you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'Three times now... We''ve fought world wars for our own nations, our own villages. We''ve hurt one another. We''ve hated one another. That hatred bred a lust for power, and that lust for power created ME. I was a Jinchuuriki, the embodiment of hatred and power. And I hated this world, and all the people in it... I wanted to destroy it with my own hands. The exact same thing Akatsuki is trying to do today. But one man, one ninja from Konoha stopped me. I was his enemy, yet he wept for me! I hurt him, yet he called me his friend! He saved me! My enemy, my fellow Jinchuuriki... He suffered the same pain as me, yet bore no ill will! There are no enemies here because we''ve all suffered at Akatsuki''s hand! SO THERE IS NO SAND, NO STONE, NO LEAF, NO MIST, NO CLOUD! THERE ARE ONLY SHINOBI! And if you still hold a grudge against the Sand, then when this war is over, come and take my head instead! Our enemies are after the friend who saved my life! If they take him, if we hand him over, o', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(63, 3943, 'Tatsuya Shiba', 'I lost all of what you could call feelings of love. They weren''t sealed, so they can''t be released. They weren''t broken, so they can''t be fixed. That which is lost, cannot be recovered.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3979, 'Daichi Sawamura', 'Even if we''re not confident that we''ll win, even if others tell us we don''t stand a chance, we must never tell ourselves that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2297, 'Simon', 'If you''re going to dig, dig to pierce the heavens. Even if it''s my grave I''m digging, I''ll keep going! When I break through, that means I''ve WON! Who the hell do you think I am? I''m Simon. I''m not my bro, Kamina. I''m ME! Simon the Digger!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3004, 'Kurisu Makise', 'Everyone is watching someone other than themselves, someone important to them...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 382, 'Brook', 'All for one, one for all! There are times when a man has no choice but to act!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'Now there''s something I understand a little better. Hate, sadness, even joy. To be able to share it with another person... Naruto Uzumaki. From fighting him I learned that. He knew pain like I did and then he taught me that you can change your path. I wish that one day I can be needed by someone. Not as a frightening weapon... But as the sand''s Kazekage.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2666, 'Hideki Hinata', 'I''ll marry you! No matter what kind of sickness you have! Even if you can''t walk or stand, or even when you can''t have kids! I''ll still marry you! No matter where or how I meet you, I''ll fall in love with you. If I can meet you again, against the 6 billion to 1 odds, and even if your body can''t move, I''ll marry you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, 3563, 'Jin Mitaka', 'You know, with talented people... They draw people to themselves, and without even trying to, they tear them to shreds. The closer you are to them, the more viciously you''ll be torn apart. They''re living in a completely different world above us. One that us normal people can''t reach. In a world that we''ll never see. A world above the clouds. That''s the kind of world they live in.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(63, 3943, 'Tatsuya Shiba', 'No one''s more aware of discrimination than the ones being discriminated against, huh?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(64, 3996, 'Ittetsu Takeda', 'Being weak means that there is a room to grow.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, NULL, 'Kyōko Sakura', 'Hey God, if you''re there, my life has really sucked. So please, for once, let me have a sweet dream.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'Even if I can''t see. Even if I can''t hear. I have light inside me. The path I walked with my friends, is bringing light to my future. I don''t fear anything! This isn''t even worthy of being called pain! The worst pain is.. The pain of losing your light.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Don''t mistake borrowed power for your own ability!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4135, 'Rize Kamishiro', 'All of the disadvantage in this world stems from a person''s lack of ability.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3378, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'Real pain is the result of losing someone you care about.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Portgas D. Ace', 'Old man, everyone!! And you.. Luffy. Even though I''ve been good for nothing my whole life, even though I have the blood of a demon within me... You guys still loved me! Thank you so much!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'If fate is a millstone, then we are the grist. There is nothing we can do. So I wish for strength. If I cannot protect them from the wheel, then give me a strong blade, and enough strength... to shatter fate.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2695, 'Elfman Strauss', 'It''s only the end if you give up!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2690, 'Natsu Dragneel', 'Maybe we can''t help feeling scared alone! But we''re all right here, together! We''ve got out friends close by!
Now there''s nothing to fear, because we are not alone!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2690, 'Natsu Dragneel', 'We know our weakness. Now what will we do?
We''ll get stronger! We''ll get up and fight!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', '"Checkmate" doesn''t mean you''ve simply cornered the enemy king. It''s a declaration that the enemy king is yours. That''s why I said it the first time I met you. "Checkmate."', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'What kind of king makes his men fight at the front line while he sits behind them relaxing?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'Huh? In a real war, what fool waits for their enemy''s "turn"?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'It''s better for a man to be slow than fast.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3754, 'Ymir', 'Do you always want to live hiding behind the mask you put up for the sake of others?! You''re you, and there''s nothing wrong with that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'If lives were lost today, then lives were also born. How important each day is... Depends on how important you feel it is to you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'When there is evil in this world that justice cannot defeat, would you taint your hands with evil to defeat evil? Or would you remain steadfast and righteous even if it means surrendering to evil?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 345, 'Smoker', 'Why did he smile? Why? Did he know he would be saved? No. In that instant, he must have understood that his life was going to end. Death. He accepted it. He was fully prepared for it and smiled.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Donquixote Doflamingo', 'I lost my mother when I was 8...and killed my father when I was 10. Those with the title of "Executive" or above...are my "family", with whom I''ve shared my joys and sorrows. They''re the only thing I have! I won''t forgive anyone that laughs at my family. Understood?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Armin Arlelt', 'You can''t change anything unless you can discard part of yourself too. To surpass monsters, you must be willing to abandon your humanity.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, NULL, 'Juvia Loxar', 'It doesn´t matter what day it is as long as you are happy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(21, NULL, 'Pain', 'Feel pain, think about pain, accept pain, know pain... Shinra Tensei!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', 'It''s not because I''m lazy, it''s just because I don''t care.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Might Guy', 'You''re right, all efforts are pointless... If you don''t believe in yourself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'If love is just a word, then why does it hurt so much if you realize it isn''t there?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'Family? Let me tell you what kind of link I have with them. They are just lumps of meat linked by hatred and murderous intent!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 140, 'Sasuke Uchiha', 'I understand now. Even if I must take the devil''s fruit, I must gain power. I am an avenger.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Dragon', 'Someday, I promise you, they will all watch as I change the world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'One Piece', 'Inherited will, the swelling of the changing times, and the dreams of people. These are things that cannot be stopped. As long as people seek the answer to freedom, these will never cease to be!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 344, 'Kuzan', 'The thing called "justice" changes its shape... Depending on where you stand.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2417, 'Franken Stein', 'To define true madness. What is it to be nothing else but mad?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2690, 'Natsu Dragneel', 'We don''t have to know what tomorrow holds! That''s why we can live for everything we''re worth today!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3378, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'Everybody can fight. It''s just a choice of whether you should.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'It''s our job as normal people to ensure the potential of those misunderstood ones are realized.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Whitebeard', 'About Whitebeard "Even in death, his body did not fall. His figure, taking down enemies while losing half of his head, was truly monstrous. The total number of sword wounds he received in this battle was 267. He was shot by 152 bullets. And was hit by 46 cannonballs. And despite all this, his proud back, over the course of his entire life as a pirate, never received a single scar from running away!"', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Obito Uchiha', 'I''m no one. I don''t want to be anyone. All I care about is completing the moon''s eye plan. This world is completely worthless. There is nothing left in it but misery.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 161, 'Orochimaru', 'Either people change or they die before they do. It''s one or the other.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Kimimaro', 'Humans... Do humans have a purpose when they are born? I have been wondering recently. Because they are born, do they have an important duty? The meaning of being born... For humans to find that answer... It is the one freedom God gave them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2694, 'Makarov Dreyar', 'Even if I can''t see you... No matter how far away you may be... I will always be watching you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', '"Time" is proof that people have lived. Every person lives the time that has been given to them... that is life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2690, 'Natsu Dragneel', 'Your so called "hope" is to throw the past into despair?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 140, 'Sasuke Uchiha', 'I have told you before, I''m an avenger. I don''t care about this test, Chunin or whatever. ''Am I strong?'' that''s the answer I want.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1413, 'Don Kanonji', 'Every week, when it is time, they stick to the TV. They watch my actions in the comfort of their families after dinner. Children watch my actions and their hearts leap. They see me stand up to evil spirits and... they know what courage is! Do you understand, boy? With them watching, I can''t run away from the enemy', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1334, 'Yasutora Sado', 'I can''t deny, I don''t know very much about Rukia. That''s not the point, I might not risk my life for her, but Ichigo wants to save her life and that''s all I need to know. What may seem like an unworthy cause to you is more than enough reason for me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3727, 'Mikasa Ackerman', 'I am strong. Stronger than all of you. Extremely strong. I can kill all the titans out there. Even if I am alone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3727, 'Mikasa Ackerman', 'You''re either incompetent or you''re spineless cowards. How pathetic. You can just sit here and suck on your fingers. Yeah, do that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'The village does have its dark side and its inconsistencies, but I''m still Konoha''s Itachi Uchiha.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Madara Uchiha', 'Wake up to reality! Nothing ever goes as planned in this world. The longer you live, the more you realize that in this reality only pain, suffering and futility exist.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Tobi', 'It''s too late to regret. Reality is just cruelly moving forward.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1342, 'Zangetsu', 'Abandon your fear. Look forward. Move forward and never stop. You''ll age if you pull back. You''ll die if you hesitate.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Levi Ackerman', 'The difference between your decision and ours is experience. But you don''t have to rely on that. CHOOSE... Believe in yourself, or believe in the survey corps and me. I don''t know... I never have. I can believe in my own abilities or the choices of the companions I trust. But no one ever knows how it will turn out. So choose for yourself, whichever decision you will regret the least.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2471, 'Taiga Aisaka', 'It''s not about being right or being wrong. There are more important things than that. That''s why apologies and forgiveness become necessary.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'There is no such thing as "truth" or "lies" in this world; there never has been. There are only plain, hard facts. And yet, all beings who exist in this world acknowledge only those "facts" that are convenient to them, and take them to be the "truth". They do so because they know no other way of living. However, for those powerless beings who comprise the majority of this world''s population, inconvenient facts that affirm their very existence, are their only truth.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Madara Uchiha', 'Man seeks peace, yet at the same time yearning for war... Those are the two realms belonging solely to man. Thinking of peace whilst spilling blood is something that only humans could do. They''re two sides of the same coin... to protect something... another must be sacrificed.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2690, 'Natsu Dragneel', 'We can''t live if we don''t keep running forward.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Nico Robin', 'Before the heart of truth, there is no need for words.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 337, 'Dracule Mihawk', 'You are defeated yet you will not step back, why not?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'An island from a dream within a dream? I could never pass up a great adventure like this!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2666, 'Hideki Hinata', 'Even if you can''t walk or stand and even if you can''t have kids, I''ll still marry you, I''ll always stay by your side.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'If you hurt somebody... or if somebody hurts you, the same red blood will be shed', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2694, 'Makarov Dreyar', 'There are people in this world who prefer solitude. But there is no one who can withstand it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, 3863, 'Chitoge Kirisaki', 'Everyone has an ability. And it means that everyone should use that ability to the fullest.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2690, 'Natsu Dragneel', 'If you don''t have the courage to change things then you might as well just die!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'There''s no more trusted observer than someone who suspects you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3378, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'If you married someone, that means you love every side of your significant other that you already know. So if you find a new side after to love, doesn''t that mean you''ll love your partner even more?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3378, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'If that bullet could also kill a player in the real world, and if you didn''t shoot them, you or someone you loved would be killed, could you still pull the trigger?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(66, 4082, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'I don''t even know the real names of the two... no, three that I killed back then. I just close my eyes, put my hands over my ears and tried to forget it all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 168, 'Pain', 'People are stupid. If I don''t do this, there will be no peace. Eventually, time will pass and the pain will heal. Eventually, checkmate''s power will weaken and people will begin fighting again. This time, they will use the weapon themselves and once more know true pain. And for the short time, peace will come again. It will give birth to short period of peace within this endless chain of hatred. That''s my wish.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Kuroko No Basket', 'There is no meaning to victory, if you win alone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, 'Tetsuya Kuroko', 'We''ll worry about the future once we get there.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Isn''t changing yourself the same as running away? Why can''t you just accept who you are?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Tachibana Marika', 'You can''t achieve anything if you don''t make a move. Love is an all-out assault.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Gasai Yuno', 'Maybe the future is bad. But there''s a future beyond that, right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2694, 'Makarov Dreyar', 'Do whatever you think is right. That''s the way of the Fairy Tail mages.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, NULL, 'Juvia Loxar', 'If I have to hurt someone, if I have to injure a comrade, then I might as well hurt myself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'When you give up, your dreams and everything else, they''re gone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2666, 'Hideki Hinata', 'No matter where I might have met you, I''m sure I''d come to love you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 168, 'Pain', 'Pain is the way to bring peace.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'You can believe in anything. But it''s your heart...That ultimately decides.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'Humans have faith too. It''s important not to lose oneself. The strength to think, the courage not to run away.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Madara Uchiha', 'Power is not will, it is the phenomenon of physically making things happen.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, 3866, 'Ruri Miyamoto', 'There''s no law that says you can''t go after someone just because he''s already in love with someone else.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 168, 'Pain', 'Sometimes you must hurt in order to know, fall in order to grow, lose in order to gain because life''s greatest lessons are learned through pain.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(62, 3922, 'Yato', 'Even if things are painful and tough, people should appreciate what it means to be alive.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3378, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'No matter what my heart will be forever yours and I will fight until the day I see you again.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Madara Uchiha', 'Don''t improvise what you cannot handle.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'If miracles only happen once, what are they called the second time?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(43, 3301, 'Mei Misaki', 'It''s sad when people die.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'Although my life hasn''t been very fortunate until now, I''m glad if I caught your eye because of that misfortune...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2689, 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'The worst kind of pain is when you''re smiling just to stop the tears from falling.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Uryuu Minene', 'This is the world I live in. The dirty world of the adults.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2910, 'Shizuo Heiwajima', 'I really hate violence ...

I just want to get stronger,
strong enough so that someday
I can contain my anger!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', 'A place where someone still thinks about you is a place you can call home.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2689, 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'You donÂ´t need a reason to cry. All you need to feel the warmth that dwells in your chest.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'Sorry. Our world isn''t as nice a place as yours. When it comes to war and killing, we have far more expertise than you do.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'Hard work is worthless for those that don''t believe in themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(67, 4151, 'Yoshimura', 'It''s not because we can''t take vengeance that we should feel sorry. The real reason to feel sorry... is when one is hung up on revenge and can''t live their own life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, 3592, 'Kenji Yamaguchi', 'People who say they don''t know their own feelings are deluding themselves. It''s because you refuse to accept what you''re thinking deep down in your heart, you think you don''t understand.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Eustass Kid', 'Compared to the "righteous" greed of the rulers, the criminals of the world seem much more honorable. When scum rules the world, only more scum is born.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'If you don''t risk your life, you can''t create a future. Right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Muguruma Kensei', 'Courage is being scared to death, but doing it anyways.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3432, 'Atsushi Murasakibara', 'Do you think everyone can make their dreams come true through hard work? Hard work isn''t always rewarded.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Life is like a mountain - you can say you''ve reached the top, but only after climbing back down.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2473, 'Minori Kushieda', 'My happiness can only be made by my own hands. My happiness doesn''t depend on anyone but me!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Uryuu Minene', 'Even if you''re weak, there are miracles you can seize with your hands if you fight on to the very end.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2708, 'Jellal Fernandes', 'The loneliest people are the kindest. The saddest people smile the brightest. The most damaged people are the wisest. All because they don''t wish to see anyone else suffer the way they did.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, NULL, 'Fullmetal Alchemist: Brotherhood', 'We have to fight in order to live. That''s what will make us strong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Kougami Shinya', 'It''s not a matter of real or fake. These avatars are idols on the net. in other words - icons. Icons cannot solely exist through their own will. Neither Hayama nor Sugawara established their status on their own. They were able to become Talsiman and Spooky Boogie because their fans idolized them based on their own distorted perceptions. Their true feelings and colors are not the same as the ideals their characters represents. It''s not surprising that a fan could do a better job than the real owners of playing the idol the fans expect to see.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Oryou Rikako', 'Everyone here is the same. They don''t notice anything. They don''t say anything. And they don''t think anything. They are merely a shell of their former selves and soon they will disappear like the melting snow. This epidemic leads innocent people to their deaths, and yet, its pathogen will never be eradicated. This is a disease called serenity - a form of death that people have wished for.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1141, 'Misato Katsuragi', 'So fucking what if I''m not you?! That doesn''t mean it''s okay for you to give up! If you do, I''ll never forgive you as long as I live. God knows I''m not perfect either. I''ve made tons of stupid mistakes and later I regretted them. And I''ve done it over and over again, thousands of times. A cycle of hollow joy and vicious self-hatred. But even so, every time I learned something about myself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Oryou Rikako', 'Chastity and grace - traditional virtues that have been lost. They comprise the educational ideology of Ousou Academy. They''re priorities that are not valued in boys, only in girls. After having them instilled in us, we''re shipped out as brand-name product, refined, sheltered maidens, and purchased by men who seek a classic piece of furniture called "a good wife and mother" in a formality known as marriage. Students in this school are all components that will be processed into an artwork called "the lady". They are rough stones waiting to be polished and finished up. They live sad and boring lives, even though there are many other possible ways they could bloom.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Toyohisa Senguji', 'When you entrust so much of your everyday life to those electronic devices, the argument that you aren''t a cyborg isn''t very convincing. To you, those portable terminals are already your second brain. Isn''t that right? It can be said that the history of science is a history of the expansion of the human body''s functionality, in other words, the history of man''s cyberization. That''s why it''s a matter of degree.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'You sure say some funny things. Solitude? Does that only apply to me? Who isn''t alone in this society? The time when our connection to others was the basis of our selves is long gone. In this world where everyone is watched over by the system and live within the system''s standards, a community isn''t necessary. Everyone just lives in their own cell, and the system tames them by giving them each their own personal serenity.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, 3522, 'Akane Tsunemori', 'Isn''t using the net just like using knives for cooking or using paper to write things down? It has nothing to do with good or bad. It''s like, it''s there, so we accept and use it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'Some people want power and they get mad when they don''t get it. They take their fury out on everyone else. You don''t want it, it becomes you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'I''m Hatake Kakashi. Things I like and things I hate? I don''t feel like telling you that. My dreams for the future? Never really thought about that. As for my hobbies... I have lots of hobbies.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'Those who cannot acknowledge themselves, will eventually fail.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'Look around you, and all you will see are people the world would be better off without.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'Admiration is the furthest thing from understanding.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 168, 'Pain', 'Even children are forced to grow up in the face of pain.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(62, 3922, 'Yato', 'Man, kids these days. They think it''s a competition to have the most friends. One is enough. Find someone completely unique.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 161, 'Orochimaru', 'It''s human nature not to realize the true value of something, unless they lose it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'In society, those who don''t have many abilities, tend to complain more.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2690, 'Natsu Dragneel', 'We all have the right to choose our own future. We should be able to walk the paths that we choose, not the future youÂ´ve decided for us.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 329, 'Sanji', 'A real man is someone who forgives a woman for her lies!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'In every time, in every world, the strong polish their fangs while the weak polish their wisdom.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'I''ve forged my own way alone. While you were consoling and fighting with one another, I faced everything myself, head on. Now look at how strong I am.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'People don''t give damn about reasons, but nobody can resist miracles.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, NULL, 'Juvia Loxar', 'If you have love in your life, you must keep living.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, NULL, 'Yoko Littner', 'Your back is your one big blind spot.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'We are Partners. If you are a Witch, then I am a Warlock.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'You think you''re special? You''re not. Everyone lies, everyone hides things... Nobody makes it through this life being completely honest.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2690, 'Natsu Dragneel', 'The minute you think of giving up, think of the reason why you held on so long.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2689, 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'Remember that everyone you meet is afraid of something, loves something, and has lost something.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2706, 'Gajeel Redfox', 'Care to little, you lose them. Care too much, you get hurt.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2693, 'Mirajane Strauss', 'We are all different from each other and that''s what makes us all special.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'Bring on the hardship. It''s preferred in a path of carnage.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'I don''t sit like this because I want to. I have to sit like this. If I were to sit normally, my deductive skills will immediately be reduced by roughly 40%.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Akito Sohma', 'It''s frightening that there''s no guarantee that I''ll ever be loved.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Akito Sohma', 'I want to believe that life isn''t full of darkness. Even if storms come to pass, the sun will shine again. No matter how painful and hard the rain my beat down on me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Akito Sohma', 'It would be nice to live in a kind world without any fear, without any troubles, without hurting anybody, without ever being hurt; only doing the right thing. I wish I could reach this kind world by the shortest path possible.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Madara Uchiha', 'Talking about peace whilst spilling blood, it''s something that only humans can do.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'If you don''t like the hand that fate''s dealt you with, fight for a new one!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'The pain of being alone is completely out of this world, isn''t it? I don''t know why, but I understand your feelings so much, it actually hurts.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Ikusaba Marco', 'I guess we won''t be living together forever as gods. But still... This is forever, too.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'If the truth is a cruel mistress, then a lie must be a nice girl.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Uryuu Minene', 'Keep fighting on, even if it ain''t worth much.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Uryuu Minene', 'I wanted to be saved too...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'Only idiots start fights they can''t win.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Now that just looks horrible. It''s like some feudal society. If that''s what it takes to make friends in this world, forever alone is fine by me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(43, 3301, 'Mei Misaki', 'There''s no point. Would apologizing serve any purpose? If it will, I''ll do it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'Klein', 'Just consider hardships as another part of training and keep working hard.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3905, 'Stephanie Dola', 'A temporary defeat is nothing if it leads to ultimate victory!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'One of the things Blank loves best is saying ''No'' to people who think they''ve got an absolute advantage.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Eren Jaeger', 'I don''t have time to worry if it''s right or wrong, you can''t hope for a horror story with a happy ending!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2476, 'Ami Kawashima', 'Adoration never leads to a balanced relationship.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', 'Getting dumped always makes a man stronger. But then again, men aren''t meant to pursue happiness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 'Kurami Zell', 'A way for the weak to stay weak, but still defeat the strong. A way to stay who you are but surpass your limits. To soar through the sky, even if you can''t fly. He''s always found a way, inside despair, suffering and darkness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'Asuna Yūki', 'I was just dreaming a little. About my old world. It''s strange. In the dream, I wondered if everything here, in Aincard, if everything that had happened with you, was only a dream. I was really scared. I''m happy this wasn''t a dream.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'Asuna Yūki', 'I cried alone every single night. It felt like every day that passed here stole another piece of my real life away. After I cried, I''d go and fight as hard as I could. My only thought was winning, moving forward and getting stronger.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'Lisbeth', 'I too, was looking for something. Something real in this world. For me, it was the warmth of your hand.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3389, 'Sachi', 'Even if I die, you keep living okay? Live to see the end of this world, and to see why it was born. Live to see why a weak girl like me ended up here. And the reason you and I met.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, 'Suoh Tamaki', 'The spring of my heart surges upon the sight of your fresh smile, my love.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, 'Suoh Tamaki', 'Do you think you could tell me what true strength is? I may be out of line, but hiding your true self and putting on airs doesn''t seem any different than running away to me. I would think that embracing the things you truly like and being able to enjoy them is worth more than anything. To just be yourself… I believe that''s what true strength really is.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 337, 'Dracule Mihawk', 'I''m not stupid enough to use a cannon to hunt a rabbit.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'Either in belief or doubt, if I lean to one of these sides, my reaction time will be dulled if my heart thinks the opposite of what I choose.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2828, 'Rufus Lore', 'Memories are, in a word, learning. And there''s no shame in learning from a formidable enemy!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Gol D. Roger', 'The world...what a glorious place! Seek freedom, and it will lie stretched out before your eyes. If the endless dream guides your restless spirit, seize it! Raise your flag, and stand tall!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Sarutobi Ayame', 'It''s as if you are stuck in some predetermined program, following some predetermined script. If you really want to live in reality, then fight against it. Break through destiny with your own hands, and build your own reality!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Hijikata Toushirou', 'There is no need for any proof. There is no need to create any. We just have to live every second to the fullest, and the traces of the path we lived will burn into the ground. That will serve as proof of our existence.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'The hole in one''s heart gets filled by others around you. Friends won''t flock to someone who abandons the memory of his friends and gives up on the world just because things don''t go the way he wants them to. That won''t help fill the hole in your heart. And people won''t help those who run away and do nothing. As long as you don''t give up, there will always be salvation.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3430, 'Daiki Aomine', 'The only one who can beat me, is me!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Kotarō Katsura', 'Change is never easy in this world. I can''t even change one friend, let alone a whole country.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'Flattery will get you everywhere.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'We are NOT asking him where the treasure is hidden!!! We''re not even asking him whether there IS any treasure or not!! I''m not sure, but... ...everybody set out to sea, risking their lives to search for it!!! If you ask this old man anything about it here and now... Then I''ll quit being a pirate! I don''t want to go on a boring adventure like that!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'They say people can change, but is that really true? If they decide they want to fly, will they grow wings? I don''t think so. You don''t change yourself, you change how you do things. You have to make your own way. You have to create a way to fly, even while you stay the same.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(61, 3904, 'Sora', 'There is no such thing as luck in this world. Rules, prerequisites, psychological states... There are any number of invisible factors that combine to produce an unpredictable, but inevitable result. The winner of each game is decided before it even begins. Chance is never a factor.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2297, 'Simon', 'We evolve beyond the person we were a minute before. Little by little, we advance a bit further with each turn.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 145, 'Rock Lee', 'If you believe in your dreams, I will prove to you, that you can achieve your dreams just by working hard.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3421, 'Taiga Kagami', 'There''s no such thing as useless effort.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Takasugi Shinsuke', 'The only people who say that money doesn''t matter in this world are the ones with lots of it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Shimura Tae', 'No matter how beautiful a person may be, they will still age and ultimately - die. But even so, even if appearances change, don''t you believe that we have, in us, things that don''t change? Even as our bodies crumble, even as the months and years take their toll... don''t you believe that we all have something that time can''t spoil? Even if you cover us with wrinkles, we won''t lose to you. That''s because we know what beauty truly is.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'People need to live their life with a clear conscience. When you want to walk on a straight path, somehow you get yourself stained with mud. However, as long as we never give up, one day the mud on you will dry up and fall off.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Silvers Rayleigh', 'Maybe nothing in this world happens by accident. As everything happens for a reason, our destiny slowly takes form...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Tobi', 'Not one wish ever gets granted in this world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ukitake Jyuushirou', 'There are two kinds of fights. As long as we place ourselves in battle, we must always know the difference, a fight to defend life or a fight to defend pride.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'After all, justice in this world is just a bunch of principles, made by those with power to suit themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1741, 'Hikaru Hitachiin', 'Yes, I''m the nice twin, but this conversation bores me. Go play in traffic, please.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Levi Ackerman', 'If you don''t want to die - think.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'Laws exist only for those who cannot live without clinging to them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Even if you can''t move anymore, or your back gets bent out of shape, it doesn''t matter! What matters is what''s inside! Not what someone looks like, dammit!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'One Piece', 'Even if armed with hundreds of weapons... there are times when you just can''t beat a man with a spear of conviction in his gut.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Annie Leonhardt', 'I just want the weak, who do get swept along with the flow, be considered human too.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'If you don''t like your destiny, don''t accept it. Instead, have the courage to change it the way you want it to be!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(63, 3943, 'Tatsuya Shiba', 'It''s a nice thought to believe in a "next time". If it was a real battlefield, there wouldn''t be a "next time".', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(58, 3855, 'Tsumugu Kinagase', 'Victory isn''t determined solely by who has the superior physical abilities.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 382, 'Brook', 'It''s over when you give up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3440, 'Teppei Kiyoshi', 'For living creatures, Victory if Life, and Defeat means Death.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Portgas D. Ace', 'We have to live a life of no regrets.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, 'Tetsuya Kuroko', 'If there''s no one happy, is it really a victory?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2690, 'Natsu Dragneel', 'The real sin is averting your eyes and failing to believe in anyone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2819, 'Mavis Vermillion', 'Comrade isn''t simply a word. Comrades are about heart. It''s the unconditional trust in your partners. Please, feel free to lean on me.... And I, too, will lean on you as well.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'In essence, language accounts for a mere 30% of human communication. The other 70% is made up of information collected from eye movements and other body language. With that, even a loner who never takes part in conversation can pull off 70% of what we consider communication.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Armin Arlelt', 'I don''t like the terms "good person" or "bad person" because it''s impossible to be entirely good to everyone or entirely bad to everyone. To some, you are a good person, while to others, you are a bad person.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Life is basically like a soap bubble. It rides on the wind, flying here and there... and before you realize it - pop! It''s gone. When it''s about to disappear, you think that you could''ve flown a little higher. But by the time, it''s already too late.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'That''s what I call smallness as a human being. No matter how much I''m irritated by it, I can''t do anything about it. It''s not complex, just stunted. Because as a human being I''m small, or something.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, 3562, 'Sorata Kanda', 'Everyday was the same. Deep down, I felt bored. But it wasn''t the days that felt boring. It was being just like everyone else.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1172, 'Izumi Curtis', 'When you live, your life will end sooner or later. The body will return to the earth. Grass and flowers will grow on top of it. The soul will nourish the hearts... and it will live on in the hearts of other people. Everything in this world flows around and circulates. That goes for human lives too.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Eren Jaeger', 'Nothing can suppress a human''s curiosity.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3378, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'There''s no meaningful difference between a real and a virtual world. It''s pointless to ask anyone who they really are. All you can do is accept and believe in them, because whoever they are in your mind, is their true identity.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'When people are protecting something truly special to them, they truly can become... as strong as they can be.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', 'There''s no advantage to hurrying through life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Akashi Seijuurou', 'When I tell you to leave, leave. In this world, winning is everything. Winners are affirmed completely, and losers are denied completely. I''ve never lost at anything before, and I never will. Because I always win, and I''m always right. I show no mercy to those who oppose me, not even my own parents.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kajoumaru Hidetomo', 'If one side was just, it would be called a defense or a suppression. But this is war. And wars happen because both sides are just.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2537, 'Meme Oshino', 'People have to save themselves. One person saving another is impossible.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2538, 'Shinobu Oshino', 'It''s difficult to change the world on your own, but twisting it a little might not be all that hard.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'All I need is the power to be able to protect my comrades. So long as I can have the strength to do that, I don''t care if I''m weaker than everyone else in the world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1169, 'Winry Rockbell', 'There are some things in life that will only be understood through words.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Levi Ackerman', 'I don''t know which option you should choose. I could never advise you on that... No matter what kind of wisdom dictates you the option you pick, no one will be able to tell if it''s right or wrong until you arrive to some sort of outcome from your choice.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3421, 'Taiga Kagami', 'This is our show. We''re the ones who are writing the script.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3004, 'Kurisu Makise', 'People''s feelings are memories that transcend time.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'The trick of real combat is that everyone is human.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Jinbei', 'Don''t just think about the ones you have lost. You can''t get back what you have lost. What is it that you still have ?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'What is right? What is wrong? In this mixed up world, deciding what is right and wrong is not easy. You can''t just go by somebody else''s rules. If you let yourself be controlled like that, you''ll just become a puppet that can''t make decisions on it''s own. You have to live by your rules.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Midorima Shintarou', 'How you change is up to you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'If we''re unable to climb down the mountain, then we won''t know whether there''s another mountain to climb up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'No single thing is perfect by itself. That''s why we''re born to attract other things to make up for what we lack. I think we start walking in the right direction only after we start getting our counterparts beside us.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, 'Tetsuya Kuroko', 'The past and the future are not the same, but they''re not completely separate either.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, 3562, 'Sorata Kanda', 'I pretended it was someone else''s fault that nothing happened. But I was wrong. If you put your mind to it, you can change the color of your world in an instant.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, NULL, 'Oreki Houtarou', 'I''m not stupid. I''m just too lazy to show how smart I am.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2537, 'Meme Oshino', 'I am not going to take sides, I am neutral. I am talking about standpoints here, that is all. Miss Class Representative (Hanekawa Tsubasa) has her point of view and her parents have their own. There is no way for an outsider to know which of them is right. Actually, there is not a right one in the first place. It is just about who is easier to agree with.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Okazaki Tomoya', 'Do not lose to the obstacles that you will meet in the future. I have my own set of goals but do not pursue them because of my laziness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Fake people have an image to maintain. Real people just don''t care.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', 'Knowing what it feels to be in pain, is exactly why we try to be kind to others.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'If you don''t take risks, you can''t create a future.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'Moping around with sadness and sorrow... what will come of it? Even dead people can do that. However, I''ll live and stand on my own two legs. If we are going to die one day, wouldn''t it be better to have no regrets?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'The world is destined for even greater chaos.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, 3040, 'Shura Kirigakure', 'You didn''t raise a weapon. You raised a son.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'You should keep your distance from me if you want to live. My place is in the shadows, yours in the light. We walk opposite paths, Aberline. It''s best that you remember that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'You want to keep everyone from dying? That''s naive. It''s war. People die.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'Is there truly any human who is not arrogant?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Annie Leonhardt', 'You are saying that innately, all people are good, and if they were to just assume their nature, this organization wouldn''t be so rotten, right? But in my opinion, the structure of the organization, the way it is set up is what provides insight into what the true human nature really is.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2413, 'Maka Albarn', 'It''s not that you don''t know how to interact with people. It''s just that no one ever came to interact with you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2688, 'Gray Fullbuster', 'Everything doesn''t have to be decided by life and death. Just think about the future.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, 3560, 'Misaki Kamiigusa', 'We found ourselves in conflict with each other many times. There were hard times when we wanted to run away or give up. But it was only because that rain fell, that the seeds of our emotions could sprout. And the flowers of deeper friendship could bloom.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, 3562, 'Sorata Kanda', 'Opportunities wait for no one! If you let an opportunity slip through your fingers with an excuse like, “I wasn''t prepared.” You''ll never get another opportunity like that again! But it is your life. Live it the way you want.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, NULL, 'Akasaka Ryuunosuke', 'Dividing an impossibly large task into smaller solvable problems, is a programmer''s job.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Before creation there must be destruction. If my soul stands in the way, then I''ll toss it aside. Yes, I have no choice but to move forward.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Armin Arlelt', 'Everyone can make a choice after they have learned what it will result in. It is so easy to say we should have done it this way afterwards. But you can''t know what your choice will result in before actually choosing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, NULL, 'Oreki Houtarou', 'I''m not against socializing, so long as it''s not tiring.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Armin Arlelt', 'I haven''t lived all that long yet, but there is something I firmly believe in. The people who have the ability to change something in this world, all without exception, have the guts to abandon things important to them if they have to. They are those who can abandon even their humanity.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'Why are you staring at me? Are you annoyed that I am the only one who has cake?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1633, 'Piccolo', 'Gohan, you showed me that power is nothing without being guided without love.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', 'I don''t think anyone is born knowing the reason why they''re here. It''s just something you have to find as you go along.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1176, 'Greed', '"I long to see someone who died", "I want to be rich", "I want women", "I want to protect the world"... They''re all desires. In other words, wishes. If you ask me, there''s neither "right" or "wrong" when it comes to greed. You humans go around ranking certain types of greed in order from good to bad, which makes you so hard to understand.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1633, 'Piccolo', 'Sometimes, we have to look beyond what we want and do what''s best.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2394, 'Charles Zi Britannia', 'The world lies! Thou shalt not commit murder, thou shalt not bear false witness, thou shalt not cheat, thou shalt not steal, thou shalt not covet thy neighbor''s wife. All of these are lies! Mere illusions and nothing more! They don''t want to be killed, they don''t want to be robbed, using the twin lies of justice and morality, the weak are endeavoring to protect themselves. But the first truth is that the strong devour the weak, so let us feed upon people, upon wealth, upon riches and power! We, at Britannia, shall feast upon the raw flesh of the world itself! We will crush this deception and bring forth the truth! All Hail Britannia!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Soichiro Yagami', 'Laws aren''t perfect, because humans who created laws aren''t perfect. It''s impossible to be perfect. However, the laws are evidence of the human''s struggle to be righteous.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', 'It''s stupid to talk about things you''re not. Be yourself and you''ll be fine.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Manga endings might always end the same. However, if it comes to life. Neither you or I are mere readers. We are writers. We can change the ending.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Time flows constantly, it doesn''t care about the people who are struggling.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'I love this game that people call "life" from the bottom of my heart.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Ohnoki', 'It''s because I''ve experienced pain in the past, that I can even consider what would be best for the future!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Kotomine Kirei', 'A certain scripture mentions that humans are superior to angels. Why? Because there are people who know of evil, but do not become evil. It''s different from angels, who know only of good since birth. Humans have evil, but can live as good, so they are superior to angels, who know only good.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2297, 'Simon', 'Reject common sense to make the impossible possible!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, NULL, 'Hunter X Hunter', 'You must be prepared to face the worst possible scenarios. Because harsh reality strikes without warning.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1200, 'Trisha Elric', 'We really are weak creatures, but that''s why we can strive to become stronger. Even if you feel it''s useless, each step we take leads to something great. That''s why I''m sure we''ll be able to change. Because we''re weak... and because death is inevitable. Humans try their best to live and end up becoming stronger.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, NULL, 'Scar''s Master', 'Enduring and forgiving are two different things. You must not forget the unjustness of society. As a human being, you must hold the event in contempt. Yet, you must endure. You must put an end to the chain of hatred!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 329, 'Sanji', 'Don''t start a fight that you can''t finish.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'I don''t care what the society says. I''ve regretted doing anything. I will survive and do what I want to.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'The fear of interacting with people...even I understand that one.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, 2607, 'Yoki', 'There''s nothing that''s entirely black or white.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'How can you move forward if you keep regretting the past?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 341, 'Crocodile', '"If I do this, I can stop the rebellion", "if I do that, I can stop the rebellion"... Open your eyes, princess! Your zealous idealism disgusts me! Ideals can only be spoken by those powerful enough to carry them out. And that excludes you!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3020, 'Sayaka Miki', 'The balance between hope and despair keeps itself to zero. When was it you told me that? I understand what you mean now, I did save quite a few people, but in exchange hatred and jealousy filled my heart, I even hurt my best friend. Someone has to be cursed to balance out a wish for someone else''s happiness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', 'Regardless of our limitations, we can always be of some use. Our power may seem insignificant... but it may just prove to be useful in the grand scheme of things. Stay focused. Never avert your eyes, because if an opening arises, even our insignificant power may be enough to determine the fate of the world. Which is why everyone must stay alert and ready to strike at any moment!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Uryuu Minene', 'It''s not possible to save everything. Prioritize your goals.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, NULL, 'Vincent Volaju', 'No one can draw a clear line between sane and insane. You move that line as you see fit for yourself. No one else can. You''ll understand soon... that the one that''s insane is this world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, NULL, 'Vincent Volaju', 'Know much about purgatory? It''s the place between heaven and hell, where those who were left behind, unable to get into heaven continue to suffer, a place of struggle and pain. In other words, the world that we''re in now.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 161, 'Orochimaru', 'Real power is forged from the desire smoldering in the heart. It fans into a flame and begins to burn with an intensity scarcely imagined to be possible.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, 'Sakura Haruno', 'Every one of us must do what''s in their power! If we''re going to die anyway, then it''s better to die fighting than to do nothing!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Kotomine Kirei', 'I want to know if it is a crime to live as you are, when you are different from others.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2, NULL, 'Johann Liebert', 'There''s nothing special about being born. Not a thing. Most of the universe is just death, nothing more. In this universe of ours, the birth of a new life on some corner of our planet is nothing but a tiny, insignificant flash. Death is a normal thing. So why live?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'In our society, letting others find out that you''re a nice person is a very risky move. It''s extremely likely that someone would take advantage of that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'Now I feel that maybe knowing who I actually am is the key to reach perfection. Because that means knowing what I can and cannot do.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ayasegawa Yumichika', 'Who are you again? Sorry, I have a bad memory for ugly faces.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, 1299, 'Kagetoki Kariya', 'Only hope can give rise to the emotion we call despair. But it is nearly impossible for a man to try to live without hope, so I guess that leaves Man no choice but to walk around with despair as his companion.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Kuroko No Basket', 'No matter how hard you practice, "someday" and "maybe" aren''t good enough. I need to know if you have ambitious goals and the will to accomplish them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Saber', 'Of what worth is a king who fails to protect the powerless?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'Under normal circumstances, humans should have continued to evolve as the greatest creatures upon this earth, but we were actually regressing. A rotten world. Politics, law, education... Was there anybody around who could correct this world? But someone had to do it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, 3083, 'Gilgamesh', 'Sinful? Corrupt? I don''t understand your logic. Why must pleasure and sin be connected? Pleasure gotten through evil means could be a sin. But pleasure can also result from good deeds. What kind of philosophy calls pleasure itself a sin?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, 3522, 'Akane Tsunemori', 'It''s not the final judgement of "good" and "evil" that''s important. What matters is that you come to that decision yourself. That you agonize over it and eventually accept it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1173, 'Roy Mustang', 'Life that has been lost cannot be brought back again. That very truth is what shows us the meaning and value
of living.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'Did you know every time you sigh, a little bit of happiness escapes?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Caster', 'Fright is about the feeling that you will die. The true meaning of terror doesn''t lie in a static condition, but in a change.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 382, 'Brook', 'No matter how deep the night, it always turns to day, eventually.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Matou Kariya', 'Children''s minds are immature. They do not possess a firm resolve and the strength to turn their misery to anger. Confronted with a cruel fate, they were not provided with the choice of having a strong will. Moreover, as they have not lived through and comprehended life, ideals such as honor and hope are yet to be completely nurtured in them. Therefore, in moments of despair, children are more prone than adults to seal away their own mind, lock up their own heart. Because they have not tasted the joy of life they can afford to discard. Because they have not understood the meaning of future, they can sink into despair.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1329, 'Rukia Kuchiki', 'Even if no one in the world believes you, stick out your chest and scream in defiance.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ayasegawa Yumichika', 'Discouraging, isn''t it? It''s always easier to tear down than to build... And much more difficult to tie than to untie.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'Why don''t you buy paper books? E-books lack character.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2362, 'Suzaku Kururugi', 'The best way to remove your lies is to make them come true.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1336, 'Soi Fon', 'Things like protecting the world are no more than moral reasons that sound good.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Hijikata Toushirou', 'If you run into a wall and pretend it doesn''t exist, you''ll never make progress. The wall will never change, so you''re the one who has to change.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Kotomine Risei', 'One''s true worth shows as hardship increases.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'Moving on doesn''t mean you forget about things. It just means you have to accept what''s happened and continue living.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'You wanted revenge? You''re just making other people as miserable as you. Revenge is just the path you took to escape your suffering.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'When people have different opinions, you should apply the majority vote.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Levi Ackerman', 'I think the best disciplining is pain.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1173, 'Roy Mustang', 'Any man who has the brains to think and the nerve to act for the benefit of the people of the country, is considered a radical, by those who are content with stagnation and willing to endure disaster.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1257, 'Zeniba', 'Once you meet someone, you never really forget them. It just takes a while for your memory to come back to you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Akise Aru', 'Whether I win or lose is up to me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'So what if the government collapses or the country is ruined? I''m not civic-minded! All I want to do is stand tall and live on until the day I collapse and die!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'Failing doesn''t give you a reason to give up as long as you believe.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'No matter how hard or impossible it is, never lose sight of your goal.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 382, 'Brook', 'What keeps me alive in this world is neither bodily organs, nor muscles - it''s my soul!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2473, 'Minori Kushieda', 'If you trip while running down a hallway, you''ll get a nosebleed. If you trip in life, you''ll cry.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'If the father''s responsibility is to protect the child... then my responsibility is to exceed the father.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3464, 'Eru Chitanda', 'If someone didn''t have any pride, wouldn''t they also be lacking in self-confidence? If someone was free of greed, wouldn''t they have trouble supporting their family? And if people didn''t envy one another, wouldn''t they stop inventing new things?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'You want to kill me? You couldn''t even kill my boredom!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Tony Tony Chopper', 'I realized that back then, the reason I wanted to become human, was that I really just wanted to have friends. Now, I just want to be a monster that can help Luffy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, 'Fujimoto Shirou', 'If you don''t like to be treated like a kid, then why don''t you try showing how much you have grown up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Hey! I''m totally an adult! I bitch and whine, lie through my teeth, and do things that are unfair.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Uryuu Minene', 'Doesn''t matter if you''re weak. If you struggle hard enough, you can make a miracle happen.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, 'Okabe Rintarou', 'Living should mean no do-overs. This is for the best.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'You sure can talk the talk, but you''re not quite ready to walk the walk. Time''s up, it''s my turn.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'CLANNAD', 'The world is beautiful. Even if you''re full of tears and sadness, open your eyes. Do what you want to do. Be what you want to be. Find friends. Don''t be in a hurry to grow up. Take your time.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2374, 'Shirley Fenette', 'Nothing is unforgivable. So if you cannot forgive him, it means you do not want to.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3440, 'Teppei Kiyoshi', 'If you wanna climb a mountain, you obviously aim for the top, but you gotta enjoy the scenery too.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'Are we friends? Or are we foes? That kind of thing you decide for yourselves!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1169, 'Winry Rockbell', 'There are some things that can only be conveyed through words.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, 2565, 'King Bradley', 'The life of each human is worth one life, that''s it. Nothing more, nothing less.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Why do people lie? It isn''t only because they struggle against each other, it''s also because there is something that they''re seeking.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, NULL, 'Olivier Mira Armstrong', 'If a man will not work, he shall not eat.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1199, 'Van Hohenheim', 'We''re all lost... That''s why we''re sad.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'I can''t stray from my path for those I''ve left behind.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Sai', 'It''s because Sakura loves Sasuke that she doesn''t want him to sink any lower. It''s because she loves him that she wants to rescue him from the evil path he currently walks. Even if the only way to do it is to kill him with her own two hands, I believe, she''s prepared to do it because she loves him.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'When a person loses their sense of belonging, they want someone else to hand it back to them on a platter.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'There are things that cannot be taken back. But the world will keep on spinning whether you laugh or you cry. High school life will eventually end too.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Rider', 'Here, my armies once rode across the land. The place all the heroes who stood with me, through joy and sorrow, will never forget. I can make this world real because it still exists within our hearts! Behold my endless armies! Their bodies destroyed, and their souls offered to the world as Heroic Spirits. And still, these legendary heroes pledge their loyalty to me! My bond with them is my greatest treasure, my path of kingship! The ultimate Noble Phantasm that I, Iskandar, possess. Ionian Hetairoi!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Kotomine Kirei', 'It is a simple story. There is nothing that brings me happiness. It does not matter, let it be believing in people or having people believe in me. What other people called happiness did not bring me any joy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Souichirou Kuzuki', 'It is fine to assume that the Master''s role is to support the battle from the back. But there are always exceptions. There are Masters who can only fight head on.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1173, 'Roy Mustang', 'Hughes, just a bit of advice. The soldiers who never shut up about their girls back home... They don''t make it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, 'Tetsuya Kuroko', 'Celebrations are more fun if there are more people.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Kizaru', 'Without strength, you won''t be able to save anyone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Rider', 'I suppose having your name recorded in the history books is a form of immortality. But if that just means your name gets passed down for two thousand years and nothing else, I''d have preferred to have even a hundredth of that added to my actual life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'How does one figure out if they''re in love with a member of the opposite sex?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, 'Okabe Rintarou', 'Urushibara Ruka, delicate as an orchid, fair as a cherry blossom, the personification of feminine grace and also... a dude. Tall as a willow, slender as a reed, a dude. Radiant in shrine vestments, dude. The sun dips low in a rosy sky, secateurs buzz, Ruka is a dude.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'There''s no point in incapable people pushing themselves. You''re better off calling for an expert in the field.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'No matter how hard you blow, you can never extinguish our fire. As long as a single flare remains, the others can be relit.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Okita Sougo', 'In this world, there are things you have to protect even if your hands get stained with blood.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', '"The important thing is to take part." Famous words spoken by Pierre de Frédy, Baron de Coubertin during a speech. However, this quote tends to be frequently misused and serves as kind of a threat to force participation. There are tons of wild-goose chases in this world, y''know. If the most important thing is to take part, then surely one could find meaning in not taking part as well. And if everything''s worth experiencing, then there''s little doubt that the feeling of not experiencing something is, in itself, worth experiencing. In fact, you could even call it a valuable experience to not experience something everyone else does.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Everything we see, everyone we meet, is caught up in a great unseen flow. But it''s bigger than that. It''s the entire world, the entire universe even. And compared to something as big as that, Al, you and I are tiny, not even the size of ants. Only one small part within a much greater flow. Nothing more than a fraction of the whole. But by putting all those "ones" together, you get one great "All", just like Teacher said. The flow of this universe follows laws of such magnitude that you and I can''t even imagine them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'But we''re alive, aren''t we? We don''t have any magic power, but we''re alive! We have the strength to overcome the weakness and the fear! That''s what it means to be alive!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'One Piece', 'We cannot direct the wind, but we can adjust the sails.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'The curtain that falls down at the end, shall be pulled down by the blade of my sword.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'Power isn''t determined by your size, but the size of your heart and dreams!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3430, 'Daiki Aomine', 'For a winner, there is nothing to say to a loser.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Life is something that can never be lived twice. Even this pointless act will eventually end. And while thinking that one day, I''ll surely regret its end...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'I''ve been thinking about this for a long time. We put all our trust in alchemy but in the end... what is it? "Alchemy is the science of understanding the flow of matter and its laws. The process of comprehension, deconstruction, and reconstruction. The world flows too. It must also follow laws. Everything circulates. Even death is a part of that circulation. You must accept the flow." Hmm, Teacher sure drummed that into our heads, didn''t she? I thought I understood it. But I don''t understand anything... Mom proves that. Now here I am again, trying desperately to figure out a way to do the impossible. I''m such a hopeless idiot. All this time and I haven''t grown up one bit. I thought maybe the rain would wash away some of this gloom that''s been following me... but right now, every drop that hits my face is even more depressing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'I don''t think ignorance is necessarily a bad thing. The more you know, the more problems you have.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3275, 'Knov', 'Whenever humans encounter the unknown, they tend to lose perspective.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'A wandering soul in isolation, has no need for a place to belong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3744, 'Dot Pixis', 'If it means mankind will live on, I don''t mind being called a murderer', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(54, NULL, 'Urushihara Hanzou', 'Heaven is a six-tatami, one room, second floor apartment on Earth. Being a NEET is the best.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(54, NULL, 'Maou Sadao', 'If you feel the ends justify the means, how does that make you different from us demons, exactly?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Soichiro Yagami', 'The real evil is the power to kill people. Someone who finds himself with that power is cursed. No matter how you use it, anything obtained by killing people can never bring true happiness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'What does someone who´s lost their standing want the most? That''s simple. They want someone to find them, where they''re standing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'You can certainly fulfill your wish to "save someone". But a wish for you to save yourself, does not exist. You will embrace a borrowed ideal that is not yours, and you will probably pursue it until you die.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3465, 'Satoshi Fukube', 'A joke only lasts for a moment, if it leaves a misunderstanding, it becomes a lie.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2665, 'Yuzuru Otonashi', 'One person needed courage to face the past.
Another person needed effort to make a dream come true.
Yet another person needed time and friends.
What about you?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'I don''t want other people to mention my "self". Besides, if I can be changed with a few words, then that wouldn''t be my "self", would it?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Nobody can take anybody''s place. There isn''t a person in this world that could take your place. It doesn''t matter if you were based on me or have the same face.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3684, 'Shizuka Hiratsuka', 'Helping someone out is not a justifiable reason for you to get hurt.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', 'People share only one common fate... death.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'That''s all I wanted to say. There is nothing at the end of helping people. It is a false life that can save neither yourself nor others.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'As a cool guy, I''m used to seeing naked women.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Kotomine Kirei', 'I envy you people. What I sought, but could not obtain. What I obtained, but could not obtain. Many things slipped out between my fingers, no matter what commandment I used.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, 3083, 'Gilgamesh', '[To Waver] The path of devotion is a great labor. Do not ever mar it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'Blue sky is in the distance. It feels so close. Yet, I cannot grab it even if I reach out with my hands. I looked up at the stars before. The stars that I cannot reach and the wishes that will not be granted. There is nothing we have been able to leave behind for each other. Therefore, traces and memories will disappear someday. But still... Even if it will not reach her, there should be something that will remain in our hearts. There is nothing that remains in our hands, but we lived the same time and looked up at the same things. If I can remember that. I can believe that we can be together even if we are far apart.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ayasegawa Yumichika', 'It''s always a lot easier to let something fall apart, than it is to try to hold it together.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Zaraki Kenpachi', 'Loyalty to someone is different from depending on them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 267, 'Shikaku Nara', 'Legends from the distant past are always exaggerated, but eventually, someone outdoes them... that''s when new legends are born!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 175, 'Gamabunta', 'What''s your wish? Peace? Money? Or the world? Whatever you wish for, it''s something you have to get with your own strength!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, 'Sakura Haruno', 'The things that are most important aren''t written in books. You have to learn them by experiencing them yourself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Emiya Kiritsugu', 'And there you go. You heard her, Iri. Our Heroic Spirit thinks a battlefield to be something better than Hell. What a joke. It''s Hell itself. There is no hope on a battlefield. There is nothing but unspeakable despair. Just a crime we call victory, paid for by the pain of the defeated. But humanity has never recognized this truth. And the reason is that, in every era, a dazzling hero has blinded the people with their legends, and kept them from seeing the evil of bloodshed. True human nature has not advanced a step beyond the Stone Age.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Rider', 'Indeed. I wanted to see Oceanus with my own eyes. Unfortunately, my dream never came true. Oceanus is still my final destination. A dream that never ends. Go ahead and laugh. Two thousand years later, and I still have the same dream. Every bit the fool as well. And so boy... a pact with a fellow idiot seems ideal.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'That is why I will keep running for now. If I aim for the distance, there should come a day when I would be able to reach out to what I have been aiming for.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Lancer', 'It should be natural for you to drink until dawn with someone you get along with, even if he may be your enemy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', '[To Gilgamesh] That''s right. I don''t create swords. I create a world that contains infinite swords. This is the only magic allowed for me. There''s no need to be surprised. These are all imitations. As you say, these are all trifling swords. But there is no rule that says an imitation cannot defeat the original. If you say you are the original, I will surpass every one of your weapons and destroy your existence. Here I come, King of Heroes! Do you have enough swords in stock?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Rider', 'Impossible, right? Compared to the enemy we''re facing, you and I are the same, no more than dots! What''s the point in comparing our heights? That is what makes this exciting! The smallest, the weakest - it doesn''t matter! I should still wish to go and take over the world, with nothing more than my tiny dot of a body! Within my chest, beats the heart of the King of Conquerors!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'Emiya Shirou! Listen, you are not "one who fights". You are nothing more than "one who creates". Don''t think of irrelevant things. There is only one thing you can do, master that one thing. Do not forget. The thing you image is always "your strongest self." You don''t need any other enemies. The opponent you have to fight is none other than "your own image".', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2689, 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'I won''t give up, I will fight til the bitter end, cause there''s no way I will back down after what you did to my friends. They are what made me the person I am today, that''s why I''ll keep fighting... For my friends!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'If strength is justice, then is powerlessness a crime?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2689, 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'Don''t judge me unless you have looked through my eyes, experienced what I went through and cried as many tears as me. Until then back-off, cause you have no idea.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2909, 'Anri Sonohara', 'What do you think a truly unusual life would be like? Something really unique. It''d be the kind of life where every single day, nothing new ever happened. Nothing changed. That kind of a life is truly unusual.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Shima Katsuki', 'Love is like a firework from the past... it''s more beautiful for it to go to pieces and scatter far off.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3779, 'Rico Brzenska', 'Of course, every soldier is prepared to die. But these people aren''t just pawns on a chessboard. They all have names, families and feelings in their hearts too. They are all humans who live and bleed. You have the responsibility to ensure their death will not be in vain. No matter what may come, remember this in your naive heart, and be ready to die to fulfill that duty.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', 'Someday, I just want to marry a regular girl who isn''t too ugly and not too pretty. Have two children, first a girl, then a boy. Retire after my daughter is married and my son becomes a successful ninja, and spend the rest of my life playing shōgi or Go. Then die of old age before my wife.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'They say that if you change yourself, you''ll change the world. but that''s a complete lie. They''re just forcing you to compromise, by feeding you a convenient little fib.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, 'Tetsuya Kuroko', 'The stronger the light, the darker the shadow.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Relying on someone, helping each other out, and supporting each other. Most would say that''s the right thing to do. However, that''s just idealistic. In reality, someone always gets the short end of the stick.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'Self-sacrifice... A nameless shinobi who protects peace within its shadow. That is a true shinobi.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Excuses are meaningless. The tougher things get, the more likely people are to come to their own conclusions.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'Fear is necessary for evolution. The fear that could be destroyed at any moment.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'I don''t want to regret anything. I want to make all the tragedies that happened into meaningful things by believing that my path is right.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1316, 'Kurama', 'People who think that they can make up their past follies with regret, cannot be forgiven.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Stress makes you bald, but it''s stressful to avoid stress, so you end up stressed out anyway. In the end, there''s nothing you can do.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Honest feelings can sometimes lead to cruel endings.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 207, 'Yashamaru', 'Love is... care and devotion you feel for the precious ones around you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 185, 'Hiruzen Sarutobi', 'It doesn''t matter what you do, if you live and die as you like. However, no matter what road you end up taking, remember to protect the people that are precious to you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', 'In life, nothing good comes out of hurrying.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Jirobou', 'I don''t know which is more pathetic; the fool, or those who follow him.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Sasori', 'What''s the point of something that disappears as soon as it''s born?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Sai', 'A smile is the best way to get oneself out of a tight spot, even if it is a fake one. Surprisingly enough, everyone takes it at face value.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nagato', 'War brings death. And wounds and pain to both sides. There''s nothing harder to accept, than the deaths of those you love. So you believe they could never die. Especially those who haven''t known war.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Shimura Danzo', 'Emotion leads one to hate... and hate leads one to conflict and war.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1185, 'King Bradley', '[To Lan Fan] Brat, quit blabbering on about trifling topics such as love and sadness. Don''t underestimate us. She''s the woman I chose. A will is unnecessary between us. That''s usually how it is between a King and his companion.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1199, 'Van Hohenheim', '[To Father] You''ve certainly mellowed out... you used to be fun, full of life and emotion. Lust, Greed, Sloth, Gluttony, Envy, Wrath, and Pride. Of course, excessive want will destroy anyone, but those same desires are necessary to understand what it means to be human. Why did you rid yourself of them?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, NULL, 'Solf J. Kimblee', 'Ah... what a beautiful sound. It doesn''t get any better than that. I can feel it deep in my bones, like a part of me I never noticed before. That sound is an extension of my being. And this land - this land that''s governed by death - I will paint it red with this shard of destruction.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'Alphonse Elric', 'This body comes with many inconveniences. But inconveniences don''t make me miserable! There is no reason for you to pity me! My life was put back together with alchemy by my brother. If I deny myself, that would mean I''m denying my brother, along with alchemy. I believe in the potential that alchemy holds. I want to believe in it!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', 'A person grows up when he''s able to overcome hardships. Protection is important, but there are some things that a person must learn on his own.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Sasori', 'True beauty lies in things that last forever, never rotting or fading.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Is it wrong to do stuff by yourself? If someone worked hard on their own until now, why do they have to face rejection here?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'I am who I am and there is nothing wrong with that. The days continue like they always have, bringing neither excessive desire nor despair, nothing''s changed. Yet I''m overwhelmed by this sense of fulfillment. I''m over here, you''re over there. If I''m your savior, then you''re mine.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Armin Arlelt', 'People who can''t throw something important away, can never hope to change anything.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Rider', 'When you someday find a way of life that you can truly be proud of, you''ll be forced into your own battle whether you like it or not.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1177, 'Lust', 'Memories... of the people we were. They''re subtle, but they''re real. It took me a lot of time to understand what I saw. Books say we shouldn''t have memories. Or at least that they''re only the memories and emotions of the alchemists who made us. But they are wrong. Those memories are mine.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1173, 'Roy Mustang', 'But you''re thinking on too large a scale there, kid... If we don''t want to drive ourselves crazy, we can only deal with what''s directly in front of us.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3465, 'Satoshi Fukube', 'A database can''t draw conclusions.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Rider', 'The inferiority you feel is actually the quality of a king. You may grumble a lot, but you know how small you are. And yet you still struggle to reach heights greater than you can imagine.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Even when our eyes are closed, there''s a whole world out there, that lives outside of ourselves and our dreams.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1177, 'Lust', 'Maybe you are right. Where did I come from and where will I go? When I die? Maybe all this time that is what I wanted: the freedom to find out.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1185, 'King Bradley', 'You think surrendering, and offering yourself will stop the war? How arrogant. The life of each human is worth one, that''s it. Nothing more, nothing less.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, NULL, 'Father', 'When you notice an insect on the ground, do you stop to consider it a fool? The life of an insect is so beneath you that it would be a waste of your time to even consider judging it. That would be an accurate summation of my feelings towards you, humans.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1175, 'Riza Hawkeye', 'If the ways of this world are based on equivalent exchange, as alchemy says, then in order to allow for a new generation to enjoy good fortune, the price that we must pay, is to carry the bodies of the dead across a river of blood.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Kotarō Katsura', 'Love is based on unpredictable events.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Rider', 'Using a simple method to accomplish something impressive, far outshines using a complex method to achieve the same thing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2915, 'Seiji Yagiri', 'A name has nothing to do with loving someone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'Alphonse Elric', 'On the day we left, we burned down the family home and all the familiar things inside. Because some memories aren''t meant to leave traces.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', '[To Envy] Now I see. You''re Jealous. You''re jealous of humans, aren''t you? According to you, humans are supposed to be a lot weaker than Homunculi. And yet, even if they get discouraged after being beaten, and even if they get close to falling down after losing their paths, they continue to get up and fight. Everyone around them helps them get back up. And you''re envious of that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, NULL, 'Miles', 'The death of a culture, is the death of a people.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2709, 'Ultear Milkovich', 'The time known as "LIFE", cannot be rewound.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3744, 'Dot Pixis', 'I wouldn´t mind being eaten, as long as it was by a scorchingly hot lady titan.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'I want to see the splendor of people''s souls.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2424, 'Crona', 'Trusting someone not to hurt you... how idiotic is that?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, NULL, 'Father', 'You can''t change reality, just your perception!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1200, 'Trisha Elric', 'You see, I''m sure we can change, because we''re weak. And because we die. We have to fight in order to live, and that is what will make us strong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1185, 'King Bradley', 'Open your eyes. "God" is nothing more than a construct created by man to inspire fear and promote order.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Eren Jaeger', 'No matter how messed up things get, you can always figure out the best solution.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, NULL, 'Pride', 'Appearances rarely share the whole truth.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1178, 'Envy', 'Don''t kid yourself, Mustang. You know how humans love to watch other people suffer while making fools of themselves. I mean, why else would you constantly be at war with each other?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1179, 'Alex Louis Armstrong', 'Destruction and creation are two sides of the same coin! You must destroy to create! That is the law of the universe!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, NULL, 'Olivier Mira Armstrong', 'Love for the dead is pointless. We fight to keep them alive, that is all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'It doesn''t matter who they are, I won''t forgive anyone who tries to stand out more than me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2538, 'Shinobu Oshino', 'There''s no reason a fake can''t do what the real thing would. And it''s possible for a fake to be more real than the real thing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Tsunade', 'People become stronger because they have things they cannot forget. That''s what you call growth.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3465, 'Satoshi Fukube', '“Expectations” are what you have when you have given up. Expectations are born from a despairingly large difference in skill.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Yoshino Yūsuke', 'At a place where you feel most restful… Next to the person you find most dear. People''s lives are repetitions of inflicting pain on each other. It''s understandable to doubt others. But being unable to trust anything is the same as being unable to feel other people''s love. Aren’t you, perhaps, feeling lonely? Aren’t you, perhaps, living slavishly? Are you able to laugh with an honest heart?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Guys are simple creatures. Just by talking to them, they get the wrong idea.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Trafalgar Law', 'The weak don''t get to decide anything, not even how they die.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1176, 'Greed', 'You want to bring back someone that you''ve lost. You might want money. Maybe you want women. Or, you might want to protect the world. These are all common things people want. Things that their hearts desire. Greed may not be good, but it''s not so bad, either. You humans think greed is just for money and power! But everyone wants something they don''t have.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3727, 'Mikasa Ackerman', 'This world is merciless, and it''s also very beautiful.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Grand Elder Guru', 'Death is simply another stage of our life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'If you can''t get along without putting someone else down, it can''t be real friendship.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3378, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'No point in wondering who someone really is, all you can do is trust them and accept them for who they are. Because the person you come to know is who that person really is.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Son Goku', 'Power comes in response to a need, not a desire. You have to create that need.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2836, 'Kagura Mikazuchi', 'Sometimes, mermaids can devour tigers.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2708, 'Jellal Fernandes', 'Life and death are the very basis of all things. They intensify every emotion. Or, to put it in a rather different way, there is nothing quite so dull as "life".', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Furukawa Nagisa', 'Life can bring lots of hardships, but it''s always important to keep in mind that there are people around you who care for you, and are willing to help you through whatever you''re dealing with.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Fujibayashi Ryou', 'If a prediction is right, then it''s like you only have one future. Like that future has been decided. But if it''s wrong, then you have an almost infinite number of possibilities. And that means that even the tiniest twist of fate can change your future. I want to believe that I have choices - that the path I walk has many different turns, and many different roads to follow!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Armin Arlelt', 'The people who have the ability to change something in this world, all, without exception, have guts to abandon things important to them if they have to.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2836, 'Kagura Mikazuchi', 'I haven''t relied on luck since the moment I was born. Everything has been the result of my choices. That is what leads my existence towards the future.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Hard work betrays none, but dreams betray many.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, 'Okabe Rintarou', 'If you want to grant your own wish, then you should clear your own path to it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2699, 'Loke', 'Do you understand the sorrow of a star that cannot return to the heavens?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Okazaki Ushio', 'Sanae-san told me, places that I can cry are in a toilet, or in daddy''s arms.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Gintama', 'Do you have any idea how stupid we are? Don''t underestimate us!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1174, 'Maes Hughes', 'Okay, here''s the plan: We go in, start hitting people, and see where it takes us.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, 'Okabe Rintarou', 'The"''present" is a leaf floating on top of the river. It moves along with the flow from past to future.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1176, 'Greed', 'There''s no such thing as no such thing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2735, 'Lisanna Strauss', 'All living things eventually die. It''s unavoidable. But as long as you remember, it will live on in your heart forever.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2732, 'Evergreen', 'I love flowers. They look so good... On me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2694, 'Makarov Dreyar', 'Magic is anything you can think of. It can be felt in infinite ways... As light, as darkness, as red, as blue. It is living freely, together along side Fairy Tail.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'I wonder how long... How long will I remain anchored at this harbor known as battle?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2688, 'Gray Fullbuster', 'I don''t care where I get hurt, as long as my injuries are visible.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(39, 3067, 'Chiriko Tsurumi', 'I''ll never dream about things that I know won''t come true.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1741, 'Hikaru Hitachiin', 'Well, I don''t see what''s so funny. I''m honest, I speak my mind, and I don''t hold back. It''s sneaky people like Kaoru who are the troublemakers.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Ignorance is bliss, isn''t it?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1175, 'Riza Hawkeye', 'The heroes during times of war, are nothing but mass murderers during times of peace.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Rider', 'The King lives to the fullest! He needs to live more fully than anyone else. He is a figure of admiration to his people!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'When humans are faced with truly terrifying circumstances, they don''t think about other people around them. They''re even willing to sacrifice those around themselves. By exposing that unsightly part of them, they can no longer get along.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Emiya Kiritsugu', 'Even if I am to carry all the evils of this world, it won''t matter. If that can save the world, then I''d gladly accept it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'The only way to truly escape the mundane is for you to constantly be evolving. Whether you choose to aim high, or aim low. Enjoy each day for what it is.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1804, 'Umibouzu', 'I like fish, biiiig FISH. I also have a crap haircut, kinda like Naruto.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', '"You can''t run away" is an ideal for the strong. You''re not always wrong. Society, the world, the people around you - often someone else is in the wrong. To think that you can change is adapting to this cruel, indifferent, trashy world. It''s admitting defeat and servility. You''re simply deceiving yourself by dressing it up with pretty words.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2417, 'Franken Stein', 'I have a simpler motive. Experimentation and observation - that''s all a true scientist cares about. And I am a scientist. Everything in the world is an experimental test subject, of course, that includes myself as well.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, 'Suoh Tamaki', 'I thought that I was, to a certain degree, an intelligent person. When I realized I was an idiot, I was really shocked!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2296, 'Kamina', 'What is your drill for?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 154, 'Chouji Akimichi', '[talking about food] The last bite. It is the final one, and the most suitable one to enjoy the most. No matter what it costs, I will not give it up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, NULL, 'Akasaka Ryuunosuke', 'Love is simply an electrical bug in the human neural circuit.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3465, 'Satoshi Fukube', 'I won''t ever be the best at anything. Or rather, you might say that I''ve stopped trying to be.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2689, 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'Oh, guilds are organizations where wizards gather to share information and find work. You can''t be considered a full-fledged wizard unless you''re in a guild.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3465, 'Satoshi Fukube', 'Whatever I do, I''ll always be me. I won''t tone myself down to fit in.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2819, 'Mavis Vermillion', 'Mistakes are not shackles that halt one from stepping forward. Rather, they are that which sustain and grow one''s heart.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2664, 'Yuri Nakamura', 'What does it mean to be reborn? That isn''t the life I had anymore. It''s someone else''s life. Everyone only gets to live life one time [Yuri places her hand on her chest.], and it''s right here. I only get it once. This is my life. I can''t entrust it to someone, I can''t steal a new one, I can''t force it on others, I can''t forget it or erase it. I can''t stomp over it, laugh at it, or beautify it! I can''t anything! I''d have to accept my one shot at life no matter how cruel, merciless, or unfair I thought it was! Sir, don''t you understand? That is why I must fight. I must keep on fighting! Because... because I can never [slams her desk with her hands] accept that kind of life!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'They say if you change yourself, you''ll change the world, but that''s a complete lie. When people judge somebody, it becomes a fixed idea and an impression that lasts. A loner is forced to stay a loner. If you do your best at something and stand out, that''ll only get used as fodder for criticism. Those are the rules of the Kingdom of Children.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Question: The world will not change, but you can change yourself. So then, how will you change?
Answer: You become the god of a new world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2693, 'Mirajane Strauss', 'People cry, not because they''re weak. Its because they''ve been strong for too long.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'I can''t lose against myself. There''s no element that would make me lose if our powers are equal. To admit defeat against such an enemy is to declare that I''m wrong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3727, 'Mikasa Ackerman', 'You don''t stand a single chance to win, unless you fight.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1317, 'Bando', 'I pull the trigger. The gun goes off. Your brains splatter all over the sand. The beach gets bloody and you get dead.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Youth is a hoax. It''s evil. People who make a big deal of their "youth", are just inviting trouble. They try to keep everything going on around them. For them, if there''s something that has to do with their "youth", they jump at it without a second thought. From normal daily life, to rebelling against the view of society. If you fall in with them - lies, secrets, failure, and even crimes await you. But for them, it''s just a spice of life. And if failure is also a mark of "youth", then isn''t it ironic, that a person who failed to make any friends, is also technically leading his "youth"? Though I wonder if they would agree. Everything runs on their schedule. Let me be clear. The people who enjoy their "youth", will eventually fall apart.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'Peace under an illusion is not true peace. It''s only meaningful if the real world manages to accomplish it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'My power isn''t the Rasengan or Sage Jutsu or the Nine Tails chakra. My power is right here. [points to the center of his chest]', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, 3524, 'Nobuchika Ginoza', 'Hey, it''s been a while. I came to talk to you today, since I decided what I''m going to do next. My Crime Coefficient went up to 140. There''s no longer a chance for recovery. But it''s not in my nature to sit around and mope in the isolation facility. So I decided to go back to where I used to work. You told me to take a different path. Guess I didn''t live up to your expectations. I''m a bad son in every respect, aren''t I? But strangely enough, I have no regrets. There''s nothing good about being a detective. Even so, it''s a job that someone needs to do. Right, dad?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, 'Suoh Tamaki', 'Forgive my rudeness, but to hide your true self and make a vain display... I think that''s just running away from reality. To know what you are really like, and acknowledge it... A positive thinking of enjoying yourself... isn''t that what true strength is?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'It''s never been "The one who becomes Hokage will be acknowledge by everyone", it''s "The one who is acknowledge by everyone, becomes the Hokage".', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(43, 3301, 'Mei Misaki', 'Death is not friendly. It''s dark, black where you look at it. You''re all alone. But it''s no different when you''re alive, right? No matter how many relationships we seem to have, we''re all alone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Tohsaka Rin', 'Those who aim further for other''s sake. Those who think of others before themselves. ...And those who hate themselves more than anyone. These are the qualities of a Magus. This is a contradiction you can only have if you are born broken.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'What''s past is past. I cannot redo it, nor go back to it. I have escaped from that scene and still continue to live. All I can do is look forward.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2664, 'Yuri Nakamura', 'When we were still in the world of living, death was something that came indiscriminately and randomly. So, there was no way to fight it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, NULL, 'Iwasawa', 'I heard that when things were painful for her, she''d cover her ears with headphones and escape to the world of music. I tried it too. It was like everything was blown away. The vocals screamed for me. They grieved for me. The ones who put on the act of common sense were wrong. Those who cried were right. We, the lonely were more human. They screamed at the absurd, beat it down, and destroyed it. They saved me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2674, 'Ooyama', 'Oh man, my heart is pounding. I''m eating snacks in the middle of class! I ate it! I totally ate it! Boldly eating snacks in the middle of class! I''m being so reckless!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1770, 'Kagura', 'It hasn''t withered. I won''t let it wither. We might just be little branches, but if the branches break off, the tree really will wither. That''s why I won''t break off. Even if winter comes and the leaves fall off, even if the wind comes and all the other little branches break off... Even if I am the last branch left, I won''t break off. I''m sure we''ll be together till the end.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2693, 'Mirajane Strauss', 'I don''t think it''s completely such a bad thing to cling to one single person, but you have any number of people all around you. People are always connected to one another. You see? Just reach out your hand, and there''s someone right here. It''s when people realize how lonely it is being on their own, that they start to become kind.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Kotomine Kirei', 'If there is a pure wish in this world, it must be the desire to be born.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'If you have a wish, don''t go back to the past and redo everything. If you want to change yourself, don''t change the past, but change who you are now!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2694, 'Makarov Dreyar', 'It is love that can make us strong, but it is also love that can make us weak.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'I don''t have any wishes that won''t come true or that are impossible. Because if it''s a dream I can''t reach by myself, I won''t even dream it in the first place.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Kotomine Kirei', 'People cannot change the past. All we can do, is accept our own actions. If you still wish to be burdened by your sins, let it show in your future actions. It is your choice how to perceive something that has already happened.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 'Kirisaki Hana', 'Time is not money. You can''t buy time, now can you?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, NULL, 'Hades', 'The mistakes people make are eventually labeled as experience. But with a true mistake, there will be no experience to be gained. Because the mistake you made taking me as your opponent will leave you with no future.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'Hurt me with the truth. But never comfort me with a lie.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2708, 'Jellal Fernandes', 'Tears are how our heart speaks when your lips cannot describe how much we''ve been hurt.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2688, 'Gray Fullbuster', 'Inside my memories lies sad thoughts and it''s hard to forget, but I try everyday to keep moving forward in life, so why can''t you, living in saddness isn''t living at all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'Do not think about other things, there is only one thing you can do. So master that one thing. Do not forget. What you must imagine is always that you, yourself, are the strongest. You do not need outside enemies. For you, the one you have to fight is none other than your own image.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'If you walk down the path that you believe is right, you cannot be wrong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Saber', 'There are no regrets. If one can be proud of one''s life, one should not wish for another chance.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Kotomine Kirei', 'There are worthless things, but there are no meaningless things.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'I just want to relieve my sexual frustrations. All I feel towards a cat eared high school girl in her underwear... is lust.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'A flower can''t choose the place where it blooms and a child can''t choose the parents he''s born to.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Eren Jaeger', 'I want to see and understand the world outside. I don''t want to die inside these walls without knowing what''s out there!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1863, 'Kirara', 'I think that in the end, I just care a lot about myself. I was the only one that I loved and respected. That''s why I was scared to know what the others thought about me. I was afraid to get hurt, so I ran away and locked myself into my shell.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Obi Hajime', 'Tears are handy for washing away troubling and sad feelings. But when you grow up, you''ll learn that there are things so sad, they can never be washed away by tears. That there are painful memories that should never be washed away. So people who are truly strong laugh when they want to cry. They endure all of the pain and sorrow while laughing with everybody else.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Trying to shoulder the burden all by yourself? Don''t be a stranger. Weep and ask for help. Lean on me with your runny nose. Cry when you feel like crying. Laugh when you feel like laughing. When you''re tearing up with an ugly face, I''ll give you a good cry with an uglier face. When you''re laughing so hard your stomach hurts, I''ll laugh in a louder voice. That''s how it should be. It''s far better to get dirty while living true to yourself, than to throw away yourself and die a clean death.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3178, 'Mito Freecss', 'If you want to get to know someone, you need to make an effort to learn why they''re angry.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Tousen Kaname', 'Those who do not fear the sword they wield, have no right to wield a sword at all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Karin', 'Regardless if you see them or not, if you don''t believe, then it''s like they never existed.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Levi Ackerman', 'The difference in judgement between you and me, originates from different rules derived from past experience.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'Eternity is instantaneous, and an instant is eternal.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2829, 'Rob', 'Freedom can be found at the bottom of your heart.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3004, 'Kurisu Makise', '[after kissing Okabe] There was a scientific rationale for that! Because... important memories, including, but not limited to, one''s first kiss, are stored in the hippocampus, which makes them harder to forget. So I figured...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2690, 'Natsu Dragneel', 'Don''t give up, the beginning is always the hardest, so let''s keep on going till the very end.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'That''s the kind of people they are. Whether it was me or not doesn''t make a difference. A person falling to their doom, and without a second thought they would jump in to save them. It''s impossible to just sit and let it happen. Without thinking of the consequences their bodies just move. That''s what kind of idiocy is gathered here. That''s the Yorozuya. Even if you forget everything else, as long as you remember that much, we''re good. As long as you remember that, whomever your leader is, you guys will do fine.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'In the shinobi world, those that break the written and unwritten rules are deemed trash... but be that as it may... Those that would desregard their comrades so easily are even worse than trash. And those who don''t have the decency to respect the memories of their comrades are the worst.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Might Guy', 'If you want to be free from your suffering, make up your mind. If you give up on your dream, you will suffer more.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'Take it, that courage you have locked in your heart. Awaken it, wipe your tears, be strong and use that courage.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, NULL, 'Yoshida Haru', 'Clean up after yourself. If you want to be accepted, you must accept yourself first.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3727, 'Mikasa Ackerman', 'Only victors are allowed to live... this world is merciless like that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Eren Jaeger', '[referring to a group of thugs] I disposed of some dangerous beasts. Mere animals that just happened to resemble humans.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, NULL, 'Leorio Paladiknight', 'For the right price, you can buy not only treasures, but dreams, hearts and even people''s lives!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'We reset, and return to our separate lives. You can''t reset your life, but you can reset your relationships.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'I really am... shinobi trash. But the one thing I still learned is this. That void is something that everyone helps you fill. Just because you face adversity and hardships, is no reason to give up on this world. A person willing to throw away all those memories... of their friends and comrades, will never find peace of mind. Resorting to something like that isn''t going to bury that hole. If you persevere and endure, someone will be there to support you!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3684, 'Shizuka Hiratsuka', 'Didn''t your mother ever tell you that mentioning a woman''s age will get you killed?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'You STILL don''t get it? When you tossed all of that away, a few important things were discarded as well. You abandoned your friends? More like you were afraid of BEING abandoned. You fight by yourself? More like you hid yourself in solitude from the beginning. You abandoned yourself? No... You just couldn''t bear the pain of having a heavy load place upon you, or being a heavy load, so you ran. Like the coward you are. If you want to live your life abandoning one thing after another, that''s your choice. But to try to incite your student to join you because you can''t handle being alone, makes you a fool.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Levi Ackerman', 'The only thing we''re allowed to do... is to believe that we won''t regret the choice we made.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, 3727, 'Mikasa Ackerman', 'If you think it''s natural for people to sacrifice their own lives to save others, surely you understand that sometimes a single death can save many lives.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Armin Arlelt', 'The strong feed upon weak. It''s such an obligingly simple rule. Except in this world, my friends tried to be strong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2689, 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'You have three choices, you can give up, give in or give it your all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2688, 'Gray Fullbuster', 'I won''t run, I will stand and look ahead to what I must do, I must face the fear, I won''t let it control me anymore, I will use my heart that holds my courage and my bravery to move me forward to what I must do.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3020, 'Sayaka Miki', 'Someone has to be cursed to balance out a wish for someone else''s happiness. That''s how we, magical girls, work.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'I wish I could go back to my childhood. It went by so quickly I feel like it was robbed from me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Eren Jaeger', 'If you win, you live. If you lose, you die. If you don''t fight, you can''t win!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3440, 'Teppei Kiyoshi', 'You keep working HARD in order to win and you get better little by little. To IMMERSE yourself in something you like, that''s what it means to enjoy something fully.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2688, 'Gray Fullbuster', 'It''s not the goodbyes that hurt, it''s the flashbacks that follow...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'We think the flower on the precipice is beautiful, because our fear makes our feet stop at its edge, instead of stepping forward into the sky, like that flower.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'In order to escape a road of solitude, one has to work hard, and forge a new path with their own power.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'When life changes to be harder, change yourself to be stronger.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2688, 'Gray Fullbuster', 'Sadness is just another wall that blocks you from moving on. I know it''s hard to get past it, but you got to break through.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Levi Ackerman', 'This is just my opinion, but when it comes to teaching somebody discipline... I believe pain is the most effective way.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2720, 'Wendy Marvell', 'If I haven''t had fear, then I also wouldn''t have been able to know what it''s like to have bravery in my heart.
Bravery that awakens when you''re being consumed by fear.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'A strong person is not the one who doesn''t cry. A strong person is the one who cries and sheds tears for a moment, then gets up and fights again.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2689, 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'Feelings are connection. They surpass time, and find their way back to the people you love.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1129, 'Rei Ayanami', 'Those who hate themselves, cannot love or trust others.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'I hate nice girls. Just exchanging greetings with them will get them on your mind. Start texting each other, and your heart will be set a flutter. If they call you, you''re done for. Enjoy staring at your logs and grinning like a fool. However, I won''t get fooled again. That''s what your kind calls kindness. If you''re nice to me, you''re nice to others. I always end up nearly forgetting that. Reality is cruel, so I''m sure lies are a form of kindness. Thus, I say kindness itself is also a lie. I always ended up with these expectations. And I always ended up with these misunderstandings. And before I knew it, I stopped hoping. A highly trained loner is once bitten, twice shy. As a veteran on this battlefield of life, I''ve gotten used to losing. That''s why I always hate nice girls.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Rider', 'Then you swear that, once I defeat an enemy, you will buy me pants?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Eren Jaeger', 'On that day, mankind received a grim reminder. We lived in fear of the titans, and were disgraced to live in these cages we called walls.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, NULL, 'Yoshida Haru', 'You can''t pick up water once it''s spilled, so handle it carefully.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1737, 'Haruhi Fujioka', 'A person can change, at the moment when the person wishes to change.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Obito Uchiha', 'Somewhere inside of me?! Take a good look, there''s nothing inside of me anymore!!! I don''t feel pain, I don''t feel anything! You need to let that guilt go Kakashi. This wind hole wasn''t your doing... It was made by this evil, cruel world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Everyone''s carrying something that matters. You just don''t realize when you''re carrying it. It''s only after it slips out of your hand that you realize how heavy it was in the first place. So many times I thought that I''d never carry a load like that ever again. And yet, before I realized it, I was carrying it again. I''d feel so much better if I just got rid of it. But I just can''t bring myself to do it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, 'Tetsuya Kuroko', 'I am a supporting actor, a shadow. But a shadow will become darker if the light is stronger and it will make the white of the light stand out. As the shadow of the main actor, I will make you, the light, the number one in Japan.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Frieza', 'There are three things I cannot tolerate: cowardice, bad haircuts, and military insurrection. It is very unfortunate that our friend Vegeta possesses all three of these.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'We as humans have the power to do such, but whether we grab on to the thread or not is a choice we make.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(54, NULL, 'Maou Sadao', 'I''ve never seen a hero fall down stairs, cry, and get first aid from demons.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1139, 'Gendou Ikari', 'Mankind''s greatest fear is Mankind itself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(13, 1589, 'Arisu Mizuki', 'If you aren''t remembered, then you never existed.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2819, 'Mavis Vermillion', 'Unwavering Faith and Resilient Bonds will bring even miracles to your side.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Momiji', 'However, I can''t be happy. I feel I can''t have that experience, I can''t assume I will have that experience. I''m free, but feeling lonely and disheartened. I hope there''s happiness out there. Besides, the future is approaching and waiting for me. In the future, I will be a part of the world. I will finally live my life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2498, 'Grell Sutcliff', 'Look what happens when you''re not fast enough! You get CUT! It''s more fun when it hurts a little bit though, isn''t it?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Momiji', 'I want to believe that memories, even sad and painful ones, should not be forgotten forever.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3019, 'Mami Tomoe', 'You shouldn''t want to be like me, I''m... just trying to act cool. No matter how scary it is, how hard it is, I can''t talk to anyone about it. I always cry alone. Being a Magical Girl isn''t good at all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3465, 'Satoshi Fukube', 'Even if I did win, it was boring. How can it be interesting unless you win in an interesting way?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3464, 'Eru Chitanda', 'If you can never get angry at anything, that probably means you have nothing that you like, either.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, NULL, 'Misawa Kyouko', 'Humans will wither away if they''re always alone. The only remedy would be to seek out other people.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', 'Rejection makes a man stronger.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2819, 'Mavis Vermillion', 'There are walls that can''t be broken through power alone. But if there is a power that can break through those walls, it is the power of feelings.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, 3587, 'Shizuku Mizutani', 'Once you''ve recognized your mistakes, it''s easy enough to correct them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'Teachings that do not speak of pain have no meaning, for humankind cannot gain anything in return.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, 2555, 'Lust', 'Blood calls for blood, while hatred begets hatred, and the energy that comes forth begins to take root in this earth and engraves a crest of blood. They never learn, no matter how many times history is repeated. Humans are foolish, sorrowful creatures.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, 3592, 'Kenji Yamaguchi', 'If you can''t give up one, learn to balance both at the same time. Why does it have to be all or nothing?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, 3587, 'Shizuku Mizutani', 'Studying was fun. I enjoyed solving problems quickly, and I was rewarded for the effort I put in. Studying made me feel complete.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, NULL, 'Misawa Mitsuyoshi', 'Love is good. It changes people, for better or for worse. You could look at it as a chance for you to change. The best kind of love helps you grow up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Madara Uchiha', 'Nine-Tails, you are merely a momentary life, a temporary existence of coalesced energy... energy that once was a single, ultimate form! An unstable force, lacking in intelligence or sapience, you require a guide to show you purpose. That guide is the Uchiha! The tailed beasts are but slaves to those with blessed eyes. Obey!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, 3587, 'Shizuku Mizutani', 'At least in academics, you can control the outcome, whether it''s good or bad.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 1, 'Spike Spiegel', 'I felt like I was watching a dream I''d never wake up from. Before I knew it, the dream was all over.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Aside from the fact that I don''t have any friends or girlfriends, I''m still a high quality product!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Eren Jaeger', 'If you think reality is just living comfortably and following your own whims, can you seriously dare to call yourself a soldier?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3678, 'Hachiman Hikigaya', 'Bears are creatures that feel no insecurity in living alone. They''re an animal that lives in isolation. Plus, they can hibernate. What a fabulous thing that is. If I were to be reborn, I definitely want to be a bear.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, NULL, 'Lida Ayano', 'The best way to write a realistic romance is to first be in love. Everyone can write a love story from their life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, 3522, 'Akane Tsunemori', 'The law doesn''t protect people. People protect the law. People have always detested evil and sought out a righteous way of living. Their feelings, the accumulation of those peoples feelings are the law. They''re neither the provisions, nor the system. They''re the fragile and irreplaceable feelings that everyone carries in their hearts.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Tohsaka Tokiomi', 'From the moment a magus is born, he is someone that has "power". And some day, he will achieve a "greater power". This responsibility was already flowing in his "blood" before he realized this destiny. That is what it means to be born into this world as the child of a magus.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1739, 'Mitsukuni Haninozuka', 'I like people who put in effort, even if they''re not good at it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'Your guilt will be your past and that will be your God.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Yuki', 'It would be so great if it was possible to go through life without making a single mistake.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, NULL, 'Yoshida Haru', 'What''s so special about studying? Every problem has an answer. How hard can it be?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, 3587, 'Shizuku Mizutani', 'The old me would never have known how blue the afternoon sky looks from the roof. My world is growing. What I once considered background noise is now comforting.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, 3577, 'Kazuki Fujisawa', 'Sometimes, your future is already set, and there''s nothing you can do about it. There are some things you just can''t change, no matter how hard you work. Unfair, don''t you think? It isn''t an easy fact to accept, and I''m not telling you to, but that''s just how life is. Unfair.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Rider', 'Only a man brave enough to ride into battle at my side could ever be my Master. A coward lacking the courage to even show himself is nowhere close to being worthy!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1986, 'Misa Amane', 'What do you mean I use my sexual charm?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, 3587, 'Shizuku Mizutani', 'If you leave, I''ll probably be sad. However, if there''s somewhere else you''d rather be, you should admit it. Don''t lose sight of what you really want.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, 3592, 'Kenji Yamaguchi', 'You can''t feel lonely if there''s no one else around.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 'Grisha Jaeger', 'Karla, nothing can surpass a human''s curiosity.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 2, 'Faye Valentine', 'The past is the past and the future is the future. A man is a man and a woman is a woman. The present is the present. I am who I am and you are who you are. That''s all there is to it. Does it really matter? Or do we just think it does?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, NULL, 'Laughing Bull', 'Do not fear Death. Death is always at our side. When we show fear, it jumps at us faster than light. But, if we do not show fear, it casts its eye upon us gently and then guides us into infinity.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 2, 'Faye Valentine', 'Survival of the fittest is the law of nature. We deceive or we are deceived. Thus, we flourish or perish. Nothing good ever happened to me when I trusted others. That is the lesson.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 3, 'Jet Black', 'Men always seem to think about their past before they die, as though they were frantically searching for proof that they truly lived.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'I think the only time people really have value is when they act according to their own will.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, NULL, 'Yoshida Haru', 'I never had anything this good before. I guess everything tastes good when I''m with you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, 3587, 'Shizuku Mizutani', 'It''s a waste of time to bother with anything uncertain.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(53, 3679, 'Yukino Yukinoshita', 'People who don''t work hard don''t have the right to be envious of the people with talent. People fail because they don''t understand the hard work necessary to be successful.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, NULL, 'Yoshida Haru', 'I''m no expert, but I think people mope when their expectations are too high. It''s tiring when you always have to overachieve. Don''t overdo it. Just work on achieving what you can.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, 3587, 'Shizuku Mizutani', 'Real friends wouldn''t use you for your money. I don''t have any friends, so I''m no expert, but I''d rather have no friends than have friends like them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'I have two rules: First, I''m never wrong. Second, if I''m wrong... back to the first rule.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'Everyone is alone. Everyone is empty. People no longer have need of others. You can always find a spare for any replacement. Any relationship can be replaced.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'I''m afraid when something is truly lost, one can never get it back again.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(49, 3577, 'Kazuki Fujisawa', 'To create something that appeals to the emotions of users, you need to make something that sways your own heart. You can''t move others hearts, unless you can move your own.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, 3098, 'Kayneth Archibald El-Melloi', '(to Kiritsugu) I shall not let you die easily. I shall use healing magic to regenerate your heart and lungs, while I rend every inch of your flesh. In pain and despair, you will die as you suffer. And while you die, you will curse them... You will curse the cowardice of those who hired you! You will curse the Einzbern''s for disgracing the Holy Grail War!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Rider', 'Fail to strike the enemy once you know their location, and it''ll be too late to even regret having missed the chance.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Tohsaka Tokiomi', 'Strive to consistently maintain the proper flow. That is the Tohsaka family motto. It means always remaining reserved and elegant.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'I''m not short, I just live in a big world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Okazaki Tomoya', 'You should cry while you still can. When you get bigger, sometimes, you can''t cry even if you have something you wanna cry about.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Rider', 'Rarely does one have the chance to exchange blows with heroes from another age. And with the chance to fight as many as six, I can''t allow one of them to fall right now. Look at Saber and Lancer. Both are valiant warriors I would love to duel with. It''d be a pity to let either die.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 329, 'Sanji', 'Men who can''t wipe away the tears from a women''s eyes, aren''t real men.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Lancer', 'Before I am a Servant, I am a knight. I can only serve but one lord.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'Vegeta', 'It''s amazing how every time you open your mouth, you manage to prove you''re an idiot.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, NULL, 'Truth', 'Who am I? One name you might have for me is the world, or you might call me the universe, or perhaps God, or perhaps the Truth. I am All, and I am One. So, of course, this also means that I am you. I am the truth of your despair, the inescapable price of your boastfulness. And now, I will bestow upon you the despair you deserve.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1174, 'Maes Hughes', 'In general, men prefer to let their actions speak instead of words. When they''re in pain, they don''t want to burden anyone with it, not if they can help it. They don''t want anyone to worry about them. That''s how they are. Even so, there may come a time when they''ll ask for your help. And when they do, I know that you''ll be there for them. Isn''t that enough?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2375, 'Milly Ashford', 'Things that don''t change go extinct.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2365, 'C.C.', 'There are times in life when you have to distance yourself from those you love, because you love them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'Books are not something that you just read words in. They''re also a tool to adjust your senses.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Rider', 'A king without greed is even worse than a figurehead! Saber, you said you would become a martyr for your ideals. In life, you must have been a pure saint. A proud and noble figure, certainly. But who can truly admire the martyr''s thorny path? Who dreams of such an ending?

A king... The king must be greedier than any other. He must laugh louder and rage harder. He must exemplify the extreme of all things, good and evil. That is why his retainers envy and adore him. And why the flames of aspiration, to be as the king is, can burn within his people.

Proud king of chivalry... The righteousness and ideals you bore may indeed have saved your nation once. However, I''m certain you know what became of those who were saved, but left to themselves.

You saved them, but you never led them. You never showed them what a king should be. You abandoned your men when they lost their way. Then, alone and untroubled, you followed your own petty little ideals.

Thus, you are no true king. You a', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Berserker', 'I am the alienated, the ridiculed, the despised. No need to praise my name. No need to envy my body. I am the shadow under the radiance of heroic spirits. Birthed of the darkness of glorious legend. And so, I hate, I resent. Nourished by the sighs of the people precipitated within the darkness, people that curse the light. This is my disgrace. Because of her unsullied glory, I must forever be belittled. You are, the sacrifice. Good, give me more, your blood and flesh, your life. Let them ignite my hatred!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 168, 'Pain', 'Love is the reason why there is pain. When we lose someone precious to us, hate is born. Vengeance is the product of that hate and so death follows. But in death there is only more death. This will give rise to more pains. In this cursed world we live in, it is a cycle of hatred that will not cease. You and I seek the same thing that Jiraiya-sensei wanted. Let me ask you this: How will you confront this hatred in order to create peace?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Yuki', 'If I were to live out life without any mistakes that would be great. But... there is no such path. Falling, tripping, losing the way, making mistakes, little by little, walking one step at a time, this is the only way to live out life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurotsuchi Mayuri', 'I hate perfection. To be perfect is to be unable to improve any further.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, NULL, 'Kyubee', 'Our contracts are completely dependent upon you agreeing to them first. I think that, in and of itself, is quite kind of us.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Shimura Tae', '*To Shinpachi* When your friend is crying, cry with him. When your friend is worried, you should worry with him. And when your friend has an awkward bowel movement, then you must have an awkward bowel movement too, Shin-chan. If you are a friend, you should be able to share the other''s pain, no matter what. And Shin-chan, if your friend goes down the wrong path... Then, you must stop your friend, even if it ruins your friendship. That is true samurai friendship.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, 3526, 'Tomomi Masaoka', 'Everything you''ve been taught is based on theories and logic. Soon, you''ll come to realize how pointless they are.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Kougami Shinya', 'Being a detective isn''t about bringing someone down, but rather protecting someone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, NULL, 'Natsume Asako', 'Who cares about school?! The real me lives on the Internet!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, NULL, 'Kyubee', 'Do you know how many civilizations are crowded together in the universe and how much energy is used up in one second? Eventually, you humans, will leave this planet as well, and join us. You wouldn''t want to be handed an empty, desolate universe then, would you?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 'Ikusaba Marco', 'If today is the worst day ever - tomorrow has to be better.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2394, 'Charles Zi Britannia', 'All men are NOT created equal! Some are born smarter, or more beautiful, or with parents of greater status. Some, by contrast, are born of weak body or mind, or with few, if any, talents. All men are different! Yes, the very existence of man is discriminatory! That''s why there is war, violence and unrest.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'Sophie Hatter', 'A heart''s a heavy burden.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 2, 'Faye Valentine', 'They often say that humans can''t live alone. But you can live pretty long by yourself. Instead of feeling alone in a group, it''s better to be alone in your solitude.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1601, 'Howl', 'Sorry, I''ve had enough of running away, Sophie. Now I''ve got something I want to protect. It''s you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, NULL, 'Oreki Houtarou', 'I''m not lazy, I''m just conserving energy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 1, 'Spike Spiegel', 'I was younger then, I wasn''t afraid of anything, I didn''t think about dying for a second. I thought I was invincible. Then I met some girl. I wanted to live, I started to think like that; for the first time I was afraid of death. I had never felt like that before.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3144, 'Killua Zoldyck', 'When I say it doesn''t hurt me, that means I can bear it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'Naruto... Just so you know, there will be a war to protect the Eight-Tails and Nine-Tails. In other words - you. For the sake of the ninja world and as the Kazekage, I will guard you with my life. If as a member of Akatsuki, Sasuke Uchiha stands in the way of the ninja coalition... I will show him no mercy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(50, NULL, 'Yoshida Haru', 'Make one peep and I will rape you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, 3523, 'Shuusei Kagari', 'No matter where you are, people find a way to entertain themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, 3522, 'Akane Tsunemori', 'I was the only one who got an A ranking for the Public Safety Bureau. There were more than 500 students and I was the only one. So I thought that there must have been something that only I could do at the Bureau. If I went there, I thought I could find my purpose in life... I thought I''d be able to find out why I was born here and now!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3464, 'Eru Chitanda', 'You don''t have to worry about being special or normal compared to everyone else! It doesn''t matter who it is. So as long as they think you''re special, then you''re special.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 3, 'Jet Black', 'Everything has a beginning and an end. Life is just a cycle of starts and stops. There are ends we don''t desire, but they''re inevitable. We have to face them. It''s what being human is all about.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Inoue Orihime', 'Sadistic? I don''t mind you calling me that. If you don''t want to get hurt, don''t attack me when I say not to.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 147, 'Zabuza Momochi', 'His soul was as pure as snow.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', 'What would you have me say? "Don''t worry, I''m sure he''s still alive."? Ridiculous. I am not here to comfort you. I don''t understand why are you so fixated on life and death? At any rate, your friends will soon be annihilated. So what if that''s one step closer? They should have seen this coming from the start. If they couldn''t see it coming, the fault lies in their own foolishness. Laughing them off as a group of idiots would be sufficient. Why can''t you do that? If it were me, and my friends entered Hueco Mundo without first gauging their strength, I''d be infuriated by their stupidity.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, 'Sakura Haruno', 'It''s always like this. The only things I can ever do for Naruto are the little things anyone could do...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, NULL, 'Sakura Kyouko', 'Rush in there right now and break his hands and legs so he''ll never be able to use them again. Make it so he won''t be able to do anything without you anymore. Then he''ll be yours. His heart, body, everything.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Hyuuga Junpei', 'Listen to your seniors once in a while or I will kill you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(52, NULL, 'Togashi Yuuta', 'Accepting something is easier said than done.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2693, 'Mirajane Strauss', 'Everyone exists for a reason. As small as it can be. I''m sure you have a meaning too.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'I always lied to you telling you to forgive me. I used these hands to keep you at distance... I did not want you to get involved. But now... I think you could have changed father and mother. Perhaps even the entire Uchiha. If I would have stood in front of you and looked you in the eyes from the very beginning... talked to you instead of down to you... and been open about everything. But I failed, and speaking to you now, like this, isn''t going to undo the permanent damage that''s already been done to you. That''s why I wanted to show you the truth. Even if it''s just a little. And no matter what you decide to do from here on out, you never have to forgive me - I will always love you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3424, 'Shun Izuki', 'Fear isn''t a bad thing. There are some things that can only be done by cowards.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'Beautiful flowers, too, eventually wither and fall. That''s the fate of all living beings.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2689, 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'Forget what hurt you in the past, but never forget what it taught you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, 3524, 'Nobuchika Ginoza', 'They say that fools learn from their experiences, while the wise learn from history. I hope you''re not a fool.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'Always skillfully manipulate your pieces, that''s how you survive. Use me and madam red, any piece within your reach. Even if the bodies of your pawns pile up in front of your thrown. Because if the king falls - this game is over.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Kougami Shinya', 'I''m sorry. I couldn''t keep my promise. I wanted to go into a line of work where I could protect people. That''s why I became a detective. But Makishima changed everything. That man will continue to kill people. And yet, the law can''t judge him. As long as I''m a detective, I can''t touch him. This case made me aware... that the law can''t protect people.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Madara Uchiha', 'In this world, wherever there is light - there are also shadows. As long as the concept of winners exists, there must also be losers. The selfish desire of wanting to maintain peace causes wars, and hatred is born to protect love.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2504, 'Undertaker', 'Life isn''t that sweet. That''s why everyone wants sweet things.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ichimaru Gin', 'It''s easier to crush a dream than realize one. Forming a bond is infinitely more difficult than breaking one.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2471, 'Taiga Aisaka', 'Entire civilizations were built and destroyed between now and the last time you said "we''ll go soon"! I''ll have rotted and turned to ash by the time this "soon" of yours comes!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Little Demon', 'Come with me. Overwhelming madness and power await.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Little Demon', 'Wouldn''t it be nice to have a strong mind, one that can get rid of the fear you feel?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'The human heart is the source of all our power... We fight with the power of our hearts.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Listen up, I don''t care what you punks do around the universe. But with this, my sword… anywhere it can reach, is part of my country! Asses who blunder in and violate my things… whether it be a Shogun, whether it be space pirates, whether it be a meteorite - I''ll destroy them!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2690, 'Natsu Dragneel', 'You must live life as long as you are still strong. Never look at your life as something insignificant.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'I''m telling you, it''s just that it''s soooooo lolilolilolied that it smokes. Come on, girls. One of you loan me your whistle. I''ll lolly it up!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1770, 'Kagura', 'You don''t need a driver''s license to hit and run!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'I''ve told you, this isn''t a cigarette. It''s a lollipop!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2944, 'Misaki Ayuzawa', 'The aura of offensive smell has come to such a strong extent that you can even see it!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2365, 'C.C.', 'False tears bring pain to those around you. A false smile brings pain to one self.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'But men are always boys at heart until the die.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Donquixote Doflamingo', 'Pirates are evil? The Marines are righteous? These terms have always changed throughout the course of history! Kids who have never seen peace and kids who have never seen war have different values! Those who stand at the top determine what''s wrong and what''s right! This very place is neutral ground! Justice will prevail, you say? But of course it will! Whoever wins this war becomes justice!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3144, 'Killua Zoldyck', 'Assassination — It''s the family trade. We all take it up. My folks see me as an exceptional prospect. But I don''t see that I should have to live up to their expectations.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, 'Tetsuya Kuroko', 'But hating something you love is a painful feeling.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'Well, hurting girls isn''t one of my hobbies. That''s why I''ll make it my hobby to stomp on their cell phones. Hahahahahaha! I''m so bored of it now... it''s no longer my hobby to stomp on cell phones.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'Yes, Children can be quite demanding about their games.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3145, 'Kurapika', 'I do not fear death. I fear only that my rage will fade over time.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'Hatred and sorrow are power; they are yours to control. All you have to do is turn them into strength, and use that strength to move forward.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'Unfortunately, in reality there is no situation where one can win merely by following the rules. There will be knights that break the rules, and even chess pieces that betray him.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Tousen Kaname', 'Justice is not something that you can express in words.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Abarai Renji', 'A man who raises his hands on a woman is trash. If I have to become trash in order to survive... It''ll be just like dying.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(29, 2560, 'Ling Yao', 'If you turn your back on something you wanted, you don''t deserve to call yourself greed!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'I guess it''s only natural for inferior beings to ride on the coattails of their superior counterparts. If they wish to keep their lives, they have no choice but to obediently comply. It''s a never ending chain... as the ones who are burdened with that trust, in order to escape that burden, seek to find someone even greater than themselves. These greater beings then seek others even greater than themselves to shelter them. This is how Gods are born. But make no mistake. They all still abide to me. Because from this point onward, you will witness first hand, the power of the God they foolishly placed their faith in. I will become that God they have no choice but to believe in.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', '*after Misa-chan says that she can''t imagine a world without Light* Hmmm... Yes, it would be dark!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3378, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'Rather than leaving someone to die, I''d much rather die together with them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 329, 'Sanji', 'Leave this guy''s key to me, I''ll do what you cant do; you do what I can''t do. Think carefully! Read the situation. If you''re here, there''s got to be a way Robin-chan can be saved! Usopp!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'Pain tends to heal as time passes, but personally, I don''t want time to heal my wounds. You may think you''ve escaped the pain and forgotten it, but that''s nothing more than stagnation. You can''t move forward without the pain.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3004, 'Kurisu Makise', 'I am a scientist, I have to act on my own theory. I can''t let my emotions get in the way. But it''s impossible to forget everything... because I''ve known you for longer than we''ve lived. This is reality. This is the world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'It is at the moment of death that humanity has value.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Whitebeard', 'It doesn''t matter who your parents were. Everyone is a child of the sea.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Alan Humphries', 'I was born alone in this world and alone I will die. If this is my fate, why are tears coming out of my eyes?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'There''s no one who can live their whole life being completely uncorrupted.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3018, 'Homura Akemi', 'Say, how about we put an end to all of this? The two of us could become Witches and destroy everything! Everything in this world that has ever made us hate, everything that has ever made us cry, will turn to ashes until nothing is left, like it was all just a bad dream! We''d have no worries! Isn''t that nice?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'You can play any character and yet in the end, you yourself are nobody. Your core personality is null. It''s empty. That''s how you could wear any mask all over your smooth, featureless face and have it fit perfectly.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 161, 'Orochimaru', 'Maybe, just maybe, there is no purpose in life... but if you linger a while longer in this world, you might discover something of value in it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 161, 'Orochimaru', 'True power is forged from the desire smoldering in the heart, it fans into a flame and begins to burn with an intensity one scarcely imagines to be possible...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'An unforeseen situation... An unexpected turn of events... In the face of those, you too will face your true self.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 'Makishima Shougo', 'I wonder what sort of criteria you use to divide people into good and evil.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'Alphonse Elric', 'No fair, sky. I''m the one who feels like crying.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1176, 'Greed', 'They weren''t my friends, they were my possessions! Money, women, henchmen... they''re all possessions! So killing my henchmen is the same as stealing from me, and I don''t let people take what''s mine!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, NULL, 'Solf J. Kimblee', 'What could be more beautiful than doing work that puts your soul at risk, because that''s what it means to be alive!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'I am not a friend of justice. I am an enemy of evil.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2538, 'Shinobu Oshino', 'The sun is my enemy, but the moon has been good to me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'Any betrayal you can see is trivial,  what is truly frightening and much more lethal, is the betrayal you cannot see.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, NULL, 'Sakura Kyouko', 'Stories where love and courage win in the end always turn out like that, you know? When I think about it, I became a magical girl because I always loved those stories.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'There are... many types of monsters in this world: Monsters who will not show themselves and who cause trouble; monsters who abduct children; monsters who devour dreams; monsters who suck blood, and... monsters who always tell lies. Lying monsters are a real nuisance. They are much more cunning than other monsters. They pose as humans even though they have no understanding of the human heart. They eat even though they''ve never experienced hunger. They study even though they have no interest in academics. They seek friendship even though they do not know how to love. If I were to encounter such a monster, I would likely be eaten by it. Because in truth, I am that monster.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'It''s often said, "People who are similar can be called friends", right? You haven''t been making a good life for yourself, have you? Well, I guess I''m no better.. People don''t try to make a life that they can''t be proud of... They have the intention of staying on the straight path, but out of blue, they''re in the dirt. But, even so, with heart and soul you try to brake through. There will be a day, that even dirt will dry and fall off.

(Gintoki to Catherine
"Gintama chapter 24, page 19")', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(52, NULL, 'Togashi Yuuta', 'I am the Dark Flame Master. Perish, enveloped in the flames of darkness!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1405, 'Pesche Guatiche', 'You''re proud of your white clothes?.. It sounds like a laundry detergent commercial.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'The Other Side of the Other Side of the Other Side would be the Other Side.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1176, 'Greed', 'They don''t call me Greed for nothing! I want money, I want women, status and power! I want everything this world''s selling and eternity''s topping the list!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 168, 'Pain', 'We are but men, drawn to act in the name of revenge that we deem to be justice. But... if there is justice in revenge then that same justice will breed only more revenge... and trigger a cycle of hatred.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 168, 'Pain', 'How can you say that you will never change? That you will not change, no matter how great the pain you face? Can you continue believing in yourself forever? Can you guarantee it? Can you have such faith in yourself?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1173, 'Roy Mustang', 'When I become Fuhrer President, all female personnel in the military ... will have to wear mini-skirts.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'Behind this mask is...Another mask! Pretty cool, huh?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kojima Mizuiro', 'My smile is nothing more than a pose, I can give it to anyone, anytime, anywhere...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'Different conclusions are reached when one fact is viewed from two separate points of view. When that happens, there is no immediate way to judge which point of view is the correct one. There is no way to conclude one''s own conclusion is the correct one. But for that exact reason, it is also premature to decide one''s own conclusion is wrong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kira Izuru', 'A true warrior would never beg someone for his life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'Listen to yourself whining and complaining like some sorry little victim! You can whimper all day for all I care, you''re nothing but a coward!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'One day I''d like to become something precious to others.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 145, 'Rock Lee', 'My motto is to be stronger than yesterday, if I have to I''ll be stronger than half a day ago, even a minute ago!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kira Izuru', 'Battles aren''t supposed to be heroic affairs. They are not supposed to be fun or exciting, to us every battle is filled with despair, they are dark, horrifying, grizzly. We should fear warfare, avoid it always and whenever possible choose the path of peace.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Starrk', 'How I envy the feeble and frail... If I were inept, I could simply blend in, not stand out, and get lost in the crowd. I yearned to be just another sheep... And if that was asking too much I''d settle for... walking among the lions.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'A lesson without pain is meaningless. That''s because no one can gain without sacrificing something. But by enduring that pain and overcoming it, he shall obtain a powerful, unmatched heart... A Fullmetal Heart.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3466, 'Mayaka Ibara', 'Oreki, you''re strange!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Midorima Shintarou', 'A man who cannot play by himself, cannot improve by himself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3378, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'I''d rather trust and regret, than doubt and regret.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'While you''re alive, you need a reason for your existence. Being unable to find one is the same as being dead.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(42, 3145, 'Kurapika', 'The only principle is that there is no principles.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2943, 'Takumi Usui', 'Your sudden smiles always surprise me. But are dangerous enough to make my heart race.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Zaraki Kenpachi', 'Death and pain are just a small price to pay for the enjoyment of battle!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 'Asuna Yūki', 'If we make it back to the real world, I''ll find you. And fall in love with you all over again.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'I don''t have anything anymore, but if there''s something on the floor, I''ll pick it up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'You and I, our levels are as distant as the earth from the heavens. Must I spell it out for you? I have discarded my left arm, discarded my left leg, and yet even then I have not nearly lowered myself to your level.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, NULL, 'Oreki Houtarou', 'The more inexperienced you are, the more you want to show off.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2693, 'Mirajane Strauss', 'When people realize just how lonely they are on their own, they will become kind.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2296, 'Kamina', 'If you are doing it, I''m doing it. If I don''t do it, will you? If you don''t do it, I''ll do it. I''m doing it so that you''ll do it too!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1173, 'Roy Mustang', 'Do you think it''s possible to send Flame Alchemy through the phone and burn someones ears off?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Kotarō Katsura', 'The zipper is a window to society.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'There''s no point in having physical strength alone. The real deal needs to have mental strength and will.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'A fake with more power than the real thing is more dangerous than the real thing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'The first requirement of being a hero isn''t being right. It''s being strong. That''s why the hero always wins.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1770, 'Kagura', 'Whether doing good or evil, I will be the boss.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'Those who get fooled are partially at fault.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'If you pick a fight with a god of death, I can''t guarantee your soul''s safety.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3020, 'Sayaka Miki', 'It really shouldn''t be all that uncommon - having a wish you''d go so far as to trade your life for. I think there are a lot of people in the world with wishes and desires like that. If we can''t think of anything, it just means that we really haven''t had anything that bad happen to us. We''ve had too much given to us and have become dull and stupid. It makes me wonder: Why us?

Don''t you think it''s unfair? I''m sure there are other people who''d really want a chance like this.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Deishū Kaiki', 'Oh, right, Senjougahara. I''ve got a great story to tell you. It''s about that man who tried to rape you way back. He was hit by a car and died in a place with no connection to you, in an event with no connection to you. Without any drama at all. [...] That''s the lesson for you here: You shouldn''t expect your life to be like the theater.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Idiots in their idiotic way have their own idiotic worries.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'When the world shoves you around, you just gotta stand up and shove back. It''s not like somebody''s gonna save you if you start babbling excuses.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 335, 'Shanks', 'By experiencing both, victory and defeat, running away and shedding tears, a man will become a man.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'It''s impossible for someone to replace someone else.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'It is not wise to judge others based on your own preconceptions and by their appearances.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'I think people should try to ignore their race, and just treat each other as equals.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'It''s not the face that makes someone a monster, it''s the choices they make with their lives.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'Something as useless as emotions, I never had them to begin with.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 1, 'Spike Spiegel', 'Whatever happens, happens.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1311, 'Lucy', 'Aren''t we all monsters inside?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, 3089, 'Ryuunosuke Uryuu', 'The world might seem boring. But, if you just look, you''ll find all kinds of crazy stuff. The world is the best form of entertainment. Something like this couldn''t just have happened by chance. There must be a writer writing the stories of more than five-billion people. And the only thing we could possibly call this person is God.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2313, 'Lordgenome', 'The probability of success was zero percent. But I''ve learned that probabilities are meaningless when it comes to you guys.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1247, 'Chihiro Ogino', 'Listen, Haku. I don’t remember it, but my mom told me... Once, when I was little, I fell into a river. She said they’d drained it and built things on top. But I’ve just remembered. The river was called the Kohaku River. Your real name is... Kohaku.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Kise Ryouta', 'Once you look up to someone, you can''t overtake them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 168, 'Pain', 'You think you''re the only ones who matter. You think you can put off death. But that peace made you foolish and thoughtless. If you kill someone, someone else will kill you... this hatred binds us together.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1175, 'Riza Hawkeye', 'Master Sergeant Fuery, during your last physical it was discovered you have Athletes Foot, and we now believe it is affecting your brain.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 168, 'Pain', 'Do you understand pain a little now? If you don''t share someone''s pain, you can never understand them. But just because you understand them doesn''t mean you can come to an agreement. That''s the truth', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 1, 'Spike Spiegel', 'A fallen angel banished from heaven, arises into the light to be recieved by the benevolence of God...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 6, 'Vicious', 'Angels banished from heaven have no choice but to become devils.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2691, 'Happy', 'Don''t think, Natsu! It''s not like you!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Kiritsugu', 'Knights cannot save the world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Kiritsugu', 'They call certain methods of fighting good and others evil, acting as if there were some nobility to the battlefield. Such illusions, perpetrated by heroes throughout history, have led countless young men to their bloody deaths, all for the sake of this valor and glory.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Kiritsugu', 'Righteousness cannot save the world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3421, 'Taiga Kagami', 'Life is all about challenges, There''s no point in living if there''s no one strong to play with, It''s better if I can''t win.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Why don''t you understand? Nunnally was blinded! My own sister was crippled! She knew... she knew that there were things in this world that she will never be able to do by herself! So her smile... Nunnally''s smile... was her way of expressing gratitude!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3378, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'Levels are just numbers. In this world, strength is just an illusion. There are more important things.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'Maybe I got something wrong, but it doesn''t matter because the thought of wanting to help others definitely isn''t wrong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'If you are still determined to take your own life, please do so outside... *To Grell*', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2424, 'Crona', 'I''ve never talked to a girl before. I don''t know how to handle it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2919, 'Celty Sturluson', 'The world isn''t as bad as you think.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'I will be the Man who surpass God.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'Well, if I had to give a reason for my actions, I guess it''s because I love people. I guess I wanted to see the faces that mankind has to offer.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2910, 'Shizuo Heiwajima', 'People who call others stupid are usually more stupid. But I''m stupid, so I''ll say it anyways...YOU''RE STUPID!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, NULL, 'Oreki Houtarou', 'Don''t care anything and do not do anything that''s a waste of energy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, 'Shima Kinzou', 'I can only tell the fortune of girls.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, NULL, 'Oreki Houtarou', 'If I don''t have to do it, I won''t. If I have to do it, I''ll make it quick.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1986, 'Misa Amane', 'Careful what you do, cuz "God" is watching your every move. Hold my hand in the dark street, for if you do I know that I''ll.. be safe. Even if I''m far away and alone, I can be sure that you''ll find me there, this I know. You told me close for a while, so quite. You tell me everything. If I forget what to say then you''ll come to me and tell me again, yes you''d tell me once again. But what happens when I know it all and what should I do, after that, what then?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3464, 'Eru Chitanda', 'We don''t know if trying our best will help, but we do know, that if we don''t try our best, it won''t help for sure!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Android 16', 'Gohan, let it go. It is not a sin to fight for the right cause. There are those who words alone will not reach.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 332, 'Usopp', 'When I left Syrup Village, I left everything behind! Tranquility… Safety… They face hardships every day, and they laugh like they’re really having fun! That’s why I decided to go out to sea! I want to laugh ’til I cry, too! But if I don’t fight with everything I’ve got, there’s no way I deserve to be on the same boat as them! There’s no way I can laugh with them!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Shigure', 'High school girls, high school girls, all for me, high school girls!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Yuki', 'They say that we should love ourselves first, before other people learn to love us, but it''s not as easy as it seems. Sometimes, we need someone to accept us and love us first, then we would learn to see ourselves through that person''s eyes and learn to love our-self.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, 'Kyoya Ootori', '*To Tamaki* It''s easy to feel sorry for him, but the hardships that he endured as a child, molded him into the person he is today. He''ll be fine, the Host Club is his refuge, which means when all is said and done... he still has us.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Even when our eyes are closed, there''s a whole world out there that lives outside ourselves and our dreams.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'I''m not short! I''m fun-sized!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', '*To Captain Kuro* So, you don’t like to get hit, huh? Well, you’re about to have a very bad day.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 1, 'Spike Spiegel', 'I''m watching a dream I''ll never wake up from.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', '*To Tayuya* How many times do I have to tell you? The first move is always a feint. It''s the most basic thing, to land a hit with the second move.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', '*To Temari* It really doesn''t matter to me if I ever become a chūnin or not, but I guess I shouldn''t let myself be beaten by a female, so let''s do it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Son Goku', 'I''m so hungry, I can''t even move.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', '*To himself, while fighting Temari* Oh man... those clouds are so lucky. so free. More to the point, I didn''t feel like doing this in the first place. And I only became a ninja because I thought life would''ve been more interesting as one... I suppose things aren''t gonna be that simple.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2689, 'Lucy Heartfilia', '*To Gajeel Redfox* You guys are complete idiots! I feel so sorry for you, I think I\\''m tearing up. Phantom Lord? The spirit ruler? What a joke; I\\''m not afraid of you at all!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'We don''t die for our friends, we live for them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1737, 'Haruhi Fujioka', 'I would solve a friend''s problem... then also find a way to keep them from ending up with a new one.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'I''m the only one who can bear the full brunt of your hate! It''s my job, no one else''s! I''ll bear the burden of your hatred... and we''ll die together!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Even your gravest mistakes shouldn''t stop you from moving forward.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatsuharu', 'If I wouldn''t have tripped, you wouldn''t have stopped, now would you?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'Hero? No! We''re pirates! I love heroes, but I don''t wanna be one! Do you know what heroes are? Say there is a chunk of meat. Pirates will have a banquet and eat it, but heroes will share it with other people. I want all the meat!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', 'I could say I''m not sad, but I''d be lying. The problem is the world won''t let me stay a kid forever, so I can''t lie around crying about it either.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(38, 3033, 'Rin Okumura', 'I''m not smart enough to figure out answers no matter how much time I spend thinking. All I can do now is to empty my head and dash forward.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3421, 'Taiga Kagami', 'You''ll always stand by the light. That is your basketball.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 'Hyuuga Junpei', 'I''m going to teach you how to talk to your seniors, baldy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', '*after touching Misa''s butt and getting away with it* This is an outrage... taking advantage of this situation! I assure you, I will get to the bottom of this!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 1, 'Spike Spiegel', 'And what''s the real lesson? Don''t leave things in the fridge.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, NULL, 'Souryuu Asuka Langley', 'You''re thinking in Japanese! If you must think, do it in German!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(45, 3378, 'Kazuto Kirigaya', 'You can go anywhere you want in this world with a single blade. This may be a virtual world, but I feel more alive here than in the real world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3467, 'Fuyumi Irisu', 'No amount of passion can overcome a lack of technical expertise.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3467, 'Fuyumi Irisu', 'Every individual must be aware of themselves. If not, those who watch them think fools of themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3443, 'Tsutomu Iwamura', 'The strong don''t win. The winners are the strong ones.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Mackenzie Glen', 'When you look back after a long life, you''ll realize there''s nothing that''s really worth risking your life for.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Kaminski Natalia', 'If you act only on what you should do without heed for what you want to do, you''re nothing more than a machine, a phenomenon.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1741, 'Hikaru Hitachiin', 'Our mom put us in one of those *points to dresses* when we were little. We still get called ''her darling little girls'' at our family reunions.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1740, 'Takashi Morinozuka', '*To Haruhi, when at her home*  You like strawberries, right? Here, you can have mine.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, 3093, 'Waver Velvet', 'I''m scared. Or should I borrow your words and say this is exciting?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'The wish of wanting everyone to be happy is merely a fairy tale!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, 3083, 'Gilgamesh', 'Ephemeral and brilliant one, fall to my embrace. That is my decision.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1741, 'Hikaru Hitachiin', '*To Kaoru* Even if I searched the world over, no one could compare to you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1740, 'Takashi Morinozuka', 'It was my fault. It was my carelessness that led to Mitsukuni''s cavity. I forgot to tell him to brush his teeth before napping... twice.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2690, 'Natsu Dragneel', '*To Pantherlily* We''ll stop it, even if my body crumbles to bits, I''ll stop it with my soul!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1737, 'Haruhi Fujioka', 'I think it''s fun to get to know a person little by little, through looking at their personality.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'Then let me ask you, do gods of death love apples?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1737, 'Haruhi Fujioka', 'Besides, it doesn''t really matter, does it? Why should I care about appearances and labels anyway. It''s what''s on the inside that counts.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1739, 'Mitsukuni Haninozuka', '*To the twins* We''ve had enough of this! You''re both to blame for this fight! Hika-chan and Kao-chan, I want you to make up and go halfsies on this cake, okay? But, I want to have a piece too, so I guess we''re gonna have to go thirdsies. We''re not going to be able to split the strawberry on top though. What should we do? Maybe I should just take it. After all, strawberries are my favorite. Oh, I forgot to ask, Hika-chan, Kao-chan, do you like strawberries?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Kiritsugu', 'The result is the most important thing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 161, 'Orochimaru', 'There probably isn''t any meaning in life. Perhaps you can find something interesting to do while you are alive. Like how you found that flower. Like how I found you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1737, 'Haruhi Fujioka', 'My face feels heavy, and I can''t walk in these shoes.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Kiritsugu', 'If I can, I''d prefer nobody to be sad.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', '*To Kuchiki Rukia* Are you any different!? You sacrificed yourself to save me that time!! At that time were you thinking about complicated stuff like "this is my Shinigami duty"!? That''s not what sacrificing yourself is! At the very least... I''m different! I haven''t accepted any commitment. If things get bad I might run away... since I''m not a good enough person to be able to sacrifice my life for total strangers. But unfortunately I''m also not trash that can live happily without paying back his debts!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'An ideal is only an ideal after all. As long as you embrace that ideal, the friction with reality will continue to increase. So you will someday face reality and will have to pay the price for your compromises.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1737, 'Haruhi Fujioka', 'I hate all these damn rich people.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Kiritsugu', 'I was reckless when I was young. I educated myself by cursing the heartlessness of the world. The world was cruel - so I made myself more heartless and used that as a weapon, trying to follow through on my ideals.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1739, 'Mitsukuni Haninozuka', 'I''m sorry! I''m sorry, Takashi! I won''t forget to brush my teeth again! I won''t forget!...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1737, 'Haruhi Fujioka', 'Mom... Mom in heaven.... Does love come suddenly like this', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'Know that the only people you can save like that are the ones that survive.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', 'Hinata... this is the unalterable difference in strength... the distinction that separates the elite from the failure. This is the unchangeable reality. From the moment you said you wouldn''t run, your defeat was inevitable. The only possible outcome was your present despair... Withdraw!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'I''m gonna kick your ***.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 161, 'Orochimaru', '[To Sarutobi] What nonsense! In the grand scheme of time, you''re nothing more than a trivial footnote in the brief history of a cluster of huts called the "Leaf Village"! In time, the Hokage Stone Faces will crumble and be worn down to nothing...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', '[To Hinata At Chuunin Exams] So you''re not going to withdraw? Then don''t blame me for what happens to you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(14, 1602, 'Sophie Hatter', 'They say that the best blaze burns brightest, when circumstances are at their worst.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'Oh sorry, my hand slipped.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 157, 'Haku', '{TO NARUTO} Oh, by the way... I''m a boy', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, 'Suoh Tamaki', 'You''re a hero to other poor people, Fujioka. You''ve shown the world that even a poor person can excel at an elite private academy. It must be hard for you to constantly be looked down upon by others... Spurned, neglected, but that doesn''t matter now. Long live the poor! We welcome you, poor man, to our world... of beauty!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 157, 'Haku', 'Often people have it wrong, mistakenly believing... that showing mercy to an enemy is kindness. They spare the foe whose life is in their hands. But don''t you see? It''s an empty existence, to go on living... alone and unloved... when defeat''s already cost you your dream!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, NULL, 'Suoh Tamaki', '*To Haruhi Fujioka about him helping her search for her wallet in water* A little water never hurt anyone. Besides, people are always telling me that I''m dripping with good looks.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'Bitter crimson tears flow from lifeless eyes, and mingle with the endless sands... Bestowing ever greater power upon the demon god.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2664, 'Yuri Nakamura', 'I put a propulsion engine under your seat just in case you messed up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ichimaru Gin', 'Bye-Bye now.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1, 1, 'Spike Spiegel', 'I love the type of woman who can kick my ***.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'In my mind this jacked-up sideways ridiculousness is the normal state?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2505, 'Lau', 'Between being eternally unable to wake from a dream, and being eternally unable to dream, which do you think would be more unfortunate? Still, both the dream that we deemed eternal, and this very reality, are destined to end someday.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2505, 'Lau', 'Can a world this interesting actually be reality?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1173, 'Roy Mustang', 'The power of one man doesn''t amount to much. But, however little strength I''m capable of, I''ll do everything humanly possible to protect the people I love, and in turn they will protect the ones they love. It seems like the least we tiny humans can do for each other.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2688, 'Gray Fullbuster', 'There''s no need to change the past. Because of the past we are who we are now. Every second, every action from then is linked to us here and now.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, 3086, 'Irisviel von Einzbern', 'I have no parents, and I''m not a product of love. Therefore, I can''t understand what a ''good wife'' is. Even so... the love he gave me is my entire world. No one can humiliate that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, NULL, 'Kyubee', 'Why is it that when humans regret the decision based on a misunderstanding they feel resentment toward the other party?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Little Demon', 'You are calm and composed. You are able to see through things clearly at this age. You are outstanding. And... Always being able to make the correct judgments, not falling into darkness. Outstanding. "That won''t do", "This is wrong". You reject any number of paths... Choosing your path with cynicism. What do you want to do? How are you going to do it? What is your motive? Where do you want to move forward to? Say it. Hmm? Fine. Then stick to the ground forever to move forward, you creep. You little coward who can only move forward by using the method of elimination. Until you found something to reject... You shall just lie on the ground helplessly.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2665, 'Yuzuru Otonashi', 'Our lives were real! Not a single moment of them were fake! Everyone lived the best they could! We carved those memories into ourselves! Memories of living as hard as we could! No matter what kind they were, they''re the life we led! Erasing them in the blink of an eye like that... Wasn''t your life also real to you?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Emiya Kiritsugu', 'I don''t think it''s possible to save everyone. I just want to save as many as I can.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2664, 'Yuri Nakamura', 'I only have one chance to have my life, and it''s right here. It''s the only life I have. This is my life. I can''t give it to anyone else, It can''t be stolen, I can''t force it on anyone, or forget it, or make it disappear, or trample on it, or laugh it away, or beautify it. I have no choice but to accept this one cruel, meaningless life! That''s why I will fight, and why I will continue fighting.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2471, 'Taiga Aisaka', 'That''s why people hesitate. In front of all the choices, one could lose hope and try to run away, because no excuse could be used. No matter how dangerous the long journey in life was, or how one admits to being dealt the short end of the stick, everything was the result of one''s own choices, it was a road chosen by oneself. Even if this path is hard, and there''s no chance of changing past choices, one cannot place the blame on other people. No matter how angry or frustrated one was, one would be alone on that path, for no one to replace you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2471, 'Taiga Aisaka', 'I dreamed that you were a dog. And the dog was my husband. Anyway, it was the worst dream ever.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23, NULL, 'Fujibayashi Kyou', 'If the results come true, it''s as if there''s only one future. If it fails, we can think that other futures exist... I want to believe that in our future there are many possibilities waiting.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26, 2471, 'Taiga Aisaka', 'Well, I''d better get back to my seat. The unmarried woman with her unmarried face is about to come to start the unmarried homeroom.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2665, 'Yuzuru Otonashi', 'Even if we forget the faces of our friends, We will never forget the bonds that were carved into our souls.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Saber', 'I only joined this war to avoid spilling rivers of blood. Fight for the Holy Grail, no meaningless bloodshed, minimize sacrifices, one person taking up the mission of fate instead of armies of men and competing here! This is what we Servants should do.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Kotomine Kirei', 'You should know. Your wish will not come true unless there is a clear evil. Even if it''s not something you approve of, a hero of justice requires a villain to defeat.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Saber', 'Anything edible is acceptable. Extravagance is our enemy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Emiya Kiritsugu', 'The world as it is, the human nature as always, it is impossible to eliminate battles. In the end, killing is necessarily evil. If so, it is best to end them in the maximum efficiency and at the least cost, least time. If you want to slander that as foul and demean that as nasty, then do as you wish. Justice can not save the world. I have no interest with things like that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(46, 3420, 'Tetsuya Kuroko', 'No one knows what the right decision, to make in life, is, and that is not why I made this choice.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Emiya Kiritsugu', 'In the battlefield, there is no place for hope. What lies there is only cold despair and a sin called victory, built on the pain of the defeated. All those people who met there have wholeheartedly admitted the evil and foolishness of this act called war. As long as people don''t repent and don''t regard it as the most evil taboo, then hell will endlessly reappear in the world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Kotomine Kirei', 'Conflict is humanity''s primal instinct. Eliminating it would mean eliminating humanity itself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Emiya Kiritsugu', 'Justice cannot save the world. It is useless.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Rider', 'Up until now, have you not faced the same enemies as I? That means you are my friend! So hold your chest high, and consider yourself my equal.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'If you truly want to continue escaping from everyday life, you''ve no other choice but to keep evolving. No matter whether you''re aiming higher or lower.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2914, 'Erika Karisawa', 'If you make fiction just as valuable as reality, then any reality you don''t need can be a delusion.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2910, 'Shizuo Heiwajima', 'I don''t have have much time. It''s not that I''m busy, but I''m only willing to give you about two and a half more minutes of my life!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'I don''t believe in god. There''s no proof he exists. In a world where there isn''t even proof of the future, the past exists. Even if it''s tainted with misunderstandings and delusions, if the people themselves believe in it, the past is the truth to them. And, if you base your actions or your life around it, in a way, it''s a type of god itself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, 'Ryuugamine Mikado', 'I don''t have the strength or wisdom to stand up against someone who is insusceptible to reason. You won''t even give me time to make an effort. That''s why I''m going to rely on numbers!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2914, 'Erika Karisawa', 'Reality is such a pain. And for those of us who get fed up with that kind of reality, we simply choose to make a new one. We create little walls, and separate the trash from the stuff we like, and when that''s all done we keep the things we care about and kick the rest to the curb. You''d be amazed how well it works! A whole world made out of just moe, tsundere, and BL, it''s the best discovery ever! If you ask me, that really is the best way to separate reality, from fiction.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, 2911, 'Izaya Orihara', 'Well, hurting girls isn''t one of my hobbies. That''s why I''ll make it my hobby... to stomp on their cell phones. Hahahahahaha!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47, 3464, 'Eru Chitanda', 'I find myself hard to understand sometimes.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3018, 'Homura Akemi', 'Madoka. My only friend... If... If it''s for your sake... I don''t mind being locked in this eternal maze!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3018, 'Homura Akemi', 'So how about we become monsters together?.. And turn this world upside down? So that... nothing bad... or sad... would remain. Destroy, destroy, destroy it all!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2689, 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'I don''t want... to run away by myself. Because no matter what, I''d rather be together with everyone...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2695, 'Elfman Strauss', 'How can a snake fly? It''s not even a man!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2836, 'Kagura Mikazuchi', 'I never rely on luck. It''s all my own choice. It leads me to the future.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, NULL, 'Kyubee', 'Make a contract with me, and become a magical girl!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3018, 'Homura Akemi', 'Even though I''ve lost my way, I will save you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'My companions make my heart strong. If I''m fighting for those I love, I care not what happens to this body.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3018, 'Homura Akemi', 'Kindness can bring you even bigger troubles.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, NULL, 'Kyubee', 'In our culture, the phenomena known as emotion is considered a mental disorder.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3018, 'Homura Akemi', 'Repeat. I''ll repeat it for however many times I have to. Until I find the only way out.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, NULL, 'Kyubee', 'If you ever feel like dying to help the universe, just let me know. I''ll be waiting.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, NULL, 'Sakura Kyouko', 'Miracles aren''t free. When you wish for hope, it creates an equivalent despair. That''s how the balance of this world is preserved.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3018, 'Homura Akemi', 'It''s all useless.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3018, 'Homura Akemi', 'We''re fighting for our own wishes. It''s normal not to get noticed or remembered.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'As long as you laugh at people''s suffering, your goal will always be out of reach. If you never want to be defeated, you must first learn your own weakness, and always be kind.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3023, 'Junko Kaname', 'You need to learn how to make mistakes before you grow up. When you are young, you can recover quickly when hurt. When you get older it''s harder to make mistakes. The more responsibilities, the less mistakes you are allowed to make.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3018, 'Homura Akemi', 'With kindness comes naivete. Courage becomes foolhardiness. And dedication has no reward. If you can''t accept any of that, you are not fit to be a magical girl.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, NULL, 'Sakura Kyouko', 'If you''re just living for your own sake, it''s all up to you. No hard feelings. No regrets.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3017, 'Madoka Kaname', 'If someone says it''s wrong to hope, I will tell them that they''re wrong every time. I could tell them that countless times!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Rider', 'I shall grieve, and I shall weep. But I shall never regret.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Rider', 'Glory lies beyond the horizon. Challenge it because it is unreachable. Speak of conquest and demonstrate it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, NULL, 'Sakura Kyouko', 'Protect the one thing you want to protect until the very end.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3020, 'Sayaka Miki', 'I don''t regret using my wish for another''s sake. If I regret my decision now, the feelings upon which it was based will be for naught.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(37, 3023, 'Junko Kaname', 'It sucks, but you can''t reach a happy ending just by doing what''s right all the time. Actually, the more people get stubborn and insist they''re in the right, the further away happiness gets.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Kaminski Natalia', 'Killing one man won''t change anything. Kill every last person in the world. If you could do that, it might be possible.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2689, 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'There''s nothing happy about having your fate decided for you! You have to grab your own happiness!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2694, 'Makarov Dreyar', 'Weaklings will stay weak forever. But weakness is not evil, since human beings are weak creatures to begin with. Alone, you feel nothing but insecurity; that''s why we form guilds, that''s why we have friends. We walk together in order to live a strong life. The clumsy ones will walk into more walls than the others, and it may also take them longer to get there. If you believe in tomorrow and put yourself out there, you can naturally obtain your strength. That''s how you will be able to smile and live strong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Rider', 'Whatever you do, enjoy it to the fullest. That is the secret of life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Rider', 'A cowardly thief would sneak away in the night; the King of Conquerors leaves with his loot amidst songs of victory!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3004, 'Kurisu Makise', 'You can run away, but that''ll just make it worse!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 'Kaminski Natalia', 'Choosing your calling based solely on your talents won''t always guarantee you happiness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3007, 'Suzuha Amane', 'Everyone gets help from someone else at some point in their lives. So someday, you should help someone too.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, 'Okabe Rintarou', 'History dictates that it is the wise who are most foolish.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, 3007, 'Suzuha Amane', 'To rule time is to rule the world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, 'Okabe Rintarou', 'Theories are nothing more than words. Accept what you''ve seen.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2689, 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'What I want isn''t money or pretty dresses, but a place that recognizes me as who I am. Fairy Tail is my other family, and it is a far more warming family than here!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, 'Okabe Rintarou', 'Conspiracy''s evil influence is much closer than you think, and is always ready to deceive you!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
