(36, NULL, 'Okabe Rintarou', 'Urushibara Ruka. The mannerisms and voice of a woman... No. More feminine than ANY woman. But he''s a guy. Taller than Mayuri, but so very thin... But he''s a guy. Looks great in a miko outfit... But he''s a guy. It''s already twilight and yet, it''s so hot. The cicadas are crying. But... He''s a guy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
