(34, 2944, 'Misaki Ayuzawa', 'Don''t ever lie, even if it''s about your feelings.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2944, 'Misaki Ayuzawa', 'I''m a little grateful to you. I wonder if I''ll forget these feelings too.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2943, 'Takumi Usui', 'It''s fine, I''ll come to save you as much as you want. I''ll make you fall for me as much as you wish. Leave this to your master.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, 'Ryuugamine Mikado', 'I love clichés, I love predictable scripts, I love it when they paste over problems and I love it when they force a happy ending too. What''s wrong with working towards that?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2646, 'Sawako Yamanaka', 'No, she''s hiding something. But what could it be? Snacks? Guitar? Wait, maybe ton-chan.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2944, 'Misaki Ayuzawa', 'It''s painful when you get disappointed by the person you look up to.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2646, 'Sawako Yamanaka', 'I''ll be waiting for you to get your asses back here!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2943, 'Takumi Usui', 'Well, I won''t be disappointed, no matter what you do.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2944, 'Misaki Ayuzawa', 'I guess I''m a girl who lacks self-awareness as one, or just too manly, eh?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2944, 'Misaki Ayuzawa', 'Usui, you perverted, outer spaceman human being!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2948, 'Soutarou Kanou', 'I really don''t get it. Why don''t you tell her how you feel if you care for her so much? Why would you lie like that and keep yourself from pursuing her?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2944, 'Misaki Ayuzawa', 'I don''t know much about you. You were the one who selfishly entered my world...yet you immediately plunged into silence. What were you thinking? Did you really pick on me just because it was fun? Which one is serious and which one of it is just a joke? That''s enough now, making me all messed up like this.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2944, 'Misaki Ayuzawa', 'About Usui, I really don''t know anything at all. It''s mortifying... Yet I already don''t want him to turn away.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2943, 'Takumi Usui', 'That''s exactly the way it should be. Doing only unexpected things, otherwise, I''ll lose my reputation as a perverted outer-space human.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2943, 'Takumi Usui', 'If it is with Ayuzawa, whatever I do, wherever I am, I am happy. So it''s okay.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2943, 'Takumi Usui', 'I''m actually a hardcore otaku who likes maids more than having three meals a day. And I only read books related to maids. Also, I only visit maid cafes. Of course, I also collect maid figurines. I play games which feature female maids and it turns me on so much. Then I wear maid uniforms and jump in joy. I''ll take my leave now.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2943, 'Takumi Usui', 'I don''t want others to hear the words that I''ve been waiting anxiously for... I want to be the only one to hear them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2943, 'Takumi Usui', 'It''s okay, no need to thank me or say anything else. I will always be there for you, I will make you fall for me over and over again.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2943, 'Takumi Usui', 'Walking along the path that she chose, without being affected by others... in this sense, white is her color...in another sense, it also makes me want to put more colors on her.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2943, 'Takumi Usui', 'Ayuzawa, you are the first person ever to appear in my life and able to make me a mess.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(34, 2943, 'Takumi Usui', 'How far do you want me to suppress myself so that you''ll be satisfied?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'Face it kid, I''m much too big of a guy for you to handle and you know it. Do you see how the very ground shakes beneath me feet?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'Can I shoot them now?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2413, 'Maka Albarn', 'He''s seriously crazy, he must be insane.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2416, 'Elizabeth Thompson', 'Now you''re suddenly in a big rush to go? What''s the point in hurrying, we''re already three hours late.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'Black Star, it''s over between us.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2416, 'Elizabeth Thompson', '*points at Black Star* What is that? Some kind of monkey? Yeah...it must be a monkey.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2416, 'Elizabeth Thompson', 'The last time I let you do my eyebrows it took you a month.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'That is why I prefer using you two pistols. There is symmetry to wielding you two, right? (Getting aggravated) But when you two are in human form, your hairstyles and your heights are completely different... (Grabs their breasts) Even your cup sizes are completely different!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'This guy''s a special kind of stupid.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'Ooops....My finger slipped.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'Man this guy is stupid, ugly and a bad shooter.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
