(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'So, you don''t like to get hit, huh? Well, you''re about to have a very bad day.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Trunks Brief', 'You''re about to find out what it''s like to fight a real super saiyan...and I''m not talking about Goku.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, NULL, 'Shiina', 'Ever since that day, I''ve kept this broom balanced on my fingertip.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, NULL, 'Yui', 'She''s an idiot, right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2666, 'Hideki Hinata', 'I''m pretty confident about my reflexes. And pretty strong too. I''m a guy after all. When the time comes, I can protect you even at the cost of my life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2672, 'TK', 'Crazy baby.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1130, 'Shinji Ikari', '[after masturbating over Asuka''s comatose body] I''m so fucked up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1143, 'Kaworu Nagisa', 'Songs are good. Singing brings us joy. It is the highest point in the culture that Lilims have created.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, NULL, 'Souryuu Asuka Langley', 'My mind is being eaten away... Kaji-san, it''s unravelling my mind! What do I do? It''s defiling my mind!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, NULL, 'Souryuu Asuka Langley', '[naked and smiling at Shinji] Hey Shinji, you idiot! Want to become of one mind and one body?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Arisawa Tatsuki', 'What a punchline, no... that was just a punch.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'Dammit, I''ll show you who''s more skilled with his language skills!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'Vegeta', 'So he killed my father and murdered my people. That means nothing to me. Strength is the only thing that matters in this world. Everything else is just a delusion for the weak.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1133, 'Ritsuko Akagi', 'The interaction of men and women isn''t very logical.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1144, 'Touji Suzuhara', 'It''s overpriced, but that''s okay, HERE''S YOUR CHANGE!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1141, 'Misato Katsuragi', 'This is your home now, so make yourself comfortable. And take advantage of everything here, except me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1129, 'Rei Ayanami', 'Man fears the darkness, and so he scrapes away at the edges of it with fire. He creates life by diminishing the Darkness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, 1141, 'Misato Katsuragi', 'Survivability takes priority.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5, NULL, 'Ryoji Kaji', 'Understanding 100% of everything is impossible. That''s why we spend all our lives trying to understand the thinking of others. That''s what makes life so interesting.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1247, 'Chihiro Ogino', '[To Yubaba] I''m not leaving until you give me a job!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1247, 'Chihiro Ogino', 'It''s just...a bad dream! Wake up, wake up...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1248, 'Haku', '[To Chihiro as she''s sleeping] Meet me at the bridge. Come alone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1248, 'Haku', 'Three days of eating our food and her smell will go away. And if she doesn''t work hard, roast her, boil her, do whatever you want. Now get back to work!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9, 1247, 'Chihiro Ogino', 'I finally get a bouquet and it''s a goodbye present. That''s depressing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2424, 'Crona', 'I bet dead people are easier to get along with.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'Just look at it Liz, Patti, just look at how the clouds are! Flowing right towards the sun! It''s so beautiful, even the sky is symmetrical!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'Victory and Glory!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'About the 1,000 provisions that you are required to observe. Now I would like for you to participate in the most important provision. Number 452 the 5 hour story telling party.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'Reaper Combat Art: Mortal Sin Stance.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'Excalibur! Excalibur! From the United K! I''m looking for heaven! I''m going to California!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'You disgust me. I am a Grim Reaper, I refuse to grant anyone the freedom to kill!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'FOOL! As someone who is unaware of the vital role that singing has played in the cultural history of mankind you are in no position to question me. Remember that the next time you stop to consider your place in this world. You do not possess the power to deny a singer his song. Do you understand what I''m telling you?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'Thus at long last the fighting between the rival gangs had ended! To sum up, this leads us to number 778 of the 1,000 provisions you must observe. Never mail a letter without the return address or the proper postage. And don''t call collect.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'I''m going to keep fighting until this world is the way it should be. Until the world is balanced.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'I was all dried up. Yes, nothing could satisfy me anymore. I was but a shell of a man. An unspeakable emptiness grew deep within my heart. I became frustrated, sad, hollow. The gapping hole inside of me was growing larger everyday. Slowly consuming me from the inside out. At least until that day came.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'To sum up, that is what led to number 679 of the 1,000 provisions you must observe. Always place a dehumidifier in your room.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2424, 'Crona', 'I can''t lose weight, I don''t know how to deal with being any skinnier than I already am.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'I do not deny evil, nor do I believe that any human is completely free of malice. Everything must be in balance. As long as evil and good maintain an equilibrium in this world, there is no problem. Perfect balance is the key to everything.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'SILENCE! This is number 349 of the 1,000 provisions you must observe. Meisters should eat everything regardless of personal likes and dislikes. Never say anything as selfish as "I don''t like carrots." again.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2424, 'Crona', 'I hate, hate, hate everyone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'I partnered with these two specifically so something like this wouldn''t happen. I need symmetry! Maybe I should have listened to my father. He tried to pick out a good weapon for me, but I refused to listen to him! Stubborn! All I cared about, all I wanted was symmetry! Two symmetrical weapons! Was that so much to ask for?! And now all my efforts have been completely and utterly wasted! Damn it!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'This brings us to number 278 of the 1,000 provisions you must observe. I hate carrots. Never even think about putting them in my food, you get it?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'It''s quite basic actually, perhaps the simplest of tricks there is. True it may not seem so simple from an ordinary persons point of view, some people may even consider it a baffling, utterly perplexing problem. Things will often appear complicated on the outside while in truth they are simplicity itself. Of course how one sees these things depends on the person, many people find there is a fine line separating the complex to the very simple.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2424, 'Crona', 'I''m scared of everyone. I need to learn to deal with people better.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2415, 'Patricia Thompson', 'Get your ass moving Kid!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'If you want to do damage to the other ship you have to ram them in the middle! Now do it again!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'One must take time to think! Rushing forward without considering things beforehand is the hight of foolishness. Ahh yes, that reminds me of another time when I had to consider things, that case was long ago but I remember it still. It was back when I still hung my hat on Bakers St. and called it home.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'Thus I found myself carrying the entire weight of the troop as I preformed my dance before a capacity crowd at the opera house.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2424, 'Crona', 'There are stars and planets floating around me. I don''t think I could handle astronomy right now.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2415, 'Patricia Thompson', 'Row, row, row your boat, gently down the stream. Merrily, merrily, merrily, merrily, life is but a dream.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'We''re hunting after a legendary sword. Finding a fairy or two shouldn''t be surprising.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'A symphony can not be created using common sense and probabilities. It is already written in the fate of the composer. No... that''s not it. A symphony is the inevitable result of a bad childhood, deafness, and too many beans eaten after a certain time of day.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'Humming and the nightly news share a very tight connection indeed.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2417, 'Franken Stein', 'You know about it, don''t you, Witch Medusa? About the Kishin beneath the DWMA.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2424, 'Crona', 'Thumbtacks in my shoes would stick into my feet whenever I tried to walk. It would hurt. I don''t think I could deal with that really.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2415, 'Patricia Thompson', 'You better watch out! I can break your neck!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'I''ll ward off the water from above, can you handle the water on the ground? We''ll work together, it''s a good thing there are two of us here. This plan would be impossible alone. Quite an obstacle.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'Black Star, I can''t come down, there''s water. Carry me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'Number 58 of the 1,000 provisions I would like you to observe, never talk to me while I''m humming to myself. This is an important provision do you understand?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'Of course they are my family, isn''t it obvious? And a wonderful family they were. It happened long ago when I was still in the flower of my youth. The cities began to grow wild, people lost hope for the future, they became lazy idol time wasters. And to my everlasting shame I was no exception. Thus I began to watch the 7 O''Clock news religiously every night!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2417, 'Franken Stein', 'This is fear. That''s good then, I had forgotten what it felt like.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2424, 'Crona', 'I''ve never seen a man with a screw sticking out of his head before. I don''t know how I''m supposed to deal with a guy like that!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2415, 'Patricia Thompson', 'Giraffe! Giraffe! I love Giraffes!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2415, 'Patricia Thompson', 'Yeah it''s going to be freaking awesome!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2416, 'Elizabeth Thompson', 'We were born as weapons and we loved the power that came with it. Nothing could scare us. We walked around town like we owned the place, taking whatever we wanted whenever we wanted it. No one ever thought to ask what our lives were really like.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'What If I didn''t fold the toilet paper? Something like that could ruin my life forever. I can''t be defeated by toilet paper, if I turn my back on this I shouldn''t be allowed to live anymore.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2426, 'Medusa Gorgon', 'That''s right, I said destory it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'Hey! Hold on, come back! I''ll tell you what! I can lower those 1,000 provisions down to 800, just as long as you take part in the five hour story telling party.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'Before becoming my Meister there is a list of 1,000 provisions you must peruse. Be sure to look through all of them, they''re important. I greatly look forward to your participation in number 452 the five hour story telling party.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2417, 'Franken Stein', 'Ha ha ha ha! Promise me something, if you''re gonna sue, go after the spirit first, okay?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2424, 'Crona', 'I don''t like it, the dark circles under my eyes will come back and I don''t know how to deal with the dark circles!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2415, 'Patricia Thompson', 'Hey sis, I''ve been wondering. How come everyone always closes their eyes when they sneeze? Is it to keep their eyes from popping out of their heads?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2416, 'Elizabeth Thompson', 'I can see through you, you''re lying, you want to gobble up my hot body!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'I''m a pig, a louse, a useless cow! I destroyed Anubis! Such utter garbage cannot be allowed to live! I deserve to die!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2416, 'Elizabeth Thompson', 'A sound soul dwells within sound skin and sound cuticles.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2415, 'Patricia Thompson', 'Yeah Kid you''re not garbage. If you were garbage you would smell a lot worse so why don''t we just get up and try again okay?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'No I can''t go on like this! I should die! How could this happen? Did I really forget to fold the tip of the toilet paper into a triangle?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2424, 'Crona', 'I''mma... I''m not very good at talking with girls. They make me nervous.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2424, 'Crona', 'This much I know, my blood is black.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2417, 'Franken Stein', 'Are you helping because you''re a doctor? Or is it because you''re a Witch?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'Nothing beats a cup of herbal tea in the morning.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'My legend dates back to the 12th Century you see. My legend is quite old. The 12th Century was a long time ago.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2426, 'Medusa Gorgon', '*chuckles* Looks like your little kitties failed. The taste of victory is very sweet!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2426, 'Medusa Gorgon', 'You''re horrible! Commenting on my appearance like that! I don''t have to listen to this from you! It''s sexual harassment!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2429, 'Eruka Frog', 'Free, we gotta inject the Black Blood into the Kishin, if we don''t then Medusa is gonna slaughter us!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2421, 'Blair', 'Pum, Pum, Pum, Pum. I always get what I want, so just give it to me. Pum, Pum, Pum, Pum. I''m a beauty, beautiful pretty lady. But you know, you know I''ve got a secret yes I do. Pumpkins, Pum, Pum, Pumpkins. Pum, Pum, Pumpkins because that''s my magic spell. Pum, Pum, Pumpkins, Pum, Pum, Pumpkins yeah!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2421, 'Blair', 'Pum, Pumkins, Smashing Pumkins!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2429, 'Eruka Frog', 'It''s so lovely to have been born a Witch.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2426, 'Medusa Gorgon', 'You don''t feel as good on my foot now, change yourself back into a frog.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'Young ones! Do you want to hear the legend of me? Do you want to hear a heroic tale?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2417, 'Franken Stein', 'I think I''d like to dissect you now!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2424, 'Crona', 'The doors here only open one way. They open inward.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'You''re disgustingly hideous! What the hell kind of thing are you? I''ve never seen anything more messed up in my life! Do you know nothing about symmetry? Whoever made you should be dug up from his grave, shot and reburied! You make me violently ill.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'Tornado Flip!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2421, 'Blair', 'Oh! My little scythey boy!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2429, 'Eruka Frog', 'Next time I really am going to kill you Medusa ribbit!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2426, 'Medusa Gorgon', 'It will be alright, have faith in yourself. Crona, you will be a Kishin.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'No autographs!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'Welcome. Welcome to my cave young ones. Please forgive the belated salutations I am the holy sword Excalibur!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2417, 'Franken Stein', 'All the more reason to dissect one, before the whole species dies off.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'Symmetry is key everything must be esthetically pleasing. That''s why I use the two of you as twin pistols in order to preserve symmetry. When I hold you both I''m completely balanced on the right and left. It isn''t perfect because your human forms are so different from each other though. Your hair styles and height for example. Even your boobs are different sizes!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2421, 'Blair', 'I never said I was a witch did I? You just made that assumption all on your own. I''m really just a cat with a ridiculous amount of magical power.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2429, 'Eruka Frog', 'I can''t stand that witch, stupid snake woman.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2429, 'Eruka Frog', 'Ribbit.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2426, 'Medusa Gorgon', 'Um well Miss Maka? Can you do me a favor and help me out with your father? I can''t get him off my leg.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2426, 'Medusa Gorgon', 'Nake, Snake, Cobra, Cobra.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'My mornings begin with a cup of coffee with cream at the cafe. My afternoon begins with hot tea with two lumps of sugar. And my evenings... In the evening I change into my pajamas.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2428, 'Excalibur', 'My legend dates back to the 12th Century thank you very much.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2417, 'Franken Stein', 'I can''t seem to get my head on straight.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'No, it can''t be 7, say 8 damn it! 8 is better! It''s physically impossible to cut the number 7 in half and make it symmetrical! It has to be 8 instead! 8 cut vertically or horizontally stays perfectly symmetrical! Take it back I beg of you! Please say 8, PLEASE!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'I''m an abomination! I''m filthy and dirty! And unbalanced! Why is there only one set of stripes?! I''m garbage! Asymmetrical garbage! I deserve to die!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'Symmetry is what makes the world beautiful.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Dr hiluluk', 'When do you think people die? When they are shot through the heart by the bullet of a pistol? No. When they are ravaged by an incurable disease? No. When they drink a soup made from a poisonous mushroom!? No! It’s when... they are forgotten.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 336, 'Enel', 'I am lightning. No matter how hard they try, mankind can never overcome lightning. Since ancient times, mankind has labeled the unknowns of nature as God. And anything they could not understand, they feared. Everything which befalls mankind is said to be the work of God. Mankind accepts that it cannot defeat natural disasters. And I am one of them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'Are you scared? I understand. The first time I saw my reflection in the mirror, even I was frightened by how BIG my reflection was.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2418, 'Death the Kid', 'I''m worthless garbage who can''t even write a straight looking K!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'Any technique is worthless before my eyes.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1982, 'Ryuk', 'The human world is a boring place with boring people doing boring things.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'The bells are very loud today.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'I will become a bigger badass than my father. And a stronger shinobi than my mother!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'You don''t understand anything, do you?! The most important thing isn''t power, it isn''t courage, it isn''t even having friends! The only thing that matters is that you can rely on ME.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2424, 'Crona', 'Do you know where hell is? Inside your head.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kyo', 'I HATE LEEKS!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, 7488, 'Arisa Uotani', 'I can''t see Kyoko-san...anymore. But she left me something. Her advice, her feelings... and Tohru. They all... all become fertilizer to help me grow.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, 7488, 'Arisa Uotani', 'But even though she''s gone... she''s not really gone, right? That the light won''t go on in that apartment... is a lie, right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, 7488, 'Arisa Uotani', 'Maybe I was lonely. Maybe I''ve just... always... been lonely.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, 7488, 'Arisa Uotani', 'Hmm... you can go anywhere you want? Cuz'' I''ll go... anywhere with you, y''know. (To Kureno)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, 7488, 'Arisa Uotani', 'HANAJIMA, MY SPEAR! GET ME MY SPEAR!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, 7488, 'Arisa Uotani', 'This may have been a useless time for you... but I really wanted to see you!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, 7488, 'Arisa Uotani', 'Is that the kinda attitude you show to someone concerned about you?! What''s gonna happen to the person who wants to see ya, huh?!?! Its obvious... Its obvious you wish to see each other... SO COME AND FREAKIN'' SEE ME ALREADY!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, 7489, 'Saki Hanajima', 'I...think that my performance today was a success because he played opposite me. Kyo-kun...Thank you. (To Kazuma)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, 7489, 'Saki Hanajima', 'I do...want to be with you...I want to be with you...! (To Tohru and Arisa)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, 7489, 'Saki Hanajima', '...If Tohru-chan were to die, I...I wonder if I''d be able to smile again one year later? Or if I''d wish that I could forget ever having met her. ...Tohru-chan... has tried really hard...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatori', 'Please stop adding to my misery. (to Ayame)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatori', 'It''s over between Kana and me. We''re not going to get back together. Even if we were together, I would only miss her... (To Shigure and Ayame)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatori', 'He''s just...he''s still a child. There are still a lot of things he can''t give up. There''s no rush. (To Ayame about Yuki)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatori', 'One more word Shigure and the entire publishing industry will know every embarrassing thing you''ve done since you were four.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatori', 'I started crying. It was the first time in my life that I felt forgiven. Like I was saved. Like the frozen snow that''s melted by spring, the tears wouldn''t stop.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, 7489, 'Saki Hanajima', 'A sixth sense cannot make up for a total lack of common sense.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatori', 'It''s true, crying unexpectedly does make you feel better. When you''re an adult you forget that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hiro', 'Go ahead! I''ll just turn you into the police for assaulting a minor! (To Kyo)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatori', '[thinking] I only take family as patients and I still get worked to death.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hiro', 'Since when did the "Cat" set the rules for this house? You mean to tell me that you contribute more to this house than anyone else? Do you pay all the bills? I can''t stand people who do absolutely nothing but complain all the time! (To Kyo)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatori', 'Often times in memory, we have the tendency to overly romanticize the people we care about.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hiro', 'So, what are you saying? You mean if your wife wasn''t controlling you, you wouldn''t be a villain? You mean you''ve never thought it''s just because you''re incompetent? And what''s that supposed to mean anyway? (To the story, "Mogeta")', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatori', 'It''s not the fun and games you think. It''s bizarre... sinister... cursed. (speaking of the curse to Tohru)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hiro', 'You''re so gullible! Don''t you have any standards? So if I told you to spin around, you''d do it? If they told you to jump off a cliff, would you do that, too? I can''t stand people who have no individuality!! (To Tohru)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatori', 'Please... even if I die surrounded by snow that never melts... please let her be happy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Momiji', 'Waah, Kyo''s picking on me! (Repeated line)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Momiji', 'I''ve gained freedom...and yet... it''s so lonesome... (after declaring he was leaving Akito''s side)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Ayame', 'Strangely enough, when you get older, the things you didn''t understand when you were a child... start to make sense. "When this happened, I should have done that." "When that happened, I should have said this." Those types of things. You start to understand rather than regret. It may be closer to repentance. So it may be that I do want to repent and erase the ignorant self from my childhood. Maybe that''s what they mean when they say adults are selfish.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Momiji', 'Pain, suffering. It''s pointless to just think about those things. The traveler (referring to "The Most Foolish Traveler" by Natsuki Takaya) didn''t. That may be stupid to some people but that''s not stupid to me. Yuki... Kyo... when you close your eyes, what do you think?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Rin', 'And if when everything ends, nothing is left in my hands...that''s alright.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Rin', 'Your happiness is in a much more vast world. Look for it. Find it. (to Hatsuharu)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Rin', '(thinking) I want Haru. I want all of him.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Rin', 'Something this, something that--jeez you''re annoying. (to Yuki)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Shigure', '(to Kagura) Sorry that''s your cue to say "Shigure you perv" and roll your eyes, slap me, whatever.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Shigure', 'I do intend to pay you for your services.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Rin', 'You don''t look like you''d be endowned with something so great (To Tohru, referring to "womans intuition")', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Shigure', 'Another story of Fruits Basket manga has begun. I have something very important to tell everyone. Yuki is actually...A GIRL!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Rin', 'Eventually, someday, whatever! If it will break, and we''ll be free then that''s good enough for me! (To Tohru)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Shigure', 'So this is how...it feels... (After just being released from the curse)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Rin', 'How long are you gonna sit in front of me sobbing your little eyes out?! It''s depressing! (To Tohru)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Shigure', 'We''ve just witnessed a classic example of what I like to call "misdirected rage". Though I believe the technical term is being an ass.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Rin', 'I don''t need someone as unreliable as you for a partner! (To Tohru)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Shigure', 'With so much at stake... are you willing to take the one in 10,000 chance?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Rin', 'A bond may seem like a beautiful thing from the outside...but if those involved see it as a burden, it''s nothing but a shackle.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Rin', 'You''re trying to break the curse. Stop it. What are you trying to do? Do you look down on us? Do you pity our wretched state? Don''t bother! We never asked for your sympathy! (To Tohru)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Shigure', 'People aren''t born social. Sure it comes easier to some people... but most people, like you, need to work at it. Some more than others. You''re just inexperienced. For example, as a martial artist, you have the strength to break the table with your fist. But you also have the self-control to stop your fist right before it hits the table. You weren''t born with that control, were you? You had to refine it. It''s the same as interacting with people. But training for that isn''t in the mountains - it has to be in town where people live. Mingling with people, hurting them, getting hurt by them. That''s how you learn about people and about yourself. If you don''t, you''ll never care about anyone but yourself. You may be a black belt fighter, but you''re still a white belt in dealing with people. For the sake of the girl who will one day tell you she loves you... Don''t turn away. Keep training.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Rin', 'I have nothing but me. I''ll give you myself. You can use me however you like for the rest of my life. (To Shigure)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Shigure', 'You reject your femininity... yet at the end here you are using it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Rin', '(thinking) Haru understood me. He cared for me. He loved me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Shigure', 'I do love Akito... I love her then... I still do now.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Rin', '(thinking) I can''t stand up...on my own. I can''t go...any further. Not...all by myself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Shigure', 'I yearn for you more than anyone else. I love you Akito... And that is the irrevocable unwavering truth.(shigures answer to akitos question "do you like me?" during a child hood flashback)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Rin', 'The biggest idiot is you! So why don''t you go back to school or whatever it is that idiots like you do and don''t ever bother me again! You piece of shit! (To Yuki)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Shigure', 'I''m ho-ome! Yuki-kun, Tohru-kun, I''m home! Oh, and let''s not forget stupid-clumsy-Kyo-kun-who-lost-yet-another-fight!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Rin', 'I don''t need you anymore. I''m tired of you. (To Haru)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Shigure', 'Even I... know what it''s like to be jealous. (referring to Kureno and Akito''s relationship)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Rin', 'You talk big yet you''re nothing but Akito''s toy! (To Yuki)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Kyoko Honda', 'I love you!! Even if you go bald or like underage girls, I can handle it! I''m crazy with love!! (Young Kyoko talking to Tohru''s father/her husband)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Kyoko Honda', 'For there to be pain, there has to be kindness. For darkness to stand out, there has to be the sun.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Kyoko Honda', 'Ah, I''m sorry, I guess this is farewell. Let Tohru find happiness. Please by many people let her be loved. If you become perplexed or make errors, in the end have the kind of life that you can have pride in living. The kind where you can say, "I persevered". Repeating delightful things and sad things. And in that way keep getting older. I persevered. (Part of Kyoko''s last words that were never said)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Kyoko Honda', 'If you don''t protect that child, I will never forgive you! (referring to Tohru as she was talking to Kyo on the day of the accident)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kagura', 'Hippo.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kagura', '(to Kyo) oh, shut up. shut up! shut up! AAHHH!! AAHHH!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Kyoko Honda', 'We''re all born with selfish desires so we can relate to those feelings in others. But kindness is created individually by each person... So it''s easy to misunderstand when someone is trying to be kind to you... But, Tohru, people''s differences are something to celebrate.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kagura', 'DON''T LEAVE ME!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Kyoko Honda', 'Tohru, you must always be yourself and do things at your own pace. Someday... you''ll catch up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kagura', 'Is it okay for me to have my own life now, father, now that I''m not "special" anymore?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatsuharu', 'It''s you that I want. Do you not want me? Don''t you want to be together? (to Rin)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatsuharu', 'I still can''t control my wish to see her. I never thought of how important she was to me. (about Rin)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatsuharu', 'I want to possess her...to make her belong to me, and only me. (about Rin)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatsuharu', 'Sometimes when I''d go to visit her in the hospital...she would purposely avoid me. Then I didn''t know what she was thinking about anymore... (to Yuki, about Rin)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatsuharu', 'Don''t try to be a hero, stupid cat. (to Kyo)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatsuharu', 'I''m creating trouble. Can''t you see?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatsuharu', 'If you don''t let me see Rin... I''ll kill myself! If I don''t kill you, I''ll kill myself! (to Akito)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatsuharu', 'I''ll always love you. (To Yuki)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kagura', 'It''s Valentine''s day, silly! It''s the day when lovers are together!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatsuharu', 'Don''t judge me based on the same story and laugh.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kagura', 'I thought that, if I could shorten the distance between us, and if you would like me back, then the me that ran away - the dirty me - would be washed away. (To Kyo)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatsuharu', 'Shut up. Quit shouting like you''re king of the figgin'' world. You''re making my ears bleed you bastard. Now I''ve got some common sense for you... If I wore a tie, it wouldn''t change who I am. If I had no piercings, it wouldn''t mean I''m nice and if my hair wasn''t black, it wouldn''t stop me from kicking your ass! Who do you think you are anyway? You think you''re God huh?! What''s the matter?! Run out of things to say? No more advice?! You''re not so hot anymore right now are you?! (Black Haru yelling at student council president for shouting at Momiji)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kagura', '...There''s nothing to feel sorry for on my behalf. I''ve been a very selfish girl. For the first time, I was able to see that. Thank you for worrying about me, mama. (to her mother)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatsuharu', 'So stupid! Stupid, Stupid! You''re so stupid! You want to live your life scared of being ratted out?! Screw that! I''d rather let everyone know everything!! (to Yuki, Tohru, Kyo, and Momiji while destroying a classroom)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kagura', 'I was... relieved. I realized that, compared to the cat, I had it easy. (To kyo)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatsuharu', 'A mystery... (Haru says this a lot, usually when it''s not a mystery at all)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kagura', 'SHII-CHAN, YOU SON OF A BITCH!!!! (after learning that Shigure invited Akito to the summer house)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatsuharu', 'Why..? How can she say things like that so easily? If we hear that from our parents, what are we supposed to do? Rin thinks that she''s been "bad". But who do you think is the one who''s being "bad" here!?! Having people take their anger out on us, being laughed at, not being taken seriously. We kids get hurt just like you do! Why can''t you understand something so simple?! Apologize! APOLOGIZE! APOLOGIZE TO RIN!! [Rin''s mom shuts the door] HEY!! I TOLD YOU TO APOLOGIZE!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kagura', 'It''s just that I''m fighting the pain of lost love. I guess it''s what you''d call a rude awakening... or, maybe... the weight of responsibility? But I''m fine. I''m fine. Caring for someone isn''t based on logic. You can''t really rationalize emotions. Once I think "I like him"... it''s all over.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatsuharu', 'It''s amazing no one''s locked you up yet (to Shigure)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kagura', 'Kyo-kun! Kyo-kun! I do love you, Kyo-kun! I love you!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatsuharu', 'Oh, you know... I''m gonna do this, and a little of that... and I''m definitely gonna do THAT...! (to Kyo about Tohru, after calling her Kyo''s girlfriend)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kagura', 'Starting today... I''ll be with you! I''ll always be by your side! (to a young Kyo)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatsuharu', 'You pansy! What kind of girly punch is that? I didn''t even feel it! (to Kyo)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatsuharu', 'Especially Yuki... He was my first love after all... [Tohru stops walking]', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kyo', 'You sicko...I knew you were depraved, but I never imagined how low you could sink! (to shigure)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kyo', 'Kagura... Regardless of what your reason was, when you played with me...I was happy. Thanks. (To Kagura)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kyo', '[To Tohru] Ever since you left I''ve been getting pissed off about everything, and because I couldn''t understand why, it just pissed me off even more!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kyo', 'Yo...time to pay the piper rat boy...I''m here to collect', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kyo', 'Tohru, I can''t stand not being with you... I... because I love you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kyo', 'I love you. When did I start to love you so much?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Yuki', '[to Kyo after they trip] What can I learn from a stupid cat like you? You didn''t even know that Jason isn''t really a bear! He''s a character from a horror film!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', '...As they played the game...I waited for someone to call "onigiri". But no one called. I was very little then. I had almost forgotten about that. But they knew...there would never be room for an onigiri...in a fruits basket.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kyo', '[To Yuki] Liar! Moping around like a sad rat who lost his cheese!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Yuki', 'STOP IMAGINING ME!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', '[To Kyo] Being away from everyone else may be lonely, but being away from you will be even lonelier.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kyo', '[referring to Tohru] If anyone can find a way to choke on rice, it''s her.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Yuki', 'Don''t you ever talk about Miss Honda that way again, you low life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', 'It''s not always easy to see the good in people. In some people, you might even doubt that it''s there at all. But if you can somehow, find a way to believe...sometimes that''s all it takes to help someone, to give them the strength to find the good in themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kyo', 'Be selfish, say what you want once in a while. It''s okay to let yourself be sad.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', 'My mom told me, it''s better to trust people than to doubt them. She said that people aren''t born with kind hearts. When we''re born, all we have are desires for food and material things. Selfish instincts, I guess. But she said that kindness is something that grows inside of each person''s body, but it''s up to us to nurture that kindness in our hearts. That''s why kindness is different for every person.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', 'Mom taught me that people''s differences are something to celebrate. When I thought of all the different shapes of human kindness -- imagining them as round or square...I got really excited. Your kindness is like a candle Sohma-kun. I can feel it light up, and I just want to smile. It''s that kind of kindness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kyo', 'Maybe I''m not perfect. Maybe I have a long way to go. But someday... someday I''ll be able to stand and walk on my own. Without hurting anyone... and without being a burden. (to Kazuma)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Yuki', 'A woman who can talk tough while completely naked...amazing. (about Rin, the horse)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', '[After seeing Yuki, Shigure, and Kyo Sohma transform for the first time] THEY''RE ALL ANIMALS!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kyo', 'I don''t want to be anyone''s burden. I don''t want you to be my dad if it''s going to hurt you. (thinking about Kazuma)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Yuki', '[To Kyo] Perhaps if you''d just die you''d be reincarnated as something more pleasant.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', '[On first seeing Kyo] The ceiling... Is he hurt...? Wh-who... Well, hello, orange-head...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kyo', 'ou know you''re a real wise ass, you know that?! (to Yuki)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Yuki', 'Leave her out of this... who we let in this house is really none of your concern. You''re the one who doesn''t belong here. (to Kyo)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', 'It''s a mystery. Just because of a simple sentence... I get shaken... or I get happy. Kyo-kun is mysterious indeed. (After Kyo says, "You wanna kill some time... with me?")', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kyo', 'I''m gonna take my place as a true member of this family!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kyo', 'Ha ha! Eat my dust, rat-boy! (to Yuki)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Yuki', 'I never... [chuckles]... laughed this hard in front of my parents.(to Tohru)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', 'As long as you live things will keep happening! As long as you''re alive wishes will keep being made!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kyo', 'You know... you really are something... (to Tohru)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Yuki', 'Skin him. Now. Barbeque the bastard!! (referring to Ayame)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', '[To Ritsu Sohma] Sometimes living can be hard, but it''s only because we''re alive that we can make each other laugh, cry...be happy! [thinking] If that''s not the reason for being born in this world...I don''t know what is!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kyo', 'Yo... Are you ready for me to break your neck... Rat-boy?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Yuki', '(referring to the letter for Kisa from the teacher) Here. It says to "like yourself". But good things about yourself... how are you supposed to find them? I only know things I hate about myself. ''Cause that''s all I know, I hate myself. But even if you force yourself to find good things... it feels so empty. It doesn''t work that way. People like your teacher just don''t get it. I think... when you hear someone say they like you, for the first time... then you can begin to like yourself. I think when someone accepts you, for the first time... you feel like you can... forgive yourself a little. You can begin to face your fears... with courage.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', '[in her head] My happiness comes from the kindness of those around me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Yuki', '[To Kyo] Seriously... Must you break something every time you come home? When are you going to learn? You''re too weak.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', '[To Ritsu Sohma] I''m sure that inside your heart...you''re trying with all your might to find it on your own...the reason you were born. Because...because really...there might not be anyone who was born with a reason. I think that everyone might have to find one on their own. [in her head] A reason for being born... A reason that it''s okay to be alive... A reason to exist. [aloud] I think everyone might have to find it themselves...and decide for themselves. It could be your dreams...your job...or a person. ...The reason you''re looking for...might be vague, unclear...and uncertain. [in her head] And you might lose it. [aloud] But as long as you''re alive...you have to keep searching for that reason.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', '[To Kyo Sohma]If you think of someone''s good qualities as the umeboshi in an onigiri, it''s as if their qualities are stuck to their back! People around the world are like onigiri. Everyone has an umeboshi with a different shape and color and flavor. But because it''s stuck on their back, they might not be able to see their umeboshi. "There''s nothing special about me. I''m just white rice." [in her head] That''s not true. There is an umeboshi -- on your back. [aloud] Maybe the reason people get jealous of each other, is because they can see so clearly the umeboshi on other people''s backs. I can see them, too. I can see them perfectly. There''s an amazing umeboshi on your back, Kyo-kun.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hiro', 'I want to be the only one... who can help the one I care about.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatori', 'Someday... no matter how cold it is now... the snow will melt. Without fail.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Ayame', 'NOW, SPARKLE, MY HOUSE OF LEARNING!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Momiji', 'But I think... I want to live with all my memories. Even if they''re bad memories. Even if they''re memories that only hurt me... that I''d rather forget. If I keep them and keep trying, without running away, then someday I''ll be strong enough that those memories can''t defeat me. I believe that because I want to think that there''s no such thing as a memory that''s ok to forget.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Shigure', 'Sometimes I think the whole world is conspiring to destroy my house.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Rin', 'Why don''t you stop forcing yourself on him and calling it love? It''s painful to watch (to Kagura about Kyo)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Akito Sohma', 'Idiots should do what idiots can to be quicker.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Kyoko Honda', 'True kindness isn''t something we''re born with. It''s something we had to work on... (to Tohru)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kagura', 'I just told you what I think, now say something DAMMIT!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Hatsuharu', 'You make me sick, you and your pathetic girly whining... You''re not a MAN! You''re just a little kitty-cat who''s afraid to fight! Know what?! YOU CAN GO TO HELL! HAHAHAHAHA! UGH! (gets kicked by Kyo in the face)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Kyo', 'Stupid ocean!!! Ya want me to kill you? Huh??', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Sohma Yuki', 'I won''t ask what you wish for. I only hope it comes true by your own two hands. (to Kyo)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', '[After Hatori asks what snow becomes when it melts]Ah...um, well...hmm. It becomes spring! No matter how cold it is now, spring will come again! Without fail. It''s strange isn''t it? But it''s true.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 'Honda Tohru', 'A lot of people are too scared to admit that they''re still children. They do everything they can to avoid it. So people who can admit that have a lot of courage.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kariya Jin', 'I am sane. It''s this world that''s crazy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, 1263, 'Mugen', 'I don''t give a rat''s ass about going to hell. I guess it''s because I feel like I''m already there.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, 1263, 'Mugen', 'Don''t live your life making up excuses. The one making your choices is yourself!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, 1263, 'Mugen', 'If you''re gonna send people after me, bring on the strongest you have.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, 1264, 'Jin', '*to Mugen* Do you want to go through all the trouble of causing an uproar to expose the level of your idiocy? Try to moderate your self-importance.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'Kasumi Fuu', 'They say "there''s always room for dessert", but for me, it''s more like "there''s always room if someone else is paying".', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, 1264, 'Jin', 'I have no desire to kill you. In fact, you''re not worth killing. Killing you, would only tarnish my blade.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, 1263, 'Mugen', 'When you point a sword at someone, either you kill them or they kill you, there ain''t no in between. So quit talkin'' like a fuckin'' pussy. Anyone who can''t handle that should just SHUT THE FUCK UP and GET OVER IT!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, 1263, 'Mugen', '[after drawing the infinity symbol] I thought of it myself, it stands for... Mugen.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, 1264, 'Jin', 'I think I''ve found what I was looking for all this time. I, who was always alone... found comrades for the first time.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, 1263, 'Mugen', 'I think that every day the sun rises, it may be the last time I bask in the sun.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'Kasumi Fuu', 'This world would be in darkness without a sense of duty.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, 1263, 'Mugen', 'If we were all the way up there, no one here''d look any bigger than a grain of sand.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, 1263, 'Mugen', '[in front of an execution squad] I don''t give a rat''s ass about going to hell. Guess I feel like I''m already there. What I do mind is the thought of being killed by you ugly bastards. I''ve gone my whole life without being helped by anyone else, and I''ll be damned if I''m gonna let you help me into my grave.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, NULL, 'Kasumi Fuu', 'There''s always room for free food.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, 1263, 'Mugen', '[looking at a porno magazine] Geez, doing it with a squid.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, 1263, 'Mugen', '[Fuu passed out after one drink and is asleep] Sleeping so carelessly. I could do something to you so easily.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, 1263, 'Mugen', 'Kiss my ass.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, 1264, 'Jin', 'Cutting down a man who''s done nothing wrong. Is that what you spent all that time honing those skills for? In my opinion, you''re worthless.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(10, 1263, 'Mugen', 'Forget all that formal crap ''bout comin'' at me one at a time. I''ll take all you bitches on!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Lancer', '---Well said. Then you can die first.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'Atone for my sins? [...] I have no sins to atone for, nor have I forced such a meaningless concept on anyone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Kiritsugu', 'Saving someone means not saving someone else.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', '...She''s scary. People who can put on a serious face while joking are the scariest.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'I''m home. What, are you greeting me in an apron? You look pretty good in it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'Oh, immortality. Heh, I gave that to the snake.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'Fortunately, I do not have any pride. But what about it? Will the name of the hero be disgraced? Hah, don''t make me laugh, Lancer. You can wash away disgrace with results. You can feed your meaningless pride to the dogs.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'You are a hateful woman. You oppose me to the very end. But I shall forgive you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'Yes, the seats are limited. There are always fewer seats called "happiness" than there are people to fill them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Saber', '...a man without fear cannot be wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'But that''s enough. If there is overwhelming power and speed, there is no room for technique. Techniques are something humans invented to compensate for their weaknesses.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', '...Yes, the desire to protect something... is, at the same time, none other than the wish for something to violate it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Kotomine Kirei', 'It is the path you have chosen. Take pride in it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Tohsaka Rin', 'The world is just another word for the things you value around you, right? That''s something I''ve had since I was born. If you tell me to rule such a world, I already rule it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'My goal is so far away that I''m not even on the starting line yet.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Lancer', 'Heroes always die due to unreasonable orders.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'That''s right! I admired his desire to save people because it was beautiful! But none of that feeling is my own! What else can you call it but hypocrisy?! I was driven by my obsessive need to help someone. I kept running, neither noticing the pain nor how wrong I was! But it''s all a fake. Such hypocrisy can not save anything. No, first of all, I didn''t even know what I wanted to save!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'Defying me till the very end, huh? But I''ll forgive you. Some things are beautiful exactly because they are unobtainable.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'The weakness that had accepted death now became the strength of wanting to live.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'I am the bone of my sword. Steel is my body, and fire is my blood. I have created over a thousand blades. Unknown to death. Nor known to life. Have withstood pain to create many weapons. Yet, those hands will never hold anything. So as I pray,
''Unlimited Blade Works''', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Saber', 'Hunger is the enemy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3891, 'Gilgamesh', 'A lot of something is ugly in itself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, 3890, 'Archer', 'Yes, I saw it over and over... Meaningless massacres. Meaningless suffering. Meaningless happiness! I was forced to watch it all. Even when I refused to look, it surrounded me. That isn''t what I wished for! I didn''t become a Guardian for this!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'People die when they are killed.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'Do you have enough swords, King of Heroes?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'It feels so close to me, yet I can''t reach it even if I hold out my hands. But even if I can''t reach it, there are things that will stay in my heart. Being in the same time and looking at the same sky – if I can remember that, then even if we are far apart, I believe we can still be together.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 'Emiya Shirou', 'Someday, my memories of her will fade. Her voice, her actions – I might forget them as well. But even then, I will always remember that I loved her.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1311, 'Lucy', 'You suddenly appeared in front of me in this hell. The day that I would get to meet you...I always wanted to apologize to you...I only endured because of that! I kept on living.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1311, 'Lucy', 'I hate these horns.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1311, 'Lucy', 'When you are miserable, you need something that is even more miserable than you to feel good about yourself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1311, 'Lucy', 'I was going to let you go. After all, there aren''t many of us out there, but you''re just such a pain in the ass.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11, 1311, 'Lucy', 'Everyone in this place is unhappy. And since they''re unhappy, they''re probably looking for someone worse off than they are.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'There''s no way I''m dying before you do, you morally bankrupt Colonel with a God complex.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1174, 'Maes Hughes', '[telling Mustang about the investigation on Scar] His bloodstained clothes washed up further downstream. We don''t know if that means that he''s dead, or just naked.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1174, 'Maes Hughes', 'Yeah, it''s still a nameless sniper. It''s become quite a topic among us. She''s still a cadet from the military academy, but at any rate she''s got a good arm. It seems she''s been brought all the way out here. Hah... to think they have to pull out even a little chick like that... this must be the end.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1174, 'Maes Hughes', '*to Edward* So, you hooked up with your mechanic, huh? Not too shabby, sprout.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1174, 'Maes Hughes', 'A bratty little midget.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1174, 'Maes Hughes', 'A normal guy like me isn''t going to be part of some "believe it or not" episode with nutcases like you guys!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1174, 'Maes Hughes', 'Are you telling me to go back and put a corpse on trial?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'If you use your head, you won''t get fat even if you eat sweets.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'Let me tell you about the difference between you and me. It''s like the story of the monkey trying to capture the moon. However close he thinks he is to the moon, it''s still just the reflection of the moon in the middle of the lake. No matter how he struggles to capture that "moon", he inevitably sinks to the bottom of that lake to no avail. You will never reach me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1174, 'Maes Hughes', 'I''m as normal as they come and this is a contest of freaks! What do you want me to do, shoot my slingshot at him?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1173, 'Roy Mustang', 'If your opponent is of choleric temper, seek to irritate.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'The great flow that maintains the universe, call it the cycle of life, the course of nature each one of us is just a small part of that part. One in the all. Yet without all the individual ones, the all can''t exist. This world flows by following grander laws that we can''t even imagine. To recognize that flow, to work in it. To decompose, and recreate, that is alchemy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'Alphonse Elric', 'Some memories... aren''t meant to leave traces.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', '*guilty voice* Because of my carelessness Araragi-kun realized that his brain is slower than others.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', '*to Araragi* A creature like you having a brain residing in his skull...is already a miracle in and of itself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', '*to Araragi* I''m suprised you know such useless things. This is the first time since birth that I''ve admired you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'You.... Could it be that you''re just an idiot? *to Senjougahara*', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'I don''t want that kind of twisted love.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2537, 'Meme Oshino', 'She''s been like that ever since I bought a box of donuts and had one more than her.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2537, 'Meme Oshino', 'No one cares about Araragi-kun.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2537, 'Meme Oshino', 'I don''t think much of you for sending a girl your age to the place where a wierd man lives.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'Right now, I''m afraid of losing you. Although my life hasn''t been very fortunate until now, I''m glad if I caught your eye because of that misfortune. Because of that, I was able to fall for you. So we''ll definitely do something, but I want to wait just a bit. So, right now, the last thing I can offer you... Is this starry sky.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'Don''t get me wrong. It''s not like I''m worried about you. But if you don''t come back I''ll never forgive you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2533, 'Nadeko Sengoku', 'You''re all grown up, so you won''t feel dirty looking at my body, right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'Don''t move. Oh, my bad. I mean, you can move if you want, but it''d be very dangerous.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'I told you, anything is OK, like saying you want me to end all my sentences with "nyu" for a week. Or that you want me to not wear underwear to school for a week. Or that you want me to wake you up every morning for a week, wearing nothing but an apron.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'Anything at all. Just this once I''ll fulfil whatever your wish is. Whether is world conquest, or eternal life, or to defeat the saiyans that are coming to earth.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'Don''t call me "this chick".', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'By the way, Araragi-kun... I''ve never broken up with a man before. Hence, I won''t be breaking up with you either.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'Come on. I don''t like this trend of explaining anything and everything about my love life. It''s impossible.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'If anyone else kills you, I''ll kill that person.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'Being kind to everyone, simply means there''s no one special.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'No one''s gonna save me. People just accept help selfishly, for their own sake.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'Even crabs have to go on a journey sometime.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'You''ve got nice solid childbearing hips, so I think you''re sure to have healthy babies. Uwehehehe', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'And, Araragi-kun....I love you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'Sunday, May 14th at 14:15:30--the moment I got Senjōgahara''s phone number.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'If I fail to make my every-minute reports, a gang of 5,000 brutes will attack your whole family.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'My abusive language is alchemized through 40 kg copper, 25 kg of zinc, 15 kg of nickel, 5 kg of ice that keeps my cool, and 97 kg of spite.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'Fine. I''ll correct myself. I have no experience. I''m a virgin. More to the point, the only kind of girl who''d talk to an unappealing virgin like you are late-bloomer virgins like me!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'Idiot! Don''t spit while you talk! Your virginity might be contagious!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'If I may suggest, I recommend my waking you up every morning wearing nothing but an apron. Then I can cook you breakfast. Isn''t it a man''s fantasy to watch that from behind?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'Is that so? Then I''ll just use "pathetic" next time.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'The word "ignorant" has a nice ring to it, so I don''t mind being called that, but "incompetent" is going just a bit too far...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, 2531, 'Koyomi Araragi', 'There stood a high school boy, who for selfish reasons had twice beaten an elementary school girl unconscious, and had gotten all nihistically worked up about it. Actually, that''s still me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'Copper, 40g; Zinc, 25g; Nickel, 15g; Hiding Embarrassment, 5g and Spite, 97kg.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 'Senjougahara Hitagi', 'If I kill you, that means I''ll be the one closest to you when you''re on your deathbed. Isn''t it romantic?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Son Goku', 'Sorry, I saw an opening that just screamed ''ATTACK,'' so I did, ha!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'Vegeta', 'Kakarot! Dodge this next attack, if you can!.. But even if I miss you... THIS WHOLE PLANET''S GOING UP IN SMOOOOKE!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'Vegeta', '[Vegeta''s last thought before he dies fighting Majin Buu] Bulma, Trunks. This is for you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'Vegeta', 'What''s wrong Frieza? Is your brain another one of your weak and under used muscles?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Krillin', 'Hey hun! I''ve got a great idea, let''s trade! Yo take my spot and I''ll fight Hercule!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1633, 'Piccolo', 'My ears do more than just frame my face.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Android 17', 'Tell me, are all you Saiyans so full of yourselves? Is this how you hide your incompetence? We androids will always be superior to your kind.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Android 17', '[clapping] A beautiful speech, I can see it now, you truly are a prince with the royal blood of a Saiyan.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Son Goku', 'How can androids have babies?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Trunks Brief', 'Father, you''re so tough and proud, hard and cold like a rock. But still, deep down, your heart beats like mine does... I know you feel... I''m your son and I will always love you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'Vegeta', 'While I was with you guys, I became more human. I didn''t like that. I even have a family and started to like living on earth.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'Vegeta', 'Trunks, I never hugged you as a baby... let me hug you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Son Goku', 'I would rather be a brainless monkey than a heartless monster. (To Frieza)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'Vegeta', 'Don''t remind me. I''m mad enough to hurt somebody and pounding you just might be the therapy I need.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'Vegeta', 'There''s only one certainty in life. A strong man stands above and conquers all!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'Vegeta', 'Let me ask you. Does a machine like yourself ever experience fear?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1633, 'Piccolo', 'I''m not going to lie to you, Vegeta, although the answer may be difficult for you to hear. This is the truth. Goku devoted his life to protecting the lives of other. Because of his selflessness, when he died, he was allowed to keep his body and travel to King Kai''s Planet. You, on the other hand, have spent your life in pursuit of your own selfish desires. You''ve caused too much pain. When you die, you will not receive the same reward.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Son Goku', 'I could go one step farther if I wanted to.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1633, 'Piccolo', 'Not bad, for an early prototype.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1633, 'Piccolo', 'Even with the energy you took from me, my power is still far greater than your own.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'Vegeta', 'You never thought to kill, or fight for revenge. Only to test your limits, and to push yourself beyond them, to become the strongest you could possibly be. How can a Saiyan fight like that, and at the same time be so gentle that he wouldn''t hurt a fly? It makes me angry just thinking about it. But perhaps it is my anger that has made me blind to the truth for so long. I see it now. This day has made it all too clear. You''re better than me, Kakarot. You are the best...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'Vegeta', 'Are you ready now, to witness a power not seen for thousands of years?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Son Goku', 'It looks like they only want me, and that''s exactly who they''ll get.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1632, 'Vegeta', 'You can take control of my mind and my body, but there is one thing a Saiyan always keep... his PRIDE!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Son Goku', 'That''s what you think, Captain Cocky!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Son Goku', 'Well, this blows.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'We''d rather die than abandon our comrade!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2688, 'Gray Fullbuster', 'Sorry, but it doesn''t matter if you''re a woman or even a child... I don''t go easy on anybody who hurts my nakama.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2688, 'Gray Fullbuster', 'I am an ice sculpture mage. I can make anything.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2692, 'Erza Scarlet', 'It is always sad to part with those whom you love, but your companions will help you bear that sadness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2706, 'Gajeel Redfox', 'Keeheehe. I like him. I''m going to make him my cat.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2689, 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'What''s the point of magic to begin with... if I can''t use it to protect my friends?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2689, 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'It''s not a crime! Caring about your friends is not a crime!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2689, 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'Stellar Spirits are not "Shields".', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2690, 'Natsu Dragneel', 'Why do you find it easy to kill? These are lives dammit!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2690, 'Natsu Dragneel', 'Mages of Fairy Tail... specialize in property damage!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'To become Hokage is my dream!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1173, 'Roy Mustang', 'Nothing''s perfect, the world''s not perfect, but it''s there for us, trying the best it can. That''s what makes it so damn beautiful.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Krillin', 'It looked like it was going to be germ warfare, but the Bacterian fight got me ready for that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Krillin', 'First it was that sewer-face and now I''m up against a superhero.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1631, 'Bulma', 'Yamcha, I was worried about you. For all I knew, you were dead in a ditch in a country you can''t pronounce. You''ll have to make this up to me. And you''re going to enjoy it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Krillin', '(after Goku moves a huge boulder all by himself) Krillin wants everybody to know he''s speechless right now.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Krillin', '(after Master Roshi tells him they have to dig in a farm) First we''re the milkmen, and now we''re stinkin'' farmers. We never did this in Orin Temple.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Master Roshi', 'But, you will not go in there with hopes of winning the tournament the first time you compete. To do so would be arrogant! And arrogance is for fools, not warriors! So you will enter the tournament with the sole purpose of improving your fighting skills.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Master Roshi', '(Master Roshi is reaching for Launch''s buttocks as Krillin barges in and makes him angry) Do you time this?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, 1631, 'Bulma', 'Look Goku, you can go out in public and have your hair sticking out in every direction if you want to, but not me!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Son Goku', 'Hey! It looks like now is a good time to do a little tail fishing!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(16, NULL, 'Son Goku', 'Where is your tail? (Searching for tail in Bulma''s butt)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1332, 'Toushirou Hitsugaya', 'I will protect Hinamori.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(32, 2690, 'Natsu Dragneel', 'I love adventures.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 382, 'Brook', 'I''m the afro-hair guy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Nico Robin', 'They call me the "demon child".', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 328, 'Franky', 'I am crazy and stubborn.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Tony Tony Chopper', 'I want a devil fruit.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 331, 'Nami', 'I''m the smartest member in the Straw Hat group.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 332, 'Usopp', 'I''m the sniper king, sogeking.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 329, 'Sanji', 'Black leg!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'I''m a pirate hunter.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'There is something mysterious about the life of a pirate.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Mikami Teru', 'Kira is a god.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 2000, 'Kiyomi Takada', 'I am Light''s girlfriend from university.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Mello', 'I love chocolates.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Rem (Death Note)', 'I am a complete opposite of Ryuk.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1986, 'Misa Amane', 'I am a famous model.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1982, 'Ryuk', 'I stole a death note.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'I have a mind of a genius and a strong sense of justice.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, NULL, 'Bismarck Waldstein', 'Strength that knows no boundaries is merely violence.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Sai', 'The best way to escape reality without running is smiling even if it is obviously fake.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ayasegawa Yumichika', 'It''s always a lot more easier to let something fall apart than it is to try to hold it together.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'Learn to treasure your life because unfortunately, it can be taken away from you anytime.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1982, 'Ryuk', 'All humans die the same, the place they go after death isn''t decided upon by a god it is Mu (nothingness).', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Inoue Orihime', 'It''s impossible to feel exactly the same as someone else... but when you both care for each other, your hearts are able to draw a little closer together. I think that''s what it means to make your hearts as one.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Urahara Kisuke', 'There''s a lot of products that you can buy with money...but my love is the only limited product that only you can have.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1329, 'Rukia Kuchiki', 'If history repeats itself, and moves in a circular path, then believing that whatever force is turning it is perfect, is all we can do as we move ahead. Pushed along by forces beyond our control, waiting, for the blade to be swung.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'So shut up about "destiny" and...how people can''t change! ''Cause... unlike me... you''re not a "failure".', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'Sasuke! Sasuke! Sasuke! What does he have that I don''t have?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'Sasuke, I always knew you were alone. In the beginning I was glad because I thought you were like me - I wanted to talk to you! But you... didn''t speak. You always had everyone watching you. You could do everything and we were too different. So I decided that you would become my rival. I didn''t want to lose because I was called a loser all the time. Even when we became Team 7, I still thought this way. I always tried to lie but... but the truth is... I always wanted to be like you. I aspired to be like you. Because of that... I was glad that you wanted to fight me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'When I''m with Iruka-sensei, I think if that''s what having a father is like... *to Sasuke* When I''m with you, I think if that''s what having a brother is like.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'Sakura-chan, you sure do love Sasuke, don''t you?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Might Guy', 'DYNAMIC ENTRY!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 163, 'Kisame Hoshigaki', '[after learning Guy Sensei''s name. Might Guy] Yeah, mighty stupid looking guy!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 163, 'Kisame Hoshigaki', 'Hmhmhmhm, I think I will play with you a bit before killing you!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 163, 'Kisame Hoshigaki', 'Hmm... Itachi... it would be annoying if he moved around a lot. Perhaps we should cut off a leg or two?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 163, 'Kisame Hoshigaki', 'I''ll enjoy shaving you to death.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 163, 'Kisame Hoshigaki', 'Konoha''s Uchiha clan and the Mist''s Seven Shinobi-gatana seem petty before his name.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Kimimaro', 'Against the power of will I posses... The capability of my body is nothing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Kimimaro', '[after Naruto does his Shadow Clone Jutsu] Oh, there sure is a lot of garbage scattered around here. But, trash is just trash after all. It simply needs to be cleaned up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Kimimaro', 'I don''t hate the darkness. It was IN the darkness that I was raised.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Kimimaro', 'I''ve been wondering... There must be a purpose for people being born into this world. Why are we here? What does it mean? I''ve been thinking about it a lot lately. I realized that finding our purpose IS the meaning. That''s why we''re here. And the ones who find it... They''re the only ones who are truly free.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Kimimaro', '*referring to Orochimaru* I am not his pawn..! He is the one, the only one who ever gave my life meaning!! But how could the likes of you EVER UNDERSTAND THAT?!?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Kimimaro', 'I will see the truth of this world... LORD OROCHIMARU WILL SHOW ME!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Kimimaro', 'I see...since I am no longer going to be Lord Orochimaru''s vessel, my duty is to protect the vessel.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Kimimaro', 'You''ve only seen one of my dances.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Kimimaro', 'Lets see, how should I kill you?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Kimimaro', '[to the Sound Ninja Four] Which do you prefer? To die, or to obey?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Kimimaro', 'Is there really a god? If there is one, why does he keep me confined in here?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Kimimaro', 'If Tayuya comes back, I''ll kill her.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 171, 'Kiba Inuzuka', 'Akamaru, what''s wrong boy? Have you forgotten my scent? We''ve always been together haven''t we? We grew up together. Akamaru please, somewhere in there, there has to be a part of you that remembers. Show me that you remember. AKAMARU! Forgive me. Can you? I know that I''ve brought you nothing but pain and suffering. I broke my word. I swore I''d always protect you. Akamaru I''m sorry. Sorry I wasn''t a better master. I''m here. Here for you. Forever.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 171, 'Kiba Inuzuka', 'I called you an idiot, idiot!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 171, 'Kiba Inuzuka', 'It''s not bad enough they buried us alive in the oversized dung heap, but now they''re stealing our chakra. You gotta give these guys credit for thoroughness!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 171, 'Kiba Inuzuka', 'A wall''s a wall and there''s no wall I can''t punch a hole through!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 171, 'Kiba Inuzuka', 'Hinata, untie the ropes before you faint.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 171, 'Kiba Inuzuka', 'I must be a pretty pathetic owner for you to have bitten me, Akamaru....', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 177, 'Kankuro', 'A fair warning... we ninja of the Sand aren''t as easygoing as those of the Leaf. But getting close to Kuroari so carelessly...isn''t good!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 177, 'Kankuro', '[Thinking] What a sucker. He doesn''t know I can re-establish control over my puppet within a blink of an eye. It''s what makes me an expert puppet master. And so what if Crow''s body is out of commission? I don''t need his body. Every part of him is a lethal weapon. [To Shino] Looks like you underestimated me, bug boy. For the last time! There''s enough poison on that to drop an elephant, so you''re dead.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 177, 'Kankuro', 'You tick me off. I hate short people anyway. And you''re so impertinent for someone younger than me. It makes me want to break you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 177, 'Kankuro', 'But I want to play around before some noisy people come!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'Gai...what I said earlier...I was out of line. I was being a self-righteous fool. I realize now that if I''d been in your shoes, I probably couldn''t have stopped him, either.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'I don''t know what this boy means to you, Gai, but I shouldn''t have to tell you that we never bring our personal feelings into play. I didn''t think you were capable of it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'I''ve lived longer than you. And times have been bad. I know the pain of loss. You and I haven''t really been fortunate. It''s true. But it could be worse. For me, and for you, too... We''ve found good friends, haven''t we? Because of your losses, you should understand.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'Sorry I''m late. You wouldn''t believe the traffic.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'Sorry I''m late guys, a black cat crossed my path so I had to go the long way.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', '[thinking] If I''m still sane by the time I finish their training it''ll be a miracle!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'I will show you my own move.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'A ninja must see underneath the underneath.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'Leaf Village Secret-Finger Justu...1,000 Years of Death!!! *sticks his fingers up Naruto''s ass*', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'Hmmm...how do I put this? My first impression of this group...you''re a bunch of idiots!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 159, 'Kabuto Yakushi', '[about the inefficacy of his attack against Tsunade] Did it not penetrate deep enough because of her fat breasts?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 159, 'Kabuto Yakushi', 'The more you want something, the harder it is to wait for it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 159, 'Kabuto Yakushi', 'Mm, she''s strong and scary. I bet she''s single.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 156, 'Iruka Umino', '[About Naruto] Well that''s typical. Not happy unless he''s giving people a heart attack.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 156, 'Iruka Umino', '[when Naruto transforms into a woman in front of the whole class] CUT THE STUPID TRICKS! THIS IS YOUR LAST WARNING!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 156, 'Iruka Umino', '[as a child] Why should I be sad?! My parents died protecting the village from the monster fox. They''re heroes, and I''m the son of those heroes! If I cry, it''s because I''m happy! I''m not even sad that they went and left me all alone...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 156, 'Iruka Umino', 'I hate the fox, but the boy - I don''t hate the boy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 156, 'Iruka Umino', 'It seems like the small leaves in the Village of Konoha have inherited that "will of fire" you spoke of, Third. The fire on the leaves will eventually burn greater and stronger... It will flash its light and protect this village.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 156, 'Iruka Umino', 'When a person dies, he disappears, along with his past, current lifestyle, and his future. Many people die in missions and wars. They die easily and in surprisingly simple ways. Hayate was one of them. Those who die have goals and dreams. But everyone has something as important as those. Parents, siblings, friends, lovers... people who are important to you. They trust and help each other. The bond between the people important to you ever since birth and the string that binds them becomes thicker and stronger as time goes by... It''s beyond reason. Those bound to you by that string will do that because it is important.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 155, 'Ino Yamanaka', 'Billboard brow!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 155, 'Ino Yamanaka', 'Oh, I''m sorry. Her head''s so empty, so I mistook her for a vase and put flowers in her. You might want to spit that out quick, though. Those can be quite poisonous.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 155, 'Ino Yamanaka', 'I believe you have the potential to bloom into something even more beautiful than the cosmos.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 157, 'Haku', 'I am of no more use as his tool. Please, kill me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 157, 'Haku', 'Often people have it wrong, mistakenly believing...that showing mercy to an enemy is kindness. They spare the foe whose life is in their hands... But don''t you see? It''s an empty existence... to go on living... alone and unloved... when defeat''s already cost you your dream!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 157, 'Haku', 'Can you understand? Not having a dream... not being needed by anyone... The pain of merely being alive.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 157, 'Haku', 'That is when I realized that in all of the world no one needed me. I was alone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 157, 'Haku', 'I''m sure that the boy I killed, who shared that skill, must also have grown up knowing the pain of which I speak. We are special. We are powerful. And we are feared.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 157, 'Haku', 'I want to make his dreams come true...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 157, 'Haku', 'Is there... somebody precious to you?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'I took the life of the woman I was supposed to call mother in the process of being born... in order to become the world''s strongest shinobi... I became the incarnation of sand...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'It''s too bad I don''t think of you as anything. If you get in my way... I''ll kill you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'BLOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOD!!! MY BLOOOOOOOOOOOOOD!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'You can make a rain of 1,000 needles. I will make it rain blood.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'People cannot win against their loneliness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 154, 'Chouji Akimichi', '[When Ino visits him in the hospital] Hehe. I''m also the type that gets girls to visit him. Take that, Shikamaru!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 154, 'Chouji Akimichi', 'I''m not fat, I''m pleasingly plump!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 154, 'Chouji Akimichi', 'This punch is heavier than life itself!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 154, 'Chouji Akimichi', 'Chubbies rule!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 148, 'Anko Mitarashi', 'Time''s a-wastin'' people, let''s go!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ichimaru Gin', '*to Ichigo* I thought you were interesting before, but now you''re just a creepy kid.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1354, 'Ganju Shiba', 'There ain''t a single coward who''d turn tail and run from just that! Not among the men of the Shiba clan!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', '*to Ichigo, after he released his bankai for the first time* What is that? Are you saying that this small thing is a bankai? Isn''t it just the sealed form of your zanpakutō? I see. First the execution, and now Bankai. I can see that you enjoy treading on our pride. Very well, then. I will carve into your body...The punishment for injuring our pride!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1342, 'Zangetsu', 'Though you fight a fierce battle on the outside, your inner world trembles not the slightest.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1342, 'Zangetsu', 'To fight...Or to live...Choose.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1342, 'Zangetsu', 'Ichigo... I hate the rain. Rain falls in this world, too. When your heart is in chaos, this sky becomes clouded. When you are sad, rain falls so terribly easy. Can you understand...the horrible feeling of being pelted by rain when you''re all alone in this solitary world? If only to stop that rain, I shall lend you any strength. If you trust in me, I won''t let a single drop of rain fall from that sky. Ichigo, trust me...you are not fighting alone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1342, 'Zangetsu', 'Just how many times must I strain my voice before it will reach you? And yet, nowhere in this world can there be anyone who knows me better than you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1342, 'Zangetsu', '*referring to Ichigo* I see. So I still haven''t reached you...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shihouin Yoruichi', '[When she hops into the bath with Ichigo, but in cat form] What? Are you a little disappointed? Come on, be honest. You are, aren''t you? You little pervert!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shihouin Yoruichi', 'That''s enough, Soifon. You remind me of myself. I even think of you sometimes as my little sister.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shihouin Yoruichi', 'Kisuke and I used to play here when we were kids. We modeled the one under his shop after this one. It was our own secret playground.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shihouin Yoruichi', '[thinking after Soifon asks why she didn''t take her with her] You''ve gotten stronger since the last time we were together, Soifon.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shihouin Yoruichi', 'No matter how many times I do this, it results in a wonderful reaction from you, Ichigo!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shihouin Yoruichi', 'It looks to me like you''ve completely lost your touch.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shihouin Yoruichi', 'Are you sure you don''t want to see this smooth skin of a young woman? This will be the last time...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shihouin Yoruichi', 'Do you remember the first time you walked? No. So you weren''t conscious of it. Then why did you walk? Everyone was born knowing how to walk. It''s called instinct. That''s what this boy reminds me of. He knows he can achieve bankai, so he continues.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shihouin Yoruichi', 'In three days, I will make this boy stronger than you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shihouin Yoruichi', 'It''s been a while... Byakuya-bo.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shihouin Yoruichi', 'You shy, little boy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shihouin Yoruichi', 'Can''t you tell, Aizen? You no longer have a place to run away to.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1334, 'Yasutora Sado', 'Ichigo...We can''t...Watch any longer...Eachother''s backs...I just can''t...I just can''t help you out anymore.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1334, 'Yasutora Sado', 'I will defeat him. It may cost my life to do it. However, if I survive, I''ll make a promise. The same promise as that time, on the same thing as that time.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1334, 'Yasutora Sado', '[in reply to Shunsui Kyōraku] It''s true, I know nothing about her (Rukia). It might not be quite enough for me to risk my own life over. But...Ichigo wants to save her. That reason is enough for me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1334, 'Yasutora Sado', 'I don''t believe that an absolute power really exists in any world. Power is unstable. It changes constantly. Small differences will always appear, as one has between you and I. So the one who widens that gap will be the winner!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1334, 'Yasutora Sado', '[to Arrancar Gantenbainne Mosqueda] It seems that my power is more akin to yours than that of a Shinigami or a Quincy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1334, 'Yasutora Sado', 'Abuelo... That means grandpa.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kusajishi Yachiru', '[thinking to self about her past, and when she first met Kenpachi] I had no name. I had no parents. I was from District 79, "Kusajishi", of the North Alley of Rukongai. I had never seen anything in colors other than the bloody red... Everyone was more beast than human. It wouldn''t have been strange to have a baby get stepped on and die. But then you appeared. From District 80, "Zaraki", of the North Alley of Rukongai. You appeared to me from even deeper in the darkness. You demolished the chaotic world that was dyed in blood... And then, you gave me a name. If it wasn''t for you...I wouldn''t be alive today. Yes...Since that day...You''ve been everything to me in this world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kusajishi Yachiru', '[to Ichigo] Try to stay alive, okay? That way, you and Kenny can play again some day!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kusajishi Yachiru', 'Ken-Chan!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kusajishi Yachiru', 'Someone get this creature off meeeeeee!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1982, 'Ryuk', 'Sorry, but...believe it or not, I''m a male too.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1982, 'Ryuk', 'Hey, all it did was go around in a full circle.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1982, 'Ryuk', 'As a rule, they say humans haunted by a shinigami have nothing but misfortune.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1982, 'Ryuk', 'Apples taste so much better indoors.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1982, 'Ryuk', 'For me, apples are like cigarettes and liquor for humans. If I''m deprived, I go into withdrawals.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1982, 'Ryuk', 'That was worth an academy award, Light.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1982, 'Ryuk', 'I feel like I''m watching a sitcom.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1982, 'Ryuk', 'Humans are so... interesting.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Near', 'That may be so. What is right from wrong? What is good from evil? Nobody can truly distinguish between them. Even if there was a god. Now, supposing a god and his world existed, even then I''d stop and think for myself. I''d decide for myself whether his teachings are right or wrong. After all, I am just the same as you. I put faith in my own convictions as to what I believe is right, and consider them to be righteous.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Near', 'Seriously, enslavement is funny...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Near', 'I''ve wanted to make him taste his own pathetic failure with all my heart.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Near', 'Does she understand what she''s doing, this stupid woman?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Near', 'For me and Mello, L has been the only person we adore, and the only person who deserves our respect.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Near', 'You said she''s smart, but it only means she got high marks, and she''s actually a stupid woman.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Near', 'Making such a sleazebag a spokesman...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Near', 'People in supervising positions in investigation are supposed to give too much of their opinion, and if they are wrong, all it would take is an apology.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Near', 'I don''t know what to say. Now, I think it''s just best to observe closely.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Near', 'To Mello, it''s like playing a videogame against me, I think. "See who gets to Kira, the last boss, first."', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Near', 'You, who''ve taken on his name, have managed – well, nothing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Near', 'It''s not whether it''s feasible or not – it''s what I''m doing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Near', 'You let them take it from right under your nose.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Near', 'Things are getting interesting now.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Near', 'And that''s precisely why it''s so convenient, don''t you think?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Near', 'I''m pleased to meet you at last, L Number Two.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Mello', 'Near and the others told me that this woman was supposed to be the second Kira. But could it really be this unbelievably stupid girl?..', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Mello', 'Matt... I never thought you''d be killed... I''m sorry.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Mello', 'It''s my turn to use you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Mello', '*to Near* Which of us will get Kira first... it''s a race!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Mello', 'I''m not just a tool for you to use in order to solve your puzzles, you know!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Mello', 'So, how about you tell me right now whom you''d like me to kill, and how. I''ll treat''cha to it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Mello', 'He''s terribly reasonable, this new L.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Mello', 'In the end, there is no greater motivation than revenge.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, NULL, 'Mello', 'It''s time I started living my own life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'If you keep my secret, this strawberry is yours.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'I haven''t said anything about letting them commit murder...yet.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'Actually, if you''re smart, you can eat sweets without gaining weight.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'Risking your life and doing something that could easily rob you of your life are exact opposites.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'This isn''t divine jugdement. It''s the work of some childish killer who''s playing at divine retribution. That''s all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'Let''s show him...that the good guys always win.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'Kira is childish and he hates losing... I''m also childish and hate to lose. That''s how I know.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'Let''s value our lives.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'It was the only way the world had to be fixed! A purpose, given to me!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'This world is still rotten!.. With too many rotten people.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'That''s right, I am Kira. And what can you do? Kill me right here?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'Our battle will be concluded, and I will begin my reign from the summit of victory!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'In the end, L is indeed the greatest detective on earth...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'But you know the saying, "play with fire, and you''ll get burned". I''ll make you regret underestimating L...underestimating me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'I must protect my fledging Utopia.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'No matter what the world, the god of that world creates the rules. In truth, you have been defeated by the rules I created. And as punishment for defying the God of the new world, you will die...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'I''ve won. Exactly as planned.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'For murderers, there is no good or evil. I know that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'The thing I hate the most is to trample on other people''s good will.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'I''ve never considered finding that notebook and gaining that power a misfortune.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'You can''t ever win if you''re always on the defensive. To win, you have to attack!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'This is the first time in my life that I''ve been provoked to hit a woman.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'L, do you know gods of death love apples?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'He was someone who deserved to die.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', '[To Orihime] Am I frightening... woman?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', '[To Orihime] You''re just in time. Watch closely. This is the moment that the man you''ve put your hope in will lose his life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', 'If it is because of what you call a heart, then it is the heart that causes you humans pain. It is because of your heart that you will die.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', 'Kurosaki Ichigo, those are the words of someone who does not know true despair. So I will show you. This is what true despair looks like.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', '[To Ichigo] So you can withstand my Cero even without your mask... You''ve gotten stronger. Is it because you defeated Grimmjow? Or...Is it because of her? [Motions to Inoue] Or maybe because of your friends, still fighting down below. That girl is already one of us. Even if you manage to rescue her, that won''t change. Rescuing her...Is meaningless.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', '[To Orihime] Your heart? You humans say that word so lightly. As if it were something one can hold in the palm of one''s hand. But my eye sees everything -- Nothing can escape it. What it doesn''t see doesn''t exist. That''s how I''ve always fought. That''s how I''ve always lived.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', '[To Yammy] They''re all trash...kill them all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', 'Even saying they were just a bunch of fools would suffice. So why can''t you? Were it me... I would be angry at the ignorance of those who would enter Hueco Mundo... without even testing their own power.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', 'It seems I have overestimated you quite a bit. Your evolution did not even satisfy my expectations. This is the end.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', 'Kurosaki Ichigo, you have no chance of defeating me. Even if you somehow manage to defeat me, there will be three more powerful than myself for you to fight. It doesn''t matter if you stand up again a thousand times. The road to victory does not exist.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', 'I was not capable of stopping it even while using both hands. That surprised me a little. Was that your full power? Well, it seems to be... disappointing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', 'And it seems you''ve acquired a new power. However, is that all you are capable of achieving with it? This is the end. You will no longer interfere. The sun has already set in our hands.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', '[To Orihime, when she refuses to eat] Shall I force it down your throat? Or would you rather be strapped down and given IV''s?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ulquiorra Schiffer', 'Therefore let me inform you...All of your dreams are to be thrown away.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1333, 'Uryuu Ishida', 'I am calm. That''s why I can fight you!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1333, 'Uryuu Ishida', '[to Yammy Rialgo, as the Espada grips the edge of a hole in the floor] Mala Suerte. I pity you. [shoots the floor just before Yammy''s hand, causing him to fall] Oh, and I broke the pillars on every floor on the way up. So, you''ll probably fall all the way to the bottom.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1333, 'Uryuu Ishida', '[to Renji] I assure you, my gratitude is sincere.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1333, 'Uryuu Ishida', 'The right to choose life or death lies with the victor. And the victor of this battle is me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1333, 'Uryuu Ishida', 'Seele Schneider isn''t a sword. [strings the weapon on his bow] A Quincy''s only weapons...Are bows and arrows. [fires the Seele Schneider]', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1333, 'Uryuu Ishida', 'That''s right...If I''m the first one here, I can save Kuchiki-san. Kurosaki must''ve wanted to rescue her himself...If I did it, he''d get really pissed...Heheheh...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1333, 'Uryuu Ishida', 'I hate Shinigami.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1333, 'Uryuu Ishida', '[to Mayuri Kurotsuchi] It''s a good thing Orihime isn''t here. I wouldn''t want her to see what I''m about to do to you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1333, 'Uryuu Ishida', '[lying about coming to save Rukia] Just passing by. No big deal.... Well, if you must know, I felt a sudden urge to go to Sunflower Seams, that 24-hour dressmaking shop. There''s a branch near here. That''s where I was headed at this late hour. I certainly didn''t bring this bag with me just so I would have an excuse for suddenly leaving the house because I sensed the spirit energy of a shinigami, all right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1333, 'Uryuu Ishida', 'Calling me a coward, eh? At least say it so I can hear it...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1333, 'Uryuu Ishida', '[to an arrogant projectile-specialist Shinigami] Apparently, on this side, "ultimate master" means a windbag with diarrhea of the mouth.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1333, 'Uryuu Ishida', 'Ah, Kurosaki. I''m glad to see you''ve finally realized the importance of a cape.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1332, 'Toushirou Hitsugaya', '[to Luppi] Hyourinmaru is the strongest of all ice-type Zanpakutoes. Your weapon may have eight arms, but mine is all the water in the atmosphere! Sennen Hyourou!! [causes several pillars of ice to form, before using them to crush Luppi] Sorry. Eight wasn''t enough.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1332, 'Toushirou Hitsugaya', 'I didn''t come here to fight! I came here to hack at you violently!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1332, 'Toushirou Hitsugaya', 'We are all like fireworks. We climb, shine, and always go our separate ways and become further apart. But even if that time comes, let''s not disappear like a firework. Let''s continue to shine... Forever.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1332, 'Toushirou Hitsugaya', 'Stand back? [To Kira after Gin asked him to stand back] No, Kira...Run. Run until you''re out of my sight, and keep running. Otherwise...I can''t guarantee you won''t get dragged into this and be killed.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1332, 'Toushirou Hitsugaya', 'I''M﻿ NOT AN ELEMENTARY STUDENT!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1332, 'Toushirou Hitsugaya', 'Aizen, I will kill you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1332, 'Toushirou Hitsugaya', 'Don''t come back... "Bed-wetter" Momo.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1332, 'Toushirou Hitsugaya', 'Dummy. I''m not gonna dwell on what happened forever. All that junk... it''s the furthest thing on my mind. You should especially quit worrying about it and get some more sleep. Hurry up and get rid of your Panda eyes, got it?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1332, 'Toushirou Hitsugaya', 'No, not yet, now that you''ve made me this serious. Regret as much as you damn well want!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1332, 'Toushirou Hitsugaya', '[to Gin Ichimaru] If you make Hinamori shed even one drop of blood, I''ll kill you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1332, 'Toushirou Hitsugaya', 'Sit upon the frozen heavens! Hyōrinmaru!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'Seek not beauty in battle. Seek not beauty in death. Consider not your own life. If you wish to protect that which must be protected, then strike while your opponent''s back is turned.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'All creatures want to believe in something bigger than themselves. They cannot live without blind obedience. And to escape the pressure of that trust, those in whom faith is placed in turn look for someone higher than themselves. And then those people in turn look for someone even stronger. That is how all Kings are born. That is how all Gods are born.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'Trusting someone...means relying on them and only the weak do that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'I never ask them to trust me at all. I told them to come with me but I never told them to trust me. And I always tell them not to trust anyone, including myself. But sadly, there are not many strong enough to do that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', '[To Barragan, before he was recruited by Aizen] Isn''t it ironic, king of Hueco Mundo? Dressed in black and poised to attack, you look just like a shinigami.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', '[To Orihime, after she had being taken from Ichigo once again] A girl like you should smile more often. Overcast skies blot out the sun, and that always brings people''s spirits down. So why not let the sun shine...For just a while longer?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'No matter what may happen... As long as you walk by my side... There shall be no enemy that can stand before us.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'Good evening, Espada. There has been an enemy attack. But first...Let us brew some tea.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', '[After Gin offers to kill some Arrancars] No thanks, for that would be boring.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'Oh? I thought I severed your body from the waist-down, but...It seems the cut was too shallow.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'In my eyes, there is no difference between wiping away one speck of dust or two.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', '"No longer the Aizen you know," hm...? I''m afraid you''ve been deluded, Abarai-kun...The ''Aizen Sousuke'' you knew never existed to begin with.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'It''s very difficult for me to step on an ant without crushing it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'Don''t use such strong words -- It makes your weakness all the more apparent.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'I had no intention of deceiving anyone. It''s just that none of you could understand...My true self.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', '[To Hitsugaya, after stabbing Hinamori] Aww...You found her. Sorry, I didn''t want you to find out this way...No. I should have chopped her into little pieces and hidden them away where you would never find them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1336, 'Soi Fon', 'I''ll show you a real assassination. No... Maybe you won''t even be able to see it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1336, 'Soi Fon', 'I thought I told you. If you see your allies losing, that''s your chance. Don''t step between them. Take the enemy down from behind. And if the enemy''s so strong, you can''t even do that, then just watch your allies get killed. That''s what it means to be Special Forces.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1336, 'Soi Fon', 'Of my five older siblings, two died on the first mission, then two more on the second. Then on the sixth mission, the last one... Died as well. I felt sad, somewhat, but more than that, I felt ashamed of their incompetence.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1336, 'Soi Fon', 'I''m inadequate in everything.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1336, 'Soi Fon', 'Such words are wasted on someone like me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1336, 'Soi Fon', 'Showing your back in a battle? You''ve become a fool Yoruichi!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1336, 'Soi Fon', 'You know the power of my zanpakuto, Suzumebachi. If someone gets hit twice in the same spot... They die!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1336, 'Soi Fon', 'The one hundred years we were apart were meant to bring me power and make you weak! Yoruichi!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1336, 'Soi Fon', 'Why didn''t you take me with you!? Yoruichi?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shunsui Kyōraku', 'Only underlings get caught up in the matter of style and lose the battle. A captain can''t afford such indulgences. Don''t try to be a good kid. Whether you own somebody or they own you. The moment you start a fight, you are wrong in either way.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shunsui Kyōraku', '[To Starrk, about Lilynette] That child with you... Can you send her somewhere else? I can''t really go all out with her there.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shunsui Kyōraku', 'Why so cold, Nanao-chan?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shunsui Kyōraku', 'Do we really have to fight, Yama-jii?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shunsui Kyōraku', 'I placed this blade of grass in my mouth thinking I''d look cool. But it must be poison ''cause ith makinth ma mouth numb.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shunsui Kyōraku', 'Cute, cute Nanao-chaaaan. Lovely, lovely Nanao -- AHHHHHHH!!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shunsui Kyōraku', 'Nanao-chan is last place!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shunsui Kyōraku', 'Flowers are disturbed, god of flowers weeps, winds of Heaven are disturbed, demon of Heaven laughs. Katen Kyōkotsu!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Komamura Sajin', 'I was glad you did not pretend to be a saint and claim to love the world despite everything. That is why I decided that I would be your true friend. I would accept your sorrow. And I would share my joy. If you strayed I would reprimand you. If you made mistakes, I would forgive you. And when you found yourself in trouble, I would be there for you. So that you who learn to hate the world, would come to love it once more.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Komamura Sajin', 'Back then. I felt a kernel of untruth in your words. You talked about "The world she loves" many times. But made not a single mention of "The world I love".', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Komamura Sajin', 'You destroyed those Menos Grandes. That''s enough for me! I have decided to fight by your side! I won''t accept no as an answer, masked ones!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Komamura Sajin', 'You are right. I have not yet introduced myself. I am Captain of the Seventh Division Komamura Sajin. And though it shames me, I am just as you say -- A meager worm of a man.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Komamura Sajin', '[to Choe Neng Poww, as the giant Arrancar charges a Cero after making a comment on Komamura''s strength] I see...Then I shall stop that yawn in its tracks. Bankai.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Komamura Sajin', 'Don''t retreat, Tetsuzaemon. No matter what. You stand firm right behind me!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Komamura Sajin', '[thinking at the grave of Tosen''s friend] O'' anonymous friend of Tousen... If you had been there...What would you have said to stop him?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Komamura Sajin', 'Let us commence, Zaraki! Your favorite game of carnage!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Komamura Sajin', '[during Tosen, Gin Ichimaru and Sosuke Aizen''s escape from Soul Society] Get down here, Tosen! Why did you become a Shingami? Was it not for your deceased friend? Was it not to carry out justice!? Where is your justice now!?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1329, 'Rukia Kuchiki', '[holds up juice box] How do you drink from this?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1329, 'Rukia Kuchiki', 'You can see me? Rather, you kicked me...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1329, 'Rukia Kuchiki', 'I see. I feel a strong pulse.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Abarai Renji', 'Have you been out on the window ledge all this time, in plain sight? What if the neighbors report a silver haired elementary student burglar?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Abarai Renji', 'I already told you...you can''t kill me with that sword anymore!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Abarai Renji', 'If you wanna talk to me, do it while I cut you to pieces. But, I''m not gonna hold back one bit! Bankai!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Abarai Renji', 'Don''t just blame yourself. You''re not tough enough to withstand everything. Split the load, to my shoulders, and to Ichigo''s. Just stack it little by little. That''s why we''ve become stronger. Believe in him, Rukia.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Abarai Renji', 'I''ve always been afraid...Always been pretending to follow you closely, always pretending to sharpen my fangs, when the truth is...I''m scared to death just treading on your shadow.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Abarai Renji', 'I shall light a fire upon the fang that falls short, so that I needn''t see that star...So that it shall not tear this throat of mine.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Abarai Renji', 'Ichigo...I know this is shameful, but I''m begging you -- Rukia...Please save Rukia!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Abarai Renji', 'The stray dog in me is dyed into my bones... All I do is howl at the moon, but I don''t have the guts to bite...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Abarai Renji', 'Howl, Zabimaru.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Abarai Renji', 'I knew it. You can''t even ask your own zanpakutō its name.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Abarai Renji', 'You''re just an overnight shinigami. You couldn''t put one scratch on us real ones.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Abarai Renji', '*to Ichigo* So you''re the human who got his powers from Rukia?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Matsumoto Rangiku', 'I''ll tattle-tale to Yachiru if you keep that up, Ikkaku!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Matsumoto Rangiku', 'I don''t know if you noticed, but you just called him "Captain."', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Matsumoto Rangiku', 'I hate talkative guys... They gross me out.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Matsumoto Rangiku', 'Growl, Haineko!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Matsumoto Rangiku', '[Rangiku steps out of the bath naked to comfort a crying Orihime] There, there! Cry, cry, you poor thing. Drown all of your sorrows in my chest!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Matsumoto Rangiku', '[to Momo on Aizen''s final letter] As a vice-captain, I think it''s a great honor to be the receiver of her captain''s final words. Read it well.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Inoue Orihime', '[thinking as Nel tells her to cheer for Ichigo] That''s right. To begin with, I came here just thinking I wanted to protect everyone. But when I heard they had come to save me, I couldn''t help but feel a little glad, just a bit in my heart. When I look at Kurosaki-kun in that mask, I think that he might not have come here to save me at all. Even though it''s wrong, they shouldn''t be going that far for me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Inoue Orihime', 'Kurosaki-kun... I''m weak, so it''s always like I turn back to look to you for help. But now I won''t turn back and I''ll go forward. The next time we meet I won''t look to you for help, Kurosaki-kun, I''ll be able to fight on my own.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Inoue Orihime', 'We don''t look any different from those shinigami. We just dress diferently.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Inoue Orihime', 'It''s just that... It''s just that not being able to fight with everyone makes me feel lonely...!! But what would make me feel worse than being lonely is getting in everyone''s way... that would make me feel worse!! If it means getting in the way of Kurosaki-kun and everyone... then I would rather be lonely, very lonely.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Inoue Orihime', 'I''m a terrible person, aren''t I? "If only Kurosaki-kun would cheer up, I''d be happy." At least, I thought that was how I felt. Then Kuchiki-san came back and cheered Kurosaki-kun up. I should have been really happy, but... but... [starts to cry] but instead I''m jealous of Kuchiki-san!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Inoue Orihime', 'If I were the rain, that binds together the heavens and the earth, whom in all eternity will never mingle, would I be able to bind two hearts together?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurotsuchi Mayuri', '[to Nemu about Uryuu. Nemu is currently attempting to restrain Uryuu so Mayruri can heal him, but she is unknowingly smothering him with her breasts] Yes, Nemu. Just smother him with those things. Worst case, he dies happy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurotsuchi Mayuri', '[to Szayel Aporro Grantz] Immaculate being... Was it? In this secular existence, perfection is an illusion, regardless of those who utter the contrary. This is the reality. Common man seeks it out, they strive to achieve it, as if it were some tangible thing... But... The fact of the matter is, perfection is a hollow shell. It is devoid of any substance. I spit on perfection. Perfection, after all, implies you''ve reached the summit. No trial and error, no ability to conceptualize. An omniscient being would have no need for such superfluous things... Am I making myself clear? For people who dabble in the sciences, such as ourselves, perfection would make us obsolete. Many magnificent things have been, and will continue to come into existence... And yet every last one of them will fall short of perfection''s finish. Our function as men of science relies on their many shortcomings. Then, and only then, can we apply the fruits of our labor. To put it simply... As soon as you began', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurotsuchi Mayuri', '[upon arriving at Szayel Aporro Grantz''s location] Arrancar, Arrancar, Arrancar... Espada! Hueco Mundo is quite the treasure trove.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurotsuchi Mayuri', 'Oh, you know what I''m talking about. That stupid line that all you Quincies keep saying up until the moment you die. By the honor of the Quincy I cannot do this, by the honor of the Quincy I won''t allow that. Quincy this, Quincy that! Every last one of you! It''s so annoying!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurotsuchi Mayuri', 'Killing you now will be as easy as strangling a baby.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurotsuchi Mayuri', 'A grenade that''s thrown should not come back.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Urahara Kisuke', '[to Chad and Orihime] Your transformation is not a disease. You were just given the key to the door in front of you. There''s no need to know the cause. No need for sorrow or sadness. What comes next is up to you. You can use your keys to open the door...or lock it tight. And if you do choose to open it... You can still decide not to pass through.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Urahara Kisuke', 'Awaken, Benihime.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Urahara Kisuke', '[Singing to Yammy] Aizen-sama will get maaaad at youuuu!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Urahara Kisuke', 'Oh, it IS a chore. Risking your life and keeping busy are all the same!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Urahara Kisuke', 'Noooo, there''s no way I, a mere handsome and sexy shopkeeper, could possibly have bankai!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Urahara Kisuke', '[To Yoruichi] It''s alright! Kurosaki-san''s potential is greater than mine!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Urahara Kisuke', '[Sees Yoruichi in cat form] Yes! It''s Yoruichi! You''ve come back! Ha ha ha!! [Picks her up] Come here you little devil, let me take a look at you! You''re my fuzzy little troublemaker, yes you are! Now who''s your daddy? Hmm?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Urahara Kisuke', 'I''ll drive you into a corner and make you remember that attack.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Urahara Kisuke', '[Urahara writes Ichigo a message in blood] Please meet at Urahara shop immediately. [After Ichigo freaked out] P.S: If you look at this message and think that it is the message of a person before his death... then you have no sense of humor.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Urahara Kisuke', 'A warrior who has lost his ability to fight is only going to be in the way.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Urahara Kisuke', 'Lately, I''ve been looking at these two guys only. As expected, I see flowers when there are women in the workplace... the atmosphere!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Tousen Kaname', '[In his Resurrección form] I can see! I can see! I can see!!! So this is the sky!! So this is blood!! So this is the world!! ...So this is what you look like. Komamura. You are uglier... than I thought.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Tousen Kaname', '[to Hisagi after stabbing him] I am afraid. Then and now, my fear has always been that I would die a shinigami like you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Tousen Kaname', '[to Komamura] Don''t make me laugh. Aizen-sama has given me something far more powerful than a bankai.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Tousen Kaname', '[to Hisagi] Open my eyes? You? Open my eyes? You never change.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Tousen Kaname', '[after Hisagi thanks him] Aren''t you clever? Is that supposed to be sarcastic?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Tousen Kaname', 'I knew it would. Someday we would cross swords and one of us will die.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Tousen Kaname', 'It must make you sick to know an underling like me is going to kill you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Tousen Kaname', 'I was trying to chop off your head from the eye up. A little scratch counts as a miss.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Tousen Kaname', 'Justice without a great cause begets nothing more than slaughter. That same slaughter in a great cause...Is Justice.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Tousen Kaname', 'I told you before, Komamura. The only paths that I see with these eyes are the ones not dyed with blood. Those paths are the paths to justice. So whichever path I choose...Is justice.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Tousen Kaname', 'If it''s not enough to believe in justice, then I will become justice. I will seek out all evil in this world and wipe them out like the clouds in the sky. I swear I will...For justice.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Tousen Kaname', '[about his deceased friend] I never overcame my shyness and told her that I actually liked clouds.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Tousen Kaname', '[to Kenpachi Zaraki, after Tosen''s senses-robbing Bankai still does not discourage the Eleventh Division Captain from fighting] I see. It''s understandable. You are a demon. You belong in the darkness. So of course you do not fear it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Tousen Kaname', 'I do not hate you. However, to protect our peaceful existence, there is no other way!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Tousen Kaname', '[to Kenpachi Zaraki] I did not say that I hate you. What I mean to say is that you are unforgivable!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shiba Kaien', 'When we die, our bodies disintegrate and become part of the reishi that make up Soul Society. And when that time comes...where does your heart go? It gets passed on to your nakama (comrades). If you pass it on to them, then your heart will always live on within them. Kuchiki, that''s why...you must never, ever, ever die alone. Got it, Kuchiki?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shiba Kaien', 'Whenever you fight from this point on, there is one thing you must never do. Which is...to die alone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shiba Kaien', 'Every time you and I interact...a bit of "heart" is born between us. Heart isn''t something inside you. But whenever you think, whenever you remember someone, that''s when heart is born. I mean, if you were the only one alive in the whole world, heart wouldn''t exist, now would it?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shiba Kaien', 'The fight to protect life and the fight to protect honor——that''s Captain Ukitake''s policy. But you know, Kuchiki...I think that in the end, those both end up being the same thing. ...Heart.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shiba Kaien', '[when Rukia asks why she is in the Gotei 13] What the hell?! That''s so obvious! To "fight" and to "protect"!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shiba Kaien', '[dying] Kuchiki, I dragged you into this...I''m sorry. You must''ve been scared. Thanks, Kuchiki. Thanks to you...I can leave my heart here.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shiba Kaien', '[possessed by a Hollow] Why do you keep calling my name so? Are you that worried about me? Are you that much in love with me, little girl? If you love me so much...I''ll eat you first!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shiba Kaien', 'Uncoil the seas and heavens, Nejibana!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shiba Kaien', 'But don''t forget... as long as you''re in my division, I''m on your side until death and beyond.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ukitake Jyuushirou', 'The Commander-General''s rather violent today, wouldn''t you say?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ukitake Jyuushirou', 'If you were in this situation, what would you have done? You would run after Byakuya...And then kick him in the butt, right? No matter how one captain complains, the Central Government won''t change their decision for one person. But if it was you, you would still run around appealing to save Kuchiki...No. You would probably do something completely different. You always chose the path that lead to the most danger. Am I right...Kaien?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ukitake Jyuushirou', 'My, my. So dangerous.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ukitake Jyuushirou', 'If you save Kaien, then what becomes of his pride? If you go to his aid now, his life will be saved. But... at the same time, it would end up killing his pride for all eternity.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ukitake Jyuushirou', 'All waves, rise now and become my shield, lightning, strike now and become my blade! Sōgyo no Kotowari!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kira Izuru', 'You may be able to save us. If you stay and protect us. But what''s good is that everyone else dies! Please go!! Captain Komamura!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kira Izuru', 'It increases the weight of whatever it hits, until my opponent can no longer bear the weight and falls to the ground. And then they bow their head as if in apology. That''s why it''s called "Wabisuke".', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kira Izuru', 'War is not heroic. War is not exhilarating. War is full of despair. It''s dark. It''s dreadful. It''s a thing of sorrow and gloom.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kira Izuru', 'Farewell, warrior of the sky. I pray... you don''t forgive me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kira Izuru', 'Raise your head, Wabisuke.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Madarame Ikkaku', '[in reference to Mizuho Asano, Keigo''s sister] I owe this crazy woman.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Madarame Ikkaku', 'You can''t carry me AND dodge at the same time, Tetsuzaemon!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Madarame Ikkaku', 'Awww maaan, and I really didn''t feel like using it this early either. Better watch closely, and make sure you don''t tell a soul! Bankai!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Madarame Ikkaku', 'Well, you sure have weird ways of doing things. The one who taught me how to give your name out to he whom you are about to kill also said... that it was always the last lesson he taught his students. That way, if you do end a person''s life... at the very least, they will know the name of the one who slashed their mortal coil. I''m of the 11th Division, 3rd seat, Madarame Ikkaku! You''re right, there''s no reason for me to hear your name, because the most important thing is that you know mine. After all, it is the name of the man... who will send you to your death!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Madarame Ikkaku', 'I got no intentions of becoming a captain. Becoming a captain would mean that I can''t fight under Captain Zaraki. If your wish is to surpass Kuchiki Byakuya... then I just have one wish: to fight and die under that man''s command. That''s all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Isshin', 'Live well, Ichigo. Live well, age well, go bald well, and die after me. And... if you can, die smiling.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Isshin', 'I didn''t hate it as much as I said. That hollow, that is. If there''s anything that I''ve truly hated for 20 years without thinking twice... it''d have to be the fact that I failed to save Masaki on that night.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Isshin', 'It''s one of the basics... So I will teach you. A shinigami at the rank of Captain can control the size of his zanpakuto got it? Otherwise everyone''d carry around ginormous swords... just like you. Remember this well. You can''t fathom the power of your rival simply from the size of his zanpakuto. You shouldn''t give lectures about Shinigami until you understand that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Isshin', '[to Yuzu] Ah! It''s okay, Yuzu, don''t cry! Daddy will show you something really hilarious!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Isshin', '[to Karin] Do as your heart desires! Jump into your father''s bosom!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Isshin', 'It''s not anyone''s fault that Masaki died. It''s just that... the woman I fell in love with... was a woman who could die protecting her son. And don''t forget. You are the guy... the woman I loved gave her life to protect.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Isshin', 'GOOD MOOOORNING ICHIGOOOOOO!!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'We can''t waste time worrying about the what-if''s. Rukia''s execution date has been changed to noon tomorrow. So what? If the deadline has been changed to tomorrow... I''ll just have to finish today!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'The moment I came out of that hole was the moment your luck ran out!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'I see. So basically, you''re a shinigami? And you came all the way from some place called Soul Society to vanquish evil spirits? Which means that monster earlier was one of those evil spirits? And it attacked that little girl? Okay, I belie- NO WAY I''LL BELIEVE THAT, DUMBASS!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'Dammit, is that how you greet your son who went out of his way to help a ghost on the way home?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Grimmjow Jeagerjaques', '[about his Hollow group prior to them becoming Arancar as he eats pieces of them] You sicken me. You''re all just a bunch of bloody cowards. Alright, I''ll eat all of you. You''ll see how it feels on the next level, as a part of my own flesh. I am... I am the king!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Grimmjow Jeagerjaques', '[To Orihime] I''ve repaid my debt to you. Now, you''re gonna accompany me on a little errand.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Grimmjow Jeagerjaques', '[to Ichigo] I don''t care if you''re a human, a Soul Reaper or even a Hollow! I''ll crush anybody who looks down on me! And you, Kurosaki, will be the first to go!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Grimmjow Jeagerjaques', '[to Ichigo] You''re a Soul Reaper and I''m a Hollow. Whichever side loses will be massacred! It''s been that way for over a thousand years! Who needs any more reason than that?! Now bring it! The last man standing gets to go home alive! That''s all there is to it!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Grimmjow Jeagerjaques', '[about Ulquiorra Cifer, after he takes out Ichigo] I''ll teach him what happens when you steal someone else''s prey.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Grimmjow Jeagerjaques', '[to Ichigo] Don''t forget my name, Soul Reaper, and you better pray that you never hear it again! Grimmjow Jaegerjaquez...because the next time you hear my name, you''ll be a dead man...I promise.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ichimaru Gin', '[as a child, to Rangiku Matsumoto] I''ve decided. I''m going to become a Shinigami. Become a Shinigami and change things. So that they''ll end...without Rangiku having to cry.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ichimaru Gin', 'Emotions? Nope, I''ve got nothin'' like that. I told you when we first met, didn''t I? I''m a snake. With cold skin, no emotions, that slithers around searching for prey with its tongue, swallowing down whatever looks tasty.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ichimaru Gin', '[Talking about Hueco Mundo] There isn''t even water! Huh? Then how''d we have tea earlier?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ichimaru Gin', '[Referring to Tosen] He''s such a boy scout, wouldn''t you agree?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ichimaru Gin', 'Oops. They found us.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ichimaru Gin', '[To Rukia as she is taken to Sokyoku Hill] Bye Bye, Rukia chan! See ''ya at the execution grounds.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ichimaru Gin', 'If you pull your sword in a place like this, I''ll just have to stop you, won''t I?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ichimaru Gin', 'Sorry, Aizen-sama. I got caught.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ichimaru Gin', 'A gatekeeper ain''t supposed to open gates.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'No matter how strong a defense, a stronger offense will always shatter it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', '"Control"... you say? When you stand before me... that word holds no meaning. Bankai. Senbonzakura Kageyoshi.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'Exactly when did I say that I do this because I am a shinigami? My killing you is no other reason than the fact that you... Pointed your blade [view shifts to Rukia] at my pride.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'The arrogant one is you, Espada. But rest at ease. The reason for your loss is not due to that arrogance. It is simply due to a difference in power.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'You and I...our levels are as distant as the earth from the heavens. ...Must I spell it out for you? I have discarded my left arm, discarded my left leg, and yet even then I have not nearly lowered myself to your level.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'It is a thousand years too early... for you to become worthy enough to die by my Bankai.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'Well done. That time, your fang definitely touched me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'Be proud as someone who, after being struck by this power, is still able to retain the shape of a body.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'Your blade will never be able to touch me. Ever.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'Put away your sword and you shall live...unless you''re still dreaming about defeating me. Did you forget, or did it just never occur to you...that I have Bankai as well?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'The curtain that falls at the end...shall be pulled down by the blade of my sword.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'That''s not possible. With your ability, you couldn''t even make one of my knees touch the ground.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'The Kuchiki clan is one of the four noble houses. We must set the standard for all shinigami. If we do not abide by the code...then who will uphold it?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'No choice, then. Before you become intoxicated by your own power, I shall show you a decisive power gap that you could not overcome in a millennium of struggle.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'Are you telling me to exploit an opening for the likes of you? Do not speak out of your league, boy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'Disappear. My sword does not exist to crush insects like you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'Scatter, Senbonzakura.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'You''re slow, even when you''re falling.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1770, 'Kagura', 'Gin-chan told me to pay people back double for revenge!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Shinpachi, just remember this... We aren''t friends with justice or even your sister. We''re YOUR friends.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Sarutobi Ayame', 'Gin-san, aren''t you gonna make fun of me? Are you just gonna ignore me?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Sarutobi Ayame', 'I watch over Gin-san to protect him. Just like a fairy, like Tinkerbell!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', '*about Katsura, who apparently got his head hit very hard* Forget his name, this guy''s questioning his own existence!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Hijikata Toushirou', '*while eating Super Spicy Senbei* It''s spicy... It''s spicy. Damn it, why am I... It''s so spicy I have tears in my eyes.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Hijikata Toushirou', 'I just...    ...want to make the woman I love happy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Isao Kondō', '*to Okita* I don''t care about that gap you created on your own. I''ll jump across it as many times as it takes, and punch some sense into you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Isao Kondō', 'If someone went the wrong way, the other two would beat him up until he got back on track. That''s how it always been. That''s why we''ll always stay on the right path!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Okita Sougo', '*talking about Shinsengumi* Every time I''m with all of you, there''s always a gap. I''m different from all of you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Hijikata Toushirou', 'Inside your mouth, it''s rat-ta-ta-ta-ta-ta-ta, wonderful.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Okita Sougo', 'Hijikata-san. I forgot my flute at the headquarters, so I''m gonna go back and get it real quick.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'What is it, you? Bang bang banging on people''s heads like that. Are you hoping to become a tambourine player? If you don''t like Shin-chan, then how about Sen-chan from secret operation?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'The best way to live a full life is to be a child, no matter your age.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1770, 'Kagura', 'I''m not eating early. In my country, we always ate hot dogs during class.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Do you really intend to lose even more of your friends for something like that? I''ll pass on that. As long as I''m alive, I''ll live by my own rules. I''ll live as I see fit and protect that which I hold dear.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Katsura, just stop this. No matter how elegant you think dying is, your death won''t appease your conscience and won''t change anything.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Shut up you! What''s with that TV drama attitude?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Kotarō Katsura', 'We could drive them off the entire earth if we had your strength, Gintoki!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'No matter how gifted you are... You, alone, cannot change the world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1981, 'L Lawliet', 'If I sit like a normal person my investigative abilities are only working at 50% efficiency.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(19, 1983, 'Light Yagami', 'I am Justice! I protect the innocent and those who fear evil. I''m the one that will become the god of a new world that every one desires!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'Unless I grip the sword, I cannot protect you. While gripping the sword, I cannot embrace you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'Sebastian, you know what to do.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Elizabeth Middleford', 'Ciel, how are you?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Kotarō Katsura', 'Gintoki, will you take up your sword once again to cleanse this rotting nation? Lend me the strength of the fearsome white demon once again. [flashback to when they were fighting together] Is this it? Rather than falling into enemy hands, we should kill ourselves and die as warriors.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1770, 'Kagura', 'I''m on TV! I gotta call my folks!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Hijikata Toushirou', '*to Okita, who tells him that he should take his job more seriously* Shall I put you to sleep, ingrate?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Okita Sougo', 'You mean that we failed again to prevent a bombing? What are you doing, Hijikata-san? You should take this job more seriously.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'It might be dog food. Take it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', '*talking about a nosebleed* And why would a girl your age pick hard enough to get a nosebleed?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'We''ve got nothing left at home but salt and sugar.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Shimura Shinpachi', '[Shinpachi and Kagura are stuck in a trashcan, and have been pushed onto the train tracks. Shinpachi sees a train coming]This timing''s just like some manga!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1770, 'Kagura', 'I don''t like men with glasses.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Shimura Shinpachi', 'Who the hell are they? Pedophile yakuza?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'In this country, we don''t call someone who can stop a scooter with her bare hands a girl. We call her a mountain gorilla.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', '[after hitting Kagura with his motor scooter, Gintoki looks inside a vending machine slot] D-don''t worry. A-all we have to do is find a t-t-time machine.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Oh crap! Today is Jump release day! I forgot it comes out on Saturday this week! We have to go back!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Shut it! Do you know the pain of having a permanent perm?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'A samurai doesn''t need a reason to do what''s right. If you want to protect her, you must draw your sword.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Shimura Shinpachi', 'Damn that sister of mine! She''s always talking about our father, but what did that baldy ever do for us?! He just played Othello with us from time to time!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Leave it at that. Even though she was raised by gorillas, she''s still a woman.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', '*to Shinpachi* Was your sister raised by gorillas?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', '*after Shinpachi caught up to him, while running from the police* What a nice boy you are. Have you come to return my wooden sword? That''s all right. It was just a souvenir I bought on a school trip.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Blah, blah, blah, blah… quit your blabbering. Look at this. [holds up an empty glass] Thanks to you assholes, my chocolate parfait [hits one of the amanto with his bokuto] fell to the ground!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Ah, I wish I could have a bankai like that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Isao Kondō', 'Hey, if you take a step over that line, your territorial law won''t mean shit!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'You can''t just run away, especially from the things you want to forget!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Don''t go thinking you''re my rival, you circus freak!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', '[crashing through the gate on his motor scooter] Thanks for the support! Here come the real heros!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'That''s like what an evil organization in some anime would do.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'We''re not going to sneak in, we''re gonna bust in. To bust in means to go in from the front, guns blazing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Isao Kondō', 'I''ve told you before, he''s not one to trust, Otae-san. No trustworthy man has eyes that look like a dead fish''s eyes.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1770, 'Kagura', '*talking about Gintoki* It''s the same as always. He doesn''t pursue those who leave, and ignores those who come.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Shimura Shinpachi', '[Shinpachi is tied up, hanging from a tree, and the rope is held by the client] What kind of training is this? What kind of potential does he have?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', '*after Katsura asks him about what he is doing* Well, I suppose I''m doing something odd, like jogging or taking a walk or something like that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', '[after the client asks Shinpachi, Kagura and Ayame to get him stronger] Well, whatever. At any rate, raise his hit points another hundred or so.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Hey, what''s that natto for, anyway? If you intend to seduce me with it, you''re way off base, you know.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'The earth''s rowdier than a group of five high school guys living under the same roof.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'What are you, some tantrum throwing brat who forgot to buy his Jump? Having no money is like having a sinus infection. You just have to ignore it and not pick at it, and it''ll go away.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Yeah, I know. It''s not good to be reading Jump at my age.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, NULL, 'Okita Sougo', 'Goodbye, vice captain. Why don''t you suck on some mayonnaise in the afterlife? [he shoots, blowing up the whole wall]', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'What are you talking about? We LET you corner us.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(18, 1768, 'Gintoki Sakata', 'Oi, oi, why are you letting them chase you, idiot?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'You will never be able to love anybody else until you love your self...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2414, 'Tsubaki Nakatsukasa', 'Our souls, together till the end!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2414, 'Tsubaki Nakatsukasa', 'I''ll admit, Black Star makes some dumb calls from time to time, but the important thing is I''m here to back him up no matter how big a fool he is. If we''re fools, we''re fools together, that''s the kind of team we are.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2414, 'Tsubaki Nakatsukasa', 'You guys are a team, you have to work together if you want to do anything! One person can''t make a decision without the other, you decide together and you fight together!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2414, 'Tsubaki Nakatsukasa', 'I have a friend who has helped me realize something. He''s helped me see that a Camellia does have a fragrance!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2414, 'Tsubaki Nakatsukasa', 'When I fall it will be silent and tragic.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2414, 'Tsubaki Nakatsukasa', 'The Camellia Blossom also know as Tsubaki, is a flower without fragrance. It proclaims nothing, blooming in silence. When the blossomed pettles scatter, it''s quietly tragic. I am Tsubaki. A silent flower without fragrance.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2414, 'Tsubaki Nakatsukasa', 'Silence means approaching quietly!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2414, 'Tsubaki Nakatsukasa', 'Excuse me... I''m not a microphone! I''m a chain scythe.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'As long as I don''t admit defeat, then it''ll never be a loss!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'If it''s fear that you speak of, then I''ll stand and face it. I''ll never give up. The only time I lose is when I die!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'I''ll never show you my tears. These are the tears of those who died with regrets. If there''s a way to take away these regrets, I''ll make sure I''ll find it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'It''s Me with a capital M! I''m the only one big enough to capitalize Me!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'London bridge is falling down dude!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'Who cares about snow? Snow can''t touch me, I could be naked out here and it wouldn''t bother me at all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'I''m not going to let myself get beaten by a jar!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'I''m Black Star. I''m on a whole different level than you. I''m a big man! I beat death! Who else can say that?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'My soul wave length just got taken away. I''m gonna miss it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'What''s the point of worrying about the past? A real star keeps moving forward.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'Hey, Tsubaki, come out of there already. You haven''t lost to him, have you? You can put on a better show than that, come back out on stage. Encore, encore. Tsubaki encore, give us an encore!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'Alright then! Come here! Come over here, Black Star''s giving you a big hug!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'I''m just a dude who''s way ahead of his time you know? Does that mean I was born too early because time can''t keep up with me?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'You can lean on me, Tsubaki.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'The tattoo is a symbol of my family, the Star Clan. They were a clan of assassins. Everybody knew they would do anything for money. After a while killing people wasn''t enough, they were hungry for even more power so they began hunting human souls. But now it''s just me, I''m the last member of the Star Clan. 13 years ago their souls were taken by Lord Death and the Meisters from the Academy. At the time I was still a baby, so they didn''t take my soul. That''s when the school took me in. That''s it. The end.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'Stars. Don''t. Clean.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'Soul! Soul! Are you okay?! You are going to be alright - Black Star is here for you now!! Open your eyes! One look at my big handsome face and you''ll be cured for sure!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'You wont be laughing once you taste our power of friendship!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'It could be real difficult to hide when you''re as big a star as I am.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'Finishing Strike! Black Star Big Wave!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'You can look high or low but you wont find a bigger guy than me!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'Compared to a man as big as me you realize how small you are, don''t you? I understand how you feel. Even I can be frightened by my own greatness. So I find it difficult to stand in front of mirrors.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'My name is Black Star. I''ll surpass the power of the gods.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'Dying now, my breath will be erased, okay?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'Sometimes I''m such a big star that I can''t handle it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'I am the great assassin Black Star! And I''ve come here to assassinate you all!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'Assassins Rule Number Three - Speed: Take out the target before the target notices your presence.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'Assassins Rule Number Two - Transpositional Thinking: Analyze the target in order to predict his thoughts and movements.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'Assassins Rule Number One - Silence: Dissolve in the darkness and erase your breath. Wait for an opening to attack your target.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Black Star', 'YAAAAAAHHHHHHHOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'You''re stubborn and reckless, all you like to do for fun is read, so you''re boring, and you have fat ankles.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'Anybody want to take the sexy kitty home? She''s free.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'If you forget your fear you become reckless.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'As far as I know music isn''t picky about when it gets played.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'What is this place? Where am I? Wherever it is, it''s completely dark. I can''t even see my own body. It hurts... Which way is up? Which way is down? Where am I supposed to go? Someone help me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'I am your weapon partner Maka! That means I''m always prepared to die for my Meister!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'You know what they say! When in Rome eat lots of pasta!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'I''m hungry! can we just get his damn zombie soul already?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'Come out! Nap times over zombie!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'I hope it''s a cool morning. That''s how cool days always start out. And a cool guy like me deserves the coolest morning possible.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'Souls are so yummy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'In the end the shape and form don''t matter at all, it''s only the soul that matters right? Nothing else.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'After all cool men don''t cheat on their partners, do they?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'Damn that witch. How am I supposed to be cool when she is all hot and naked like that huh?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'It''s okay, cool guys see naked women all the time, I''m totally used to it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'Your soul is mine!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'Naked lady!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 'Soul Evans', 'What are you smoking? Don''t you see how cool I am? You think I''m going to settle for a flat chested girl like her?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2413, 'Maka Albarn', 'We might be scared but that''s what makes us stronger!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2413, 'Maka Albarn', 'Watch it, or I''ll take your soul!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2413, 'Maka Albarn', 'What could that creep possibly be thinking sending sexy underwear to his own daughter.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2413, 'Maka Albarn', 'Papa was only 18 years old when I was born. He used to read a lot of books to me back then.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2413, 'Maka Albarn', 'It doesn''t hurt! It''s not hot! I''m not scared! I will not be beaten!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2413, 'Maka Albarn', 'I refuse to let my fear control me anymore.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2413, 'Maka Albarn', 'We have to find a way to face this scar.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2413, 'Maka Albarn', 'I was wondering. Do souls taste good? You seem to like ''em.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2413, 'Maka Albarn', 'Stop looking at my soul you creep!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2413, 'Maka Albarn', 'The legendary super-skill of the Scythe-Meister! Witch Hunter!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2413, 'Maka Albarn', 'People need fear to survive. We experience it so we can grow stronger.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2413, 'Maka Albarn', 'You men. All of you, you''re horrible. Cheating on every woman. But you, you I actually decided to trust. I put my faith in you. I can''t believe this. I wish that all of you would just die!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2413, 'Maka Albarn', '42-42-564 whenever you wanna knock on deaths door.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2413, 'Maka Albarn', 'A sound soul dwells within a sound mind and a sound body.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25, 2413, 'Maka Albarn', 'MAKA CHOP!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Wrong, holy man. All we want is to get our bodies normal again. See, we don''t lie about what''s possible. We didn''t start a cult.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Sun, it''s just a mass of hydrogen... Get too close to it and all you do is burn.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1175, 'Riza Hawkeye', '*referring to Armstrong taking off his shirt* Did he have to strip?..', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1171, 'Scar', 'Foolish alchemists who have turned their backs on the ways of God...shall all be punished.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, NULL, 'Solf J. Kimblee', 'I think you''ve got me all wrong. My motives aren''t so sophisticated as "revenge" or "honor" or any of that... The reason I killed all of those men... was because I could. It''s that simple.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1185, 'King Bradley', 'You clearly have nerves of steel. But, I''d say you still have much to learn about the world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Save your breath. The laws of alchemy don''t justify murder!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Whoever invented stew is brilliant! It has milk in it and it still tastes good.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1173, 'Roy Mustang', 'Hughes again? Put him through. It''s me. I won''t listen if you''re going to be bragging about your daughter. *...* Hughes? Hughes... Hey! Hughes! Hughes!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'You''re lucky Al. Since your body''s huge.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', '*referring to Winry* I didn''t know she could be so cute.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1171, 'Scar', 'For one that turns against God to come in person to receive judgement... Today is a good day!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1171, 'Scar', 'I am an instrument of divine judgment!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1171, 'Scar', 'No matter what, if you intend to interfere, I will eliminate you too.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1175, 'Riza Hawkeye', 'If there is such a thing as the work of the devil, then there''s no doubt it''s what happened in this incident.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Hey, mutt! I need exercise, so I''ll play with you!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1173, 'Roy Mustang', '*to Edward* There''s something disturbing about having to be in your debt...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Don''t give alcohol to minors!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'It was just a rebound! Don''t make a big deal over one or two arms!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'If there''s no door, then I''ll make one!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Come down here and face me, you third-rate fraud. I''ll show you there''s no comparison between us!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'It''s like that myth about the hero... He made wings out of wax so he could fly... but when he got too close to the sun... to God... the wax melted and he crashed to the ground...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, NULL, 'Rose Tomas', 'What pride... are you saying that you are God''s equal?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'AHA-HA-HA! Alchemists are scientists. We don''t believe in unprovable concepts like "God". *Rose looks angry* We strive to uncover the principles of creation in the matter of the world, to pursue truth... *gazes at Leto statue* it''s ironic that we scientists... who don''t believe in God... are in a sense the closest things to him.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1173, 'Roy Mustang', 'Ed believes he saved that town, it''s one of the first successes he''s had. I''ll let him keep thinking that for a while. He''ll learn the truth soon enough: we always do.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'DON''T CALL ME SMALL! I''LL BREAK DOWN YOUR FEET AND STICK THEM ON YOUR HEAD!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1173, 'Roy Mustang', 'Of course! Dogs embody loyalty, they follow their master''s commands above all else! Be a jerk to them and they don''t complain, and they never once beg for a paycheck! Trust me Fuery, they''re the great servants of man! *singing* Loyal canine how we salute thee! *laughs maniacally*', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Yeah, I get it. You couldn''t see me since I''m so short, you couldn''t distinguish me from all the grains of sand. VERY FUNNY!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Even with your stones, I''m on a whole other level!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'You know, it''s funny. Every crook I meet wants to tell me how much I''m just like them. But there''s a big difference between you and me and the burdens we bear.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'WHO ARE YOU CALLING SO SMALL YOU WANNA CRUSH LIKE AN ANT?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Come on now. Is that anyway to talk to your new boss, landlord, and all-around overseer?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'Alphonse Elric', 'I don''t know if we chose the right path, brother. But I do know this: I don''t want to be in this suit anymore. I want to feel things again. It''s strange. We''ve been right beside each other all this time. But I can''t remember what your skin feels like, or how you smell.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'CHILDBIRTH''S NOT ALCHEMY, YOU DOPE!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'Alphonse Elric', 'Those people had us dancing right in the palms of their hands, didn''t they? I guess it doesn''t matter what we do. We''ll never be the ones in control.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1173, 'Roy Mustang', 'You can call me Roy Mustang, or just Lieutenant Colonel. Hell, you can call me the Flame Alchemist. Whatever you do, remember the pain.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Attention, gun-toting extremists! Can you hear me all right, or did you blow your ears out playing target practice?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'WHO ARE YOU CALLING A RUNT SO TINY HE COULD ONLY BE SEEN WITH A MAGNIFYING GLASS, YOU JERK!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1175, 'Riza Hawkeye', '*on the phone* I''m sorry to interrupt you, Major, but let me offer a bit of feminine advice. BABIES AREN''T BORN AFTER JUST FIVE MONTHS!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Nobody calls me a pipsqueak and gets away with it! Not even a little girl!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', '*referring to Alphonse* This pain''s nothing...compared to what he''s given up...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'Alphonse Elric', 'Dad left... A long time ago, when brother and I were still boys. Mom stared off into the distance a lot. But she carried on as if nothing were wrong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1169, 'Winry Rockbell', 'What do I have to live for now that I know Cain won''t come back? You tell me that, Ed!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'WHO ARE YOU CALLING A MOUSY LITTLE PIPSQUEAK?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Told you, Rose. Get too close to the sun, and you''ll burn.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Don''t look away, Rose! You need to see what happens when you try to bring a human to life, when you cross into God''s territory or whatever the hell it is! Is this what you want?! Look!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'By the way, I don''t get my skills from a pocketwatch.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'You combined animals, the most depraved kind of alchemy there is.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'Alphonse Elric', 'It''s true, I don''t have a body, but I''m here. This is my punishment for setting foot on holy ground where mortals are forbidden. We made a mistake, Rose, and we''re paying for it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', '*grabs two citizens and swings them around in a circle* Shorty?! Could a shorty do this?! What else you want to call me: a half-pint bean-sprout midget?! I''m still growing you backwater desert idiots!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', '*spits out his juice* I don''t think so, pops! Do I look like a clown to you?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'Alphonse Elric', 'I sunk again. *after sinking in the desert*', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'I hate deserts. It''s nothing but sand. *collapses* If there was some grass, I could turn it into bread. I''m starving! Huh? Hey! Al, where''d you go? Al? Hey!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Alchemy: The science of understanding the structure of matter, breaking it down, then reconstructing it as something else. It can even make gold from lead. But alchemy is a science, so it must follow the natural laws: To create, something of equal value must be lost. This is the principle of Equivalent Exchange. But on that night, I learned the value of some things can''t be measured on a simple scale. My brother and I knew the laws of science, of Equivalent Exchange, that gain required sacrifice, that something had to be taken from us. But we thought there was nothing more we could lose. We were wrong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'Alphonse Elric', 'The Philosopher''s Stone: those who possess it, no longer bound by the laws of equivalent exchange in alchemy, can gain without sacrifice...create without equal exchange. We searched for it... and we found it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, NULL, 'Yui', 'Even death can''t cure idiocy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2666, 'Hideki Hinata', 'She''s an idiot, but she''s useful.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2664, 'Yuri Nakamura', 'That''s right. Our weakness is that we''re utterly stupid.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2666, 'Hideki Hinata', 'Glad you''re okay *wink* I kinda like you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2672, 'TK', 'Hurry up! You can make it! Oh, run to her and hug her tight!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2672, 'TK', 'I kiss you!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2681, 'Ayato Naoi', 'Are you talking to me, scum? I''m God.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2664, 'Yuri Nakamura', 'Are you saying I can be god?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2664, 'Yuri Nakamura', 'I said she''s not an Angel. She''s a human, just like us. Didn''t you notice?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2666, 'Hideki Hinata', 'Hey, why does this situation look like something at the end of a shonen manga?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, NULL, 'Yui', 'Care about me!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, NULL, 'Yui', 'Um, if we encounter the Angel here, I''m going to pee buckets on the spot!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2664, 'Yuri Nakamura', 'Just give up already. Or do you want my other knife to slice your throat?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2663, 'Kanade Tachibana', 'Messing around at night together... This calls for punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, NULL, 'Yui', 'For all our sake I will sing and pee my heart out in the name of spirit!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2674, 'Ooyama', 'You got away with just physical damage, but I''m going to take CRITICAL MENTAL DAMAGE!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2666, 'Hideki Hinata', 'Wow, he did it. He''s gonna fl- *boosts up to the ceiling and smashes his head*', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2672, 'TK', 'I''ll be back.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2666, 'Hideki Hinata', 'Don''t think that the me tomorrow will be the same as the me today. You''d better be careful.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2665, 'Yuzuru Otonashi', 'What is the resulting amperage when applying 3.0V to a conductor with 20ohm resistance?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2672, 'TK', 'Knockin'' on Heaven''s Door.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2672, 'TK', 'Scrambled it trouble down.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2672, 'TK', 'He can''t dance in my world right now. Don''t let me cry!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2672, 'TK', 'Hey, yo, check this out! It''s a moonwalk, it''s a moonwalk! Head spin!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2672, 'TK', 'Ouch! Are you serious?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2672, 'TK', 'Just wild heaven.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 2672, 'TK', 'Come on let''s dance... aw yeah don''t be afraid.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Zaraki Kenpachi', '*to Yammy after recieving his punch*  I barely feel a thing. Now I''m sure you think I''m a big fly or something. But if you are going to punch, you better put in some effort you great big worm.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Zaraki Kenpachi', 'Never admit defeat and ask for a quick death! Die first, then admit defeat! If you are defeated but didn''t die, it just means you were lucky! At those times, think only about survival! Survive and think only about killing the one who failed to kill you!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Zaraki Kenpachi', 'You idiot! There''s always shadows wherever there''s light!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Zaraki Kenpachi', 'Oh, shut up. I was just thinkin''. With four arms, you''re just gonna keep on blockin'' my blade. That''s no fun at all. So, while I was layin'' on the ground, I was thinkin'' about how to stop you blockin'' all my attacks. But, you know...I couldn''t think up a single good idea lying down there. So I figure...I''ll just have to take out those arms, one by one.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Zaraki Kenpachi', 'Finished? It''ll never be finished. A battle isn''t like some stupid argument. As long as someone''s still breathing, the fight isn''t over.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Zaraki Kenpachi', 'Playing comes first, you can work later!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2301, 'Nia Teppelin', 'I can''t know about somebody who isn''t here. But, you shouldn''t depend on people who aren''t here.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2301, 'Nia Teppelin', 'Do you want to die? If you''re scared, it''s okay to run.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2296, 'Kamina', '*to Yoko* If your fat ass slows us down, I''ll leave you behind, Undergrounder.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2300, 'Viral', 'I have no reason to listen to anything a human says!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2300, 'Viral', '*to Kamina* However, surprise attacks need more than surprise. It won''t work again.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2300, 'Viral', '*to Kamina* Boasting like that is just asking for death.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2300, 'Viral', 'I''ll tell you two things: First, any human on the surface will be completely annihilated by our Human Eradication Army. Second, that is my dinner - give it back!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2296, 'Kamina', 'This-Is-The-Real-Spirit-Of-Men'' Cannonball Attack!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2296, 'Kamina', 'How-Dare-You-Do-That-To-My-Precious-Underling'' Punch!!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2296, 'Kamina', 'Well, Well, Well, Well... Listen up, big guys! I''ll only say this once... Undefeatable, untouchable, with no regrets! Never looking back, never wavering! You can''t win against this man''s will! Gurren Brigade''s Kamina-sama will be your opponent! Believe it!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2297, 'Simon', 'If you become a wall that stands in my way... I''ll tear open a hole and break through you every time! That''s... MY DRILL!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2297, 'Simon', 'We''ll break through the heavens and dimensions!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2300, 'Viral', 'Our burning blood will cut through fate!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2300, 'Viral', 'Now then... I''ve come to reclaim my helm! That''s what I wanted to say, but before that... put on some damn clothes!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2297, 'Simon', '*to Nia* I don''t fully understand, but it doesn''t matter why you were born, or if you''re a princess. The Nia right here is you. So it''s okay if you just be yourself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2296, 'Kamina', 'Who-The-Hell-Do-You-Think-I-Am kick!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2296, 'Kamina', 'My-Wife-Is-The-Best-In-The-Universe throw!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, NULL, 'Yoko Littner', 'I keep telling you I''m a girl!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2297, 'Simon', 'If there''s no road, we''ll forge it with our own hands!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2297, 'Simon', 'If there''s a wall in our way, we''ll destroy it!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2297, 'Simon', 'Bro is dead. He''s no longer here. However, on my back, within my heart, he continues to live on!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2296, 'Kamina', 'When I feel weak, or when I lack self-confidence, I remember Simon''s back as he dug tirelessly. I wanted to become a man who''s back would never break. That''s what I thought.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2296, 'Kamina', 'When we were trapped in that hole...there was nothing I could do. But Simon just kept on digging. Believing in my show of courage. In the end, he was the one who saved me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2296, 'Kamina', 'I didn''t have any confidence. I thought I was living the wrong way. Impatiently. Why couldn''t I go where my father could? Truthfully, I wasn''t strong enough.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, NULL, 'Yoko Littner', 'Kamina told me before. "He''s the one that always saves me.", "He''s the one that doesn''t give up, even at the end.".', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2296, 'Kamina', 'Listen up, Simon. Don''t forget. Believe in yourself. Not in you who believes in me. Not in me who believes in you. Believe in yourself!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(22, 2296, 'Kamina', 'I can''t even rest in peace, can I..?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17, 1741, 'Hikaru Hitachiin', 'Good God, is she in the running for ''brattiest princess ever''? Must''ve been spoiled rotten when she was growing up', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1329, 'Rukia Kuchiki', 'People are able to hold onto hope, since death is that which cannot be seen.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'You''re such a child. You talk of nothing but pipe dreams... there are times when people must make painful choices.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'Alphonse Elric', 'Humankind cannot gain anything without first giving something in return. To obtain, something of equal value must be lost. That is alchemy''s first law of equivalent exchange. In those days, we really believed that to be the world''s one and only truth.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Claude Faustus', 'If he made a ripple in the long, long lazy life of a demon, then Alois Trancy''s soul also was worth cracking open, per...haps.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Claude Faustus', 'Passion to insincerity, lies to reality, a stray dog into an Earl. That is...''s but...ler.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Claude Faustus', 'Ciel Phantomhive, I will pierce your soft skin with my needle... and slowly suck out your sensual soul.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Claude Faustus', '*to Sebastian* Say, have your demonic senses weakened after devoting too much to that human''s soul?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Claude Faustus', 'Passion to calm, hesitation to resolve, love to gravestones. That is the Trancy butler.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Claude Faustus', 'I simply have a hell of a desire to devour you, Master.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Claude Faustus', 'For a mere butler, to go that far... Don''t worry, Young Master. The menial soul that can give love to one is only a butler.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Claude Faustus', '*teasing Sebastian* A demon and a butler... I am one too.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Claude Faustus', 'Master.. I will always stay by your side. Day and night, sugar and salt, living and dead, impure and pure.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Claude Faustus', '*to Sebastian* To touch something that is meant to transport food with one''s shoes is a disgrace for a butler!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Claude Faustus', '*to Alois* I am your loyal servant. Even if you do not try to attract my attention, I want to greedily devour you to the very end.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Claude Faustus', 'Yes, Your Highness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Alois Trancy', 'Everyone, everything is happy!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Alois Trancy', '*to Ciel* Oh, so we were not going to the restroom together?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Alois Trancy', '*to Luka* They should all die! All of them! Everything, annihilated!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Alois Trancy', 'My heart was entwined in a spider web. You''ll always be my Highness. I wanted your love.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Alois Trancy', 'How does my blood smell? Do you want to devour me now?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Alois Trancy', '*to Claude* Then show me those eyes. Not the eyes of those villagers who looked as if they''d seen a pile of vomit. Not the old man''s greedy, inflamed eyes. That day, those eyes. Those eyes that longed only for me, Claude.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Alois Trancy', '*to Claude* You are...you yourself are...My Highness!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Alois Trancy', 'Hannah, don''t you think a sunny-side-up egg is pitiable? Its shell is broken and it''s forced to publicly show an indecorous appearance. Then it becomes an eyeball, internal organs, or a plume. And I rob it of any and all possibilities.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Alois Trancy', 'How pitiable.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2505, 'Lau', 'In this world, Earl, there''re people who can''t survive because of the cruelty of reality. I sell those people dreams.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2505, 'Lau', 'The spider''s web has already been woven. The more you struggle, the harder it becomes to escape from those bonds. Whatever the prey, once they get involved with me, catching them is only a matter of time.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2505, 'Lau', 'I''ve got to exterminate the bad rats infesting my city, don''t I? So I keep a cat. Meow!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2505, 'Lau', 'The earl said there''s no point in going after the small fries, but someone who tries something once will try it again, right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2505, 'Lau', 'Meh, Ran-Mao is my little sister. Yeah, my sister. Even though we aren''t related by blood.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2505, 'Lau', '*to Ciel* That means you will steadily sink into mud. Even if you step toward a place from which you can''t return, you choose not to reveal your screaming for help to other people, eh?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Madame Red', '*referring to Vincent Phantomhive* I came to love my red hair that was just like my father''s. I came to love red. I came to love you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Madame Red', 'I used to hate my red hair that was just like my father''s. I used to hate red.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Madame Red', '*to Ciel* You want to take revenge for my murdered sister? Sister would definitely have not... we would not have wanted you to be like this.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Madame Red', '*when Ciel questions why he''s dressed up as a female for Aleister''s party* Because I''ve always wanted a daughter! A cute daughter who would look lovely in those long flowing dresses!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Madame Red', '*referring to getting into Aleister Chamber''s party* Aren''t you underestimating me? Aren''t I rather popular? A few words here and there and it''ll be arranged.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Maylene', 'I''ll keep to what the young master has told me. To face the master with a clean mansion every day. That is a maid''s job. I wipe away the mansion''s dirt.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Maylene', 'These are my precious glasses that the young master bought for me! These maid outfits as well. Before I''d come here, I''d never worn anything like a skirt. I''m so happy I''m a maid now.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2500, 'Finnian', 'The young master doesn''t give me injections every day. The young master doesn''t kill my friends. The young master doesn''t lock me up. I love it here. That''s why I decided I''d protect it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2500, 'Finnian', '*to Agni, who tells him to be nice to the trees* Treat them kindly,'' huh? Before I came here, I don''t think I would have understood. But now, I feel like I can do it!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2500, 'Finnian', 'It used to be that I couldn''t go outside like this. So now it''s fun to do it every day. I can touch trees and bugs and people.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2500, 'Finnian', '*when Agni asks him to mash potatoes* It requires strength? Since that''s the case, I might be able to do it! I wanna do it! Please allow me to do it!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2500, 'Finnian', 'But my strength is too large, so Mr. Sebastian forbids me to touch anything in the kitchen.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2500, 'Finnian', '*after Sebastian tells him to design the garden* Then... then ... I''ll make a cool garden that looks like a transforming robot! Can I?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'Do not-arrogant people exist?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'I ... humiliated as a pet ... my house was burnt, my family was killed. I was such a... powerless kid. Therefore, I returned to this place in order to make those people who put me through such fate taste the same humiliation. The successors of the generations killed three years prior would come to me as long as I am the head of the Phantomhive family that stands in their way. I''m waiting ...for them to come and try to kill me here.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'So what? You''re another person, so of course you look different. What do you need to be ashamed for? Besides, I''m free to be with whoever I want. No one has the right to say anything about it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'Listen when people are talking to you!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'He is nothing more than one of my pawns. However, he is not a normal pawn. He is a pawn that can get across the whole board in one move.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'What are you lazily standing around for? You obtained me my revenge. This is an order! Come and eat my soul already! Until the very moment when you eat all my soul you are my butler - Sebastian Michaelis!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', '*to Sebastian* Let''s go, you cat-obsessed moron.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'I''m sorry. Seeing Sebastian''s corpse so many times... is just too much for me...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'I''m a human being, Sebastian!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'I''m arrogant, but not so much that I''d irresponsibly save someone just to brag about it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', '*to Sebastian* I don''t need your "fawning". It''s disgusting.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', '*to Prince Sohma* Who''s my best friend? Don''t say such ridiculous things.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'It''s in bad taste to play games that make me feel like throwing up, Demon!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'Enough already! I''m going to feel queer if I continue to live like this!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'Father, Mother, God, please... Why? Why is there no one? No one comes to our rescue.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', '*to Sebastian* You shall never betray me. You shall never leave my side. No matter what!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'I''m afraid today''s game was quite uninteresting.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'To smile happily, I''ve... forgotten.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', '*to Sebastian* You idiot!! Do you think I''d dance with a big, male partner like you?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'It''s not like I became her fiancée. I was forced to do it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'Yes, "kids" have a great greed for games.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2498, 'Grell Sutcliff', '*to Sebastian* Ah, I can finally appear before you in my real form! Because isn''t it embarrassing to appear before a handsome guy without makeup?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2498, 'Grell Sutcliff', '*to Sebastian* Such an ice king you are! A beautiful tyrant! An angelic devil! A raven with the wings of a dove! My little lamb with the appetite of a wolf... My very own Sebastian DARLING!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2498, 'Grell Sutcliff', '*to Claude* Ally? What''s with that cliched word? Supreme love is always a battle to death!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2498, 'Grell Sutcliff', 'I am the queen of all fruits!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2498, 'Grell Sutcliff', '*to Sebastian* This is great! I''m getting goosebumps all over my body, Little Sebas-chan! If I have your child, I will definitely give birth to it!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2498, 'Grell Sutcliff', 'I''m going to use the heels of my shoes to step on this cold, uncaring face of yours! I want you to lick my shoes clean!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2498, 'Grell Sutcliff', 'A good man''s past makes people curious! But if he''s a bad man, then it makes me wanna see even more!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2498, 'Grell Sutcliff', '*to Sebastian* Don''t say that. I''m sure you''ll become addicted to the taste of my "death scythe".', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2498, 'Grell Sutcliff', 'Even if I''m like this, I''m still the butler of death!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2498, 'Grell Sutcliff', 'Lately, I''ve only been encountering unsophisticated prey. My scythe and I are unsatisfied.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2498, 'Grell Sutcliff', 'Oh, Little Sebas-chan, I do love red the most. Hair, clothes, lipstick, I love them to be red. That''s why I love using fresh blood to do make-up for those ugly women. The more flamboyant a woman is, the more she''s as beautiful as a poisonous flower, right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2498, 'Grell Sutcliff', '*to Sebastian* I really wanna do some vigorous exercise with you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'Those round and innocent eyes that know no filth or foulness, those tails that lovingly swish as if they belong to nobility, those paws in the soft shade of warm light pink!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', '*to Grell* You really have no standards.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'Yes...I am a demon. There''s no way I could understand my prey, a human''s sense of taste. What I understand is...only the taste of a human''s soul.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', '*to Grell* Isn''t it a hot day?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', '*to Hannah* I have a contract. Even if you steal him from me, he is still my Young Master. The lot of you aren''t fit to even lick his soul.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'Forsake the future, sacrifice your dreams, while stained with deep despair, elude the past, fight the reality, and never relinquish your nobility. Just like that, Young Master. That is the soul I wish to consume.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', '*to Claude, teasing him* This is your way, right? Day into night, sugar into salt, dark blue into gold. Then I will turn the gold... into black.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'Young Master... It''s time to wake up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'Now I can show you my true nature.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', '*to Claude* How can you say that. I''m one hell of- wait, it''s still early for that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'I do not need a thousand souls, I only need one, which is my master''s.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'I''m a butler. I can''t let my master see the form that speaks badly of my reputation.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', '*to Ciel* I shall make it as gentle as possible.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'Heaven? That has no hold over me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', '*to Ciel* I am your knight, after all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'Unseemly... ugly... vicious... My true form.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'Cats are great. They don''t talk about useless things. Or do them. Nothing is cuter. They are something that don''t exist in my world. They have pets over there as well...but...it doesn''t quite compare.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', '*to Beast*  Wouldn''t it be good to forget everything even if it''s just for tonight? Indulge in pleasure...breathe a sweet poison deep into your lungs.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', '*to Ciel*  In your current state...you are even more like...My Lady.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'For a king to survive it''s good for him to be able to skillfully manipulate the other pieces using both the knight and the queen. Beneath the throne the bodies of your pieces will pile up along with your sins. You must not lose.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', '*to Ciel* You''re a child when it''s convenient, huh.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'Any game becomes boring when it lacks thrills.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'As long as there is the contract, I will protect your life. However, if you make a mistake of your own accord, you will possibly suffer a painful experience while alive. You already know that, don''t you?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', '*to William Spears* My, my. How difficult to handle alone. But this large quantity of souls, shall a demon like me offer you assistance with them?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'It has nothing to do with England or India. No matter where or when, it''s the same. Humanity, that is.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', '*to Ciel* Well, aren''t you a very young master. You have summoned me. This fact will not change for all eternity. What has been sacrificed will never be returned. Now... choose.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', '*talking to other servants* Why don''t you all kneel down on the ground and beg for even a mere scrap of Agni''s talents? Perhaps it would even improve you a little.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'However, when trying to reach your goals, you need to learn how to eat some humble pie occasionally. If you don''t, one small trip one day might mean your fall.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'Heaven? I don''t have an affinity with that place.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', '*about Finnian* I have lived for a long time, but this is my first time meeting a space alien. What kind of counter-attack is that sparkly, smiley face expecting from me?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'It seems your talent for dancing is non-existent. It must be crushing, young master.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2504, 'Undertaker', 'Now... Earl, give me that!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2504, 'Undertaker', '*to Ciel* You don''t need to tell me, I know why you came, with just one look I can tell what''s on your mind.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2504, 'Undertaker', 'I wonder, if the butler isn''t here, is the earl just a child who can''t do anything?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2504, 'Undertaker', 'Victoria, aye? I''m not a fan. She sits herself up so high above everyone else, and leaves the painful dirty work to the earl.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2504, 'Undertaker', 'Today is a particular woman''s special gala. The final great ceremony in each human''s life. A funeral.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2504, 'Undertaker', 'I don''t want any of the queen''s money!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2504, 'Undertaker', '*to Ciel* Welcome, Earl. Do you want to see how it feels to sleep in my custom-made coffin?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2642, 'Yui Hirasawa', 'Oh, a headband! *runs off in that direction*', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2642, 'Yui Hirasawa', 'In the manga, when I wasn''t in the picture, even if I didn''t sing nobody noticed, but if I don''t sing in the anime...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2642, 'Yui Hirasawa', 'Make sure you don''t mistake soy sauce for sugar.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2642, 'Yui Hirasawa', 'He''s so cute, I want to put peanuts in his nose.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2643, 'Mio Akiyama', 'We''ll follow her BUTT and find out what kind of guy she''s dating!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2652, 'Jun Suzuki', 'MAN! I''M SO JEALOUS!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2642, 'Yui Hirasawa', 'I want to be able to snap my fingers!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2642, 'Yui Hirasawa', 'The Cake is a Lie!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2646, 'Sawako Yamanaka', 'Where on earth would you find such a hot fifty year old?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2642, 'Yui Hirasawa', 'Wait, does that mean you''re in your fifties?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2644, 'Ritsu Tainaka', 'Thou art not good! Thou shalt not become a great actress at this rate!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2645, 'Tsumugi Kotobuki', 'You and Mio-chan...you''re hitting each other and bonding through bodily contact, right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2643, 'Mio Akiyama', 'Ritsu~! Don''t do this~! MEN ARE ANIMALS!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2642, 'Yui Hirasawa', 'I have one last request. Please slap me in the face with that wad of cash.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2642, 'Yui Hirasawa', 'I''m tree G! Pose of a tree!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2642, 'Yui Hirasawa', 'I''m FLYING!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2642, 'Yui Hirasawa', 'High schoolers are kind of amazing!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2642, 'Yui Hirasawa', 'Mugi-chan, you have really thick eyebrows.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2645, 'Tsumugi Kotobuki', '*to Ritsu* If you were a boy, I am sure you would be very popular with the girls!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2645, 'Tsumugi Kotobuki', 'Jello is nice...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2642, 'Yui Hirasawa', 'We didn''t call you because we thought you have a date with your boyfriend or something.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2642, 'Yui Hirasawa', 'All your sweets are belong to me!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2646, 'Sawako Yamanaka', 'Do you want me to transform you into someone that even you won''t recognize?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2642, 'Yui Hirasawa', '*joyfully* I''ve never caught a cold! *they say only idiots don''t catch colds*', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2645, 'Tsumugi Kotobuki', 'Tapping!?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2643, 'Mio Akiyama', 'Speed shredding!?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2644, 'Ritsu Tainaka', 'Teeth shredding!?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2646, 'Sawako Yamanaka', 'I''ll go out with you if you want.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2642, 'Yui Hirasawa', 'Not joining a club means you become a NEET?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2642, 'Yui Hirasawa', 'Squishy~!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2645, 'Tsumugi Kotobuki', 'I''ve always wanted someone to ask me if I would like fries with that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2643, 'Mio Akiyama', 'Would something like that make her feel better... - OH, IT DID!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2643, 'Mio Akiyama', 'There are only two kinds of rock guitarists: Jeff Beck and everyone else.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2645, 'Tsumugi Kotobuki', 'Yes, but I''d rather be friends with fun people that I don''t meet often.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(30, 2643, 'Mio Akiyama', 'So we''re like rare animals?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 158, 'Temari', '*about Shikamaru* Amazing. This slacker-clown outsmarted me!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 158, 'Temari', 'Sharpen your kama at sunset.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 158, 'Temari', '*to Lee* Get yourself and that loser out of my way.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 158, 'Temari', '*to Shikamaru* You are awfully fragile. What kind of man are you?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 158, 'Temari', 'Wasn''t much of a match...kinda boring.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'There are no enemies here because we''ve all suffered at Akatsuki''s hand! So there is no Suna, no Iwa, no Konoha, no Kiri, and no Kumo! There are only "shinobi"!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'He was the one who taught me to deepen my bond with my people. Thanks to him, I was able to regain my true self. That village has him, the one who cherishes a friend''s bond more than anyone I know. Naruto Uzumaki... Knowing him and the friends he holds so dear, they will overcome this disaster and grow even stronger from it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'This is where it all starts for me. Starting with this small bond. I too want to become someone who is needed, instead of a weapon that is feared. And as the Kazekage of Sunagakure.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'I know him well. He takes too many risks when it comes to his friends...that''s why.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', '*to Naruto* I think of you as a friend. I used to think "friend" was just another word... Nothing more, nothing less. But when I met you, I realized what was important was the word''s meaning.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', '*to Naruto* If you''re truly prepared to take up the mantle of a Kage, then as Sasuke''s friend, you know what you have to do.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'Peace under an illusion is not a true peace. It''s only meaningful if the real world manages to accomplish it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'When did you forsake yourselves?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'Up until now, my bonds with others have only been ones of hatred and murder. But, seeing him fight so hard made me wonder what a bond really is. I think I understand a little now. Suffering, sadness...and joy. To be able to share it with another person. Naruto Uzumaki...when I fought him, I feel that is what he taught me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'Perhaps the companionship of an evil person is preferable to loneliness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'You''re the same then. When you feel the honor of your idol under scrutiny... you become enraged, as if it were your own honor being questioned. The more precious your idol is to you... the harder you fight for him.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'I shall kill you. I will not cease to exist.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', '*to Sasuke* You have the same eyes as I do...the eyes, filled with hatred and death, that long for strength... Just like mine. Your eyes tell me how badly you wish to kill the one who put you through the hell called loneliness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'I am a relic they want to get rid of, so why do I exist and live? In order to exist you need a purpose, to exist for no reason is the same as being dead... I would love only myself and fight for only myself. If all other people exist to magnify that love, then there is no more a splendid universe than this one...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'The corpse''s bitter crimson tears flow and mingle with the endless sand, filling the chaos within me - and making me stronger.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'I finally understand... I''m alone. I won''t believe in anyone, or love anyone. I''m alone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'What does pain feel like?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 148, 'Anko Mitarashi', 'I wasn''t cast aside. It was my choice, and mine alone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 148, 'Anko Mitarashi', '*to Orochimaru* But why? How could you do this!? I don''t get it, I''ve looked up to you more than anyone in the world!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 148, 'Anko Mitarashi', '*about Sasuke* I don''t care what the heck he is! If he stays, he''s a danger to everyone! Don''t you see!? As he gets stronger, so does the Curse Mark! That thing is feeding off his chakra! It''s a Forbidden Jutsu that devours the one who bears it! It''s incredible the kid''s still standing. By now, he...should be dead.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 148, 'Anko Mitarashi', '*to Orochimaru* This is no time to reminisce, you''re an S-class criminal, top of the most wanted list. You''ve got to be taken down, and it''s only fitting that I''m the one to do it. ''Cause after all, you''re the one that taught me everything, right, Sensei?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 148, 'Anko Mitarashi', '*to Naruto* Tough guys like you usually leave their blood all over this forest.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Might Guy', 'He was a worthy opponent! A man who lived and died like a real shinobi! Kisame Hoshigaki! I''ll remember that name for the rest of my life!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Might Guy', '*to Kisame* A failure will win even at the cost of their own life!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Might Guy', 'That''s it, Lee! Let the power of youth explode!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Might Guy', 'When a man struts around like a peacock, acting like Mr. Big Stuff, he should keep his promises. Even if it kills him.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Might Guy', 'Gahh! Kakashi! You make me so mad! Why do you have to act so cool?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Might Guy', 'You have the gift of perseverance, and that''s what makes you a genius too!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Might Guy', 'Don''t let anything stir you up the path you have drawn for yourself! Forge ahead in the end! Stick to it Lee! Make me proud! Be everything you can be!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Might Guy', 'You worked hard Lee, there''s no doubt in my mind the surgery will be a success. You have the power to shape your own destiny. And on the one-in-one thousand, no, one in a million chance something to happen to go wrong, I will die right along with you. Since the day I met you, my nindō has been to train you to become the most splendid ninja possible. That''s a promise!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Might Guy', '*to Neji* I was a failure when I was your age, but now I can even beat Kakashi, the elite genius. It''s only a matter of time until Lee finally surpasses you!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Might Guy', 'People call me the Leaf''s Noble Gentleman!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Might Guy', 'That''s it, Lee! Run...run towards the setting sun!... But don''t mess up your hair!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Might Guy', 'Look deep into my eyes and accept my sincere apology! Also notice my handsome manly features.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Might Guy', '*to Kakashi* What is with your attitude?! We''ll never be young like this again!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 169, 'Shino Aburame', 'I kind of hate him.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 169, 'Shino Aburame', 'If you fight me, you won''t be able to recover. Forfeit and withdraw.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 169, 'Shino Aburame', 'Never underestimate your opponent, no matter how small they may seem.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 169, 'Shino Aburame', 'Even if it''s been a while, you should remember your comrades faces. Why? Because otherwise you will hurt their feelings when they call out to you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 169, 'Shino Aburame', 'I hate explaining the same thing twice.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 169, 'Shino Aburame', 'This is what a real trump card is.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 171, 'Kiba Inuzuka', 'If I kick enough asses I might even end up Hokage!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 171, 'Kiba Inuzuka', 'Let''s die together.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 171, 'Kiba Inuzuka', '*to Naruto* You? Hokage? You can''t even beat me! No-one''s deluded enough to think that you have what it takes to become the next Hokage, not even you! Tell you what, though... I''ll become Hokage in your place!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 171, 'Kiba Inuzuka', 'Don''t think you can run away from my nose.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 171, 'Kiba Inuzuka', 'Heh, I don''t know what''s going on, but I''m always up for getting wild.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 171, 'Kiba Inuzuka', 'Yahoo! Akamaru, let''s do this!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 154, 'Chouji Akimichi', 'I''m gonna eat until I can eat no more!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 154, 'Chouji Akimichi', 'I can''t forgive you for calling me fat! But even more than that... Not just for stealing the last chip... or calling me fat... most importantly I won''t forgive anyone who insults my best friend!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 154, 'Chouji Akimichi', 'Fat!? I''m big boned!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 154, 'Chouji Akimichi', '*to Shikamaru* I won''t let even YOU eat the last barbecue chip!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', 'My master entrusted me with a lot, from big things to little things. It''s the same for you an unlimited number of things, don''t you think it''s about time for us, to be the ones who entrust not the entrusted, it''s a pain in the ass but I can''t say that. Someday you''ll be the one to treat others to ramen and you''ll be called Master Naruto... We can''t stay kids forever, like Asuma and Jiraiya, I wanna be as cool as them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', '*about Temari* Subtle as a rhino... she might even be scarier than my mom.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', '*about women, to his father* If women made you a better person, I wouldn''t want to know what you were like before.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', '*about girls* C''mon. You know what they''re like. You can never figure them out. You never know where you could stand with them. The smallest things could put you in their bad side. Always playing little mind games with you. Trying to make you do what they want. They''re just a big pain basically.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', 'When you have that kid, I''ll have to protect it. So I''ve gotta grow up to be a cool adult too!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', 'We''re not stupid enough to go out there planning to die.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', '*to Hidan* That pathetic Lord Jashin or whatever isn''t your God anymore. I am. The only one bringing down vengeance is me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', '*to Hidan* See, you and I have different beliefs. I believe in the Will of Fire.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', 'Ughh. Great. What''s the point in setting the alarm if I''m going to wake up before it goes off? What a total waste. Now I''ve gotta shut it off but I don''t feel like moving. But if I don''t shut it off it will just keep ringing and ringing. Sigh. It makes me tired just thinking about the whole thing. Some mornings are such a drag...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', 'You would think just this once, when it was life or death, I could pull through.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', 'How many times do I have to tell you? The first move is always a feint.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', 'I never really liked Sasuke, but all the same, he''s a member of the Hidden Leaf village, he''s a comrade and I''ll put my life on the line to help him, that''s the way of our village. I know I usually seem like a pretty lazy guy, but not today. Because now, I''m responsible for your lives too.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', 'Sometimes I wish I was just a cloud, floating along.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Nara Shikamaru', '*about Ino* What a drag... I say a single thing against Sasuke, and I have to get that evil look from her eyes.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 155, 'Ino Yamanaka', 'Who''re you calling "pig", you billboard brow?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 155, 'Ino Yamanaka', '*to Sakura* You bloomed into a beautiful flower.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 155, 'Ino Yamanaka', '*talking about Naruto* I could almost fall for him.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 145, 'Rock Lee', 'Wise words, Guy sensei! So simple but filled with such profound meaning!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 145, 'Rock Lee', 'The lotus of the Leaf Village blooms twice.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 145, 'Rock Lee', 'I want to show I can be a splendid ninja as well even if I don''t have ninjutsu or genjutsu... I want to prove it to the whole world!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 145, 'Rock Lee', 'Sakura, please go out with me! I''ll protect you with my life!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 145, 'Rock Lee', 'A rock thrown at a pole will not hit, but if one does not aim at the pole, it will hit! That is the law I used!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 172, 'Tenten', 'Amazing... The brilliance of the blade... the design. They''re all beautiful! I want to take them all home!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 172, 'Tenten', 'Three members of Team Guy specializes in Close-Contact battles so I often render aid from the distance. I don''t mind providing back up, but I was hoping to find new ninja tools that would enable me to fight on the front lines.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 172, 'Tenten', 'You''re gonna fight Sasuke alone? And you think all of us are just gonna stand here and let you?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 172, 'Tenten', 'Let''s just say I don''t like being kept in the dark!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 172, 'Tenten', 'I''m not running away and I''m not giving up. I will save this child.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 172, 'Tenten', 'I won''t let that happen. You''re not getting off that easy. No way! The people you and Raiga killed, they all wanted to live but you didn''t leave them that choice! You decided for them! Well you don''t get to decide this time, ok?! You''re gonna live and you''re going to take some responsibility for all those people''s lives you cut short!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 172, 'Tenten', 'I can''t stand weak and indecisive people!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 172, 'Tenten', 'I want to be a great and powerful ninja! To walk in the footsteps of the legendary kunoichi, Tsunade!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 172, 'Tenten', 'It''s not because they''re girls you know, Neji. It''s just that those two are using kid gloves. It doesn''t matter if you''re a man or woman in battle.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 185, 'Hiruzen Sarutobi', '*last words* When the tree leaves dance, one shall find flames. The fire''s shadow will illuminate the village, and once again, tree leaves shall bud anew.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 185, 'Hiruzen Sarutobi', 'It is a place where every year shinobi are born, raised, grow old, fight, and die to protect their home. These people are precious to me. We share a home, we share a life, and though we may not share ties of blood, they are precious to me. They are my family. And if I do fall, you still will fail. I am only one of a long line. I carry this title in trust for those Hokage who came before and those who will come after. I am the Third Hokage!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 185, 'Hiruzen Sarutobi', 'I wonder...do you have it, young as you are... the Will of Fire?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 185, 'Hiruzen Sarutobi', 'He has combined Shadow Clone with his own invention, the Sexy Jutsu. What a foolish ninja technique...and he could probably get me with it, too.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Tsunade', 'I am the Fifth Hokage... You''ve trampled on our ancestors treasure...their dream...and you will pay the price! As the Hokage, I will put a stop to you here and now!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Tsunade', '*talking to the advisers* People like Jiraiya...and Sarutobi, and Elder Chiyo of the Sand possessed something you two sorely lack. Do you know what that is!? ...Faith! My grandfather, the First Hokage, believed in you and entrusted you with the village. Now it''s your turn to believe in these children and entrust it to them!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Tsunade', 'Grow up... Death comes with being a shinobi. There are times when death is hard to accept, but if you don''t get over it, there''s no future...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Tsunade', '*to Orochimaru about Naruto* "I will die before I let you touch him!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Tsunade', 'Why am I putting my life on the line? Because now... I am the Fifth Hokage of the Village Hidden in the Leaves!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Tsunade', 'Jiraiya, are you the one who taught him the Rasengan? Are you acting like a teacher by teaching him something he can''t master? Don''t give him any ideas! That''s why this kid likes to daydream that he''s going to become Hokage someday.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Tsunade', '*about to fight Naruto* One of the Legendary Sannin taking on a snot-nosed Genin... I oughta be ashamed of myself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 163, 'Kisame Hoshigaki', '*last words* Itachi-san... It seems that in the end... I''m not so terrible after all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 163, 'Kisame Hoshigaki', 'I get stronger in direct proportion to how strong my opponent is. I do not tire, and cannot be defeated.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 163, 'Kisame Hoshigaki', '*to Asuma* My massive blade, Samehada, doesn''t slice... It shreds to ribbons!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 163, 'Kisame Hoshigaki', 'Sharks start out as eggs, but incubate and hatch in the womb. Sometimes the number of pups is less than the number of eggs that were fertilized. Do you know why? Cannibalism. The pups start eating each other within the mother''s womb the moment they hatch. They start killing their siblings the moment they enter the world, viewing everything they see as nothing more than prey. As of today you and I are fellow members of Akatsuki. So be careful... of me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 163, 'Kisame Hoshigaki', 'I knew that from the first time I had to kill my comrades... Kill a Kiri ninja as a Kiri ninja. What does that make me? Am I a friend or foe? What is my purpose and my position? Where do I go? Where can I go? I''m well aware that my entire life has been a one giant lie.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 147, 'Zabuza Momochi', '*to Kakashi* I died as a human!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 147, 'Zabuza Momochi', '*last words* You were always at my side, the least I can do is to be beside you at the end. I know it cannot be, but I wish I could go to where you have gone. How I wish I could join you there, Haku.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 147, 'Zabuza Momochi', 'I can''t think of a more fitting destination for a demon ninja, can you?! I''m told there are many demons down there - of all shapes and sizes! Oh yes, I should fit right in! You, on the other hand, Gatō... Well,I fear you''re in for a long and very painful eternity!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 147, 'Zabuza Momochi', 'Even the unremarkable Demon of the Hidden Mist can die and become a real Demon in hell!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 147, 'Zabuza Momochi', 'Uh uh...I won''t be joining Haku. Where he''s gone I cannot follow. We wouldn''t be welcome where Haku''s gone to. Hell''s where WE''RE going, Gatō!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 147, 'Zabuza Momochi', 'Well? Cat got your tongue? Are you so surprised to discover that I''m human? Even shinobi are human. No matter how hard we try, we always fail to escape that simple fact. Well at least, I have failed.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 147, 'Zabuza Momochi', '*to Naruto* Your words cut deep, deeper than any blade.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 147, 'Zabuza Momochi', 'When you''ve hovered between life and death so many times that it doesn''t faze you, you may be called a ninja. When you''ve become so deadly that your profile has been entered into my bingo book, then you may have earned the title ninja.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 147, 'Zabuza Momochi', 'You''re right. Those little people and their little dreams, why should I care about them?! I have my own dream!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 147, 'Zabuza Momochi', 'When I was your age, my hands were already soaked in blood...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 149, 'Hinata Hyuuga', 'I used to always cry and give up... I made many wrong turns... But you... You helped me find the right path... I always chased after you... I wanted to catch up to you... I wanted to walk beside you all the time... I just wanted to be with you... You changed me! Your smile is what saved me! That is why I''m not afraid to die protecting you! Because... I love you...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 149, 'Hinata Hyuuga', 'I won''t let you lay another finger on Naruto!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 149, 'Hinata Hyuuga', '*to Naruto* You make mistakes... but... because of those mistakes... you get the strength to stand up to them. That''s why I think you are truly strong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 149, 'Hinata Hyuuga', '*to Naruto* When I watch you, I feel strong, like I can do anything - that even I am worth something.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 149, 'Hinata Hyuuga', 'You''re wrong, Neji... Because I can see that you are suffering more than me... You are the one who is confused and suffering inside the fate of the head and branch families.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 149, 'Hinata Hyuuga', 'Was I able to change myself...even a little, N-Naruto-kun?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 149, 'Hinata Hyuuga', 'I will never go back on my word, because that too is my ninja way!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 157, 'Haku', 'By the way, I''m a boy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'My name is Uzumaki Naruto. I like ramen. I hate the three minutes you have to wait while the water boils. And my dream is to one day become a Hokage. Then everyone will have to respect me at last.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 177, 'Kankuro', 'Sasori...your strength came because of your soul, not in spite of it. You tried to erase it, to become a puppet yourself, but couldn''t change completely. Now you''ve got your immortal body, but you''ve fallen, sunk to the level of the puppets you used to control. You were supposed to be a top class ninja puppeteer, not a worthless nobody who lets someone else pull the strings.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 177, 'Kankuro', 'How well or poorly we execute our ambush will have a huge impact on this war and how many casualties we suffer. If you wanna protect your friends and family, the only thing you should be thinking about is how to make this operation a success!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 177, 'Kankuro', '*to Naruto* Aww, don''t sweat it. Women always go weak in the knees for that cool, elite type of guy. So what can you do, am I right?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 177, 'Kankuro', 'Naruto... please save my little brother.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 177, 'Kankuro', 'I''ll show you the real power of the battle puppet Crow.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 177, 'Kankuro', 'I can''t back down when they show me no respect.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 177, 'Kankuro', '*thinking about Naruto* This brat...I''m going to kill him.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'Growth occurs when one goes beyond one''s limits. Realizing that is also part of training.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', '*last words* Forgive me Sasuke... It ends with this.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', '*to Kisame* Those who turn their hands against their comrades are sure to die a terrible death. Be prepared.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'The people of this clan are all the same. You focus on the trivial, and lose sight of what''s most important. Change is impossible, in this fog of ignorance. How can we evolve when regulation is all we know?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'I''ve had enough, there''s no hope left for this pathetic clan.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'Don''t cry, Sasuke. Your big brother is here to protect you, no matter what happens.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'You and I are flesh and blood. I''m always going to be there for you, even if it''s only as an obstacle for you to overcome. Even if you do hate me. That''s what big brothers are for.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Obito Uchiha', '*last words* Just when me and Kakashi were becoming friends... I couldn''t bring myself to confess to Rin... I wish I had more time with everyone...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Obito Uchiha', '*to Kakashi* I''m about to... die... but I''ll become your eye.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Obito Uchiha', 'I believe the "White Fang" is a true hero!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Obito Uchiha', '*to Kakashi* I am Uchiha Obito and I will surpass you once I awaken my Sharingan!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 140, 'Sasuke Uchiha', 'I have already awakened.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'I don''t understand what''s going on, but I''ll just pretend that I do. *nods head in agreement*', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 159, 'Kabuto Yakushi', '*to Naruto* Finding a new me, that is the lesson you taught me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 159, 'Kabuto Yakushi', 'I decided I wished to be like you as well, Naruto-kun, and for that reason...with Orochimaru-sama now intregrated into this body, I plan on finding a new "me", one stronger than Orochimaru-sama himself!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 159, 'Kabuto Yakushi', 'Hehehe...you can''t beat me. You have no skills, unlike Sasuke.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 159, 'Kabuto Yakushi', '*to Naruto* You''ve just thrown it all away! Dreams don''t come true when you''re dead!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 159, 'Kabuto Yakushi', 'Little kids think life is so easy. That''s why they go on and on about their dreams. That''s why they never give up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 159, 'Kabuto Yakushi', 'Oh you look so beautiful... We''re not here for a picnic you know.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 140, 'Sasuke Uchiha', 'Don''t worry, this will be over in five seconds.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'We''re just some normal ninja, we don''t want to see what''s under your mask.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 156, 'Iruka Umino', '*to Naruto* Lord Jiraiya only had praise for you. He was always boasting about you, saying you were like his own grandchild. He had faith that you were the one who would inherit his will, and truly believed that you would one day be a great Hokage. Lord Jiraiya will always watch over you. Even this very minute, he''s watching from somewhere. He wouldn''t be happy seeing you sad like this. So...be your usual self, the one he praised so much. Don''t stay depressed forever. For Lord Jiraiya himself, one of the Legendary Sannin...acknowledged you as his promising student!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 156, 'Iruka Umino', 'So I acted like an idiot. It was tough, has it been lonely for you Naruto, was it tough Naruto??', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'We are humans, not fish. We don''t know what kind of people we truly are until the moment before our deaths. As death comes to embrace you, you will realize what you are. That''s what death is, don''t you think?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'You are weak. Why are you so weak? Because you lack... hatred.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 145, 'Rock Lee', 'If I can''t do 400 push-ups, I''ll hit the dummy 800 times! If I can''t hit the dummy 800 times, I''ll do 2000 jump ropes!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 145, 'Rock Lee', 'I am the Handsome Devil of the Hidden Leaf Village! My name is Rock Lee!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 145, 'Rock Lee', 'Guy-sensei is the coolest! He practically GLOWS with cool!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', 'Stop calling me Ero-sennin!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', 'Baka, baka, baka!! They found out I was peeking! Now my research is ruined!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'The only thing that can keep a fire from dying and give it more power, is wind.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'If I become as strong as you, will I really become like you? To die as a tool...that''s...that''s just too sad.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', '*last words* The Tale of Naruto Uzumaki... yes... that has a nice ring to it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', 'There, that ending...was a little better. The frog at the bottom of the well drifts off into the great ocean. Heh heh ...yep. Pretty damn honorable... pretty damn honorable...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', '*to Naruto* I think we all have to acknowledge you. Gamatatsu, Gamakichi, Sakura, Tsunade...and I... We all admit you''ve worked really hard. But I wonder what''s pushing you forward.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', 'Never go back on your word...and never give up. That''s your ninja way...and as your mentor ... I have no business whining! Because the student''s ninja way should be the master''s too! Isn''t that so, Naruto?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', 'The true measure of a shinobi is not how he lives, but how he dies.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', '*to Orochimaru about Sasuke* Because it''s no fun to train a genius!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', '*to Orochimaru* You''re wrong, that''s not what makes a shinobi. You never did get it, a real ninja is one who endures no matter what gets thrown at him... Let me explain something to you, there is only one thing that matters if you are a shinobi, and it isn''t the number of jutsu you possess. All you do need, is the guts to never give up.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', '*to Naruto* Even I can tell that hatred is spreading. I wanted to do something about it...but I don''t know what. I believe... that someday the day will come when people truly understand one another!! If I can''t find the answer, it will be up to you to do it!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', 'When people get hurt, they learn to hate... When people hurt others, they become hated and racked with guilt. But knowing that pain allows people to be kind. Pain allows people to grow... and how you grow is up to you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', 'Wherever someone thinks of you, that''s where home is.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', 'I''m not a pervert... I''m a super pervert!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', 'Die! Just Die! You have no talent at all!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', 'Shut up you flat-chested bitch Tsunade!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', 'You are the strongest enemy I have ever fought.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', 'No one can determine another''s destiny.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', 'The heavens will not allow a pawn who can only seek victory at the cost of himself to advance...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', '*about Gai* He''s so childish. He acts like a seven-year-old!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', '*about Lee and Gai* As usual, I can''t keep up with their craziness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', 'Because Naruto... you saved me from the darkness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', 'All this time I''ve been called a genius, so I cannot lose.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', 'Sasuke''s out there right now, heading toward Orochimaru. We can''t allow such evil to take someone from our village... that is not our way.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', 'Naruto... Sometimes, your eyes are even better than mine.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', 'Father, is a person''s destiny a thing like a cloud flowing with an inescapable flow? Or can a person choose the flow he wishes... I still don''t know the answer to this. Either way the destination may be the same in the end. However by choosing to live like the latter, a person can live and strive towards a goal. And in this match I have finally understood those who have that are truly strong. Father, I have but one goal, I want to become stronger... Enough not to lose to anyone... That''s how I feel. Father, the birds are flying freely today... They look so happy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', 'There''s no method but death to escape this horrible curse.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', 'The curse represents a mark of the bird in a cage... It is... the symbol of being tied down to an inescapable destiny.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', '*to Naruto* These eyes of mine show me many things. One thing they''ve shown me...people''s limitations are set, fixed, and unchangeable. Only a fool wastes his time trying to become something he can never be!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', 'Do you understand now? You have no way of beating me!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', 'Once a failure, always a failure. You can''t change that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 151, 'Neji Hyuuga', 'Right now, Sasuke is in the darkness. The only one who can save him is you, Naruto.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'Try it trash! I''ll return the pain a thousand times over!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 160, 'Jiraiya', 'I am, Jiraiya, the epitome of manliness! I shall fall for no woman''s wiles! When you''re me, you only need to flash that sexiness to have women fall at your feet.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 155, 'Ino Yamanaka', 'WHAT?! Why wasn''t he affected by my sexiness?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 155, 'Ino Yamanaka', 'SHIKAMARU! Beat her up with a 16 HIT COMBO!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 155, 'Ino Yamanaka', 'There''s no meaning to a flower unless it blooms.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'A soul needs a purpose to live...and so I concluded that my purpose was to kill everyone besides myself. I felt alive...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', 'I fight for my sake only and live to love no one but myself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 150, 'Gaara', '*young Gaara attempts to slash his wrist* It''s no use, the sand gets in the way.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Madara Uchiha', 'The concept of hope is nothing more than giving up. A word that holds no true meaning.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Madara Uchiha', 'The Uchiha is a clan destined for revenge...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Madara Uchiha', '*to Minato, about his reason for attacking Konoha* Oh, you know...it''s fun, it''s part of my plan...to start a war...to bring peace...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Madara Uchiha', 'It will be a new world... A world of truth, not lies.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Madara Uchiha', 'When a man learns to love, he must bear the risk of hatred.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', '*to Sasuke* No matter how far Orochimaru fell, he still loved him... Now I know how the Third Hokage felt.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', '*to Sakumo* Regardless of what happened, you did the best you could. I understand that now...you broke the rules for all our sakes - I''m proud of you now...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', '*to Pain* The people from this village are different from your average village. Even if it means dying, there''s not a single one of us, who would sell out a comrade.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', '*to Naruto* You''ve become as strong...if not stronger than me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'Like the fate of the two who founded the village of Konoha... Naruto and Sasuke...your fates are like theirs.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'This place makes me think about the mistakes I''ve made in the past... and I''ve made a lot.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', '*to Orochimaru* I don''t care if you are one of the legendary Sannin, the great shinobi of legend, I swear take one more step towards Sasuke and one of us will die here!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'I''m Kakashi Hatake. Things I like and things I hate...I don''t feel like telling you that. My dreams for the future...never really thought about it. As for my hobbies...I have lots of hobbies.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 145, 'Rock Lee', 'A genius, huh? What does that mean? "Genius"? So I was not born with a whole lot of natural talent, not gifted like Neji ...but I work hard and I never give up! That is my gift, that is my ninja way!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 161, 'Orochimaru', '*to Sasuke* I refuse...to let this happen! I am Orochimaru! I am immortal! I will not die here! Destined to discover the true meaning behind everything! Destined to take control of everything in this world!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 161, 'Orochimaru', 'When there is a true desire in the heart and that desire is strong... That is when he finds real strength that even he did not know he had!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 161, 'Orochimaru', 'Everything will be mine.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 161, 'Orochimaru', '*about Sasuke* When I watch this boy, I look back to the time I was called a genius, and think how ridiculous it was.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 161, 'Orochimaru', '*to Sasuke* How impressive. A thousand foes stand before you and you don''t even bat an eyelid.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 161, 'Orochimaru', '*talking about Naruto* This child... intrigues me to no end!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 161, 'Orochimaru', 'Hate only gives birth to even more hate.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 161, 'Orochimaru', 'I want to obtain all the jutsu and gain a true understanding of everything in this world. The first one to mix blue and yellow called the new color "green". I want to do something similar to that. If blue is the chakra, then yellow is the seal, and green is the jutsu... Just as there is no end to the variety of colors, there are so many thousands...tens of thousands of jutsu in the world as well. But in order to obtain every possible jutsu and truth, it would require an eternity. Only one who understands everything after spending such time on this can be fittingly called the Ultimate Being.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 161, 'Orochimaru', '*to Kabuto, talking about Tsunade) The best medicines always taste bitter.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, 'Sakura Haruno', 'Naruto''s here because he''s made up his mind. My resolve is nothing compared to his now! I''m supposed to be a ninja, but all I''ve ever done is lean on him and cry... I was supposed to change that... I came here and I thought I was ready. But I can''t do anything... I can''t say anything. The only thing that remains for me...is to believe in them!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, 'Sakura Haruno', '*about killing Sasuke* I... Sasuke... I... I thought I could do this...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, 'Sakura Haruno', 'I''m the one who made Naruto suffer the most... I''ve just been getting it wrong. Just been messing it up... I don''t want to get it wrong anymore...don''t want to screw it up anymore.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, 'Sakura Haruno', '*talking to Yamato* Same as always... I can only do the dumbest of things for Naruto...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, 'Sakura Haruno', 'A smile is the easiest way out of a difficult situation.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, 'Sakura Haruno', '*to Sasuke* I... I love you with all my heart!.. If you were to stay here with me, there would be no regrets...because every day we''d do something fun, we''d be happy I swear..! I would do anything for you! So...please, just stay with me!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, 'Sakura Haruno', 'I''ve always considered myself to be a true ninja...but those were just empty words, because Sasuke and Naruto were always in the lead! But now it''s my turn to take the lead, and all of you can watch me from the background!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, 'Sakura Haruno', '*to Ino* Didn''t you know? Women have to be strong in order to survive!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, 'Sakura Haruno', 'All I''ve been doing is watching you two from behind... Now, get a good look at MY back!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 144, 'Sakura Haruno', '*talking to Sasuke* On that day, you taught me that solitude is painful! I understand that so well right now. I have family, and I have friends but if you''re gone... To me... It will be the same as being alone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'In the ninja world, those who break the rules are scum, that''s true, but those who abandon their friends are worse than scum.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'I won''t allow my comrades to die. I''ll protect you with my life. Trust me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'The next generation will always surpass the previous one. It''s one of the never-ending cycles in life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', '*making excuses for being late, as usual* Hello students, today I got lost on the road of life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', '*making excuses for being late, as usual* A cute girl stopped me on the way, so I danced.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, NULL, 'Hatake Kakashi', 'Naruto, it''s nice that you removed the poison so spiritedly, but you''ll bleed to death if you lose any more blood... Seriously...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'People live their lives bound by what they accept as correct and true. That''s how they define "reality". But what does it mean to be "correct" or "true"? Merely vague concepts... Their "reality" may all be a mirage. Can we consider them to simply be living in their own world, shaped by their beliefs?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'If you want to kill me, despise me, hate me, and live in an unsightly way... Run, and cling to life, and then some day, when you have the same eyes as I do, come before me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 141, 'Itachi Uchiha', 'You aren''t even worth killing, foolish little brother.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 140, 'Sasuke Uchiha', 'If you think I''m just a foolish kid ruled by his emotions, that''s fine. Following Itachi''s path would be childish, the whispering of fools who don''t know hatred. If anyone else tries to ridicule the way I live, I''ll slaughter everyone they ever cared about. And then maybe they''ll understand what it''s like to taste... a little of my hatred.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 140, 'Sasuke Uchiha', '*Talking to Naruto* Just shut up for once! What the hell do you know about it?! It''s not like you ever had a family in the first place! You were on your own right from the beginning, what makes you think you know anything about it?! Huh?! I''m suffering now because I had those ties, how on earth could you possibly understand, what it feels like to lose all that?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 140, 'Sasuke Uchiha', '*Introducing himself to Kakashi, Naruto and Sakura* My name is Sasuke Uchiha. I hate a lot of things, and I don''t particularly like anything. What I have is not a dream, because I will make it a reality. I''m going to restore my clan, and kill a certain someone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 140, 'Sasuke Uchiha', 'I have long since closed my eyes... My only goal is in the darkness.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'Hey, you stupid fox! You''re in my body and you owe me rent! So for payment, I''ll take your chakra! You got that?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'The pain of being alone...is not an easy one to bear. Why is it...that I can understand your pain? But...I already have many people who are important to me now...and I can''t let you hurt any of them. Even if I have to kill you!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(3, 142, 'Naruto Uzumaki', 'I won''t run away anymore... I won''t go back on my word... That is my ninja way!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Portgas D. Ace', 'Thank you... for loving me!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Gecko Moria', 'Fine! Go see for yourself, Straw Hat... What a real nightmare is... In the New World!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 332, 'Usopp', 'A dumbass is still a dumbass. *looking at Duval''s new face*', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'A place where you can never ever EVER enter? *Luffy, in Skypea*', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Whitebeard', 'The name of this era is WHITEBEARD!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Whitebeard', 'I am only one man with one heart... Call me a demon, call me a monster... but I can''t be the strongest forever!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'I am going to save you even if it kills me.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 382, 'Brook', 'I wonder if it''ll be fun to see mermaid-san''s panties.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Whitebeard', 'These fools... thinking that this might truly be enough to take my life... I need no help! I AM WHITEBEARD!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', '*talking to Zoro* The world''s greatest swordsman, that''s great! And it''s fitting since your new boss is going to be King of the Pirates! Anything else would make me look bad!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'Just shut up with your god crap, already!!! What kind of GOD... CAN''T SAVE A SINGLE DAMN THING??!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'A wound that''d make an ordinary man unconscious... I won''t lose to it. A wound that would kill an ordinary person... I won''t lose to it! To face one who is extraordinary, Hawk Eyes... I can''t allow myself to be ordinary!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Marshall D. Teach', 'Let the heavens deal with life and death, even the most fearful lose to that. Let''s live for another moment!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'It''s not like "thanks" are something I can eat.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'There should be a limit to how similar a couple looks like.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'When I decided to follow my dream, I had already discarded my life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'If you kill yourself, I''ll kill you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', '*to Captain Kuro* If you want to compare ambitions, mine is bigger!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'Well, how about this. My "luck" versus this thing''s "curse". Wanna see what''s stronger..? If I lose, then I''m just that much of a man anyways...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'There is someone that I must meet again. And until that day...not even Death itself can take my life away!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 341, 'Crocodile', 'Weakness is a sin.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 336, 'Enel', 'People don''t fear god, fear itslef is god.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 329, 'Sanji', 'You selfish people! Can''t you see that he''s hungry? Why do you hurt him? I think he is sick, so he can''t find food by himself. Am I right? Here! Eat this food. *Luffy tries to eat Sanji* Die!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 329, 'Sanji', 'A cow? A cow can swim? I think it''s a hippo!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'Let''s continue eating.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 358, 'Nojiko', 'Since 8 years ago, that girl has never cried again, and she''s never asked anyone for help. Because she doesn''t want to die like our mother. She was 10 years old, and Nami decided to fight alone in that situation. Have you ever realized how much pain she''s been going through?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 329, 'Sanji', 'Any person who hurts Nami-san''s feelings! I won''t let them live peacefully!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 332, 'Usopp', '*talking about Nami* Because it was the only way to save the village, she decided to join the people who killed her mother.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 331, 'Nami', 'Just one more time and everything will be the same. Everything will come back to me. And I will be free from Arlong. Bellemere-san. Finally, I can laugh with all my heart.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'Why does that man have a pinwheel on his head?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 331, 'Nami', 'Everyone is expecting help from you, but you come here and don''t think about doing anything to help those people?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 331, 'Nami', 'Why? The work that the marines should be doing now...there are many things that you have to take care of. Don''t know that Arlong has killed many people and destroyed many villages? Under his control, everyone was treated like a slave! And you didn''t do a single thing about that!! And now you just want to find the treasure of one thief? Is this a real government?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 331, 'Nami', 'Don''t touch Bellemere-san''s orange with your dirty hands! I won''t give that money to you. That money is...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'Don''t you dare make my navigator cry!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 329, 'Sanji', 'Moron! I''m not worried about you. I meant that you shouldn''t take all the credit for yourself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Marshall D. Teach', 'There is no such thing as impossible in this world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'I don''t know. I''m not sure why myself. But if I were to take even one step back, I believe that all those important oaths, promises and many other deals ''til now, will all go to waste and I''ll never be able to return before you, ever again.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Gecko Moria', 'A true pirate should fear nothing, not even death!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Nico Robin', 'Sometimes the only thing you have to doubt is your own common sense.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'Being alone hurts worse than pain.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 335, 'Shanks', 'Your honor isn''t worth your life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'If you don''t want the negative reputation you shouldn''t be a pirate.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'I won''t let you touch him. Young master would be sullied if an inferior, dirty person like you were to touch him. *says to Alois*', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Kizaru', 'Victory or defeat can be determined in a single moments misstep.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'Under one of your orders, I am to be your pawn and your sword. So please, young master, move me into check.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2496, 'Sebastian Michaelis', 'Even though I dislike being kicked by others, I do enjoy the feeling of kicking others.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Coby', 'We shouldn''t worry about being able to achieve our dreams, as long as we have the desire to do it!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'So what if you''re a girl.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1168, 'Alphonse Elric', 'Oh this is perfect! Now my arm''s fallen off too! Today is a terrible day!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Don Krieg', 'When a guy gets flustered, because someone calls him weak, it''s proof that he recognizes he IS weak. Let the outcome determine the weak and the strong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Alois Trancy', 'I want you, Ciel Phantomhive. That''s all there is to it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'If I can''t even protect my captain''s dream, then whatever ambition I have is nothing but talk...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'Dying is not repaying a debt! That is not what he saved you for! Only weak men would die after someone spared their lives!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 337, 'Dracule Mihawk', 'I don''t remember the name of every weakling I crush.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 360, 'Bellemere', 'No matter what happens, don''t be sorry you were born. Even though nobody praises us, don''t forget to smile in any situation. As long as you''re alive there will be better things later...and there will be many.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'When you decided to go to the sea, it was your own decision. Whatever happens to you on the sea, it depends on what you''ve done! Don''t blame others!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 331, 'Nami', 'Hopes for the future..? Yes. However, getting there with you...is not much different than being alone..! What good is the treasure if I''m alone? After sharing so much of our dreams. Instead of sacrificing them and leaving with you I would rather... HAVE NOTHING AT ALL!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 329, 'Sanji', 'I don''t care if you''re a god. If you lay even one finger on Nami-san, I''ll become the Devil of the Blue Sea!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Boa Hancock', 'Fufufu.. I think I like you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Marshall D. Teach', 'A man''s dream never dies!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'I don''t want to conquer anything. I just think the guy with the most freedom in this whole ocean... is the Pirate King!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Silvers Rayleigh', '*talking to Luffy* Can you really do this..? The Grand Line is just going to keep going on...surpassing your wildest imaginations! And the enemies will be strong. Can you really conquer this ultimate ocean?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 382, 'Brook', 'Yohohohoho!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Kizaru', 'Have you ever been kicked at the speed of light?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'You''ll never understand...your swords will never be as heavy as mine!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 335, 'Shanks', 'You can spill drinks on me, even spit on me. I''ll just laugh about it. But If you dare to hurt my friends... I WON''T FORGIVE YOU!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 382, 'Brook', 'Would you let me see your panties?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'If you do anything that would cause me to abandon my ambitions... You will end your own life on my sword!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Gol D. Roger', 'Inherited will. Destiny of the age. The dreams of the people. These are things that will not be stopped. As long as people continue to pursue the meaning of freedom. These things will never cease to be.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 332, 'Usopp', 'There... Comes a time when a man has to stand and FIGHT!! This is the time when his friends dreams are laughed at. Luffy wont die... I KNOW he''ll be the pirate king one day. I WONT LET YOU LAUGH AT THAT!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 332, 'Usopp', 'Then stand up right away! And don''t act like you''re about to die! It''s not like you! Even if there are billows of smoke, we can still see the sky. We can still see the ocean! It ain''t like it''s hell here! So don''t act like you''re about to die!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 329, 'Sanji', 'I''ll never kick a woman, even if I die!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 329, 'Sanji', 'A man forgives a woman''s lies.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'I have Nakama who''re not strong... But I still want them to be with me..!!So I have to be stronger than anybody else... Or I''ll lose them all!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 328, 'Franky', 'Existing Isn''t A Crime!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 331, 'Nami', '*talking about Usopp and Luffy* It''s never ending with those idiots. HEY! Lay off the sob stories! You know how dangerous this island is! Let''s not give it any help in killing us!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 329, 'Sanji', 'That''s no way to treat a lady!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 331, 'Nami', 'I''ll have mapped out the entire world!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 332, 'Usopp', 'I''ll be brave!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 329, 'Sanji', 'I''ll find the All Blue!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'Soon I''ll be King of the Pirates!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 332, 'Usopp', '*after his "5 ton''s hammer" breaks* Of course it was fake! I can''t lift five tons! I quit after five pounds!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Tony Tony Chopper', '*after seeing Ussopp''s 5 ton hammer break* You mean it was a fake?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', '*after seeing a skinny woman claiming to be Alvita* Don''t you mean you''re like half of her?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 329, 'Sanji', 'It''s time to get a girl.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Gol D. Roger', 'Bear conviction under your flag!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 332, 'Usopp', 'Protecting what we cherish most as men is the reason why we formed this pirate crew!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 335, 'Shanks', '*after saving Luffy and losing one arm* It isn''t worth much. It''s just one arm. I''m glad you''re safe.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'Fine! I''d rather be a pirate than die here!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'I am always serious.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'I want to eat meat!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'I do things my own way! So don''t give me any lip about it!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 335, 'Shanks', '*to Luffy* Keep this hat safe for me?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Gol D. Roger', 'My wealth and treasures? If you want it, I''ll let you have it. Look for it, I left all of it at that place!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', '*talking to Shanks* One day, I''ll have a ship and a crew better than yours!! And we''ll have the biggest hoard of treasure in the world!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 335, 'Shanks', 'I''m saying it''s not safe to point guns.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Roronoa Zoro', 'I''m going to be the world''s greatest swordsman! All I have left is my destiny! My name may be infamous...but it''s gonna shake the world!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'I''ve set myself to become the King of Pirates... and if I die trying... then at least I tried!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'Well, ya see... I''m gonna be the unbeatable pirate!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, NULL, 'Monkey D. Luffy', 'Being killed by marines, or coming with me. Which one do you pick?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 329, 'Sanji', 'Cooking is a gift from the gods. Spices are a gift from the devil. Looks like it was a little too spicy for you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 345, 'Smoker', 'With my own hands, JUSTICE will be served.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Let''s play this democracy game, shall we?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'I shall gamble on the geass known as people wishes. For the sake of the world''s future.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Don''t you think wishes are the same as Geass? Things you can''t accomplish with your own powers, you ask assistance from others.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2367, 'Jeremiah Gottwald', 'It''s not over yet!... Carve into your memories "Jeremiah Gottwald", the memorable name of the man that made you taste defeat!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'I am Lelouch Vi Britannia, son of the late Empress Marianne. The prince abandoned by his empire. If there are any that think they can go beyond my despair, then let them try.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'If happiness had a form, what would it look like? It might be something like glass, because one doesn''t notice it normally. However, it is actually there. As proof, if you look at it from a different angle, the glass will reflect light. It will state it''s presence and existence more eloquently than any other thing in this world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2365, 'C.C.', 'If you had the strength, you could live. This is our contract. In return for my gift of power, you must grant one of my wishes. If you enter this contract, you will live as a human, but also as one completely different. Different rules, different time, a different life.... The power of the king will make you lonely indeed. If you are prepared for that, then...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2368, 'Euphemia Li Britannia', 'I order you to love me!..', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Claude Faustus', 'Day into night, sugar into salt, living to dead, and dark blue into gold.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 'Alois Trancy', 'Hoheo taralna, rondero tarel!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(7, 1167, 'Edward Elric', 'Awww!! There are just so many people whose asses I have to kick!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'If you are crying, fight against it! If you''re regretting, walk forward! Only complaining on your misfortune, you''re nothing but a common pig!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(27, 2509, 'Vincent Phantomhive', 'There is nothing shameful about being different from others. This is your character! Ann''s red hair is really beautiful, just like the color of red spider lilies in their full bloom. Red really suits you. You should have more confidence in yourself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2364, 'Nunnally Lamperouge', 'I see... You''re taking things awfully fast, but like they say, "to each his own". I suppose that''s just how you operate---*Lelouch drops a teacup on the ground*', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2365, 'C.C.', 'Win through, Lelouch. Ignore your past, and the consequences of your actions.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', '*to C.C.* It''s a contract, this time coming from me to you.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'You foolish impostor, who tried to take Nunnally''s place, I will use you until you dry up, then throw you away like a ragged cloth!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2361, 'Kallen Stadtfeld', 'You know what this badass mother can do so back off!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2365, 'C.C.', 'You revealed it much too fast. Such a bad sport, girl.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Fuhahahahaha, this is how you create panic.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Compete, fight, take, control. Beyond that lies the future! All Hail Britannia!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'I don''t want to hear that from an eternally young and immortal witch.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'From this moment on, this room shall be the very first territory of the United States of Japan!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2393, 'Kaguya Sumeragi', 'Once you have won this war, you will need a wife someday, right? For you to have a life where you cannot reveal your identity to the world, I believe that there will be someone who can calm your soul?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'The world will change. I will change it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'I would like you to answer a question before you dispose of me. If being powerless is evil, is having power justice? Is revenge Evil? Can friendship coexist with justice..?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'I''ve made a contract with the devil, so I can''t be friends with a god.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'You''ve had only two choices ever since you joined the Order of the Black Knights. Either live with me, or die with me!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'I don''t know why snow is white, but I find such white snow beautiful, and I don''t dislike it at all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, NULL, 'Cecile Croomy', 'Lloyd-san, shall I teach you the proper way to communicate with others?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'What are you doing, C.C.? Now you''re all wet. Come on, we''ll have to go to the washroom. I''ll get you a change of clothes.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Terrorism is nothing more than childish harassment.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2362, 'Suzaku Kururugi', 'F*CK OFF!! *to Kallen while he''s trying to kill Zero*', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', '...supposed to be dead? I have returned, your Majesty. In order to change EVERYTHING.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'I am the 17th successor, the second in line to the throne. Lelouch Vi Britannia.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2365, 'C.C.', 'Why must I search through other people''s underwear? You Owe me Big Time for this.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2367, 'Jeremiah Gottwald', '*holding a hand to his face as he steps out in front of a car* I...I..I am not ORAAAAAAAAAAANGE. *falls and fails*', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2365, 'C.C.', 'I was just checking, you horny little punk.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Tss, useless terrorists!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'You are not alone. We are accomplices. If you are a witch, I will become a warlock.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2365, 'C.C.', 'Within the endless flow of time, I am alone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2365, 'C.C.', '*after a giant pizza is thrown into the air**Gasp* Pizza!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2368, 'Euphemia Li Britannia', 'Everyone who calls themselves Japanese:I have a request. Can you all die?Erm...I hoped that you would all commit suicide, but is that impossible?Then can all the soldiers please annihilate them?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'That''s right, I''m Zero. The leader of the Order of Black Knight. The one who declared war on the Holy Britannia Empire. And, a guy who is about to take over the world!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Perhaps this is what I have always wished for since that day. The loss and destruction of all. That''s right, one must destroy before creating. In that case, if my conscience becomes a hindrance to me, then I will simply erase it. I have no other choice but to move forward...therefore!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Since that day, I''ve always been living a lie. The fact that I''m alive is a lie. My name is a lie, my background is a lie. It''s full of lies. Fed up with the world that does not change at all, but I can''t even let everything go because of this despair called "lies". But now I have in my hands...this power, therefore!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Or have you realized it? That only those who are prepared to be shot have the right to shoot...! Lelouch Vi Britannia commands you all...to DIE!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'What''s wrong? You aren''t going to shoot? Your opponent''s a student.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Hey, tell me, how should a Britannian who hates Britannia live?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2384, 'Lloyd Asplund', 'That''s not necessary. It''s a waste of time. Let''s get married.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Those with power, fear us! Those without power, seek us!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2365, 'C.C.', '*to Lelouch* No matter how great you make yourself sound, you''re still just a naive boy who''s all talk and who only dreams of victory in his head.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', '*Milay describes Lelouch as a subordinate* Subordinate..? Yeah, I guess I am.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'That''s easy. If someone wins, the fighting will end.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2384, 'Lloyd Asplund', 'Ah, I''m sorry. Sorry! *is punched by Cecile*', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2384, 'Lloyd Asplund', 'That contradiction might kill you someday.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2367, 'Jeremiah Gottwald', 'O-O-O-range?! DIE !!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Oh it has been a while. you are still in the army? But I don''t have the time to deal with you, Orange-kun.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2367, 'Jeremiah Gottwald', 'Is Zero here? If you are around, fight with me...fight with me, Jeremiah Gottwald!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'Those who are allowed to shoot are those who are prepared to be shot.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24, 2360, 'Lelouch Lamperouge', 'I was dead until the moment I met you. I was a powerless corpse pretending to be alive. Living without power, without the ability to change my course, was akin to a slow death.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1333, 'Uryuu Ishida', 'I swear by the pride of the Quincy...I will KILL you!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ayasegawa Yumichika', 'If it was me, I would probably give up in a beautiful way...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'Kurosaki Ichigo, my sword has been broken by your freedom of spirit.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'I''m going to have to ask you to stop now, Abarai-kun. I can only step on an ant so hard without crushing it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1342, 'Zangetsu', 'What are you doing? Why do you run Ichigo? You still have not called me. Face forward, Ichigo. You should be able to hear it now. That which blocks your ears is worthless fear. The enemy is one, you are one. What is there to fear? Cast off your fear. Look forward! Go forward! Never stand still. Retreat and you will age. Hesitate and you will die. Shout... my name is... ZANGETSU!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1333, 'Uryuu Ishida', 'Your brain must have been constructed wrong.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Aizen Sousuke', 'Admiration is a feeling furthest away from understanding.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Zaraki Kenpachi', 'How about I give you an advantage. Cut me anywhere you want.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'Dude, that name is so lame.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1329, 'Rukia Kuchiki', '*Rukia talking to Renji* Hit a nerve, did I? Well, don''t worry Mr. Officer. Now you have the rank, and the pompous attitude, and weird eyebrows to go with it!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'This twisted spritual pressure... that white mask... Are you a Hollow?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ayasegawa Yumichika', '*Ganju offers Yumichika to kiss his ass* An ugly thought... That''s truly ugly.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1354, 'Ganju Shiba', 'You can kiss my ass!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'Z-A-N-G-E-T-S-U!!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1354, 'Ganju Shiba', 'Why, you...! You punched my ruggedly handsome face! Not once, but twice!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1354, 'Ganju Shiba', 'Are you kidding me? You really don''t know who I am?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Ayasegawa Yumichika', 'And you better get this street clean enough to eat off of, or I''ll kill you both.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kira Izuru', 'Warriors aren''t supposed to beg for their lives.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kira Izuru', 'A grounded bird is nothing more than dinner.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kariya Jin', 'A battle without risk is simply a child''s quarrel.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Kouga', 'It seems that I was born under a star that forces me to watch young people, with futures ahead of them, die.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Kouga', 'Desiring power is dangerous.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Madarame Ikkaku', 'If you two are gonna goof off, try not to be so obvious about it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1354, 'Ganju Shiba', 'I''ve breathed enough sewer air to gag a hippo!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1333, 'Uryuu Ishida', 'Did I just get nick-named Pencil?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shihouin Yoruichi', 'Think about it this way: a person picks up a sword when he''s trying to protect something. Perhaps it''s your life or your social status, maybe a reputation, a loved one, or personal beliefs. The motives may be completely different, but in the end, it''s the same desire to protect something.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Shihouin Yoruichi', 'Quit it. Stop whining. Unless you''re able to activate your powers at will, you will die, like a dog, in the Soul Society.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1329, 'Rukia Kuchiki', 'We are taught never to shed tears. For to shed tears means that the body has been defeated by emotion. And, to us, that simple act of crying proves, without question, that the existence of emotion is nothing but a burden.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1354, 'Ganju Shiba', 'Ya gotta wonder about someone who''d be dumb enough to follow a person as crazy as he is. Wait, I think I just insulted myself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'If you want revenge, do it on your own! Don''t draw innocent people into it!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Inoue Orihime', 'When people constantly show their affection for you, you start taking it for granted. If you don''t realize how much they care for you until they''re gone, you''ll only be left with regret and remorse.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Inoue Orihime', 'There were a lot of things I wanted to do. I wanted to become a teacher, and an astronaut, and a baker... I wanted to go to a bunch of different donut shops and ask for one of everything! And I wanted to tell the ice-cream man to give me one of everything, too! I wish I could have five different lives! Then I could have been born in five different towns, and eaten five lifetime''s worth of food, and had five different careers, and... fallen in love with the same person, five times.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1329, 'Rukia Kuchiki', 'Those who are left behind in a fight or are in the way aren''t the ones who lack power. They''re the ones who lack resolve.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Urahara Kisuke', 'Training hard, risking your life... what''s the difference?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1329, 'Rukia Kuchiki', 'It''s been a while! Or something like that...', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1329, 'Rukia Kuchiki', 'Shut up. Don''t talk and keep running!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Madarame Ikkaku', 'Hey... whoever just called me bald, get over here!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1329, 'Rukia Kuchiki', 'Revolving... If fate is a wheel, we are the cogs that drive it. We have no choice but to believe that this wheel is flawless and forge on ahead. The power of the individual cogs and their destinations... And the blade that is brought down upon them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'Revolving. And each time it''s touched by the light of the sun and moon... The world is always changing into something new.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'Kariya sought the power to change his fate. What I sought was... a turn of fate.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'Because he attained so much power, he could only be controlled by it. And in the end, maybe his only option was to destroy himself.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1332, 'Toushirou Hitsugaya', 'Authority never goes anywhere without a fanfare.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Ichigo', 'Whatever she is, it doesn''t change the fact that she''s here now. She still experiences anger, happiness and pain.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Senna', 'When you''re up high, all the stuff that looks confusing and messed up...suddenly becomes crystal clear.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kuchiki Byakuya', 'Arrogance destroys the footholds of victory.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Urahara Kisuke', 'That wasn''t very nice. I do believe you''ve killed my hat.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1342, 'Zangetsu', 'Abandon your fear. Turn and face him. Don''t back an inch. Now, Ichigo, advance! Never stop! If you retreat, you will age. Be afraid, and you''ll die.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Arisawa Tatsuki', 'You''ll find that Ichigo has an uncanny knack for forgeting people''s faces, and the names to go with them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, 1329, 'Rukia Kuchiki', '*yelling at her pager, which is laying on the ground* Urahara! Why don''t you ever pick up when I call you in emergencies like this? You call yourself a business man! Then why do you show up when you''re not wanted, and then when I really need you, you won''t answer?!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(12, NULL, 'Kurosaki Karin', 'Isn''t she awfully happy...for someone visiting a grave?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
