(27, 2497, 'Ciel Phantomhive', 'You aren''t wrong. You fought to protect your world. What''s wrong with that? In the end, "justice" is just an official line taken by those in power to serve their own ends. No one''s looking out for others. If you''re careless, you''ll be robbed. There are only two kinds of people in this world. Those who steal, and those who are stolen from. And today, I steal your futures. That''s all this is.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
